ou design and build grand hotels across the globe. Juggle the increasingly elaborate demands of disorderly guests, logistical nightmares and unexpected obstacles in Hotel Architect, the ultimate hotel construction and tycoon management game.','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1602000/Hotel_Architect/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(755,'ultimate_chicken_horse',NULL,'Ultimate Chicken Horse is a party platformer game where you build the level as you play, placing traps and hazards to screw your friends over, but trying not to screw yourself.','2016/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/386940/Ultimate_Chicken_Horse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(756,'nubby\'s_number_factory',NULL,'A plinko-style roguelike where you work at a number factory. Launch your spherical friend, Nubby, down a pegboard to make bigger and bigger numbers! But beware, if you fail to meet your number quota, the sun will explode.','2025/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3191030/Nubbys_Number_Factory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(757,'trepang2',NULL,'Become the ultimate badass in Trepang2: A gory, action-packed FPS set in the near future. Unleash all hell on your enemies, dodge bullets and leave a trail of destruction in this hardcore and frenetic shooter.','2023/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1164940/Trepang2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(758,'a_game_about_digging_a_hole',NULL,'A minimalist game about digging a hole in the garden of a newly purchased house. Collect resources, sell them, upgrade your equipment and discover a mysterious secret. Costs you only one coffee!','2025/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3244220/A_Game_About_Digging_A_Hole/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(759,'bonelab',NULL,'BONELAB is an experimental physics action game. Explore a mysterious lab filled with weapons, enemies, challenges and secrets. Escape your reality, or wreak havoc. No wrong answers.','2022/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1592190/BONELAB/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(760,'the_sims™_4_get_to_work',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2015/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235734/The_Sims_4_Get_To_Work/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(761,'untitled_goose_game',NULL,'It\'s a lovely morning in the village and you are a horrible goose.','2020/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/837470/Untitled_Goose_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(762,'the_forever_winter',NULL,'The Forever Winter is a tactical shooter where you and your squad must loot the dead to survive under the shadow of terrifying and gargantuan war machines locked in a never-ending conflict. Millions of deaths later the war continues with our latest update!','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2828860/The_Forever_Winter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(763,'surviving_mars',NULL,'There will be challenges to overcome. Execute your strategy and improve your colony’s chances of survival while unlocking the mysteries of this alien world. Are you ready? Mars is waiting for you.','2018/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/464920/Surviving_Mars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(764,'portal',NULL,'Portal™ is a new single player game from Valve. Set in the mysterious Aperture Science Laboratories, Portal has been called one of the most innovative new games on the horizon and will offer gamers hours of unique gameplay.','2007/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/400/Portal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(765,'mechwarrior_5:_clans_-_ghost_bear:_flash_storm',NULL,'This content requires the base game MechWarrior 5: Clans on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3463200/MechWarrior_5_Clans__Ghost_Bear_Flash_Storm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(766,'wolfenstein:_the_new_order',NULL,'Wolfenstein®: The New Order reignites the series that created the first-person shooter genre. Wolfenstein offers a deep game narrative packed with action, adventure and first-person combat.','2014/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/201810/Wolfenstein_The_New_Order/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(767,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_road_to_the_black_sea',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1056760/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Road_to_the_Black_Sea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(768,'promise_mascot_agency',NULL,'Explore a cursed Japanese town! Recruit mascot friends and come to the rescue when disaster strikes! Solve the mystery of your exile! Help a living finger work through her many anger issues! Turn Promise Mascot Agency into the best agency in Japan in this open-world narrative adventure!','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2585830/Promise_Mascot_Agency/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(769,'steel_division_2',NULL,'Steel Division 2 is a historically-accurate WW2 real-time strategy game set on the Eastern Front. Features 1:1-scale turn-based army management and real-time tactical battles with thousands of men at your order.','2019/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/919640/Steel_Division_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(770,'lords_of_the_fallen',NULL,'A vast world awaits in the medieval, dark fantasy action-RPG, Lords of the Fallen. As a fabled Dark Crusader, embark on an epic quest to overthrow Adyr, the demon God. The definitive Version 2.0 out now: features Shared Progression Co-op & Free Friend’s Pass.','2023/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1501750/Lords_of_the_Fallen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(771,'l.a._noire',NULL,'In his fight to climb the ranks and do what\'s right, LAPD detective Cole Phelps must unravel the truth behind a string of arson attacks, conspiracies, and brutal murders, battling the L.A. underworld and even members of his own department.','2011/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/110800/LA_Noire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(772,'spore™',NULL,'Be the architect of your own universe with Spore, an exciting single-player adventure. From Single Cell to Galactic God, evolve your creature in a universe of your own creations.','2008/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/17390/SPORE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(773,'jojo\'s_bizarre_adventure:_all-star_battle_r',NULL,'Hirohiko Araki\'s masterpiece, brought to life as a fighting game! Battle with 50 colorful characters, wielding Stands, Hamon, and more! See how characters who could never meet in the story interact when they come face to face!','2022/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1372110/JoJos_Bizarre_Adventure_AllStar_Battle_R/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(774,'planet_coaster',NULL,'Planet Coaster® - the future of coaster park simulation games has arrived! Surprise, delight and thrill incredible crowds as you build your coaster park empire - let your imagination run wild, and share your success with the world.','2016/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/493340/Planet_Coaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(775,'scum_deluxe_content_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SCUM on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3596770/SCUM_Deluxe_Content_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(776,'the_spell_brigade',NULL,'Survivors-like with ONLINE CO-OP for 1-4 players. Team up with your wizard friends to slay hordes of dark creatures. Complete team-based objectives, unlock new upgrades and create overpowered spell synergies. Friend nor foe is safe in this friendly fire bullet hell!','2024/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2904000/The_Spell_Brigade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(777,'human_fall_flat',NULL,'Human Fall Flat is a hilarious, light-hearted platformer set in floating dreamscapes that can be played solo or with up to 8 players online. Free new levels keep its vibrant community rewarded.','2016/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/477160/Human_Fall_Flat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(778,'aska',NULL,'Lay claim to unspoiled lands and pave the way for a fierce Viking tribe. Craft the ultimate settlement solo or together with up to x3 friends. Trust in the Gods and the power of the Eye of Odin and summon intelligent NPC villagers to provide camaraderie and relief from the toils of survival.','2024/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1898300/ASKA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(779,'the_sims™_4_city_living',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2016/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235731/The_Sims_4_City_Living/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(780,'spirit_city:_lofi_sessions',NULL,'Spirit City: Lofi Sessions is a gamified focus tool, set to a soothing lofi soundtrack. Discover and collect Spirits, customize your cozy virtual space, and facilitate your real-life tasks with a collection of handy features designed to improve concentration and ease stress.','2024/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2113850/Spirit_City_Lofi_Sessions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(781,'life_is_strange_remastered',NULL,'Experience the BAFTA award-winning story of Life is Strange now beautifully remastered with enhanced visuals and vastly improved animation using mocap technology.','2022/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1265920/Life_is_Strange_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(782,'graveyard_keeper',NULL,'Build and manage a medieval graveyard while facing ethical dilemmas and making questionable decisions. Welcome to Graveyard Keeper, the most inaccurate medieval cemetery sim of the year.','2018/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/599140/Graveyard_Keeper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_16'),(783,'shadows_of_doubt',NULL,'Take on the role of a private investigator in this immersive detective simulator. Solve murders and other crimes in a procedurally generated and persistent city where every NPC lives and breathes their own independent lives. Find the killer quickly… or they will kill again!','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/986130/Shadows_of_Doubt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(784,'dirt_rally_2.0',NULL,'DiRT Rally 2.0 dares you to carve your way through a selection of iconic rally locations from across the globe, in the most powerful off-road vehicles ever made, knowing that the smallest mistake could end your stage.','2019/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/690790/DiRT_Rally_20/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(785,'architect_life:_a_house_design_simulator',NULL,'Create dream homes! From 3D plan modelling through to on-site decision-making, you must bring each project to life while giving free rein to your creativity, to take your architectural firm to the pinnacle of the profession.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1296400/Architect_Life_A_House_Design_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(786,'forever_skies',NULL,'A first-person survival game set on a post-apocalyptic, ecologically ruined Earth. Play solo or with up to 3 friends as you build, upgrade, and fly a high-tech airship. Scavenge resources, craft tools, and face dangers on the surface as you hunt for a cure to save humanity.','2025/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1641960/Forever_Skies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(787,'soulmask',NULL,'Escaping a deadly sacrificial ritual, you find an ancient mystical mask on your journey. This mask holds potent knowledge, changing the world you knew. Face the harsh challenges of nature, survive, rally followers, and build your own tribe. Explore and unveil the truths behind the enigmatic mask.','2024/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2646460/Soulmask/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(788,'aliens:_fireteam_elite',NULL,'Aliens: Fireteam Elite is a cooperative third-person survival game set in the iconic Alien Universe. Battle through hordes of different types of Xenomorph, customize your character and gear, and level-up as you try to contain this ever-growing threat.','2021/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1549970/Aliens_Fireteam_Elite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(789,'hydroneer',NULL,'Hydroneer is a mining and base building sandbox. Dig for gold and other resources to turn a profit and enhance your mining operation. Build a base of operations, forge weapons, go fishing, and dig deep!','2020/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1106840/Hydroneer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(790,'tokyo_xtreme_racer',NULL,'\"Tokyo Xtreme Racer\" is a racing game set in a blocked-off future Tokyo, where players aim to be the fastest by driving their best cars on the highways that weave through the city.','2025/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2634950/Tokyo_Xtreme_Racer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(791,'sky:_children_of_the_light',NULL,'Sky: Children of the Light is a peaceful, award-winning MMO from the creators of Journey. Explore a beautifully-animated kingdom across seven realms and create enriching memories with other players in this delightful puzzle-adventure game.','2024/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2325290/Sky_Children_of_the_Light/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(792,'tinkerlands',NULL,'Explore, craft, and fight your way through uncharted islands — solo or with up to 4 players in co-op! Tinkerlands is an exciting survival adventure where you will build your settlement, craft useful tools to survive, and even use magic!','2025/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2617700/Tinkerlands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(793,'cricket_captain_2025',NULL,'Build your dream team with Cricket Captain 2025. Complete interface overhaul, with easier to use, clean look. New Player Editor for batting, bowling, fielding, aggression and opener type. Match engine update with more accurate 20 Over simulation. Fast-play engine.','2025/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3637540/Cricket_Captain_2025/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(794,'ultimate_epic_battle_simulator_2',NULL,'Welcome to Ultimate Epic Battle Simulator 2, the most ridiculous and insane battle simulator in existence! Create eye watering battles with hundreds of thousands, even millions of characters on screen! Jump into multiple campaigns in game or player made, or play in sandbox mode and FPS invasion','2023/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1468720/Ultimate_Epic_Battle_Simulator_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(795,'drova_-_forsaken_kin',NULL,'Drova is an Action-RPG that marries the dark grim tones of its genre with the mysticism of Celtic mythology. Encounter a society where ancient restless spirits and divided factions battle for dominance. Uncover forgotten abilities and unravel the secrets of a past shrouded in mystery.','2024/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1585180/Drova__Forsaken_Kin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(796,'heroes_of_hammerwatch_ii',NULL,'A rogue-lite action-rpg that offers extensive persistent progression. Build your town, upgrade and equip your heroes, before taking on the the ever-changing Dark Citadel - either solo or with a team of friends.','2025/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/619820/Heroes_of_Hammerwatch_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(797,'sulfur',NULL,'SULFUR is a modern old-school action-adventure: Outsmart enemies, find treasure, improve weapons, harness powers. Delve deeper, find answers, make it end.','2024/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2124120/SULFUR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(798,'the_sims™_4_island_living',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235730/The_Sims_4_Island_Living/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(799,'elden_ring_nightreign_-_deluxe_upgrade_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game ELDEN RING NIGHTREIGN on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3515610/ELDEN_RING_NIGHTREIGN__Deluxe_Upgrade_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(800,'powerwash_simulator_–_wallace_&_gromit_special_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PowerWash Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3077590/PowerWash_Simulator__Wallace__Gromit_Special_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(801,'persona_4_golden',NULL,'A coming of age story that sets the protagonist and his friends on a journey kickstarted by a chain of serial murders.','2020/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1113000/Persona_4_Golden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(802,'skull_and_bones',NULL,'Set sail into the vibrant open world of Skull and Bones, a naval online action RPG where you rise to become the most fearsome pirate kingpin. Customize your fleet, craft unique ships, and forge formidable weapons to dominate in exhilarating sea battles.','2024/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2853730/Skull_and_Bones/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(803,'undisputed',NULL,'Become Undisputed in the most authentic boxing game to date! Featuring true to life visuals, bone-jarring action, and more licensed boxers than ever before, Undisputed gives you unprecedented control to master every inch of the ring.','2024/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1451190/Undisputed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(804,'capcom_fighting_collection_2',NULL,'Capcom\'s new fighting collection hits the stage! Choose from fan-favorite games like Capcom vs. SNK 2: Mark of the Millennium 2001 and Project Justice to 3D action games like Power Stone and Power Stone 2 in this collection of eight classic fighting games!','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2400430/Capcom_Fighting_Collection_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(805,'south_park™:_the_fractured_but_whole™',NULL,'From the creators of South Park, Trey Parker and Matt Stone, comes South Park: The Fractured But Whole, a sequel to 2014\'s award-winning South Park: The Stick of Truth.','2017/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/488790/South_Park_The_Fractured_But_Whole/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(806,'bleach_rebirth_of_souls',NULL,'Awaken the blade within you and reverse your fate in BLEACH Rebirth of Souls! Engage in thrilling battles with powerful sword abilities and characters from this legendary anime franchise.','2025/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1689620/BLEACH_Rebirth_of_Souls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(807,'wandering_sword',NULL,'Wandering Sword is a Chinese martial-arts RPG where you play a young swordsman caught up in a feud and nearly dies. Escaping the event puts you on the path of pursuing the highest form of martial arts and exploring the pugilistic world to become the great hero you are always destined to be.','2023/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1876890/Wandering_Sword/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(808,'sonic_racing:_crossworlds',NULL,'Race across land, sea, air, space, and time in Sonic Racing: CrossWorlds! Warp through Travel Rings into new dimensions where something new awaits around every twist and turn.','2025/9/25','Unreleased','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2486820/Sonic_Racing_CrossWorlds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(809,'farthest_frontier',NULL,'Protect and guide your people as you forge a town from untamed wilderness at the edge of the known world. Harvest raw materials, hunt, fish and farm to survive. Produce crafted items to trade, consume, equip and fight with as you battle for your survival against the elements and outside threats.','2022/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1044720/Farthest_Frontier/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(810,'9_days',NULL,'You have 9 days before the final fight. At your current state, you do not stand a chance! Explore this Open World to gain new skills and abilities for the battle. Choose where you go, what you do carefully. You cannot waste time! You have 9 days.','2024/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2075720/9_Days/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(811,'prototype_2',NULL,'Become the ultimate shape-shifting weapon!','2012/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/115320/Prototype_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(812,'trackmania',NULL,'Welcome to the Club! Grab the wheel and play Trackmania® for FREE now.','2023/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2225070/Trackmania/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(813,'yu-gi-oh!_duel_links',NULL,'Take on Duelists around the world with \"Yu-Gi-Oh! Duel Links\"! Step into a world that crosses dimensions and connects all Duelists. In Duel World, any location transforms into a Duel Field where heated Duels unfold!','2017/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/601510/YuGiOh_Duel_Links/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(814,'sonic_frontiers',NULL,'Experience Sonic like never before!','2022/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1237320/Sonic_Frontiers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(815,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_italia',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2017/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/558244/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Italia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(816,'resident_evil_0',NULL,'Before the mansion, before the destruction of Raccoon City, there was Resident Evil 0. Now remastered with improved visuals and sounds, as well as the all-new Wesker Mode, there\'s never been a better time to experience the origins of the Resident Evil story.','2016/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/339340/Resident_Evil_0/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(817,'worshippers_of_cthulhu',NULL,'LEAD the CULT OF CTHULHU. Decide the fate of your followers, perform eldritch rituals, and master the art of city-building in a world where the line between sanity and madness blurs. Can you endure the horrors you unleash?','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2807150/Worshippers_of_Cthulhu/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(818,'ori_and_the_will_of_the_wisps',NULL,'Play the critically acclaimed masterpiece. Embark on a new journey in a vast, exotic world where you’ll encounter towering enemies and challenging puzzles on your quest to unravel Ori’s destiny.','2020/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1057090/Ori_and_the_Will_of_the_Wisps/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(819,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_vive_la_france_!',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2016/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/531130/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Vive_la_France/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(820,'intravenous_2',NULL,'Intravenous 2 is the ultimate blend of tactical gameplay and immersive storytelling. Will you embrace the shadows or confront your foes head-on? The choice is yours. Experience a new era of tactical stealth action. Save lives. Uncover secrets. Take vengeance.','2024/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2608270/Intravenous_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(821,'tiny_aquarium:_social_fishkeeping',NULL,'A happy aquarium that lives at the bottom of your screen! Tiny Aquarium is a social idle simulator that keeps growing, even when offline. Hatch, sell fish, decorate, go fishin’, and visit your friends’ aquariums with bite-sized daily sessions.','2025/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2581950/Tiny_Aquarium_Social_Fishkeeping/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(822,'dead_by_daylight_-_resident_evil_chapter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1634040/Dead_by_Daylight__Resident_Evil_Chapter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(823,'need_for_speed™_unbound',NULL,'Race to the top, definitely don’t flop. Outsmart the cops, and enter weekly qualifiers for The Grand: the ultimate street race. Pack your garage with precision-tuned, custom rides, and light up the streets with your style.','2022/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1846380/Need_for_Speed_Unbound/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(824,'warframe:_oraxia_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warframe on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3778430/Warframe_Oraxia_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(825,'max_payne_3',NULL,'No longer a New York City cop, Max Payne moves to São Paulo to protect a wealthy family in an effort to finally escape his troubled past. This complete edition of Max Payne 3 includes the complete original game and all previously released downloadable content.','2012/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/204100/Max_Payne_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(826,'backpack_battles',NULL,'A PvP inventory management auto battler! Buy and craft powerful items, then carefully arrange them in your backpack.','2025/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2427700/Backpack_Battles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(827,'warhammer_40,000:_chaos_gate_-_daemonhunters',NULL,'Lead humanity’s greatest weapon, the Grey Knights, in this fast-paced turn-based tactical RPG. Root out and purge a galaxy-spanning plague in a cinematic, story-driven campaign, using the tactics and talents of your own personalised squad of Daemonhunters.','2022/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1611910/Warhammer_40000_Chaos_Gate__Daemonhunters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(828,'viewfinder',NULL,'Challenge perception, redefine reality, and reshape the world around you with an instant camera. Viewfinder is a new single player game offering gamers hours of interesting and fun experiences while uncovering the mysteries left behind.','2023/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1382070/Viewfinder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(829,'five_nights_at_freddy\'s:_security_breach',NULL,'In Five Nights at Freddy’s: Security Breach, play as Gregory, a young boy who’s been trapped overnight inside of Freddy Fazbear’s Mega Pizzaplex. With the help of Freddy himself, Gregory must uncover the secrets of the Pizzaplex, learn the truth, and survive until dawn.','2021/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/747660/Five_Nights_at_Freddys_Security_Breach/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(830,'resident_evil_6',NULL,'Blending action and survival horror, Resident Evil 6 promises to be the dramatic horror experience of 2013.','2013/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/221040/Resident_Evil_6/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_17'),(831,'rebel_inc:_escalation',NULL,'A unique and deeply engaging political/military strategic simulation from the creator of Plague Inc. Balance competing civilian and military priorities and deal with a deadly insurgency in order to stabilise a war-torn country.','2021/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1088790/Rebel_Inc_Escalation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(832,'dead_by_daylight_-_resident_evil:_project_w_chapter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2102730/Dead_by_Daylight__Resident_Evil_PROJECT_W_Chapter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(833,'days_gone_-_broken_road_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Days Gone on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3238470/Days_Gone__Broken_Road_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(834,'spaceengine',NULL,'The world\'s first science-based photorealistic interactive 3D planetarium that models the entire Universe, using procedural generation for uncharted areas.','2019/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/314650/SpaceEngine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(835,'the_sims™_4_lovestruck_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2815270/The_Sims_4_Lovestruck_Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(836,'system_shock',NULL,'A first-person fight to the death in the depths of space!','2023/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/