an_–_thrones_of_decay',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: WARHAMMER III on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2891700/Total_War_WARHAMMER_III__Tamurkhan__Thrones_of_Decay/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(844,'expansion_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_arms_against_tyranny',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2183930/Expansion__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_Arms_Against_Tyranny/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(845,'steins;gate_0',NULL,'If you can\'t save the one you love… How can you save humanity? Sequel to the visual novel cult classic. Experience an alternate worldline of STEINS;GATE.','2018/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/825630/STEINSGATE_0/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(846,'dead_by_daylight_-_castlevania_chapter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3103150/Dead_by_Daylight__Castlevania_Chapter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(847,'darkest_dungeon®',NULL,'Darkest Dungeon is a challenging gothic roguelike turn-based RPG about the psychological stresses of adventuring. Recruit, train, and lead a team of flawed heroes against unimaginable horrors, stress, disease, and the ever-encroaching dark. Can you keep your heroes together when all hope is lost?','2016/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/262060/Darkest_Dungeon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(848,'age_of_empires_iv:_knights_of_cross_and_rose ',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires IV: Anniversary Edition on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3144890/Age_of_Empires_IV_Knights_of_Cross_and_Rose/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(849,'mindseye',NULL,'MindsEye is a narrative driven, single-player action-adventure thriller set in the near-future fictional desert city of Redrock. Featuring best-in-class cinematics, high octane driving, and explosive combat from game director, Leslie Benzies.','2025/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3265250/MindsEye/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(850,'ender_magnolia:_bloom_in_the_mist',NULL,'Decades after the events of ENDER LILIES, Homunculi — sorrowful, artificial life forms — roam the land. In this dark fantasy Metroidvania, face formidable enemies and explore a bewitching post-apocalyptic world. Humans and Homunculi — what awaits at the end of the quest for their salvation?','2025/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2725260/ENDER_MAGNOLIA_Bloom_in_the_Mist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(851,'rpg_maker_mz',NULL,'You want to create an RPG, but every game making tool you have found was either too complex or too limited? RPG Maker MZ empowers you with simple tools to create your RPG right out of the box, yet is customizable enough to make the exact RPG you want!','2020/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1096900/RPG_Maker_MZ/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(852,'blood_bowl_3',NULL,'Brutal, crazy, tactical… this is BLOOD BOWL! The iconic death sport returns with the new video game of fantasy football faithfully using the latest board game rules and new content. Create your team, then crush, mulch and cheat your way to the top... leaving your opponents in the graveyard.','2023/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1016950/Blood_Bowl_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(853,'the_elder_scrolls_v:_skyrim_vr',NULL,'A true, full-length open-world game for VR has arrived from Bethesda Game Studios. Skyrim VR reimagines the complete epic fantasy masterpiece with an unparalleled sense of scale, depth, and immersion. Skyrim VR also includes all official add-ons.','2018/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/611670/The_Elder_Scrolls_V_Skyrim_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(854,'broken_sword_-_shadow_of_the_templars:_reforged',NULL,'The classic multi-award winning adventure \"Broken Sword - the Shadow of the Templars\" returns with glorious 4K visuals and iconic remastered audio, pitching intrepid American George Stobbart and fearless journalist Nico Collard into a journey of perilous adventures and ancient conspiracies.','2024/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2544110/Broken_Sword__Shadow_of_the_Templars_Reforged/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(855,'summoners_war',NULL,'A global hit RPG that captured the Summoners all around the world! Jump into the Sky Arena, a world under battle over the vital resource: Mana Crystals. Design your own deck and strategy using 1,000 Monsters to claim victory. Go on an epic adventure with your Monsters!','2024/1/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2426960/Summoners_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(856,'duck_detective:_the_secret_salami',NULL,'Solving crime is no walk in the pond. You are a down-on-his-luck detective who also happens to be a duck. Use your powers of de-duck-tion to inspect evidence, fill in the blanks, and bust the case wide open! This is a short but twisty detective case.','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2637990/Duck_Detective_The_Secret_Salami/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(857,'assassin\'s_creed®_unity',NULL,'Assassin’s Creed® Unity tells the story of Arno, a young man who embarks upon an extraordinary journey to expose the true powers behind the French Revolution. In the brand new co-op mode, you and your friends will also be thrown in the middle of a ruthless struggle for the fate of a nation.','2014/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/289650/Assassins_Creed_Unity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(858,'crusader_kings_ii',NULL,'Explore one of the defining periods in world history in an experience crafted by the masters of Grand Strategy.','2012/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/203770/Crusader_Kings_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(859,'alien:_isolation',NULL,'Discover the true meaning of fear in Alien: Isolation, a survival horror set in an atmosphere of constant dread and mortal danger.','2014/10/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/214490/Alien_Isolation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(860,'trash_goblin',NULL,'A wholesome, cosy shopkeeping game with no pressures, no stress, and endless good vibes! Uncover & clean trinkets then upcycle them to sell to endless colourful & quirky customers. Spend your savings to upgrade your shop, buy better tools, plus expand and customise your space.','2025/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2407830/Trash_Goblin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(861,'the_witcher_2:_assassins_of_kings_enhanced_edition',NULL,'A time of untold chaos has come. Mighty forces clash behind the scenes in a struggle for power and influence. The Northern Kingdoms mobilize for war. But armies on the march are not enough to stop a bloody conspiracy...','2011/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/20920/The_Witcher_2_Assassins_of_Kings_Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(862,'sniper_elite_4',NULL,'Discover unrivalled sniping freedom in the largest and most advanced World War 2 shooter ever built. Experience tactical third-person combat, gameplay choice and epic longshots across gigantic levels as you liberate wartime Italy from the grip of Fascism.','2017/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/312660/Sniper_Elite_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(863,'stacklands',NULL,'Stacklands is a village builder where you stack cards to collect food, build structures, and fight creatures. 🃏 For example, dragging a Villager card on top of a Berry Bush card will spawn Berry cards which the villagers can eat to survive. 🃏 Play your cards right and expand your village!','2022/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1948280/Stacklands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(864,'dead_by_daylight_-_tokyo_ghoul',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3448670/Dead_by_Daylight__Tokyo_Ghoul/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(865,'tales_of_arise',NULL,'300 years of tyranny. A mysterious mask. Lost pain and memories. Wield the Blazing Sword and join a mysterious, untouchable girl to fight your oppressors. Experience a tale of liberation, featuring characters with next-gen graphical expressiveness!','2021/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/740130/Tales_of_Arise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(866,'age_of_empires_iii:_definitive_edition',NULL,'Age of Empires III: Definitive Edition offers players a trial of this historical single & multiplayer RTS experience. *Note: To unlock all features of the game please see the “Base Game” product.','2020/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/933110/Age_of_Empires_III_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(867,'predecessor',NULL,'Inspired by the legacy of Paragon, built with love by the community, and powered by Unreal Engine 5, Predecessor is the ultimate fusion of shooter action and MOBA strategy. Join more than 2,000,000 players and play for FREE now!','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/961200/Predecessor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(868,'railway_empire_2',NULL,'Don the coat of a clever entrepreneur, take over a small railway company in the early 1800s and turn your steam engines into the workhorses of the economy. Grow your company into the largest railway company of the continent and outsmart your competitors.','2023/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1644320/Railway_Empire_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(869,'like_a_dragon_gaiden:_the_man_who_erased_his_name',NULL,'ERASE YOUR PAST TO PROTECT YOUR FUTURE Once a legendary yakuza, Kazuma Kiryu faked his own death and abandoned his name for the sake of protecting his family. Now, he is thrust into conflict by a mysterious figure attempting to drive him out of hiding.','2023/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2375550/Like_a_Dragon_Gaiden_The_Man_Who_Erased_His_Name/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(870,'mx_vs_atv_legends',NULL,'Race your way to victory on bikes, ATVs and UTVs in MX vs ATV Legends! Featuring massive new open environments, plus a career mode that lets you experience all the risks and rewards of becoming a world-famous professional rider. Become an off-road racing legend in your own right! Your time is now!','2022/6/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1205970/MX_vs_ATV_Legends/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(871,'terminator:_resistance',NULL,'Terminator: Resistance, is a first-person shooter set during the \'Future War\' scenario that was only glimpsed at in the iconic films, \'THE TERMINATOR\' and \'T2: JUDGMENT DAY\'. The machines are destined to lose, but at what cost?','2019/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/954740/Terminator_Resistance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(872,'gang_beasts',NULL,'Gang Beasts is a silly multiplayer party game with surly gelatinous characters, brutal slapstick fight sequences, and absurd hazardous environments, set in the mean streets of Beef City.','2017/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/285900/Gang_Beasts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(873,'pro_cycling_manager_25',NULL,'New graphics for an even more realistic simulation. Become a team manager and lead your riders to the top. Choosing sponsors, recruiting riders, managing the race, it\'s all up to you.','2025/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2511310/Pro_Cycling_Manager_25/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(874,'a_total_war_saga:_troy',NULL,'Inspired by The Iliad and brought to life through the award-winning strategy game series, A Total War Saga: TROY brings a blend of grand, turn-based empire management and spectacular real-time battles to the heart of the Trojan War.','2021/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1099410/A_Total_War_Saga_TROY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(875,'watch_dogs®:_legion',NULL,'Build a resistance as you fight to take back a near-future London facing its downfall. Welcome to the Resistance.','2023/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2239550/Watch_Dogs_Legion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(876,'v_rising_-_legacy_of_castlevania_premium_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game V Rising on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2833600/V_Rising__Legacy_of_Castlevania_Premium_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_18'),(877,'lego®_harry_potter™_collection',NULL,'The LEGO® Harry Potter™: Collection brings LEGO® Harry Potter™: Years 1-4 and LEGO® Harry Potter™: Years 5-7 together in one game, now remastered with enhanced graphics.','2024/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2950340/LEGO_Harry_Potter_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(878,'stranger_of_paradise_final_fantasy_origin',NULL,'Developed in cooperation between Square Enix and Team NINJA (Koei Tecmo Games), STRANGER OF PARADISE FINAL FANTASY ORIGIN is a hard-core action RPG that takes the FINAL FANTASY series in a new direction. Experience the boldest and most merciless battles in FINAL FANTASY history.','2023/4/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1358700/STRANGER_OF_PARADISE_FINAL_FANTASY_ORIGIN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(879,'yes,_your_grace_2:_snowfall',NULL,'Rule your crumbling kingdom as you try to satisfy the petty needs of your people in this cinematic kingdom management RPG. Balance your resources, collect taxes, hire agents and make difficult decisions to see your kingdom prosper or fail.','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1373090/Yes_Your_Grace_2_Snowfall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(880,'dune:_imperium',NULL,'The award-winning board game of strategy and intrigue in the iconic universe of Dune. The Spice must flow.','2024/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1689500/Dune_Imperium/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(881,'shop_titans',NULL,'Shop Titans is the ultimate RPG shopkeeper simulation. Craft powerful equipment, stock your shop and sell to aspiring heroes… at a markup! Hire heroes and explore dungeons to gather valuable materials to craft with. There’s never a dull moment in the world of Shop Titans!','2020/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1258080/Shop_Titans/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(882,'besiege:_the_splintered_sea',NULL,'This content requires the base game Besiege on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2165710/Besiege_The_Splintered_Sea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(883,'governor_of_poker_3',NULL,'Governor of Poker 3 is the best multiplayer poker game with a great design. In this multi-player version of Governor of Poker you compete live with thousands of real poker players to prove you are the number 1 Texas Hold ’em poker star!','2016/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/436150/Governor_of_Poker_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(884,'the_outer_worlds:_spacer\'s_choice_edition',NULL,'The Outer Worlds: Spacer’s Choice Edition is the ultimate way to play the award-winning RPG from Obsidian Entertainment and Private Division. Including the base game and all DLC, this remastered masterpiece is the absolute best version of The Outer Worlds.','2023/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1920490/The_Outer_Worlds_Spacers_Choice_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(885,'everspace™_2_-_wrath_of_the_ancients',NULL,'This content requires the base game EVERSPACE™ 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2873470/EVERSPACE_2__Wrath_of_the_Ancients/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(886,'enter_the_gungeon',NULL,'Enter the Gungeon is a bullet hell dungeon crawler following a band of misfits seeking to shoot, loot, dodge roll and table-flip their way to personal absolution by reaching the legendary Gungeon’s ultimate treasure: the gun that can kill the past.','2016/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/311690/Enter_the_Gungeon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(887,'battletech',NULL,'Take command of your own mercenary outfit of 