nline RPG where you can fight with or against friends in a surreal world filled with creatures beyond comprehension. Customize and progress your character(s), complete quests, and discover strange locations.','2024/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2768430/ATLYSS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(894,'dystopika',NULL,'A city-building sandbox for futuristic cities. No goals, no management, just creativity and dark cozy vibes.','2024/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2379910/Dystopika/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(895,'the_rise_of_the_golden_idol',NULL,'The Award-winning detective saga returns in this standalone sequel to The Case of the Golden Idol. Uncover the truth behind 20 strange cases of crime, death and depravity in the 1970s. The world has changed dramatically - the sins of humanity have not.','2024/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2716400/The_Rise_of_the_Golden_Idol/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(896,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_beyond_the_baltic_sea',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2018/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/925580/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Beyond_the_Baltic_Sea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(897,'total_war:_medieval_ii_–_definitive_edition',NULL,'Spanning the most turbulent era in Western history, your quest for territory and power takes you through Europe, Africa, the Middle East, and even onto the shores of the New World.','2006/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/4700/Total_War_MEDIEVAL_II__Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(898,'lost_but_found',NULL,'Organize and give out lost items! Lost But Found is a job simulator game where you are an officer who oversees the lost items in an airport. Organize those items and distribute them to people who lost their belongings. Upgrade your office, manage requests, collect stickers, and more.','2024/11/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3204250/Lost_But_Found/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(899,'wreckfest',NULL,'Wreckfest is a demolition derby themed racing game with soft-body damage modeling, sophisticated driving dynamics and in-depth vehicle upgrading, featuring both demolition derbies and more traditional track races. It’s all about fun, breakneck racing and over-the-top crashes.','2018/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/228380/Wreckfest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(900,'flyknight',NULL,'Explore, fight, loot and fish! Solo or in co-op mode in this Old School First Person Dungeon Crawler. Earn your knighthood as you oppose the evil witch Lunamoth and stop her curse which prevents everyone from growing wings.','2025/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3108510/FlyKnight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(901,'solasta:_crown_of_the_magister',NULL,'Roll for initiative, take attacks of opportunity, manage player location and the verticality of the battle field in this Turn-Based Tactical RPG based on the SRD 5.1 Ruleset. In Solasta, you make the choices, dice decide your destiny.','2021/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1096530/Solasta_Crown_of_the_Magister/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(902,'far_cry_3',NULL,'Discover the dark secrets of a lawless island ruled by violence and take the fight to the enemy as you try to escape. You’ll need more than luck to escape alive!','2012/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/220240/Far_Cry_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(903,'reka',NULL,'Channel your inner witch! Build your cozy chicken-legged hut, practice witchcraft, and forage for ingredients in autumnal woodlands. Solve quests & uncover the great mysteries of the legendary witch Baba Jaga…','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1737870/REKA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(904,'liftoff®:_fpv_drone_racing',NULL,'Liftoff® is a drone simulator that translates the rush of first-person view drone flight to the digital world. Join the biggest community for virtual FPV racing and freestyle!','2018/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/410340/Liftoff_FPV_Drone_Racing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(905,'a_plague_tale:_requiem',NULL,'Embark on a heartrending journey into a brutal, breathtaking world, and discover the cost of saving those you love in a desperate struggle for survival. Strike from the shadows or unleash hell with a variety of weapons, tools and unearthly powers.','2022/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1182900/A_Plague_Tale_Requiem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(906,'dying_light:_the_beast',NULL,'Unleash the beast on August 22! You are Kyle Crane and after years of being experimented on, you are out for revenge. Experience a unique blend of open world and action survival horror as you hunt down the man who turned you into half man, half beast.','2025/8/22','Unreleased','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3008130/Dying_Light_The_Beast/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(907,'total_war:_warhammer_iii_-_yuan_bo_–_shadows_of_change',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: WARHAMMER III on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3301120/Total_War_WARHAMMER_III__Yuan_Bo__Shadows_of_Change/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(908,'planet_of_lana',NULL,'A young girl and her loyal friend embark on a rescue mission through a colorful world full of cold machines and unfamiliar creatures. Planet of Lana is a cinematic puzzle adventure framed by an epic sci-fi saga that stretches across centuries and galaxies.','2023/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1608230/Planet_of_Lana/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(909,'digimon_story_time_stranger',NULL,'The latest in the Digimon Story series is finally here! In this RPG, unravel a mystery that spans across the human world and the Digital World, collecting and raising a wide variety of Digimon to save the world.','2025/10/2','Unreleased','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1984270/Digimon_Story_Time_Stranger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(910,'crisis_core_–final_fantasy_vii–_reunion',NULL,'CRISIS CORE -FINAL FANTASY VII- REUNION is a remaster of CRISIS CORE featuring updated graphics, combat systems and soundtrack. Follow the tale of SOLDIER operative Zack Fair, as he discovers the secrets of Shinra\'s dark experiments.','2022/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1608070/CRISIS_CORE_FINAL_FANTASY_VII_REUNION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(911,'the_sims™_4_horse_ranch_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1990600/The_Sims_4_Horse_Ranch_Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(912,'victoria_3:_pivot_of_empire',NULL,'This content requires the base game Victoria 3 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3174360/Victoria_3_Pivot_of_Empire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(913,'kingdom_two_crowns',NULL,'Gather coins, build defenses and reclaim your fallen Kingdom. Explore and uncover secrets, unlock new technologies and protect your crown versus waves of Greed monsters that come at night. Kingdom is a solo or co-op micro-strategy and tower defense game set in an atmospheric pixel world.','2018/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/701160/Kingdom_Two_Crowns/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(914,'total_war:_warhammer_iii_-_champions_of_chaos',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: WARHAMMER III on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1824060/Total_War_WARHAMMER_III__Champions_of_Chaos/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(915,'descenders',NULL,'Descenders is extreme downhill freeriding for the modern era, with procedurally generated worlds, and where mistakes have real consequences. Will you lead your team to glory and become the next legendary Descender?','2019/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/681280/Descenders/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(916,'bully:_scholarship_edition',NULL,'Bully tells the story of mischievous 15-year-old Jimmy Hopkins as he goes through the hilarity and awkwardness of adolescence. Beat the jocks at dodge ball, play pranks on the preppies, save the nerds, kiss the girl and navigate the social hierarchy in the worst school around.','2008/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/12200/Bully_Scholarship_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(917,'left_4_dead',NULL,'From Valve (the creators of Counter-Strike, Half-Life and more) comes Left 4 Dead, a co-op action horror game for the PC and Xbox 360 that casts up to four players in an epic struggle for survival against swarming zombie hordes and terrifying mutant monsters.','2008/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/500/Left_4_Dead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(918,'jurassic_world_evolution_2:_park_managers\'_collection_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2897800/Jurassic_World_Evolution_2_Park_Managers_Collection_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(919,'wolfquest:_anniversary_edition',NULL,'Live the life of a wild wolf in a realistic ecological simulation set in Yellowstone National Park.','2019/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/926990/WolfQuest_Anniversary_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(920,'old_school_runescape',NULL,'The best retro fantasy MMORPG on the planet. Old School is RuneScape but… older! This is the open world you know and love, but as it was in 2007. Saying that, it’s even better than that – Old School is shaped by you, its players, with regular new content, fixes and expansions voted for by the fans!','2013/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1343370/Old_School_RuneScape/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(921,'medieval_dynasty_-_echoes_of_nature',NULL,'This content requires the base game Medieval Dynasty on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3774330/Medieval_Dynasty__Echoes_of_Nature/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(922,'pico_park_2',NULL,'PICO PARK is back with all new levels! Play with 2-8 players locally or online in this co-op action-puzzle game!','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2644470/PICO_PARK_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(923,'nobody_wants_to_die',NULL,'Lose yourself in the dystopian world of New York, 2329; immortality comes at a price that someone has to pay. In this interactive noir story, lead the investigation using advanced technology, as Detective James Karra who risks it all in pursuit of a serial killer targeting the city’s elite.','2024/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1939970/Nobody_Wants_to_Die/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(924,'sleeping_dogs:_definitive_edition',NULL,'The Definitive Edition of the critically acclaimed, award winning open-world action adventure, reworked, rebuilt and re-mastered for the new generation. With all previously available DLC included and a wealth of tech and visual improvements, Hong Kong has never felt so alive.','2014/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/307690/Sleeping_Dogs_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_19'),(925,'windblown',NULL,'Brave the Vortex and dash your way to greatness in this lightning-fast action roguelite for 1-3 players from the crafters of Dead Cells. Absorb the powers of fallen warriors, rebuild their weapons, and WIPE THE FLOOR with those Sentinels in search of that perfect run!','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1911610/Windblown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(926,'rec_room',NULL,'Rec Room is the best place to build and play games together. Party up with friends from all around the world to chat, hang out, explore MILLIONS of player-created rooms, or build something new and amazing to share with us all.','2016/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/471710/Rec_Room/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(927,'humanitz',NULL,'HumanitZ is a co-op, isometric, open world survival game in a world ended by the zombie outbreak. As one of the few human survivors, try to last as long as “humanly” possible. The past can’t be changed, but you can make a difference today for the future of humanity.','2023/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1766060/HumanitZ/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(928,'digimon_story_cyber_sleuth:_complete_edition',NULL,'With engaging storylines, classic turn-based battles, and tons of Digimon to collect, Digimon Story Cyber Sleuth: Complete Edition delivers everything fans loved about Digimon Story: Cyber Sleuth and Digimon Story: Cyber Sleuth – Hacker’s Memory.','2019/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1042550/Digimon_Story_Cyber_Sleuth_Complete_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(929,'into_the_radius_2',NULL,'Into the Radius 2 is an immersive VR survival shooter, set in a realm of surreal landscapes and deadly entities known as Pechorsk Anomaly. Arm yourself with realistic weapons and venture deeper into the mysteries that lie within, either solo or with a friend by your side.','2024/7/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2307350/Into_the_Radius_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(930,'big_ambitions',NULL,'Big Ambitions is a revolutionary role-playing business sim. Go from nothing to the biggest entrepreneur in New York by opening small businesses or slowly building huge corporations any way you like.','2023/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1331550/Big_Ambitions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(931,'orcs_must_die!_deathtrap',NULL,'Orcs Must Die! Deathtrap combines chaotic third-person combat with devious trap-laying strategy. Enjoy endless replayability as your War Mage grows stronger through roguelite progression. Repel relentless orc hordes solo or with up to 4 players.','2025/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2273980/Orcs_Must_Die_Deathtrap/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(932,'realm_of_the_mad_god_exalt',NULL,'Embark on an exhilarating journey into the pixelated Realm of the Mad God! Join, an action-packed, free-to-play MMO bullet hell game. Discover a world with danger, challenges, and hidden treasures as you battle through waves of enemies. Team up with players and conquer dungeons to become a legend!','2012/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/200210/Realm_of_the_Mad_God_Exalt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(933,'workers_&_resources:_soviet_republic_-_early_start',NULL,'This content requires the base game Workers & Resources: Soviet Republic on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3334790/Workers__Resources_Soviet_Republic__Early_Start/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(934,'oddsparks:_an_automation_adventure',NULL,'Oddsparks is a blend of automation and real-time strategy for both the die-hard fans of the automation genre and the automation-curious. Explore a strange fantasy world, uncover the mysteries of the past, automate your workshops, and go on adventures with your odd & adorable Sparks!','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1817800/Oddsparks_An_Automation_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(935,'morimens',NULL,'Morimens is a roguelite card-building game inspired by the Cthulhu mythos, where you craft a versatile and intricate deck tailored to your playstyle. The choice is yours to embark on a climb up treacherous towers or engage in tactical battles. Explore misty maps and uncover the truth of the world.','2024/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3052450/Morimens/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(936,'cricket_24',NULL,'Cricket 24 is the culmination of a decade of Cricket video game development and includes teams from every corner of the globe.','2023/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2358260/Cricket_24/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(937,'the_coffin_of_andy_and_leyley',NULL,'Walk-n-talk adventure with light puzzling. Brother and sister practice cannibalism after witnessing a botched satanic ritual.','2023/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2378900/The_Coffin_of_Andy_and_Leyley/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(938,'resident_evil',NULL,'The game that defined the survival-horror genre is back! Check out the remastered HD version of Resident Evil.','2015/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/304240/Resident_Evil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(939,'kingdoms_and_castles',NULL,'Kingdoms and Castles is a city-building simulation game about growing a kingdom from a tiny hamlet to a sprawling city and imposing castle. Make trade agreements, alliance, and war with neighboring AI controlled kingdoms. Each villager and resource is individually simulated.','2017/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/569480/Kingdoms_and_Castles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(940,'as_we_descend',NULL,'The apocalyptic roguelike deckbuilder with squad sculpting and deep tactics. Recruit the right units and outmaneuver titanic foes on dangerous expeditions. Build up allies and resources in the feudal Vault-City. Can you survive all the perils that await the last bastion of humanity?','2025/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1769830/As_We_Descend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(941,'kathy_rain_2:_soothsayer',NULL,'In this point-and-click urban thriller, down-and-out private eye Kathy Rain will embark on her most dangerous case yet — the pursuit of the notorious serial killer known as the Soothsayer. Find clues, gather evidence, connect the dots, and confront the murderer before the hunter becomes the hunted…','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1466390/Kathy_Rain_2_Soothsayer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(942,'back_4_blood',NULL,'Back 4 Blood is a thrilling cooperative first-person shooter from the creators of the critically acclaimed Left 4 Dead franchise. Experience the intense 4 player co-op narrative campaign, competitive multiplayer as human or Ridden, and frenetic gameplay that keeps you in the action.','2021/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/924970/Back_4_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(943,'dungeons_4',NULL,'The Absolute Evil and its trusted *cough* servant, the Dark Elf Thalya, return in Dungeons 4 after the events of its fabulous predecessor to bring about their triumph over the forces of good once more.','2023/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1643310/Dungeons_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(944,'medieval_dynasty_-_echoes_of_nature',NULL,'This content requires the base game Medieval Dynasty on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3774330/Medieval_Dynasty__Echoes_of_Nature/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(945,'onimusha_2:_samurai\'s_destiny',NULL,'Reclaim your destiny. Onimusha 2: Samurai\'s Destiny returns with higher resolution graphics and modernised controls to perform issen critical counter attacks and intense swordplay. Experience this dramatic revenge story set in Feudal Japan.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3046600/Onimusha_2_Samurais_Destiny/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(946,'suikoden_i&ii_hd_remaster_gate_rune_and_dunan_unification_wars',NULL,'A hero\'s destiny is written in the Stars. The legendary KONAMI JRPGs Suikoden I and Suikoden II have now been remastered in HD!','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1932640/Suikoden_III_HD_Remaster_Gate_Rune_and_Dunan_Unification_Wars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(947,'american_truck_simulator_-_arkansas',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2585150/American_Truck_Simulator__Arkansas/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(948,'deck_of_haunts',NULL,'Deck of Haunts invites you to become a malevolent Haunted House. Lure humans into your cursed halls, manipulate their fears, and drain their essence to grow your power. Use strategy to build your mansion and expand your dark influence, turning your home into a terrifying, inescapable nightmare.','2025/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3179730/Deck_of_Haunts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(949,'stranded:_alien_dawn',NULL,'Brave a new world in Stranded: Alien Dawn, a planet survival sim placing the fate of a small marooned group in your hands. Forge your story through compelling and immersive strategic gameplay as you make vital decisions to protect your survivors.','2023/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1324130/Stranded_Alien_Dawn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(950,'poppy_playtime_-_chapter_4',NULL,'This content requires the base game Poppy Playtime on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3008670/Poppy_Playtime__Chapter_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(951,'(the)_gnorp_apologue',NULL,'(the) Gnorp Apologue is the journey of the gnorps as you guide them towards their goal of delightfully excessive wealth accumulation.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1473350/the_Gnorp_Apologue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(952,'crusader_kings_iii:_khans_of_the_steppe',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings III on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3315510/Crusader_Kings_III_Khans_of_the_Steppe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(953,'old_world',NULL,'Old World is a revolutionary new historical strategy game where you lead your dynasty over generations of rule against rival kings and queens. Wage massive wars, manage your court, and build a dynasty — or watch your empire crumble to dust. What legacy will you leave behind?','2022/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/597180/Old_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(954,'hello_kitty_island_adventure_-_deluxe_edition',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hello Kitty Island Adventure on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3359740/Hello_Kitty_Island_Adventure__Deluxe_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(955,'ark:_genesis_season_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game ARK: Survival Evolved on Steam in order to play.','2019/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1113410/ARK_Genesis_Season_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(956,'ace_attorney_investigations_collection',NULL,'Miles Edgeworth\'s dramatic turnabouts take center stage! Experience both Ace Attorney Investigations games in one gorgeous collection! Investigate crime scenes and solve tough, intriguing cases through logic and deduction. When Edgeworth\'s past and present collide, his future begins!','2024/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2401970/Ace_Attorney_Investigations_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(957,'spirit_of_the_north_2',NULL,'Unveil the mysteries of a beautiful ancient world in this breathtaking 3rd-Person Adventure, a sequel to the acclaimed ‘Spirit of the North.’ Take on the role of an isolated fox with a raven companion on a quest to restore the lost guardians and return home.','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1778840/Spirit_of_the_North_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(958,'the_quarry',NULL,'When the sun goes down on the last night of summer camp, nine teenage counselors are plunged into an unpredictable night of horror. The only thing worse than the blood-drenched locals and creatures hunting them are the unimaginable choices you must make to help them survive.','2022/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1577120/The_Quarry/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(959,'fallout_3:_game_of_the_year_edition',NULL,'Prepare for the Future™ With Fallout 3: Game of the Year Edition, experience the most acclaimed game of 2008 like never before. Create a character of your choosing and descend into an awe-inspiring, post-apocalyptic world where every minute is a fight for survival.','2009/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/22370/Fallout_3_Game_of_the_Year_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(960,'﻿the_desert_armor_set',NULL,'This content requires the base game 7 Days to Die on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3635260/The_Desert_Armor_Set/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(961,'code_vein',NULL,'In the face of certain death, we rise. Team up and embark on a journey to the ends of hell to unlock your past and escape your living nightmare in CODE VEIN.','2019/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/678960/CODE_VEIN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(962,'football_manager_2024_in-game_editor',NULL,'This content requires the base game Football Manager 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2473420/Football_Manager_2024_Ingame_Editor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(963,'a_hat_in_time',NULL,'A Hat in Time is a cute-as-heck 3D platformer featuring a little girl who stitches hats for wicked powers! Freely explore giant worlds and recover Time Pieces to travel to new heights!','2017/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/253230/A_Hat_in_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(964,'digimon_world:_next_order',NULL,'The Digital World has run rampant with Machinedramon and is now in a state of utter chaos. As a Digidestined, it’s up to you to restore order to the world in Digimon World: Next Order, a monster collecting RPG.','2023/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1530160/Digimon_World_Next_Order/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(965,'the_casting_of_frank_stone™',NULL,'The shadow of Frank Stone looms over Cedar Hills, a town forever altered by his violent past. As a group of young friends are about to discover, Stone’s blood-soaked legacy cuts deep, leaving scars across families, generations, and the very fabric of reality itself.','2024/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2223840/The_Casting_of_Frank_Stone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(966,'star_wars™_-_the_force_unleashed™_ultimate_sith_edition',NULL,'A game that will show gamers the deepest, darkest side of the Force in a story that puts them on a collision course with Luke Skywalker himself.','2009/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/32430/STAR_WARS__The_Force_Unleashed_Ultimate_Sith_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(967,'the_sims™_4_high_school_years_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1816550/The_Sims_4_High_School_Years_Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(968,'kiborg',NULL,'KIBORG is a relentless rogue-lite beat’em up where you enhance your body with new cybernetic implants each run. You’ve been sent to the worst prison in the galaxy for crimes you didn’t commit. Death won’t provide an escape, but a violent reality show may offer a way out.','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2405060/KIBORG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(969,'sticky_business',NULL,'Experience the joy of running your own cozy small business: Create stickers, pack orders and hear your customers’ stories. Time to build the cutest shop on the internet!','2023/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2303350/Sticky_Business/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(970,'legacy_of_kain™_soul_reaver_1&2_remastered',NULL,'Experience the epic conflict of Kain and Raziel in original form or with remastered graphics.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2521380/Legacy_of_Kain_Soul_Reaver_12_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(971,'final_fantasy_xiv:_dawntrail',NULL,'This content requires the base game FINAL FANTASY XIV Online on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2649240/FINAL_FANTASY_XIV_Dawntrail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(972,'expansion_starter_pack_-_guild_wars_2:_heart_of_thorns™_and_path_of_fire™',NULL,'This content requires the base game Guild Wars 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1996840/Expansion_Starter_Pack__Guild_Wars_2_Heart_of_Thorns_and_Path_of_Fire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_20'),(973,'marvel\'s_spider-man_2_-_digital_deluxe_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Marvel\'s Spider-Man 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3172660/Marvels_SpiderMan_2__Digital_Deluxe_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(974,'life_is_strange:_double_exposure',NULL,'When Max Caulfield finds her friend Safi dead in the snow, she tears open the way to a parallel timeline. Here, Safi is still alive - and still in danger! With her new power to Shift between two timelines – can Max solve and prevent the same murder?','2024/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1874000/Life_is_Strange_Double_Exposure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(975,'steamworld_build',NULL,'SteamWorld Build is a casual city-building and dungeon-management cross-over set in the SteamWorld Universe, where you build and manage a town on a dying planet. You\'ll need to balance resources, construction, and exploration to its depths to ensure your town\'s survival and eventual escape.','2023/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2134770/SteamWorld_Build/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(976,'the_case_of_the_golden_idol',NULL,'A new kind of detective game that allows you to think and investigate freely. Discover clues surrounding 12 strange and gruesome deaths and build your own theory. Pick your suspect, deduce the motive, unmask the awful truth.','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1677770/The_Case_of_the_Golden_Idol/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(977,'out_of_the_park_baseball_26',NULL,'26 years of sports gaming excellence! Out of the Park Baseball 26 is here - officially licensed by MLB, the MLB Players Inc. and KBO! This year\'s brand new version puts you firmly in charge of your favorite baseball franchise. Your team, your way, your rules.','2025/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3116890/Out_of_the_Park_Baseball_26/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(978,'batman™:_arkham_origins',NULL,'As of December 4, 2016, the online services portion of Batman: Arkham Origins has been retired. We thank those that have joined us to battle. The Single player campaign may still be played and enjoyed offline. For any questions relating to Batman: Arkham Origins, please contact WB Games customer service.','2013/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/209000/Batman_Arkham_Origins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(979,'in_stars_and_time',NULL,'Live with the ever-present burden of being trapped in a time loop only you can know about in this turn-based RPG. Create a better future for you and your friends. Find hope where there is none left. Pray to the stars and free yourself from time.','2023/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1677310/In_Stars_And_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(980,'borderlands:_the_pre-sequel',NULL,'Launch into the Borderlands universe and shoot ‘n’ loot your way through a brand new adventure that rockets you onto Pandora’s moon in Borderlands: The Pre-Sequel!','2014/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/261640/Borderlands_The_PreSequel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(981,'we_who_are_about_to_die',NULL,'Fight & strategize your way through spectacles and arenas -- rise from lowly slave to Grand Champion and earn your freedom. Or... die trying. This Gladiator RPG Roguelite features in-depth career management and a unique physics simulated combat system. To those who are about to die, I salute you!','2022/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/973230/We_Who_Are_About_To_Die/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(982,'steins;gate_elite',NULL,'STEINS;GATE ELITE follows a rag-tag band of tech-savvy young students who discover the means of changing the past via e-mail using a modified microwave.','2019/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/819030/STEINSGATE_ELITE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(983,'dorfromantik',NULL,'Dorfromantik is a peaceful building strategy and puzzle game where you create a beautiful and ever-growing village landscape by placing tiles. Explore a variety of colorful biomes, discover and unlock new tiles and complete quests to fill your world with life!','2022/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1455840/Dorfromantik/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(984,'uboat',NULL,'UBOAT is a simulator of a submarine from WWII era. It is a survival sandbox with crew management mechanics while its primary theme is life of German sailors. The boat is their home, but it can become their grave at any time.','2024/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/494840/UBOAT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(985,'lost_judgment',NULL,'When a police officer discloses the murder of the student teacher who bullied his son to suicide, the twisted secrets of a Yokohama, high school bleed out. Nothing, in this case, is black and white.','2022/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2058190/Lost_Judgment/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(986,'storror_parkour_pro',NULL,'Escape Reality. The ultimate multiplayer parkour experience. Escape, race, and explore the streets and rooftops of London’s Isle of Dogs. Join team STORROR to save your estate, or challenge your friends to test their skills. STORROR Parkour Pro is complete control and freedom of movement.','2025/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3125250/STORROR_Parkour_Pro/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(987,'just_cause™_3',NULL,'With over 1000 km² of complete freedom from sky to seabed, Rico Rodriguez returns to unleash chaos in the most creative and explosive ways imaginable.','2015/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/225540/Just_Cause_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(988,'tomb_raider_i-iii_remastered_starring_lara_croft',NULL,'Play the original three Tomb Raider adventures with all expansions and secret levels in this definitive collection.','2024/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2478970/Tomb_Raider_IIII_Remastered_Starring_Lara_Croft/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(989,'they_are_billions',NULL,'They Are Billions is a Steampunk strategy game set on a post-apocalyptic planet. Build and defend colonies to survive against the billions of the infected that seek to annihilate the few remaining living humans. Can humanity survive after the zombie apocalypse?','2019/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/644930/They_Are_Billions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(990,'five_nights_at_freddy\'s',NULL,'Welcome to your new summer job at Freddy Fazbear\'s Pizza, where kids and parents alike come for entertainment and food! The main attraction is Freddy Fazbear, of course; and his two friends. They are animatronic robots, programmed to please the crowds!','2014/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/319510/Five_Nights_at_Freddys/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(991,'total_war:_warhammer_iii_-_gorbad_–_omens_of_destruction',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: WARHAMMER III on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2574900/Total_War_WARHAMMER_III__Gorbad__Omens_of_Destruction/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(992,'lost_skies',NULL,'Chart a course in a breathtaking, but fractured world. Explore ancient ruins, master advanced technology, and craft your very own skyship to brave nature’s fury and colossal threats in Lost Skies. Team up with friends or go it alone in this awe-inspiring cooperative survival adventure.','2025/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1931180/Lost_Skies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(993,'the_jackbox_party_pack_7',NULL,'Five new games: the hit threequel Quiplash 3, the collaborative chaos of The Devils and the Details, the fierce drawing game Champ’d Up, the speech game Talking Points and the guessing game Blather \'Round. Use phones or tablets as controllers and play with up to 8 players, and an audience of 10,000!','2020/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1211630/The_Jackbox_Party_Pack_7/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(994,'the_escapists_2',NULL,'Craft, Steal, Brawl and Escape! It’s time to bust out of the toughest prisons in the world as you return to the life of an inmate in The Escapists 2, now with multiplayer! Have you got what it takes to escape?','2017/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/641990/The_Escapists_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(995,'sid_meier\'s_civilization®_vi:_gathering_storm',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier’s Civilization® VI on Steam in order to play.','2019/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/947510/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_VI_Gathering_Storm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(996,'warriors:_abyss',NULL,'Through victory and defeat, traverse the merciless trials of hell.','2025/2/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3178350/WARRIORS_Abyss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(997,'yakuza:_like_a_dragon',NULL,'Become Ichiban Kasuga, a low-ranking yakuza grunt left on the brink of death by the man he trusted most. Take up your legendary bat and get ready to crack some underworld skulls in dynamic RPG combat set against the backdrop of modern-day Japan.','2020/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235140/Yakuza_Like_a_Dragon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(998,'astrometica',NULL,'Astrometica is a space exploration and base-building survival game. After a catastrophic event, explore vast space, gather resources, build bases, and uncover cosmic mysteries. Use advanced technology, craft tools, and discover new blueprints to survive and thrive in the unknown.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2353250/Astrometica/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(999,'neva',NULL,'Experience the moving tale of a young woman and her lifelong bond with a magnificent wolf as they embark on a thrilling adventure through a rapidly dying world.','2024/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2420660/Neva/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1000,'doom_+_doom_ii',NULL,'Developed by id Software, and originally released in 1993 and 1994, the definitive, newly enhanced versions of DOOM + DOOM II are available as a combined product.','1995/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2280/DOOM__DOOM_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1001,'zombie_army_4:_dead_war',NULL,'Hitler’s hordes are back for more in this spine-chilling shooter from the makers of Sniper Elite 4! Abominable occult enemies, epic weapons and a harrowing new campaign for 1-4 players await in 1940s Europe, as you fight to save humankind from undead Armageddon!','2021/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/694280/Zombie_Army_4_Dead_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1002,'battle_brothers',NULL,'Battle Brothers is a turn based tactical RPG which has you leading a mercenary company in a gritty, low-power, medieval fantasy world. You decide where to go, whom to hire or to fight, what contracts to take and how to train and equip your men in a procedurally generated open world campaign.','2017/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/365360/Battle_Brothers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1003,'warhammer_40,000:_inquisitor_-_martyr',NULL,'Enter the Chaos-infested Caligari Sector and purge the unclean with the most powerful agents of the Imperium of Man! W40k: Inquisitor – Martyr is a grim Action-RPG featuring multiple classes of the Inquisition who will carry out the Emperor’s will.','2018/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/527430/Warhammer_40000_Inquisitor__Martyr/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1004,'dead_rising_deluxe_remaster',NULL,'Dead Rising returns with modern graphics in this Deluxe Remaster!','2024/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2527390/Dead_Rising_Deluxe_Remaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1005,'carx_street_-_deluxe_cars',NULL,'This content requires the base game CarX Street on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3028020/CarX_Street__Deluxe_Cars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1006,'dayz_frostline',NULL,'This content requires the base game DayZ on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2968040/DayZ_Frostline/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1007,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_going_east!',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2013/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/227310/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Going_East/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1008,'dragon_ball_z:_kakarot',NULL,'The Dragon Ball RPG of your dreams! For the first time, you can play the rest of the story. Step into the universe of Dragon Ball Z in all its iconic glory and become the hero you were always meant to be!','2020/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/851850/DRAGON_BALL_Z_KAKAROT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1009,'stronghold:_definitive_edition',NULL,'Greetings sire! Your stronghold awaits you. Build a castle economy, besiege unforgettable villains and return to the \'castle sim\' that started it all. Experience this classic RTS with upgraded visuals, modernised gameplay, Steam multiplayer and a new campaign.','2023/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2140020/Stronghold_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1010,'supercar_collection_simulator',NULL,'Start your own diecast store! Unbox surprise car packs, expand your collection, oin exciting races with customers on the tracks, and play online trading games. A world full of speed and excitement is waiting for you in your store!','2025/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3453600/Supercar_Collection_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1011,'don\'t_starve',NULL,'Don’t Starve is an uncompromising wilderness survival game full of science and magic. Enter a strange and unexplored world full of strange creatures, dangers, and surprises. Gather resources to craft items and structures that match your survival style.','2013/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/219740/Dont_Starve/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1012,'minecraft_dungeons',NULL,'Fight your way through an exciting action-adventure game, inspired by classic dungeon crawlers and set in the Minecraft universe!','2021/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1672970/Minecraft_Dungeons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1013,'kindergarten',NULL,'Welcome to Kindergarten! Have fun trying to learn and share...and not die. That\'s important too. In a school that\'s just not quite right, it\'s important to be friendly...and take out those that aren\'t.','2017/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/589590/Kindergarten/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1014,'girls\'_frontline_2:_exilium',NULL,'GIRLS\' FRONTLINE 2: EXILIUM is a Post-Apocalyptic Tactical RPG. Players take on the role of a commander who acts as a bounty hunter, leading a squad of tactical dolls through the contaminated zones. While accepting and completing various missions, players will face continuous waves of enemies.','2025/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3308670/GIRLS_FRONTLINE_2_EXILIUM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1015,'revolution_idle',NULL,'Join an experience where each revolution takes you further into the unknown! Revolution Idle challenges you to multiply your accumulators to reach unimaginable heights. Will you manage to reach infinity?','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2763740/Revolution_Idle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1016,'bomb_rush_cyberfunk',NULL,'Bomb Rush Cyberfunk is 1 second per second of advanced funkstyle. Battle rival crews and dispatch militarized police to conquer the five boroughs of New Amsterdam. Become All City.','2023/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1353230/Bomb_Rush_Cyberfunk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1017,'tales_of_seikyu',NULL,'Inspired by the charm of games like Fields of Mistria and Rune Factory, Tales of Seikyu is a cozy adventure filled with warmth, nature, and magic! Farm, decorate and find love in this charming and mystical fantasy farming sim.','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2340520/Tales_of_Seikyu/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1018,'motogp™25',NULL,'Rev up your engines for the 2025 season! Feel the authentic MotoGP™ thrills with refined sound design and exciting challenges. Train with new disciplines in Race Off mode and choose the Arcade or Pro Experience for ultimate fun or realism!','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3077390/MotoGP25/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1019,'worms_w.m.d',NULL,'The worms are back in their most destructive game yet. With a gorgeous, hand-drawn 2D look, brand new weapons, the introduction of crafting, vehicles and buildings plus the return of some much-loved classic weapons and gameplay, Worms W.M.D is the best worms experience ever.','2016/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/327030/Worms_WMD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1020,'apollo_justice:_ace_attorney_trilogy',NULL,'Join rookie attorney Apollo Justice and his mentor, the legendary Phoenix Wright, in this collection of 3 games! This title features 16 episodes (including previously DLC-only episodes) and supports English, French, German, Japanese Korean, and Traditional and Simplified Chinese.','2024/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2187220/Apollo_Justice_Ace_Attorney_Trilogy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_21'),(1021,'stranded_deep',NULL,'Take the role of a plane crash survivor stranded somewhere in the Pacific Ocean. Come face to face with some of the most life threatening scenarios that will result in a different experience each time you play. Scavenge. Discover. Survive.','2022/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/313120/Stranded_Deep/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1022,'overcooked!_all_you_can_eat',NULL,'Experience all the Onion Kingdom has to offer, Overcooked! 1 & 2 infused with 4k goodness running at a smooth 60 FPS. Fully remastered and cooked up from scratch. Enjoy 200+ levels (22 new) and 80+ chefs (3 new), this is the ultimate Overcooked! experience.','2021/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1243830/Overcooked_All_You_Can_Eat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1023,'the_callisto_protocol™',NULL,'Survive to escape the horrors of Callisto and uncover the dark secrets of Jupiter’s dead moon.','2022/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1544020/The_Callisto_Protocol/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1024,'darfall',NULL,'Darfall is a hero-based RPG city-building game that puts you in the role of a hero who must protect their home and help it grow! During the day, grow your hero’s might, find epic loot, master new abilities, and fortify your settlement. At night, survive the hordes of undead, until you triumph.','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1961600/Darfall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1025,'what_remains_of_edith_finch',NULL,'What Remains of Edith Finch is a collection of strange tales about a family in Washington state. As Edith, you’ll explore the colossal Finch house, searching for stories as she explores her family history and tries to figure out why she\'s the last one in her family left alive.','2017/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/501300/What_Remains_of_Edith_Finch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1026,'sniper_ghost_warrior_contracts_2',NULL,'SGW Contracts 2 is a modern warfare shooter set in the Middle East. Play as Raven, Contract Sniper Assassin, as you take out a series of targets across a dramatic single-player campaign. With extreme-range shots exceeding 1000m, gear up for the most challenging entry to the series yet.','2021/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1338770/Sniper_Ghost_Warrior_Contracts_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1027,'american_truck_simulator_-_nebraska',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2543810/American_Truck_Simulator__Nebraska/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1028,'the_legend_of_heroes:_trails_through_daybreak_ii',NULL,'Return to the Calvard Republic and unravel the mystery of the crimson beast! One day, a shocking series of murders set the wheels of fate into motion once again. Chaos looming on the horizon, the spriggan Van Arkride receives an unexpected visitor. Who is behind the murders, and what is their goal?','2025/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2668430/The_Legend_of_Heroes_Trails_through_Daybreak_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1029,'action_taimanin',NULL,'An intense, gorgeous hack-and-slash action RPG from the Taimanin fame!','2020/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1335200/Action_Taimanin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1030,'total_war:_warhammer_iii_-_mother_ostankya_–_shadows_of_change',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: WARHAMMER III on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3301130/Total_War_WARHAMMER_III__Mother_Ostankya__Shadows_of_Change/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1031,'another_crab\'s_treasure',NULL,'In a vibrant undersea kingdom on the verge of collapse, a hermit crab embarks on a treasure hunt to buy back his repossessed shell. The second game from AGGRO CRAB.','2024/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1887840/Another_Crabs_Treasure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1032,'trackdayr',NULL,'The most complete motorcycle simulator that allows you to ride every type of motorbikes including ATVs, 3 Wheelers prototype and Sidecars. Challenge your online friends on TrackDayR and climb the leaderboards of players all over the world. TrackDayR, Trackday Everyday!','2021/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1511630/TrackDayR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1033,'no_more_room_in_hell_2',NULL,'No More Room in Hell 2 is a terrifying 8 player co-op action horror experience. Find your friends in the dark and survive - in a dynamic, endlessly replayable zombie apocalypse.','2024/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/292000/No_More_Room_in_Hell_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1034,'viscera_cleanup_detail',NULL,'In Viscera Cleanup Detail, you step into the boots of a space-station janitor tasked with cleaning up after various horrific sci-fi horror events. Instead of machineguns and plasma-rifles, your tools are a mop and bucket. That hero left a mess, and it\'s up to you to deal with the aftermath.','2015/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/246900/Viscera_Cleanup_Detail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1035,'the_elder_scrolls_iii:_morrowind®_game_of_the_year_edition',NULL,'The Elder Scrolls III: Morrowind® Game of the Year Edition includes Morrowind plus all of the content from the Bloodmoon and Tribunal expansions. The original Mod Construction Set is not included in this package. An epic, open-ended single-player RPG, Morrowind allows you to create and play any kind of character imaginable.','2002/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/22320/The_Elder_Scrolls_III_Morrowind_Game_of_the_Year_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1036,'march_of_empires',NULL,'Claim your title as Shogun, Highland King, Northern Tsar or Desert Sultan and join this genre-redefining strategy game where you will wage constant war for real territorial conquest! Fortify your castle, fuel a massive army, and enter the ultimate fight for realm domination!','2017/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/702320/March_of_Empires/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1037,'infinity_nikki',NULL,'Embark on a cozy open-world adventure filled with vast landscape, mystical puzzles and unexpected platforming challenges. Dress up not just for style, but to unravel hidden mysteries, interact with a vibrant environment, and experience the freedom to explore at your own pace.','2025/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3164330/Infinity_Nikki/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1038,'warhammer_40,000:_rogue_trader_-_void_shadows',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Rogue Trader on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2951990/Warhammer_40000_Rogue_Trader__Void_Shadows/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1039,'marvel_vs._capcom_fighting_collection:_arcade_classics',NULL,'The legendary crossover hits are back! The action-packed lineup consisting of seven unique titles, is full of heavy hitters like X-MEN VS. STREET FIGHTER, and MARVEL vs. CAPCOM 2 New Age of Heroes. The collection also includes the rare beat \'em up game, THE PUNISHER.','2024/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2634890/MARVEL_vs_CAPCOM_Fighting_Collection_Arcade_Classics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1040,'devil_may_cry_4_special_edition',NULL,'The smash-hit stylish action game DMC4 is back and better than ever, boasting new playable characters and game modes!','2015/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/329050/Devil_May_Cry_4_Special_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1041,'who\'s_your_daddy?!',NULL,'Who\'s Your Daddy is a casual multiplayer game featuring a clueless father attempting to prevent his infant son from certain death. Play with up to 7 of your friends, and test your parenting skills in a competitive setup with wacky physics and over 69 potentially ominous household items.','2015/12/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/427730/Whos_Your_Daddy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1042,'mini_motorways',NULL,'Mini Motorways is a strategy simulation game about designing the road map for a growing city. Build a traffic network, one road at a time, to create a bustling metropolis. Redesign your roads and place your motorways to get everyone where they need to go. How long can you keep the city moving?','2021/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1127500/Mini_Motorways/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1043,'dave_the_diver_-_ichiban\'s_holiday_content_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DAVE THE DIVER on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3543180/DAVE_THE_DIVER__Ichibans_Holiday_Content_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1044,'disney_epic_mickey:_rebrushed',NULL,'Embark on a magical journey in Disney Epic Mickey: Rebrushed! Shape your adventure with the stroke of a brush and transform Wasteland as Mickey Mouse in this beautifully recreated 3D platformer.','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1522160/Disney_Epic_Mickey_Rebrushed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1045,'deadside',NULL,'An Open World Survival Shooter blending hardcore PVP and PVE action. Secure precious loot in safe zones or build your own fortress in the wild. With intense gunfights, stunning visuals, and performance smooth enough for any system, the challenge awaits!','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/895400/Deadside/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1046,'half-life_2',NULL,'Reawakened from stasis in the occupied metropolis of City 17, Gordon Freeman is joined by Alyx Vance as he leads a desperate human resistance. Experience the landmark first-person shooter packed with immersive world-building, boundary-pushing physics, and exhilarating combat.','2004/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/220/HalfLife_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1047,'city_transport_simulator®',NULL,'The All-in-One Simulation! Drive highly detailed and licensed real buses & trams, build and design your own transport company, and grow your network in a European-inspired city.','2025/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2604480/City_Transport_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1048,'old_market_simulator',NULL,'Old Market Simulator is a 1-4 player co-op game where you manage your market by ordering goods, growing produce, raising animals, fishing, and crafting items in your workshop, while hiring employees and expanding your business.','2024/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2878420/Old_Market_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1049,'american_truck_simulator_-_texas',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1465750/American_Truck_Simulator__Texas/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1050,'metal_gear_rising:_revengeance',NULL,'Developed by Kojima Productions and PlatinumGames, METAL GEAR RISING: REVENGEANCE takes the renowned METAL GEAR franchise into exciting new territory with an all-new action experience. The game seamlessly melds pure action and epic story-telling that surrounds Raiden – a child soldier transformed into a half-human, half-cyborg ninja who...','2014/1/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/235460/METAL_GEAR_RISING_REVENGEANCE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1051,'wartales,_the_skelmar_invasion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wartales on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3335020/Wartales_The_Skelmar_Invasion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1052,'tactics_ogre:_reborn',NULL,'Tactics Ogre, crown jewel of the tactical role-playing genre, is reborn! Based on the 2010 release, the game features improved graphics and sound, as well as updated game design, bringing to life a new Tactics Ogre that remains true to its roots.','2022/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1451090/Tactics_Ogre_Reborn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1053,'peglin',NULL,'Peglin is a Pachinko Roguelike - Fight enemies by collecting special orbs and popping pegs to deal damage. Acquire special relics that radically change the game and ensure no two runs are the same. Aim carefully to survive in this unique turn-based RPG!','2024/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1296610/Peglin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1054,'expansion_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_no_step_back',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1348661/Expansion__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_No_Step_Back/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1055,'ori_and_the_blind_forest',NULL,'“Ori and the Blind Forest” tells the tale of a young orphan destined for heroics, through a visually stunning action-platformer crafted by Moon Studios for PC.','2015/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/261570/Ori_and_the_Blind_Forest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1056,'trombone_champ',NULL,'Honk, blow, & toot your way through over 60 songs, collect all 50 unique Tromboner Cards, and uncover the mysteries of the Trombiverse. Do you have what it takes to become the true Trombone Champ?','2022/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1059990/Trombone_Champ/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1057,'dead_by_daylight_-_alien_chapter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2515990/Dead_by_Daylight__Alien_Chapter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1058,'keep_talking_and_nobody_explodes',NULL,'Find yourself trapped alone in a room with a ticking time bomb. Your friends have the manual to defuse it, but they can\'t see the bomb, so you\'re going to have to talk it out – fast!','2015/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/341800/Keep_Talking_and_Nobody_Explodes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1059,'sally_face_-_episode_one',NULL,'Delve into a dark adventure following the boy with a prosthetic face and a tragic past. Unravel the sinister mysteries of Sally\'s world to find the truth that lies hidden beneath the shadows.','2016/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/541570/Sally_Face__Episode_One/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1060,'wildermyth',NULL,'Wildermyth follows heroes over their whole careers, from their pitchfork days to their powerful primes, and on into old age and memory. It’s a party-based procedural storytelling RPG where tactical combat and story decisions will alter your world and reshape your cast of characters.','2021/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/763890/Wildermyth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1061,'drug_dealer_simulator_2',NULL,'What turns a drug dealer into a drug lord? Find out in DDS2, a first-person co-op sim set in a dynamic open world. Make contacts, cook drugs, and manage your cartel on Isla Sombra, where power is the only law.','2024/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1708850/Drug_Dealer_Simulator_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1062,'scrap_mechanic',NULL,'Enter the creative paradise of Scrap Mechanic! Build fantastic machines, go on adventures with your friends and defend against waves of evil Farmbots in this imaginative multiplayer survival sandbox. With Scrap Mechanic’s powerful creation tools you can engineer your own adventures!','2016/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/387990/Scrap_Mechanic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1063,'the_sims™_4_discover_university',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235722/The_Sims_4_Discover_University/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1064,'commandos:_origins',NULL,'ALARM! You have been selected for a mission which will shape the fate of the entire world. Witness the very beginning of the legendary elite WWII force in Commandos: Origins. The long-awaited sequel to the Commandos series brings you right back to the foundation of the real-time tactics genre.','2025/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1479730/Commandos_Origins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1065,'train_sim_world®_5:_cardiff_city_network:_radur_&_coryton_–_penarth_&_bae_caerdydd_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2971220/Train_Sim_World_5_Cardiff_City_Network_Radur__Coryton__Penarth__Bae_Caerdydd_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1066,'game_of_thrones_winter_is_coming',NULL,'Game of Thrones Winter is Coming is a PC strategy game based on the HBO drama television series, officially licensed by Warner Bros. Interactive Entertainment under HBO, and developed and published by YOOZOO Games. Interactive Entertainment and HBO.','2019/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1105420/Game_of_Thrones_Winter_is_Coming/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1067,'pizza_tower',NULL,'Pizza Tower is a fast paced 2D platformer, with an emphasis on movement, exploration and score attack. Featuring highly stylized pixel art inspired by the cartoons from the \'90s, and a highly energetic soundtrack.','2023/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2231450/Pizza_Tower/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1068,'stellaris:_galactic_paragons',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2380030/Stellaris_Galactic_Paragons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1069,'watch_dogs™',NULL,'In today\'s hyper-connected world, Chicago operates under ctOS, the most advanced computer network in America.','2014/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/243470/Watch_Dogs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_22'),(1070,'muse_dash',NULL,'Paradise of parkour & rhythm game ★★★ — Muse Dash!!','2019/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/774171/Muse_Dash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1071,'octopath_traveler™',NULL,'Eight travelers. Eight adventures. Eight roles to play. Embark on an epic journey across the vast and wondrous world of Orsterra and discover the captivating stories of each of the eight travelers.','2019/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/921570/OCTOPATH_TRAVELER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1072,'triangle_strategy',NULL,'A new tactics RPG from the team who brought you the Bravely series and Octopath Traveler. An epic tale, brought to life with stunning HD-2D graphics. Make difficult decisions in this story set against a backdrop of the war-torn continent of Norzelia.','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1850510/TRIANGLE_STRATEGY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1073,'ara:_history_untold',NULL,'Build a nation starting at any point in human history and compete for supremacy in this epic turn-based strategy game. Engage in diplomacy, fight wars, and go head-to-head with other leaders from history.','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2021880/Ara_History_Untold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1074,'orebound',NULL,'Orebound is a voxel, factory, automation game set in a first person open-world. The King has tasked you to locate the elusive Emberstone. Go forth and use your Dwarven prowess and knowledge to mine, craft and automate through anything standing in your way - Build up or dig down! How far will you go?','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2467810/Orebound/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1075,'gloomhaven',NULL,'Lead your band of mercenaries in the land of Gloomhaven, work with unsavoury individuals, shape the fate of the region, fight your way through horrific places and get rich or die trying in this ruthless Tactical-RPG.','2021/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/780290/Gloomhaven/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1076,'command_&_conquer™_remastered_collection',NULL,'Command & Conquer and Red Alert are both remastered in 4K by the former Westwood Studios team members. Includes all 3 expansions, rebuilt multiplayer, a modernized UI, Map Editor, bonus footage gallery, and over 7 hours of remastered music.','2020/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1213210/Command__Conquer_Remastered_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1077,'the_sims™_4_growing_together_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1904392/The_Sims_4_Growing_Together_Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1078,'stolen_realm',NULL,'Stolen Realm is a simultaneous turn-based tactical dungeon crawling looter with action RPG elements where you control up to 6 heroes, solo or through online co-op, venturing forth in adventures set in a high-fantasy, low-poly world.','2024/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1330000/Stolen_Realm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1079,'dc_universe™_online',NULL,'DC Universe Online is a Free-to-Play, massive multiplayer online action game set in the popular DC Universe. Become one of a new breed of Heroes or Villains and wield incredible powers as you go to war with legendary characters such as Batman, Superman, Lex Luthor and The Joker.','2011/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/24200/DC_Universe_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1080,'nuclear_nightmare',NULL,'Venture forth as part of a specialized team of fellow players tasked with retrieving classified materials, evading the black goo virus, and the nightmarish entities it has spawned. With time running out before the US government initiates a devastating nuclear strike to contain the spreading menace.','2024/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2909110/Nuclear_Nightmare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1081,'need_for_speed™_most_wanted',NULL,'The open-world action in Need for Speed Most Wanted gives you the freedom to drive your way. Hit jumps and shortcuts, switch cars, lie low or head for terrain that plays to your vehicle’s unique strengths. Fight your way past cops and rivals using skill, high-end car tech and tons of nitrous.','2012/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1262560/Need_for_Speed_Most_Wanted/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1082,'total_war:_warhammer_ii_-_rise_of_the_tomb_kings',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2018/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/617870/Total_War_WARHAMMER_II__Rise_of_the_Tomb_Kings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1083,'mortal_sin',NULL,'Mortal Sin is a chaotic, blood-soaked roguelike where skill is power—and overconfidence is death. Carve through procedurally generated nightmares with brutal melee and flashy, satisfying combos.','2023/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1494810/Mortal_Sin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1084,'selaco',NULL,'Selaco is a brand new original shooter inspired by classics, featuring thrilling action set pieces, destructibility, smart enemies and a fleshed out story taking place within an immersive game world.','2024/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1592280/Selaco/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1085,'project_wingman',NULL,'Project Wingman is a flight action game that lets you take the seat of advanced fighter jets and become a true ace. Fight in various missions and gamemodes ranging from intense aerial dogfights to large scale ground assault in an alternate scorched earth setting.','2020/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/895870/Project_Wingman/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1086,'hard_bullet',NULL,'HARD BULLET is a physics-based action game, where enemies flood the neon-lit city bringing destruction to its streets. Use slow-motion, a huge arsenal, and brutal combat to survive and unlock new weapons. Prepare for the next RIDE by mastering your skills in Sandbox and Arena modes.','2020/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1294760/HARD_BULLET/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1087,'the_sims™_4_get_famous',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2018/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235720/The_Sims_4_Get_Famous/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1088,'webfishing',NULL,'WEBFISHING a multiplayer chatroom-focused fishing game! Relax and fish (on the web!)','2024/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3146520/WEBFISHING/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1089,'badlands_crew',NULL,'Create, customize and command your battle wagon to conquer crazed enemy factions and save innocent survivors scattered throughout the lawless Badlands in the aftermath of a devastating apocalypse. Do you have what it takes to Build, Evolve and Fight to survive?','2025/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2078230/Badlands_Crew/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1090,'moonstone_island',NULL,'Moonstone Island is a creature-collecting life-sim set in an open world with 100 islands to explore. Make friends, brew potions, collect Spirits, and test your strength in card-based encounters to complete your Alchemy training!','2023/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1658150/Moonstone_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1091,'stellaris:_federations',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1140001/Stellaris_Federations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1092,'trove',NULL,'Grab your friends, hone your blades, and set off for an epic procedurally generated adventure in Trove! Battle the Shadow in realms filled with dungeons and items created by your fellow players. Whether hunting treasure or building realms of your own, it’s never been this good to be square!','2015/7/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/304050/Trove/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1093,'call_of_duty®:_ghosts',NULL,'Outnumbered and outgunned, but not outmatched.Call of Duty®: Ghosts is an extraordinary step forward for one of the largest entertainment franchises of all-time. This new chapter in the Call of Duty® franchise features a new dynamic where players are on the side of a crippled nation fighting not for freedom, or liberty, but simply to...','2014/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/209160/Call_of_Duty_Ghosts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1094,'house_of_legacy',NULL,'Step into the shoes of a fallen clan leader, starting with nothing but a crumbling estate and a handful of hopes, rising through careful planning, trade, and diplomacy to become one of the most powerful families in the land. Now it’s time to forge a legendary dynasty that leaves its mark on history.','2025/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2503770/House_of_Legacy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1095,'nordhold',NULL,'Enemies are coming! Every decision matters: build your city, grow the economy, and prepare for enemy waves. Strengthen your defenses, adapt your strategy, and unleash your hero’s full potential. This unique Tower Defense will test your skills – are you worthy to claim a place at Valhalla?','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3028310/Nordhold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1096,'total_war:_warhammer_iii_-_the_changeling_–_shadows_of_change',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: WARHAMMER III on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3301110/Total_War_WARHAMMER_III__The_Changeling__Shadows_of_Change/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1097,'dale_&_dawson_stationery_supplies',NULL,'In \"Dale & Dawson Stationery Supplies,\" play as a Manager, Specialist, or Slacker in an office setting. Slackers blend in, mimicking Specialists to avoid the Manager\'s suspicion. Uncover or cause deception to win.','2024/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2920570/Dale__Dawson_Stationery_Supplies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1098,'the_mortuary_assistant',NULL,'Alone with the dead... Embalm corpses, banish demons, save your soul.','2022/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1295920/The_Mortuary_Assistant/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1099,'raid:_shadow_legends',NULL,'RAID: Shadow Legends is a free-to-play collection RPG with 800+ playable Champions and 8 game modes. Heed the Arbiter\'s call and defend the dark fantasy world of Teleria.','2024/1/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2333480/RAID_Shadow_Legends/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1100,'lego®_the_lord_of_the_rings™',NULL,'Based on The Lord of the Rings motion picture trilogy, LEGO® The Lord of the Rings follows the original story-lines of The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring, The Lord of the Rings: The Two Towers, and The Lord of the Rings: The Return of the King, taking players through the epic story events re-imagined with the humor and endl','2012/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/214510/LEGO_The_Lord_of_the_Rings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1101,'starship_troopers:_terran_command',NULL,'Lead the Mobile Infantry in this RTS game set in the Starship Troopers film universe. Balance your army composition with a diverse set of unit types, overcome line-of-sight and line-of-fire challenges through tactical positioning, and use special abilities to smash the Arachnid hordes!','2022/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1202130/Starship_Troopers_Terran_Command/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1102,'ea_sports™_wrc',NULL,'Experience the thrill of the 2024 rally season with new locations, moments, stages, high-performance vehicles, new liveries, and licensed crews. Brace yourself to embark on your continued rally journey.','2023/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1849250/EA_SPORTS_WRC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1103,'stellaris:_overlord',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1889490/Stellaris_Overlord/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1104,'marvel\'s_midnight_suns',NULL,'FIGHT AND STRATEGIZE LIKE A SUPER HERO IN THE DARKER CORNERS OF THE MARVEL UNIVERSE. Play as The Hunter, a legendary demon slayer who must lead a team of Super Heroes and supernatural warriors facing apocalyptic threats.','2022/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/368260/Marvels_Midnight_Suns/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1105,'dark_and_darker',NULL,'An unforgiving hardcore fantasy FPS dungeon PvPvE adventure. Band together with your friends and use your courage, wits, and cunning to uncover mythical treasures, defeat gruesome monsters, while staying one step ahead of the other devious treasure-hunters.','2024/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2016590/Dark_and_Darker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1106,'aliens:_dark_descent',NULL,'Drop into the gripping journey of Aliens: Dark Descent, a squad-based, single-player action game in the iconic Alien franchise. Lead your soldiers in real-time to stop a new and terrifying kind of Xenomorph outbreak on Planet Lethe.','2023/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1150440/Aliens_Dark_Descent/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1107,'house_flipper_-_dine_out_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game House Flipper on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2819590/House_Flipper__Dine_Out_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1108,'tiny_pasture',NULL,'Meet your new little desk buddies! They’ll snooze, scratch, and scamper around while you work or study (don’t worry, they’ve been trained not to invade your workspace). If you’re good at animal management, they will occupy the bottom of your screen with different kinds and colors!','2025/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3167550/Tiny_Pasture/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1109,'dead_by_daylight_-_steady_pulse',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3698790/Dead_by_Daylight__Steady_Pulse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1110,'harry_potter:_quidditch_champions',NULL,'Your next chapter takes flight! Immerse yourself in the enchanting world of Quidditch by playing solo or sharing the magic with friends and family.','2024/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2878600/Harry_Potter_Quidditch_Champions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1111,'warhammer_40,000:_speed_freeks',NULL,'Adrenaline-fueled combat racing in the brutal Warhammer 40,000 universe! Drive ferocious vehicles equipped with powerful weapons and abilities into a full-throttle battle to the death. Speed Freeks is a fresh, Ork-y take on vehicle combat that you’ve never seen before. WAAAGH!','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2078450/Warhammer_40000_Speed_Freeks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1112,'citizen_sleeper_2:_starward_vector',NULL,'A dice-driven RPG, in a human and heartfelt sci-fi world. You are an escaped android, with a malfunctioning body, a price on your head and no memory of your past. Get a ship, find a crew, and take on contracts while you navigate across the Starward Belt.','2025/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2442460/Citizen_Sleeper_2_Starward_Vector/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1113,'earth_defense_force_6',NULL,'Live the future of despair.The year is 2024 AD. The survivors fought against the remaining threats while trying their best to continue their recovery.Three years passed in the year 2027. In a new world without hope, the time has come to once again resist the fate of the Earth.','2024/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2291060/EARTH_DEFENSE_FORCE_6/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1114,'return_of_the_obra_dinn',NULL,'Lost at sea 1803 ~ The good ship Obra Dinn.','2018/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/653530/Return_of_the_Obra_Dinn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1115,'cookie_clicker',NULL,'An idle game about making cookies! Originally released in 2013 on the web, and actively developed since then. This is the official version for Steam.','2021/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1454400/Cookie_Clicker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1116,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_the_ghost_of_blanchett_graves',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3569970/Hunt_Showdown_1896__The_Ghost_of_Blanchett_Graves/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1117,'planet_zoo:_zookeepers_animal_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3146420/Planet_Zoo_Zookeepers_Animal_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_23'),(1118,'blood_strike',NULL,'Gather your friends and dive into the action-packed Battle Royale, Squad Fight, or Hot Zone like there\'s no tomorrow! Blood Strike offers a wide range of playable Strikers, each with a unique active and passive ability letting you deploy drones, shield walls and everything in between.','2025/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3199170/Blood_Strike/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1119,'small_spaces',NULL,'Small Spaces is a relaxing game about designing beautiful, small apartments you\'d want to live in. Let your creativity flow from a simplistic flat in Tokyo to an industrial loft in New York. Your only limit is the space itself.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3151380/Small_Spaces/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1120,'lost_in_random:_the_eternal_die',NULL,'Take on an ancient evil in Lost in Random: The Eternal Die, a fast-paced action roguelite set in the whimsical world of Random. Play as Queen Aleksandra and her die-companion Fortune as you battle twisted foes, wield powerful relics and abilities, and roll the dice to escape this nightmarish realm.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2564520/Lost_in_Random_The_Eternal_Die/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1121,'root',NULL,'Might makes right in the wild wood! The award-winning board game of asymmetrical woodland warfare comes to cross-platform digital play! Combine subtle strategy and bold daring to guide your forest faction to victory!','2020/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/965580/Root/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1122,'oneshot',NULL,'OneShot is a surreal top down Puzzle/Adventure game with unique gameplay capabilities. You are to guide a child through a mysterious world on a mission to restore its long-dead sun. The world knows you exist.','2016/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/420530/OneShot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1123,'warhammer_40,000:_mechanicus',NULL,'MECHANICUS II ANNOUNCED! Take control of one of the most technologically advanced factions in the Imperium: the Adeptus Mechanicus. In this turn-based tactical game, your every decision will weigh heavily on the outcome of the conflict. Will you be blessed by the Omnissiah?','2018/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/673880/Warhammer_40000_Mechanicus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1124,'total_war:_napoleon_–_definitive_edition',NULL,'Complete your Total War collection with this Definitive Edition of Total War: NAPOLEON, which includes all DLC and feature updates since the game’s release','2010/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/34030/Total_War_NAPOLEON__Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1125,'mad_max',NULL,'Play as Mad Max, a reluctant hero and survivor who wants nothing more than to leave the madness behind and find solace.','2015/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/234140/Mad_Max/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1126,'norland',NULL,'Lead your noble family in this medieval colony sim, facing off against class conflict, religious struggle, and political treachery. Tend to your people’s needs, uncover the lost knowledge of a fallen empire, and engage in nefarious plots against your enemies.','2024/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1857090/Norland/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1127,'fable_anniversary',NULL,'FOR EVERY CHOICE, A CONSEQUENCE.Fully re-mastered with HD visuals and audio, Fable Anniversary is a stunning rendition of the original game that will delight faithful fans and new players alike! The all new Heroic difficulty setting will test the mettle of even the most hardcore Fable fan.','2014/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/288470/Fable_Anniversary/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1128,'pixel_gun_3d:_pc_edition',NULL,'The legendary mobile multiplayer FPS Pixel Gun 3D comes to PC! Experience an enhanced world of colorful, blocky action. Featuring dozens of game modes and maps, 1500+ guns plus cross-platform multiplayer and progression.','2024/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2524890/Pixel_Gun_3D_PC_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1129,'thief_simulator',NULL,'Become the best thief. Gather intel, steal things and sell them to buy hi-tech equipment. Do everything that a real thief does.','2018/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/704850/Thief_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1130,'paint_the_town_red',NULL,'Paint the Town Red is a chaotic first person melee combat game set in different locations and time periods. The voxel-based enemies can be punched, bashed, kicked, stabbed and sliced completely dynamically using almost anything that isn\'t nailed down.','2021/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/337320/Paint_the_Town_Red/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1131,'until_then',NULL,'A fateful meeting sets off a chain reaction, upending Mark\'s life. People disappear and memories prove unreliable. Uncover a hidden truth with Mark and his friends in this narrative adventure and race to unravel the mystery before it\'s too late.','2024/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1574820/Until_Then/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1132,'soma',NULL,'From the creators of Amnesia: The Dark Descent comes SOMA, a sci-fi horror game set below the waves of the Atlantic ocean. Struggle to survive a hostile world that will make you question your very existence.','2015/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/282140/SOMA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1133,'jurassic_world_evolution_2:_deluxe_upgrade_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1336321/Jurassic_World_Evolution_2_Deluxe_Upgrade_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1134,'brick_rigs',NULL,'Build your own vehicles or download one of the more than 200,000 creations already uploaded to the Workshop and experience the dynamic driving and destruction physics of Brick Rigs!','2023/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/552100/Brick_Rigs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1135,'kovaak\'s',NULL,'Master your aim with KovaaK’s, the world’s best aim trainer. With over 200,000 scenarios, playlists and more! Embrace total customization, including a map editor and game physics. More than just a trainer, it’s a dynamic, community-driven platform that elevates your gameplay.','2018/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/824270/KovaaKs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1136,'space_engineers_-_fieldwork_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3601770/Space_Engineers__Fieldwork_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1137,'total_war:_empire_–_definitive_edition',NULL,'Command the seas, control the land, forge a new nation, and conquer the globe.','2009/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/10500/Total_War_EMPIRE__Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1138,'poly_bridge_3',NULL,'The best just got better! Rediscover your engineering creativity in this genre-defining bridge engineering and puzzle solving masterpiece.','2023/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1850160/Poly_Bridge_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1139,'dead_by_daylight_-_dungeons_&_dragons',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2958440/Dead_by_Daylight__Dungeons__Dragons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1140,'space_haven',NULL,'Embark on a space voyage with your ragtag crew of civilians in search of a new home. Build spaceships tile by tile, create optimal gas conditions, manage the needs and moods of their crew, encounter other space-faring groups, and explore the universe in this spaceship colony simulation.','2020/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/979110/Space_Haven/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1141,'project_hospital',NULL,'Become an ace doctor, an aspiring architect and a successful manager at the same time. Design your very own hospital, tweak every detail or choose one of the prebuilt scenarios and just jump to the doctor’s duty.','2018/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/868360/Project_Hospital/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1142,'final_fantasy_v',NULL,'The original FINAL FANTASY V comes to life with completely new graphics and audio as a 2D pixel remaster! A remodeled take on the fifth game in the world-renowned FINAL FANTASY series! Enjoy the timeless story told through charming retro graphics.','2021/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1173810/FINAL_FANTASY_V/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1143,'planet_coaster_2:_thrill-seekers_ride_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Coaster 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3337040/Planet_Coaster_2_ThrillSeekers_Ride_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1144,'train_sim_world®_5:_frankfurt_s-bahn:_s1,_s8_&_s9_route_add-on_',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3260440/Train_Sim_World_5_Frankfurt_SBahn_S1_S8__S9_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1145,'nightingale',NULL,'Nightingale is an open world survival crafting game, where you’ll adventure across the mysterious and dangerous Fae Realms. As a daring Realmwalker, you’ll defeat monstrous enemies, survive hostile environments, and build elaborate estates in a visually stunning Gaslamp Fantasy world.','2024/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1928980/Nightingale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1146,'riven',NULL,'Uncover a story of intrigue, betrayal, and a civilization teetering on the brink of collapse as you solve intricate puzzles to unlock the secrets of Riven. Built from the ground-up and expanded from the award-winning original game released in 1997.','2024/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1712350/Riven/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1147,'quasimorph',NULL,'Take on a role of a hardened PMC fighter in a dark turn-based extraction RPG. Engage in unforgiving combat, manage your ship and pile up the bodies of your clones to unravel the dark mystery behind threat to all life.','2023/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2059170/Quasimorph/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1148,'yakuza_0',NULL,'SEGA’s legendary Japanese series finally comes to PC. Fight like hell through Tokyo and Osaka as junior yakuza Kiryu and Majima. Take a front row seat to 1980s life in Japan in an experience unlike anything else in video gaming, with uncapped framerates and 4K resolutions. A legend is born.','2018/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/638970/Yakuza_0/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1149,'returnal™',NULL,'BREAK THE CYCLE Fight to survive as this award-winning third-person shooter brings Selene’s story to PC. Take on roguelike challenges. Engage enemies in bullet hell-fuelled clashes. Share your journey through Returnal™ with another player.','2023/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1649240/Returnal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1150,'chef_rpg',NULL,'Craft your culinary adventure in a beautiful pixel art world. Manage your restaurants, forage and hunt for ingredients, befriend locals, and grow your culinary empire. What kind of chef will you be?','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1796790/Chef_RPG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1151,'incursion_red_river',NULL,'Incursion Red River is a tactical first-person extraction shooter set in war-torn modern day Vietnam. Exclusively single-player and co-op gameplay! Customize your loadout, complete contracts & extract, or die trying!','2024/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2116120/Incursion_Red_River/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1152,'i_am_your_beast',NULL,'Hunt the military-industrial complex across stylish comic book micro-sandboxes in this fast-paced covert revenge thriller FPS from the developers of El Paso, Elsewhere.','2024/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1876590/I_Am_Your_Beast/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1153,'sengoku_dynasty',NULL,'Sengoku Dynasty is the ultimate feudal Japan experience: build villages, grow your community, and shape the open world through combat or economy. The choice is yours alone - or that of up to 4 players in multiplayer co-op!','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1702010/Sengoku_Dynasty/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1154,'final_fantasy_viii_-_remastered',NULL,'The mega-hit RPG, FINAL FANTASY VIII returns! This Steam® version features new graphical enhancements and a whole host of options to customise your gameplay experience.','2019/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1026680/FINAL_FANTASY_VIII__REMASTERED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1155,'the_talos_principle_2',NULL,'The Talos Principle 2 is a thought-provoking first-person puzzle experience that greatly expands on the first game\'s philosophical themes and stunning environments with increasingly mind-bending challenges.','2023/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/835960/The_Talos_Principle_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1156,'south_park™:_the_stick_of_truth™',NULL,'From the perilous battlefields of the fourth-grade playground, a young hero will rise, destined to be South Park’s savior. From the creators of South Park, Trey Parker and Matt Stone, comes an epic quest to become… cool. Introducing South Park™: The Stick of Truth™.For a thousand years, the battle has been waged.','2014/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/213670/South_Park_The_Stick_of_Truth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1157,'crow_country',NULL,'The year is 1990. It’s been two years since the mysterious disappearance of Edward Crow and the abrupt closure of his theme park, Crow Country. But your arrival has broken the silence, Mara Forest. If you want answers, you’ll have to venture deep into the darkness of Crow Country to find them…','2024/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1996010/Crow_Country/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1158,'dark_hours',NULL,'Dark Hours is a co-op survival horror game for up to 4 players. Your heist has been disrupted by a supernatural event, and your team of robbers is now trapped with an evil entity. Forget your plan, your mission is to survive. Explore and cooperate to find a way out or hide and wish for daylight.','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2208570/Dark_Hours/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1159,'ground_branch',NULL,'From one of the developers behind the original Rainbow Six® and Ghost Recon® games, comes a thinking-man\'s first-person shooter featuring in-depth character and weapon customization. Take your time. Think ahead. Get the job done.','2018/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/16900/GROUND_BRANCH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1160,'dead_by_daylight_-_tomb_raider_chapter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3024580/Dead_by_Daylight__Tomb_Raider_Chapter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1161,'bedlam_pack_-_tom_clancy’s_the_division_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tom Clancy’s The Division® 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3588090/Bedlam_Pack__Tom_Clancys_The_Division_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1162,'raceroom_racing_experience',NULL,'RaceRoom is the premier free-to-play racing simulation on PC and home to official race series like DTM, WTCR, the WTCC and ADAC GT Masters. Enter RaceRoom and enter the world of a professional race car driver.','2013/2/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/211500/RaceRoom_Racing_Experience/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1163,'reverse:_1999',NULL,'Reverse: 1999 is a 20th Century Time-Travel Strategic RPG developed by Bluepoch. As the Timekeeper, the observer of eras, you will embark on a journey across time and space, from the Roaring \'20s to the turn of the millennium, uncovering the truth about the \"Storm\" and the mystery of the year 1999.','2024/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3092660/Reverse_1999/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1164,'the_henry_stickmin_collection',NULL,'A choose-your-own-path where failing is more fun than succeeding.','2020/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1089980/The_Henry_Stickmin_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1165,'my_singing_monsters',NULL,'Breed them, feed them, listen to them sing! Create an island full of Singing Monsters, then watch your song evolve as you breed and upgrade them. Design and build unique decorations to make your world look just the way you want. You\'ll love exploring the wonderful fantasy land of the Monster World!','2021/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1419170/My_Singing_Monsters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1166,'a_total_war_saga:_thrones_of_britannia',NULL,'From the multi-award-winning strategy series, A Total War Saga: Thrones of Britannia combines huge real-time battles with engrossing turn-based campaign, set at a critical flashpoint in history. Anglo-Saxons, Gaelic clans and Viking settlers clash for control. What Kingdom will you build?','2018/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/712100/A_Total_War_Saga_THRONES_OF_BRITANNIA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_24'),(1167,'the_elder_scrolls_iv:_oblivion®_game_of_the_year_edition_deluxe_(2009)',NULL,'PUBLISHER UPDATE - This is the product page for The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Game of the Year Deluxe Edition, released in 2009.---The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion® Game of the Year Edition presents one of the best RPGs of all time like never before. Step inside the most richly detailed and vibrant game-world ever created.','2009/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/900883/The_Elder_Scrolls_IV_Oblivion_Game_of_the_Year_Edition_Deluxe_2009/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1168,'wizard101',NULL,'Unleash your inner magic and prepare to unravel the mysteries surrounding a death professor gone rogue. Darkness threatens to engulf the Spiral as you master powerful spells, explore over 22 whimsical worlds, and team-up with friends in this nostalgic wizard turn-based deckbuilding MMORPG.','2008/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/799960/Wizard101/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1169,'call_of_duty®:_modern_warfare®_ii',NULL,'Call of Duty®: Modern Warfare® II drops players into an unprecedented global conflict that features the return of the iconic Operators of Task Force 141.','2022/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1962660/Call_of_Duty_Modern_Warfare_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1170,'plants_vs._zombies_goty_edition',NULL,'Zombies are invading your home, and the only defense is your arsenal of plants! Armed with an alien nursery-worth of zombie-zapping plants like peashooters and cherry bombs, you\'ll need to think fast and plant faster to stop dozens of types of zombies dead in their tracks.','2009/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3590/Plants_vs_Zombies_GOTY_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1171,'oxygen_not_included_-_spaced_out!',NULL,'This content requires the base game Oxygen Not Included on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1452490/Oxygen_Not_Included__Spaced_Out/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1172,'the_elder_scrolls_iv:_oblivion®_game_of_the_year_edition_(2009)',NULL,'PUBLISHER UPDATE - This is the product page for The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Game of the Year Edition, released in 2009. ---The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion® Game of the Year Edition presents one of the best RPGs of all time like never before. Step inside the most richly detailed and vibrant game-world ever created.','2007/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/22330/The_Elder_Scrolls_IV_Oblivion_Game_of_the_Year_Edition_2009/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1173,'wild_assault',NULL,'Wild Assault is an anthro-themed tactical shooter built with Unreal Engine 5, featuring large-scale battlefield gameplay centered around Valiant abilities. Work closely with your team, harness your instincts, and charge into battle to secure victory.','2025/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2827230/Wild_Assault/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1174,'attack_on_titan_2_-_a.o.t.2',NULL,'Abandon all fear. Attack on Titan 2 is the gripping sequel to the action game based on the worldwide hit anime series \"Attack on Titan.\"','2023/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/601050/Attack_on_Titan_2__AOT2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1175,'icbm:_escalation',NULL,'ICBM: Escalation is a grand RTS where you command armies, develop cutting-edge tech, and wield devastating weapons. Conquer enemies with conventional forces or nuclear firepower. With new modes like Standoff and Conquest, the game offers deep strategic layers in a global warfare setting.','2024/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2647680/ICBM_Escalation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1176,'wobbly_life',NULL,'Wobbly Life is a vibrant open-world physics sandbox. Play with your friends online or in local co-op, with exciting jobs, mini games and wacky story missions. Earn cash to spend in the world on clothes, vehicles and houses. There is a whole Wobbly World out there to explore!','2020/7/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1211020/Wobbly_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1177,'dragon_ball_fighterz',NULL,'DRAGON BALL FighterZ is born from what makes the DRAGON BALL series so loved and famous: endless spectacular fights with its all-powerful fighters.','2018/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/678950/DRAGON_BALL_FighterZ/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1178,'equinox:_homecoming',NULL,'Saddle up with friends and investigate a dark mystery, where each trail leads to wonder and intrigue. A string of events has set the idyllic island on edge. Discover the truth behind your mother’s disappearance and a local\'s sudden death. For fans of horses, murder mysteries, and cozy exploration!','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3258290/Equinox_Homecoming/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1179,'necesse',NULL,'Build, quest, and conquer across an infinite procedurally generated world. Play alone or with friends as you establish a settlement and explore deep dungeons, fight monsters and bosses, mine rare ores, craft magical equipment, recruit specialists for your colony, and more!','2019/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1169040/Necesse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1180,'we_were_here_forever',NULL,'You both awaken imprisoned inside the sinister Castle Rock - were you betrayed, or simply not that clever? Find out in the greatest co-op puzzle adventure in the We Were Here Series! Do you and your partner have what it takes to face the dark forces of this realm or will you be trapped… forever?','2022/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1341290/We_Were_Here_Forever/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1181,'age_of_empires_iv:__the_sultans_ascend',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires IV: Anniversary Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1959430/Age_of_Empires_IV__The_Sultans_Ascend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1182,'final_fantasy_vii',NULL,'The RPG classic FINAL FANTASY VII returns to PC, now with brand new online features!','2013/7/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/39140/FINAL_FANTASY_VII/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1183,'ea_sports™_madden_nfl_25',NULL,'Hit like you mean it with FieldSENSE™ powered by BOOM Tech. Experience how the new physics-informed dynamic tackling system unlocks realistic collisions & new gameplay animations on both sides of the ball.','2024/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2582560/EA_SPORTS_Madden_NFL_25/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1184,'plague_inc:_the_cure',NULL,'This content requires the base game Plague Inc: Evolved on Steam in order to play.','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1472780/Plague_Inc_The_Cure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1185,'rollercoaster_tycoon®_3:_complete_edition',NULL,'Build the park of a lifetime and rediscover the critically acclaimed rollercoaster simulation bestseller. Feel the thrill of a genre-defining classic, complete with two huge expansion packs.','2020/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1368820/RollerCoaster_Tycoon_3_Complete_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1186,'grim_dawn_-_ashes_of_malmouth_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Grim Dawn on Steam in order to play.','2017/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/642280/Grim_Dawn__Ashes_of_Malmouth_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1187,'golden_lap',NULL,'Step into the polished shoes of a racing team manager in the heart-stirring Golden Era of motorsport where every decision can lead to glory or gravel. With sleek minimalist charm and deep strategic gameplay, Golden Lap offers a unique experience in the motorsport management genre.','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2052040/Golden_Lap/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1188,'uno',NULL,'UNO makes its return with new exciting features! Match cards by color or value and play action cards to change things up. Race against others to empty your hand before everyone else in Classic play or customize your experience with House Rules.','2016/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/470220/UNO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1189,'mysims™',NULL,'Explore a new world with MySims™ — it\'s your world to transform in this retro re-release with updated graphics! Move to an adorable town. With a little creativity and some help from the locals, you can make this place thrive!','2025/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3328900/MySims/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1190,'suzerain',NULL,'Assume the role of President Anton Rayne and guide the nation of Sordland. Amidst brewing international conflicts, need for reform, deep-seated corruption, and economic recession, you must make the decisions in this political drama. How will you lead?','2020/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1207650/Suzerain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1191,'hollywood_animal',NULL,'Make movies, even if someone has to die. Take the helm of a major Hollywood studio at the dawn of sound cinema, and guide it through decades of creative achievements and glamor, debauchery and dark deeds, tough choices and unpleasant compromises.','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2680550/Hollywood_Animal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1192,'the_sims™_4_get_together',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2015/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235732/The_Sims_4_Get_Together/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1193,'cassette_beasts',NULL,'Collect awesome monsters to use during turn-based battles in this open-world RPG, now with online multiplayer mode. Combine any two monster forms using Cassette Beasts’ Fusion System to create unique and powerful new ones!','2023/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1321440/Cassette_Beasts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1194,'kena:_bridge_of_spirits',NULL,'A story-driven, action adventure combining exploration with fast-paced combat. Untangle the past as Kena, a young Spirit Guide in search of the sacred Mountain Shrine. Help free the spirits trapped in a forgotten village with the help of the Rot, her adorable (yet powerful) spirit companions.','2022/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1954200/Kena_Bridge_of_Spirits/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1195,'gunner,_heat,_pc!',NULL,'Gunner, HEAT, PC! (GHPC) is a simulation game about modern mounted combat, with special attention to authenticity and fun.','2022/9/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1705180/Gunner_HEAT_PC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1196,'crusader_kings_iii:_legends_of_the_dead',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings III on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2671060/Crusader_Kings_III_Legends_of_the_Dead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1197,'jurassic_world_evolution_2:_cretaceous_predator_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2610980/Jurassic_World_Evolution_2_Cretaceous_Predator_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1198,'company_of_heroes_2',NULL,'Experience the ultimate WWII RTS platform with COH2 and its standalone expansions. This package includes the base game, which you can then upgrade by purchasing The Western Front Armies, Ardennes Assault and/or The British Forces. More info in the \"About This Game\" section below.','2013/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/231430/Company_of_Heroes_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1199,'warframe:_yareli_prime_-_accessories_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warframe on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3678030/Warframe_Yareli_Prime__Accessories_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1200,'jurassic_world_evolution_2:_prehistoric_marine_species_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2492640/Jurassic_World_Evolution_2_Prehistoric_Marine_Species_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1201,'call_of_duty®:_advanced_warfare_-_gold_edition',NULL,'Call of Duty®: Advanced Warfare envisions a powerful future, where both technology and tactics have evolved to usher in a new era of combat for the franchise.Power Changes Everything.','2014/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/209650/Call_of_Duty_Advanced_Warfare__Gold_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1202,'gears_of_war:_reloaded',NULL,'Experience the origins of one of gaming’s most acclaimed franchises like never before, faithfully remastered and optimized for PC.','2025/8/26','Unreleased','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2523720/Gears_of_War_Reloaded/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1203,'recycling_center_simulator',NULL,'Recycling Center Simulator is a business simulator game with a first person view. Make money from garbage, collect raw materials for your recycling center from different locations, recycle them, make money by producing new products and improve your factory.','2024/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2928520/Recycling_Center_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1204,'melvor_idle',NULL,'Inspired by RuneScape, Melvor Idle takes the core of what makes an adventure game so addictive and strips it down to its purest form! This is a feature-rich, idle/incremental game combining a distinctly familiar feel with a fresh gameplay experience. Maxing 20+ skills has never been more zen.','2021/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1267910/Melvor_Idle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1205,'jurassic_world_evolution',NULL,'Place yourself at the heart of the Jurassic franchise and build your own Jurassic World. Bioengineer dinosaurs that think, feel and react intelligently to the world around them and face threats posed by espionage, breakouts and devastating tropical storms in an uncertain world where life always finds a way.','2018/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/648350/Jurassic_World_Evolution/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1206,'football_life_simulator',NULL,'Live the life of a professional footballer both on and off the field. Train, play matches, manage your social life, climb the career ladder, and spend your earned money. Decorate your life with luxury while managing your relationships and finances.','2025/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3158270/Football_Life_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1207,'dishonored',NULL,'Dishonored is an immersive first-person action game that casts you as a supernatural assassin driven by revenge. With Dishonored’s flexible combat system, creatively eliminate your targets as you combine the supernatural abilities, weapons and unusual gadgets at your disposal.','2012/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/205100/Dishonored/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1208,'rounds',NULL,'Rounds is a 1v1 rogue-lite shooter where each round gets more intense. The losing player of each round unlocks clever upgrades to create a better build to counter their opponent.','2021/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1557740/ROUNDS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1209,'chrono_trigger®',NULL,'The timeless RPG classic returns loaded with upgrades! Journey to the forgotten past, to the far future, and to the end of time. A big adventure to save the planet, now begins…','2018/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/613830/CHRONO_TRIGGER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1210,'dolls_nest',NULL,'Dolls Nest is a 3D action game where you can customize mecha girls and explore a ruined world. As a Frame Unit, your adventure will pit you against the gigantic autonomous factory world of Hod. Overcome obstacles using the parts at your disposal and uncover the mysteries that lie at its center.','2025/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1839430/Dolls_Nest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1211,'palia_-_founders_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Palia on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3708940/Palia__Founders_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1212,'city_car_driving',NULL,'City Car Driving – realistic car driving simulator, which will help you master the basic skills of the car driving in various traffic conditions, with plunging into the environment most closely resembling the real one.','2016/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/493490/City_Car_Driving/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1213,'assetto_corsa_competizione_-_24h_nürburgring_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa Competizione on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2700610/Assetto_Corsa_Competizione__24H_Nrburgring_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1214,'mass_effect™:_andromeda_deluxe_edition',NULL,'Return to the Mass Effect universe & lead the first humans in Andromeda on a desperate search for our new home.','2017/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238000/Mass_Effect_Andromeda_Deluxe_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_25'),(1215,'eternal_strands',NULL,'A next-generation action experience where the elements obey you, the terrain bends to your will, and every victory is entirely your own.','2025/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1491410/Eternal_Strands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1216,'guild_wars_2:_janthir_wilds™_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Guild Wars 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2982320/Guild_Wars_2_Janthir_Wilds_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1217,'last_train_home',NULL,'The Great War is over - the fight continues. Command a legion of soldiers, desperately trying to make their way home amidst the chaos of civil war. Lead them through the unforgiving wilderness onboard an armored train. Manage your crew and resources and try to survive.','2023/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1469610/Last_Train_Home/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1218,'carrier_command_2',NULL,'Carrier Command 2 is the real-time strategy game that puts you in command of a futuristic carrier capable of deploying a vast array of aircraft and amphibious units. Compete against AI or human players and hop into every single vehicle to take matters into your own hands!','2021/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1489630/Carrier_Command_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1219,'needy_streamer_overload',NULL,'NEEDY STREAMER OVERLOAD is a “multi-ending ADV” depicting daily life with “OMGkawaiiAngel”, a young girl with a rather extreme need for approval attempting to become the #1 “Internet Angel” (streamer).','2022/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1451940/NEEDY_STREAMER_OVERLOAD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1220,'democracy_4',NULL,'Democracy 4 lets you take the role of President / Prime minister, govern the country (choosing its policies, laws and other actions), and both transform the country as you see fit, while trying to retain enough popularity to get re-elected...','2022/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1410710/Democracy_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1221,'stellaris:_first_contact_story_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2277860/Stellaris_First_Contact_Story_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1222,'unravel_two',NULL,'When you cut ties to the past, new bonds form. Build relationships with other Yarnys in local co-op or as a single player, fostering friendship and support as you journey together.','2018/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1225570/Unravel_Two/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1223,'pc_building_simulator',NULL,'Build and grow your very own computer repair enterprise as you learn to diagnose, fix and build PCs. With real-world licensed components and comprehensive hardware and software simulation, you can plan and bring your ultimate PC to life.','2019/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/621060/PC_Building_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1224,'hot_wheels_unleashed™_2_-_turbocharged',NULL,'The world’s raddest cars are back and taking the fun to the next level! Race over 130 vehicles with crazy new mechanics and even more vehicle types. Plus, build your tracks with stunning new environments and different game modes to have fun off and online!','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2051120/HOT_WHEELS_UNLEASHED_2__Turbocharged/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1225,'rfactor_2',NULL,'rFactor 2 is a realistic, easily extendable racing simulation that offers race customization, great graphics, outstanding multiplayer and the height of racing realism. It features mixed class road racing with ultra realistic dynamics, an immersive sound environment and stunning graphics.','2013/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/365960/rFactor_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1226,'sworn',NULL,'SWORN is a 1-4 player co-op action rogue-like. Explore and reclaim a fallen Camelot from the reign of a corrupted Arthur and his Knights of the Round Table.','2025/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1763250/SWORN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1227,'the_last_of_us™_part_i_-_upgrade_to_digital_deluxe_edition',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Last of Us™ Part I on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2254450/The_Last_of_Us_Part_I__Upgrade_to_Digital_Deluxe_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1228,'train_sim_world®_4',NULL,'Feel the power of simulation in your hands. Experience immense velocity and express unrivalled creativity with Train Sim World 4! Expand your rail hobby and discover the raw emotion of driving a diverse array of iconic routes and trains. From training center to mountain pass, this is your journey.','2023/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2362300/Train_Sim_World_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1229,'devour',NULL,'DEVOUR is a co-op horror survival game for 1-4 players. Stop possessed cultists before they drag you to hell. Run. Scream. Hide. Just don\'t get caught.','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1274570/DEVOUR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1230,'emissary_zero',NULL,'Co-op horror (1-4 players). You are sent to explore a mysterious building at night. Find the Moon and try to return alive.','2025/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3176060/Emissary_Zero/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1231,'popucom',NULL,'Venture together with your friends on an unknown planet. Use color switching, match-3 shooting, and artifact powers to overcome challenges and keep advancing. What lies ahead of you is an adventure filled with wonder, hope, and much more to discover!','2025/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2543180/POPUCOM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1232,'rematch_-_elite_edition_upgrade_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game REMATCH on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3743390/REMATCH__Elite_Edition_Upgrade_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1233,'final_fantasy_iv',NULL,'The original FINAL FANTASY IV comes to life with completely new graphics and audio! A remodeled 2D take on the fourth game in the world-renowned FINAL FANTASY series! Enjoy the timeless story told through charming retro graphics.','2021/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1173800/FINAL_FANTASY_IV/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1234,'powerwash_simulator_–_shrek_special_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PowerWash Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2983890/PowerWash_Simulator__Shrek_Special_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1235,'ship_graveyard_simulator_2',NULL,'Dust off your torch and hammer - it\'s time to get back to work, you have a new job to do. Visit the new beach coast with the largest, biggest ship graveyard in the world, dismantle huge ship parts and collect tons of precious steel. Roll up your sleeves, it\'s time to get back to the business.','2023/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2201940/Ship_Graveyard_Simulator_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1236,'banishers:_ghosts_of_new_eden',NULL,'Hunt ghosts as two memorable characters in a story-driven Action-RPG where your decisions carry dramatic consequences. Torn between honoring your oath to the living and saving your departed partner, how far will you go for love?','2024/2/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1493640/Banishers_Ghosts_of_New_Eden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1237,'bmx_streets',NULL,'Ready to hit the streets? BMX Streets brings the essence of street riding to your fingertips. Experience the next generation of BMX gaming with realistic physics, meaningful customization and a massive open world. Practice, experiment and explore to find your own unique style and master the streets.','2024/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/871540/BMX_Streets/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1238,'jurassic_world_evolution_2:_camp_cretaceous_dinosaur_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1882470/Jurassic_World_Evolution_2_Camp_Cretaceous_Dinosaur_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1239,'castle_crashers®',NULL,'Hack, slash, and smash your way to victory in this award winning 2D arcade adventure from The Behemoth!','2012/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/204360/Castle_Crashers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1240,'snacko',NULL,'Driven away by the cost of living, you and your childhood friend set off with the goal to turn things around and start a new life. Explore, gather, and build up the town from scratch into a place you\'ll be proud to call \"home\"!','2025/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1125510/Snacko/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1241,'one_piece_bounty_rush',NULL,'Take the loot, pirates! Bounty Rush is a 4 vs 4 multiplayer team action game. Work with your team to capture the other teams\' berries!','2024/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2918150/ONE_PIECE_Bounty_Rush/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1242,'night_in_the_woods',NULL,'NIGHT IN THE WOODS is an adventure game focused on exploration, story, and character, featuring dozens of characters to meet and lots to do across a lush, vibrant world.','2017/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/481510/Night_in_the_Woods/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1243,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator',NULL,'Bored of waiting for a bite? Would you like to catch some fish? You\'re lucky - in Ultimate Fishing Simulator, fish bite like crazy! Spinning, float fishing, ground fishing, and more! Comprehensive fishing simulator that allows using various techniques, in different places around the world!','2018/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/468920/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1244,'road_96_🛣️',NULL,'Hitchhike your way to freedom in this crazy procedurally generated road trip. No one\'s road is the same!','2021/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1466640/Road_96/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1245,'tennis_manager_25',NULL,'Dive into the most advanced tennis management experience to date. Manage your academy, develop your staff and facilities, and recruit the best players from junior to pro, across both men\'s and women\'s circuits. Forge the champions of tomorrow and shape the future of tennis!','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3549220/Tennis_Manager_25/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1246,'ninja_gaiden_2_black',NULL,'Using Unreal Engine 5 to significantly enhance graphic expression, this is the definitive version of \"NINJA GAIDEN 2,\" featuring additional playable characters and enhanced battle support functions.','2025/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3287520/NINJA_GAIDEN_2_Black/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1247,'from_the_depths',NULL,'Over 1000 unique components allow you to build and command voxel vehicles from the deep ocean to outer space! Forge strategies, allegiances and fleets strong enough to destroy eight deadly factions of the planet and reign supreme. A genre-defying mashup of simulation, building, RTS and RPG.','2020/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/268650/From_the_Depths/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1248,'survival_machine',NULL,'Build your base on a moving Machine, travel through biomes with different resources, and prepare for the night when a zombie threat is much higher than during the day. Would you go solo or explore this new world with your best friends?','2025/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1601330/Survival_Machine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1249,'wingspan:_asia_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wingspan on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3362880/Wingspan_Asia_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1250,'warhammer_40,000:_space_marine_-_anniversary_edition',NULL,'In Warhammer 40,000 Space Marine you are Captain Titus, a Space Marine of the Ultramarines chapter and a seasoned veteran of countless battles.','2011/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/55150/Warhammer_40000_Space_Marine__Anniversary_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1251,'total_war:_warhammer_ii_-_curse_of_the_vampire_coast',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2018/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/835670/Total_War_WARHAMMER_II__Curse_of_the_Vampire_Coast/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1252,'oxygen_not_included:_the_bionic_booster_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Oxygen Not Included on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3302470/Oxygen_Not_Included_The_Bionic_Booster_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1253,'the_killing_antidote',NULL,'This is a TPS game. Shooting, fighting, dress-up, puzzle solving, and more. In the future, a special germ causes humans to be constantly infected and mutated. The protagonist, Jodi, is a brave journalist who goes on her way to find the legendary antidote and is in danger.','2024/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2254890/The_Killing_Antidote/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1254,'locomoto',NULL,'Customise and manage your train, tend to quirky passengers, gather resources, craft decorations, and upgrade your conductors style all accompanied by soft lo-fi tunes. Become a conductor and save your hometown Barrenpyre from environmental disaster!','2025/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2328650/Locomoto/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1255,'guild_wars_2:_end_of_dragons™_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Guild Wars 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2008610/Guild_Wars_2_End_of_Dragons_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1256,'final_fantasy_iii',NULL,'The original FINAL FANTASY III comes to life with completely new graphics and audio! A remodeled 2D take on the third game in the world-renowned FINAL FANTASY series! Enjoy the timeless story told through charming retro graphics.','2021/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1173790/FINAL_FANTASY_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1257,'a_little_to_the_left:_seeing_stars',NULL,'This content requires the base game A Little to the Left on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2828160/A_Little_to_the_Left_Seeing_Stars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1258,'jacksmith:_weapons_and_warriors',NULL,'Fire up the forge and craft your finest weapons in Jacksmith: Weapons and Warriors, a reforged adventure! Equip the local warriors with custom swords, bows, shields and more in your hands-on blacksmith shop. Follow the soldiers into battle as you push onward toward the evil wizard Dudley!','2025/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3580580/Jacksmith_Weapons_and_Warriors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1259,'bopl_battle',NULL,'A couch/online game where you battle your friends with unique and wild abilities. There are many choices such as a shrink ray, creating black holes, stopping time and attaching a rocket engine to the stage to send it flying. Choose a combination that synergizes well to win the round!','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1686940/Bopl_Battle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1260,'laundry_store_simulator',NULL,'In Laundry Store Simulator, you\'ll start small and work your way up, upgrading your equipment, designing a stylish store, and expanding your services! Are you ready to own the best Laundry Store in the world?','2024/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3150440/Laundry_Store_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1261,'fate/stay_night_remastered',NULL,'Seek the root of the Fate franchise. Return to where it all began.','2024/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2396980/Fatestay_night_REMASTERED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1262,'gex_trilogy',NULL,'Everyone\'s favorite tail-whipping, channel-surfing, gecko is back in a collection that features all of his best-selling adventures!','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3183970/GEX_Trilogy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1263,'pico_park',NULL,'PICO PARK is a cooperative local/online multiplay action puzzle game for 2-8 players.','2021/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1509960/PICO_PARK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1264,'dead_cells:_return_to_castlevania',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead Cells on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2101430/Dead_Cells_Return_to_Castlevania/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_26'),(1265,'x-plane_12',NULL,'Ultra-Realistic Flight Simulation','2022/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2014780/XPlane_12/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1266,'clair_obscur:_expedition_33_–_deluxe_edition_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3228520/Clair_Obscur_Expedition_33__Deluxe_Edition_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1267,'stellaris:_nemesis',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2021/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1522090/Stellaris_Nemesis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1268,'remnant:_from_the_ashes',NULL,'The world has been thrown into chaos by an ancient evil from another dimension. As one of the last remnants of humanity, you must set out alone or alongside up to two other survivors to face down hordes of deadly enemies to try to carve a foothold, rebuild, and retake what was lost.','2019/8/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/617290/Remnant_From_the_Ashes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1269,'way_of_the_hunter',NULL,'Become the new owner of a hunting lodge nestled among gorgeous habitats and rich animal populations. Explore vast open world environments and hunt with a premium selection of firearms. Enjoy the perfect hunt on your own or with friends in co-op.','2022/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1288320/Way_of_the_Hunter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1270,'ballionaire',NULL,'BALLIONAIRE is a fast-paced, kinetic roguelike where strategy meets physics to create outrageous wealth! Find and exploit game-breaking synergies as you theorycraft your way to victory. Welcome to the autobonker genre!','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2667120/Ballionaire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1271,'vampyr',NULL,'London, 1918. You are newly-turned Vampyr Dr. Jonathan Reid. As a doctor, you must find a cure to save the city’s flu-ravaged citizens. As a Vampyr, you are cursed to feed on those you vowed to heal.','2018/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/427290/Vampyr/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1272,'snowbreak:_containment_zone',NULL,'The new 3D Waifu Sci-Fi RPG Shooter is here! Aim at fate, fight by our side! Clear the specified stage to claim an Orange-Tier Operative!','2023/12/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2668080/Snowbreak_Containment_Zone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1273,'class_of_\'09',NULL,'This is the anti-visual novel. Instead of playing as some guy magically able to score with beautiful anime girls, YOU play the anime girl and create mass chaos in the lives of your potential \"suitors\". Earnest comedy, social accuracy, and late 2000\'s aesthetic await you in Class of \'09!','2021/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1443200/Class_of_09/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1274,'vampire:_the_masquerade_-_bloodlines',NULL,'Vampire®: The Masquerade-Bloodlines™ delivers a new type of RPG experience-one that blends all the core elements of a traditional RPG with the graphical richness, immediacy and brutal combat of a first-person action game. The game plunges players into the dark and gritty vampire underworld of modern-day L.A. as a creature of the night.','2004/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2600/Vampire_The_Masquerade__Bloodlines/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1275,'rival_stars_horse_racing:_desktop_edition',NULL,'With stunning, realistic horses, an in-depth breeding system, and a range of exciting game modes, Rival Stars Horse Racing offers horse fans the ultimate racing and riding experience. Take the reins and become an equestrian legend!','2020/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1166860/Rival_Stars_Horse_Racing_Desktop_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1276,'assetto_corsa_competizione_-_gt2_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa Competizione on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2700600/Assetto_Corsa_Competizione__GT2_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1277,'voidtrain',NULL,'Become a crew member of an Interdimensional Express Train! Discover a new world full of mysterious creatures, enemies and places. Upgrade and customize your train, gather new materials and build better weapons. Play solo or online сo-op with up to 4 people.','2023/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1159690/Voidtrain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1278,'age_of_empires_ii:_de_-_chronicles:_battle_for_greece',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2805520/Age_of_Empires_II_DE__Chronicles_Battle_for_Greece/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1279,'star_trucker',NULL,'Haul cargo, trade salvage and keep your space suit close as you search for fame and fortune among the stars in a game that puts an interstellar twist on the truck sim genre.','2024/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2380050/Star_Trucker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1280,'fantasy_map_simulator',NULL,'Fantasy Map Simulator: Create and watch imaginary worlds evolve over centuries. Design maps, simulate nations, and control destinies. See empires rise and fall on your desktop wallpaper. A unique simulation for history buffs and creative minds.','2024/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3035500/Fantasy_Map_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1281,'book_of_hours',NULL,'Restore a crumbling occult library by a winter sea. Build the world’s foremost collection of grimoires and arcana. Master the invisible arts. BOOK OF HOURS is a narrative crafting RPG set in a 1930s world of hidden gods and secret histories. What sort of Librarian will you choose to be?','2023/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1028310/BOOK_OF_HOURS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1282,'ravenfield',NULL,'Fight upon the Ravenfield together with your Blue allies! Take down those pesky Reds using helicopters, tanks, guns, and active ragdoll physics!','2017/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/636480/Ravenfield/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1283,'squeakross:_home_squeak_home',NULL,'In Squeakross: Home Squeak Home, solve and transform puzzles into furniture to decorate the perfect home for your rodent friend. Collect hundreds of decorations, accessories and stickers in this cozy game full of charm!','2025/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2871440/Squeakross_Home_Squeak_Home/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1284,'alan_wake',NULL,'A Dark Presence stalks the small town of Bright Falls, pushing Alan Wake to the brink of sanity in his fight to unravel the mystery and save his love.','2012/2/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/108710/Alan_Wake/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1285,'mind_over_magic',NULL,'Mind Over Magic is a colony sim set at the site of a cursed magic school. Build and optimize your own magical academy, train powerful Mages, and master mighty relics in order to battle through the Underschool, a mysterious underground dungeon that holds the key to liberation from a deadly curse.','2025/2/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1270580/Mind_Over_Magic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1286,'outworld_station',NULL,'Take the helm as a new Station Commander and exploit an alien star system in this stunning space-station factory automation game. Amass resources and construct starships using increasingly advanced manufacturing and expand your station in a hostile universe.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3242950/Outworld_Station/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1287,'blood_trail',NULL,'You are Wendigo. A hard-hearted contract killer tasked with annihilating a fanatical cult. With your trusted arsenal at the ready, experience what has been called \"The most violent game in VR\". EARLY ACCESS includes RAID, ARENA and SANDBOX modes with a story campaign and much more on the way.','2019/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1032430/Blood_Trail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1288,'pinball_fx',NULL,'Pinball FX is digital pinball evolved. Get the highest score on tables inspired by the biggest brands in entertainment. New tables arrive frequently!','2023/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2328760/Pinball_FX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1289,'call_of_duty®_4:_modern_warfare®_(2007)',NULL,'The new action-thriller from the award-winning team at Infinity Ward, the creators of the Call of Duty® series, delivers the most intense and cinematic action experience ever. Call of Duty 4: Modern Warfare arms gamers with an arsenal of advanced and powerful modern day firepower and transports them to the most treacherous hotspots...','2007/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/7940/Call_of_Duty_4_Modern_Warfare_2007/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1290,'shovel_knight:_treasure_trove',NULL,'Shovel Knight: Treasure Trove is the complete Shovel Knight collection, containing all 5 games in the 