de range of ships. In single- and multiplayer modes, immerse yourself in tasks such as service, cargo transport, and commercial fishing as you explore the breathtaking open world of Norway´s Islands and its stunning scenery. The ocean is within your reach!','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1266540/Ships_At_Sea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1309,'little_sim_world',NULL,'Welcome to Little London! Little Sim World is a cosy 2D life sim set in the heart of a little city full of charm, dreams, and surprises. Design your perfect home, meet quirky locals, build your routine, and live life at your own pace. A gentle world, a fresh start, and a story only you can write!','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1429880/Little_Sim_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1310,'evil_west',NULL,'A dark menace consumes the Old West. In solo or coop, fight with style in visceral, explosive combat against bloodthirsty monstrosities. Eradicate the vampiric hordes with your lightning-fueled gauntlet and become a Wild West Superhero.','2022/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1065310/Evil_West/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1311,'sid_meier’s_civilization®_vi:_rise_and_fall',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier’s Civilization® VI on Steam in order to play.','2018/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/645402/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_VI_Rise_and_Fall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1312,'tom_clancy’s_the_division™',NULL,'After a deadly pandemic sweeps through New York, it\'s up to Agents to save what remains. Complete missions, explore the Dark Zone, and fight back enemy factions alone or with 3 friends. Experience a full endgame offering you new PvP and PvE modes.','2016/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/365590/Tom_Clancys_The_Division/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_27'),(1313,'dead_space™_3',NULL,'Journey across space to the icy planet of Tau Volantis with Isaac Clarke and Sgt. John Carver to discover and destroy the source of the Necromorph outbreak.','2013/2/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238060/Dead_Space_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1314,'torchlight:_infinite',NULL,'The fate of Ember Technology is in your hands. With abounding hero build possibilities, dive into an epic journey with endless loot, adrenaline-pumping fights & new seasonal contents.','2023/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1974050/Torchlight_Infinite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1315,'bugsnax',NULL,'Catch mysterious living snacks and feed them to your friends in this unusual island adventure!','2022/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/674140/Bugsnax/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1316,'war_of_rights',NULL,'War of Rights is a first person multiplayer game featuring massive 400 player battles with a focus on historical authenticity, teamplay and immersion. It is set during the perilous days of the American Civil War, in the Maryland Campaign of September, 1862.','2018/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/424030/War_of_Rights/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1317,'rust_-_voice_props_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rust on Steam in order to play.','2021/7/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1670430/Rust__Voice_Props_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1318,'witchspring_r',NULL,'WitchSpring R is a story-driven RPG combining elements of collecting, simulation, and battling. Experience the joy of training a young witch and accompany her on a grand adventure!','2023/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1958220/WitchSpring_R/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1319,'echo_point_nova',NULL,'Echo Point Nova is an open-world FPS that offers unparalleled freedom and thrilling speed. Designed for both singleplayer and coop. From the creators of Severed Steel.','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1836730/Echo_Point_Nova/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1320,'the_jackbox_party_pack_3',NULL,'The threequel to the party game phenomenon features the deadly quiz show Trivia Murder Party, the say-anything sequel Quiplash 2, the surprising survey game Guesspionage, the t-shirt slugfest Tee K.O., and the sneaky trickster game Fakin’ It.','2016/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/434170/The_Jackbox_Party_Pack_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1321,'elite_dangerous:_odyssey',NULL,'This content requires the base game Elite Dangerous on Steam in order to play.','2021/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1336350/Elite_Dangerous_Odyssey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1322,'dead_by_daylight_-_stranger_things_chapter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2019/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1135280/Dead_by_Daylight__Stranger_Things_Chapter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1323,'naruto_to_boruto:_shinobi_striker',NULL,'Battle as a team of 4 to compete against other teams online! Graphically, SHINOBI STRIKER is also built from the ground up in a completely new graphic style. Lead your team and fight online to see who the best ninjas are!','2018/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/633230/NARUTO_TO_BORUTO_SHINOBI_STRIKER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1324,'mafia:_the_old_country',NULL,'Uncover the origins of organized crime in Mafia: The Old Country, a gritty mob story set in the brutal underworld of 1900s Sicily. Fight to survive as Enzo Favara and prove your worth to the Family in this immersive third-person action-adventure.','2025/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1941540/Mafia_The_Old_Country/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1325,'chained_echoes',NULL,'Take up your sword, channel your magic or board your Mech. Chained Echoes is a 16-bit style RPG set in a fantasy world where dragons are as common as piloted mechanical suits.','2022/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1229240/Chained_Echoes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1326,'planet_coaster_2:_vintage_funfair_ride_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Coaster 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3091190/Planet_Coaster_2_Vintage_Funfair_Ride_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1327,'counter-strike:_source',NULL,'Counter-Strike: Source blends Counter-Strike\'s award-winning teamplay action with the advanced technology of Source™ technology.','2004/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/240/CounterStrike_Source/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1328,'five_nights_at_freddy\'s_2',NULL,'Welcome back to the new and improved Freddy Fazbear\'s Pizza! As always, Fazbear Entertainment is not responsible for death or dismemberment.','2014/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/332800/Five_Nights_at_Freddys_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1329,'king_arthur:_knight\'s_tale',NULL,'A unique hybrid between turn-based tactical games and traditional, character-centric RPGs. Knight\'s Tale is a modern retelling of a classic Arthurian mythology story filtered through the dark fantasy tropes, a twist on the traditional tales of chivalry.','2022/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1157390/King_Arthur_Knights_Tale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1330,'the_last_spell',NULL,'Defend the last bastion of humanity with your squad of heroes! Exterminate fiendish monsters with magic and brute force by night and re-build your battered city defenses by day in this tactical RPG with rogue-lite mechanics.','2023/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1105670/The_Last_Spell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1331,'dragon_age:_origins_-_ultimate_edition',NULL,'Explore a stunning world, make complex moral choices, and engage in bone-crushing combat against massive and terrifying creatures. The Ultimate Edition includes Dragon Age: Origins, Dragon Age: Origins - Awakening and all nine content packs.','2010/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/47810/Dragon_Age_Origins__Ultimate_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1332,'dragon_age™_inquisition',NULL,'Winner of over 130 Game of the Year awards, discover the definitive Dragon Age: Inquisition experience. The Game of the Year Edition includes the critically acclaimed game, all three official add-ons - Jaws of Hakkon, The Descent, and Trespasser - and more.','2014/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1222690/Dragon_Age_Inquisition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1333,'carry_the_glass',NULL,'Team up as two quirky construction workers in this fun 2-player co-op platformer! Carry a fragile glass window through colorful levels filled with challenges. Communicate and coordinate to dodge obstacles and solve puzzles. Can you finish the job without breaking the glass?','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3263320/Carry_The_Glass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1334,'castlevania_dominus_collection',NULL,'Three incredible action adventure games from the Castlevania series have finally returned, for the first time! But wait, there\'s more! Haunted Castle Revisited, a redesigned version of the very first Castlevania arcade game, makes its debut!','2024/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2369900/Castlevania_Dominus_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1335,'terminator:_dark_fate_-_defiance',NULL,'Terminator: Dark Fate – Defiance is not just a game; it\'s an adrenaline-fueled journey where your strategic prowess decides the fate of mankind against the machines. After the machines took over, the greatest threats may not come from the machines but rather from other human survivors.','2024/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1839950/Terminator_Dark_Fate__Defiance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1336,'sally_face_-_season_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sally Face - Episode One on Steam in order to play.','2016/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/567990/Sally_Face__Season_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1337,'that\'s_not_my_neighbor',NULL,'It\'s 1955, and for unknown reasons, doppelgangers are more common than usual. Therefore, the Department of Doppelganger Detection (D.D.D.) has taken action. You are the doorman of an apartment complex, and you must decide whether to let in those who claim to be your neighbors.','2025/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3431040/Thats_not_my_Neighbor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1338,'teenage_mutant_ninja_turtles:_splintered_fate',NULL,'TMNT Splintered Fate - Unleash the Turtles in a rogue-like quest to rescue Splinter from the Foot Clan! Master ninja skills, unite in bodacious co-op gameplay, and conquer iconic NYC locales.','2024/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2996040/Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_Splintered_Fate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1339,'alice:_madness_returns',NULL,'Alice: Madness Returns is a third-person, single-player, action adventure platformer. Visit the grim reality of Victorian London and travel to the beautiful yet ghastly Wonderland to uncover the root of Alice\'s madness.','2011/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/19680/Alice_Madness_Returns/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1340,'crusader_kings_iii:_wandering_nobles',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings III on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2671080/Crusader_Kings_III_Wandering_Nobles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1341,'total_war:_warhammer_-_realm_of_the_wood_elves',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2016/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/534331/Total_War_WARHAMMER__Realm_of_The_Wood_Elves/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1342,'the_legend_of_heroes:_trails_through_daybreak',NULL,'The spriggan known as Van Arkride, an underground professional, accepts any job, acting as detective, negotiator, or bounty hunter. Dive into the Trails series\' latest chapter with intense combat, beautiful visuals, and a new alignment system in Calvard!','2023/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2138610/The_Legend_of_Heroes_Trails_through_Daybreak/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1343,'tekken_7',NULL,'Discover the epic conclusion of the long-time clan warfare between members of the Mishima family. Powered by Unreal Engine 4, the legendary fighting game franchise fights back with stunning story-driven cinematic battles and intense duels that can be enjoyed with friends and rivals.','2017/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/389730/TEKKEN_7/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1344,'the_jackbox_party_pack_8',NULL,'Plan your next game night! Jackbox Games is back with 5 hilarious new party games including Drawful Animate, Job Job, The Poll Mine, Weapons Drawn, and The Wheel of Enormous Proportions.','2021/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1552350/The_Jackbox_Party_Pack_8/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1345,'bread_&_fred',NULL,'Grab your best bud for help in this new co-op challenge to help two adorable penguins, Bread and Fred, reach the top of the snowy summit. Time your jumps, cling to walls and swing across gaps to see how far you can make it before you tumble all the way back down the mountain.','2023/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1607680/Bread__Fred/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1346,'squirreled_away',NULL,'Live your best squirrel life. Explore, gather, craft, and build incredible treehouses in acres of beautiful parkland. Scurry across lawns, up trees, and leap limb to limb solo, or up to four friends can play together in co-op. Endless summer days of adventure await.','2025/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2977620/Squirreled_Away/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1347,'star_wars™_battlefront',NULL,'The STAR WARS™ Battlefront™ Ultimate Edition includes the STAR WARS™ Battlefront™ Deluxe Edition as well as the STAR WARS™ Battlefront™ Season Pass.','2015/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1237980/STAR_WARS_Battlefront/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1348,'baldur\'s_gate:_enhanced_edition',NULL,'The classic adventure