://store.steampowered.com/app/2313540/Crusader_Kings_III_Legacy_of_Persia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1354,'mobile_suit_gundam_seed_battle_destiny_remastered',NULL,'Become a pilot in the world of Mobile Suit Gundam SEED, for the first time available with English localization! Engage in thrilling, action-packed Gundam battles, complete missions, and tune up your newly acquired Mobile Suits!','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1857740/MOBILE_SUIT_GUNDAM_SEED_BATTLE_DESTINY_REMASTERED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1355,'uncrashed_:_fpv_drone_simulator',NULL,'Amateur or experienced FPV pilot, learn or improve your skills on Uncrashed,the new ultra realistic FPV simulator. Simulate your own FPV drone with settings based on real values and you will have the same feeling as a real flight without the risk of breaking your drone !','2021/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1682970/Uncrashed__FPV_Drone_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1356,'ftl:_faster_than_light',NULL,'This \"spaceship simulation roguelike-like\" allows you to take your ship and crew on an adventure through a randomly generated galaxy filled with glory and bitter defeat.','2012/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/212680/FTL_Faster_Than_Light/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1357,'generation_zero®',NULL,'Generation Zero is a stealth-action shooter where you wage guerilla warfare against lethal mechanical enemies. Explore a vast open world map inspired by the Swedish Cold War era, take part in the resistance alone or with up to three friends in seamless co-op.','2019/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/704270/Generation_Zero/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1358,'session:_skate_sim',NULL,'Made by and for skaters, the dual stick controls faithfully reproduce your feet on the skateboard for an ultra-realistic experience. Try out real-life iconic skate spots, customise your skater and equipment with items from the top brands','2022/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/861650/Session_Skate_Sim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1359,'jurassic_world_evolution_2:_feathered_species_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2314000/Jurassic_World_Evolution_2_Feathered_Species_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1360,'turing_complete',NULL,'Learn CPU architecture with puzzles','2021/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1444480/Turing_Complete/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1361,'cruelty_squad',NULL,'An immersive power fantasy simulator with tactical stealth elements set in a sewage infused garbage world','2021/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1388770/Cruelty_Squad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_28'),(1362,'peripeteia',NULL,'Peripeteia is a first-and-third-person role-playing stealth game taking place in alt-history cyberpunk Poland. Inspired by immersive sims from Ion Storm and Looking Glass Studios, Peripeteia expands on the formula with new ideas and an original setting.','2025/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1437760/Peripeteia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1363,'panicore',NULL,'PANICORE is a survival horror game that mixes permadeath, AI monsters and a co-op experience up to 5 players (4 players in demo). Try to escape and don\'t get caught, but beware: they don\'t only hear your steps, but also your voice.','2024/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2695940/PANICORE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1364,'call_to_arms_-_gates_of_hell:_talvisota',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call to Arms - Gates of Hell: Ostfront on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1911520/Call_to_Arms__Gates_of_Hell_Talvisota/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1365,'starship_troopers:_extermination',NULL,'Starship Troopers: Extermination is a 16-player co-op FPS that puts you on the far-off frontlines of an all-out battle against the Bugs! Squad up, grab your rifle, and do your part as an elite Deep Space Vanguard Trooper to take back planets from the Arachnid threat!','2024/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1268750/Starship_Troopers_Extermination/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1366,'arma_3_creator_dlc:_s.o.g._prairie_fire',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2021/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1227700/Arma_3_Creator_DLC_SOG_Prairie_Fire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1367,'spilled!',NULL,'Clean up ocean waste in this short & relaxing game! Recycle, earn coins and upgrade your boat. Explore new areas. Clean bigger spills and different kinds of waste!','2025/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2240080/Spilled/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1368,'tetris®_effect:_connected',NULL,'Tetris® Effect: Connected adds an all-new robust multiplayer expansion to the huge variety of addictive and innovative single-player modes that Tetris Effect is known for, with all-new co-op and competitive online and local multiplayer modes!','2021/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1003590/Tetris_Effect_Connected/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1369,'out_of_sight',NULL,'You’re Sophie, a young blind girl who sees through her teddy bear’s eyes. Escape your captors and uncover the evil history of the dark mansion you desperately seek to escape in this unique, atmospheric horror puzzle/adventure game.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2526310/Out_of_Sight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1370,'resident_evil_4_-_separate_ways',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2109300/Resident_Evil_4__Separate_Ways/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1371,'zero_sievert',NULL,'Now with over 500,00 copies sold, ZERO Sievert is a tense top-down extraction shooter that challenges you to scavenge a procedurally-generated wasteland, loot gear, and explore what’s left of a devastated world. When the odds are stacked against you, you’ll need to do more than just survive...','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1782120/ZERO_Sievert/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1372,'bloodstained:_ritual_of_the_night',NULL,'Bloodstained: Ritual of the Night is an exploration-focused, side-scroller action RPG by Koji Igarashi. Play as Miriam, an orphan scarred by an alchemist\'s curse that slowly crystallizes her body. Battle through a demon-infested castle and defeat its master to save yourself, and all of humanity!','2019/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/692850/Bloodstained_Ritual_of_the_Night/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1373,'humankind™',NULL,'Rewrite history by shaping a civilization as unique as you are. Combine 60 cultures from the Ancient Era to the Modern Age to lead your empire to victory. Build thriving cities, outsmart rivals in epic battles, spread your influence and leave your mark on HUMANKIND™.','2021/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1124300/HUMANKIND/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1374,'master_detective_archives:_rain_code_plus',NULL,'Yuma, an amnesiac detective-in-training, and Shinigami, the spirit haunting him, tackle unsolved mysteries.','2024/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2903950/Master_Detective_Archives_RAIN_CODE_Plus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1375,'final_fantasy®_xiii',NULL,'Final Fantasy XIII is a fantasy RPG in which a band of brave humans struggle against fate in the utopian sky city of Cocoon and the primeval world of Pulse. Follow stylish heroine Lightning\'s fast paced battles and high adventure in a mysterious new world.','2014/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/292120/FINAL_FANTASY_XIII/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1376,'spellforce:_conquest_of_eo',NULL,'On a journey to great magical might, explore and control the lands of Eo in this ever-changing turn-based strategy role-playing game. Field armies and heroes in tactical combat, finish hundreds of quests, and gather spells and artefacts to become the most powerful mage of all. ','2023/2/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1581770/SpellForce_Conquest_of_Eo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1377,'elin',NULL,'Successor to the roguelike RPG \"Elona\". Adventure, survival, crafting, home-building, myths passed down, and stories of humans and Elea spun. What scars will you leave on the land of Ylva?','2024/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2135150/Elin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1378,'the_sims™_4_vampires',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2017/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235743/The_Sims_4_Vampires/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1379,'jagged_alliance_3',NULL,'The country of Grand Chien is thrown into chaos when the elected president goes missing and the paramilitary force known as “the Legion” seizes control. Hire mercs, meet interesting characters, and fight in tactically deep turn-based combat in this true successor to a beloved franchise.','2023/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1084160/Jagged_Alliance_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1380,'rabbit_and_steel',NULL,'RABBIT & STEEL is a co-op action roguelike that recreates the essence of high-level MMO raiding in a randomized, simplified, bunny-sized package. Choose your class, gather your rabbit-eared companions and battle your way to the Moonlit Pinnacle!','2024/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2132850/Rabbit_and_Steel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1381,'crush_crush',NULL,'Welcome to Crush Crush - the Idle Dating Sim! Meet, flirt, and fall in love with a motley cast of girls in this heartfelt and hilarious game.','2016/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/459820/Crush_Crush/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1382,'microsoft_flight_simulator_x:_steam_edition',NULL,'Take to the skies in the World’s favourite flight simulator! The multi award winning Microsoft Flight Simulator X lands on Steam for the first time. Take off from anywhere in the world, flying some of the world’s most iconic aircraft to any one of 24,000 destinations.','2006/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/314160/Microsoft_Flight_Simulator_X_Steam_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1383,'trailmakers:_packing_heat',NULL,'This content requires the base game Trailmakers on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3708690/Trailmakers_Packing_Heat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1384,'bigfoot',NULL,'You are a Bigfoot hunter with an important mission: to put an end to rumours once and for all and prove to yourself that Bigfoot is not just a myth or an invention of the mind...','2017/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/509980/BIGFOOT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1385,'poppy_playtime_-_chapter_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game Poppy Playtime on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2555190/Poppy_Playtime__Chapter_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1386,'metro_awakening',NULL,'Metro Awakening is a story-driven first person adventure built for VR that blends atmospheric exploration, stealth and combat in the most immersive Metro experience yet. Don your gas mask, brave the crippling radiation and venture into the depths of the Metro where threats haunt your every step.','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2669410/Metro_Awakening/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1387,'murky_divers',NULL,'Solo or up to 8 players. Get rid of your employer\'s failed experiments in abandoned underwater labs. Navigate your submarine, avoid abyssal terrors, and remove all corpses.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2963880/Murky_Divers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1388,'wuchang:_fallen_feathers',NULL,'WUCHANG: Fallen Feathers is a soulslike, action RPG set in the land of Shu during the dark and tumultuous late Ming Dynasty, plagued with warring factions and a mysterious illness spawning monstrous creatures.','2025/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2277560/WUCHANG_Fallen_Feathers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1389,'rpg_maker_mv',NULL,'POWERFUL enough for a developer SIMPLE enough for a child VERSATILE enough for any platform!RPG MAKER MV allows you to make the RPG of your dreams! This latest version includes a host of new featuresand export options for MacOSX, Android, and iPhone!','2015/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/363890/RPG_Maker_MV/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1390,'dead_or_alive_6',NULL,'DEAD OR ALIVE 6 is fast-paced 3D fighting game, produced by Koei Tecmo Games, featuring stunning graphics and multi-tiered stages that create a truly entertaining competitive experience.','2019/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/838380/DEAD_OR_ALIVE_6/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1391,'dcs:_f-16c_viper',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1090850/DCS_F16C_Viper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1392,'beholder:_conductor',NULL,'A Beholder series spin-off. Become a conductor of the Determination Bringer train: monitor passengers, report incidents, and carry out important Ministry assignments — whose level of secrecy depends only on your loyalty. And remember: mission success is very important to you!','2025/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2825530/Beholder_Conductor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1393,'tom_clancy\'s_the_division_2__battle_for_brooklyn_deluxe_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tom Clancy’s The Division® 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3572160/Tom_Clancys_The_Division_2__Battle_for_Brooklyn_Deluxe_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1394,'unnamed_space_idle',NULL,'Destroy endless waves of alien ships that have all but wiped out humanity in this long form, unfolding, sci-fi idle 