050/Yarimono/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1400,'farm_together_2',NULL,'Grow your own farm all by yourself, or cooperate with your friends in the long awaited sequel to the cozy, relaxing farming experience!','2025/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2418520/Farm_Together_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1401,'the_sims™_4_enchanted_by_nature_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2025/7/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3199780/The_Sims_4_Enchanted_by_Nature_Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1402,'warhammer_40,000:_battlesector_-_deeds_of_the_fallen',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3577600/Warhammer_40000_Battlesector__Deeds_of_the_Fallen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1403,'fae_farm',NULL,'Escape to the magical life of your dreams in Fae Farm, a farm sim RPG for 1-4 players. Craft, cultivate, and decorate to grow your homestead, and use spells to explore the enchanted island of Azoria!','2023/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2230110/Fae_Farm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1404,'tomb_raider',NULL,'Tomb Raider explores the intense origin story of Lara Croft and her ascent from a young woman to a hardened survivor.','2013/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/203160/Tomb_Raider/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1405,'life_is_strange:_true_colors',NULL,'Alex Chen hides her \'curse\': the psychic power of Empathy, the ability to absorb the emotions of others. When her brother dies in a so-called accident, Alex must embrace her power to find the truth.','2021/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/936790/Life_is_Strange_True_Colors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1406,'streamer_life_simulator_2',NULL,'In the second game of the series, competition has increased and now everyone wants to be a streamer. Are you ready to stream until your cpu burns out?','2025/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2890830/Streamer_Life_Simulator_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1407,'this_war_of_mine',NULL,'In This War Of Mine you do not play as an elite soldier, rather a group of civilians trying to survive in a besieged city; struggling with lack of food, medicine and constant danger from snipers and hostile scavengers. The game provides an experience of war seen from an entirely new angle.','2014/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/282070/This_War_of_Mine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1408,'the_walking_dead:_saints_&_sinners',NULL,'Saints & Sinners is a game unlike any other in The Walking Dead universe. Every challenge you face and decision you make is driven by YOU. Fight the undead, scavenge through the flooded ruins of New Orleans, and face gut-wrenching choices for you and the other survivors. Live The Walking Dead.','2020/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/916840/The_Walking_Dead_Saints__Sinners/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_29'),(1409,'towerborne',NULL,'Towerborne is a new kind of Looter Brawler, combining side-scrolling combat with action RPG loot progression and endless customization. Unite with other Aces and defend the Belfry, humanity’s last refuge. Explore, fight, and grow stronger – together.','2024/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2458830/Towerborne/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1410,'we_love_katamari_reroll+_royal_reverie',NULL,'The second title in the Katamari Damacy series has returned in a remastered, powered-up version! This new REROLL comes with improved graphics and gameplay enhancements. In Royal Reverie, roll up katamari as the King of All Cosmos in his boyhood!','2023/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1730700/We_Love_Katamari_REROLL_Royal_Reverie/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1411,'do_no_harm',NULL,'Lovecraftian Doctor Simulator. Diagnose patients by analyzing unsettling symptoms and treat them using your Book of Medicine. Make moral choices — decide who to save or kill, discover whom to trust, and unlock multiple endings! Can you endure 30 days of perilous decisions?','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3138780/Do_No_Harm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1412,'wartales,_pirates_of_belerion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wartales on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2692400/Wartales_Pirates_of_Belerion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1413,'resident_evil_revelations',NULL,'Resident Evil® Revelations returns redefined for PC complete with high quality HD visuals, enhanced lighting effects and an immersive sound experience.','2013/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/222480/Resident_Evil_Revelations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1414,'custom_order_maid_3d2_it\'s_a_night_magic',NULL,'Empire Club. The most luxurious bar that ladies and gentlemen come and gather. The beautiful maids who worked there danced and talked with the customers to amuse them.','2019/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1097580/CUSTOM_ORDER_MAID_3D2_Its_a_Night_Magic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1415,'stellaris:_megacorp',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2018/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/944290/Stellaris_MegaCorp/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1416,'lego®_star_wars™_iii_-_the_clone_wars™',NULL,'LEGO Star Wars III: The Clone Wars will allow fans to explore endlessly and laugh their way through the Star Wars galaxy in the most humorous, accessible and action-packed LEGO game to date.','2011/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/32510/LEGO_Star_Wars_III__The_Clone_Wars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1417,'daemon_x_machina',NULL,'Pilot your fully customizable Arsenal mech and join your fellow mercenaries in defending humanity from the corrupted machines and gigantic robots in this post-apocalyptic action game!','2020/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1167450/DAEMON_X_MACHINA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1418,'midnight_fight_express',NULL,'A former member of the criminal underworld is lured back into “the life” by a mysterious drone claiming they have until sunrise to prevent a citywide criminal takeover together.','2022/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1390410/Midnight_Fight_Express/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1419,'ghosts_of_tabor',NULL,'Ghosts of Tabor is VRs only FPS PVP and PVE survival game where you will use your wits, skills and resources to survive. Inspired by games such as Escape from Tarkov and DayZ, featuring different scenarios from scavenging to looting and crafting. Will you survive long enough to make it out alive?','2023/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1957780/Ghosts_of_Tabor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1420,'arma_3_contact',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2019/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1021790/Arma_3_Contact/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1421,'american_truck_simulator_-_kansas',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2298430/American_Truck_Simulator__Kansas/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1422,'fallout_shelter',NULL,'Fallout Shelter puts you in control of a state-of-the-art underground Vault from Vault-Tec. Build the perfect Vault, keep your Dwellers happy, and protect them from the dangers of the Wasteland.','2017/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/588430/Fallout_Shelter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1423,'ixion',NULL,'IXION is an unrelenting, city-building odyssey across the stars. As Administrator of the Tiqqun, DOLOS’ prototype space station, you are tasked with balancing preservation and exploration as you manage infrastructure, resources and crew. Can you keep the flame of humanity alight in the cold dark?','2022/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1113120/IXION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1424,'anger_foot',NULL,'Anger Foot is a lightning fast action FPS where the only things harder than your ass kicking feet are the ass kicking beats.','2024/7/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1978590/Anger_Foot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1425,'eternal_return',NULL,'Eternal Return is a free-to-play, 2.5D perspective Battle Royale game. Search, Craft, Hunt, and Fight using a variety of characters. Plan your strategy and become the last survivor on this eternal experiment.','2023/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1049590/Eternal_Return/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1426,'final_fantasy',NULL,'The original FINAL FANTASY comes to life with completely new graphics and audio! A remodeled 2D take on the first game in the world-renowned FINAL FANTASY series! Enjoy the timeless story told through charming retro graphics.','2021/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1173770/FINAL_FANTASY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1427,'life_is_strange_-_episode_1',NULL,'Episode 1 now FREE! Life is Strange is an award-winning and critically acclaimed episodic adventure game that allows the player to rewind time and affect the past, present and future.','2015/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/319630/Life_is_Strange__Episode_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1428,'powerwash_simulator_–_alice’s_adventures_special_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PowerWash Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2736310/PowerWash_Simulator__Alices_Adventures_Special_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1429,'five_nights_at_freddy\'s:_into_the_pit',NULL,'Survive five nights of terror in this chilling adventure game. Travel between time periods to solve puzzles, gather clues, and outrun the threat relentlessly pursuing you. Move swiftly and stay hidden, and you may just survive. But be careful—it\'s not just your own life that’s on the line this time.','2024/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2638370/Five_Nights_at_Freddys_Into_the_Pit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1430,'the_sims™_4_snowy_escape_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1368572/The_Sims_4_Snowy_Escape_Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1431,'faith:_the_unholy_trinity',NULL,'What you are about to do has not been approved by the Vatican. As a young priest, struggle against demons, insane cultists, and your own weakening faith in this pixel horror game inspired by the era of classic 8-bit gaming and the \"Satanic Scare\" of the 1980s.','2022/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1179080/FAITH_The_Unholy_Trinity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1432,'﻿the_hoarder_armor_set',NULL,'This content requires the base game 7 Days to Die on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3314750/The_Hoarder_Armor_Set/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1433,'clanfolk',NULL,'Clanfolk is a colony sim set in the Scottish Highlands. Harness your environment to survive - fish, gather, hunt, and farm as you prepare for the winter. Build an inn, trade with other clans, have children and marry them off - live life and prosper across the generations.','2022/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1700870/Clanfolk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1434,'hero\'s_land',NULL,'HERO\'S LAND is an MMO PVPVE game where survival isn\'t just a goal—it\'s a necessity. Monsters and enemies are out to get you, making every encounter a potential ambush. Fight for glory, and welcome to a world where strategy and courage are your greatest assets.','2023/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2349820/Heros_Land/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1435,'neverwinter_nights:_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Return to the Forgotten Realms in this bestselling Dungeons & Dragons roleplaying game. Combines all the content of Neverwinter Nights Diamond Edition with all-new enhanced features. Includes 100+ hours of award-winning adventures and the tools to create your own!','2018/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/704450/Neverwinter_Nights_Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1436,'journey_to_the_savage_planet',NULL,'\"WELCOME TO THE PIONEER PROGRAM! As the newest recruit of Kindred Aerospace - The 4th best interstellar space exploration company - Your job is to determine if the planet ARY-26 planet is fit for humans. You may be short on equipment and experience, but you\'ll figure it out. Good luck!','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/973810/Journey_To_The_Savage_Planet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1437,'city_bus_manager',NULL,'Build your own bus depot from scratch and create your personal bus routes in City Bus Manager. Play in your own hometown or any famous city in the world with real map data. Buy buses, maintain them, take care of your staff and lead your bus company to become the #1 in town!','2024/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1364210/City_Bus_Manager/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1438,'this_bed_we_made',NULL,'This Bed We Made is a third-person mystery game in which you play as a maid in a 1950s hotel and snoop around strangers\' rooms to uncover their deadly secrets. Discover what links guests together in this tale of love, heartbreak and murder!','2023/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1243850/This_Bed_We_Made/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1439,'witch_of_eclipse',NULL,'Travel the world as a witch and help the people by defeating threats, going to dungeons in search of materials, and granting other special favors.','2025/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2952690/Witch_of_Eclipse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1440,'simrail_-_the_railway_simulator',NULL,'SimRail is new, advanced railway simulator. Master high-speed long-distance EMU, heavy freight hauls and suburban trains. Travel 500 km of geodetic-data based real routes. Become train dispatcher and control the traffic according to the schedule or cooperate with other players on multiplayer mode.','2024/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1422130/SimRail__The_Railway_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1441,'a_webbing_journey',NULL,'Adorable spider chaos! Swing around the house, weave crazy structures, play with physics-based objects, and pull off chores with nothing but your webs and your wits in this madcap sandbox adventure.','2025/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2073910/A_Webbing_Journey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1442,'ratopia',NULL,'Ratopia is a new game that has combined elements of both strategic survival and city building. With plenty of content available, and more planned, enjoy a vast world to adventure and populate with citizens! Build your own economical system to sustain your ideal city of Ratopia.','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2244130/Ratopia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1443,'metro_gravity',NULL,'Explore, fight, solve puzzles and bend gravity to escape the dream-like world of the Halls! Metro Gravity is a mind-boggling musical adventure with rhythmic combat and compelling lore.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2986450/Metro_Gravity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1444,'a_dance_of_fire_and_ice',NULL,'A Dance of Fire and Ice is a strict rhythm game. Keep your focus as you guide two orbiting planets along a winding path without breaking their perfect equilibrium.','2019/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/977950/A_Dance_of_Fire_and_Ice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1445,'kingdoms_of_amalur:_re-reckoning',NULL,'The hit RPG returns! Remastered with stunning visuals and refined gameplay Re-Reckoning delivers intense, customizable RPG combat inside a sprawling game world.','2020/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1041720/Kingdoms_of_Amalur_ReReckoning/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1446,'expansion_-_europa_universalis_iv:_winds_of_change',NULL,'This content requires the base game Europa Universalis IV on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2854750/Expansion__Europa_Universalis_IV_Winds_of_Change/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1447,'hotline_miami_2:_wrong_number',NULL,'Hotline Miami 2: Wrong Number is the brutal conclusion to the Hotline Miami saga, set against a backdrop of escalating violence and retribution over spilled blood in the original game.','2015/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/274170/Hotline_Miami_2_Wrong_Number/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1448,'stellaris:_utopia',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2017/4/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/553280/Stellaris_Utopia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1449,'zompiercer',NULL,'Take control of the train which will become your haven on the rails. Collect resources, craft equipment, construct a cozy house on railway cars, and travel through the carefully handcrafted locations to explore the story of a zombie apocalypse world.','2020/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1262460/Zompiercer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1450,'fabledom',NULL,'Set in a wholesome fairytale world, Fabledom is a laid-back City builder. Enjoy the growth of your settlement, interact with your neighbors and defend your kingdom from magical creatures. All to find true love and live happily ever after!','2024/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1651560/Fabledom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1451,'maneater',NULL,'Experience the ultimate power fantasy as the apex predator of the seas - a giant Shark! Terrorize the coastal waterways. Tear swimmers and divers limb from limb, give the humans a reason to fear you!','2021/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/629820/Maneater/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1452,'hotline_miami',NULL,'Hotline Miami is a high-octane action game overflowing with raw brutality, hard-boiled gunplay and skull crushing close combat.','2012/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/219150/Hotline_Miami/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1453,'the_ranch_of_rivershine',NULL,'Saddle up and build your own horse ranch! Raise foals, care for your horses and train them as you explore the countryside. Participate in cross country competitions and become your town\'s champion! Befriend the villagers who\'ll help you on your adventure at the Ranch of Rivershine!','2025/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1559600/The_Ranch_of_Rivershine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1454,'silent_hill_f',NULL,'Hinako\'s hometown is engulfed in fog, driving her to fight grotesque monsters and solve eerie puzzles. Uncover the disturbing beauty hidden in terror.','2025/9/24','Unreleased','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2947440/SILENT_HILL_f/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1455,'topspin_2k25',NULL,'TopSpin 2K25 returns as a next-level tennis sim, bringing realistic court physics and challenging skill-based gameplay. Play single or multiplayer locally or online. Build your MyPLAYER or play as icons like Roger Federer and Serena Williams with custom animations mirroring their real-life styles.','2024/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1785650/TopSpin_2K25/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1456,'naval_action',NULL,'Or were you deaf or were you blind when you left your two fine legs behind, Or was it sailing on the sea when you got the cannonball to your knee, I too was young and I was slim and I had a leg for every limb, But now I’ve got no legs at all, they were both shot away by a cannonball.','2019/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/311310/Naval_Action/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_30'),(1457,'oxygen_not_included:_the_frosty_planet_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Oxygen Not Included on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2952300/Oxygen_Not_Included_The_Frosty_Planet_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1458,'neverwinter',NULL,'Neverwinter is a free, action MMORPG based on the acclaimed Dungeons & Dragons fantasy roleplaying game. Epic stories, action combat and classic roleplaying await those heroes courageous enough to enter the fantastic world of Neverwinter!','2013/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/109600/Neverwinter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1459,'fate/samurai_remnant',NULL,'“Your wish shall perish...” A Holy Grail War begins in Edo Japan. A brand new Fate action RPG presented by TYPE-MOON and KOEI TECMO GAMES.','2023/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1902690/FateSamurai_Remnant/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1460,'the_sims™_legacy_collection',NULL,'The original game you know and love. For Windows 10/11. Create a neighborhood of Sims and guide their lives through careers and romance — or create chaos with open-ended gameplay that lets you shape their destinies.','2025/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3314060/The_Sims_Legacy_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1461,'dysmantle',NULL,'Ascend from your shelter. Ruin everything. Escape the wretched island. ⚔️🔨🎣🌱🌵🍰 Explore. Fight. Level up. Survive. Gather. Craft. Harvest. Hunt. Build. Farm. Solve puzzles. Fish. Cook. Live. Enjoy the bittersweet post-apocalypse.','2021/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/846770/DYSMANTLE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1462,'danganronpa:_trigger_happy_havoc',NULL,'Investigate murders, search for clues and talk to your classmates to prepare for trial. There, you\'ll engage in deadly wordplay, going back and forth with suspects. Dissect their statements and fire their words back at them to expose their lies! There\'s only one way to survive—pull the trigger.','2016/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/413410/Danganronpa_Trigger_Happy_Havoc/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1463,'divinity:_original_sin_-_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Gather your party and get ready for the kick-ass new version of GameSpot\'s PC Game of the Year 2014. With hours of new content, new game modes, full voiceovers, split-screen multiplayer, and thousands of improvements, there\'s never been a better time to explore the epic world of Rivellon!','2015/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/373420/Divinity_Original_Sin__Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1464,'lego®_the_hobbit™',NULL,'Reclaim the Lost Kingdom brick by brick! Join Bilbo Baggins, Gandalf, Thorin and his company of Dwarves in an epic adventure across Middle-earth to recapture the Lonely Mountain in the most expansive LEGO game to date.','2014/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/285160/LEGO_The_Hobbit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1465,'cataclismo',NULL,'Design and build fortresses brick by brick to stand against endless hordes of Horrors in this real-time strategy game with resource management, siege defense, and exploration. Lead from the ramparts, push back the darkness, and hold fast against the creatures of the Mist.','2025/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1422440/Cataclismo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1466,'expansion_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_la_résistance',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2020/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1158100/Expansion__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_La_Rsistance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1467,'rail_route',NULL,'In Rail Route, you will design, construct, upgrade, and automate your railway network in one of the many maps based on real-life cities worldwide. Dispatch the trains to make the traffic flow and the network grow!','2024/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1124180/Rail_Route/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1468,'golf_it!',NULL,'Embark on an exciting journey with Golf It! Seize your putter, rally your friends, and immerse yourself in an epic minigolf adventure. Conquer countless courses, create lasting memories, and refine your skills to emerge as the ultimate minigolf champion. Your thrilling golfing odyssey begins here!','2023/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/571740/Golf_It/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1469,'the_outer_worlds:_peril_on_gorgon',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Outer Worlds on Steam in order to play.','2020/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1393110/The_Outer_Worlds_Peril_on_Gorgon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1470,'tower_of_fantasy',NULL,'Embark together on your fantasy adventure! Set hundreds of years in the future on the distant planet of Aida, the shared open-world RPG, anime-infused sci-fi adventure Tower of Fantasy now is officially available on Steam.','2022/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2064650/Tower_of_Fantasy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1471,'company_of_heroes_3:_fire_&_steel',NULL,'This content requires the base game Company of Heroes 3 on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3469800/Company_of_Heroes_3_Fire__Steel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1472,'dark_and_darker_-_legendary_status',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dark and Darker on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3211120/Dark_and_Darker__Legendary_Status/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1473,'le_mans_ultimate_-_2024_pack_5',NULL,'This content requires the base game Le Mans Ultimate on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3511300/Le_Mans_Ultimate__2024_Pack_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1474,'\"1e999\"_firestone:_online_idle_rpg',NULL,'Firestone: Online Idle RPG is a multiplayer fantasy game with idle rpg mechanics. Collect heroes, upgrade their gear & skills, and send them in idle battles or go on an incremental clicker frenzy to beat monstrous bosses! Chat with guild friends or engage in PVP- the choice is in your hands!','2024/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1013320/1e999_Firestone_Online_Idle_RPG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1475,'deliver_at_all_costs',NULL,'Deliver At All Costs is a thrilling action game where destruction, absurdity and intrigue collide! Step into the shoes of Winston Green — a down-on-his-luck courier with a fiery temper and a mysterious past — as he delivers highly unconventional cargo, leaving a trail of havoc and chaos behind him.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1880610/Deliver_At_All_Costs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1476,'tower_of_babel:_survivors_of_chaos',NULL,'Battle hordes of monsters, acquire new skills, and upgrade your abilities. Customize your build with hundreds of item combinations and reach the top to fulfill your deepest desires. Conquer the tower in this thrilling roguelite hack and slash survivors game!','2025/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2665680/Tower_of_Babel_Survivors_of_Chaos/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1477,'dungeons_&_degenerate_gamblers',NULL,'Battle your way through a seedy tavern filled with gambling addicted townspeople in this Blackjack Roguelike Adventure. From aces and face cards to tarot cards, business cards and more, create your unique deck to beat the house.','2024/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2400510/Dungeons__Degenerate_Gamblers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1478,'half-life',NULL,'Named Game of the Year by over 50 publications, Valve\'s debut title blends action and adventure with award-winning technology to create a frighteningly realistic world where players must think to survive. Also includes an exciting multiplayer mode that allows you to play against friends and enemies around the world.','1998/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/70/HalfLife/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1479,'hellish_quart',NULL,'A physics-based, realistic 3D sword-fighting game. Immerse yourself in a cinematic adventure, utilizing real sword-fighting martial arts and a variety of historically accurate weapons to survive brutal duels in 17th century Poland. Featuring single-player modes and a LOCAL 2-player mode.','2021/2/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1000360/Hellish_Quart/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1480,'the_witcher:_enhanced_edition_director\'s_cut',NULL,'Become The Witcher, Geralt of Rivia, a legendary monster slayer caught in a web of intrigue woven by forces vying for control of the world. Make difficult decisions and live with the consequences in a game that will immerse you in an extraordinary tale like no other.','2008/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/20900/The_Witcher_Enhanced_Edition_Directors_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1481,'ghostrunner',NULL,'Ghostrunner offers a unique single-player experience: fast-paced, violent combat, and an original setting that blends science fiction with post-apocalyptic themes. It tells the story of a world that has already ended and its inhabitants who fight to survive.','2020/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1139900/Ghostrunner/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1482,'call_to_arms_-_gates_of_hell:_airborne',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call to Arms - Gates of Hell: Ostfront on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2904660/Call_to_Arms__Gates_of_Hell_Airborne/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1483,'hot_dogs,_horseshoes_&_hand_grenades',NULL,'Do you like hot dogs? How about horseshoes? Hand grenades? (everyone likes hand grenades) Anyway, we\'ve got all that, and guns. SO MANY GUNS. So if you like ordnance, meat, and far too many groan-worthy puns, this is the VR sandbox game for you.','2016/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/450540/Hot_Dogs_Horseshoes__Hand_Grenades/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1484,'forts',NULL,'Unleash your creativity and strategic prowess in Forts, the exhilarating physics-based RTS! Design, construct, and customize imposing fortresses, bristling with devastating firepower, and blast your opponent’s buildings to rubble!','2017/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/410900/Forts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1485,'assassin’s_creed®_brotherhood',NULL,'It’s time to join the Brotherhood.','2011/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/48190/Assassins_Creed_Brotherhood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1486,'naruto_shippuden:_ultimate_ninja_storm_4',NULL,'The latest opus in the acclaimed STORM series is taking you on a colourful and breathtaking ride. Take advantage of the totally revamped battle system and prepare to dive into the most epic fights you’ve ever seen !','2016/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/349040/NARUTO_SHIPPUDEN_Ultimate_Ninja_STORM_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1487,'taiko_no_tatsujin:_rhythm_festival',NULL,'Taiko no Tatsujin: Rhythm Festival is a drum-based rhythm game featuring songs from genres such as Anime and VOCALOID™, and also a variety of game modes! Have fun playing solo or online!','2024/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2288630/Taiko_no_Tatsujin_Rhythm_Festival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1488,'hero\'s_adventure:_road_to_passion',NULL,'Hero\'s Adventure:Road to Passion is a wuxia open-world RPG. You will commence your journey as an underdog in the tumultuous Martial World and will be met with a wide array of choices as you navigate your own heroic saga.','2023/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1948980/Heros_Adventure_Road_to_Passion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1489,'star_ocean_the_second_story_r',NULL,'In this science fantasy RPG, choose between Claude or Rena, play through their perspectives, and unlock various endings. Recruit allies and defeat foes in fast paced real-time battles.','2023/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2238900/STAR_OCEAN_THE_SECOND_STORY_R/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1490,'a_short_hike',NULL,'Hike, climb, and soar through the peaceful mountainside landscapes of Hawk Peak Provincial Park as you make your way to the summit.','2019/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1055540/A_Short_Hike/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1491,'planet_zoo:_barnyard_animal_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2837730/Planet_Zoo_Barnyard_Animal_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1492,'crysis_3_remastered',NULL,'Experience the single-player experience from the iconic first-person shooter, Crysis 3, optimized to take advantage of today\'s hardware in Crysis 3 Remastered.','2022/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2096610/Crysis_3_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1493,'bayonetta',NULL,'PlatinumGames’ universally acclaimed action masterpiece finally comes to PC. Experience the over-the-top stylish action in 60fps at unlocked HD resolutions. The definitive way to play: being bad never felt so good.','2017/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/460790/Bayonetta/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1494,'the_outer_worlds:_murder_on_eridanos',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Outer Worlds on Steam in order to play.','2021/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1393111/The_Outer_Worlds_Murder_on_Eridanos/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1495,'terra_invicta',NULL,'An alien invasion has fractured humanity into seven ideological factions each with a unique vision for the future. Lead your chosen faction to take control of Earth’s nations, expand across the Solar System, and battle enemy fleets in tactical combat.','2022/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1176470/Terra_Invicta/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1496,'vegas_infinite_by_pokerstars',NULL,'PokerStars presents Vegas Infinite, a world of entertainment with no limits. Leap into VR or PC with no headset required! Take on the house at blackjack and roulette. Light up the dice at craps. Play dazzling slots and challenge real players at authentic poker. Your seat is open.','2023/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/886250/Vegas_Infinite_by_PokerStars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1497,'x4:_timelines',NULL,'This content requires the base game X4: Foundations on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2700340/X4_Timelines/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1498,'getting_over_it_with_bennett_foddy',NULL,'A game I made for a certain kind of person. To hurt them.','2017/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/240720/Getting_Over_It_with_Bennett_Foddy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1499,'empires_of_the_undergrowth',NULL,'Command swarms of warriors at an unprecedented scale of warfare in this blend of RTS and base-building. Lead ant colonies against the many fearsome threats of the insect world, while building intricate nests, developing pheromone-based tactics, and evolving to meet growing dangers.','2024/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/463530/Empires_of_the_Undergrowth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1500,'dungeon_clawler',NULL,'Dungeon Clawler is a Roguelike Claw Machine Deckbuilder. Build your deck, grab weapons and items from the claw machine to battle enemies, discover powerful perks that create game-changing synergies and unleash crazy combos as you fight your way through the dungeon!','2024/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2356780/Dungeon_Clawler/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1501,'art_of_rally',NULL,'Race in the golden era of rally. Drive iconic cars from the 60s to Group B on challenging stages through stylized environments inspired by real worldwide locations. Will you master the art of rally?','2020/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/550320/art_of_rally/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1502,'dead_by_daylight_-_endless_hunt_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2922730/Dead_by_Daylight__Endless_Hunt_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1503,'dead_by_daylight_-_nicolas_cage_chapter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2023/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2469400/Dead_by_Daylight__Nicolas_Cage_Chapter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1504,'five_nights_at_freddy\'s_4',NULL,'In this last chapter of the Five Nights at Freddy\'s original story, you must once again defend yourself against Freddy Fazbear, Chica, Bonnie, Foxy, and even worse things that lurk in the shadows.','2015/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/388090/Five_Nights_at_Freddys_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_31'),(1505,'eve_online',NULL,'EVE Online is a free-to-play community driven space MMO where players can choose their own path from countless different options. Experience space exploration, immense PvP and PvE battles, mining, industry and a thriving player economy in an ever-expanding sandbox.','2003/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/8500/EVE_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1506,'the_marauder_armor_set',NULL,'This content requires the base game 7 Days to Die on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3486400/The_Marauder_Armor_Set/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1507,'the_talos_principle:_reawakened',NULL,'Step back into a world of thought-provoking puzzles, philosophical intrigue, and breathtaking visuals with The Talos Principle: Reawakened - a first-person puzzle masterpiece for both new players and long-time fans alike.','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2806640/The_Talos_Principle_Reawakened/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1508,'dcs:_f/a-18c',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2018/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/411950/DCS_FA18C/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1509,'journey',NULL,'Explore the ancient, mysterious world of Journey as you soar above ruins and glide across sands to discover its secrets.','2020/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/638230/Journey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1510,'call_of_the_wild:_the_angler™',NULL,'The Angler is an open world fishing game that can be played solo or with friends. Discover and catch a wide variety of unique fish species, from common to rare, on your journey to become a master angler.','2022/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1408610/Call_of_the_Wild_The_Angler/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1511,'citizen_sleeper',NULL,'Roleplaying in the ruins of interplanetary capitalism. Live the life of an escaped worker, washed-up on a lawless station at the edge of an interstellar society. Inspired by the flexibility and freedom of TTRPGs, explore the station, choose your friends, escape your past and change your future.','2022/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1578650/Citizen_Sleeper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1512,'warframe:_tennocon_2025_digital_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warframe on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3515860/Warframe_TennoCon_2025_Digital_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1513,'stellaris:_cosmic_storms',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2863060/Stellaris_Cosmic_Storms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1514,'jurassic_world_evolution_2:_late_cretaceous_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2106800/Jurassic_World_Evolution_2_Late_Cretaceous_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1515,'star_wars™:_the_force_unleashed™_ii',NULL,'The Star Wars® Saga continues with Star Wars®: The Force Unleashed™ II, the highly anticipated sequel to the fastest-selling Star Wars game ever created.','2010/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/32500/STAR_WARS_The_Force_Unleashed_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1516,'into_the_breach',NULL,'Control powerful mechs from the future to defeat an alien threat. Each attempt to save the world presents a new randomly generated challenge in this turn-based strategy game.','2018/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/590380/Into_the_Breach/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1517,'tank_squad',NULL,'Tank Squad is a tactical-combat action game. Take part in big tank battles during World War II. Play single-player or coop (4 players). Repair your tanks, replenish supplies, manage the crew and get back to the action!','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1498130/Tank_Squad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1518,'steamworld_heist_ii',NULL,'Join Captain Leeway on the biggest Heist yet to save botkind from a brewing water crisis! With tactical turn-based battles featuring signature ricochet action, 150+ weapons and items, a new job system, real-time naval combat and 30+ hours of gameplay, prepare for an epic SteamWorld adventure!','2024/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2396240/SteamWorld_Heist_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1519,'mount_&_blade:_warband',NULL,'In a land torn asunder by incessant warfare, it is time to assemble your own band of hardened warriors and enter the fray. Lead your men into battle, expand your realm, and claim the ultimate prize: the throne of Calradia!','2010/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/48700/Mount__Blade_Warband/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1520,'powerwash_simulator_–_warhammer_40,000_special_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PowerWash Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2593910/PowerWash_Simulator__Warhammer_40000_Special_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1521,'assassin\'s_creed®_revelations',NULL,'Ezio Auditore walks in the footsteps of the legendary mentor Altair, on a dangerous journey of discovery and revelation.','2011/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/201870/Assassins_Creed_Revelations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1522,'1000xresist',NULL,'1000xRESIST is a thrilling sci-fi adventure. The year is unknown, and a disease spread by an alien invasion keeps you underground. You are Watcher. You dutifully fulfil your purpose in serving the ALLMOTHER, until the day you discover a shocking secret that changes everything.','2024/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1675830/1000xRESIST/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1523,'cabernet',NULL,'Cabernet is a 2D narrative RPG set in a 19th century Eastern European inspired world, with a modern twist. Guide Liza, a young vampire in her new unlife among the unsuspecting townsfolk. Will you retain your humanity or descend further into the horror you have become?','2025/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2401410/Cabernet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1524,'rivals_of_aether',NULL,'RIVALS OF AETHER is an indie fighting game where warring civilizations summon the power of Fire, Water, Air, and Earth. Play with up to four players either locally or online.','2017/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/383980/Rivals_of_Aether/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1525,'lego®_star_wars™:_the_force_awakens',NULL,'The No. 1 LEGO® videogame franchise triumphantly returns with a fun-filled, humorous journey based on the blockbuster film. The game will also feature brand new story content from the Star Wars Universe that explores the time between Star Wars: Return of the Jedi and Star Wars: The Force Awakens.','2016/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/438640/LEGO_STAR_WARS_The_Force_Awakens/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1526,'total_conflict:_resistance',NULL,'Total Conflict: Resistance is a unique symbiosis of global strategy, tactics and first-person action. Realistic mass battles, many types of armored vehicles, weapons, uniforms, unique mechanics, immersive free gameplay. Lead any state and bring it to greatness!','2023/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1860510/Total_Conflict_Resistance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1527,'dead_space™_2',NULL,'Three years after the Necromorph infestation aboard the USS Ishimura, Isaac Clarke awakens from a coma, confused, disoriented, and on a space station called The Sprawl. Explore this world and its zero-g environments to discover the truth about the Unitology and its role in the Necromorph epidemic.','2011/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/47780/Dead_Space_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1528,'dark_souls™_ii',NULL,'Developed by FROM SOFTWARE, DARK SOULS™ II is the highly anticipated sequel to the gruelling 2011 breakout hit Dark Souls. The unique old-school action RPG experience captivated imaginations of gamers worldwide with incredible challenge and intense emotional reward.','2014/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/236430/DARK_SOULS_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1529,'skydance\'s_behemoth',NULL,'Skydance’s BEHEMOTH is an original story set in the Forsaken Lands, a fallen kingdom haunted by tragedy. Play as an outland warrior, Wren the Hunter (the player), and embark on a perilous quest to save yourself and your village. Your only hope is to slay the unslayable, the monstrous Behemoths.','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1707990/Skydances_BEHEMOTH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1530,'news_tower',NULL,'Develop your newspaper and become New York’s new media mogul! In this tycoon, build and manage your newspaper from printer to toilet. Create your editorial line and lead your journalists through unique 1930\'s stories and dig out the latest scoops!','2024/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1649950/News_Tower/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1531,'blazblue_entropy_effect_-_bullet_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game BlazBlue Entropy Effect on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3681910/BlazBlue_Entropy_Effect__Bullet_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1532,'throne_and_liberty_nature\'s_celebration_pack:_gold',NULL,'This content requires the base game THRONE AND LIBERTY on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3717470/THRONE_AND_LIBERTY_Natures_Celebration_Pack_Gold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1533,'stellaris:_astral_planes',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2534090/Stellaris_Astral_Planes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1534,'troubleshooter:_abandoned_children',NULL,'TROUBLESHOOTER: Abandoned Children is the first season of a turn-based strategy SRPG that takes place in the world of Troubleshooter.','2020/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/470310/TROUBLESHOOTER_Abandoned_Children/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1535,'caribbean_legend',NULL,'An open-world RPG, set in the Golden Age of Caribbean piracy. Embark on a 200-hour-long adventure, plunder cities and ships, explore the unknown, discover treasures, forge friendships, earn bounties on your head, and charm the ladies on your path to ultimate freedom!','2024/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2230980/Caribbean_Legend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1536,'jotunnslayer:_hordes_of_hel',NULL,'Hordes of Hel is a gripping roguelike horde-survivor game set in the dark realms of Norse Mythology. Fight waves of enemies to earn divine blessings of ancient Viking Deities, explore hostile worlds and face powerful bosses. Become a god-like warrior in this ultimate showdown.','2025/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2820820/Jotunnslayer_Hordes_of_Hel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1537,'steamworld_dig_2',NULL,'SteamWorld Dig is back! Dig deep, gain riches and unearth the terrors of the underworld in this platform mining adventure influenced by classic Metroidvania style games.','2017/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/571310/SteamWorld_Dig_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1538,'total_war:_warhammer_iii_-_ogre_kingdoms',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: WARHAMMER III on Steam in order to play.','2022/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1670540/Total_War_WARHAMMER_III__Ogre_Kingdoms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1539,'resident_evil_revelations_2',NULL,'RE Revelations 2 continues the series acclaimed essential survival horror experience, while uncovering startling truths.','2015/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/287290/Resident_Evil_Revelations_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1540,'the_horror_at_highrook',NULL,'The Horror at Highrook is an occult card crafting narrative RPG. Explore a haunted mansion with your team of investigators, summon dark entities, craft powerful protections, uncover the fate of the missing family, and choose your own path through the darkness.','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2836860/The_Horror_at_Highrook/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1541,'steep™',NULL,'Ride a massive open world across the Alps, where the powder is always fresh and the run never ends. Defy and master the mountain alone or with friends on skis, wingsuits, snowboards and paragliders. Record and share your best stunts.','2016/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/460920/Steep/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1542,'60_seconds!_reatomized',NULL,'The post-apocalyptic dark comedy is back - remastered and even more radioactive than before! Scavenge supplies, rescue your family, and stay alive in your fallout shelter. Make difficult decisions, hunt mutant roaches... and maybe survive. Or not.','2019/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1012880/60_Seconds_Reatomized/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1543,'melatonin',NULL,'Melatonin is a rhythm game about dreams and reality merging together. It uses animations and sound cues to keep you on beat without any intimidating overlays or interfaces. Harmonize through a variety of dreamy levels containing surprising challenges, hand-drawn art, and vibrant music.','2022/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1585220/Melatonin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1544,'cult_of_the_lamb:_pilgrim_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cult of the Lamb on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2890190/Cult_of_the_Lamb_Pilgrim_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1545,'doom_3',NULL,'A demonic invasion has overwhelmed the Union Aerospace Corporation\'s Mars research facility. As one of only a few survivors, you must fight your way to hell and back against a horde of demons in this award-winning horror/action FPS and reimagining of the original DOOM.','2012/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/208200/DOOM_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1546,'ender_lilies:_quietus_of_the_knights',NULL,'ENDER LILIES is a dark fantasy 2D action RPG about unraveling the mysteries of a destroyed kingdom. On this sorrowful journey, encounter horrific enemies against whom a moment of inattention could be fatal. Overcome these hardships and seek the truth with the help of fallen knights.','2021/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1369630/ENDER_LILIES_Quietus_of_the_Knights/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1547,'the_sims™_4_parenthood',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2017/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235745/The_Sims_4_Parenthood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1548,'killer_frequency',NULL,'Killer Frequency is a first-person horror puzzle game set in 1987, that puts you in the role of a late-night radio talk show host in small town America whose callers are being stalked by a mysterious killer.','2023/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1903620/Killer_Frequency/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1549,'sniper_elite:_resistance_-_mud_and_thunder_mission,_weapons_and_skin_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sniper Elite: Resistance on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2800250/Sniper_Elite_Resistance__Mud_and_Thunder_Mission_Weapons_and_Skin_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_32'),(1550,'date_everything!_-_lavish_dlc',NUL