apocalypse',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2018/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/716670/Stellaris_Apocalypse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1558,'bleach_brave_souls',NULL,'The world of mega-hit manga and anime BLEACH comes to Steam in this exciting 3D action game! Build a team using your favorite characters from the BLEACH universe!','2020/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1201240/BLEACH_Brave_Souls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1559,'panzer_corps_2',NULL,'Panzer Corps 2 is the ultimate Second World War strategy game! Enjoy the time-proven gameplay formula which has been appreciated by millions of players over the years, brought to a whole new level of refinement up to the latest technical standards.','2020/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1072040/Panzer_Corps_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1560,'the_jackbox_party_pack_9',NULL,'Save your next party! 5 new games in 1 Party Pack: the trivia bluff-off Fibbage 4, the team test Quixort, the joke auction Junktopia, the silly guessfest Nonsensory and the reality TV game Roomerang.','2022/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1850960/The_Jackbox_Party_Pack_9/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1561,'persona®_5_strikers',NULL,'Join the Phantom Thieves and strike back against the corruption overtaking cities across Japan. A summer vacation with close friends takes a sudden turn as a distorted reality emerges; reveal the truth and redeem the hearts of those imprisoned at the center of the crisis!','2021/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1382330/Persona_5_Strikers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1562,'mindustry',NULL,'An open-ended factory management game with RTS and tower defense elements.','2019/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1127400/Mindustry/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1563,'the_wandering_village',NULL,'The Wandering Village is a city-building simulation game on the back of a giant, wandering creature. Build your settlement and form a symbiotic relationship with the colossus. Will you survive together in this hostile, yet beautiful post-apocalyptic world, contaminated by poisonous plants?','2022/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1121640/The_Wandering_Village/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1564,'pillars_of_eternity_ii:_deadfire',NULL,'Patch 5.0 - Turn-based mode and The Ultimate challenge out now! Pursue a rogue god over land and sea in the sequel to the multi-award-winning RPG Pillars of Eternity. Captain your ship on a dangerous voyage of discovery across the vast unexplored archipelago region of the Deadfire.','2018/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/560130/Pillars_of_Eternity_II_Deadfire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1565,'mortal_shell',NULL,'Their Flesh is Your Armor. Mortal Shell is a deep action-RPG that tests your sanity and resilience in a shattered world. Survival demands superior awareness, precision, and instincts. Possess lost warriors, track down hidden sanctums of the devout, and face formidable foes.','2021/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1110910/Mortal_Shell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1566,'aerofly_fs_4_flight_simulator',NULL,'We promise you will feel like a pilot flying airliners, helicopters, fighters, gliders, historical and aerobatic aircraft in a photorealistic world! Over 10,000 real world flights, highly detailed cockpits and scenery are awaiting you.','2022/7/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1995890/Aerofly_FS_4_Flight_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1567,'kards_-_the_ww2_card_game',NULL,'KARDS, The World War II Card Game, combines traditional CCG gameplay with innovative mechanics inspired by classic strategy games and real battlefield tactics. Take command and challenge other players in grand-scale warfare on the ground, air, or seas.','2020/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/544810/KARDS__The_WW2_Card_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1568,'airport_ceo',NULL,'Build and manage an international airport!','2021/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/673610/Airport_CEO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1569,'dcs:_f4u-1d_corsair',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/411940/DCS_F4U1D_Corsair/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1570,'destroy_all_humans!_2_-_reprobed',NULL,'Crypto is back with a license to probe. The alien invader returns, groovier than ever. Experience the swinging ‘60s in all its chemical-induced glory and take revenge on the KGB for blowing up your mothership. You’ll have to form alliances with members of the very species you came to enslave.','2022/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1266700/Destroy_All_Humans_2__Reprobed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1571,'katamari_damacy_reroll',NULL,'The beloved roll-em-up game returns with fully updated graphics, completely recreated cutscenes and in full HD!','2018/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/848350/Katamari_Damacy_REROLL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1572,'deathloop',NULL,'DEATHLOOP is a next-gen FPS from Arkane Lyon, the award-winning studio behind Dishonored. In DEATHLOOP, two rival assassins are trapped in a mysterious timeloop on the island of Blackreef, doomed to repeat the same day for eternity.','2021/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1252330/DEATHLOOP/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1573,'wizardry_variants_daphne',NULL,'3D Dungeon RPG The portal of despair opens again. The labyrinth calls you to destruction. Revel in the endless dangers, relish the risk, devour the rewards. Savor the risk.','2025/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2379740/Wizardry_Variants_Daphne/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1574,'guild_wars_2:_secrets_of_the_obscure™_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Guild Wars 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2450010/Guild_Wars_2_Secrets_of_the_Obscure_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1575,'fallen_aces',NULL,'The A.C.E.S, watchful guardians of Switchblade City, are being taken down, one by one. Now it\'s up to one man, with two fists, to get to the bottom of it all. Fallen Aces is a crime noir FPS that plays right out of the \'90s and looks like it\'s right outta the comics.','2024/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1411910/Fallen_Aces/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1576,'persona_3_reload:_expansion_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Persona 3 Reload on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2689210/Persona_3_Reload_Expansion_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1577,'to_pixelia',NULL,'Meet the Pixelians and discover the ultimate life simulator in To Pixelia. As you climb your career ladder of choice, step into the world of politics, art, sports, music, and even crime. Live your dream life in pixels!','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1954160/To_Pixelia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1578,'powerwash_simulator_–_spongebob_squarepants_special_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PowerWash Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2236950/PowerWash_Simulator__SpongeBob_SquarePants_Special_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1579,'battle_nations',NULL,'Battle Nations is back! Build your empire and lead your armies to victory! Choose from traditional troops and vehicles or unleash exotic forces like mammoths, velociraptors, sandworms, and futuristic plasma units!','2014/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/251670/Battle_Nations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1580,'ancestors:_the_humankind_odyssey',NULL,'Survive your evolution in Neogene Africa starting 10 million years ago. Ancestors: The Humankind Odyssey is a third-person open world survival game where you Explore, Expand, and Evolve to advance your clan to the next generation in the exciting new adventure from Panache Digital Games.','2020/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/536270/Ancestors_The_Humankind_Odyssey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1581,'we_were_here_together',NULL,'As we explore these frozen wastes, misfortune strikes once again. Through the fierce blizzard, a flare lights the sky, followed by a cry for help over the radio - broken, dying... No one else can come to their rescue. Can we make it back - together?','2019/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/865360/We_Were_Here_Together/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1582,'call_of_duty®:_vanguard',NULL,'Call of Duty®: Vanguard includes a deeply engaging single player Campaign, a massive Multiplayer offering featuring over 20 maps including 16 built for core Multiplayer and an exciting new Zombies experience developed by Treyarch.','2023/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1985820/Call_of_Duty_Vanguard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1583,'vampire_therapist',NULL,'Guide vampires through centuries of emotional baggage, decades of delusions and the odd bout of self-loathing with real cognitive behavioral therapy concepts and become a Vampire Therapist! Even vampires need a shoulder to cry on when a neck to bite just won’t do.','2024/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2481020/Vampire_Therapist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1584,'prey',NULL,'In Prey, you awaken aboard Talos I, a space station orbiting the moon in the year 2032. You are the key subject of an experiment meant to alter humanity forever – but things have gone terribly wrong. The space station has been overrun by hostile aliens and you are now being hunted.','2017/5/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/480490/Prey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1585,'roman_triumph:_survival_city_builder',NULL,'At the northern fringes of the empire, a new Roman city is born! Manage and grow your city, please the gods, and survive against barbarians and mythological threats to achieve Roman Triumph!','2025/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1864880/Roman_Triumph_Survival_City_Builder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1586,'call_to_arms_-_gates_of_hell:_scorched_earth',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call to Arms - Gates of Hell: Ostfront on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2123890/Call_to_Arms__Gates_of_Hell_Scorched_Earth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1587,'world_of_goo_2',NULL,'Build bridges, grow towers, terraform terrain, and fuel flying machines in the stunning followup to the multi-award winning World of Goo. The world is beautiful, dangerous, and evolving.','2025/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3385670/World_of_Goo_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1588,'gundam_breaker_4',NULL,'Create your own ultimate Gundam in the newest Gundam Breaker! With more customizable parts than ever before, you finally have the freedom to build your perfect Gunpla. Test it in battle using the brand new dual-weapon system and break parts off of your enemies and add them to your collection.','2024/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1672500/GUNDAM_BREAKER_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1589,'psycho_patrol_r',NULL,'FPS/mecha hybrid europolice sim with emphasis on interacting with NPCs and different gameplay systems.','2025/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1907590/Psycho_Patrol_R/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1590,'predator:_hunting_grounds',NULL,'Hunt or be hunted in this asymmetrical multiplayer shooter that pits man against Predator. As part of a Fireteam, complete missions before the Predator finds you. Or be the Predator and hunt your prey.','2021/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1556200/Predator_Hunting_Grounds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1591,'the_witness',NULL,'You wake up, alone, on a strange island full of puzzles that will challenge and surprise you.','2016/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/210970/The_Witness/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1592,'resident_evil_4_(2005)',NULL,'(Release: 2014) Special agent Leon S. Kennedy is sent on a mission to rescue the U.S. President’s daughter who has been kidnapped.','2014/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/254700/Resident_Evil_4_2005/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1593,'sonic_adventure_2',NULL,'Experience two unique adventures featuring both long-time heroes and new and returning villains as they battle for the fate of the world!','2012/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/213610/Sonic_Adventure_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1594,'rust_-_sunburn_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rust on Steam in order to play.','2020/7/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1353060/Rust__Sunburn_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1595,'cattle_country',NULL,'Howdy partner! Welcome to Cattle Country, the Cozy Cowboy Adventure Life Sim. Become a determined pioneer traveling west to start a new life. Make a home in the mountains, take on bandits, discover dastardly plots, build a farm, develop your town, and make friends with fellow residents.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2818150/Cattle_Country/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1596,'ship_of_fools',NULL,'Ship of Fools is a seafaring cooperative roguelite. Set sail, man the cannons and battle sea monsters through the tempestuous seas of the Archipelago. Are you fool enough to stop the Aquapocalypse?','2022/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1286580/Ship_of_Fools/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1597,'barony:_myths_&_outcasts',NULL,'This content requires the base game Barony on Steam in order to play.','2019/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1010820/Barony_Myths__Outcasts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1598,'lorelei_and_the_laser_eyes',NULL,'The stage is set. Imagine an old baroque manor, perhaps a hotel or a museum, somewhere in central Europe. A woman wanders in search of answers.','2024/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2008920/Lorelei_and_the_Laser_Eyes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1599,'assassin’s_creed®_rogue',NULL,'Introducing Assassin’s Creed® Rogue, the darkest chapter in the Assassin’s Creed franchise yet. As Shay, you will experience the slow transformation from Assassin to Assassin Hunter. Follow your own creed and set off on an extraordinary journey through New York City, the wild river valley, and far away to the icy cold waters of the North...','2015/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/311560/Assassins_Creed_Rogue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1600,'american_truck_simulator_-_oklahoma',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2209650/American_Truck_Simulator__Oklahoma/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1601,'infinity_kingdom',NULL,'Conquer the city, discover the Infinity! Infinity Kingdom is a cartoon-style mmo strategy game. As a resourceful lord, you must defend the land of Norheim against the evil gnomes while protecting yourself from other invading players!','2021/7/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1573360/Infinity_Kingdom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_33'),(1602,'a_building_full_of_cats_2',NULL,'A Building Full of Cats 2 is a Hidden Object Game where you’ll search for over a thousand hidden cats while also helping the building’s residents with their daily tasks. Can you pet all the cats and make a difference in the lives of the building\'s residents?','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2810730/A_Building_Full_of_Cats_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1603,'avorion',NULL,'A procedural co-op space sandbox where players can build their own space ships out of dynamically scalable blocks. Fight epic space battles, explore, mine, trade, wage wars and build your own empire to save your galaxy from being torn apart by an unknown enemy.','2020/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/445220/Avorion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1604,'the_wolf_among_us',NULL,'From the makers of the 2012 Game of the Year: The Walking Dead, comes a thriller based on the award-winning Fables comic books. As Bigby Wolf you will discover that a brutal, bloody murder is just a taste of things to come in a game series where your every decision can have enormous consequences.','2013/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/250320/The_Wolf_Among_Us/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1605,'assassin\'s_creed_2',NULL,'An epic story of family, vengeance and conspiracy set in the pristine, yet brutal, backdrop of a Renaissance Italy. New low price!','2010/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/33230/Assassins_Creed_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1606,'final_fantasy_ii',NULL,'The original FINAL FANTASY II comes to life with completely new graphics and audio! A remodeled 2D take on the second game in the world-renowned FINAL FANTASY series! Enjoy the timeless story told through charming retro graphics.','2021/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1173780/FINAL_FANTASY_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1607,'rain_world:_downpour',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rain World on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1933390/Rain_World_Downpour/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1608,'bus_simulator_21_next_stop',NULL,'Bus Simulator 21 Next Stop offers the most comprehensive bus fleet in the history of the series with 30 officially licensed buses. Drive on two vastly different maps, alone or with friend. Play with extended management elements or just enjoy your time on the road.','2021/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/976590/Bus_Simulator_21_Next_Stop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1609,'terra_nil',NULL,'Terra Nil is an intricate environmental strategy game about transforming a barren wasteland into a thriving, balanced ecosystem. Bring life back to a lifeless world by purifying soil, cleaning oceans, planting trees, and reintroducing wildlife, then leave without a trace.','2023/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1593030/Terra_Nil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1610,'fatal_fury:_city_of_the_wolves',NULL,'26 years on, a brand-new entry in the Fatal Fury series is set to arrive on the scene! FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves features a unique art style that stimulates the senses and an innovative REV System that supercharges the excitement. Here, at long last, a new legend is about to unfold…','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2492040/FATAL_FURY_City_of_the_Wolves/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1611,'love_curse:_find_your_soulmate',NULL,'Love Curse is a GL visual novel. You’ve fallen under a curse, and the only way to break it is to find your soulmate! The clock is ticking… Will you find true love? And what secrets will you uncover along the way?','2025/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3069120/Love_Curse_Find_Your_Soulmate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1612,'just_cause_4_reloaded',NULL,'Rogue agent Rico Rodriguez journeys to Solis, a huge South American world home of conflict, oppression and extreme weather conditions. Strap into your wingsuit, equip your fully customizable grappling hook, and get ready to bring the thunder!','2018/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/517630/Just_Cause_4_Reloaded/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1613,'battleblock_theater®',NULL,'Welcome to BattleBlock Theater! You’ve got no where to go but up...on stage. Play single player or co-op to free your friends and save Hatty Hattington! Jump, solve and battle your way through a mysterious theater inhabited by highly technological felines.','2014/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/238460/BattleBlock_Theater/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1614,'cosmoteer:_starship_architect_&_commander',NULL,'Design and simulate the starships of your dreams! Command your ship or fleet in epic battles and manage your crew while exploring a dangerous galaxy. Play alone or with friends, test your ships in online PvP, and let your imagination reach for the stars!','2022/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/799600/Cosmoteer_Starship_Architect__Commander/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1615,'yakuza_kiwami_2',NULL,'Kazuma Kiryu, the Dragon of Dojima, must face the ambitious Ryuji Goda, the Dragon of Kansai, in an all-out war between two rival yakuza clans. An extreme recreation of one of Yakuza’s most beloved entries, now in stunning 4K and unlocked framerates. There can be only one dragon.','2019/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/927380/Yakuza_Kiwami_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1616,'postal_2',NULL,'Live a week in the life of \"The POSTAL Dude\"; a hapless everyman just trying to check off some chores. Buying milk, returning an overdue library book, getting Gary Coleman\'s autograph, what could possibly go wrong?','2003/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/223470/POSTAL_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1617,'total_war:_warhammer_ii_-_the_silence_&_the_fury',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2021/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1556110/Total_War_WARHAMMER_II__The_Silence__The_Fury/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1618,'like_a_dragon:_ishin!',NULL,'Don the clothes and weaponry of the elite to become the samurai of legend, Sakamoto Ryoma. Draw your blade and join the revolution in this heated historical adventure.','2023/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1805480/Like_a_Dragon_Ishin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1619,'kabuto_park',NULL,'Enjoy summer in Kabuto Park! Catch the cutest bugs, train them and win the Summer Beetle Battles Championship in this tiny bug collection game! Upgrade your equipment to find rarer, stronger and shinier little friends.','2025/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3376990/Kabuto_Park/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1620,'american_truck_simulator_-_montana',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1811080/American_Truck_Simulator__Montana/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1621,'songs_of_conquest_-_roots',NULL,'This content requires the base game Songs of Conquest on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3511790/Songs_of_Conquest__Roots/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1622,'a_little_to_the_left:_cupboards_&_drawers',NULL,'This content requires the base game A Little to the Left on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2343790/A_Little_to_the_Left_Cupboards__Drawers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1623,'psychonauts_2',NULL,'Combining quirky missions and mysterious conspiracies, Psychonauts 2 is a platform-adventure game with cinematic style and tons of customizable psychic powers.','2021/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/607080/Psychonauts_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1624,'bloomtown:_a_different_story',NULL,'Bloomtown: A Different Story is a narrative JRPG mixing turn-based combat, monster taming and social RPG set in a seemingly pleasant 1960s Americana world. Join Emily and her group of friends to save their cozy town from the demonic creatures that live in the hearts of its residents!','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2445990/Bloomtown_A_Different_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1625,'age_of_empires_iii:_definitive_edition_(base_game)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires III: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2477660/Age_of_Empires_III_Definitive_Edition_Base_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1626,'stellaris:_toxoids_species_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2115770/Stellaris_Toxoids_Species_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1627,'kingdom_rush_5:_alliance_td',NULL,'While a formidable evil emerges, an unexpected alliance is taking shape! It will take the finest warriors of Linirea and the relentless Dark Army to stop it. Beware! Though they may journey side by side the ever-changing winds of fate could swiftly alter their course.','2024/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2849080/Kingdom_Rush_5_Alliance_TD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1628,'myst',NULL,'Welcome to Myst: a starkly beautiful island, eerily tinged with mystery and shrouded in intrigue. Built from the ground up to play in 2D & VR, explore Myst in a whole new dimension! Journey to the Ages, unravel puzzles, and be a part of the surrealistic adventure that will become your own.','2021/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1255560/Myst/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1629,'house_flipper_-_pets_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game House Flipper on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1569190/House_Flipper__Pets_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1630,'gems_of_war_-_puzzle_rpg',NULL,'Gems of War is a Match-3 RPG from the original creators of Puzzle Quest! Start your RPG journey and fight puzzle battles through hundreds of quests, or build your army of troops and go to war in strategic PVP match-3 combat!','2014/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/329110/Gems_of_War__Puzzle_RPG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1631,'chinese_frontiers',NULL,'Build the Great Wall and lead your village to glory in this immersive building and management simulator! Explore medieval China, develop your settlement, manage NPCs, and construct monumental structures. Your choices will shape the fate of an empire and leave a mark in history!','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1640820/Chinese_Frontiers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1632,'cuphead_-_the_delicious_last_course',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cuphead on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1117850/Cuphead__The_Delicious_Last_Course/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1633,'dark_deity_2',NULL,'Verroa is a peaceful continent on the brink of war as the Asverellian Empire seeks to expand - at your homeland’s expense. Command unlikely heroes, fight challenging turn-based battles, and watch hardship forge iron into steel. Dark Deity is back, bigger and better than before!','2025/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2446600/Dark_Deity_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1634,'total_war:_warhammer_ii_-_the_twisted_&_the_twilight',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2020/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1315750/Total_War_WARHAMMER_II__The_Twisted__The_Twilight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1635,'hitman_3_-_the_banker_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game HITMAN World of Assassination on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3711140/HITMAN_3__The_Banker_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1636,'one_piece:_pirate_warriors_4',NULL,'ONE PIECE: PIRATE WARRIORS 4 is the latest evolution of PIRATE WARRIORS action! Based on the concept of \"experiencing a real ONE PIECE battlefield,\" buildings will come crashing down during the action and attacks will throw up smoke and dust, placing you in the thick of the ONE PIECE world!','2020/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1089090/ONE_PIECE_PIRATE_WARRIORS_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1637,'dead_by_daylight_-_the_halloween®_chapter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2016/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/530711/Dead_by_Daylight__The_Halloween_Chapter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1638,'dishonored®:_death_of_the_outsider™',NULL,'From the award-winning developers at Arkane® Studios comes Dishonored®: Death of the Outsider, the next standalone adventure in the critically-acclaimed Dishonored® series.','2017/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/614570/Dishonored_Death_of_the_Outsider/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1639,'jurassic_world_evolution_2:_early_cretaceous_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1336322/Jurassic_World_Evolution_2_Early_Cretaceous_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1640,'the_texas_chain_saw_massacre',NULL,'Take on the role of one of the notorious Slaughter family, or their victims, in The Texas Chain Saw Massacre, a third-person asymmetrical horror experience based on the groundbreaking and iconic 1974 horror film. Experience the mad and macabre for yourself in The Texas Chain Saw Massacre.','2023/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1433140/The_Texas_Chain_Saw_Massacre/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1641,'goofy_gorillas',NULL,'Relive your childhood nostalgia at Goofy Gorillas, the largest virtual jungle gym! Battle it out with your friends in a wide range of casual but intense PvP gamemodes, or chill out and take part in some extra activities around the venue! Make the Goofy experience your own!','2023/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2627570/Goofy_Gorillas/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1642,'the_jackbox_party_pack_6',NULL,'It’s the wildest Party Pack yet, with the absurd deathmatch Trivia Murder Party 2, the weird word circus Dictionarium, the hidden identity game Push The Button, the comedy contest Joke Boat and the offbeat personality test Role Models.','2019/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1005300/The_Jackbox_Party_Pack_6/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1643,'crysis_remastered',NULL,'The classic first person shooter from Crytek is back with the action-packed gameplay, sandbox world, and thrilling epic battles you loved the first time around – now with remastered graphics optimized for a new generation of hardware.','2021/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1715130/Crysis_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1644,'powerwash_simulator_–_back_to_the_future_special_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PowerWash Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2464650/PowerWash_Simulator__Back_to_the_Future_Special_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1645,'styx:_shards_of_darkness',NULL,'Styx returns in a new stealth adventure! Explore and master huge open environments, sneak past or assassinate new enemies and bosses, and experiment with the new array of lethal abilities and weapons in our goblin assassin\'s arsenal.','2017/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/355790/Styx_Shards_of_Darkness/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1646,'hero_siege',NULL,'Hero Siege brings you the loot with a legion of playable character classes, procedually generated world, over 1000 unique items, endless replayability and a wide variety of dungeons and dangerous zones to explore!','2014/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/269210/Hero_Siege/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1647,'the_sims™_4_eco_lifestyle',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1301020/The_Sims_4_Eco_Lifestyle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1648,'visions_of_mana',NULL,'Explore a world of elemental spirits and adventure in the latest Mana action-RPG.','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2490990/Visions_of_Mana/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1649,'yakuza_kiwami',NULL,'SEGA’s critically-acclaimed entry that started a legend. Become Kazuma Kiryu, an up-and-coming yakuza who takes the fall for the murder of a crime boss, only to emerge from prison ten years later to a changed world. Remastered from the ground up, now in 4K and uncapped framerates on PC.','2019/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/834530/Yakuza_Kiwami/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1650,'age_of_history_3',NULL,'Grand strategy wargame where the destiny of Civilizations rests in your hands - will they stand united under your leadership or fall divided in conflict? Journey through the entire saga of human civilization, from its earliest days to the futuristic era, crafting your legacy age by age.','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2772750/Age_of_History_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_34'),(1651,'yu-gi-oh!_early_days_collection',NULL,'Yu-Gi-Oh! EARLY DAYS COLLECTION is packed with classic Yu-Gi-Oh! games from the very early days of Dueling — bursting with retro RPGs and strategic card games with beloved anime characters!','2025/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3013550/YuGiOh_EARLY_DAYS_COLLECTION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1652,'dragon_quest_builders™_2',NULL,'DRAGON QUEST BUILDERS™ 2 is a block-building RPG set in a fantasy land threatened by an evil cult. Explore, battle, build and harvest in the charming single-player campaign or build big projects in the online sandbox mode for up to 4-players.','2019/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1072420/DRAGON_QUEST_BUILDERS_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1653,'dungeon_alchemist',NULL,'Dungeon Alchemist is mapmaking software for tabletop RPG\'s that enables you to make amazing, high-quality maps in seconds!','2022/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1588530/Dungeon_Alchemist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1654,'gotham_knights',NULL,'Batman is dead. It is now up to the Batman Family - Batgirl, Nightwing, Red Hood, and Robin - to protect Gotham City.','2022/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1496790/Gotham_Knights/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1655,'turmoil',NULL,'Drill for oil like it\'s 1899! Turmoil offers players a visually charming, tongue-in-cheek take on the simulation genre inspired by the 19th century oil rush in North America.','2016/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/361280/Turmoil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1656,'streets_of_rage_4',NULL,'Amongst the best beat’em up series ever created, jammin’ ‘90s beats and over the top street fighting, the iconic series Streets of Rage comes back with a masterful tribute to and revitalization of the classic action fans adore.','2020/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/985890/Streets_of_Rage_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1657,'men_of_war:_assault_squad_2',NULL,'Men of War: Assault Squad 2 features new single player style skirmish modes that take players from extreme tank combat to deadly sniper stealth missions. Commanders can now faceoff against opponents on various new multiplayer 1v1 – 8v8 maps.','2014/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/244450/Men_of_War_Assault_Squad_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1658,'firewatch',NULL,'Firewatch is a single-player first-person mystery set in the Wyoming wilderness, where your only emotional lifeline is the person on the other end of a handheld radio.','2016/2/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/383870/Firewatch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1659,'ithya:_magic_studies',NULL,'Ithya: Magic Study is a cozy background app combined with productivity tools. Customize your room and relax with lofi or fantasy playlists in beautiful, hand-drawn environments. Perfect for a focused or creative session in a magical world.','2025/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3330250/Ithya_Magic_Studies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1660,'automobilista_2_-_imsa_track_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3022980/Automobilista_2__IMSA_Track_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1661,'barony:_legends_&_pariahs',NULL,'This content requires the base game Barony on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1010821/Barony_Legends__Pariahs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1662,'placid_plastic_duck_simulator',NULL,'The ultimate high-tech rubber duck simulation, Placid Plastic Duck brings you dangerous levels of relaxation. With chill music, dreamy 3D graphics, and many different happy ducks, your only priority is to float around. Zero Ducks given.','2022/7/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1999360/Placid_Plastic_Duck_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1663,'the_sims™_4_realm_of_magic',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2019/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235746/The_Sims_4_Realm_of_Magic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1664,'subwaysim_2',NULL,'Explore the three most picturesque underground lines in Germany! The Berlin U1/U3 and the Hamburg U3 are waiting for you.  Immerse yourself in everyday life in the two German metropolises and discover famous sights such as Hamburg\'s harbour or Berlin\'s Oberbaum Bridge. ','2025/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2707070/SubwaySim_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1665,'wylde_flowers',NULL,'Join Tara on a heartfelt journey to become a witch in Wylde Flowers. Farm by day, and cast spells by night as you craft your cottagecore life and bond with your coven. Come to know and love the fully voice acted characters of Fairhaven, as you unravel a local mystery.','2022/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1896700/Wylde_Flowers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1666,'class_of_\'09:_the_re-up',NULL,'The REJECTION SIM returns! Explore a slice of chaotic life in late 2000\'s American high school as you assume the role of Nicole once again. A 100% fully voiced VN presenting as the most culturally accurate period piece in the history of gaming.','2023/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2318310/Class_of_09_The_ReUp/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1667,'desktop_survivors_98',NULL,'Desktop Survivors 98 is a chaotic roguelite dungeon crawler that unfolds right on your Desktop. Your cursor becomes the hero as you explore new rooms, battle relentless waves of enemies, and collect powerful new weapons.','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3339780/Desktop_Survivors_98/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1668,'expansion_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_man_the_guns',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2019/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/815460/Expansion__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_Man_the_Guns/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1669,'men_of_war_ii',NULL,'Experience warfare like never before! Men of War II, the anticipated sequel to the highly acclaimed RTS franchise is here with all-new units, locations, campaigns, game modes and true trademarks of the series: historical fidelity and action-filled gameplay on the Eastern and Western Fronts of WWII.','2024/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1128860/Men_of_War_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1670,'the_invincible',NULL,'Rethink human’s dominion in The Invincible: a story-driven adventure set in a hard sci-fi world by Stanisław Lem. Discover planet Regis III as scientist Yasna, use atompunk tools looking for a missing crew and face unforeseen threats. Make choices in a philosophical story that’s driven by science.','2023/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/731040/The_Invincible/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1671,'gunsmith_simulator',NULL,'Become a Gunsmith and unveil the great pleasure of working in your own workshop! Repair, restore and personalize guns to make unique pieces that every firearm lover will appreciate.','2024/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1101120/Gunsmith_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1672,'sonic_mania',NULL,'Sonic Mania is an all-new adventure with Sonic, Tails, and Knuckles full of unique bosses, rolling 2D landscapes, and fun classic gameplay.','2017/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/584400/Sonic_Mania/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1673,'teenage_mutant_ninja_turtles:_shredder\'s_revenge',NULL,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Shredder’s Revenge reunites Leonardo, Michelangelo, Donatello and Raphael as they kick shell in a beautifully realized beat ’em up.','2022/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1361510/Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_Shredders_Revenge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1674,'wolfenstein:_the_old_blood',NULL,'Wolfenstein®: The Old Blood™ is a standalone prequel to the critically acclaimed first-person action-adventure shooter, Wolfenstein®: The New Order. This adventure spans eight chapters and features the hallmarks of MachineGames – thrilling action, immersive story, and intense FPS combat.','2015/5/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/350080/Wolfenstein_The_Old_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1675,'the_crust',NULL,'Automate a lunar base as you become the savior of humanity exploring the future on the moon. Mine, craft, research, and trade resources with Earth in this gripping narrative basebuilder.','2024/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1465470/The_Crust/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1676,'fallout_76:_atomic_angler_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fallout 76 on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3699170/Fallout_76_Atomic_Angler_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1677,'colony_ship:_a_post-earth_role_playing_game',NULL,'Colony Ship is a turn-based, party-based role-playing game set aboard a generation ship launched to Proxima Centauri. The game features a detailed skill-based character system, multiple ways to handle quests, choices & consequences, and branching dialogue trees.','2023/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/648410/Colony_Ship_A_PostEarth_Role_Playing_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1678,'home_safety_hotline',NULL,'Hearing noises? Seeing things? Call Home Safety Hotline! Our operators are standing by, waiting to give you the answers you need to protect your home from all manner of pests and household hazards.','2024/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2357910/Home_Safety_Hotline/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1679,'halo_wars:_definitive_edition',NULL,'Halo Wars: Definitive Edition is an enhanced version of the real-time strategy classic, Halo Wars, updated to run natively on PC. Halo Wars: Definitive Edition includes improved graphics, new achievements and all of the DLC created for the landmark real-time strategy game.','2017/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/459220/Halo_Wars_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1680,'pillars_of_eternity',NULL,'Prepare to be enchanted by a world where the choices you make and the paths you choose shape your destiny. Obsidian Entertainment, the developer of Fallout: New Vegas™ and South Park: The Stick of Truth™, together with Paradox Interactive is proud to present Pillars of Eternity.','2015/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/291650/Pillars_of_Eternity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1681,'stick_fight:_the_game',NULL,'Stick Fight is a physics-based couch/online fighting game where you battle it out as the iconic stick figures from the golden age of the internet.','2017/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/674940/Stick_Fight_The_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1682,'clair_obscur:_expedition_33_–_original_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Clair Obscur: Expedition 33, but does not include the base game.','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3405480/Clair_Obscur_Expedition_33__Original_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1683,'assetto_corsa_-_dream_pack_1',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa on Steam in order to play.','2015/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/347990/Assetto_Corsa__Dream_Pack_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1684,'metal_gear_solid_δ:_snake_eater',NULL,'A remake of the 2004 game METAL GEAR SOLID 3: SNAKE EATER, with the same gripping story and engrossing world, now with all new graphics and 3D audio that enhance the jungle atmosphere. Get ready for the ultimate survival stealth action experience.','2025/8/28','Unreleased','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2417610/METAL_GEAR_SOLID_D_SNAKE_EATER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1685,'the_division_2_-_warlords_of_new_york_-_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tom Clancy’s The Division® 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2222570/The_Division_2__Warlords_of_New_York__Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1686,'cultist_simulator',NULL,'Seize forbidden treasures. Summon alien gods. Feed on your disciples. Cultist Simulator is a game of apocalypse and yearning. Play as a seeker after unholy mysteries, in a 1920s-themed setting of hidden gods and secret histories.','2018/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/718670/Cultist_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1687,'windward_horizon',NULL,'Trade, quest, fight, or simply set sail and enjoy the ambiance in this charming open world naval RPG. Sequel to Tasharen\'s fan favorite game Windward released on Steam in 2015.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2665460/Windward_Horizon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1688,'warfare_legacy_collection',NULL,'Warfare 1917 and 1944 return, fully remastered with enhanced visuals, full-screen support, and custom battles. Warfare Legacy Collection also Includes the Battle of the Bulge, a brand-new campaign set during WWII’s final offensive with all-new missions, snowy maps, and intense front-line action.','2025/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2745870/Warfare_Legacy_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1689,'spirit_island',NULL,'Become the spirits of the land, and defend the island from colonizing Invaders spreading blight and destruction! Your spirits work with the native islanders to increase your power and drive the invading colonists from your island in this strategic area-control game.','2020/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1236720/Spirit_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1690,'wartales_-_the_tavern_opens!',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wartales on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2903960/Wartales__The_Tavern_Opens/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1691,'dread_delusion',NULL,'Dread Delusion is an open world RPG brimming with strange places and dark perils. Carve your own path through the flying continents of a shattered land. Discover curious towns, unearth occult secrets, master powerful magic - and change the world through your choices.','2024/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1574240/Dread_Delusion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1692,'the_walking_dead',NULL,'A five-part adventure horror series set in the same universe as Robert Kirkman’s award-winning comic book series.','2012/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/207610/The_Walking_Dead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1693,'美女，请别影响我成仙',NULL,'You, Lin Fan, the only male cultivator of the Crane Illusion Sect, were supposed to be the chosen son of the cultivation world, until you realized that the real \"crossing tribulation\" was not thunder punishment, but a thousand tribulation with the sect\'s young ladies and sisters.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3545990/_/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1694,'smalland:_survive_the_wilds',NULL,'Experience a big adventure on a tiny scale! Enjoy multiplayer survival in a vast, hazardous world. Preparation is key when you\'re this small & at the bottom of the food chain. Craft weapons & armour, tame & ride creatures, build encampments & explore a strange new land.','2024/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/768200/Smalland_Survive_the_Wilds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1695,'saints_row®:_the_third™_remastered',NULL,'The Full Package, Remastered – With enhanced graphics, improved lighting, reworked environments, and visual effects, Steelport and The Third Street Saints have never looked so good.','2021/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/978300/Saints_Row_The_Third_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1696,'islands_&_trains',NULL,'Craft tiny railway dioramas in a stress-free island sandbox. No rules or timers - just design, build, and enjoy.','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1957760/Islands__Trains/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1697,'temtem',NULL,'Temtem is an online creature-collection adventure. Tame 165 unique creatures across 7 vibrant islands, battle other tamers, tackle mythical Lairs, chase Luma & Umbra variants, and breed your favorite Tems - with friends by your side! Dive into a colorful monster catching adventure, so Temtem up!','2022/9/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/745920/Temtem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1698,'the_evil_within',NULL,'Developed by Shinji Mikami -- creator of the seminal Resident Evil series -- and the talented team at Tango Gameworks, The Evil Within embodies the meaning of pure survival horror. Highly-crafted environments, horrifying anxiety, and an intricate story are combined to create an immersive world that will bring you to the height of tension.','2014/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/268050/The_Evil_Within/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_35'),(1699,'the_walking_dead:_the_final_season',NULL,'A secluded school might finally be Clementine’s chance for a home, but protecting it will mean sacrifice.','2018/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/866800/The_Walking_Dead_The_Final_Season/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1700,'mandragora:_whispers_of_the_witch_tree',NULL,'Slay your way in Mandragora: Whispers of the Witch Tree, an epic action RPG set in a dark fantasy world. Battle monsters, master six unique Classes, craft hundreds of useful items, and explore the secrets of an expansive, interconnected world.','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1721060/Mandragora_Whispers_of_the_Witch_Tree/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1701,'survive_the_fall',NULL,'Explore, loot and fight in an open world action game set in a post-apocalyptic future after a devastating meteor strike. Assemble your team and take the fight to the enemy or choose a stealthy approach to gain the upper hand. Expand your base to research new gear and get ready to survive the fall.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1579340/Survive_the_Fall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1702,'planet_zoo:_eurasia_animal_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2675740/Planet_Zoo_Eurasia_Animal_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1703,'sunset_motel',NULL,'Ready for the transformation of neglected rooms? Ensure customer satisfaction, renovate interiors, design entertainment spaces! Manage your motel in your own style and provide travelers with unforgettable experiences!','2025/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2616140/Sunset_Motel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1704,'ark_fantastic_tames_-_dreadmare',NULL,'This content requires the base game ARK: Survival Ascended on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3282470/ARK_Fantastic_Tames__Dreadmare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1705,'spelunky_2',NULL,'Spelunky 2 builds upon the unique, randomized challenges that made the original a roguelike classic, offering a huge adventure designed to satisfy players old and new. Meet the next generation of explorers as they find themselves on the Moon, searching for treasure and missing family.','2020/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/418530/Spelunky_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1706,'atelier_yumia:_the_alchemist_of_memories_&_the_envisioned_land',NULL,'\"Atelier Yumia\" is a story about “memory”. Explore the field to gather materials and synthesis items. The items you create can be key to advancing the story and can also be used in battles and exploration. Additionally, you can create your own base with “Building\" in the field.','2025/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3123410/Atelier_Yumia_The_Alchemist_of_Memories__the_Envisioned_Land/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1707,'storyteller',NULL,'Storyteller is an award-winning puzzle game about building stories. Start with a title, settings and characters and create a story that fits the story’s description. Play with stories of love, intrigue, crime, monsters, betrayal, and more!','2023/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1624540/Storyteller/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1708,'definitely_not_fried_chicken',NULL,'Definitely Not Fried Chicken is a business management sim with a Twist! Grow your drugs trade through legitimate fronts by managing both sides of the business. Acquire new \"businesses\", meet new clientele, Develop more potent narcotics, make lots of money and leave a city in ruin!','2023/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1036240/Definitely_Not_Fried_Chicken/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1709,'ghostrunner_2',NULL,'Blood will run in Ghostrunner 2, a hardcore FPP slasher set in a post-apocalyptic cyberpunk future. Become the ultimate cyber ninja and prepare for epic boss fights, improved skills, an interactive story, new game modes, and captivating synthwave soundtrack.','2023/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2144740/Ghostrunner_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1710,'one_piece_odyssey',NULL,'A brand new RPG set in the world of the popular anime, ONE PIECE! Play as members of the Straw Hat Crew in a fantastic adventure set in the ONE PIECE world!','2023/1/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/814000/ONE_PIECE_ODYSSEY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1711,'roots_of_pacha',NULL,'The charming and relaxing stone-age farming sim where you live in a thriving community exploring the wonderful world of Pacha. Discover \"ideas,\" domesticate crops, befriend animals, and help your village grow. Play co-op with friends or explore the early days of civilization in single-player.','2023/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1245560/Roots_of_Pacha/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1712,'labyrinthine',NULL,'A co-op horror game like no other... Play with 1-8 players online as you solve puzzles, collect items and run from the horrors that lie within. Follow in the footsteps of Joan in the story mode or tackle procedurally generated maps that scale with your level and bring a fresh experience each game..','2023/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1302240/Labyrinthine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1713,'wilmot_works_it_out',NULL,'Wilmot Works It Out is a puzzle building game about completing beautiful images and using them to decorate the walls of your house.','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2060590/Wilmot_Works_It_Out/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1714,'[ninja_gaiden:_master_collection]_ninja_gaiden_σ2',NULL,'3 high speed ninja action titles are now available in one package!','2021/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1580790/NINJA_GAIDEN_Master_Collection_NINJA_GAIDEN_S2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1715,'railroader',NULL,'You and your fellow railroaders are the lifeblood of your railroad, just like it is the lifeblood of the communities it serves. Switch cars at industries. Keep people moving while running local passenger trains. Run trains with a purpose in transition era Appalachia – in Railroader!','2023/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1683150/Railroader/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1716,'preserve',NULL,'Preserve is a relaxing puzzle nature-building game in which you flourish a vibrant ecosystem by cleverly placing plants and animals to create a perfect symbiosis to your liking.','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2109270/Preserve/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1717,'stardeus',NULL,'Stardeus is a deep colony sim set on a broken starship manned by drones and hibernating human survivors. As the AI, have your drones repair your ship, save your crew and travel the stars in this beautiful simulation.','2022/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1380910/Stardeus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1718,'metal_gear_solid_3:_snake_eater_-_master_collection_version',NULL,'Metal Gear Solid 3: Snake Eater is the origin story of Naked Snake and his mentor The Boss and the fifth title in the METAL GEAR series.','2023/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2131650/METAL_GEAR_SOLID_3_Snake_Eater__Master_Collection_Version/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1719,'the_crew™_2',NULL,'Take on the American motorsports scene as you explore and dominate the land, air, and sea across the entire USA. With a wide variety of cars, bikes, boats, and planes, compete in a wide range of driving disciplines.','2018/6/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/646910/The_Crew_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1720,'your_only_move_is_hustle',NULL,'Master your technique, execute flashy combos, and outsmart opponents across the world, frame-by-frame. Slow down the clock to fine-tune your fighting style in this innovative, turn-based combat simulator. Pulverize your friends and choreograph spectacular fight scenes. No training mode required.','2023/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2212330/Your_Only_Move_Is_HUSTLE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1721,'the_long_dark:_tales_from_the_far_territory',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Long Dark on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2091330/The_Long_Dark_Tales_from_the_Far_Territory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1722,'dominions_6_-_rise_of_the_pantokrator',NULL,'In Dominions 6 you take control of a powerful being that rules a nation and aspires to godhood. The type of Pretender Gods can vary from magically powerful arch mages to old dragons or an enormous tree. Dominions is a deep 4x turn based strategy game with a very large variety of spells and units.','2024/1/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2511500/Dominions_6__Rise_of_the_Pantokrator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1723,'cast_n_chill_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cast n Chill on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3817870/Cast_n_Chill__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1724,'command:_modern_operations',NULL,'Command: Modern Operations is the next generation in cross-domain modern wargaming. It enables you to simulate every military engagement from post World War II to the present day and beyond. The scale is primarily tactical/operational, although strategic scale operations are also possible.','2019/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1076160/Command_Modern_Operations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1725,'judgment',NULL,'Fight for the truth and uncover the twisted crime running deep beneath the surface of Tokyo. In this legal thriller , the balance between justice and mercy teeters on the edge.','2022/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2058180/Judgment/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1726,'the_game_of_life_2',NULL,'The board game played by 50 million fans worldwide has an official award-winning sequel! The Game of Life 2 brings bright, fun, 3D animated magic to your game night. Spin the spinner and discover new choices, new crossroads and new ways to win. The decisions are all yours!','2020/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1455630/THE_GAME_OF_LIFE_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1727,'planet_zoo:_aquatic_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1471590/Planet_Zoo_Aquatic_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1728,'soulcalibur_vi',NULL,'Bring more than your fists to the fight! Featuring all-new battle mechanics and characters, SOULCALIBUR VI marks a new era of the historic franchise. Welcome back to the stage of history!','2018/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/544750/SOULCALIBUR_VI/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1729,'star_wars™:_bounty_hunter™',NULL,'Bring In Your Bounty, Dead or Alive','2024/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2419090/STAR_WARS_Bounty_Hunter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1730,'street_fighter™_6_-_year_2_character_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Street Fighter™ 6 on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2825190/Street_Fighter_6__Year_2_Character_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1731,'mullet_madjack',NULL,'MULLET MADJACK is a HIGH-OCTANE-ACTION SHOOTER that put you directly inside a CLASSIC ANIME. Pick your favorite weapon and reach the last floor; Beat your best time or try again. Haste makes waste… OF YOUR ENEMIES!','2024/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2111190/MULLET_MADJACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1732,'mortal_kombat_x',NULL,'Experience the Next Generation of the #1 Fighting Franchise. Mortal Kombat X combines unparalleled, cinematic presentation with all new gameplay.','2015/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/307780/Mortal_Kombat_X/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1733,'mahjong_soul',NULL,'Mahjong Soul is an online game that adopted the classic Japanese Mahjong gameplay. Here, you can hone your mahjong skills with players from worldwide or spend leisure time with friends, bond with various charismatic characters, and experience an abundance of unique stories.','2024/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2739990/Mahjong_Soul/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1734,'crysis_2_remastered',NULL,'Relive the legendary single-player campaign from the classic first-person shooter, Crysis 2, optimized for today\'s hardware in Crysis 2 Remastered.','2022/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2096600/Crysis_2_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1735,'assetto_corsa_-_ready_to_race_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa on Steam in order to play.','2017/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/619680/Assetto_Corsa__Ready_To_Race_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1736,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_high_power_cargo_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2014/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/304214/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__High_Power_Cargo_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1737,'star_wars™_battlefront_ii_(classic,_2005)',NULL,'Join the rise of Darth Vader’s elite 501st Legion of Stormtroopers as you fight through an all new story-based saga where every action you take impacts the battlefront and, ultimately, the fate of the Star Wars galaxy.','2005/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6060/STAR_WARS_Battlefront_II_Classic_2005/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1738,'flashing_lights_-_police,_firefighting,_emergency_services_(ems)_simulator',NULL,'Play solo or in up to 10-player multiplayer co-op! Flashing Lights is an open world police, firefighting and EMS simulator game with plenty of opportunity for role-play or more relaxed fun with friends. Become the law or save lives! Discover leagues of player-created mods!','2023/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/605740/Flashing_Lights__Police_Firefighting_Emergency_Services_EMS_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1739,'fights_in_tight_spaces',NULL,'A stylish blend of deck-building, turn-based tactics, and thrilling animated fight sequences in classic action-movie settings. Learn to balance your hand, momentum, and positioning to overcome the odds to defeat your adversaries. Build your deck, control the space and live to fight another day.','2021/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1265820/Fights_in_Tight_Spaces/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1740,'pavlov',NULL,'Pavlov vr is a multiplayer shooter in VR with heavy focus on community features. Realistic reloading features and fast paced combat as part of the core experience. Play the #1 most popular VR shooter on PC today.','2024/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/555160/Pavlov/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1741,'dead_by_daylight_-_silent_hill_chapter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1324970/Dead_By_Daylight__Silent_Hill_Chapter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1742,'realflight_evolution',NULL,'RealFlight® is the industry-leading flight simulator for radio-controlled airplanes, helicopters, and drones. Fly more than 300 hyper-realistic vehicles in an immense, open world right from your desktop. This RC classic is a must-have tool for flight enthusiasts of all skill levels!','2022/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2069310/RealFlight_Evolution/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_36'),(1743,'hardspace:_shipbreaker',NULL,'Equipped with cutting-edge salvaging tech, carve & slice spaceships to recover valuable materials. Upgrade your gear to take on more lucrative contracts and pay your billion credits debt to LYNX Corp!','2022/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1161580/Hardspace_Shipbreaker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1744,'forager',NULL,'The highly popular and quirky \"idle game that you want to actively keep playing\". Explore, craft, gather & manage resources, find secrets and build your base out of nothing! Buy land to explore and expand!','2019/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/751780/Forager/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1745,'doki_doki_literature_club_plus!',NULL,'Welcome to the club! Write poems for your crush and experience the terror of school romance in this critically-acclaimed psychological horror story.','2021/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1388880/Doki_Doki_Literature_Club_Plus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1746,'assetto_corsa_-_dream_pack_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa on Steam in order to play.','2015/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/404430/Assetto_Corsa__Dream_Pack_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1747,'undawn',NULL,'Explore, adapt, and survive in Undawn, a free-to-play open-world survival RPG for mobile and PC developed by LightSpeed Studios and published by Level Infinite. Embark on an adventure with other survivors four years after a worldwide disaster where hordes of infected roam a shattered world.','2023/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1881700/Undawn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1748,'expeditions:_a_mudrunner_game',NULL,'Embark on scientific expeditions with this new off-road adventure game. Lead research missions as you drive a variety of all-terrain vehicles, using high-tech tools and managing your camp and crew to ensure your success in the wild.','2024/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2477340/Expeditions_A_MudRunner_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1749,'danganronpa_v3:_killing_harmony',NULL,'A new cast of 16 characters find themselves kidnapped and imprisoned in a school. Inside, some will kill, some will die, and some will be punished. Reimagine what you thought high-stakes, fast-paced investigation was as you investigate twisted murder cases and condemn your new friends to death.','2017/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/567640/Danganronpa_V3_Killing_Harmony/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1750,'teddy\'s_haven_-_a_fantasy_inspired_shop_simulator',NULL,'Teddy’s Haven is a cozy shop simulator where you manage a magical store, explore a whimsical world, and master skills like Stocking and Harvesting. Enjoy shop customization, dynamic events, and a New Game+ system. Join Early Access to help shape the game’s future!','2025/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3615160/Teddys_Haven__A_Fantasy_Inspired_Shop_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1751,'parallel_experiment',NULL,'Two detectives, one deadly experiment, a race against time. Each player only has one half of the puzzle. In this 2-player co-op puzzle game you can survive the parallel experiment only by working together.','2025/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2012320/Parallel_Experiment/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1752,'towers_of_aghasba',NULL,'Explore a stunning open-world filled with majestic creatures and quirky characters. Nurture the barren land into vibrant ecosystems and flex your creativity as you build a thriving civilization in balance with nature.','2024/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2178070/Towers_of_Aghasba/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1753,'metal:_hellsinger',NULL,'Slay to the rhythm of metal and vengeance on an infernal journey through the eight Hells. Make them fear the beat. Metal: Hellsinger is a rhythm FPS bursting with demons, badass weapons, and heavy metal music.','2022/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1061910/Metal_Hellsinger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1754,'il-2_sturmovik:_battle_of_normandy',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2118560/IL2_Sturmovik_Battle_of_Normandy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1755,'warhammer_40,000:_boltgun_-_forges_of_corruption_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Boltgun on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2668290/Warhammer_40000_Boltgun__Forges_of_Corruption_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1756,'dungeons_&_dragons_online®',NULL,'Enter a world of danger and adventure with Dungeons & Dragons Online® based on the beloved RPG that started it all.','2012/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/206480/Dungeons__Dragons_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1757,'ultimate_admiral:_dreadnoughts',NULL,'Design warships the way you want them, command fleets, win the naval arms race for your nation!','2023/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1069660/Ultimate_Admiral_Dreadnoughts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1758,'regiments',NULL,'Regiments is a Real-Time Tactics game set in Germany 1989. The Cold War has gone hot, and the inferno is raging. Lead your Regiment through the fires of conflict and the fog of war. Break through the lines, call in artillery, maneuver, feign retreats, stage defenses, counter-attack. Do not relent.','2022/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1109680/Regiments/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1759,'expansion_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_by_blood_alone',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1880650/Expansion__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_By_Blood_Alone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1760,'kings_call',NULL,'Collect an array of creature and skill cards through quests, upgrades and trading, and craft your ultimate deck by choosing your favorite cards and prepare for epic battles. Dive into the exhilaration of strategic gameplay and let your inner tactician shine to outsmart your opponents!','2023/12/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2674290/Kings_Call/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1761,'battlefleet_gothic:_armada_2',NULL,'Battlefleet Gothic: Armada 2 is the new real-time strategy game adapted from Games Workshop’s famous tabletop game that portrays the epic space battles of the Warhammer 40,000 universe.','2019/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/573100/Battlefleet_Gothic_Armada_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1762,'zombie_graveyard_simulator',NULL,'Manage your Graveyard by day as you bury and cremate bodies, maintain graves, fulfill visitor requests, grow crops, run a shop and unlock upgrades. When night falls, face relentless zombie hordes as you build defenses to protect your work and fight to survive in Zombie Graveyard Simulator!','2025/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3430450/Zombie_Graveyard_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1763,'five_nights_at_freddy\'s_3',NULL,'Thirty years after Freddy Fazbear\'s Pizza closed it\'s doors, the events that took place there have become nothing more than a rumor and a childhood memory, but the owners of \"Fazbear\'s Fright: The Horror Attraction\" are determined to revive the legend and make the experience as authentic as possible for patrons, going to great l','2015/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/354140/Five_Nights_at_Freddys_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1764,'build_master:_marsville',NULL,'Build Master: MarsVille is a city-building and strategy game that invites you to create your Martian colony with your engineering genius and building skills. Form alliances, trade resources, and conquer rival colonies. Embrace the challenge and become the ultimate Build Master on Mars!','2023/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2366120/Build_Master_MarsVille/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1765,'melty_blood:_type_lumina',NULL,'This is the latest addition to the series of 2D fighting games based on TYPE-MOON\'s visual novel, Tsukihime. The curtain rises once more on dramatic battles played out with familiar characters from Tsukihime: A Piece of Blue Glass Moon.','2021/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1372280/MELTY_BLOOD_TYPE_LUMINA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1766,'best_served_cold',NULL,'Can you mix a cocktail while eye-to-eye with a criminal? Find out in Best Served Cold, a murder mystery set in a bustling speakeasy where you serve customers, make friends and enemies, and solve crimes. At the Nightcap bar, prohibition is a killer… and so are some of your customers!','2025/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3218530/Best_Served_Cold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1767,'feed_and_grow:_fish',NULL,'Hunt and eat other fish - simply, grow into larger beasts!','2016/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/429050/Feed_and_Grow_Fish/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1768,'rayman®_legends',NULL,'Michel Ancel, the celebrated creator of Rayman®, Beyond Good & Evil®, and the Raving Rabbids®, returns to unleash his innovative creativity on this new entry into the Rayman® franchise.When Rayman, Globox, and the Teensies discover a mysterious tent filled with captivating paintings, they are suddenly transported to a