per_Heroes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1775,'beastieball',NULL,'A turn-based volleyball RPG where you coach a sports team of Beasties! Your Beasties\' relationships grow and change, unlocking new abilities and combo plays!','2024/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1864950/Beastieball/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1776,'vietnam_war',NULL,'Open world single-player FPS. Command your squad in battle across jungles, hills and villages of Vietnam. Fight as U.S or Vietcong. Vast arsenal of weapons and 50+ vehicles','2025/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1837480/Vietnam_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1777,'nitro_gen_omega',NULL,'A sandbox turn-based tactical RPG that puts you in the director\'s seat of your own shonen anime. Lead your crew through wastelands overrun by ruthless machines and engage in cinematic Mech battles featuring a unique timeline system. Recruit pilots, grow bonds and make a name for yourself!','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2525510/NITRO_GEN_OMEGA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1778,'dusk',NULL,'Battle through an onslaught of mystical backwater cultists, possessed militants & even darker forces as you attempt to discover just what lurks beneath the Earth in this retro FPS inspired by the \'90s legends.','2018/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/519860/DUSK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1779,'postal_4:_no_regerts',NULL,'POSTAL 4: No Regerts is a satirical and outrageous comedic open world first person shooter and the long-awaited true sequel to what’s been fondly dubbed as \"The Worst Game Ever™\", POSTAL 2!','2022/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/707030/POSTAL_4_No_Regerts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1780,'superliminal',NULL,'Perception is reality. In this mind-bending first-person puzzler, you escape a surreal dream world through solving impossible puzzles using the ambiguity of depth and perspective.','2020/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1049410/Superliminal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1781,'rivals_of_aether_ii',NULL,'Rivals of Aether II is the sequel to the hit indie fighting game, Rivals of Aether. Play as both new and returning elemental fighters in the next generation of platform fighters.','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2217000/Rivals_of_Aether_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1782,'disney_dreamlight_valley:_the_storybook_vale',NULL,'This content requires the base game Disney Dreamlight Valley on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3259120/Disney_Dreamlight_Valley_The_Storybook_Vale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1783,'atelier_ryza:_ever_darkness_&_the_secret_hideout',NULL,'The concept of this title, the latest in the series to depict a new \"Atelier\" world, is \"True-to-life youths that develop together, even if just a little bit\".','2019/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1121560/Atelier_Ryza_Ever_Darkness__the_Secret_Hideout/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1784,'american_truck_simulator_-_wyoming',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1415692/American_Truck_Simulator__Wyoming/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1785,'carx_street_-_dlc_sunset_speedway',NULL,'This content requires the base game CarX Street on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3153040/CarX_Street__DLC_Sunset_Speedway/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1786,'carrion',NULL,'CARRION is a reverse horror game in which you assume the role of an amorphous creature of unknown origins, stalking and consuming those that imprisoned you.','2020/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/953490/CARRION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1787,'sol_cesto',NULL,'Sol Cesto is a tactical and frantic roguelite where mastering your luck is key. Choose a hero, upgrade them using cursed teeth and magical items, and descend to the bottom of an ever-changing dungeon. In this dark world, every action has consequences…','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2738490/Sol_Cesto/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1788,'bravely_default_ii',NULL,'A new entry in the “Bravely\" series! Four new Heroes of Light emerge in a new world and story!','2021/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1446650/BRAVELY_DEFAULT_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_37'),(1789,'assetto_corsa_-_red_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa on Steam in order to play.','2016/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/493190/Assetto_Corsa__Red_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1790,'beyond_citadel',NULL,'Beyond Citadel is an anime style retro throwback shooter inspired by the classics of the 90\'s, with realistic gunplay mechanics, anime violence and fast paced combat. Fight your way through the heavily armed mechanical fortress and discover the secret that lies beneath.','2025/1/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3371240/Beyond_Citadel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1791,'dragon_quest_monsters:_the_dark_prince',NULL,'DRAGON QUEST MONSTERS: The Dark Prince comes to Steam®! Recruit monsters from the DQ series, synthesize new creatures and compose your ideal team.','2024/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2175540/DRAGON_QUEST_MONSTERS_The_Dark_Prince/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1792,'fernbus_simulator',NULL,'The world of coach drivers awaits you! Drive along motorways and country roads to the bus stations in over 40 cities in Germany. Thanks to the cooperation with FlixBus and true-to-the-original MAN buses, you will experience the game world in a realistic way.','2016/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/427100/Fernbus_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1793,'the_executive_-_movie_industry_tycoon',NULL,'Shape the history of the Hollywood movie industry in this sandbox business simulation game. Create the movies you\'ve always wanted to see, hire the best team, research cutting-edge technologies, and dominate the Box Office. Can you rise from a small studio to a Hollywood giant?','2025/2/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2315430/The_Executive__Movie_Industry_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1794,'critter_cove',NULL,'A deep, open world life sim and town building game set in a cozy post-apocalyptic paradise. Restore an old town, sail across a mysterious archipelago. Hunt for relics and farm, fish & craft everything you need. Can you help turn Critter Cove into a thriving tourist town once again?','2024/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1631470/Critter_Cove/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1795,'star_wars™_knights_of_the_old_republic™',NULL,'It is four thousand years before the Galactic Empire and hundreds of Jedi Knights have fallen in battle against the ruthless Sith. You are the last hope of the Jedi Order. Can you master the awesome power of the Force on your quest to save the Republic? Or will you fall to the lure of the dark side?','2003/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/32370/STAR_WARS_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1796,'endless™_space_2',NULL,'ENDLESS™ Space 2 is a Strategic Space Opera, featuring the compelling “just one more turn” gameplay, set in the mysterious ENDLESS™ Universe. As the leader of your civilization, will you impose your vision and build the greatest stellar empire?','2017/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/392110/ENDLESS_Space_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1797,'paranormal_cleanup',NULL,'Paranormal Cleanup is a 1-4 player online co-op survival horror game. This is no ordinary clean-up job. You are tasked with cleaning up paranormal locations. Unclog dirty toilets and scrub ectoplasm, but don\'t get caught by the entities that are hunting you!','2025/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2197890/Paranormal_Cleanup/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1798,'stellaris:_aquatics_species_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1749080/Stellaris_Aquatics_Species_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1799,'djmax_respect_v_-_v_liberty_iii_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3773070/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__V_LIBERTY_III_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1800,'romancing_saga_2:_revenge_of_the_seven',NULL,'In this non-linear RPG, rule and expand the Empire of Varennes across multiple generations. Discover a vast array of story experiences as you fight the Seven Heroes in an epic battle that plays out over thousands of years.','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2455640/Romancing_SaGa_2_Revenge_of_the_Seven/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1801,'cryptmaster',NULL,'SAY ANYTHING in this bizarre dungeon adventure where words control everything. Fill in the blanks with text or voice to uncover lost abilities, embark on strange quests, and solve mindbending riddles. Can you conquer the crypt and uncover the mystery at the heart of CRYPTMASTER?','2024/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1885110/Cryptmaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1802,'asphalt_legends_unite',NULL,'Spark your competitive soul with Asphalt Legends UNITE and feel the collective heartbeat of the road! Join forces with other players to speed through intense arcade races, perform jaw-dropping stunts, and charge towards victory while driving the finest hypercars!','2022/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1815780/Asphalt_Legends_Unite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1803,'stationeers',NULL,'Stationeers puts you in control of the construction and management of a space station to run by yourself or online with your friends. Complex atmospheric, electrical, manufacturing, agriculture, and gravitational systems require your thought and management at all times!','2017/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/544550/Stationeers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1804,'the_other_side',NULL,'Embark on a chilling co-op adventure in The Other Side, an action packed horror experience. Customize your gear, strategize with friends, and uncover paranormal mysteries. Are you prepared to face the unknown together in this immersive supernatural experience?','2025/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2764750/The_Other_Side/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1805,'monster_hunter_stories',NULL,'Monster Hunter Stories is an RPG that takes the world of Monster Hunter and expands upon it in new and exciting ways! No longer are you hunting monsters, but raising them! In this deep story featuring heroes known as Monster Riders, you will live alongside monsters and form lifelong bonds with them.','2024/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2356560/Monster_Hunter_Stories/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1806,'assetto_corsa_-_porsche_pack_ii',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa on Steam in order to play.','2016/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/540710/Assetto_Corsa__Porsche_Pack_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1807,'yaoling:_mythical_journey',NULL,'Yaoling: Mythical Journey is a creature collecting Eastern fantasy RPG featuring an world filled with rich stories and unique Yaolings. Tasked to uncover a mysterious evil, you embark on a journey with your Yaolings, forming new friendships, engage in intense battles, and face countless challenges!','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2816950/Yaoling_Mythical_Journey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1808,'wartales_-_the_beast_hunt',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wartales on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3559560/Wartales__The_Beast_Hunt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1809,'tavern_manager_simulator_🍻',NULL,'Restore your fantasy tavern to its full glory. Repair, improve and expand the establishment. Cook delicious food and keep an eye on the mood of the visitors. Create a unique atmosphere for unforgettable adventures!','2024/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2756770/Tavern_Manager_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1810,'the_evil_within_2',NULL,'Detective Sebastian Castellanos has lost everything, including his daughter, Lily. To save her, he must descend into the nightmarish world of STEM. Horrifying threats emerge from every corner, and he must rely on his wits to survive. For his one chance at redemption, the only way out is in.','2017/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/601430/The_Evil_Within_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1811,'pharaoh™:_a_new_era',NULL,'The legendary city-builder returns! Lead the creation of one of the greatest civilizations the world has ever seen in this HD remake with modernized UI. Build monuments, manage your population and explore 4,000 years of history through over a hundred hours of gameplay.','2023/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1351080/Pharaoh_A_New_Era/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1812,'gas_station_simulator_-_car_junkyard_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Gas Station Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2782920/Gas_Station_Simulator__Car_Junkyard_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1813,'arizona_sunshine®_2',NULL,'It\'s time to say hello to your old pal, Fred. Arizona Sunshine® 2, the next-gen sequel to the fan-favorite VR apocalypse, packs even more gore-geous zombie action! And what\'s better than braving the end of the f*cking world alone? Surviving it with your new best friend--Buddy.','2023/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1540210/Arizona_Sunshine_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1814,'destiny_2:_heresy_silver_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Destiny 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2972410/Destiny_2_Heresy_Silver_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1815,'darkwood',NULL,'Darkwood - a new perspective on survival horror. Scavenge and explore a rich, ever-changing free-roam world by day, then hunker down in your hideout and pray for the morning light.','2017/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/274520/Darkwood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1816,'peaks_of_yore',NULL,'Travel around The Great Gales to climb challenging peaks in this physics-based climbing adventure set in 1887. Meet like-minded mountaineers, unlock helpful climbing gear, and become a pioneer of mountaineering.','2023/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2236070/Peaks_of_Yore/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1817,'the_legend_of_heroes:_trails_into_reverie',NULL,'Three different legends are about to unfold! Determine the fates of Rean Schwarzer, Lloyd Bannings, and the mysterious “C” in this climactic chapter of The Legend of Heroes series.','2023/7/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1668540/The_Legend_of_Heroes_Trails_into_Reverie/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1818,'quantum_break',NULL,'From Remedy Entertainment, the masters of cinematic action games, comes Quantum Break, a time-amplified suspenseful blockbuster. The Quantum Break experience is part game, part live action show—where decisions in one dramatically affect the other.','2016/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/474960/Quantum_Break/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1819,'wizard_of_legend_2',NULL,'Face perilous magical trials in the fast-paced rogue-lite follow-up to the acclaimed original, featuring co-op and vibrant new 3D visuals. Master new Arcana and elements, experiment with spell combinations, and become the next Wizard of Legend!','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2193540/Wizard_of_Legend_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1820,'need_for_speed™_hot_pursuit_remastered',NULL,'Feel the thrill of the chase and the rush of escape behind the wheels of the world’s hottest high-performance cars in Need for Speed™ Hot Pursuit Remastered– a heart-pumping, socially competitive racing experience.','2020/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1328660/Need_for_Speed_Hot_Pursuit_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1821,'rain_world:_the_watcher',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rain World on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2857120/Rain_World_The_Watcher/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1822,'suicide_squad:_kill_the_justice_league',NULL,'From the creators of Batman: Arkham, Suicide Squad: Kill the Justice League is a genre-defying third-person action shooter where the ultimate band of misfits must do the impossible: Kill the Justice League.','2024/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/315210/Suicide_Squad_Kill_the_Justice_League/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1823,'dead_island_definitive_edition',NULL,'Welcome to the zombie apocalypse experience of a lifetime – and now more beautiful than ever. Caught in the midst of an epic zombie outbreak on the tropical island of Banoi, your only thought is: Survive!','2016/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/383150/Dead_Island_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1824,'dark_deception',NULL,'Death awaits you in Dark Deception, a story-driven first-person horror maze game. There\'s nowhere to hide & nowhere to catch your breath. Run or die - it\'s your choice. Trapped in a realm of nightmarish mazes with a mysterious woman, your only hope of survival is to find a way to escape.','2018/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/332950/Dark_Deception/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1825,'wasteland_3',NULL,'Following the critically acclaimed 2014 Game of the Year winner Wasteland 2, the RPG series that pioneered the post-apocalyptic genre in video games returns with Wasteland 3.','2020/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/719040/Wasteland_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1826,'diceomancer',NULL,'DICEOMANCER is a roguelike deck-building game. Though you long for a peaceful life, you\'re forced to embark on an adventure. In this world of swords, magic, and guns, make good use of your dice and deck to find a way back to tranquility! What can the dice be used for? To change... anything.','2024/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2501600/DICEOMANCER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1827,'assetto_corsa_competizione_-_2023_gt_world_challenge_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa Competizione on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2328720/Assetto_Corsa_Competizione__2023_GT_World_Challenge_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1828,'dragon_age_ii:_ultimate_edition',NULL,'You are Hawke, a refugee seeking to escape the darkspawn-plagued land of Ferelden and become Champion of Kirkwall. Rise to power and fight epic battles while making decisions that determine the course of civilization.','2011/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238040/Dragon_Age_II_Ultimate_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1829,'assetto_corsa_-_porsche_pack_iii',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa on Steam in order to play.','2016/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/540711/Assetto_Corsa__Porsche_Pack_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1830,'danganronpa_2:_goodbye_despair',NULL,'Jabberwock Island—You and your classmates were ready for fun in the sun until Monokuma returned to restart his murderous game! Trapped in a kill-or-be-killed situation, your only hope rests in solving the island’s mysteries.','2016/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/413420/Danganronpa_2_Goodbye_Despair/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1831,'desperados_iii',NULL,'Desperados III is a story-driven, hardcore tactical stealth game, set in a ruthless Wild West scenario. Play smart if you want to succeed. A good plan can make the difference between survival and finding yourself at the business end of a pistol.','2020/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/610370/Desperados_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1832,'unrailed_2:_back_on_track',NULL,'The chaotic co-op railroad construction game is back! Team up with your friends to build a railroad through procedurally generated worlds with new biomes and bosses. Permanently upgrade your character and engine, even create your own levels - just don‘t let your train derail!','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2211170/Unrailed_2_Back_on_Track/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1833,'helldivers™_dive_harder_edition',NULL,'HELLDIVERS™ is a hardcore, cooperative, twin stick shooter. As part of the elite unit called the HELLDIVERS, players must work together to protect SUPER EARTH and defeat the enemies of mankind in an intense intergalactic war.','2015/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/394510/HELLDIVERS_Dive_Harder_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1834,'kingdom_come:_deliverance_ii_brushes_with_death',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Come: Deliverance II on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3368600/Kingdom_Come_Deliverance_II_Brushes_with_Death/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1835,'supermarket_together',NULL,'The multiplayer supermarket has arrived to your neighbourhood for free! Stock your shop space, unlock perks and franchises, hire employees or chase those pesky shoplifters. The more players, the more action!','2024/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2709570/Supermarket_Together/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1836,'expansion_-_europa_universalis_iv:_domination',NULL,'This content requires the base game Europa Universalis IV on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2223660/Expansion__Europa_Universalis_IV_Domination/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_38'),(1837,'i_was_a_teenage_exocolonist',NULL,'Spend your teenage years on an alien planet in this narrative RPG with card-based battles. Explore, grow up, and fall in love. The choices you make and