tore.steampowered.com/app/557340/My_Friend_Pedro/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1844,'house_flipper_-_garden_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game House Flipper on Steam in order to play.','2019/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/942290/House_Flipper__Garden_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1845,'greedfall_ii:_the_dying_world',NULL,'Dive back into the unique world of GreedFall again in an even deeper RPG experience. Uprooted from the island of your birth, find your freedom, explore the old continent and forge your destiny through alliances, scheming and battles!','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1997660/GreedFall_II_The_Dying_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1846,'borderlands_2:_commander_lilith_&_the_fight_for_sanctuary',NULL,'This content requires the base game Borderlands 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/872280/Borderlands_2_Commander_Lilith__the_Fight_for_Sanctuary/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1847,'sonic_origins',NULL,'Experience the collected adventures of Sonic the Hedgehog in Sonic Origins Plus! With 16 legendary Sonic titles, including 12 Game Gear games, new playable characters, modes, challenges, behind-the-scenes content, and more, this is the definitive way to play these classic games!','2022/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1794960/Sonic_Origins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1848,'cardfight!!_vanguard_dear_days_2',NULL,'\"Cardfight!! Vanguard,\" has newly come to digital game! Over 3,000 cards for the Standard format! A brand-new original story shares the world of anime series unfolds! Enjoy your own cardfight experience!!','2025/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2457540/Cardfight_Vanguard_Dear_Days_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1849,'assetto_corsa_competizione_-_gt4_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa Competizione on Steam in order to play.','2020/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1337860/Assetto_Corsa_Competizione__GT4_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1850,'vladik_brutal',NULL,'Fight under the onslaught of mutated monsters, obsessed soldiers and even darker bosses. Just try to survive and find out what to do next in this life, simultaneously tearing your enemies to pieces.','2024/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1316680/VLADiK_BRUTAL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1851,'total_war:_rome_ii_-_empire_divided_campaign_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ROME II - Emperor Edition on Steam in order to play.','2017/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/694880/Total_War_ROME_II__Empire_Divided_Campaign_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1852,'grandchase',NULL,'Grand Chase is a free side-scrolling online action RPG with anime inspired graphics. Enjoy exciting adventures in dungeons and PvP with unique characters.','2021/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/985810/GrandChase/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1853,'fbc_:_firebreak_deluxe_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game FBC: Firebreak on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3625720/FBC__Firebreak_Deluxe_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1854,'planet_zoo:_oceania_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2502240/Planet_Zoo_Oceania_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1855,'gloomwood',NULL,'Trapped in a dark, Victorian city consumed by an ancient curse, you must plan your survival and daring escape using nothing but stealth, an arsenal of eccentric weapons, and your wit in this haunting adventure inspired by the immersive sims and survival horror greats of the late 90s and early 2000s.','2022/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1150760/Gloomwood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1856,'house_flipper_-_farm_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game House Flipper on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1832960/House_Flipper__Farm_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1857,'va-11_hall-a:_cyberpunk_bartender_action',NULL,'VA-11 HALL-A: Cyberpunk Bartender Action is a booze em\' up about waifus, technology, and post-dystopia life.','2016/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/447530/VA11_HallA_Cyberpunk_Bartender_Action/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1858,'imperator:_rome',NULL,'Dominate the classical Mediterranean in Imperator: Rome, a grand strategy game from Paradox Interactive. Navigate the dangerous waters of politics and diplomacy as you build up your provinces and conquer foreign lands. Now available with special content and the digital artbook.','2019/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/859580/Imperator_Rome/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1859,'the_universim',NULL,'Jump straight into managing your own planets as you guide a civilization through the ages. Build the ultimate empire in The Universim, a new breed of God Game in development by Crytivo.','2024/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/352720/The_Universim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1860,'total_war:_warhammer_ii_-_the_warden_&_the_paunch',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2020/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1209120/Total_War_WARHAMMER_II__The_Warden__The_Paunch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1861,'the_last_starship',NULL,'The Last Starship is a 2D space construction game where you design and upgrade your starship. Choose your path: pirate hunter, miner, engineer, spacebus driver, and more, whilst exploring vibrant star systems. Enjoy a growing sandbox world, with regular free updates. Your cosmic adventure awaits!','2023/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1857080/The_Last_Starship/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1862,'angel_legion',NULL,'Idle or play whenever and wherever you want. Customize the looking of your favorite Angels. Automatically accumulate resources all the time.','2020/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1333350/Angel_Legion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1863,'easy_red_2:_shanghai_-_nanking',NULL,'This content requires the base game Easy Red 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3499380/Easy_Red_2_Shanghai__Nanking/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1864,'total_war:_rome_ii_-_rise_of_the_republic_campaign_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ROME II - Emperor Edition on Steam in order to play.','2018/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/850010/Total_War_ROME_II__Rise_of_the_Republic_Campaign_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1865,'supermarket_together_-_the_cool_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Supermarket Together on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3146530/Supermarket_Together__The_Cool_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1866,'lego®_marvel_super_heroes_2',NULL,'It\'s about TIME! Join your favorite Super Heroes and Super Villains from different eras and realities as they go head-to-head with the time-traveling Kang the Conqueror in the all-new, original adventure, LEGO® Marvel Super Heroes 2!','2017/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/647830/LEGO_Marvel_Super_Heroes_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1867,'shogun_showdown',NULL,'Shogun Showdown is a turn-based combat game with rogue-like and deck-building elements. Position yourself and attack at the right time, upgrade your tiles and combo them to get ready to face the Shogun!','2024/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2084000/Shogun_Showdown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1868,'talespire',NULL,'TaleSpire is a beautiful way to play pen and paper RPGs online. Bring your stories to life and embark upon campaigns together with your friends, regardless of where you are in the world.','2021/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/720620/TaleSpire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1869,'the_sims™_4_werewolves_game_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1776780/The_Sims_4_Werewolves_Game_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1870,'crusader_kings_iii:_northern_lords',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings III on Steam in order to play.','2021/3/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1303183/Crusader_Kings_III_Northern_Lords/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1871,'the_thaumaturge',NULL,'The Thaumaturge is a character-driven RPG with a rich story, morally ambiguous choices, and turn-based combat. In a city on the brink of change, use your mystical powers to read emotions, uncover motives, and command folklore-inspired demons — while resisting the temptation of your own pride.','2024/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1684350/The_Thaumaturge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1872,'warhammer_40,000:_darktide_-_arbites_class_cosmetic_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Darktide on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3710980/Warhammer_40000_Darktide__Arbites_Class_Cosmetic_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1873,'far_cry®_new_dawn',NULL,'Dive into a transformed vibrant post-apocalyptic Hope County, Montana, 17 years after a global nuclear catastrophe. Lead the fight against the Highwaymen, as they seek to take over the last remaining resources.','2019/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/939960/Far_Cry_New_Dawn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1874,'brighter_shores',NULL,'Brighter Shores is an all new adventure from award winning MMORPG designer Andrew Gower. It is an enchanting point-and-click style RPG with hundreds of hours of gameplay, set in a land of magic and mysteries, with a huge number of professions to try, and something new to find around every corner.','2024/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2791440/Brighter_Shores/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1875,'wargame:_red_dragon',NULL,'The new reference in RTS at its best! The Wargame series returns to duty, larger, richer and more spectacular than ever before. In Wargame Red Dragon, you are engaged in a large-scale conflict where Western forces clash against the Communist bloc.','2014/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/251060/Wargame_Red_Dragon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1876,'against_the_storm_-_keepers_of_the_stone',NULL,'This content requires the base game Against the Storm on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3075500/Against_the_Storm__Keepers_of_the_Stone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1877,'street_fighter_v',NULL,'Experience the intensity of head-to-head battles with Street Fighter® V! Choose from 16 iconic characters, then battle against friends online or offline with a robust variety of match options.','2016/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/310950/Street_Fighter_V/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1878,'a_date_with_death',NULL,'Fight against & romance the one hunting for your soul in A Date with Death, a romance chat simulator where you date(?) the Grim Reaper himself. Create your own character, decorate your apartment, and chat away with the charming yet dangerous Grim Reaper through text and video calls.','2023/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2415010/A_Date_with_Death/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1879,'dishonored_2',NULL,'Reprise your role as a supernatural assassin in Dishonored 2. Declared a “masterpiece” by Eurogamer and hailed “a must-play revenge tale” by Game Informer, Dishonored 2 is the follow up to Arkane’s 1st-person action blockbuster & winner of 100+ \'Game of the Year\' awards, Dishonored.','2016/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/403640/Dishonored_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1880,'killing_floor_3',NULL,'It’s 2091 and megacorp Horzine has produced the ultimate army: an obedient horde of bioengineered monsters called zeds. Now, join the rebel group Nightfall in this co-op action/horror FPS that puts you and your teammates in a battle for the future of humanity.','2025/7/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1430190/Killing_Floor_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1881,'halls_of_torment',NULL,'Slay hordes of terrifying monsters in this horde survival roguelite. Descend into the Halls of Torment where the Lords of the underworld await you. Treasures, magical trinkets, and a growing cast of heroes will grant you the power to vanquish these horrors from beyond. How long can you survive?','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2218750/Halls_of_Torment/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1882,'canvas_of_kings',NULL,'Canvas of Kings is a minimalistic mapmaking tool that focuses on randomness and auto-generated elements on user-definable and interactive paths, plots and rooms.','2023/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2498570/Canvas_of_Kings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1883,'baldur\'s_gate_ii:_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Rediscover the beloved RPG classic— now enhanced for modern adventurers! Gather your party of heroes and continue the legendary adventure in this story-rich fantasy epic where every choice matters.','2013/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/257350/Baldurs_Gate_II_Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1884,'old_skies',NULL,'A time travel adventure spanning two hundred years! Dive into the past with time agent Fia Quinn as she embarks on seven trips through time. History is up for grabs, from the speakeasies of Prohibition to the vicious gangs of the Gilded Age to the World Trade Center on September 10, 2001.','2025/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1346360/Old_Skies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1885,'scarlet_hollow',NULL,'You\'ve finally made it to the dead-end mining town of Scarlet Hollow, North Carolina, where your aunt is dead, your cousin hates you, and something otherworldly stalks you from the shadows. You won\'t be able to save everyone. You might not even be able to save yourself. Welcome home.','2021/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1609230/Scarlet_Hollow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1886,'potionomics',NULL,'You’ve inherited your uncle’s potion shop—and a huge debt. Better get brewing! Customize your store, hire heroes to gather ingredients, befriend (or romance) fellow vendors to learn new haggling strategies, and go head-to-head with competitors in this narrative-driven, deck-building shop simulator.','2022/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1874490/Potionomics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_39'),(1887,'caravan_sandwitch',NULL,'Embark on a journey across vast landscapes in Caravan SandWitch, a captivating narrative-driven exploration adventure.','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1582650/Caravan_SandWitch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1888,'outlast:_whistleblower_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Outlast on Steam in order to play.','2014/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/273300/Outlast_Whistleblower_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1889,'sorry_we\'re_closed',NULL,'Sorry We\'re Closed is an eccentric story-driven survival horror game about demons, angels and what happens when both sides collide. A mix of classic fixed-camera exploration and arcade-style shooting where Michelle must use her Third Eye to see between worlds, uncover secrets and solve puzzles.','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1796580/Sorry_Were_Closed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1890,'stormworks:_search_and_destroy',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stormworks: Build and Rescue on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1542360/Stormworks_Search_and_Destroy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1891,'clone_drone_in_the_danger_zone',NULL,'Clone Drone in the Danger Zone is a robot voxel slice-em-up where any part of your body can be sliced off. With your mind downloaded into a robot gladiator, you must survive the sinister trials of the arena.','2021/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/597170/Clone_Drone_in_the_Danger_Zone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1892,'xcom_2:_war_of_the_chosen',NULL,'This content requires the base game XCOM® 2 on Steam in order to play.','2018/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/593380/XCOM_2_War_of_the_Chosen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1893,'assetto_corsa_-_dream_pack_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa on Steam in order to play.','2015/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/423630/Assetto_Corsa__Dream_Pack_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1894,'warhammer_40,000:_battlesector_-_astra_militarum',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3202720/Warhammer_40000_Battlesector__Astra_Militarum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1895,'life_is_strange_2',NULL,'After a tragic incident, brothers Sean and Daniel Diaz run away from home. Fearing the police, and dealing with Daniel\'s new telekinetic power, the boys head to Mexico. Each stop on their journey brings new friends and new challenges.','2018/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/532210/Life_is_Strange_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1896,'amnesia:_the_bunker',NULL,'Amnesia: The Bunker is a first-person horror game set in a WW1 bunker. A relentless, AI-driven monster stalks you. Survival depends on finding tools, crafting items, and keeping the lights on.','2023/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1944430/Amnesia_The_Bunker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1897,'yes,_your_grace',NULL,'These are troubling times, Your Grace. The petitioners’ petty matters exceed our limited resources, to say nothing of the war. A careful balance must be struck. Your throne awaits.','2020/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1115690/Yes_Your_Grace/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1898,'age_of_empires_ii:_definitive_edition_-_return_of_rome',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2141580/Age_of_Empires_II_Definitive_Edition__Return_of_Rome/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1899,'contractors_showdown_:_exfilzone',NULL,'Contractors Showdown delivers adrenaline-fueled VR combat with two distinct modes: fast-paced Battle Royale and the immersive, tactical Exfil Zone. Customize your loadout, complete missions, and fight to survive in dynamic, high-stakes battles. Gear up, squad up, and dominate the VR battlefield!','2024/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2719160/Contractors_Showdown__ExfilZone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1900,'geckoshop',NULL,'Collect and sell geckos. Manage and upgrade your shop. Explore the island, filled with life and secrets. Sell your geckos, or keep \'em as your Pets!','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3392420/GeckoShop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1901,'boneworks',NULL,'BONEWORKS is an Experimental Physics VR Adventure. Use found physics weapons, tools, and objects to fight across dangerous playscapes and mysterious architecture.','2019/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/823500/BONEWORKS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1902,'the_operator',NULL,'Welcome to the FDI. As our newest Operator, your role is to use your detective skills to assist our field agents and investigate mysterious crimes. Use cutting-edge FDI software to dig for clues, solve puzzles, and uncover the truth.','2024/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1771980/The_Operator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1903,'let\'s_build_a_zoo',NULL,'It\'s time to Build a Zoo! Construct and decorate enclosures, buy and breed animals, hire zookeepers and vets... then try your hand at DNA splicing, and stitch together over 300,000 different types of animal. This can only go smoothly...','2021/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1547890/Lets_Build_a_Zoo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1904,'dungeons_&_dragons_neverwinter_nights_2:_enhanced_edition',NULL,'The Fate of The Forgotten Realms is in Your Hands. Return to the city of Neverwinter in Dungeons & Dragons Neverwinter Nights 2: Enhanced Edition.','2025/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2738630/Dungeons__Dragons_Neverwinter_Nights_2_Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1905,'last_epoch_-_woven_legend_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Last Epoch on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3512600/Last_Epoch__Woven_Legend_Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1906,'monster_hunter_wilds_-_alma_outfit:_cammy_outfit_-_sf6',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Hunter Wilds on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3360500/Monster_Hunter_Wilds__Alma_Outfit_Cammy_Outfit__SF6/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1907,'zort',NULL,'Zort is an action, adventure, and horror game that can be played with up to 4 people. Explore maps with your friends and have fun while escaping from various creatures. Experience a realistic horror experience with in-game voice chat with your friends!','2024/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3121110/Zort/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1908,'spiral_knights',NULL,'Join the ranks of the Spiral Knights. Stranded on an alien world, you must explore the ever-changing Clockworks beneath its surface.','2011/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/99900/Spiral_Knights/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1909,'fran_bow',NULL,'Fran Bow is a creepy adventure game that tells the story of Fran, a young girl struggling with a mental disorder and an unfair destiny.','2015/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/362680/Fran_Bow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1910,'summer_memories',NULL,'It\'s summer break, and it\'s been years since you\'ve last seen your aunt and cousins in the countryside! You don\'t know what to expect, but what could go wrong? Find out in Summer Memories!','2020/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1227890/Summer_Memories/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1911,'disney_speedstorm',NULL,'Welcome to Disney Speedstorm! Drift into the ultimate hero-based combat racing game, set on high-speed circuits inspired by Disney and Pixar worlds. Master each character’s unique skills and claim victory in this thrilling arcade racing experience from the creators of the Asphalt series!','2023/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1537830/Disney_Speedstorm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1912,'assassin\'s_creed®_iii_remastered',NULL,'Relive the American Revolution or experience it for the first time in Assassin\'s Creed® III Remastered, with enhanced graphics and improved gameplay mechanics. Also includes Assassin\'s Creed Liberation remastered and all solo DLC content.','2019/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/911400/Assassins_Creed_III_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1913,'dungeon_defenders',NULL,'Create a hero from one of four classes to save Etheria in this 4-player coop Tower Defense Action-RPG. Includes Steam exclusive Portal gun & TF2 familiars!','2011/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/65800/Dungeon_Defenders/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1914,'project:_gorgon',NULL,'Project: Gorgon is a fantasy MMORPG that allows you to forge your own path through exploration and discovery.','2018/3/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/342940/Project_Gorgon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1915,'star_wars™:_dark_forces_remaster',NULL,'The evil Empire is currently creating a doomsday army behind a veil of secrecy. However, they are no match for the Rebel Alliance\'s covert operations division. Your mission is to infiltrate the Empire and put an end to their plans for terror and domination.','2024/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2292260/STAR_WARS_Dark_Forces_Remaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1916,'battle_train',NULL,'Battle Train is a run-based roguelite deck-n-track builder set in the world’s most explosive game show. Choose your cards, upgrade your train, lay down tracks, and use destructive locomotives to blast your rival Champions off the rails in a chaotic mashup of deck-building and tactical rail combat.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1708950/Battle_Train/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1917,'arma_3_creator_dlc:_spearhead_1944',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2023/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1175380/Arma_3_Creator_DLC_Spearhead_1944/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1918,'f.e.a.r._2:_project_origin',NULL,'Assume the role of Special Forces Sgt. Becket as your routine mission quickly turns into a fight for survival against the wrath of Alma Wade. As Alma\'s terrifying power surges out of control, your squad is forced to battle through an apocalyptic landscape in search of clues for how to destroy her!','2009/2/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/16450/FEAR_2_Project_Origin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1919,'the_bus',NULL,'The Bus is the next generation of city bus driving simulation. Sell tickets and transport passengers with various buses on different lines across the German capital Berlin on a realistic scale of 1:1.','2021/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/491540/The_Bus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1920,'monster_train',NULL,'Monster Train is a strategic roguelike deck building game with a twist. Set on a train to hell, you’ll use tactical decision making to defend multiple vertical battlegrounds. With real time competitive multiplayer and endless replayability, Monster Train is always on time.','2020/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1102190/Monster_Train/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1921,'warhammer_40,000:_space_marine_2_-_dark_angels_chapter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2792170/Warhammer_40000_Space_Marine_2__Dark_Angels_Chapter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1922,'dungeon_defenders_ii',NULL,'Dungeon Defenders II is a cooperative Action Tower Defense game packed with roleplaying elements like loot, leveling, and pets.','2017/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/236110/Dungeon_Defenders_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1923,'airborne_empire',NULL,'Build your sky city while exploring a vast landscape in this Open World RPG City Builder. Combining the methodical construction and management of a city builder; the unique lift, balance, and propulsion needed for a flying city; and the compelling characters, dangers, and adventures of an RPG!','2025/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2438680/Airborne_Empire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1924,'mudrunner',NULL,'MudRunner is the ultimate off-road experience putting the players in the driver seat and dares them to take charge of incredible all-terrain vehicles, venturing across extreme Siberian landscapes with only a map and compass as guides!','2017/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/675010/MudRunner/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1925,'liquor_store_simulator',NULL,'Open your own Liquor Store! Buy goods, manage your store, hire staff. Who knows, maybe you will be able to make a real alcohol empire out of a small store.','2025/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3124550/Liquor_Store_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1926,'kayak_vr:_mirage',NULL,'Kayak VR: Mirage is a jaw-dropping and exhilarating journey through beautiful locations, made for Virtual Reality. Maneuver our fully physically accurate kayak around checkpoints and crown yourself the fastest, or take it easy and use the free roam mode and enjoy the scenery.','2022/7/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1683340/Kayak_VR_Mirage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1927,'kingdom_hearts_iii_+_re_mind_(dlc)',NULL,'KINGDOM HEARTS III + Re Mind (DLC) brings one chapter of the series to a close. Travel to exciting new Disney and Pixar worlds, and prepare for the final showdown.','2024/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2552450/KINGDOM_HEARTS_III__Re_Mind_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1928,'deep_rock_galactic_-_skullcrusher_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Deep Rock Galactic on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3481460/Deep_Rock_Galactic__Skullcrusher_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1929,'hitman:_absolution™',NULL,'The original assassin is back! Betrayed by the Agency and hunted by the police, Agent 47 finds himself pursuing redemption in a corrupt and twisted world.','2012/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/203140/Hitman_Absolution/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1930,'five_nights_at_freddy\'s:_help_wanted',NULL,'Five Nights at Freddy’s: Help Wanted is a collection of classic and original mini-games set in the Five Nights universe. Experience the horror in flat (non-VR) mode or VR. Oculus Rift and HTC Vive are supported. A VR Headset is NOT required to play.','2019/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/732690/FIVE_NIGHTS_AT_FREDDYS_HELP_WANTED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1931,'ultimate_general:_american_revolution',NULL,'American Revolution is a sandbox strategy game featuring the epic historical period during the rebellion of the American colonies against the British Empire.','2024/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1901910/Ultimate_General_American_Revolution/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1932,'alien:_rogue_incursion_vr',NULL,'Alien: Rogue Incursion is an all-new action-horror VR game that transforms you into ex-Colonial Marine Zula Hendricks on a dangerous mission to the uncharted planet Purdan, featuring innovative real-life motion gameplay, a whole-body loadout, and the most cunning Xenomorphs ever encountered.','2024/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1850050/Alien_Rogue_Incursion_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1933,'songs_of_silence',NULL,'Lead armies, rebuild fallen kingdoms, and rise to greatness in Songs of Silence. Embark on an epic journey through an Art Nouveau-inspired fantasy world with intense battles and captivating storytelling!','2024/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2195410/Songs_of_Silence/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_40'),(1934,'counter-strike',NULL,'Play the world\'s number 1 online action game. Engage in an incredibly realistic brand of terrorist warfare in this wildly popular team-based game. Ally with teammates to complete strategic missions. Take out enemy sites. Rescue hostages. Your role affects your team\'s success. Your team\'s success affects your role.','2000/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/10/CounterStrike/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1935,'new_arc_line',NULL,'Take a stand in the eternal conflict between Arcane Magic and Steampunk Revolution and tip the uneasy balance between sorcery, elves, dwarves and mysterious monsters on one side and steampunk gadgets, zeppelins, and tesla guns on the other in this single-player, party-based, story-rich RPG.','2024/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2458310/New_Arc_Line/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1936,'granny:_escape_together',NULL,'This is a creepy co-op horror game. In which you find yourself locked in a crazy Granny\'s house. But Granny is not the only danger that awaits you in the house, someone else creepy lives in the basement. You have five days to get out of the house!','2024/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3070520/Granny_Escape_Together/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1937,'astral_ascent',NULL,'Choose one of four heroes and explore the Garden, an astral prison guarded by 12 powerful mystical bosses: the Zodiacs. Challenge them with dozens of unique spells and faithful friends by your side to unfold the story of this platform roguelite with lightning fast combat.','2023/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1280930/Astral_Ascent/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1938,'stoneshard',NULL,'Stoneshard is a challenging turn-based RPG set in an open world. Experience the unforgiving life of a medieval mercenary: travel across the war-torn kingdom, fulfill contracts, fight, mend your wounds and develop your character without any restrictions.','2020/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/625960/Stoneshard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1939,'total_war:_rome_ii_-_caesar_in_gaul_campaign_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ROME II - Emperor Edition on Steam in order to play.','2013/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/261050/Total_War_ROME_II__Caesar_in_Gaul_Campaign_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1940,'viking_rise',NULL,'Race against other players to explore Valhalla and conquer Midgard!','2024/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2819520/Viking_Rise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1941,'mon_bazou',NULL,'Build your crappy vehicle into a race car, install the parts yourself. Make money by cutting wood, racing at night or delivering pizza. Maybe you want to manage a sugar shack or build yourself a big garage?','2021/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1520370/Mon_Bazou/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1942,'fears_to_fathom_-_ironbark_lookout',NULL,'Jack Nelson, a 24-year-old fire lookout, transferred to a new outpost. As he settled into his new home, he couldn\'t shake the feeling that something was off, little did he know what was transpiring down in Ironbark State Park.','2023/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2506160/Fears_to_Fathom__Ironbark_Lookout/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1943,'farming_simulator_25_-_plains_&_prairies_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Farming Simulator 25 on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3453950/Farming_Simulator_25__Plains__Prairies_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1944,'aliens_vs._predator™',NULL,'Survive, hunt and prey in the deadly jungles and swamps in distinctly new and thrilling first person gameplay.','2010/2/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/10680/Aliens_vs_Predator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1945,'wrench',NULL,'Wrench is a mechanic simulator where players prepare and maintain race cars. The parts in Wrench are the most detailed of any game in the genre. Extreme attention has been paid to even the smallest components, including fasteners which are accurate to the thread pitch and install torque.','2018/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/936720/Wrench/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1946,'monopoly_poker',NULL,'Go all-in on fun and fortune! Welcome to the official MONOPOLY Poker game, the ultimate Texas Hold’em poker experience with a board game twist! Step into a world where online poker meets property-building, and every poker hand brings you closer to building your own empire.','2021/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1474700/MONOPOLY_Poker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1947,'sunset_overdrive',NULL,'Sunset Overdrive transforms an open-world apocalypse into your tactical playground. Zip, grind and wall-run across Sunset City with an unconventional arsenal. Hyper-agility, unique weapons, and customizable abilities deliver an explosive and irreverent adventure in the end times.','2018/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/847370/Sunset_Overdrive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1948,'the_jackbox_party_pack_5',NULL,'It’s the biggest Party Pack yet, including the return of the classic pop culture trivia mash-up YOU DON’T KNOW JACK: Full Stream; the game of hilarious hypotheticals Split the Room; the lyric-writing, robot rap battle Mad Verse City; the inventive drawing game Patently Stupid; and the outer space fling-fest Zeeple Dome.','2018/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/774461/The_Jackbox_Party_Pack_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1949,'the_outlast_trials_-_sweet_release_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Outlast Trials on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3518320/The_Outlast_Trials__Sweet_Release_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1950,'witch_on_the_holy_night',NULL,'A tale told with vivid colors and rich sound in a classic TYPE-MOON visual novel.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2052410/WITCH_ON_THE_HOLY_NIGHT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1951,'lego®_marvel\'s_avengers',NULL,'Avengers Assemble! The best-selling LEGO® MARVEL videogame franchise returns with a new action-packed, Super Hero adventure.','2016/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/405310/LEGO_MARVELs_Avengers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1952,'volcano_princess',NULL,'Prepare the next monarch by finding her hobbies, training her for battle, and befriending the citizens she\'ll one day protect. Dive into an all-new parenting-simulator-RPG adventure, where every decision you make will not only affect the future of your daughter but that of an entire empire!','2023/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1669980/Volcano_Princess/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1953,'age_of_empires_ii:_definitive_edition_-_the_mountain_royals',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2555420/Age_of_Empires_II_Definitive_Edition__The_Mountain_Royals/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1954,'anno_117:_pax_romana',NULL,'From the award-winning Anno series: shape the Roman Empire in 117 AD. Will you encourage economic growth or expand through dominance? Lead with rebellion or unite cultures? The cost of peace is yours to decide.','2025/11/13','Unreleased','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3274580/Anno_117_Pax_Romana/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1955,'dynasty_warriors_8:_xtreme_legends_complete_edition',NULL,'\"Dynasty Warriors 8: Xtreme Legends\" introduces entirely new levels of fun to the refreshing gameplay vanquishing swarms of enemies with mighty warriors found in \"Dynasty Warriors 8.\"','2014/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/278080/DYNASTY_WARRIORS_8_Xtreme_Legends_Complete_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1956,'memoriapolis',NULL,'In Memoriapolis, you\'re not just building a city, you\'re shaping a living, evolving civilization. Travel through five major eras, from Antiquity to the Industrial Revolution. Leave your mark on history by navigating the power struggles between rival factions.','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2228280/MEMORIAPOLIS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1957,'dead_by_daylight_-_sadako_rising_chapter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1899750/Dead_by_Daylight__Sadako_Rising_Chapter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1958,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_emerald_coast_australia',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2383430/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Emerald_Coast_Australia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1959,'get_to_work',NULL,'You are poor and bald. Get to Work.','2024/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2706170/Get_To_Work/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1960,'going_medieval',NULL,'Build and manage your own castle settlement in a land reclaimed by wilderness. With detailed management, survival strategy, and a moddable sandbox world, Going Medieval challenges you to build the mightiest colony this side of the apocalypse.','2021/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1029780/Going_Medieval/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1961,'tavern_talk',NULL,'A cozy visual novel about running a tavern in a D&D-inspired fantasy! Gather rumors, serve magical drinks, and meet adventurers on a life-changing quest.','2024/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2076140/Tavern_Talk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1962,'fahrenheit:_indigo_prophecy_remastered',NULL,'Fahrenheit (known as Indigo Prophecy in North America) was a breakthrough in interactive narrative. This newly remastered edition features updated textures in HD, expanded controller support, and is based on the uncut and uncensored international version of the game.','2015/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/312840/Fahrenheit_Indigo_Prophecy_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1963,'inside',NULL,'Hunted and alone, a boy finds himself drawn into the center of a dark project. INSIDE is a dark, narrative-driven platformer combining intense action with challenging puzzles. It has been critically acclaimed for its moody art style, ambient soundtrack and unsettling atmosphere.','2016/7/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/304430/INSIDE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1964,'saints_row:_the_third',NULL,'Get ready for the most out-landish gameplay scenarios ever seen as the Third Street Saints take on the Syndicate!','2011/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/55230/Saints_Row_The_Third/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1965,'ark:_extinction_-_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game ARK: Survival Evolved on Steam in order to play.','2018/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/887380/ARK_Extinction__Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1966,'total_war:_rome_ii_-_hannibal_at_the_gates_campaign_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ROME II - Emperor Edition on Steam in order to play.','2014/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/273380/Total_War_ROME_II__Hannibal_at_the_Gates_Campaign_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1967,'eden_crafters',NULL,'Embark on a journey of survival, crafting, and automation in Eden Crafters, a solo and co-op open-world game that challenges you to turn a hostile planet into a habitable haven for humanity. Temper the climate, create a breathable atmosphere, and turn toxic lakes into water: shape a new world!','2024/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2570210/Eden_Crafters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1968,'wayfinder',NULL,'Become a Wayfinder, and unlock their powers as you choose your path and playstyle while pushing back a hostile force that has overtaken your world. A Co-Op ARPG where you directly shape and customize the endless adventures you go on with friends, because Wayfinders are stronger together.','2024/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1171690/Wayfinder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1969,'mini_metro',NULL,'Mini Metro is a strategy simulation game about designing a subway map for a growing city. Draw lines between stations and start your trains running. As new stations open, redraw your lines to keep them efficient. Decide where to use your limited resources. How long can you keep the city moving?','2015/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/287980/Mini_Metro/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1970,'total_war:_warhammer_ii_-_the_queen_&_the_crone',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2018/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/779880/Total_War_WARHAMMER_II__The_Queen__The_Crone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1971,'death\'s_door',NULL,'Reaping souls of the dead and punching a clock might get monotonous but it\'s honest work for a Crow. The job gets lively when your assigned soul is stolen and you must track down a desperate thief to a realm untouched by death - where creatures grow far past their expiry.','2021/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/894020/Deaths_Door/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1972,'papa\'s_pizzeria_deluxe',NULL,'Top, bake, and serve delicious pizzas in Papa\'s Pizzeria Deluxe! Craft pizzas for Papa Louie\'s loyal customers while earning tips, points, and Special Recipes. Unlock holiday ingredients for seasonal pies, and take a