 emergency number operator every day!','2020/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/793460/112_Operator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1979,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_sundarpatan_nepal_hunting_reserve',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2869680/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Sundarpatan_Nepal_Hunting_Reserve/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1980,'heroes_of_valor',NULL,'This is war, soldier. Pick a class, gear up, and hit the front lines. Whether you\'re storming beaches, piloting fighters, or holding the line with your squad, your orders are clear: fight hard, fight smart, and never back down. Enlist now! Become a Hero of Valor today!','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2504090/Heroes_of_Valor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1981,'go-go_town!',NULL,'Plan, Build...Prosper? As mayor, it’s up to you to breathe life back into this rundown town. Construct shops, hire staff, automate deliveries with couriers, and attract tourists to town, all while managing infrastructure and avoiding catastrophes! Who said being mayor was going to be easy…','2024/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2195120/GoGo_Town/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1982,'f1®_24',NULL,'Join the grid and Be One of the 20. Drive like the greatest in EA SPORTS™ F1® 24, the official video game of the 2024 FIA Formula One World Championship™.','2024/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2488620/F1_24/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_41'),(1983,'gunfire_reborn_-_realm_of_frost_and_inkwash',NULL,'This content requires the base game Gunfire Reborn on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3063250/Gunfire_Reborn__Realm_of_Frost_and_Inkwash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1984,'wandering_sword_-_secrets_of_the_eastern_sea',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wandering Sword on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3600640/Wandering_Sword__Secrets_of_the_Eastern_Sea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1985,'ark:_scorched_earth_-_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game ARK: Survival Evolved on Steam in order to play.','2016/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/512540/ARK_Scorched_Earth__Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1986,'metal_thunder',NULL,'Command the legendary gunship in a high-octane action-roguelite! Engage insurgents with devastating firepower in ever-changing missions. Upgrade your arsenal, adapt to dynamic challenges, and survive relentless waves of enemies. Every run offers new tactics and chaos as you dominate the skies.','2024/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3091340/Metal_Thunder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1987,'my_dream_setup',NULL,'My Dream Setup is a simulation game about building the room you\'ve always dreamed of. A huge selection of furniture, computers and their accessories, posters, pictures, plants, and other interior details await you. Try all of them and create your dream setup.','2023/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2200780/My_Dream_Setup/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1988,'le_mans_ultimate_-_2024_pack_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game Le Mans Ultimate on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3260810/Le_Mans_Ultimate__2024_Pack_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1989,'vtube_studio_-_remove_watermark',NULL,'This content requires the base application VTube Studio on Steam in order to run.','2021/3/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1520620/VTube_Studio__Remove_Watermark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1990,'x4:_kingdom_end',NULL,'This content requires the base game X4: Foundations on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1990040/X4_Kingdom_End/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1991,'wgt_golf',NULL,'Experience iconic golf courses like Pebble Beach, St Andrews and Wolf Creek in the most realistic free golf game, and connect with millions of players all over the world!','2020/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1182020/WGT_Golf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1992,'demon_slayer_-kimetsu_no_yaiba-_the_hinokami_chronicles',NULL,'Become the Blade that Destroys Demons!','2021/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1490890/Demon_Slayer_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_The_Hinokami_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1993,'the_forgotten_city',NULL,'The Forgotten City is a narrative-driven time loop adventure in ancient Rome. Discover the ruins of an ancient underground city, travel 2000 years into the past, and unravel the mystery of who destroyed it by cleverly exploiting the power to wind back time. The fate of the city is in your hands.','2021/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/874260/The_Forgotten_City/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1994,'gears_5',NULL,'From one of gaming’s most acclaimed sagas, Gears is bigger than ever. With all-out war descending, Kait Diaz breaks away to uncover her connection to the enemy and discovers the true danger to Sera – herself.','2019/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1097840/Gears_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1995,'planet_zoo:_africa_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1647620/Planet_Zoo_Africa_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1996,'spray_paint_simulator',NULL,'Bring color to the world in Spray Paint Simulator! Restore worn-out surfaces with a fresh coat of paint and watch them come back to life. Use your spray tool with precision, cover every inch, and enjoy the satisfaction of a flawless finish.','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1811340/Spray_Paint_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1997,'the_stanley_parable',NULL,'The Stanley Parable is a first person exploration game. You will play as Stanley, and you will not play as Stanley. You will follow a story, you will not follow a story. You will have a choice, you will have no choice. The game will end, the game will never end.','2013/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/221910/The_Stanley_Parable/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1998,'metal_gear_solid_2:_sons_of_liberty_-_master_collection_version',NULL,'The fourth game in the METAL GEAR series: set over two incidents in 2007 and 2009, featuring Solid Snake and Raiden, introducing new stealth gameplay features.','2023/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2131640/METAL_GEAR_SOLID_2_Sons_of_Liberty__Master_Collection_Version/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(1999,'chrono_ark',NULL,'Chrono Ark is a singleplayer roguelike that combines elements from deckbuilders and party-based RPGs. Recruit, train, and build a team of unique Investigators to restore the Twisted World!','2024/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1188930/Chrono_Ark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2000,'return_to_monkey_island',NULL,'Return to Monkey Island is an unexpected, thrilling return of series creator Ron Gilbert that continues the story of the legendary adventure games.','2022/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2060130/Return_to_Monkey_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2001,'american_truck_simulator_-_colorado',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1209471/American_Truck_Simulator__Colorado/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2002,'tom_clancy’s_splinter_cell_blacklist',NULL,'The United States has a military presence in two-thirds of countries around the world, and some of them have had enough. A group of terrorists calling themselves The Engineers initiate a terror ultimatum called the Blacklist - a deadly countdown of escalating attacks on U.S. interests.','2013/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/235600/Tom_Clancys_Splinter_Cell_Blacklist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2003,'expeditions:_rome',NULL,'Determine the destiny of Rome as you conquer foreign lands and navigate political intrigue in this turn-based RPG. Directly fight with your party of Praetorians, guide your legion to victory, and choose your own path in a story where every decision matters. How will you shape the future of Rome?','2022/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/987840/Expeditions_Rome/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2004,'xcom:_enemy_unknown',NULL,'The XCOM: Enemy Unknown - Slingshot Pack is Now Available!','2012/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/200510/XCOM_Enemy_Unknown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2005,'chillquarium',NULL,'Chillquarium is a cozy and relaxing idle game. Buy fish and raise them in real time, then sell them to turn a profit! Customize your aquarium as you progress from a simple starter tank to your dream setup by filling your collection with rare exotic fish and ultra-rare color variants!','2023/9/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2276930/Chillquarium/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2006,'train_sim_world®_5:_spoorlijn_zwolle_-_groningen_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2971270/Train_Sim_World_5_Spoorlijn_Zwolle__Groningen_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2007,'the_walking_dead:_season_two',NULL,'The Walking Dead: Season Two continues the story of Clementine, a young girl orphaned by the undead apocalypse. Left to fend for herself, she has been forced to learn how to survive in a world gone mad.','2013/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/261030/The_Walking_Dead_Season_Two/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2008,'a_quiet_place:_the_road_ahead',NULL,'A Quiet Place: The Road Ahead is a single-player horror adventure game inspired by the critically acclaimed blockbuster movie franchise. Survive in silence.','2024/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2233120/A_Quiet_Place_The_Road_Ahead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2009,'the_jackbox_party_pack_10',NULL,'Become a party legend! The celebrated franchise returns with epic drawing battles in Tee K.O. 2, chaotic type-offs in FixyText, time-travel trivia in Timejinx, hidden identity intrigue in Hypnotorious, and group music-making in Dodo Re Mi.','2023/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2216830/The_Jackbox_Party_Pack_10/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2010,'craftcraft:_fantasy_merchant_simulator',NULL,'CraftCraft is a story-based RPG merchant sim with hands on crafting! Create a pretty necklace for a mermaid or a sword made of dragon blood! Be a Moth or an Elf or a Cat and express your creativity in your cozy crafting studio and change the lives of locals in the mysterious port town of Windspell.','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2226430/CraftCraft_Fantasy_Merchant_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2011,'the_jackbox_party_pack_4',NULL,'The fourth pack in this storied party game franchise features Fibbage 3 and its new game mode, Fibbage: Enough About You; the twisted web game Survive the Internet; the dating contest Monster Seeking Monster; the deranged debate match Bracketeering; and the one-up art game Civic Doodle.','2017/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/610180/The_Jackbox_Party_Pack_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2012,'monster_prom_3:_monster_roadtrip',NULL,'Embark on a road trip like no other in this co-op narrative survival adventure. Visit fun locations, meet wacky characters, and manage your resources wisely. And yes: you still can date some hot monsters ;)','2022/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1665190/Monster_Prom_3_Monster_Roadtrip/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2013,'royal_quest_online',NULL,'Fantasy comes alive in this vast yet cozy free-to-play MMORPG! Choose between 4 classes and 8 subclasses, explore hundreds of locations, thousands of quests, dive into varied PvE and PvP modes, enter the unique vibrant world, and trade with other players. Play, explore, fight and be victorious!','2024/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2962300/Royal_Quest_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2014,'copycat',NULL,'A poignant narrative-driven game about rejection, belonging and the meaning of home. It follows the story of a newly adopted shelter cat whose space in the home is taken by a copycat. Bring the tissues.','2024/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1622350/Copycat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2015,'bank_simulator',NULL,'Bank Simulator is a realistic bank management game where you build, manage, and expand your financial empire. Hire staff, approve loans, invest in bonds, handle customer accounts, and run marketing campaigns, all while navigating financial challenges.','2025/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3355800/Bank_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2016,'megaquarium',NULL,'The public aquarium simulator. Design your displays, look after your fish, manage your staff and keep your guests happy! It\'s all in a day\'s work as the curator of your very own Megaquarium.','2018/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/600480/Megaquarium/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2017,'crypt_custodian',NULL,'Crypt Custodian is a charming metroidvania about cleaning up the afterlife. Play as Pluto - a mischievous cat who has died, and is sentenced to be the afterworld\'s janitor... FOREVER! Hang out with other doomed ghosts, battle beasts, and explore a vastly expansive landscape.','2024/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2394650/Crypt_Custodian/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2018,'mordhau',NULL,'MORDHAU is a multiplayer medieval slasher. Create your mercenary and fight in brutal battles where you will experience fast paced combat, castle sieges, cavalry charges, and more.','2019/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/629760/MORDHAU/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2019,'arma_3_creator_dlc:_expeditionary_forces',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2647830/Arma_3_Creator_DLC_Expeditionary_Forces/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2020,'planet_zoo:_wetlands_animal_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1934140/Planet_Zoo_Wetlands_Animal_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2021,'airportsim',NULL,'AirportSim is an Advanced Airport Ground Handling Simulator with true-to-life visuals and operations, licensed planes and vehicles, real airports and live weather conditions. Enjoy the many tasks alone or with friends, making this experience unforgettable.','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1715280/AirportSim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2022,'lunacid',NULL,'Cast into the Great Well, unwanted by the world above. You delve the dark in search of the Old One, your last salvation. Lunacid is a dark fantasy dungeon crawler inspired by Shadow Tower and King’s Field.','2023/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1745510/Lunacid/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2023,'walkabout_mini_golf_vr',NULL,'Escape into a fun and beautiful world filled with the best mini golf courses you’ve ever seen! Play by yourself, meet someone new, or challenge your friends in a private game with up to 8 people. Extremely realistic physics create the perfect experience for hardcore golfers and casual players alike.','2021/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1408230/Walkabout_Mini_Golf_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2024,'wordatro!',NULL,'Wordatro! fuses addictive word game with thrilling roguelite strategy! Spell high-scoring words, chain massive combos, and unlock game-changing bonuses. With 50+ unique upgrades and daily challenges, endless linguistic adventures await!','2025/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3140120/Wordatro/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2025,'warhammer_40,000:_rogue_trader_-_voidfarer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Rogue Trader on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2682670/Warhammer_40000_Rogue_Trader__Voidfarer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2026,'kletka',NULL,'KLETKA is a co-op (up to 6 players) horror game about going down in an elevator that is trying to eat you. Feed the elevator, explore deadly floors and descend deeper.','2024/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1699480/KLETKA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2027,'middle-earth™:_shadow_of_mordor™',NULL,'Fight through Mordor and uncover the truth of the spirit that compels you, discover the origins of the Rings of Power, build your legend and ultimately confront the evil of Sauron in this new chronicle of Middle-earth.','2014/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/241930/Middleearth_Shadow_of_Mordor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2028,'once_human_-_ascend_daily_theme_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Once Human on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3816110/Once_Human__Ascend_Daily_Theme_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2029,'ni_no_kuni_wrath_of_the_white_witch™_remastered',NULL,'Journey back to the other world in Ni no Kuni: Wrath of the White Witch™ Remastered. LEVEL-5’s classic tale returns better than ever, with improved graphics and performance.','2019/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/798460/Ni_no_Kuni_Wrath_of_the_White_Witch_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2030,'total_war:_warhammer_ii_-_the_hunter_&_the_beast',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2019/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1074320/Total_War_WARHAMMER_II__The_Hunter__The_Beast/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2031,'die_in_the_dungeon',NULL,'Fight your way through a mysterious dungeon in this deck-building, turn-based roguelike game where you don\'t use cards, but dice! Deal with enemies by combining powerful dice on your board, boost their effects with magical relics, and risk it all hoping for a good roll on unexpected encounters.','2025/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2026820/Die_in_the_Dungeon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2032,'lynked:_banner_of_the_spark',NULL,'Build a bright new world alongside a band of rescued robot buddies! In this colorful action RPG, battle waves of enemies in solo or co-op, then return home and use their parts to craft a thriving town. Assemble your crew and grow stronger with each new adventure!','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3159570/Lynked_Banner_of_the_Spark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_42'),(2033,'highfleet',NULL,'Battle for survival in the skies of a mysterious future Earth in this unique action-strategy game mixing arcade combat, exploration, management and diplomacy. As giant flying ships wage spectacular aerial warfare, a prophecy tells of one who will save the world – could it be you?','2021/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1434950/HighFleet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2034,'blood_west',NULL,'Weird west legends meet eldritch horror in BLOOD WEST, an immersive stealth FPS. Become the Undead Gunslinger, doomed to roam the barren lands until he manages to purge their curse, freeing his soul. 3 varied scenarios, perk-based character progression, and 20+ hours of gameplay await you!','2023/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1587130/Blood_West/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2035,'lego®_jurassic_world',NULL,'Following the epic storylines of Jurassic Park, The Lost World: Jurassic Park and Jurassic Park III, as well as the highly anticipated Jurassic World, LEGO Jurassic World™ is the first videogame where players will be able to relive and experience all four Jurassic films.','2015/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/352400/LEGO_Jurassic_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2036,'escape_academy',NULL,'Welcome to Escape Academy. Train to become the ultimate Escapist. Solve Puzzles. Hack Servers. Meet the Faculty. Brew the perfect cup of tea. Escape Rooms in single player or co-op with a friend - local or online!','2022/7/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1812090/Escape_Academy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2037,'mushroom_musume',NULL,'Raise a mushroom from a spore into a fine young woman, then discover the twists and turns her life may take in this creepy-cute fairytale life simulation game.','2025/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2484580/Mushroom_Musume/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2038,'pseudoregalia',NULL,'Deep within the realm of sleep, Sybil finds herself pulled to a distorted castle. Grow strong, and unlock new abilities to build up a deep movement system, fight enemies, find secrets, and free the weary soul of Castle Sansa, in this retro-inspired 3D Platformer Metroidvania.','2023/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2365810/Pseudoregalia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2039,'tavern_master',NULL,'Tavern Master is all about managing your medieval tavern. You start with a very small room, couple of benches and tables and build your way up to a huge successful tavern with a kitchen, rooms for guests, group of loyal staff and much more!','2021/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1525700/Tavern_Master/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2040,'dead_by_daylight_-_alan_wake_chapter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2661250/Dead_by_Daylight__Alan_Wake_Chapter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2041,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_jcb_equipment_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2780800/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__JCB_Equipment_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2042,'tyranny',NULL,'Experience a story-driven RPG where your choices mean all the difference in the world.','2016/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/362960/Tyranny/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2043,'terratech',NULL,'TerraTech is an open-world, sandbox adventure game, where you design and build your own creations through a mix of crafting, combat and discovery. Design vehicles from a huge library of blocks. Scavenge, craft and buy new parts to survive and become the ultimate planetary prospector.','2018/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/285920/TerraTech/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2044,'roadcraft_–_aramatsu_bowhead_30t',NULL,'This content requires the base game RoadCraft on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2806770/RoadCraft__Aramatsu_Bowhead_30T/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2045,'slitterhead',NULL,'\"I must eliminate them...ALL...\" The bodiless \"Hyoki\" hunts down the brain-devouring \"Slitterheads\", lurking in the alleys of a neon-lit city','2024/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2631250/Slitterhead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2046,'state_of_survival',NULL,'Survive the Zombies War in this RPG game of Apocalypse and Survival','2023/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2485460/State_of_Survival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2047,'touhou_mystia\'s_izakaya',NULL,'A brand new pixel art restaurant simulator based on the Touhou Project! Play as Mystia, the owner of a small izakaya. Collect ingredients by day, cater to the customers by night, learn recipes from familiar characters, and become the best izakaya owner in all of Gensokyo!','2021/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1584090/Touhou_Mystias_Izakaya/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2048,'naruto_x_boruto_ultimate_ninja_storm_connections',NULL,'Legendary ninjas reunite in the next exciting entry of the STORM series! NARUTO X BORUTO Ultimate Ninja STORM CONNECTIONS is an action/fighting game with fast-paced ninja battles and two different story modes.','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1020790/NARUTO_X_BORUTO_Ultimate_Ninja_STORM_CONNECTIONS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2049,'brutalistick_vr',NULL,'The golden age of violent flash games now in your VR headset. Fully physics based combat with melee and firearms featuring copious amounts of blood, gore and destruction.','2024/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2669380/BRUTALISTICK_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2050,'the_exit_8',NULL,'You are trapped in an endless underground passageway. Observe your surroundings carefully to reach \"The Exit 8\".','2023/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2653790/The_Exit_8/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2051,'ultimate_marvel_vs._capcom_3',NULL,'Marvel and Capcom join forces to deliver the most frenetic 3 vs 3 tag battles ever with Ultimate Marvel VS Capcom 3. This release comes fully loaded, including all previous DLC, Marvel VS. Capcom : Official Complete Works.','2017/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/357190/ULTIMATE_MARVEL_VS_CAPCOM_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2052,'suzerain:_kingdom_of_rizia',NULL,'This content requires the base game Suzerain on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2352340/Suzerain_Kingdom_of_Rizia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2053,'conquest_of_elysium_5',NULL,'Conquest of Elysium 5 is a quick turn based fantasy strategy game with a touch of rogue-like. The game is full of depth, details and monsters. There are also a huge number of factions, each with its own unique gameplay and magic rituals.','2021/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1606340/Conquest_of_Elysium_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2054,'bloodshed',NULL,'Bloodshed is a Roguelite Survivors FPS; an exhilarating fusion of Roguelite elements merged with retro-styled visuals and first-person “Survivors-like” frenetic combat action!','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2747550/Bloodshed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2055,'call_of_duty:_united_offensive',NULL,'Award-winning developer Gray Matter Interactive follows up on the success of Infinity Ward\'s Call of Duty™ - winner of over 80 Game of the Year and 50 Editors\' Choice awards worldwide - with Call of Duty™: United Offensive™.','2004/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2640/Call_of_Duty_United_Offensive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2056,'saints_row',NULL,'Welcome to Santo Ileso, a vibrant fictional city in the American Southwest. In a world rife with crime, where lawless factions fight for power, a group of young friends embark on their own criminal venture, as they rise to the top in their bid to become Self Made.','2023/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/742420/Saints_Row/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2057,'a_plague_tale:_innocence',NULL,'Follow the grim tale of young Amicia and her little brother Hugo, in a heartrending journey through the darkest hours of history.','2019/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/752590/A_Plague_Tale_Innocence/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2058,'xenonauts_2',NULL,'Wage a global war of resistance against an alien invasion. Command turn-based tactical battles, build a network of covert bases, directly control your fighter wings, and achieve strategic victory in a simulation of asymmetric warfare against a technologically superior foe.','2023/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/538030/Xenonauts_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2059,'lonestar',NULL,'LONESTAR is a strategic Roguelike spaceship deckbuilder. As a bounty hunter, you will capture criminals scattered across the universe. Win the shockwave battle to gain rewards and vacations. Find treasures, customize spaceships, unlock talents, defeat the felons and be a legend!','2025/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2056210/LONESTAR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2060,'age_of_wonders_4:_eldritch_realms',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Wonders 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2401860/Age_of_Wonders_4_Eldritch_Realms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2061,'v_rising_-_sinister_evolution_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game V Rising on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2358430/V_Rising__Sinister_Evolution_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2062,'age_of_darkness:_final_stand',NULL,'Age of Darkness: Final Stand is a dark fantasy survival RTS where you must illuminate, build and defend humanity’s last bastion against hordes of Nightmares. Set in the remnants of a kingdom consumed by a deadly fog, you decide. Will you hide in the light? Or take back your world.','2025/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1426450/Age_of_Darkness_Final_Stand/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2063,'ryse:_son_of_rome',NULL,'“Ryse: Son of Rome” tells the story of Marius Titus, a young Roman soldier who witnesses the murder of his family at the hands of barbarian bandits, then travels with the Roman army to Britannia to seek revenge.','2014/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/302510/Ryse_Son_of_Rome/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2064,'dagger_directive',NULL,'Dagger Directive is a tactical FPS that allows you to approach each mission in your own way. Select equipment, decide the time of day, then move methodically to complete your mission. Enjoy the modern mechanics and old school graphics as you fight across a variety of missions and environments.','2025/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2437670/Dagger_Directive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2065,'fears_to_fathom_-_woodbury_getaway',NULL,'Sydney Harper, a 23-year-old working at a consulting firm plans a weekend getaway to a Woodbury rental with her college friends. Little did she know what was about to unfold during their stay.','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2961530/Fears_to_Fathom__Woodbury_Getaway/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2066,'hydroneer:_journey_to_volcalidus',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hydroneer on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2659380/Hydroneer_Journey_to_Volcalidus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2067,'heavenly_bodies',NULL,'Wrangle the hands and arms of a 1970s space cosmonaut and push, pull and twist your way through an increasingly precarious range of physically simulated stellar scenarios, where without gravity, nothing is still, nothing is secure, and nothing is simple.','2021/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1138850/Heavenly_Bodies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2068,'poly_bridge_2',NULL,'The acclaimed bridge-building indie-hit is back! More levels, more features, more physics fun!','2020/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1062160/Poly_Bridge_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2069,'squirrel_with_a_gun',NULL,'Squirrel, meet gun. As the neighborhood’s most obnoxious rodent, develop a knack (and a love?) for crime and mayhem in pursuit of golden acorns in this nutty sandbox shooter and puzzle platformer. Fight tooth, claw, and gun to escape a secret underground facility and defeat the Agents.','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2067050/Squirrel_with_a_Gun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2070,'hobo:_tough_life',NULL,'Hobo: Tough Life is an urban survival role-playing game where you play as a homeless person. Play alone or team up in online co-op. Explore the streets of Praslav, scavenge for food and supplies, beg, steal, and do whatever else it takes to survive the forthcoming winter.','2021/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/632300/Hobo_Tough_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2071,'shellshock_live',NULL,'Demolish your friends with hundreds of upgradable weapons shot from your customizable tank in this action-packed online multiplayer tanks game. Earn XP to level up and unlock new tanks, weapons, and gear. Fight against or alongside your friends for strategic team or free-for-all matches.','2020/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/326460/ShellShock_Live/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2072,'assassin\'s_creed™:_director\'s_cut_edition',NULL,'Assassin\'s Creed™ is the next-gen game developed by Ubisoft Montreal that redefines the action genre. While other games claim to be next-gen with impressive graphics and physics, Assassin\'s Creed merges technology, game design, theme and emotions into a world where you instigate chaos and become a vulnerable, yet powerful, agent of...','2008/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/15100/Assassins_Creed_Directors_Cut_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2073,'planetside_2',NULL,'PlanetSide 2 is an all-out planetary war, where thousands of players battle as one across enormous continents. Utilize infantry, ground and air vehicles, and teamwork to destroy your enemies in this revolutionary first-person shooter on a massive scale.','2012/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/218230/PlanetSide_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2074,'need_for_speed™_payback',NULL,'Set in the underworld of Fortune Valley, you and your crew were divided by betrayal and reunited by revenge to take down The House, a nefarious cartel that rules the city’s casinos, criminals and cops. In this corrupt gambler’s paradise, the stakes are high and The House always wins.','2017/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1262580/Need_for_Speed_Payback/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2075,'tales_from_the_borderlands',NULL,'Tales from the Borderlands is a five-part episodic game set on the unforgiving world of Pandora between the events of Borderlands 2 and Borderlands 3. This is a story full of Borderlands\' trademark humor, following two adventurers on their quest for greatness.','2021/2/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/330830/Tales_from_the_Borderlands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2076,'astlibra_revision',NULL,'Confront time and fate in the 2D action RPG, Astlibra Revision. Explore meticulously crafted worlds, fight brutal boss battles, and upgrade your skills to take down enemies lurking around every corner.','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1718570/ASTLIBRA_Revision/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_43'),(2077,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_onslaught_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3743110/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Onslaught_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2078,'toheart',NULL,'The late-’90s landmark visual novel from AQUAPLUS is back and fully remastered with 3D scenes and animations, full HD resolution, the choice between the original cast or all-new voiceovers, and international translations for the first time ever!','2025/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3380520/ToHeart/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2079,'doodle_empires',NULL,'Doodle Empires is an alternate history sandbox game all about drawing your own nations with your own histories and stories in a variety of maps. Watch your world take shape and evolve over time, and decide which nations will rise and which nations will fall.','2025/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3438800/Doodle_Empires/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2080,'felvidek',NULL,'In Felvidek, a JRPG set in 15th century Slovakia, you embrace the role of an alcoholic knight Pavol. Meet diverse and interesting characters to help you drive out the Hussites and Ottomans who blight this land.','2024/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2299900/Felvidek/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2081,'ranch_simulator:_southwest_ranch_&_farm_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ranch Simulator: Build, Hunt, Farm on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3255980/Ranch_Simulator_Southwest_Ranch__Farm_Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2082,'deus_ex:_mankind_divided',NULL,'You play as Adam Jensen, an experienced covert operative operating in a world that despises his kind: augmented humans. Choose from an arsenal of state-of-the-art weapons and augmentations to build your playstyle, and decide who you\'ll trust, to unravel a vast worldwide conspiracy.','2016/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/337000/Deus_Ex_Mankind_Divided/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2083,'the_great_ace_attorney_chronicles',NULL,'Immerse yourself in a dramatic yet charming and witty world of evidence-gathering, deduction and courtroom battles with this double-pack of the adventures of rookie lawyer Ryunosuke.','2021/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1158850/The_Great_Ace_Attorney_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2084,'rune_factory_5',NULL,'As the newest ranger of a peacekeeping organization known as SEED, protect your community by rounding up rowdy monsters and going on special missions. Cultivate your farm and friendships alike while unravelling rune-related mysteries!','2022/7/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1702330/Rune_Factory_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2085,'robocop:_rogue_city_-_unfinished_business',NULL,'Unfinished Business is a new standalone adventure of RoboCop: Rogue City. OmniTower is their fortress, violence their language. Face elite mercenaries all the way to the top of the tower and enforce the law amidst the chaos!','2025/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3527760/RoboCop_Rogue_City__Unfinished_Business/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2086,'brawlhalla_-_all_legends_(current_and_future)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Brawlhalla on Steam in order to play.','2015/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/387020/Brawlhalla__All_Legends_Current_and_Future/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2087,'planet_zoo:_tropical_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2346830/Planet_Zoo_Tropical_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2088,'pools',NULL,'Walking simulator. Explore, admire and listen. Uncanny. Relaxing. Unnerving. Eerie. Immersive. No monsters chasing you or jumping towards at your screen, but can feel oppressive at times by invoking fears of getting lost, the dark, tight spaces and liminal space architecture. Inspired by backrooms.','2024/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2663530/POOLS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2089,'wolfenstein:_youngblood',NULL,'Wolfenstein: Youngblood is the first modern co-op Wolfenstein adventure. Team up with a friend or play solo as one of BJ Blazkowicz’s twin daughters and wield a powerful arsenal of new weapons, gadgets, and abilities to liberate Paris from the Nazis.','2019/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1056960/Wolfenstein_Youngblood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2090,'poppy_playtime_-_chapter_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Poppy Playtime on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1817490/Poppy_Playtime__Chapter_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2091,'patrick\'s_parabox',NULL,'A mind-bending recursive puzzle game about boxes within boxes within boxes within boxes. Learn to use infinity to your advantage as you explore a deep and elegant system.','2022/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1260520/Patricks_Parabox/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2092,'american_truck_simulator_-_idaho',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2020/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1209470/American_Truck_Simulator__Idaho/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2093,'five_nights_at_freddy\'s:_help_wanted_2',NULL,'Five Nights at Freddy’s: Help Wanted 2 is the sequel to the terrifying VR experience that brought new life to the iconic horror franchise. As a brand new Fazbear employee you’ll have to prove you have what it takes to excel in all aspects of Pizzeria management and maintenance.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2287520/Five_Nights_at_Freddys_Help_Wanted_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2094,'american_truck_simulator_-_new_mexico',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2017/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/684630/American_Truck_Simulator__New_Mexico/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2095,'car_for_sale_simulator_2023',NULL,'Car For Sale Simulator 2023 - Developed for car enthusiasts, grow your own car sales business by buying and selling different car models. Drive the purchased cars as you wish, repair them, modify them, and sell them to customers at affordable prices.','2024/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2248760/Car_For_Sale_Simulator_2023/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2096,'grocery_store_simulator',NULL,'Grocery Store Simulator is a 1-4 player co-op game where you build and manage your own supermarket by stocking shelves, setting prices, hiring staff, and customizing your store, all while expanding your business and keeping customers happy.','2024/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2961880/Grocery_Store_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2097,'assetto_corsa_competizione_-_intercontinental_gt_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa Competizione on Steam in order to play.','2020/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1201360/Assetto_Corsa_Competizione__Intercontinental_GT_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2098,'wo_long:_fallen_dynasty',NULL,'A new dark fantasy Three Kingdoms action RPG from Team NINJA, the developers of Nioh.','2023/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1448440/Wo_Long_Fallen_Dynasty/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2099,'dead_by_daylight_-_ghost_face®',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1089270/Dead_by_Daylight__Ghost_Face/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2100,'pathfinder:_kingmaker_—_enhanced_plus_edition',NULL,'Pathfinder: Kingmaker - Enhanced Plus Edition is the first isometric party-based cRPG set in the Pathfinder fantasy universe. Enjoy a classic RPG experience inspired by games like Baldur\'s Gate, Fallout 1 and 2 and Arcanum. Explore and conquer the Stolen Lands and make them your kingdom!','2018/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/640820/Pathfinder_Kingmaker__Enhanced_Plus_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2101,'little_misfortune',NULL,'Led by her new friend, Mr. Voice, Misfortune ventures into the woods, where mysteries are unraveled and a little bad luck unfolds.','2019/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/714120/Little_Misfortune/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2102,'automobilista_2_-_endurance_pack_pt2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3022990/Automobilista_2__Endurance_Pack_Pt2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2103,'age_of_empires:_definitive_edition',NULL,'Age of Empires, the pivotal real-time strategy game that launched a 20-year legacy returns with modernized gameplay, all-new 4K visuals, 8-person multiplayer battles and a host of other new features. Welcome back to history.','2019/8/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1017900/Age_of_Empires_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2104,'far_cry_3_-_blood_dragon',NULL,'Far Cry® 3: Blood Dragon is THE Kick-Ass Cyber Shooter.Welcome to an 80’s vision of the future. The year is 2007 and you are Sargent Rex Colt, a Mark IV Cyber Commando. Your mission: get the girl, kill the baddies, and save the world.','2013/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/233270/Far_Cry_3__Blood_Dragon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2105,'the_walking_dead:_a_new_frontier',NULL,'After society was ripped apart by undead hands, pockets of civilization emerge from the chaos. But at what cost? Can the living be trusted on this new frontier?','2016/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/536220/The_Walking_Dead_A_New_Frontier/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2106,'spellrogue',NULL,'SpellRogue is the ultimate tactical turn-based roguelike! Draft from over 350 powerful spells to assemble the perfect combination and crush your enemies in 70+ unique encounters. Face brutal choices, adapt to impossible odds, and strike back at the horrors that destroyed the world.','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1990110/SpellRogue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2107,'total_war:_warhammer_-_the_grim_and_the_grave',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2016/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/404013/Total_War_WARHAMMER__The_Grim_and_the_Grave/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2108,'dead_by_daylight_-_old_wounds_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2526540/Dead_by_Daylight__Old_Wounds_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2109,'alone_in_the_dark',NULL,'Return to Derceto Manor in this reimagination of Alone in the Dark, a love letter to the 90’s cult classic horror game.','2024/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1310410/Alone_in_the_Dark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2110,'total_war:_rome_ii_-_wrath_of_sparta_campaign_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ROME II - Emperor Edition on Steam in order to play.','2014/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/327280/Total_War_ROME_II__Wrath_of_Sparta_Campaign_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2111,'ambulance_life:_a_paramedic_simulator',NULL,'Dedicate your life to saving others. As soon as you receive the emergency call, speed off to the site of the accident in your ambulance, sirens wailing. Apply first aid and transport the seriously injured to hospital. Every second counts!','2025/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1926520/Ambulance_Life_A_Paramedic_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2112,'persona_3_portable',NULL,'If I say there’s an hour “hidden” between one day and the next... would you believe me? Master the power of the heart, Persona, and uncover the tragic truth of the Dark Hour.','2023/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1809700/Persona_3_Portable/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2113,'the_rogue_prince_of_persia',NULL,'Sprint on the walls with a unique 2D movement, flowing seamlessly into fast-paced acrobatic combat as you tear through an army invading your capital city, in this action-platformer roguelite installment in the Prince of Persia series.','2024/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2717880/The_Rogue_Prince_of_Persia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2114,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_cabin_accessories',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2015/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/388470/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Cabin_Accessories/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2115,'postal:_brain_damaged',NULL,'POSTAL: Brain Damaged is a new, action-oriented take on the Running With Scissors’ cult game series with throwback graphics, and fast-paced, modern gameplay. Take a wild roller coaster ride through the twisted wonderland encased in the POSTAL DUDE’S messed-up mind.','2022/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1359980/POSTAL_Brain_Damaged/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2116,'yu-gi-oh!_legacy_of_the_duelist_:_link_evolution',NULL,'Build your Deck from over 10,000 cards and take on the most iconic Duelists from the Yu-Gi-Oh! universe. Relive the stories from the original Yu-Gi-Oh! animated series through Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS!','2020/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1150640/YuGiOh_Legacy_of_the_Duelist__Link_Evolution/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2117,'dark_deception_complete',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dark Deception on Steam in order to play.','2019/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1022850/Dark_Deception_Complete/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2118,'sable',NULL,'Embark on an unique and unforgettable journey and guide Sable through her Gliding; a rite of passage that will take her across vast deserts and mesmerizing landscapes, capped by the remains of spaceships and ancient wonders.','2021/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/757310/Sable/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2119,'assetto_corsa_competizione_-_american_track_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa Competizione on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1865970/Assetto_Corsa_Competizione__American_Track_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2120,'animal_shelter',NULL,'In Animal Shelter, your main target is to make your four-legged friends happy. Pet them, hand out treats, play with toys - and they will pay you back with great trust. Get to know the animals well enough to find them the best home! Don\'t wait any longer, open your animal shelter now!','2022/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1239320/Animal_Shelter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2121,'antonblast',NULL,'ANTONBLAST is a fast-paced explosive action platformer that\'s all about destruction. Play as the enraged Dynamite Anton (or his cranked-out coworker Annie) and use your Mighty F’n Hammer to demolish bizarre worlds, tussle with screen-filling bosses, and steal your Spirits back from Satan!','2024/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1887400/ANTONBLAST/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2122,'disney_dreamlight_valley:_a_rift_in_time',NULL,'This content requires the base game Disney Dreamlight Valley on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2632050/Disney_Dreamlight_Valley_A_Rift_in_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2123,'american_truck_simulator_-_washington',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1015160/American_Truck_Simulator__Washington/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2124,'unbridled:_that_horse_game',NULL,'Unbridled: That Horse Game is the ultimate horse simulator, giving you the freedom to follow your own dreams and create your own unique story. Experience the freedom of riding, the challenges of horse sports, and the joy of breeding horses - all in a stunning virtual world.','2025/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1938050/Unbridled_That_Horse_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_44'),(2125,'three_kingdoms_mushouden',NULL,'Set on the eve of the Yellow Turban Rebellion (AD 182), you can play as an original character or a historical warlord, building forces and forging alliances. Whether you choose to be a lone wanderer or rally famous generals, use your knowledge and wisdom to reshape history!','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3285500/Three_Kingdoms_Mushouden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2126,'nebulous:_fleet_command',NULL,'Take command of your hand-tailored fleet of space warships and use realistic radar, electronic warfare, advanced movement controls in 3D space, and precision targeting to outmaneuver and outwit your opponents in a simulation-heavy tactical space game like no other.','2022/2/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/887570/NEBULOUS_Fleet_Command/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2127,'total_war:_warhammer_-_norsca',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2017/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/455040/Total_War_WARHAMMER__Norsca/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2128,'x4:_hyperion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game X4: Foundations on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3419300/X4_Hyperion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2129,'the_riftbreaker:_heart_of_the_swamp',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Riftbreaker on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2506610/The_Riftbreaker_Heart_of_the_Swamp/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2130,'phoenix_point',NULL,'The acclaimed strategy game from the creator of X-COM. Fight tactical battles on procedural maps against a foe that adapts to your tactics. Manage diplomacy and economy on a global scale. Research, explore, overcome. Now includes Steam Workshop support for mods!','2020/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/839770/Phoenix_Point/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2131,'loco_motive',NULL,'On the Reuss Express a passenger has been murdered, and you’re the prime suspects. Uncover a thrilling mystery and solve satisfying point and click puzzles to prove your innocence! A slapstick adventure, packed full of deadly surprises, shocking twists and larger than life characters!','2024/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1709880/Loco_Motive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2132,'dungeons_of_hinterberg',NULL,'Discover the magic and lore of the Alps in this acclaimed Action Adventure. Forge relationships with locals to help you solve puzzles, battle monsters and uncover secrets of the legendary Dungeons of Hinterberg!','2024/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1983260/Dungeons_of_Hinterberg/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2133,'parkitect',NULL,'Parkitect is a business simulation game that charges you with the construction and management of theme parks! Bringing back the best of classic theme park games with many new features and content on top. Now supports online co-op with up to 8 players!','2018/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/453090/Parkitect/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2134,'creeper_world_4',NULL,'The unstoppable fluid enemy has returned and destroyed every world in its path! Defend against Creeper as it floods across the 3D terrain in this real time strategy game where the enemy is a fluid.','2020/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/848480/Creeper_World_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2135,'the_plucky_squire',NULL,'Storybook characters discover a three-dimensional world outside the pages of their book and must jump between 2D & 3D realms to save their friends in this charming action-adventure.','2024/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1627570/The_Plucky_Squire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2136,'poly_bridge',NULL,'Unleash your engineering creativity with an engaging and fresh bridge-building simulator with all the bells and whistles. Enjoy hours of physics-based puzzle solving in the Campaign and then jump in the Sandbox to create your own bridge designs and puzzles!','2016/7/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/367450/Poly_Bridge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2137,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_rapid_hunt_rifle_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3447720/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Rapid_Hunt_Rifle_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2138,'rusty\'s_retirement',NULL,'A relaxing idle-farming simulator that sits at the bottom of your screen while you do other things.','2024/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2666510/Rustys_Retirement/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2139,'jdm:_japanese_drift_master_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game JDM: Japanese Drift Master on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3749550/JDM_Japanese_Drift_Master__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2140,'mirthwood',NULL,'Embark on an enchanting journey and brave ferocious creatures in an immersive medieval fantasy world. Will you settle a new homestead to live a life of farming and trade, or pick up the sword and take up the adventurers\' path?','2024/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2272900/Mirthwood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2141,'shin_megami_tensei_iii_nocturne_hd_remaster',NULL,'Reawaken your inner demon in a modernized version of the acclaimed ATLUS classic, Shin Megami Tensei III Nocturne HD Remaster.','2021/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1413480/Shin_Megami_Tensei_III_Nocturne_HD_Remaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2142,'be_my_horde',NULL,'Be My Horde is a roguelite survivor where your minions fight for you. Become a formidable necromancer and turn your enemies into a resource! Raise fallen foes, build massive undead hordes, enhance your skills with devoured souls, and conquer the world – you’re the villain in this story.','2024/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2499520/Be_My_Horde/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2143,'homicipher',NULL,'Homicipher is a language deciphering and exploration ADV based on the concept of \"romance with horror men.\" The protagonist, who has wandered into another world, interacts with non-human beings to decipher their language while striving to escape.','2024/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2302660/Homicipher/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2144,'five_nights_at_freddy\'s:_sister_location',NULL,'Welcome to Circus Baby\'s Pizza World, where family fun and interactivity go beyond anything you\'ve seen at those *other* pizza places! Now hiring: Late night technician. Must enjoy cramped spaces and be comfortable around active machinery. Not responsible for death or dismemberment.','2016/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/506610/Five_Nights_at_Freddys_Sister_Location/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2145,'pioneers_of_pagonia',NULL,'This city builder challenges you to build a thriving community while facing the dangers of an untamed land. Lead your people to success in a procedurally generated and dynamic world. Construct detailed settlements, defend against emerging threats, and optimize resource management.','2023/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2155180/Pioneers_of_Pagonia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2146,'lake',NULL,'It\'s 1986 - Meredith Weiss takes a break from her career in the big city to deliver mail in her hometown. How will she experience two weeks in beautiful Providence Oaks, with its iconic lake and quirky community? And what will she do next? It\'s up to you.','2021/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1118240/Lake/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2147,'mini_settlers',NULL,'Mini Settlers is a minimalistic city builder! Settle islands, construct cities, and design efficient logistic networks to fulfill your buildings\' needs and fuel population growth to adventure into new worlds.','2025/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2521630/Mini_Settlers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2148,'rebel_inc:_escalation_-_dollars_&_disasters',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rebel Inc: Escalation on Steam in order to play.','2023/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1747950/Rebel_Inc_Escalation__Dollars__Disasters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2149,'total_war:_warhammer_ii_-_the_shadow_&_the_blade',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2019/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1158180/Total_War_WARHAMMER_II__The_Shadow__The_Blade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2150,'cobalt_core',NULL,'A sci-fi roguelike deckbuilder with a deep new single-axis spin on tactics games! Dodge missiles, line up your cannons, and blast \'em out of the sky... Then get to the bottom of these time loops, before it\'s too late!','2023/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2179850/Cobalt_Core/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2151,'sker_ritual',NULL,'An intense round-based zombie survival FPS, play solo or co-op. Shoot your way through relentless waves of vicious horrors with high-octane objectives, upgrading steampunk weapons, collecting Celtic God powers, and surviving the onslaught of the Quiet Ones.','2024/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1492070/Sker_Ritual/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2152,'trine_5:_a_clockwork_conspiracy',NULL,'The Trine series is back with its biggest adventure! In their fifth outing, the Heroes of Trine are pitted against dastardly and duplicitous villains, who will stop at nothing to seize control of the kingdom. The clock is ticking to save the world of Trine!','2023/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1436700/Trine_5_A_Clockwork_Conspiracy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2153,'terrascape',NULL,'Build gorgeous kingdoms on floating islands by strategically placing buildings in this cozy City-Puzzler. Discover secret combinations, take on weekly challenges and explore randomly generated maps in various single- and multiplayer game modes.','2024/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2290000/TerraScape/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2154,'american_truck_simulator_-_oregon',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/800370/American_Truck_Simulator__Oregon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2155,'american_truck_simulator_-_utah',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1104880/American_Truck_Simulator__Utah/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2156,'used_cars_simulator',NULL,'Used Cars Simulator - trade used or stolen cars, fix and customize them, drive around, and explore the open world! Grow your business, complete quests, and have fun with a physics-based sandbox!','2025/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2637940/Used_Cars_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2157,'hypercharge:_unboxed',NULL,'Hypercharge is a first and third-person shooter action figure game you\'ve always dreamed of! Grab your friends, complete objectives, defend the Hypercore against waves of weaponized toys, and defeat Major Evil together in the story campaign!','2020/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/523660/HYPERCHARGE_Unboxed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2158,'age_of_wonders_4:_empires_&_ashes',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Wonders 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2401830/Age_of_Wonders_4_Empires__Ashes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2159,'sickly_days_and_summer_traces',NULL,'A devoted brother and his fragile sister share a quiet, dreamlike summer. As her gentle companion, speak with her, care for her, and gather the fleeting, precious fragments of a love that blooms softly in the stillness of everyday life.','2025/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3682050/Sickly_Days_and_Summer_Traces/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2160,'ballisticng',NULL,'BallisticNG is a high speed, all thrills anti-gravity combat racer and open modding environment developed as a tribute to old school classics such as Wipeout, Rollcage and Jet Moto.','2018/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/473770/BallisticNG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2161,'tobacco_shop_simulator',NULL,'Run your tobacco shop. Sign contracts with leading brands, order products, hire workers, expand your store, and never let your customers leave the store empty-handed. Play with friends or go solo, and enjoy the growth of your shop.','2025/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3211680/Tobacco_Shop_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2162,'forgive_me_father_2',NULL,'Embark on a journey into the darkest nightmares to restore your sanity. Blast your way through hordes of possessed enemies, unlock an arsenal of deadly weapons and unearthly abilities, and get ready to face even more Lovecraftian madness in this action-packed FPS sequel.','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2272250/Forgive_Me_Father_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2163,'pax_augusta',NULL,'Pax Augusta is probably the most authentic ancient city-building simulation. Build flourishing cities and look after your citizens. Earn gold with production and trade of goods and build impressive monuments. Strengthen your influence and become a Roman emperor!','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1989760/Pax_Augusta/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2164,'house_flipper_-_luxury_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game House Flipper on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1021110/House_Flipper__Luxury_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2165,'idle_slayer',NULL,'Idle Slayer is an incremental game with idle and active playstyle mechanics, medieval pixel art visuals and retro 8-bit sounds and music.','2020/12/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1353300/Idle_Slayer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2166,'the_dark_pictures_anthology:_house_of_ashes',NULL,'At the close of the Iraq War, Special Forces hunting for weapons of mass destruction unearth something far deadlier – a buried Sumerian temple containing a nest of unearthly creatures. To survive the night below, they must forge a brotherhood with their enemies from the world above.','2021/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1281590/The_Dark_Pictures_Anthology_House_of_Ashes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2167,'mirror\'s_edge™',NULL,'In a city where information is heavily monitored, couriers called Runners transport sensitive data. In this seemingly utopian paradise, a crime has been committed, & you are being hunted. You are a Runner called Faith and this innovative first-person action-adventure is your story.','2009/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/17410/Mirrors_Edge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2168,'the_sims™_4_for_rent_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2140610/The_Sims_4_For_Rent_Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2169,'temtem:_swarm',NULL,'Can you Survive the Swarm? Unlock mighty abilities and upgrades, find and collect Tems to evolve and become stronger, discover overpowered strategies, and battle massive bosses in this survivor-like bullet heaven! Play solo or online co-op with up to 3 players, building the wildest synergies.','2024/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2510960/Temtem_Swarm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2170,'monster_care_simulator',NULL,'Manage a care center for adorable monsters in Monster Care Simulator! Treat clients\' creatures, hatch eggs, raise your own companions, and keep them happy with fun activities. Hire staff, expand your facilities, and customize your space to build the ultimate monster sanctuary!','2025/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3288270/Monster_Care_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2171,'ultimate_general:_civil_war',NULL,'Ultimate General: Civil War is a tactical real time strategy war-game. Experience the bloodiest period of U.S. history - the American Civil War of 1861-1865.','2017/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/502520/Ultimate_General_Civil_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2172,'minishoot\'_adventures',NULL,'Fly into a charming handcrafted world and go on an adventure that mixes up open exploration with crispy twin-stick shooter action. Fight your way from the shiny overworld to the deepest caves, improve your ship and overcome the dungeons\' bosses to rescue your friends!','2024/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1634860/Minishoot_Adventures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_45'),(2173,'motogp™24',NULL,'Rev up your engines, MotoGP™24 is back! Dive into the heart-pounding action of the 2024 season and immerse yourself in the thrills of unexplored landscapes, all thanks to the revolutionary Riders market!','2024/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2581700/MotoGP24/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2174,'underdogs',NULL,'UNDERGROUND MECH FIGHTS! Wrap yourself in 5 tons of metal & go smashing through a dark scene of full-on metal-on-metal violence!','2024/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2441700/UNDERDOGS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2175,'high_on_life:_high_on_knife',NULL,'This content requires the base game High On Life on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/2','Released','https://stor