online) to beat levels, find hidden carrots and race against the clock. Experience bunny madness. Embrace carrot chaos. Become Super Bunny Man.','2023/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/673750/Super_Bunny_Man/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2182,'crime_boss:_rockay_city',NULL,'Crime Boss: Rockay City is a 1-4 player co-op FPS heist game with enjoyable stealth and epic killing spree combat. Featuring a solo roguelike campaign that combines FPS and strategy elements with the most hilariously cheesy voice acting that make you laugh.','2024/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2933080/Crime_Boss_Rockay_City/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2183,'ruffy_and_the_riverside',NULL,'In Ruffy and the Riverside, you wield the magic SWAP to Copy & Paste textures - turn ice into lava or waterfalls into vines! Explore, fight, skate on straw bales, and unleash your imagination in this quirky open-world action game. Dive into an adventure that lets you literally change the world!','2025/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1002260/Ruffy_and_the_Riverside/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2184,'payday_3:_party_powder_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 3 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3679630/PAYDAY_3_Party_Powder_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2185,'dokapon_kingdom:_connect',NULL,'Make friends or frenemies! Be a savvy schemer in this hybrid RPG party game!','2023/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2338140/Dokapon_Kingdom_Connect/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2186,'snufkin:_melody_of_moominvalley',NULL,'Join Snufkin in this musical adventure about restoring harmony and balance to Moominvalley, protecting it from the industrious Park Keeper.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1808680/Snufkin_Melody_of_Moominvalley/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2187,'ostranauts',NULL,'Ostranauts is a hardcore noir space-sim. Manage life aboard your ship, and beware the cost of every decision you make. Scavenge and explore the boneyard. Create, build, and customise your ship. Hire a crew to help but remember, nothing is more certain than death and taxes.','2020/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1022980/Ostranauts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2188,'the_saboteur™',NULL,'This open-world action thriller takes you through the seedy streets of Paris as you seek to undermine the German authority and lead a rebellion. Fight across rooftops and through dangerous alleys, and operate a wide variety of vehicles as you navigate your terrain.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/24880/The_Saboteur/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2189,'planet_zoo:_conservation_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2013290/Planet_Zoo_Conservation_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2190,'dead_by_daylight_-_chucky_chapter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2656010/Dead_by_Daylight__Chucky_Chapter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2191,'ruined_king:_a_league_of_legends_story™',NULL,'Rise Against Ruin - Unite a party of League of Legends Champions, explore Bilgewater and set sail for the Shadow Isles to uncover the secrets of the deadly Black Mist in this immersive turn-based RPG.','2021/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1276790/Ruined_King_A_League_of_Legends_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2192,'ooblets',NULL,'Ooblets is a relaxing and offbeat farming, town life, and creature collection game. Manage your farm, grow and train your ooblets, explore strange lands, and have dance-offs!','2023/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/593150/Ooblets/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2193,'choo-choo_charles',NULL,'Navigate an open-world island in an old train, upgrade it over time, and use it to fight an evil spider train named Charles.','2022/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1766740/ChooChoo_Charles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2194,'blush_blush',NULL,'You are responsible somehow for a curse that befalls 12 unfortunate hawt dudes. Now you have to find them and break the curse with your love!!','2019/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/777130/Blush_Blush/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2195,'kathy_rain:_director\'s_cut',NULL,'The award-winning point-and-click adventure returns in the Director\'s Cut with an extended story, additional puzzles, and new areas to explore. Witness the rise of an iconic detective as you uncover a dark and sinister truth hiding behind the calm exterior of a small rural town.','2021/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1395030/Kathy_Rain_Directors_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2196,'train_sim_world®_5:_west_coast_main_line:_london_euston_-_milton_keynes_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970800/Train_Sim_World_5_West_Coast_Main_Line_London_Euston__Milton_Keynes_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2197,'crusader_kings_iii:_fate_of_iberia',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings III on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1303184/Crusader_Kings_III_Fate_of_Iberia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2198,'pinball_fx3',NULL,'Pinball FX3 is the biggest, most community focused pinball game ever created. Multiplayer matchups, user generated tournaments and league play create endless opportunity for pinball competition.','2017/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/442120/Pinball_FX3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2199,'gold_mining_simulator',NULL,'Become a gold miner. Work hard, dig deep, explore the world, and you’ll become the wealthiest person in Alaska. Use a variety of specialist machines to find as much gold as you can.','2017/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/451340/Gold_Mining_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2200,'lost_ark:_t4_founder\'s_platinum_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Lost Ark on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3200700/Lost_Ark_T4_Founders_Platinum_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2201,'gorn_2',NULL,'Rejoice in the glory of battle in GORN 2, a massive sequel to Free Lives\' brutal VR gladiator simulator.','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3391450/GORN_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2202,'isonzo',NULL,'Ferocious Alpine warfare will test your tactical skills in this authentic WW1 FPS. Battle among the scenic peaks, rugged valleys and idyllic towns of northern Italy. The Great War on the Italian Front is brought to life and elevated to unexpected heights!','2022/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1556790/Isonzo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2203,'escape_simulator:_mayan_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Escape Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2644890/Escape_Simulator_Mayan_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2204,'skul:_the_hero_slayer',NULL,'Guide \'Skul\' on his quest to single-handedly take on the Imperial Army and rescue his King from captivity, in an action-packed rogue-lite 2D platformer for the ages.','2021/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1147560/Skul_The_Hero_Slayer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2205,'solium_infernum',NULL,'Take the Infernal Throne in this hellish turn-based grand strategy game. The Prince of Darkness has vanished, leaving Archfiends to conspire: muster your legions while intoning dark sorceries, devilish schemes, and machiavellian plots. Who will be the new ruler of Hell and ascend the Throne?','2024/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1893810/Solium_Infernum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2206,'overcooked',NULL,'Overcooked is a chaotic couch co-op cooking game for one to four players. Working as a team, you and your fellow chefs must prepare, cook and serve up a variety of tasty orders before the baying customers storm out in a huff.','2016/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/448510/Overcooked/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2207,'outward_definitive_edition',NULL,'No remarkable journey is achieved without great effort. In Outward, the cold of the night or an infected wound can be as dangerous as a predator lurking in the dark. Explore the vast world of Aurai solo or in Co-op. The Definitive Edition features both DLCs and quality of life improvements.','2022/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/794260/Outward_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2208,'five_hearts_under_one_roof',NULL,'Yuman’s, the player, once solitary home and routine are now invaded by five beautiful women! Each has her unique charm – the \'childhood friend of 20 years,\' the \'first love and former idol,\' the \'demanding boss,\' the \'bold younger girl,\' and the \'shy recluse.\' Who will you choose?','2024/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3021100/Five_Hearts_Under_One_Roof/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2209,'emberward',NULL,'Build twisting mazes with tetromino blocks and deploy unique towers in this engaging roguelite tower defense game!','2024/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2459550/Emberward/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2210,'icarus:_new_frontiers_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game ICARUS on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1648532/Icarus_New_Frontiers_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2211,'coin_push_rpg',NULL,'Coin Push RPG is a unique blend of Semi-Idle RPG and coin-pusher gameplay! Recruit legendary heroes, equip them with powerful gear, upgrade your town, construct buildings, and unlock stunning backgrounds as you expand your influence. Build a diverse and unstoppable team with your own unique style .','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3036010/Coin_Push_RPG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2212,'operation:_new_earth',NULL,'Operation: New Earth is an intense sci-fi multiplayer strategy game in which you must command an advanced military facility to defend Earth from a hostile alien invasion. Create an alliance, gather resources, and unlock advanced technology to level up your stronghold!','2016/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/528740/Operation_New_Earth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2213,'ticket_to_ride®',NULL,'Discover a fresh adaptation of the iconic, multi-award-winning board game. Play against fellow fans around the world, or take on state-of-the-art AI opponents. Build a railway empire, claim routes and dominate your competitors on the leaderboards in this fan-favourite modern classic!','2023/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2477010/Ticket_to_Ride/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2214,'ghost_trick:_phantom_detective',NULL,'Ghost Trick: Phantom Detective, the classic puzzle-solving mystery adventure directed by Ace Attorney creator Shu Takumi, is back! This long-awaited HD remaster features upgraded visuals and sound and new gallery content.','2023/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1967430/Ghost_Trick_Phantom_Detective/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2215,'assetto_corsa_competizione_-_british_gt_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa Competizione on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1493170/Assetto_Corsa_Competizione__British_GT_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2216,'lego®_pirates_of_the_caribbean:_the_video_game',NULL,'LEGO® Pirates of the Caribbean: The Video Game is an action adventure game that brings the Pirates of the Caribbean world and all its colorful characters to life in LEGO Brick form. Players experience all the memorable scenes from all four films in the humorous and quirky LEGO Video Games style.','2011/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/311770/LEGO_Pirates_of_the_Caribbean_The_Video_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2217,'i_am_an_air_traffic_controller_4',NULL,'Since its release in 1998, I am an Air Traffic Controller 4 has established itself as a long seller, strongly supported by numerous users both inside and outside of aviation fandom.','2020/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1348390/I_am_an_Air_Traffic_Controller_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2218,'karma:_the_dark_world',NULL,'KARMA: The Dark World is a first-person cinematic psychological thriller set in a dystopian world where the Leviathan Corporation is omnipresent. The year is 1984, the place is East Germany, and things are not quite what they seem.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1376200/KARMA_The_Dark_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_46'),(2219,'sephiria',NULL,'Sephiria is a top-down action rogue-lite game with pixel graphics. Go down the tower, meet various animals, and collect various talismans and artifacts to become stronger.','2025/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2436940/Sephiria/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2220,'vampire_survivors:_operation_guns',NULL,'This content requires the base game Vampire Survivors on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2887680/Vampire_Survivors_Operation_Guns/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2221,'stellaris:_humanoids_species_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2017/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/756010/Stellaris_Humanoids_Species_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2222,'in_sink:_a_co-op_escape_adventure',NULL,'Work together to solve puzzles and escape a desert island in this stylized multiplayer co-op adventure. Success requires more than just you and your partner thinking alike - you\'ll have to communicate and stay In Sink to overcome the challenges ahead.','2024/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1858650/In_Sink_A_Coop_Escape_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2223,'city_tales_-_medieval_era',NULL,'City Tales is a medieval city builder, allowing you to unleash your creativity and shape vast cities that break outside a traditional grid. Plan each district for your citizens needs and aid your companions in their tales, creating a city to be proud of!','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3265070/City_Tales__Medieval_Era/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2224,'scene_investigators',NULL,'Scene Investigators is a hardcore deductive reasoning game for fans of the \"true crime\" genre. Step into re-created crime scenes, observe closely for pieces of evidence, analyze possible motives behind the crimes, and uncover what truly happened.','2023/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1159830/Scene_Investigators/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2225,'papa\'s_freezeria_deluxe',NULL,'Return to Calypso Island to serve seasonal sundae treats in Papa\'s Freezeria Deluxe! Craft sundaes in the Freezeria for all your quirky customers while earning tips, points and Special Recipes. Switch gears and take a trip in the Food Truck to concoct your own chilly creations and see who shows up!','2023/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2291760/Papas_Freezeria_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2226,'tactical_assault_vr',NULL,'Tactical Assault VR is an intense tactical shooter where you use real-world CQB (Close Quarters Battles) tactics to stack up, breach doors and eliminate threats. Play solo or join an online co-op special forces unit in missions around the world.','2023/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2314160/Tactical_Assault_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2227,'into_the_radius_vr',NULL,'Into the Radius is a single-player survival shooter in VR. Explore the Pechorsk zone filled with surreal landscapes and dangerous anomalies. Defend yourself with realistic firearms, recover strange artifacts, scavenge for loot, and uncover the mysteries of this unforgiving dystopian environment.','2020/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1012790/Into_the_Radius_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2228,'god_of_weapons',NULL,'Embark on a thrilling journey in God of Weapons, an action roguelike where you must ascend the tower of Zhor to reclaim the last light for the world. To survive the monster onslaught on each tower\'s level, you\'ll need to obtain and carefully organize weapons and accessories in your inventory.','2023/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2342950/God_Of_Weapons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2229,'loddlenaut',NULL,'Play as an interstellar custodian sent to clean up a polluted ocean planet. Pick up trash, explore the vibrant waters, and take care of axolotl-like alien creatures!','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1644940/Loddlenaut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2230,'ale_abbey_-_monastery_brewery_tycoon',NULL,'Build and expand your monastery, craft recipes and brew holy ales in this unique brewery tycoon. No pre-made recipes in Ale Abbey, oh no. It\'s a canvas for true beer alchemists. It\'s as simple as: brew, sip, repeat. Welcome to Ale Abbey!','2025/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2789460/Ale_Abbey__Monastery_Brewery_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2231,'youtubers_life_3_-_stream_together!',NULL,'Reach the top of the rankings! Create your dream home with a luxury setup, compete online in real-time with other users by streaming, creating VODs, and editing them in the most epic way… and don’t forget to share your photos in the unique and time-limited events on your calendar!','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3487060/Youtubers_Life_3__Stream_Together/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2232,'risk_of_rain_returns',NULL,'Carefully designed, beautifully remastered, and loaded with new ways to play—Risk of Rain is back and better than ever! Dive into the iconic roguelike full of unique loot combinations, enhanced with new Survivors, overhauled multiplayer, fan favorite content from Risk of Rain 2, and more!','2023/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1337520/Risk_of_Rain_Returns/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2233,'easy_red_2:_normandy',NULL,'This content requires the base game Easy Red 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2317930/Easy_Red_2_Normandy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2234,'colony_survival',NULL,'Colony Survival is a unique first-person strategy game developed by a two-man team. Build your own colony in a voxel world. Command guards, farmers, miners and other colonists. Defend your colony against the horde of monsters that attacks every night!','2017/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/366090/Colony_Survival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2235,'doloc_town',NULL,'Doloc Town is a cozy pixel-art farming simulation set in a post-apocalyptic world. Build your dream farm from scratch and explore this mysterious wasteland. Harvest, plant, build, and uncover the untold stories of this forgotten land!','2025/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2285550/Doloc_Town/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2236,'lost_judgment_-_the_kaito_files_story_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Lost Judgment on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2060280/Lost_Judgment__The_Kaito_Files_Story_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2237,'bear_and_breakfast',NULL,'Bear and Breakfast is a laid-back management adventure game where you build and run a bed and breakfast...but you’re a bear.','2022/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1136370/Bear_and_Breakfast/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2238,'tank_mechanic_simulator',NULL,'Renovate & build II World War tanks. Experience highly detailed & realistic simulation game. Take tanks fully apart by using different tools. Transform them from rusty and ruined to fully working. Check them on the training ground, sell or put into your own museum.','2020/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/407130/Tank_Mechanic_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2239,'planet_zoo:_twilight_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2150050/Planet_Zoo_Twilight_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2240,'wobbledogs',NULL,'A 3D pet simulation where you raise your own personal hive of mutating dogs, physically simulated all the way down to their guts! Wobbledogs is a casual and chill sandbox for players of all ages who want to care for their very own virtual pets in a surprising, unique, and stress-free environment.','2022/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1424330/Wobbledogs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2241,'tt_isle_of_man:_ride_on_the_edge_3',NULL,'An iconic course for motorbike fans. 200km of open roads to practise on. Challenging physics. A simulation for the best riders.','2023/5/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1924170/TT_Isle_Of_Man_Ride_on_the_Edge_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2242,'summer_pockets_reflection_blue',NULL,'No matter how much times passes... I remember that blue, blue summer. Summer Pockets, the midsummer story brought to you by Key, has been powered-up with even more to play, including new heroines and routes, in Summer Pockets REFLECTION BLUE, now available on Steam!','2025/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3418570/Summer_Pockets_REFLECTION_BLUE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2243,'command_&_conquer™_3:_kane’s_wrath',NULL,'In the name of Kane! The Command & Conquer™ series continues to thrive with Command & Conquer™ 3: Kane’s Wrath.','2009/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/24810/Command__Conquer_3_Kanes_Wrath/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2244,'battlestar_galactica_deadlock',NULL,'In Battlestar Galactica Deadlock™ you’ll take command of the Colonial Fleet in defense of the Twelve Colonies during the First Cylon War. Lead many different types of ships in this 3D tactical game. Every decision counts, your strategy will be vital – can you ensure mankind’s survival?','2017/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/544610/Battlestar_Galactica_Deadlock/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2245,'secret_agent_wizard_boy_and_the_international_crime_syndicate',NULL,'Use magic spells and military surplus explosives to topple an evil crime syndicate hidden beneath a prestigious wizarding school. Learn spells, engage in espionage, and spread lore-unfriendly chaos.','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3111080/Secret_Agent_Wizard_Boy_and_the_International_Crime_Syndicate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2246,'lego®_city_undercover',NULL,'Join the Chase! In LEGO® CITY Undercover, play as Chase McCain, a police officer who\'s been tasked with going undercover to hunt down the notorious – and recently escaped – criminal Rex Fury and putting an end to his city-wide crime wave.','2017/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/578330/LEGO_City_Undercover/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2247,'gnomes',NULL,'Gnomes is a turn-based tower defense with deep roguelike progression, set in ever-expanding, procedurally generated biomes. Build, farm and defend your village as you push deeper into goblin-infested territory. Unlock powerful upgrades and craft your environment to survive the endless goblin horde','2025/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3133060/Gnomes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2248,'crashlands_2',NULL,'Slap your way across a vibrant world where interstellar friendships are the key to your survival. Befriend eccentric aliens, craft bizarre weaponry, and stick it to the man in this sequel to the award-winning open world crafting RPG Crashlands.','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1401730/Crashlands_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2249,'need_for_speed™',NULL,'Ready to own the streets? Get behind the wheel of iconic cars and floor it through Ventura Bay, a sprawling urban playground. Explore overlapping stories as you build your reputation – and your dream car – and become the ultimate racing icon.','2016/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1262540/Need_for_Speed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2250,'burnout™_paradise_remastered',NULL,'Burnout Paradise Remastered provides the ultimate driving playground for you and your friends to play online. This remaster includes all add-ons from the Year of Paradise, including the Big Surf Island update, meticulously recreated and ready to wreck in 4K.','2018/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238080/Burnout_Paradise_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2251,'commander_quest',NULL,'Congratulations! You just found a \'one of a kind\' roguelike that combines deck-building card game and auto battle strategy game! Consider unit counters, then create powerful synergy by breaking down the boundaries between the battlefield and cards, then lead your army to victory!','2025/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2697930/Commander_Quest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2252,'order_13',NULL,'You wake up in a dark warehouse, tasked with packing orders while something lurks in the shadows. Work fast, stay safe, and protect your cat. He’s all you’ve got.','2025/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2259310/ORDER_13/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2253,'drill_core',NULL,'Corporate greed meets strategic planet-mining in Drill Core! Drill to the heart of planets while managing workers, researching cutting-edge tech, and fortifying against alien attacks. Will you prioritize efficiency and risk your workers\' safety, or focus on defense for survival?','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2821800/Drill_Core/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2254,'max_payne',NULL,'Max Payne is a man with nothing to lose in the violent, cold urban night. A fugitive undercover cop framed for murder, hunted by cops and the mob, Max is a man with his back against the wall, fighting a battle he cannot hope to win. Prepare for pain…','2001/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/12140/Max_Payne/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2255,'resident_evil_village_-_winters’_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil Village on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1731080/Resident_Evil_Village__Winters_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2256,'the_sims™_4_dream_home_decorator_game_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1458151/The_Sims_4_Dream_Home_Decorator_Game_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2257,'fallout_4_vr',NULL,'Fallout 4, the legendary post-apocalyptic adventure from Bethesda Game Studios and winner of more than 200 ‘Best Of’ awards, including the DICE and BAFTA Game of the Year, comes in its entirety to VR.','2017/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/611660/Fallout_4_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2258,'lost_in_random™',NULL,'Play the odds in Lost in Random™, a gothic-fairy-tale-inspired action-adventure where every citizen’s fate is determined by a roll of the dice.','2021/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1462570/Lost_in_Random/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2259,'automobilista_2_-_endurance_pack_pt1',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2697800/Automobilista_2__Endurance_Pack_Pt1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2260,'tape_to_tape',NULL,'Tape to Tape is a roguelite hockey game where every choice matters on your journey to build the best hockey team. Choose your path, hire unique players, discover synergies between them, pick unique abilities, bribe the referees or visit the Blademaster on your way to restore hockey\'s former glory.','2023/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1566200/Tape_to_Tape/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2261,'puzzle_pirates',NULL,'Every activity in Puzzle Pirates is a uniquely fun puzzle: be it sailing, gunning, or hauling treasure, your own puzzling skill determines your success!','2011/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/99910/Puzzle_Pirates/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2262,'the_talos_principle',NULL,'The Talos Principle is a first-person puzzle game in the tradition of philosophical science fiction. Made by Croteam and written by Tom Jubert (FTL, The Swapper) and Jonas Kyratzes (The Sea Will Claim Everything).','2014/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/257510/The_Talos_Principle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2263,'hogwarts_legacy:_dark_arts_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hogwarts Legacy on Steam in order to play.','2023/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1880832/Hogwarts_Legacy_Dark_Arts_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2264,'thronebreaker:_the_witcher_tales',NULL,'Discover a brand new RPG from the creators of The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt. Facing an imminent invasion, Meve — war-veteran and Queen of Lyria and Rivia — is forced to once again enter the warpath and set out on a dark journey of destruction and revenge.','2018/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/973760/Thronebreaker_The_Witcher_Tales/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2265,'space_engineers_-_contact_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3066290/Space_Engineers__Contact_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_47'),(2266,'super_meat_boy',NULL,'The infamous, tough-as-nails platformer comes to Steam with a playable Head Crab character (Steam-exclusive)!','2010/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/40800/Super_Meat_Boy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2267,'mudborne:_frog_management_sim',NULL,'Mudborne is a casual nature management sim about discovering & breeding frogs! Awoken from hibernation you find your pond abandoned. Through the genetic keys of new species you must unlock the paths between the waking & dreaming worlds, and embark on a journey to restore lost populations.','2025/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2355150/Mudborne_Frog_Management_Sim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2268,'planet_zoo:_grasslands_animal_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2199210/Planet_Zoo_Grasslands_Animal_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2269,'starbound',NULL,'You’ve fled your home, only to find yourself lost in space with a damaged ship. Your only option is to beam down to the planet below, repair your ship and set off to explore the universe...','2016/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/211820/Starbound/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2270,'rogue_legacy_2',NULL,'Rogue Legacy 2 is what you\'d get if you mashed Rogue Legacy and a sequel together. Every time you die, your children will succeed you, and each child is unique. Your daughter might be a Colourblind Archer, and your son could be a Pacifistic Chef. Either way, one of them is getting conscripted.','2022/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1253920/Rogue_Legacy_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2271,'for_the_king',NULL,'For The King is a strategic RPG that blends tabletop and roguelike elements in a challenging adventure that spans the realms. Set off on a single player experience or play cooperatively both online and locally.','2018/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/527230/For_The_King/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2272,'magicraft',NULL,'\"Magicraft\" is a Roguelike game that uses a variety of spells to match unimaginable spell effects, and the construction of ultra-high degrees of freedom cannot even be exhausted by developers.','2024/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2103140/Magicraft/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2273,'sherlock_holmes_the_awakened',NULL,'Experience a nerve-racking Lovecraftian adventure, rebuilt from the ground up with modern graphics and gameplay. Become Sherlock Holmes, and find yourself at the heart of the terrifying Cthulhu Mythos as you investigate a series of mysterious disappearances in Europe and the US.','2023/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1949030/Sherlock_Holmes_The_Awakened/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2274,'ride_4',NULL,'Are you ready to live the best gaming experience that a motorcycle fan can get? RIDE 4 will spark your competitive soul with hundreds of bikes, dozens of tracks and a whole new level of realism.','2020/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1259980/RIDE_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2275,'super_robot_wars_30',NULL,'30 years on, the battle for our world\'s future continues. Super Robot Wars is a tactical RPG that brings characters and robots from a variety of mecha anime together to battle their mutual foes.','2021/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/898750/Super_Robot_Wars_30/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2276,'victoria_3:_colossus_of_the_south',NULL,'This content requires the base game Victoria 3 on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2591240/Victoria_3_Colossus_of_the_South/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2277,'dragon\'s_dogma:_dark_arisen',NULL,'Set in a huge open world, Dragon’s Dogma: Dark Arisen presents a rewarding action combat experience.','2016/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/367500/Dragons_Dogma_Dark_Arisen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2278,'neighbors:_suburban_warfare',NULL,'Take the fight to your pesky neighbors in a mayhem filled team-based online co-op battle. Assemble a team of iconic residents, attack your rival’s home with crazy items, and deploy devious traps to defend your own. Whose house will survive to rule the neighborhood?','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1732430/Neighbors_Suburban_Warfare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2279,'waltz_of_the_wizard',NULL,'Step into the most obsessively detailed wizard simulator this side of reality! Conjure chaos, brew spells, magically modify anything, and endure nonstop sass from Skully—the chattiest, most strange skull companion you’ll ever accidentally throw out a window. VR not required.','2019/7/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1094390/Waltz_of_the_Wizard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2280,'hello_neighbor',NULL,'Hello Neighbor is a Stealth Horror Game about sneaking into your neighbor\'s house and figuring out what he\'s hiding in the basement. Play against an advanced AI that learns from your actions.','2017/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/521890/Hello_Neighbor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2281,'fuel_harvest_together',NULL,'Play solo or co-op with up to 5 players to find oil, store crude, refine fuels, and sell them at gas stations and shop. Dig for gems and fossils, upgrade your gear, lease new land, and dominate the city as the biggest oil supplier!','2025/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3441460/Fuel_Harvest_Together/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2282,'assetto_corsa_-_japanese_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa on Steam in order to play.','2016/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/467980/Assetto_corsa__Japanese_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2283,'crypt_of_the_necrodancer:_synchrony',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crypt of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2094810/Crypt_of_the_NecroDancer_SYNCHRONY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2284,'the_sinking_city_remastered',NULL,'Powered by Unreal Engine 5, The Sinking City Remastered brings the eerie, atmospheric world of Oakmont back to life with enhanced gameplay and fully relit environments, perfect for both newcomers and returning players.','2021/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/750130/The_Sinking_City_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2285,'penny’s_big_breakaway',NULL,'Ready. Set. YO! - Join Penny & Yo-Yo in a kinetic 3D-platformer bursting with innovative gameplay! Showcase your catalog of tricks and chain impressive combos to deliver Penny & Yo-Yo\'s perfect breakout performance. Take the stage with this vibrant pair in Penny’s Big Breakaway.','2024/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1955230/Pennys_Big_Breakaway/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2286,'darkwater',NULL,'Darkwater is a cooperative extraction horror game for 1-4 players. Command a submarine trapped under the ice of an alien planet. Battle enemy vessels and deep sea abominations as you hunt for resources. Do what it takes to survive.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/619540/Darkwater/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2287,'the_tenants',NULL,'Become a landlord and deal with problematic tenants as you build your rental property empire. Decide how to react to annoyed neighbors or police interventions. Will you design your apartment for a group of gamer friends or an aspiring musician looking for a new home?','2021/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1009560/The_Tenants/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2288,'lushfoil_photography_sim',NULL,'A tranquil exploration and photography experience set across a vast selection of faithfully detailed landscapes.','2025/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1749860/Lushfoil_Photography_Sim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2289,'train_sim_world®_5:_london_overground_mildmay_line:_stratford_-_willesden_junction_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2971190/Train_Sim_World_5_London_Overground_Mildmay_line_Stratford__Willesden_Junction_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2290,'dead_by_daylight_-_escape_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1622941/Dead_by_Daylight__Escape_Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2291,'warhammer_40,000:_dawn_of_war_iii',NULL,'Step into a brutal battle between three warring factions In Dawn of War III you will have no choice but to face your foes when a catastrophic weapon is found on the mysterious world of Acheron.','2017/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/285190/Warhammer_40000_Dawn_of_War_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2292,'stray_gods:_the_roleplaying_musical',NULL,'Gods. Romance. Murder. Musical Numbers?! Play as Grace in a world where Greek Gods live in hiding among us. Change your fate as you draw friends, foes & lovers into song using your powers of musical persuasion to unravel the mystery of the Last Muse\'s death.','2023/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1920780/Stray_Gods_The_Roleplaying_Musical/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2293,'siralim_ultimate',NULL,'Siralim Ultimate is a monster-catching, dungeon-crawling RPG with a ridiculous amount of depth. Summon over 1200 different creatures and travel through randomly generated dungeons to acquire resources, new creatures, and loot.','2021/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1289810/Siralim_Ultimate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2294,'cozy_caravan',NULL,'Embark on a single-player, top-down journey in Cozy Caravan, where the arts of crafting, trading, and exploration come together in a beautifully cozy world. Form lasting bonds as you and your caravan journey through charming towns, enriching lives along the way.','2024/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2788520/Cozy_Caravan/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2295,'country_pack_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_graveyard_of_empires',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3152790/Country_Pack__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_Graveyard_of_Empires/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2296,'vagrus_-_the_riven_realms',NULL,'Embark on a perilous journey across a realm forsaken by the gods and devastated by an arcane cataclysm. Accompanied by a hardy crew, you must trade, fight, and explore your way to success as the leader of a traveling company in Vagrus, an award-winning turn-based post-apocalyptic fantasy RPG.','2021/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/909660/Vagrus__The_Riven_Realms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2297,'madness:_project_nexus',NULL,'MADNESS: Project Nexus is a third-person Run n\' Gun / Beat\'Em Up filled with arcade-style action and button-mashing brutality. Gun your way through droves of bad guys in the Story Campaign, or build your perfect killing machine in the neverending onslaught of Arena Mode.','2021/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/488860/MADNESS_Project_Nexus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2298,'command_&_conquer_3_tiberium_wars™',NULL,'The year is 2047. A massive nuclear fireball explodes high in the night sky, marking the dramatic beginning of the Third Tiberium War and the long-awaited return of the most groundbreaking Real-Time Strategy franchise of all time','2007/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/24790/Command__Conquer_3_Tiberium_Wars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2299,'teardown:_the_greenwash_gambit',NULL,'This content requires the base game Teardown on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2657100/Teardown_The_Greenwash_Gambit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2300,'thymesia',NULL,'Thymesia is a gruelling action-RPG with fast-paced combat and an intricate plague weapon system. In a kingdom where death spreads, play as a mysterious character known by the code name \"Corvus\". Prey upon your enemies, wield the power of disease and find the truth in your own memories.','2022/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1343240/Thymesia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2301,'premium_starter_pack_-_assassin\'s_creed_shadows',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assassin’s Creed Shadows on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3362570/Premium_Starter_Pack__Assassins_Creed_Shadows/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2302,'warhammer_40,000:_space_marine_2_-_blood_angels_cosmetic_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3274440/Warhammer_40000_Space_Marine_2__Blood_Angels_Cosmetic_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2303,'stellaris:_distant_stars_story_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2018/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/844810/Stellaris_Distant_Stars_Story_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2304,'starcom:_unknown_space',NULL,'Starcom: Unknown Space is an action RPG of space exploration and adventure. Build your own starship while discovering an epic story in a universe of strange mysteries, alien factions and uncharted worlds.','2024/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1750770/Starcom_Unknown_Space/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2305,'knights_of_honor_ii:_sovereign',NULL,'Become the king and fight over Europe in this fresh take on medieval real-time grand strategy. Manage provinces, gather armies, initiate diplomacy, and dabble in espionage. The path is open: become the true Sovereign of your people and bring them to glory.','2022/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/736820/Knights_of_Honor_II_Sovereign/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2306,'darksiders_genesis',NULL,'DARKSIDERS: GENESIS gives players their first look at the world of DARKSIDERS before the events of the original game. Furthermore, it introduces the fourth and last horseman STRIFE, as well as Co-op gameplay for the first time in the history of the franchise.','2019/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/710920/Darksiders_Genesis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2307,'winter_memories',NULL,'After the unforgettable summer memories you’ve made half a year ago, Yui, Rio, and Miyuki are back. With the change of seasons and the cold falling snow, a new page to your story is about to begin.','2024/1/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2495450/Winter_Memories/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2308,'train_sim_world®_5:_london_overground_suffragette_line:_gospel_oak_-_barking_riverside_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970550/Train_Sim_World_5_London_Overground_Suffragette_line_Gospel_Oak__Barking_Riverside_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2309,'the_eminence_in_shadow:_master_of_garden',NULL,'Enter the world of The Eminence in Shadow: Master of Garden, a multiplayer, narrative driven, action-RPG where players form their own party from a deep roster of unique characters, voiced by the actors from the anime, and engage in new stories, to take down the world-threatening Cult of Diabolos.','2024/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2776900/The_Eminence_in_Shadow_Master_of_Garden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2310,'immersion_pack_-_europa_universalis_iv:_king_of_kings',NULL,'This content requires the base game Europa Universalis IV on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2502910/Immersion_Pack__Europa_Universalis_IV_King_of_Kings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_48'),(2311,'better_mart',NULL,'EARLY ACCESS - Better Mart – Build and Manage Your Dream Supermarket!Welcome to Better Mart, a dynamic management game where you create, customize, and grow the ultimate supermarket!','2025/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3498270/Better_Mart/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2312,'goat_simulator_3_-_multiverse_of_nonsense',NULL,'This content requires the base game Goat Simulator 3 on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2809180/Goat_Simulator_3__Multiverse_of_Nonsense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2313,'cat_goes_fishing',NULL,'Start out on an island with a basic rod. Progress into a radar-wielding master fisher-cat scouring the sea for the biggest and baddest fish. Each fish has unique behaviors that you will learn to exploit as you tailor your arsenal of fishing rods to suit your style of play. Mrrrow!','2015/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/343780/Cat_Goes_Fishing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2314,'warhammer_40,000:_chaos_gate_-_daemonhunters_-_execution_force',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Chaos Gate - Daemonhunters on Steam in order to play.','2023/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2421890/Warhammer_40000_Chaos_Gate__Daemonhunters__Execution_Force/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2315,'menace_from_the_deep',NULL,'Menace from the Deep is an enthralling Roguelike Deckbuilding card game that unfolds in a dark world, drawing inspiration from Howard Lovecraft and the Cthulhu Mythos.Set against the backdrop of 1920s USA, the narrative revolves around a clandestine occult society.','2024/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2644610/Menace_from_the_Deep/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2316,'visage',NULL,'Visage is a first-person psychological horror game. Explore a mysterious ever-changing house in a slow-paced, atmospheric world that combines both uncannily comforting and horrifyingly realistic environments, and enjoy a genuinely terrifying experience.','2020/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/594330/Visage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2317,'age_of_mythology:_retold_-_immortal_pillars',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Mythology: Retold on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2991170/Age_of_Mythology_Retold__Immortal_Pillars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2318,'farming_&_supermarket_simulator',NULL,'Embark on a relaxing yet challenging journey to manage your own supermarket. Grow organic crops, care for your animals, and sell products to your customers. Build and expand your shelves. Can you transform your supermarket into an empire?','2025/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3070880/Farming__Supermarket_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2319,'bioshock™',NULL,'BioShock is a shooter unlike any you\'ve ever played, loaded with weapons and tactics never seen. You\'ll have a complete arsenal at your disposal from simple revolvers to grenade launchers and chemical throwers, but you\'ll also be forced to genetically modify your DNA to create an even more deadly weapon: you.','2007/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/7670/BioShock/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2320,'yakuza_6:_the_song_of_life',NULL,'Step into Japan\'s criminal underworld in this explosive action brawler starring legendary yakuza, Kazuma Kiryu, who is hellbent on unraveling the truth around his daughter\'s tragic accident.','2021/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1388590/Yakuza_6_The_Song_of_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2321,'lego®_dc_super-villains',NULL,'It\'s good to be bad… Embark on an all-new DC/LEGO® adventure by becoming the best villain the universe has seen. Players will create and play as an all-new super-villain throughout the game, unleashing mischievous antics and wreaking havoc in an action-packed story.','2018/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/829110/LEGO_DC_SuperVillains/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2322,'destroy_all_humans!',NULL,'The cult-classic returns! Terrorize the people of 1950\'s Earth in the role of the evil alien Crypto-137. Harvest their DNA and bring down the US government in the faithful remake of the legendary alien invasion action adventure. Annihilate puny humans using an assortment of alien weaponry and psychic abilities.','2020/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/803330/Destroy_All_Humans/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2323,'final_fantasy®_xiii-2',NULL,'It is no longer about facing destiny. Create a new future and change the world! Now enhanced for Windows PC.','2014/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/292140/FINAL_FANTASY_XIII2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2324,'the_dark_pictures_anthology:_the_devil_in_me',NULL,'A group of documentary film makers receive a mysterious call inviting them to a modern-day replica of serial killer H.H. Holmes ‘Murder Castle’. But on arrival they soon discover they’re being watched, and even manipulated, and suddenly there is much more at stake than just their ratings…','2022/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1567020/The_Dark_Pictures_Anthology_The_Devil_in_Me/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2325,'you_and_me_and_her:_a_love_story',NULL,'YOU and ME and HER: A Love Story is the visual novel medium in its purest form. Will Shinichi choose Miyuki, the beautiful queen bee of the school, or the endearingly awkward misfit Aoi? With art by Tsuji Santa, these beautifully rendered romances will stay with you forever.','2020/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1293820/YOU_and_ME_and_HER_A_Love_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2326,'eiyuden_chronicle:_hundred_heroes',NULL,'Eiyuden Chronicle: Hundred Heroes is designed to bring players a modern take on a classic JRPG experience. Get ready to lead 100+ playable characters through a war-torn world only you can save.','2024/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1658280/Eiyuden_Chronicle_Hundred_Heroes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2327,'train_sim_world®_5:_blackpool_branches:_preston_-_blackpool_&_ormskirk_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970320/Train_Sim_World_5_Blackpool_Branches_Preston__Blackpool__Ormskirk_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2328,'persona_4_arena_ultimax',NULL,'A Persona 4 Smackdown!','2022/3/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1602010/Persona_4_Arena_Ultimax/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2329,