_230_150_49'),(2336,'we_happy_few',NULL,'From the independent studio that brought you Contrast, We Happy Few is an action/adventure game set in a drug-fuelled, retrofuturistic city in an alternative 1960s England. Hide, fight and conform your way out of this delusional, Joy-obsessed world.','2018/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/320240/We_Happy_Few/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2337,'project:_gorgon_vip_membership',NULL,'This content requires the base game Project: Gorgon on Steam in order to play.','2021/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1476200/Project_Gorgon_VIP_Membership/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2338,'cat_quest_iii',NULL,'In Cat Quest III you play as a purrivateer in a freely explorable 2.5D open-world swarming with Pi-rats. You can sail the seas in your ship for treasures galore! But prepare for peril, as the Pirate King aims to hunt you down...','2024/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2305840/Cat_Quest_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2339,'urban_myth_dissolution_center',NULL,'Join forces with the psychic Director of the Urban Myth Dissolution Center and solve a variety of cases involving cursed relics, rental properties with shady histories, and dimensional anomalies. Monstrous oddities and otherworldly planes abound in this occult mystery adventure game!','2025/2/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2089600/Urban_Myth_Dissolution_Center/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2340,'warhammer_40,000:_space_marine_-_master_crafted_edition',NULL,'Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine returns. Enhanced for a new generation! Enjoy quality of life & graphical improvements that take the Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine experience to the next level.','2025/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3169520/Warhammer_40000_Space_Marine__Master_Crafted_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2341,'darkest_dungeon®_ii:_inhuman_bondage',NULL,'This content requires the base game Darkest Dungeon® II on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3205310/Darkest_Dungeon_II_Inhuman_Bondage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2342,'injustice™_2',NULL,'Build and power up the ultimate version of your favourite DC legends in INJUSTICE 2. This is your Legend. Your Journey. Your Injustice.','2017/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/627270/Injustice_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2343,'dead_by_daylight_-_terror_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1622940/Dead_by_Daylight__Terror_Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2344,'company_of_heroes',NULL,'Delivering a visceral WWII gaming experience, Company of Heroes redefines RTS by bringing the sacrifice of heroic soldiers, war-ravaged environments, and dynamic battlefields to life. Please visit the \"Company of Heroes - Legacy Edition\" page for additional user reviews.','2006/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/228200/Company_of_Heroes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2345,'simcity™_4_deluxe_edition',NULL,'SimCity 4 Deluxe Edition includes the bestselling SimCity 4 and the all-new SimCity 4 Rush Hour Expansion Pack. Create the most massive region of cities ever, with a farming town, bedroom community, high-tech commercial center, and industrial backbone.','2003/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/24780/SimCity_4_Deluxe_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2346,'star_wars™_knights_of_the_old_republic™_ii_-_the_sith_lords™',NULL,'5 years after the events of the award winning original, the Sith are on the verge of crushing the Old Republic. As a lone Jedi, will you follow the light side or succumb to the dark?','2005/2/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/208580/STAR_WARS_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_II__The_Sith_Lords/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2347,'we_were_here_too',NULL,'As your final hour approaches, a large structure looms up in the distance, towering above the relentless storm. Discover the truth behind this dark castle in a communication-based, cooperative puzzle adventure.','2018/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/677160/We_Were_Here_Too/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2348,'fantasy_grounds_vtt',NULL,'FANTASY GROUNDS is a powerful virtual tabletop that allows your TTRPG group to connect - whether you\'re around a table or online. With its updated visuals, versatile interface, comprehensive features, and vast library of supported game systems, Fantasy Grounds VTT provides unforgettable experiences!','2020/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1196310/Fantasy_Grounds_VTT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2349,'crusader_kings_iii:_wards_&_wardens',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings III on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2313541/Crusader_Kings_III_Wards__Wardens/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2350,'snooker_19',NULL,'Snooker 19 - The official videogame of World Snooker.','2019/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/887800/Snooker_19/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2351,'oneshot:_world_machine_edition',NULL,'A completely self-contained portable version of one of the highest user-rated games. Built on an entirely new engine with new UI, support for Steam Deck, & more. Features world-bending puzzles, intriguing denizens, surreal environments, and a captivating story about the truth of the game\'s reality.','2024/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2915460/OneShot_World_Machine_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2352,'land_of_the_vikings',NULL,'Land of the Vikings is a survival colony sim game. Build and lead your village, and expand it into a thriving city. A wise Jarl must manage resources, survive harsh conditions, and guide their fellow Vikings to work together through social conflict. Skál!','2023/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1981570/Land_of_the_Vikings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2353,'command_&_conquer™_red_alert™_3',NULL,'The desperate leadership of a doomed Soviet Union travels back in time to change history and restore the glory of Mother Russia.','2008/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/17480/Command__Conquer_Red_Alert_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2354,'castle_craft',NULL,'Will your castle survive the relentless onslaught, or collapse under pressure? Build, manage resources, and outsmart your foes in a world where everything can be destroyed. Use strategy and creativity to turn the chaos into your greatest advantage!','2025/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2086680/Castle_Craft/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2355,'ai:_the_somnium_files_-_nirvana_initiative',NULL,'Special Agents Mizuki and Ryuki, along with their AI partners Aiba and Tama, are tasked to solve the bizarre Half Body serial killings in this sequel to the critically acclaimed AI: THE SOMNIUM FILES.','2022/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1449200/AI_THE_SOMNIUM_FILES__nirvanA_Initiative/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2356,'paleo_pines',NULL,'Welcome to Paleo Pines, a charming island known for its friendly dinosaurs, quirky townsfolk, and mysterious past. Befriend dinos and enlist their help to fix up your ranch and farm crops to create your cozy dino sanctuary! Then set out with your companion, Lucky, to uncover the island’s secrets.','2023/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1202200/Paleo_Pines/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2357,'lightning_returns™:_final_fantasy®_xiii',NULL,'Lightning Returns is the concluding chapter of the Final Fantasy XIII saga and series heroine Lightning\'s final battle. The grand finale of the trilogy brings a world reborn as well as free character customization and stunning action based battles.','2015/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/345350/LIGHTNING_RETURNS_FINAL_FANTASY_XIII/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_49'),(2358,'minami_lane',NULL,'Welcome to Minami Lane! Build your own street in this tiny cozy, casual management sim! Unlock and customize buildings, manage your shops, and maximize the happiness of your villagers to complete quests and fill your street with love!','2024/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2678990/Minami_Lane/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2359,'berserk_and_the_band_of_the_hawk',NULL,'Behold the fierce blend of \"Warriors\" and \"Berserk\"!','2017/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/502280/BERSERK_and_the_Band_of_the_Hawk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2360,'train_sim_world®_5:_mittenwaldbahn:_innsbruck_-_garmisch-partenkirchen_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970840/Train_Sim_World_5_Mittenwaldbahn_Innsbruck__GarmischPartenkirchen_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2361,'under_night_in-birth_ii_sys:celes',NULL,'The newest riveting installment in the epic Under Night In-Birth saga rises from the Abyss! Improved visuals and battle system! Witness the curtain fall on the tale of the Hollow Night. Vie for supremacy through exhilarating combat and a deep, robust battle system!','2024/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2076010/UNDER_NIGHT_INBIRTH_II_SysCeles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2362,'train_sim_world®_5:_east_coast_main_line:_peterborough_-_doncaster_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970430/Train_Sim_World_5_East_Coast_Main_Line_Peterborough__Doncaster_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2363,'crosscode',NULL,'A retro-inspired 2D Action RPG set in the distant future. CrossCode combines 16-bit SNES-style graphics with butter-smooth physics, a fast-paced combat system, and engaging puzzle mechanics, served with a gripping sci-fi story.','2018/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/368340/CrossCode/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2364,'jusant',NULL,'Enjoy meditative vibes in Jusant, an action-puzzle climbing game. Scale an immeasurably tall tower and ascend to new heights alongside your watery companion. Master your climbing tools, find your way up through diverse biomes, and piece together the tower’s past.','2023/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1977170/Jusant/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2365,'prototype™',NULL,'You are the Prototype, Alex Mercer, a man without memory armed with amazing shape-shifting abilities, hunting your way to the heart of the conspiracy which created you; making those responsible pay. Fast & Deadly Shape-Shifting Combat: Reconfigure your body to the situation at hand.','2009/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/10150/Prototype/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2366,'war_on_the_sea',NULL,'Command ships, submarines and aircraft in the South Pacific during WWII.','2021/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1280780/War_on_the_Sea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2367,'maltese\'s_fluffy_onsen',NULL,'Run a bathhouse visited by animals! Maltese\'s Fluffy Onsen is a relaxing simulation game that you can enjoy while doing other tasks, as it sits at the bottom of your screen. Place baths with different temperatures and rest areas to help a variety of animal friends unwind.','2025/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3404470/Malteses_Fluffy_Onsen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2368,'lego®_horizon_adventures™',NULL,'Join machine hunter Aloy as she leads a colourful crew of heroes on a quest to save the world and learn the secrets of her past. Dive into boundless adventure, customize to your heart’s content, and take on action-packed battles solo or with friends.','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2428810/LEGO_Horizon_Adventures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2369,'overgrowth',NULL,'Feel like the star of a martial arts film in Overgrowth, as you jump, kick, throw, and slash your way to victory. Free the rabbits from their evil overlords in the main story, then play through the prequel story, and finally, try out nine years of mods developed by the community, or create your own!','2017/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/25000/Overgrowth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2370,'street_fighter™_6_-_year_2_ultimate_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Street Fighter™ 6 on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2825200/Street_Fighter_6__Year_2_Ultimate_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2371,'forspoken',NULL,'Forspoken follows the journey of Frey, a young New Yorker transported to the beautiful and cruel land of Athia. In search of a way home, Frey must use her newfound magical abilities to traverse sprawling landscapes and battle monstrous creatures.','2023/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1680880/Forspoken/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2372,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_dodge_|_plymouth_|_chrysler_remastered_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2464230/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__Dodge__Plymouth__Chrysler_Remastered_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2373,'of_life_and_land',NULL,'Of Life and Land is a charming settlement-building strategy game paired with a rich simulation experience. Every animal and plant strives to find its place in nature while you lead your villagers to their future. Expand to different regions and trade with local factions to gain needed resources.','2025/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1733110/Of_Life_and_Land/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2374,'planet_zoo:_north_america_animal_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1747960/Planet_Zoo_North_America_Animal_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2375,'conscript',NULL,'During the First World War, a lone French soldier must navigate twisted trenches, scavenge for limited supplies and solve complex puzzles - all whilst fighting for survival in the midst of mankind’s most brutal and horrifying conflict. CONSCRIPT is a new take on classic survival horror.','2024/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1286990/CONSCRIPT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2376,'my_hero_one\'s_justice_2',NULL,'MY HERO ONE\'S JUSTICE 2, the over-the-top follow-up to the smash hit 3D arena fighter MY HERO ONE\'S JUSTICE, makes its heroic debut! Make full use of characters\' Quirks as you clash head-to-head in epic battles across huge arenas!','2020/3/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1058450/MY_HERO_ONES_JUSTICE_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2377,'furi_-_onnamusha',NULL,'This content requires the base game Furi on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1802170/Furi__Onnamusha/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2378,'warno_-_northag',NULL,'This content requires the base game WARNO on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2978620/WARNO__NORTHAG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2379,'rhythm_doctor',NULL,'Save patients with your rhythm mastery! Rhythm Doctor is a rhythm game where you heal patients by defibrillating in time to their heartbeats. Learn each patient\'s unique heartbeat and defeat boss viruses trying to sabotage your rhythm, all set to heart-pumping, soul-soothing music.','2021/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/774181/Rhythm_Doctor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2380,'knights_in_tight_spaces',NULL,'Control your environment, gather your party, and build your best deck to overcome outlaws and supernatural forces, across a rich fantasy world. Watch as your tactical choices and deckbuilding prowess play out through stylish fight sequences.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2315400/Knights_in_Tight_Spaces/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2381,'infiniclick',NULL,'Combine, automate and upgrade programs to amass a fortune! Infiniclick is a relaxing (or not, it\'s up to you) incremental game in which your goal is to pay an unfair debt with Fun Corp.','2025/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3612640/Infiniclick/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2382,'pikuniku',NULL,'Pikuniku is an absurdly wonderful puzzle-exploration game that takes place in a strange but playful world where not everything is as happy as it seems. Help peculiar characters overcome struggles, uncover a deep state conspiracy, and start a little revolution in this delightful dystopian adventure!','2019/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/572890/Pikuniku/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2383,'ifsunsets',NULL,'「IfSunSets」 is a survival RPG adventure game. During the day, secure necessary supplies across the island, and survive the night against strong and terrifying monsters that track you down. You can utilize resources you\'ve secured to build a base to fend off threatening monsters.','2024/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2271930/IfSunSets/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2384,'goat_simulator:_remastered',NULL,'Goat Simulator Remastered is the latest in goat simulation technology. Your favorite chaotic sandbox is back and more beautiful than ever, with updated graphics, every DLC, and more bugs that you can shake a goat at. WASD to rewrite history.','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1762930/Goat_Simulator_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2385,'symphony_of_war:_the_nephilim_saga',NULL,'Enter Tahnra, a land savaged by war. You, a fresh academy graduate with humble beginnings, will grow to lead a grand army against a corrupt adversary. Gather heroes, form bonds, and lead your force in turn-based battles. Make use of tactics, terrain, morale and more to bring peace to the land!','2022/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1488200/Symphony_of_War_The_Nephilim_Saga/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2386,'yakuza_3_remastered',NULL,'Kazuma Kiryu has earned his retirement on the sandy beaches of Okinawa. But when a deadly power struggle arrives on his doorstep, he’ll have to walk the streets of Kamurocho to escape his past for good. Complete The Dragon of Dojima’s journey.','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1088710/Yakuza_3_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2387,'vampire_survivors:_emergency_meeting',NULL,'This content requires the base game Vampire Survivors on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2690330/Vampire_Survivors_Emergency_Meeting/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2388,'cult_of_the_lamb:_sinful_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cult of the Lamb on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2646130/Cult_of_the_Lamb_Sinful_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2389,'sniper_elite_3',NULL,'Sniper Elite 3 is a tactical third-person shooter that combines stealth, gameplay choice and genre-defining ballistics with huge, open levels and the exotic terrain of World War 2 North Africa.','2014/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/238090/Sniper_Elite_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2390,'spirit_x_strike',NULL,'An Action Adventure Game that lets you craft unique COMBOs and explore endless ways to style on your enemies with a high-speed combat system. Test your skills in fun chaotic one-vs-group battles, intense, strategic duels, and exhilarating post-apocalyptic adventure that will set your blood boiling.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2538880/Spirit_X_Strike/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2391,'superhot_vr',NULL,'Lose track of what’s real. Commit yourself, body and mind. Confront the evocative, elegantly brutal world of SUPERHOT VR. Enemies pouring into the room from all sides, dozens of bullets coursing through the air... Wait. Something seems different in here...','2017/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/617830/SUPERHOT_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2392,'the_past_within',NULL,'The Past Within is the new co-op experience from Rusty Lake! Play together with someone you deem trustworthy: one in The Past, the other in The Future. Observe and communicate what you see around you. Solve the puzzles and uncover Albert Vanderboom’s plan.','2022/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1515210/The_Past_Within/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2393,'farming_simulator_19',NULL,'The best-selling franchise takes a giant leap forward with a complete overhaul of the graphics engine, offering the most striking and immersive visuals and effects, along with the deepest and most complete farming experience ever.','2018/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/787860/Farming_Simulator_19/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2394,'dead_by_daylight_-_the_saw®_chapter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2018/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/750381/Dead_by_Daylight__The_Saw_Chapter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2395,'ggst_additional_character_16_-_unika',NULL,'This content requires the base game GUILTY GEAR -STRIVE- on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3001230/GGST_Additional_Character_16__Unika/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2396,'the_bloodline',NULL,'The Bloodline is a sandbox adventure RPG that lets you play your way. Reforge bonds between kingdoms, explore the wilds, craft and plan adventures and wield mighty weapons or magic as you prepare for what is to come…','2023/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1159290/The_Bloodline/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2397,'squad_44',NULL,'Team up and join the frontline in Squad 44, the most authentic tactical WW2 shooter. Experience ruthless realism with an immense arsenal of faithfully recreated weapons and vehicles across massive WW2 battlefields.','2018/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/736220/Squad_44/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2398,'dead_by_daylight_-_macabre_tales_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2526550/Dead_by_Daylight__Macabre_Tales_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2399,'mobile_suit_gundam_battle_operation_2',NULL,'This is a free-to-play team battle action game based on the \"Mobile Suit Gundam\" series of the Universal Century. Whether by land or by space, lay waste to your foes using either your favorite Mobile Suit or roam the battlefield as infantry and capture important objectives.','2023/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1367080/MOBILE_SUIT_GUNDAM_BATTLE_OPERATION_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2400,'planet_zoo:_arid_animal_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2436600/Planet_Zoo_Arid_Animal_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2401,'spongebob_squarepants:_battle_for_bikini_bottom_-_rehydrated',NULL,'Are you ready, kids? The cult classic is back, faithfully remade in spongetastic splendor! Play as SpongeBob, Patrick and Sandy and show the evil Plankton that crime pays even less than Mr. Krabs.','2020/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/969990/SpongeBob_SquarePants_Battle_for_Bikini_Bottom__Rehydrated/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2402,'call_to_arms_-_gates_of_hell:_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call to Arms - Gates of Hell: Ostfront on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3588040/Call_to_Arms__Gates_of_Hell_Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2403,'need_for_speed™_most_wanted_complete_dlc_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Need for Speed™ Most Wanted on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1262572/Need_for_Speed_Most_Wanted_Complete_DLC_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2404,'wartales_-_the_pits',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wartales on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3112270/Wartales__The_Pits/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2405,'age_of_wonders_4:_giant_kings',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Wonders 4 on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3181500/Age_of_Wonders_4_Giant_Kings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_50'),(2406,'school_666',NULL,'School 666 is a 1-4 Player Co-op Survival Horror. You must escape this endless nightmare. Try to identify the correct path and survive the anomalies in this endless school. Some extremely powerful anomalies will catch you to their dimensions. Explore the reason why you are here... and don\'t die.','2025/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2802820/School_666/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2407,'planet_zoo:_europe_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1726150/Planet_Zoo_Europe_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2408,'yakuza_5_remastered',NULL,'Get ready for a Yakuza experience of unprecedented scale! Follow five characters across five Japanese cities, each trying to achieve their dream. The connections between them bring them together, but the conflict that unfolds is nothing any of them could have predicted.','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1105510/Yakuza_5_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2409,'lumberjacked',NULL,'You wake up in a strange cabin deep in a mysterious forest, axe in hand, with only one way forward—through. Chop trees, sell logs, purchase and upgrade gear, and uncover the secrets hidden deep in the forest.','2025/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3593780/Lumberjacked/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2410,'stellaris:_necroids_species_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2020/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1341520/Stellaris_Necroids_Species_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2411,'we_were_here_expeditions:_the_friendship',NULL,'Partner up with your friend online and test your friendship by solving puzzles together in an abandoned amusement park. Work together to overcome brain-teasing challenges in this standalone We Were Here experience.','2023/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2296990/We_Were_Here_Expeditions_The_FriendShip/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2412,'contractors',NULL,'Contractors is a team-based competitive multiplayer shooter game for virtual reality devices. Experience the next level virtual warfare with hardcore controls, lethal weapons, customizable load-outs, and intense firefights. BECOME AN OPERATOR.','2018/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/963930/Contractors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2413,'ark_animated_series_109-costumes_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game ARK: Survival Ascended on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3571730/ARK_Animated_Series_109Costumes_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2414,'scarlet_nexus',NULL,'Choose between Yuito and Kasane, elite psionics each armed with a talent in psychokinesis and their own reason to fight. Complete both of their stories to unlock all the mysteries of a Brain Punk future caught between technology and psychic abilities.','2021/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/775500/SCARLET_NEXUS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2415,'atelier_sophie_2:_the_alchemist_of_the_mysterious_dream',NULL,'A mysterious story of a mysterious dream ... This is a story about one of the adventures Sophie the Alchemist had after she left her hometown of Kirchen Bell.','2022/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1621310/Atelier_Sophie_2_The_Alchemist_of_the_Mysterious_Dream/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2416,'mega_man_battle_network_legacy_collection_vol._1',NULL,'The renowned Mega Man Battle Network series is back! Vol. 1 contains Mega Man Battle Network 1-3, including both versions of Mega Man Battle Network 3 for a total of four titles, plus additional features like a gallery of illustrations and music! In addition, online play is supported!','2023/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1798010/Mega_Man_Battle_Network_Legacy_Collection_Vol_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2417,'voin',NULL,'Crafted by a solo developer, VOIN is a first-person hack-and-slash. Cleave through hordes of enemies in fast-paced combat. Explore dark fantasy realms filled with secrets and dangers. Discover powerful gear and weapons, and face menacing bosses in your quest to cleanse a broken world.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2464530/VOIN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2418,'touhou_danmaku_kagura_phantasia_lost',NULL,'\"The collapse of Gensokyo... it was all you - \" To rebuild the now barren phantasia, Reimu\'s journey begins. A Touhou Project officially approved derivative rhythm action game.','2024/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2190220/Touhou_Danmaku_Kagura_Phantasia_Lost/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2419,'yakuza_4_remastered',NULL,'When a dark secret brings a loan shark, a death-row inmate, a corrupt cop and the legendary yakuza Kazuma Kiryu together the resulting war in Kamurocho might level the district to the ground.','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1105500/Yakuza_4_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2420,'total_war:_warhammer_-_the_king_and_the_warlord',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2016/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/404014/Total_War_WARHAMMER__The_King_and_the_Warlord/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2421,'live_a_live',NULL,'The legend is alive! LIVE A LIVE, originally only released for the Super Famicom in Japan, is being revived on Steam! Experience this legendary RPG, brought alive in the same HD-2D visual style as OCTOPATH TRAVELER.','2023/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2014380/LIVE_A_LIVE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2422,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_labrador_retriever',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2631430/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Labrador_Retriever/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2423,'new_cycle',NULL,'New Cycle is a city building game with focus on survival. After an apocalyptic series of solar flares, human society has been thrown into disarray. Establish a settlement and develop it all the way from humble beginnings to industrial metropolis.','2024/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2198510/New_Cycle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2424,'my_time_at_portia',NULL,'Start a new life in the enchanting town of Portia! Restore your Pa\'s neglected workshop to its former glory by fulfilling commissions, growing crops, raising animals, and befriending the quirky inhabitants of this charming post-apocalyptic land!','2019/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/666140/My_Time_at_Portia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2425,'hole',NULL,'Casual & Hard FPS. Be careful with jam.','2024/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2971610/HOLE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2426,'dcs:_syria',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1120300/DCS_Syria/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2427,'hypnospace_outlaw',NULL,'Greetings Enforcer, and thank you for enlisting in the Hypnospace Patrol Department! As the world falls into its slumber, Hypnospace becomes a bustling global village. These virtual streets aren\'t going to police themselves!','2019/3/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/844590/Hypnospace_Outlaw/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2428,'demeo',NULL,'Adventurers, it’s time to unite! Gather your friends and battle the dark forces that have overtaken the world of Resolution Games\' award-winning RPG dungeon crawler, Demeo. The next generation of tabletop adventure has arrived!','2021/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1484280/Demeo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2429,'inkbound',NULL,'A turn-based tactical roguelike from the creators of Monster Train. Play solo or co-op, create powerful builds, and save the Atheneum.','2024/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1062810/Inkbound/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2430,'cities:_skylines_-_green_cities',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2017/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/614580/Cities_Skylines__Green_Cities/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2431,'tainted_grail:_conquest',NULL,'A unique, infinitely replayable, story-driven hybrid between a deck-building Roguelike and an RPG game. Explore the ever-changing maps, fight with deadly enemies, and learn what happened to the cursed island of Avalon.','2021/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1199030/Tainted_Grail_Conquest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2432,'persona_5_tactica',NULL,'Join the Phantom Thieves as they lead an uprising of the heart! Assemble an all-star team of heroes in a brand-new story in this thrilling combat adventure set in Persona’s iconic universe.','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2254740/Persona_5_Tactica/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2433,'vtol_vr:_ef-24_mischief_-_electronic_warfare',NULL,'This content requires the base game VTOL VR on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2531290/VTOL_VR_EF24_Mischief__Electronic_Warfare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2434,'banished',NULL,'In this city-building strategy game, you control a group of exiled travelers who decide to restart their lives in a new land. They have only the clothes on their backs and a cart filled with supplies from their homeland. The townspeople of Banished are your primary resource.','2014/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/242920/Banished/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2435,'the_expanse:_a_telltale_series',NULL,'Take on the role of Camina Drummer and explore the dangerous, uncharted edges of the Belt. From scavenging wrecked ships in a zero-g environment, to combating fearsome pirates, you make the difficult choices in this latest Telltale adventure. All five episodes playable at launch!','2023/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1708010/The_Expanse_A_Telltale_Series/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2436,'kaiserpunk',NULL,'Build a city to rule the world in Kaiserpunk, a grand city builder blending production-focused city building with world conquest in an alternate 20th century world. Manage your city, grow industries, build a military, and defeat rivals to become the greatest empire.','2025/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2012190/KAISERPUNK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2437,'metro:_last_light_redux',NULL,'It is the year 2034. Beneath the ruins of post-apocalyptic Moscow, in the tunnels of the Metro, the remnants of mankind are besieged by deadly threats from outside – and within. Mutants stalk the catacombs beneath the desolate surface, and hunt amidst the poisoned skies above.','2014/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/287390/Metro_Last_Light_Redux/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2438,'heroes®_of_might_&_magic®_iii_-_hd_edition',NULL,'The most popular Heroes® title of all time is back in HD! Fifteen years later, rediscover the epic tale of Queen Catherine Ironfist, as she re-embarks on her critically acclaimed quest to unite her ravaged homeland and re-conquer the kingdom of Erathia.','2015/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/297000/Heroes_of_Might__Magic_III__HD_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2439,'assetto_corsa_competizione_-_challengers_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa Competizione on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1865950/Assetto_Corsa_Competizione__Challengers_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2440,'immortals_fenyx_rising',NULL,'Immortals Fenyx Rising brings grand mythological adventure to life. Play as Fenyx on a quest to save the Greek gods.','2022/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2221920/Immortals_Fenyx_Rising/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2441,'undecember',NULL,'UNDECEMBER is a Hack & Slash Action RPG in which players are able to surpass the conventional limits of skills by endlessly combining variety of Skill and Link Runes. Become a Rune Hunter and experience the joy of farming and growth!','2022/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1549250/UNDECEMBER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2442,'ages_of_conflict:_world_war_simulator',NULL,'Ages of Conflict is a versatile Map Simulation game where you create and observe custom AI nations battle it out across an infinite number of worlds. Paint beautiful maps and scenarios, and command nations to change history into your liking!','2023/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2186320/Ages_of_Conflict_World_War_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2443,'monster_prom',NULL,'You have 3 weeks to get a date for Monster Prom! Go through absurd and funny situations, raise your stats and seduce one of your classmates. Beautiful art, bold, unapologetic dialogue and hard choices make up this Multiplayer (1-4 players) Dating Sim. Be your worst self.','2018/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/743450/Monster_Prom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2444,'adventure_capitalist',NULL,'Welcome, eager young investor, to AdVenture Capitalist! Arguably the world\'s greatest Capitalism simulator!','2015/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/346900/AdVenture_Capitalist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2445,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_bmw_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2601200/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__BMW_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2446,'furnish_master',NULL,'Furnish Master is a relaxing game about furnishing apartments, houses, commercial estate and even outdoor territory! Realize your design dreams!','2024/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2004080/Furnish_Master/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2447,'x4:_cradle_of_humanity',NULL,'This content requires the base game X4: Foundations on Steam in order to play.','2021/3/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1288460/X4_Cradle_of_Humanity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2448,'talisman:_digital_5th_edition',NULL,'For the first time in Talisman, customise your own epic adventures to play solo or with friends. Discover a world where every journey is a fresh experience in this latest digital adaptation of the beloved fantasy adventure board game.','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/908060/Talisman_Digital_5th_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2449,'war_thunder_-_t-80u-e1_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game War Thunder on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3010120/War_Thunder__T80UE1_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2450,'stormworks:_industrial_frontier',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stormworks: Build and Rescue on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2124750/Stormworks_Industrial_Frontier/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2451,'kebab_chefs!_-_restaurant_simulator',NULL,'Kebab Chefs! is a Co-Op, cooking and restaurant management game that can be played up to 4 players. Design your own restaurant. Cook delicious foods, fill your menu with various recipes, feed customers and become the biggest kebab restaurant in town!','2024/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1001270/Kebab_Chefs__Restaurant_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2452,'dead_by_daylight_-_a_nightmare_on_elm_street™',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2017/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/700282/Dead_by_Daylight__A_Nightmare_on_Elm_Street/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2453,'warframe:_yareli_prime_access_-_weapons_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warframe on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3678020/Warframe_Yareli_Prime_Access__Weapons_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_51'),(2454,'outbrk',NULL,'Storm Chasing Simulator','2024/6/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1107320/OUTBRK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2455,'world_of_final_fantasy®',NULL,'CAPTURE, CUSTOMISE AND EVOLVE! Embark on a magical journey with siblings Reynn and Lann as they explore the vast land of Grymoire to rediscover their past and save the future.','2017/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/552700/WORLD_OF_FINAL_FANTASY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2456,'operator',NULL,'In OPERATOR, you will play as an elite \"Tier 1\" operator undergoing dangerous clandestine operations all over the globe. With a strategic, measured, and unforgiving style of gameplay. You are the tactical advantage, Good luck.','2023/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1913370/OPERATOR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2457,'fishing_planet:_congo_discovery_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1200349/Fishing_Planet_Congo_Discovery_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2458,'the_talos_principle_2_-_road_to_elysium',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Talos Principle 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2981410/The_Talos_Principle_2__Road_to_Elysium/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2459,'easy_red_2:_stalingrad',NULL,'This content requires the base game Easy Red 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1888350/Easy_Red_2_Stalingrad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2460,'forza_horizon_5:_hot_wheels',NULL,'This content requires the base game Forza Horizon 5 on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1613280/Forza_Horizon_5_Hot_Wheels/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2461,'a_date_with_death_-_beyond_the_bet_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game A Date with Death on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2799720/A_Date_with_Death__Beyond_the_Bet_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2462,'rising_storm_2:_vietnam',NULL,'Red Orchestra Series\' take on Vietnam: 64-player MP matches; 20+ maps; US Army & Marines, PAVN/NVA, NLF/VC; Australians and ARVN forces; 50+ weapons; 4 flyable helicopters; mines, traps and tunnels; Brutal. Authentic. Gritty. Character customization. And napalm in the morning.','2017/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/418460/Rising_Storm_2_Vietnam/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2463,'gogh:_focus_with_your_avatar',NULL,'gogh: Focus with Your Avatar is more than a focus tool – it’s a cozy blend of avatar creation, room design, and virtual pet game. Build your perfect space, vibe with Lofi beats, and let your cute avatar and quirky companion turn work into pure fun!','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3213850/gogh_Focus_with_Your_Avatar/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2464,'far_cry®_2',NULL,'You are a gun for hire, trapped in a war-torn African state, stricken with malaria and forced to make deals with corrupt warlords on both sides of the conflict in order to make this country your home. You must identify and exploit your enemies\' weaknesses, neutralizing their superior numbers and firepower with surprise, subversion,...','2008/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/19900/Far_Cry_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2465,'iron_harvest',NULL,'A classic real-time strategy game with an epic single player campaign, multiplayer & coop, set in the alternate reality of 1920+','2020/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/826630/Iron_Harvest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2466,'mechwarrior_5:_mercenaries_-_heroes_of_the_inner_sphere',NULL,'This content requires the base game MechWarrior 5: Mercenaries on Steam in order to play.','2021/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1456180/MechWarrior_5_Mercenaries__Heroes_of_the_Inner_Sphere/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2467,'samurai_warriors_4_dx',NULL,'The sparks of destiny ignite in this rich depiction of the Warring States period that features a total of 55 different officers. The deluxe edition contains more than 150 previously released DLC from \"SAMURAI WARRIORS 4,\" including costumes, weapons, customization parts, scenarios, and BGM!','2024/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2719200/SAMURAI_WARRIORS_4_DX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2468,'opus_magnum',NULL,'Opus Magnum is the latest open-ended puzzle game from Zachtronics, the creators of SpaceChem, Infinifactory, and SHENZHEN I/O. Design and build machines that assemble potions, poisons, and more using the alchemical engineer’s most advanced tool: the transmutation engine!','2017/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/558990/Opus_Magnum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2469,'life_makeover',NULL,'Explore Life Makeover: Unleash your style, dye outfits, and design freely. Dive into unlimited dress-up, build your dream home - all for free.','2023/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2626940/Life_Makeover/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2470,'wrestling_empire',NULL,'The lightweight champion of wrestling comes full circle with higher resolution visuals and a smoother frame rate - whilst still retaining the retro style that puts the fun first! Now featuring whole other booking & roaming modes at no extra cost for the biggest Triple Threat in wrestling.','2021/7/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1620340/Wrestling_Empire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2471,'forza_horizon_5_vip',NULL,'This content requires the base game Forza Horizon 5 on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1613283/Forza_Horizon_5_VIP/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2472,'stellaris:_ancient_relics_story_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1045980/Stellaris_Ancient_Relics_Story_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2473,'star_overdrive',NULL,'Star Overdrive is a high-speed action adventure set in an open world. Race across an alien planet on your Hoverboard, mastering tricks, battling enemies, solving puzzles, and using your powers to overcome challenges and shape your destiny!','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2055590/Star_Overdrive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2474,'moonlighter',NULL,'Moonlighter is an Action RPG with rogue-lite elements that demonstrates two sides of the coin – revealing everyday routines of Will, an adventurous shopkeeper that secretly dreams of becoming a hero.','2018/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/606150/Moonlighter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2475,'software_inc.',NULL,'Construct and design buildings for optimal working conditions. Hire people to design and release software, so you can defeat the simulated competition and take over their businesses. Manage and educate your employees to make sure they are skilled and satisfied with their job.','2015/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/362620/Software_Inc/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2476,'command_&_conquer™_generals_zero_hour',NULL,'Command & Conquer Generals Zero Hour brings you closer to the enemy than ever before. Engage opposing forces at hot spots around the globe as you match strategies and arsenals against the new masterminds of modern war.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2732960/Command__Conquer_Generals_Zero_Hour/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2477,'command_&_conquer_renegade™',NULL,'Command & Conquer gets up close and personal in this classic First Person Shooter for one of the most iconic franchises.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2229890/Command__Conquer_Renegade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2478,'command_&_conquer™_generals',NULL,'Be the Ultimate Modern Warfare General','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2229870/Command__Conquer_Generals/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2479,'command_&_conquer_red_alert™,_counterstrike™_and_the_aftermath™',NULL,'Surrender is not an option','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2229840/Command__Conquer_Red_Alert_Counterstrike_and_The_Aftermath/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2480,'command_&_conquer™_tiberian_sun™_and_firestorm™',NULL,'The Second Tiberium War begins in this legendary sequel to the original Command & Conquer. With his forces stronger than ever, arch villain and leader of The Brotherhood of Nod - Kane - is pitched in an epic battle against the world\'s war machine - the Global Defense Initiative.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2229880/Command__Conquer_Tiberian_Sun_and_Firestorm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2481,'age_of_mythology:_extended_edition',NULL,'Age of Mythology is back! Choose your god and take to the battlefield in this classic, upgraded with full Steamworks integration and enhanced features.','2014/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/266840/Age_of_Mythology_Extended_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2482,'command_&_conquer_red_alert™_2_and_yuri’s_revenge™',NULL,'The world erupts in conflict as Soviet forces invade American soil in Command & Conquer: Red Alert 2. You are the Supreme Commander. Arm yourself to the teeth with top-secret technologies and lead the Soviet or Allied troops to victory.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2229850/Command__Conquer_Red_Alert_2_and_Yuris_Revenge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2483,'superhot',NULL,'SUPERHOT is the smash-hit FPS where time moves only when you move. No regenerating health bars. No conveniently placed ammo drops. It\'s you, alone, outnumbered and outgunned. Snatch weapons from fallen enemies to shoot, slice and dodge through a truly cinematic hurricane of slow-motion bullets.','2016/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/322500/SUPERHOT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2484,'dune:_spice_wars_-_house_vernius_of_ix',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dune: Spice Wars on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2807090/Dune_Spice_Wars__House_Vernius_of_Ix/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2485,'class_of_\'09:_the_flip_side',NULL,'The final chapter of the Class of \'09 VN series... this time from a different perspective! Join Nicole\'s best friend Jecka as you help her navigate the pitfalls of post-grad life! See what 2009 was truly like in this fully voiced interactive sitcom!','2024/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2757330/Class_of_09_The_Flip_Side/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2486,'two_point_campus:_medical_school',NULL,'This content requires the base game Two Point Campus on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2195430/Two_Point_Campus_Medical_School/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2487,'the_riftbreaker:_into_the_dark',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Riftbreaker on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2108630/The_Riftbreaker_Into_The_Dark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2488,'worms_armageddon',NULL,'Those intrepid invertebrates return with a vengeance in the much-loved Worms™ Armageddon. It’s a whole new can of worms! It’s hilarious fun that you can enjoy on your own or with all your friends.','1999/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/217200/Worms_Armageddon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2489,'job_simulator',NULL,'In a world where robots have replaced all human jobs, step into the \"Job Simulator\" to learn what it was like \'to job\'.','2016/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/448280/Job_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2490,'wartorn',NULL,'Harness the elements in fierce real-time battles while gathering and upgrading a crew of fantasy creatures in this rogue-lite adventure across a world torn apart by war.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1296660/Wartorn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2491,'breachway',NULL,'Explore the galaxy in this deckbuilding, sci-fi roguelike where ship upgrades and crew management are key to your survival. Optimize resource generation, engage in intense turn-based battles, and take on ever-growing threats as you seek out The Signal.','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2118810/Breachway/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2492,'savara',NULL,'In this colorful action roguelite, participate in the festivities organized for the pleasure of the warrior god. Equip your best weapons, prove your valor against powerful monsters, and permanently engrave your name in history!','2025/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3021630/Savara/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2493,'movies_tycoon',NULL,'Movies Tycoon is a simulation game where you dive into the world of film-making. Start with a humble studio, scout and manage top talent, customize unique characters, and direct blockbuster films.','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2659050/Movies_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2494,'netherworld_covenant',NULL,'In the abyss where the mortal realm and netherworld intertwine, become a warrior wielding the power of the Nether Lantern to fight along with the fallen souls. With hardcore, soulslike action and intriguing roguelike builds, shatter the cursed barriers and unveil the truth woven from blood and soul.','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2735580/Netherworld_Covenant/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2495,'endless™_legend',NULL,'ENDLESS™ Legend is a 4X turn-based fantasy strategy game by the creators of ENDLESS™ Space and Dungeon of the ENDLESS™. Control every aspect of your civilization as you struggle to save your homeworld Auriga. Create your own Legend!','2014/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/289130/ENDLESS_Legend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2496,'arco',NULL,'A Mesoamerican fantasy RPG that blends turn-based and real-time combat. Explore the world through three handcrafted stories forged in bloodshed, laced with magic, and united by revenge.','2024/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2366970/Arco/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2497,'cult_of_the_lamb:_heretic_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cult of the Lamb on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2331540/Cult_of_the_Lamb_Heretic_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2498,'zombie_army_trilogy',NULL,'The cult horror shooter series comes to an apocalyptic conclusion with an epic new third chapter, a heart-pumping new horde mode, and remastered editions of the best-selling Nazi Zombie Army 1 & 2.','2015/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/301640/Zombie_Army_Trilogy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2499,'battle_brothers_-_blazing_deserts',NULL,'This content requires the base game Battle Brothers on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1361280/Battle_Brothers__Blazing_Deserts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2500,'icaria',NULL,'Icaria is a robot colony builder where everything can be programmed. Build factories, design logistic networks, terraform the landscape, and explore an unknown alien world.','2025/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2613890/Icaria/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2501,'nodebuster',NULL,'Nodebuster is a short, experimental incremental game about busting nodes and destroying reality.','2024/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3107330/Nodebuster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2502,'call_of_duty®:_black_ops_iii_-_der_eisendrache_zombies_map',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of Duty®: Black Ops III on Steam in order to play.','2018/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/830450/Call_of_Duty_Black_Ops_III__Der_Eisendrache_Zombies_Map/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2503,'metro_2033_redux',NULL,'In 2013 the world was devastated by an apocalyptic event, annihilating almost all mankind and turning the Earth\'s surface into a poisonous wasteland. A handful of survivors took refuge in the depths of the Moscow underground, and human civilization entered a new Dark Age. The year is 2033.','2014/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/286690/Metro_2033_Redux/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_52'),(2504,'dead_space_(2008)',NULL,'You are Isaac Clarke, an engineer on the spacecraft USG Ishimura. You\'re not a warrior. You\'re not a soldier. You are, however, the last line of defense for the remaining living crew.','2008/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/17470/Dead_Space_2008/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2505,'final_fantasy_tactics_-_the_ivalice_chronicles',NULL,'Featuring fully voiced dialogue, beautifully enhanced graphics, and countless gameplay improvements, the genre-defining tactical RPG makes its long-awaited return.','2025/9/30','Unreleased','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1004640/FINAL_FANTASY_TACTICS__The_Ivalice_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2506,'coromon',NULL,'Coromon is a modern take on the classic monster-taming genre. Tame Coromon and explore a vast world filled with thrilling turn-based battles, brain-twisting puzzles, and a mysterious threat to the world awaiting defeat. Nobody said being a Battle Researcher was easy!','2022/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1218210/Coromon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2507,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_yukon_valley',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1093700/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Yukon_Valley/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2508,'easy_red_2:_ardennes_1940_&_1944',NULL,'This content requires the base game Easy Red 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2617770/Easy_Red_2_Ardennes_1940__1944/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2509,'rollercoaster_tycoon®_classic',NULL,'Create incredible parks in the original rollercoaster sim from Chris Sawyer.','2017/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/683900/RollerCoaster_Tycoon_Classic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2510,'sonic_&_all-stars_racing_transformed_collection',NULL,'Compete across land, water and air in incredible transforming vehicles that change from cars to boats to planes mid-race.','2013/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/212480/Sonic__AllStars_Racing_Transformed_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2511,'dead_cells:_the_queen_and_the_sea',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead Cells on Steam in order to play.','2022/1/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1580050/Dead_Cells_The_Queen_and_the_Sea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2512,'stormworks:_space',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stormworks: Build and Rescue on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2383250/Stormworks_Space/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2513,'chronicles_of_the_wolf',NULL,'Hunt the legendary Beast of Gévaudan in Chronicles of the Wolf! Step into the boots of Mateo Lombardo in this epic adventure featuring brutal bosses, vast castles, and secrets to uncover. Narration by the legendary Robert Belgrade and other special appearances!','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2371890/Chronicles_of_the_Wolf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2514,'kart_racing_pro',NULL,'Kart Racing Pro is a realistic karting simulator. The aim is to create a software useful as a training tool for real drivers, based on a scratch built physics engine that accurately simulates kart dynamics and setup options.','2017/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/415600/Kart_Racing_Pro/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2515,'monster_prom_2:_monster_camp',NULL,'\"Monster Prom 2: Monster Camp\" brings you more of the world\'s best (and maybe only?) multiplayer dating sim; but in a way you\'ve never expected!','2020/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1140270/Monster_Prom_2_Monster_Camp/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2516,'unrailed!',NULL,'Unrailed! is a co-op multiplayer game where you have to work together with your friends to build a train track across endless procedurally generated worlds. Master random encounters with its inhabitants, upgrade your train and keep it from derailing!','2020/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1016920/Unrailed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2517,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_kässbohrer_trailer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3034950/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Kssbohrer_Trailer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2518,'arizona_sunshine®_remake',NULL,'Arizona Sunshine® Remake elevates the original, award-winning game, completely rebuilt with GORE-geous VR graphics and next-gen VR combat and weapons. Face the undead alone or with up to three fellow survivors in a post-apocalyptic southwestern America overrun by zombies.','2024/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2897700/Arizona_Sunshine_Remake/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2519,'children_of_morta',NULL,'Children of Morta is a story-driven action RPG game about an extraordinary family of heroes. Lead the Bergsons, with all their flaws and virtues, against the forthcoming Corruption. Will you be able to sacrifice everything to save the ones you care for?','2019/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/330020/Children_of_Morta/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2520,'rising_front',NULL,'A FPS WW1 & Revolutionary War battle simulator with a focus on Workshop Content, rag-doll physics, intelligent AI, massive battles, procedural AI cover system, real-time building system and FPS combat!','2023/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1560250/Rising_Front/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2521,'harold_halibut',NULL,'Harold Halibut is a handmade narrative game about friendship and life on a city-sized spaceship submerged in an alien ocean. Join Harold as he explores a vibrant retro-future world in his quest to find the true meaning of ‘home’.','2024/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/924750/Harold_Halibut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2522,'clone_drone_in_the_hyperdome',NULL,'Cut robots apart in VR. Feel your sword disintegrate their metal bodies. Now you live and die in the Crashloop, a roguelike tournament to the death. Lock swords! Shoot shurikens from your wrist! This is CLONE DRONE... in the HYPERDOME!!!','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2401230/Clone_Drone_in_the_Hyperdome/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2523,'stellaris:_lithoids_species_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1140000/Stellaris_Lithoids_Species_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2524,'backpack_hero',NULL,'The inventory management roguelike! Collect rare items, organize your backpack, and vanquish your foes!','2023/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1970580/Backpack_Hero/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2525,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_heavy_cargo_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2017/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/531131/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Heavy_Cargo_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2526,'house_party_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game House Party on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3487780/House_Party__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2527,'call_to_arms',NULL,'Call to Arms offers an innovative mix of real-time strategy and 3rd, as well as 1st person controls. Set in the time of modern warfare, the game offers realistically modeled vehicles and heavy weaponry. Command your troops to victory or fight by yourself in the 3rd or 1st person action mode.','2018/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/302670/Call_to_Arms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2528,'the_legend_of_heroes:_trails_to_azure',NULL,'The Special Support Section is back with more members and more cases to solve! How will this rag-tag group deal with the oncoming threats to Crossbell’s political stability while maintaining their team’s foundation?','2023/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1668520/The_Legend_of_Heroes_Trails_to_Azure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2529,'warhammer_40,000:_inquisitor_-_martyr_-_hierophant_class',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Inquisitor - Martyr on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3003800/Warhammer_40000_Inquisitor__Martyr__Hierophant_Class/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2530,'fishing_planet:_ocean_voyager_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2922530/Fishing_Planet_Ocean_Voyager_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2531,'crusader_kings_iii_content_creator_pack:_medieval_monuments',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings III on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3315540/Crusader_Kings_III_Content_Creator_Pack_Medieval_Monuments/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2532,'despelote',NULL,'A slice-of-life adventure about childhood and the magical grip soccer held over the people of Quito, Ecuador in 2001.','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2367820/despelote/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2533,'conan_exiles:_isle_of_siptah',NULL,'This content requires the base game Conan Exiles on Steam in order to play.','2021/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1206200/Conan_Exiles_Isle_of_Siptah/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2534,'kingdom_come:_deliverance_ii_the_lion’s_crest',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Come: Deliverance II on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3118100/Kingdom_Come_Deliverance_II_The_Lions_Crest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2535,'finnish_cottage_simulator',NULL,'Finnish Cottage Simulator is the ultimate cottage experience. Relax and enjoy the Finnish summer nature, go to the sauna, get drunk, grill food or play games with others!','2024/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1723780/Finnish_Cottage_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2536,'deep_rock_galactic_-_order_of_the_deep_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Deep Rock Galactic on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2934390/Deep_Rock_Galactic__Order_of_the_Deep_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2537,'bokura',NULL,'BOKURA is a two-player puzzle adventure game. Play as two boys who ran away from their homes and work together to take yourselves somewhere far, far away. Relive the friendship of your childhood through the journey of two boys.','2023/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1801110/BOKURA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2538,'cell_to_singularity_-_evolution_never_ends',NULL,'The epic story of evolution, technology, humanity, and dinosaurs is yours to tap.','2021/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/977400/Cell_to_Singularity__Evolution_Never_Ends/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2539,'police_simulator:_patrol_officers:_highway_patrol_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Police Simulator: Patrol Officers on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2350410/Police_Simulator_Patrol_Officers_Highway_Patrol_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2540,'wildmender',NULL,'A desert gardening survival game. Start from a tiny spring and cultivate a blooming garden. Explore a vast world amid the sands and uncover its mysteries. Can you defend against the relentless forces of nature and mysterious wraith corruption, to bring life to a dying world?','2023/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1599330/Wildmender/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2541,'total_war:_warhammer_-_chaos_warriors',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2016/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/404010/Total_War_WARHAMMER__Chaos_Warriors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2542,'chernobylite_complete_edition',NULL,'Chernobylite is a science-fiction survival horror RPG. Set in the hyper-realistic, 3D-scanned wasteland of Chernobyl’s Exclusion Zone, explore a non-linear storyline in your search to uncover the truth of your tortured past.','2021/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1016800/Chernobylite_Complete_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2543,'amber_isle',NULL,'Welcome to Amber Isle - a quaint, friendly village of prehistoric residents who are in need of a new shopkeep... That’s you! Craft and sell items, upgrade your shop, befriend your Paleofolk neighbours and customise the island to bring the village back to life and welcome even more prehistoric pals!','2024/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1663040/Amber_Isle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2544,'cossacks_3',NULL,'Cossacks 3 is the return of RTS classics. Obtain resources, build cities and research technologies while taking command of great armies, crushing enemies in grand historical warfares on land and sea!','2016/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/333420/Cossacks_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2545,'digseum',NULL,'Digseum is a short incremental journey about digging up ancient relics and building the greatest museum ever!','2024/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3361470/Digseum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2546,'deliver_us_the_moon',NULL,'Deliver Us The Moon is a Sci-Fi thriller set in an apocalyptic near future, where Earth\'s natural resources are depleted. A lone astronaut is sent to the moon on a critical mission to save humanity from extinction.','2019/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/428660/Deliver_Us_The_Moon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2547,'victoria_3:_melodies_for_the_masses_music_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Victoria 3 on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2348450/Victoria_3_Melodies_for_the_Masses_Music_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2548,'escape_simulator:_magic_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Escape Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2419810/Escape_Simulator_Magic_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2549,'railway_empire',NULL,'In Railway Empire, you will create an elaborate and wide-ranging rail network, purchase over 40 different trains modelled in extraordinary detail, and buy or build railway stations, maintenance buildings, factories and tourist attractions to keep your travel network ahead of the competition.','2018/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/503940/Railway_Empire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2550,'gunfire_reborn_-_artisan_and_magician',NULL,'This content requires the base game Gunfire Reborn on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2430400/Gunfire_Reborn__Artisan_and_Magician/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2551,'granado_espada',NULL,'Granado Espada, the long-standing MMORPG beloved in dozens of countries around the world for its unique control system that allows you to take the role of up to 3 different characters simultaneously! Now available in English to Southeast Asia players, from imcgames.','2017/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/663090/Granado_Espada/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2552,'5d_chess_with_multiverse_time_travel',NULL,'It\'s the first ever chess variant with spatial, temporal, and parallel dimensions. It\'s 5D Chess With Multiverse Time Travel! Move pieces back in time to create branching timelines. Send a rook to a parallel dimension. Protect your kings in the present and in the past!','2020/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1349230/5D_Chess_With_Multiverse_Time_Travel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_53'),(2553,'expelled!',NULL,'A School Prefect has been pushed out of a window, and everyone\'s blaming YOU. Can you find the culprit - or someone to take the fall - before you get EXPELLED? Mystery with a wicked twist, from the creators of Overboard!, 80 Days, Heaven\'s Vault and A Highland Song.','2025/3/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2963890/Expelled/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2554,'monster_hunter_stories_2:_wings_of_ruin',NULL,'A new adventure awaits you in this second installment of the turn-based RPG series set in the world of Monster Hunter! Become a Rider and form bonds with friendly monsters known as Monsties to fight alongside them as you take part in an epic story.','2021/7/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1277400/Monster_Hunter_Stories_2_Wings_of_Ruin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2555,'automobilista_2_-_lamborghini_dream_pack_pt1',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3023000/Automobilista_2__Lamborghini_Dream_Pack_Pt1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2556,'warhammer_40,000:_space_marine_2_-_white_scars_chapter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2792190/Warhammer_40000_Space_Marine_2__White_Scars_Chapter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2557,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_special_transport',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2017/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/558245/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Special_Transport/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2558,'7_days_to_end_with_you',NULL,'To know a language, know the world, and finally know you.','2022/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1859280/7_Days_to_End_with_You/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2559,'reus_2',NULL,'Shape worlds with your godly titans. Make symbiotic ecosystems and inspire humanity with your creations. Their achievements unlock new possibilities. Make different planets for different human spirits, and fill the universe with life!','2024/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1875060/Reus_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2560,'the_outlast_trials_-_unholy_night_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Outlast Trials on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3307910/The_Outlast_Trials__Unholy_Night_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2561,'zero_escape:_the_nonary_games',NULL,'Kidnapped and taken to an unfamiliar location, nine people find themselves forced to participate in a diabolical Nonary Game by an enigmatic mastermind called Zero. Why were they there? Why were they chosen to put their lives on the line? And more importantly, who can be trusted?','2017/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/477740/Zero_Escape_The_Nonary_Games/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2562,'arctic_eggs',NULL,'Eggs: perfection in two parts. The simple whites. The sublime yolk. Each the lesser without its partner. Chorus and verse. A symphony of flavor. The catchy tune reminding us of warm baths and late-night movies. The elevator music to whatever lies beyond.','2024/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2763670/Arctic_Eggs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2563,'pathologic_2',NULL,'Pathologic 2 is a groundbreaking open-world horror RPG. Resist the plague. Make medicine. Heal people. Perform an autopsy. Trade to get what you need. Fight and kill if necessary. Survive. Struggle with an outbreak in a secluded rural town that is rapidly turning into hell.','2019/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/505230/Pathologic_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2564,'darksiders_iii',NULL,'Return to an apocalyptic Earth in Darksiders III, a hack-n-slash Action Adventure where players assume the role of FURY in her quest to hunt down and dispose of the Seven Deadly Sins. The most enigmatic of the Four Horsemen, FURY must bring balance to the forces that now ravage Earth.','2018/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/606280/Darksiders_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2565,'automobilista_2_-_circuit_des_24_heures_du_mans',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2697790/Automobilista_2__Circuit_des_24_Heures_du_Mans/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2566,'ember_knights',NULL,'Ember Knights is an action rogue-lite for 1-4 players where you play as legendary knights, the last spark of hope against the mad sorcerer Praxis and his hordes of unwavering fiends. Wield weapons & skills, build synergies with game-changing relics and free the universe of Praxis’ corruption.','2023/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1135230/Ember_Knights/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2567,'shakes_and_fidget',NULL,'Shakes & Fidget is a hilarious fantasy role-playing satire and at the same time, an award-winning RPG! Sounds crazy? With over 50 million enthusiastic players, it ranks among the most celebrated online role-playing games worldwide!','2016/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/438040/Shakes_and_Fidget/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2568,'mirror\'s_edge™_catalyst',NULL,'Mirror\'s Edge™ Catalyst raises the action-adventure bar through fluid, first person action and immerses players in Faith\'s story as she fights for freedom.','2016/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1233570/Mirrors_Edge_Catalyst/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2569,'abzu',NULL,'From the art director of Journey®, ABZÛ is a beautiful underwater adventure that evokes the dream of diving. Immerse yourself in a vibrant hidden world bursting with color and life as you descend into the heart of the ocean. But beware as you swim deeper as dangers lurk in the depths.','2016/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/384190/ABZU/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2570,'spirit_city:_lofi_sessions_-_cozy_kitchen_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Spirit City: Lofi Sessions on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3210380/Spirit_City_Lofi_Sessions__Cozy_Kitchen_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2571,'everspace™_2_-_titans',NULL,'This content requires the base game EVERSPACE™ 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2873460/EVERSPACE_2__Titans/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2572,'scorn',NULL,'Scorn is an atmospheric first-person horror adventure game set in a nightmarish universe of odd forms and somber tapestry.','2022/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/698670/Scorn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2573,'rentlord',NULL,'Rentlord is a combo-making roguelike real estate game where you buy properties, manage your income, and overcome unique weekly challenges. Strategic property upgrades and plugins with high combo potential, each run offers new opportunities to maximize rent, while avoiding taxes!','2025/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3546440/Rentlord/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2574,'dcs:_ah-64d',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1770580/DCS_AH64D/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2575,'arma_3_laws_of_war',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2017/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/571710/Arma_3_Laws_of_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2576,'scooterflow',NULL,'The world’s most realistic freestyle scooter game is finally here. Ride the skatepark, hit the streets, boost the mega ramp, fully customize your scooter & throw down all of the real life trick combinations you could dream of within this physics based scooter game.','2021/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1648390/ScooterFlow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2577,'lunar_eclipse',NULL,'Explore dark locations, solve puzzles, and uncover a gripping story. Fight or evade bloodthirsty zombies using wit and agility. Immerse yourself in a tense adventure with a charming blonde heroine in a chilling, atmospheric world.','2025/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2953480/Lunar_Eclipse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2578,'call_of_duty®_2',NULL,'Call of Duty® 2 redefines the cinematic intensity and chaos of battle as seen through the eyes of ordinary soldiers fighting together in epic WWII conflicts. The sequel to 2003\'s Call of Duty, winner of over 80 Game of the Year awards, Call of Duty 2 offers more immense, more intense, more realistic battles than ever before, thanks to...','2005/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2630/Call_of_Duty_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2579,'the_sims™_4_strangerville',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2019/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235742/The_Sims_4_StrangerVille/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2580,'ark_nova',NULL,'Plan and build a modern, scientifically managed zoo to support conservation projects in an acclaimed strategy board game.','2025/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2438990/Ark_Nova/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2581,'dead_by_daylight_-_end_transmission_chapter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2399750/Dead_by_Daylight__End_Transmission_Chapter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2582,'boxes:_lost_fragments',NULL,'As a legendary thief, your next assignment lures you into a grand and lavish mansion. There you find a series of puzzle boxes, designed for an unknown purpose. What should have been a quick in-and-out, gradually turns into your own harrowing struggle for freedom and answers.','2024/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2019810/Boxes_Lost_Fragments/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2583,'liftoff®:_micro_drones',NULL,'Explore the world of FPV like never before! In Liftoff®: Micro Drones any indoor area becomes an exciting aerial playground. Explore, customize and compete in this simulator dedicated to the micro drones class.','2021/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1432320/Liftoff_Micro_Drones/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2584,'scramble:_battle_of_britain',NULL,'Scramble: Battle of Britain is a tactical dogfighting game set in 1940, featuring intense aerial battles in a 3D airspace. Take control of a squadron of fighters, planning maneuvers, witnessing real-time simulations, and analyzing battle damage with detailed camera tools.','2024/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1530450/Scramble_Battle_of_Britain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2585,'obenseuer',NULL,'Obenseuer is an urban survival RPG game, where you become a property manager of a rundown unfinished tenement building, in an isolated quarantine district of Obenseuer. Maintain and upgrade your tenement for rent, uncover the secrets of this infamous district and grow your wealth with your craft.','2018/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/951240/Obenseuer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2586,'fallout_tactics:_brotherhood_of_steel',NULL,'Tactical Squad-Based Combat comes to the Fallout® Universe! You are the wretched refuse. You may be born from dirt, but we will forge you into steel. You will learn to bend; if not you, will you break. In these dark times, the Brotherhood - your Brotherhood - is all that stands between the rekindled flame of civilization and the howling,...','2001/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/38420/Fallout_Tactics_Brotherhood_of_Steel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2587,'surviving_the_aftermath',NULL,'Survive and thrive in a post-apocalyptic future — resources are scarce, but opportunity calls! Build the ultimate disaster proof colony, protect your colonists, and restore civilization to a devastated world.','2021/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/684450/Surviving_the_Aftermath/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2588,'survival:_fountain_of_youth',NULL,'Survival: Fountain of Youth is a challenging single-player open-world adventure game set on the Caribbean islands. Survive as a shipwrecked 16th-century explorer, craft tools and shelter, and uncover the secrets of both an ancient civilization and your own fate.','2024/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1967630/Survival_Fountain_of_Youth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2589,'underground_garage',NULL,'Dive into Underground Garage, a mechanic sim blending car customization with fast driving. Craft builds for every drive, test them in an open world filled with challenges. Gear up and rev up your ultimate automotive adventure!','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1452250/Underground_Garage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2590,'war_for_the_overworld',NULL,'War for the Overworld is an unholy union of Dungeon Management and Strategy that rewards all those villainous thoughts you’ve been having. Craft your own perilous dungeon and defend it against pesky heroes who keep exploring it and taking your stuff.','2015/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/230190/War_for_the_Overworld/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2591,'digimon_survive',NULL,'Digimon Survive presents a hybrid visual novel and tactical RPG set in a mysterious world filled with dangerous monsters and deadly battles that will test your ability to survive.','2022/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/871980/Digimon_Survive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2592,'mars_first_logistics',NULL,'Build physically simulated rovers to transport awkwardly shaped cargo across the rugged terrain of Mars. Earn funds, unlock new parts, and use your ingenuity to help the Martians establish a new home. Playable solo or in online co-op!','2023/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1532200/Mars_First_Logistics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2593,'urban_jungle',NULL,'Use luscious plants to turn your ordinary home into a green haven in Urban Jungle. Find the best place for each plant in your small apartment and enjoy gardening without worries. And don\'t forget to pet your cat!','2025/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2744010/Urban_Jungle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2594,'cities:_skylines_-_mass_transit',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2017/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/547502/Cities_Skylines__Mass_Transit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2595,'the_survivalists',NULL,'A living world full of surprises, secrets and danger awaits in The Survivalists, an adventure-filled survival sandbox set in The Escapists universe. Explore, build, craft and even train monkeys with up to three friends in a desperate bid to survive. Have you got what it takes to be a Survivalist?','2020/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/897450/The_Survivalists/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2596,'bio_inc._redemption',NULL,'Bio Inc.: Redemption is a realistic simulation and strategy game in which you make life or death decisions. Create a deadly illness to infect and torment your victim or play as the head of a medical team and hopefully find a cure to save your human patient. Will you be the plague or preserve humanity?','2018/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/612470/Bio_Inc_Redemption/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2597,'styx:_master_of_shadows',NULL,'Styx: Master of Shadows is an infiltration game with RPG elements taking place in a dark fantasy universe, where you sneak, steal and assassinate your way through as Styx, a Goblin two-centuries of age.','2014/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/242640/Styx_Master_of_Shadows/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2598,'dramatical_murder',NULL,'Aoba\'s vibrant cyberpunk world is one of contrasts: high-tech virtual reality battles versus street gang turf wars, ultra-exclusive luxury resorts and tiny junk shops. The choices you make will shape the path of Aoba\'s journey into the dark secrets lurking beneath the glossy sheen of the city.','2021/4/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1481080/DRAMAtical_Murder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2599,'hi-fi_rush',NULL,'Test your abilities in two new game modes, uncover new rewards and even a few secrets in the Arcade Challenge! Update! Feel the beat as wannabe rockstar Chai and his ragtag team fight against an evil megacorp in a world that syncs to the music.','2023/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1817230/HiFi_RUSH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2600,'dead_cells:_fatal_falls',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead Cells on Steam in order to play.','2021/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1451460/Dead_Cells_Fatal_Falls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_54'),(2601,'terraformers',NULL,'Terraform Mars in this turn-based colony builder and resource management game with roguelike elements. Explore the planet, develop spectacular cities, spread life and turn the Red Planet into a green one!','2023/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1244800/Terraformers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2602,'chef_life:_a_restaurant_simulator',NULL,'Create and manage your dream restaurant! Menus, purchasing, décor, staff, equipment, customers… and don\'t forget the actual cooking! Experience the daily life of a restaurateur and earn your awards from the Michelin Guide.','2023/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1122340/Chef_Life_A_Restaurant_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2603,'bokura:_planet',NULL,'\"There\'s something I can\'t tell you...\" Explore new frontiers of co-op gaming in BOKURA: planet, a puzzle adventure game that you can only play with two players. Take on the role of a spaceship\'s exploration crew and try to escape from the red planet you crash-landed on.','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3126150/BOKURA_planet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2604,'starward',NULL,'The Steam version of 《Starward》 is an Asian server version, and the account is not compatible with other servers. Starward is a 3D fighting game that integrates mecha girls and classic GVG combat gameplay, with 1V1 and 2V2 mode as the core gameplay.','2024/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2764370/Starward/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2605,'streets_of_rogue',NULL,'Fight, sneak, and hack your way through randomly generated cities. It\'s like Nuclear Throne meets Deus Ex, mixed with the anarchy of GTA. Rogue-lite meets immersive sim, and goes completely insane.','2019/7/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/512900/Streets_of_Rogue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2606,'beasts_of_bermuda',NULL,'Play as a dinosaur and become part of a player-created ecosystem! Beasts of Bermuda is a multiplayer game where players endure catastrophic storms and fearsome foes while growing to monstrous sizes. Do you have what it takes to survive in the Bermuda Triangle?','2018/12/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/719890/Beasts_of_Bermuda/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2607,'trainz_railroad_simulator_2022',NULL,'Drive, Explore, Operate and Create the railroad of your dreams - and now you can collaborate in real time with Multiplayer Surveyor! TRS22 showcases a range of high quality routes, sessions and trains to drive, plus all the scenery you need to make your own masterpiece.','2022/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1784570/Trainz_Railroad_Simulator_2022/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2608,'the_outlast_trials_-_reagent_starter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Outlast Trials on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2328320/The_Outlast_Trials__Reagent_Starter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2609,'machinarium',NULL,'Machinarium is the award-winning independent adventure game developed by the makers of Samorost series, Botanicula and CHUCHEL. Help Josef the robot save his girlfriend Berta kidnapped by the Black Cap Brotherhood gang!','2009/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/40700/Machinarium/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2610,'king_arthur:_legends_rise',NULL,'Embark on a dark squad RPG journey inspired by King Arthur\'s perilous adventures. Gather loyal heroes, explore a vast world, and battle against mythical bosses and monsters to restore the kingdom\'s former glory.','2025/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2279730/King_Arthur_Legends_Rise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2611,'ghostwire:_tokyo',NULL,'Tokyo\'s population has vanished, and deadly supernatural forces prowl the streets. Use an arsenal of elemental abilities to unravel the truth behind the disappearance and save Tokyo.','2022/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1475810/Ghostwire_Tokyo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2612,'ak-xolotl:_together',NULL,'The cutest, deadliest top-down roguelike shooter featuring AK-wielding Axolotls. Blast your way through the animal kingdom with an arsenal of kick-ass guns, mighty power-ups and even raise an army of trigger-happy baby axolotls. 🔫🔫 Double the firepower! Local co-op update now live!','2023/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1479140/AKxolotl_Together/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2613,'nostale_-_anime_mmorpg',NULL,'NosTale is a free-to-play anime action MMORPG which takes you on an exciting journey through a world full of mystery with your friends.','2017/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/550470/NosTale__Anime_MMORPG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2614,'stellaris:_synthetic_dawn_story_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2017/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/642750/Stellaris_Synthetic_Dawn_Story_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2615,'dead_cells:_the_bad_seed',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead Cells on Steam in order to play.','2020/2/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1204130/Dead_Cells_The_Bad_Seed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2616,'luck_be_a_landlord',NULL,'Luck be a Landlord is a roguelike deckbuilder about using a slot machine to earn rent money and defeat capitalism. This game does not contain any real-world currency gambling or microtransactions.','2023/1/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1404850/Luck_be_a_Landlord/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2617,'fatal_frame_/_project_zero:_maiden_of_black_water',NULL,'“FATAL FRAME / PROJECT ZERO: Maiden of Black Water” comes to Steam for the first time to celebrate the 20th anniversary of the horror-adventure series FATAL FRAME / PROJECT ZERO. The game is set on sacred Mt. Hikami, a site of many mysterious and terrifying incidents.','2021/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1732190/FATAL_FRAME__PROJECT_ZERO_Maiden_of_Black_Water/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2618,'the_riftbreaker:_metal_terror',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Riftbreaker on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1945600/The_Riftbreaker_Metal_Terror/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2619,'make_way',NULL,'Speed around loops, dart through train crossings, drift around helter skelters, and unleash wacky weaponry in this modern take on classic top-down multiplayer racing games. The twist? You build the track.','2023/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1445790/Make_Way/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2620,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_silver_ridge_peaks',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1316840/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Silver_Ridge_Peaks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2621,'fish_to_dish:_idle_sushi',NULL,'Welcome to Fish to Dish: Idle Sushi! This is a relaxing and enjoyable idle fishing game that can sit at the bottom or any corner of your screen, allowing you to enjoy a leisurely sea fishing time in your busy life.','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3399960/Fish_to_Dish_Idle_Sushi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2622,'train_sim_world®_5:_scotrail_express:_edinburgh_-_glasgow_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970260/Train_Sim_World_5_ScotRail_Express_Edinburgh__Glasgow_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2623,'uncle_chop\'s_rocket_shop',NULL,'Come on down to Uncle Chop’s Rocket Shop, for all your roguelite spaceship repair simulation needs! WARNING: Untested genre not suitable for people with tentacles for arms or an aversion to dying horrifically. Side effects include improved reading comprehension under pressure and a furry fetish.','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1849790/Uncle_Chops_Rocket_Shop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2624,'living_with_sister:_monochrome_fantasy',NULL,'When your father goes off on an adventure, it\'s up to you to keep the lights on and take care of your sister.','2024/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2429860/Living_With_Sister_Monochrome_Fantasy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2625,'monster_sanctuary',NULL,'Monster taming meets metroidvania. Collect, train and battle monsters in a lovely side-scroller pixel world.','2020/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/814370/Monster_Sanctuary/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2626,'pacify',NULL,'There is reportedly an evil inside that house. Something about an old funeral parlor offering a last chance to talk to their dead loved ones. Plus something about lights, laughter, a girl, missing people, etc... You know the same stuff everyone claims. Take a team, and check the place out.','2019/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/967050/Pacify/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2627,'v_rising_-_dracula\'s_relics_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game V Rising on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1983900/V_Rising__Draculas_Relics_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2628,'doomsday:_last_survivors',NULL,'New tower defense gameplay! The apocalypse has come, and zombies are running amok. As the leader of the survivors, collect and use resources to defend their last shelter!','2023/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2439510/Doomsday_Last_Survivors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2629,'blazblue_centralfiction',NULL,'Combining a 2D fighting game with a visual novel, the BlazBlue series continues on with massive fan support! The latest installation, BlazBlue: Centralfiction, serves as the ending to the Azure Saga, revealing the hidden truth of the world!','2017/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/586140/BlazBlue_Centralfiction/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2630,'samabakescramble',NULL,'Watch a whole town come alive as characters designed in quite possibly the greatest character creator of all time interact and form—ahem—deep and meaningful relationships! Each exciting development that arises amongst the cast of lifelike characters promises to be more thrilling than the last!','2025/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3443620/SamabakeScramble/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2631,'songs_of_syx',NULL,'Songs of Syx is a fantasy city-builder where you start off as an insignificant colony and build, scheme, and fight your way towards a metropolis and empire. The mechanics are complex and true to life, where small events can spiral into the collapse of kingdoms. Try the unlimited demo first!','2020/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1162750/Songs_of_Syx/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2632,'cornerpond',NULL,'A chill idle-fishing desktop toy in the corner of your screen. Buy upgrades, catch rare fish, and customize your avatar at your own pace!','2025/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3454590/Cornerpond/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2633,'pipistrello_and_the_cursed_yoyo',NULL,'Are you ready for the first Yoyovania?! In this 2D top-down adventure you\'ll explore a sprawling urban landscape, reinterpreting your surroundings through your mastery of yoyo tricks. Navigate the city\'s many districts, fight rival crime bosses, and regain the influence of the Pipistrello family!','2025/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2870350/Pipistrello_and_the_Cursed_Yoyo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2634,'amerzone_-_the_explorer\'s_legacy',NULL,'Set off on a quest for the Great White Birds in a mysterious land full of secrets! Answer the call of exploration as you travel to Amerzone, a forgotten Latin American country, to fulfill the last wishes of a late explorer.','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2429190/Amerzone__The_Explorers_Legacy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2635,'the_sims™_4_spa_day_game_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2015/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235740/The_Sims_4_Spa_Day_Game_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2636,'empire_of_sin',NULL,'Empire of Sin is a new strategy game brought to you by Romero Games and Paradox Interactive that puts you at the heart of the ruthless criminal underworld of 1920s Prohibition-era Chicago.','2020/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/604540/Empire_of_Sin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2637,'gnosia',NULL,'The Gnosia lie. Pretending to be human, they’ll get in close, trick and deceive, and then eliminate one victim at a time...','2022/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1608290/GNOSIA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2638,'laika:_aged_through_blood',NULL,'Laika: Aged Through Blood is an action-adventure Metroidvania set in a post-apocalyptic western world. Play as Laika, a coyote mother and fierce warrior, and carve your motorbike through a land ravaged by betrayal and loss as you uncover dark secrets in the pursuit of vengeance against oppression.','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1796220/Laika_Aged_Through_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2639,'game_dev_tycoon',NULL,'In Game Dev Tycoon you replay the history of the gaming industry by starting your own video game development company in the 80s. Create best selling games. Research new technologies and invent new game types. Become the leader of the market and gain worldwide fans.','2013/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/239820/Game_Dev_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2640,'sid_meier\'s_civilization®_vi:_vietnam_&_kublai_khan_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier’s Civilization® VI on Steam in order to play.','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1436950/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_VI_Vietnam__Kublai_Khan_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2641,'call_of_duty®:_black_ops_-_rezurrection_content_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of Duty®: Black Ops on Steam in order to play.','2011/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/42719/Call_of_Duty_Black_Ops__Rezurrection_Content_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2642,'the_battle_of_polytopia',NULL,'Welcome to the unique, turn-based strategy game set in the strange, flat world of the Square. Lead one of 16 distinct civilizations to victory by expanding your empire, researching technologies, and ultimately become ruler of the world! Play in single-player or multiplayer mode for up to 16 players.','2020/8/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/874390/The_Battle_of_Polytopia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2643,'dawn_of_man',NULL,'Command a settlement of ancient humans, guide them through the ages in their struggle for survival. Hunt, gather, craft tools, fight, research new techs and face the challenges the environment will throw at you.','2019/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/858810/Dawn_of_Man/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2644,'鬼谷八荒_tale_of_immortal',NULL,'Tale of Immortal is an open-world sandbox based on Chinese mythology and cultivation. You will grow to become immortal, conquer the beasts from the Classic of Mountains and Season, make your choices carefully and grasp your own destiny.','2023/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1468810/_Tale_of_Immortal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2645,'country_pack_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_trial_of_allegiance',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2695150/Country_Pack__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_Trial_of_Allegiance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2646,'the_classrooms',NULL,'The Classrooms is a procedural, liminal-space, found-footage, survival horror game. Explore The Classrooms and discover the various anomalies it contains; from malicious entities, to harmless oddities. And remember, it\'s different every time you play, so your found footage is uniquely yours.','2022/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2099110/The_Classrooms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_55'),(2647,'slackers_-_carts_of_glory',NULL,'Step into the wonderful world of Slackers! Picture this: you and your friends run out of drinks and the store is closing! Hop in a shopping cart, the ultimate eco-friendly marvel, master the art of riding an unpredictable beast, discover shortcuts as you pave your path to glory!','2024/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2354000/Slackers__Carts_of_Glory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2648,'saleblazers',NULL,'Fight. Sell. Survive. Live off the land, build your perfect shop, and defend against nightly horrors in this open world survival shop simulator for 1-8 players.','2023/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1419850/Saleblazers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2649,'the_jackbox_party_pack_2',NULL,'The sequel to the party game phenomenon The Jackbox Party Pack, featuring FIVE fresh, rib-tickling party games! Your phones or tablets are your controllers – no big mess of controllers needed. For up to 8 players plus an Audience of up to 10,000! It’s a game-night riot in a box… without the box!','2015/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/397460/The_Jackbox_Party_Pack_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2650,'mad_games_tycoon_2',NULL,'Start your own game development studio in 1976. Build your own offices, production facilities and server rooms. Develop the games of your dreams and produce the next next-gen console. Rise from a small garage company to a huge corporation.','2023/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1342330/Mad_Games_Tycoon_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2651,'the_witcher_3:_wild_hunt_-_blood_and_wine',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt on Steam in order to play.','2016/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/378648/The_Witcher_3_Wild_Hunt__Blood_and_Wine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2652,'arma_3_tanks',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2018/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/798390/Arma_3_Tanks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2653,'dead_by_daylight_-_maddening_darkness_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2526530/Dead_by_Daylight__Maddening_Darkness_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2654,'cloudpunk',NULL,'A neon-noir story in a rain-drenched cyberpunk metropolis. It’s your first night on the job working for the Cloudpunk delivery service. Two rules: Don’t miss a delivery and don’t ask what’s in the package.','2020/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/746850/Cloudpunk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2655,'airport_x-ray_simulator',NULL,'Step into the critical role of a baggage security operative in Airport X-Ray Simulator. As part of the backbone of airport security, you are the last line of defense against prohibited or illegal items making their way onto an aircraft or into the airport.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3079970/Airport_XRay_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2656,'zombieville_usa_3d',NULL,'Zombieville USA 3D is a stylized arcade shooter combining retro gameplay with strikingly polished visuals. Fight through an endless undead horde in the bleak hellscape of suburbia! Choose your weapons, grab a friend, and see how long you can survive.','2025/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1801520/Zombieville_USA_3D/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2657,'state_of_decay:_yose',NULL,'Make your stand against the collapse of society in the ultimate zombie survival-fantasy game. Explore an open world full of dangers and opportunities that respond to your every decision. Recruit a community of playable survivors, each with their own unique skills and talents.','2015/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/329430/State_of_Decay_YOSE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2658,'arma_3_creator_dlc:_reaction_forces',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2647760/Arma_3_Creator_DLC_Reaction_Forces/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2659,'x4:_tides_of_avarice',NULL,'This content requires the base game X4: Foundations on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1701060/X4_Tides_of_Avarice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2660,'bright_memory:_infinite',NULL,'Bright Memory: Infinite is an all-new lightning-fast fusion of the FPS and action genres, created by FYQD-Studio. Combine a wide variety of skills and abilities to unleash dazzling combo attacks.','2021/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1178830/Bright_Memory_Infinite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2661,'neo:_the_world_ends_with_you',NULL,'\"Only the possibility of you can change our fate\" Rindo comes to the grim realization that his life is on the line when he is forced to compete in the so-called \"Reapers\' Game.\"','2022/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1647550/NEO_The_World_Ends_with_You/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2662,'classified:_france_\'44',NULL,'Command an elite team of allied special operators in Nazi-occupied France wreaking havoc in the run up to D-Day in this ambitious turn-based tactics game. Take on the might of Germany\'s war machine and launch daring raids in occupied territory. Can you do enough to ensure Allied victory?','2024/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2085370/Classified_France_44/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2663,'train_sim_world®_5:_brighton_main_line:_london_victoria_-_brighton_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2969930/Train_Sim_World_5_Brighton_Main_Line_London_Victoria__Brighton_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2664,'country_pack_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_battle_for_the_bosporus',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2020/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1348660/Country_Pack__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_Battle_for_the_Bosporus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2665,'vtol_vr:_ah-94_attack_helicopter',NULL,'This content requires the base game VTOL VR on Steam in order to play.','2022/1/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1770480/VTOL_VR_AH94_Attack_Helicopter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2666,'grey_hack',NULL,'Grey Hack is a massively multiplayer hacking simulator game. You\'re a hacker with full freedom to act as you wish on a vast network of procedurally generated computers.','2017/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/605230/Grey_Hack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2667,'ultimate_admiral:_age_of_sail',NULL,'Ultimate Admiral: Age of Sail is a tactical wargame from the creators of the Ultimate General series set amidst the epic naval campaigns in the period of the American Revolutionary and Napoleonic Wars.','2021/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1069650/Ultimate_Admiral_Age_of_Sail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2668,'command_&_conquer:_red_alert_3_-_uprising',NULL,'Red Alert 3: Uprising features four new mini-campaigns, giving players a deeper dive into the storyline\'s of the Soviets, the Allies, the Empire of the Rising Sun and a unique campaign centered on the origins of everyone’s favorite psionic Japanese schoolgirl commando, Yuriko Omega.','2009/3/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/24800/Command__Conquer_Red_Alert_3__Uprising/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2669,'botany_manor',NULL,'Welcome to Botany Manor, a stately home in 19th century England. You play as inhabitant Arabella Greene, a retired botanist. Explore your house and gardens, filled with research, to figure out the ideal habitat of forgotten flora. Grow each plant to discover the mysterious qualities they hold…','2024/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1425350/Botany_Manor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2670,'sid_meier\'s_civilization®_vi:_byzantium_&_gaul_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier’s Civilization® VI on Steam in order to play.','2020/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1284470/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_VI_Byzantium__Gaul_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2671,'nobunaga\'s_ambition:_awakening',NULL,'Conquer Warring States Japan under one banner','2022/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1336980/NOBUNAGAS_AMBITION_Awakening/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2672,'urbek_city_builder',NULL,'Urbek is a city building game where you can build your own neighbourhoods: from nightlife district to industrial district. Don\'t exhaust your natural resources before you have an educated population to build more efficient structures.','2022/7/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1411740/Urbek_City_Builder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2673,'straftat',NULL,'STRAFTAT is a 1v1 ONLINE first person SHOOTER with quick rounds in over 250 MAPS ; Including all WEAPONS and proximity chat','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2386720/STRAFTAT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2674,'iron_rebellion',NULL,'Climb inside a colossal, crushing war machine, where every switch, lever, and round of ammunition is at your command. Physically interact with every support system and navigation stick as if you were truly in the cockpit. Customize and outfit your mech to outsmart and assert your superiority.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1192900/IRON_REBELLION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2675,'yet_another_zombie_survivors',NULL,'The Horde is coming but you\'re ready to fight it! Assemble your team and decide upon their enhancements to find the most efficient synergies against thousands of the undead. Survive. Then evolve. Then break all the limits in this deceivingly simple but addictive reverse bullet hell.','2023/7/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2163330/Yet_Another_Zombie_Survivors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2676,'cozy_grove',NULL,'Welcome to Cozy Grove, a game about camping on a haunted, ever-changing island. As a Spirit Scout, you\'ll wander the island\'s forest each day, finding new hidden secrets and helping soothe the local ghosts. With a little time and a lot of crafting, you\'ll bring color and joy back to Cozy Grove!','2021/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1458100/Cozy_Grove/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2677,'sid_meier\'s_civilization®_vi:_maya_&_gran_colombia_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier’s Civilization® VI on Steam in order to play.','2020/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1253990/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_VI_Maya__Gran_Colombia_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2678,'doom_64',NULL,'Play the enhanced version of the original game released on the Nintendo 64 in 1997. Years have passed since you stopped Hell’s invasion of Earth. Quarantined for humanity’s safety, the UAC research facilities on Mars were abandoned and forgotten...until now.','2020/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1148590/DOOM_64/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2679,'motorsport_manager',NULL,'Have you got what it takes to become the manager of a high-performance motorsport team? Motorsport Manager is a highly detailed, best-in-class management game for fans of motorsport. You’ll hire the drivers, build the cars and embed yourself in the dynamic world of racing.','2016/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/415200/Motorsport_Manager/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2680,'ys_ix:_monstrum_nox',NULL,'While imprisoned in Balduq, Adol is cursed and becomes a Monstrum. With his newfound powers, he must stop the Grimwald Nox from consuming the city.','2021/7/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1351630/Ys_IX_Monstrum_Nox/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2681,'medal_of_honor™',NULL,'Fight Today\'s War: Elite Special Forces in a gritty combat campaign using the surgical tactics of Tier 1 Operators combined with the sledgehammer force of Army Rangers.','2010/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/47790/Medal_of_Honor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2682,'lil_gator_game',NULL,'Embark on an adorable adventure, discover new friends and uncover everything the island has to offer. Climb, Swim, Glide and slide your way into the hearts of the many different characters you meet on your travels!','2022/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1586800/Lil_Gator_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2683,'planet_zoo:_southeast_asia_animal_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2021/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1567110/Planet_Zoo_Southeast_Asia_Animal_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2684,'murders_on_the_yangtze_river',NULL,'\"Murders on Yangtze River\" is an Ace Attorney-like detective game that takes you on a journey through early 20th century China as you solve a series of intriguing cases. Use your logical reasoning and deduction skills to uncover clues, interrogate suspects, and solve the mysteries.','2024/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1746030/Murders_on_the_Yangtze_River/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2685,'kinitopet',NULL,'KinitoPET is a psychological horror experience that takes place through Kinito, an early 2000s virtual assistant. Kinito is able to walk, talk, browse, adapt, and play games as Kinito is like no other with its adaptive technology!','2024/1/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2075070/KinitoPET/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2686,'god_eater_3',NULL,'Set in a post-apocalyptic setting, it’s up to your special team of God Eaters to take down god-like monsters devastating the world. With an epic story, unique characters, and all new God Arcs and Aragami, the latest evolution in ACTION is here!','2019/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/899440/GOD_EATER_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2687,'shadow_warrior_2',NULL,'Shadow Warrior 2 is the stunning evolution of Flying Wild Hog’s offbeat first-person shooter starring the brash warrior Lo Wang, who must again wield a devastating combination of guns, blades, magic and wit to strike down the demonic legions overwhelming the world.','2016/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/324800/Shadow_Warrior_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2688,'command_&_conquer™_and_the_covert_operations™',NULL,'The legendary RTS game which started it all. Will you side with the humanistic GDI or bring the world to its knees with Kane and the Brotherhood of Nod. Your adversaries are without mercy. And so are you.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2229830/Command__Conquer_and_The_Covert_Operations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2689,'warhammer:_end_times_-_vermintide',NULL,'Vermintide is an epic co-operative action combat adventure set in the End Times of the iconic Warhammer Fantasy world.','2015/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/235540/Warhammer_End_Times__Vermintide/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2690,'red_dead_online',NULL,'Step into the vibrant, ever-evolving world of Red Dead Online and experience life in frontier America. Chase down bounties, battle outlaw gangs and other players, hunt, fish and trade, search for exotic treasures, run Moonshine, and much more to discover in a world of astounding depth and detail.','2020/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1404210/Red_Dead_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2691,'space_engineers_-_signal_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2914120/Space_Engineers__Signal_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2692,'skullgirls_2nd_encore',NULL,'--Main Stage Game at Evo 2022!-- The ultimate Skullgirls experience: Featuring 14 hand-animated characters, fully voiced story mode, countless palettes, and unparalleled GGPO-based multiplayer netcode.','2013/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/245170/Skullgirls_2nd_Encore/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2693,'star_wars™:_episode_i:_jedi_power_battles™',NULL,'Take back the Theed Royal Palace in this fast and furious lightsaber action game. You will have the power of the Force and your trusty lightsaber to help you ward off legions of battle droids, destroyer droids, assassins, and other creatures from Star Wars: The Phantom Menace.','2025/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2443630/STAR_WARS_Episode_I_Jedi_Power_Battles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_56'),(2694,'airships:_conquer_the_skies',NULL,'Construct mighty steampunk airships and fly them into battle, waging war and conquering the skies!','2018/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/342560/Airships_Conquer_the_Skies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2695,'cities:_skylines_-_plazas_&_promenades',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2008400/Cities_Skylines__Plazas__Promenades/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2696,'kingdom_rush_vengeance_-_tower_defense',NULL,'It\'s payback time! Lead your mighty dark army and make the Kingdom tremble with every step. Build powerful towers, choose your arsenal for destruction, and find the deadliest combination - train legendary heroes and lead them to victory!','2020/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1367550/Kingdom_Rush_Vengeance__Tower_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2697,'jump_king',NULL,'Take up the challenge and face true high-stakes platforming in Jump King! Struggle upwards in search of the Smoking Hot Babe of legend, but explore with care; a single missed jump could lead to a long fall back down...','2019/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1061090/Jump_King/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2698,'the_room_4:_old_sins',NULL,'The disappearance of an ambitious engineer and his high-society wife provokes a hunt for a precious artefact. The trail leads you to the attic of their home, and the discovery of an old, peculiar dollhouse. What secrets lie within these walls?','2021/2/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1361320/The_Room_4_Old_Sins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2699,'okami_hd',NULL,'Experience the critically acclaimed masterpiece with its renowned Sumi-e ink art style in breathtaking high resolution.','2017/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/587620/Okami_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2700,'have_a_nice_death',NULL,'Have a Nice Death is a 2D action roguelike where you play as an overworked Death, whose employees have run rampant, completely throwing off the balance of souls - and his vacation plans. In order to restore order, you\'ll have to grab your trusty scythe and show your employees who\'s boss.','2023/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1740720/Have_a_Nice_Death/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2701,'magicka_2',NULL,'The world’s most irreverent co-op action adventure returns! In the next chapter of Magicka, players ascend from the ruins of Aldrheim to experience a Midgård almost wiped free of Wizards after the Wizard Wars, with the few that do remain having either gone mad or extremely hostile toward all others','2015/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/238370/Magicka_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2702,'rune_factory_3_special',NULL,'Bridge the divide of an ancient schism between humans and monsters in Rune Factory 3 Special as half-human, half-wooly protagonist Micah. Farm, fight and fall in love as you revisit a classic in the series that perfected the blend of RPG & Life-sim genres.','2023/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2243710/Rune_Factory_3_Special/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2703,'god_of_war_ragnarök_-_digital_deluxe_edition_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game God of War Ragnarök on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2974330/God_of_War_Ragnark__Digital_Deluxe_Edition_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2704,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_ultima_founding',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3326080/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Ultima_Founding/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2705,'indika',NULL,'Play a third-person, story-driven game set in alternative Russia at the turn of the XIX century where religious visions clash with harsh reality. INDIKA tells the story of a young nun who sets off on a journey of self-discovery with the most unusual companion by her side, the devil himself.','2024/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1373960/INDIKA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2706,'house_flipper_-_party_furniture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game House Flipper on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3363170/House_Flipper__Party_Furniture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2707,'stellar_blade™_x_goddess_of_victory:_nikke',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellar Blade™ on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3596190/Stellar_Blade_x_GODDESS_OF_VICTORY_NIKKE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2708,'senren＊banka',NULL,'Senren＊Banka is a Japanese-style visual novel produced by Yuzusoft, a Japanese developer of romance VNs. This game commemorated Yuzusoft\'s 10th anniversary. It won numerous awards on the year of its release in Japan for its art, music, and characters.','2020/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1144400/SenrenBanka/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2709,'the_outer_worlds_2',NULL,'The Outer Worlds 2 is the sequel to the award-winning first-person sci-fi RPG from Obsidian Entertainment.','2025/10/29','Unreleased','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1449110/The_Outer_Worlds_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2710,'cities:_skylines_-_hotels_&_retreats',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2342310/Cities_Skylines__Hotels__Retreats/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2711,'warhammer_40,000:_space_marine_2_-_space_wolves_chapter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2792180/Warhammer_40000_Space_Marine_2__Space_Wolves_Chapter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2712,'a_space_for_the_unbound',NULL,'A magical adventure about two high school sweethearts set at the end of their school days - and the end of the world. Explore a crumbling town and help friends face their inner demons, which could be the key to stopping reality itself disintegrating. And don’t forget to pet the cats.','2023/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1201270/A_Space_for_the_Unbound/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2713,'the_sims™_4_tiny_living_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2020/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235766/The_Sims_4_Tiny_Living_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2714,'exposed_livestream',NULL,'Stream by day, prank by night, and build your fame in this RPG adventure game! As IRL streamer Laika, create content, earn subscribers, and expand your skills. Explore the city and risk it all to entertain your growing audience. Show them what they actually want to see...','2025/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3304770/Exposed_Livestream/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2715,'granny',NULL,'You have to escape Granny`s house...You have five days...','2018/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/962400/Granny/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2716,'sid_meier\'s_civilization_v:_brave_new_world',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier\'s Civilization® V on Steam in order to play.','2013/7/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/235580/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_V_Brave_New_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2717,'bomber_crew',NULL,'Chocks away! Bomber Crew is a strategic simulation game, where picking the right crew and keeping your bomber in tip top shape is the difference between completing your mission or losing it all! USAAF DLC NOW AVAILABLE! FLY THE ICONIC AMERICAN BOMBER!','2017/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/537800/Bomber_Crew/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2718,'stolen_realm:_chaos_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stolen Realm on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3709260/Stolen_Realm_Chaos_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2719,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_medved-taiga',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2017/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/695680/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__MedvedTaiga/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2720,'pax_dei',NULL,'Welcome to a vast, social sandbox MMO inspired by the legends of the medieval era. Here, myths are real, ghosts exist, and magic is unquestioned. Join thousands of players as you explore the land, build your home, forge your reputation, and craft your own stories. What world will you make?','2024/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1995520/Pax_Dei/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2721,'workers_&_resources:_soviet_republic_-_world_maps',NULL,'This content requires the base game Workers & Resources: Soviet Republic on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3333420/Workers__Resources_Soviet_Republic__World_Maps/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2722,'stellar_blade™_x_nier:automata',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellar Blade™ on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3596180/Stellar_Blade_x_NieRAutomata/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2723,'soccer_manager_2025',NULL,'Manage elite football clubs and lead your dream team as a football manager!','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3217240/Soccer_Manager_2025/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2724,'rollercoaster_tycoon®_2:_triple_thrill_pack',NULL,'This compilation includes the entire RollerCoaster Tycoon 2 series, with the original game as well as the Time Twister and Wacky Worlds expansions.','2002/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/285330/RollerCoaster_Tycoon_2_Triple_Thrill_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2725,'post_trauma',NULL,'Puzzle Horror game inspired by PS2 era classics. Navigate environments, tackle threats, and meet other lost characters in the depths of the Gloom.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1750030/Post_Trauma/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2726,'i_am_future:_cozy_apocalypse_survival',NULL,'I Am Future is a relaxing single-player survival game about building a cozy rooftop camp amid a flooded post-apocalyptic city. Set up a farm, go fishing, tinker with gadgets, craft new tools, manage a team of cute robots to automate and expand your base, explore the mysterious world, and chill out!','2024/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1658040/I_Am_Future_Cozy_Apocalypse_Survival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2727,'sniper_elite_v2_remastered',NULL,'In the dark days of the end of World War 2 amidst the ruins of Berlin, one bullet can change history… Elite sniper Karl Fairburne returns to the front line in the remaster of this award-winning stealth-action experience. Packed with new features, contemporary visuals and definitive content.','2019/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/728740/Sniper_Elite_V2_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2728,'good_pizza,_great_pizza_-_cooking_simulator_game',NULL,'Ever wanted to know what it feels like to run your own cozy Pizza shop? Do your best to fulfill pizza orders from customers while making enough money to keep your shop open. Upgrade your shop with new toppings and equipment to compete against your pizza rival, Alicante!','2023/1/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/770810/Good_Pizza_Great_Pizza__Cooking_Simulator_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2729,'anno_2205™',NULL,'In Anno 2205™, you join humankind‘s next step into the future with the promise to build a better tomorrow. You conquer Earth, establishing rich, bustling cities and grand industrial complexes, but to secure the prosperity of your people, you must travel into space.','2015/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/375910/Anno_2205/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2730,'saeko:_giantess_dating_sim',NULL,'You opened your eyes to find a giant girl looking down at you. Experience the fate of Saeko and the little people in this cruel yet captivating story with avant-garde art.','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2492120/SAEKO_Giantess_Dating_Sim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2731,'war_thunder_-_leopard_2a4m_can_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game War Thunder on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3010110/War_Thunder__Leopard_2A4M_CAN_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2732,'railgods_of_hysterra',NULL,'Embark on a co-op survival journey for 1-5 players through a post-apocalyptic Lovecraftian world! Command and evolve a living, monstrous train, craft weapons, build a mobile base, gain powers, and face the Great Old Ones. Explore an ever-changing world, hold on to your sanity, and ascend to godhood!','2025/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3201910/RailGods_of_Hysterra/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2733,'the_division_2_crossroads_season_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tom Clancy’s The Division® 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3588070/The_Division_2_Crossroads_Season_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2734,'spirit_of_the_north',NULL,'Spirit of the North is a single-player 3rd-person adventure game inspired by the breathtaking and mysterious landscapes of Iceland. Play as an ordinary red fox whose story becomes entwined with the guardian of the Northern Lights, a female spirit fox.','2020/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1213700/Spirit_of_the_North/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2735,'star_wars™_jedi_knight_-_jedi_academy™',NULL,'Forge your weapon and follow the path of the Jedi Jedi Knight: Jedi Academy is the latest installment of the highly acclaimed Jedi Knight series. Take on the role of a new student eager to learn the ways of the Force from Jedi Master Luke Skywalker.','2003/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6020/STAR_WARS_Jedi_Knight__Jedi_Academy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2736,'lego®_bricktales',NULL,'In this puzzle-adventure, use an intuitive brick-by-brick building mechanic to solve puzzles and bring your creations to life! Experience a charming story as you explore beautiful LEGO® dioramas and help the people inhabiting them.','2022/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1898290/LEGO_Bricktales/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2737,'call_of_the_sea',NULL,'Call of the Sea is an otherworldly tale of mystery and love set in the 1930s South Pacific. Explore a lush island paradise, solve puzzles and unlock secrets in the hunt for your husband’s missing expedition.','2020/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1042490/Call_of_the_Sea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2738,'death_must_die',NULL,'Descend the nether in search of Death himself! Choose from God-given powers to slay his hordes of minions. Unlock new heroes, collect powerful items and create game-breaking synergies in this roguelite hack and slash survivors game.','2023/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2334730/Death_Must_Die/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2739,'nobody_saves_the_world',NULL,'Transform from a featureless nobody into a SLUG, a GHOST and a DRAGON in this new take on Action RPGs from the creators of Guacamelee! Discover 15+ distinct Forms, mix-and-match their abilities, clear evolving dungeons and... SAVE THE WORLD!?','2022/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1432050/Nobody_Saves_the_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2740,'fantasian_neo_dimension',NULL,'Embark on an adventure to discover your memories and save the world from a mechanical infection. Maneuver your skill trajectories during battle, and dive into a new dimension with a unique twist on a classic RPG experience.','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2844850/FANTASIAN_Neo_Dimension/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_57'),(2741,'at_dead_of_night',NULL,'At Dead Of Night is part horror film, part horror game and part ghost hunt. It blends live-action and graphics to create a unique immersive horror experience like no other.','2020/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1450830/At_Dead_Of_Night/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2742,'snakecremental',NULL,'Snake, but with a skill tree','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3570430/Snakecremental/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2743,'keywe',NULL,'KeyWe is a cute, co-operative postal puzzler starring Jeff and Debra, two small kiwi birds working in a whimsical post office. They must jump, flap, peck and butt-slam their way across an interactive landscape of levers, bells and buttons to get those messages delivered on time!','2021/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1242980/KeyWe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2744,'batman:_arkham_city_-_game_of_the_year_edition',NULL,'Get Batman: Arkham City and all DLC for one low price with the release of the GOTY Edition!','2012/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/200260/Batman_Arkham_City__Game_of_the_Year_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2745,'survive_the_nights',NULL,'Survive the Nights is a unique FPS survival game focusing on teamwork, fortification, creativity & strategy. Secure a structure or roam free, the choice is yours. Gameplay focuses on realistic survival, post zombie infestation. Prepare during the day for nightfall. How many nights will you survive?','2017/12/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/541300/Survive_the_Nights/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2746,'tryp_fpv:_drone_racer_simulator',NULL,'Fly freely and perfect your skills as an FPV pilot without the risk of breakage, with hyper-realistic visuals and flight sensations. Whether you\'re a beginner or an expert, TRYP FPV is the next-generation simulator that immerses you in the pure adrenaline of FPV drone flying.','2022/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1881200/TRYP_FPV_Drone_Racer_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2747,'forgive_me_father',NULL,'Forgive Me Father is a dark retro horror FPS set in a comic book style world inspired by the novels of H.P. Lovecraft. As the only one left with full senses, you begin a journey in search of answers and relief. How long can you last?','2022/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1590910/Forgive_Me_Father/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2748,'pixark',NULL,'Enter a world of mystery, danger, ancient dinosaurs, mythical beasts, and cubes! Work by yourself or with a tribe of others to gather materials, craft useful items, tame wild creatures, and build huge bases to survive in PixARK! ','2019/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/593600/PixARK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2749,'hylics_2',NULL,'A surreal RPG with a unique graphical style and droll scenario.','2020/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1286710/Hylics_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2750,'sid_meier\'s_civilization_v:_gods_and_kings',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier\'s Civilization® V on Steam in order to play.','2012/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/16870/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_V_Gods_and_Kings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2751,'the_coin_game',NULL,'A collection of ticket redemption arcades with realistic physics, a carnival, goofy robots, open world design, a global ranking system and silly prizes. Featuring 50+ modern inspired arcade machines and a pawn shop to keep money in your pocket. The Coin Game is made by a solo developer.','2019/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/598980/The_Coin_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2752,'coloring_pixels',NULL,'A relaxing coloring by numbers game. Enjoy completing a variety of images with differing themes, complexity, and sizes.','2018/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/897330/Coloring_Pixels/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2753,'the_sims™_4_sleek_bathroom_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3415980/The_Sims_4_Sleek_Bathroom_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2754,'friends_vs_friends',NULL,'A frantic, online PvP shooter that combines combat and deck building. Choose a character, customize your card-based loadout, and get ready for the fights of your life!','2023/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1785150/Friends_vs_Friends/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2755,'star_of_providence',NULL,'Star of Providence is a top down action shooter with procedurally generated elements. Explore a large, abandoned facility in search of incredible power, fighting dangerous foes and gaining new weapons and upgrades as you progress.','2017/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/603960/Star_of_Providence/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2756,'the_ascent',NULL,'The Ascent is a solo and co-op Action-shooter RPG set in a cyberpunk world. The mega corporation that owns you and everyone, The Ascent Group, has just collapsed. Can you survive without it?','2021/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/979690/The_Ascent/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2757,'the_sims™_4_laundry_day_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2018/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235761/The_Sims_4_Laundry_Day_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2758,'lords_mobile:_pacific_rim_war',NULL,'Clash with global players in this epic real-time strategy game!','2019/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1041320/Lords_Mobile_Pacific_Rim_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2759,'bendy_and_the_dark_revival',NULL,'Bendy and the Dark Revival® is a first-person survival horror game set in the creepiest cartoon studio to ever exist. Discover the truth. Escape the studio. Above all, fear the Ink Demon…and survive.','2022/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1063660/Bendy_and_the_Dark_Revival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2760,'quern_-_undying_thoughts',NULL,'Discover the truth about Quern’s past, unfold the mysteries of its present, and be the explorer who shapes its future. Quern introduces reusable puzzle mechanics to the classic genre, making the player think about the game as a whole, and not just as a series of individual challenges.','2016/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/512790/Quern__Undying_Thoughts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2761,'project_castaway',NULL,'Project Castaway is a survival crafting title set in the Pacific Ocean. Live the life of a stranded castaway, with only yourself - and the island\'s inhabitants - for company! Sail the ocean, hunt, explore unique islands and gather resources as you fight for survival.','2024/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1713350/Project_Castaway/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2762,'stellar_blade™_deluxe_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellar Blade™ on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3596170/Stellar_Blade_Deluxe_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2763,'orcs_must_die!_3',NULL,'Slice, burn, toss, zap, grind and gib massive hordes of repugnant orcs in this long-awaited successor to the award-winning Orcs Must Die! series.','2021/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1522820/Orcs_Must_Die_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2764,'victoria_3:_dawn_of_wonder',NULL,'This content requires the base game Victoria 3 on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2411230/Victoria_3_Dawn_of_Wonder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2765,'chains_of_freedom',NULL,'Embark on a thrilling journey in a high-stakes, turn-based tactics game. Lead an elite squad in a fictional, dystopian Eastern European country as you unravel a conspiracy threatening the state. Navigate intense strategic battles and adapt to ever-evolving challenges to prevail.','2025/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2994010/Chains_of_Freedom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2766,'terminator:_resistance_annihilation_line',NULL,'This content requires the base game Terminator: Resistance on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1755190/Terminator_Resistance_Annihilation_Line/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2767,'bendy_and_the_ink_machine',NULL,'Bendy and the Ink Machine® is the first person puzzle action horror game that will forever ruin your childhood love of cartoons.','2017/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/622650/Bendy_and_the_Ink_Machine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2768,'vindictus',NULL,'Enter a dark and sinister world where you must battle for survival. With gratifying real-time combat, epic monsters, and glorious visuals, this isn\'t just another MMO... This is VINDICTUS!','2012/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/212160/Vindictus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2769,'pulsar:_lost_colony',NULL,'The co-op open-world space sim where everyone has a role! Pilot the ship. Reroute power. Launch nukes. Explore alien planets. Research new talents. Work together to find the Lost Colony! ...or just deliver some biscuits','2021/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/252870/PULSAR_Lost_Colony/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2770,'deep_rock_galactic_-_supporter_ii_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Deep Rock Galactic on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2291670/Deep_Rock_Galactic__Supporter_II_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2771,'stellaris:_plantoids_species_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2016/8/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/498870/Stellaris_Plantoids_Species_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2772,'tiny_rogues',NULL,'Tiny Rogues is a challenging fantasy rogue-lite bullet-hell dungeon crawler with rpg elements. Build a new unique character each run and fight one monster-infested room after another! Discover unique weapons, collect magical items and level up to become more and more powerful!','2022/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2088570/