 JR East Train Simulator\" is a train driving simulator that allows you to experience live-action images and realistic driving sounds of JR East\'s actual train lines in your own home.','2022/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2111630/JR_EAST_Train_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2780,'earth_defense_force_5',NULL,'Stand and fight for humanity. This arcade shooter takes place in the year 2022, as the Earth Defense Force fends off an all-out attack by unknown life forms. Become an EDF soldier, battle against endless hordes of immense enemies, and restore peace to the earth.','2019/7/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1007040/EARTH_DEFENSE_FORCE_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2781,'fishing:_north_atlantic_-_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Commercial fishing in North Atlantic! Discover majestic world of Canadian Nova Scotia while admiring the vast diversity of ocean life. Search for the ocean gold with upgradable fishing boats and various fishing gear as you progress in your fisherman career.','2020/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1264250/Fishing_North_Atlantic__Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2782,'hitman_3_-_the_splitter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game HITMAN World of Assassination on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3254350/HITMAN_3__The_Splitter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2783,'astroneer:_glitchwalkers',NULL,'This content requires the base game ASTRONEER on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3042220/ASTRONEER_Glitchwalkers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2784,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_wheel_tuning_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2016/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/388475/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Wheel_Tuning_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2785,'tank_force:_online_shooter_game',NULL,'Tank Force - the coolest free online tank shooter! This is a new word in online tank battles, which combines the best qualities of a tank simulator and thrilling arcade battles.','2017/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/604500/Tank_Force_Online_Shooter_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2786,'evil_genius_2:_world_domination',NULL,'A satirical spy-fi lair builder where YOU are the criminal mastermind! Construct your base, train your minions, defend your operations from the Forces of Justice, and achieve global domination!','2021/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/700600/Evil_Genius_2_World_Domination/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2787,'lego®_indiana_jones™:_the_original_adventures',NULL,'Build, Battle and Brawl your way out of trouble! Play through all three classic Indiana Jones™ movies and relive your favorite Indy adventures in the tongue-in-cheek worlds of LEGO®. Explore and Discover - Battle enemies, solve puzzles, and seek out the world\'s greatest treasures.','2008/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/32330/LEGO_Indiana_Jones_The_Original_Adventures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_58'),(2788,'amazing_frog?',NULL,'Amazing Frog? is the original open world buffet of bonkers physics sandbox mayhem. For one to four players.','2014/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/332570/Amazing_Frog/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2789,'microtopia',NULL,'Become the hive mind of a robot ant colony in Microtopia! Use pheromone trails to create, automate and optimize supply chains for your ants to follow. Collect resources, produce goods, feed your queen, grow your colony and fly out to expand the species!','2025/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2750000/Microtopia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2790,'dead_rising®_2',NULL,'The sequel to the million-plus selling Dead Rising, Dead Rising 2 takes the zombie survival horror to Fortune City, America’s latest and greatest entertainment playground.','2010/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/45740/Dead_Rising_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2791,'transformice',NULL,'Transformice is an MMO platformer about dozens of mice running to bring back the cheese! Will the almighty Shaman help you or just ruin everything? Millions of levels, hectic physics, skill trees, and more importantly... hats!','2015/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/335240/Transformice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2792,'milky_way_idle',NULL,'Milky Way Idle: A multiplayer idle RPG where automation replaces grinding. Level up skills, gather resources, craft powerful items, and battle monsters—all while AFK. Trade in the marketplace, join a guild, team up for party combat, and socialize in chat as you progress effortlessly.','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3224420/Milky_Way_Idle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2793,'before_your_eyes',NULL,'Embark on an emotional first-person narrative adventure where you control the story—and affect its outcomes—with your real-life blinks. With this innovative technique you will fully immerse yourself in a world of memories, both joyous and heartbreaking, as your whole life flashes before your eyes.','2021/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1082430/Before_Your_Eyes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2794,'stormshot',NULL,'300 brilliant levels await! Come unveil the myth of Treasure Isle!','2023/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2554670/Stormshot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2795,'nunholy',NULL,'In a world overrun by vampires, a group of nuns with their own stories have arrived at the Hunters\' Guild. They are ready to wield any power—even that of demons—to defeat their enemies. What fate awaits them on this perilous journey?','2025/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2854740/Nunholy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2796,'who\'s_lila?',NULL,'A reverse-detective adventure, where you control your character\'s face','2022/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1697700/Whos_Lila/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2797,'ys_viii:_lacrimosa_of_dana',NULL,'Ys returns with a brand new adventure for the first time in 8 years! Adol awakens shipwrecked and stranded on a cursed island. There, he and the other shipwrecked passengers he rescues form a village to challenge fearsome beasts and mysterious ruins on the isolated island.','2018/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/579180/Ys_VIII_Lacrimosa_of_DANA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2798,'valkyria_chronicles_4_complete_edition',NULL,'A Continent Engulfed in the Bitter Flames of War! Commander Claude Wallace and his childhood friends set out to fight in a desperate war, but bone-chilling blizzards, waves of imperial soldiers, and the godlike powers of the Valkyria stand between them and victory.','2018/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/790820/Valkyria_Chronicles_4_Complete_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2799,'age_of_wonders_4:_dragon_dawn',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Wonders 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2367860/Age_of_Wonders_4_Dragon_Dawn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2800,'destiny_2:_the_edge_of_fate',NULL,'This content requires the base game Destiny 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3186490/Destiny_2_The_Edge_of_Fate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2801,'killer_klowns_from_outer_space:_the_game',NULL,'Plan your own alien invasion and harvest humans as the iconic Killer Klowns, or gather a team of survivors to fight the extraterrestrial threat, in a game based on the ‘80s cult classic movie. Welcome to a new, craazzy take on the asymmetrical multiplayer horror experience!','2024/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1556100/Killer_Klowns_from_Outer_Space_The_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2802,'grid_legends',NULL,'GRID Legends delivers thrilling wheel-to-wheel motorsport action. Create dream race events, hop into live races, experience a dramatic virtual production story, and embrace the sensation of spectacular racing.','2022/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1307710/GRID_Legends/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2803,'amazing_cultivation_simulator',NULL,'Rise up in a search for immortality in this strategy sim and management game based on Chinese mythology. Rebuild your sect and train new disciples through the path of cultivation. Research magic and gather mystical artifacts, face ancient dangers and other sects in your path to spiritual ascension.','2020/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/955900/Amazing_Cultivation_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2804,'total_war:_rome_ii_-_desert_kingdoms_culture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ROME II - Emperor Edition on Steam in order to play.','2018/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/792520/Total_War_ROME_II__Desert_Kingdoms_Culture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2805,'batman:_arkham_asylum_game_of_the_year_edition',NULL,'Experience what it’s like to be Batman and face off against Gotham\'s greatest villians. Explore every inch of Arkham Asylum and roam freely on the infamous island.','2010/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/35140/Batman_Arkham_Asylum_Game_of_the_Year_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2806,'rogue:_genesia',NULL,'Walk upon a new world and slay foes endangering it. Rogue : Genesia is an action rogue-lite game, where you fight relentless hordes consisting of hundreds and thousands of monsters, make your build, break the balance, defeat bosses and save one of the many worlds.','2025/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2067920/Rogue_Genesia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2807,'arma_3_marksmen',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2015/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/332350/Arma_3_Marksmen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2808,'sonic_superstars',NULL,'Adventure through the mystical Northstar Islands in this all-new take on classic 2D Sonic high-speed action platforming.','2023/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2022670/SONIC_SUPERSTARS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2809,'ropuka\'s_idle_island',NULL,'A cozy idle game that sits anywhere on your desktop. Watch the frog cut grass, upgrade his tools, and decorate the island while you work or relax.','2025/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3416070/Ropukas_Idle_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2810,'blood_bar_tycoon',NULL,'Blood Bar Tycoon is a vampire bar management game. Build bars and blood factories, lure humans to harvest their blood, process it, and serve your customers: other vampires. Research quirky machines and deal with hunters! Expand through Crimson City to become a mighty Elder!','2025/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2776780/Blood_Bar_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2811,'battle_talent',NULL,'Battle Talent is a challenging physics-based rogue-lite sword-fighting game, and now includes multiplayer mode, team up with friends to defeat enemies! You can create your own fighting style in a mega seamless procedural dungeon. With over 80 enemy variants, 100 weapons, and 60 perks.','2023/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1331510/Battle_Talent/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2812,'starship_troopers:_terran_command_-_urban_onslaught',NULL,'This content requires the base game Starship Troopers: Terran Command on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2139991/Starship_Troopers_Terran_Command__Urban_Onslaught/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2813,'splitgate_2_-_ultimate_founder\'s_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Splitgate 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3757880/Splitgate_2__Ultimate_Founders_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2814,'atomfall:_story_expansion_pack_wicked_isle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Atomfall on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3047140/Atomfall_Story_Expansion_Pack_Wicked_Isle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2815,'the_dark_pictures_anthology:_man_of_medan',NULL,'The Dark Pictures Anthology is a series of stand-alone, branching cinematic horror games that can also be played online with a friend. In Man of Medan, five friends set sail on a holiday diving trip that soon changes into something much more sinister.','2019/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/939850/The_Dark_Pictures_Anthology_Man_of_Medan/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2816,'the_monster_breeder',NULL,'Turn-based fantasy gladiatorial game with monster breeding. Crossbreed various species to create monster hybrids for gladiatorial combat. Manipulate creatures’ traits with surgery, magic, and alchemy. Manage your enterprise, craft items and upgrade your base. Fight in the arena for gold and glory!','2025/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1192440/The_Monster_Breeder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2817,'shin_chan:_shiro_and_the_coal_town',NULL,'Shin chan starts a mysterious daily routine, traveling between two worlds: the Village in Akita and Coal Town.','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2699820/Shin_chan_Shiro_and_the_Coal_Town/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2818,'the_anomaly_project',NULL,'Your goal is simple, spot anomalies to escape. Play alone or together with up to 8 players in online co-op. Make the right decisions to advance to the next level, or risk being reset to the beginning!','2024/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2960770/The_Anomaly_Project/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2819,'king_of_the_bridge',NULL,'Face off against the bridge troll in his bizarre game of chess! Decrypt, Twist and Enforce the rules as your devious opponent attempts to break them in King of the Bridge!','2024/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2523120/King_of_the_Bridge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2820,'volcanoids',NULL,'A base-building open-world survival shooter that replaces your typical base with a giant drill. Alone or with friends, explore an island plagued by eruptions, upgrade your drill, and fight robots to uncover what\'s been hiding beneath the surface.','2019/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/951440/Volcanoids/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2821,'sniper_ghost_warrior_contracts',NULL,'Become the ultimate assassin in the most realistic modern warfare sniping game available. Engage in an immersive single-player campaign across large, open-ended maps. Tactical thinking, stealth approach and precision in execution of long shots required.','2019/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/973580/Sniper_Ghost_Warrior_Contracts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2822,'outriders',NULL,'Outriders’ brutal and bloody combat combines frenetic gunplay, violent powers and deep RPG systems to create a true genre hybrid.','2021/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/680420/OUTRIDERS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2823,'ni_no_kuni™_ii:_revenant_kingdom',NULL,'Join the young king Evan as he sets out on an epic quest to found a new kingdom and, with the help of some new friends, unite his world, saving its people from a terrible evil.','2018/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/589360/Ni_no_Kuni_II_Revenant_Kingdom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2824,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_tyranids',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2019/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/995860/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Tyranids/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2825,'northgard_-_gardariki,_clan_of_the_hippogriff',NULL,'This content requires the base game Northgard on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3691650/Northgard__Gardariki_Clan_of_the_Hippogriff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2826,'the_painscreek_killings',NULL,'Investigate an infamous cold case in the eerie, abandoned town of Painscreek. Search for evidence, connect the dots and uncover who killed Vivian Roberts. Can you expose the truth behind this town’s dark secrets?','2017/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/624270/The_Painscreek_Killings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2827,'marvel_contest_of_champions',NULL,'The ultimate Super Hero fighting game is now on Steam! Collect and upgrade iconic Super Heroes and Villains from the Marvel Universe, engage in fast-paced 1v1 battles, and unleash powerful abilities in Marvel Contest of Champions!','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3127280/Marvel_Contest_of_Champions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2828,'incredibox',NULL,'Incredibox is a music game that lets you create your own music with the help of a merry crew of beatboxers.','2009/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1545450/Incredibox/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2829,'medal_of_honor™:_above_and_beyond',NULL,'Take the fight to war-torn Europe in Medal of Honor: Above and Beyond. The franchise returns to its roots complete with a deep single-player campaign and powerful interviews with survivors and veterans of the Second World War. (VR Title)','2020/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1402320/Medal_of_Honor_Above_and_Beyond/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2830,'bramble:_the_mountain_king',NULL,'Bramble The Mountain King is a grim adventure set in a world inspired by dark, Nordic fables. Explore the beautiful yet dangerous and twisted land of Bramble in your endeavour to rescue your sister. Traverse a wondrous landscape and survive deadly encounters with Bramble\'s many hideous creatures.','2023/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1623940/Bramble_The_Mountain_King/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2831,'vtube_studio_-_vnet_multiplayer_collab',NULL,'This content requires the base application VTube Studio on Steam in order to run.','2023/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2384550/VTube_Studio__VNet_Multiplayer_Collab/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2832,'motel_manager_simulator',NULL,'Restore an old motel alongside a shop and a gas station. Design, furnish, decorate and rent rooms. provide products for customers and fuel for cars. Hire employees to help you and be the boss of your own empire.','2024/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2594540/Motel_Manager_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2833,'zoo_2:_animal_park',NULL,'Zoo 2: Animal Park – Take care of wild and tame zoo animals in this animal game!','2020/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1352330/Zoo_2_Animal_Park/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2834,'haven',NULL,'Two lovers gave up everything and escaped to a lost planet to be together. Glide through a mysterious landscape, explore a fragmented world and fight against what’s trying to tear them apart in this RPG adventure about love, rebellion, and freedom.','2020/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/983970/Haven/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2835,'dotage',NULL,'Village elder, help us! The Apocalypse is approaching, and we need your guidance to survive. Assign your workers and build a thriving village against the pending doom. DotAGE is the merciless survival roguelite turn-based city builder. Will you fulfill the Prophecy?','2023/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/638510/dotAGE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_59'),(2836,'dead_frontier_2',NULL,'Survival horror MMO. As one of the few survivors of the outbreak, you must scratch a living out of the decaying ruins of society. Scavenge for supplies, improve your skills, and trade with other players. All the while, keeping your eyes peeled for the infected lurking around every corner.','2019/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/744900/Dead_Frontier_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2837,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_schmitz_cargobull_trailer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2833100/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Schmitz_Cargobull_Trailer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2838,'the_excavation_of_hob\'s_barrow',NULL,'The Excavation of Hob\'s Barrow is a folk horror narrative-driven adventure. Explore the isolated moors of rural Victorian England as you uncover the mysteries of Hob\'s Barrow. The answers lie in the soil...','2022/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1182310/The_Excavation_of_Hobs_Barrow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2839,'neon_abyss',NULL,'Neon Abyss is a frantic, roguelite action-platformer where you run ‘n’ gun your way into the Abyss. Featuring unlimited item synergies and a unique dungeon evolution system, each run diversifies the experience and every choice alters the ruleset.','2020/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/788100/Neon_Abyss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2840,'tron:_catalyst',NULL,'The Arq Grid stands on the brink of collapse. With your Identity Disc and Light Cycle, fight to escape by wielding the power of the Glitch loop. Electrifying action and a rich story combine in a new adventure set within Disney’s iconic TRON universe.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3025590/TRON_Catalyst/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2841,'everspace™_2_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game EVERSPACE™ 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2911770/EVERSPACE_2__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2842,'the_cosmic_wheel_sisterhood',NULL,'Immerse yourself in an enchanting narrative experience as Fortuna, a fortune-teller Witch condemned to exile on her asteroid home. Craft your own Tarot deck, regain your freedom, and shape the fate of the cosmic Witch society.','2023/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1340480/The_Cosmic_Wheel_Sisterhood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2843,'rick_and_morty:_virtual_rick-ality',NULL,'Rick and Morty: Virtual Rick-ality smashes together the absolute VR chaos of the award-winning Job Simulator with the ridiculous, all-out, take-no-prisoners comedy of Rick and Morty.','2017/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/469610/Rick_and_Morty_Virtual_Rickality/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2844,'jujutsu_kaisen_cursed_clash',NULL,'Master the Jujutsu of your favorite Sorcerers and Cursed Spirits! Bring a friend and dive into the world of JUJUTSU KAISEN in this action-packed, 2-on-2 fighting game!','2024/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1877020/Jujutsu_Kaisen_Cursed_Clash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2845,'coffee_talk',NULL,'Coffee Talk is a coffee brewing and heart-to-heart talking simulator about listening to fantasy-inspired modern peoples’ problems, and helping them by serving up a warm drink or two.','2020/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/914800/Coffee_Talk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2846,'plant_nursery_simulator',NULL,'Run your own cozy Plant Nursery in this relaxing sim. Grow crops, stock shelves, and help customers. Expand with greenhouses, hire staff, and decorate your dream shop. Perfect for fans of wholesome farming and sim games.','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3474700/Plant_Nursery_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2847,'dragon_ball_xenoverse_2_-_dragon_ball_daima_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3387210/DRAGON_BALL_XENOVERSE_2__Dragon_Ball_DAIMA_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2848,'dead_by_daylight_-_leatherface™',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2017/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/700280/Dead_by_Daylight__Leatherface/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2849,'spongebob_squarepants:_the_cosmic_shake',NULL,'Wish-granting Mermaid’s Tears in the hands of SpongeBob and Patrick… What could go wrong? Sure, the very fabric holding the universe together could come undone, opening portals into wild Wishworlds. But that’s nothing our favorite sponge can’t handle- with the right cosmic costume!','2023/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1282150/SpongeBob_SquarePants_The_Cosmic_Shake/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2850,'dummynation',NULL,'Geopolitical management game with real-time shifting borders and a streamlined gameplay, designed to minimize all burdensome chores while allowing an absolute strategic control, from military recruitment and deployment, to diplomatic and economic management.','2022/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1892030/Dummynation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2851,'immersion_pack_-_europa_universalis_iv:_lions_of_the_north',NULL,'This content requires the base game Europa Universalis IV on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2012010/Immersion_Pack__Europa_Universalis_IV_Lions_of_the_North/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2852,'911_operator',NULL,'Game about the difficult work of people that manage emergency lines and services. Answer incoming calls and react properly - give first aid instructions, advise, dispatch correct number of firemen / police / ambulances, or sometimes - just ignore the call. Play on ANY CITY in the world!','2017/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/503560/911_Operator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2853,'monster_hunter_wilds_-_alma_outfit:_chun-li_outfit_-_sf6',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Hunter Wilds on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3360490/Monster_Hunter_Wilds__Alma_Outfit_ChunLi_Outfit__SF6/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2854,'intravenous_2:_iv1_remaster',NULL,'This content requires the base game Intravenous 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3391540/Intravenous_2_IV1_Remaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2855,'underrail',NULL,'Underrail is an old school turn-based isometric indie role playing game that focuses on exploration and combat. The game is set in a distant future, when the life on the Earth’s surface has long since been made impossible and the remnants of humanity now dwell in the Underrail, a vast system of metro station-states that, it seems, are...','2015/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/250520/UnderRail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2856,'cities:_skylines_-_parklife',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2018/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/715191/Cities_Skylines__Parklife/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2857,'carx_drift_racing_online_-_season_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game CarX Drift Racing Online on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1535220/CarX_Drift_Racing_Online__Season_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2858,'payday_3:_jacket_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 3 on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3450550/PAYDAY_3_Jacket_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2859,'greedfall',NULL,'Engage in a core roleplaying experience, and forge the destiny of a new world seeping with magic, and filled with riches, lost secrets, and fantastic creatures. With diplomacy, deception and force, become part of a living, evolving world - influence its course and shape your story.','2019/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/606880/GreedFall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2860,'le_mans_ultimate_-_2024_pack_4',NULL,'This content requires the base game Le Mans Ultimate on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3260820/Le_Mans_Ultimate__2024_Pack_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2861,'sprocket',NULL,'Carefully balance mobility, firepower and armour in a dedicated tank designer. Then uncarefully put them to the test in a series of combat scenarios progressing through the ages of the tank. Here, your limit is what you can fit inside your hull and turret while still being able to move forwards.','2021/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1674170/Sprocket/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2862,'apocalypse_party',NULL,'Apocalypse Party is a 3D top-down action Roguelike game. In this game, you will embark on a new mission to traverse through the Middle Ages and gradually master abilities, and arm yourself to become the strongest survivor through numerous choices.','2023/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2351560/Apocalypse_Party/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2863,'do_not_feed_the_monkeys',NULL,'A digital voyeur simulator where you watch strangers through surveillance cameras. Invade their privacy and witness their most intimate moments, but don’t interact with the subjects – anything could happen if you dare feed the monkeys!','2018/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/658850/Do_Not_Feed_the_Monkeys/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2864,'dream_daddy:_a_dad_dating_simulator',NULL,'Dream Daddy: A Dad Dating Simulator is a game where you play as a Dad and your goal is to meet and romance other hot Dads. Are you ready? Hi ready, I\'m Dad.','2017/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/654880/Dream_Daddy_A_Dad_Dating_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2865,'to_the_moon',NULL,'A story-driven experience about two doctors traversing backwards through a dying man\'s memories to artificially fulfill his last wish.','2011/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/206440/To_the_Moon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2866,'operation:_tango',NULL,'It takes two to save the world in this cooperative spy adventure. Pair up with a friend as Agent or Hacker—with only your voices to connect you—and work together to bring a hi-tech global menace to its knees. Now with a FREE CONTENT UPDATE!','2021/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1335790/Operation_Tango/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2867,'leaf_blower_revolution_-_idle_game',NULL,'Blow leaves, upgrade your gear, and automate your progress as you explore the Leaf Universe. A satisfying incremental idle game where every leaf blown brings you closer to the next big upgrade. Simple, relaxing, and endlessly rewarding. Let the leaves fall, and your progress rise!','2020/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1468260/Leaf_Blower_Revolution__Idle_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2868,'your_turn_to_die_-death_game_by_majority-',NULL,'Your Turn To Die -Death Game By Majority- is a multi-ending horror adventure game. Sara Chidouin returns home from school late one night to discover that something\'s gone terribly wrong. When she comes to, she finds herself, her friend Joe, and 9 other people trapped in a mysterious place.','2023/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2067780/Your_Turn_To_Die_Death_Game_By_Majority/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2869,'potion_permit',NULL,'Moonbury\'s residents need healing, and you\'re the best chemist around! With your trusty tools, a brewing cauldron, and a canine companion at your side, you\'ll need to diagnose symptoms, gather ingredients, brew potions, and cure ailments in this open-ended sim RPG.','2022/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1337760/Potion_Permit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2870,'sharks_and_minnows',NULL,'Find supplies to maintain your stamina. Complete ten laps. Escape.','2025/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3446200/Sharks_and_Minnows/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2871,'resonance_of_fate™/end_of_eternity™_4k/hd_edition',NULL,'This symphonic gunplay RPG, where you can change the fate of the world, has been remastered in a 4K/HD EDITION. Fly through the air and enjoy the blazing gun battles in this fateful tale set on a ruined planet.','2018/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/645730/RESONANCE_OF_FATEEND_OF_ETERNITY_4KHD_EDITION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2872,'gladio_mori',NULL,'Gladio Mori is a physics-driven multiplayer gladiator combat game featuring dismemberment, organ-specific damage, and a fully customizable move editor. Craft your own fighting style or use community created movesets to fight your way to glory.','2024/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2689120/Gladio_Mori/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2873,'new_star_gp',NULL,'New Star GP is a fast and exciting arcade motorsport game with crisp retro visuals. Play career mode and work your way through decades of racing while upgrading your car and your support team... or chase high scores in championship mode on your own or in split-screen with up to three friends!','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2217580/New_Star_GP/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2874,'tower_unite',NULL,'PLAY, CREATE, PARTY! Tower Unite is a community-based virtual world party game with online games, entertainment, activities, and absolutely NO microtransactions.','2025/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/394690/Tower_Unite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2875,'replicube',NULL,'Replicube is an open-ended programming puzzle game/toy about writing code to replicate 3D voxel-based objects.  Solve puzzles, pursue leaderboard glory, or just make art to share with the in-game community.','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3401490/Replicube/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2876,'immortals_of_aveum™',NULL,'Immortals of Aveum is a single-player first person magic shooter that tells the story of Jak as he joins an elite order of battlemages to save a world on the edge of abyss.','2023/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2009100/Immortals_of_Aveum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2877,'into_the_restless_ruins',NULL,'A roguelike deckbuilder where you create the dungeon you fight through. Each night use your cards to expand the ruins then battle through them, harvesting Glimour from the lost souls and improving your deck. Can you reach The Warden and defeat it, so The Maiden will grant your heart’s desire?','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2877770/Into_the_Restless_Ruins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2878,'tropico_6_-_return_to_nature',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tropico 6 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3391380/Tropico_6__Return_to_Nature/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2879,'xcom_2:_war_of_the_chosen_-_tactical_legacy_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game XCOM 2: War of the Chosen on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/785300/XCOM_2_War_of_the_Chosen__Tactical_Legacy_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2880,'funko_fusion',NULL,'Experience a festival of fandom like never before in Funko Fusion! Play through iconic worlds and mashup characters inspired by some of your favorite franchises in an action-adventure game with uniquely authentic, irreverent humor from the creative minds of 10:10 Games.','2024/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1843310/Funko_Fusion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2881,'sherlock_holmes_chapter_one',NULL,'In this story-driven detective thriller, a young Sherlock Holmes struggles to prove himself as he navigates an exotic, dangerous island in the Mediterranean to investigate the mystery of his mother’s death.','2021/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1137300/Sherlock_Holmes_Chapter_One/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_60'),(2882,'x-plane_11',NULL,'The future of flight simulation is now! X-Plane 11 is the detailed, realistic, and modern simulator you’ve been waiting for. Intuitive user interface, 3-D cockpits, new effects, 3-D sound, living airports and world-wide scenery.','2017/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/269950/XPlane_11/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2883,'the_house_in_fata_morgana',NULL,'A gothic suspense tale set in a cursed mansion. \"The House in Fata Morgana\" is a full-length visual novel spanning nearly a millennium that deals in tragedy, human nature, and insanity.','2016/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/303310/The_House_in_Fata_Morgana/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2884,'omega_crafter',NULL,'Adventure in a vast open-world survival craft game with your programmable sidekick Grammi! Program the Grammi to collect materials, build your town, craft weapons and armor to challenge strong enemies! Play alone or with friends online!','2025/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2262080/Omega_Crafter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2885,'sovl:_fantasy_warfare',NULL,'SOVL is a ruleset for playing fantasy wargames. It can be played with miniatures on a table or digitally on Steam.','2023/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1870300/SOVL_Fantasy_Warfare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2886,'no_case_should_remain_unsolved',NULL,'Twelve years after Senior Inspector Jeon Gyeong\'s retirement, she is visited by a young police officer: a woman who pleads with her to reexamine Seowon\'s case. But with each uncovered memory, only one thing becomes clear: everyone in Seowon\'s vicinity was lying.','2024/1/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2676840/No_Case_Should_Remain_Unsolved/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2887,'electrician_simulator',NULL,'Take on the electrician role and learn the profession\'s basics! Install sockets, repair worn-out equipment, assemble broken appliances, replace light bulbs, and lay wires at your customers\' homes. Be sure to check everything twice, with electricity there are no jokes!','2022/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1080020/Electrician_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2888,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_scopes_and_crosshairs_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3106720/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Scopes_and_Crosshairs_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2889,'beyond_good_&_evil_-_20th_anniversary_edition',NULL,'Embark on this epic adventure in up to 4K 60 fps with improved graphics and audio, a new speedrun mode, updated achievements, and an exclusive anniversary gallery.','2024/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2556990/Beyond_Good__Evil__20th_Anniversary_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2890,'dollmare',NULL,'You\'ve accepted a shady job offer at a doll factory. Inspect dolls for defects and anomalies. Follow strange protocols. Don\'t get fired and stay alive.','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2793710/Dollmare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2891,'chivalry_2_-_king\'s_edition_content',NULL,'This content requires the base game Chivalry 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2140440/Chivalry_2__Kings_Edition_Content/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2892,'romance_of_the_three_kingdoms_xiv',NULL,'Triumph over the land, take charge of the fate of China! Conquer territories and fly your colors!','2020/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/872410/ROMANCE_OF_THE_THREE_KINGDOMS_XIV/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2893,'gunfire_reborn_-_visitors_of_spirit_realm',NULL,'This content requires the base game Gunfire Reborn on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2111850/Gunfire_Reborn__Visitors_of_Spirit_Realm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2894,'cardboard_town',NULL,'Cardboard Town is a city-building card game. Manage your resources, obtain upgrades, draw your cards and thrive! Random events, quest cards, and game modes make each run different.','2023/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2198070/Cardboard_Town/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2895,'net.attack()',NULL,'Unleash your inner hacker skills and code your way to victory in a game where complex algorithms and intuitive gameplay collide.Net.Attack() is a dynamic Top-Down Survivors-like Roguelite where you create your own abilities using programming.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3047370/NetAttack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2896,'stronghold_crusader_2',NULL,'Stronghold Crusader 2 is the long awaited sequel to the original castle sim. After 12 years Stronghold returns to the desert with a new 3D engine and powerful Havok Physics. Crusader 2 recaptures the original game’s addictive, fast-paced gameplay and authentic castle simulation.','2014/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/232890/Stronghold_Crusader_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2897,'flintlock:_the_siege_of_dawn',NULL,'From games studio A44, makers of Ashen, comes an explosive Souls-lite, where Gods and guns collide in a battle for the future of humanity.','2024/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1832040/Flintlock_The_Siege_of_Dawn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2898,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_adepta_sororitas',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2130960/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Adepta_Sororitas/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2899,'arms_trade_tycoon:_tanks',NULL,'Arms Trade Tycoon: Tanks is a unique combination of tank design and tycoon game. It puts you in charge of an arms trading company specialized in tanks from WWI to the modern era. Research, design, sell and follow your tanks in battle to make your own history!','2024/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1662210/Arms_Trade_Tycoon_Tanks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2900,'djmax_respect_v_-_blue_archive_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3653040/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__Blue_Archive_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2901,'those_who_rule',NULL,'Join three fresh recruits caught in a web of betrayal as war looms over the land. Lead your band of heroes through tactical turn-based battles, master unique abilities, and forge powerful gear to turn the tide of battle. Will you unravel the conspiracy driving the conflict—or be consumed by it?','2025/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1822060/Those_Who_Rule/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2902,'warhammer_40,000:_chaos_gate - daemonhunters_-_duty_eternal',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Chaos Gate - Daemonhunters on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2126610/Warhammer_40000_Chaos_Gate__Daemonhunters__Duty_Eternal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2903,'lawn_mowing_simulator',NULL,'Experience the beauty and detail of mowing the Great British countryside in Lawn Mowing Simulator, the only simulator that allows you to ride an authentic and expansive roster of real-world licensed lawn mowers from prestigious manufacturers; Toro, SCAG and STIGA as you manage your business.','2021/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1480560/Lawn_Mowing_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2904,'esail_sailing_simulator',NULL,'eSail Sailing Simulator is an authentic yacht sailing experience with numerous tutorials, sailing, mooring and anchoring modes, charting, challenges, races, Live Sailing mode, \'Learn Yachting with eSail\' and more.','2019/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/794860/eSail_Sailing_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2905,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_revontuli_coast',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1931910/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Revontuli_Coast/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2906,'cold_waters',NULL,'Spiritual Successor to the Microprose Classic “Red Storm Rising”.','2017/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/541210/Cold_Waters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2907,'hachishaku',NULL,'Search the village of Naninani Mura to find answers about your past and evade the hauntingly beautiful 8 foot tall HachiShaku-sama!','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3572580/Hachishaku/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2908,'paranoia_place',NULL,'PARANOIA PLACE is a 1-3 player online co-op survival horror game. Together or alone, you will need to solve puzzles, find items and run from the bloodthirsty demonic killer.','2025/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1592290/PARANOIA_PLACE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2909,'assetto_corsa_competizione_-_2020_gt_world_challenge_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa Competizione on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1449260/Assetto_Corsa_Competizione__2020_GT_World_Challenge_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2910,'battlefield_1_™_shortcut_kit:_ultimate_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Battlefield™ 1 on Steam in order to play.','2016/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238851/Battlefield_1__Shortcut_Kit_Ultimate_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2911,'eastward',NULL,'Welcome to the charming world of Eastward - population declining! Journey through a society on the brink of collapse. Discover delightful towns, strange creatures and even stranger people! Wield a trusty frying pan and mystic powers on an adventure into the unknown…','2021/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/977880/Eastward/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2912,'space_engineers_-_decorative_pack_#3',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2504720/Space_Engineers__Decorative_Pack_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2913,'arma_3_jets',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2017/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/601670/Arma_3_Jets/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2914,'quake',NULL,'Developed by the award-winning id Software, Quake® is the ground-breaking, original dark fantasy first-person shooter that inspires today’s retro-style FPS games. With Quake (Enhanced), experience the authentic, updated, and visually enhanced version of the original.','1996/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2310/Quake/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2915,'stranded:_alien_dawn_-_robots_and_guardians',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stranded: Alien Dawn on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2104870/Stranded_Alien_Dawn__Robots_and_Guardians/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2916,'batman_-_the_telltale_series',NULL,'Enter the fractured psyche of Bruce Wayne and discover the powerful and far-reaching consequences of your choices as the Dark Knight.','2016/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/498240/Batman__The_Telltale_Series/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2917,'monster_hunter_world:_iceborne_deluxe_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Hunter: World on Steam in order to play.','2020/1/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1118012/Monster_Hunter_World_Iceborne_Deluxe_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2918,'nimby_rails',NULL,'Design and run your own railroads for the real world. Solve global transportation dilemmas. Unleash your inner railway engineer and transit policy manager.','2021/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1134710/NIMBY_Rails/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2919,'battlebit_remastered',NULL,'BattleBit Remastered is a low-poly, massive multiplayer FPS, supporting 254 players per server. Battle on a near-fully destructible map with various vehicles!','2023/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/671860/BattleBit_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2920,'i_have_no_mouth,_and_i_must_scream',NULL,'The adventure plunges you into the tortured and hidden past of five humans. Delve into their darkest fears. Outwit the Master Computer AM in a game of psychological warfare. Disturbing, compelling. An adventure you won\'t easily forget !!','1996/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/245390/I_Have_No_Mouth_and_I_Must_Scream/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2921,'escape_first_alchemist_⚗️',NULL,'First-person escape game, playable solo or co-op with up to 4 people. Solve riddles of a reclusive alchemist that trapped you in his workshop. Brew potions and overcome challenges as he laughs at your failures and makes light of your successes...But what if things are not what they seem?','2023/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2094320/Escape_First_Alchemist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2922,'shadow_empire',NULL,'Shadow Empire is a deep turn-based 4X wargame with a unique blend of military focus, procedurally generated content and role-playing features. Players take the seat of the supreme ruler of a small nation, with the goal of reconquering a devastated planet.','2020/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1154840/Shadow_Empire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2923,'amenti',NULL,'A photographer enters the Great Pyramids to photograph Pharaoh Rudamon’s remains, but is soon overwhelmed by a sinister curse, as the ancient tomb awakens dark forces that claw at his sanity.','2025/1/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3292260/Amenti/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2924,'rayman®_origins',NULL,'Experience the magical universe of Rayman with legendary 2D gameplay that has captured the hearts of millions of fans!','2012/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/207490/Rayman_Origins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2925,'plan_b:_terraform',NULL,'Terraform a lifeless rock into a lush and habitable world. Build trucks, trains and sprawling factories on an enormous hexagonal planet. Grow its population to millions. Enjoy a dynamic simulation of atmosphere, temperature, water and forests.','2023/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1894430/Plan_B_Terraform/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2926,'sam_&_max:_the_devil\'s_playhouse',NULL,'The last game in the episodic Sam & Max trilogy, beautifully remastered! As the intergalactic villains who seek the Devil’s Toybox close in and Max’s psychic abilities grow beyond his control, the Freelance Police will come up against their most frightening adversary yet: the power of Max’s mind.','2024/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2648050/Sam__Max_The_Devils_Playhouse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2927,'hacker_simulator',NULL,'Become a hacker and build your online reputation to the top by discovering a simplified and enjoyable version of real-life hacking methods. Complete contracts, buy new programs, upgrade your computer, crack wifi networks and infiltrate peoples or companies online systems.','2021/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1754840/Hacker_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2928,'total_war:_three_kingdoms_-_a_world_betrayed',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: THREE KINGDOMS on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1209110/Total_War_THREE_KINGDOMS__A_World_Betrayed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2929,'mechwarrior_5:_mercenaries_-_legend_of_the_kestrel_lancers',NULL,'This content requires the base game MechWarrior 5: Mercenaries on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1705820/MechWarrior_5_Mercenaries__Legend_of_the_Kestrel_Lancers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2930,'shadows_of_the_damned:_hella_remastered',NULL,'Shadows of the Damned, an action-adventure road trip through hell, has been remastered at last! Get ready for a story about rock, love, and just a little bit of demon slaying.','2024/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2535440/Shadows_of_the_Damned_Hella_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2931,'planescape:_torment:_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Uncover secrets of past lives in this story-rich, tactical roleplaying game set in Sigil, a dark fantasy city at the heart of the Dungeons & Dragons multiverse. Explore the planes, survive combat alongside a party of bizarre companions, and solve puzzles unlike any ever seen in the genre.','2017/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/466300/Planescape_Torment_Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_61'),(2932,'the_escapists',NULL,'The Escapists provides players the opportunity of experiencing a light-hearted insight into everyday prison life with the main objective being that of escaping!','2015/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/298630/The_Escapists/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2933,'to_a_t',NULL,'A charming, colorful adventure game from the creator of Katamari Damacy and the uvula team about a teen navigating life in a small town with their cute dog companion. While their body is stuck in a T-pose, they do their best to make the most of it.','2025/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1875320/to_a_T/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2934,'saints_row_2',NULL,'Saints Row 2 brings true freedom to open-world gaming. Players can play as who they want, how they want, and with whomever they want in this sequel to the much acclaimed and tremendously successful Saints Row.','2009/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/9480/Saints_Row_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2935,'atelier_ryza_3:_alchemist_of_the_end_&_the_secret_key',NULL,'The final summer, the final secret... Ryza\'s final adventure is about to begin!','2023/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1999770/Atelier_Ryza_3_Alchemist_of_the_End__the_Secret_Key/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2936,'gorogoa',NULL,'Gorogoa is an elegant evolution of the puzzle genre, told through a beautifully hand-drawn story designed and illustrated by Jason Roberts. Winner of Debut Game at the 2018 BAFTA Games Awards, as well as Best Mobile Game and the Innovation Award at the GDC 2018 Choice Awards.','2017/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/557600/Gorogoa/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2937,'warhammer_40,000:_mechanicus_-_heretek',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Mechanicus on Steam in order to play.','2019/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1049290/Warhammer_40000_Mechanicus__Heretek/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2938,'cinema_simulator_2025',NULL,'Cinema Simulator 2025 is a simulation game where you will manage your own movie theater and test your strategy and management skills. Starting from a small movie theater, try to become a giant in the movie industry.','2025/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3098070/Cinema_Simulator_2025/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2939,'day_of_dragons',NULL,'Day of Dragons is an online creature survival game set in a large, beautiful, sandbox open world with multiple biomes and distinct creatures. Rule the world as one of several dragon species, or play as an elemental.','2019/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1088090/Day_of_Dragons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2940,'our_life:_beginnings_&_always',NULL,'A twenty-dollar bill, four summers, fifteen years, and a one of a kind life. Create an experience that’s all your own in this near-fully customizable visual novel where you grow from childhood to adulthood with the lonely boy next door.','2020/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1129190/Our_Life_Beginnings__Always/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2941,'supervive',NULL,'MOBA BR MEETS HERO SHOOTER. Jump, glide, shoot, punch, bounce, nuke, spike your enemies in this free-flowing, chaotic battleground in the sky. Face off in all-out, multi-squad teamfights, take down boss monsters for big loot, get that W and run it back.','2024/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1283700/SUPERVIVE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2942,'bootstrap_island',NULL,'Stranded in the 17th century after a brutal shipwreck, you awaken alone on a deadly tropical island. To survive, you’ll need to learn fast - facing wild beasts, nature’s wrath, and uncovering secrets hidden deep in the jungle. Every step is a fight for your life.','2024/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1942110/Bootstrap_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2943,'en_garde!',NULL,'En Garde! – the swashbuckler action game! Battle graceless guards and nefarious noblemen in fast-paced fights full of spectacle. Use the environment, your wit and your blade to teach them all a lesson!','2023/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1654660/En_Garde/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2944,'maestro',NULL,'Step into a gorgeous opera house with Maestro, the VR orchestra conducting rhythm game that\'s the essence of elegance, control, and high-society french sophistication.','2024/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2701700/Maestro/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2945,'far_cry®',NULL,'A tropical paradise seethes with hidden evil in Far Cry®, a cunningly detailed action shooter that pushes the boundaries of combat to shocking new levels. Freelance mariner Jack Carver is cursing the day he ever came to this island.','2004/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/13520/Far_Cry/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2946,'atelier_ryza_2:_lost_legends_&_the_secret_fairy',NULL,'This story takes place three years after the events of the previous game “Atelier Ryza: Ever Darkness & the Secret Hideout,” and depicts the reunion of Ryza and her friends, who go through new encounters and goodbyes to discover a true priceless treasure.','2021/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1257290/Atelier_Ryza_2_Lost_Legends__the_Secret_Fairy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2947,'cities:_skylines_-_industries',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/715194/Cities_Skylines__Industries/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2948,'madison',NULL,'MADiSON is a first person psychological horror game that delivers an immersive and terrifying experience. With the help of an instant camera, connect the human world with the beyond, take pictures and develop them by yourself. Solve puzzles, explore your surroundings and most importantly, survive.','2022/7/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1670870/MADiSON/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2949,'teenage_mutant_ninja_turtles:_tactical_takedown',NULL,'Splinter and Shredder are dead. Help the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles tackle deadly new threats and the approach of adulthood in this fast-paced turn-based beat-em-up!','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3229100/Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_Tactical_Takedown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2950,'the_citadel',NULL,'The Citadel is a brutal first person shooter, and a love letter to classic games such as Marathon, Doom and Wolfenstein 3d. Descend into the depths of a dark citadel, and fight through 6 Episodes and 30 levels of action packed with 6 challenging bosses. Go forth, Martyr.','2020/8/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1378290/The_Citadel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2951,'drug_dealer_simulator_2:_casino_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Drug Dealer Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3169480/Drug_Dealer_Simulator_2_Casino_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2952,'clue/cluedo:_classic_edition',NULL,'The official digital version of Hasbro’s classic mystery board game, Cluedo (Clue). Roll the dice and launch into a murder investigation. Whodunit? With what weapon? Where? You’ll need all your brain power to find the answers you need, as you race your friends and family to the truth!','2018/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/794800/ClueCluedo_Classic_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2953,'hellcard',NULL,'Hellcard is a unique cooperative deck builder rogue-like game. Descend into the paper dungeons on your own, recruit computer-controlled companions or join other players\' lobbies in fast-paced tactical card battles against the armies of darkness and the Archdemon himself!','2024/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1201540/HELLCARD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2954,'war_robots:_frontiers',NULL,'Gear up for tactical mech action in War Robots: Frontiers, a free-to-play multiplayer mech shooter. Construct and customize, squad up with Pilots online, and fire up your engines in massive intergalactic battles.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1491000/War_Robots_Frontiers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2955,'back_to_the_dawn',NULL,'You were framed and incarcerated. Learn to survive in prison. Explore every inch and exploit any weakness. Manipulate and scheme. Make friends (or foes) with fellow inmates and with their help, break out of prison.','2023/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1735700/Back_to_the_Dawn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2956,'total_war:_attila_-_age_of_charlemagne_campaign_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ATTILA on Steam in order to play.','2015/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/343464/Total_War_ATTILA__Age_of_Charlemagne_Campaign_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2957,'freedom_planet_2',NULL,'The fast paced platforming of Freedom Planet returns! Become a full-time cartoon heroine and use abilities and items suited to your play style to explore the world of Avalice and defend its animal citizens!','2022/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/595500/Freedom_Planet_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2958,'burggeist',NULL,'With the walking fortress Burggeist at your command, fight back the enemies and build \"the Tower.\"','2024/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2203210/BURGGEIST/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2959,'scribblenauts_unlimited',NULL,'The best-selling, award-winning franchise is back – on your home PC in gorgeous HD for the first time.','2013/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/218680/Scribblenauts_Unlimited/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2960,'omsi_2_add-on_yorkshire_counties',NULL,'This content requires the base game OMSI 2: Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1599050/OMSI_2_Addon_Yorkshire_Counties/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2961,'armored_warfare',NULL,'Wage war against players around the world with an unstoppable arsenal of powerful armored combat vehicles. Use 300+ vehicles to engage in furious PvP tank combat, complete co-op missions, and crush your enemies on breathtaking maps, from scorching deserts to neon-drenched urban jungles.','2015/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/443110/Armored_Warfare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2962,'arma_3_helicopters',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2014/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/304380/Arma_3_Helicopters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2963,'car_mechanic_simulator_2018',NULL,'Build and expand your repair service empire in this incredibly detailed and highly realistic simulation game, where attention to car detail is astonishing. Find classic, unique cars in the new Barn Find module and Junkyard module. You can even add your self-made car in the Car Editor.','2017/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/645630/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2018/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2964,'x4:_split_vendetta',NULL,'This content requires the base game X4: Foundations on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1133000/X4_Split_Vendetta/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2965,'cinnabunny',NULL,'Cinnabunny is a cozy life simulator game where you play as a bunny who runs a bakery. Unlock new recipes, go birdwatching, collect mushrooms, and charm your community. Save up enough carrots to help your family move.','2025/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2794830/Cinnabunny/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2966,'the_legend_of_heroes:_trails_from_zero',NULL,'When Lloyd Bannings is assigned to Crossbell\'s Special Support Section, he and his new teammates must prove themselves as they fight to overcome the injustice of a city gripped by corruption.','2022/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1668510/The_Legend_of_Heroes_Trails_from_Zero/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2967,'skald:_against_the_black_priory',NULL,'SKALD:Against the Black Priory is a retro-style party-based RPG set in a grim-dark fantasy world of tragic heroes, violent deaths and Lovecraftian horror. Take a chance and roll the dice as you embark on a compelling story filled with deadly creatures, branching story and tactical, turn-based combat','2024/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1069160/SKALD_Against_the_Black_Priory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2968,'clank!',NULL,'Burgle your way to adventure in the award-winning board game!','2024/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1722870/Clank/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2969,'coffee_talk_episode_2:_hibiscus_&_butterfly',NULL,'Dust off your coffee machine and prepare your warmest smile to meet your customers again in the second episode of the much loved coffee brewing and heart-to-heart talking simulator; Coffee Talk Episode 2: Hibiscus & Butterfly.','2023/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1663220/Coffee_Talk_Episode_2_Hibiscus__Butterfly/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2970,'stellaris:_leviathans_story_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellaris on Steam in order to play.','2016/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/518910/Stellaris_Leviathans_Story_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2971,'agatha_christie_-_murder_on_the_orient_express',NULL,'Step on board the legendary Orient Express and immerse yourself in the most famous detective suit in a race against the clock to unmask the murderer.','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1904790/Agatha_Christie__Murder_on_the_Orient_Express/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2972,'tower_factory',NULL,'Tower Factory is a tower defense and automation game with roguelite elements. Optimize resource production using conveyor systems while defending against monster waves. Can you find and destroy the enemy tower before it\'s too late?','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2707490/Tower_Factory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2973,'the_room_vr:_a_dark_matter',NULL,'The British Institute of Archaeology, London, 1908: The disappearance of an esteemed Egyptologist prompts a Police investigation into the unknown. Explore cryptic locations, examine fantastic gadgets and uncover an otherworldly discovery which blurs the line between reality and illusion.','2020/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1104380/The_Room_VR_A_Dark_Matter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2974,'pac-man_world_re-pac',NULL,'PAC-MAN arrives home on his birthday to find the Ghosts have kidnapped PAC-MAN’s family and ruined his party! Off to the rescue, PAC-MAN sets out to Ghost Island!','2022/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1859470/PACMAN_WORLD_RePAC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2975,'to_the_core',NULL,'To The Core is an incremental game about extracting and using resources from planets to buy upgrades.','2023/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1988550/To_The_Core/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2976,'loop_hero',NULL,'The Lich has thrown the world into a timeless loop and plunged its inhabitants into never ending chaos. Wield an expanding deck of mystical cards to place enemies, buildings, and terrain along each unique expedition loop for the brave hero.','2021/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1282730/Loop_Hero/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2977,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_ghost_face_rampage',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3204800/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Ghost_Face_Rampage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2978,'ranch_farm_and_store_simulator',NULL,'Enjoy the experience of running your own ranch and store from the ground up. Grow crops, raise livestock, and keep your customers stocked with fresh products. Defend your farm from wild animal attacks. Hire employees and grow from a humble beginning into a thriving business.','2025/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3706960/Ranch_Farm_and_Store_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2979,'baldur\'s_gate:_dark_alliance_ii',NULL,'An old-school hack-and-slash action RPG awaits! Pick one of five heroes, defeat monstrous enemies with weapons and spells, loot treasure and level up in this classic D&D fantasy adventure.','2022/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1889930/Baldurs_Gate_Dark_Alliance_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2980,'baldi\'s_basics_plus',NULL,'Baldi\'s Basics® Plus is an active stealth roguelike that parodies cheap \'90s edutainment with a subtle horror twist! Play Hide & Seek with Baldi as he chases you through procedurally generated levels while using your surroundings, items, and game knowledge to shift chaos in your favor.','2020/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1275890/Baldis_Basics_Plus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_62'),(2981,'atelier_sophie:_the_alchemist_of_the_mysterious_book_dx',NULL,'The definitive edition of the Atelier \"Mysterious\" series at a new price, with brand new content and various DLCs! \"Atelier Sophie\" is the 1st instalment: a chance encounter between Sophie and a sentient book Plachta takes them on an adventure to recover Plachta\'s memories.','2021/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1502970/Atelier_Sophie_The_Alchemist_of_the_Mysterious_Book_DX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2982,'warhammer_40,000:_warpforge',NULL,'A free-to-play digital collectible card game set in the 41st millennium, Warpforge brings together the major factions of the Warhammer 40,000 universe as digital cards for players to collect and do battle with in brutal and fast-paced skirmishes.','2024/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1985170/Warhammer_40000_Warpforge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2983,'ark_fantastic_tames_-_pyromane',NULL,'This content requires the base game ARK: Survival Ascended on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2972680/ARK_Fantastic_Tames__Pyromane/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2984,'wingspan:_oceania_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wingspan on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1962870/Wingspan_Oceania_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2985,'vampire_survivors:_legacy_of_the_moonspell',NULL,'This content requires the base game Vampire Survivors on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2230760/Vampire_Survivors_Legacy_of_the_Moonspell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2986,'farming_simulator_25_-_nexat_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Farming Simulator 25 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3450870/Farming_Simulator_25__NEXAT_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63');
INSERT INTO `table_games` VALUES (2987,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™__-_ambusher_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2532370/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild___Ambusher_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2988,'miscrits:_world_of_creatures',NULL,'After years of absence, Miscrits is back and better than ever! Return to the world of Miscria and capture hundreds of iconic Miscrits. Train your Miscrits to their strongest forms and put a stop to the Magicites, who threaten to eliminate all Miscrit life from the world!','2025/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3628960/Miscrits_World_of_Creatures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2989,'fire_pro_wrestling_world',NULL,'The greatest grappling game returns to take on the world! Customize every aspect of the match, from your wrestler to the ring itself, in your fight for the championship belt.','2017/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/564230/Fire_Pro_Wrestling_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2990,'throne_and_liberty_nature\'s_celebration_pack:_silver',NULL,'This content requires the base game THRONE AND LIBERTY on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3717460/THRONE_AND_LIBERTY_Natures_Celebration_Pack_Silver/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2991,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_german_shorthaired_pointer',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3244800/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__German_Shorthaired_Pointer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2992,'planet_zoo:_australia_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1349400/Planet_Zoo_Australia_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2993,'nitro_express',NULL,'Nitro Express is a 2D side-view gun action game where cute pixel-art girls shoot assault weapons with 360° free aiming in the streets of Japan!','2025/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3088250/Nitro_Express/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2994,'gorebox',NULL,'GoreBox is a chaotic physics-driven sandbox where creativity meets destruction. Use the Reality Crusher to spawn, manipulate, and obliterate anything. Customize, battle with friends, roleplay, or face devious creatures. In this world, your imagination rules—and chaos is your playground!','2023/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2027330/GoreBox/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2995,'age_of_wonders_4:_primal_fury',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Wonders 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2401850/Age_of_Wonders_4_Primal_Fury/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2996,'the_house_of_da_vinci',NULL,'Enter The House of Da Vinci, a new must-try 3D puzzle adventure game. Solve mechanical puzzles, discover hidden objects, escape from rooms and dive into the authentic atmosphere of the Renaissance. Use all your wits to find out what\'s behind your master\'s disappearance.','2017/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/522470/The_House_of_Da_Vinci/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2997,'the_dark_pictures_anthology:_little_hope',NULL,'Trapped and isolated in the abandoned town of Little Hope, 4 college students and their teacher must escape the nightmarish apparitions that relentlessly pursue them through an impenetrable fog.','2020/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1194630/The_Dark_Pictures_Anthology_Little_Hope/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2998,'frostpunk:_the_last_autumn',NULL,'This content requires the base game Frostpunk on Steam in order to play.','2020/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1146960/Frostpunk_The_Last_Autumn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(2999,'saints_row_iv:_re-elected',NULL,'Experience the insane antics of Saints Row IV. The Saints have gone from the Penthouse to the White House - but Earth has been invaded and it’s up to you to save it with an arsenal of superpowers and strange weapons, in the wildest open world game ever.','2013/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/206420/Saints_Row_IV_ReElected/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3000,'darkest_dungeon®_ii:_the_binding_blade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Darkest Dungeon® II on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2598510/Darkest_Dungeon_II_The_Binding_Blade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3001,'gas_station_simulator_-_tidal_wave_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Gas Station Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2600880/Gas_Station_Simulator__Tidal_Wave_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3002,'catherine_classic',NULL,'Catherine: a tale of love, betrayal, and the terror of commitment. Experience the mature action-adventure-puzzle game unlike any other from the makers of the Persona series, now enhanced for PC in all its Classic glory. Is love over? Climb to the top or die trying.','2019/1/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/893180/Catherine_Classic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3003,'kartkraft™',NULL,'No seatbelts, no suspension, no downforce. This is pure head to head racing at 90mph...','2018/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/406350/KartKraft/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3004,'wild_hearts™',NULL,'Master ancient tech to hunt down giant beasts. WILD HEARTS™ is a twist on the hunting genre where technology gives you a fighting chance against giant nature-infused beasts. Hunt alone or with friends.','2023/2/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1938010/WILD_HEARTS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3005,'clustertruck',NULL,'Clustertruck is a chaotic physics based truckformer. Jump your way through insane levels in a game of \"the floor is lava\" on top of speeding trucks driven by terrible drivers.','2016/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/397950/Clustertruck/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3006,'the_jackbox_party_pack',NULL,'The team behind YOU DON’T KNOW JACK presents FIVE guffaw-inducing party games in one pack! You’re gonna need more than one party for this. Your phones or tablets are your controllers! For 1-100 players!','2014/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/331670/The_Jackbox_Party_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3007,'vampire_survivors:_tides_of_the_foscari',NULL,'This content requires the base game Vampire Survivors on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2313550/Vampire_Survivors_Tides_of_the_Foscari/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3008,'dead_letter_dept.',NULL,'Working at a data entry job in the big city, you type up and transcribe the lost mail and letters that have nowhere else to go. But as the days carry on oddities in the mail start to emerge, and cracks begin to appear.','2025/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1627350/DEAD_LETTER_DEPT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3009,'songs_of_conquest_-_vanir',NULL,'This content requires the base game Songs of Conquest on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3260210/Songs_of_Conquest__Vanir/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3010,'total_war:_attila_-_the_last_roman_campaign_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ATTILA on Steam in order to play.','2015/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/343462/Total_War_ATTILA__The_Last_Roman_Campaign_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3011,'frostpunk:_on_the_edge',NULL,'This content requires the base game Frostpunk on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1147010/Frostpunk_On_The_Edge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3012,'terraforming_mars',NULL,'The taming of the Red Planet has begun! Corporations are competing to transform Mars into a habitable planet by spending vast resources and using innovative technology to raise temperature, create a breathable atmosphere, and make oceans of water.','2018/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/800270/Terraforming_Mars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3013,'don\'t_starve:_shipwrecked',NULL,'This content requires the base game Don\'t Starve on Steam in order to play.','2015/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/393010/Dont_Starve_Shipwrecked/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3014,'moving_out_2',NULL,'Moving Out is back and wackier than ever, and now with ONLINE PLAY! Return to Packmore and use your moving skills across brand new dimensions and some old favourites. Help rebuild Smooth Moves and become an all-star F.A.R.T. (Furniture Arrangement & Relocation Technician)!','2023/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1641700/Moving_Out_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3015,'summerhouse',NULL,'A tiny building game about beautiful lived-in houses. No rules or restrictions, just pure creativity.','2024/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2533960/SUMMERHOUSE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3016,'the_medium',NULL,'Discover a dark mystery only a medium can solve. Travel to an abandoned communist resort and use your unique psychic abilities to uncover its deeply disturbing secrets, solve dual-reality puzzles, survive encounters with sinister spirits, and explore two realities at the same time.','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1293160/The_Medium/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3017,'lunar_remastered_collection',NULL,'Dive into the enchanting worlds of LUNAR: Silver Star Story Complete and LUNAR 2: Eternal Blue Complete! Tag along on Alex and Hiro\'s quests and challenge enemies like the Magic Emperor and God of Destruction to save the world from dire peril in two adventures set 1000 years apart from each other!','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3255380/LUNAR_Remastered_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3018,'sonic_adventure_dx',NULL,'An ancient evil lurking within the Master Emerald has been unleashed from its slumber by the devious Dr. Eggman and is on the verge of becoming the ultimate monster using the 7 Chaos Emeralds. Only Sonic and his friends are heroic enough to put a stop to Dr. Eggman and his evil minions.','2011/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/71250/Sonic_Adventure_DX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3019,'texas_hold\'em_poker:_pokerist',NULL,'Try the legendary Texas Poker! Enjoy a real casino atmosphere and superior 3D graphics. Jump into a world of excitement, challenge other players, and show you\'re a true winner!','2025/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3174070/Texas_Holdem_Poker_Pokerist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3020,'farm_manager_world',NULL,'Dive into the agricultural life with Farm Manager World! Manage your own farm across vibrant global locations, cultivate exotic crops, and build your agribusiness empire. Welcome to sustainable farming at its finest.','2025/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2206350/Farm_Manager_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3021,'just_cause_2',NULL,'Dive into an adrenaline-fuelled free-roaming adventure with 400 square miles of rugged terrain and hundreds of weapons and vehicles.','2010/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/8190/Just_Cause_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3022,'total_war:_three_kingdoms_-_yellow_turban_rebellion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: THREE KINGDOMS on Steam in order to play.','2019/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/853360/Total_War_THREE_KINGDOMS__Yellow_Turban_Rebellion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3023,'my_friendly_neighborhood',NULL,'Something scary is happening with everyone\'s favorite Saturday morning puppet show, The Friendly Neighborhood! Play as Gordon, a repairman sent to get to the bottom of this disturbing dilemma. Fend off puppets and solve puzzles in this survival horror adventure.','2023/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1574260/My_Friendly_Neighborhood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3024,'parking_garage_rally_circuit',NULL,'Retro Arcade Rally Racing... in Parking Garages?!? Precision driving with tight simple controls and arcade physics, all in a Sega Saturn style presentation','2024/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2737300/Parking_Garage_Rally_Circuit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3025,'clue/cluedo',NULL,'Step into new Crime Scenes. Use your skills of deduction to unravel the mystery and find out who did it, with what weapon, where. It’s the original crime-solving classic with new investigation formats exclusive to the video game. Solve every case and become the detective you want to be!','2023/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2506480/ClueCluedo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3026,'dcs:_f-4e_phantom_ii_by_heatblur_simulations',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2518950/DCS_F4E_Phantom_II_by_Heatblur_Simulations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_63'),(3027,'carx_street_-_drift_cars',NULL,'This content requires the base game CarX Street on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3285610/CarX_Street__Drift_Cars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3028,'shapez',NULL,'shapez is an easy-going, minimalistic factory building game about the automation of shapes through extraction and satisfying production lines. Adapt to increasingly complex shapes and grow your factory across an infinitely expanding map. Your only limitation is your creativity!','2020/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1318690/shapez/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3029,'gourdlets',NULL,'An easygoing sandbox game about building towns for cute vegetable folks. Create your perfect community then watch as the gourdlets make themselves at home. No objectives, no points, just good vibes. Play in full screen, or let your gourdlets hang out at the bottom of your screen!','2024/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2013730/Gourdlets/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3030,'dave_the_diver_digital_extra',NULL,'This content requires the base game DAVE THE DIVER on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2492320/DAVE_THE_DIVER_Digital_Extra/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3031,'hatred',NULL,'Hatred is a violent twin-stick shooter, in which you take the role of The Antagonist fighting against all of humanity.','2015/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/341940/Hatred/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3032,'fishing_planet:_sailor_collection_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2922520/Fishing_Planet_Sailor_Collection_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3033,'death_road_to_canada',NULL,'Control a car full of jerks as they explore cities, recruit weird people, rescue dogs, argue with each other, and face gigantic swarms of slow zombies. Randomly generated for a new story and rare events every time you play!','2016/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/252610/Death_Road_to_Canada/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3034,'blazblue_entropy_effect_-_hazama_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game BlazBlue Entropy Effect on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3422870/BlazBlue_Entropy_Effect__Hazama_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3035,'warriors_orochi_4',NULL,'The supreme \"WARRIORS OROCHI\" experience is here! The definitive installment of the \"WARRIORS OROCHI 4\", featuring all the content of the WARRIORS OROCHI 4: The Ultimate Upgrade Pack, is available now.','2018/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/831560/WARRIORS_OROCHI_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3036,'wizordum',NULL,'Wizordum is a retro FPS that puts you in the role of a Mage on a quest to track down the source of Chaos. With a wide arsenal of spells and magic items, battle your way through the world of Terrabruma in this unique blend of classic 90s shooters and modern gaming elements.','2025/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1715590/Wizordum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3037,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_ford_remastered_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2282030/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__Ford_Remastered_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3038,'world_war_z:_sin_city_apocalypse_episode',NULL,'This content requires the base game World War Z on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3245120/World_War_Z_Sin_City_Apocalypse_Episode/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3039,'train_sim_world®_5:_fife_circle_line_&_levenmouth_rail_link_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970580/Train_Sim_World_5_Fife_Circle_Line__Levenmouth_Rail_Link_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3040,'hitman_3_-_the_drop_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game HITMAN World of Assassination on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3110360/HITMAN_3__The_Drop_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3041,'juufuutei_raden™\'s_guide_for_pixel_museum',NULL,'Solve the puzzle and complete the art! \"Pixel Puzzle\" that lets you experience art and culture with Juufuutei Raden.','2025/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3204020/Juufuutei_Radens_Guide_for_Pixel_Museum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3042,'assetto_corsa_-tripl3_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assetto Corsa on Steam in order to play.','2016/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/509350/Assetto_Corsa_Tripl3_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3043,'age_of_wonders:_planetfall',NULL,'Age of Wonders: Planetfall is the new strategy game from Triumph Studios, creators of the critically acclaimed Age of Wonders series, bringing all the exciting tactical turn-based combat and in-depth empire building of its predecessors to space in an all-new, sci-fi setting.','2019/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/718850/Age_of_Wonders_Planetfall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3044,'captain_tsubasa:_rise_of_new_champions',NULL,'Captain Tsubasa: Rise of New Champions is an arcade football game bringing a refreshing look to the football genre with the exhilarating action and over the top shots that made the license famous. Defy The Laws of Football Become Legend','2020/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1163550/Captain_Tsubasa_Rise_of_New_Champions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3045,'stacklands_2000',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stacklands on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2867570/Stacklands_2000/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3046,'dungeon_tycoon',NULL,'Build your own dungeon and attract heroes from all over the realm! Grow your business by exploiting every facet of your visitors\' dungeon exploration experience. Will you be able to keep your evil dungeon business going?','2024/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2400770/Dungeon_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3047,'bulletstorm:_full_clip_edition',NULL,'Step into the boots of Grayson Hunt after a crash landing on an old resort planet forces him to make a hard choice: survival or revenge. Execute masterful kills with Bulletstorm: Full Clip Edition’s unique combat system that rewards you for performing the most creative and deadly kills imaginable.','2017/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/501590/Bulletstorm_Full_Clip_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3048,'two_point_museum:_explorer_upgrade_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Two Point Museum on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2999850/Two_Point_Museum_Explorer_Upgrade_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3049,'don\'t_starve_together:_starter_pack_2025',NULL,'This content requires the base game Don\'t Starve Together on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3373370/Dont_Starve_Together_Starter_Pack_2025/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3050,'darksiders_ii_deathinitive_edition',NULL,'The ultimate DARKSIDERS II experience! 1080p native resolution. Reworked and tuned game balancing and loot distribution. Improved Graphic Render Engine for even higher visual quality, lighting and shadows. Improved and reworked level, character and environment graphics.','2015/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/388410/Darksiders_II_Deathinitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3051,'blazblue:_cross_tag_battle',NULL,'THE COLLISION IS INEVITABLE! THE IMPACT WILL BE UNAVOIDABLE! Cross over between 4 different universes! Play as characters from the BlazBlue, Persona, Under Night In-Birth, and (for the first time ever in a fighting game), RWBY series!','2019/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/702890/BlazBlue_Cross_Tag_Battle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3052,'play_together',NULL,'Play Together is a popular casual social networking game enjoyed by players worldwide. Express yourself through character customization, decorate your home and host Home Parties for a fun time with friends. Enjoy tons of content with friends from all across the globe!','2025/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3198850/Play_Together/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3053,'punch_club_2:_fast_forward',NULL,'Train, fight, and rise to the top in this knockout sequel to the smashing fighter management simulator! Mentor your fighter and guide him to become the ultimate champion: choose from different combat styles, control his routine, and watch him kick some butt like a proud sensei!','2023/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1161590/Punch_Club_2_Fast_Forward/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3054,'tails_of_iron_2:_whiskers_of_winter',NULL,'Embark upon a vast, snow-ravaged kingdom in Tails of Iron 2, sequel to the critically acclaimed action-RPG. As Arlo, heir to the Warden of the Wastes, adventure through harsh northern lands, home to giant beasts and ragtag bandits, in an epic quest to overcome an ancient, blood-starved evil.','2025/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2473480/Tails_of_Iron_2_Whiskers_of_Winter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3055,'click_and_conquer',NULL,'Click and Conquer is a short, relaxing incremental game. Drop bombs through the fog of war, uncover hidden enemies, collect rewards, and spend currency to boost passive income, increase bombing power, and unlock new maps.','2025/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3267900/Click_and_Conquer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3056,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_volvo_construction_equipment',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1704460/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Volvo_Construction_Equipment/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3057,'godslayer_arena',NULL,'Godslayer Arena is a roguelike fusion of autobattlers and action-rpgs. Combat is performed completely automatically. Understanding complex interactions between the spells, gems, and items you draft will be key to success. Break the game. Become overpowered.','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2870430/Godslayer_Arena/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3058,'solasta:_crown_of_the_magister_-_palace_of_ice',NULL,'This content requires the base game Solasta: Crown of the Magister on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2100431/Solasta_Crown_of_the_Magister__Palace_of_Ice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3059,'kynseed',NULL,'Embark on a lifetime of adventure in a beautiful world of creativity and intrigue. Raise a family, customise your farm, run a business, craft items, and battle some marvellously malevolent monsters.','2022/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/758870/Kynseed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3060,'house_flipper_-_hgtv_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game House Flipper on Steam in order to play.','2020/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1126050/House_Flipper__HGTV_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3061,'escape_simulator:_steampunk_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Escape Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1942100/Escape_Simulator_Steampunk_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3062,'sand_land',NULL,'SAND LAND is an action RPG where you become the main character as Beelzebub, a Fiend Prince. Lead your company of heroic misfits and explore the legendary world of SAND LAND created by Akira Toriyama.','2024/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1979440/SAND_LAND/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3063,'i\'m_on_observation_duty_7',NULL,'As an employee of a mysterious organization your job is to monitor live surveillance camera footage and spot anomalies using your sharp eyes and good memory. Can you survive the entire night shift or will you succumb into paranoia?','2024/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2462520/Im_on_Observation_Duty_7/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3064,'metal_slug:_awakening',NULL,'Metal Slug: Awakening continues the classic gameplay loved by fans, with exciting new features like World Adventure, 3-player Team-up, and Roguelike challenges. Join forces with your friends online to take on powerful bosses anytime, anywhere!','2024/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2963870/Metal_Slug_Awakening/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3065,'backyard_baseball_\'97',NULL,'Rediscover the joy of the original Backyard Baseball 1997, now updated for modern systems! Build your roster from among the iconic Backyard Kids, aim for those home runs, and various game modes. Relive the magic of this classic baseball game!','2024/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3170540/Backyard_Baseball_97/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3066,'shadow_tactics:_blades_of_the_shogun',NULL,'Shadow Tactics is a hardcore tactical stealth game set in Japan around the Edo period. A new Shogun seizes power over Japan and enforces nationwide peace. In his battle against conspiracy and rebellion, he recruits five specialists with extraordinary skills for assassination, sabotage and espionage.','2016/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/418240/Shadow_Tactics_Blades_of_the_Shogun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3067,'goat_simulator',NULL,'Goat Simulator is the latest in high-tech Goat Simulation technology.','2014/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/265930/Goat_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3068,'hollow_knight_-_official_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Hollow Knight, but does not include the base game.','2017/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/598190/Hollow_Knight__Official_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3069,'city_of_gangsters',NULL,'In this management tycoon game, you’ll start a criminal operation from nothing and grow it into a well-oiled money machine! Build speakeasies and illegal distilleries. Manage production chains and resource distribution. Leverage favors, chase down debtors, and bribe the police to look the other way.','2021/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1386780/City_of_Gangsters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3070,'doom:_the_dark_ages_-_premium_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game DOOM: The Dark Ages on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3698350/DOOM_The_Dark_Ages__Premium_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3071,'sid_meier\'s_civilization_iv:_colonization',NULL,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization IV: Colonization is the third offering in the award winning Civilization IV series. A re-imagining of the classic Colonization game Sid Meier created in 1994, Sid Meier\'s Civilization IV: Colonization is a total conversion of the Civilization IV engine into a game experience in which players will lead a European...','2008/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/16810/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_IV_Colonization/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3072,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_drukhari',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2668040/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Drukhari/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_64'),(3073,'sins_of_a_solar_empire®:_rebellion',NULL,'Command a space-faring empire in Sins of a Solar Empire: Rebellion, the new stand-alone expansion that combines 4X depth with real-time strategy gameplay.','2012/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/204880/Sins_of_a_Solar_Empire_Rebellion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3074,'police_stories',NULL,'A fresh take on top-down shooters with an emphasis on tactics that forces you to make split second decisions. Neutralize criminals, rescue civilians and defuse bombs in Single Player mode or Co-op. And remember - shooting first is not an option!','2019/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/539470/Police_Stories/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3075,'children_of_the_sun',NULL,'On a deadly road trip into darkness, control the path of a single bullet and unleash a fury of vengeance on the sinister cult that ruined your life in this tactical puzzle-shooter.','2024/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1309950/Children_of_the_Sun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3076,'arma_3_creator_dlc:_western_sahara',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1681170/Arma_3_Creator_DLC_Western_Sahara/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3077,'the_settlers:_new_allies',NULL,'The Settlers®: New Allies is a strategy game with an in-depth build-up experience and real-time strategic battles.','2024/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2750080/The_Settlers_New_Allies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3078,'let\'s_school',NULL,'Dive into the exhilarating role of a headmaster entrusted to revive your alma mater! Beyond just bricks and mortar, train teachers, recruit students. Sculpt your school into a unique educational haven! Let\'s School!','2023/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1937500/Lets_School/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3079,'spellforce:_conquest_of_eo_-_children_of_nor',NULL,'This content requires the base game SpellForce: Conquest of Eo on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3540990/SpellForce_Conquest_of_Eo__Children_of_Nor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3080,'dungeons_of_blood_and_dream',NULL,'Play as a mighty Blood Wizard on a quest to escape a death-loop of psychedelic dungeons. Slay disgusting creatures using a large array of bladed weapons and unnerving spells, harness the power of cursed rings, find mysterious treasures, and learn the secrets of the universe you are trapped in.','2024/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2488590/Dungeons_of_Blood_and_Dream/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3081,'除邪(chuxie)',NULL,'除邪(CHUXIE) is a surreal first person horror shooting game developed using Unreal Engine 5. With the powerful capabilities of Unreal Engine 5, players will experience stunning realistic visual effects, smooth game controls, and intense battles with terrifying monsters.','2024/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2969160/CHUXIE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3082,'cities:_skylines_-_airports',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2022/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1726380/Cities_Skylines__Airports/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3083,'the_last_stand:_aftermath',NULL,'From the creators of The Last Stand: Union City and Dead Zone comes an all-new singleplayer rogue-lite action adventure. After you become infected by the zombie virus, you set out to explore the post-apocalypse and find hope for your fellow survivors. You can still make a difference. Don\'t give up.','2021/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1266840/The_Last_Stand_Aftermath/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3084,'peggle™_nights',NULL,'Join the Peggle Masters on a dreamtime adventure of alter egos and peg-tastic action. Stay up late to aim, shoot and clear orange pegs, and bask in Extreme Fever glory under the silver moon.','2008/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3540/Peggle_Nights/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3085,'garden_of_witches',NULL,'Garden of Witches is a cute roguelike action game full of danger. Help the protagonist, Sil, as she tries to round up her unruly fellow witches and save the Garden.','2025/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2530470/Garden_of_Witches/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3086,'monster_hunter_wilds_-_pendant:_trot-along_crake',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Hunter Wilds on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3619130/Monster_Hunter_Wilds__Pendant_Trotalong_Crake/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3087,'our_adventurer_guild',NULL,'Become the new Guild Master of the Adventurer Guild and lead your adventurers in explorations and turnbased tactical battles. Will the Guild thrive under your leadership? Or will it finally disband under it?','2024/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2026000/Our_Adventurer_Guild/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3088,'knowledge,_or_know_lady',NULL,'You, the \"sole male student\" at a women\'s university, are about to embark on a sweet and laughter-filled campus love journey from a first-person perspective! How will you resist the temptations of the beauties and create your own legend in this girls\' school?','2024/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2786680/Knowledge_or_know_Lady/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3089,'portal_knights',NULL,'The world of Elysia needs YOU! Join this cooperative, 3D sandbox action RPG to level up your character, craft epic weapons, conquer enemies in real-time, and build almost anything! Craft your adventure. Forge your hero. Become the ultimate Portal Knight!','2017/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/374040/Portal_Knights/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3090,'ultra_street_fighter®_iv',NULL,'The world’s greatest fighting game evolves to a whole new level with Ultra Street Fighter IV.','2014/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/45760/Ultra_Street_Fighter_IV/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3091,'dredge_-_blackstone_key',NULL,'This content requires the base game DREDGE on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2104240/DREDGE__Blackstone_Key/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3092,'prison_architect_-_gangs',NULL,'This content requires the base game Prison Architect on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1948120/Prison_Architect__Gangs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3093,'ai:_the_somnium_files',NULL,'Play as detective Kaname Date on the case of an elusive serial killer in this thrilling, sci-fi murder mystery.','2019/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/948740/AI_The_Somnium_Files/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3094,'train_sim_world®_5:_southeastern_highspeed:_london_st_pancras_–_ashford_intl_&_faversham_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970070/Train_Sim_World_5_Southeastern_Highspeed_London_St_Pancras__Ashford_Intl__Faversham_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3095,'shadows_over_loathing',NULL,'Shadows over Loathing — a slapstick-figure comedy adventure-RPG full of mobsters, monsters, and mysteries.','2022/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.co