sims_3:_seasons',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2012/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/223594/The_Sims_3_Seasons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3103,'the_cabin_factory',NULL,'Your job at the Cabin Factory is simple: inspect the cabins and decide on whether they’re haunted or not. If you do find any anomalies, get out…immediately.','2024/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3311740/The_Cabin_Factory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3104,'shenzhen_i/o',NULL,'BUILD CIRCUITS. WRITE CODE. RTFM.','2016/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/504210/SHENZHEN_IO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3105,'capcom_arcade_2nd_stadium',NULL,'Play more of your favorite arcade hits from yesteryear. Includes SONSON for free!','2022/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1755910/Capcom_Arcade_2nd_Stadium/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3106,'danganronpa_another_episode:_ultra_despair_girls',NULL,'Komaru Naegi has been imprisoned inside a mysterious apartment for over a year. Her rescue is derailed when hundreds of Monokumas suddenly attack. She teams up with Toko Fukawa to survive the rampaging Monokumas, escape the crafty Monokuma Kids, and uncover the secrets of the city.','2017/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/555950/Danganronpa_Another_Episode_Ultra_Despair_Girls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3107,'rust_-_instruments_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rust on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1174370/Rust__Instruments_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3108,'the_sims™_4_home_chef_hustle_stuff_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2304400/The_Sims_4_Home_Chef_Hustle_Stuff_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3109,'beltmatic',NULL,'Beltmatic is a casual factory game where you combine numbers using mathematical operations.','2024/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2674590/Beltmatic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3110,'baten_kaitos_i_&_ii_hd_remaster',NULL,'Baten Kaitos: Eternal Wings and the Lost Ocean and Baten Kaitos Origins are now on Steam with improved graphics and new features to aid game progression, making them even easier to play!','2024/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2146170/Baten_Kaitos_I__II_HD_Remaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3111,'cozy_keep:_farm,_craft,_manage',NULL,'Experience the daily life of a shopkeeper! Clean and decorate the place, pay taxes, gather resources and craft products that can be sold for maximum profits! Explore the world, hunt, and cultivate the land! Own the best shop in the region and save your father from the wrath of the King!','2024/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2261350/Cozy_Keep_Farm_Craft_Manage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3112,'faceminer',NULL,'Build a biometric data harvesting empire from scratch in FACEMINER, the hardcore thriller clicker set in 1999. Classify data, upgrade mining infrastructure, and scale up your A.I. surveillance empire to obscene ends in this creepy narrative-driven incremental management sim with a dystopian twist.','2025/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2276980/FACEMINER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3113,'fishing_sim_world®:_pro_tour',NULL,'Fishing Sim World: Pro Tour features an authentic career mode where you work your way up to an elite angler competing against over 100 of the best anglers in the world across Bass, Carp and Predator fishing whilst unlocking sponsorship opportunities, gaining career earnings and social media followers as you go.','2018/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/834280/Fishing_Sim_World_Pro_Tour/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_65'),(3114,'cult_of_the_lamb:_cultist_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cult of the Lamb on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2015880/C