player_tower_defense',NULL,'An infinitely replayable multiplayer and single-player tower defense. Defend against waves of enemies and destroy the enemy\'s king before they destroy yours. Legion TD 2 is a one-of-a-kind game of tactics, teamwork, and prediction. Party as 1-8 players.','2021/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/469600/Legion_TD_2__Multiplayer_Tower_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3122,'lethal_league_blaze',NULL,'Banging beats and mad style, Lethal League Blaze is the most intense ball game you can play online with up to 4 players.','2018/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/553310/Lethal_League_Blaze/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3123,'sid_meier\'s_civilization®_vi:_khmer_and_indonesia_civilization_&_scenario_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier’s Civilization® VI on Steam in order to play.','2017/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/645401/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_VI_Khmer_and_Indonesia_Civilization__Scenario_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3124,'dawn_of_defiance',NULL,'You are the Defier, a Spartan beginning your afterlife on the Crossroads. In this Greek myth-inspired survival craft, ascend from weak soldier to god-like anti-hero. Build impressive Greek structures, craft legendary gear, and break the seals of the Underworld with up to 3 friends.','2024/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2059530/Dawn_of_Defiance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3125,'wrc_9_fia_world_rally_championship',NULL,'WRC is the leading off-road simulation franchise. It returns with even more realistic gameplay and more content than ever: 3 new rallies, 35 new special stages, creation of your own custom championships and completely redesigned engine sounds.','2021/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1267540/WRC_9_FIA_World_Rally_Championship/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3126,'workers_&_resources:_soviet_republic_-_biomes',NULL,'This content requires the base game Workers & Resources: Soviet Republic on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2499360/Workers__Resources_Soviet_Republic__Biomes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3127,'thief',NULL,'Garrett, the Master Thief, steps out of the shadows into the City. In this treacherous place, where the Baron’s Watch spreads a rising tide of fear and oppression, his skills are the only things he can trust. Even the most cautious citizens and their best-guarded possessions are not safe from his reach.','2014/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/239160/Thief/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3128,'cabin_crew_life_simulator',NULL,'Have you ever wondered what flight attendants do on each flight? Let\'s find out with Cabin Crew Life Simulator, the pioneering flight attendant simulator with variety of aircraft, airports, passenger services, handling emergency situations, in-flight business, teamwork and much more.','2025/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2959610/Cabin_Crew_Life_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3129,'inside_the_backrooms',NULL,'Inside the Backrooms is a horror multiplayer game mixed with different mechanics that will make you spend an intense night with friends. Explore, think, interact, but be careful, it is rumored that there are several entities wishing to find you...','2022/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1987080/Inside_the_Backrooms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3130,'space_engineers_2_pioneer_edition',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3365540/Space_Engineers_2_Pioneer_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3131,'nova_drift',NULL,'Nova Drift distills the mechanical depth and strategy of an ARPG into classic arcade space combat. Control an endlessly evolving bio-mechanical ship, face legions of strange and deadly foes, and ride the wake of a dying star across the void.','2024/8/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/858210/Nova_Drift/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3132,'not_monday_cafe',NULL,'Cozy idle cafe management that keeps you company while you work. Grow fresh ingredients, cook, and serve delicious food to adorable animal customers. Build your dream cafe that sits at the bottom of your screen.','2025/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3167540/Not_Monday_Cafe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3133,'arma:_cold_war_assault',NULL,'Bohemia Interactive\'s debut game published by Codemasters as Operation Flashpoint in 2001, became genre-defining combat military simulation and the No. 1 bestselling PC game around the world and has won many international awards, including “Game of The Year” and “Best Action Game”. Over 2 million copies have been sold since its release.','2011/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/65790/ARMA_Cold_War_Assault/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3134,'stumble_guys',NULL,'Ready for the chaos? Stumble Guys is a 32-player, fast-paced multiplayer party royale where players dash, jump, and fall across hilarious obstacle courses in a fun race to be the last one standing.','2021/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1677740/Stumble_Guys/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3135,'metal_bringer',NULL,'In this roguelike action-adventure, control humanoid \"Labor\" and giant \"Arms\" to uncover the mysteries of the world. Create fully-customizable robots, strengthen them, and take down hordes of enemies!','2025/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2334170/Metal_Bringer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3136,'sandwich_simulator',NULL,'Ready to create your own world of flavor? Play solo or co-op with up to 6 players, prepare sandwiches with your friends, deliver online orders to the courier and run your sandwich restaurant. Clean, expand, and keep your customers happy!','2025/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3445340/Sandwich_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3137,'firefighting_simulator_-_the_squad',NULL,'Firefighting Simulator lets you experience what it means to fight fires up close as an active part of a major US city\'s firefighting crew - together with up to 3 friends in the co-op multiplayer- or in the single player mode.','2020/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/420560/Firefighting_Simulator__The_Squad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3138,'sanabi',NULL,'SANABI is an exhilarating stylish dystopian action-platformer. Play as a legendary retired veteran and use your signature prosthetic arm to jump over cliffs and skyscrapers, zip through bullets and traps and defeat powerful enemies.','2023/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1562700/SANABI/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3139,'freedom_wars_remastered',NULL,'Born into a one-million-year prison sentence, you must survive deadly missions to earn any hope of freedom. Die in prison or live on the battlefield. The choice is yours.','2025/1/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3004100/FREEDOM_WARS_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3140,'warhammer_40,000:_shootas,_blood_&_teef',NULL,'From the developers of the Guns, Gore and Cannoli franchise comes a new 2D run & gun platformer: Warhammer 40,000: Shootas, Blood & TEEF! Spearhead an Ork invasion, destroy the hive city and kill your warboss! ‘Ere we go!','2022/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1324530/Warhammer_40000_Shootas_Blood__Teef/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3141,'new_tales_from_the_borderlands',NULL,'Decide the fates of altruistic scientist Anu, her ambitious, \"streetwise\" brother Octavio, and the fierce, frogurt-slinging Fran. Claw and con your way through five thrilling chapters!','2022/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1454970/New_Tales_from_the_Borderlands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3142,'dustland_delivery',NULL,'Dustland Delivery is a post-apocalyptic survival business simulator. Scour the wastes for profit, complete missions to grow your trading empire, and assemble a rag-tag band of adventurers to turn your city into the capital of the Dustlands. Danger lurks around every corner—but no risk, no reward!','2024/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2943280/Dustland_Delivery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3143,'disgaea_7:_vows_of_the_virtueless',NULL,'Disgaea is back and better than ever in Disgaea 7: Vows of the Virtueless! Join Fuji as he embarks on a perilous journey of redemption, and experience unique features new to the Disgaea series!','2023/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2250600/Disgaea_7_Vows_of_the_Virtueless/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3144,'vertigo_2',NULL,'Vertigo 2 is a single-player VR adventure. Explore the depths of the vast Quantum Reactor as you descend to finish your journey home.','2023/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/843390/Vertigo_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3145,'anno_1404_-_history_edition',NULL,'Relive the captivating gameplay of a true city-building classic with Anno® 1404 History Edition.','2020/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1281630/Anno_1404__History_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3146,'super_mega_baseball™_4',NULL,'Super Mega Baseball™ 4 is where the Legends play. The signature combo of arcade-inspired style and immersive gameplay returns with over 200 baseball Legends and a grand slam of presentation upgrades.','2023/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1487210/Super_Mega_Baseball_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3147,'the_song_of_saya',NULL,'Bear witness to a love that will change the world, in this classic horror romance visual novel from acclaimed writer Urobuchi Gen.','2019/8/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/702050/The_Song_of_Saya/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3148,'empire_of_the_ants',NULL,'Conquer enemy nests and lead your colony through the perils of the forest in this groundbreaking RTS. Empire of the Ants is a photorealistic, third-person real-time strategy game where you command your insect legions in epic battles.','2024/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2287330/Empire_of_the_Ants/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3149,'hordes_of_hunger',NULL,'Vanquish an onslaught of monsters in this 3D action survivorslike from the creators of Blood West. Take control of Mirah to defend your homeland from a living hunger, wield powerful weapons and abilities, and save others from the advancing hordes.','2025/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2157710/Hordes_of_Hunger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3150,'star_wars™_republic_commando™',NULL,'You are the leader of an elite squad of Republic Commandos, your mission is to infiltrate, dominate, and ultimately, annihilate the enemy. Your squad will follow your orders and your lead, working together as a team - instinctively, intelligently, instantly. You are their leader. They are your weapon.','2005/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6000/STAR_WARS_Republic_Commando/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3151,'crypt_of_the_necrodancer:_amplified',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crypt of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2017/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/554000/Crypt_of_the_NecroDancer_AMPLIFIED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3152,'nolimits_2_roller_coaster_simulation',NULL,'NoLimits 2 is the ultimate roller coaster simulation that lets you experience authentic roller coaster thrills. Climb into the world\'s most famous roller coasters and experience the excitement in real time. Or design a new roller coaster that is engineered to your specifications.','2014/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/301320/NoLimits_2_Roller_Coaster_Simulation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3153,'warhammer_40,000:_battlesector_-_t\'au',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2583910/Warhammer_40000_Battlesector__Tau/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3154,'don\'t_starve:_hamlet',NULL,'This content requires the base game Don\'t Starve on Steam in order to play.','2018/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/712640/Dont_Starve_Hamlet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3155,'hitman_3_access_pass:_hitman_2_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game HITMAN World of Assassination on Steam in order to play.','2022/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1829590/HITMAN_3_Access_Pass_HITMAN_2_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3156,'necrophosis',NULL,'Necrophosis is a first-person horror adventure, plunging you into a nightmarish realm teeming with grotesque forms and ominous visuals. Delve into eerie landscapes and uncover secrets in this atmospheric journey through the macabre.','2025/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2019760/Necrophosis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3157,'reentry_-_a_space_flight_simulator',NULL,'Do you have what it takes to be an astronaut? Reentry is a realistic space flight simulator based on NASAs space programs; from the first American human spaceflight in Project Mercury, the rendezvous and EVAs of Project Gemini to the Moon landing in Project Apollo.','2018/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/882140/Reentry__A_Space_Flight_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3158,'amid_evil',NULL,'A retro FPS for the ages! Once branded a HERETIC. Now YOU have been chosen as our champion! Reclaim our sacred weapons. Take back our ancient lands. If you can stand... AMID EVIL.','2019/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/673130/AMID_EVIL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3159,'train_sim_world®_5:_avanti_west_coast_br_class_390_pendolino_emu_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970820/Train_Sim_World_5_Avanti_West_Coast_BR_Class_390_Pendolino_EMU_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3160,'no_more_heroes',NULL,'Fight your way to the top in this HD remaster of everyone\'s favorite assassin action game! As all-American otaku Travis Touchdown, use your trusty beam katana to hack-and-slash though the competition and claim the title of world\'s #1 assassin!','2021/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1420290/No_More_Heroes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3161,'shotgun_cop_man',NULL,'GO TO HELL, ARREST SATAN. Propel yourself to justice and glory on a journey through hell in this punchy, crunchy, son-of-a-gun precision platformer from the creator of My Friend Pedro.','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2966850/Shotgun_Cop_Man/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3162,'deus_ex:_human_revolution_-_director\'s_cut',NULL,'You play Adam Jensen, an ex-SWAT specialist who\'s been handpicked to oversee the defensive needs of one of America\'s most experimental biotechnology firms. Your job is to safeguard company secrets, but when a black ops team breaks in and kills the very scientists you were hired to protect, everything you thought you knew about your job...','2013/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/238010/Deus_Ex_Human_Revolution__Directors_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3163,'scum_supporter_pack_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game SCUM on Steam in order to play.','2021/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1643210/SCUM_Supporter_Pack_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3164,'soulstone_survivors:_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Soulstone Survivors on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3615530/Soulstone_Survivors_Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3165,'monster_hunter_rise:_sunbreak',NULL,'This content requires the base game MONSTER HUNTER RISE on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1880360/Monster_Hunter_Rise_Sunbreak/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3166,'don\'t_starve:_reign_of_giants',NULL,'This content requires the base game Don\'t Starve on Steam in order to play.','2014/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/282470/Dont_Starve_Reign_of_Giants/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3167,'anno:_mutationem',NULL,'ANNO: Mutationem is an action-adventure game with RPG elements set in a cyberpunk world, featuring a unique mix of pixelated 2D & 3D graphic style with a rich, dark and bizarre plot.','2022/3/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1368030/ANNO_Mutationem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3168,'9-bit_armies:_a_bit_too_far',NULL,'Unleash voxel warfare in 9-Bit Armies: A Bit Too Far. Lead a modern military, build bases, unlock units, and attack in all-out war. Engage on land, sea and air in over two dozen missions, online skirmishes, or co-op. Easy to learn, a challenge to master.','2024/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1439750/9Bit_Armies_A_Bit_Too_Far/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_66'),(3169,'warhammer_40,000:_battlesector_-_orks',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2305830/Warhammer_40000_Battlesector__Orks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3170,'the_last_plague:_blight',NULL,'The Last Plague: Blight is an authentic survival experience rooted in realism and immersion. Endure the hazards of a brutal open world and uncover the origins of a mysterious disease. You are humanity’s final hope in ending the Blight','2024/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1564600/The_Last_Plague_Blight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3171,'fly_corp',NULL,'Develop your own transport network in different regions and cities: open new routes, buy and upgrade new planes, and increase airport capacity!','2023/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1372530/Fly_Corp/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3172,'coffee_caravan',NULL,'Fuel your coffee passion in Coffee Caravan! As a cafe manager, brew, experiment with delicious recipes, and build your dream coffee business on wheels. Serve customers, unlock new flavors, purchase appliances, and enjoy your procedurally generated road trip in this roguelite experience.','2024/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2649080/Coffee_Caravan/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3173,'garden_life:_a_cozy_simulator',NULL,'Garden Life is a relaxing gardening game in which you create your dream garden in a peaceful, colourful world. Plant and add ornaments at your own pace, transforming an overgrown forgotten plot into a flourishing community garden.','2024/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1915380/Garden_Life_A_Cozy_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3174,'breathedge',NULL,'Survive in outer space! Together with your immortal chicken, discover the truth behind your sudden spaceship crash. Craft tools, pilot vehicles, and even control space stations to survive and explore the wreckage.','2021/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/738520/Breathedge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3175,'junkyard_simulator',NULL,'Did you ever wish to work in a junkyard? Now you can, with Junkyard Simulator. They are many roads leading to success - whichever you take depends on your decisions.','2021/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/671970/Junkyard_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3176,'my_garage',NULL,'MY GARAGE is a car simulation game with main focus being simulating real car repair, maintenance and physics.','2021/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1578390/My_Garage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3177,'circuit_superstars',NULL,'Circuit Superstars is a top down racing game with a tactile arcade physics model, pitstops, and a pure motorsport approach. It includes 16 categories that span different styles and eras of motorsport.','2023/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1097130/Circuit_Superstars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3178,'project_warlock_ii',NULL,'Adrenaline-pumping gore retro funhouse that’s full of guns, magic, demons, vertical arenas, 3D visuals, 2D sprites, and heavy metal music. Inspired by FPS classics like Quake and Doom 64, Project Warlock II is the explosive boomer shooter sequel you were too shy to ask for.','2025/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1640300/Project_Warlock_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3179,'immortal_life',NULL,'Embark on a magical journey in this captivating life simulation game. Escape to a welcoming valley, farm with spells, and master skills like fishing, crafting, and cooking. Engage in epic battles, strengthen the bonds with your companions, and build your dream home to achieve Immortal Life!','2024/1/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1201230/Immortal_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3180,'forza_horizon_5_apex_allstars_car_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Forza Horizon 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2894270/Forza_Horizon_5_Apex_Allstars_Car_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3181,'biped',NULL,'Biped is a coop action adventure game with a strong focus on moment-to-moment collaboration between 2 players.','2020/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1071870/Biped/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3182,'thimbleweed_park™',NULL,'In Thimbleweed Park, a dead body is the least of your problems. Switch between five playable characters to uncover the surreal secrets of this strange town in a modern mystery adventure game from the creators of Monkey Island and Maniac Mansion. The deeper you go, the weirder it gets.','2017/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/569860/Thimbleweed_Park/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3183,'little_inferno',NULL,'Throw your toys into your fire, and play with them as they burn. An adventure that takes place almost entirely in front of a fireplace - about looking up up up out of the chimney, and the cold world just on the other side of the wall. From the creators of World of Goo and Human Resource Machine.','2012/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/221260/Little_Inferno/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3184,'hitman:_blood_money',NULL,'Money Talks. Silence Pays. Prepare to Make a Killing. When assassins from Agent 47\'s contract agency, The ICA, are eliminated in a series of hits, it seems a larger, more powerful agency has entered the fray. Sensing he may be a target, 47 travels to America, and prepares to make a killing.','2006/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6860/Hitman_Blood_Money/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3185,'falcon_4.0',NULL,'Falcon 4.0 breaks the sight-and-sound barrier with its cutting-edge graphics, realism, dynamic campaigns and multiplayer gameplay.','1998/1/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/429530/Falcon_40/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3186,'fisher_online',NULL,'Fisher Online - online wild fishing simulator. Forget about licenses and catch rates. Choose bait or lures and catch fish in Europe and Russia.','2019/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1094780/Fisher_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3187,'the_great_war:_western_front™',NULL,'The Great War: Western Front is the definitive WW1 strategy game. Play a deciding role in history with this real-time tactical experience as you take charge in the iconic Western Front from 1914 to 1919. Pick your faction and lead your forces to victory.','2023/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2109370/The_Great_War_Western_Front/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3188,'manifold_garden',NULL,'Rediscover gravity and explore an Escher-esque world of impossible architecture. Witness infinity in first-person and master its rules to solve physics-defying puzzles. Cultivate a garden to open new paths forward, where an eternal expanse awaits.','2020/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/473950/Manifold_Garden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3189,'trailmakers:_airborne_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Trailmakers on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2285970/Trailmakers_Airborne_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3190,'the_king_of_fighters_xv',NULL,'SHATTER ALL EXPECTATIONS! Transcend beyond your limits with KOF XV!','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1498570/THE_KING_OF_FIGHTERS_XV/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3191,'the_sims™_4_crystal_creations_stuff_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2727400/The_Sims_4_Crystal_Creations_Stuff_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3192,'scott_pilgrim_vs._the_world™:_the_game_–_complete_edition',NULL,'Rediscover the beloved 2D arcade-style beat \'em up inspired by the iconic comic and movie Scott Pilgrim vs. The World!','2023/1/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2215260/Scott_Pilgrim_vs_The_World_The_Game__Complete_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3193,'the_dungeon_of_naheulbeuk:_the_amulet_of_chaos',NULL,'Step into the wacky heroic fantasy universe of the Dungeon of Naheulbeuk. Lead a team of unlikely and clumsy heroes in an epic and challenging tactical RPG. Live an adventure filled with humor, surprises and silly encounters.','2020/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/970830/The_Dungeon_Of_Naheulbeuk_The_Amulet_Of_Chaos/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3194,'void_stranger',NULL,'Place your faith and embrace the Void.','2023/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2121980/Void_Stranger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3195,'simrail_-_the_railway_simulator:_łódź_-_warsaw',NULL,'This content requires the base game SimRail - The Railway Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3583200/SimRail__The_Railway_Simulator_d__Warsaw/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3196,'final_outpost:_definitive_edition',NULL,'Final Outpost is a survival strategy base-builder. You lead the last survivors of the apocalypse. Assign roles, craft tools, and manage resources carefully. Construct buildings, level up your citizens, and fortify your town against hordes of zombies. How many days can you survive?','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3066310/Final_Outpost_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3197,'serious_sam_4',NULL,'Serious Sam 4 reignites the classic FPS series in a high-powered prequel loaded with an explosive arsenal, intergalactic carnage, and perfectly timed one-liners.','2020/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/257420/Serious_Sam_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3198,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_modern_rifle_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2022/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1843410/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Modern_Rifle_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3199,'rise_of_nations:_extended_edition',NULL,'Rise of Nations is back! Play the updated classic with full Steamworks integration and enhanced features!','2014/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/287450/Rise_of_Nations_Extended_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3200,'the_sims™_4_sweet_allure_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3415990/The_Sims_4_Sweet_Allure_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3201,'split/second',NULL,'Split/Second is an intense action racing game set within a reality TV show. Competitors vie to be the first to the finish line in a set rigged to blow. Players don’t just collide with other vehicles to knock them from the track, but can also trigger devastating events that alter the race dynamics.','2010/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/297860/SplitSecond/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3202,'warhammer_40,000:_space_marine_2_-_raven_guard_cosmetic_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3274400/Warhammer_40000_Space_Marine_2__Raven_Guard_Cosmetic_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3203,'planet_zoo:_arctic_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1196770/Planet_Zoo_Arctic_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3204,'need_for_speed™_rivals',NULL,'Erase the line between single player and multiplayer in this street-racing rivalry between Cops and Racers. Seamlessly join a world where your friends are already racing and chasing.','2013/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1262600/Need_for_Speed_Rivals/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3205,'fears_to_fathom_-_norwood_hitchhike',NULL,'Holly Gardner, a 19 year old on an interstate drive experiences unusual happenings that leads to an unplanned stay at a motel, little did she know what was transpiring down in Norwood Valley.','2022/1/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1763050/Fears_to_Fathom__Norwood_Hitchhike/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3206,'tricky_towers',NULL,'With your brilliant robe and magic powers, it’s time to build some Tricky Towers! Stack your bricks in this land of fable, whose marvelous tower will be the most stable? Battle your friends and rise to fame, in this frantic physics game.','2016/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/437920/Tricky_Towers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3207,'trine_4:_the_nightmare_prince',NULL,'The best-selling Trine series returns to the magic of 2.5D! Join three iconic heroes as they set off on a quest through fantastical fairytale landscapes to save the world from the Nightmare Prince’s shadows.','2019/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/690640/Trine_4_The_Nightmare_Prince/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3208,'the_legend_of_heroes:_trails_of_cold_steel',NULL,'At Thors Military Academy, Erebonia’s best learn everything from the art of war to liberal arts. First year Rean Schwarzer learns he’s been selected to join the controversial Class VII, and they’ll need to deal with more than just class warfare--they’ll need to safeguard their country from chaos.','2017/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/538680/The_Legend_of_Heroes_Trails_of_Cold_Steel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3209,'astral_party_',NULL,'Astral Party is a multiplayer party game populated by cute anime girls! Choose your favorite character, strategize skills & cards, and roll the dice to destroy friendships in this unique board game.','2024/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2622000/Astral_Party/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3210,'scourge_of_war_-_remastered',NULL,'Welcome to Scourge of War, a real-time 3D computer game/simulation developed by NorbSoftDev, the company headed by renowned game designer Norb Timpko, designer of Mad Minute Games\' acclaimed Take Command series. Scourge of War is the epitome of historical command simulations.','2024/9/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2205330/Scourge_Of_War__Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3211,'moss',NULL,'Moss is an action-adventure puzzle game from Polyarc tailor-made for the VR platform. It combines classic components of a great game—compelling characters, gripping combat, and captivating world exploration—with the exciting opportunities of VR.','2018/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/846470/Moss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3212,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_t\'au',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2020/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1239450/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Tau/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3213,'ai2u:_with_you_\'til_the_end',NULL,'You wake up in a cute girl\'s home who\'s eager to keep you by her side! Engage with thematic stories, puzzles, and unique AI NPCs who\'ll go to any lengths to protect you—even when it means contradicting themselves. Bask in meet-cutes or brace for chaos if you try to escape.','2025/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2880730/AI2U_With_You_Til_The_End/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3214,'dragon_quest_builders',NULL,'The beloved block-building RPG, DRAGON QUEST BUILDERS, is bringing its handy crafting features to Steam! Weave your own tale as you build your own unique buildings and towns to restore Alefgard to it\'s former glory!','2024/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2436570/DRAGON_QUEST_BUILDERS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3215,'chicory:_a_colorful_tale',NULL,'A top-down adventure game in a coloring book world full of vibrant characters. Use painting powers to explore, solve puzzles, make friends, and draw on anything! From creators on Wandersong + Celeste.','2021/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1123450/Chicory_A_Colorful_Tale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3216,'speedrunners',NULL,'Cut-throat multiplayer running game that pits 4 players against each other, locally and/or online. Run, jump, swing around, and use devious weapons and pick-ups to knock opponents off-screen! One of the most competitive games you\'ll ever play.','2016/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/207140/SpeedRunners/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_67'),(3217,'metal_slug_tactics',NULL,'METAL SLUG makes an explosive return! Dive into this dynamic tactical RPG with a roguelite thrill and experience the iconic run\'n\'gun action of the original series, redefined. Grab your weapons, assemble your squad and conquer the battlefield to defeat the infamous Rebel Army.','2024/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1590760/Metal_Slug_Tactics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3218,'rise_of_industry_2',NULL,'Navigate the competitive industrial landscape of vibrant 1980\'s USA! Make strategic manufacturing decisions, optimize production chains, acquire technologies, and expand your global business network with key contacts. Opportunities await those savvy enough to capitalize on them!','2025/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2532490/Rise_of_Industry_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3219,'the_sims™_4_outdoor_retreat',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2015/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235741/The_Sims_4_Outdoor_Retreat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3220,'psychopomp_gold',NULL,'Psychopomp is BACK. The catacombs stretch down farther than ever before. Your entire life has been a lie. Delve into the depths, and discover the horrors that lie below. More realms, more modes, more secrets. An ancient voice calls to you from the center of the earth. Will you answer it?','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3243190/Psychopomp_GOLD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3221,'call_of_juarez:_gunslinger',NULL,'From the dust of a gold mine to the dirt of a saloon, Call of Juarez® Gunslinger is a real homage to the Wild West tales. Live the epic and violent journey of a ruthless bounty hunter on the trail of the West’s most notorious outlaws.','2013/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/204450/Call_of_Juarez_Gunslinger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3222,'surviving_mars:_green_planet',NULL,'This content requires the base game Surviving Mars on Steam in order to play.','2019/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/952890/Surviving_Mars_Green_Planet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3223,'the_infected',NULL,'The Infected is a survival crafting game set in an open world sandbox. Build your base defend and protect yourself from wildlife and infected Vambies. (Hybrid Vampire-Zombie)','2020/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1360000/The_Infected/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3224,'scum_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SCUM on Steam in order to play.','2018/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/919680/SCUM_Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3225,'kill_knight',NULL,'KILL KNIGHT is an ultra-responsive arcade-inspired isometric action shooter. Condemned to eternal sufferance, deep within the voids of an eldritch arena, you must wield an arsenal of devastating weaponry to obliterate swarms of otherworldly horrors - and MASTER THE DEMON WITHIN.','2024/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2694420/KILL_KNIGHT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3226,'unravel',NULL,'Unravel is a physics-based puzzle platformer. Yarny, a character made from a single thread of yarn, must embark on a larger than life adventure.','2016/2/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1225560/Unravel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3227,'fruitbus',NULL,'A journey of flavors and friendships awaits you in your cozy, customisable food truck! Forage for fresh ingredients to create your own menu, then feed tummies and souls with home-cooked meals. Change the world, one apple at a time.','2024/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2484130/Fruitbus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3228,'fpv_kamikaze_drone',NULL,'\"FPV Drone Kamikaze\" is a fast-paced action game where players control a combat drone from a first-person perspective. The objective is to destroy enemy equipment in war using maneuvers and explosive devices. Speed and strategy will be the keys to victory.','2023/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2707940/FPV_Kamikaze_Drone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3229,'lorn\'s_lure',NULL,'An android is led through a vast structure by a glitch in his visual system. Lorn\'s Lure is an atmospheric narrative first-person platformer with novel climb-anything mechanics and modernized retro 3D graphics.','2024/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1417930/Lorns_Lure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3230,'minds_beneath_us',NULL,'MINDS BENEATH US is an emotional sci-fi narrative game. Through the eyes of a humble individual, experience a mad world where humans are exploited as computing devices for AI. Listen to the concerns of those you meet and offer guidance. Together, face challenges and confront an uncertain destiny.','2024/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1610440/Minds_Beneath_Us/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3231,'supporter_pack_-_v16_engines',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automation - The Car Company Tycoon Game on Steam in order to play.','2017/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/350690/Supporter_Pack__V16_Engines/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3232,'the_mageseeker:_a_league_of_legends_story™',NULL,'From Digital Sun, creators of Moonlighter, The Mageseeker is an action RPG in the League of Legends universe. Play as Sylas, a mage now freed from years in captivity. Wield the chains that once bound you and liberate Demacia from the Mageseekers\' tyranny.','2023/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1457080/The_Mageseeker_A_League_of_Legends_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3233,'the_beekeeper\'s_picnic_-_a_sherlockian_adventure',NULL,'Beekeeper (and former world’s greatest detective) Sherlock Holmes is arranging a surprise picnic for his friend Watson. Unfortunately pesky mysteries keep getting in the way! Explore, find clues and interrogate your neighbours in this cosy point and click adventure!','2025/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2248890/The_Beekeepers_Picnic__A_Sherlockian_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3234,'lisa:_the_painful',NULL,'The miserable journey of a broken man...','2014/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/335670/LISA_The_Painful/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3235,'legend_of_grimrock_2',NULL,'Legend of Grimrock 2 is a dungeon crawling role playing game with a modern execution but an oldschool heart. A group of four prisoners have shipwrecked on the secluded Isle of Nex. The island is filled with ancient crumbled ruins, mysterious shrines and a vast underground network of dungeons.','2014/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/251730/Legend_of_Grimrock_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3236,'the_house_of_da_vinci_3',NULL,'The grand finale to The House of Da Vinci trilogy is here! Solve numerous new puzzles and mind benders and explore new mystifying locations of ravishing beauty.','2022/12/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1603640/The_House_of_Da_Vinci_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3237,'hyper_light_drifter',NULL,'Explore a beautiful, vast and ruined world riddled with dangers and lost technologies.','2016/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/257850/Hyper_Light_Drifter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3238,'path_of_achra',NULL,'Path of Achra is a dark fantasy roguelike of the ancient earth, with a focus on streamlined controls and rapid hero customization. A \"broken build sandbox.\" Fight through the deadly lands of Achra to reach the horrors of the Obelisk, and discover what lies beyond...','2024/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2128270/Path_of_Achra/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3239,'perfect_heist_2',NULL,'Perfect Heist 2 is a round-based online game, where robbers try to hide in plain sight while robbing a bank without being noticed by the cop team!','2021/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1521580/Perfect_Heist_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3240,'grim_dawn_-_crucible_mode_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Grim Dawn on Steam in order to play.','2016/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/483840/Grim_Dawn__Crucible_Mode_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3241,'dead_rising_4',NULL,'Dead Rising 4 marks the return of photojournalist Frank West in an all-new chapter of one of the most popular zombie game franchises of all time. With an unmatched level of weapon and character customization, ambitious new features including new zombie classes and EXO Suits, Dead Rising 4 delivers a heart-pounding experience as players...','2017/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/543460/Dead_Rising_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3242,'war_thunder_-_f-4s_phantom_ii_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game War Thunder on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2315421/War_Thunder__F4S_Phantom_