ul minions & cast cosmic spells where every run takes you one step closer to the moon.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2862890/Become_the_Moon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3249,'fishing_planet:_japan_odyssey_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2922540/Fishing_Planet_Japan_Odyssey_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3250,'schoolboy_runaway',NULL,'“You little rascal! Go study your lessons right now!” said the angry parents, grounding you. Try to outsmart them and find a way to have fun with your friends.','2024/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3359320/SchoolBoy_Runaway/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3251,'bulwark_evolution:_falconeer_chronicles',NULL,'Bulwark: Evolution mixes elements of a chill builder with grand strategy and exploration elements. It\'s a genre bending experimental game that can be both a peaceful building experience or a total conquest with airships, warbirds and fortresses. It\'s up to the player to decide.','2024/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/290100/Bulwark_Evolution_Falconeer_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3252,'galaxy_burger',NULL,'🌴👩‍🍳🍔 A stress-free cooking game that lets you relax! Cook up burgers for mecha cats and aliens. Play solo or with up to 7 friends!','2024/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2749770/Galaxy_Burger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3253,'tangle_tower',NULL,'Unravel a thrilling mystery by exploring a strange and twisted mansion, discovering curious clues, interrogating peculiar suspects and solving unique puzzles. Will you be able to uncover the secrets of Tangle Tower?','2019/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/359510/Tangle_Tower/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3254,'police_simulator:_patrol_officers:_unmarked_police_vehicle_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Police Simulator: Patrol Officers on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2893870/Police_Simulator_Patrol_Officers_Unmarked_Police_Vehicle_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3255,'little_goody_two_shoes',NULL,'Venture into the woods as you play Little Goody Two Shoes, a phantasmagorical horror narrative adventure where all your decisions matter!','2023/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1812370/Little_Goody_Two_Shoes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3256,'annihilate_the_spance',NULL,'RTS base builder with constant production and minimal micromanagement. Direct fleets of autonomous ships in huge battles. Features a singleplayer story campaign with 3 distinct playable factions and many subfactions, and full level editor. Test your abilities in the shifting tides of the Spance.','2025/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1706360/Annihilate_The_Spance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3257,'starfield_-_shattered_space',NULL,'This content requires the base game Starfield on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2721670/Starfield__Shattered_Space/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3258,'townscaper',NULL,'Instant town building toy','2021/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1291340/Townscaper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3259,'transistor',NULL,'Discover the world of Transistor, a sci-fi-themed action RPG from the creators of Bastion.','2014/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/237930/Transistor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3260,'bounty_of_one',NULL,'Fallen hero of the Wild West, you’re wanted and in disgrace! Grab your guns, survive endless hordes of bounty hunters and fight to clear your name! Bounty of One is a fast-paced casual roguelite bullet hell for 1 to 4 players. Dash, Dodge, Shoot, Repeat!','2023/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1968730/Bounty_of_One/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3261,'cruel',NULL,'A fast run and gun horror shooter with roguelike elements','2025/1/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2689470/CRUEL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_68'),(3262,'hotel_renovator',NULL,'Unleash your inner designer and renovate the hotel of your dreams! Embark on a makeover journey to turn this worn-out place into a successful getaway. Play with thousands of furniture pieces and accessories, and manage the hotel to get 5-star reviews!','2023/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1214470/Hotel_Renovator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3263,'steamworld_dig',NULL,'SteamWorld Dig is an action-adventure puzzler with strong Metroidvanian influences set in the SteamWorld Universe. You’ll need to dig deep into the earth, gather resources to upgrade your tools and abilities, take on enemies, solve challenging puzzles and uncover the secrets to save a dying town.','2013/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/252410/SteamWorld_Dig/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3264,'mortal_shell:_the_virtuous_cycle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Mortal Shell on Steam in order to play.','2021/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1672210/Mortal_Shell_The_Virtuous_Cycle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3265,'beacon_pines',NULL,'Beacon Pines is a cute and creepy adventure set within a mysterious book. Sneak out late, make new friends, uncover hidden truths, and collect words that will change the course of fate!','2022/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1269640/Beacon_Pines/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3266,'grunn',NULL,'A gardener gets hired for maintenance work over the weekend. A simple task, but strangely some tools are missing… The owner of the garden isn\'t around, and their house is off-limits. Perhaps new tools can be found in the mysterious town, or maybe some of the reserved townsfolk have seen them?','2024/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2720950/Grunn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3267,'dwarves:_glory,_death_and_loot',NULL,'Create your fully customizable army of dwarves and lead them to victory! Strategize with up to 10 individual beardlings in this combination of classic RPGs, roguelikes and auto-battlers. Forge your own path and decimate orcs, fight trolls or battle dragons - There will be Glory, Death and Loot!','2023/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2205850/Dwarves_Glory_Death_and_Loot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3268,'tcg_multiplayer_card_shop_simulator',NULL,'Multiplayer TCG Card Shop Simulator game. Dive into the world of multiplayer gaming by opening your own local game store! Stock your shelves with the latest booster packs, or crack them open to collect the cards yourself.','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3354260/TCG_Multiplayer_Card_Shop_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3269,'sudden_strike_4',NULL,'Sudden Strike is back! The beloved Real Time Strategy series returns, this time with bigger battlefields, more units, better graphics, new scenarios and legendary commanders – making Sudden Strike 4 more tactical and realistic than ever before!','2017/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/373930/Sudden_Strike_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3270,'the_legend_of_heroes:_trails_of_cold_steel_iii',NULL,'Experience an epic story developed across three titles, and crafted for new and old fans alike. Also includes an interactive introduction to catch up new players to the ongoing story so anyone can dive right in to the world of Trails of Cold Steel.','2020/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/991270/The_Legend_of_Heroes_Trails_of_Cold_Steel_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3271,'100%_orange_juice',NULL,'100% Orange Juice is a digital multiplayer board game populated by developer Orange Juice\'s all-star cast. Characters from Flying Red Barrel, QP Shooting, Suguri and Sora come together with all-new characters to duke it out... with dice.','2013/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/282800/100_Orange_Juice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3272,'burden_of_command™',NULL,'Can you lead? Burden of Command is an emotionally authentic tactical leadership RPG. You’re a company Captain in the historical Cottonbalers. Fighting psychology as much as bullets, you must build respect, trust, and battlefield experience to bring your brothers safely home.','2025/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/887490/Burden_of_Command/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3273,'the_last_faith',NULL,'A dark, gothic fusion of metroidvania and soulslike. The Last Faith thrives on merciless and precise combat with a huge range of weapons, firearms, and custom executions at your disposal. Let nothing stand in your way.','2023/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1274600/The_Last_Faith/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3274,'rule_the_waves_3',NULL,'Rule the Waves III is a simulation of naval ship design and construction, fleet management and naval warfare from 1890 to 1970.','2023/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2008100/Rule_the_Waves_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3275,'half-life:_opposing_force',NULL,'Return to the Black Mesa Research Facility as one of the military specialists assigned to eliminate Gordon Freeman. Experience an entirely new episode of single player action. Meet fierce alien opponents, and experiment with new weaponry. Named \'Game of the Year\' by the Academy of Interactive Arts and Sciences.','1999/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/50/HalfLife_Opposing_Force/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3276,'cities:_skylines_-_after_dark',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2015/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/369150/Cities_Skylines__After_Dark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3277,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_bloodhound',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2021/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1546670/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Bloodhound/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3278,'hotel_owner_simulator',NULL,'Hotel Owner Simulator is a hotel management game where you start from a small hotel and grow your business by creating beautifully designed rooms, adjusting room sizes and layouts by placing each individual wall, negotiating high prices, and expanding your empire. Lets build, and manage the resort.','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3158480/Hotel_Owner_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3279,'guilty_gear_xrd_rev_2',NULL,'Astonishing 3D cell animations and overwhelming content volume, the next-generation fighting game \"GUILTY GEAR Xrd REV 2\" is now out on Steam! Total cast of 25 unique characters, and tons of game modes, get ready to ROCK!','2016/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/520440/GUILTY_GEAR_Xrd_REV_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3280,'battle_brothers_-_warriors_of_the_north',NULL,'This content requires the base game Battle Brothers on Steam in order to play.','2019/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1067690/Battle_Brothers__Warriors_of_the_North/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3281,'wizard_of_legend',NULL,'Wizard of Legend is a no-nonsense, action-packed take on wizardry that emphasizes precise movements and smart comboing of spells in a rogue-like dungeon crawler that features over a hundred unique spells and relics!','2018/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/445980/Wizard_of_Legend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3282,'moss:_book_ii',NULL,'Quill is back—and she’s being hunted. To stand a chance, Quill will need a true partner by her side—and we hope that partner is you. Moss: Book II is an action-adventure puzzle game and award-winning sequel (The Game Awards \"Best VR/AR Game\") to Moss.','2022/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2059670/Moss_Book_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3283,'age_of_empires_iii:_definitive_edition_-_knights_of_the_mediterranean',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires III: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/26','Released'