21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/944071/Cities_Skylines__Campus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3290,'amanda_the_adventurer_2',NULL,'In Amanda the Adventurer 2, the story continues as Riley encounters a mysterious masked figure after destroying the TV in the attic. Travel to the Kensdale Public Library and dig deeper into the mystery of Amanda the Adventurer.','2024/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2826800/Amanda_the_Adventurer_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3291,'ion_fury',NULL,'3D Realms, creators of Duke Nukem 3D, Prey, and Max Payne, are excited to team up with Voidpoint to bring back the legendary Build Engine, famously known for classic first-person shooters like Duke Nukem 3D, Shadow Warrior, and Blood. Ion Fury is the real deal!','2019/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/562860/Ion_Fury/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3292,'the_binding_of_isaac',NULL,'Now 20% More Evil with the Free Halloween update!','2011/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/113200/The_Binding_of_Isaac/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3293,'tom_clancy\'s_splinter_cell_chaos_theory®',NULL,'The year is 2008. Citywide blackouts ... stock exchange sabotage ... electronic hijacking of national defense systems ... this is information warfare. To prevent these attacks, operatives must infiltrate deep into hostile territory and aggressively collect critical intelligence, closer than ever to enemy soldiers.','2005/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/13570/Tom_Clancys_Splinter_Cell_Chaos_Theory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3294,'tennis_elbow_4',NULL,'Created by and for tennis fans, Tennis Elbow 4 is the sequel of TE2013, and offers a tennis simulation with an easy and intuitive learning curve, but with exceptional gameplay depth.','2021/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/760640/Tennis_Elbow_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3295,'le_mans_ultimate_-_2024_pack_1',NULL,'This content requires the base game Le Mans Ultimate on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2973290/Le_Mans_Ultimate__2024_Pack_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3296,'planet_zoo:_south_america_pack ',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2020/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238440/Planet_Zoo_South_America_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3297,'fatal_frame_/_project_zero:_mask_of_the_lunar_eclipse',NULL,'Japanese survival horror game \"FATAL FRAME / PROJECT ZERO: Mask of the Lunar Eclipse\" is back with better graphics.','2023/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2130460/FATAL_FRAME__PROJECT_ZERO_Mask_of_the_Lunar_Eclipse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3298,'lil\'_guardsman',NULL,'Imagine you\'re a 12 year old, suddenly in charge of the guard shed at the castle gate, where you decide if elves, goblins and 100+ other characters should be admitted. It\'s a wonderful combination of deduction, narrative and puzzle games.','2024/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1924360/Lil_Guardsman/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3299,'underground_blossom',NULL,'Underground Blossom is a new adventure game by Rusty Lake. Fulfil various tasks at every station to find the metro that will take you through each important event from Laura Vanderboom\'s life.','2023/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2291850/Underground_Blossom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3300,'project_wingman:_frontline-59_campaign',NULL,'This content requires the base game Project Wingman on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2536180/Project_Wingman_Frontline59_Campaign/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3301,'djmax_respect_v_-_v_liberty_ii_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3371120/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__V_LIBERTY_II_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3302,'train_sim_world®_5:_glossop_line:_manchester_-_hadf