... Bloons TD Battles 2 is a brand new installment of the top-rated head-to-head tower defense game. Gather your Hero, choose your team of powerful Monkey Towers, and prepare to battle one on one against other players and relentless waves of Bloons!','2021/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1276390/Bloons_TD_Battles_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_69'),(3309,'bloons_td_battles_2',NULL,'From the creators of Bloons TD6... Bloons TD Battles 2 is a brand new installment of the top-rated head-to-head tower defense game. Gather your Hero, choose your team of powerful Monkey Towers, and prepare to battle one on one against other players and relentless waves of Bloons!','2021/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1276390/Bloons_TD_Battles_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3310,'sniper_elite_5:_kraken_awakes_mission,_weapon_and_skin_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sniper Elite 5 on Steam in order to play.','2023/7/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2167703/Sniper_Elite_5_Kraken_Awakes_Mission_Weapon_and_Skin_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3311,'bad_north:_jotunn_edition',NULL,'Bad North is a charming but brutal real-time tactics roguelite. Defend your idyllic island kingdom against a horde of Viking invaders, as you lead the desperate exodus of your people. Command your loyal subjects to take full tactical advantage of the unique shape of each island.','2018/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/688420/Bad_North_Jotunn_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3312,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_demolition_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2932380/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Demolition_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3313,'gigabash',NULL,'GigaBash is the ultimate Kaiju Fighting Game for 1-4 players, where you battle as film-inspired Kaijus and giant Heroes in fully destructible cityscapes.','2022/8/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1546400/GigaBash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3314,'3on3_freestyle:_rebound',NULL,'3on3 FreeStyle: Rebound allows players to work with their teammates to pull off rim-shaking slam dunks, awe-inspiring alley-oops, flashy no-look passes, and clutch outside shots which breaks the heart of the opposing team in competitive games filled with the joy and energy of street basketball.','2020/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1292630/3on3_FreeStyle_Rebound/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3315,'ngu_idle',NULL,'NGU Idle is a Free To Play Idle game that\'s full of weird humor, tons of upgrades and hundreds of hours of content! Try out NGU Idle today and experience the joy of Numbers Going Up!','2019/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1147690/NGU_IDLE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3316,'champions_online',NULL,'Grab your cape and defend Millennium City in this comic book-style action MMORPG! Design your hero and costume from thousands of costume pieces, face super-villains like Dr. Destroyer, and create your own unique nemesis.','2009/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/9880/Champions_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3317,'octodad:_dadliest_catch',NULL,'Octodad: Dadliest Catch is a game about destruction, deception, and fatherhood. The player controls Octodad, a dapper octopus masquerading as a human, as he goes about his life. Octodad\'s existence is a constant struggle, as he must master mundane tasks with his unwieldy boneless tentacles while simultaneously keeping his cephalopodan...','2014/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/224480/Octodad_Dadliest_Catch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3318,'galactic_civilizations_iv_-_warlords',NULL,'This content requires the base game Galactic Civilizations IV on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2671140/Galactic_Civilizations_IV__Warlords/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3319,'total_war:_three_kingdoms_-_mandate_of_heaven',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: THREE KINGDOMS on Steam in order to play.','2020/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1154760/Total_War_THREE_KINGDOMS__Mandate_of_Heaven/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3320,'cities:_skylines_ii_-_creator_pack:_leisure_venues',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines II on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2945630/Cities_Skylines_II__Creator_Pack_Leisure_Venues/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3321,'bō:_path_of_the_teal_lotus',NULL,'Flow gracefully through a colorful, hand-drawn 2.5D action platformer inspired by Japanese folklore. Engage in acrobatic aerial combat, unlock powerful mystical abilities, and explore an interconnected world of myth as you seek to unravel the mysteries of your origin.','2024/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1614440/B_Path_of_the_Teal_Lotus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3322,'tiebreak+:_official_game_of_the_atp_and_wta',NULL,'The official ATP and WTA Tennis game has finally arrived! Become the Number One player in the world, competing for entire seasons against the largest cast of professional tennis players ever united in a tennis videogame.','2024/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2264340/TIEBREAK_Official_Game_of_the_ATP_and_WTA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3323,'tour_de_france_2025',NULL,'The official game takes on a new dimension thanks to new graphics for enhanced immersion. Take on the roads of the Tour de France 2025, sprint, climb and try to win the mythical Yellow Jersey.','2025/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2511320/Tour_de_France_2025/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3324,'the_jackbox_survey_scramble',NULL,'Discover how people across the country think! The Jackbox Survey Scramble is a collection of hilarious survey-based game modes, using real one-word answers from real people. Really! Grab some friends and start guessing!','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2948640/The_Jackbox_Survey_Scramble/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3325,'plants_vs._zombies:_battle_for_neighborville™',NULL,'Kick some grass in Plants vs. Zombies: Battle for Neighborville, the wackiest shooter yet!','2019/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1262240/Plants_vs_Zombies_Battle_for_Neighborville/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3326,'the_legend_of_heroes:_trails_in_the_sky_sc',NULL,'Picking up shortly after The Legend of Heroes: Trails in the Sky, Estelle travels across Liberl in search of Joshua. The journey involves more than seeking loved ones, however, as the Bracer Guild also tasks her with unraveling the mysteries behind the newly unveiled Society of Ouroboros.','2015/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/251290/The_Legend_of_Heroes_Trails_in_the_Sky_SC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3327,'fuga:_melodies_of_steel_3',NULL,'The dramatic RPG Fuga: Melodies of Steel series is now complete!','2025/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3081320/Fuga_Melodies_of_Steel_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3328,'microcivilization',NULL,'Incremental clicker strategy, where you expand, construct, research, fight, collect heroes and make choices between good and evil. Ascend through difficulty tiers by playing through challenge campaign going back and forth through history. Mammoths included.','2023/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1822550/Microcivilization/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3329,'the_last_campfire',NULL,'The Last Campfire is an adventure, a story of a lost ember trapped in a puzzling place, searching for meaning and a way home.','2021/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/990630/The_Last_Campfire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3330,'tiny_pasture:_azure_waters_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tiny Pasture on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3734130/Tiny_Pasture_Azure_Waters_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3331,'port_royale_4',NULL,'Set sail and join the colonial powers of Spain, England, France and the Netherlands in their fight for supremacy of the Caribbean in the 17th century.','2020/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1024650/Port_Royale_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3332,'widget_inc.',NULL,'A hybrid factory builder / incremental clicker game. Starting from humble beginnings, master the many crafting processes to build up resources and expand your factory. Then, using your newly automated production, unlock new technology and grow ever closer to your goal of spreading to the stars.','2024/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3184110/Widget_Inc/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3333,'cocoon',NULL,'From Jeppe Carlsen, the lead gameplay designer of LIMBO and INSIDE — COCOON takes you on an adventure across worlds within worlds. Master world-leaping mechanics and solve intricate puzzles to unravel a cosmic mystery.','2023/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1497440/COCOON/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3334,'captain_of_industry_-_supporter_edition_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Captain of Industry on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2004740/Captain_of_Industry__Supporter_edition_upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3335,'warhammer:_vermintide_2_-_necromancer_career',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer: Vermintide 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2585630/Warhammer_Vermintide_2__Necromancer_Career/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3336,'monomyth',NULL,'MONOMYTH is an immersive, first-person dungeon-crawling RPG inspired by the genre\'s late classics. Embark on a journey through a vast and highly interactive game world as you unravel the mysteries hidden beneath the ancient fortress of Lysandria.','2024/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/908360/Monomyth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3337,'scoot',NULL,'Scoot is the long awaited scooter riding game that riders have been waiting years for. Enter this physics based game and perform over 40 different tricks, customise your scooter and rider, build your dream park, film clips, or play online with friends!','2020/12/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1494840/Scoot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3338,'the_wild_eight',NULL,'The Wild Eight is an intense survival action-adventure set in the frozen wilderness of Alaska. Team up with friends in online co-op or go solo, explore the mysterious land, craft weapons and fight to live another day.','2019/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/526160/The_Wild_Eight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3339,'nova_lands',NULL,'Nova Lands is a factory building, exploration, and island management game. Explore, engage in combat, and automate your industry. The planet you’re on is full of mysteries, creatures, people, and things to do. Welcome to your new home amongst the stars!','2023/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1501610/Nova_Lands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3340,'darkest_dungeon®_ii:_infernal_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Darkest Dungeon® II on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3591040/Darkest_Dungeon_II_Infernal_Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3341,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_kögel_trailer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3034940/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Kgel_Trailer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3342,'gwent:_the_witcher_card_game',NULL,'Command mighty Witcher-world heroes in epic online PvP card battles!','2020/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1284410/GWENT_The_Witcher_Card_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3343,'unboxing_the_cryptic_killer',NULL,'Unravel the mystery of a cryptic box in this 2-player co-op puzzle game. Join forces as two detectives, solve cooperative puzzles, communicate effectively, crack the codes and outsmart the killer.','2023/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2069040/Unboxing_the_Cryptic_Killer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3344,'knock_on_the_coffin_lid',NULL,'Investigate your own death, find ways to break free from a time loop, choose a hero who will ascend to the throne and rule the Northern gate! The fates of whole nations of the land of Midian depend on your choices.','2024/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1232580/Knock_on_the_Coffin_Lid/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3345,'deadly_premonition_2:_a_blessing_in_disguise',NULL,'Deadly Premonition 2: A Blessing in Disguise is an open-world survival horror video game serving as both a sequel and prequel to the original Deadly Premonition: The Director’s Cut.','2022/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1271100/Deadly_Premonition_2_A_Blessing_in_Disguise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3346,'jazzpunk:_director\'s_cut',NULL,'Jazzpunk is a comedy adventure set in an alternate reality Cold War World, plagued with corporate espionage, CyberCrime, and sentient martinis. Gameplay is inspired by spoof comedy films and cartoons of yesteryear, with a focus on weird gadgets, exotic locales, and open-world style exploration.','2014/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/250260/Jazzpunk_Directors_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3347,'mechwarrior_5:_mercenaries_-_the_dragon\'s_gambit',NULL,'This content requires the base game MechWarrior 5: Mercenaries on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2489020/MechWarrior_5_Mercenaries__The_Dragons_Gambit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3348,'call_of_duty®_(2003)',NULL,'Call of Duty® delivers the gritty realism and cinematic intensity of World War II\'s epic battlefield moments like never before.','2003/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2620/Call_of_Duty_2003/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3349,'worms_reloaded',NULL,'Ten years on from Worms™ Armageddon and the turn-based comic mayhem continues in Worms™ Reloaded, an all-new edition available for PC through Steam.','2010/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/22600/Worms_Reloaded/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3350,'mementomori',NULL,'Dive into a World Where Sorrow Meets Beauty','2025/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2302530/MementoMori/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3351,'nba_2k25_hall_of_fame_pass:_season_8',NULL,'This content requires the base game NBA 2K25 on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2974980/NBA_2K25_Hall_of_Fame_Pass_Season_8/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3352,'call_of_duty®:_black_ops_6_-_hella_fresh:_starter_pack',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3159170/Call_of_Duty_Black_Ops_6__Hella_Fresh_Starter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3353,'finding_frankie',NULL,'Finding Frankie invites YOU to a true experience of terror as you compete in a terrifyingly twisted parkour show. Stealthily navigate around horrifying characters and swing through challenging parkour courses. This is one game show you won’t want to miss!','2024/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2597970/Finding_Frankie/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3354,'outcast_-_a_new_beginning',NULL,'Explore the breathtaking alien world of Adelpha, support the local Talans in their struggles and fight your way through fast-paced battles against invading robot forces in this 3rd-person, open world, action adventure sequel to the 1999 cult classic.','2024/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1013140/Outcast__A_New_Beginning/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3355,'total_war:_pharaoh_-_blood_&_sand',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: PHARAOH on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2574940/Total_War_PHARAOH__Blood__Sand/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_70'),(3356,'spaceflight_simulator',NULL,'In Spaceflight Simulator, you will get to build your rockets, plan launches and flights, attempt landings, deploy payloads and explore new worlds.','2022/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1718870/Spaceflight_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3357,'beholder',NULL,'You’re a state-installed landlord in a totalitarian country. Place listening devices, steal and sneak into your tenants’ apartments. Use what you uncovered to report anyone capable of plotting against the state. You MUST! But WILL you?','2016/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/475550/Beholder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3358,'pro_wrestling_sim',NULL,'Pro Wrestling Sim is a text-based pro-wrestling booking simulator. Control a wrestling promotion, decide your roster, and create storylines, feuds and matches where the winners and losers are in your hands.','2021/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1157700/Pro_Wrestling_Sim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3359,'brutal_legend',NULL,'Brütal Legend is an action-adventure that marries visceral action combat with open-world freedom. Set in a universe somewhere between Lord of the Rings and Spinal Tap, it’s a fresh take on the action/driving genre, which in this case is full of imitation cover bands, demons intent on enslaving humanity and Heavy metal tunes.','2013/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/225260/Brutal_Legend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3360,'antichamber',NULL,'Antichamber is a mind-bending psychological exploration game where nothing can be taken for granted. Discover an Escher-like world where hallways wrap around upon each other, spaces reconfigure themselves, and accomplishing the impossible may just be the only way forward.','2013/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/219890/Antichamber/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3361,'pixel_starships',NULL,'Pixel Starships is an FTL-style online sci-fi strategy builder and management game with a competitive PVP tournament. Set in the retro galaxy, your role is to explore space, meet aliens, and develop your ship, crew and AI. The game contains deep strategic and 4x elements. PSS is community-driven.','2023/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/378760/Pixel_Starships/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3362,'crusader_kings_iii_content_creator_pack:_arctic_attire',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings III on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3315550/Crusader_Kings_III_Content_Creator_Pack_Arctic_Attire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3363,'duckside',NULL,'Imagine DayZ or Rust but you\'re a duck. A persistent world survival game with PVP, PVE, crafting, base building and hat wearing ducks, wielding weapons.','2024/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2682580/DUCKSIDE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3364,'total_war:_rome_ii_-__black_sea_colonies_culture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ROME II - Emperor Edition on Steam in order to play.','2014/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/297831/Total_War_ROME_II___Black_Sea_Colonies_Culture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3365,'the_lego®_movie_-_videogame',NULL,'Join Emmet and an unlikely group of resistance fighters in their heroic quest to thwart Lord Business’ evil plans—a mission that Emmet is hopelessly and hilariously unprepared for.  It’s a wild ride with a surprising mix of over 90 playable characters including Batman, Superman, Wonder Woman, the Green Ninja, Gandalf, Shakespeare,...','2014/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/267530/The_LEGO_Movie__Videogame/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3366,'lost_castle_2',NULL,'\"Lost Castle 2\" is a 2D Beat\'em up Rogue-Lite game. Explore abundant treasures and items to enhance yourself, master various weapons to showcase your skills, and challenge powerful monsters to demonstrate your strength. A new adventure is calling for treasure hunters!','2024/7/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2445690/Lost_Castle_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3367,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_salzwiesen_park',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3244810/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Salzwiesen_Park/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3368,'armored_brigade_ii',NULL,'Armored Brigade II revolutionizes real-time tactical warfare in 3D, focusing on the intense combined arms combat of the Cold War era, from 1965 to 1991. Boasting a meticulously researched database and huge real-world terrain maps, this game offers an unparalleled combat simulation experience.','2025/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1934300/Armored_Brigade_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3369,'kill_the_crows',NULL,'\"Kill The Crows\" is a fast-paced top-down arena shooter set in the twisted western world. A gunslinger burning with vengeance steps into the ruins of a forsaken town, ready to face death. Prepare for one-shot, one-kill gunfights using classic revolvers and fanning techniques.','2023/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2441270/Kill_The_Crows/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3370,'crown_gambit',NULL,'Play as three intrepid paladins through a terrible war of succession to save a sinister medieval kingdom from political turmoil. Pick a side amongst noble families to choose the future monarch and crush those who stand in your way through board-shattering tactical card combat!','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2447980/Crown_Gambit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3371,'journey_to_incrementalia',NULL,'Journey to Incrementalia is an active incremental auto-battler about a necromancer on a short quest. Cast diabolical spells, summon an army and open the gates of hell on your quest to break down 99 walls and reach the lost city of Incrementalia.','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3147430/Journey_to_Incrementalia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3372,'miasma_chronicles',NULL,'From the creators of Mutant Year Zero: Road to Eden comes a beautifully crafted tactical adventure you won’t forget. Embark on a quest across a post-apocalyptic wasteland torn apart by a savage force known only as the ‘Miasma’.','2023/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1649010/Miasma_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3373,'dcs:_f-14a/b_tomcat_by_heatblur_simulations',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2019/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/411893/DCS_F14AB_Tomcat_by_Heatblur_Simulations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3374,'the_sims™_3_pets',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2011/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/47930/The_Sims_3_Pets/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3375,'the_beginner\'s_guide',NULL,'The Beginner\'s Guide is a narrative video game from Davey Wreden, the creator of The Stanley Parable. It lasts about an hour and a half and has no traditional mechanics, no goals or objectives. Instead, it tells the story of a person struggling to deal with something they do not understand.','2015/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/303210/The_Beginners_Guide/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3376,'navalart',NULL,'Design your own warships, equip them with a variety of armament, and bring them out to the ocean!','2018/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/842780/NavalArt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3377,'cities:_skylines_ii_-_creator_pack:_modern_architecture',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines II on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2427741/Cities_Skylines_II__Creator_Pack_Modern_Architecture/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3378,'smite®',NULL,'Join 40+ million players in SMITE, the Battleground of the Gods! Wield Thor’s hammer, turn your foes to stone as Medusa, or flex your divine power as one of 100+ other mythological icons. Become a God and play FREE today!','2015/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/386360/SMITE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3379,'dcs:_cold_war_germany_by_ugra_media',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3570230/DCS_Cold_War_Germany_by_Ugra_Media/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3380,'the_house_of_da_vinci_2',NULL,'Become an apprentice of the famous Leonardo da Vinci. Solve handcrafted mechanical 3D puzzles and discover hidden secrets. Navigate through mesmerizing environments of the Italian Renaissance. Travel through time to influence your surroundings.','2020/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1259840/The_House_of_Da_Vinci_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3381,'warhammer_40,000:_space_marine_2_-_macragge’s_chosen_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2486150/Warhammer_40000_Space_Marine_2__Macragges_Chosen_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3382,'dokimon:_quest',NULL,'\"Whoa, watch out!\" That was close, didn\'t you know Dokimon are dangerous!?ーStep into Xelos region, where you\'ll set off on an adventure to uncover the mystery behind your missing childhood friend.','2024/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2019300/Dokimon_Quest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3383,'birth',NULL,'You are alone. You will build a creature, a partner, a wet warm heart, a collection of bones.','2023/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1889040/Birth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3384,'steelrising',NULL,'Paris, 1789. The French Revolution has been suppressed with bloodshed by Louis XVI and his merciless mechanical army. Aegis, a mysterious automaton masterpiece, must confront the king\'s army alone to save history in this challenging action-RPG.','2022/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1283400/Steelrising/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3385,'steel_division_2_-_tribute_to_normandy_\'44',NULL,'This content requires the base game Steel Division 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2873780/Steel_Division_2__Tribute_to_Normandy_44/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3386,'the_surge_2',NULL,'In a bid to survive, explore the sprawling, devastated Jericho City. Fight ferocious threats in brutal, unforgiving combat, slashing and tearing the limbs off your opponents to steal their equipment.','2019/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/644830/The_Surge_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3387,'shadow_gambit:_yuki\'s_wish',NULL,'This content requires the base game Shadow Gambit: The Cursed Crew on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2304810/Shadow_Gambit_Yukis_Wish/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3388,'the_life_and_suffering_of_sir_brante',NULL,'A narrative-driven hardcore RPG set in a gritty world ruled by real but unrelenting gods. Set out on a challenging lifetime journey, where every choice has a price and entails consequences. Will you become an inquisitor, a judge, or conspire against the old order? Dare to decide!','2021/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1272160/The_Life_and_Suffering_of_Sir_Brante/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3389,'automate_it:_factory_puzzle',NULL,'Automate It is a factory-building puzzle game that challenges players to find clever solutions within size, power, and time constraints. Design, build, and share your own puzzles with other players. If you want to build it - choose Automate It.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2472770/Automate_It_Factory_Puzzle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3390,'total_war:_rome_ii_-_greek_states_culture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ROME II - Emperor Edition on Steam in order to play.','2013/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/212301/Total_War_ROME_II__Greek_States_Culture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3391,'escape_simulator:_wild_west_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Escape Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2175260/Escape_Simulator_Wild_West_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3392,'dead_estate',NULL,'Cornered with nowhere else to turn, can you escape the monster-filled mansion? Dead Estate is a gory, fast-paced, challenging roguelike shooter with a heavy emphasis on horror.','2021/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1484720/Dead_Estate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3393,'hyper_light_breaker',NULL,'Enter the Overgrowth, a new realm in the world of Hyper Light. Play alone or with friends to explore open worlds, create new builds, rip through hordes and overcome the Crowns and the Abyss King.','2025/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1534840/Hyper_Light_Breaker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3394,'empyreal',NULL,'Empyreal is a complex, challenging, feature-rich action RPG. In a far-flung corner of the galaxy an Expedition arrives on a hitherto unexplored planet to find a colossal Monolith built by a lost civilisation.','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1377700/Empyreal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3395,'the_typing_of_the_dead:_overkill',NULL,'Typing of the dead: Overkill fuses the horror and comedy of the legendary House of the Dead series with unique typing mechanics in order to deliver a truly original gaming experience! This gruesome shooter puts you in the middle of a mutant outbreak in Bayou county.','2013/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/246580/The_Typing_of_The_Dead_Overkill/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3396,'prison_architect_-_going_green',NULL,'This content requires the base game Prison Architect on Steam in order to play.','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1493470/Prison_Architect__Going_Green/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3397,'redout_2',NULL,'The fastest racing game in the universe. Redout 2 is a tribute to classic arcade racing games and the sequel to the critically acclaimed Redout. Reach impossible speeds in exhilarating futuristic races across an extensive single-player campaign and competitive multiplayer.','2022/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1799930/Redout_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3398,'age_of_water',NULL,'Age of Water is an online adventure game set on a post-apocalyptic Earth completely covered in water. Sail through storms, fight and trade, capture other people\'s boats or build your own, extract resources from the bottom of the ocean and reveal the secrets of the Age of Water world.','2025/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2695490/Age_of_Water/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3399,'umineko_when_they_cry_-_question_arcs',NULL,'Umineko When They Cry is the 2nd series of Sound Novel released by 07th Expansion. The steam version features renewed character sprites which is swappable from the classic art.','2016/7/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/406550/Umineko_When_They_Cry__Question_Arcs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3400,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_parque_fernando',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2018/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/986850/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Parque_Fernando/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3401,'all_quiet_in_the_trenches',NULL,'All Quiet in the Trenches is a narrative turn-based strategy RPG set in World War I. Get to know your soldiers, take care of their needs and lead them in battle, trying to strike a precarious balance between the ambitions of your superiors and the survival of your men.','2024/1/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/863500/All_Quiet_in_the_Trenches/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3402,'the_boba_teashop',NULL,'A cozy horror game where you own and manage a boba tea shop. Prepare boba teas, serve customers, and expand your menu to grow your business.','2025/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3461920/The_Boba_Teashop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3403,'heroes_of_hammerwatch',NULL,'Heroes of Hammerwatch is a rogue-lite action-adventure. Explore and battle your way through procedurally generated levels on your own or with up to 3 friends.','2018/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/677120/Heroes_of_Hammerwatch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3404,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_fh_tuning_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1299530/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__FH_Tuning_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3405,'death_and_taxes',NULL,'In this 2D, short narrative-based game, you assume the role of the Grim Reaper... on an office job. Your job is to decide which people are going to live or die. The consequences of your choices are yours to bear, while the mystery of your incarnation awaits revelation!','2020/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1166290/Death_and_Taxes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_71'),(3406,'automobilista_2_-_nürburgring_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1386931/Automobilista_2__Nrburgring_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3407,'hot_wheels_unleashed™',NULL,'Collect the best vehicles in the Hot Wheels™ universe, build spectacular tracks and dive into breathtaking races.','2021/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1271700/HOT_WHEELS_UNLEASHED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3408,'tinykin',NULL,'Catch hundreds of tinykin and use their unique powers to bring Milo back to his home planet and back to normal size!','2022/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1599020/Tinykin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3409,'mutant_year_zero:_road_to_eden',NULL,'A tactical game combining the turn-based combat of XCOM with story, exploration, stealth, and strategy. Take control of a team of Mutants navigating a post-human Earth. Created by a team including former HITMAN leads and the designer of PAYDAY.','2018/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/760060/Mutant_Year_Zero_Road_to_Eden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3410,'the_troop',NULL,'The Troop is a turn-based, platoon-level tactical game set in WW2. From the early hours of D-Day to Falaise, play as British and Canadian or German forces in desperate fighting across Normandy.','2023/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1363740/The_Troop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3411,'toem:_a_photo_adventure',NULL,'Set off on a delightful expedition and use your photographic eye to uncover the mysteries of the magical TOEM in this hand-drawn adventure game. Chat with quirky characters, solve their problems by snapping neat photos, and make your way through a relaxing landscape!','2021/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1307580/TOEM_A_Photo_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3412,'zoochosis',NULL,'Zoochosis is a bodycam horror simulation game. You’re a zookeeper. Identify infected mutant animals, make a vaccine and cure them. Will you save all of them and survive?','2024/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2458560/Zoochosis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3413,'chivalry_2_-_special_edition_content',NULL,'This content requires the base game Chivalry 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1998240/Chivalry_2__Special_Edition_Content/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3414,'arma_3_creator_dlc:_global_mobilization_-_cold_war_germany',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2019/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1042220/Arma_3_Creator_DLC_Global_Mobilization__Cold_War_Germany/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3415,'the_darkest_files',NULL,'Germany, 1956. The war is over, but justice is not served. Former Nazis walk free, while their victims lie in unmarked graves. As a prosecutor, you\'ll unearth long-buried evidence, confront witnesses and hunt down perpetrators. Will you have the courage to bring these \"ordinary men\" to court?','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2058730/The_Darkest_Files/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3416,'fallout_3',NULL,'Vault-Tec engineers have worked around the clock on an interactive reproduction of Wasteland life for you to enjoy from the comfort of your own vault. Included is an expansive world, unique combat, shockingly realistic visuals, tons of player choice, and an incredible cast of dynamic characters.','2008/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/22300/Fallout_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3417,'trials_of_mana',NULL,'Trials of Mana is a modern revival of the 3rd game in the seminal Mana series. The game, originally released in Japan as Seiken Densetsu 3, has been fully rebuilt from the ground up in 3D.','2020/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/924980/Trials_of_Mana/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3418,'clannad',NULL,'From the world renowned visual novel studio Key, the highly rated story of CLANNAD is now available on Steam! Improved visuals, achievement integration, and Dangopedia make this the best version of CLANNAD to date.','2004/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/324160/CLANNAD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3419,'eastshade',NULL,'You are a traveling painter, exploring the island of Eastshade. Capture the world on canvas using your artist’s easel. Talk to the inhabitants to learn about their lives. Make friends and help those in need. Visit cities, scale summits, unearth mysteries, and discover forgotten places!','2019/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/715560/Eastshade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3420,'dungeons_3',NULL,'At last, the Dungeon Lord has successfully united the forces of evil and established his dark empire. Time for the next step in his most diabolical quest: expansion!','2017/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/493900/Dungeons_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3421,'shadow_gambit:_zagan\'s_ritual',NULL,'This content requires the base game Shadow Gambit: The Cursed Crew on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2576620/Shadow_Gambit_Zagans_Ritual/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3422,'spiderheck',NULL,'Spiders with laser swords! Duel to the death against your friends or choose to team up and hold back swarms of savage enemies. Swing, stab and shoot with style, effortlessly performing movie-worthy parkour.','2022/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1329500/SpiderHeck/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3423,'blazblue_entropy_effect_-_rachel_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game BlazBlue Entropy Effect on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3085820/BlazBlue_Entropy_Effect__Rachel_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3424,'alpha_response',NULL,'From Gooseman, creator of the original Counter-Strike mod - Alpha Response delivers intense police action in dynamic, real-world environments. Fight solo or with friends against diverse enemies in high-stakes missions that demand tactical precision and split-second decisions.','2024/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2089250/Alpha_Response/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3425,'the_outlast_trials_-_exotica_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Outlast Trials on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3030370/The_Outlast_Trials__Exotica_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3426,'mordheim:_city_of_the_damned',NULL,'Mordheim: City of the Damned is the first video game adaptation of Games Workshop\'s cult classic tabletop game Mordheim. Set in the Warhammer World\'s decimated Empire city, Mordheim: City of the Damned is a turn-based tactical game where you lead warbands into bloody and lethal skirmishes.','2015/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/276810/Mordheim_City_of_the_Damned/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3427,'kingdoms_reborn',NULL,'A city builder with simulated citizens, set in a procedurally-generated world map. Grow your kingdom through the eras from a tiny medieval hamlet into a prosperous global empire! Cooperate or compete in real-time with your friends in multiplayer mode.','2020/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1307890/Kingdoms_Reborn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3428,'broforce',NULL,'Broforce is an action-packed side-scrolling run ‘n’ gun ode to freedom, putting you in control of an under-funded, overpowered paramilitary organization dealing exclusively in excessive force.','2015/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/274190/Broforce/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3429,'stick_rpg_2:_director\'s_cut',NULL,'Get ready to enter the 2nd Dimension! Thrust into a bizarre and unfamiliar city and find your place among strange citizens. Work, Fight, Study, Eat, Drink, Gamble, Train, Sleep, Quest, Collect, Invest, Repeat.','2011/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/307640/Stick_RPG_2_Directors_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3430,'batman:_the_enemy_within_-_the_telltale_series',NULL,'In this latest chapter from the award-winning studio behind Batman - The Telltale Series, both Bruce Wayne and Batman will be forced into precarious new roles. The Riddler has returned to terrorize Gotham City, but his gruesome puzzles merely foreshadow an even greater crisis.','2017/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/675260/Batman_The_Enemy_Within__The_Telltale_Series/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3431,'train_sim_world®_5:_great_western_express_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2969390/Train_Sim_World_5_Great_Western_Express_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3432,'there_is_no_game:_wrong_dimension',NULL,'There is no game. So don\'t go messing things up by clicking everywhere. You don’t want to be kicked out of your video game world, do you? Of course not!','2020/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1240210/There_Is_No_Game_Wrong_Dimension/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3433,'total_war:_rome_ii_-_pirates_and_raiders_culture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ROME II - Emperor Edition on Steam in order to play.','2014/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/273381/Total_War_ROME_II__Pirates_and_Raiders_Culture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3434,'buggos',NULL,'Lead your hive to victory in \'Buggos\', an RTS Auto Battler! Customize your swarm with 120+ evolutions and conquer humanity. Strategy meets bug chaos!','2022/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/789660/Buggos/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3435,'salt_and_sanctuary',NULL,'Explore a haunting, punishing island in this stylized 2D action RPG. Salt and Sanctuary combines fast and brutal 2D combat with richly developed RPG mechanics in a cursed realm of forgotten cities, blood-soaked dungeons, and desecrated monuments.','2016/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/283640/Salt_and_Sanctuary/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3436,'the_farmer_was_replaced',NULL,'Program and optimize a drone to automate a farm and watch it do the work for you. Collect resources to unlock better technology and become the most efficient farmer in the world. Improve your problem solving and coding skills.','2023/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2060160/The_Farmer_Was_Replaced/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3437,'call_of_duty®:_infinite_warfare_-_season_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of Duty®: Infinite Warfare on Steam in order to play.','2016/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/420490/Call_of_Duty_Infinite_Warfare__Season_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3438,'empyrion_-_galactic_survival',NULL,'Build and explore in a true space sandbox survival adventure. Construct mighty capital vessels, sprawling planetary settlements, and vast space stations in your galactic journey to discover the mysteries of Empyrion!','2020/8/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/383120/Empyrion__Galactic_Survival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3439,'sakuna:_of_rice_and_ruin',NULL,'Discover the true power of rice in Sakuna: Of Rice and Ruin! Take on hordes of demons in side-scrolling combat to reclaim the land as Sakuna, a spoiled harvest goddess banished to a dangerous island. Then, return to your mountain village and tend a field full of glorious rice.','2020/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1356670/Sakuna_Of_Rice_and_Ruin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3440,'fallout:_a_post_nuclear_role_playing_game',NULL,'You\'ve just unearthed the classic post-apocalyptic role-playing game that revitalized the entire CRPG genre. The Fallout® SPECIAL system allows drastically different types of characters, meaningful decisions and development that puts you in complete control. Explore the devastated ruins of a golden age civilization.','1997/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/38400/Fallout_A_Post_Nuclear_Role_Playing_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3441,'gridroad',NULL,'GRIDROAD is a traffic optimisation puzzle/simulation game. Build roads, place road markings and tweak traffic lights to build the most efficient traffic junction!','2024/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2677310/GRIDROAD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3442,'god_of_weapons:_eternal_nightmare',NULL,'This content requires the base game God Of Weapons on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3282270/God_of_Weapons_Eternal_Nightmare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3443,'virtua_fighter_5_r.e.v.o.',NULL,'Virtua Fighter 5 R.E.V.O. takes the gameplay of Virtua Fighter 5 and raises it to new levels! Rollback Netcode support, gorgeous 4K visuals and additional content make it the best version of this legendary game ever.','2025/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3112260/Virtua_Fighter_5_REVO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3444,'heat_death:_survival_train',NULL,'Heat Death is a sci-fi survival game where you can build, upgrade, and customize your battle train to explore and survive a frozen world! This train is not only your shelter and vehicle, but also your weapon and ally to face hostile drones, deadly storms, and hidden mysteries of an unknown world!','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2662780/Heat_Death_Survival_Train/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3445,'warhammer_the_horus_heresy:_legions',NULL,'A card battler based in the rich universe of the Horus Heresy, the origin story of Warhammer 40,000. Play through epic single-player campaigns, take part in draft tournaments based on famous battles, or build your own unstoppable deck and compete in fast and epic duels against players worldwide.','2019/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1031140/Warhammer_The_Horus_Heresy_Legions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3446,'remember_me',NULL,'Remember Me™ is a 3rd person action adventure where players take on the role of Nilin, a former elite memory hunter with the ability to break into people’s minds and steal or even alter their memories.','2013/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/228300/Remember_Me/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3447,'welcome_to_the_game_ii',NULL,'Welcome to the Game II is an atmospheric horror / strategy / puzzle game that takes you into the world of the deep web in search of the shadow web. Play as an investigative reporter trying to solve a case of a mysterious woman broadcasting for help as masked men are on the hunt to kill her.','2018/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/720250/Welcome_to_the_Game_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3448,'smushi_come_home',NULL,'Play as a tiny lil\' mushroom who\'s lost in the forest and can\'t find its way home. Explore unique areas freely at your own pace, chat with friendly inhabitants, and take on different adventures to get back home!','2023/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1740300/Smushi_Come_Home/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3449,'dungeon_keeper™_2',NULL,'Bad guys have all the fun. Discover your dark side as you build an evil underground kingdom and defend it against the forces of good.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2616460/Dungeon_Keeper_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_72'),(3450,'backrooms_cleanup_crew',NULL,'You and your crew are tasked with cleaning up after the last exploration team\'s ill-fated journey into the Backrooms. Dodge deadly incursions, scrub every surface, and leave no trace.','2025/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3140990/Backrooms_Cleanup_Crew/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3451,'snowrunner_-_freightliner_&_western_star_dual_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SnowRunner on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3623240/SnowRunner__Freightliner__Western_Star_Dual_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3452,'aquarist',NULL,'A relaxing sandbox casual simulation game where you perform various, even strange, aquarium-related tasks on very diverse levels. As an Aquarist you must create and manage a home to amazing fish🐟, sea turtles🐢, sharks🦈, octopuses🐙, and more🐬. Aquarium is their world and life. Make it worth...','2024/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1430760/Aquarist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3453,'grim_fandango_remastered',NULL,'One of the most acclaimed adventure games of all time is now back, better than ever. Grim Fandango Remastered has the all the beautiful art and engaging story fans remember, but has also been remastered to look, sound, and control even better than the award-winning original release.','2015/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/316790/Grim_Fandango_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3454,'the_room_three',NULL,'Lured to a remote island, you find yourself confined within the rooms of an ominous mansion. You must draw upon all your puzzle-solving ability to navigate a series of trials devised by a mysterious figure known only as “The Craftsman”. Do you have what it takes to escape?','2018/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/456750/The_Room_Three/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3455,'road_redemption',NULL,'Road Redemption lets you lead a biker gang on an epic journey across the country in this driving combat road rage adventure. Huge campaign, dozens of weapons, full 4-player co-op splitscreen.','2019/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/300380/Road_Redemption/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3456,'bee_island',NULL,'Take control of the hive and protect it from enemies. Build factories and defence, research technologies and, if necessary, use nuclear weapons, but do not let the enemies harm the queen!','2023/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2345020/Bee_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3457,'3dsen_pc',NULL,'3dSen is a unique emulator that transforms classic 2D NES games into stunning 3D voxel experiences. Relive your favorite retro titles like never before!','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1147940/3dSen_PC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3458,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_chaos_space_marines',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2019/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1084820/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Chaos_Space_Marines/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3459,'ebola_village',NULL,'EBOLA VILLAGE - this is a classic survival horror game from the 90s with a focus on atmosphere and player immersion. Solve puzzles, follow the story carefully and use various weapons in a brutal fight for survival. Danger lurks at every turn.','2025/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2306030/EBOLA_VILLAGE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3460,'soulash_2',NULL,'Soulash 2 is a sandbox RPG roguelike with a procedurally generated open world, simulated history, skill-based progression system, customizable abilities, material-based crafting, building, trading, and the possibility of total mayhem. Will you save your world or destroy it?','2023/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2399160/Soulash_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3461,'field_of_glory:_kingdoms',NULL,'Politics, religion, war. They are nothing without a legacy that can stand the test of time. Lead any nation, and turn it into a mighty kingdom in one of the most compelling grand strategy games ever created.','2024/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1985050/Field_of_Glory_Kingdoms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3462,'sackboy™:_a_big_adventure',NULL,'PERFECTLY CRAFTED FOR PC. PlayStation® icon Sackboy bursts into action on PC in a huge 3D multiplayer platforming adventure. An epic journey stuffed with platforming challenges. Deeply immersive controls. Collaborative, chaotic and joyful multiplayer fun.','2022/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1599660/Sackboy_A_Big_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3463,'farm_together',NULL,'Grow your own farm all by yourself, or cooperate with your friends in this unique, relaxing farming experience!','2018/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/673950/Farm_Together/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3464,'wytchwood',NULL,'Wytchwood is a crafting adventure game set in a land of gothic fables and fairytales. As the old witch of the woods, explore a strange countryside, collect magic ingredients, brew sorcerous spells, and pass judgement upon a capricious cast of characters.','2021/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/729000/Wytchwood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3465,'borderlands_game_of_the_year_enhanced',NULL,'Discover the original co-op shooter-looter, crammed with new enhancements! As one of 4 trigger-happy mercenaries with RPG progression, equip bazillions of guns to take on the desert planet Pandora.','2023/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/729040/Borderlands_Game_of_the_Year_Enhanced/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3466,'hell_let_loose_-_operation_overlord_units',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hell Let Loose on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3768610/Hell_Let_Loose__Operation_Overlord_Units/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3467,'south_park:_snow_day!',NULL,'Play as the New kid in South Park and join Cartman, Stan, Kyle, and Kenny, in three-dimensional glory, to celebrate the most magical day in any young child’s life - a snow day!','2024/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1214650/SOUTH_PARK_SNOW_DAY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3468,'battle_brothers_-_beasts_&_exploration',NULL,'This content requires the base game Battle Brothers on Steam in order to play.','2018/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/961930/Battle_Brothers__Beasts__Exploration/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3469,'cartel_tycoon',NULL,'Cartel Tycoon is a survival business sim inspired by the ‘80s and \'90s narco trade. Expand and conquer, fight off rival thugs and evade the authorities. Earn people\'s loyalty and strive to overcome the doomed fate of a power-hungry drug lord.','2022/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1220140/Cartel_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3470,'unity_of_command_ii',NULL,'Unity of Command II is the sequel to one of the most critically acclaimed strategy games of all time; a game critics called \'the perfect gateway\' into computer war games.','2019/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/809230/Unity_of_Command_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3471,'war_planet_online:_global_conquest',NULL,'Build your army, dominate your region and lead your alliance to conquer the globe!','2017/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/719640/War_Planet_Online_Global_Conquest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3472,'warface:_clutch',NULL,'𝗪𝗮𝗿𝗳𝗮𝗰𝗲: 𝗖𝗹𝘂𝘁𝗰𝗵 𝗶𝘀 𝗮 𝗰𝗼𝗻𝘁𝗲𝗺𝗽𝗼𝗿𝗮𝗿𝘆 𝗠𝗠𝗢 𝗳𝗶𝗿𝘀𝘁 𝗽𝗲𝗿𝘀𝗼𝗻 𝘀𝗵𝗼𝗼𝘁𝗲𝗿 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗺𝗶𝗹𝗹𝗶𝗼𝗻𝘀 𝗼𝗳 𝗳𝗮𝗻𝘀 𝗮𝗿𝗼𝘂𝗻𝗱 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝘄𝗼𝗿𝗹𝗱. 𝗜𝘁 𝗼𝗳𝗳𝗲𝗿𝘀 𝗶𝗻𝘁𝗲𝗻𝘀𝗲 𝗣𝘃𝗣 𝗺𝗼𝗱𝗲𝘀, 𝗰𝗼𝗺𝗽𝗲𝗹𝗹𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗣𝘃𝗘 𝗺𝗶𝘀𝘀𝗶𝗼𝗻𝘀 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗿𝗮𝗶𝗱𝘀 𝘁𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝘆𝗼𝘂 𝗰𝗮𝗻 𝗰𝗵𝗮𝗹𝗹𝗲𝗻𝗴𝗲 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗳𝗶𝘃𝗲 𝗱𝗶𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘀𝗲 𝗰𝗹𝗮𝘀𝘀𝗲𝘀 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗮 𝗰𝗼𝗹𝗼𝘀𝘀𝗮𝗹 𝗰𝘂𝘀𝘁𝗼𝗺𝗶𝘇𝗮𝗯𝗹𝗲 𝗮𝗿𝘀𝗲𝗻𝗮𝗹.','2012/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/291480/Warface_Clutch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3473,'davigo:_vr_vs._pc',NULL,'DAVIGO is a VR vs. PC physics-based battle game. Become the GIANT in VR or a small KNIGHT on PC and fight your friends in local or online matches. KNIGHTS play for free with DAVIGO KNIGHT\'S PASS.','2023/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1116540/DAVIGO_VR_vs_PC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3474,'great_god_grove',NULL,'THE WORLD IS ENDING AND THE GODS ARE SQUABBLING! Suck up and launch dialogue in a world of puzzles, puppets, and weird gods… or THE RIFT WILL CONSUME US ALL!','2024/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2840190/Great_God_Grove/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3475,'tropico_6_-_tropican_shores',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tropico 6 on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2938080/Tropico_6__Tropican_Shores/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3476,'barn_finders',NULL,'Search for valuable items stashed in abandoned barns. Take part in storage auctions, bid high and buy yourself a chance to find exclusive items hidden in the past.','2020/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/991170/Barn_Finders/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3477,'the_legend_of_heroes:_trails_of_cold_steel_iv',NULL,'The long awaited finale to the epic engulfing a continent comes to a head in the final chapter of the Trails of Cold Steel saga!','2021/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1198090/The_Legend_of_Heroes_Trails_of_Cold_Steel_IV/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3478,'doors:_paradox',NULL,'A relaxing puzzle escape game! Make your way through a variety of hand-crafted 3D dioramas, look for useful objects, find hidden clues and solve fun puzzles! Unravel this mysterious adventure about chaos, order and the surreal.','2022/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1622770/Doors_Paradox/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3479,'cyber_manhunt_2:_new_world_-_the_hacking_simulator',NULL,'Discover a digital realm shrouded in mystery. Sequel to an award-winning narrative driven hacking simulator puzzle game. Play as an AI assistant in a major corporation. Deploy intricate social engineering tactics and expose hidden truths in a world of ambition and high-tech deception.','2025/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2421410/Cyber_Manhunt_2_New_World__The_Hacking_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3480,'sniper_elite_5:_rough_landing_mission_and_weapon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sniper Elite 5 on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1724941/Sniper_Elite_5_Rough_Landing_Mission_and_Weapon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3481,'amanda_the_adventurer',NULL,'Join Amanda and her pal Wooly on a series of adventures as they explore and learn about our wonderful world! With several NEW play-along, laugh-along, learn-along episodes there\'s always fun to be had! Just make sure to do everything Amanda says or she might get angry.','2023/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2166060/Amanda_the_Adventurer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3482,'hitman_3_-_the_undying_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game HITMAN World of Assassination on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2828470/HITMAN_3__The_Undying_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3483,'a_total_war_saga:_troy_-_mythos',NULL,'This content requires the base game A Total War Saga: TROY on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1553061/A_Total_War_Saga_TROY__MYTHOS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3484,'idle_fishing',NULL,'Relax and catch fish in a beautiful environment. Hire skilled crewmates, invest in lucrative buildings, unlock many boats & upgrades. Dive into the challenge of the fishing mini-game for an interactive experience unlike any other!','2024/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2725560/Idle_Fishing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3485,'griftlands',NULL,'Griftlands is a deck-building roguelite where you negotiate, fight, steal or otherwise persuade others to get your way. Every decision is important, be it the jobs you take, the friends you make, or the cards you collect.','2021/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/601840/Griftlands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3486,'i_expect_you_to_die_3:_cog_in_the_machine',NULL,'Outwit your most cunning adversary to date in the latest installment of this popular, spy-themed VR puzzle series. Wield new gadgets, visit action-packed locales, and wear custom disguises as you dive back into the world of espionage in this escape room game.','2023/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2296380/I_Expect_You_To_Die_3_Cog_in_the_Machine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3487,'town_of_salem_2',NULL,'A multiplayer online social deduction game for 7–15 players. Use deception, strategy, and teamwork to find the truth—or get away with murder.','2023/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2140510/Town_of_Salem_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3488,'the_jackbox_party_starter',NULL,'Get the party started with The Jackbox Party Starter! Featuring three updated titles: Quiplash 3, Trivia Murder Party 2 and Tee K.O., this starter pack is sure to entertain!','2022/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1755580/The_Jackbox_Party_Starter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3489,'ghostbusters:_the_video_game_remastered',NULL,'The beloved and critically acclaimed Ghostbusters video game is back! Strap on your proton pack once again and join the Ghostbusters on the adventure with the voice and likeness of the original crew as you battle to save New York!','2019/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1449280/Ghostbusters_The_Video_Game_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3490,'the_sapling',NULL,'The Sapling is a short simulation game where you design your own plants and animals, and put them in a world together. Or you turn on random mutations, and see what evolution does to your ecosystem!','2019/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/997380/The_Sapling/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3491,'yellow_taxi_goes_vroom',NULL,'Make full use of your advanced move-set to navigate hand-crafted retro worlds without a jump button in this vibrant love letter to the N64 era of collectathons!','2024/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2011780/Yellow_Taxi_Goes_Vroom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3492,'hooked_on_you:_a_dead_by_daylight_dating_sim™',NULL,'Welcome to Murderer’s Island. Your companions: four dead-sexy Killers who, underneath their murderous exteriors, just want a little romance. Flirt your way into their hearts, uncovering dark twists along the way. Will you find true love, forge friendships… or get hacked to death?','2022/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1866180/Hooked_on_You_A_Dead_by_Daylight_Dating_Sim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3493,'refind_self:_the_personality_test_game',NULL,'Games can really show someone\'s personality, don\'t you think? By way of a simple exploration-based adventure, this data-science game analyzes your actions to estimate your personality.','2023/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2514960/Refind_Self_The_Personality_Test_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3494,'age_of_reforging:the_freelands',NULL,'Welcome to medieval high-freedom sandbox adventure CRPG!You\'ll be a reforger in freelands chosen by the Goddess to embark on medieval adventure tour at your own pace, gathering teammates, seeking survival, and craft your unique legend!','2025/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1161830/Age_of_ReforgingThe_Freelands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3495,'the_matchless_kungfu',NULL,'The Matchless Kungfu is an open world sandbox RPG game based on a WuXia background. You can play any martial arts role you imagine in this wild world. Travel through the great wilderness, or be the leader of the group. The most important thing is, build your own story and live the experience!','2024/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1696440/The_Matchless_Kungfu/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3496,'shotgun_king:_the_final_checkmate',NULL,'Chess, but you replace your entire army with a royal shotgun. A unique strategy roguelike based on the timeless checkboard classic.','2022/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1972440/Shotgun_King_The_Final_Checkmate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3497,'hrot',NULL,'HROT is a single-player retro FPS set in a small socialist country neighboring Soviet Union (Czechoslovakia) after an unspecified disaster in 1986. Those times were dark and terrifying and so is the game.','2023/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/824600/HROT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_73'),(3498,'infraspace',NULL,'Create an extrasolar efficiency utopia from scratch! In this sci-fi city builder you need to start mining operations, plan production, and lay down transportation routes to ensure a smooth supply chain.','2023/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1511460/InfraSpace/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3499,'everhood',NULL,'An UNCONVENTIONAL ADVENTURE RPG that takes place in an inexpressible world filled with amusing musical battles and strange delightful encounters. To put it simply: You are in for a ride.','2021/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1229380/Everhood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3500,'emergency_20',NULL,'Coordinate your team of first responders in the anniversary edition of EMERGENCY! Featuring 10 remastered classic EMERGENCY missions and three full campaigns, EMERGENCY 20 is the complete package for both experienced and new rescue commanders!','2017/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/735280/EMERGENCY_20/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3501,'rage_2',NULL,'RAGE 2 brings together two studio powerhouses – Avalanche Studios, masters of open world insanity, and id Software, creators of the first-person shooter – to deliver a carnival of carnage where you can go anywhere, shoot anything, and explode everything.','2019/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/548570/RAGE_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3502,'skater_xl_-_the_ultimate_skateboarding_game',NULL,'Experience unparalleled board control and responsiveness while you skate iconic real-world skate spots. This is the evolution of skateboarding gameplay. With Independent Foot Control and unique physics-based gameplay, skate gamers finally have the expressive controls they have always dreamed of.','2020/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/962730/Skater_XL__The_Ultimate_Skateboarding_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3503,'escape_from_mystwood_mansion',NULL,'In this first-person puzzle escape room game, you are trapped in the mysterious Mystwood mansion. Explore the mansion and find hidden compartments while solving puzzles and deciphering codes to find a way out. Will you escape or linger to uncover the mansion\'s final secret?','2023/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2292650/Escape_From_Mystwood_Mansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3504,'brothers:_a_tale_of_two_sons_remake',NULL,'Guide two brothers on an epic journey of discovery, loss, adventure and mystery remade for the latest generation of graphics, performance, and gameplay. Play in single-player mode or local co-op with a friend. This is one journey you will never forget.','2024/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2153350/Brothers_A_Tale_of_Two_Sons_Remake/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3505,'ancient_dungeon',NULL,'Ancient Dungeon VR is a fast-paced roguelite dungeon crawler built for VR. Explore procedurally generated dungeons, slash enemies, collect loot, and unlock upgrades in immersive physics-based combat. Play solo or co-op with up to 4 players.','2021/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1125240/Ancient_Dungeon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3506,'gori:_cuddly_carnage',NULL,'Humanity has been destroyed - and it\'s up to Gori, along with his deadly but wise-cracking sentient hoverboard, F.R.A.N.K, and morose AI companion, CH1-P, to shred and slay the evil Adorable Army!','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1299690/Gori_Cuddly_Carnage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3507,'observer:_system_redux',NULL,'The year is 2084. In a dark cyberpunk world shattered by plagues and wars, become a neural police detective and hack into the jagged minds of others. Make use of anything they felt, thought, or remembered to solve the case and catch the elusive killer.','2020/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1386900/Observer_System_Redux/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3508,'shin_chan:_me_and_the_professor_on_summer_vacation_the_endless_seven-day_journey',NULL,'Shin chan: Summer Vacation Experience','2022/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2061250/Shin_chan_Me_and_the_Professor_on_Summer_Vacation_The_Endless_SevenDay_Journey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3509,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_adeptus_mechanicus',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1788210/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Adeptus_Mechanicus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3510,'story_of_seasons:_a_wonderful_life',NULL,'Put down roots on your new farm in the peaceful town of Forgotten Valley. Bring life to the land by cultivating crops and raising animals, find love among the town\'s friendly folk, and make lasting memories with a family of your very own.','2023/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2111170/STORY_OF_SEASONS_A_Wonderful_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3511,'darkest_days',NULL,'DARKEST DAYS is a zombie shooting RPG set in a post-apocalyptic world devastated by a sudden zombie outbreak. Explore a dark yet captivating open world, build a sanctuary with fellow survivors, grow stronger, and fight for survival.','2025/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1548520/DARKEST_DAYS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3512,'cogmind',NULL,'Cogmind is a sci-fi roguelike epic in which you play a robot building yourself from components found or salvaged from other robots. Explore a living, breathing world through turn-based tactical combat, or sneak, hack, and fly your way to victory.','2017/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/722730/Cogmind/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3513,'quantum_witch',NULL,'A feud between old gods, a missing flock of faer, and every choice has consequences. Ren is in the middle of it all. What will her story be? You will decide in this narrative driven adventure.','2025/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3100650/Quantum_Witch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3514,'call_of_duty®:_black_ops_6_or_call_of_duty®:_warzone™_points',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2022/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2170970/Call_of_Duty_Black_Ops_6_or_Call_of_Duty_Warzone_Points/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3515,'story_of_seasons:_friends_of_mineral_town',NULL,'Experience the joys of life on the farm in this reimagining of a timeless STORY OF SEASONS classic!','2020/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/978780/STORY_OF_SEASONS_Friends_of_Mineral_Town/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3516,'castlevania:_lords_of_shadow_2',NULL,'Dracula, weak and yearning release from immortality, must reclaim his powers and defeat Satan. An epic fantasy adventure set in an expansive modern-day world!Awoken after centuries of slumber, weakened and yearning for release from his immortal bonds, Dracula must reclaim his powers and make a pact with Death, to defeat Satan and gain...','2014/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/239250/Castlevania_Lords_of_Shadow_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3517,'il-2_sturmovik:_battle_of_bodenplatte',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1198460/IL2_Sturmovik_Battle_of_Bodenplatte/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3518,'dune:_imperium_-_rise_of_ix',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dune: Imperium on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3051590/Dune_Imperium__Rise_of_Ix/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3519,'dead_by_daylight_-_ash_vs_evil_dead',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2019/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1009821/Dead_by_Daylight__Ash_vs_Evil_Dead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3520,'farmer\'s_life',NULL,'🌾Unleash the Farmer within. 🚜 Dive into the rustic charm of rural living in \"Farmer\'s Life,\" where you\'ll experience the joy and challenges of life on a vibrant farmstead. Plant, grow, and embrace a country living in a vast open world. You choose from diverse mechanics and endless possibilities.','2023/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1137750/Farmers_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3521,'primal_carnage:_extinction',NULL,'Hunt humans, slay dinosaurs. It\'s chaotic prehistoric PvP, pick a side. Think fast, or you\'re extinct!','2015/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/321360/Primal_Carnage_Extinction/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3522,'urban_strife',NULL,'Old school TBS, post-apoc survival and RPG. Recruit deranged locals in your militia, ally local factions and fight those you hate. Haul loot back and rebuild your shelter, doctor your wounds, and fix your guns. People need feeding, booze needs brewing and there is an end of the world to enjoy.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/710230/Urban_Strife/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3523,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_hunters\'_choice:_bolt-action_rifle_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3244820/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Hunters_Choice_BoltAction_Rifle_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3524,'senran_kagura_peach_beach_splash',NULL,'The buxom shinobi of SENRAN KAGURA are back, and they\'ve traded their katanas for water guns in this Third-Person Splasher! Customize your team, lead them through battles across a sprawling single-player campaign, or go online and take on teams worldwide. Come on in; the water\'s great!','2018/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/696170/SENRAN_KAGURA_Peach_Beach_Splash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3525,'hylics',NULL,'Hylics is a recreational program with light JRPG elements.','2015/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/397740/Hylics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3526,'animal_revolt_battle_simulator',NULL,'The ultimate physics-based, sandbox battle simulator where you can create funny battles between all sorts of ragdoll creatures! You can also make your own monsters with the unit creator or even join the battles yourself in the first-person mode!','2022/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1215390/Animal_Revolt_Battle_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3527,'palia_-_starter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Palia on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3720190/Palia__Starter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3528,'expansion_-_europa_universalis_iv:_emperor',NULL,'This content requires the base game Europa Universalis IV on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1259360/Expansion__Europa_Universalis_IV_Emperor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3529,'paranormasight:_the_seven_mysteries_of_honjo',NULL,'How far would you go to bring someone back from the dead? Discover the depths that some will go to in this horror-adventure game.','2023/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2106840/PARANORMASIGHT_The_Seven_Mysteries_of_Honjo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3530,'grocery_store_tycoon',NULL,'Start with a clean slate and grow your grocery store from the ground up. Buy shelves, hire employees, expand your space, and manage your business your way—whether from behind the register, in the warehouse, or from the comfort of your office.','2025/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2870330/Grocery_Store_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3531,'railgrade',NULL,'RAILGRADE is the train RTS game! Construct dense vertical railroads, build cities, construct vast factory chains with train automation! Restore an off world colony\'s economy all in the intense story driven campaign or relaxing sandbox mode!','2023/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1355090/RAILGRADE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3532,'nexomon',NULL,'Catch, evolve and collect over 300 unique Nexomon! Assemble the ultimate Nexomon team to save your friends and save the world! Clash against legendary champions and become a hero in this epic journey!','2020/7/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1191580/Nexomon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3533,'age_of_empires_ii_(retired)',NULL,'Age of Empires II has been re-imagined in high definition. With the release of Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition, this product will not be updated further.','2013/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/221380/Age_of_Empires_II_Retired/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3534,'harry_potter:_quidditch_champions_deluxe_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Harry Potter: Quidditch Champions on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3105320/Harry_Potter_Quidditch_Champions_Deluxe_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3535,'refarm',NULL,'The ocean took it all… now take it back! In this short semi-idle island builder you’ll resurface fertile farmland - tile by tile. As you plant, harvest and expand you’ll obtain helping hands and discover what else lies below the surface.','2024/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2857000/refarm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3536,'super_monkey_ball_banana_mania',NULL,'Go Bananas with your favorite monkey gang in the ultimate Super Monkey Ball adventure!','2021/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1316910/Super_Monkey_Ball_Banana_Mania/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3537,'two_point_hospital:_bigfoot',NULL,'This content requires the base game Two Point Hospital on Steam in order to play.','2018/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/966690/Two_Point_Hospital_Bigfoot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3538,'instruments_of_destruction',NULL,'Crash through walls and tear down buildings in Instruments of Destruction, a vehicle-action game featuring advanced physics-based demolition. Pilot 130+ unique vehicles across scores of challenge-packed missions or design your own contraptions and wreck highly-interactive sandbox worlds.','2024/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1428100/Instruments_of_Destruction/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3539,'train_valley_origins',NULL,'The cutest management game about trains. 🚂 Choo-choo! Manage increasingly complex railroad. The rich history of railway transport awaits! From steam engines to futuristic marvels. Explore different eras and countries and witness the evolution of train technology. 🛤️🚂🚄❤️','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3451440/Train_Valley_Origins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3540,'wild_woods',NULL,'Wild Woods is a couch co-op game full of action, teamwork and woodland critters. One to four players take on the role of brave little cats defending their wooden wagon on its way through a dangerous forest. Clever cooperation is key - their way is full of obstacles!','2024/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1975580/Wild_Woods/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3541,'regiments_-_winds_of_change',NULL,'This content requires the base game Regiments on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2542770/Regiments__Winds_of_Change/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3542,'sword_of_convallaria',NULL,'Fantasy Tactical RPG revitalizing the beloved Japanese turn-based & pixel art genre. Collect & train a roster of mercenaries, customize your squad, and use your own strategy to save the nation of Iria. Journey through a world of plot twists where every choice you make will reshape your destiny.','2024/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2526380/Sword_of_Convallaria/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3543,'combat_master:_season_4',NULL,'Join fast-paced action-packed combat. Play Combat Master -- AAA experience on any hardware. Best-in-class multiplayer gunfight. Next-level extreme performance. Lightning-speed loading time and a whole lot more.','2023/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2281730/Combat_Master_Season_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3544,'station_to_station',NULL,'‘Station to Station’ is a minimalist & relaxing game about building railway connections. Grab your conductor’s hat and bring the voxel-art world to life through the magic of trains!','2023/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2272400/Station_to_Station/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3545,'turbo_dismount®_2',NULL,'Turbo Dismount 2 is a comedy physics racing sandbox with Mr. Dismount and his friends. It is the officially ambitious sequel to the wildly popular, immensely successful, world-renowned entertainment juggernaut - Turbo Dismount.','2025/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2280350/Turbo_Dismount_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_74'),(3546,'wingspan:_european_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wingspan on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1741470/Wingspan_European_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3547,'dead_island:_riptide_definitive_edition',NULL,'Welcome to the zombie apocalypse experience of a lifetime – more beautiful than ever. Caught in an epic zombie outbreak on the tropical island of Banoi, your only thought is: Survive!','2016/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/383180/Dead_Island_Riptide_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3548,'the_legend_of_heroes:_trails_in_the_sky',NULL,'Hailed as one of the largest, longest and most meticulously detailed turn-based JRPG series of all time, this first chapter in the ongoing Trails saga sets the stage for what\'s quickly become Ys developer Nihon Falcom\'s most popular and best-selling franchise in their entire 30+ year history.','2014/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/251150/The_Legend_of_Heroes_Trails_in_the_Sky/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3549,'layers_of_fear',NULL,'All stories must come to an end, even twisted and eerie ones. The canvas. The stage. The novel. This narrative-focused psychological horror experience is ready for its final brushstrokes, its curtain call, its final chapter. Are you ready to return and face your fears one last time?','2023/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1946700/Layers_of_Fear/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3550,'a_difficult_game_about_climbing',NULL,'This is a difficult game about climbing.','2024/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2497920/A_Difficult_Game_About_Climbing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3551,'little_witch_in_the_woods',NULL,'Little Witch in the Woods tells the story of Ellie, an apprentice witch. Explore the mystical forest, help the charming residents, and experience the daily life of the witch.','2022/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1594940/Little_Witch_in_the_Woods/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3552,'dynasty_warriors_8_empires',NULL,'DYNASTY WARRIORS 8 Empires is part of the \"Empires\" series, in which you aim to conquer ancient China using both strategy and the one warrior versus one thousand tactical action the WARRIORS series is known for.','2015/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/322520/DYNASTY_WARRIORS_8_Empires/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3553,'gloomhaven_-_jaws_of_the_lion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Gloomhaven on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1809490/Gloomhaven__Jaws_of_the_Lion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3554,'receiver_2',NULL,'Receiver 2 simulates every internal part of each firearm based on manufacturer schematics and gunsmithing resources. Learn exactly how each sidearm works, including how to load and unload them, clear malfunctions, and operate their safety features.','2020/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1129310/Receiver_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3555,'cafemart_simulator',NULL,'Create and decorate your cozy cafe, where guests can enjoy delicious food and drinks. Expand your service with a supermarket offering a wide selection of fresh products, so visitors can not only have a tasty meal but also do some shopping. Play solo or with friends in cooperative mode!','2025/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3408110/Cafemart_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3556,'poker_championship',NULL,'Play the most authentic Texas Hold’em Poker App. Fair play guaranteed by the officially certified Random Number Generator implemented for every hand dealing. Compete with outstanding players throughout the world in real time and be the World Champion!','2019/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1138190/Poker_Championship/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3557,'dead_rising®',NULL,'You are Frank West. A hard-edged photojournalist hellbent on investigating the mystery at Willamette Mall. It\'s swarming with zombies. You have 72 hours. Chop \'till you drop!','2016/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/427190/DEAD_RISING/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3558,'dragon_song_tavern:_cozy_&_adventurous',NULL,'Ready to run a tavern with a Dragon companion? On this charming island, you can live out your tavern-keeping dreams. Along the way, you\'ll meet all kinds of guests, Encounter unicorns, battle Giant Elementals, and embrace adventures! Begin your journey as the Dragon Song calls!','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3148160/Dragon_Song_Tavern_Cozy__Adventurous/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3559,'astronomics',NULL,'Top-down action and space exploration meet asteroid mining automation! Navigate to randomly generated asteroids passing by and start mining. Impress your employer, upgrade your equipment, fight off pirates and save up for that ticket to Earth so you can finally come home... for the very first time.','2025/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1975520/Astronomics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3560,'lonely_mountains:_snow_riders',NULL,'Crash over and over until you master the mountain in the snowy followup to Lonely Mountains: Downhill. Now also including 2-8 person crossplatform multiplayer - work your way down the slopes together as a group, or risk it all in a breakneck race to the base!','2025/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2545360/Lonely_Mountains_Snow_Riders/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3561,'metal_garden',NULL,'Travel through an overgrown megastructure, and discover what lies beyond it. Metal Garden is a short, atmospheric singleplayer FPS game.','2025/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3539440/Metal_Garden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3562,'donut_county',NULL,'Donut County is a story-based physics puzzle game where you play as an ever-growing hole in the ground. Meet cute characters, steal their trash, and throw them in a hole.','2018/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/702670/Donut_County/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3563,'raging_loop',NULL,'The feast has begun, can you escape the village alive?','2017/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/648100/Raging_Loop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3564,'the_sexy_brutale',NULL,'The Sexy Brutale — a never-ending masked ball featuring intrigue, murder and the (quite possibly) occult! Relive the same mysterious day where the guests at the casino mansion are being murdered by the staff over and over again...','2017/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/552590/The_Sexy_Brutale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3565,'so_to_speak',NULL,'Can you learn Japanese by solving puzzles? So to Speak is a game about wandering in Japan, looking at signs, overhearing conversations, and using context clues in the environment to figure out what it all means. No background in Japanese is assumed.','2025/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1779030/So_to_Speak/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3566,'cat_god_ranch',NULL,'Lead hundreds of \"wise\" little animals to pay tribute to the Cat God!! 7 animal families, 100+ animals, 10+ Cat Gods, 100+ items, and various animal combinations waiting for you to explore!','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2797340/Cat_God_Ranch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3567,'river_city_girls_2',NULL,'The River City Girls are back! Misako, Kyoko, Kunio, and Riki - joined by newcomers Marian and Provie - hit the streets for an all-new beat-\'em-up adventure! Team up for local or online co-op and explore a massive world packed with new abilities, enemies, locations, and more!','2022/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1920480/River_City_Girls_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3568,'secret_world_legends',NULL,'Secret World Legends is a story-driven, shared-world action RPG that plunges players into a shadowy war against the supernatural, where ancient myths and legends cross over into the modern day.','2017/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/215280/Secret_World_Legends/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3569,'the_last_stand_legacy_collection',NULL,'Survive the zombie apocalypse and make humanity\'s last stand in this three-game legacy bundle, revamped for modern hardware. Explore, build, and survive for as long as you can in The Last Stand, The Last Stand 2, and The Last Stand: Union City.','2021/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1615100/The_Last_Stand_Legacy_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3570,'norco',NULL,'NORCO is a dialogue-focused point & click adventure that immerses the player in the sinking suburbs and industrial swamplands of an increasingly surreal and distorted South Louisiana.','2022/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1221250/NORCO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3571,'jump_king_quest',NULL,'The most BRUTAL Platforming-Action-Multiplayer-RPG in THE WORLD with NO Game-Over, only falling down… Defy the fiends of The Heights TOGETHER or alone to rise as KING on your Quest to The Smoking Hot Babe at the Top!','2025/2/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2317640/JUMP_KING_QUEST/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3572,'mark_of_the_ninja:_remastered',NULL,'In Mark of the Ninja, you\'ll know what it is to truly be a ninja. You must be silent, agile and clever to outwit your opponents in a world of gorgeous scenery and flowing animation.','2018/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/860950/Mark_of_the_Ninja_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3573,'zombie_army_vr',NULL,'Zombie Hitler may have been defeated, but the zombie hordes are still at large and Europe remains in the throes of war. Return to the field as part of the Deadhunters, an elite squad fighting to end the zombie apocalypse!','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2058030/Zombie_Army_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3574,'creaks',NULL,'The ground starts shaking, light bulbs are breaking - and something rather unusual is happening right behind the walls of your very room. Equipped with nothing but wit and courage, you slowly descend into a world inhabited by avian folk and seemingly deadly furniture monsters.','2020/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/956030/Creaks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3575,'farewell_north',NULL,'Play as a border collie and restore color to your human’s world in an atmospheric journey through the northern isles of Scotland. Explore land and sea, uncover hidden paths, herd animals and free wildlife to bring color back to her world, while revealing an emotional story about saying farewell.','2024/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1432850/Farewell_North/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3576,'line_war',NULL,'A new type of RTS-style game with elements from 4X, Wargame, and Real-Time Tactics genres. Draw commands and execute a superior strategy to win over your opponent without the need for micro-management.','2022/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1309610/Line_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3577,'american_truck_simulator_-_jcb_equipment_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2926440/American_Truck_Simulator__JCB_Equipment_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3578,'monster_con_-_damien_&_valerie_(playable_character_pack)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Prom 4: Monster Con on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3610660/Monster_Con__Damien__Valerie_Playable_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3579,'wall_world',NULL,'Explore the mysterious Wall World on your giant robospider: mine for valuable resources, upgrade your equipment to fight off hordes of monsters, and discover exotic biomes in-between attacks. Will you be able to survive and learn the secrets of the Wall World?','2023/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2187290/Wall_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3580,'hollow_knight_-_gods_&_nightmares',NULL,'This is additional content for Hollow Knight, but does not include the base game.','2018/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/916000/Hollow_Knight__Gods__Nightmares/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3581,'teenage_mutant_ninja_turtles:_the_cowabunga_collection',NULL,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: The Cowabunga Collection contains thirteen prior released classic games. This collection is a great place for gamers to experience these popular titles on Steam.','2022/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1659600/Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_The_Cowabunga_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3582,'castlevania:_lords_of_shadow_–_ultimate_edition',NULL,'Castlevania: Lords of Shadow – Ultimate Edition is the complete edition of Castlevania: Lords of Shadow, a dark and vivid new re-imagining of the Castlevania mythology. It is the end of days and ungodly powers isolate the Earth.','2013/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/234080/Castlevania_Lords_of_Shadow__Ultimate_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3583,'quake_ii',NULL,'You are humanity’s last hope to stop the Strogg, a hostile alien race waging war against Earth. Play this military sci-fi FPS, now upgraded for modern platforms with improved visuals, new campaign content, online multiplayer/co-op, and more.','1997/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2320/Quake_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3584,'near-mage',NULL,'You have been invited to stay in Transylvania for the summer... Only to find out that you come from a long line of witches. Meet your new vampyre and strigoi classmates, embrace your destiny, and enroll in the Transylvanian Institute for Magick! A supernatural adventure made in Transylvania.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1685870/NearMage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3585,'half-life:_blue_shift',NULL,'Made by Gearbox Software and originally released in 2001 as an add-on to Half-Life, Blue Shift is a return to the Black Mesa Research Facility in which you play as Barney Calhoun, the security guard sidekick who helped Gordon out of so many sticky situations.','2001/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/130/HalfLife_Blue_Shift/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3586,'youtubers_life_2',NULL,'Start from humble beginnings and take charge of the daily life of a wannabe influencer. Balance your day between creating trend-based content, completing tasks to earn money, and building trust with your neighbors to uncover their stories. Are you ready to embark on your road to fame?','2021/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1493760/Youtubers_Life_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3587,'starstruck_vagabond',NULL,'A space captain accidentally freezes themselves for two thousand years, finding themselves in an unfamiliar galaxy. Fortunately, there\'s always someone who needs cargo delivered.','2024/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2448930/Starstruck_Vagabond/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3588,'cube_escape_collection',NULL,'In this classic point-and-click adventure anthology you follow the path of Dale and Laura and other famous Rusty lake characters such as Mr. Crow and Mr. Owl. The series will be updated, preserved and bundled to survive the end of the Flash Games era.','2020/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1292940/Cube_Escape_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3589,'spongebob_squarepants™:_the_patrick_star_game',NULL,'Step into Patrick’s shorts and create hilarious, physics-based mayhem, as you make the open world of Bikini Bottom your playground!','2024/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2322380/SpongeBob_SquarePants_The_Patrick_Star_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3590,'private_military_manager:_tactical_auto_battler',NULL,'You are the CEO of a private military company. Recruit capable mercenaries, purchase weapons, and develop your mercenaries according to their roles and characteristics. Observe how your mercenaries perform in combat and plan your tactics to ensure mission success.','2025/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2564320/Private_Military_Manager_Tactical_Auto_Battler/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3591,'creeper_world_ixe',NULL,'The unstoppable alien force known as The Creeper has returned, devouring thousands of worlds in its path, and yours is next. Battle against the Creeper fluid in a groundbreaking pixel-level simulation to prove that humanity will rule the galaxy forever!','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2257010/Creeper_World_IXE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3592,'the_oregon_trail',NULL,'The Oregon Trail is back in a beautiful blend of charming pixel art characters, 3D environments, and cutting-edge lighting and visual effects!','2022/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2013360/The_Oregon_Trail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3593,'paper_trail',NULL,'Paper Trail is a top-down puzzle adventure about leaving home, set in a foldable, paper world.','2024/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1889740/Paper_Trail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3594,'the_sims™_4_comfy_gamer_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2815440/The_Sims_4_Comfy_Gamer_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_75'),(3595,'mmorpg_tycoon_2',NULL,'MMORPG Tycoon 2 is a single-player world-builder game about creating the greatest MMORPG of all time – yours.','2020/1/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/486860/MMORPG_Tycoon_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3596,'a_highland_song',NULL,'Moira McKinnon is running away. A wild adventure through the Scottish Highlands, with open platforming and dynamic storytelling, maps and music. From the creators of Heaven\'s Vault and 80 Days.','2023/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1240060/A_Highland_Song/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3597,'castleminer_z',NULL,'CastleMiner Z is an infinite world filled with deep places to explore, and horrifying monsters to slay. Build structures out of blocks, craft weapons and tools from raw materials, and explore the vast and frightening world around you.','2011/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/253430/CastleMiner_Z/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3598,'gothic_1',NULL,'War has been waged across the kingdom of Myrtana. Orcish hordes invaded human territory and the king of the land needed a lot of ore to forge enough weapons, should his army stand against this threat. Whoever breaks the law in these darkest of times is sentenced to serve in the giant penal colony of Khorinis, mining the so much needed...','2001/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/65540/Gothic_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3599,'bugtopia',NULL,'300+ lifelike bugs to collect and grow—breed them to unlock rare species! Customize your terrarium with 300+ landscaping items and 70+ backgrounds. A tiny, soothing nature escape on your screen!🦋🐌🦗🐝🐞🐛🦐','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2988300/Bugtopia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3600,'white_shadows',NULL,'The wolves are watching! Venture through a captivating but brutal dystopia where our young adventurer Ravengirl will travel through this huge city’s brightest highs and delve to its darkest depths on her perilous journey of discovery and finding her destiny where hope seems in short supply.','2021/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1158890/White_Shadows/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3601,'warhammer_40,000:_battlesector_-_sisters_of_battle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2011980/Warhammer_40000_Battlesector__Sisters_of_Battle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3602,'limbo',NULL,'Uncertain of his sister\'s fate, a boy enters LIMBO','2011/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/48000/LIMBO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3603,'victoria_ii',NULL,'Carefully guide your nation from the era of absolute monarchies in the early 19th century, through expansion and colonization, to finally become a truly great power by the dawn of the 20th century. Victoria II is a grand strategy game played during the colonial era of the 19th century, where the player takes control of a country, guiding...','2010/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/42960/Victoria_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3604,'approaching_infinity',NULL,'Approaching Infinity is a turn-based space RPG in the spirit of the sci-fi classics, with endless progression and exploration. Fight tactical battles or use diplomacy. Seek powerful artifacts. Quest, mine, trade, and craft. Level up forever or attempt 10 victories in hardcore or adventure mode.','2025/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/551620/Approaching_Infinity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3605,'epic_battle_fantasy_5',NULL,'A turn-based RPG adventure, full of video game references, juvenile dialogue, and anime fanservice... and also strategic combat, monster catching, and tons of treasure hunting! Updated with tons of new content!','2018/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/432350/Epic_Battle_Fantasy_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3606,'vanquish',NULL,'PlatinumGames’ revolutionary sci-fi action shooter slide-boosts onto PC. Battle legions of future-tech enemies using a vast arsenal of weapons, including all DLC. Fully unlocked framerate and gorgeous HD resolutions up to 4K. The definitive way to play: war has accelerated.','2017/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/460810/Vanquish/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3607,'hush_hush_-_only_your_love_can_save_them',NULL,'A Visual Novel with a twist - improve skills, charm girls, and learn dangerous secrets... by any means necessary.','2023/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/782250/Hush_Hush__Only_Your_Love_Can_Save_Them/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3608,'warno_-_nemesis_#3_-_homefront',NULL,'This content requires the base game WARNO on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3333260/WARNO__Nemesis_3__Homefront/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3609,'summer_pockets',NULL,'From the creators of Angel Beats! and CLANNAD, Key, comes their latest emotional, award-winning journey. Follow protagonist Takahara Hairi as he travels to the secluded island Torishirojima, where he rediscovers what it means to enjoy summer vacation.','2018/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/897220/Summer_Pockets/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3610,'the_quinfall',NULL,'Embark on an adventurous journey to explore the Quinfall universe. Be a part of unique battles and an immersive story with dozens of different professions in the depths of medieval times in an all-new MMORPG experience.','2025/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2294660/The_Quinfall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3611,'cash_cleaner_simulator_-_luxury_loadout',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cash Cleaner Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3660310/Cash_Cleaner_Simulator__Luxury_Loadout/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3612,'monster_con_-_aaravi_&_milo_(playable_character_pack)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Prom 4: Monster Con on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3610600/Monster_Con__Aaravi__Milo_Playable_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3613,'nekopara_vol._1',NULL,'What\'s NEKOPARA? Why, it\'s a cat paradise! Kashou Minaduki, the son of a long line of Japanese confection makers moved out to open his own shop \"La Soleil\" as a patisserie.','2014/12/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/333600/NEKOPARA_Vol_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3614,'airline_manager',NULL,'Create and manage your own airline. Create both passenger and cargo routes all over the world while you upgrade and expand your fleet of airplanes and airports. Airline Manager is among the most realistic of its genre - so prove yourself and beat your friends and other real life managers.','2021/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1641650/Airline_Manager/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3615,'earth_defense_force_4.1_the_shadow_of_new_despair',NULL,'It\'s a fight for the future of the planet between the Ravagers, a merciless swarm of alien invaders, and the Earth Defense Force (EDF) in this third-person shooter.Play as four different classes in over 80 missions with a range of 800 weapons at your disposal.Co-op play supported.','2016/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/410320/EARTH_DEFENSE_FORCE_41_The_Shadow_of_New_Despair/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3616,'deep_rock_galactic_-_supporter_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Deep Rock Galactic on Steam in order to play.','2018/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/801860/Deep_Rock_Galactic__Supporter_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3617,'f1®_25_iconic_edition_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game F1® 25 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3493830/F1_25_Iconic_Edition_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3618,'true_fear:_forsaken_souls_part_3',NULL,'True Fear: Forsaken Souls Part 3 is the final chapter of the psychological thriller trilogy. With point-and-click mechanics, intricate puzzles, and cinematic cutscenes, immerse yourself in a dark horror experience that redefines the genre.','2025/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3168310/True_Fear_Forsaken_Souls_Part_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3619,'hitman_3_-_sarajevo_six_campaign_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game HITMAN World of Assassination on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2475260/HITMAN_3__Sarajevo_Six_Campaign_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3620,'chaos;child',NULL,'From the creators of the critically acclaimed STEINS;GATE comes a sensational new visual novel: CHAOS;CHILD. Set in Shibuya in 2015, a group of high school students who survived an earthquake six years ago find themselves at the center of a new series of bizarre murders in the city.','2019/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/970570/CHAOSCHILD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3621,'roadwarden',NULL,'Roadwarden is an illustrated text-based RPG that uses isometric pixel art and combines mechanics borrowed from RPGs, Visual Novels, adventure games and interactive fiction.','2022/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1155970/Roadwarden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3622,'severed_steel',NULL,'An intense single-player FPS featuring a stylish movement system, completely destructible levels, and an acclaimed OST.','2021/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1227690/Severed_Steel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3623,'nordic_ashes:_survivors_of_ragnarok',NULL,'Nordic Ashes: Survivors of Ragnarok, is a challenging Norse inspired roguelite-survivor game, where you’ll have to survive hordes of creatures that come your way.','2024/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2068280/Nordic_Ashes_Survivors_of_Ragnarok/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3624,'galactic_civilizations_iv_-_megastructures',NULL,'This content requires the base game Galactic Civilizations IV on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2671160/Galactic_Civilizations_IV__Megastructures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3625,'house_builder',NULL,'Become a one-man construction crew! Travel around the world and through the ages to build iconic designs! Beware of unpleasant temperatures and dangerous fauna!','2024/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1244630/House_Builder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3626,'4story_:_the_original',NULL,'Between Berkilious, the God of Destruction, and Lea, the Goddess of creation, long-lasting antagonism has repeated numerous creations and destructions. In the name of the Goddess Lea, exists the world of Iveria. In this world of chaos, will there be a hero to end this war once and for all?','2025/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3609170/4STORY__The_Original/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3627,'planetbase',NULL,'Guide a group of space settlers trying to establish a base on a remote planet. Grow food, collect energy, mine resources, survive disasters and build a self-sufficient colony in a harsh and unforgiving environment.','2015/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/403190/Planetbase/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3628,'the_messenger',NULL,'As a demon army besieges his village, a young ninja ventures through a cursed world, to deliver a scroll paramount to his clan’s survival. What begins as a classic action platformer soon unravels into an expansive time-traveling adventure full of thrills, surprises, and humor.','2018/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/764790/The_Messenger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3629,'tiny_terry\'s_turbo_trip',NULL,'Terry wants to launch himself into space using his new car. Doing something this cool and reckless will surely make him the talk of the town. Run, drive and glide through this small journey of big discoveries as Terry works towards achieving this goal.','2024/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2238040/Tiny_Terrys_Turbo_Trip/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3630,'gatekeeper',NULL,'Gatekeeper is a fast-paced rogue-like. Go on a quest to chase down Chaos and reclaim the stolen Heart of Time, fighting your way through relentless enemy forces. Play solo or in 4-player co-op and become the next Gatekeeper!','2024/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2106670/Gatekeeper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3631,'nikoderiko:_the_magical_world_—_director’s_cut',NULL,'Jump into adventure in Nikoderiko: The Magical World - Director\'s Cut, a love letter to platformers! Play in single-player or couch co-op, and enjoy 8 colorful worlds, classic platforming challenges, and music by legendary composer David Wise.','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2374190/Nikoderiko_The_Magical_World__Directors_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3632,'laysara:_summit_kingdom',NULL,'Build and expand your very own settlements in high mountains! Carefully plan production chains and satisfy various needs of your three-caste society while dealing with mountain hazards such as weather breakdowns and avalanches. Are you skilled enough to make your town thrive?','2024/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1823950/Laysara_Summit_Kingdom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3633,'crypt_of_the_necrodancer:_hatsune_miku_character_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crypt of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2828720/Crypt_of_the_NecroDancer_Hatsune_Miku_Character_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3634,'moving_out',NULL,'Moving Out is a ridiculous physics-based moving simulator that brings new meaning to \"couch co-op\"! Are you ready for an exciting career in furniture? As a newly certified Furniture Arrangement & Relocation Technician, you’ll take on moving jobs all across the busy town of Packmore.','2020/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/996770/Moving_Out/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3635,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_jeep_|_ram_remastered_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2889700/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__Jeep__RAM_Remastered_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3636,'simcity™_3000_unlimited',NULL,'SimCity 3000 Unlimited brings you the classic strategy gaming of SimCity 3000 with all-new scenarios that open up a whole world of city planning and building possibilities! The thrills of the classic SimCity 3000 are here again!','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2741560/SimCity_3000_Unlimited/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_76'),(3637,'house_party_-_detective_liz_katz_in_a_gritty_kitty_murder_mystery_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base 