l_War_ROME_II__Nomadic_Tribes_Culture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3649,'cooking_simulator_vr',NULL,'Become the ultimate chef in VR! Take control of a highly polished, realistic kitchen equipped with all kinds of utensils and stands. Unlock and master over 80 recipes or use dozens of lifelike ingredients to cook everything you like. A simulator spiced up with a dash of real-life physics!','2021/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1358140/Cooking_Simulator_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3650,'homeworld_remastered_collection',NULL,'Experience the epic space strategy games that redefined the RTS genre. Control your fleet and build an armada across more than 30 single-player missions. Choose unit types, fleet formations and flight tactics for each strategic situation.','2015/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/244160/Homeworld_Remastered_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3651,'etrian_odyssey_hd',NULL,'Beyond the village of Etria lies a mysterious forest with a colossal crack opening to a puzzling labyrinth. Lead a team of explorers into the dungeon with the promise of riches, fame, and adventure!','2023/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1868180/Etrian_Odyssey_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3652,'paladins®',NULL,'Paladins is the ultimate fantasy team-based shooter experience, with over 50 customizable Champions fighting in 5v5 action across a diverse Realm of modes and maps!','2018/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/444090/Paladins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3653,'iratus:_lord_of_the_dead',NULL,'Iratus: Lord of the Dead is a turn-based tactical roguelike RPG set in a dark fantasy universe. Lead an army of undead to help an angry necromancer in his quest to reach the surface world and bring death to the mortal realms!','2020/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/807120/Iratus_Lord_of_the_Dead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3654,'chaos;head_noah',NULL,'CHAOS;HEAD NOAH is now available on Steam!','202