dia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3686,'bloons_td_5',NULL,'Five-star tower defense with unrivaled depth and replayability. The Bloons are back in full HD glory and this time they mean business! Build awesome towers, choose your favorite upgrades, hire new Special Agents, and pop every last invading Bloon in the most popular tower defense series in history.','2014/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/306020/Bloons_TD_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3687,'worms_ultimate_mayhem',NULL,'Load your weapons and experience a whole new dimension in destructive turn-based cartoon action!','2011/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/70600/Worms_Ultimate_Mayhem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3688,'omsi_2_add-on_london',NULL,'This content requires the base game OMSI 2: Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/434063/OMSI_2_AddOn_London/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3689,'what_the_golf?',NULL,'A silly physics-based golf parody where every golf course is a new surprising type of golf, some brilliant or hilarious, others so absurd you will ask yourself: WHAT THE GOLF?','2020/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/785790/WHAT_THE_GOLF/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3690,'prodeus',NULL,'Prodeus is a first-person shooter of old, re-imagined using modern rendering techniques and technology. Experience the quality you’d expect from a modern AAA game, designed with retro aesthetics and gameplay that invoke the tech-imposed limits of older hardware.','2022/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/964800/Prodeus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3691,'hollowbody',NULL,'A tech-noir survival horror short story, set in the urban decay of a long abandoned British city. Solve environmental puzzles, manage limited resources and fight for a way to escape beyond the wall.','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2123640/Hollowbody/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3692,'wwe_2k25_new_wave_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game WWE 2K25 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3401650/WWE_2K25_New_Wave_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_77'),(3693,'one-armed_robber',NULL,'One-armed robber is a chaotic first-person heist game that centers around a uniquely challenging premise. Players take the role of a determined robber equipped with only one arm, tasked with pulling off daring heists on banks, shops, and various establishments.','2023/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2551020/Onearmed_robber/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3694,'tormented_souls',NULL,'Classic survival horror is back! Inspired by the original Resident Evil and Alone in the Dark series, Tormented Souls modernises with a fresh twist on the fixed perspective adventure - as Caroline Walker investigates the mysterious disappearance of twin girls in a terrifying mansion-turned-hospital.','2021/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1367590/Tormented_Souls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3695,'killer7',NULL,'Sneak into a world of underground assassins as Harman Smith, a man who manifests 7 deadly personalities, the killer7. Take control of this distinct murderers\' row as they hunt down the sinister Kun Lan to thwart his plan of world dominance.','2018/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/868520/killer7/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3696,'supraland',NULL,'Try the demo! A mix between Portal, Zelda and Metroid. Exploration, puzzles, terrible combat, secret upgrades and new abilities that help you reach new places. Playtime 12-25h.','2019/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/813630/Supraland/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3697,'trimps',NULL,'A text-based incremental idle game with a ridiculous amount of unique content. Automate old stuff as you unlock new stuff to keep things interesting for hours and hours, no spam clicking necessary! Trimps is everything you love about your favorite games, distilled to their purest form.','2022/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1877960/Trimps/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3698,'space_engineers_-_warfare_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2022/2/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1783760/Space_Engineers__Warfare_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3699,'summer_memories+_-_expansion_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Summer Memories on Steam in order to play.','2021/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1390150/Summer_Memories__Expansion_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3700,'anonymous_hacker_simulator',NULL,'Step into the shoes of a skilled Anonymous hacker and embark on a mission to unveil the truth hidden behind a sinister organization\'s plans to monitor civilian data and enforce mass surveillance.','2024/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2487060/Anonymous_Hacker_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3701,'baldur\'s_gate:_dark_alliance',NULL,'A new legacy begins...','2021/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1695830/Baldurs_Gate_Dark_Alliance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3702,'lyca',NULL,'A small, relaxing, incremental game about restoring a barren wasteland into a lush meadow. Help the magical wolf Lyca run through the land, gather resources, and unlock a vast upgrade tree.','2025/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3421300/Lyca/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3703,'activation_bundle_-_tom_clancy’s_the_division_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tom Clancy’s The Division® 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3268800/Activation_Bundle__Tom_Clancys_The_Division_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3704,'bastion',NULL,'Discover the secrets of the Calamity, a surreal catastrophe that shattered the world to pieces.','2011/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/107100/Bastion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3705,'two_point_hospital:_speedy_recovery',NULL,'This content requires the base game Two Point Hospital on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1901750/Two_Point_Hospital_Speedy_Recovery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3706,'railroads_online',NULL,'Build your dream railroad across a huge open world! You can build tracks and stations, drive detailed locomotives, and transport goods to earn money and experience. Play exciting Online Multiplayer sessions with your friends or create your very own sandbox!','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1696810/Railroads_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3707,'gal*gun_returns',NULL,'The infamous ecchi rail-shooter is back! Fight back with pheromones as girls throw themselves at you and try to find true love in less than a day! Discover a beautifully reimagined version of the first game of the series that never came to the west!','2021/2/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1425730/GalGun_Returns/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3708,'automobilista_2_-_formula_hitech',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2697780/Automobilista_2__Formula_HiTech/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3709,'atomic_exile',NULL,'Atomic Exile is a top down post-apocalyptic extraction shooter set in the desert wastelands of near future America. You will visit enclaves, explore devastated ruins and encounter NPCs such as other survivors, raiders, mutated beasts and rogue machines.','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2956440/Atomic_Exile/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3710,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_mercedes-benz_remastered_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2112232/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__MercedesBenz_Remastered_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3711,'bionic_bay',NULL,'A scientist uses a unique teleportation instrument to escape an ancient biomechanical world filled with imaginative technology, deadly traps, and hidden secrets.','2025/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1928690/Bionic_Bay/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3712,'atelier_marie_remake:_the_alchemist_of_salburg',NULL,'It\'s not about saving the world. In this \"leisure adventure RPG,\" failing student Marie pursues alchemy, adventures, and quests while aiming to graduate in five years. \"Atelier Marie,\" the origin of the Atelier series, has been remade with new elements!','2023/7/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2138090/Atelier_Marie_Remake_The_Alchemist_of_Salburg/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3713,'riichi_city_×_overlord',NULL,'Riichi City is a competitive urban-style Anime mahjong game, featuring beginner-friendly mahjong tutorials, Ranked Matches and tournaments crowded with masters! Spice up the experience with our ACG characters voiced by famous CVs, and attractive items and decorations! Set off for Riichi City now!','2022/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1954420/Riichi_City_x_OVERLORD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3714,'baldur\'s_gate:_siege_of_dragonspear',NULL,'This content requires the base game Baldur\'s Gate: Enhanced Edition on Steam in order to play.','2016/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/385970/Baldurs_Gate_Siege_of_Dragonspear/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3715,'noun_town_language_learning',NULL,'Gain new vocab while playing a game! Learn 1,000+ words & phrases in a world that regains color as you learn. Test your skills with mini-games and talk to the local villagers. Learn Japanese, Korean, Chinese, Spanish, & more…','2023/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2313720/Noun_Town_Language_Learning/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3716,'two_point_hospital:_a_stitch_in_time',NULL,'This content requires the base game Two Point Hospital on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1498090/Two_Point_Hospital_A_Stitch_in_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3717,'prison_simulator',NULL,'Get a taste of prison life! Become a prison guard and deal with dangerous convicts. Prison management, lots of daily activities. Will you become the best guard in history? Or maybe you\'ll turn into the worst scumbag this Prison has ever seen?','2021/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/842180/Prison_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3718,'succubus',NULL,'Become a demonic priestess of lust and use her unique skills to take revenge on your enemies. Regain your kingdom making hell tremble under your hooves! Leave no one alive if they won\'t bend the knee.','2021/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/985830/SUCCUBUS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3719,'arise:_a_simple_story',NULL,'Embark on an emotional journey of losing the love of one\'s life. Manipulate time, solve puzzles, reshape surroundings as you push forward into the bittersweet recollections of a past life. This is a story about happiness and hardship, joy and sorrow. A story that all of us will one day experience.','2020/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/866140/Arise_A_Simple_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3720,'xenotilt:_hostile_pinball_action',NULL,'LIGHTNING STRIKES AGAIN!! XENOTILT, the sequel to the cult hit, DEMON\'S TILT. Get ready for another PINBALL FANTASY. XENOTILT shreds the envelope with face-melting gameplay & graphics.','2024/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2008980/XENOTILT_HOSTILE_PINBALL_ACTION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3721,'pro_soccer_online',NULL,'Pro Soccer Online is a 1st/3rd person, highly skill based, online multiplayer soccer game. It offers a sports game experience unlike any other with smooth, physics based, input driven gameplay that is competitive and rewarding with no pay to win mechanics.','2021/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1583320/Pro_Soccer_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3722,'endzone_2',NULL,'Endzone 2 is a post-apocalyptic survival colony builder, where you embark to secure humanity\'s survival after a cataclysmic disaster. Discover and repopulate the last habitable grounds, while the survival of your people hinges on your wits, foresight, and resilience in a harsh and unforgiving world.','2024/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2144640/Endzone_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3723,'cricket_captain_2024',NULL,'Build your own dream team with Cricket Captain 2024. New commentary from Daniel Norcross tells the story of your matches. Honours boards showing every international century and five-wicket hall across all formats at every ground. Score predictor helps you manage your matches.','2024/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2900670/Cricket_Captain_2024/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3724,'day_of_the_tentacle_remastered',NULL,'Originally released by LucasArts in 1993 as a sequel to Ron Gilbert’s ground breaking Maniac Mansion, Day of the Tentacle is back in a remastered edition that features all new hand-drawn, high resolution artwork, with remastered audio, music and sound effects.','2016/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/388210/Day_of_the_Tentacle_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3725,'world_of_outlaws:_dirt_racing_24_gold_edition',NULL,'iRacing presents the Official Game of The World of Outlaws, featuring the World of Outlaws Sprint Car, Late Models and Super DIRTcar Big Block Modifieds, as well as 8 additional series including the all-new Micro Sprints, and many others.','2025/2/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3281130/World_of_Outlaws_Dirt_Racing_24_Gold_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3726,'emergency_4_deluxe',NULL,'Coordinate firefighters, police, medical personnel and specialists in the classic EMERGENCY 4 Deluxe! Now with the previously untranslated bonus missions in English.','2006/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/757210/EMERGENCY_4_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3727,'industry_giant_4.0',NULL,'Build an industrial empire from scratch in Industry Giant 4.0. Produce goods, build up your industries, construct transportation networks, plan production, manage finances, and navigate global events. Become the next business tycoon and write history!','2024/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1129570/Industry_Giant_40/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3728,'borderlands_2:_ultimate_vault_hunter_upgrade_pack_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Borderlands 2 on Steam in order to play.','2013/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/224180/Borderlands_2_Ultimate_Vault_Hunter_Upgrade_Pack_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3729,'world_of_horror',NULL,'Experience the quiet terror of this 1-bit love letter to Junji Ito and H.P. Lovecraft. Navigate a hellish roguelite reality with turn-based combat and unforgiving choices. Experiment with your deck of event cards to discover new forms of cosmic horror in every playthrough. The inevitable awaits...','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/913740/WORLD_OF_HORROR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3730,'cepheus_protocol',NULL,'Cepheus Protocol is an Open World RTS Military Survival Game. Play as the CERC hunting Patient 0, maintain Quarantine camps, fight dangerous mutations & Rogue Civilian Combatants . There’s nobody else coming, it’s up to you now.','2020/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/979640/Cepheus_Protocol/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3731,'passpartout_2:_the_lost_artist',NULL,'Embark on your struggling artist adventure. Draw and sell art to cheeky critics to reclaim your lost art career. Explore the endearing art-starved town of Phénix and show them you\'re a true artist!','2023/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1571100/Passpartout_2_The_Lost_Artist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3732,'night_of_the_dead',NULL,'\'Night of the Dead\' is an open-world game that combines elements of exploration, tower defense, survival, and crafting. Traverse a world dominated by zombies while collecting various resources and powerful equipment. Build a fortress to survive the hordes of zombies that swarm every night!','2020/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1377380/Night_of_the_Dead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3733,'sam_&_max_save_the_world',NULL,'An open-and-shut case of petty vandalism balloons into a far-flung mind-control conspiracy involving former child stars, the media, the mafia, the government, the internet, and the bright side of the moon. Telltale\'s episodic classic, lovingly remastered by members of the original development team.','2020/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1440440/Sam__Max_Save_the_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3734,'star_wars™_battlefront_(classic,_2004)',NULL,'Fight the greatest battles in the STAR WARS universe any way you want to. The choice is yours.','2004/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1058020/STAR_WARS_Battlefront_Classic_2004/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3735,'proverbs',NULL,'Proverbs is a picross/minesweeper hybrid featuring a single ENORMOUS puzzle, inspired by Bruegel the Elder\'s 1559 painting \"Netherlandish Proverbs\"','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3083300/Proverbs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3736,'captain_blood',NULL,'Captain Blood is a pirate-themed action game where you play as a fearsome pirate seeking gold and glory. Expect adventures with cannon firing, pistol shooting, swashbuckling sword fights, and plenty of pirate shenanigans. This hack\'n\'slash features fierce combat, hordes of enemies and flashy combos.','2025/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3040220/Captain_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3737,'i_expect_you_to_die_2:_the_spy_and_the_liar',NULL,'Become an elite super spy ready for espionage, explosives, and gadgets galore. This popular escape-the-room VR franchise is back with more ingenious puzzles, cunning villains, and dangerous locales.','2021/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1499120/I_Expect_You_To_Die_2_The_Spy_and_the_Liar/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3738,'space_engineers_deluxe',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2016/12/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/573160/Space_Engineers_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3739,'cities:_skylines_-_natural_disasters',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2016/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/515191/Cities_Skylines__Natural_Disasters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_78'),(3740,'cities:_skylines_-_natural_disasters',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2016/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/515191/Cities_Skylines__Natural_Disasters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3741,'across_the_obelisk:_sands_of_ulminin',NULL,'This content requires the base game Across the Obelisk on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2511580/Across_The_Obelisk_Sands_of_Ulminin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3742,'rift_riff',NULL,'Jump a rift, fight off monsters, plunder their world. A strategic mix of juicy tower loadouts, varied monster behaviors, and forgiving mechanics.','2025/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2800900/Rift_Riff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3743,'spirit_island_-_jagged_earth',NULL,'This content requires the base game Spirit Island on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2419041/Spirit_Island__Jagged_Earth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3744,'battletech_urban_warfare',NULL,'This content requires the base game BATTLETECH on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1047180/BATTLETECH_Urban_Warfare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3745,'call_of_duty®:_black_ops_iii_-_zombies_chronicles',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of Duty®: Black Ops III on Steam in order to play.','2017/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/581450/Call_of_Duty_Black_Ops_III__Zombies_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3746,'warhammer:_vermintide_2_-_back_to_ubersreik',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer: Vermintide 2 on Steam in order to play.','2018/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/975400/Warhammer_Vermintide_2__Back_to_Ubersreik/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3747,'railroad_corporation',NULL,'Relive the pioneering spirit of the Golden Age of Steam by establishing your own railroad empire across 19th century North America. Bring settlements together, produce and trade goods and develop new technologies to stay ahead of the competition. Want more? RAILROAD CORPORATION 2 Out Now!','2019/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/797400/Railroad_Corporation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3748,'none_shall_intrude',NULL,'Venture into None Shall Intrude, a roguelite deck-builder with tile-based combat where you become a powerful Raid Boss. Epic battles, intricate strategies, and the ever-present threat of heroic challengers seeking to vanquish your reign. Will you conquer all or fall to valiant heroes?','2025/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2518630/None_Shall_Intrude/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3749,'the_sims_3:_supernatural',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2012/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/223593/The_Sims_3_Supernatural/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3750,'puyo_puyo™_tetris®_2',NULL,'Japan’s beloved puzzle game series Puyo Puyo and the world-renowned Tetris® game franchise have teamed up again to deliver even more Puyo-popping and Tetrimino-clearing fun in Puyo Puyo Tetris 2.','2021/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1259790/Puyo_Puyo_Tetris_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3751,'book_of_hours:_house_of_light',NULL,'This content requires the base game BOOK OF HOURS on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2834350/BOOK_OF_HOURS_HOUSE_OF_LIGHT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3752,'exit_the_gungeon',NULL,'Exit the Gungeon is a small, spin-off \'dungeon climber\' immediately following the adventures of the misfit Gungeoneers.','2020/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1209490/Exit_the_Gungeon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3753,'king_of_retail_2',NULL,'Ready to build another empire? Build your career as a retail manager, from Bodega to Boardroom. Design your store, hire the right employees, and hustle to grow your business. Can you handle the pressure, or will you be a buck short? Welcome to King of Retail 2.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2425150/King_of_Retail_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3754,'rift_of_the_necrodancer:_supporter_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rift of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3467170/Rift_of_the_NecroDancer_Supporter_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3755,'dirt_5',NULL,'DIRT 5 is a fun, amplified, off-road arcade racing experience created by Codemasters. Blaze a trail on routes across the world, covering gravel, ice, snow and sand, with a roster of cars ranging from rally icons to trucks, to GT heroes.','2020/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1038250/DIRT_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3756,'made_in_abyss:_binary_star_falling_into_darkness',NULL,'Experience the awesome power of the Curse of the Abyss, as well as the astonishing, legendary entities known as primeval creatures. Prepare to glimpse the world of Riko and her friends.','2022/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1324340/Made_in_Abyss_Binary_Star_Falling_into_Darkness/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3757,'elroy_and_the_aliens',NULL,'It\'s the year 1993. Talking robots, ghosts from the past, and ancient alien technology buried under desert sand. An adventure following Elroy and Peggie in the search of a long-lost father. How far would you go to bring back the ones you love?','2025/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1082190/Elroy_and_the_Aliens/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3758,'ib',NULL,'A 2D exploration adventure game set in a creepy, mysterious art gallery.','2022/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1901370/Ib/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3759,'planetary_annihilation:_titans',NULL,'Wage war across entire solar systems with massive armies at your command. Annihilate enemy forces with world-shattering TITAN-class units, and demolish planets with massive super weapons!','2015/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/386070/Planetary_Annihilation_TITANS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3760,'ww2_rebuilder',NULL,'Build the new future of Europe! Flip, renovate, repair and rebuild places destroyed during World War 2. Get to know the history and stories of civilians. Play an immersive building simulator with grappling storytelling.','2023/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1573280/WW2_Rebuilder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3761,'hard_time_iii',NULL,'The toughest prison sim in the yard is back to serve its 3rd consecutive sentence - combining classic moments from the OG with the best aspects of 2D, while putting out a few hits of its own! Tackle crime from either side of the prison fence, while a larger world beyond it makes life worth living.','2024/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3009850/Hard_Time_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3762,'victoria_3:_voice_of_the_people',NULL,'This content requires the base game Victoria 3 on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2282100/Victoria_3_Voice_of_the_People/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3763,'shenmue_i_&_ii',NULL,'SEGA®’s most requested re-release of all time finally comes to a new generation. Shenmue delivers an epic story of revenge within a unique open world that is still unrivalled in depth and detail. Return to the epic saga that defined modern gaming. The saga begins…again.','2018/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/758330/Shenmue_I__II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3764,'world_of_guns:_gun_disassembly',NULL,'World of Guns: Gun Disassembly lets you delve into the inner workings of guns from the largest gears to the smallest screws','2014/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/262410/World_of_Guns_Gun_Disassembly/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3765,'monument_valley',NULL,'Embark on a journey of forgiveness through impossible environments and illusionary puzzles. Experience this meditative and calming puzzle game by manipulating monuments and creating evolving paths to explore new, surreal, and mysterious worlds.','2022/7/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1927720/Monument_Valley/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3766,'super_auto_pets',NULL,'Build the strongest team of pets and tussle with your friends!','2021/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1714040/Super_Auto_Pets/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3767,'fear_the_spotlight',NULL,'Fear the Spotlight is an atmospheric third-person horror adventure with a disturbing mystery to unravel. Sneak into school after hours with Vivian and Amy, survive a séance gone wrong, solve tactile puzzles, and, whatever you do, stay out of the spotlight…','2024/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1959390/Fear_the_Spotlight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3768,'arken_age',NULL,'Arken Age is a VR action-adventure game set in the Bio-Chasm—a terraformed fantasy world created by the Grand Arborist. Engage in full physics combat using Arkenite infused swords & guns—and freely explore the densely filled environments under siege by Hyperion\'s neural corruption.','2025/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2274200/Arken_Age/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3769,'might_&_magic®_heroes®_vii',NULL,'Might & Magic® Heroes® VII makes a triumphant return bringing you the essence of turn based strategy gaming. Set in a fantasy universe with RPG progression with a strong story narrative, you will embark on a journey that you will never forget!','2015/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/321960/Might__Magic_Heroes_VII/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3770,'thalassa:_edge_of_the_abyss',NULL,'Uncover the mystery of Thalassa, a first-person psychological drama set under the sea. Ill-fate has fallen on your former crew and friends and it’s up to you to find answers onboard the wreckage. Experience the melancholic underwater journey of human stories facing life and loss.','2024/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1783680/Thalassa_Edge_of_the_Abyss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3771,'ty_the_tasmanian_tiger',NULL,'G\'day, Mate. Explore the wilds of Australia with TY the Tasmanian Tiger, the charming Aussie platformer.','2016/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/411960/TY_the_Tasmanian_Tiger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3772,'rise_of_gun',NULL,'Rise of Gun - immerses you in a world of zombie apocalypse as a gun store owner. Buy parts, craft, sell, upgrade your store and hire workers. Help to humanity survive','2024/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2319640/Rise_of_Gun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3773,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_wielton_trailer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2455690/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Wielton_Trailer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3774,'amnesia:_the_dark_descent',NULL,'Amnesia: The Dark Descent, a first person survival horror. A game about immersion, discovery and living through a nightmare. An experience that will chill you to the core.','2010/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/57300/Amnesia_The_Dark_Descent/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3775,'american_truck_simulator_-_forest_machinery',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2