 coordinate actions with your crew.','2017/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/527100/Star_Trek_Bridge_Crew/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3782,'graveyard_keeper_-_stranger_sins',NULL,'This content requires the base game Graveyard Keeper on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1163770/Graveyard_Keeper__Stranger_Sins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3783,'nimrods',NULL,'Assemble a limitless arsenal in this survive-em-up roguelite shooter. As a Gun Manufacturer\'s testing force, your mission is simple: test the latest gun tech and scavenge alien planets. Collect insane weapon parts to invent crazy guns that slay thousands. You may not survive, but your guns will!','2024/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2086430/NIMRODS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3784,'steel_division:_normandy_44',NULL,'Steel Division: Normandy is a tactical real-time strategy (RTS) game that pits players against AI enemies in a single-player campaign -- or against several opponents in massive 10-on-10 multiplayer battles.','2017/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/572410/Steel_Division_Normandy_44/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3785,'rising_star_2',NULL,'Start a band, and take on the world in this music industry simulation/role-playing game. Success doesn\'t come without hard work, and making connections in your local music scene is the only path to stardom.','2020/8/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235110/Rising_Star_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3786,'etrian_odyssey_iii_hd',NULL,'Set sail to an undersea labyrinth in search of the Deep City of Armoroad! Lead a party of adventurers to explore the vast dungeon in search of untold technology, treasure, and lost secrets.','2023/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1810820/Etrian_Odyssey_III_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3787,'final_fantasy_xv_episode_ardyn',NULL,'This content requires the base game FINAL FANTASY XV WINDOWS EDITION on Steam in order to play.','2019/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/977610/FINAL_FANTASY_XV_EPISODE_ARDYN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_79'),(3788,'swords_and_sandals_classic_collection',NULL,'\"Gladiator, gladiator, gladiator, Swords and Sandals, Gladiatorrrrr!\"You grew up playing the legendary Swords and Sandals turn based combat game series. These games have been played over half a billion times. Swords and Sandals is nostalgia, Swords and Sandals is life.','2019/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1055430/Swords_and_Sandals_Classic_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3789,'wrc_generations_–_the_fia_wrc_official_game',NULL,'Rise to all the challenges of the most comprehensive, realistic and demanding rally simulation ever developed. Dive into the heart of the action and drive the cars from the 2022 WRC championship, including the new hybrid models.','2022/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1953520/WRC_Generations__The_FIA_WRC_Official_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3790,'strike_force_heroes',NULL,'Strike Force Heroes is an oldschool arena shooter rebuilt with modern mechanics with full co-operative and PvP online multiplayer. It melds over the top action with epic story-telling in this intense remake of the hit Flash game.','2023/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1981820/Strike_Force_Heroes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3791,'infra',NULL,'INFRA puts you into the boots of a structural analyst on a routine mission. Quickly though, your task turns into a fight for survival, all caused by deep-rooted schemes of the past. Your tools are simple: your camera and the wits to navigate a labyrinth of debris.','2016/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/251110/INFRA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3792,'two_point_hospital:_culture_shock',NULL,'This content requires the base game Two Point Hospital on Steam in order to play.','2020/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1377080/Two_Point_Hospital_Culture_Shock/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3793,'60_parsecs!',NULL,'60 Parsecs! is an Atomic Space Age adventure of scavenge and survival. Keep your crew alive and ready for action. Make difficult choices, face soup shortages and other horrors of outer space. And maybe reach your destination. Or not.','2018/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/646270/60_Parsecs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3794,'fractal_block_world',NULL,'This is a surreal exploration game. Explore a massive fractal with great complexities. You can shrink infinitely to go deeper into the fractal. Or you can become larger by growing. Inner space awaits you in this infinite world.','2021/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1540570/Fractal_Block_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3795,'spirittea',NULL,'Hey human, we\'ve got problems! This town is crawling with troublesome spirits, and you\'re the only one who can see them. You\'d better get that old bathhouse up and running, maybe that\'ll help them chill out!','2023/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1931010/Spirittea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3796,'svarog\'s_dream',NULL,'Awaken as a soul from the Underworld. Discover who you are and explore an ever-changing open world full of mystery. Battle beasts and gods, or forge alliances with them. Die and be reborn in this adventure.','2023/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2004640/Svarogs_Dream/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3797,'killing_floor',NULL,'6-player co-op survival horror at its finest! Free updates, free special events and a ridiculous amount of fun!','2009/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1250/Killing_Floor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3798,'mortal_online_2',NULL,'A persistent sandbox world. No classes or levels. Train the skills you want for your own unique build. Player-driven trade, economy, and housing. Millions of crafting combinations. First-person immersive combat. Exploration. Bosses. Full loot, full PvP. The world of Nave is yours - who will you be?','2022/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1170950/Mortal_Online_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3799,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_tents_&_ground_blinds',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2017/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/622450/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Tents__Ground_Blinds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3800,'love,_ghostie',NULL,'Become a wholesome ghost matchmaker and grow relationships between the manor’s residents! Gift items to lift their spirits, set them up on dates, and watch love bloom! Discover cute romances with a unique story between every pair of residents! How will love blossom in your manor?','2024/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1789490/Love_Ghostie/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3801,'flyout',NULL,'Build and fly realistic aircraft. Use free-form fuselage and wing editor tools and tune your engines to recreate aircraft from any era or design your own.','2023/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/777390/Flyout/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3802,'one_piece_world_seeker',NULL,'Leave your compass behind and join Luffy as he embarks on a brand new action-packed adventure where you can experience the powers of the legendary Gum-Gum fruit to uncover hidden secrets on an original, never-before-seen island!','2019/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/755500/ONE_PIECE_World_Seeker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3803,'bluey:_the_videogame',NULL,'Play a brand-new story set across 4 interactive adventures, explore iconic locations, play your favourite games from the TV show and also play with your friends and family in local multiplayer.','2023/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2078350/Bluey_The_Videogame/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3804,'lego®_worlds',NULL,'Experience a galaxy of Worlds made entirely from LEGO bricks. EXPLORE gigantic landscapes, DISCOVER countless surprises, and CREATE anything you can imagine by building with LEGO bricks.','2017/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/332310/LEGO_Worlds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3805,'wilmot\'s_warehouse',NULL,'Wilmot\'s Warehouse is a puzzle game about keeping a warehouse running in tip-top shape. Just remember where you put everything, because when the service hatch opens, you\'ll need to find the things people want quickly, in order to earn the coveted Performance Stars.','2019/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/839870/Wilmots_Warehouse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3806,'hellboy_web_of_wyrd',NULL,'Hellboy Web of Wyrd is a roguelike action brawler with an original story created in partnership with Dark Horse Comics and Hellboy creator Mike Mignola. When an agent of the B.P.R.D. goes missing, Hellboy is sent to investigate; pulling him into the depths of the Wyrd.','2023/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2160480/Hellboy_Web_of_Wyrd/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3807,'tom_clancy\'s_rainbow_six®_vegas_2',NULL,'Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six® Vegas 2 - the sequel to the award-winning next-generation first-person shooter - returns to Sin City. Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six Vegas 2 is your last chance to rescue America\'s sexiest city from an escalating terrorist siege that will force you into heart-pounding action from beginning to end.','2008/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/15120/Tom_Clancys_Rainbow_Six_Vegas_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3808,'dying_light_2_stay_human:_g.r.e._hazmat_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dying Light 2 Stay Human: Reloaded Edition on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3453200/Dying_Light_2_Stay_Human_GRE_Hazmat_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3809,'terminator:_dark_fate_-_defiance:_we_are_legion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Terminator: Dark Fate - Defiance on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3227830/Terminator_Dark_Fate__Defiance_We_are_Legion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3810,'the_deadseat',NULL,'A horror game where you play a hand-held console in the backseat during a long drive home.','2025/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3667230/The_Deadseat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3811,'viking_frontiers',NULL,'Survival of your people - that\'s the only thing that matters. Become the leader of a newly founded Viking settlement and lead it to safety and glory. Gather, build, craft, hunt, raid and follow your Gods to endure hardships of nature and save your clan from violent destruction.','2025/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1304430/Viking_Frontiers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3812,'cities:_skylines_-_financial_districts',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2148901/Cities_Skylines__Financial_Districts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3813,'necromunda:_hired_gun',NULL,'Become a Hired Gun. The money’s good, the dog’s loyal, and the gun’s reliable. Embark on a fast-paced, violent, and thrilling FPS set in the darkest reaches of Warhammer 40,000’s most infamous hive city.','2021/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1222370/Necromunda_Hired_Gun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3814,'house_flipper_-_pop_art_furniture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game House Flipper on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2910200/House_Flipper__Pop_Art_Furniture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3815,'bandle_tale:_a_league_of_legends_story',NULL,'Bandle Tale: A League of Legends Story is a crafting RPG set in the whimsical world of Bandle City. After a party goes wrong, the portals that connect your home collapse and throw everything into chaos! Using your knitting magic and backpack house, restore the portals to reunite Bandle City.','2024/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1759380/Bandle_Tale_A_League_of_Legends_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3816,'tropico_6_-_new_frontiers',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tropico 6 on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2186250/Tropico_6__New_Frontiers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3817,'shipwrecked_64',NULL,'A recovered copy of a lost game from the late 1990s about a Beaver named Bucky and his friends trying to escape from an island they crashed upon.','2024/1/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2160220/Shipwrecked_64/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3818,'sucker_for_love:_first_date',NULL,'Put the \'love\' in \'Lovecraftian horror\'! Perform terrifying rituals to win the affections of eldritch horrors and smooch \'em... at any cost!','2022/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1574270/Sucker_for_Love_First_Date/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3819,'warrior_maiden_lecia_and_the_lost_fortress',NULL,'A fresh graduate of the military academy, Lecia has just joined the ranks and received her first posting. She is to head to Kreist Fortress, a remote outpost far from the capital Central. However, what awaits her is the Lost Fortress fallen into disrepute at the hands of her new commander.','2025/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2752520/Warrior_Maiden_Lecia_and_the_Lost_Fortress/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3820,'war_thunder_-_two_fronts_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game War Thunder on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3386550/War_Thunder__Two_Fronts_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3821,'terratech_worlds',NULL,'TerraTech Worlds is an open world, build-craft adventure game, set on an uncharted alien world. Play solo or with friends, explore your surroundings, craft unique vehicles, construct automated bases, and battle your way through hazards and enemies to harness the power of your environment','2024/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2313330/TerraTech_Worlds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3822,'summoners_war:_chronicles',NULL,'The King of Rahil is looking for a Summoner to protect the kingdom against Tefo\'s enormous conspiracy. Explore a vast world with your Monsters by your side in this new Action RPG set in the Summoners War Universe.','2022/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2167580/Summoners_War_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3823,'final_fantasy_iii_(3d_remake)',NULL,'FINAL FANTASY® III, one of the best-loved games from the epic RPG series, available on Steam.','2014/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/239120/Final_Fantasy_III_3D_Remake/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3824,'submachine:_legacy',NULL,'Submachine is a hand-drawn puzzle adventure game. You find yourself in a vast network of desolate locations containing puzzles, secrets, notes and items to collect to help you along the way. Follow the story of a banished lighthouse keeper to discover his descent into ruins.','2023/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1564790/Submachine_Legacy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3825,'hyper_demon',NULL,'HYPER DEMON is an FPS like no other. a pearl of lightning. a dream from the future. a drop of poison. a swan song. The faster you slay demons, the harder the game and the higher your score. There is an end. Will it see you?','2022/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1743850/HYPER_DEMON/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3826,'lootun',NULL,'Lootun is a Semi-Idle RPG with a strong focus on Character/Skill Progression, Item Hunting, and Inventory Management. Assemble a team of adventurers and send them off to clear missions while you Craft, Upgrade and Enchant the Loot!','2024/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1960270/Lootun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3827,'europa',NULL,'On the moon Europa, a lush terraformed paradise in Jupiter’s shadow, an android named Zee sets out in search of answers. Run, glide and fly across the landscape, solve mysteries in the ruins of a fallen utopia, and discover the story of the last human alive.','2024/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2214880/Europa/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3828,'dread_templar',NULL,'Dread Templar is a fast-paced hardcore old-school FPS, combining classic 90s shooter and modern FPS elements. Unlock and combine dozens of weapon upgrades and skills, embrace the Dread Force and obliterate hordes of fiendish enemies. Become the scariest thing in hell and get your revenge!','2023/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1334730/Dread_Templar/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3829,'song_of_nunu:_a_league_of_legends_story',NULL,'Two best friends, one wild adventure. Join best friends Nunu and Willump on an adventure across the frozen wilds of the Freljord. Song of Nunu: A League of Legends Story is a single-player story adventure developed by Tequila Works.','2023/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1333200/Song_of_Nunu_A_League_of_Legends_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3830,'everdream_valley',NULL,'A farming adventure with a dash of magic. Play solo or up to a 4-player coop. By day, restore your quaint farm into a summer paradise. Explore, raise crops, care for animals and rebuild your home. At night inhabit various creatures through your dreams and bring enchantment to the valley.','2023/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1403650/Everdream_Valley/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3831,'total_war:_three_kingdoms_-_the_furious_wild',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: THREE KINGDOMS on Steam in order to play.','2020/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1299591/Total_War_THREE_KINGDOMS__The_Furious_Wild/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3832,'crusader_kings_iii_content_creator_pack:_west_slavic_attire',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings III on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3275760/Crusader_Kings_III_Content_Creator_Pack_West_Slavic_Attire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3833,'heaven\'s_vault',NULL,'An archaeologist uncovers a lost history in an ancient space Nebula. Award-winning narrative adventure game with hieroglyphic language puzzles, from the creators of 80 DAYS.','2019/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/774201/Heavens_Vault/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3834,'rebellion_godsoul:_awakening',NULL,'\"GODSOUL\" is a story-driven,Hyper-visually RPG. Team with \"rebel\" girls who love gaming and drawing（and more）, resist villains and enjoy a mix of cyber reality, fantastical worlds, and card game action.','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1213300/Rebellion_GODSOUL_Awakening/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_80'),(3835,'killer_instinct:_anniversary_edition',NULL,'This content requires the base game Killer Instinct on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2625580/Killer_Instinct_Anniversary_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3836,'cell_command',NULL,'TURN-BASED TACTICS meets SNAKE: A new roguelike in the Genome Guardian universe. SPLICE DNA to create new units, enhance their genetics, and take on the Abyss virus once more in a variety of different modes & match types.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3362040/Cell_Command/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3837,'turnip_boy_commits_tax_evasion',NULL,'Play as an adorable yet trouble-making turnip. Avoid paying taxes, solve plantastic puzzles, harvest crops and battle massive beasts all in a journey to tear down a corrupt vegetable government!','2021/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1205450/Turnip_Boy_Commits_Tax_Evasion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3838,'klonoa_phantasy_reverie_series',NULL,'KLONOA is a 3D side-scrolling action game series whose first title was released by Namco in 1997. Set in a unique universe populated by a range of original characters, the game follows the hero, Klonoa, as he sets off on a journey to save the world.','2022/7/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1730680/Klonoa_Phantasy_Reverie_Series/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3839,'wwe_2k24',NULL,'Experience a gripping retelling of WrestleMania’s greatest moments in 2K Showcase of the Immortals in WWE 2K24, where you can relive a collection of some of the most unforgettable, career-defining matches.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2315690/WWE_2K24/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3840,'atri_-my_dear_moments-',NULL,'\"As the world sank, I found you.\" In the near future, a sudden and unexplained sea rise has left much of human civilization underwater. In a little town slowly being enveloped by the ocean, an unforgettable summer is about to begin for a boy and a mysterious robot girl...','2020/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1230140/ATRI_My_Dear_Moments/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3841,'manhunt',NULL,'You awake to the sound of your own panicked breath. In Manhunt, you must run, hide and fight to survive. If you can stay alive long enough, you may find out who did this to you. This is a brutal blood sport.','2004/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/12130/Manhunt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3842,'scum_vehicle_skins_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SCUM on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2651720/SCUM_Vehicle_Skins_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3843,'icarus:_styx_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game ICARUS on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1995690/Icarus_Styx_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3844,'stronghold_crusader_hd_(2012)',NULL,'The highly anticipated sequel to the best-selling Stronghold, Stronghold Crusader HD throws you into historic battles and castle sieges from the Crusades with fiendish AI opponents, new units, 4 historical campaigns and over 100 unique skirmish missions.','2002/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/40970/Stronghold_Crusader_HD_2012/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3845,'fallout_2:_a_post_nuclear_role_playing_game',NULL,'Fallout® 2 is the sequel to the critically acclaimed game that took RPG\'ing out of the dungeons and into a dynamic, apocalyptic retro-future. It\'s been 80 long years since your ancestors trod across the wastelands.','1998/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/38410/Fallout_2_A_Post_Nuclear_Role_Playing_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3846,'rolling_line',NULL,'Build your own model railway tracks and scenery or explore pre-made layouts, including 1000s of player-made layouts and mods on the Steam Workshop! Play in virtual reality and on PC!','2018/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/754150/Rolling_Line/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3847,'contra:_operation_galuga',NULL,'The legendary Contra series returns! This reimagining of the classic run-\'n\'-gun action game from the ‘80s features new stages, new enemies, new play mechanics, and co-op combat for up to 4 players!','2024/3/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2235020/Contra_Operation_Galuga/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3848,'oblivity_-_find_your_perfect_sensitivity',NULL,'Oblivity is an advanced aim training software that provides everything you need to improve your aim! Find your perfect, intuitive mouse sensitivity with Oblivity\'s sensitivity finder. Or detect your bad aiming habits in the extensive analysis and replay space.','2022/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1389990/Oblivity__Find_your_perfect_Sensitivity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3849,'the_room',NULL,'A mysterious invitation leads to the attic of an abandoned house. In the room is a cast-iron safe laced with strange carvings and on top, a note from your distant companion. It promises something ancient and astonishing concealed in the iron chamber - you need only find a way in.','2014/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/288160/The_Room/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3850,'asgard\'s_fall_—_viking_survivors',NULL,'Embark on an epic saga in Asgard\'s Fall, a norse Survivors-like Roguelite. Fight your way through hordes of creatures and let the gods feel your relentless wrath. How will your saga unfold?','2025/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2780710/Asgards_Fall__Viking_Survivors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3851,'a_monster\'s_expedition',NULL,'An adorable and relaxing open world puzzle adventure for monsters who love to learn about humans!','2020/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1052990/A_Monsters_Expedition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3852,'total_war:_attila_-_empires_of_sand_culture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ATTILA on Steam in order to play.','2015/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/343463/Total_War_ATTILA__Empires_of_Sand_Culture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3853,'tom_clancy’s_rainbow_six®_extraction',NULL,'Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six® Extraction is a tactical, co-op, PvE first-person shooter where you and your squad face an evolving alien threat. Teamwork, tactics, and flawless execution are key to your survival.','2023/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2379390/Tom_Clancys_Rainbow_Six_Extraction/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3854,'the_legend_of_heroes:_trails_in_the_sky_the_3rd',NULL,'Half a year after Trails in the Sky SC, Father Kevin Graham takes on a routine mission on behalf of the Septian Church. He and his partner are then plunged into a realm that follows an unnaturally strict set of rules and is as intent to open old wounds as it is to keep them behind closed doors.','2017/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/436670/The_Legend_of_Heroes_Trails_in_the_Sky_the_3rd/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3855,'the_hungry_lamb:_traveling_in_the_late_ming_dynasty',NULL,'Trek across ancient China in a dark, boundary-pushing visual novel inspired by traditional Chinese art with modern animation. Escort four girls to the prosperous city of Luoyang in a branching narrative with themes of revenge, cannibalism, involuntary servitude, and more on a redemptive journey.','2024/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2593370/The_Hungry_Lamb_Traveling_in_the_Late_Ming_Dynasty/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3856,'train_valley_2',NULL,'Build bigger and more complex railway networks than ever before! Building on the success of the original, you’ll get more of what you loved about the original and then some. With increasingly difficult and complex challenges from local industries, the Valley has never felt so vast! ALL ABOARD!','2019/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/602320/Train_Valley_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3857,'anode_heart',NULL,'A semi-open world, monster tamer RPG, set in a digital, futuristic environment, with fast-paced combat, a card minigame and focus on exploration.','2023/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1592750/Anode_Heart/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3858,'survivalist:_invisible_strain',NULL,'It\'s ten years since the infection started. Long-established settlements are collapsing, one by one, for unknown reasons. Survivors are running to the hills to escape, hoping for safety in remote places. As another refugee, you\'re here to carve out a new life for yourself - by any means necessary.','2025/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1054510/Survivalist_Invisible_Strain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3859,'supreme_commander_2',NULL,'Includes 47 Steam achievements, leaderboards, and stats!','2010/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/40100/Supreme_Commander_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3860,'spore™_creepy_&_cute_parts_pack',NULL,'Add horror and humor to your universe. Make grotesque beasts or cuddly critters, then watch them do the robot, zombie walk, break dance and more! Includes over 100 new items. 60 New parts 48 New paint options 24 New animations','2008/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/17440/SPORE_Creepy__Cute_Parts_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3861,'taxi_life:_a_city_driving_simulator_-_delivery_driver',NULL,'This content requires the base game Taxi Life: A City Driving Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3384710/Taxi_Life_A_City_Driving_Simulator__Delivery_Driver/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3862,'corpse_party_(2021)',NULL,'Explore the haunted halls of Heavenly Host Elementary in Corpse Party (2021), the horror cult classic now updated for the next generation.','2021/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1273260/Corpse_Party_2021/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3863,'melvor_idle:_throne_of_the_herald',NULL,'This content requires the base game Melvor Idle on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2055140/Melvor_Idle_Throne_of_the_Herald/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3864,'boomerang_fu',NULL,'Slice and dice your friends with boomerangs in this frantic physics party game. Join a crew of your favorite foods as you grill, chill and spill your enemies. Discover ridiculous power-ups and stack them together in deadly combinations.','2020/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/965680/Boomerang_Fu/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3865,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator_2',NULL,'Fish around the globe using float, bottom, spinning, or casting gear, and catch over 60 realistic fish species. Play solo or online in normal, realistic, or sandbox mode! Explore stunning locations, switch to an underwater cam, and fill your trophy room!','2025/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1136380/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3866,'sid_meier\'s_civilization®_vi:_babylon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier’s Civilization® VI on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1388850/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_VI_Babylon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3867,'lovers_in_a_dangerous_spacetime',NULL,'Explore a neon galaxy in your very own battleship in this 1- to 4-player couch co-op adventure.','2015/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/252110/Lovers_in_a_Dangerous_Spacetime/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3868,'battletech_heavy_metal',NULL,'This content requires the base game BATTLETECH on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1151170/BATTLETECH_Heavy_Metal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3869,'sunless_sea',NULL,'LOSE YOUR MIND. EAT YOUR CREW. DIE. Take the helm of your steamship and set sail for the unknown! Sunless Sea is a game of discovery, loneliness and frequent death, set in the award-winning Victorian Gothic universe of Fallen London.','2015/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/304650/SUNLESS_SEA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3870,'ghosts_of_tabor_-_nuclear_night_edition_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ghosts of Tabor on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2057012/Ghosts_of_Tabor__Nuclear_Night_Edition_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3871,'sea_fantasy',NULL,'Save the world by fishing! This is a brand new action RPG game where you stand on an adventure to fish the Sea\'Az, the marine life of this world, in a vast pixel world. This is not a peaceful fishing game. The destruction of the world is imminent....','2025/1/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2835110/Sea_Fantasy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3872,'chinese_parents',NULL,'In this casual sim set in China, you step into the shoes of an average kid from birth towards the end of your high school. Study hard, have fun, make friends and face your ultimate challenge, the “Gaokao”. What will your life be after that? And when you have a child, will you be a Tiger Parent?','2018/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/736190/Chinese_Parents/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3873,'automobilista_2_-_historical_track_pack_pt2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2697770/Automobilista_2__Historical_Track_Pack_Pt2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3874,'bad_end_theater',NULL,'select your protagonist and explore a variety of terrible fates!','2021/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1764390/BAD_END_THEATER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3875,'carcassonne_-_tiles_&_tactics',NULL,'The official adaptation of the famous board game Carcassonne! A modern classic tile-placement game based on the award winning game in which the players draw and place a tile with a piece of southern French landscape on it. The player can then decide to place one of his followers, called Meeples.','2017/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/598810/Carcassonne__Tiles__Tactics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3876,'sd_gundam_g_generation_cross_rays',NULL,'Beyond creation, four eras come together as one! Discover the latest entry in this iconic Tactical RPG series. Form your own team of SD Gundams and deploy for battle -- with units from Mobile Suit Gundam Wing, SEED, 00, and Iron-Blooded Orphans!','2019/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/728530/SD_GUNDAM_G_GENERATION_CROSS_RAYS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3877,'dragon_ball_xenoverse_2_-_future_saga_chapter_1',NULL,'This content requires the base game DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2814240/DRAGON_BALL_XENOVERSE_2__FUTURE_SAGA_Chapter_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3878,'idle_colony',NULL,'A condensed incremental experience, where you build a colony to collect and merge bigger and bigger fruits. Combine game-changing technologies and special upgrades to find the best synergies and take your cash flow to another dimension.','2024/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2843640/Idle_Colony/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3879,'scythe:_digital_edition',NULL,'Scythe transports you to an alternate reality in 1920s Europa, one ravaged by the First World War. Take up the role of leader by assuming command of one of 5 factions, and set out to conquer the coveted \"Factory\". Lead your mechs to war and your people to victory!','2018/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/718560/Scythe_Digital_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3880,'curse_of_the_dead_gods',NULL,'You seek untold riches, eternal life, divine powers - it leads to this accursed temple, a seemingly-infinite labyrinth of bottomless pits, deadly traps, and monsters.','2021/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1123770/Curse_of_the_Dead_Gods/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_81'),(3881,'no_place_like_home',NULL,'Humanity Trashed the Earth and left for Mars. Only few remained. EXPLORE the world. Clean the environment, CRAFT with recycled resources. Domesticate animals. Rebuild your village. Restore environment and run your own post-apo FARM as there is No Place Like Home!','2022/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1472660/No_Place_Like_Home/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3882,'mist_survival',NULL,'MIST SURVIVAL is a Single-player, survival stealth sandbox game Players will experience the Apocalypse stimulation in the form of virus pandemic, the players have to deal with it to survive through the difficulties such as finding shelter and food, threats from the environment and climate: wild animals, bandits, infected, and dense mist t','2018/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/914620/Mist_Survival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3883,'white_day:_a_labyrinth_named_school',NULL,'Notorious cult-classic Korean horror. Sneak into school at midnight to return your sweetheart\'s diary and get caught in a terrifying game of cat and mouse. Explore haunted hallways, solve classic survival horror puzzles and escape the clutches of a killer Janitor who is out for your blood.','2017/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/466130/White_Day_A_Labyrinth_Named_School/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3884,'exoprimal',NULL,'Exoprimal is an online, team-based action game that pits humanity\'s cutting-edge exosuit technology against history\'s most ferocious beasts – dinosaurs.​​','2023/7/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1286320/Exoprimal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3885,'midori_no_kaori',NULL,'Welcome to Midori no Kaori, a relaxing cozy game that allows you to create your own Japanese shop and manage customers. There are no winners or losers here, just unleash your creativity and enjoy a unique experience.','2024/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2903160/Midori_no_Kaori/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3886,'hunter_roulette',NULL,'Ladies and gentlemen, welcome to the underground survivor\'s showdown! All you need is a locked-and-loaded gun and the guts to stare death in the face to have the time of your life. Ready or not, this isn’t just any gamble—it’s your one shot at survival and rebirth. The hunt starts now！Good luck!','2025/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3591550/Hunter_Roulette/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3887,'sniper_elite_5_:_landing_force_mission_and_weapon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sniper Elite 5 on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1724940/Sniper_Elite_5__Landing_Force_Mission_and_Weapon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3888,'gladiator_guild_manager',NULL,'A strategic autobattler sim where you build a team of gladiators, compete in arenas, plan fight tactics, and form alliances. Combine fighters, beasts, and mages, develop and equip them to optimize your well-oiled fighting machine, dominate the championships, and leave your mark on the world.','2024/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1043260/Gladiator_Guild_Manager/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3889,'supreme_commander:_forged_alliance',NULL,'The last days of man are at hand.. Two years after the Infinite War the once great warring nations now lie in ruins, and humanity’s hope for a brighter future is nothing but a bitter memory. A new, seemingly unstoppable enemy, supported by the zealots of The Order, now seeks to eradicate mankind: UEF, Aeon Loyalist, and Cybran alike.','2011/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/9420/Supreme_Commander_Forged_Alliance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3890,'call_of_duty®:_black_ops_iii_-_the_giant_zombies_map',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of Duty®: Black Ops III on Steam in order to play.','2016/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/366849/Call_of_Duty_Black_Ops_III__The_Giant_Zombies_Map/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3891,'desynced',NULL,'Desynced is a sci-fi strategy game with fully customizable units and behaviors. Gather, build, research, and explore the unknown. Alone or with friends, unveil the mystery of an AI on the edge of self-awareness and uncover the hidden truth in this blend of strategy, automation, and exploration.','2023/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1450900/Desynced/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3892,'the_lord_of_the_rings:_return_to_moria™_ent-craft_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Lord of the Rings: Return to Moria™ on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3560550/The_Lord_of_the_Rings_Return_to_Moria_Entcraft_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3893,'warhammer_40,000:_battlesector_-_necrons',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1793051/Warhammer_40000_Battlesector__Necrons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3894,'ena:_dream_bbq',NULL,'Experience surreal environments and inexplicable characters as ENA in a new wild world.','2025/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2134320/ENA_Dream_BBQ/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3895,'youtubers_life',NULL,'Become the most successful youtuber on the planet! Create videos, get subscribers, attend events, interact with your fans… and grow your channel. Live a youtuber’s life!','2016/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/428690/Youtubers_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3896,'is_this_game_trying_to_kill_me?',NULL,'An old shack deep in a dense forest, a strange computer and a game that\'s trying to kill you!','2024/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2658470/Is_this_Game_Trying_to_Kill_Me/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3897,'project_warlock',NULL,'Project Warlock is a first-person shooter that fans of Doom, Hexen, and Wolfenstein cannot miss. It serves you an exploding cocktail of bullets, spells, and monsters. Battle through 60 levels of non-stop action, packed with bloodthirsty enemies and challenging bosses.','2018/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/893680/Project_Warlock/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3898,'robobeat',NULL,'Keep your trigger finger on the pulse! In rhythm shooter ROBOBEAT, you\'ll play as Ace - a bounty hunter on a mission to capture robot-gone-rogue Frazzer in his ever-shifting lair. Wall run, slide, and shoot to your own beat using the in-game custom music editor, blasting through Frazzer\'s armies!','2024/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1456760/ROBOBEAT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3899,'from_glory_to_goo',NULL,'From Glory To Goo is a Sci-Fi survival RTS set on an alien world. Serve as humanity\'s bulwark by establishing a colony and supporting your colonists still in orbit. But beware, for The Goo, a relentless and shape-shifting force approaches from all sides, even above and below.','2024/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2607060/From_Glory_To_Goo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3900,'the_doors_of_trithius',NULL,'The Doors of Trithius is an open-world RPG roguelike. Engage in tactical turn-based combat in a living world of warring factions, wandering behemoths, and ancient magic. Level your skills, cook, craft, and explore dungeons. Will you follow the story, or let adventure be your guide?','2021/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1519490/The_Doors_of_Trithius/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3901,'shiren_the_wanderer:_the_mystery_dungeon_of_serpentcoil_island',NULL,'A new adventure for Shiren and Koppa begins!','2024/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2178480/Shiren_the_Wanderer_The_Mystery_Dungeon_of_Serpentcoil_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3902,'secret_neighbor:_hello_neighbor_multiplayer',NULL,'Hello Neighbor Multiplayer. Secret Neighbor is a Multiplayer Social Horror Game where a group of intruders try to rescue their friend from the Neighbor\'s creepy basement. Only problem is one of the intruders is the Neighbor in disguise.','2019/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/859570/Secret_Neighbor_Hello_Neighbor_Multiplayer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3903,'kingdom_rush_frontiers_-_tower_defense',NULL,'Command your troops through an epic (mis)adventure as you defend exotic lands from dragons, man-eating plants, and ghastly denizens of the underworld -all with flashy new towers, levels, heroes, and more goodies to help you crush your foes in this Fantasy Action Tower Defense game!','2016/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/458710/Kingdom_Rush_Frontiers__Tower_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3904,'deep_rock_galactic_-_megacorp_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Deep Rock Galactic on Steam in order to play.','2020/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1283091/Deep_Rock_Galactic__MegaCorp_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3905,'gedonia_2',NULL,'Gedonia 2 is an online coop RPG, which allows up to 4 players to freely explore living open world and build absolutely unique characters. An expanded and improved sequel for RPG Gedonia.','2025/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2566340/Gedonia_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3906,'rumble',NULL,'Become the greatest RUMBLE fighter the world has ever seen! By performing specific martial-arts inspired movements, you can control the earth around you. Gain mastery over this power, and use it to defeat your opponents in intense 1-on-1 PVP duels!','2022/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/890550/RUMBLE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3907,'firmament',NULL,'Firmament is a new puzzle-adventure game by the legendary game studio behind the best-selling games Myst and Riven. Featuring deep storytelling and world-building, discover the story of this seemingly abandoned world as you explore and unlock the mysteries of 3 unique Realms… and beyond!','2023/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/754890/Firmament/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3908,'wizard_with_a_gun',NULL,'Wizard with a Gun is an online sandbox survival game for 1 - 4 players set in a magical wilderness wrought with dangerous creatures and arcane mysteries. Embark on a journey alone or with a friend to collect, craft, and outfit your wizard however you see fit as you explore the unknown.','2023/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1150530/Wizard_with_a_Gun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3909,'this_war_of_mine:_the_little_ones',NULL,'This content requires the base game This War of Mine on Steam in order to play.','2016/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/481090/This_War_of_Mine_The_Little_Ones/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3910,'darksiders™',NULL,'Deceived by the forces of evil into prematurely bringing about the end of the world, War – the first Horseman of the Apocalypse – stands accused of breaking the sacred law by inciting a war between Heaven and Hell. In the slaughter that ensued, the demonic forces defeated the heavenly hosts and laid claim to the Earth.','2010/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/50620/Darksiders/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3911,'showgunners',NULL,'As a contestant on a high stakes reality game show of the future, you must survive a dangerous urban environment packed with traps, confounding puzzles, and heavily armed psychopaths. Turn-based combat in hand crafted levels, built for entertainment.','2023/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1155330/Showgunners/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3912,'lego®_indiana_jones™_2:_the_adventure_continues',NULL,'LEGO® Indy is back in his biggest adventure yet. Battle through all four movies, including all-new levels from the original adventures and your favorite new moments from The Kingdom of the Crystal Skull... or in true LEGO® fashion, get creative and build your own levels to play with friends!','2010/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/32450/LEGO_Indiana_Jones_2_The_Adventure_Continues/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3913,'unheard_-_voices_of_crime',NULL,'What if you could hear every word spoken at the scene of a crime? “Acoustic Detectives” wanted for testing our new device! Return aurally to crime scenes and use the voices you hear to identify potential suspects and solve the mysteries. What is it that’s connecting these seemingly unrelated cases?','2019/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/942970/Unheard__Voices_of_Crime/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3914,'dreamcore',NULL,'Step into the surreal with Dreamcore, a body-cam styled psychological horror game that plunges you into the eerie beauty of \"liminal spaces.\" Unravel the mysteries of Dreamcore’s non-linear worlds and uncover its hidden secrets. Can you discover what lies beyond the edge of reality?','2025/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2453060/Dreamcore/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3915,'cuisineer',NULL,'A super cute and tasty roguelite-flavored dungeon crawler! Explore a lush world and defeat monsters with your trusty spatula and some boba tea, then gather delicious ingredients and bring them home to cook and serve at your restaurant!','2023/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1963570/Cuisineer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3916,'quake_4',NULL,'As part of the elite Rhino Squad, you must spearhead Earth’s military invasion of a hostile alien homeworld. But, in this desperate war for humanity’s survival against an unrelenting enemy, you may discover that the only way to defeat them...is to become one of them.','2005/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2210/Quake_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3917,'shadowrun:_hong_kong_-_extended_edition',NULL,'Shadowrun: Hong Kong - Extended Edition is the capstone title in Harebrained Schemes\' Shadowrun series - and now includes the all-new, 6+ hr Shadows of Hong Kong Bonus Campaign. Experience the most impressive Shadowrun RPG yet, hailed as one of the best cRPG / strategy games of 2015!','2015/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/346940/Shadowrun_Hong_Kong__Extended_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3918,'sid_meier\'s_civilization®:_beyond_earth™',NULL,'Sid Meier’s Civilization: Beyond Earth is a new science-fiction-themed entry into the award winning Civilization series. As part of an expedition sent to find a home beyond Earth, lead your people into a new frontier, explore and colonize an alien planet and create a new civilization in space.','2014/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/65980/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_Beyond_Earth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3919,'eternium',NULL,'Hack & slash against the dark forces threatening your home-world. Experience intense tactical fights in this fast paced, old school action RPG.','2023/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/981600/Eternium/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3920,'cities:_skylines_-_sunset_harbor',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1146930/Cities_Skylines__Sunset_Harbor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3921,'marble_world',NULL,'Marble World is a physics sandbox simulator with marbles. Create your own marble races, runs and machines. Customize a variety of tracks, decorations and marbles to create a beautiful world.','2021/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1491340/Marble_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3922,'call_of_duty®:_black_ops_first_strike_content_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of Duty®: Black Ops on Steam in order to play.','2011/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/42716/Call_of_Duty_Black_Ops_First_Strike_Content_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3923,'the_sims™_4_paranormal_stuff_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2021/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1368571/The_Sims_4_Paranormal_Stuff_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3924,'zephon_-_the_twisted_&_the_hollow',NULL,'This content requires the base game ZEPHON on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3607430/ZEPHON__The_Twisted__The_Hollow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3925,'american_truck_simulator_-_heavy_cargo_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2017/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/620610/American_Truck_Simulator__Heavy_Cargo_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3926,'sid_meier\'s_civilization®_vi:_portugal_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier’s Civilization® VI on Steam in order to play.','2021/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1478300/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_VI_Portugal_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_82'),(3927,'aragami_2',NULL,'Aragami 2 is a third person stealth game where you play as an assassin with the power to control the shadows. Join the shadow clan and fight the invader armies to protect your people.','2021/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1158370/Aragami_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3928,'aimlabs+_premium_membership',NULL,'This content requires the base game Aimlabs on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2253310/Aimlabs_Premium_Membership/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3929,'the_room_two',NULL,'Unique events transport you to the halls of a long-forgotten crypt. The only means of escape lies locked within a stone pedestal, along with a note from your mysterious ally. His words promise assistance, but only serve to entice you into a compelling world of mystery and exploration.','2016/7/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/425580/The_Room_Two/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3930,'undisputed_-_the_iron_and_steel_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Undisputed on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3525000/Undisputed__The_Iron_and_Steel_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3931,'mechwarrior_online™_legends',NULL,'MechWarrior Online™ Legends is a tactical, \'Mech-based online shooter set in the vast BattleTech Universe. Assume the role of an elite MechWarrior, piloting powerful BattleMechs, fighting for supremacy over the Inner Sphere.','2015/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/342200/MechWarrior_Online_Legends/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3932,'beholder_2',NULL,'You are an intern at the central ministry of a totalitarian state with your whole career ahead of you. Work your way up the ladder by scheming against employees, spying on your boss, and completing paperwork. Or do you turn against the state and expose corruption. The choice is still yours to make!','2018/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/761620/Beholder_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3933,'chambers',NULL,'Welcome to REVOLVERPUNK! Chambers is a comedic RPG shooter set in the Weird Wild West! Cook the boomstick, fingercatch some bullets and wrangle that fella into your pocket!','2025/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2437570/Chambers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3934,'hello_love:_18_again',NULL,'Unexpectedly back at 18, you embark on a thrilling and sweet campus rebirth journey with the memories! The campus goddess, the sexy girl, the childhood sweetheart, the frigid CEO, the gentle teacher. Who will ignite your heart among the dreams and regrets of youth? Relive old dreams without regrets!','2025/1/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3167180/Hello_Love_18_Again/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3935,'jurassic_world_evolution:_return_to_jurassic_park',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1144410/Jurassic_World_Evolution_Return_To_Jurassic_Park/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3936,'steins;gate:_my_darling\'s_embrace',NULL,'Fall in love with the lab members all over again in this sweet and slapstick romantic comedy!','2019/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/970560/STEINSGATE_My_Darlings_Embrace/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3937,'ez2on_reboot_:_r',NULL,'EZ2ON REBOOT : R – The latest entry in the beloved rhythm-action franchise is now released on Steam! Revisit the huge collection of classics with remastered audiovisual. Catch up with the freshest new songs and experiences.','2022/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1477590/EZ2ON_REBOOT__R/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3938,'atlas_fallen:_reign_of_sand',NULL,'In solo or co-op, experience Reign of Sand, the ultimate version of Atlas Fallen. Ride the sands of a timeless land and defeat legendary monsters in spectacular Action-RPG combat using devastating powers.','2023/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1230530/Atlas_Fallen_Reign_Of_Sand/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3939,'bit_heroes_quest',NULL,'Collect and craft thousands of pieces of loot to increase your power. Build your team by capturing monsters and bosses to fight at your side in old school, turn-based combat. Prove you’re the mightiest hero in the land by competing in the PvP arena, Raids, and weekly events for awesome prizes!','2017/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/666860/Bit_Heroes_Quest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3940,'two_point_hospital:_off_the_grid',NULL,'This content requires the base game Two Point Hospital on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1196150/Two_Point_Hospital_Off_the_Grid/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3941,'toram_online',NULL,'The MMORPG of a massive and magnificent fantasy! Let\'s explore the MMO world!','2021/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1827180/Toram_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3942,'a_shelter_full_of_cats',NULL,'Everyone can be a hero! Help a cat rescuer take care of her rescuees and root for their adoption! Every cat deserves a chance to be loved. ❤️','2024/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3087650/A_Shelter_Full_of_Cats/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3943,'warframe:_yareli_prime_access_-_complete_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warframe on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3678040/Warframe_Yareli_Prime_Access__Complete_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3944,'edition_upgrade_(digital_deluxe)',NULL,'This content requires the base game FANTASY LIFE i: The Girl Who Steals Time on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3464380/Edition_Upgrade_Digital_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3945,'cultic',NULL,'Death is only the beginning. Crawl from your grave and gear up to fight your way through the ranks of a mysterious and twisted cult. You, your guns, and your dynamite will have to shoot, slide, blast, duck, dodge, and maybe throw a gib or two to survive in this old-school-inspired shooter.','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1684930/CULTIC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3946,'lego®_the_incredibles',NULL,'Experience the thrilling adventures of the Parr family as they conquer crime and family life through both Disney-Pixar films The Incredibles and Incredibles 2, in a LEGO® world full of fun and humor.','2018/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/818320/LEGO_The_Incredibles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3947,'wizardry:_proving_grounds_of_the_mad_overlord',NULL,'Wizardry: Proving Grounds of the Mad Overlord is a full 3D remake of the first game in the legendary Wizardry series of RPGs.','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2518960/Wizardry_Proving_Grounds_of_the_Mad_Overlord/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3948,'kentucky_route_zero:_pc_edition',NULL,'KENTUCKY ROUTE ZERO is a magical realist adventure game about a secret highway running through the caves beneath Kentucky, and the mysterious folks who travel it.','2013/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/231200/Kentucky_Route_Zero_PC_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3949,'the_longing',NULL,'An unusual mix of adventure and idle game. In utter loneliness deep below the surface, it\'s your task to wait for the awakening of your king... for 400 days.','2020/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/893850/THE_LONGING/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3950,'the_legend_of_heroes:_trails_of_cold_steel_ii',NULL,'Civil war has broken out across Erebonia. After his narrow escape from Trista, Rean will take up his sword again on a journey with his Divine Knight, Valimar, in search of his friends from Class VII and a way to end the conflict before its price becomes far too dear...','2018/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/748490/The_Legend_of_Heroes_Trails_of_Cold_Steel_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3951,'rusty_lake:_roots',NULL,'Experience the beginning and end of characters\' lives and build your own family tree! Rusty Lake: Roots is the second premium point-and-click adventure by the creators of the Cube Escape series and Rusty Lake Hotel.','2016/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/532110/Rusty_Lake_Roots/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3952,'call_of_duty®:_black_ops_escalation_content_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of Duty®: Black Ops on Steam in order to play.','2011/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/42718/Call_of_Duty_Black_Ops_Escalation_Content_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3953,'paradise_killer',NULL,'Paradise Island, a world outside reality. There’s been a murder that only \"investigation freak\" Lady Love Dies can solve. Gather evidence and interrogate suspects in this open world adventure. You can accuse anyone, but you’ll have to prove your case in trial. It’s up to you to decide who’s guilty.','2020/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1160220/Paradise_Killer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3954,'mechwarrior_5:_mercenaries_-_rise_of_rasalhague',NULL,'This content requires the base game MechWarrior 5: Mercenaries on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2179800/MechWarrior_5_Mercenaries__Rise_of_Rasalhague/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3955,'level_devil',NULL,'“Troll” is such a strong word for this 2D platformer with nearly 200 uniquely inventive levels. Don’t let screaming YouTubers convince you that this game is unfair. It’s fair. Sure, there are buzzsaws but they’re NICE buzzsaws. You will curse the guy who made Level Devil (Me😈) then ask for more.','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3242750/Level_Devil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3956,'bpm:_bullets_per_minute',NULL,'BPM is a rhythm-action FPS rogue-like where you must shoot, jump and dodge to the beat of an epic rock soundtrack. Delve into a randomly generated dungeon where one missed note can lead to your death. Gain game-changing abilities and loot powerful weaponry to defeat your ancient enemy: Nidhogg.','2020/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1286350/BPM_BULLETS_PER_MINUTE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3957,'omsi_2_add-on_lancsbus_omnidecker',NULL,'This content requires the base game OMSI 2: Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3533470/OMSI_2_AddOn_Lancsbus_Omnidecker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3958,'sid_meier\'s_civilization®_vi:_ethiopia_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier’s Civilization® VI on Steam in order to play.','2020/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1270540/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_VI_Ethiopia_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3959,'across_the_obelisk:_shores_of_sahti',NULL,'This content requires the base game Across the Obelisk on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3185630/Across_the_Obelisk_Shores_of_Sahti/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3960,'space_engineers_-_automatons',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1958640/Space_Engineers__Automatons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3961,'shieldwall',NULL,'Shieldwall is a funny third-person tactical battle simulator with strategy elements. It allows you to feel like a squad leader right on the battlefield.','2023/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1216320/Shieldwall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3962,'isles_of_sea_and_sky',NULL,'A fantastic, oceanic, open world puzzle adventure. Solve innovative block puzzles while unearthing a mystifying story, gaining new friends that change the puzzle landscape, and unlocking powers that provide more options for how you choose to progress through the enigmatic Isles of Sea and Sky.','2024/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1233070/Isles_of_Sea_and_Sky/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3963,'stardew_valley_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Stardew Valley, but does not include the base game.','2016/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/440820/Stardew_Valley_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3964,'exploding_kittens®_2',NULL,'Download Exploding Kittens® 2 and live your best and most chaotic kitty life! Take a deep whiff of burning furballs, draw a card and pray for victory (and look stylish all the while, thanks to oodles of customisation options for your own adorable avatar).','2024/8/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2999030/Exploding_Kittens_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3965,'sam_&_max:_beyond_time_and_space',NULL,'The Freelance Police are back on the crime beat in a newly remastered version of their second episodic season. Zombies will dance. Mariachis will sing. A giant battle robot will trash the streets. And when their friends’ lives are at stake, Sam & Max will risk their very souls to set things right.','2021/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1747050/Sam__Max_Beyond_Time_and_Space/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3966,'grand_tactician:_the_civil_war_(1861-1865)',NULL,'Take command of the Union or the Confederacy. Prepare your nation for war, recruit and organize great armies and fleets under legendary commanders like Grant, Lee, Jackson or Farragut, plan cunning maneuvers on an epic campaign map and defeat your enemies in real-time battles!','2021/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/654890/Grand_Tactician_The_Civil_War_18611865/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3967,'dragonheir:_silent_gods',NULL,'Dragonheir: Silent Gods is an open-world high-fantasy RPG that puts you in control of over 200 heroes. In the multiversal adventure, you\'ll experience strategic combat like never before, where every move counts and every decision could be the difference between victory and defeat.','2023/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2203070/Dragonheir_Silent_Gods/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3968,'bang-on_balls:_chronicles',NULL,'A quirky, absolutely content-packed, destructible open-world sandbox adventure with combat, platforming, character customization, and collect-a-thon scavenger hunt experience. Play solo, 2-player split screen, or online co-op for up to 4 players. No paid cosmetic DLC nonsense.','2023/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1227650/BangOn_Balls_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3969,'combat_mission_battle_for_normandy',NULL,'Combat Mission Battle for Normandy faithfully recreates the experience of tactical land warfare in Western France during World War Two.','2023/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2297010/Combat_Mission_Battle_for_Normandy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3970,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_tirsan_trailer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2569750/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__TIRSAN_Trailer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3971,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_firepower_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2399890/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Firepower_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3972,'noble_fates',NULL,'Harness your Demigod powers to lead a group from rags to riches in this 3D Fantasy Kingdom Management Sim with RPG elements. Command from the sky or take control in 3rd Person to BUILD, BATTLE, and RULE. Navigate a world of interesting Nobles, earn their respect, and decide their Fates.','2021/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1769420/Noble_Fates/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3973,'vampire_hunters',NULL,'To hunt vampires, you\'ll need guns. Lots of guns. Mow down hordes of undead creatures by stacking your guns into absurd, over-the-top builds. Unleash your firepower and survive the mayhem in this Roguelite Survivors FPS.','2024/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2206270/Vampire_Hunters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3974,'phogs!',NULL,'In PHOGS! you play as a duo of dogs on a captivating, puzzle-filled adventure. Linked by a stretchy belly, you’ll need to bark, bite and bounce your way through obstacles set across the themed worlds of Food, Sleep and Play, in co-op or single-player.','2020/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/850320/PHOGS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3975,'lego®_builder\'s_journey',NULL,'LEGO Builder’s Journey is an atmospheric, geometric puzzle game that asks us to sometimes follow the instructions… and sometimes to break the rules.','2021/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1544360/LEGO_Builders_Journey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_83'),(3976,'tom_clancy\'s_splinter_cell®',NULL,'Infiltrate terrorists\' positions, acquire critical intelligence by any means necessary, execute with extreme prejudice, and exit without a trace! You are Sam Fisher, a highly trained secret operative of the NSA\'s secret arm: Third Echelon.','2003/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/13560/Tom_Clancys_Splinter_Cell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3977,'kingdom_hearts_hd_2.8_final_chapter_prologue',NULL,'KINGDOM HEARTS HD 2.8 Final Chapter Prologue features 3 magical experiences, all leading up to KINGDOM HEARTS III.','2024/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2552440/KINGDOM_HEARTS_HD_28_Final_Chapter_Prologue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3978,'craft_the_world',NULL,'Craft The World is a unique sandbox strategy game, the mix of Dungeon Keeper, Terraria and Dwarf Fortress. Explore a random generated world populated by dangerous creatures, build a dwarf fortress, gather resources, and craft all the items, weapons, and armor you need.','2014/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/248390/Craft_The_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3979,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_feldbinder_trailer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2193220/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Feldbinder_Trailer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3980,'spore™_galactic_adventures',NULL,'Take Your Creature From Zero To Galactic HeroGet out of your starship and turn your Spore creatures into legendary Space Captains. For the first time, beam down with your allies to take on action-packed, planetside adventures. Complete quests, collect rewards, and even create your own missions.','2009/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/24720/SPORE_Galactic_Adventures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3981,'far:_changing_tides',NULL,'An atmospheric vehicle adventure that follows the emotional journey of a boy and his ship as he embarks on a voyage to find a new home.','2022/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1570010/FAR_Changing_Tides/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3982,'west_hunt',NULL,'West Hunt is a 1-8 player social deduction game set in the Old West! Among the hardworking townsfolk hides an Outlaw or two causing mischief and mayhem across town. Luckily, there are eagle-eyed Sheriffs ready to sniff them out! No matter what role you play, you\'re sure to have a hog-killin\' time!','2023/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1570330/West_Hunt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3983,'depersonalization',NULL,'\"May all stories find their best endings.\" \"Depersonalization\" is an anthology-style game featuring standalone chapters and diverse story genres. We continuously collect and create a wide variety of stories, ultimately housing them in a library that transcends the flow of time.','2024/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1477070/Depersonalization/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3984,'heat_signature',NULL,'Heat Signature is a game from the developers of Gunpoint where you break into spaceships, make terrible mistakes, and think of clever ways out of them. You take a mission, fly to the target ship, sneak inside, and make clever use of your gadgets to distract, ambush and take out the crew.','2017/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/268130/Heat_Signature/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3985,'senua’s_saga:_hellblade_ii',NULL,'The sequel to the award winning Hellblade: Senua’s Sacrifice, Senua returns in a brutal journey of survival through the myth and torment of Viking Iceland. Intent on saving those who have fallen victim to the horrors of tyranny, Senua faces a battle of overcoming the darkness within and without.','2024/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2461850/Senuas_Saga_Hellblade_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3986,'valkyria_chronicles™',NULL,'The critically acclaimed Valkyria Chronicles is now available on PC in 1080p True HD, including all previously released DLC!','2014/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/294860/Valkyria_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3987,'intergalactic_fishing',NULL,'Intergalactic Fishing is a fishing RPG that features procedurally generated content and graphics. Travel to lakes all over the universe and catch unique fish, explore uncharted lakes and sell data, complete quests, upgrade your gear, compete in fishing tournaments, design your own lures, and more!','2020/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/949600/Intergalactic_Fishing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3988,'destiny_2:_the_witch_queen',NULL,'This content requires the base game Destiny 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1656330/Destiny_2_The_Witch_Queen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3989,'farm_manager_2021',NULL,'Farm Manager 2021 is an indie game that lets you relax and immerse yourself in farm management. A casual but grounded builder game that combines management and farm maintenance in one package. Grow and expand your farm into a thriving estate or enjoy it as a delightful escape from everyday life.','2021/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1123830/Farm_Manager_2021/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3990,'unavowed',NULL,'A demon has possessed you and used your body to tear a swath of bloodshed through New York. You are now free, but life as you knew it is over. Your only path forward is joining the Unavowed - an ancient society dedicated to stopping evil. No matter what the cost.','2018/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/336140/Unavowed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3991,'the_thing:_remastered',NULL,'The Thing: Remastered is a faithful restoration of the cult-classic 2002 third-person survival horror shooter game inspired by Universal Pictures’ genre-defining 1982 film, The Thing','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2958970/The_Thing_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3992,'the_sims™_3_ambitions',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2010/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/47893/The_Sims_3_Ambitions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3993,'iron_lung',NULL,'A short horror game where you pilot a tiny submarine through an ocean of blood on an alien moon.','2022/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1846170/Iron_Lung/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3994,'hitman:_contracts',NULL,'Enter the world of a HITMAN - a world of crime, sin and greed. Delve into the mind of Agent 47 and encounter his greatest adversaries, completing the work that made him so brutally efficient and shaped him as an assassin. Eliminate your targets by any means necessary. There are no rules... only the contract, signed in blood.','2004/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/247430/Hitman_Contracts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3995,'project_hospital_-_hospital_services',NULL,'This content requires the base game Project Hospital on Steam in order to play.','2020/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1282550/Project_Hospital__Hospital_Services/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3996,'weird_west:_definitive_edition',NULL,'Survive and unveil the mysteries of the Weird West through the intertwined destinies of its unusual heroes in an Action RPG from the co-creators of Dishonored and Prey.','2022/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1097350/Weird_West_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3997,'pushing_it!_together_-_sisyphus_co-op',NULL,'Roll a boulder up a hill with your friends in this Online Co-op adventure based off the ancient Myth of Sisyphus.','2025/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3298460/Pushing_it_Together__Sisyphus_Coop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3998,'tails_of_iron',NULL,'Tails of Iron is an epic RPG Adventure with punishingly brutal combat. As Redgi, heir to the throne, you must embark on a perilous quest to reclaim your Kingdom. Explore a deceivingly charming world. Assemble a band of brave companions. Banish the merciless Frog clan!','2021/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1283410/Tails_of_Iron/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(3999,'uboat_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game UBOAT on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3129990/UBOAT__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4000,'magical_girl_konoha',NULL,'To aid the King, Priestess Konoha plunges into \"Grimoire\"! The world inside \"Grimoire\" is formed by another world called Grimoire Land in which Konoha becomes a magical girl, and has come to save the world!','2025/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2529520/Magical_Girl_Konoha/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4001,'voxel_project_vr',NULL,'Voxel Project offers an immersive sandbox experience set in a fully destructible voxel environment. Explore a dynamic world teeming with vehicles, dynamic fire mechanics, enemy NPCs, voxel gore, weapon customization, and a bunch of additional features to discover.','2025/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2858370/Voxel_Project_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4002,'singularity™',NULL,'FIGHT THE PAST TO SAVE THE FUTURE. STOP THE SINGULARITY. Learn the truth behind a massive cover-up of the catastrophic SINGULARITY, an event that fractured time and threatens the world as we know it. Armed with powerful, advanced weaponry and the experimental Time Manipulation Device, fight enemies from the past, the present, and...','2010/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/42670/Singularity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4003,'worms_revolution',NULL,'Worms™ Revolution is the latest game in the classic turn-based strategy series to come to the PC.','2012/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/200170/Worms_Revolution/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4004,'executive_assault_2',NULL,'The RTS/FPS phenomenon has moved into space! Build your base on an asteroid, command fleets of starships for epic battles, pilot fighters, mine and trade resources, assemble robots to defend or assault other stations. Take sole command or share the glory as you fight for control of the quadrant.','2023/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/510500/Executive_Assault_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4005,'team_fortress_classic',NULL,'One of the most popular online action games of all time, Team Fortress Classic features over nine character classes -- from Medic to Spy to Demolition Man -- enlisted in a unique style of online team warfare. Each character class possesses unique weapons, items, and abilities, as teams compete online in a variety of game play modes.','1999/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/20/Team_Fortress_Classic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4006,'tomba!_special_edition',NULL,'In Tomba! Special Edition, leap, bite, and throw your way across stunning 2.5D landscapes in this vastly-enhanced update to a platforming classic!','2024/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2851150/Tomba_Special_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4007,'street_fighter™_6_-_year_1_character_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Street Fighter™ 6 on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2224460/Street_Fighter_6__Year_1_Character_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4008,'the_slormancer_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Slormancer on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3625910/The_Slormancer__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4009,'atelier_lydie_&_suelle:_the_alchemists_and_the_mysterious_paintings_dx',NULL,'The definitive edition of the Atelier \"Mysterious\" series at a new price, with brand new content and various DLCs! \"Atelier Lydie & Suelle\" is the 3rd instalment: after discovering a mysterious painting, Lydie & Suelle get closer to their dream of running the best atelier.','2021/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1502990/Atelier_Lydie__Suelle_The_Alchemists_and_the_Mysterious_Paintings_DX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4010,'deep_rock_galactic_-_dawn_of_the_dread_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Deep Rock Galactic on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1530640/Deep_Rock_Galactic__Dawn_of_the_Dread_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4011,'space_engineers_-_sparks_of_the_future',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1307680/Space_Engineers__Sparks_of_the_Future/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4012,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_emerging_downtown',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2955910/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Emerging_Downtown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4013,'creatures_of_ava',NULL,'Let your empathy guide you as you play an exciting action-adventure, creature-saver game. Understand and tame the creatures of Ava and let them lead you through a variety of ecosystems – all in the hopes of saving the planet from a life-consuming infection.','2024/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2304440/Creatures_of_Ava/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4014,'scum:_danny_trejo_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SCUM on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1990860/SCUM_Danny_Trejo_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4015,'nekopara_vol._2',NULL,'Business is booming for La Soleil, the patisserie run by Kashou Minaduki with his two catgirls, Chocola and Vanilla, his sister Shigure, and the Minaduki family\'s four catgirl sisters.','2016/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/420110/NEKOPARA_Vol_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4016,'age_of_wonders_iii',NULL,'Age of Wonders III is the long anticipated sequel to the award-winning strategy series. Delivering a unique mix of Empire Building, Role Playing and Warfare, Age of Wonders III offers the ultimate in turn-based fantasy strategy for veterans of the series and new players alike!','2014/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/226840/Age_of_Wonders_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4017,'syberia:_the_world_before',NULL,'Embark on a quest for identity through time, as you piece together the puzzle of two lives.','2022/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1410640/Syberia_The_World_Before/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4018,'golf_with_your_friends_-_olympus_odyssey_course',NULL,'This content requires the base game Golf With Your Friends on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3041140/Golf_With_Your_Friends__Olympus_Odyssey_Course/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4019,'armello',NULL,'Armello is a grim fairy-tale board game come to life, with every match combining deep, tactical card play, rich tabletop strategy and RPG elements. Leverage subterfuge, spells and careful strategy to wrangle control of the game\'s chaotic odds as you quest for the throne.','2015/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/290340/Armello/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4020,'turok_3:_shadow_of_oblivion_remastered',NULL,'Finish the hunt in this epic finale to the Turok Trilogy. Pick up immediately after the events of Turok 2: Seeds of Evil, with dual protagonists Joseph and Danielle Fireseed, of the Turok family tree, as they battle the titular antagonist Oblivion and its followers, the Flesh Eaters.','2023/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1996770/Turok_3_Shadow_of_Oblivion_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4021,'lakeburg_legacies',NULL,'Take fate into your own hands in Lakeburg Legacies, a social-based village management sim where love is your favourite resource. Play matchmaker to create the most effective, and most loved up, couples and help your kingdom thrive. How long will it take you to crown a sovereign?','2023/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1584940/Lakeburg_Legacies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4022,'super_lesbian_animal_rpg',NULL,'Melody has decided to become a healer in this classic-inspired turn-based RPG about love, anxiety, and fighting funny-looking monsters in dungeons.','2022/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2124380/Super_Lesbian_Animal_RPG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4023,'turbo_overkill',NULL,'Enter Paradise as Johnny Turbo—half-metal, half-human, all-murder machine. Clean up the streets with a chainsaw leg, 15+ weapons and your hovercar as you battle the rogue AI Syn, rival bounty hunters and cyberpunks aplenty. Apogee’s most outrageous FPS since Duke Nukem 3D. Good hunting, Sir!','2023/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1328350/Turbo_Overkill/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_84'),(4024,'ggst_additional_character_6_-_bridget',NULL,'This content requires the base game GUILTY GEAR -STRIVE- on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2081050/GGST_Additional_Character_6__Bridget/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4025,'american_truck_simulator_-_special_transport',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2018/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/962750/American_Truck_Simulator__Special_Transport/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4026,'vega_conflict',NULL,'Stake your claim, command your fleets, and wage epic war in space.','2015/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/339600/VEGA_Conflict/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4027,'il-2_sturmovik:_flying_circus_-_volume_ii',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2366320/IL2_Sturmovik_Flying_Circus__Volume_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4028,'atari_50:_the_anniversary_celebration',NULL,'Atari 50: The Anniversary Celebration takes players on an interactive journey through 50 years of video games via interviews with designers, developers and industry leaders, documentary footage, product design documents, high-res original artwork, and a curated list of more than 90 playable games.','2022/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1919470/Atari_50_The_Anniversary_Celebration/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4029,'street_fighter_30th_anniversary_collection',NULL,'Celebrate Street Fighter’s historic legacy with the Street Fighter 30th Anniversary Collection. In this collection of 12 Street Fighter games, four groundbreaking titles let you hop online and relive the arcade experience through the online Arcade Mode or play with friends.','2018/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/586200/Street_Fighter_30th_Anniversary_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4030,'rosewater',NULL,'A thrilling Western adventure in the alternate 19th century world of Lamplight City! Embark on a harrowing journey across the frontier with Harley Leger and her ragtag posse, encountering bandits, rebels, visionaries, eccentrics, and many more friends and foes on your quest for fame and riches.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1226670/Rosewater/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4031,'atelier_ayesha:_the_alchemist_of_dusk_dx',NULL,'\"The promise begins.\" The \"Dusk\" series, a trilogy of RPG titles from Gust\'s popular Atelier series, tells the story of a world on the verge ruin, told from the perspective of its unique characters. The 1st title in the series \"Atelier Ayesha\" is now available as a deluxe version.','2020/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1152300/Atelier_Ayesha_The_Alchemist_of_Dusk_DX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4032,'gas_station_simulator_-_airstrip_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Gas Station Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2137370/Gas_Station_Simulator__Airstrip_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4033,'zoombinis',NULL,'In the entertaining and educational game Zoombinis, players guide the little blue creatures through fun and increasingly challenging puzzles on their way to a new home.','2015/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/397430/Zoombinis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4034,'little_big_adventure_–_twinsen’s_quest',NULL,'Step into Twinsun\'s fantastical world in this action-adventure remake! Little Big Adventure - Twinsen\'s Quest brings brand new visuals, new music by the original composer, and smoother gameplay to the iconic classic released back in 1994.','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2318070/Little_Big_Adventure__Twinsens_Quest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4035,'valkyrie_connect',NULL,'Enjoy deep character growth and co-op boss battles in this JRPG.','2020/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1222800/VALKYRIE_CONNECT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4036,'lawgivers_ii',NULL,'Lawgivers II is a political sandbox game that features multiple electoral systems, approve/reject bills and govern a country. Start out your career from the very bottom, and perhaps one day, lead your nation to become the most influential in the world.','2023/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1407180/Lawgivers_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4037,'trivia_tricks',NULL,'Trivia Tricks is a quiz game featuring 8-player online where friends play free with Friend Pass! Play competitively against your friends or team up to take on trivia bosses in Co-Op! Pick from a ton of categories including user-created Quiz Packs in Steam Workshop!','2024/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1404090/Trivia_Tricks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4038,'commandos:_behind_enemy_lines',NULL,'Commandos: Behind Enemy Lines is a real-time tactics game set in World War II that puts you in command of a small squad of elite troopers. Send them behind enemy lines on a series of hazardous missions, and bring them back alive.','1998/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6800/Commandos_Behind_Enemy_Lines/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4039,'kill_it_with_fire_2',NULL,'Arachnophobia. The Game. The Sequel. Take on the arachnid menace alone or with friends in full campaign co-op. Wage the arachnid war across time and space and exterminate every last spider across the multiverse, or jump into Spider Hunt PvP and play as the eight-legged menace for the first time!','2024/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2357000/Kill_It_With_Fire_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4040,'mechwarrior_5:_mercenaries_-_call_to_arms',NULL,'This content requires the base game MechWarrior 5: Mercenaries on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1969380/MechWarrior_5_Mercenaries__Call_to_Arms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4041,'the_political_process',NULL,'Explore a dynamic world of politics in this turn-based, political simulator. Create a character, run for political office, write legislation, balance budgets, and more as you move up the political hierarchy.','2019/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1184770/The_Political_Process/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4042,'freeride',NULL,'Hop on board the ride of your life. FREERIDE is a narrative RPG that’s (not-so) secretly a PERSONALITY TEST. Help others solve their Unfinished Business, navigate a looping, branching story, and use telekinesis to change Fate itself. Your subconscious playstyle will reveal who you really are.','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1597910/FREERIDE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4043,'witch_it',NULL,'Witch It is a multiplayer hide & seek game set in a vibrant, magical world. Brave hunters seek hidden witches that curse their villages!','2020/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/559650/Witch_It/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4044,'the_secret_of_monkey_island:_special_edition',NULL,'Back by popular demand, The Secret of Monkey Island™: Special Edition faithfully re-imagines the internationally-acclaimed classic game (originally released in 1990) for original and new audiences alike.','2009/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/32360/The_Secret_of_Monkey_Island_Special_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4045,'anno_1800™_-_season_2_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Anno 1800 on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1247710/Anno_1800__Season_2_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4046,'trials_fusion™',NULL,'Trials Fusion is the gold-standard platform racer for the next-generation of gaming. Built upon the Trials franchise’s proven gameplay foundations, Fusion challenges players endlessly in both classic and all-new ways.','2014/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/245490/Trials_Fusion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4047,'the_walking_dead:_saints_&_sinners_-_chapter_2:_retribution',NULL,'Hunted by the seemingly unstoppable Axeman and facing off against the Tower’s latest push for total dominance, discover what connects these new threats together before it’s too late. New faces, places, weapons and gear all await you on your journey to a final showdown for the city\'s fate.','2023/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1947500/The_Walking_Dead_Saints__Sinners__Chapter_2_Retribution/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4048,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_jaguar_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1748990/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__Jaguar_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4049,'sticky_business:_camp_zinnias',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sticky Business on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3100090/Sticky_Business_Camp_Zinnias/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4050,'world_of_guns:_guns_full_access',NULL,'This content requires the base game World of Guns: Gun Disassembly on Steam in order to play.','2014/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/304310/World_of_Guns_Guns_Full_Access/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4051,'duke_nukem_3d:_20th_anniversary_world_tour',NULL,'Frag like it’s 1996 – this time with even more asses to kick! Join the world’s greatest action hero in Duke Nukem 3D: 20th Anniversary World Tour as he saves Earth once again, kicking alien ass and saving babes across the globe along the way.','2016/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/434050/Duke_Nukem_3D_20th_Anniversary_World_Tour/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4052,'dominion',NULL,'Expand a small kingdom to a mighty Dominion! Play the Spiel des Jahres winning boardgame beloved by millions around the world. Discover the game that defined a genre, Dominion was first to popularize deck-building and remains a staple of tabletop. This is the officially licensed implementation.','2024/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1131620/Dominion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4053,'a_tower_full_of_cats',NULL,'A Tower Full of Cats is a hidden object game where you need to gather cats through the whole history of catkind... and beyond!','2024/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2179170/A_Tower_Full_of_Cats/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4054,'the_stronghold_collection',NULL,'Enjoy the complete medieval experience in The Stronghold Collection, featuring five real-time strategy games. Create and defend your castle stronghold as you expand your lands, survey the castle life in your domain, host great jousting festivals and feasts, or conduct public executions to keep the peasantry in line.','2009/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/901735/The_Stronghold_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4055,'mlb_rivals',NULL,'Take your rivalries to the next level in MLB RIVALS!','2025/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2569510/MLB_Rivals/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4056,'mr.mine',NULL,'Explore the depths of the earth and uncover hidden treasures in this addictive idle mining game. Unlock the power of your drill with hundreds of upgrades, discover mysterious relics, and unearth priceless gems. Can you master the mines and reveal their deepest secrets? Dive in and dig deep!','2020/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1397920/MrMine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4057,'inazuma_eleven:_victory_road',NULL,'The latest entry in the character collection and football simulation RPG series, \"Inazuma Eleven!\" With an original story featuring new main characters, over 4,500 players from across the series\' history to collect and train, as well as exciting online tournaments, you can play the game your way!','2025/8/21','Unreleased','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2799860/INAZUMA_ELEVEN_Victory_Road/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4058,'dicefolk',NULL,'Wield magical dice and build a team of powerful Chimeras to stop a mysterious evil in this tactical roguelite adventure. As a Chimera Summoner, recruit and create your perfect team of mythical beasts and command them to victory using unique dice mechanics.','2024/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1996430/Dicefolk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4059,'fez',NULL,'Gomez is a 2D creature living in a 2D world. Or is he? When the existence of a mysterious 3rd dimension is revealed to him, Gomez is sent out on a journey that will take him to the very end of time and space. Use your ability to navigate 3D structures from 4 distinct classic 2D perspectives.','2013/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/224760/FEZ/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4060,'warhammer:_vermintide_2_-_shadows_over_bögenhafen',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer: Vermintide 2 on Steam in order to play.','2018/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/828790/Warhammer_Vermintide_2__Shadows_Over_Bgenhafen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4061,'superhot:_mind_control_delete',NULL,'The long-awaited third game in the groundbreaking SUPERHOT franchise - MIND CONTROL DELETE gives you more insight into the world of SUPERHOT, more story, more signature gameplay. Keep dancing the slow-motion ballet of destruction for so much longer than ever before.','2020/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/690040/SUPERHOT_MIND_CONTROL_DELETE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4062,'hitman_2:_silent_assassin',NULL,'Enter the realm of a retired assassin, forced back into action by treason. You may be a hired killer but you still have a sense of loyalty and justice. Visit the dark recesses of a world corrupted by crime, greed, degradation and dishonor. And a past that catches up with you.','2002/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6850/Hitman_2_Silent_Assassin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4063,'war_thunder_-_rdf/lt_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game War Thunder on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3386540/War_Thunder__RDFLT_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4064,'aliens:_colonial_marines_collection',NULL,'You & your friends are the deadliest killers in the galaxy – the US Colonial Marines. It’s up to you to not just survive, but wipe out the Xeno infestation.','2012/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/49540/Aliens_Colonial_Marines_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4065,'s.t.a.l.k.e.r.:_shadow_of_chornobyl_-_enhanced_edition',NULL,'S.T.A.L.K.E.R.: Shadow of Chornobyl, the first chapter of the Legends of the Zone Trilogy, which started it all.','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2427410/STALKER_Shadow_of_Chornobyl__Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4066,'icbm',NULL,'ICBM is a real-time strategy game of nuclear destruction. Research new technologies, build up your nuclear stockpile and use a combination of ships, planes and missiles to strike at the heart of your opponents’ cities while keeping your population safe from harm.','2020/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1178220/ICBM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4067,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_nissan_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2021/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1685720/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__Nissan_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4068,'supermoves:_world_of_parkour',NULL,'Supermoves is the ultimate world of parkour where you run, jump and grind rails to glory! Brave the single player career mode, speedrun your way to the leaderboards or race against your friends in multiplayer Tournaments. Make your own games and levels with our powerful tools. Never stop running!','2024/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1959580/Supermoves_World_of_Parkour/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4069,'mass_effect™_3_n7_digital_deluxe_edition_(2012)',NULL,'Earth is burning. The Reapers have taken over and other civilizations are falling like dominoes. Lead the final fight to save humanity and take back Earth from these terrifying machines, Commander Shepard.','2012/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238020/Mass_Effect_3_N7_Digital_Deluxe_Edition_2012/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4070,'starship_troopers:_terran_command_-_raising_hell',NULL,'This content requires the base game Starship Troopers: Terran Command on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2139990/Starship_Troopers_Terran_Command__Raising_Hell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4071,'stay_out',NULL,'Stay Out - is a MMORPG with shooter elements, based on spirit of “stalking” - an urban exploration, searching and exploring mysterious, abandoned and forgotten by humanity pieces of our planet.','2019/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1180380/Stay_Out/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_85'),(4072,'subsistence',NULL,'Subsistence is a sandbox, first person, solo or co-op, PvE open-world survival game. Struggle through changing seasons to build a base, develop technology and gear-up in the hostile environment. Defend yourself from wildlife, the elements and AI hunters (who also build bases in the world).','2016/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/418030/Subsistence/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4073,'stronghold_kingdoms',NULL,'A massively multiplayer grand strategy game, Stronghold Kingdoms is about forging alliances, political mind games, city-building and castle sieges with thousands of other players!','2012/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/47410/Stronghold_Kingdoms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4074,'the_sims™_3_late_night',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2010/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/47894/The_Sims_3_Late_Night/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4075,'icewind_dale:_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Icewind Dale: Enhanced Edition revives the classic RPG with fresh updates for modern players. Build a party of Dungeons & Dragons heroes and explore the frozen tundra in this retro fantasy adventure.','2014/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/321800/Icewind_Dale_Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4076,'vtol_vr:_t-55_tyro_-_trainer_jet',NULL,'This content requires the base game VTOL VR on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2141700/VTOL_VR_T55_Tyro__Trainer_Jet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4077,'dungeon_keeper_gold™',NULL,'Build your dungeon & protect it with a labyrinth of dark corridors, a web of deadly traps, an arsenal of powerful spells, and an army of bloodthirsty demons','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1996630/Dungeon_Keeper_Gold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4078,'rusty_lake_paradise',NULL,'Rusty Lake Paradise is set on a small remote island which is cursed by the ten plagues of Egypt. Solve all the mysteries of this dark, macabre puzzle adventure. Paradise builds upon the distinctive atmosphere and excitement from the Rusty Lake series.','2018/1/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/744190/Rusty_Lake_Paradise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4079,'ena:_dream_bbq_-_supporter_edition_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game ENA: Dream BBQ on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3416090/ENA_Dream_BBQ__Supporter_Edition_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4080,'axiom_verge',NULL,'Explore and uncover the mystery of a surreal alien world by blasting aliens and glitching your environment in this intense retro side-scrolling action/adventure.','2015/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/332200/Axiom_Verge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4081,'the_pale_beyond',NULL,'You didn’t ask to lead this expedition, but here you are. Stuck in the ice, Captain missing, miles from civilisation. Someone has to take charge. Manage your meagre resources, balance safety and morale, make the hard calls, and head in the only direction you can - through The Pale Beyond.','2023/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1266030/The_Pale_Beyond/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4082,'dokapon!_sword_of_fury',NULL,'Whosoever winds up wealthiest in the end (meaning, the bearer of the most assets) shall be deemed the winner! How do you achieve that? Well, by fighting monsters, plundering, pillaging, and betraying your best buds; that\'s how! All the rules are made to be broken in this board game!','2025/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3077020/DOKAPON_Sword_of_Fury/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4083,'tchia',NULL,'A Tropical Open-World adventure. Climb, glide, swim, and sail your boat around a beautiful archipelago in this physics-driven sandbox. Take control of any animal or object you can find, and Jam on your fully playable Ukulele.','2024/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1496590/Tchia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4084,'death_note_killer_within',NULL,'DEATH NOTE Killer Within is an online social deduction game for up to 10 players. Players will be split into two teams with different objectives. To win the game, players will need to figure out each other’s identities and either eliminate L who threatens Kira\'s power or seize the Death Note.','2024/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2213190/DEATH_NOTE_Killer_Within/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4085,'zuma_deluxe',NULL,'Deep in the jungle lie hidden temples bursting with traps and trickery, and it\'s up to you to uncover their treasures. Fire magical balls from your stone frog idol to make matches of three or more and clear the deadly chain before it reaches the golden skull.','2006/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3330/Zuma_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4086,'lords_and_villeins',NULL,'Build a prosperous settlement in a unique simulation of a feudal economy - each family runs their shop, owns their goods, and trades with other villagers in a free market. You will manage the land, build houses, organise events, set taxes, and balance supply and demand while engaging in diplomacy!','2022/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1287530/Lords_and_Villeins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4087,'nuclear_throne',NULL,'Nuclear Throne is a post-apocalyptic roguelike-like top-down shooter. Not \'the final hope of humanity\' post-apocalyptic, but \'humanity is extinct and mutants and monsters now roam the world\' post-apocalyptic. Fight your way through the wastelands with powerful weaponry, collecting radiation to mutate some new limbs and abilities.','2015/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/242680/Nuclear_Throne/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4088,'endling_-_extinction_is_forever',NULL,'As the last mother fox on Earth, your cubs need all your care to survive in a merciless world that slowly destroys itself. You have to help them, teach them and save them. And you should never forget that extinction is forever – in the real world and in this 2023 BAFTA award winning experience.','2022/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/898890/Endling__Extinction_is_Forever/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4089,'the_witcher_3:_wild_hunt_-_hearts_of_stone',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt on Steam in order to play.','2015/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/378649/The_Witcher_3_Wild_Hunt__Hearts_of_Stone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4090,'the_enjenir:_the_engineering_physics_building_simulator',NULL,'Put your engineering and problem solving skills to the test in this sandbox physics building game! Enjoy the freedom of completely gridless 3D sandbox building combined with hilarious ragdoll third person controls, offering a truly unique and hilarious \"Enjeniring\" experience!','2023/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1800940/The_Enjenir_The_Engineering_Physics_Building_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4091,'webbed',NULL,'Swing through the trees, spin sticky webs, and make friends with bugs! Be the adorable spider you\'ve always wanted to be.','2021/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1390350/Webbed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4092,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_renault_trucks_t_tuning_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1967640/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Renault_Trucks_T_Tuning_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4093,'boyfriend_dungeon',NULL,'Date your weapons! Romance swords, daggers, and polearms to level them up in this “shack-and-slash” dungeon crawling adventure.','2021/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/674930/Boyfriend_Dungeon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4094,'idigging',NULL,'In iDigging, you’ll balance treasure hunting, home improvement, and the strategy of hiding from curious neighbors and authorities. Upgrade, dig, and create your best life despite all the challenges!','2025/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3447690/iDigging/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4095,'simpleplanes',NULL,'Build airplanes by snapping parts together, designing wing sections, and attaching engines. At any time, you can strap yourself into the cockpit and see how it flies with realistic physics. If you\'re not in the mood for building, over 100,000 airplanes are available to download for free.','2015/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/397340/SimplePlanes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4096,'ticket_to_ride®:_round_the_world_ticket',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ticket to Ride® on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2608230/Ticket_to_Ride_Round_the_World_Ticket/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4097,'spelunky',NULL,'Spelunky is a unique platformer with randomized levels that offer a challenging new experience each time you play. Journey deep underground and explore fantastic places filled with all manner of monsters, traps, and treasure.','2013/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/239350/Spelunky/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4098,'cyber_manhunt',NULL,'Cyber Manhunt is a story-oriented puzzle game focusing on big data, hacking, citizen privacy, and social workers. It focuses on social issues such as cyber violence and privacy breaches.','2021/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1216710/Cyber_Manhunt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4099,'draw_&_guess',NULL,'An online party game of drawing and guessing for up to 16 players with a variety of modes. Bring out the best (or worst) of your drawing and guessing skills!','2021/3/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1483870/Draw__Guess/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4100,'lost_planet™:_extreme_condition',NULL,'Driven to the brink of extinction on ice-covered wastelands, humankind fights to survive. Battle to survive against gargantuan alien Akrid and treacherous Snow Pirates on the vast and frozen landscape of EDN III.','2007/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6510/Lost_Planet_Extreme_Condition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4101,'jumping_jazz_cats',NULL,'Play, race and hang with your feline friends in this online platformer party game! Purrfect your pussycat parkour as you sprint, jump, bounce, swing, skid and slide through a collection of collaborative and competitive mini-games set in a grandiose cartoon mansion. Get jumpin\', jazz cats!','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1951780/Jumping_Jazz_Cats/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4102,'hacknet',NULL,'Hacknet is an immersive, terminal-based hacking simulator for PC. Dive down a rabbit hoIe as you follow the instructions of a recently deceased hacker, whose death may not have been the accident the media reports.','2015/8/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/365450/Hacknet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4103,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_mighty_griffin_tuning_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2016/6/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/461244/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Mighty_Griffin_Tuning_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4104,'not_tonight',NULL,'Person of European Heritage #112: Welcome to Relocation Block B, your new home. Your designated role is \'Bouncer\'. Work hard, stay out of trouble, and we might let you stay in the UK.','2018/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/733790/Not_Tonight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4105,'autopsy_simulator',NULL,'Autopsy Simulator is a first-person horror-sim hybrid where players take on the role of a practice pathologist and study case files, created in collaboration with real-world forensic doctors, to help guide their dissection of anatomically accurate bodies to determine each subject’s cause of death.','2024/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1283230/Autopsy_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4106,'medieval_blacksmith',NULL,'Medieval Blacksmith is a blacksmithing simulation set in a magical medieval world. Play as a blacksmith with no past, craft legendary weapons from daggers to spears, and forge your path to becoming the world’s greatest. Dive into a story filled with adventure and endless creative possibilities!','2025/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2732100/Medieval_Blacksmith/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4107,'pyre',NULL,'Pyre is a party-based RPG from the creators of Bastion and Transistor. Lead your band of exiles to freedom through a series of mystical competitions in the Campaign, or challenge a friend to a fast-paced ritual showdown in the head-to-head Versus Mode.','2017/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/462770/Pyre/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4108,'venba',NULL,'Venba is a short narrative cooking game, where you play as an Indian mom who immigrates to Canada with her family in the 1980s. Cook various dishes and restore lost recipes, hold branching conversations, and explore South Indian food in this story about family, love, and loss.','2023/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1491670/Venba/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4109,'slime_rancher:_secret_style_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Slime Rancher on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1079180/Slime_Rancher_Secret_Style_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4110,'berserk_or_die',NULL,'This is an action game in which players attempt to survive by defeating a number of enemies which appear from the left and right sides of the screen. Use a unique keyboard-banging control scheme for maximum dopamine! Go Berserk, or Die!','2025/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2874130/Berserk_or_Die/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4111,'train_sim_world®_5:_cathcart_circle_line:_glasgow_-_neilston_&_newton_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2969840/Train_Sim_World_5_Cathcart_Circle_Line_Glasgow__Neilston__Newton_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4112,'astro_colony',NULL,'Explore endless Universe and create the most efficient constellation of colonies. Build conveyor systems to automate production. Take care of Astronauts and their needs! Establish new colonies as part of intergalactic simulation.','2022/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1614550/Astro_Colony/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4113,'platform_8',NULL,'You are trapped on a train that runs forever. Keep an eye out for anomalies and find a way out.','2024/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2903560/Platform_8/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4114,'war_thunder_-_a-10a_thunderbolt_(early)_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game War Thunder on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1947130/War_Thunder__A10A_Thunderbolt_Early_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4115,'little-known_galaxy',NULL,'Join Space Alliance as a new captain-in-training and work with your crew to solve the mysteries of an ancient relic found on the Grey Planet. Little-Known Galaxy is a cozy single-player RPG space adventure full of friendly characters, exploration, crafting, and farming.','2024/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2521600/LittleKnown_Galaxy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4116,'far:_lone_sails',NULL,'Traverse a dried-out seabed littered with the remains of a decaying civilization. Keep your unique vessel going, overcome numerous obstacles and withstand the hazardous weather conditions. How far can you make it? What will you find?','2018/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/609320/FAR_Lone_Sails/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4117,'builder_simulator',NULL,'Builder Simulator is the perfect game for those who want to build a house, from the ground up, one brick at a time. On easy, the game will guide and teach you by showing you full instruction, but on hard you will get no help - instead rely on your builder skills and make everything yourself.','2022/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1120320/Builder_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4118,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_weapon_pack_1',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2018/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/766870/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Weapon_Pack_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4119,'nekopara_vol._4',NULL,'Despite the popularity of, \"La Soleil\", Kashou\'s father continues to disapprove of it. Determined to get his father to approve of him, Kashou journeys to France to seek advice from the teacher who taught him his craft. A new chapter awaits in the next volume of the NEKOPARA series!','2020/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1406990/NEKOPARA_Vol_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_86'),(4120,'blade_&_soul_neo',NULL,'Relive an iconic tale with Blade & Soul NEO. Fully remastered where players reconnect with the original spirit of the free-to-play, open-world MMORPG. Experience a richer visually enhanced experience set in a world of Wuxia mythology where fast-paced combat collides with the stunning visual beauty.','2025/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3669060/Blade__Soul_NEO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4121,'deceit_2',NULL,'Deceit 2 is an online social deduction horror game. Inspire fear as the Infected, play detective as the Innocent, or create mayhem as the Cursed. Trapped with friends and strangers: who can you trust to help you escape?','2023/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2064870/Deceit_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4122,'zaccaria_pinball',NULL,'Play free and try tables in trial mode with Zaccaria Pinball, featuring 140+ tables, including 40+ officially licensed from Zaccaria was founded by three brothers: Marino, Franco, & Natale. Zaccaria was the world’s 3rd largest pinball manufacturer, next to Bally & Williams. Relive the golden age.','2016/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/444930/Zaccaria_Pinball/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4123,'arcade_paradise',NULL,'Manage profits, pick up gum, do the laundry and get coin to unlock arcade units and flip the family laundromat business to become an Arcade Paradise!','2022/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1388870/Arcade_Paradise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4124,'iron_saga_vs',NULL,'Take control of an assortment of superb mechs and engage in thrilling combat with other enthusiasts on the same battlefield! In addition to original mecha, well-known IPs such as \"Mazinger Z\" and “Dancouga – Super Beast Machine God” also ready for the mecha war!','2025/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2463800/Iron_Saga_VS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4125,'#drive_rally',NULL,'#DRIVE Rally is an arcade-inspired rally-driving experience set in the golden racing era of the ‘90s. Grab your co-driver and burn some rubber on iconic race-winning cars across a variety of terrains in some of the most iconic rallying locations in the world!','2025/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2494780/DRIVE_Rally/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4126,'the_entropy_centre',NULL,'Think in reverse. Outsmart the impossible. A mind-bending first-person adventure where you solve ingenious and complex puzzles by rewinding objects through time.','2022/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1730590/The_Entropy_Centre/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4127,'missing_banban',NULL,'Grab your weapons and delve into this action side-scroller intense adventure. Jump around and explore the insane levels. Shoot and dodge your way through enemies. Fight to find your friend and solve the disappearance!','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3113680/Missing_Banban/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4128,'totally_reliable_delivery_service',NULL,'Delivery Attempted. That\'s the Totally Reliable Delivery Service guarantee! T.R.D.S. is a ragdoll physics simulation about terrible package delivery couriers. Work together using odd machinery, useful gadgets, and the wonders of physics to reliably deliver packages to their destination.','2021/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1011670/Totally_Reliable_Delivery_Service/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4129,'sentry',NULL,'SENTRY is an action-defense first person shooter where you defend your spaceship against invading aliens. Plot an escape route through hostile space and battle the enemy across your vessel with the support of traps, turrets and environmental destruction.','2024/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1252680/SENTRY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4130,'bang_average_football',NULL,'Experience the thrill of the beautiful game in Bang Average Football - the fast-paced, addictive, easy-to-learn football game for 1-4 players! Play against your friends for footballing glory in multiplayer, or turn a hopeless club into national champions as player-manager in Story mode!','2024/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2393770/Bang_Average_Football/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4131,'immortality',NULL,'Marissa Marcel was a film star. She made three movies. But none of the movies were ever released. And Marissa Marcel disappeared. An interactive trilogy from Sam Barlow, creator of Her Story.','2022/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1350200/IMMORTALITY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4132,'nova_hearts',NULL,'A mysterious force of power transforms you and other highly attractive people in your area into superheroes and villains! TEXT, DATE and FIGHT your friends and enemies alike.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2506290/Nova_Hearts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4133,'swords_&_souls:_neverseen',NULL,'Swords & Souls: Neverseen is a unique RPG where leveling up takes skill! Create, train and upgrade your character as you please, discover The Neverseen and its eccentric locals, and battle across the lands to foil an evil witch\'s plans!','2019/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/679900/Swords__Souls_Neverseen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4134,'love_is_all_around',NULL,'The player becomes Gu Yi, uses the first-person perspective to immerse himself in meeting six beauties, and embarks on a joyful and sweet love journey with them. Six girls that are charming, innocent, intelligent, wild, sexy, glamorous, who will go to the end with you is up to you to decide.','2023/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2322560/Love_Is_All_Around/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4135,'planet_zoo:_deluxe_upgrade_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1098120/Planet_Zoo_Deluxe_Upgrade_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4136,'intruder',NULL,'The ultimate spy-vs-guards simulator. Carefully sneak your way to the objective as Intruders or use the wide variety of tactical gadgets to trap your opponents as Guards. Intruder allows for stealth, teamwork, and environmental interactions never before seen in a multiplayer game.','2019/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/518150/Intruder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4137,'the_witch\'s_house_mv',NULL,'A young girl, Viola, is drawn inexorably to a mysterious manor that seems to change behind her back. It is a place of pain, turmoil and death. Plumb its detestable depths and abominable history. Untangle riddles that bar your perilous path. And flee the hellish halls of The Witch’s House.','2018/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/885810/The_Witchs_House_MV/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4138,'no-skin',NULL,'Horror Roguelike characterized by an experimental artstyle and storytelling, strategic gameplay and deep mysteries','2025/2/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3011030/NOSKIN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4139,'everhood_2',NULL,'AN UNCONVENTIONAL ARPG where you battle enemies through musical encounters while being accompanied by a raven who promises to retrieve your voice if you slay the mighty Mind Dragon!','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1984020/Everhood_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4140,'yuppie_psycho:_executive_edition',NULL,'Join Brian Pasternack on his first working day at Sintracorp. Uncertain, unprepared, and massively unqualified, will Pasternack have what it takes to shine in Sintracorp’s hierarchy? It all depends on how he performs on his first assignment… and whether he survives it.','2019/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/597760/Yuppie_Psycho_Executive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4141,'samurai_warriors_5',NULL,'A new SAMURAI WARRIORS begins. After a 7-year wait, a new instalment in the tactical action series \"SAMURAI WARRIORS\" is finally here!','2021/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1591530/SAMURAI_WARRIORS_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4142,'nightclub_simulator',NULL,'Step into the wild world of Nightclub Simulator VR! Experience an exclusive party where you can dance, mingle, fight, or flirt your way through a chaotic nightclub scene. Interact with lifelike NPCs, build relationships, cause a little mayhem, or just enjoy the music. Your night, your rules.','2024/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2729480/NightClub_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4143,'rabi-ribi',NULL,'Dodge bullets, missiles and lasers in battle as you wrap your head around that bunny girl costume! Combo away with your mighty Piko Hammer or spam various spells from afar with your fiery fairy friend. Explore and explode through Rabi-Rabi Island as you collect power-ups and uncover secrets...','2016/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/400910/RabiRibi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4144,'umineko_when_they_cry_-_answer_arcs',NULL,'This is the 2nd half of the Umineko When They Cry sound novel series, featuring episodes 5 through 8. This steam version features multi-language options, swap-able renewed character sprites, as well as the original BGMs and un-cut content.','2017/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/639490/Umineko_When_They_Cry__Answer_Arcs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4145,'fate:_reawakened',NULL,'Reawaken the critically acclaimed FATE games like never before! Play all 4 classic dungeon crawler titles with enhanced graphics as you battle through challenging procedurally generated dungeons, learn powerful spells, and fish to your heart’s content. Are you up to the task? Your FATE awaits!','2025/3/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3030720/FATE_Reawakened/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4146,'touhou:_lost_branch_of_legend',NULL,'Welcome to Eientei, combine multiple colors of mana to build your ideal deck, duel with gensokyo girls, and chase back the mysterious moon treasure. Also, enjoy the unpredictable Roguelike with fantasy Danmaku!','2022/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1140150/Touhou_Lost_Branch_of_Legend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4147,'ragnarock',NULL,'Lead your viking ship to victory in this rhythm game (PC or VR)! Pound your drums to the sound of epic music, from celtic rock to viking power metal, and set sail against your rivals in multiplayer mode. Will you outrace them all and carve your name on top of the leaderboard?','2021/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1345820/Ragnarock/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4148,'tainted_grail:_the_fall_of_avalon_-_supporters_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tainted Grail: The Fall of Avalon on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3687050/Tainted_Grail_The_Fall_of_Avalon__Supporters_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4149,'pro_basketball_manager_2025',NULL,'Suit up and become the manager of a basketball team. You’ll have all the managerial tools you’ve come to expect in a manager game, scouting, facilities, training and more. Will you put emphasis on coaching or player development? Success is only the result of your decisions both on and off the court.','2024/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2935400/Pro_Basketball_Manager_2025/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4150,'age_of_empires_iii:_definitive_edition_-_the_african_royals',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires III: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2021/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1581451/Age_of_Empires_III_Definitive_Edition__The_African_Royals/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4151,'beyblade_x_xone',NULL,'\'BEYBLADE X XONE is a \"Beyblade action\" game that faithfully recreates the BEYBLADE X series (distributed by TOMY Company, Ltd.) that is popular among fans of all ages. Battle through intense Beybattles and aim for the top of The X!','2024/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3023070/BEYBLADE_X_XONE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4152,'realflight_trainer_edition',NULL,'RealFlight Trainer Edition is the perfect way to learn radio control flying on your PC. With 8 aircraft from Horizon Hobby (more are unlockable) and flying lessons from experienced RC pilots, you\'ll be ready to solo in no time. When you\'re ready, an upgrade to RealFlight Evolution is also available.','2020/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1314820/RealFlight_Trainer_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4153,'lost_eidolons:_veil_of_the_witch',NULL,'From the world of \"Lost Eidolons\" comes an all-new roguelite tactical RPG! Stranded on a mysterious island with scattered memories, your only means of survival is to fight. Recruit allies, undertake a perilous journey, and battle to reclaim what you\'ve lost... no matter how many deaths it takes.','2024/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2530490/Lost_Eidolons_Veil_of_the_Witch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4154,'pan\'orama',NULL,'Relax and unleash your creativity in this new city building puzzle game. Create amazing landscapes and discover wide range of structures with special abilities. Enter the world of beauty and tranquility with the panoramas of your own creation and don\'t forget to pet your new animal friends!','2023/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1730250/Panorama/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4155,'arctic_motel_simulator',NULL,'Have you ever been to the Arctic? Do you want to open a motel in the Arctic? With the company of aurora, blizzards, polar days and nights, primeval forests, and wild animals, can you turn a run-down motel into a landmark in the Arctic?','2025/2/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3098470/Arctic_Motel_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4156,'wee_tanks!',NULL,'Explosions. Tanks. Bosses. And more explosions. Crazy fun with your friends. Hundreds of maps. Boom.','2023/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1797680/Wee_Tanks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4157,'iron_meat',NULL,'Iron Meat is a run-and-gun arcade shooter that immerses players in an apocalyptic future overrun by \"The Meat,\" an iron-ravenous mass mutating everything in its path. Blast your way through retro-inspired stages and bosses to uncover the shocking horrors behind secret experiments on the Moon.','2024/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1157740/Iron_Meat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4158,'element_td_2_-_tower_defense',NULL,'Element TD 2 sees you combine powerful elements to create unique towers. Prove your defenses against challenging foes, and compete or cooperate with others to determine who has mastered the elements.','2021/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1018830/Element_TD_2__Tower_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4159,'northgard_-_cross_of_vidar_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Northgard on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2228200/Northgard__Cross_of_Vidar_Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4160,'the_sims™_4_jungle_adventure',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2018/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235744/The_Sims_4_Jungle_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4161,'lego®_harry_potter:_years_1-4',NULL,'Build the adventure from Privet Drive to the Triwizard Tournament and experience the magic of the first four Harry Potter stories – LEGO style! Explore Hogwarts™ School of Witchcraft and Wizardry, learn spells, brew potions and relive the adventures like never before with tongue-in-cheek humor and creative customization that is unique to...','2010/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/21130/LEGO_Harry_Potter_Years_14/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4162,'shady_knight',NULL,'Shady Knight is a first-person skill-driven melee action game centered around swift swordplay, acrobatic archery, and fluid platforming that seamlessly blends combat and parkour skills into a stylish dance of death full of creative chaos.','2024/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1155650/Shady_Knight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4163,'sas:_zombie_assault_4',NULL,'Purge the undead! Intense action-shooter with deep rpg elements, including upgradeable guns and armor, unique class skills, and class special abilities. Entire game can be played single player or as a 4-player online co-op game, including PvP events like Last Man Standing.','2017/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/678800/SAS_Zombie_Assault_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4164,'zeus_+_poseidon',NULL,'Zeus + Poseidon delivers hundreds of hours of gameplay in one game!','2016/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/566050/Zeus__Poseidon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4165,'kitty_powers\'_matchmaker',NULL,'Kitty Powers’ Matchmaker is a hilarious dating simulator with a difference. Manage your own matchmaking agency with the guidance of your fabulous boss, drag queen diva Kitty Powers!','2015/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/285740/Kitty_Powers_Matchmaker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4166,'don\'t_escape:_4_days_to_survive',NULL,'Survive through four days at the end of the world in this post-apocalyptic point-and-click thriller where your choices could keep you alive... or not.','2019/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/611760/Dont_Escape_4_Days_to_Survive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4167,'warhammer_40,000:_space_marine_2_-_ultramarines_cosmetic_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2792150/Warhammer_40000_Space_Marine_2__Ultramarines_Cosmetic_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4168,'blazing_sails',NULL,'Fight for survival in Blazing Sails, a fast-paced pirate PvP game! Create your own unique pirate and ship. Band together with other players to command your mighty vessel! Explore different game-modes, maps, weapons, ship types and more while eliminating other crews in epic battles on land and sea!','2023/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1158940/Blazing_Sails/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_87'),(4169,'the_lord_of_the_rings:_return_to_moria™_rohan_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Lord of the Rings: Return to Moria™ on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3308250/The_Lord_of_the_Rings_Return_to_Moria_Rohan_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4170,'f1®_25:_f1®_the_movie_-_chapter_scenarios',NULL,'This content requires the base game F1® 25 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3335220/F1_25_F1_The_Movie__Chapter_Scenarios/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4171,'rubber_bandits',NULL,'Rubber Bandits is a criminally fun multiplayer party game for up to 4 players. With 8 action-packed game modes, players steal, brawl, and dash to the finish line with the most loot to win!','2021/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1206610/Rubber_Bandits/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4172,'crypto_miner_tycoon_simulator',NULL,'Build rigs to mine Bitcoin, Ethereum and other cryptocurrency. Trade on the market to grow wealth. Expand your business into new offices. Hire skilled employees and assign tasks. Use cash from your mega farms to research new technologies and reach the goal of each scenario.','2022/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1859290/Crypto_Miner_Tycoon_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4173,'henpri',NULL,'Thrown into prison for an act of self-expression, protagonist Shuichiro must confront both a violent system and his own actions—or else try to find happiness on the inside in this visual novel from the makers of NUKITASHI.','2025/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3094010/HENPRI/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4174,'frog_detective_3:_corruption_at_cowboy_county',NULL,'You\'re a detective, and a frog, and it\'s time to solve a mystery in the wild west.','2022/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1171320/Frog_Detective_3_Corruption_at_Cowboy_County/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4175,'cat_quest_ii',NULL,'Open-world action-RPG in a fantasy realm of cats and dogs. Sequel to the award-winning original, CAT QUEST II lets you play solo or with a friend, as both a cat and dog! Quest in a world filled with magic, defeat monsters and collect loot in a catventure like never before!','2019/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/914710/Cat_Quest_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4176,'mini_airways_-_atc_simulator',NULL,'Mini Airways is a real-time management game where you play the role of an air traffic controller. Clear your aircraft to takeoff & land, direct them to the destination...and most of all don\'t let them crash!! London, Tokyo, Shanghai... Test your ATC skills in distinctive maps around the globe!','2024/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2289650/Mini_Airways__ATC_simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4177,'blood™_fresh_supply',NULL,'Battle an army of sycophantic cultists, zombies, gargoyles, hellhounds, and an insatiable host of horrors in your quest to defeat the evil Tchernobog. Squirm through 42 loathesome levels filled with more atmosphere than a Lovecraftian mausoleum.','2019/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1010750/Blood_Fresh_Supply/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4178,'titan_quest:_eternal_embers',NULL,'This content requires the base game Titan Quest Anniversary Edition on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1804460/Titan_Quest_Eternal_Embers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4179,'absolver',NULL,'Absolver is an online multiplayer combat game where players are placed behind the mask of a Prospect under control of the Guides, the new rulers of the fallen Adal Empire, who will determine your worth in joining their elite corps of Absolvers.','2017/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/473690/Absolver/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4180,'sonic_colors:_ultimate',NULL,'Join Sonic in the high-speed adventure of a lifetime across a colorful interstellar amusement park. Color the Universe in Sonic Colors: Ultimate!','2023/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2055290/Sonic_Colors_Ultimate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4181,'knight_online',NULL,'The Great Battle between Karus and El Morad has arrived to Steam! Pledge allegiance to one of the Nations and put your skills to the test in one of the best PvP system in the MMORPG universe!','2016/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/389430/Knight_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4182,'sunless_skies:_sovereign_edition',NULL,'SAIL THE STARS. BETRAY YOUR QUEEN. MURDER A SUN. Sunless Skies is a Gothic Horror roleplay game with a focus on exploration and exquisite storytelling.','2019/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/596970/Sunless_Skies_Sovereign_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4183,'surgeon_simulator',NULL,'Surgeon Simulator is an over-the-top operation sim, stitching together pitch-black humour with life-saving surgery. Become Dr. Burke, a would-be surgeon with a less than conventional toolkit, as he performs procedures on patients including the Heavy from TF2! ...is that a hammer?','2013/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/233720/Surgeon_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4184,'marble_it_up!_ultra',NULL,'Roll, bounce, boost, and blast your way to victory in Marble It Up! Ultra - the ultimate marble platformer. Chase the records of your friends and the world\'s best players through a vast campaign - or face them head-on in thrilling multiplayer mayhem. Get ready to roll!','2018/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/864060/Marble_It_Up_Ultra/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4185,'hatsune_miku:_project_diva_mega_mix+_extra_song_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hatsune Miku: Project DIVA Mega Mix+ on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1887030/Hatsune_Miku_Project_DIVA_Mega_Mix_Extra_Song_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4186,'dcs:_f-15c_flaming_cliffs',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2014/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/250300/DCS_F15C_Flaming_Cliffs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4187,'shashingo:_learn_japanese_with_photography',NULL,'Shashingo is an edutainment game that teaches you Japanese through virtual photography. With your trusty camera, take photographs of the fictional streets of Japan to capture new words and images as fully translated flash cards!','2024/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1632490/Shashingo_Learn_Japanese_with_Photography/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4188,'spark_the_electric_jester_3',NULL,'High speed 3D action platformer! Join Spark on his latest adventure.','2022/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1629530/Spark_the_Electric_Jester_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4189,'space_engineers_-_heavy_industry',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2021/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1676100/Space_Engineers__Heavy_Industry/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4190,'later_alligator',NULL,'Pat the alligator, a (mostly) harmless and (probably) innocent reptile is at the center of a conspiracy that could bring down the biggest, scariest family in Alligator New York City: his own! Explore the city, meet the Family, and try to save Pat before the clock runs out.','2019/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/966320/Later_Alligator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4191,'martha_is_dead',NULL,'Martha Is Dead is a dark first-person psychological thriller, set in 1944 Italy, that blurs the lines between reality, superstition and the tragedy of war.','2022/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/515960/Martha_Is_Dead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4192,'alba:_a_wildlife_adventure',NULL,'Even the smallest person can make a big difference. Join Alba, as she sets out to save her beautiful island and its wildlife. And possibly start a revolution.','2020/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1337010/Alba_A_Wildlife_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4193,'resident_evil_2_-_all_in-game_rewards_unlocked',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/920571/Resident_Evil_2__All_Ingame_Rewards_Unlocked/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4194,'disney_infinity_1.0:_gold_edition',NULL,'Enjoy Disney Infinity with a Full Toy Box! Disney Infinity 1.0: Gold Edition gives you the freedom to create stories and play experiences with all Disney Infinity 1.0 Characters and Playsets Unlocked and ready for you to mix, match and mash up to invent just about any adventure you can imagine.','2016/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/541640/Disney_Infinity_10_Gold_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4195,'golden_idol_mysteries:_the_lemurian_vampire',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Case of the Golden Idol on 