l face the darkest of horrors while struggling with his own grip on reality.','2009/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/19000/Silent_Hill_Homecoming/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4202,'samurai_shodown',NULL,'SAMURAI REBOOT! A brand new SAMURAI SHODOWN game takes aim for the world stage!','2021/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1342260/SAMURAI_SHODOWN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4203,'galacticare',NULL,'Build, manage and optimise intergalactic hospitals! Recruit staff to satisfy the whims of various alien species, and cure their bizarre illnesses - for money! Save the (literal) Galaxy in story mode, or head into sandbox to design the hospital of your dreams.','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/494730/Galacticare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4204,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_map_pack_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2955880/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Map_Pack_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4205,'shovel_knight_pocket_dungeon',NULL,'Delve with Shovel Knight into the depths of the Pocket Dungeon in an action-packed puzzle adventure mashup like none other!','2021/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1184760/Shovel_Knight_Pocket_Dungeon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4206,'menace_from_the_deep_-_the_rift_of_sanity',NULL,'This content requires the base game Menace from the Deep on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3752400/Menace_from_the_Deep__The_Rift_of_Sanity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4207,'king_of_the_castle',NULL,'Take your rightful place on the throne in this political party game for 4+ players. Rule the kingdom with an iron fist or silver tongue as you steer through bloodshed, intrigue & madcap disaster! Can you keep your crown when others plot your downfall? More importantly, can you keep your head?','2023/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1839880/King_Of_The_Castle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4208,'20_minutes_till_dawn',NULL,'20 Minutes Till Dawn is a survival roguelite where endless hordes of creatures lurk from the dark. Craft an array of overpowering builds and eradicate waves of Lovecraftian nightmares. Will you be able to survive the night?','2023/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1966900/20_Minutes_Till_Dawn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4209,'spellforce:_conquest_of_eo_-_weaver\'s_realms',NULL,'This content requires the base game SpellForce: Conquest of Eo on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3132660/SpellForce_Conquest_of_Eo__Weavers_Realms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4210,'atelier_rorona_~the_alchemist_of_arland~_dx',NULL,'First release in the Arland series. The main character Rorona must save her Atelier from being closed by the Kingdom. Using Synthesis, Exploration, and Battle, gain recognition for the Atelier and save it from being closed.','2018/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/936160/Atelier_Rorona_The_Alchemist_of_Arland_DX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4211,'book_bound',NULL,'Book Bound is a cozy bookshop simulation game. Use a range of items to decorate your shop and make it truly yours. Pick the books you would like to sell. Help customers find books they want most. Sell books in different genres.','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3320800/Book_Bound/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4212,'hex_of_steel',NULL,'Hex of Steel is a refreshing WWII wargame covering all fronts featuring a certain amount of original mechanics. Fight in solo against finally a decent AI throughout Europe, Africa or the Pacific, or against a friend in the cross-platform PBEM or real time multiplayer. Coop is also an option!','2020/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1240630/Hex_of_Steel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4213,'tap_ninja_-_idle_game',NULL,'Defeat enemies, earn gold, upgrade your village, become a Ninja Master!','2022/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1891700/Tap_Ninja__Idle_game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4214,'no_straight_roads:_encore_edition',NULL,'Start a rock band & end the EDM empire in NO STRAIGHT ROADS, a rockin\' action-adventure that mashes together rhythm-infused third-person combat with a kick-ass soundtrack!','2021/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1726190/No_Straight_Roads_Encore_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4215,'cloud_gardens',NULL,'A chill game about using plants to overgrow abandoned wasteland dioramas','2021/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1372320/Cloud_Gardens/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4216,'il-2_sturmovik:_desert_wings_-_tobruk',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Cliffs of Dover Blitz Edition on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1049440/IL2_Sturmovik_Desert_Wings__Tobruk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4217,'outpost:_infinity_siege',NULL,'Command Mobile Outpost and take XEN Firearm to venture deep into the Signet surveillance off-limit area. Collect unique Weapon Units. Amp up the firepower of the Outpost that fights with you. This is an FTD game - FPS, Tower Defense, Base Building and much more all at the same time.','2024/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1566690/Outpost_Infinity_Siege/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_88'),(4218,'the_pathless',NULL,'From the creators of ABZÛ, The Pathless is the mythic adventure of an archer and an eagle in a vast forest. Become the Hunter, a master of archery who travels to a mystical island to dispel a curse of darkness that grips the world.','2021/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1492680/The_Pathless/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4219,'adventurequest_3d',NULL,'The Void King is raising an army in secret. Death has chosen you as his champion to bring him down. Adventure & quest alongside your friends in this bizarre cross-platform MMORPG from the creators of the original, and comically-redundantly named... AdventureQuest! Weekly releases!','2022/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/429790/AdventureQuest_3D/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4220,'the_forever_winter_-_nosebleed_skin_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Forever Winter on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3651820/The_Forever_Winter__Nosebleed_Skin_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4221,'blair_witch',NULL,'Inspired by the cinematic lore of Blair Witch, experience a new story-driven psychological horror game that studies your reactions to fear and stress.','2019/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1092660/Blair_Witch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4222,'endzone_-_a_world_apart',NULL,'Endzone is a post-apocalyptic survival city builder, where you start a new civilization with a group of people after an ecological disaster. Build them a new home and ensure their survival in a shattered world, threatened by constant radiation, toxic rain, sandstorms and droughts.','2021/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/933820/Endzone__A_World_Apart/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4223,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_craftworld_aeldari',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1425820/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Craftworld_Aeldari/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4224,'havendock',NULL,'Breathe easy and thrive in this cozy colony sim. Build a haven for castaways, manage resources, live your best life on the ocean. Lead your humble settlement into a high-tech society.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2020710/Havendock/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4225,'steel_seed',NULL,'Steel Seed is a stealth-action adventure set in a dark sci-fi world on the brink of extinction. Play as Zoe and her drone Koby as they explore a hostile underground facility. Uncover secrets, survive dangers, search for answers, and humanity’s last hope.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/458430/Steel_Seed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4226,'republic_of_pirates',NULL,'Establish and grow a pirate utopia during the Golden Age of Piracy. Create a resource-based economy, engage in real-time naval combat, and conduct diplomacy with rival powers. Explore the far reaches of the Caribbean in search of the ultimate fortune and glory.','2024/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2103470/Republic_of_Pirates/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4227,'psychonauts',NULL,'A Psychic Odyssey Through the Minds of Misfits, Monsters, and Madmen. This classic action/adventure platformer from acclaimed developers Double Fine Productions follows the story of a young psychic named Razputin.','2005/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3830/Psychonauts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4228,'fishing:_barents_sea',NULL,'Commercial fishing on the Barents Sea! Take the helm of your very own fishing boat in Fishing: Barents Sea and explore the vastness of the Barents Sea in search for the best fishing zones. Start out small and earn officially licensed Scanmar Equipment and the officially licensed Hermes trawler.','2018/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/501080/Fishing_Barents_Sea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4229,'critter_café',NULL,'Welcome to your Critter Café! Rescue and bond with adorable, fantasy critters in need of your help and build a new home together. Design and run your own café, care for your critters, uncover the secrets of mysterious portals, and create a wholesome café for all to enjoy!','2024/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2367610/Critter_Caf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4230,'ghost_of_a_tale',NULL,'Ghost of a Tale is an action-RPG game in which you play as Tilo, a mouse and minstrel thrown into a perilous adventure. Through stealth and cunning you’ll be able to explore the secrets of Dwindling Heights Keep and navigate its dangers.','2018/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/417290/Ghost_of_a_Tale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4231,'heads_will_roll:_reforged',NULL,'Hardcore survival RPG with non-linear story that lets you play as a young medieval soldier who over the course of battles and adventures becomes the most formidable and respected knight of his era. Or, if he’s not lucky enough, perishes in the chaos of the Hundred Years\' War.','2023/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/687800/Heads_Will_Roll_Reforged/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4232,'backrooms_rec.',NULL,'Dive into the mysteries of the Backrooms with a solo-developed survival game. Explore eerie hallways, uncover secrets alone or in multiplayer (up to 6 players), and take on unique challenges.','2024/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2275020/Backrooms_Rec/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4233,'last_epoch_-_woven_vanquisher_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Last Epoch on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3512590/Last_Epoch__Woven_Vanquisher_Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4234,'super_meat_boy_forever',NULL,'Super Meat Boy is back! This time around Meat Boy is always running, literally it\'s an auto-runner. You will jump, dive, slide and punch your way through brutal levels and mean boss fights. We designed 5,000+ levels so you can play the game over and over without seeing the same level twice.','2022/1/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/581660/Super_Meat_Boy_Forever/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4235,'the_pedestrian',NULL,'I can see the signs in my sleep now, always guiding me closer. Will this really work? Have we almost achieved the impossible?','2020/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/466630/The_Pedestrian/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4236,'star_trek:_infinite',NULL,'Star Trek: Infinite is a grand strategy experience that lets you play your own Star Trek story as the leader of one of four major factions in the galaxy. Follow the specially crafted story or blaze your own trail in the first Star Trek grand strategy game.','2023/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1622900/Star_Trek_Infinite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4237,'fpv_logic',NULL,'FPV LOGIC is an FPV drone simulator with near-real physics and operation experience. Whether you enjoy freestyle or racing, you can find the same fun as flying a real drone in this game.','2023/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2398030/FPV_LOGIC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4238,'i_expect_you_to_die',NULL,'Test your problem-solving skills in this virtual reality escape-the-room puzzle game. Play as a secret agent armed with telekinetic abilities on a mission to stop Zoraxis, an evil corporation with plans for world domination.','2017/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/587430/I_Expect_You_To_Die/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4239,'project_gunship',NULL,'Rain hell on the enemy from 12,000 feet in an AC-130 Gunship. Project Gunship provides an authentic and historical simulation of combat in all gunship variants from Vietnam to present day.','2022/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1968340/Project_Gunship/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4240,'auto_rogue',NULL,'A roguelike where you automate combat. Combine skills and conditions to find your own optimal solution! No complicated controls at all!! Sit back with a coffee and watch the beautiful battles you\'ve crafted unfold! Utilize a variety of skills, conditions, and relics to craft the ultimate build!','2025/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3553210/Auto_Rogue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4241,'farlight_84',NULL,'1st Pet Capture Battle Royale!','2023/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1928420/Farlight_84/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4242,'railbound',NULL,'A relaxing puzzle game about fixing train connections and travelling the world - now with a level editor!','2022/9/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1967510/Railbound/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4243,'star_wars™_galactic_battlegrounds_saga',NULL,'Lead the great armies of the Star Wars™ Episode II: Attack of the Clones saga in intense real-time strategy clashes. Enter the fray as the Galactic Empire, Rebel Alliance, Wookies, Trade Federation, Gungans or Royal Naboo to determine the course of the Galactic Civil War.','2001/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/356500/STAR_WARS_Galactic_Battlegrounds_Saga/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4244,'heretical',NULL,'Die. Adapt. Strike back. Climb Sanctora in this brutal Rogue-lite where every death unlocks powers, heroes, and paths to vengeance.','2024/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2877540/Heretical/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4245,'fireworks_mania_-_an_explosive_simulator',NULL,'FIREWORKS MANIA is a small casual explosive simulator game where you play around with fireworks, create beautiful firework shows or just blow stuff up.','2020/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1079260/Fireworks_Mania__An_Explosive_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4246,'g_string',NULL,'Slip into the Standard Issue Biosuit as Myo Hyori, a gifted Korean teenage girl who must face the perils of the future. Survive many hazards, explore a seemingly endless metropolis and beyond as the world around you implodes and history marches towards its inevitable conclusion.','2020/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1224600/G_String/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4247,'karate_survivor',NULL,'Become a martial arts master in this survivor-like roguelite inspired by action movies of the ‘80s. Use your fists, feet, and the environment to fight off relentless thugs. Master powerful combos, enhance your skills, and remember: everything around you is a weapon!','2024/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3027930/Karate_Survivor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4248,'legendary_tales',NULL,'Legendary tales is a VR Action roleplaying game with up to 4 player co-op. Collect items, enhance your abilities and fight your way through an ever changing dungeon to make your own Legendary Tales.','2024/2/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1465070/Legendary_Tales/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4249,'nine-ball_roulette',NULL,'This will be the most thrilling pool game you have ever played. Join up to 3 of your friends in this exciting pool roulette game! Eliminate each other with pool until only one person is left.','2025/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3376250/NineBall_Roulette/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4250,'necromunda:_underhive_wars',NULL,'Deep below the hive cities of Necromunda, lead, customize and grow your gang in the twisted tunnels of the dystopian Underhive. Face rival gangs in tactical gunfights for power, wealth, survival, and honor.','2020/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/566440/Necromunda_Underhive_Wars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4251,'story_of_seasons:_pioneers_of_olive_town',NULL,'Welcome to Olive Town, a peaceful community established by your trailblazing grandfather and his friends. Now that you\'ve taken over his farm, it\'s your job to carry on his legacy. Plant crops, raise animals, build relationships, and get to know the residents of your new home!','2021/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1392960/STORY_OF_SEASONS_Pioneers_of_Olive_Town/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4252,'standbox',NULL,'STANDBOX is a single-player physics sandbox about bullying a ragdoll. Shoot him, push him, watch him get back up until he doesn\'t.','2023/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2246880/STANDBOX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4253,'last_train_outta\'_wormtown',NULL,'Last Train Outta\' Wormtown is a chaotic Sandworm vs. Cowboys showdown. The Worm can only detect players touching the sand, like \"hot lava\" with a giant sandworm twist! Work together, Complete the objectives, and get outta\' Wormtown! - Or, play as the Worm and gobble up your friends!','2025/1/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2318480/Last_Train_Outta_Wormtown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4254,'troubleshooter:_abandoned_children_-_crimson_crow',NULL,'This content requires the base game TROUBLESHOOTER: Abandoned Children on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2168550/TROUBLESHOOTER_Abandoned_Children__Crimson_Crow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4255,'warriors_orochi_3_ultimate_definitive_edition',NULL,'The truly ultimate \"WARRIORS OROCHI 3\" is now available on Steam! With all the content of \"WARRIORS OROCHI 3\", new characters and episodes that deepen the story, new modes, and DLC that has been released for other platforms, enjoy the world of Orochi to your heart\'s content!','2022/7/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1879330/WARRIORS_OROCHI_3_Ultimate_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4256,'tropico_4',NULL,'The world is changing and Tropico is moving with the times - geographical powers rise and fall and the world market is dominated by new players with new demands and offers - and you, as El Presidente, face a whole new set of challenges.','2011/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/57690/Tropico_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4257,'destiny_2:_triumphant_silver_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Destiny 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1745440/Destiny_2_Triumphant_Silver_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4258,'the_bridge_curse_2:_the_extrication',NULL,'Try to escape with your life in a first-person survival horror adventure. Play through the eyes of four distinct characters as you evade and confront terrifying ghosts, unravel mind-bending puzzles, and unearth a sinister conspiracy…','2024/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2331330/The_Bridge_Curse_2_The_Extrication/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4259,'solasta:_crown_of_the_magister_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Solasta: Crown of the Magister on Steam in order to play.','2020/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1438980/Solasta_Crown_of_the_Magister__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4260,'solar_ash',NULL,'From the creators of the award-winning Hyper Light Drifter comes the high-speed and gravity-bending world of Solar Ash.','2022/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1867530/Solar_Ash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4261,'slice_&_dice',NULL,'Tactical dice-rolling roguelike combat. Take control of 5 heroes, each with their own unique dice. Fight your way through 20 levels of monsters and try to take on the final boss. If you lose a single fight you have to start over so be careful (and lucky!).','2024/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1775490/Slice__Dice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4262,'hellsplit:_arena',NULL,'VR horror-slasher with physically correct combat system and dynamic battles across arenas in the dark fantasy world.','2019/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1039880/Hellsplit_Arena/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4263,'mika_and_the_witch\'s_mountain',NULL,'Mika and the Witch’s Mountain is a fantasy adventure about an aspiring witch who delivers packages to the townspeople of a small island. Explore every cranny and soar through the sky with your magic broom.','2025/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1819460/Mika_and_The_Witchs_Mountain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4264,'anno_1800™_-_season_1_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Anno 1800 on Steam in order to play.','2019/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1066850/Anno_1800__Season_1_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4265,'cattails:_wildwood_story',NULL,'Become a cat! In this cozy life sim RPG, you\'ll lead your colony into the mysterious Wildwood. Hunt prey, harvest herbs, collect magical treasures, & defend your new home from intruders. Build a thriving town to recruit new cats. Get to know the residents, fall in love, & raise a litter of kittens!','2023/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1882500/Cattails_Wildwood_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_89'),(4266,'rogue_waters',NULL,'Rogue Waters is a Pirate Tactical Turn-Based Rogue-lite. Play as Captain Cutter, commanding your ship and crew through procedurally generated encounters to seek revenge. Recruit, train, and upgrade crew, use powerful sea creatures, and engage in dynamic naval and melee combat to gain the upper hand.','2024/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1691190/Rogue_Waters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4267,'reverse_collapse:_code_name_bakery',NULL,'Experience the newest tactical RPG from the creators of Girls’ Frontline. Some 30 years in the future, AU agent Mendo and the mysterious girl Jefuty find themselves in gruesome battles against armed URNC forces…','2024/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1127700/Reverse_Collapse_Code_Name_Bakery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4268,'deus_ex:_game_of_the_year_edition',NULL,'The year is 2052 and the world is a dangerous and chaotic place. Terrorists operate openly - killing thousands; drugs, disease and pollution kill even more. The world\'s economies are close to collapse and the gap between the insanely wealthy and the desperately poor grows ever wider.','2000/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6910/Deus_Ex_Game_of_the_Year_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4269,'kingdom_rush_origins_-_tower_defense',NULL,'Command your elven army and defend mystical lands from sea serpents, evil sorcerers, and wave after wave of gnoll tribesman, all with the help of brand-spankin’ new towers, heroes, and spells to fend off every last baddie.','2018/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/816340/Kingdom_Rush_Origins__Tower_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4270,'alpha_protocol™',NULL,'Loyalty carries a price and no one knows this more than agent Michael Thorton. A talented young agent cast out by his government, Thorton is the only one with the information needed to stop an impending international catastrophe.','2010/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/34010/Alpha_Protocol/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4271,'fallout_4_far_harbor',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fallout 4 on Steam in order to play.','2016/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/435881/Fallout_4_Far_Harbor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4272,'project_highrise',NULL,'Project Highrise is a skyscraper construction and management sim...','2016/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/423580/Project_Highrise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4273,'chorus',NULL,'Take control of Nara on a quest to destroy the dark cult that created her. Unlock devastating weapons & mind-bending abilities in an evolution of the space-combat shooter. Along with Forsaken, her sentient starfighter, explore ancient temples, engage in zero-g combat & venture beyond waking reality.','2021/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1153640/Chorus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4274,'date_a_live:_ren_dystopia',NULL,'Play as Shido and unravel the secrets of the mysterious spirit Ren in the visual novel follow-up to DATE A LIVE: Rio Reincarnation, based on the acclaimed light novel and anime series.','2024/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2627780/DATE_A_LIVE_Ren_Dystopia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4275,'exanima',NULL,'Explore, fight, survive and unravel mysteries in this unique and unforgiving 3D isometric RPG set in an original dark, low fantasy world. Exanima\'s exceptional attention to detail and realistic simulation of all things aim to provide a deeply immersive and dynamic gameplay experience.','2015/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/362490/Exanima/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4276,'intravenous_2_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Intravenous 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3116710/Intravenous_2__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4277,'football_coach:_college_dynasty',NULL,'A true college football management game. Play as a coach or a school, recruit players, develop your team, and compete for national championships. Build a college football dynasty and become a coaching legend!','2025/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2151290/Football_Coach_College_Dynasty/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4278,'ai_war_2',NULL,'The most devious and acclaimed artificial intelligence in strategy gaming is better than ever. A grand strategy/RTS hybrid that reverses many conventions of both genres. Take territory without attracting attention, build your empire with care, and adapt to an ever-evolving galactic battleground.','2019/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/573410/AI_War_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4279,'seeds_of_calamity',NULL,'Take part in healing after the Great Calamity. Tend your farm, complete quests for the villagers, and explore dungeons filled with challenge and treasure in this cozy, solo-developed farming sim. Build a new life in a recovering world with your fluffy Spellbook Companion.','2025/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1780070/Seeds_of_Calamity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4280,'the_break-in',NULL,'Steal everything. Even the people. The Break-In lets you take whatever you want, from TVs to fridges to toilets. And all in 1-4 player co-op, VR and non VR. Select your getaway vehicle, anything from a bicycle to a stolen police van, and load up with gear like hammers and rocket boosters, and steal.','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1397390/The_BreakIn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4281,'turnip_boy_robs_a_bank',NULL,'Turnip Boy is back! This time he’s teaming up with the fearsome Pickled Gang to plan and execute the weirdest heist of all time. Shake down hostages, steal precious valuables, battle the fuzz, and use wacky tools bought off the dark web to move further into the vaults of the Botanical Bank.','2024/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2097230/Turnip_Boy_Robs_a_Bank/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4282,'the_stone_of_madness',NULL,'The Stone of Madness is a real-time tactical stealth game set in an 18th-century Spanish Monastery. Five prisoners pool their skills and resources to face their phobias, stave off insanity, uncover the mysteries of the Monastery, and find a way to escape.','2025/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1309710/The_Stone_of_Madness/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4283,'lost_lullabies:_the_orphanage_chronicles',NULL,'\"Lost Lullabies - The Orphanage Chronicles\" is a Co-Op horror game set in 1980, inspired by the real stories of an orphanage ruined by a fire in 1960 Lowell. Playable with 1-4 players, the goal is to identify and expel malevolent spirits alone or with your team.','2025/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2903710/Lost_Lullabies_The_Orphanage_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4284,'lonely_mountains:_downhill',NULL,'Just you and your bike - take it on a thrilling ride down an unspoiled mountain landscape. Make your way through thick forests, narrow trails and wild rivers. Race, jump, slide and try not to crash - all the way from the peak to the valley!','2019/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/711540/Lonely_Mountains_Downhill/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4285,'gbvsr_-_additional_character_set_(galleon)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Granblue Fantasy Versus: Rising on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3604390/GBVSR__Additional_Character_Set_Galleon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4286,'lab_rat',NULL,'A metrics-obsessed AI will monitor, profile, and entertain you as you progress through over a hundred genre-bending puzzles in this delightfully satirical adventure.','2025/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1304610/Lab_Rat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4287,'café_stella_and_the_reaper\'s_butterflies',NULL,'Takamine Kousei was living a carefree college life until, one day, he tragically died in an accident. But then, the bizarre happened: Takamine Kousei opened his eyes again. And what\'s more, when he woke up, it was the morning of the very day, he had died.','2022/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1829980/Caf_Stella_and_the_Reapers_Butterflies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4288,'arma_3_tac-ops_mission_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2017/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/744950/Arma_3_TacOps_Mission_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4289,'talented',NULL,'Slay waves of spooky enemies for 20 nights to survive \'The Demonic Conveyor Belt\'. Talented is an arcade roguelite with randomly generated skill trees. Choose your upgrades and abilities wisely and you might just make it out alive. Are you truly Talented?','2024/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2435090/Talented/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4290,'the_eternal_cylinder',NULL,'Control a herd of charming creatures called Trebhum and explore an unforgettable alien world filled with exotic lifeforms and surreal environments. Discover dozens of mutations to overcome puzzles, explore new biomes, and survive on a dangerous planet.','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/865680/The_Eternal_Cylinder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4291,'dragon_is_dead',NULL,'Dragon is Dead is a hack-and-slash, roguelite action platformer. It offers tons of customization fun with different character skill trees and legendary equipment.','2025/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2803280/Dragon_Is_Dead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4292,'beyond_a_steel_sky',NULL,'From multi-award winning Revolution comes ‘Beyond a Steel Sky’, a groundbreaking 3D adventure thriller, set in an AI-driven future. Subvert the world, hack the systems and solve dark conspiracies to uncover the devastating truth.','2020/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1146310/Beyond_a_Steel_Sky/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4293,'supreme_ruler_2030',NULL,'Rise to power as any modern day country in a realistic military, political and economic simulation. Command your country\'s diplomacy, espionage, and resource management to strengthen your position. Use real-time tactical control of your military to fortify your place as the Supreme Ruler.','2023/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2093410/Supreme_Ruler_2030/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4294,'death_of_the_reprobate',NULL,'Explore a world built from the luscious landscapes, turbulent townscapes and preposterous portraits of real Renaissance paintings. Death of the Reprobate is a Rabelaisian adventure game from the creator of Four Last Things and The Procession to Calvary.','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1739900/Death_of_the_Reprobate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4295,'rollerdrome',NULL,'Rollerdrome is a BAFTA award-winning third person action shooter that seamlessly blends high octane, visceral combat with fluid movement and tricking mechanics into one complementary and challenging whole, to create an original adrenaline-pumping shooter experience like no other.','2022/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1294420/Rollerdrome/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4296,'golden_idol_mysteries:_the_spider_of_lanka',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Case of the Golden Idol on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2377000/Golden_Idol_Mysteries_The_Spider_of_Lanka/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4297,'the_curse_of_monkey_island',NULL,'The only pirate adventure that asks the question: What\'s sharper, your sword or your wit?','1997/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/730820/The_Curse_of_Monkey_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4298,'atelier_escha_&_logy:_alchemists_of_the_dusk_sky_dx',NULL,'\"The promise is entrusted to two alchemists...\" The \"Dusk\" series, a trilogy of RPG titles from Gust\'s popular Atelier series, tells the story of a world on the verge ruin, told from the perspective of its unique characters.','2020/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1152310/Atelier_Escha__Logy_Alchemists_of_the_Dusk_Sky_DX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4299,'torchlight_ii',NULL,'The adventure continues in Torchlight II! An Action RPG filled with epic battles, bountiful treasure, and a fully randomized world. Bring your friends along for the journey with online and LAN multiplayer.','2012/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/200710/Torchlight_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4300,'warlord:_britannia',NULL,'Lead a Roman expeditionary force into the heart of Ancient Britain! Recruit, promote, and upgrade your legionaries while constructing a series of fortified marching camps. Use Roman tactics and strategies to conquer the entire island and become Warlord!','2022/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1970980/Warlord_Britannia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4301,'tetris®_the_grand_master_4_-absolute_eye-',NULL,'The latest title in the \"TGM\" series, \"TETRIS® THE GRAND MASTER 4 -ABSOLUTE EYE-\" offers the ultimate Tetris game that no one has ever experienced before. Challenge yourself in new modes such as ASUKA and SHIRANUI.','2025/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3328480/TETRIS_THE_GRAND_MASTER_4_ABSOLUTE_EYE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4302,'reignbreaker',NULL,'Reignbreaker is a high-octane action rogue-like set in a dystopian medievalpunk world. Step into the boots of Clef, a fearless rebel ready to rid the world of the Kingdom’s oppression, take down the Elite and lay siege to the Queen’s grand Bastion. Grab your javelin and become The Reignbreaker!','2025/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2129810/Reignbreaker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4303,'twelve_minutes',NULL,'An interactive thriller about a man trapped in a time loop. Featuring James McAvoy, Daisy Ridley, and Willem Dafoe.','2021/8/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1097200/Twelve_Minutes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4304,'little_busters!_english_edition',NULL,'Capturing the hearts of countless fans since 2007, Little Busters! is an emotional visual novel from Key, the minds behind Angel Beats! and CLANNAD. This special English release supports touch controls and dynamic switching between English and Japanese text, and is in HD for the first time on PC.','2017/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/635940/Little_Busters_English_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4305,'american_truck_simulator_-_w900_tuning_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2386530/American_Truck_Simulator__W900_Tuning_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4306,'terminus:_zombie_survivors',NULL,'Terminus: Zombie Survivors is a 2D turn-based survival roguelike set during a zombie apocalypse. Each journey is unique, and every decision can mean the difference between life and death. Can you brave hunger, cold, and the undead in order to reach the Terminus and find salvation?','2024/8/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1534980/Terminus_Zombie_Survivors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4307,'river_towns',NULL,'Solve puzzles by placing buildings and creating vibrant cities in River Towns. Each district has its own style and shapes, making every level a new challenge. Help to restore and rebuild our River Towns.','2025/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2485350/River_Towns/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4308,'wonderful_everyday_down_the_rabbit-hole',NULL,'Wonderful Everyday is a visual novel with multiple routes which develops a story based on a few concepts: \"the sky and the world\", \"the beginning and the end\", \"literature and science\", \"savior and hero\", \"brother and sister\".','2017/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/658620/Wonderful_Everyday_Down_the_RabbitHole/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4309,'dynasty_warriors_7:_xtreme_legends_definitive_edition',NULL,'The new modes and replay elements of \"Xtreme Legends\", even including downloadable content, have been packed into the thrilling one vs. one-thousand action game \"DYNASTY WARRIORS 7\", comprising a massive single title that is available now for a reasonable price!','2018/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/968790/DYNASTY_WARRIORS_7_Xtreme_Legends_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4310,'grow:_song_of_the_evertree',NULL,'Grow your own worlds and nurture a deep natural connection with everything they hold. See your actions change the world for better! Bring the Evertree back to life in this breathtaking world-crafting sandbox, with life management and adventure elements.','2021/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1380420/Grow_Song_of_the_Evertree/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4311,'mad_father',NULL,'Witness the tale of a most foolish family. A remake of the classic horror exploration game makes its way to Steam.','2016/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/483980/Mad_Father/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4312,'dreadline:_net_quota',NULL,'You’re deep in debt. Pay your quota in 3 days or end up like chum. Dreadline: Net Quota is a 6-player co-op horror fishing game. Fish or Die.','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3576880/Dreadline_Net_Quota/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4313,'sniper_ghost_warrior_3',NULL,'Go behind enemy lines with the ultimate modern military shooter. Play as an American sniper dropped in Georgia, near Russian border. Choose your own path to accomplish your missions across an unforgiving open world.','2017/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/368070/Sniper_Ghost_Warrior_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4314,'world_of_warplanes',NULL,'World of Warplanes is an aerial combat MMO action game set in the Golden Age of military aviation. The game throws players into a never-ending battle for dominance of the skies.','2018/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/790710/World_of_Warplanes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_90'),(4315,'dead_or_alive_5_last_round:_core_fighters',NULL,'The free version of the final word in fighting entertainment - DEAD OR ALIVE 5 Last Round!','2015/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/311730/DEAD_OR_ALIVE_5_Last_Round_Core_Fighters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4316,'hot_lava',NULL,'The Floor is Hot Lava! Run, jump, climb, and surf across nostalgia-packed environments flooded with hot molten lava. Explore alone, or join your friends. And whatever you do, don’t touch the floor.','2019/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/382560/Hot_Lava/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4317,'cats_hidden_around_the_world_2',NULL,'Find 2000 cats hiding in 20 iconic locations such as Rome, Dubai or Bangkok in this cute hand-drawn hidden object game by Travellin Cats - the original viral hidden cats game creator! Can you find them all?','2025/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2951880/Cats_Hidden_Around_the_World_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4318,'tribes_of_midgard',NULL,'A vibrant blend of survival and action RPG for 1-10 players! Craft legendary items, grow your home base and embark on an epic journey through procedural realms to face towering creatures hel-bent on unleashing Ragnarök. Valhalla can wait, Einherjar!  ','2021/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/858820/Tribes_of_Midgard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4319,'shotgun_farmers',NULL,'Missed shots grow guns in this multiplayer shooter. Fire your bullets into the ground to plant your ammo. The longer it grows the more ammo you will get!','2019/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/604240/Shotgun_Farmers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4320,'night_is_coming',NULL,'Survival strategy game set in a world inspired by Slavic mythology and the nature of Eastern Europe. Build your settlement, protect its dwellers, and help them prepare for the coming Darkness.','2025/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1011590/Night_is_Coming/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4321,'card_survival:_tropical_island',NULL,'Card Survival is a card-based survival experience. Stranded on a desert island you must use your wits and skills to stay alive. Use cards and combine them together to explore, gather resources and craft useful tools.','2022/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1694420/Card_Survival_Tropical_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4322,'n++_(nplusplus)',NULL,'N++ is a fast-paced, momentum-based platformer about darting around obstacles, narrowly evading enemies and collecting gold in a beautiful minimalist landscape.','2016/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/230270/N_NPLUSPLUS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4323,'space_engineers_-_decorative_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2019/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1049790/Space_Engineers__Decorative_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4324,'record_of_lodoss_war-deedlit_in_wonder_labyrinth-',NULL,'A 2D Metroidvania-style game developed under the supervision of Ryo Mizuno, depicting the story of Deedlit and the events leading up to Record of Lodoss War: Diadem of the Covenant. Use a variety of weapons and spirit powers to unravel the mystery of the labyrinth.','2021/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1203630/Record_of_Lodoss_WarDeedlit_in_Wonder_Labyrinth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4325,'the_thrill_of_the_fight_-_vr_boxing',NULL,'The Thrill of the Fight is a room-scale only VR boxing game focused on authenticity. Face off in the virtual ring where you\'ll jab, dodge, and sweat your way to the top of the boxing world. Grab your gloves, step through the ropes, and become a champion.','2016/7/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/494150/The_Thrill_of_the_Fight__VR_Boxing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4326,'starless_abyss',NULL,'Earth has fallen. Science and the Occult have united forces to brace for the arrival of the Eldritch. But will the efforts against this strange, alien race be enough? Play as one of many Proximae used to help defend humanity in this turn-based, roguelike, intergalactic deck builder.','2025/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3167970/Starless_Abyss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4327,'hypnagogia_無限の夢_boundless_dreams',NULL,'Meet colorful characters, discover mysterious secrets, and reassemble the fractured remains of an ethereal crystal as you explore a series of abstract worlds based on dreams, nightmares, and the places in between.','2021/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1665500/Hypnagogia__Boundless_Dreams/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4328,'total_war:_attila_-_celts_culture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ATTILA on Steam in order to play.','2015/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/343461/Total_War_ATTILA__Celts_Culture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4329,'factory_town',NULL,'Build, automate, and optimize a giant factory on 3D terrain using conveyor belts, trains, chutes, pipes, and airships. Sell your goods to nearby villages to expand their borders, increase happiness, and unlock even better technology!','2021/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/860890/Factory_Town/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4330,'the_catch:_carp_&_coarse_fishing',NULL,'Take on the hunt of a lifetime as you target and pursue monster-sized fish around the world. You’re set, waiting…. The line tightens, your alarm screams, the fish is on and the battle commences!','2020/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1237610/The_Catch_Carp__Coarse_Fishing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4331,'the_sims_3:_university_life',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2013/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/223597/The_Sims_3_University_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4332,'touhou hero of ice fairy',NULL,'Touhou Hero of Ice Fairy is an indie game developed by GAMEPULSE.Step into the shoes of Cirno, the Hero of Ice, as she embarks on a journey against evil, liberating Gensokyo and saving her dear princess.','2024/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1955830/Touhou_Hero_of_Ice_Fairy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4333,'growing_up',NULL,'This is the story of your life. Experience the entire journey from toddler to adulthood. Go to schools, learn new things, meet new friends, and have wild adventures! Every choice you make will influence your future career, and decide who your romantic partner will be. Who will you become?','2021/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1191120/Growing_Up/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4334,'shadowrun_returns',NULL,'The unique cyberpunk-meets-fantasy world of Shadowrun has gained a huge cult following since its creation nearly 25 years ago. Now, creator Jordan Weisman returns to the world of Shadowrun, modernizing this classic game setting as a single player, turn-based tactical RPG.','2013/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/234650/Shadowrun_Returns/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4335,'megaton_musashi_w:_wired',NULL,'Launch a counteroffensive to take back the Earth from alien invaders in this mecha action RPG.','2024/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2450450/MEGATON_MUSASHI_W_WIRED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4336,'grime',NULL,'Destroy... Absorb... Grow... GRIME is a fast and unforgiving Action-Adventure RPG in which you crush your foes with living weapons that mutate form and function, and then consume their remains with a black hole to strengthen your vessel as you break apart a world of anatomical horror and intrigue.','2021/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1123050/GRIME/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4337,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_high-tech_hunting_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2019/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1146830/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__HighTech_Hunting_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4338,'disney_infinity_2.0:_gold_edition',NULL,'Enjoy Disney Infinity with a Full Toy Box! Disney Infinity 2.0: Gold Edition invites you to enter the worlds of Disney Storytelling and Marvel Adventures with all Disney Infinity 2.0 Characters and Playsets Unlocked to enjoy experiences only Disney, Marvel, and your imagination can bring to life.','2016/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/541660/Disney_Infinity_20_Gold_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4339,'fishtank:_reality_tv_simulator',NULL,'It\'s time to run the show! Give yourself the opportunity to direct the internet reality experience, Fishtank.live, and enjoy the chaos that comes with it!','2025/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3229330/Fishtank_Reality_TV_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4340,'between_the_stars',NULL,'Become the Captain of an interstellar cruiser and journey across the galaxy to save the Republic. During your journey you will have to make important decisions, improve the weaponry of your ship and fight against numerous enemies.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/727130/Between_the_Stars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4341,'a_date_with_death_-_expansion_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game A Date with Death on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2696090/A_Date_with_Death__Expansion_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4342,'cities:_skylines_ii_-_creator_pack:_mediterranean_heritage',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines II on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2945610/Cities_Skylines_II__Creator_Pack_Mediterranean_Heritage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4343,'senran_kagura_burst_re:newal',NULL,'Experience the original SENRAN KAGURA Burst, the beginning of the world\'s best-loved buxom battle series, like never before! Tackle the classic ninja brawler from a whole new perspective in gorgeous, fluid HD, with new features and mechanics throughout!','2019/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/889510/SENRAN_KAGURA_Burst_ReNewal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4344,'millennia',NULL,'Create your own nation in Millennia, a historical turn-based 4X game that challenges your strategic prowess across 10,000 years of history, from the dawn of humanity to our possible futures.','2024/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1268590/Millennia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4345,'blasfemia',NULL,'Blasfemia is a first-person horror game. You are trapped in a seemingly normal apartment but realize early on that you\'re not alone. Explore a handcrafted, detail rich environment in a tense and terrifying atmosphere and try to find a way out before an ominous entity gets to you.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3699970/Blasfemia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4346,'cat_cafe_manager',NULL,'Travel to the sleepy village of Caterwaul Way and rebuild your grandmother\'s cat cafe. Renovate your restaurant, befriend the local cats and townsfolk, forge lasting friendships, unravel catty mysteries, and build a home for dozens of unique felines!','2022/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1354830/Cat_Cafe_Manager/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4347,'solasta:_crown_of_the_magister_-_lost_valley',NULL,'This content requires the base game Solasta: Crown of the Magister on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1723950/Solasta_Crown_of_the_Magister__Lost_Valley/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4348,'rpg_maker_xp',NULL,'RPG MAKER lets you create an original role-playing game without any prior specialized knowledge or training. RPG MAKER XP is full of the functions you\'ve been asking for, including game data encryption and a scripting feature that lets you change the very heart of the RPG MAKER engine.','2005/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/235900/RPG_Maker_XP/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4349,'day_of_defeat:_source',NULL,'Valve\'s WWII Multiplayer Classic - Now available for Mac.','2005/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/300/Day_of_Defeat_Source/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4350,'two_point_hospital:_pebberley_island',NULL,'This content requires the base game Two Point Hospital on Steam in order to play.','2019/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1003310/Two_Point_Hospital_Pebberley_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4351,'暖雪_warm_snow',NULL,'\'Warm Snow\' is a Rogue-like action game with a background set in a dark fantasy world, where the eerie \'Warm Snow\' holds sway. You will play as the Warrior \'Bi-an\' on a crusade against the Five Great Clans, in order to save a world teetering on the brink of destruction.','2022/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1296830/_Warm_Snow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4352,'gauntlet™_slayer_edition',NULL,'The classic Gauntlet 4-player co-op action gameplay returns in a completely new experience! Battle the endless hordes of foes as you and your friends fight for treasure and glory via both local and online co-op multiplayer. Invade the Darkness!','2014/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/258970/Gauntlet_Slayer_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4353,'wurm_online',NULL,'A sandbox MMORPG that has pushed the boundaries on what it means to be open world and stood the test of time. Dig, mine, shape the world around you and make your lasting mark!','2012/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1179680/Wurm_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4354,'tales_of_maj\'eyal',NULL,'Tales of Maj’Eyal is a roguelike RPG, featuring tactical turn-based combat and advanced character building. Play as one of many unique races and classes in the lore-filled world of Eyal, exploring random dungeons, facing challenging battles, and developing characters with your own tailored mix of abilities and powers.','2012/12/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/259680/Tales_of_MajEyal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4355,'pirate101',NULL,'Assemble your ragtag crew and prepare to plunder the skyways in search of the legendary map to El Dorado! Danger lurks around every corner as you outsmart clockwork soldiers, uncover hidden mysteries, and unleash powerful combos in this pirate turn-based tactics MMORPG.','2023/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/620620/Pirate101/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4356,'il-2_sturmovik:_cliffs_of_dover_blitz_edition',NULL,'Scramble to intercept in your RAF Spitfire or Hurricane. Or join huge formations of German or Italian Fighters and Bombers as they roar across the Channel towards London. Decide the fate of Britain!','2017/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/754530/IL2_Sturmovik_Cliffs_of_Dover_Blitz_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4357,'payday™_the_heist',NULL,'Take on the role of a hardened career criminal executing intense, dynamic heists in constant pursuit of the next “big score”','2011/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/24240/PAYDAY_The_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4358,'idle_big_devil',NULL,'Idle Big Devil is a free idle RPG game with 3D graphics. If you are interested in strategy or idle games, you might want to take a look!','2021/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1158980/Idle_Big_Devil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4359,'tales_of_kenzera™:_zau',NULL,'Wield the dance of the shaman. Reclaim your father’s spirit. Brave the beautiful and treacherous land of Kenzera with the God of Death in Tales of Kenzera™: ZAU, a metroidvania-style adventure crafted by Surgent Studios.','2024/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2316580/Tales_of_Kenzera_ZAU/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4360,'another_try_2',NULL,'The virus has devastated cities and lands. Most of the population died, the rest turned into the walking dead. You\'re one of the last survivors. Do whatever it takes to last another day.','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2788040/Another_Try_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_91'),(4361,'power_rangers:_battle_for_the_grid',NULL,'Generations of Power Rangers collide across the multiverse’s 25 year history. Experience authentic, but reimagined Power Rangers gameplay. This easy to learn, but hard to master fighting game is designed to welcome players of all skill levels.','2019/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1110100/Power_Rangers_Battle_for_the_Grid/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4362,'grip:_combat_racing',NULL,'GRIP is a high octane, hardcore combat racer, packing ferocious speed and armed to the teeth with heavy weapons. Inspired by games like Rollcage, Wipeout, Motorstorm and Star Wars Podracer, it\'s like nothing you\'ve ever played before.','2018/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/396900/GRIP_Combat_Racing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4363,'rogue_command',NULL,'Classic RTS gameplay fused with a modern roguelike. Shape your build each run by assembling an evolving arsenal of powerful units and facilities. Harvest resources, build out your base. Raise your army and call down orbital strikes to overcome the forces threatening your survival.','2024/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1461910/Rogue_Command/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4364,'aerofly_fs_4_flight_simulator_-_aircraft_addon',NULL,'This content requires the base game Aerofly FS 4 Flight Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2011820/Aerofly_FS_4_Flight_Simulator__Aircraft_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4365,'duke_nukem_forever',NULL,'The King arrives with an arsenal of over-the-top weapons, giant explosions and pure unadulterated fun!','2011/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/57900/Duke_Nukem_Forever/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4366,'undermine',NULL,'An action-adventure roguelike with a bit of RPG tossed in. Adventure deep into the UnderMine and discover powerful relics, deadly enemies, hidden secrets, and a few friends to help along the way.','2020/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/656350/UnderMine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4367,'dragon_ball_xenoverse_2_-_future_saga_chapter_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3188680/DRAGON_BALL_XENOVERSE_2__FUTURE_SAGA_Chapter_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4368,'bejeweled®_3',NULL,'The biggest, brightest Bejeweled ever! Discover all-new ways to play the world’s #1 puzzle game. Find your perfect match with 8 breathtaking game modes that meet all your moods.','2010/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/78000/Bejeweled_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4369,'rotwood',NULL,'The world has been thrown into chaos, and it\'s up to you and your friends to battle the corrupted beasts of the Rotwood. Upgrade your gear, choose your preferred weapon, and hone your skills to defend your safe haven.','2024/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2015270/Rotwood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4370,'trine_2:_complete_story',NULL,'Three Heroes make their way through dangers untold in a fairytale world, featuring physics-based puzzles, beautiful sights and online co-op.','2013/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/35720/Trine_2_Complete_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4371,'rebuild_3:_gangs_of_deadsville',NULL,'Rebuild a ruined city in this post-apocalyptic mix of strategy and simulation. Manage survivors, scavenge for food and supplies, deal with rival gangs, illness, interpersonal strife and zombie attacks.','2015/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/257170/Rebuild_3_Gangs_of_Deadsville/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4372,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_aston_martin_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2112230/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__Aston_Martin_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4373,'clothing_store_simulator',NULL,'Are you ready to shape fashion world? Make a brand deal, order products, fill the aisles, dress the mannequins and start selling. Dresses, shirts, coats, pants, nightwear, underwear, shoes and more are waiting for you.','2024/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2923390/Clothing_Store_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4374,'call_of_cthulhu®',NULL,'1924. Private Investigator Pierce is sent to look into the tragic death of the Hawkins family. Plunge into a world of creeping madness and cosmic horror. Cryptic clues, shadowy figures, and pure terror bar your way as you fight to retain your sanity and solve an otherworldly mystery.','2018/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/399810/Call_of_Cthulhu/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4375,'a_hat_in_time_-_nyakuza_metro_+_online_party',NULL,'This content requires the base game A Hat in Time on Steam in order to play.','2019/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/940220/A_Hat_in_Time__Nyakuza_Metro__Online_Party/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4376,'mix_universe',NULL,'Mix Universe is a musical sandbox game where you play as a Mixonaut adding beautiful vibes to the universe. Everything you hear and see is 100% real-time and editable in-game.','2023/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1654810/Mix_Universe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4377,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_pagani_remastered_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1773800/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__Pagani_Remastered_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4378,'pit_people®',NULL,'In this fast-paced, turn-based, co-op adventure you\'ll quest and explore, find awesome loot, customize your fighters, and recruit strange species! Come master your destiny in this strategic game of positioning.','2018/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/291860/Pit_People/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4379,'corner_kitchen_fast_food_simulator',NULL,'Buy cooking equipment, prepare delicious meals, and serve hungry customers. Upgrade your setup, read customer reviews, and expand your business to become the top fast-food joint in the city.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3357250/Corner_Kitchen_Fast_Food_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4380,'battle_shapers',NULL,'Battle Shapers is an action-packed, sci-fi FPS roguelite in which you shoot and smash your way through swarms of corrupt robots. Wield powerful weapons, abilities, and game-changing new powers stolen from ruthless Overlords.','2024/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1421290/Battle_Shapers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4381,'no_more_heroes_3',NULL,'Travis Touchdown is back, baby! The otaku assassin takes up his trusty beam katana once more to slash his way to the top of the Galactic Superhero Rankings and save the world in the latest entry in the No More Heroes series.','2022/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1744330/No_More_Heroes_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4382,'sonic_lost_world',NULL,'When the Deadly Six threaten to destroy his world, Sonic’s new moves & power-ups are the only way to defeat them before it’s too late!','2015/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/329440/Sonic_Lost_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4383,'forgotten_but_unbroken',NULL,'A tactical turn-based strategy game inspired by events and stories of forgotten and unsung heroes of WW2. Unique and new-to-genre features offer immersion and deeper protagonists to lead and care for. Lead the resistance against the Axis Forces.','2024/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2122090/Forgotten_but_Unbroken/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4384,'lumines_remastered',NULL,'The critically-acclaimed puzzle game produced by legendary creator Tetsuya Mizuguchi comes to PC.','2018/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/851670/LUMINES_REMASTERED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4385,'streets_of_rage_4_-_mr._x_nightmare',NULL,'This content requires the base game Streets of Rage 4 on Steam in order to play.','2021/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1585820/Streets_Of_Rage_4__Mr_X_Nightmare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4386,'enotria:_the_last_song',NULL,'Enotria: The Last Song is a soulslike set in a beautiful sun-lit world inspired by Italian folklore where the brightest sun casts the darkest shadow. Wear unique role-altering masks, face formidable foes and alter reality with the power of Ardore to unravel the secrets of Enotria.','2024/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2102450/Enotria_The_Last_Song/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4387,'the_sims™_4_star_wars™:_journey_to_batuu_game_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2020/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1301021/The_Sims_4_Star_Wars_Journey_to_Batuu_Game_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4388,'warhammer:_vermintide_2_-_warrior_priest_career',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer: Vermintide 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1782450/Warhammer_Vermintide_2__Warrior_Priest_Career/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4389,'per_aspera',NULL,'Make Mars your own! Take control of the world’s most sophisticated AI (AMI) and terraform the surface of the Red Planet for a city-building experience on a planetary scale. Transform this barren world into a lush paradise and explore the surface for any ancient secrets that may be waiting.','2020/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/803050/Per_Aspera/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4390,'nekopara_vol._3',NULL,'Patisserie \"La Soleil\", run by Kashou Minaduki, is flourishing thanks to the help of two catgirls: Maple, full of pride and a little on the haughty side, and Cinnamon, an impulsive daydreamer.','2017/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/602520/NEKOPARA_Vol_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4391,'just_a_to_the_moon_series_beach_episode',NULL,'The Beach Episode™ of To the Moon, Finding Paradise, and Impostor Factory. But something\'s off.','2024/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2159210/Just_a_To_the_Moon_Series_Beach_Episode/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4392,'among_the_whispers_-_provocation',NULL,'Tired of PHASMO-clones and Walking-sims? Me too, I made this ghost investigation sim to bring a new take to the genre. Research the family’s history, learn their stories, use essential paranormal tools, and release them into the afterlife. With deep replayability.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2814680/Among_The_Whispers__Provocation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4393,'attack_on_titan_/_a.o.t._wings_of_freedom',NULL,'An international hit anime \"Attack on Titan\" has come to Steam®! Battle is joined between the man-eating Titans and Eren and his companions. Experience the illusion of being in the anime, and controlling the flow of the story. The story from the anime, with a few original twists, is yours to experience!','2016/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/449800/Attack_on_Titan__AOT_Wings_of_Freedom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4394,'exapunks',NULL,'The year is 1997. You used to be a hacker, but now you have the phage. You made a deal: one hack, one dose. There’s nothing left to lose… except your life.','2018/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/716490/EXAPUNKS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4395,'i_am_cat',NULL,'I Am Cat - a unique virtual reality game, there\'s nothing like it in the world! A sandbox adventure centered around a Cat protagonist bearing. A captivating journey where you embrace the role of a Cat. Immerse yourself in a world brimming with diversity and excitement, awaiting your exploration.','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3016840/I_Am_Cat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4396,'door_kickers',NULL,'Door Kickers is an innovative realtime strategy game that puts you in charge of a SWAT team and lets you command them during a tactical intervention.','2014/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/248610/Door_Kickers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4397,'train_sim_world®_5:_thameslink_br_class_700/0_emu_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970290/Train_Sim_World_5_Thameslink_BR_Class_7000_EMU_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4398,'anoxia_station',NULL,'Descend into darkness in Anoxia Station, a turn-based strategy game with puzzle elements. Operate a subterranean mining station, where you\'ll gather resources, confront horrors, and make life-or-death choices for the survival of your crew.','2025/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2924310/Anoxia_Station/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4399,'il-2_sturmovik:_flying_circus_-_volume_i',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1198470/IL2_Sturmovik_Flying_Circus__Volume_I/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4400,'nova:_space_armada',NULL,'An exceptional sci-fi strategy game based on space adventure as its core.','2024/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1108270/Nova_Space_Armada/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_92'),(4401,'stygian:_outer_gods',NULL,'Dive into a hostile world that challenges your very existence, in this survival horror game with RPG elements. Unravel a thousand-year-old mystery, risk your sanity and face the Outer Gods with your skills. Every bullet and every decision counts now, are you up to the task?','2025/4/14','Released