rse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4409,'f.e.a.r.',NULL,'Experience the original F.E.A.R. along with F.E.A.R. Extraction Point and F.E.A.R. Perseus Mandate.','2005/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/21090/FEAR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4410,'nightmare_knight_~sacred_maiden_&_fallen_magic~',NULL,'The young girl Rayne, who became the sacred knight of the kingdom, was entrusted by Jas, the leader of the sacred knights and her lover, to investigate the disturbances occurring in a distant town named \"Hakudeti\".','2024/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2630020/Nightmare_Knight_Sacred_Maiden__Fallen_Magic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4411,'bakeru',NULL,'Bakeru\'s adventure begins in this Japan-esque Wild Action Game!','2024/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2969380/BAKERU/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4412,'awaken_-_astral_blade',NULL,'Weave your own story in this dark fairy tale. In the mysterious ancient ruins, you will adventure with Tania to reveal her origins and fate. Is there any chance of survival in the darkest and desperate place?','2024/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1716310/AWAKEN__Astral_Blade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4413,'slipways',NULL,'Weave isolated planets into a vast trade empire. Hatch plans. Research game-breaking technologies. Still be done in time for lunch. Enjoy the endless possibilities of a space grand strategy game in 60 minutes flat.','2021/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1264280/Slipways/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4414,'victory_heat_rally',NULL,'Welcome to VHR! Unlock the secrets of speed in this turbocharged neo super scaler arcade racing experience. Dominate the track & drift your way to the finish line on the road to becoming the VHRC champion.','2024/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1594060/Victory_Heat_Rally/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4415,'peaks_of_yore_-_the_great_alps',NULL,'This content requires the base game Peaks of Yore on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3246790/Peaks_of_Yore__The_Great_Alps/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4416,'the_darkness_ii',NULL,'An intense first person shooter that delivers a twisted and gripping narrative of tragedy, modern crime drama, and supernatural horror.','2012/2/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/67370/The_Darkness_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4417,'mash_vp!_re:vision',NULL,'[Fusion, Synthesis, Coalescence]\"MASH VP! Re:VISION\" is a revolutionary rhythm game that “fuses” two lanes and music into a completely new experience.With a variety of tracks, game modes, and a creativity-driven mashup system, it invites you into a new world of music!','2025/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2928330/MASH_VP_ReVISION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4418,'synthetik_2',NULL,'SYNTHETIK 2 is a bold continuation of SYNTHETIK: Legion Rising. Fight a world overrun by the relentless Machine Legion. Experience the next level in gun-play and upgrade yourself beyond measure to rival their Gods. Can you defeat the Heart of Armageddon?','2021/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1471410/SYNTHETIK_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4419,'caesar™_3',NULL,'Prove your strength of mind and spirit and you just may be crowned Caesar!','1999/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/517790/Caesar_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4420,'yield!_fall_of_rome',NULL,'Forge your Kingdom amidst the Ruins of Rome in this turn-based 4X strategy game! As the world crumbles, rebuild civilization and shape your people’s destiny. Unleash your strategic prowess, conquer provinces, and crush all who stand in your way.','2025/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1561960/Yield_Fall_of_Rome/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4421,'kiosk',NULL,'Kiosk is a horror cooking game where you prepare orders for late-night customers who visit your cozy, rain-soaked kiosk. The eerie atmosphere clashes with the mounting tension as you serve your mysterious visitors.','2025/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3126330/Kiosk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4422,'parkasaurus',NULL,'Parkasaurus is a dinosaur tycoon management simulation where you take care of your dinosaurs by constructing well-designed exhibits, researching specialized technologies, and maximizing profits to expand into the ultimate dinosaur theme park. Do you favor development for guests or your dinosaurs?','2020/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/591460/Parkasaurus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4423,'old_world_-_wonders_and_dynasties',NULL,'This content requires the base game Old World on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2587430/Old_World__Wonders_and_Dynasties/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4424,'dicey_dungeons',NULL,'Become a giant walking dice, explore dungeons and defy Lady Luck in this dice powered roguelike! Now featuring \"Reunion\", a free DLC with six brand-new episodes!','2019/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/861540/Dicey_Dungeons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4425,'world_of_goo',NULL,'World of Goo is a multiple award winning physics based puzzle / construction game made entirely by two guys.','2008/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/22000/World_of_Goo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4426,'sonic_forces',NULL,'The fate of Sonic the Hedgehog’s world is in your hands – Join the Uprising.','2017/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/637100/Sonic_Forces/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4427,'farming_simulator_25_-_macdon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Farming Simulator 25 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2981090/Farming_Simulator_25__MacDon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4428,'the_last_spell_-_elves_of_amberwald',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Last Spell on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/