ergence:_a_league_of_legends_story™',NULL,'Traverse the sprawling city of Zaun as Ekko, a young inventor with a device to manipulate time, in this story-driven action platformer. Collect parts, craft gadgets, and unlock abilities—then rewind time to adapt your approach to every new challenge.','2023/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1276800/CONVERGENCE_A_League_of_Legends_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4436,'going_under',NULL,'Going Under is a satirical dungeon crawler about exploring the cursed ruins of failed tech startups. As an unpaid intern in the dystopian city of Neo-Cascadia, you’ll wield office junk as weaponry as you make your way through the offbeat procedural dungeons beneath your company campus.','2020/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1154810/Going_Under/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4437,'graveyard_keeper_-_better_save_soul',NULL,'This content requires the base game Graveyard Keeper on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1788370/Graveyard_Keeper__Better_Save_Soul/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4438,'broventure:_the_wild_co-op',NULL,'Broventure = Vampire Survivors + Base building + Co-op. Band together with friends and obliterate hordes of grueling enemies, gather crucial resources, and transform your camp into a sanctuary of liberation.','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2939640/Broventure_The_Wild_Coop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4439,'torque_drift_2',NULL,'From the vibrant streets of Tokyo to high-stakes professional competitions backed by global brands, Torque Drift 2 invokes all aspects of drift and street culture to offer an experience as diverse and dynamic as the motorsport itself.','2024/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3116640/Torque_Drift_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4440,'zero_escape:_zero_time_dilemma',NULL,'Nine participants awaken, trapped in an underground facility. To escape, they must play a game with deadly consequences. Who will live, and who will die? The choice is yours. Let the Decision Game begin…','2016/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/311240/Zero_Escape_Zero_Time_Dilemma/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4441,'star_chef_2:_cooking_game',NULL,'Kitchen Simulation | Learn Cuisines | Cook Delicious Food | Become A Chef','2021/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1612810/Star_Chef_2_Cooking_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4442,'swordship',NULL,'Swordship is a roguelike where dodging is your best weapon. Trick your enemies into killing each other, steal containers to upgrade your ship and unlock new ways to play. Dodge, dive, die, learn, repeat.','2022/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1804270/Swordship/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4443,'god_eater_2_rage_burst',NULL,'Swear your oath as a GOD EATER and drive back the supernatural harbingers of Earth’s destruction. Buy GOD EATER 2 Rage Burst and get GOD EATER Resurrection FOR FREE','2016/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/438490/GOD_EATER_2_Rage_Burst/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4444,'buddy_simulator_1984',NULL,'Thanks to next generation AI technology, BUDDY SIMULATOR 1984 simulates the experience of hanging out with a best buddy! Your buddy learns from you, constantly adapting to your interests and personality. But most importantly, your buddy can play games with you!','2021/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1269950/Buddy_Simulator_1984/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4445,'master_of_magic',NULL,'Take up the role of a great wizard, wield powerful spells, command fantasy races and challenge your rivals in this remake of a cult turn-based strategy classic. Do you have what it takes to become Master of Magic?','2022/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1623070/Master_of_Magic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4446,'little_witch_nobeta',NULL,'Control the lovely little witch Nobeta, explore the unknown mysterious castle, and gradually discover the truth!','2022/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1049890/Little_Witch_Nobeta/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4447,'freeways',NULL,'You are a traffic engineer. Draw freeway interchanges. Optimize for efficency and avoid traffic jams!','2017/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/780210/Freeways/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4448,'train_sim_world®_5:_thomas_&_friends™_visit_the_west_somerset_railway',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2971230/Train_Sim_World_5_Thomas__Friends_Visit_the_West_Somerset_Railway/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4449,'wavetale',NULL,'Surf the waters of a submerged city! Unravel the past, save the islanders from mysterious sea monsters and discover secrets hidden under the surface.','2022/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1823930/Wavetale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4450,'dice_with_death',NULL,'Dice With Death is a Dicebuilding Roguelike – Unfortunately you have already died. Fortunately, Death is up for some friendly competition. Collect new dice and relics, create damage stacking combos, and even cheat Death himself to emerge victorious.','2025/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3435260/Dice_With_Death/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4451,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_escalation_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2006870/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Escalation_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4452,'no_one_survived',NULL,'This is a multiplayer cooperative open world construction survival sandbox game, where you and your friends must find supplies and build shelters in this world. You have to keep an eye on your character\'s needs state at all times, a bad state is likely to lead to death.','2023/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1963370/No_One_Survived/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4453,'prison_architect_-_island_bound',NULL,'This content requires the base game Prison Architect on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1244781/Prison_Architect__Island_Bound/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4454,'fell_seal:_arbiter\'s_mark',NULL,'Fell Seal: Arbiter\'s Mark is a turn-based tactical RPG with a focus on storytelling and strategic battles. Unfold a mature story as you progress through hand-crafted scenarios, controlling your own group of Arbiters, with each character customizable from a wide selection of classes and abilities!','2019/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/699170/Fell_Seal_Arbiters_Mark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4455,'headquarters:_world_war_ii',NULL,'Headquarters: World War II is a fast-paced turn-based strategy game where your battlefield tactics are as important as your army management skills. Experience both sides of the war, battling in Europe as the USA, the UK, or Germany. Storm bunkers, occupy houses, win tank duels.','2024/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1840800/Headquarters_World_War_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_93'),(4456,'monster_prom:_second_term',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Prom on Steam in order to play.','2019/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/958370/Monster_Prom_Second_Term/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4457,'wild_bastards',NULL,'The spiritual successor to the award-winning game Void Bastards, Wild Bastards is a roguelike strategy shooter with heart-pounding FPS action, mod management, and a tactical campaign. Saddle up and lead the most notorious outlaws in the galaxy.','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1660840/Wild_Bastards/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4458,'pieces_of_me',NULL,'\"Pieces of me\" is a psychological thriller drama in the genre of \"walking simulator\", which is a spin-off to the game \"September 7th\"','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2479740/Pieces_of_me/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4459,'cybercorp',NULL,'Brutal fast-paced isometric Co-op Loot Shooter in Cyberpunk world. Equipment-based combos. Exotic Weapons and Armor. Easy to start, hard to master. Play solo or with friends.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1116170/CyberCorp/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4460,'nanomon_virtual_pet',NULL,'Nanomon are byte-sized virtual pets for the corner of your screen! Raise over 25 unique monsters, and explore their cyber-world! Feed them, train them, or chill with them! By your side, nanomon evolve, learn new abilities, and venture further into the Nanoscape! What kind of monster will you raise?','2025/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1498060/Nanomon_Virtual_Pet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4461,'sid_meier\'s_pirates!',NULL,'Sail the Caribbean, marauding all on the high seas or ally your ship and crew as a privateer in search of riches - the life you choose is up to you. Face dogged enemies, raid unsuspecting villages, woo fair maidens, avoid capture or dig for buried treasure. Discover what it takes to become one of the most famous pirates in history!','2005/7/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3920/Sid_Meiers_Pirates/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4462,'steamworld_heist',NULL,'Command a steam-driven pirate crew in a series of epic tactical shootouts in SteamWorld Heist. This is turn-based strategy with a twist: You manually aim the guns of your robots, allowing for insane skill shots and bullet-bouncing action!','2016/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/322190/SteamWorld_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4463,'freddi_fish_and_the_case_of_the_missing_kelp_seeds',NULL,'Help underwater detective Freddi Fish and her finny friend Luther solve the case. Explore underwater caves, deep canyons and colorful reefs, and discover fascinating places like King Crab\'s Castle and A Sunken Ship Out of Time, in an effort to save the reef.','1994/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/283940/Freddi_Fish_and_the_Case_of_the_Missing_Kelp_Seeds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4464,'little_nightmares_the_residence_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Little Nightmares on Steam in order to play.','2018/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/584097/Little_Nightmares_The_Residence_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4465,'prince_of_persia®:_the_sands_of_time',NULL,'Amidst the scorched sands of ancient Persia, there is a legend spun in an ancient tongue. It speaks of a time borne by blood and ruled by deceit. Drawn to the dark powers of a magic dagger, a young Prince is led to unleash a deadly evil upon a beautiful kingdom.','2003/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/13600/Prince_of_Persia_The_Sands_of_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4466,'marvel_vs._capcom:_infinite',NULL,'The epic clash between two storied universes returns with Marvel vs. Capcom: Infinite. Ultron Sigma has begun the eradication of all biological life. Against all odds, heroes stand together against the ultimate threat, their only hope laying with the all-powerful Infinity Stones.','2017/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/493840/Marvel_vs_Capcom_Infinite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4467,'gravity_circuit',NULL,'Gravity Circuit is a flashy action packed 2D platformer in the spirit of console classics. Follow Kai, a lone operative war hero who harnesses the mysterious powers of the Gravity Circuit, on an adventure in a futuristic world inhabited by sentient robots.','2023/7/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/858710/Gravity_Circuit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4468,'robin_hood_-_sherwood_builders',NULL,'Robin Hood - Sherwood Builders is an action-adventure RPG with base-building elements, where you take on the role of a classic hero who stands up to the tyranny and injustice that haunts Sherwood. Fight, craft, steal, and of course help the local people grow and prosper.','2024/2/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1159420/Robin_Hood__Sherwood_Builders/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4469,'blood_bowl_2',NULL,'Blood Bowl 2 smashes Warhammer and American football together, in an explosive cocktail of turn-based strategy, humour and brutality, adapted from Games Workshop’s famous boardgame.','2015/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/236690/Blood_Bowl_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4470,'final_fantasy®__xi:_ultimate_collection_seekers_edition',NULL,'Note: From the 8th July the game is available in EN only.BEGIN A NEW JOURNEY WITH THE COMPLETE EDITION OF FINAL FANTASY XIEnter an online multiplayer RPG that challenges players to journey through the world of Vana’diel® — a world of fantasy, adventure, and exploration.','2013/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/230350/FINAL_FANTASY__XI_Ultimate_Collection_Seekers_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4471,'call_of_duty®:_black_ops_iii_-_gorod_krovi_zombies_map',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of Duty®: Black Ops III on Steam in order to play.','2018/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/830460/Call_of_Duty_Black_Ops_III__Gorod_Krovi_Zombies_Map/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4472,'synthetik:_legion_rising',NULL,'SYNTHETIK is an unforgiving tactical shooter rogue-lite where freedom and experimentation is key. Fight in a world overrun by the Machine Legion and their Gods. Experience the next level in gun-play and dive into unparalleled build options and Android upgrades. Can you defeat the Heart of Armageddon?','2018/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/528230/SYNTHETIK_Legion_Rising/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4473,'castlevania_anniversary_collection',NULL,'Konami\'s Castlevania Anniversary Collection traces the origins of the historic vampire franchise. Included is a unique eBook with details provided by developers, artists and others inspired by the Castlevania legacy which sheds a fresh light into the world of Castlevania.','2019/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1018010/Castlevania_Anniversary_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4474,'spooky\'s_jump_scare_mansion:_hd_renovation',NULL,'Can you survive 1000 rooms of cute terror? Or will you break once the cuteness starts to fade off and you\'re running for your life from the unspeakable hideous beings that shake and writhe in bowels of this house? They wait for you, they wait and hunger for meeting you.','2017/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/577690/Spookys_Jump_Scare_Mansion_HD_Renovation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4475,'atelier_firis:_the_alchemist_and_the_mysterious_journey_dx',NULL,'The definitive edition of the Atelier \"Mysterious\" series at a new price, with brand new content and various DLCs! \"Atelier Firis\" is the 2nd instalment: after Firis encounters alchemy and is able to leave town, she is taken on a magical journey that has no limits.','2021/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1502980/Atelier_Firis_The_Alchemist_and_the_Mysterious_Journey_DX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4476,'dragon_ball_xenoverse_2_-_future_saga_chapter_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3188680/DRAGON_BALL_XENOVERSE_2__FUTURE_SAGA_Chapter_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4477,'wrc_10_fia_world_rally_championship',NULL,'Hailed by reviewers and professional drivers, the standard-setting off-road racing simulation has been reinvented! Reach the 2021 season podium, and to celebrate the 50th anniversary of the competition, relive the highlights at the wheel of legendary cars.','2021/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1462810/WRC_10_FIA_World_Rally_Championship/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4478,'battlefleet_gothic:_armada_2_-_chaos_campaign_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Battlefleet Gothic: Armada 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1032370/Battlefleet_Gothic_Armada_2__Chaos_Campaign_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4479,'patron',NULL,'Patron is a survival city builder with a unique social dynamics system. Gather and produce resources, build your fledgling village into a prosperous city and navigate the intricate social tensions before they reach boiling point.','2021/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1538570/Patron/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4480,'blasphemous_-_digital_artbook',NULL,'This content requires the base game Blasphemous on Steam in order to play.','2019/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1143850/Blasphemous__Digital_Artbook/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4481,'eternights',NULL,'Eternights is a dating action game where you try to make the most out of life during the apocalypse. Monday: Go on a date. Tuesday: Clear dungeon. Friday: Freak out! The clock is ticking!!','2023/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1402110/Eternights/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4482,'verdun',NULL,'Merciless trench warfare immerses you and your squad in intense battles of attack and defense. Verdun is the first multiplayer FPS set in an authentic World War One setting offering a rarely seen battlefield experience.','2015/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/242860/Verdun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4483,'the_drone_racing_league_simulator',NULL,'The DRL Simulator is the premier FPV racing game and simulator. The DRL Sim offers a robust, evolving feature set, including high-intensity drone racing. It packs tracks that DRL\'s real world pilots compete on, with more added every season. And, it\'s the only place to fly DRL\'s exclusive drone, the Racer4!','2017/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/641780/The_Drone_Racing_League_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4484,'i\'m_on_observation_duty_6',NULL,'As an employee of a mysterious organization your job is to monitor live surveillance camera footage and spot anomalies using your sharp eyes and good memory. Can you survive the entire night shift or will you succumb into paranoia?','2023/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2137700/Im_on_Observation_Duty_6/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4485,'prison_architect_-_second_chances',NULL,'This content requires the base game Prison Architect on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1601350/Prison_Architect__Second_Chances/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4486,'the_front',NULL,'The Front is a survival open-world crafting sandbox game. You are a resistance fighter sent back in time to stop the rise of a tyrannical empire. Collect resources, craft tech, build shelters, and fight monsters to accomplish your mission.','2023/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2285150/The_Front/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4487,'honkai_impact_3rd',NULL,'Honkai Impact 3rd - Ultimate anime action made real! HD cel-shading, infinite combos, explosive feedback... Experience next-gen real-time action! An original tale told across media, immersive stage events, star-studded voice cast... Become part of the legend!','2021/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1671200/Honkai_Impact_3rd/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4488,'scratchers',NULL,'Scratchers is an incremental game where you scratch cards to earn cash, unlock upgrades, and hire little scratchers to do the scratching for you. Discover rare cards, and optimize your earnings as you climb to scratcher supremacy!','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3697950/Scratchers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4489,'wandersong',NULL,'A musical platforming adventure with an emotional story. Play as a silly bard and use music to interact with everything on a journey around the world. Along the way you\'ll explore, solve puzzles, and meet a huge cast of characters!','2018/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/530320/Wandersong/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4490,'warframe:_1999_complete_collection',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warframe on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3327800/Warframe_1999_Complete_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4491,'star_traders:_frontiers',NULL,'You are the captain of a starship venturing through a massive open universe. Customize your crew and take command at the helm of your very own ship as you explore a galaxy torn apart by internal strife, alien threats, and political intrigue.','2018/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/335620/Star_Traders_Frontiers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4492,'zeroranger',NULL,'This is the story of a fighter who wanted to become...','2018/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/809020/ZeroRanger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4493,'defcon',NULL,'Inspired by the 1983 cult classic film, Wargames, DEFCON superbly evokes the tension, paranoia and suspicion of the Cold War era, playing on the fascinating aspects of psychological gameplay that occur during strategic nuclear warfare.','2006/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1520/DEFCON/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4494,'stronghold_2:_steam_edition',NULL,'Tax, torture or treat your peasants! Rehabilitate criminals or sentence them to death? Decide as you enjoy jousting over a lavish banquet, all while under siege from the warmongering Lord Barclay.',NULL,NULL,'https://store.steampowered.com/app/40960/Stronghold_2_Steam_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4495,'idling_to_rule_the_gods',NULL,'Idling to Rule the Gods is a free to play Idle-Game with a lot of content and some Minigames. Depending on your play-style, you can play it fast or slow. Either way it can be fun for hundreds of hours!','2016/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/466170/Idling_to_Rule_the_Gods/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4496,'serious_sam:_siberian_mayhem',NULL,'Serious Sam: Siberian Mayhem is a new stand-alone expansion to the world of the classic FPS series. Join the fight against Notorious Mental on a journey through the wild lands of Russia, and find your way through this lost chapter of Sam Stone\'s adventures.','2022/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1792250/Serious_Sam_Siberian_Mayhem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4497,'metal_wolf_chaos_xd',NULL,'Metal Wolf Chaos XD is a modernized re-release of FromSoftware\'s 2004 mech shooter with upgraded visual fidelity, refined controls and gameplay, a new save system, and 4K + 16:9 support for modern displays.','2019/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/820630/Metal_Wolf_Chaos_XD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4498,'asylum',NULL,'An epic supernatural horror adventure and the spiritual successor to cult classic Scratches set in a massive, decaying mental institute. Inspired by H. P. Lovecraft, Hammer Films and twisted Euro Horror from the 80s.','2025/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/230210/ASYLUM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4499,'unit_pack_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_axis_armor',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1086480/Unit_Pack__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_Axis_Armor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4500,'after_the_fall®',NULL,'From the team that brought you Arizona Sunshine® comes an epic VR action FPS with intense co-op gameplay at its core. Team up with friends and take on a hostile VR world filled with ferocious undead--mutated and twisted by the relentless cold.','2021/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/751630/After_the_Fall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4501,'haydee_3',NULL,'Haydee III is a hardcore metroidvania with third-person shooter mechanics, platforming, puzzles, a sexy heroine and cake!','2025/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3508770/Haydee_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4502,'chronicon',NULL,'Use the magical device known as the Chronicon to travel into the souls and memories of fallen heroes to re-live their grand tales! Epic adventures full of loot and monsters await!','2020/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/375480/Chronicon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4503,'cat_quest',NULL,'The multi award-winning Action RPG. Some say \'Diablo with Cats\' others a \'Super-cute Skyrim\', whatever your take, Cat Quest\'s loot-fuelled cat-venture is as beautifully crafted, as its combat and magic are ultra-satisfying. Universally adored by critics - it\'ll have you purring for joy!','2017/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/593280/Cat_Quest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_94'),(4504,'silica',NULL,'Silica blends FPS and RTS in epic, photorealistic battles. Choose to fight on the ground or command from above as humans or aliens. Dive into thrilling multiplayer combat or master strategic command. Are you ready to survive and conquer?','2023/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1494420/Silica/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4505,'town_of_salem',NULL,'Inspired by the party games Werewolf and Mafia, Town of Salem is a game of murder, mystery and deception.','2014/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/334230/Town_of_Salem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4506,'graveyard_keeper_-_game_of_crone',NULL,'This content requires the base game Graveyard Keeper on Steam in order to play.','2020/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1430990/Graveyard_Keeper__Game_Of_Crone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4507,'polypine',NULL,'A forest simulator where you grow trees and create habitats for animals, plants and insects. Click on animals to make them poop, hunt, dig, cut and twerk! Start with a few basic seeds and attempt to grow a thriving ecosystem.','2025/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2718240/PolyPine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4508,'my_lands:_black_gem_hunting',NULL,'My Lands is a free online RTS where dark and light forces fight for Black Gem and dominion in a vast fantasy world. Cooperation between players, joint economy development, creation of clans and alliances and elaboration of a team strategy serve as the very foundation of the game.','2014/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/290730/My_Lands_Black_Gem_Hunting/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4509,'apocalypse_express',NULL,'Conduct, upgrade and repair your train through endless waves of enemies in a post-apocalyptic setting. In this action management roguelike, the player decides to embark on a journey through the wasteland looking to fulfill the dream of seeing the remains of the outside world.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3223160/Apocalypse_Express/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4510,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_rims_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2721070/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__Rims_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4511,'zeepkist',NULL,'Welcome to Zeepkist! You race soapboxes down hills!','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1440670/Zeepkist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4512,'fish_game',NULL,'Fish Game is a detailed and highly “sofishticated” freshwater aquarium simulator, lovingly crafted *by* enthusiasts *for* enthusiasts! Featuring fish with personalities and dynamic relationships, water quality modeling, and so much more! Made with support from our friends at Smarter Every Day!','2023/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1372150/Fish_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4513,'on_your_tail',NULL,'A cozy detective adventure where you play as a vacation-bound writer who stumbles upon an idyllic town plagued by an enigmatic thief. Crack the case in this charming seaside town, build relationships, and unravel secrets in a world full of quirky characters and heartwarming stories.','2024/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2132560/On_Your_Tail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4514,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_land_rover_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2022/2/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1748991/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__Land_Rover_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4515,'il-2_sturmovik:_flying_circus_-_volume_iii',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2731420/IL2_Sturmovik_Flying_Circus__Volume_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4516,'hexarchy',NULL,'Hexarchy is an innovative, fast-paced, historical 4x strategy game where you use cards and deckbuilding to make your decisions. Single-player and online multiplayer.','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1356810/Hexarchy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4517,'post_void',NULL,'Post Void is a hypnotic scramble of early first-person shooter design that values speed above all else. Keep your head full and reach the end; Kill what you can to see it mend; Get the high score or try again.','2020/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1285670/Post_Void/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4518,'the_elder_scrolls_online:_gold_road',NULL,'A forgotten Daedric Prince has returned, bringing chaos to West Weald! Explore a new zone and defend the city of Skingrad, now beset by a dangerous Daedric cult and the jungles of Valenwood. Customize your skills like never before with the new Scribing system.','2024/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2662630/The_Elder_Scrolls_Online_Gold_Road/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4519,'crawl',NULL,'Crawl is the local multiplayer dungeon crawler where your friends control the monsters! Battle through dungeons and power up your hero - if a friend kills you they take your place and it’s their turn to crawl. It\'s a race to gain enough XP and loot to take on the hulking final boss!','2017/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/293780/Crawl/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4520,'military_conflict:_vietnam',NULL,'It\'s 1968 in Vietnam, the time to \'Make War Not Love\'. Side with the Viet Cong or U.S. Army in this intense, fast-paced FPS set in the Vietnam War. Choose from over 200+ weapons of destruction. Kill or be killed!','2022/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1012110/Military_Conflict_Vietnam/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4521,'hitman_3_-_deluxe_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game HITMAN World of Assassination on Steam in order to play.','2022/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1829591/HITMAN_3__Deluxe_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4522,'yooka-laylee_and_the_impossible_lair',NULL,'Yooka-Laylee and the Impossible Lair is a brand-new 2.5D platformer from some of the key creative talent behind \'Donkey Kong Country\'. As the colourful buddy duo you must tackle a series of stunning, 2.5D levels and explore a puzzling 3D Overworld rich with secrets and surprises!','2019/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/846870/YookaLaylee_and_the_Impossible_Lair/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4523,'anno_1800_–_new_world_rising',NULL,'This content requires the base game Anno 1800 on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2222640/Anno_1800__New_World_Rising/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4524,'minutescape',NULL,'Dodge bullets and upgrade yourself in Minutescape, a retro-inspired incremental game that keeps unfolding. Unlock new abilities and keep upgrading yourself to survive for 5 consecutive minutes.','2025/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3327170/Minutescape/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4525,'kingdom_two_crowns:_norse_lands',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Two Crowns on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1708680/Kingdom_Two_Crowns_Norse_Lands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4526,'il-2_sturmovik:_battle_of_kuban',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/629700/IL2_Sturmovik_Battle_of_Kuban/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4527,'shadows_of_forbidden_gods',NULL,'Take on the role of a Dark Elder God and lead your agents to bring about an apocalypse in a fantasy world. Work in the shadows, avoiding the heroes who will try to stop you, as you bring about plague and famine, ice age and volcanic destruction, madness and never ending night.','2023/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1741640/Shadows_of_Forbidden_Gods/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4528,'aliens:_fireteam_elite_-_pathogen_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Aliens: Fireteam Elite on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1942650/Aliens_Fireteam_Elite__Pathogen_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4529,'wolfquest_anniversary_-_hellroaring_mountain',NULL,'This content requires the base game WolfQuest: Anniversary Edition on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2874030/WolfQuest_Anniversary__Hellroaring_Mountain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4530,'atomic_heart_-_enchantment_under_the_sea',NULL,'This content requires the base game Atomic Heart on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2214823/Atomic_Heart__Enchantment_Under_the_Sea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4531,'smack_studio',NULL,'A sandbox fighting game with built-in creation tools to create characters and stages. Animate pixel art characters using our 3D pixel art rotation technology, then battle with up to 8 players! Use our tools to export sprites for your own projects.','2024/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1739300/Smack_Studio/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4532,'black_one_blood_brothers',NULL,'Black One Blood Brothers is a tactical military shooter game where strategy and coordination are key. Command a squad of top operators, with unique skills, through high-risk missions around the globe. Customize your crew, plan your missions, and adjust on the fly for a vast replayability.','2022/1/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1621560/Black_One_Blood_Brothers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4533,'paperklay',NULL,'A classic 3D platformer with a tactile twist: Open, unfold, and rotate your way through a stunning world built with familiar crafting materials. Featuring the talents of composer Kirkhope & Melin (Banjo-Kazooie, Yooka-Laylee) and voice actor Kevin Miller (Sly Cooper)','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1350720/PaperKlay/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4534,'yeah!_you_want_\"those_games,\"_right?_so_here_you_go!_now,_let\'s_see_you_clear_them!',NULL,'Cute and comical stickman characters have arrived for you to enjoy \"those games\" you\'ve seen and wanted to play before. Play a variety of minigames fully, thoroughly, and enjoyably to your heart\'s content!','2023/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2348100/YEAH_YOU_WANT_THOSE_GAMES_RIGHT_SO_HERE_YOU_GO_NOW_LETS_SEE_YOU_CLEAR_THEM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4535,'spirit_city:_lofi_sessions_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Spirit City: Lofi Sessions on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2374850/Spirit_City_Lofi_Sessions__Supporter_pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4536,'space_engineers_-_economy_deluxe',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2019/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1135960/Space_Engineers__Economy_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4537,'bum_simulator',NULL,'Bum Simulator is a sandbox game bursting with inappropriate humor and memorable characters. You live on the streets of Bumsville. Do you have what it takes to adapt, survive and become an urban legend?','2023/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/855740/Bum_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4538,'space_engineers_-_wasteland',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1374610/Space_Engineers__Wasteland/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4539,'i_am_fish',NULL,'I Am Fish is a charming, physics-based adventure starring four intrepid fish friends, forcibly separated from their home in a pet shop fish tank. Swim, fly, roll and chomp your way to the open ocean in a bid for freedom and to re-unite once again.','2021/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1472560/I_Am_Fish/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4540,'steamworld_quest:_hand_of_gilgamech',NULL,'Lead a party of aspiring heroes through a beautifully hand-drawn world and intense battles using only your wits and a handful of cards. Take on whatever threat comes your way by crafting your own deck choosing from over 100 unique punch-cards!','2019/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/804010/SteamWorld_Quest_Hand_of_Gilgamech/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4541,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_sports_venues',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2224690/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Sports_Venues/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4542,'mosa_lina',NULL,'a hostile interpretation of the immersive sim, where nothing is planned, and everything works','2023/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2477090/Mosa_Lina/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4543,'american_theft_80s',NULL,'From the THIEF SIMULATOR developers. It\'s the 80s. Steal VCRs, tapes, classic cars, and if you get caught, outrun the police!','2022/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1321450/American_Theft_80s/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4544,'trans-siberian_railway_simulator',NULL,'Take control of a Soviet locomotive and battle wild animals, bandits, severe frost, and constant mechanical breakdowns as you cross the world’s longest railway. How far will you get?','2024/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/998400/TransSiberian_Railway_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4545,'dice_&_fold',NULL,'A turn-based dungeon crawler where your only way of attacking the enemy is by rolling dice. Roll dice to damage enemy cards to FOLD. Inspired by classic Solitaire, in a top-down table and enemies made out of cards, try to beat the dungeon with 35 unique classes. Build your deck, kill monsters.','2024/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2693930/Dice__Fold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4546,'northern_journey',NULL,'A norwegian happysad game set in a northern land! Adventure through a beautiful and very varied wilderness. Dive, fly, use ziplines and find different weapons to aid your journey to reach the cold mountains and below. Encounter over 50 unique bosses and enemy types!','2021/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1639790/Northern_Journey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4547,'toukiden_2',NULL,'Slayers! Go forth and eradicate the Oni menace! Experience the latest hunting action game featuring a dynamic targeted destruction system! The latest installment in the hunting action series \"Toukiden\".','2017/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/551730/Toukiden_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4548,'exogate_initiative',NULL,'Build and manage mankind’s first mission across the universe! Create a sprawling facility underground, recruit a diverse group of specialists from around the globe and explore mysterious new worlds through the Exogate.','2025/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1681060/Exogate_Initiative/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_95'),(4549,'american_truck_simulator_-_volvo_construction_equipment',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1662380/American_Truck_Simulator__Volvo_Construction_Equipment/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4550,'sniper_elite_5:_target_führer_-_wolf_mountain',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sniper Elite 5 on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1872750/Sniper_Elite_5_Target_Fhrer__Wolf_Mountain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4551,'dark_souls™_iii_-_the_ringed_city™',NULL,'This content requires the base game DARK SOULS™ III on Steam in order to play.','2017/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/506971/DARK_SOULS_III__The_Ringed_City/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4552,'darkest_dungeon®:_the_shieldbreaker',NULL,'This content requires the base game Darkest Dungeon® on Steam in order to play.','2017/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/702540/Darkest_Dungeon_The_Shieldbreaker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4553,'grandia_hd_remaster',NULL,'GRANDIA HD Remaster brings enhanced visuals to both gameplay and cinematic videos.','2019/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1034860/GRANDIA_HD_Remaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4554,'stay_out_of_the_house',NULL,'Can you escape the home of a cannibal serial killer? It\'s only a matter of time until you\'re dinner!','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/896520/Stay_Out_of_the_House/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4555,'lootplot',NULL,'Re-arrange items, discover synergies, bend the rules, and break the game! LOOTPLOT is a points-based, inventory builder Roguelite centered around items, which all have a unique twist.','2025/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3057190/LOOTPLOT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4556,'root:_the_riverfolk_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Root on Steam in order to play.','2021/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1586100/Root_The_Riverfolk_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4557,'ship_graveyard_simulator_2_-_steam_ships_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ship Graveyard Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3550840/Ship_Graveyard_Simulator_2__Steam_Ships_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4558,'ultros',NULL,'ULTROS is a psychedelic metroidvania where you wake up stranded on The Sarcophagus — a cosmic uterus holding an ancient, demonic being. Trapped in the loop of a black hole, you will have to explore The Sarcophagus and meet its inhabitants to understand the part you play...','2024/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2386310/Ultros/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4559,'grimlord',NULL,'Grimlord is a Dark Fantasy Action Souls-like RPG - on VR. Awakened in a monastery deep in the Lonely Mountains, you walk in an epic quest as the adventurer standing before the darkness and striving for the light against the tyrannical Grim Lord.','2024/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1910860/Grimlord/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4560,'teenage_mutant_ninja_turtles:_splintered_fate_-_casey_jones_&_the_junkyard_jam',NULL,'This content requires the base game Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Splintered Fate on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3316670/Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_Splintered_Fate__Casey_Jones__the_Junkyard_Jam/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4561,'drapline',NULL,'\"DRAPLINE\" is a roguelite training game where you raise a dragon girl who eats anything and train her to become the strongest in one year. Feed her a variety of things to increase her abilities, combine various skills to build your own strategy, and defeat the impending catastrophe!','2025/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3103780/DRAPLINE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4562,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_electric_car_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2021/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1685721/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__Electric_Car_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4563,'pilgrim',NULL,'Pilgrim is a medieval-based, co-op horror, adventure. Can you and your friends make it to the end of The Road?','2024/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2965660/PILGRIM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4564,'world_war_z:_aftermath_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game World War Z on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2243210/World_War_Z_Aftermath_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4565,'the_white_door',NULL,'Enter The White Door and discover Rusty Lake’s universe in a new game with a unique style! Explore Robert Hill’s dreams and help him to find his lost memories. Can you survive the strict daily routine and bring back color to Robert\'s life?','2020/1/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1145960/The_White_Door/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4566,'darkblade_ascent',NULL,'Fast paced First-Person Melee Roguelike RPG with randomly generated weapons and upgrades, unlockable new classes and persistent leveling. Hack and slash your way through atmospheric dark fantasy locations, unique monsters and bosses.','2025/2/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2406370/Darkblade_Ascent/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4567,'bloodrayne:_terminal_cut',NULL,'Enhanced and updated for modern systems, this is the definitive edition of the action horror game that unleashed the red-headed dhampir on the world. In a story spanning five years, Rayne must stop a madman bent on using occult relics to bring about a new age of domination for the Third Reich.','2020/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1373510/BloodRayne_Terminal_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4568,'mount_&_blade:_warband_-_viking_conquest_reforged_edition',NULL,'This content requires the base game Mount & Blade: Warband on Steam in order to play.','2014/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/321300/Mount__Blade_Warband__Viking_Conquest_Reforged_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4569,'runes_of_magic',NULL,'Start your heroic saga today in a world full of magic and excitement: Choose your race, build a home and discover the fantastic world of Taborea in the classic free-to-play MMO!','2009/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/808290/Runes_of_Magic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4570,'postal_2:_paradise_lost',NULL,'This content requires the base game POSTAL 2 on Steam in order to play.','2015/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/360960/POSTAL_2_Paradise_Lost/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4571,'juno:_new_origins',NULL,'Bring to life anything you can imagine from rockets and airplanes to cars and more. Automate them with a visual programming language. Explore 3D planets and make your own. Share your creations online. Complete contracts, conquer milestones, and unlock technology in the newly added Career Mode.','2023/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/870200/Juno_New_Origins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4572,'calico',NULL,'Calico is a day-in-the-life community sim game where you are given an important and adorable task: rebuild the town’s cat café and fill it with cute and cuddly creatures! Build up your café by filling it with cute furniture, fun decorations, yummy pastries, and get it bustling with animals again!','2020/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1112890/Calico/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4573,'cellveillance',NULL,'\"Cellveillance\" is a detective drama entertainment product, you will visit the apartment every day, and the entire apartment is responsible for everything that happens in the apartment, a mysterious organization asks you to return the information of the residents.','2025/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3218580/Cellveillance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4574,'sniper_elite_5:_conqueror_mission,_weapon_and_skin_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sniper Elite 5 on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1724942/Sniper_Elite_5_Conqueror_Mission_Weapon_and_Skin_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4575,'sword_art_online_fractured_daydream',NULL,'In this online co-op action game, enter a distorted version of the SWORD ART ONLINE world. Pick your role in the form of favorite SWORD ART ONLINE characters and team up with 20 players for raids to defeat powerful enemies.','2024/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1858630/SWORD_ART_ONLINE_Fractured_Daydream/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4576,'monster_jam™_showdown',NULL,'It’s time to jump into a groundbreaking off-road arcade racing game, packed with thrilling sprints and unique tricks. Get behind the wheel of the most iconic Monster Jam™ trucks ever, and show your skills in several game modes!','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2350280/Monster_Jam_Showdown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4577,'occupy_mars:_the_game',NULL,'Survive and colonize Mars in a highly technical, open-world sandbox game. Build and upgrade your base, discover new regions, conduct mining operations, retrieve water, generate oxygen, grow crops, and fix broken parts.','2023/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/758690/Occupy_Mars_The_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4578,'pocket_mirror_~_goldenertraum',NULL,'Delve into the enthralling world of Pocket Mirror ~ GoldenerTraum, the acclaimed RPG Maker gothic horror game that\'ll take you on a moving journey of self-discovery.','2023/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1899060/Pocket_Mirror__GoldenerTraum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4579,'call_of_duty®:_black_ops_iii_-_revelations_zombies_map',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of Duty®: Black Ops III on Steam in order to play.','2018/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/830461/Call_of_Duty_Black_Ops_III__Revelations_Zombies_Map/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4580,'wandering_sword_-_mount_pack:_majestic_steeds',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wandering Sword on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3027840/Wandering_Sword__Mount_Pack_Majestic_Steeds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4581,'cats_hidden_around_the_world',NULL,'Find 2000 cats hiding in 20 iconic locations such as Rio de Janeiro, Istanbul or Tokyo in this cute hand-drawn hidden object game by Travellin Cats - the original viral hidden cats game creator! Can you find them all?','2024/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2377970/Cats_Hidden_Around_the_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4582,'cage_of_roses',NULL,'A haunting gothic romance set in the 19th century. Follow Meike, a young woman from an impoverished noble family, as she’s swept off her feet by the mysterious Magdalena: a vampire who possesses a dark secret.','2025/2/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2993720/Cage_of_Roses/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4583,'song_of_farca',NULL,'Hack into crime scenes, look for evidence, analyze data, interrogate criminals, track suspects and deal with the consequences of your decisions. This is a dark and brutal detective story with a Black Mirror-esque atmosphere of digital dominance and the narrative structure of a US crime procedural.','2021/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1435670/Song_of_Farca/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4584,'atelier_shallie:_alchemists_of_the_dusk_sea_dx',NULL,'\"A story of two girls fulfilling their wishes.\" The \"Dusk\" series, a trilogy of RPG titles from Gust\'s popular Atelier series, tells the story of a world on the verge ruin, told from the perspective of its unique characters. The 3rd title in the series \"Atelier Shallie\" is now available as a deluxe version.','2020/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1152320/Atelier_Shallie_Alchemists_of_the_Dusk_Sea_DX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4585,'unit_pack_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_eastern_front_planes',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1579991/Unit_Pack__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_Eastern_Front_Planes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4586,'milk_inside_a_bag_of_milk_inside_a_bag_of_milk',NULL,'A short story about what sort of challenges everyday little things can be. Help the girl buy milk, be the first not to disappoint her.','2020/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1392820/Milk_inside_a_bag_of_milk_inside_a_bag_of_milk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4587,'root:_the_marauder_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Root on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3346620/Root_The_Marauder_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4588,'cities:_skylines_-_snowfall',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2016/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/420610/Cities_Skylines__Snowfall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4589,'megaloot',NULL,'Megaloot is an addictive Inventory Management Roguelike RPG, where meticulous loot management lets you create diverse and powerful builds for each run. With every new attempt, start from scratch and loot strategically to craft dominating setups and become the ultimate power hunter.','2024/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2440380/Megaloot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4590,'gaming_cafe_simulator',NULL,'Revive a closed-down gaming café and build it into the ultimate gaming hub! Manage rentals, sell gaming merch, and expand with PCs, consoles, and an in-house café to prepare and sell fresh food. Attract customers with unique gaming sections. Can you turn your dream café into a bustling success?','2025/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2978540/Gaming_Cafe_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4591,'the_surge',NULL,'Welcome to CREO, the megacorporation saving the world! A catastrophic event has knocked you out during the first day on the job… you wake up equipped with a heavy-grade exoskeleton, in a destroyed section of the complex.','2017/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/378540/The_Surge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4592,'sid_meier\'s_civilization®_vi:_australia_civilization_&_scenario_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier’s Civilization® VI on Steam in order to play.','2017/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/512034/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_VI_Australia_Civilization__Scenario_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4593,'endless_monday:_dreams_and_deadlines',NULL,'\"Endless Monday: Dreams and Deadlines\" - In this short story from the Endless Monday, Penny, a mild-mannered corporate grunt, spends a weekend at the office in an effort to finish her project on time while overcoming distractions from coworkers, space aliens, imaginary friends, and herself.','2023/5/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2262610/Endless_Monday_Dreams_and_Deadlines/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4594,'tevi',NULL,'Embark on an epic action-adventure as you slash, dash, and combo your way through a vast, vibrant world. Explore and uncover hidden secrets. Customize your build to triumph in spectacular boss battles. Experience a tale of mystery, magic, and mayhem in TEVI, a bullet hell metroidvania!','2023/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2230650/TEVI/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4595,'anno_2070™',NULL,'Build your society of the future, colonize islands, and create sprawling megacities with multitudes of buildings, vehicles, and resources to manage.','2011/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/48240/Anno_2070/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4596,'guns_of_fury',NULL,'Guns of Fury is a retro-inspired action platformer that combines the run & gun and Metroidvania genres. Explore a vast interconnected world, gain new abilities and weapons, battle epic bosses and stop the plans of an evil corporation before it’s too late!','2025/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3099000/Guns_of_Fury/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4597,'brothers_in_arms:_earned_in_blood™',NULL,'With its unprecedented combination of authenticity, compelling story and squad-based action, the Brothers in Arms franchise has established itself as a benchmark for military action games, receiving the highest average review scores of any console WWII game to date (www.gamerankings.com).','2005/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/19800/Brothers_in_Arms_Earned_in_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_96'),(4598,'oppidum',NULL,'Face the challenges of Oppidum, a survival adventure for 1-4 players with a unique story waiting to be unraveled. Build a camp, collect everything a fantastic land can offer, and use it to push forward through the island. A world hanging by a thread needs your help – will you answer the call?','2025/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2115760/Oppidum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4599,'kithack_model_club',NULL,'Developed by the creator of the original Kerbal Space Program, KitHack Model Club is a physics-based model building sandbox that offers limitless freedom for you and your friends. Design, build, battle, fly (and crash!) your very own RC vehicles, or experiment with over 2,400 ready-made vehicles!','2024/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2107090/KitHack_Model_Club/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4600,'dcs:_spitfire_lf_mk_ix',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2017/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/411920/DCS_Spitfire_LF_Mk_IX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4601,'galactic_civilizations_iii',NULL,'Build a civilization that will stand the test of time in the largest space-based strategy game ever! Choose from dozens of unique races and make a name for yourself across the galaxy through diplomacy, espionage, technological advances, and more.','2015/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/226860/Galactic_Civilizations_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4602,'old_world_-_wrath_of_gods',NULL,'This content requires the base game Old World on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3406150/Old_World__Wrath_of_Gods/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(