',NULL,'Say helloaphant to jmtb02’s classic series of elephant games–now remastered into one elephant-sized package!','2023/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2274110/The_Elephant_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4610,'sonic_&_sega_all-stars_racing',NULL,'SONIC AND SEGA ALL-STARS RACE FOR VICTORY IN A HIGH SPEED HIGH SKILL RACETRACK SHOWDOWN! TAKE TO THE TRACK BY CAR, MONSTER TRUCK, BIKE AND EVEN AEROPLANE IN SONIC & SEGA ALL-STARS RACING. Explore stunning new circuits including Sonic Seaside Hill, Curien Mansion and Blizzard Castle as you zip around medieval castle ramparts, hurtle...','2010/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/34190/Sonic__SEGA_AllStars_Racing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4611,'overboard!',NULL,'GET AWAY WITH MURDER. Highly replayable detective game where you\'re the one whodunnit. From the creators of 80 Days and Heaven\'s Vault.','2021/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1546920/Overboard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4612,'picayune_dreams',NULL,'Picayune Dreams is a roguelike blend of bullet heaven horde survival, and bullet hell gameplay. Adrift across the endless void, you must fend off thousands of nightmarish and otherwordly creatures. Uncover a mysterious and surreal story. And don\'t forget. You mu [TRANSMISSION INTERRUPTED...]','2023/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2088840/Picayune_Dreams/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4613,'turok',NULL,'A world where time has no meaning - and evil knows no bounds. Torn from a world long gone, the time traveling warrior Turok has found himself thrust into a savage land torn by conflict.','1997/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/405820/Turok/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4614,'blue_revolver',NULL,'Fight, fly, flourish! BLUE REVOLVER is a manic arcade-style shoot-em-up built for newcomers and psychos alike. Powerful special weapons cut through tough areas, while an adaptive difficulty system tailors the game to your skill level as you evade and counter a maniac environmental force!','2016/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/439490/BLUE_REVOLVER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4615,'infinifactory',NULL,'Infinifactory is a sandbox puzzle game by Zachtronics, the creators of SpaceChem and Infiniminer. Build factories that assemble products for your alien overlords, and try not to die in the process.','2015/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/300570/Infinifactory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4616,'time_to_morp',NULL,'Play with friends in a cozy base-building adventure! Take care of adorable creatures — Morps, explore, discover new species, grow crops, fish, build relationships with your crew, decorate your perfect home, and automate production along the way!','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/977510/Time_to_Morp/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4617,'monument_valley_2',NULL,'Discover illusionary pathways and delightful puzzles as you learn the secrets of The Sacred Geometry. Follow the heart warming story of Ro in her journey through motherhood. Rediscover independence through manipulating monuments and evolving paths to explore new, surreal, and mysterious worlds.','2022/7/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1927740/Monument_Valley_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4618,'coin_pusher_casino',NULL,'Coin Pusher Casino brings the excitement of classic coin pusher machines to your computer! With its engaging gameplay and realistic physics, Coin Pusher Casino is a must-play for fans of arcade and coin pusher games!','2024/2/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2178590/Coin_Pusher_Casino/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4619,'iron_harvest_-_iron_harvest_1920+',NULL,'This content requires the base game Iron Harvest on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1628070/Iron_Harvest__Iron_Harvest_1920/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4620,'supreme_commander',NULL,'For a thousand years, three opposing forces have waged war for what they believe is true. There can be no room for compromise: their way is the only way. Dubbed The Infinite War, this devastating conflict has taken its toll on a once-peaceful galaxy and has only served to deepen the hatred between the factions.','2007/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/9350/Supreme_Commander/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4621,'trailmakers:_space_voyager_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Trailmakers on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2579530/Trailmakers_Space_Voyager_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4622,'darkest_dungeon®:_the_color_of_madness',NULL,'This content requires the base game Darkest Dungeon® on Steam in order to play.','2018/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/735730/Darkest_Dungeon_The_Color_Of_Madness/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4623,'[chilla\'s_art]_shinkansen_0_|_新幹線_0号',NULL,'Shinkansen 0 | 新幹線 0号 is a game set in Japan where players are tasked with finding anomalies in the Shinkansen. (Japanese bullet train)','2024/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2793370/Chillas_Art_Shinkansen_0___0/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4624,'music_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_radio_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1086481/Music__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_Radio_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4625,'house_flipper_2_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game House Flipper 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2649200/House_Flipper_2__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4626,'overlord_ii',NULL,'Overlord II, sequel to the critically acclaimed cult hit, sees the return of the chaotic Minions and their new Dark Master. Bigger, badder and more beautifully destructive, Overlord 2 has a Glorious Empire to smash, a massive Netherworld to revive, Minion mounts to mobilize, a trio of mistresses to woo, War Machines to crush opposition...','2009/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/12810/Overlord_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4627,'star_wars™_jedi_knight_ii_-_jedi_outcast™',NULL,'The Legacy of Star Wars Dark Forces™ and Star Wars® Jedi Knight lives on in the intense first-person action of Jedi Outcast.','2003/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6030/STAR_WARS_Jedi_Knight_II__Jedi_Outcast/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4628,'idle_hero_td_-_tower_defense',NULL,'Endless idle tower defense game full of deep strategy and combat mechanics. Unlock and upgrade dozens of epic fantasy heroes to defeat an infinite swarm of enemy monsters. Strategize hero positions, synergies, and skills for an effective defense, then sit back and let the auto-battler do its thing!','2024/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2897580/Idle_Hero_TD__Tower_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4629,'the_sims™_4_nifty_knitting_stuff_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2020/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1368570/The_Sims_4_Nifty_Knitting_Stuff_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4630,'glyphica:_typing_survival',NULL,'Weaponize your WPM. Glyphica: Typing Survival is a single-player roguelite horde survival typing game that lets you mow down hordes of enemies in a minimalistic arena using your finger dexterity, your choice of weapons loadout, and sheer determination.','2024/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2400160/Glyphica_Typing_Survival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4631,'wildermyth_-_omenroad',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wildermyth on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2935580/Wildermyth__Omenroad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4632,'frog_detective_2:_the_case_of_the_invisible_wizard',NULL,'You\'re a detective, and a frog, and it\'s time to solve a mystery. Also there\'s a wizard.','2019/12/9','Released','htt