iety of vehicles to buy, sell and unlock.','2023/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2083210/Super_Woden_GP_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_97'),(4646,'dcs:_oh-58d_kiowa_warrior_by_polychop_simulations',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2948500/DCS_OH58D_Kiowa_Warrior_by_Polychop_Simulations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4647,'atelier_meruru_~the_apprentice_of_arland~_dx',NULL,'Third release in the Arland series. Princess of the small frontier country of Arls, Meruru plans to use alchemy to stimulate the growth of her small country. Use Synthesis, Explore, and Battle to increase the population within the time limit and boost the advancement of the kingdom.','2018/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/936190/Atelier_Meruru_The_Apprentice_of_Arland_DX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4648,'mask_of_the_rose',NULL,'A marvellous romance with a hint of murder, where every playthrough is different! Seek love, friendship, or more... intimate encounters. Help a murdered man find justice. And watch out for the bats.','2023/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1769980/Mask_of_the_Rose/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4649,'_knights_of_the_crusades',NULL,'Travel to the Holy Land with the First Crusades. Rise from a humble knight to the founding father of a world-spanning holy order. Lead through war, faith, diplomacy, and cunning schemes. Experience a unique blend of RTS, city-building, and sandbox gameplay, and shape history!','2025/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3440120/_Knights_of_the_Crusades/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4650,'riddle_joker',NULL,'For decades, superpowers and psychic abilities were thought to be mere science fiction, but the discovery of a certain particle called the \"Astron\" at the end of the 20th century proved to the world that these wondrous phenomena were real.','2020/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1277930/Riddle_Joker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4651,'dead_rising_2:_off_the_record',NULL,'You are Frank West – photojournalist and original hero of the Dead Rising Willamette incident – taking center stage experiencing the re-imagined Fortune City outbreak.','2011/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/45770/Dead_Rising_2_Off_the_Record/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4652,'warhammer:_vermintide_2_-_forgotten_relics_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer: Vermintide 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1592630/Warhammer_Vermintide_2__Forgotten_Relics_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4653,'threshold',NULL,'In a lonely station atop a mountain, a train rumbles its precious cargo to places unknown. Now is your shift. Keep the pace. Uncover a mystery. Fight for your last breath. The air is thin up here.','2024/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2580020/THRESHOLD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4654,'life_is_strange_2_-_episode_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Life is Strange 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/895490/Life_is_Strange_2__Episode_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4655,'star_conflict',NULL,'Star Conflict is an action-packed, massively multiplayer space simulation game that puts players in the role of elite pilots engaging in a widespread interplanetary skirmish. The whole world for PVP and PVE!','2013/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/212070/Star_Conflict/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4656,'last_call_bbs',NULL,'Boot up your Z5 Powerlance and dial into Last Call BBS, the last game from Zachtronics! The Barkeep’s loaded up his retro computer with a full set of puzzle games for you to download and play. No need to worry about copy protection, they’re all fully cracked and ready to enjoy!','2022/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1511780/Last_Call_BBS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4657,'starters_orders_7_horse_racing',NULL,'Starters Orders 7 is the latest in the acclaimed horse racing management series from Strategic Designs Ltd. New features include in-depth breeding stats and lineage, realistic dynamic commentary, newspaper style race and form cards, new racecourses, old-school style betting shop race modes and more.','2019/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/978960/Starters_Orders_7_Horse_Racing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4658,'rocksmith+',NULL,'Learn guitar and piano with an expanding library of thousands of songs!','2024/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2834910/Rocksmith/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4659,'yeah!_you_want_\"those_games,\"_right?_so_here_you_go!_now,_let\'s_see_you_clear_them!_2',NULL,'\"Those Games\" are back! Play through familiar minigames to your heart\'s content! Take on five different minigames with a total of 250 stages! Sit back and play fully, thoroughly, and enjoyably!','2024/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2744230/YEAH_YOU_WANT_THOSE_GAMES_RIGHT_SO_HERE_YOU_GO_NOW_LETS_SEE_YOU_CLEAR_THEM_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4660,'ostriv',NULL,'Ostriv is a city-building game that puts you in a role of a governor of an 18th century Ukrainian town to challenge your creative skills and management abilities.','2020/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/773790/Ostriv/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4661,'nickelodeon_all-star_brawl_2',NULL,'Nickelodeon All-Star Brawl 2 lets you duke it out with the biggest and best fighting character roster yet! Choose your favorite brawlers, master their unique move sets, and use all-new powerful Supers to land the finishing blow with friends or across a unique, roguelike player campaign!','2023/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2017080/Nickelodeon_AllStar_Brawl_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4662,'serious_sam_3:_bfe',NULL,'Serious Sam 3: BFE is a prequel to the original indie fast action FPS and Game of the Year sensation - Serious Sam: The First Encounter!','2011/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/41070/Serious_Sam_3_BFE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4663,'harvest_moon:_the_winds_of_anthos',NULL,'Explore the wide world of Anthos with the help of your wacky inventor friend Doc Jr. and many others! It’ll be up to you to revive the Harvest Goddess and the Harvest Sprites, as well as reconnect all of the villages of Anthos with each other! Farm all around Anthos using the improved Expando-Farm!','2023/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2140650/Harvest_Moon_The_Winds_of_Anthos/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4664,'stonks-9800:_stock_market_simulator',NULL,'Simulator of an 80s Japanese stock market businessman. Chill, catch a retro vibe and watch your profits grow in the text-based game STONKS-9800.','2023/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1539140/STONKS9800_Stock_Market_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4665,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_actros_tuning_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1056761/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Actros_Tuning_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4666,'konosuba_-_god\'s_blessing_on_this_wonderful_world!_love_for_these_clothes_of_desire!',NULL,'It\'s time for a Visual Novel Quest with a twist! Join Kazuma, a reincarnated adventurer, and spend turbulent days with his unfortunate party members. Prepare for waifus, dress-up and resource management and get ready for an Isekai comedy that’s out of this world!','2024/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2349140/KONOSUBA__Gods_Blessing_on_this_Wonderful_World_Love_For_These_Clothes_Of_Desire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4667,'sherlock_holmes:_crimes_and_punishments',NULL,'Become the most celebrated detective of all time: Sherlock Holmes! Use your impressive talents as a detective to solve six thrilling and varied cases: murders, missing persons, spectacular thefts and numerous investigations that sometimes lead you into the realms of the fantastic.','2014/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/241260/Sherlock_Holmes_Crimes_and_Punishments/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4668,'sticky_business:_plan_with_me',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sticky Business on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2667860/Sticky_Business_Plan_With_Me/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4669,'of_the_devil',NULL,'Immerse yourself in neon, smoke, and high-stakes legal gambles as a Defense Attorney with uniquely Killer insights in this episodic, diabolically stylish visual novel adventure game.','2025/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2739630/of_the_Devil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4670,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_krone_trailer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2018/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/933610/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Krone_Trailer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4671,'northgard_-_hafgufa,_clan_of_the_turtle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Northgard on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3352480/Northgard__Hafgufa_Clan_of_the_Turtle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4672,'killing_time:_resurrected',NULL,'Journey into a mansion on the Island of Matinicus where you\'ll arrive to find the mansion full of hellacious demonic creatures. Solve deadly puzzles, uncover the secrets behind a famous mystery and discover an ancient artifact from the Pharaoh Ramses, if you can live long enough to find it.','2024/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1733170/Killing_Time_Resurrected/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4673,'coastal_kitchen_simulator',NULL,'Cook and serve dishes as you run your own seafood restaurant! Unlock new recipes, grow your kitchen with the help of employees, and satisfy every customer’s craving. Expand your reputation, manage resources wisely, and build a seafood restaurant that becomes the talk of the town.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3444630/Coastal_Kitchen_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4674,'the_unfinished_swan',NULL,'From the creators of What Remains of Edith Finch. Enter the surreal world of The Unfinished Swan and explore a mysterious, hidden kingdom by splatting paint to reveal the world around you.','2020/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1206430/The_Unfinished_Swan/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4675,'zoo_tycoon:_ultimate_animal_collection',NULL,'The wildly popular Zoo Tycoon series gets set to crank up the excitement, challenge, and fun of building the ultimate zoo. Let your imagination run wild with Zoo Tycoon: Ultimate Animal Collection. Build, manage, and maintain your dream zoo alone or with up to four players.','2018/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/613880/Zoo_Tycoon_Ultimate_Animal_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4676,'expansion_-_europa_universalis_iv:_mandate_of_heaven',NULL,'This content requires the base game Europa Universalis IV on Steam in order to play.','2017/4/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/538020/Expansion__Europa_Universalis_IV_Mandate_of_Heaven/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4677,'drake_hollow',NULL,'Build and defend villages of vegetable folk from deadly feral beasts in the blighted world of The Hollow. Explore, gather, and fight! You can even invite your friends. Can you craft the perfect village?','2020/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/739650/Drake_Hollow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4678,'astral_ascension',NULL,'A choice-driven, space sci-fi visual novel featuring full voice-over and an intricate relationship system!','2025/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1529350/Astral_Ascension/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4679,'voidigo',NULL,'A vividly animated action roguelite focused on boss hunting. Unleash an array of diverse weapons and powerups to combat the corruption of the Void.','2023/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1304680/Voidigo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4680,'in_other_waters',NULL,'Play as an Artificial Intelligence guiding a stranded xenobiologist through a beautiful and mysterious alien ocean. A non-violent sci-fi story, enter a world of wonder, fear and vulnerability, unraveling the history and ecology of an impossible planet. What will you discover together?','2020/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/890720/In_Other_Waters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4681,'vrc_pro',NULL,'VRC Pro takes you deep into the world of cutting edge, modern RC cars. You can race up to 15 different RC cars on real existing mini race tracks all around the world; all fully customizable & tunable.','2015/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/335070/VRC_PRO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4682,'tacview_advanced',NULL,'This content requires the base application Tacview on Steam in order to run.','2011/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1177050/Tacview_Advanced/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4683,'kamaeru:_a_frog_refuge',NULL,'Foster a sanctuary for frogs and restore the biodiversity of the wetlands in Kamaeru, a cozy frog collecting game, where you take pictures of frogs, play mini-games and decorate your habitat. Hop right to it!','2024/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1978150/Kamaeru_A_Frog_Refuge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4684,'el_paso,_elsewhere',NULL,'STAKES. GUNS. SLOW-MO. Fight werewolves and vampires in a reality-shifting motel. Dive through barricades to escape the grasp of evil puppets. Destroy the villain you loved. A new, third-person love letter to classic shooters. Neo-noir never looked so good.','2023/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1546310/El_Paso_Elsewhere/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4685,'don\'t_scream',NULL,'Survive the night by finding batteries and evading hunters. But beware: any scream, gasp, or squeak into your microphone restarts the game! Time only moves when you do, so keep moving. See who in your group can stay quiet the longest! MICROPHONE REQUIRED!','2024/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2497900/DONT_SCREAM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4686,'rusted_moss',NULL,'Rusted Moss is a twin-stick shooter metroidvania where you sling around the map with your grapple, blasting your way through witches and rusted machine monstrosities alike. This wasteland once harboring mankind has since fallen, and Fae long forgotten now knock on humanity\'s door...','2023/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1772830/Rusted_Moss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4687,'warhammer:_vermintide_2_-_outcast_engineer_career',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer: Vermintide 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1443780/Warhammer_Vermintide_2__Outcast_Engineer_Career/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4688,'whispers_of_the_eyeless',NULL,'Whispers of the Eyeless is a dark fantasy strategy RPG where you build a cult and cling to your sanity. Command disciples, outwit enemies in combat, and shape the fate of Aranthor as you awaken the Dead Gods — Wrath, Desire, and Madness.','2025/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2523890/Whispers_of_the_Eyeless/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4689,'project_unknown',NULL,'An online co-op horror game featuring unique playable characters and RPG mechanics. Exorcise ghosts using your special abilities and tools while surviving the supernatural onslaught','2024/7/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2115390/Project_Unknown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4690,'vrovpilot:_titanic',NULL,'Experience the bow of the Titanic wreck as captured by Magellan at the bottom of the North Atlantic Ocean. Immerse yourself as an ROV pilot to explore the wreck and complete missions to scan key features of this sleeping spectacle.','2024/12/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3397800/vROVpilot_TITANIC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4691,'alien_market_simulator',NULL,'Run a market on your space station. Restore and upgrade the station, expand your services, and sell to a variety of alien customers. Experience the challenge of managing a business in space and growing your market','2025/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3215290/Alien_Market_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_98'),(4692,'pure_sniper',NULL,'Hunt your target & become a strong PVP sniper in this Epic 3D sniper FPS game.Pure Sniper is an exciting and realistic sniper shooting game with a massive campaign mode that can be played offline and a realtime multiplayer PvP combat mode.','2023/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1612020/Pure_Sniper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4693,'gp_bikes',NULL,'GP Bikes is a realistic motorcycle simulator, based on a scratch built physics engine that accurately simulates motorcycle dynamics and setup options.','2021/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/848050/GP_Bikes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4694,'windowkill',NULL,'Windowkill is a twin-stick shooter, but the game window itself is constantly closing in on you. Shoot the window edges to push it around your screen as you fight and dodge enemies and bosses in their own windows.','2024/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2726450/Windowkill/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4695,'haunted_house_renovator',NULL,'Become a paranormal renovator! Explore and renovate haunted locations as you deal with pesky spirits that have fun at your expense! Decide if you want to be mean or nice to banished entities, you can also adopt some! Restore old furniture and decorate the interiors as you see fit! Make a profit!','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1917850/Haunted_House_Renovator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4696,'out_of_hands',NULL,'Out of Hands is a bizarre card-based adventure game that blends video-collage graphics with gripping psychological horror. Will you seek the truth lurking in this wicked, warped world—and can you bear its weight? Misty memories threaten to tear you apart, contorting you into a being... Out of Hands.','2025/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1839810/Out_Of_Hands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4697,'red_faction_guerrilla_re-mars-tered',NULL,'Red Faction: Guerrilla re-defines the limits of destruction-based game-play with a huge open-world, fast-paced guerrilla-style combat, and true physics-based destruction.','2018/7/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/667720/Red_Faction_Guerrilla_ReMarstered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4698,'witchy_life_story',NULL,'You have two weeks to save the harvest festival! Tend your garden and collect plants for spells and rituals to help the villagers of Flora. After all, if magic isn\'t for solving everyday problems, what’s the point of a village witch anyway? A cozy story filled with chaos, friendship, and romance!','2022/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1427340/Witchy_Life_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4699,'rift_of_the_necrodancer:_hatsune_miku_-_\"m@gical☆cure!_love_♥_shot!\"',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rift of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3627150/Rift_of_the_NecroDancer_Hatsune_Miku__MGICALCURE_LOVE__SHOT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4700,'dynasty_warriors_9_empires',NULL,'A new release in the Empires series, featuring a mix of thrilling action and country capturing simulation. Experience the human drama of the Three Kingdoms in a way only Empires can provide. Fight exciting Castle Sieges and manipulate the country\'s Politics. Welcome to the Empires experience!','2021/12/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1341200/DYNASTY_WARRIORS_9_Empires/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4701,'shadowrun:_dragonfall_-_director\'s_cut',NULL,'Harebrained Schemes\' biggest Shadowrun game to date, and the definitive Shadowrun RPG experience available on PC. Now a standalone title with tons of new content & improvements!','2014/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/300550/Shadowrun_Dragonfall__Directors_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4702,'clickteam_fusion_2.5_developer_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base application Clickteam Fusion 2.5 on Steam in order to run.','2014/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/267810/Clickteam_Fusion_25_Developer_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4703,'void_crew_-_founder\'s_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Void Crew on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2445890/Void_Crew__Founders_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4704,'virtual_sailor_ng',NULL,'Virtual Sailor NG is an open world sailing simulator with accurate physics, simulating well the various boats included. The game allows the user to modify and experiment with scenery making and vehicle design by way of extreme mod ability, with a large library of existing mods and add-ons.','2022/10/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2153610/Virtual_Sailor_NG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4705,'freestyle_2:_street_basketball',NULL,'Freestyle 2: Street Basketball is a fast paced online arcade basketball game. Create your own unique player and compete in the online street league! Use variety of b-ball moves and customize your player! Team up with the best street ballers online and rise to the top!','2015/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/339610/Freestyle_2_Street_Basketball/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4706,'space_engineers_-_decorative_pack_#2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1167910/Space_Engineers__Decorative_Pack_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4707,'shinobi_warfare',NULL,'Play an 2d turn based RPG multiplayer game, stylize your own shinobi and play different game modes alone or with your friends! 