content requires the base game Anno 1800 on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1530880/Anno_1800__Season_3_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4714,'idle_clans',NULL,'Idle Clans is a multiplayer idle game that combines the classic MMORPG experience with simplified gameplay and less time commitment. Features include a player-driven economy, PvE, trading, quests, crafting and opportunities to play, socialize and collaborate with other players.','2023/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2103530/Idle_Clans/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4715,'magicka',NULL,'Magicka is a satirical action-adventure game set in a rich fantasy world based on Norse mythology. The player assumes the role of a wizard from a sacred order tasked with stopping an evil sorcerer who has thrown the world into turmoil, his foul creations besieging the forces of good.','2011/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/42910/Magicka/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4716,'warside',NULL,'Welcome to Warside, the fast-paced turn-based tactics game. With a single-player story campaign, multiplayer support, and a built-in map editor, the fight for victory never ends. Choose your Commander, assemble your forces, and battle your way to victory.','2025/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2368300/Warside/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4717,'not_tonight_2',NULL,'Immigration Enforcement Case #112: You are under arrest. Unless your friends can cross a broken America, retrieve your identifying documents and stay out of trouble... this is the end of the American dream for you.','2022/2/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1600370/Not_Tonight_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4718,'shadow_warrior_3:_definitive_edition',NULL,'Take an adrenaline-fueled journey through a mythical Japanese realm in the Definitive Edition of Shadow Warrior 3, packed with new features, and enjoy an ultraviolent blend of fast-paced gunplay, razor-sharp melee combat, and spectacular free-running movement.','2022/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1036890/Shadow_Warrior_3_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4719,'unpossess:_exorcism_simulator',NULL,'Unpossess is a 1-4 co-op exorcism simulator game set in the early 1900s. Players take on the role of exorcists responsible for addressing cases of human possession.','2025/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2976900/Unpossess_Exorcism_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4720,'total_war:_attila_-_slavic_nations_culture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ATTILA on Steam in order to play.','2016/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/428730/Total_War_ATTILA__Slavic_Nations_Culture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4721,'cube_escape:_paradox',NULL,'The tenth Cube Escape follows the story of detective Dale Vandermeer who finds himself trapped in two different universes and needs to escape. Cube Escape: Paradox will be released together with the accompanying Paradox: A Rusty Lake Film.','2018/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/909080/Cube_Escape_Paradox/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4722,'tekken_8_-_anna_williams',NULL,'This content requires the base game TEKKEN 8 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3417000/TEKKEN_8__Anna_Williams/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4723,'dawnsbury_days',NULL,'Lead a group of childhood friends through their first adventures in a turn-based tactical RPG played under the rules of PF2E, the second edition of a powerful OGL ruleset. Customize their builds, acquire loot and level up, and ultimately defeat the sinister enemies who threaten your hometown.','2024/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2693730/Dawnsbury_Days/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4724,'air',NULL,'Summer stretches on endlessly. Beneath the vast blue sky. Beneath the air in which she awaits— AIR, the second game released by visual novel studio Key, is now available on Steam! Now featuring the side story novel, \"First Sky Chapter\" and full voice support!','2025/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2983250/AIR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4725,'unsighted',NULL,'EXPLORE YOUR WAY. Awoken to a world ruined by war, Alma must traverse the vast city of Arcadia before the life force of her friends and herself withers away. Time is ticking, and every moment matters. Who will you save, and who will you leave to turn UNSIGHTED?','2021/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1062110/UNSIGHTED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4726,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_hunter_power_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2299780/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Hunter_Power_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4727,'project_winter',NULL,'In Project Winter, survival is just the beginning. Work with your friends to escape the icy wilderness, but don’t get too comfortable. Traitors lurk among you, ready to lie, sabotage, and turn even the closest of friends against each other. Who will you trust?','2019/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/774861/Project_Winter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4728,'frog_detective_1:_the_haunted_island',NULL,'You\'re a detective, and a frog, and it\'s time to solve a mystery.','2018/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/963000/Frog_Detective_1_The_Haunted_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4729,'fishing_planet:_club_enthusiast_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1804849/Fishing_Planet_Club_Enthusiast_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4730,'blade_runner:_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Armed with your investigative skills and the tools of the Blade Runner trade, you\'ll be immersed in a world that lives and breathes around you with breakthrough lighting and visual effects. Your ability to survive will be put to the test in the richest game environment ever created.','2022/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1678420/Blade_Runner_Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4731,'chaos_express:_delivery_simulator',NULL,'Deliver goods with your friends in open-world city. Manage and upgrade your delivery point, acquire new ways of delivery and become the best.','2025/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2818480/Chaos_Express_Delivery_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4732,'lingo',NULL,'Lingo is a first person word puzzle game with a large, abstract world to explore. With its epiphany-driven gameplay and impossible geometry, Lingo provides a unique and nonlinear experience.','2021/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1814170/Lingo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4733,'xcom_2:_shen\'s_last_gift',NULL,'This content requires the base game XCOM® 2 on Steam in order to play.','2016/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/433091/XCOM_2_Shens_Last_Gift/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4734,'warframe:_yareli_prime_access_-_prime_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warframe on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3678010/Warframe_Yareli_Prime_Access__Prime_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4735,'pharaoh_+_cleopatra',NULL,'Immerse yourself in Ancient Egypt from the age of the great pyramids to the final years of the New Kingdom.','1999/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/564530/Pharaoh__Cleopatra/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4736,'meme_mayhem',NULL,'Hurl emojis and battle the internet\'s biggest stars to rise as a meme master in Meme Mayhem! Collect powerful perks and relics, enjoy a darkly comic social media story, and assemble the ultimate emoji attack stack in this roguelite idle RPG.','2024/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2719030/Meme_Mayhem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_99'),(4737,'nancy_drew®:_mystery_of_the_seven_keys™',NULL,'A thrilling blend of adventure, mystery, and history! Play as Nancy Drew to uncover the truth behind the theft of a client\'s heirloom necklace. Solve challenging puzzles, uncover a sinister web of cyber crime, and sleuth through Prague\'s mysterious streets entwined with medieval legends and alchemy.','2024/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1926590/Nancy_Drew_Mystery_of_the_Seven_Keys/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4738,'idle_waters',NULL,'A relaxing idle fishing game that waits for you at the bottom of your screen. CATCH fish, BUY upgrades, COMPLETE your collection, and DISPLAY them in your aquarium.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2963540/Idle_Waters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4739,'sludge_life_2',NULL,'SLUDGE LIFE 2 is the grimiest first-person vandalism sim since the first SLUDGE LIFE—but, like, twice as dense. Explore a huger, weirder, gnarlier open world loaded with secrets, weirdos, jokes, and, of course, plenty of spots to tag.','2023/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2275150/SLUDGE_LIFE_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4740,'shadow_warrior',NULL,'Shadow Warrior is a bold reimagining of the classic 3D Realms’ shooter from independent developer Flying Wild Hog (Hard Reset) starring the legendary and quick-witted warrior Lo Wang.','2013/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/233130/Shadow_Warrior/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4741,'warhammer_40,000:_mechanicus_-_upgrade_to_omnissiah_edition',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Mechanicus on Steam in order to play.','2018/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/916250/Warhammer_40000_Mechanicus__Upgrade_to_Omnissiah_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4742,'deeeer_simulator:_your_average_everyday_deer_game',NULL,'Put simply, DEEEER Simulator is a “Slow-Life Town Destruction Game”. You can spend your days enjoying a nice, relaxed frolic here and there together with the other animals around town, or you can choose to relieve some stress and absolutely destroy the town and everything in it.','2021/11/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1018800/DEEEER_Simulator_Your_Average_Everyday_Deer_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4743,'coridden',NULL,'Become the ultimate shapeshifter in this hack n’ slash ARPG with action-based combat. Transform seamlessly and customize both your human and beast powers as you level up, find new gear and DNA-strands. Venture out solo or in co-op to uncover the secrets sealed inside a legendary city.','2025/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1656930/Coridden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4744,'warno_-_early_access_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game WARNO on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2978610/WARNO__Early_Access_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4745,'atelier_lulua_~the_scion_of_arland~',NULL,'The long awaited 4th installment of the popular \"Arland\" series that had begun with the \"Atelier Rorona\"! In this new story, players will revisit the nostalgic world of Arland and embark on exciting journey of alchemy together with Rorona\'s daughter, Lulua.','2019/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1045620/Atelier_Lulua_The_Scion_of_Arland/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4746,'xcom:_enemy_within',NULL,'This content requires the base game XCOM: Enemy Unknown on Steam in order to play.','2013/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/225340/XCOM_Enemy_Within/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4747,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_mazda_remastered_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2085260/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__Mazda_Remastered_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4748,'forza_horizon_5_jdm_jewels_car_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Forza Horizon 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3051730/Forza_Horizon_5_JDM_Jewels_Car_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4749,'sucker_for_love:_date_to_die_for',NULL,'Put the ‘love’ in \'Lovecraftian horror!\' Avoid the fanatical cultists and survive dangerous rituals to escape the Black Woods with your life in this 90’s anime inspired visual novel!','2024/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2240790/Sucker_for_Love_Date_to_Die_For/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4750,'becastled',NULL,'Becastled is about building and defending your castle from sieges in a fantasy world!','2021/2/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1330460/Becastled/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4751,'ghost_watchers',NULL,'Ghost Watchers is a co-op online horror game. You will explore and hunt ghosts in abandoned houses','2022/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1850740/Ghost_Watchers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4752,'gary_grigsby\'s_war_in_the_east_2',NULL,'War in the East 2 is the most comprehensive, most realistic, and most advanced wargame modeling Eastern Front warfare in World War Two.','2021/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1775550/Gary_Grigsbys_War_in_the_East_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4753,'rogue_tower',NULL,'Rogue Tower is a tower defense game with roguelike elements and a continuously expanding path which you can influence. Unlock, build, upgrade, expand, defend.','2022/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1843760/Rogue_Tower/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4754,'running_with_rifles',NULL,'RUNNING WITH RIFLES is a top-down tactical shooter with open world RPG elements. In RWR, you join the ranks of an army as a common soldier, just like the thousands around you.','2015/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/270150/RUNNING_WITH_RIFLES/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4755,'wrc_7_fia_world_rally_championship',NULL,'Take on all the challenges of the 2017 World Rally Championship: the official cars and drivers, 13 countries, 52 Special Stages, every surface, more powerful cars, more demanding physics, longer races, and an eSports mode to keep you on the edge of your seat all year round.','2017/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/621830/WRC_7_FIA_World_Rally_Championship/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4756,'kingdom_eighties',NULL,'Kingdom Eighties is a short story-based standalone expansion set in the Kingdom universe. A rad adventure of micro-strategy and base building in vivid ‘80s neon. Defend your town against the mysterious Greed and discover the secrets of your family lineage!','2023/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1956040/Kingdom_Eighties/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4757,'just_crow_things',NULL,'You\'re a little crow trying to prove herself to the world. Make new animal friends, poop on unsuspecting hoomans, and steal all the shiny trinkets! Each level is a little sandbox full of fun items to discover and puzzles to solve, while leaving a bit of chaos behind. Why? Just caws!','2024/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2537920/Just_Crow_Things/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4758,'project_hospital_-_traumatology_department',NULL,'This content requires the base game Project Hospital on Steam in order to play.','2020/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1423900/Project_Hospital__Traumatology_Department/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4759,'unknown_9:_awakening',NULL,'You are Haroona, a Quaestor born with the ability to venture into a mysterious dimension: the Fold. On her quest for powerful hidden knowledge, she must learn to master the powers of the Fold to fight a secret society with a hostile agenda.','2024/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1477940/Unknown_9_Awakening/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4760,'lunch_lady',NULL,'Lunch Lady is a 1-4 player online co-op survival horror game. The school final exams are coming up and the best idea you and your friends had was to steal the test answers. Find all 10 pages and don\'t get caught by the murderous Lunch Lady!','2021/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1571440/Lunch_Lady/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4761,'hitman_3_-_trinity_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game HITMAN World of Assassination on Steam in order to play.','2022/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1829596/HITMAN_3__Trinity_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4762,'golden_idol_investigations:_the_lemurian_phoenix',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Rise of the Golden Idol on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3333880/Golden_Idol_Investigations_The_Lemurian_Phoenix/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4763,'dcs:_jf-17_thunder',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1199120/DCS_JF17_Thunder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4764,'her_story',NULL,'A woman is interviewed seven times by the police. Search the video database and explore hundreds of authentic clips to discover her story in this groundbreaking and award winning narrative game.','2015/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/368370/Her_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4765,'black_book',NULL,'“Black Book” is a dark RPG Adventure, based on Slavic myths, in which you play as a young sorceress. Fight evil forces in card-based battles and explore the world, where humans live alongside mythological creatures.','2021/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1138660/Black_Book/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4766,'tom_clancy\'s_splinter_cell_conviction™',NULL,'Uniting revolutionary gameplay enhancements with a high-octane, no-holds-barred storyline, Tom Clancy’s Splinter Cell Conviction arms you to the teeth with all the high-tech weaponry and lethal skills of an elite operative','2010/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/33220/Tom_Clancys_Splinter_Cell_Conviction/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4767,'thief_simulator_-_