ighting_Fantasy_Classics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4774,'hydroponics_farm_&_store_simulator',NULL,'Transform your passion into profit with hydroponics! Design, build, and manage your own sustainable farming and business system. Experiment with different plants and fish, customize your setup, supply the market needs, and harvest your success. Dive into the future of farming today!','2025/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3152540/Hydroponics_Farm__Store_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4775,'embr',NULL,'Fight fires for fun and profit in this unpredictable and frantic multiplayer game. Team up with friends, take on daily challenges and climb to the top of the corporate firefighting ladder. More than one way to become a hero!','2021/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1062830/Embr/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4776,'pantheon:_rise_of_the_fallen',NULL,'Pantheon: Rise of the Fallen is a deeply social high fantasy MMORPG that challenges its players and rewards effort. Join the denizens of Terminus to uncover the mysteries of a world divided by Celestial loyalty… and betrayal.','2024/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3107230/Pantheon_Rise_of_the_Fallen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4777,'zero_hour',NULL,'Zero Hour is a tactical FPS with online team-based game play that takes place in a variety of fictional locations interpreted in Bangladesh with Real-life scale & resource management. It brings a grounded, close quarter combat experience to the game.','2024/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1359090/Zero_Hour/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4778,'emergency_call_112_–_the_fire_fighting_simulation_2',NULL,'Emergency Call 112 – The Fire Fighting Simulation 2 is the consequent further development of the successful first part, which lets every Firefighter Fan experience the way a professional fire brigade works.','2021/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/785770/Emergency_Call_112__The_Fire_Fighting_Simulation_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4779,'港詭實錄paranormalhk',NULL,'Paranormal HK is a first person horror game about Urban legends of Hong Kong, China. The story is about a crew of online supernatural channel“Beyond the Invisible” went to Kowloon Walled City to film a short movie for their latest episode and encountered something out of their expectations.','2020/1/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1178490/ParanormalHK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4780,'pogostuck:_rage_with_your_friends',NULL,'Climb a surreal mountain on a pogo stick and make friends along the way.','2019/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/688130/Pogostuck_Rage_With_Your_Friends/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4781,'esports_godfather',NULL,'E-sports Godfather is a Deck-building game simulating MOBA e-sports. You will play a role as team coach and build your team. You need to train players and make strategies in various game versions, beat other teams and finally, take the Champion of the World. Be nobody, or lead your team to dominate!','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1278540/Esports_Godfather/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4782,'wolfquest_anniversary_-_lost_river',NULL,'This content requires the base game WolfQuest: Anniversary Edition on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1529930/WolfQuest_Anniversary__Lost_River/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4783,'everybody\'s_gone_to_the_rapture',NULL,'Featuring a beautiful, detailed open-world and a haunting soundtrack, Everybody’s Gone to the Rapture is non-linear storytelling at its best.','2016/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/417880/Everybodys_Gone_to_the_Rapture/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_100'),(4784,'life_is_strange_2_-_episode_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game Life is Strange 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/895491/Life_is_Strange_2__Episode_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4785,'rift_of_the_necrodancer:_hatsune_miku_-_\"radiant_revival\"',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rift of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3627190/Rift_of_the_NecroDancer_Hatsune_Miku__Radiant_Revival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4786,'rift_of_the_necrodancer:_hatsune_miku_-_\"mikufiesta\"',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rift of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3627180/Rift_of_the_NecroDancer_Hatsune_Miku__MikuFiesta/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4787,'impostor_factory',NULL,'A bonkers time-loop tragicomedy murder mystery thriller featuring multiple casualties and a suspicious cat, from the creator of To the Moon & Finding Paradise.','2021/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1182620/Impostor_Factory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4788,'section_13',NULL,'Unravel a thrilling sci-fi mystery in this action-packed twin-stick roguelite shooter. Select your load-out, stack up temporary and persistent upgrades, and delve into the depths of a subterranean base, either alone or in a group of up to 3 players.','2025/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2111870/Section_13/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4789,'hero_zero_-_multiplayer_rpg',NULL,'Become a hero, build your own Hide-Out and start by saving your neighbourhood. Level up your skills, collect incredibly weird superhero gadgets, and join a superhero team to save the world!','2016/7/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/482920/Hero_Zero__Multiplayer_RPG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4790,'snowrunner_-_the_mastodon',NULL,'This content requires the base game SnowRunner on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2353720/SnowRunner__The_Mastodon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4791,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_skyscrapers',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2144481/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Skyscrapers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4792,'honey,_i_joined_a_cult',NULL,'It\'s time to start working towards that ultimate goal of enlightenment, faith and money…lots and lots of money! Become the ultimate tycoon - create, customise, and manage your own cult whilst listening to funky music. Welcome to Honey, I Joined a Cult!','2022/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/841190/Honey_I_Joined_a_Cult/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4793,'across_the_obelisk:_sigrun,_the_valkyrie',NULL,'This content requires the base game Across the Obelisk on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3185650/Across_the_Obelisk_Sigrun_the_Valkyrie/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4794,'alien_hominid_invasion',NULL,'Old friends and bitter enemies await as you invade Earth alongside a Mothership full of alien friends! Blast, beam, and bite your way through an endless swarm of enemies as you and up to three of your fellow hominids cause mayhem with a huge arsenal of weapons, mutations, and acrobatic maneuvers.','2023/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/843200/Alien_Hominid_Invasion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4795,'stronghold:_definitive_edition_-_swine\'s_bay_campaign',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stronghold: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2727990/Stronghold_Definitive_Edition__Swines_Bay_Campaign/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4796,'omsi_2_add-on_masterbus_gen_3_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game OMSI 2: Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2019/8/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1058180/OMSI_2_AddOn_Masterbus_Gen_3_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4797,'sugardew_island_-_your_cozy_farm_shop',NULL,'In this cozy farming game, you have to run your own farm shop. Take care of your animals and your farm, sell your goods to the cute Forest Folk, upgrade the island and fulfill small orders from the Harmony Tree to fill the island with life again.','2025/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2711030/Sugardew_Island__Your_cozy_farm_shop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4798,'tourist_bus_simulator',NULL,'Create your own bus empire on Fuerteventura now! Thanks to the economy system in the new Tourist Bus Simulator, you will be able to found your own bus company on the popular holiday island Fuerteventura.','2018/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/953580/Tourist_Bus_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4799,'the_7th_guest_vr',NULL,'The iconic supernatural mystery, The 7th Guest, has been brought back to life with cutting-edge VR technology, that delivers an atmospheric story like no other. Explore the foreboding mansion, solve challenging puzzles, and uncover its dark secrets.','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2456960/The_7th_Guest_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4800,'homefront®:_the_revolution',NULL,'Homefront®: The Revolution is an open-world first person shooter where you must lead the Resistance movement in guerrilla warfare against a superior military force.','2016/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/223100/Homefront_The_Revolution/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4801,'behind_the_frame:_the_finest_scenery',NULL,'Guide brush strokes and solve a variety of puzzles to help an aspiring artist complete her masterpiece amid her brusque neighbor’s gaze and his pesky cat. As her painting starts to take shape, uncover an emotional tale of chance and artistry revealed behind unrelated yet familiar moments.','2021/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1634150/Behind_the_Frame_The_Finest_Scenery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4802,'spin_rhythm_xd',NULL,'Enter the Rhythm Dimension. A homage to classic arcade rhythm games (Guitar Hero, DDR), with a modern aesthetic and soundtrack. Match colours and beats, spin, tap, flick and flow through the juiciest beats in the universe. Supports multiple control styles including MIDI DJ gear on Steam!','2023/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1058830/Spin_Rhythm_XD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4803,'catan_universe',NULL,'Trade – build – settle: Become Lord of Catan! Get to know Catan and play the starter scenario in multiplayer mode. Purchase the complete base game, expansions, card game and much more to discover the entire Universe of Catan.','2017/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/544730/Catan_Universe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4804,'rift_wizard_2',NULL,'Rift Wizard 2 is a tough as nails traditional roguelike wizard simulator. You play as an immortal amnesiac wizard who must journey through the cosmos to defeat his nemesis. Each run, you\'ll build a unique repertoire of spells, passive skills, and magical artifacts.','2025/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2058570/Rift_Wizard_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4805,'nice_day_for_fishing_-_legendary_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Nice Day for Fishing on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3473650/Nice_Day_for_Fishing__Legendary_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4806,'surviving_ceres',NULL,'Explore a handcrafted survival game with an emphasis on crafting and base building. Export manufactured goods to earn funding, manage colonists, defend against hostile aliens, and work towards terraforming Ceres from a frozen ball of ice to a tropical paradise.','2025/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2810070/Surviving_Ceres/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4807,'naheulbeuk\'s_dungeon_master',NULL,'A dungeon in danger ! Build, manage, and defend your tower in the satirical heroic fantasy universe of Dungeon of Naheulbeuk. From a shaky establishment to an infamous lair!','2023/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2005160/Naheulbeuks_Dungeon_Master/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4808,'ggst_additional_character_11_-_elphelt_valentine',NULL,'This content requires the base game GUILTY GEAR -STRIVE- on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2524040/GGST_Additional_Character_11__Elphelt_Valentine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4809,'grit_and_valor_-_1949',NULL,'A dieselpunk real-time tactics roguelite set in an alt-history World War 2. Grit and Valor – 1949 puts you in command of an elite Mech Squadron. Think fast and battle the Evil Axis forces to liberate Europe. Upgrade your Mechs and Pilots and develop new strategies to neutralise the enemy HQ!','2025/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1911860/Grit_and_Valor__1949/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4810,'naruto_shippuden:_ultimate_ninja_storm_2',NULL,'NARUTO SHIPPUDEN: Ultimate Ninja STORM 2 is a tour de force of Naruto thrills and spills. Impressively faithful to the universe of the anime, the game takes players through the Shippuden story arc. Ultimate Ninja STORM 2 has been remastered in HD.','2017/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/543870/NARUTO_SHIPPUDEN_Ultimate_Ninja_STORM_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4811,'icarus:_pet_companions_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game ICARUS on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2923820/Icarus_Pet_Companions_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4812,'need_for_speed™_heat_-_keys_to_the_map',NULL,'This content requires the base game Need for Speed™ Heat on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1281881/Need_for_Speed_Heat__Keys_to_the_Map/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4813,'quadrilateral_cowboy',NULL,'When you have a top-of-the-line hacking deck armed with a 56.6k modem and a staggering 256k RAM, it means just one thing: you answer only to the highest bidder.','2016/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/240440/Quadrilateral_Cowboy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4814,'omsi_2_add-on_masterbus_veiling_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game OMSI 2: Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1880550/OMSI_2_Addon_Masterbus_Veiling_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4815,'battlefield_4™_ultimate_shortcut_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Battlefield 4™ on Steam in order to play.','2013/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238871/Battlefield_4_Ultimate_Shortcut_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4816,'assemble_with_care',NULL,'Repair old-school objects in this cozy puzzle game. Join antique-restorer Maria, as she arrives in the sun-soaked town of Bellariva and set out on a journey of helping the townsfolk reconnect.','2020/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1202900/Assemble_with_Care/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4817,'drug_dealer_simulator',NULL,'Have you ever considered creating your own crime empire, without the legal and moral consequences? SIMULATE IT! Crawl into the dark alleys of the street business in this OG drug-dealing game, and make a fortune! A co-op sequel – DDS2 – is out NOW','2020/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/682990/Drug_Dealer_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4818,'brigador:_up-armored_edition',NULL,'Pilot a mech to hunt down and destroy the oppressive government of a cyberpunk autocracy. In this fast-paced, top-down shooter, use overwhelming firepower to destroy columns of tanks and level buildings. Unlock up to 56 unique vehicles and 40 weapons.','2016/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/274500/Brigador_UpArmored_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4819,'police_simulator:_patrol_officers:_vehicle_customization_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Police Simulator: Patrol Officers on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3597220/Police_Simulator_Patrol_Officers_Vehicle_Customization_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4820,'house_of_the_dying_sun',NULL,'House of the Dying Sun is a tactical space shooter that puts you in the cockpit of the universe\'s most terrifying starfighter. Hunt the enemies of the Empire and bring ruin to their people.','2016/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/283160/House_of_the_Dying_Sun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4821,'quake_live',NULL,'Experience the most exciting and fast-paced FPS gameplay while competing with players from around the world in over 100 arenas, a dozen game modes, and with persistent career stats tracking, in this online features-focused successor to Quake III Arena.','2010/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/282440/Quake_Live/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4822,'age_of_wonders_4:_ways_of_war',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Wonders 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2914280/Age_of_Wonders_4_Ways_of_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4823,'gal*gun_2',NULL,'Notoriously lewd first-person shooter, where you find yourself irresistible to every girl in school! Fend off their advances as you explore the school grounds. Use gadgets to expel mischievous demons and upgrade kit like the \'Demon Sweeper\' to suck the skirts clean off your suitors!','2018/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/851890/GalGun_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4824,'nidhogg',NULL,'Nidhogg is the epic award-winning game of fencing tug-of-war complete with flying giant worms.','2014/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/94400/Nidhogg/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4825,'taiwan_love_story⁵',NULL,'\"Taiwan Love Story ⁵\" is a romantic interactive novel. To write a thesis on love, you meet girls from different parts of Taiwan. As you conduct your academic research, you gradually become captivated by them, leading to a series of sweet, bittersweet, and complex romantic encounters.','2024/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2976870/Taiwan_Love_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4826,'the_last_clockwinder',NULL,'A VR puzzle-automation game. Create intricate clockwork contraptions out of your own clones and restore life to an ancient tree using automation, a collection of rare plants from across the galaxy and a team of clockwork gardeners.','2022/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1755100/The_Last_Clockwinder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4827,'life_is_strange_2_-_episode_5',NULL,'This content requires the base game Life is Strange 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/895493/Life_is_Strange_2__Episode_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4828,'wasteland_2:_director\'s_cut',NULL,'From the producer of the original Fallout comes Wasteland 2. With over 80 hours of gameplay, deck out your Ranger squad with devastating weaponry, test the limits of your strategy skills, and bring justice to the Wasteland! The choices are yours…but so are the consequences.','2014/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/240760/Wasteland_2_Directors_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4829,'dysmantle:_doomsday',NULL,'This content requires the base game DYSMANTLE on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2147250/DYSMANTLE_Doomsday/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4830,'ghostbusters:_spirits_unleashed_ecto_edition',NULL,'This is an asymmetrical game of hide and seek. In true form to IllFonic’s past titles, this title is a 4v1 setup where players will either play as part of a team of new Ghostbusters or a singular Ghost.','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2383990/Ghostbusters_Spirits_Unleashed_Ecto_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_101'),(4831,'the_black_grimoire:_cursebreaker',NULL,'A story driven solo RPG inspired by oldschool games like RuneScape and Ultima Online! Explore a sprawling medieval fantasy world full of npcs with dialogue, level skills, fight varied monsters and uncover the story of Rothar Aercrest – the cursed lord to the remote woodlands of Imberthale.','2024/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1189290/The_Black_Grimoire_Cursebreaker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4832,'book_of_yog_idle_rpg',NULL,'The Book of Yog is a 3D idle RPG game presented with a Cel-Shading art style. You can rally heroes, develop the kingdom and explore the secrets of a lost world. Dozens of heroes, hundreds of skills, thousands of loot for you to combine freely. Come to embark on a journey to build the strongest team!','2022/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1097430/Book_of_Yog_Idle_RPG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4833,'keep_me_gifted',NULL,'In Keep Me Gifted you will make your career debut as a Gift Shop owner. Be ready to encounter unhinged characters and their requests, try to match those requests with your wrapping skills, manage your item stock, upgrade your shop, and increase your store\'s popularity. And stay gifted!','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3649900/Keep_Me_Gifted/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4834,'american_truck_simulator_-_wheel_tuning_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2016/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/450550/American_Truck_Simulator__Wheel_Tuning_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4835,'malys',NULL,'Expose, endure and expel evil from innocents on your hunt through a corrupted city. As Noah, former priest turned demon-hunter, you\'ll perform exorcisms, forge precarious alliances and strengthen your deck of arcane tricks in this unholy roguelite deckbuilder.','2025/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3449690/Malys/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4836,'maneater:_truth_quest',NULL,'This content requires the base game Maneater on Steam in order to play.','2021/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1611940/Maneater_Truth_Quest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4837,'age_of_empires_iii:_definitive_edition_-_mexico_civilization',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires III: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1817370/Age_of_Empires_III_Definitive_Edition__Mexico_Civilization/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4838,'dark_and_darker_-_ea#6_seasonal_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dark and Darker on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3622300/Dark_and_Darker__EA6_Seasonal_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4839,'withering_rooms',NULL,'Withering Rooms is a challenging 2.5D horror RPG set in a procedurally generated Victorian mansion that changes each night. Explore Mostyn House to collect the perfect items for your build and face a huge cast of overgrown undead, invisible ghosts, devious witches, and more.','2024/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2006140/Withering_Rooms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4840,'car_manufacture',NULL,'Car Manufacture is an automotive tycoon game. Start in the beginning of the XX century and create thriving business. Build cars, manage people, expand your plant and research new technology. Make tons of money and stay on top.','2024/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/983380/Car_Manufacture/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4841,'against_the_storm_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Against the Storm on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2712950/Against_the_Storm__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4842,'tribal_wars',NULL,'Compete in hardcore PvP strategy in persistent game worlds where real time resource and troop management in coordination with other players is required to expand your kingdom from one village to hundreds as you conquer the map in this winner takes all medieval contest.','2020/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/675690/Tribal_Wars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4843,'ancient_cities',NULL,'Ancient Cities is a realistic, survival city builder in an immersive procedural environment. Lead the fate of your tribe through ancient times!','2023/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/667610/Ancient_Cities/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4844,'pga_tour_2k23',NULL,'Hit the links with more swagger in PGA TOUR 2K23. Now featuring playable male and female pros, including Tiger Woods, new licensed courses, more control options, an authentic PGA TOUR MyCAREER, Course Designer, and new MyPLAYER Skills and Archetypes! PGA TOUR 2K23. More Golf. More Game.','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1588010/PGA_TOUR_2K23/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4845,'necroking',NULL,'Necroking is a turn-based tactics roguelite with vast deckbuilding. You play as a Master of Necromancy. Build your skulls deck, raise skeletons and other scum to defeat settlements desecrated by life.','2024/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2852980/Necroking/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4846,'after_us',NULL,'Explore the corners of a surrealistic post-human world to give life on Earth a second chance in this touching story about sacrifice and hope.','2023/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1406810/After_Us/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4847,'haiku,_the_robot',NULL,'Delve into the depths of a mechanical world in this cute, adventure-exploration game. Explore and fight in a land full of corrupt robots and machinery. All while seeking answers to the mysteries around you.','2022/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1231880/Haiku_the_Robot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4848,'i_wani_hug_that_gator!',NULL,'I Wani Hug that Gator! Is a choice-driven narrative about teenagers struggling to find their way. Help Inco, loser highschooler extraordinaire, navigate his budding friendships (and romance!) while surviving being the only human in a dinosaur-filled school.','2024/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1895350/I_Wani_Hug_that_Gator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4849,'one_hour_one_life',NULL,'A multiplayer survival game of parenting and civilization building. Get born to another player as your mother. Live an entire life in one hour. Have babies of your own in the form of other players. Leave a legacy for the next generation as you help to rebuild civilization from scratch.','2018/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/595690/One_Hour_One_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4850,'4d_golf',NULL,'Explore higher dimensions... with golf! Conquer mind-bending challenges, design your own 4D courses, and unlock new worlds and accessories as you golf your way through the 4th dimension and beyond!','2024/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2147950/4D_Golf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4851,'railroad_corporation_2',NULL,'The 20th century heralds the new age of electrification for the railroad, and a new opportunity to make your fortune. Build your corporation carefully, as you deploy modern electric and diesel locomotives, lay new tracks, transport goods and passengers, and stay ahead of the competition.','2024/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1677970/Railroad_Corporation_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4852,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_weapon_pack_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2019/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1028270/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Weapon_Pack_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4853,'melvor_idle:_into_the_abyss',NULL,'This content requires the base game Melvor Idle on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2860590/Melvor_Idle_Into_the_Abyss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4854,'train_simulator:_west_highland_line_extension_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2014/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/277748/Train_Simulator_West_Highland_Line_Extension_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4855,'conan_exiles_-_people_of_the_dragon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Conan Exiles on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1668110/Conan_Exiles__People_of_the_Dragon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4856,'godsworn',NULL,'Godsworn is a classic mythological RTS. Experience an epic fantasy retelling of the Baltic Crusades, where pagan gods and their tribes clash against crusaders and armies of heaven. Choose a divine hero, rally worshippers alongside mythical creatures, and smite the unworthy!','2024/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1328990/Godsworn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4857,'[redacted]',NULL,'Get ready to massacre monsters, race your rivals, and combat corpses of your fellow guards as you race to escape Black Iron Prison in the critically acclaimed roguelike, [REDACTED].','2024/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2229940/REDACTED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4858,'combat_mission_fortress_italy',NULL,'Combat Mission Fortress Italy brings wargamers to the \"soft underbelly of Europe\", a place that was anything but.','2023/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2551110/Combat_Mission_Fortress_Italy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4859,'supraland_six_inches_under',NULL,'A mix between Portal, Zelda and Metroid. Exploration, puzzles, combat! A first-person-metroidvania taking place six inches under Supraland.','2022/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1522870/Supraland_Six_Inches_Under/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4860,'melvor_idle:_atlas_of_discovery',NULL,'This content requires the base game Melvor Idle on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2492940/Melvor_Idle_Atlas_of_Discovery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4861,'world_of_fate',NULL,'World of Fate is a massive strategy game where you spend your time taking over real life buildings and establishing your empire on the real life map. The game uses super advanced tech to provide real time street data and building data to create all the terrain and play space.','2022/12/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2241860/World_of_Fate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4862,'cato:_buttered_cat',NULL,'CATO = Cat + Toast = Buttered cat paradox = Anti-gravity 🍞🐈🧩 200+ puzzles，40+ skins','2024/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1999520/CATO_Buttered_Cat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4863,'endless™_dungeon_-_definitive_edition',NULL,'ENDLESS™ Dungeon is a Rogue-lite Tactical Action game, set in the award-winning ENDLESS™ Universe. Recruit a team of shipwrecked heroes, plunge into a long-abandoned space station, and protect your crystal against never-ending waves of monsters… or die trying, get reloaded, and try again.','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1485590/ENDLESS_Dungeon__Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4864,'grandia_ii_hd_remaster',NULL,'Grandia II is back and better than ever! The classic Japanese RPG returns with enhanced visuals, new difficulty level, and features both keyboard and gamepad support!','2015/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/330390/GRANDIA_II_HD_Remaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4865,'clash:_artifacts_of_chaos',NULL,'Hunted by mercenaries of an enemy with untold power, the fighter Pseudo and the creature under his protection begin a perilous quest to the edges of strange lands.','2023/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1430680/Clash_Artifacts_of_Chaos/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4866,'brokenlore:_don\'t_watch',NULL,'In BrokenLore: DON\'T WATCH, immerse yourself in the haunting world of Shinji, a young hikikomori trapped in his Tokyo apartment. As his mind unravels, confront a malevolent entity lurking in the shadows. Will you uncover the truth before it\'s too late?','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2351330/BrokenLore_DONT_WATCH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4867,'detention',NULL,'Detention is an atmospheric horror game set in 1960s Taiwan under martial law. Incorporated religious elements based in Taiwanese/Chinese culture and mythology, the game provided players with unique graphics and gaming experience.','2017/1/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/555220/Detention/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4868,'a.v.a_global',NULL,'A.V.A is a classic FPS shooter game featuring various types game Modes. Depending on the battlefield, you can choose Pointman, Rifleman, and Sniper and enjoy strategic team play.','2022/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1473480/AVA_Global/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4869,'trials®_rising',NULL,'Explore over-the-top action and physics-bending motorcycle racing in the latest opus of the Trials franchise. With new tracks in exotic places all over the world and more ways to compete, Trials® Rising is the best one yet.','2019/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/641080/Trials_Rising/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4870,'techtonica',NULL,'Techtonica is a first-person factory automation game with a gripping mystery about mining your way out from the depths of an alien planet. Explore bioluminescent caves, mold destructible terrain, construct a massive subterranean factory. Dig your way toward answers & discover the secrets of Calyx.','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1457320/Techtonica/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4871,'sensei!_i_like_you_so_much!',NULL,'Sensei! I like you so much! is a fandom business simulation game. You will play as a fanfic author, create fanfic of all genres, release your fanzine, join comicons, gather followers, and become a legend. In the meantime, buy goods of your pairing, build itabags, and decorate your room.','2024/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2957700/Sensei_I_Like_You_So_Much/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4872,'worldless',NULL,'Worldless is a stylised 2D platformer with a unique, active, turn-based combat system, and a mind-bending interpretative narrative. Players embark on a journey of self-growth and understanding, pushing the limits of their nature in a newly born and abstract universe.','2023/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1898500/Worldless/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4873,'teenage_mutant_ninja_turtles:_shredder\'s_revenge_-_dimension_shellshock',NULL,'This content requires the base game Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Shredder\'s Revenge on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2348930/Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_Shredders_Revenge__Dimension_Shellshock/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4874,'train_sim_world®_5:_bakerloo_line_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970120/Train_Sim_World_5_Bakerloo_Line_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4875,'monster_hunter_wilds_-_gesture:_sf6_hadoken',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Hunter Wilds on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3360510/Monster_Hunter_Wilds__Gesture_SF6_Hadoken/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4876,'the_chef\'s_shift',NULL,'The Chef’s Shift is a fast-paced typing game in a restaurant setting, where you’ll both cook & serve food to hungry customers, all done by TYPING.','2025/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2390230/The_Chefs_Shift/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_102'),(4877,'tick_tock:_a_tale_for_two',NULL,'You and your friend are trapped in a mystical world. As time ebbs away you must solve increasingly complex puzzles to escape. Cooperation is key as neither of you have the full picture! Play on two devices, local or remotely, all you need is a voice connection.','2019/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/790740/Tick_Tock_A_Tale_for_Two/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4878,'thief_simulator_-_shopping_center_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Thief Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2518240/Thief_Simulator__Shopping_Center_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4879,'resident_evil_village_-_extra_content_shop_all_access_voucher',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil Village on Steam in order to play.','2021/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1456361/Resident_Evil_Village__Extra_Content_Shop_All_Access_Voucher/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4880,'denizen',NULL,'Make a living for yourself in a city full of opportunity while you meet a variety of locals, explore unique locations, and work your way to the top in this open-world life simulator.','2024/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2010030/Denizen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4881,'cineris_somnia',NULL,'\"I hope that someday, you\'ll dream of me.\" -- CINERIS SOMNIA is a 3D adventure through a beautifully strange and mesmerizing world - and a young girl\'s cruel and forlorn dreams.','2018/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/752470/CINERIS_SOMNIA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4882,'slapshot:_rebound',NULL,'Slapshot: Rebound is a physics-based multiplayer game where you play an arcade style match of hockey. No shoot button, no puck glue, no RNG. It’s up to you and your team to take control of the puck, pass, shoot, outplay your opponents. Play with your friends or team up with other Slapshot players!','2024/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1173370/Slapshot_Rebound/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4883,'convrgence',NULL,'CONVRGENCE is an atmospheric VR extraction shooter set in the procedurally generated, ever-changing Chernokamensk Anomaly Zone. Scavenge loot, fight bandits and hunt for mystical artifacts — all with your loyal dog companion by your side. But extract before nightfall, or face what lurks in the dark.','2024/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2609610/CONVRGENCE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4884,'smash_legends',NULL,'Play Smash Legends for free! Smash Legends is an exciting PVP action brawler where fairy tale Legends engage in a lively battle. Play solo or in a 3v3 team battle with your friends! Play now with Smashers from all over the world on Steam, iOS, and Android!','2021/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1352080/SMASH_LEGENDS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4885,'guilty_gear_xx_accent_core_plus_r',NULL,'Ultimate battle action, and the epitome of the GUILTY GEAR XX series now on Steam! Bonus soundtracks included!','2015/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/348550/GUILTY_GEAR_XX_ACCENT_CORE_PLUS_R/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4886,'imperator:_rome_-_heirs_of_alexander_content_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Imperator: Rome on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1437660/Imperator_Rome__Heirs_of_Alexander_Content_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4887,'moonglow_bay',NULL,'Embark on a journey as a rookie angler in Moonglow Bay, fulfilling your partner\'s final wish. Team up with friends, family, and neighbours to hone your fishing skills, nourish relationships, and restore a remote town\'s fractured community in this slice-of-life fishing RPG!','2021/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1361400/Moonglow_Bay/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4888,'war_hospital',NULL,'Take charge of a WW1 field hospital on the Western Front, and make all the decisions necessary to help the soldiers recover and to support the war effort. In this narrative management game, you are the last bastion of humanity.','2024/1/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1553000/War_Hospital/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4889,'valiant_hearts:_the_great_war™_/_soldats_inconnus_:_mémoires_de_la_grande_guerre™',NULL,'Valiant Hearts : The Great War is the story of 4 crossed destinies and a broken love in a world torn apart. Dive into a 2D animated comic book adventure, mixing exploration, action and puzzles. Lost in the middle of the trenches, play as each of the 4 strangers, relive the War and help a young German soldier find his love.','2014/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/260230/Valiant_Hearts_The_Great_War__Soldats_Inconnus__Mmoires_de_la_Grande_Guerre/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4890,'squirrel_stapler',NULL,'Hunt squirrels, staple them to a corpse, and meet god.','2023/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2535830/Squirrel_Stapler/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4891,'rusted_warfare_-_rts',NULL,'{{An RTS inspired by the classics of the past!}} Making up for it\'s subpar retro graphics with fun gameplay and modern multi-threaded tech enabling huge battles to run smooth... Featuring singleplayer challenges, skirmish, sandbox, 10-player multiplayer & workshop modding.','2017/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/647960/Rusted_Warfare__RTS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4892,'lemon_cake',NULL,'Restore an abandoned bakery and prepare pastries from farm to table! Grow fresh ingredients in the greenhouse, cook pastries & sweets in the kitchen and serve your baked goods to hungry customers in your own shop!','2021/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1338330/Lemon_Cake/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4893,'injustice:_gods_among_us_ultimate_edition',NULL,'Injustice: Gods Among Us Ultimate Edition enhances the bold new franchise to the fighting game genre from NetherRealm Studios. Featuring six new playable characters, over 30 new skins, and 60 new S.T.A.R. Labs missions, this edition packs a punch.','2013/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/242700/Injustice_Gods_Among_Us_Ultimate_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4894,'we_need_to_go_deeper',NULL,'DIVE. DISCOVER. DIE. Crew a submarine with friends in We Need To Go Deeper - a 2-4-player cooperative submarine roguelike set in a Verne-inspired undersea universe.','2019/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/307110/We_Need_To_Go_Deeper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4895,'ggst_additional_character_10_-_johnny',NULL,'This content requires the base game GUILTY GEAR -STRIVE- on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2524030/GGST_Additional_Character_10__Johnny/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4896,'galactic_civilizations_iv_-_tales_of_centauron',NULL,'This content requires the base game Galactic Civilizations IV on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2671130/Galactic_Civilizations_IV__Tales_of_Centauron/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4897,'age_of_history_ii',NULL,'Age of History II is a grand strategy wargame that is simple to learn yet hard to master.Your objective is to use military tactics and cunning diplomacy to either unify the world, or conquer it.Will the world bleed out or bow before you? The choice is yours..','2018/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/603850/Age_of_History_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4898,'duck_game',NULL,'Enter the futuristic year of 1984, an age where ducks run wild in a frantic battle for glory. Blast your friends with Shotguns, Net Guns, Mind Control Rays, Saxophones, Magnet Guns, and much, much more. This is DUCK GAME. Don\'t blink.','2015/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/312530/Duck_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4899,'among_the_sleep_-_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Among the Sleep: Enhanced Edition is a new and improved version of the award winning first person horror adventure. In the game you play as a small child trapped in a weird nightmare where you go looking for your mom.','2017/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/250620/Among_the_Sleep__Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4900,'boat_crew',NULL,'Command your crew in Boat Crew, a gripping action-strategy experience amidst the Pacific War. Take charge of a PT boat against Imperial Japan, skillfully managing resources and personnel by any means necessary to ensure victory in this high-stakes conflict.','2022/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1633370/Boat_Crew/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4901,'beyond_hanwell',NULL,'Explore Westminster, London on a journey to the ruins of Hanwell. Fight with whatever you can find or use the environment to defend yourself against an ever increasing scourge of Anomalies.','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2565550/Beyond_Hanwell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4902,'duck_season',NULL,'The game of your dreams just dropped, DUCK SEASON, a hunter with ridiculous graphics. Luckily, it\'s summer vacation and Mom just surprised you with a one day rental of it! Unfortunately, as you binge play it becomes apparent that all is not right with Duck Season...','2017/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/503580/Duck_Season/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4903,'golden_treasure:_the_great_green',NULL,'Golden Treasure is a game for those who carry dragons in their hearts. Hunt, explore, survive, and become Great among the True Children of Sun and Earth.','2019/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1065100/Golden_Treasure_The_Great_Green/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4904,'underspace',NULL,'The spiritual successor to Freelancer with a Lovecraftian, sandbox RPG twist. Explore a vast handmade universe with Day 1 mod support and a planned PvP/co-op multiplayer on the Early Access roadmap. You\'re going to need a bigger ship.','2024/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1111930/Underspace/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4905,'bleak_faith:_forsaken',NULL,'Explore the last remnants of civilization in this vast, unforgiving, and interconnected world. Learn what is left of its history. Discover pockets of natural life in the perpetually expanding Omnistructure. Lose yourself in a journey unlike any other. Find your purpose in the world.','2023/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1173220/Bleak_Faith_Forsaken/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4906,'kanon',NULL,'A tale of small miracles in a snow-covered town— Kanon, the very first game from visual novel studio Key, is now available on Steam! Now featuring HD visuals and full voice support! (The protagonist is only voiced in certain scenes.)','2024/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2850310/Kanon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4907,'big_winner',NULL,'In a future where the financial system has collapsed, the lottery becomes a lifeline for survival, with luck as the only currency. As an ordinary person in this predestined world, can you leverage the \"Luck System\" with courage and wit to rise from obscurity and attain the wealth others covet?','2025/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3315330/Big_Winner/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4908,'mxgp_2021_-_the_official_motocross_videogame',NULL,'All the power of Motocross in your hands: the new MXGP 2021 is finally here! The official MXGP videogame is ready to show you what it\'s made of: warm up your engines and get ready for the most realistic, exciting two-wheeled experience ever!','2021/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1610470/MXGP_2021__The_Official_Motocross_Videogame/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4909,'the_lego®_ninjago®_movie_video_game',NULL,'Find your inner ninja with the all-new LEGO NINJAGO Movie Video Game! Play as your favorite ninjas to defend Ninjago from the evil Lord Garmadon. Master the art of Ninjagility by wall-running and high-jumping, and battle foes to rank up and upgrade the ninja\'s combat skills.','2017/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/640590/The_LEGO_NINJAGO_Movie_Video_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4910,'broken_sword_5_-_the_serpent\'s_curse',NULL,'From multi-award winning Revolution Software comes the latest explosive episode in this classic series. Playing as intrepid American George Stobbart and sassy French journalist Nico Collard, you find yourself on the trail of a stolen painting – and a murderous conspiracy...','2014/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/262940/Broken_Sword_5__the_Serpents_Curse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4911,'dust:_an_elysian_tail',NULL,'Immerse yourself in a gorgeous hand-painted world on a search for your true identity. As the mysterious warrior, Dust, your action-packed journey will take you from peaceful glades to snowy mountaintops and beyond.','2013/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/236090/Dust_An_Elysian_Tail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4912,'la_quimera',NULL,'La Quimera is a story-driven FPS set in dystopian future Latin America. In a fractured world where microstates rely on mercenary forces, you are an operative caught in a web of lies and deception. Play alone or with up to two friends geared with futuristic weapons, exoskeletons and combat abilities.','2025/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2282350/La_Quimera/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4913,'hero\'s_hour',NULL,'A fast turn-based strategy RPG with real-time combat. Develop your cities and armies, level up your heroes to gain new, powerful spells and skills, and explore the wonders and dangers of the procedurally generated maps as you aim to conquer your enemies before they do the same to you.','2022/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1656780/Heros_Hour/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4914,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_xf_tuning_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2017/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/461249/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__XF_Tuning_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4915,'rusty_lake_hotel',NULL,'Are you ready to serve the guests in the Rusty Lake Hotel? Solve all mysteries in this dark and eerie puzzle game. Rusty Lake Hotel is a point-and-click adventure by the creators of the Rusty Lake & Cube Escape series.','2016/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/435120/Rusty_Lake_Hotel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4916,'root:_the_underworld_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Root on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2253060/Root_The_Underworld_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4917,'tom_clancy’s_ghost_recon®_breakpoint_year_1_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tom Clancy\'s Ghost Recon® Breakpoint on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2231410/Tom_Clancys_Ghost_Recon_Breakpoint_Year_1_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4918,'monster_energy_supercross_25_-_the_official_video_game',NULL,'Get ready for a new beginning with the upcoming 2025 season, official riders and tracks, a renewed gameplay thanks to Unreal Engine 5, and much more!','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2581370/Monster_Energy_Supercross_25__The_Official_Video_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4919,'death\'s_gambit:_afterlife',NULL,'Death\'s Gambit: Afterlife is a challenging 2D action platformer with deep RPG elements. As an agent of Death bound to his service, unravel the mystery of Siradon and discover the true price of immortality.','2018/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/356650/Deaths_Gambit_Afterlife/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4920,'payday_2:_crude_awakening_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2353512/PAYDAY_2_Crude_Awakening_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4921,'steam_engine_simulator',NULL,'The Steam Engine Simulator shown on AngeTheGreat\'s YouTube channel.','2023/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2381620/Steam_Engine_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4922,'hell_let_loose_-_wacht_am_rhein_units',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hell Let Loose on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3312110/Hell_Let_Loose__Wacht_am_Rhein_Units/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4923,'terminal_one',NULL,'Airport building and light business tycoon game. Build up an airport providing cargo, maintenance, and passenger service. Choose which upgrades to invest in, manage policies, organize finances, optimize layouts, and balance carbon emissions.','2025/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3197060/Terminal_One/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_103'),(4924,'scars_above',NULL,'Scars Above is a challenging sci-fi third-person action adventure shooter combining the rewarding feel of overcoming difficulty with a compelling and intricate story, set in a mysterious alien world to explore.','2023/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1196090/Scars_Above/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4925,'hospital_666',NULL,'Hospital 666 is a 1-4 player horror escape game. Traverse through eerie hospital levels while observing the occurrence of anomalies and choosing the correct elevator. Some abnormal bosses will chase you to death, and you must find the right way to escape them.','2024/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2774380/Hospital_666/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4926,'changed',NULL,'You are trapped in an experiment, trying to find ways to make you still \"yourself\" , persevere, and survive.','2018/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/814540/Changed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4927,'lurkbait_twitch_fishing',NULL,'A Twitch powered interactive cozy fishing idle game. Add as an overlay for your stream and let your viewers fish with commands, points, bits or subs. Reel in the lurkers and boost viewer engagement passively with a fun interactive game that runs itself while you focus on your content.','2024/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2767520/LurkBait_Twitch_Fishing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4928,'galactic_glitch',NULL,'Galactic Glitch is a roguelike shooter, with Physics! Throw rocks, catch missiles, and rip apart your enemies - then use them as ammo! Craft your builds from a huge array of weapons and powers. Explore the far reaches of this mysterious universe, become more powerful, and uncover its secrets.','2025/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1536620/Galactic_Glitch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4929,'exo_one',NULL,'A strange signal... an alien craft... an interplanetary, gravity-defying journey through space and time.','2021/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/773370/Exo_One/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4930,'forewarned',NULL,'FOREWARNED is a 1-4 player co-op survival horror. Delve deep into ancient Egyptian ruins with your team of fellow archaeologists. Investigate phenomena, collect treasure, discover lore, survive danger, and banish the evil that lurks within.','2024/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1562420/FOREWARNED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4931,'unit_pack_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_allied_armor',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1317230/Unit_Pack__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_Allied_Armor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4932,'metal_gear_solid_v:_ground_zeroes',NULL,'World-renowned Kojima Productions brings the Metal Gear Solid franchise to Steam with METAL GEAR SOLID V: GROUND ZEROES. Play as the legendary hero Snake and infiltrate a Cuban military base to rescue the hostages. Can you make it out alive?','2014/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/311340/METAL_GEAR_SOLID_V_GROUND_ZEROES/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4933,'warhammer:_vermintide_2_-_grail_knight_career',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer: Vermintide 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1343500/Warhammer_Vermintide_2__Grail_Knight_Career/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4934,'hatsune_miku_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base application Desktop Mate on Steam in order to run.','2025/1/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3359730/Hatsune_Miku_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4935,'tram_simulator_urban_transit',NULL,'Welcome to Tram Simulator Urban Transit - get on aboard! In this game, you take on the role of a tram driver and manager. Drive 6 tram models. Transport passengers and drive them to the numerous stops. Plan your own routes, manage your timetables, and expand your tram network.','2023/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2546690/Tram_Simulator_Urban_Transit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4936,'insaniquarium_deluxe',NULL,'The craziest aquarium game ever! Tend to your fish, keep them happy and they\'ll reward you with coins and jewels. Buy tank upgrades or egg parts which hatch different in-tank pets. These pets can help you feed your fish, collect coins, or even protect against the aliens that will invade your tank.','2006/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3320/Insaniquarium_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4937,'return_to_castle_wolfenstein',NULL,'World War II rages and nations fall. The Nazis are twisting science and the occult into an army capable of annihilating the Allies once and for all. As US Army Ranger William “B.J.” Blazkowicz, pierce the black heart of the Third Reich and stop them...or die trying.','2001/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/9010/Return_to_Castle_Wolfenstein/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4938,'deep_rock_galactic_-_biohazard_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Deep Rock Galactic on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2165590/Deep_Rock_Galactic__Biohazard_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4939,'lok_digital',NULL,'Learn a cryptic language of world-changing words and master their mind-bending effects. Embark on your charming puzzle-solving journey to help the LOK creatures thrive.','2024/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2207440/LOK_Digital/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4940,'airport_ceo_-_helicopters',NULL,'This content requires the base game Airport CEO on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2555540/Airport_CEO__Helicopters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4941,'tiny_combat_arena',NULL,'Tiny Combat Arena is an approachable combat flight simulator sporting a stylized look and various game modes. Dogfight your way in the Arena and in Quick Action or craft your own scenarios and take part in a vast war with objectives and friendly armies to support.','2022/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1347550/Tiny_Combat_Arena/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4942,'monkey_island™_2_special_edition:_lechuck’s_revenge™',NULL,'Wannabe pirate Guybrush Threepwood, and the now zombie pirate LeChuck, return in what has long been considered one of the greatest LucasArts adventure games of all time.','2010/7/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/32460/Monkey_Island_2_Special_Edition_LeChucks_Revenge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4943,'caliber',NULL,'Caliber is a team-based online shooter focused on special forces units from all over the world. More than 70 operators with unique abilities and weapons as well as various game modes and maps are waiting for you.','2023/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/307950/Caliber/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4944,'enslaved™:_odyssey_to_the_west™_premium_edition',NULL,'Follow a gripping, surprise-filled journey as two dissimilar characters form an uneasy partnership in order to survive through a perilous, post-apocalyptic America. 150 years in the future, war and destruction have left the world in ruins with few humans remaining and nature having reclaimed the world.','2013/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/245280/ENSLAVED_Odyssey_to_the_West_Premium_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4945,'urge',NULL,'Fight, build, explore, survive, while the dynamic player-caused hazardous fog is slowly changing the rules of the world around you.','2021/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1304350/Urge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4946,'blood_west:_dead_man’s_promise',NULL,'This content requires the base game Blood West on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3158590/Blood_West_Dead_Mans_Promise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4947,'fable_-_the_lost_chapters',NULL,'Each person you aid, each flower you crush, and each creature you slay will change this world forever. Fable: Who will you be?','2011/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/204030/Fable__The_Lost_Chapters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4948,'il-2_sturmovik:_battle_of_moscow',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2016/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/502870/IL2_Sturmovik_Battle_of_Moscow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4949,'total_war:_attila_-_longbeards_culture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ATTILA on Steam in order to play.','2015/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/343460/Total_War_ATTILA__Longbeards_Culture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4950,'afterimage',NULL,'Afterimage is a hand-drawn 2D action adventure that emphasizes fast-paced combat with diversified character builds, non-linear levels, and a gripping story set in the ruins of a fantasy world.','2023/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1701520/Afterimage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4951,'sniper_elite:_resistance_-_vercors_vendetta_mission_and_weapons_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sniper Elite: Resistance on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2729150/Sniper_Elite_Resistance__Vercors_Vendetta_Mission_and_Weapons_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4952,'super_mini_mart',NULL,'Super Mini Mart is your 100% fresh, 100% chill round-the-corner supermarket sim. Stock, supervise, manage and get to know your colorful clientele-to-be in this sweet, stress-free management game!','2025/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1914060/Super_Mini_Mart/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4953,'marbles_on_stream',NULL,'Marbles on Stream is a Marble Racing game for EVERYONE! You can simulate races yourself or stream it on Twitch.tv with your viewers! Many features in game to help interact with your viewers and engage with them in unique ways. 3 ways to play! Download and stream! Download the MoS app on your mobile device! Get on Twitch.','2018/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1170970/Marbles_on_Stream/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4954,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_hirschfelden_veteran_cosmetic_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2198874/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Hirschfelden_Veteran_Cosmetic_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4955,'empires_of_the_undergrowth_-_exploding_ants',NULL,'This content requires the base game Empires of the Undergrowth on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3402420/Empires_of_the_Undergrowth__Exploding_Ants/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4956,'aotenjo: infinite hands',NULL,'The Mahjong Roguelike. Aotenjo: Infinite Hands is an deckbuilder where you will use Mahjong styles all over the world to beat innate threats, play different Patterns and combos, reach the \"bottom\" of Aotenjo, and discover ancient secrets....','2025/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3066570/Aotenjo_Infinite_Hands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4957,'space_trash_scavenger',NULL,'Grab your jetpack and explore procedural asteroid fields, derelict spaceships and abandoned outposts. Build and automate your Space Rig to process scavenged trash. Craft, trade and fight your way home in this interstellar, open-world survival sandbox.','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1759350/Space_Trash_Scavenger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4958,'million_monster_militia',NULL,'A roguelike autobattling deckbuilder. Draft an army of… Succubi? Tax Accountants? Whales? It’s up to you! Discover thousands of possible synergies based on what fighters you choose. Fights are snappy and turn-based. Recruit your army and let them fight for you!','2024/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2358770/Million_Monster_Militia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4959,'jurassic_world_evolution:_secrets_of_dr_wu',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution on Steam in order to play.','2018/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/953940/Jurassic_World_Evolution_Secrets_of_Dr_Wu/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4960,'field_of_glory_ii:_medieval',NULL,'Field of Glory II Medieval is a turn-based tactical game set in the High Middle Ages from 1040 AD to 1270 AD. Developed by legendary designer Richard Bodley Scott it brings the best from the tabletop world into the best digital framework.','2021/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1368870/Field_of_Glory_II_Medieval/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4961,'lego®_harry_potter:_years_5-7',NULL,'LEGO Harry Potter: Years 5-7 takes players through Harry Potter\'s heroic adventures in the Muggle and wizarding worlds.','2012/1/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/204120/LEGO_Harry_Potter_Years_57/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4962,'mind_over_magnet',NULL,'An attractive puzzle platformer where you use magnetism to escape a factory. Meet a cast of magnet characters and work together to solve logical conundrums.','2024/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2685900/Mind_Over_Magnet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4963,'ace_combat™7:_skies_unknown_-_top_gun:_maverick_aircraft_set_-',NULL,'This content requires the base game ACE COMBAT™ 7: SKIES UNKNOWN on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1966880/ACE_COMBAT7_SKIES_UNKNOWN__TOP_GUN_Maverick_Aircraft_Set/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4964,'heavy_cargo_-_the_truck_simulator',NULL,'Transport oversized cargo in a variety of missions across a 175km² open world. Drive customisable, highly detailed trucks through dynamic weather and day and night. The official cooperation with Gruber Logistics allows you to get behind the wheel of real-life heavy cargo transports.','2024/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1474930/Heavy_Cargo__The_Truck_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4965,'tyrion_cuthbert:_attorney_of_the_arcane',NULL,'In Tyrion Cuthbert: Attorney of the Arcane, you play as a defense attorney who practices law in a world of fantasy and wizards. You must defend clients accused of various crimes committed using magic and use the rules of magic to prove them innocent.','2023/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1590230/Tyrion_Cuthbert_Attorney_of_the_Arcane/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4966,'langrisser_i_&_ii',NULL,'The battle between light and chaos comes to a head in this remake of legendary Strategy RPGs Langrisser I and Langrisser II.','2020/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1060220/Langrisser_I__II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4967,'xcom®:_chimera_squad',NULL,'XCOM: Chimera Squad delivers an all-new story and turn-based tactical combat experience in the XCOM universe.','2020/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/882100/XCOM_Chimera_Squad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4968,'aokana_-_four_rhythms_across_the_blue',NULL,'In a world where flying through the sky is as simple as riding a bicycle, the sport \"Flying Circus\" is all the rage. Following the discovery of anti-gravitons, special shoes that allow an individual to fly, Anti-Graviton Shoes, took the world by storm.','2019/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1044620/Aokana__Four_Rhythms_Across_the_Blue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4969,'naruto_shippuden:_ultimate_ninja_storm_3_full_burst_hd',NULL,'Live the 4th Great Ninja War and its overpowering boss fights or defy your friends in ultra dynamic online and offline ninja confrontations!','2013/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/234670/NARUTO_SHIPPUDEN_Ultimate_Ninja_STORM_3_Full_Burst_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4970,'the_centennial_case_:_a_shijima_story',NULL,'Unravel the mysteries of death, and find the answers to life.A unique Mystery-Adventure Game:The Centennial Case: A Shijima Story','2022/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1612780/The_Centennial_Case__A_Shijima_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_104'),(4971,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_taker_of_trophies',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3204810/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Taker_of_Trophies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4972,'the_wonderful_101:_remastered',NULL,'Lead an army of 100 Wonderful Ones from around the world in this Unite Action spectacular!','2020/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1190400/The_Wonderful_101_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4973,'sky_force_reloaded',NULL,'Sky Force Reloaded is a classic shoot ‘em up experience packed in gorgeous visuals and excellent gameplay. Enjoy flashy explosions, beautiful scenery and massive bosses in single player or local cooperative modes.','2017/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/667600/Sky_Force_Reloaded/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4974,'monaco_2',NULL,'Get your crew back together for the ultimate heist experience! Return to Monaco, plan your operation, and skedaddle when things inevitably go awry in this co-op heist game. The city is yours for the taking!','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1063030/Monaco_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4975,'braid,_anniversary_edition',NULL,'Control the flow of time to solve puzzles in this new version of the indie classic, featuring fully repainted artwork, a new world of puzzles, and seriously in-depth commentary.','2024/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/499180/Braid_Anniversary_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4976,'dysmantle:_pets_&_dungeons',NULL,'This content requires the base game DYSMANTLE on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2439690/DYSMANTLE_Pets__Dungeons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4977,'rpg_maker_vx_ace',NULL,'RPG Maker VX Ace improves on every aspect of creating your very own epic adventure. An extremely powerful editor, Ace supports multiple tilesets, offers full control over autoshadow and has a very flexible features system.','2012/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/220700/RPG_Maker_VX_Ace/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4978,'yohane_the_parhelion_-_numazu_in_the_mirage_-',NULL,'Yohane the Parhelion is an official spin-off of \"Love Live! Sunshine\". 『Yohane the Parhelion - NUMAZU in the MIRAGE -』 is a deckbuilding roguelite set in that world! A mysterious mirror world that changes each time it\'s entered. After countless choices, Yohane chooses...','2024/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2459750/Yohane_the_Parhelion__NUMAZU_in_the_MIRAGE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4979,'little_nightmares_the_hideaway_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Little Nightmares on Steam in order to play.','2017/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/584096/Little_Nightmares_The_Hideaway_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4980,'full_throttle_remastered',NULL,'Originally released by LucasArts in 1995, Full Throttle is a classic graphic adventure game from industry legend Tim Schafer, telling the story of Ben Throttle; butt-kicking leader of biker gang the Polecats, who gets caught up in a tale of Motorcycles, Mayhem and Murder.','2017/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/228360/Full_Throttle_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4981,'kind_words_2_(lofi_city_pop)',NULL,'A game about being kind to real people. Send nice letters from your cozy room, go outside and say hi to your neighbors, swap recommendations, dress up for the poetry slam and add your dreams to a sky full of wishes. Join a community of real people with their hearts on their sleeves.','2024/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2118120/Kind_Words_2_lofi_city_pop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4982,'toy_shop_simulator',NULL,'Run your own toy store! Arrange shelves, set prices, process payments, and manage staff. Expand and design your shop, handle online orders, deliver with a scooter, trade rare toys, and ensure security. Create a magical shopping experience in Toy Shop Simulator!','2025/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3163790/Toy_Shop_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4983,'crusader_kings_iii_content_creator_pack:_north_african_attire',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings III on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2671030/Crusader_Kings_III_Content_Creator_Pack_North_African_Attire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4984,'door_kickers:_action_squad',NULL,'Rescue hostages, disarm bombs and save the day in this old school, side-scroller action game with retro graphics and retro sensibilities. Online and Couch Coop Included.','2018/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/686200/Door_Kickers_Action_Squad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4985,'maximum_action',NULL,'MAXIMUM Action is a brutal and satisfying physics-based first person shooter influenced by Hong Kong cinema, heroic slow motion bloodshed, and old-school FPS ACTION.','2018/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/853770/Maximum_Action/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4986,'there_is_no_light:_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Battle your way through the grim Underground world in this brutal action-adventure RPG. Exterminate hordes of enemies, fight dangerous bosses and explore the world the way you want!','2022/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1132980/There_Is_No_Light_Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4987,'islanders',NULL,'ISLANDERS is a minimalist strategy game about building cities on colorful islands.','2019/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/104603