al_orchestra',NULL,'Brutal Orchestra is a Turn-Based Roguelike Strategy Game. You died, someone killed you. You are in Purgatory and you will never escape. Make a deal with the \"demon\" Bosch and set off into Purgatory finding ​all manner of demented friends and foes on your quest to get petty revenge.','2021/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1734320/Brutal_Orchestra/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4995,'anonymous;code',NULL,'Hack Into God','2023/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2291020/ANONYMOUSCODE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4996,'project_hospital_-_department_of_infectious_diseases',NULL,'This content requires the base game Project Hospital on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1368210/Project_Hospital__Department_of_Infectious_Diseases/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4997,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_trophy_lodge_spring_creek_manor',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2019/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1052690/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Trophy_Lodge_Spring_Creek_Manor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4998,'double_dragon_gaiden:_rise_of_the_dragons',NULL,'The Double Dragon brothers return in this fresh addition to the iconic franchise. With roguelite elements, every playthrough is a chance at new action. Tag in with 2 of 4 starter characters or unlock 12 additional characters, each with their own special moves and playstyles. Online & Local Co-op.','2023/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1967260/Double_Dragon_Gaiden_Rise_Of_The_Dragons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(4999,'emily_is_away_<3',NULL,'Emily <3 is a brand new story set on an old-new social media. Customize your facenook profile, send some friend requests and determine the outcome of your senior year.','2021/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/978460/Emily_is_Away_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(5000,'the_upturned',NULL,