d','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2172900/Little_Friends_Puppy_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(5006,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_michelin_fan_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2017/1/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/388471/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Michelin_Fan_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(5007,'ghost_master:_resurrection',NULL,'Command an army of specters, unleash terror on the town of Gravenville, and solve puzzles to unlock mysteries in this strategic adventure game of resource management and supernatural mayhem.','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3289090/Ghost_Master_Resurrection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(5008,'theotown',NULL,'Build and manage your dream city in this captivating simulation game. Create unique urban landscapes and enjoy compatibility with the mobile versions. Unleash your creativity and shape the metropolis of your dreams.','2019/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1084020/TheoTown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(5009,'out_of_ore_-_mine_decoration_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Out of Ore on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2741150/Out_of_Ore__Mine_Decoration_Supporter_pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(5010,'phantom_breaker:_battle_grounds_ultimate',NULL,'\"Phantom Breaker: Battle Grounds Ultimate\" is a side-scrolling beat-\'em-up with the heart of a fighting game, showcasing nostalgic pixel art and the latest cross-platform online multiplayer. Experience the biggest and most expansive entry in the \"Phantom Breaker: Battle Grounds\" series to date!','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2067350/Phantom_Breaker_Battle_Grounds_Ultimate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(5011,'tom_clancy\'s_rainbow_six®_vegas',NULL,'Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six makes its next-generation hardware debut in the most dramatic installment of the renowned first-person shooter franchise to date. Rainbow operatives take to the chaotic streets of Las Vegas as an escalating terrorist siege in \'Sin City\' threatens to take world terrorism to new, uncontrollable heights.','2006/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/13540/Tom_Clancys_Rainbow_Six_Vegas/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(5012,'quilts_and_cats_of_calico',NULL,'Quilts and Cats of Calico is a wholesome, award-winning complex puzzle game for 1 to 4 players. Meet adorable cats and sew the coziest quilts. Compete with other players in multiplayer mode, play solo, or delve into the story of a quilter sewing their way through the city of cats.','2024/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1993180/Quilts_and_Cats_of_Calico/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(5013,'call_of_juarez:_bound_in_blood',NULL,'THE OLD WEST, 1864. In order to save their family, the McCall brothers will kill anyone who stands between them and the legendary Gold of Juarez.','2009/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/21980/Call_of_Juarez_Bound_in_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(5014,'aooni_the_horror_of_blueberry_onsen',NULL,'Challenge yourself while being chased by fear! A horror puzzle action adventure! ■A completely new version of the legendary horror game \"Ao Oni\"!','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3388870/Aooni_The_Horror_of_Blueberry_Onsen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(5015,'combat_mission_black_sea',NULL,'Combat Mission Black Sea is a military grade simulation depicting a fictional series of escalations between Russian and Ukraine which results in open conflict in the summer of 2017','2021/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1502380/Combat_Mission_Black_Sea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(5016,'parkitect_-_taste_of_adventure',NULL,'This content requires the base game Parkitect on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1129050/Parkitect__Taste_of_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_105'),(5017,'alliance_peacefighter',NULL,'A linear, story-driven space sim in the style of 90s classics like X-Wing and Wing Commander. As a newly qualified Alliance pilot, you find yourself caught up in a plot to break the fragile peace between two galactic superpowers.','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3538210/Alliance_Peacefighter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5018,'nomad_idle',NULL,'Face waves of enemies automatically and create builds by distributing stat points, leveling up equipment, choosing passive skills, summons and more. An idle game about killing hordes of enemies, becoming stronger, and exploring an unfolding storyline. A spin-off of Nomad Survival.','2025/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3042190/Nomad_Idle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5019,'prim',NULL,'PRIM is a creepy-but-cute point’n’click adventure game full of dark humor. When her mother dies, Prim finds out she’s Death’s daughter and now has to live with her father. But the Grim Reaper has strict rules and when Prim breaks them, things take a fatal turn. Can you breathe life into her misery?','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1510470/PRIM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5020,'maid_cafe_on_electric_street',NULL,'Maid Cafe on Electric Street is a leisurely maid cafe adventure set in the otaku haven of Nipponbashi, Osaka.','2024/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1789030/Maid_Cafe_on_Electric_Street/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5021,'solasta:_crown_of_the_magister_-_inner_strength',NULL,'This content requires the base game Solasta: Crown of the Magister on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2100430/Solasta_Crown_of_the_Magister__Inner_Strength/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5022,'atrio:_the_dark_wild',NULL,'Keep your disposable android-body alive by automating everything. Automate farming, foraging, crafting and capturing - and even assimilate creatures into your production lines during your impossible mission to relight the world.','2023/1/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1125390/Atrio_The_Dark_Wild/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5023,'hidden_through_time',NULL,'Embark on a colourful hand drawn journey of discovery through the ages! From missing dinosaur eggs in the stone age, to a king\'s crown in medieval times, can you find them all? Discover, create and share worlds with your own hidden treasures in Hidden Through Time!','2020/3/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/524910/Hidden_Through_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5024,'nukitashi',NULL,'Seiran Island. Even here in paradise, there are those who work in the shadows to bring it down... Confront the tyranny of a twisted system in this long-awaited visual novel adventure.','2023/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2399220/NUKITASHI/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5025,'ship_graveyard_simulator_2_-_floating_cities_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ship Graveyard Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3142330/Ship_Graveyard_Simulator_2__Floating_Cities_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5026,'tell_me_why',NULL,'Tell Me Why is the multi-award winning episodic adventure game from Dontnod Entertainment in which twins use their supernatural bond to discover the truth of their troubled past.','2020/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1180660/Tell_Me_Why/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5027,'slender_threads',NULL,'In this paranormal point-and-click adventure, a traveling salesman races to stop a string of horrific deaths in a quiet seaside town—before he’s next.','2025/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1116480/Slender_Threads/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5028,'space_engineers_-_warfare_1',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2021/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1475830/Space_Engineers__Warfare_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5029,'warhammer:_chaos_and_conquest',NULL,'MMORPG and strategy gameplay in one. Living realms of Chaos Champions battle in PVE and PVP strategic combat. Persistent army management and constant live events. Collect Warlords, manage resources, and conquer your foes.','2019/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1144170/Warhammer_Chaos_And_Conquest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5030,'shadow_man_remastered',NULL,'He is coming, stalking criminals in the spirit world and the real world. A possessed man is coming, a voodoo mask in his chest and lines of power in his back. Shadow Man is coming, trailing evil from Liveside to Deadside. To stop an apocalypse. To save your soul.','2021/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1413870/Shadow_Man_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5031,'cube_escape:_paradox_-_chapter_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cube Escape: Paradox on Steam in order to play.','2018/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/909150/Cube_Escape_Paradox__Chapter_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5032,'omsi_2_add-on_valiant_citybus_family',NULL,'This content requires the base game OMSI 2: Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3743640/OMSI_2_Addon_Valiant_Citybus_Family/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5033,'the_red_strings_club',NULL,'The Red Strings Club is a cyberpunk narrative experience about fate and happiness featuring the extensive use of pottery, bartending and impersonating people on the phone to take down a corporate conspiracy.','2018/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/589780/The_Red_Strings_Club/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5034,'keylocker_|_turn_based_cyberpunk_action',NULL,'In a silent world where music is outlawed, play as a singer to shatter the strings of fate and sing the melody of freedom in this unforgiving Turn Based Rhythm JRPG.','2024/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1325040/Keylocker__Turn_Based_Cyberpunk_Action/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5035,'resident_evil_3_-_all_in-game_rewards_unlock',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil 3 on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1348140/Resident_Evil_3__All_Ingame_Rewards_Unlock/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5036,'tin_can',NULL,'You\'ve barely managed to escape your exploding spaceship. Now in an old escape pod, you hurtle through space at the mercy of the cosmos. With no knowledge of the pod’s complex systems, your life depends on a technical manual and your own wits. How long can you survive?','2022/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1315980/Tin_Can/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5037,'frostpunk:_the_rifts',NULL,'This content requires the base game Frostpunk on Steam in order to play.','2019/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1125020/Frostpunk_The_Rifts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5038,'city_bus_manager_-_e-bus_&_green_energy',NULL,'This content requires the base game City Bus Manager on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2700180/City_Bus_Manager__EBus__Green_Energy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5039,'axon_td:_uprising_-_tower_defense',NULL,'Axon TD lets you expand the map boundaries themselves. A huge arsenal of towers and a wide variety of enemies clash in a battlefield that grows to your whims. Engage in single, cooperative, and roguelite gameplay.','2024/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2296550/Axon_TD_Uprising__Tower_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5040,'necrobarista',NULL,'In a back-alley cafe, the dead are granted one last night to mingle with the living. Necrobarista follows a dynamic and diverse cast of characters as they navigate Melbourne\'s hipstery coffee culture, the questionable ethics of necromancy, and the process of letting go.','2020/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/725270/Necrobarista/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5041,'earth_defense_force:_world_brothers_2',NULL,'The Earth is in pieces...again! We\'ve gotta do more to save the planet!','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2370170/EARTH_DEFENSE_FORCE_WORLD_BROTHERS_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5042,'tank_mechanic_simulator_-_shermans_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tank Mechanic Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1065400/Tank_Mechanic_Simulator__Shermans_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5043,'tunguska:_the_visitation_-_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Tunguska: The Visitation is a single player top-down shooter RPG. Seek fortune as a Ghoul Hunter in an abandoned Soviet Exclusion Zone. Use your grit and ingenuity to survive deadly radiation, mysterious anomalies, and poisonous mutants. Go in guns-blazing, or stay in the shadows - your choice.','2021/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1601970/Tunguska_The_Visitation__Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5044,'嗜血印_bloody_spell',NULL,'This is a martial arts action role-playing game. The core of the game is battle-oriented, and it combines many fighting elements. If you are a player who pursues blood and is brave enough to challenge the limits, it will definitely inspire your adrenaline and bring you the best combat experience.','2022/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/992300/_Bloody_Spell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5045,'invisible,_inc.',NULL,'Take control of Invisible\'s agents in the field and infiltrate the world\'s most dangerous corporations. Stealth, precision, and teamwork are essential in high-stakes, high-profit missions, where every move may cost an agent their life.','2015/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/243970/Invisible_Inc/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5046,'battlefleet_gothic:_armada',NULL,'Battlefleet Gothic: Armada is the RTS videogame adaptation of Games Workshop’s classic tabletop game, pitting the Chaos, Imperium, Eldar, and Orks against each other in visceral space-battles.','2016/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/363680/Battlefleet_Gothic_Armada/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5047,'blue_reflection:_second_light',NULL,'“As the last summer day fades, all is illuminated.” With gorgeous translucent designs by Mel Kishida, as well as a story that depicts the youth of lifelike girls, based on a theme of human identity and bonding, a new title in the BLUE REFLECTION series is here!','2021/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1423600/BLUE_REFLECTION_Second_Light/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5048,'mount_&_blade:_warband_-_napoleonic_wars',NULL,'This content requires the base game Mount & Blade: Warband on Steam in order to play.','2012/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/48705/Mount__Blade_Warband__Napoleonic_Wars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5049,'seed_of_the_dead:_sweet_home',NULL,'Slaughter the ghouls to save the girls! Build up your love nest and woo four heroines as you fight to survive a ruined zombie hellscape! A one-of-a-kind Post apocalyptic FPS dating sim game filled with intense zombie killing action and lusty romance!','2021/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1566390/Seed_of_the_Dead_Sweet_Home/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5050,'saints_row:_gat_out_of_hell',NULL,'Join Johnny Gat & Kinzie Kensington as you tear apart Hell in a quest to save the Boss’ soul. Historical icons, old friends, older enemies, a talking gun, a full length musical number & a whole lot more shenanigans await!','2015/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/301910/Saints_Row_Gat_out_of_Hell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5051,'leap_year',NULL,'Leap Year is a clumsy platformer about knowledge and discovery. Explore a compact, hand drawn world filled with hidden paths. Understand the game’s secrets to reach new areas and collect all the pages of your calendar.','2024/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2951770/Leap_Year/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5052,'while_true:_learn()',NULL,'You’re a machine learning specialist who makes neural networks but your cat seems to be better at it. Now you must solve puzzles to build a cat-to-human translation system (who knows what else this cat is capable of!). Earn a fortune, buy kickass cat outfits, learn how machine learning really works!','2019/1/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/619150/while_True_learn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5053,'fairy_tail_2',NULL,'The final battle of FAIRY TAIL is about to begin','2024/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3002850/FAIRY_TAIL_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5054,'quiplash',NULL,'For 3-8 Players and an Audience of thousands! Your phones or tablets are your controllers! The gut-busting, say-anything, no-rules party game!','2015/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/351510/Quiplash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5055,'stronghold:_warlords',NULL,'Besiege Great Khans, Imperial warlords and Shōgun commanders in Stronghold: Warlords, the latest \'castle sim\' from Firefly Studios. Command AI warlords across the battlefield as you build a castle economy and new gunpowder-fuelled siege engines!','2021/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/907650/Stronghold_Warlords/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5056,'immersion_pack_-_europa_universalis_iv:_origins',NULL,'This content requires the base game Europa Universalis IV on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1756130/Immersion_Pack__Europa_Universalis_IV_Origins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5057,'offworld_trading_company',NULL,'Mars has been colonized, and Earth\'s corporate titans fight to dominate this new market. Competition is fierce in this fast-paced economic RTS from Civilization IV Lead Designer, Soren Johnson.','2016/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/271240/Offworld_Trading_Company/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5058,'tiny_bunny',NULL,'Tiny Bunny is a non-linear horror visual novel. Those, who have heard the voice of the forest, are beyond help.','2021/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1421250/Tiny_Bunny/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5059,'gorn',NULL,'GORN is a ludicrously violent VR gladiator simulator, made by Free Lives, the developers of Broforce and Genital Jousting.','2019/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/578620/GORN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5060,'order_of_battle:_world_war_ii',NULL,'Order of Battle: World War II is a breath of fresh air for all strategy fans. It is a game that takes wargaming to a new level by upgrading every single game element and rebooting the genre for a new generation of players.','2015/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/312450/Order_of_Battle_World_War_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5061,'stronghold_legends:_steam_edition',NULL,'Catapult werewolves over castle walls, incinerate troops with dragon fire and command the Knights of the Round Table! This remaster of the mythical ‘castle sim’ features Steam multiplayer, Workshop support, new maps, achievements and DLC campaigns.','2009/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/40980/Stronghold_Legends_Steam_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5062,'train_sim_world®_5:_maintalbahn:_aschaffenburg_-_miltenberg_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970460/Train_Sim_World_5_Maintalbahn_Aschaffenburg__Miltenberg_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5063,'chicken_police_-_paint_it_red!',NULL,'A wild tale of love, death, chickens, and redemption! Chicken Police is a buddy-cop noir adventure with a carefully crafted world, a gritty story, and absurd humor. The game mixes classic adventure games with visual novel-style storytelling, presented in a beak-droppingly unique art style.','2020/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1084640/Chicken_Police__Paint_it_RED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5064,'the_sims™_3_world_adventures',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2009/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/47892/The_Sims_3_World_Adventures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_106'),(5065,'garden_galaxy',NULL,'Discover, collect and organise to create your own unique garden in this relaxing idle / creative sandbox!','2022/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1970460/Garden_Galaxy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5066,'ty_the_tasmanian_tiger_2',NULL,'STREWTH! It\'s time to go back Down Under with this fully remastered version of TY the Tasmanian Tiger 2: Bush Rescue. Rang, bite, smash and glide your way around the Australian Outback and stop the evil machinations of the diabolical BOSS CASS in this open world adventure.','2017/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/411970/TY_the_Tasmanian_Tiger_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5067,'pepper_grinder',NULL,'Pepper Grinder is an action-packed 2D adventure blending traditional platforming with an alternate drilling mode that allows you to dive in and out of the earth like a dolphin swims through water.','2024/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2076580/Pepper_Grinder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5068,'retail_company_simulator',NULL,'Run your retail company. Sign contracts with leading brands, order products, hire workers, expand your store, and never let your customers leave the store empty-handed. Play with friends or go solo, and enjoy the growth of your shop.','2024/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3089130/Retail_Company_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5069,'steel_division_2_-_men_of_steel',NULL,'This content requires the base game Steel Division 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2499890/Steel_Division_2__Men_of_Steel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5070,'stickman_trenches',NULL,'Stickman Trenches is a Real Time Strategy game in which you need to manage your men and weapons and build up your defenses in the brutal trenches of Stick World War 1.','2023/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1896390/Stickman_Trenches/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5071,'lego®_2k_drive',NULL,'Welcome to Bricklandia, home of a massive open-world LEGO® driving adventure. Race anywhere, play with anyone, build your dream rides, and defeat a cast of wild racing rivals for the coveted Sky Trophy!','2023/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1451810/LEGO_2K_Drive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5072,'slayers_x:_terminal_aftermath:_vengance_of_the_slayer',NULL,'So.... got what it takes to be a X Slayer?!?... 7 weapons, blood and gore, twisted music by Seepage & Psyko Syndikate, and maps where you can blow up everything. its awesome. started making it in 1998 in high school with my friend and now im 37, so i have life experience now.','2023/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1931020/Slayers_X_Terminal_Aftermath_Vengance_of_the_Slayer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5073,'hitman:_codename_47',NULL,'As the enigmatic Hitman, you must use stealth and tactical problem solving to enter, execute and exit your assignment with minimum attention and maximum effectiveness. For a price, you have access to the most devious devices, but how you use them will determine if you retire as a millionaire or get permanently retired.','2000/11/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6900/Hitman_Codename_47/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5074,'styx:_shards_of_darkness_-_the_akenash_set',NULL,'This content requires the base game Styx: Shards of Darkness on Steam in order to play.','2017/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/465250/Styx_Shards_of_Darkness__The_Akenash_Set/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5075,'medieval_legacy',NULL,'Start as a humble commoner and guide your family through generations in this family sim meets city builder. Climb the ranks of society to become the most influential family in the land. With wit, strategy, and a bit of luck, build your legacy - just try not to trip over your ambition!','2025/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3232580/Medieval_Legacy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5076,'let\'s_build_a_zoo:_aquarium_odyssey',NULL,'This content requires the base game Let\'s Build a Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2380280/Lets_Build_a_Zoo_Aquarium_Odyssey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5077,'trover_saves_the_universe',NULL,'From Squanch Games comes Trover Saves the Universe. Your pups are missing. The cosmos is at stake. Only you and Trover can save everything in this bizarre comedy adventure!','2019/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1051200/Trover_Saves_the_Universe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5078,'dragon_ball_z:_kakarot_-_daima_-_adventure_through_the_demon_realm_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DRAGON BALL Z: KAKAROT on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3279970/DRAGON_BALL_Z_KAKAROT__DAIMA__Adventure_Through_The_Demon_Realm_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5079,'mech_builder',NULL,'Welcome to Mech Builder- a relaxing puzzle game inspired by Model building(gunpla). You will experience the relaxing process of building a model kit with complete freedom with over 70+ puzzles.','2024/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2870420/Mech_Builder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5080,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_last_of_the_herd',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3415590/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Last_of_the_Herd/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5081,'odd_remedy',NULL,'Escape the open-world island infested with monster spiders while on duty as a prisoner with your friends. Loot the city, destroy the caves, take some selfies on the way out in your car before you set sail.','2024/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1745680/Odd_Remedy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5082,'pistol_whip',NULL,'Enter: the ultimate action hero. Pistol Whip is a physical action-rhythm game where film-inspired gunplay and blood-pumping beats collide. Blast, duck and dodge your way through fever dream Scenes, build unique rhythms in a ballet of bullets and claim glory on the leaderboards. Includes mod support!','2019/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1079800/Pistol_Whip/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5083,'curious_expedition_2',NULL,'Curious Expedition 2 is a turn-based narrative roguelike set in a reimagined version of the late 19th century that uses procedural gameplay and story elements to create completely unique and epic adventures every time you play.','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1040230/Curious_Expedition_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5084,'strange_brigade',NULL,'Embark on an exotic journey into danger in this rip-roaring 1930s third person adventure for 1-4 players! Encounter pulse-pounding action, treacherous traps and tales of derring-do!','2018/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/312670/Strange_Brigade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5085,'hellbreak',NULL,'Fight to save your soul from damnation in a brutal arena where only the strongest survive. Entertain the Lords of Hell and earn their favor to unlock new weapons, spells, and blessings. Dive into this fast-paced roguelite arena shooter and achieve the highest score. Can you reclaim your soul?','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3043760/HELLBREAK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5086,'yu-gi-oh!_legacy_of_the_duelist',NULL,'Relive past Dueling glory against Yu-Gi-Oh! characters from the past and present! Compete against other players online with your custom deck, then challenge them in Battle Pack Draft and Sealed Play!','2016/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/480650/YuGiOh_Legacy_of_the_Duelist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5087,'resident_evil_4_weapon_exclusive_upgrade_ticket_x5_(a)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2197328/Resident_Evil_4_Weapon_Exclusive_Upgrade_Ticket_x5_A/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5088,'sumerian_six',NULL,'Lead an unlikely team of commando scientists behind enemy lines to fight Nazis, uncover arcane mysteries, and wield experimental technology to turn the tide of WWII in this real-time tactical stealth adventure.','2024/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1429850/Sumerian_Six/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5089,'american_truck_simulator_-_cabin_accessories',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1477840/American_Truck_Simulator__Cabin_Accessories/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5090,'rift_of_the_necrodancer:_hololive_-_\"bibbidiba\"',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rift of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3627090/Rift_of_the_NecroDancer_hololive__BIBBIDIBA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5091,'distant_worlds_2:_factions_-_atuuk_and_wekkarus',NULL,'This content requires the base game Distant Worlds 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3350550/Distant_Worlds_2_Factions__Atuuk_and_Wekkarus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5092,'need_for_speed™_heat_-_mclaren_f1_black_market_delivery',NULL,'This content requires the base game Need for Speed™ Heat on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1281880/Need_for_Speed_Heat__McLaren_F1_Black_Market_Delivery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5093,'the_crush_house',NULL,'Film and produce 1999\'s hottest reality TV show: The Crush House! Select a crush-worthy cast, satisfy voracious audiences and keep the show on air to uncover the sinister secrets behind this darkly comic thirst-person shooter.','2024/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2337820/The_Crush_House/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5094,'motorcycle_mechanic_simulator_2021',NULL,'Become a motorbike mechanic and build your empire. Buy, repair, renovate, and create your own dreamed custom motorcycle.','2021/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1078760/Motorcycle_Mechanic_Simulator_2021/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5095,'once_human-\'double_agent\'_theme_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Once Human on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3379260/Once_HumanDouble_Agent_Theme_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5096,'i_am_legion:_stand_survivors',NULL,'Summon your stands and brawl it out! Dive into the thrill of mowing down enemies, synthesizing and upgrading, mining, forging gear, unlocking new characters and equipment. Discover unique stands combos and craft your own battle style to break through the chaos!','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3109580/I_Am_Legion_Stand_Survivors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5097,'60_seconds!',NULL,'60 Seconds! is a dark comedy atomic adventure of scavenge and survival. Collect supplies and rescue your family before the nuke hits. Stay alive in your fallout shelter. Make difficult decisions, ration food and hunt mutant cockroaches. And maybe survive. Or not.','2015/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/368360/60_Seconds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5098,'gym_simulator_24',NULL,'Gym Simulator 24: Build Your Fitness Empire! Embark on a journey to create your dream fitness haven in Gym Simulator 24, the ultimate simulation game where you\'ll ascend the ranks and craft your very own fitness empire.','2024/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2559270/Gym_Simulator_24/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5099,'a_total_war_saga:_troy_-_rhesus_&_memnon',NULL,'This content requires the base game A Total War Saga: TROY on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1553060/A_Total_War_Saga_TROY__Rhesus__Memnon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5100,'cave_story+',NULL,'Run, jump, shoot, fly and explore your way through a massive action-adventure reminiscent of classic 8- and 16-bit games.','2011/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/200900/Cave_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5101,'spellforce_3_fallen_god',NULL,'Command the Trolls and lead them on an epic journey across the wild continent of Urgath. As Chieftain of the Moonkin, a tribe driven from its home by tusk hunters and disease, their survival is in your hands.','2020/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1154040/SpellForce_3_Fallen_God/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5102,'mythforce',NULL,'MAJOR UPDATE 1.2: SKILL TREES! The wait is over—no better time to jump in than now! Pick your class & tailor your skill tree to match your ideal playstyle. Shake up the experience with Encounter System & Elemental Combos. Stronger, sleeker, and bursting with new thrills—MythForce is ready!','2023/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/363860/MythForce/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5103,'fantasy_general_ii',NULL,'The fantasy wargaming classic is back! Lead powerful heroes and mighty armies into battle in this critically acclaimed turn-based strategy milestone. Level up and train your units and guide them through a gripping story campaign to decide the fate of a world on the brink of destruction.','2019/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1025440/Fantasy_General_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5104,'simairport',NULL,'Build & Manage Your Airport. An International Hub or a Regional Masterpiece -- it\'s up to you. Buy more land to scale out, or escalators to scale up with MULTIPLE FLOORS. You\'re in full control in this modern business management tycoon!','2020/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/598330/SimAirport/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5105,'kunitsu-gami:_path_of_the_goddess',NULL,'A new tale of the Kami awaits... Kunitsu-Gami: Path of the Goddess is a unique Japanese-inspired, single player Kagura Action Strategy game.','2024/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2510710/KunitsuGami_Path_of_the_Goddess/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5106,'dead_signal',NULL,'Monitor camera feeds, report valuable info, and hand-deliver shady packages. An hourly quota of reports will test your keen eye to spot the differences, while timed deliveries will force you outside unexpectedly. Until you clock out for the night almost nowhere is safe.','2023/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2599300/Dead_Signal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5107,'the_mosquito_gang',NULL,'The year is... probably 2025. Humans created the ultimate mosquito repellent. If it launches — game over. Now the bugs bite back. Play as a bloodthirsty mosquito or the last human standing in this fast-paced, asymmetric multiplayer game. Slap, dodge, and survive!','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2811100/The_Mosquito_Gang/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5108,'trackmania_united_forever',NULL,'TrackMania is the most entertaining car racing game ever. Millions of players play it in single or multiplayer modes. TrackMania United Forever is the ultimate TrackMania edition thanks to the numerous additions and innovations it has to offer.','2008/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/7200/Trackmania_United_Forever/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5109,'tyrant\'s_realm',NULL,'Tyrant\'s Realm is a roguelite action-adventure inspired by classic PS1 visuals. Explore procedurally generated dark fantasy worlds, battling through dangers that evolve with each run. Death is not the end, as the night is still young.','2025/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2259260/Tyrants_Realm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5110,'lego®_batman™:_the_videogame',NULL,'When all the villains in Arkham Asylum team up and break loose, only the dynamic duo is bold enough to take them on to save Gotham City. The fun of LEGO, the drama of Batman and the uniqueness of the combination makes for a comical and exciting adventure in LEGO Batman: The Videogame.','2008/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/21000/LEGO_Batman_The_Videogame/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5111,'tribal_hunter',NULL,'An action platformer with size-changing mechanics. Be quick and nimble or large and in-charge!','2022/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1379870/Tribal_Hunter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5112,'lost_in_play',NULL,'Solve puzzles, riddles, and embark on an exciting journey of discovery! Join Toto and Gal as they explore dreamscapes and befriend magical creatures. Lost in their imagination, the brother and sister must stick together and solve puzzles to find their way home.','2022/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1328840/Lost_in_Play/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_107'),(5113,'deep_rock_galactic:_survivor_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Deep Rock Galactic: Survivor on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2782850/Deep_Rock_Galactic_Survivor__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5114,'destiny_2:_throne_of_atheon_emote_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Destiny 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1569630/Destiny_2_Throne_of_Atheon_Emote_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5115,'secrets_of_grindea',NULL,'Secrets of Grindea is an old-school Action RPG with co-op support for up to 4 players. Journey through fantastical lands and battle tons of different enemies and bosses in your quest for truth, friendship and, above all, finding the world’s rarest treasures!','2024/2/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/269770/Secrets_of_Grindea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5116,'deep_rock_galactic_-_rival_tech_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Deep Rock Galactic on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1797340/Deep_Rock_Galactic__Rival_Tech_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5117,'gods_vs_horrors',NULL,'A drafting roguelike focused on synergies, scaling, and positioning. Recruit Gods from different mythologies, buff and upgrade them, arrange them in perfect formation, and defend the Earth from cosmic horrors!','2025/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2994240/Gods_vs_Horrors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5118,'star_trek_timelines',NULL,'Explore the Final Frontier in the ultimate sci-fi strategy RPG, Star Trek Timelines! Join Starfleet and overcome challenges as you boldly go where no game has gone before – across the entire history of Star Trek.','2016/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/600750/Star_Trek_Timelines/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5119,'elex_ii',NULL,'In this sequel to the vintage Open World RPG ELEX, Jax must once again unite the free people of the Science-Fantasy world of Magalan against a new threat - the Skyands, who want to change the face of the planet forever.','2022/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/900040/ELEX_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5120,'disney•pixar_wall-e',NULL,'Based on the 2008 computer animated film from Pixar Animation Studios, the video game version of WALL-E involves playing as the lonely robot as he navigates a trash-tainted world and begins an unlikely trek across the cosmos.','2008/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/331750/DisneyoPixar_WALLE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5121,'humankind™_-_together_we_rule_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game HUMANKIND™ on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1833990/HUMANKIND__Together_We_Rule_Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5122,'spacebourne_2',NULL,'Embark on a journey to greatness. Get ready for adrenaline-fueled battles and a chance to claim your place in the galaxy. Grab the controls of your ship, gear up for the fight, and unleash your ambition to conquer and build a new empire in the vastness of space.','2023/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1646850/SpaceBourne_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5123,'the_sims™_4_grunge_revival_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2278350/The_Sims_4_Grunge_Revival_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5124,'bus_simulator_18',NULL,'Experience the job of a bus driver in a vast and freely drivable urban area. Drive original licensed city buses from the great brands: Mercedes-Benz, Setra, MAN, and IVECO BUS. Transport your passengers safely and punctually, either solo in single player mode, or in multiplayer mode.','2018/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/515180/Bus_Simulator_18/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5125,'the_greatest_penguin_heist_of_all_time',NULL,'The Greatest Penguin Heist of All Time is a sandboxy physics game for 1-8 players, with everything from sneaky heists to hilarous stupidity to baking pizzas. With continuous updates, plenty of maps, and hundreds of items, clothes and quests, it has something for everyone.','2021/7/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1451480/The_Greatest_Penguin_Heist_of_All_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5126,'mega_man_x_dive_offline',NULL,'Mega Man X DiVE reimagined the world of the Mega Man X series, and now it\'s getting an offline version! Strengthen your characters and weapons with a variety of powerups to make them all your own. Then test them out in the side-scrolling action of \"what-if\" worlds in Mega Man X!','2023/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2183650/MEGA_MAN_X_DiVE_Offline/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5127,'onigiri',NULL,'Onigiri is an MMO Action RPG with a fast weapon changing battle system. Join a party of other players or travel with 8 NPC companions on your journey. With simple controls, you can dive into the thrilling world of Onigiri. Switch between weapons to battle through the Youkai.','2019/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/290470/Onigiri/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5128,'turok_2:_seeds_of_evil',NULL,'Having defeated the Campaigner, Turok throws the Chronocepter into a waiting volcano to destroy it. Unfortunately the blast awakens an even deadlier force - The Primagen. Once again a Turok is tasked with restoring peace to the land and stopping the Primagen from merging Earth with the nether world.','1998/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/405830/Turok_2_Seeds_of_Evil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5129,'sherlock_holmes:_the_devil\'s_daughter',NULL,'Experience a fantastic adventure with unique gameplay that blends investigation, action and exploration in a breath-taking thriller that will test the limits of your nerves and intelligence. Play as the great detective and track down evil in the darkest corners of London and the human soul…','2016/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/350640/Sherlock_Holmes_The_Devils_Daughter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5130,'lockdown_protocol_-_tiphanie',NULL,'This content requires the base game LOCKDOWN Protocol on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3391970/LOCKDOWN_Protocol__Tiphanie/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5131,'spirit_city:_lofi_sessions_-_winter_spirit_cosmetics_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Spirit City: Lofi Sessions on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3349330/Spirit_City_Lofi_Sessions__Winter_Spirit_Cosmetics_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5132,'rift_of_the_necrodancer:_hololive_-_\"play_dice!\"',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rift of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3627110/Rift_of_the_NecroDancer_hololive__Play_Dice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5133,'as_dusk_falls',NULL,'Explore the entangled lives of two families across thirty years in an original interactive drama from INTERIOR/NIGHT. Starting in 1998 with a robbery-gone-wrong, the character\'s lives depend on the choices you make.','2022/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1341820/As_Dusk_Falls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5134,'remnant:_from_the_ashes_-_subject_2923',NULL,'This content requires the base game Remnant: From the Ashes on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1344680/Remnant_From_the_Ashes__Subject_2923/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5135,'icarus:_creature_comforts_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game ICARUS on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2790990/Icarus_Creature_Comforts_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5136,'gal*gun:_double_peace',NULL,'A rail shooter, with a difference, replacing bullets with pheromone shots, and enemies with giddy love-obsessed school girls. Every love letter and advancing kiss drains your energy! Repel them while upgrading your power ups and take part in outrageously lewd mini-games to find your true love!','2016/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/511740/GalGun_Double_Peace/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5137,'adaca',NULL,'A Sci-fi FPS set on the mysterious planet ADACA. - Use your GRAVITY-MANIPULATING arm to HURL objects at your foes or even RIP weapons directly from their hands! - EXPLORE and manipulate the environment in this EERIE and HOSTILE world!','2022/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1765780/ADACA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5138,'b-17_flying_fortress_:_the_mighty_8th_redux',NULL,'The classic game remastered. Feel the power of flying a 10-men crew on a B-17 over occupied Europe in WWII. Plan the mission, choose your men and take action in every post onboard, from pilot to bombardier and machine gunners. Get ready for a high-flying adventure in this all-time classic remake.','2024/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2000800/B17_Flying_Fortress__The_Mighty_8th_Redux/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5139,'sea_chronicles',NULL,'Sea Chronicles is a first-person comedy-adventure where you must escape a sinking ship while navigating a world filled with niche pop-culture references—mostly from SpongeBob. Experience a weird journey with unexpected twists, absurd puzzles, ridiculous deaths, and collectible bugs (insects)','2025/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2347290/Sea_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5140,'tt_isle_of_man:_ride_on_the_edge_2',NULL,'Racing across an over 60 km long ultra-technical track at breakneck speed requiring realistic riding skills... that is the challenge that awaits in TT2! Lots of new features lie ahead: open world, reworked physics, classic motorbikes, and more…','2020/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1082180/TT_Isle_of_Man_Ride_on_the_Edge_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5141,'soul_hackers_2',NULL,'Explore a supernatural RPG with stylish summoners and dark dangers lurking under the neon lights of a cyberpunk Japan. It is up to Ringo, an agent of Aion, to save the world from apocalypse.','2022/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1777620/Soul_Hackers_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5142,'art_of_rally:_australia',NULL,'This content requires the base game art of rally on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2250420/art_of_rally_australia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5143,'just_cause™_4:_digital_deluxe_content',NULL,'This content requires the base game Just Cause 4 Reloaded on Steam in order to play.','2018/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/868422/Just_Cause_4_Digital_Deluxe_Content/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5144,'anno_1701_history_edition',NULL,'Rediscover the classic gameplay of 1701 A.D. and its expansion The Sunken Dragon in Anno® 1701 History Edition.','2024/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2820140/Anno_1701_History_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5145,'eiyuden_chronicle:_rising',NULL,'Eiyuden Chronicle: Rising is an action RPG set in the same world as Eiyuden Chronicle: Hundred Heroes. Features town-upgrading mechanics, fast-paced combat. A prequel to the world of the Eiyuden Chronicle: Hundred Heroes.','2022/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1658290/Eiyuden_Chronicle_Rising/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5146,'dude,_stop',NULL,'\"So, I made a game, right? I filled it with harmless funny puzzles, narrated it a little bit, and then players started making fun of it! They broke the game, ignored my rules! They... they... laughed at me! As if it was some kind of a joke! Why do they have to be so mean?!\" - developer of Dude, Stop','2018/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/574560/Dude_Stop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5147,'warhammer:_vermintide_2_-_sister_of_the_thorn',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer: Vermintide 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1629000/Warhammer_Vermintide_2__Sister_of_the_Thorn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5148,'salt_2:_shores_of_gold',NULL,'Salt 2 is an open world pirate game focused on exploration, survival, crafting, and RPG elements. Set sail across an infinite world with just you and your ship. Explore islands filled with quests, caves, towns, pirates, and secrets. Level up skills, craft, hunt, fish, loot, and decorate your ship.','2022/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1574900/Salt_2_Shores_of_Gold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5149,'ghost_exile',NULL,'Ghost Exile - is a cooperative horror from 1 to 4 players: when hunting for ghosts, you need to determine the type of ghost, carry out a ritual of exorcism and then the ghost can no longer harm anyone. Be careful! Hasty conclusions can lead you to a sad outcome.','2022/1/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1807080/Ghost_Exile/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5150,'sayonara_wild_hearts',NULL,'Sayonara Wild Hearts is a dreamy arcade game about riding motorcycles, skateboarding, dance battling, shooting lasers, wielding swords, and breaking hearts at 200 mph.','2019/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1122720/Sayonara_Wild_Hearts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5151,'sniper_elite_5_:_concealed_target_weapon_and_skin_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sniper Elite 5 on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2053020/Sniper_Elite_5__Concealed_Target_Weapon_and_Skin_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5152,'muv-luv_alternative',NULL,'Playtime\'s over. Time for despair. Experience the definitive version of a masterpiece in the Muv-Luv trilogy\'s thrilling conclusion. Note: therapy not included.','2017/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/802890/MuvLuv_Alternative/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5153,'gold_mining_simulator_-_orange_beast',NULL,'This content requires the base game Gold Mining Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3228240/Gold_Mining_Simulator__Orange_Beast/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5154,'ova_magica',NULL,'Stardew Valley meets Pokémon! Experience a content-rich JRPG game inspired by the classics! Raise cute blob creatures, take care of your farm and make friends with the people of Clover Town.','2024/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1299170/Ova_Magica/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5155,'crime_simulator:_playgrounds',NULL,'Crime Simulator: Playgrounds is a short, chaotic, and hilarious entry in the Crime Simulator franchise. Throw hammers, spray pepper gas, and cause mayhem solo or with up to 4 players. Take over hideouts, complete absurd missions, and unleash destruction with the wildest weapons. No rules—just fun!','2024/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2928280/Crime_Simulator_Playgrounds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5156,'granny:_chapter_two',NULL,'You have to escape Granny and Grandpa...You have five days...','2019/12/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1205040/Granny_Chapter_Two/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5157,'sniper_elite_vr',NULL,'Grab your rifle, gaze down the scope and take aim in this stealth-action WW2 first-person shooter built exclusively for VR. With an explosive campaign, astonishing immersion, authentic weaponry, and signature gunplay from the award-winning Sniper Elite series','2021/7/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/752480/Sniper_Elite_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5158,'i\'m_on_observation_duty_5',NULL,'As an employee of a mysterious organization your job is to monitor live surveillance camera footage and spot anomalies using your sharp eyes and good memory. Can you survive the entire night shift or will you succumb into paranoia?','2022/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1850550/Im_on_Observation_Duty_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5159,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_shopping_malls',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2224691/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Shopping_Malls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5160,'synth_riders',NULL,'Let the music move you in Synth Riders, a dance-action VR rhythm game with custom song support and a thriving multiplayer community!','2018/7/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/885000/Synth_Riders/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_108'),(5161,'dsx_-_virtual_dualsense_emulation',NULL,'This content requires the base application DSX on Steam in order to run.','2023/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2345650/DSX__Virtual_DualSense_Emulation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5162,'prophunter',NULL,'PropHunter - a fresh representative of the genre of hide and seek on the net! The players are divided into two teams - one team is hiding by taking the form and properties of objects, the second team is seek to find for impostors among props. The team that eliminates its rivals wins!','2021/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1682050/PropHunter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5163,'guns,_gore_and_cannoli_2',NULL,'Guns, Gore & Cannoli 2 revives the good, old, action platform run & gun genre, but this time with a bunch of humor and buckets of blown off body parts. In this sequel to Guns, Gore & Cannoli, Vinnie Cannoli’s story continues and this time it’s personal.','2018/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/525510/Guns_Gore_and_Cannoli_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5164,'forts_-_high_seas',NULL,'This content requires the base game Forts on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1811550/Forts__High_Seas/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5165,'academia_:_school_simulator',NULL,'Design, build, and manage a high school with terrific teachers and fantastic facilities or simply let your students poop in the bushes? Academia : School Simulator is a management/tycoon game where you get to decide!','2017/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/672630/Academia__School_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5166,'chrono_cross:_the_radical_dreamers_edition',NULL,'CHRONO CROSS is an RPG that transcends time and space, unfolding across two interlinked parallel worlds. With over 40 party members to meet, people and dimensions will intertwine in this epic drama about the planet itself.','2022/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1133760/CHRONO_CROSS_THE_RADICAL_DREAMERS_EDITION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5167,'life_is_strange_2_-_episode_4',NULL,'This content requires the base game Life is Strange 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/895492/Life_is_Strange_2__Episode_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5168,'paw_patrol_world',NULL,'Explore the world of PAW Patrol like never before and stop Mayor Humdinger’s super blimp mayhem, in a free-roaming 3D adventure full of pup-tastic fun!','2023/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1952520/PAW_Patrol_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5169,'worms_rumble',NULL,'Worms Rumble is Worms like you’ve never played it before, with intense, real-time, arena-based 32 player cross-platform combat. Get ready for Deathmatch and Last Worm Standing modes where you’re only ever a Holy Hand Grenade away from death!','2020/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1186040/Worms_Rumble/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5170,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_specialist_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1640850/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Specialist_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5171,'tiny_garden',NULL,'Tiny Garden lets you grow a pocket-sized garden inside a magical toy passed down through generations. Nurture plants, trade them for furniture, and customize your space in this relaxing mix of farming, puzzles, and strategy. No scores or time limits — let your creativity bloom!','2025/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2812450/Tiny_Garden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5172,'anno_1800_-_sunken_treasure',NULL,'This content requires the base game Anno 1800 on Steam in order to play.','2019/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1125790/Anno_1800__Sunken_Treasure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5173,'demon_slayer_-kimetsu_no_yaiba-_sweep_the_board!',NULL,'The anime Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba makes its virtual board game debut! Enjoy events and minigames with up to four players!','2024/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2424110/Demon_Slayer_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_Sweep_the_Board/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5174,'the_walking_dead:_destinies',NULL,'Change the course of AMC’s The Walking Dead history. Fight walkers, relive iconic moments, and change the destiny of The Walking Dead Universe as your choices separate heroes from villains, and the living from the dead. Will you make the same choices as Rick, or will you forge your own path?','2023/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2192790/The_Walking_Dead_Destinies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5175,'total_war:_attila_-_viking_forefathers_culture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ATTILA on Steam in order to play.','2015/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/335020/Total_War_ATTILA__Viking_Forefathers_Culture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5176,'icbm:_escalation_-_endless_october',NULL,'This content requires the base game ICBM: Escalation on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3535540/ICBM_Escalation__Endless_October/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5177,'achilles:_legends_untold',NULL,'Rewrite fate with every strike. Face gods, mythic heroes, and legendary beasts in this souls-like Action RPG set in ancient Greece. Master brutal combat, unlock divine skills, and shape Achilles into the warrior only you can become.','2023/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1314000/Achilles_Legends_Untold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5178,'hell_let_loose_-_western_desert_campaign_units',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hell Let Loose on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3515070/Hell_Let_Loose__Western_Desert_Campaign_Units/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5179,'assassin’s_creed®_liberation_hd',NULL,'Introducing Assassin’s Creed® Liberation HD, the striking chapter of the pre-American Revolution Assassin’s Creed saga which arrives for the first time on HD consoles and PC. With improved gameplay, a deeper story, and HD graphics, Liberation is an immersive and full Assassin’s Creed experience.The year is 1765.','2014/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/260210/Assassins_Creed_Liberation_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5180,'warhammer_40,000:_space_marine_2_-_imperial_fists_champion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3274430/Warhammer_40000_Space_Marine_2__Imperial_Fists_Champion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5181,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_mississippi_acres_preserve',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1776430/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Mississippi_Acres_Preserve/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5182,'border_pioneer',NULL,'As the kingdom\'s most promising pioneer, embark on a legendary journey to tame the frontier! Build thriving towns across various landscapes, fending off waves of diverse enemies until you establish a firm foothold and have explored everything the eye can see!','2025/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2346410/Border_Pioneer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5183,'chonkers',NULL,'Chonkers is a cozy and relaxing idle game. Adopt the cutest fur balls and watch them ramp up the chonk scale as you play with them. Find them a new family. They’ll pay A LOT for your hefty chonker! Complete your collection by finding all the breeds and the rarest space cats!','2024/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3244210/Chonkers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5184,'ben_and_ed',NULL,'Ben and Ed is a 3D platformer, in which the player controls Ed the Zombie, who is forced to participate in a grotesque game show called \"Rundead\". Will he beat all obstacles Hans Showmaster confronts him with, to save his best friend Ben?','2015/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/395200/Ben_and_Ed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5185,'home_safety_hotline:_seasonal_worker',NULL,'This content requires the base game Home Safety Hotline on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2914730/Home_Safety_Hotline_Seasonal_Worker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5186,'redout:_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Redout is a tribute to the old racing monsters such as F-Zero, WipeOut, Rollcage, and POD. It is designed to be an uncompromising, fast, tough and satisfying driving experience, soaked in that vertigo that stands at the core of the arcade racing genre.','2016/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/517710/Redout_Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5187,'jupiter_hell',NULL,'True Roguelike. Turn-based shooter. Permadeath. Tribute to the sci-fi classics of the Golden VHS era. Successor to DRL. Just you and your gun against hordes of horrors and monstrosities. Give them hell to the rhythm of heavy metal.','2021/8/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/811320/Jupiter_Hell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5188,'the_sims™_4_bowling_night_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2017/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235757/The_Sims_4_Bowling_Night_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5189,'utopia_must_fall',NULL,'Defend humanity\'s last surviving metropolis from mysterious alien machinations in this challenging base-defense arcade shooter. Featuring rapid upgrade progression, procedurally generated attack waves, dark humor and laser-sharp aesthetics.','2024/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2849680/Utopia_Must_Fall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5190,'wolfpack',NULL,'A crew of players experience the tense atmosphere of a WW2 U-boat, manning the stations in this realistic co-op simulation game. Several crews may play together in a wolfpack, completing missions based on iconic events during the different stages of German U-boat warfare. Solo play included.','2019/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/490920/Wolfpack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5191,'a_castle_full_of_cats',NULL,'A Castle Full of Cats is a catvania hidden object game where you need to find all the cursed cats in the castle. Save each and every cat and unleash the power of love! ♡','2022/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2070550/A_Castle_Full_of_Cats/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5192,'gears_tactics',NULL,'Gears Tactics is the fast-paced, turn-based strategy game from one of the most-acclaimed video game franchises – Gears of War. Outnumbered and fighting for survival, recruit and command your squad to hunt down an evil mastermind who makes monsters.','2020/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1184050/Gears_Tactics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5193,'aragami',NULL,'Aragami is a third person stealth game that casts you as an undead assassin with the power to control the shadows. Teleport to any shadow, become invisible, materialize weapons or even summon a shadow dragon to infiltrate the enemy ranks and dispose of your targets.','2016/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/280160/Aragami/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5194,'prince_of_persia:_warrior_within™',NULL,'Enter the dark underworld of Prince of Persia Warrior Within, the sword-slashing sequel to the critically acclaimed Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time™. Hunted by Dahaka, an immortal incarnation of Fate seeking divine retribution, the Prince embarks upon a path of both carnage and mystery to defy his preordained death.','2004/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/13500/Prince_of_Persia_Warrior_Within/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5195,'holoidle',NULL,'A relaxing Hololive idle game. Unlock upgrades, complete your card collection and take care of your idol to increase your influence!','2025/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3543350/Holoidle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5196,'please,_don’t_touch_anything',NULL,'A brain-racking game about bathroom breaks, screwdrivers and nuclear explosions.','2015/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/354240/Please_Dont_Touch_Anything/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5197,'passpartout:_the_starving_artist',NULL,'Even you can become a great artist! Wrestle subjectivity as you attempt to sell your art to rude customers in order to progress in this confusing art scene. The only thing threatening you is your expensive wine and baguette addiction! Will your art end up in the Louvre or on your parents\' fridge?','2017/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/582550/Passpartout_The_Starving_Artist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5198,'sniper:_ghost_warrior_2',NULL,'Sniper: Ghost Warrior 2 takes the bulls-eye precision of its predecessor to new and exciting heights!','2013/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/34870/Sniper_Ghost_Warrior_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5199,'recettear:_an_item_shop\'s_tale',NULL,'Recettear is the story of an item shop, the girl who lives in it, and the fairy who turned her life upside down. Recette Lemongrass finds herself in charge of an item shop built into her house, in order to pay back a loan her father took and then skipped out on - and Tear, her newfound fairy \"companion\", won\'t take no for an answer!','2010/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/70400/Recettear_An_Item_Shops_Tale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5200,'escape_memoirs:_safe_house',NULL,'\"Escape Memoirs: Safe House\" is a co-operative reverse escape-room puzzle game. You are a member of a criminal organization who must break into one of their own safe houses to fetch some important tools. Do you think you have what it takes to overcome the puzzles that stand in your way?','2024/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2722360/Escape_Memoirs_Safe_House/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5201,'populous™:_the_beginning',NULL,'In the third part of the Populous series, you control your shaman and the tribe of her followers in a difficult quest to conquer all 25 planets of a star system and ascend to godhood.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2616430/Populous_The_Beginning/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5202,'robocop:_rogue_city_-_vanguard_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game RoboCop: Rogue City on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2436840/RoboCop_Rogue_City__Vanguard_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5203,'little_nightmares_the_depths_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Little Nightmares on Steam in order to play.','2017/7/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/584095/Little_Nightmares_The_Depths_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5204,'geometry_wars™_3:_dimensions_evolved',NULL,'Experience the full evolution of the award-winning Geometry Wars franchise and battle through waves of enemies on 3D grids in this frenetic arcade shooter!','2014/11/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/310790/Geometry_Wars_3_Dimensions_Evolved/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5205,'sword_and_fairy_7',NULL,'An action RPG based on Chinese art style, as the 7th lineal sequel of this series, it earns a lot of anicipations. Better gaming experience than any of its previous episode will be brought to all the players.','2021/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1543030/Sword_and_Fairy_7/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5206,'outpath',NULL,'An experimental clicker base building game. Craft, gather & manage resources, build your base and buy more islands to exploit and expand!','2023/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2237970/Outpath/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5207,'just_die_already',NULL,'Just Die Already is an old people mayhem sandbox game created by the designers of Goat Simulator. You are old and angry and you\'ve just been kicked out of your retirement home. How will you survive in a world that wants you to Just Die Already?','2021/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/979070/Just_Die_Already/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5208,'fort_solis',NULL,'Answer the call from a mining base on Mars as engineer Jack Leary and search for the missing crew. Fort Solis will immerse you with cinematic visuals powered by UE 5 and voice acting of Roger Clark and Troy Baker. Explore the mining complex and reach climax of this narrative thriller experience.','2023/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1931730/Fort_Solis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5209,'blasphemous_-_ost',NULL,'This is additional content for Blasphemous, but does not include the base game.','2019/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1143852/Blasphemous__OST/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_109'),(5210,'puppet_team',NULL,'Try to control one person with 2 people! Take the reins with your friends as you try to complete challenging and hilarious missions in this fun cooperative game of teamwork, chaos and comedy!','2025/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3030360/Puppet_Team/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5211,'virtual_pool_4',NULL,'Play 8-Ball, 9-Ball, Snooker, Billiards, Pub Pool, 27 games total! “So realistic it will make your real life pool game better!”Two career play modes, trick shots, video tutorials, multi-player online. Virtual Pool 4 is the most comprehensive cue sport game ever!','2015/5/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/336150/Virtual_Pool_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5212,'stella_of_the_end',NULL,'Jude Gray, a wandering Courier, receives a request to deliver some very special cargo. This cargo turns out to be Philia, an android girl who is unaffected by the enigmatic Singularity Machines.','2023/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2510770/Stella_of_The_End/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5213,'goat_simulator_3_-_super_duper_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Goat Simulator 3 on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3299590/Goat_Simulator_3__Super_Duper_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5214,'contractors_showdown_:_exfilzone_-_johnny\'s_secret_stash',NULL,'This content requires the base game Contractors Showdown : ExfilZone on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3682240/Contractors_Showdown__ExfilZone__Johnnys_secret_stash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5215,'warframe:_gunblade_battlekit',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warframe on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3658020/Warframe_Gunblade_Battlekit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5216,'timespinner',NULL,'Travel back in time to change fate itself, in this beautifully crafted story-driven adventure, inspired by classic 90s action-platformers. Join timekeeper Lunais on her quest for revenge against the empire that killed her family, using time-bending powers to explore a vast, connected world.','2018/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/368620/Timespinner/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5217,'islets',NULL,'Take to the sky and reunite a fragmented world in this surprisingly wholesome metroidvania! Help Iko adventure across beautiful hand-painted islands, receive letters from a quirky cast of characters, and face powerful monstrous adversaries.','2022/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1669420/Islets/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5218,'screeps:_world',NULL,'Screeps: World is an open source MMO RTS sandbox game for programming enthusiasts, wherein the core mechanic is programming your units AI. You control your colony by writing JavaScript which operates 24/7 in the single persistent open world filled by other players on par with you.','2016/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/464350/Screeps_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5219,'granny_simulator',NULL,'In Granny Simulator there are two players, a feeble old grandmother and her lovely grandson. The grandmothers objective is to complete her every day routine while the grandson utilizes uncanny violence and pure brutality to stop her.','2019/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1053680/Granny_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5220,'il-2_sturmovik:_c-47a_skytrain_collector_plane',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2220832/IL2_Sturmovik_C47A_Skytrain_Collector_Plane/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5221,'crystal_project',NULL,'Crystal Project is a non-linear JRPG where you are the maker of your own adventure. Explore the world while you find Crystals, unlock classes, learn abilities, and create a strategy capable of taking down the world\'s toughest bosses. Or just stick to exploring; it\'s up to you.','2022/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1637730/Crystal_Project/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5222,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_industrial_evolution',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2313322/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Industrial_Evolution/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5223,'il-2_sturmovik:_tank_crew_-_clash_at_prokhorovka',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1467120/IL2_Sturmovik_Tank_Crew__Clash_at_Prokhorovka/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5224,'this_is_the_police',NULL,'This Is the Police is a strategy/adventure game set in a city spiraling the drain. Taking the role of gritty Police Chief Jack Boyd, you\'ll dive into a deep story of crime and intrigue. Will Jack reach his retirement with a nice stack of bills, or will he end up broken ... or worse?','2016/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/443810/This_Is_the_Police/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5225,'aew:_fight_forever',NULL,'Developed by YUKE’S, AEW: Fight Forever combines nostalgic arcade-wrestling with All Elite Wrestling finishers and moves. Featuring a big roster of AEW talent, multiple match types, robust career mode, tons of customization options, more than 40 weapons, and so much more!','2023/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1913210/AEW_Fight_Forever/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5226,'ikaruga',NULL,'Shoot! Dodge! and... Get Hit!? \"Ikaruga\" is a vertical shoot \'em up that features an unique polarity-switching gameplay. Switch the ship\'s polarity and \"get hit and absorb\" enemy bullets! Achieve High Score with the chain bonus!','2014/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/253750/Ikaruga/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5227,'the_bookwalker:_thief_of_tales',NULL,'The Bookwalker is a narrative adventure in which you play as Etienne Quist, a writer-turned-thief with the ability to dive into books. Use your powers to journey between reality and book worlds, and steal legendary items like Thor\'s Hammer and Excalibur to restore your ability to write.','2023/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1432100/The_Bookwalker_Thief_of_Tales/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5228,'remnant:_from_the_ashes_-_swamps_of_corsus',NULL,'This content requires the base game Remnant: From the Ashes on Steam in order to play.','2020/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1245150/Remnant_From_the_Ashes__Swamps_of_Corsus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5229,'zone_of_the_enders_the_2nd_runner_:_m∀rs_/_アヌビス_ゾーン・オブ・エンダーズ_:_マーズ',NULL,'ZONE OF THE ENDERS THE 2nd RUNNER - M∀RS Remastered in 4K and full VR. Enter Orbital Frame JEHUTY\'s cockpit and fly through Martian skies!','2018/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/650510/ZONE_OF_THE_ENDERS_THE_2nd_RUNNER__MRS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5230,'world_of_final_fantasy®_maxima_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game WORLD OF FINAL FANTASY® on Steam in order to play.','2018/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/896680/WORLD_OF_FINAL_FANTASY_MAXIMA_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5231,'mega_man_11',NULL,'Mega Man is back! The newest entry in this iconic series blends classic, challenging 2D platforming action with a fresh new visual style. The new Double Gear system boosts Mega Man\'s speed and power for a new twist to the satisfying gameplay the series is known for.','2018/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/742300/Mega_Man_11/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5232,'espresso_tycoon',NULL,'Espresso Tycoon - a coffee shop simulator. Create your brand, decorate the coffee shop, manage your employees, and take care of your customers. Use the 3D coffee editor to create coffee recipes, order supplies, and collect rating points. Build the whole coffee business and complete all the missions!','2023/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1543280/Espresso_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5233,'the_sims™_4_blooming_rooms_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1621474/The_Sims_4_Blooming_Rooms_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5234,'omsi_2_add-on_studio_polygon_400_mmc_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game OMSI 2: Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2020/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1232070/OMSI_2_AddOn_Studio_Polygon_400_MMC_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5235,'scum_male_hair_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SCUM on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2651740/SCUM_Male_Hair_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5236,'tiny_town_vr',NULL,'Create an original world and fill it with buildings, roads, vehicles and more. Give it life with posable characters. Tell a story with custom speech bubbles and in-game photo captures. Then, share with friends!','2017/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/653930/Tiny_Town_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5237,'dcs:_black_shark_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2214600/DCS_Black_Shark_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5238,'midnight_murder_club',NULL,'A heart-pounding and hilarious horror party game set in a pitch-black mansion. Armed with a flashlight, a revolver, and proximity chat, you and up to five friends sneak, shout, and stumble your way through tense shootouts, chaotic traps, and total darkness.','2025/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2698870/Midnight_Murder_Club/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5239,'snø:_ultimate_freeriding',NULL,'SNØ is a minimalistic freeriding game. Push your limits for the high score, or simply explore the raw, endless wilderness.','2025/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2943150/SN_Ultimate_Freeriding/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5240,'timelie',NULL,'Timelie is a stealth puzzle adventure, where you control time like a media player. Perceive future events to plan your escape strategy from the past, sneak an enemy, and manipulate time through this companionship journey of a mysterious cat and a little girl with a precognitive power.','2020/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1150950/Timelie/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5241,'steam_engine_simulator_-_power_generation',NULL,'This content requires the base game Steam Engine Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2601380/Steam_Engine_Simulator__Power_Generation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5242,'the_last_hero_of_nostalgaia',NULL,'The Last Hero of Nostalgaia is a satirical action-adventure, brought to life by a twisted and wicked tale. Featuring hard but fair combat, *full character customization, unique battle armor and engaging narrative mechanics rich in lore, Nostalgaia plunges you into almost certain death at every turn.','2022/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1766100/The_Last_Hero_of_Nostalgaia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5243,'grim_dawn_-_steam_loyalist_items_pack_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game Grim Dawn on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2701090/Grim_Dawn__Steam_Loyalist_Items_Pack_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5244,'hellsweeper_vr',NULL,'DARE TO DESCEND INTO HELL? Hellsweeper VR is an intense first-person action-combat VR experience. Traverse the underworld where every step brings a challenge or a chance. Gain mastery of your weapons and elemental magic, or fall to the unrelenting onslaught of hell\'s twisted souls.','2023/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1341490/Hellsweeper_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5245,'space_engineers_-_style_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1084680/Space_Engineers__Style_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5246,'endorphin_vice',NULL,'Endorphin Vice is a physics-based sandbox game for exploring realistic gore and wound reactions. Customize your environment with tactically designed objects and gear. Play as a vigilante, using military tactics and tools to create and test various scenarios and effects.','2022/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1861610/Endorphin_Vice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5247,'butcher\'s_creek',NULL,'A first person melee horror game where you use rusty tools to brutalize a gang of serial torturers in the remote Appalachian Forest.','2025/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2512560/Butchers_Creek/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5248,'senran_kagura_estival_versus',NULL,'Thrust into a parallel dimension, our buxom shinobi prepare for a new kind of beach-side battle. Can the islands’ hosts be trusted? Will the other schools play fair? Will there be time to enjoy the beach before the fighting starts? Will anyone manage to keep their clothes intact?','2017/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/502800/SENRAN_KAGURA_ESTIVAL_VERSUS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5249,'call_of_juarez',NULL,'Call of Juarez is an epic adventure western themed FPS game. The player alternately assumes the roles of two distinct, antagonistic characters: a sneaking fugitive Billy and his hunter the reverend Ray.','2007/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3020/Call_of_Juarez/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5250,'are_you_smarter_than_a_5th_grader',NULL,'Based on the popular TV franchise, this charming couch co-op quiz game for 1-8 players will have you face more than 6800 fully English-voiced questions. Prove how much you still know from school and that you are, in fact, smarter than a 5th grader.','2022/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1521160/Are_You_Smarter_Than_A_5th_Grader/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5251,'counterside',NULL,'Everything has another side Urban Graphic Novel RPG \"CounterSide\" A world where conflict never ends between Counters and Corrupted Objects after the Administration Failure We invite you to a journey to save the Reality.','2022/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1976440/CounterSide/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5252,'king\'s_orders',NULL,'King\'s Orders is a simplified historical strategy game with an important innovation. You command your armies by sending letters with orders. Messengers with these letters travel the land and can be lost or intercepted. Generals execute orders upon receipt and send you reports the same dangerous way.','2024/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1369690/Kings_Orders/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5253,'tom_clancy\'s_ghost_recon:_future_soldier™',NULL,'In Ghost Recon Future Soldier join an elite team of highly trained, cut-throat special-ops soldiers. Armed to the teeth with unrivalled combat technology, Ghost Recon takes you to the globe’s most deadly warzones to hunt down the highest value targets.','2012/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/212630/Tom_Clancys_Ghost_Recon_Future_Soldier/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5254,'prison_architect_-_psych_ward:_warden\'s_edition',NULL,'This content requires the base game Prison Architect on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1143650/Prison_Architect__Psych_Ward_Wardens_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_110'),(5255,'towerfall_ascension',NULL,'TowerFall Ascension is the definitive version of the hit archery combat game. Inspired by classics from the golden age of couch multiplayer, it\'s a 4-player local party game centering around hilarious, intense versus matches. The core mechanics are simple and accessible, but hard to master and combat is fierce.','2014/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/251470/TowerFall_Ascension/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5256,'inayah_-_life_after_gods',NULL,'A hand-drawn 2D metroidvania in a post-apocalyptic world. Forge your destiny in a non-linear story with multiple endings. Explore diverse biomes, conquer 20+ unique bosses, and master a magical Gauntlet with ever-evolving powers.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3199390/INAYAH__Life_after_Gods/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5257,'heave_ho',NULL,'Heave Ho is a riotous multiplayer party game for up to four players in couch co-op and versus play, or online with Steam Remote Play. Reach out, get a grip, and swing to victory — or meet your messy end!','2019/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/905340/Heave_Ho/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5258,'shadow_tactics:_aiko\'s_choice',NULL,'Aiko\'s Choice is the anticipated standalone expansion to the acclaimed stealth strategy game Shadow Tactics. Set in Edo Japan, you take control of the skillful kunoichi adept Aiko and her deadly assassin friends to hunt down the ghosts of her past.','2021/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1579380/Shadow_Tactics_Aikos_Choice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5259,'midnight_ghost_hunt',NULL,'The chaotic multiplayer hide-and-seek game. Possess seemingly harmless objects as Ghosts or chase them down as Hunters before the clock strikes midnight!','2024/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/915810/Midnight_Ghost_Hunt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5260,'wantless_:_solace_at_world’s_end',NULL,'In this dystopic sci-fi Tactical RPG, save your patients from themselves. Craft your skills among millions of combinations, heal the mind and face ever growing nightmares in 10mn runs. Will you overcome the insidious being chasing you across minds?','2024/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1807090/Wantless__Solace_at_Worlds_End/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5261,'the_gunk',NULL,'The Gunk is an action-adventure game in which you play as Rani, part of our duo of gritty space haulers. As they’re struggling to bring in funds, they chance upon an untouched planet brimming with life. They came in search of valuable resources, and it looks like they’ve hit the jackpot…','2022/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1087760/The_Gunk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5262,'tetris®_forever',NULL,'Celebrate 40 years of Tetris® with 15+ games, a new game, and documentary videos','2024/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3180240/Tetris_Forever/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5263,'blue_reflection',NULL,'A clear summer sky spreads over the Hoshinomiya Girls\' High School. This story begins with the belated start of school life for Hinako Shirai, who has just recovered from a leg injury due to a tragic accident. The magical sisters Yuzu and Lime bestowed to her a special power to become a \"Reflector\".','2017/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/658260/BLUE_REFLECTION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5264,'hidden_folks',NULL,'Search for hidden folks in hand-drawn, interactive, miniature landscapes. Unfurl tent flaps, cut through bushes, slam doors, and poke some crocodiles! Rooooaaaarrrr!!!!!','2017/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/435400/Hidden_Folks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5265,'islets_defense',NULL,'Islets Defense is a turn-based tower defense game in which you build a small village to gather resources and defend your castle. Carefully plan your actions, as each move brings the enemy waves closer! Strategize building placements and play your cards wisely, as timing and order are key.','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3235170/Islets_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5266,'forza_horizon_5_welcome_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Forza Horizon 5 on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1613284/Forza_Horizon_5_Welcome_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5267,'gamedec_-_definitive_edition',NULL,'Gamedec is a single-player cyberpunk isometric RPG. You are a game detective, who solves crimes inside virtual worlds. Use your wits to gather info from your witnesses and suspects, getting to the bottom of deceptive schemes. The game continually adapts to your decisions and never judges.','2021/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/917720/Gamedec__Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5268,'darkest_dungeon_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Darkest Dungeon®, but does not include the base game.','2016/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/345800/Darkest_Dungeon_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5269,'dcs:_mig-21bis',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2014/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/316964/DCS_MiG21Bis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5270,'turmoil_-_the_heat_is_on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Turmoil on Steam in order to play.','2018/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/804760/Turmoil__The_Heat_Is_On/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5271,'garfield_kart_-_furious_racing',NULL,'Garfield, the famous lasagna-loving cat is back to take on Jon, Odie and company in a no-holds-barred racing game!','2019/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1085510/Garfield_Kart__Furious_Racing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5272,'trainz_plus',NULL,'Drive, Explore, Operate and Create the railroad of your dreams - and now collaborate in real time with Multiplayer Surveyor! And with Trainz Plus memberships, you get more content, more features and the latest Trainz has to offer!','2022/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1904160/Trainz_Plus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5273,'pixel_dungeon_vr',NULL,'With core gameplay of multiplayer cooperative dungeon combat, upgrade Battle Talent\'s combat thrills, this co-op game brings you into VR Minecraft world to explore the unknown！Designed around player exploration and social experiences.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3063750/Pixel_Dungeon_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5274,'puffin_planes',NULL,'A casual airline management game set on Earth and Mars. Supports singleplayer and Steam co-op.','2024/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2897240/Puffin_Planes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5275,'prominence_poker',NULL,'Welcome to Prominence Poker, a card game that pits players from around the world against each other – and devious AI – to build the rep, prestige, and bankroll needed to be, and beat, the best of the best.','2016/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/384180/Prominence_Poker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5276,'beholder_3',NULL,'When a high-ranking security officer saves you from prison, you end up a pawn in her schemes. Now you must eliminate anyone standing in the way of her secret plans and try to get your life back while working two jobs. No tenant, employee or superior is safe from your spying.','2022/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1570070/Beholder_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5277,'xcom:_enemy_unknown_-_slingshot_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game XCOM: Enemy Unknown on Steam in order to play.','2012/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/209812/XCOM_Enemy_Unknown__Slingshot_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5278,'charlie_murder',NULL,'It’s a punk rock apocalypse! Team up with your friends to lead embattled punk rock band Charlie Murder in their epic quest to save the world from rival death metalers Gore Quaffer and their legions of evil.','2017/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/405290/Charlie_Murder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5279,'mafia',NULL,'It’s 1930. After an inadvertent brush with the mafia, cabdriver Tommy Angelo is reluctantly thrust into the world of organized crime. Initially, he is uneasy about falling in with the Salieri family, but soon the rewards become too big to ignore.','2002/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/40990/Mafia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5280,'peppered:_an_existential_platformer',NULL,'An existential platformer where Doomsday is just around the corner. Save the world or become an eternal corporate slave for the God of Death. Choices matter. Or do they? Goof around and find out.','2025/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1883370/PEPPERED_an_existential_platformer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5281,'red_matter_2',NULL,'Red Matter 2 is an immersive, puzzle-adventure game that will transport you to the far reaches of space. Step into the shoes of Sasha, an agent awakened in a lunar base by an undercover operative and tasked with uncovering the secrets of the mysterious Red Matter.','2022/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2081470/Red_Matter_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5282,'king_arthur:_legion_ix',NULL,'Dive into a unique blend of turn-based tactics and character-centric RPGs. Lead the skilled Roman tribune Gaius Julius Mento as he navigates through the dark fantasy realm of Avalon.','2024/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2739830/King_Arthur_Legion_IX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5283,'naval_action_-_galeon',NULL,'This content requires the base game Naval Action on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3010160/Naval_Action__Galeon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5284,'last_cloudia',NULL,'A fantasy RPG that weaves a sprawling tale with quirky characters and cinematic effects. Its gorgeous, fast-paced battles feature pixel art characters sweeping though 3D playspaces.','2021/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1687670/LAST_CLOUDIA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5285,'space_reign',NULL,'An indie space-sim and strategy game featuring ship and fleet combat mixed with RTS elements. Complete contracts and Claim sectors for your faction in the near-future, where resource exploiting corporations are in a state of constant conflict over territory control.','2023/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1762570/Space_Reign/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5286,'the_diofield_chronicle',NULL,'A gritty and immersive story brought to life with the latest technology. Introducing \"Real Time Tactical Battle\" (RTTB), a new, deeply strategic, real-time battle system. The beginnings of a new Strategy RPG, crafted by a skilled and experienced development team.','2022/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1399080/The_DioField_Chronicle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5287,'tis-100',NULL,'TIS-100 is an open-ended programming game by Zachtronics, the creators of SpaceChem and Infinifactory, in which you rewrite corrupted code segments to repair the TIS-100 and unlock its secrets. It’s the assembly language programming game you never asked for!','2015/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/370360/TIS100/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5288,'my_time_at_sandrock_-_love_chronicles',NULL,'This content requires the base game My Time at Sandrock on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2969170/My_Time_at_Sandrock__Love_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5289,'multiverse_loot_hunter',NULL,'This is a brush treasure adventure game across the heavens. The protagonist awakens his powers and freely passes through different planes such as Xiuxian, history, Wuxia, magic, and future. Collect equipment, spirits, characters and cheats distributed across all planes through battle.','2025/1/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2776450/Multiverse_Loot_Hunter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5290,'an_amazing_wizard',NULL,'An Amazing Wizard is a 2D fast-paced metroidvania-inspired spell-slinging roguelike where you\'ll create spells. Master 7 elements and merge 120 unique spells in any order to create endless possibilities. Choose from 250+ perks and 200 artifacts. Collect your lost memories and reclaim true name!','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1372660/An_Amazing_Wizard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5291,'dungeon_fighter_online',NULL,'Get ready for the ultimate brawl! Dungeon Fighter Online is a classic beat-em up 2D action game with an epic storyline and RPG elements! Choose from 17 diverse classes, and unravel ancient mysteries as you punch, slash, shoot, or summon your way to victory!','2016/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/495910/Dungeon_Fighter_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5292,'autoforge',NULL,'A 2D automation sandbox adventure. Build an automated factory with Mana-powered machines, progress through an expansive tech tree, explore a vast and wonderful world, upgrade yourself with ancient technologies, and defend it all from invasions.','2024/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1960480/AutoForge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5293,'rift_of_the_necrodancer:_pizza_tower_-_\"it\'s_pizza_time!\"',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rift of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3626830/Rift_of_the_NecroDancer_Pizza_Tower__Its_Pizza_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5294,'assassin\'s_creed_freedom_cry',NULL,'Play as Adewale, an ex-slave turned Assassin fighting for freedom with the help of his own Pirate crew.','2014/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/277590/Assassins_Creed_Freedom_Cry/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5295,'high_seas,_high_profits!',NULL,'Live your medieval trader life! Buy low, sell high and explore the world! Buy ships, build businesses, find or train captains. Deal with pirates, manipulate mayors and challenge traders. React to hundreds of events that shape your very own procedurally-generated world!','2025/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2828490/High_Seas_High_Profits/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5296,'fishing_planet:_lucky_start_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2016/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/496432/Fishing_Planet_Lucky_Start_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5297,'castle_of_illusion',NULL,'Mickey Mouse returns to star in Castle of Illusion, a fantastical reimagining of the Sega Genesis classic.','2013/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/227600/Castle_of_Illusion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_111'),(5298,'nautical_survival',NULL,'Captain an armed sea vessel to fight off hordes of oceanic terrors! Explore the seas, upgrade your seacraft, equip it with weapons and hire crew members to your aid in this roguelite auto-shooter.','2025/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2860990/Nautical_Survival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5299,'bellfortis',NULL,'Bellfortis is a strategy game from the early Middle Ages. Expand your kingdom, use politics and power. Strategic planning on the map alternates with realtime battles of armies. Play as a grand strategy or on smaller local maps, build, recruit armies and fight!','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2532470/Bellfortis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5300,'titan_quest:_ragnarök',NULL,'This content requires the base game Titan Quest Anniversary Edition on Steam in order to play.','2017/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/741350/Titan_Quest_Ragnark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5301,'murdered:_soul_suspect',NULL,'MURDERED: SOUL SUSPECT™ takes players into a whole new realm of mystery where the case is personal and the clues just out of reach, challenging gamers to solve the hardest case of all… their own murder.','2014/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/233290/Murdered_Soul_Suspect/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5302,'the_sims™_4_movie_hangout_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2016/1/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235767/The_Sims_4_Movie_Hangout_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5303,'lost_ember_-_vr_edition',NULL,'Explore the remains of a fallen world from fascinating perspectives! Slip into the role of different animals to uncover the fate of an ancient world. Dive into deep waters, fly at lofty heights, dig underground as a mole, climb steep cliffs with a mountain goat, and many more!','2022/7/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1880890/LOST_EMBER__VR_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5304,'kristala',NULL,'Kristala is a dark fantasy ARPG featuring challenging combat, fluid parkour, and deep exploration. Master the ancient magic of the Sacred Six Kristals and uncover the source of a mysterious curse in a thrilling, story-driven adventure.','2024/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1206410/Kristala/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5305,'b-17_flying_fortress_:_the_mighty_8th_redux',NULL,'The classic game remastered. Feel the power of flying a 10-men crew on a B-17 over occupied Europe in WWII. Plan the mission, choose your men and take action in every post onboard, from pilot to bombardier and machine gunners. Get ready for a high-flying adventure in this all-time classic remake.','2024/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2000800/B17_Flying_Fortress__The_Mighty_8th_Redux/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5306,'idol_party',NULL,'“WOW,you can really dance!” Welcome to IDOL PARTY. Immerse yourself in dance and song to find friends in this social game. Charm your love with moves and melodies, pledge togetherness, marry, and start a family. Tired? Farm or play mini-games for endless fun!','2024/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2955300/Idol_Party/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5307,'disillusion_st',NULL,'A strange journey throughout an elaborate labyrinth awaits, featuring hundreds of characters and happenings as you try to gather items that once brought happiness to others.','2024/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2775370/Disillusion_ST/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5308,'zombie_gunship_survival',NULL,'The Apocalypse came and went. All we have left is our will to survive, the endless hordes of zombies, and enough bullets to rip them all to shreds.','2021/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1597480/Zombie_Gunship_Survival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5309,'a_total_war_saga:_troy_-_ajax_&_diomedes',NULL,'This content requires the base game A Total War Saga: TROY on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1486710/A_Total_War_Saga_TROY__Ajax__Diomedes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5310,'scourge_of_war_-_gettysburg',NULL,'Welcome to Scourge of War, a real-time 3D computer game/simulation developed by NorbSoftDev, the company headed by renowned game designer Norb Timpko, designer of Mad Minute Games\' acclaimed Take Command series. Scourge of War is the epitome of historical command simulations.','2024/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3142400/Scourge_Of_War__Gettysburg/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5311,'trine_enchanted_edition',NULL,'Three Heroes make their way through dangers untold in a fairytale world of great castles and strange machinery, featuring physics-based puzzles, beautiful sights and online co-op.','2009/7/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/35700/Trine_Enchanted_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5312,'rez_infinite',NULL,'The legendary action-shooter finally comes to PC, and in style! Blast your way through mind-melting visuals and amazing beats, all in your quest through cyberspace to save a world on the verge of collapse. Playable on your desktop or in fully immersive VR.','2017/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/636450/Rez_Infinite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5313,'skul:_the_hero_slayer_-_mythology_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Skul: The Hero Slayer on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2512790/Skul_The_Hero_Slayer__Mythology_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5314,'storm_chasers',NULL,'Be one of those intrepid storm chasers in this online multiplayer video game. Your goal is to shoot the best twisters pictures without dying because of powerful winds and flying debris. Feel the challenge of correctly forecasting and intercepting storms with the optimal vantage points before other players.','2019/6/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/862800/Storm_Chasers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5315,'battlefield_v_-_premium_starter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Battlefield™ V on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1264170/Battlefield_V__Premium_Starter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5316,'warhammer_age_of_sigmar:_realms_of_ruin',NULL,'Wage a campaign of brutal conquest in this realm-shattering real-time strategy game set in the Warhammer Age of Sigmar universe. Become a warlord and lead four unique factions to conquer the wild and savage Realm of Ghur in tense and tactical battles.','2023/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1844380/Warhammer_Age_of_Sigmar_Realms_of_Ruin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5317,'neighbours_from_hell_compilation',NULL,'INTRODUCING THE GAME OF NEIGHBOURHOOD NASTINESS AND COMMUNITY COMMOTION! Living next door to you is a real Neighbour From Hell and it\'s now time to have your revenge! This compilation includes the original Neighbours From Hell and it\'s sequel Neighbours from Hell 2: On Vacation.','2004/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/260750/Neighbours_from_Hell_Compilation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5318,'action_game_maker',NULL,'The latest in the long-running “Maker” series of game development toolkits, “ACTION GAME MAKER” brings 2D action game development to those of all skill levels! Built using Godot Engine, “ACTION GAME MAKER” provides access to professional level functions without any programming required!','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2987180/ACTION_GAME_MAKER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5319,'pizza_possum',NULL,'Live your ultimate possum dreams in a snackable, chaotic arcade game focused on eating as much food as you can in single-player or local co-op - without getting caught.','2023/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1951230/Pizza_Possum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5320,'scum_luis_moncada_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SCUM on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2371620/SCUM_Luis_Moncada_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5321,'counter-strike_nexon',NULL,'Counter-Strike Nexon is a Free to Play MMOFPS offering competitive PvP and PvE action including content from the original Counter-Strike and all new game modes, map creation function, weapons, and hordes of Zombies!','2014/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/273110/CounterStrike_Nexon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5322,'gt_manager',NULL,'Take charge as the ultimate racing manager, leading your GT racing team to victory. Build your team, improve your car, and deploy winning race strategies across 5 official GT leagues, including the pinnacle of endurance racing: the hypercar category! Are you ready to dominate the world of GT racing?','2025/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2457030/GT_Manager/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5323,'animalia_survival',NULL,'Live as your favourite african animal, choose between being a carnivore, herbivore or omnivore, predator or prey. In this multiplayer ecosystem, with a realistic open world, choose to become a lion, a elephant or even a swift gazelle! But remember, the savannahs law is to survive at any cost!','2021/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1364290/Animalia_Survival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5324,'the_bard\'s_tale_trilogy',NULL,'The Bard\'s Tale Trilogy is a complete remaster of the iconic series that helped define the RPG genre. Featuring updated graphics and optional quality of life gameplay features, this is the ideal way to experience the dungeon crawling challenge that made the original games beloved classics.','2018/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/843260/The_Bards_Tale_Trilogy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5325,'avorion_-_black_market',NULL,'This content requires the base game Avorion on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1357160/Avorion__Black_Market/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5326,'creepy_redneck_dinosaur_mansion_3',NULL,'MATCH DNA BUBBLES IN AN UNDERGROUND LAB TO KEEP YOUR PSYCHIC CLONE FROM INVADING YOUR MIND AND TURNING YOU INTO A CANNIBAL. This is the match-3 survival horror comedy RPG metroidvania you didn\'t know you needed.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2116510/Creepy_Redneck_Dinosaur_Mansion_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5327,'trepang2_-_bladekisser_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Trepang2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2615920/Trepang2__Bladekisser_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5328,'onward',NULL,'Onward is the most immersive tactical VR shooter. Join your squad for a wide variety of competitive PvP, co-op PvE, and solo game modes, including intense multiplayer battles or 4-player co-op missions. Realistic weaponry and combat mechanics will push your survival and combat skills to their limit','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/496240/Onward/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5329,'terracards',NULL,'Farm, sell, learn, repeat. Terracards is a tactical roguelike-deckbuilder where you manage your own farm, You\'ll utilize animals, crops, and structures through cards, transforming them into valuable resources and wealth with each turn. But beware - deplete your funds, and it\'s game over.','2023/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2464880/Terracards/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5330,'el_shaddai_ascension_of_the_metatron_hd_remaster',NULL,'El Shaddai, originally released in 2011, is a unique third-person action adventure filled with a deeply artistic world-building, outstanding aesthetics and thrilling battles. Experience an incredible mix of 2D-like platformer action and a colorful 3D world in an exceptional setting.','2021/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1581040/El_Shaddai_ASCENSION_OF_THE_METATRON_HD_Remaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5331,'ctrl_alt_ego',NULL,'Innovative genre mashup (first-person immersive sim puzzler FPS RPG) with emphasis on problem-solving and creativity. Unique vibes and original mechanics that you won\'t have experienced before. One of the best games of 2022 according to various credible sources!','2022/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1571940/Ctrl_Alt_Ego/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5332,'front_mission_1st:_remake',NULL,'FRONT MISSION 1st: Remake is an immersive, tactical turn-based RPG, placing you in command of the awe-inspiring Wanzers – powerful military machines.','2023/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2399730/FRONT_MISSION_1st_Remake/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5333,'humanity',NULL,'A unique blend of puzzle-solving and action-platforming. Play a lone Shiba Inu charged with commanding massive, marching crowds to the goal in Story Mode, or browse a wide array of user-made levels crafted via the in-game Stage Creator!','2023/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1581480/HUMANITY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5334,'borderlands_2_vr',NULL,'Get virtually immersed in the mayhem-filled world of Borderlands as you step into the boots of a treasure-seeking Vault Hunter, grab 87 bazillion guns, and free Pandora from Handsome Jack’s clutches!','2019/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/991260/Borderlands_2_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5335,'touhou_luna_nights',NULL,'Touhou Luna Nights is a Metroidvania title with a heavy emphasis on exploration and action.　 Developed by Team Ladybug, creators of multiple fantastic action games thus far.','2019/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/851100/Touhou_Luna_Nights/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5336,'the_sims™_4_modern_luxe_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2397791/The_Sims_4_Modern_Luxe_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5337,'fate/extella',NULL,'In the digital realm of SE.RA.PH, the Holy Grail War is over, but the land’s new ruler faces challenges and threats from all sides. The servants now find themselves drawing up tense and unlikely alliances, preparing for a conflict that may tear SE.RA.PH apart...or destroy it entirely.','2017/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/511680/FateEXTELLA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5338,'sir_whoopass™:_immortal_death',NULL,'WARNING: This game contains puns, dad jokes, flappy-bird-like-arcade-minigames, breaking of the 4th wall and jabs directed at tryhard-overly-serious-RPGS. Do not play if you hate FUN or would not like to strap in for a Hilarious quest for The Legendary Villain-Beating Artifact™.','2022/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1240590/Sir_Whoopass_Immortal_Death/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5339,'call_of_the_wild_the_angler™_-_japan_fishing_reserve',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of the Wild: The Angler™ on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3046830/Call_of_the_Wild_The_Angler__Japan_Fishing_Reserve/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5340,'romance_of_the_three_kingdoms_8_remake',NULL,'Theater of war, infinite drama. A masterpiece of historical simulation \"ROMANCE OF THE THREE KINGDOMS 8\" is revived after 20 years. Enjoy the greatest military drama in the Three Kingdoms series, with the largest number of officers and scenarios!','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2288150/ROMANCE_OF_THE_THREE_KINGDOMS_8_REMAKE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5341,'lies_of_p:_prince_of_krat_cosmetics_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Lies of P on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2325281/Lies_of_P_Prince_of_Krat_Cosmetics_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5342,'pih',NULL,'Pih is a really simple game that you can play on PC or VR. Complete each level by collecting all the food , without being killed by the enemy pigs. The game has 52 levels and 3 bosses. Ragdoll physics, platforms and good music. No story, no loading screens, no cutscenes, just gameplay.','2024/8/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2870710/Pih/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5343,'lake_-_season\'s_greetings',NULL,'This content requires the base game Lake on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2450860/Lake__Seasons_Greetings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5344,'magical_girl_celesphonia',NULL,'Amane has always lived for herself, choosing to focus on her studies and happiness. But what will she do when given magical powers beyond human comprehension to face a horde of terrible monsters? It\'s time for her to become Magical Girl Celesphonia!','2022/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1786790/Magical_Girl_Celesphonia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_112'),(5345,'llamasoft:_the_jeff_minter_story',NULL,'42 of the weirdest, trippiest, sheepiest games ever created. Enter the mind of Jeff Minter, the legendary creator of Attack of the Mutant Camels, Gridrunner, and Tempest 2000, in this interactive documentary from Digital Eclipse.','2024/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2236680/Llamasoft_The_Jeff_Minter_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5346,'edge_of_eternity',NULL,'Wage epic turn-based battles as you follow Daryon and Selene on their quest to find a cure to the all-consuming Corrosion in this grand tale of hope and sacrifice, created by a small team of passionate JRPG lovers.','2021/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/269190/Edge_Of_Eternity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5347,'payday_2:_mcshay_weapon_pack_4',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2353510/PAYDAY_2_McShay_Weapon_Pack_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5348,'an_english_haunting',NULL,'While looking for the existence of the Great Beyond, Professor Patrick Moore, aided by a fake medium, will build a device to see the other side, embark on a search for a millenary artefact, and investigate the most haunted manor of 1907 England.','2024/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2474030/An_English_Haunting/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5349,'deadside_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Deadside on Steam in order to play.','2020/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1248380/Deadside_Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5350,'banquet_for_fools',NULL,'The Pavura needs four volunteers to solve the mystery of an abandoned village. Answer the call to adventure in this party-based brawler RPG.','2024/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3172700/Banquet_for_Fools/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5351,'call_of_duty®:_black_ops_iii_-_zetsubou_no_shima_zombies_map',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of Duty®: Black Ops III on Steam in order to play.','2018/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/830451/Call_of_Duty_Black_Ops_III__Zetsubou_No_Shima_Zombies_Map/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5352,'scum_dance_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SCUM on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2651750/SCUM_Dance_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5353,'disgaea_5_complete',NULL,'The nefarious Overlord Void Dark seeks to enslave countless Netherworlds...and only the young demon Killia can stop him! Assemble your tenacious army of rebels and unleash vengeance in this hell-raising adventure! The stakes are high, the damage cap is higher, and the destruction is limitless!','2018/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/803600/Disgaea_5_Complete/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5354,'the_iron_oath',NULL,'Command, endure, and prosper in The Iron Oath, a turn-based tactical RPG where the fate of your mercenary company rests on your decisions. Customize your roster, build your renown, and discover the secrets that await in the medieval fantasy realm of Caelum.','2023/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/699330/The_Iron_Oath/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5355,'rungore',NULL,'Card game mechanics - check. Real time battles - check. Silly humor - check. If this isn\'t the game of your dreams i don\'t know what is (Also we have hidden memes everywhere lol)','2024/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2113040/RUNGORE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5356,'magic_research_2',NULL,'Welcome to Magic Research 2, an incremental RPG from the creator of Magic Research. Learn countless spells, face powerful foes, and command a team of Wizards who can cast spells for you as you journey to find or create the Philosopher\'s Stone.','2024/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2864890/Magic_Research_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5357,'train_sim_world®_5:_berninalinie:_tirano_-_ospizio_bernina_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970520/Train_Sim_World_5_Berninalinie_Tirano__Ospizio_Bernina_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5358,'automobilista_2_-_spa-francorchamps_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1386932/Automobilista_2__SpaFrancorchamps_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5359,'shogun:_total_war™_-_collection',NULL,'SHOGUN: Total War™ is the first, original title in a 15 year series of award-winning strategy games. This Collection Edition also includes the Mongol Invasion Expansion Pack.','2000/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/345240/SHOGUN_Total_War__Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5360,'pets_hotel',NULL,'Welcome to Pets Hotel, a place where you can start the business you always dreamed of! Pets Hotel gives you a unique opportunity to build, design, and run a place where pets can feel at home. Cats, dogs, turtles, and many other animals are waiting for you to take care of them!','2023/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1714250/Pets_Hotel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5361,'deadlink',NULL,'Get ready to put a sizable dent in the profits of megacorporations in Deadlink, a guns-blazing cyberpunk FPS with roguelite elements. Your mission is to conduct covert ops while piloting a humanoid combat shell. And no, \"covert\" doesn’t mean \"quiet.\"','2023/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1676130/Deadlink/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5362,'goat_simulator_3_-_hocus_pocus_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Goat Simulator 3 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3204290/Goat_Simulator_3__Hocus_Pocus_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5363,'otxo',NULL,'Enter an inexplicable, abstract mansion to rescue a loved one in this fast-paced, brutal, and dark roguelite filled with precise but savage gunplay and time-bending slow motion. Face your inner demons and unveil the secrets of the Mansion.','2023/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1608640/OTXO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5364,'ad_infinitum',NULL,'When reality is a nightmare, nightmares become real. In this psychological horror game, you fight the terrifying creatures invading your mind. Can you save your sanity?','2023/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1234430/Ad_Infinitum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5365,'timeshift™',NULL,'Master time to become the ultimate weapon! Dr. Aiden Krone has made a Time Jump across the space-time continuum - a reckless act with frightening consequences. Now, a disturbing alternate reality has evolved within the bleak and rain-soaked Alpha District.','2007/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/10130/TimeShift/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5366,'the_long_dark:_wintermute',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Long Dark on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2095000/The_Long_Dark_WINTERMUTE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5367,'scp:_fragmented_minds',NULL,'You arrive at Mars Site-113, a decaying monument to the SCP Foundation\'s ambition—and its failures. Once the most secure facility, now a cradle of horrors calling you to uncover its secrets. Face relentless anomalies, humanity\'s darkest truths, and a mission that demands survival above all else.','2025/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1184790/SCP_Fragmented_Minds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5368,'bears_in_space',NULL,'Unleash your inner bear in this over-the-top bullet-hell FPS! Embark on a zany retro-futuristic adventure and destroy oil-thirsty robots with an outrageous arsenal. Transform into a bear, wield unique powers, and embrace the absurd fast-paced action of Bears in Space!','2024/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1309620/Bears_In_Space/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5369,'hand_of_fate_2',NULL,'A new hero rises to challenge the Dealer in Hand of Fate 2! Master a living boardgame of infinitely replayable quests - unlock new cards, build your adventure, then defeat your foes in brutal real-time combat! Draw your cards, play your hand and discover your fate!','2017/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/456670/Hand_of_Fate_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5370,'atomicrops',NULL,'A twin-stick, bullet-hell, roguelite where you must cultivate and defend the last farm in a post-apocalyptic wasteland. Farm mutated crops, upgrade your weapons, marry townsfolk, and kill every mutant creature that tries to invade your homestead! Yee-haw! ','2020/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/757320/Atomicrops/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5371,'alaskan_road_truckers',NULL,'Brave the challenging conditions of Alaskan life in the definitive trucker simulator. Be the master of your own destiny as you take jobs, transport cargo and experience a sense of freedom on foot and in your cab.','2023/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/849100/Alaskan_Road_Truckers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5372,'zup!_s',NULL,'Minimal physical puzzle with explosions','2018/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/617670/Zup_S/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5373,'idol_manager',NULL,'Idol Manager is a business sim about conquering the entertainment industry using any means you deem necessary.','2021/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/821880/Idol_Manager/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5374,'disney•pixar_cars',NULL,'Play as Lightning McQueen, a rookie racecar looking to win fame and fortune at the Piston Cup Championship, in the video game adaptation of Disney•Pixar\'s Cars.','2006/7/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/331160/DisneyoPixar_Cars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5375,'truck_&_logistics_simulator',NULL,'Load, drive, and deliver through a huge open world with up to 24 players in cross-platform multiplayer. Join your friends in exciting heavy transport convoys. Jump into the driver\'s seat of more than 30 unique vehicles and carry out complex loading tasks to deliver a variety of cargo.','2023/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/873840/Truck__Logistics_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5376,'kingdom,_dungeon,_and_hero',NULL,'Lead your kingdoms. protect your lands, conquer your enemies. Stop the fallen god Draeul. Collect the Unity Runes to prevent the Corruption Curse from destroying the realm. Armies keep you in power, Heroes do your bidding and adventure to defeat the horrific creations of the curse.','2024/7/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2572400/Kingdom_Dungeon_and_Hero/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5377,'djmax_respect_v_-_v_extension_v_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2681820/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__V_EXTENSION_V_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5378,'dungeon_mori',NULL,'Explore Dungeons, find loot, customize your character and face monsters! A Dungeon Crawling adventure featuring a choice based exploration and visual character customization!','2025/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3597590/Dungeon_Mori/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5379,'wolfenstein_3d',NULL,'World War II rages. The Nazis are planning to build an unstoppable, mutant army. On a mission to steal the secret plans, you were captured and imprisoned. Now, a lucky break gives you the chance to escape, but a maze of passages and trigger-happy Nazis stand in your way.','1994/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2270/Wolfenstein_3D/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5380,'due_process',NULL,'A PVP tactical FPS about PLANNING & EXECUTION. Sound strategy and good teamwork are essential for victory because new PROCEDURALLY-GENERATED MAPS are delivered every week. You\'ll face a new tactical challenge every round.','2020/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/753650/Due_Process/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5381,'titanfall®_2:_prime_titan_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Titanfall® 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238103/Titanfall_2_Prime_Titan_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5382,'inkulinati',NULL,'Inkulinati is a turn-based strategy game straight from medieval manuscripts, where a rabbit’s bum can be deadlier than a dog\'s sword. Become a master of the Living Ink, build your own bestiary, defeat medieval superstars and collect perks to unleash hidden powers.','2024/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/957960/Inkulinati/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5383,'dungeons_4_-_the_good,_the_bad_and_the_evil',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dungeons 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2964020/Dungeons_4__The_Good_the_Bad_and_the_Evil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5384,'broken_age',NULL,'A family friendly, hand-animated, puzzle-filled adventure game with an all-star cast, including Elijah Wood, Jack Black and Masasa Moyo. Funded by a record breaking crowdfunding campaign and designed by industry legend Tim Schafer, Broken Age is a timeless coming-of-age story.','2014/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/232790/Broken_Age/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5385,'ride_3',NULL,'Experience the most complete racing ever with RIDE 3! Race on different tracks all over the world, put your favourite vehicles\' speed to the test and have fun by customising them with the new Livery Editor.','2018/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/759740/RIDE_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5386,'space_engineers_-_frostbite',NULL,'This content requires the base game Space Engineers on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1241550/Space_Engineers__Frostbite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5387,'sonic_generations_collection',NULL,'Celebrate 20 years of Sonic in an all new adventure that delivers a definitive experience to Sonic fans new and old!','2011/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/71340/Sonic_Generations_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5388,'heretic\'s_fork',NULL,'Dear candidate, we are pleased to invite you to take up the position of manager of Hell. You will punish sinners by using our deck-building computer system to construct hellish towers capable of keeping the endless hordes of the underworld in check. Best of luck!','2023/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2181610/Heretics_Fork/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5389,'card-en-ciel',NULL,'Card-en-Ciel is a roguelite card-battling RPG featuring over 300 different cards and 50 unique vocal songs! Play as Neon, the \"Gaming Chair Detective\" famous for solving net-crimes, as he encounters a strange new case when he dives into an in-development game world.','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2730540/CardenCiel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5390,'hasbro\'s_battleship',NULL,'Hasbro\'s Battleship is the original strategic naval war game. Choose your Captain, position your ships, aim your missiles and sink the enemy\'s fleet! Face them in Classic mode, or step-up the stakes in the all new Commanders Mode. Ready, aim, FIRE!','2018/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/893050/Hasbros_BATTLESHIP/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5391,'football,_tactics_&_glory',NULL,'XCOM meets Football Manager. Develop your club, earn experience in turn-based matches, learn new skills, achieve new classes, upgrade your facilities, buy and sell footballers, grow your youth academy, make difficult choices. It\'s a deep strategy game that respects your time.','2018/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/375530/Football_Tactics__Glory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_113'),(5392,'forza_motorsport:_racing_heroes_car_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Forza Motorsport on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3472460/Forza_Motorsport_Racing_Heroes_Car_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5393,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_map_pack_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2148903/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Map_Pack_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5394,'bridge_constructor_portal',NULL,'Enter the Aperture Science Enrichment Center and experience Bridge Constructor Portal – the unique merging of the classic Portal™ and Bridge Constructor™ games.','2017/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/684410/Bridge_Constructor_Portal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5395,'train_station_renovation',NULL,'Welcome to an old, ruined train station. A place that will give you a lot of fun! In Train Station Renovation you play as a renovation company specialized in restoring old and damaged railway stations.','2020/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/914010/Train_Station_Renovation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5396,'star_wars™_episode_i_racer',NULL,'Two Engines. One Champion. No Limits.','1999/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/808910/STAR_WARS_Episode_I_Racer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5397,'mega_man_legacy_collection',NULL,'Mega Man Legacy Collection is a celebration of the 8-bit history of Capcom’s iconic Blue Bomber featuring faithful reproductions of the series’ origins with the original six Mega Man games.','2015/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/363440/Mega_Man_Legacy_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5398,'genome_guardian',NULL,'COMBINE WEAPONS in the microscopic roguelite turret shooter with macroscopic depth. Survive 6 modes using an astounding array of turrets, perks, mutations and power-ups on this psychedelic journey to the heart of the abyss. Shmup Mode turns it into a vertical shoot \'em up!','2024/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2891310/Genome_Guardian/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5399,'total_tank_simulator',NULL,'Commander in the ranks. Soldier at heart. Choose a faction and deploy and command your army into massive physics-driven WWII battles to the last man standing. Destroy everything on sight with an insane amount of units that will behave tactically.','2020/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/674500/Total_Tank_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5400,'foundation_guivre_garden',NULL,'This content requires the base game Foundation on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3482250/Foundation_Guivre_Garden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5401,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_treestand_&_tripod_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1076850/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Treestand__Tripod_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5402,'punch_club',NULL,'Train hard, fight crocodiles and find love. Earn your place in the Punch Club ranks, and discover who brutally murdered your father, in this choose your own adventure boxing management tycoon.','2016/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/394310/Punch_Club/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5403,'deep_rock_galactic_-_roughneck_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Deep Rock Galactic on Steam in order to play.','2020/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1430610/Deep_Rock_Galactic__Roughneck_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5404,'silent_depth_2:_pacific',NULL,'Silent Depth 2: Pacific is a lite sub-sim. You enter the Silent Service at the command of a Gato class submarine on War Patrols during World War 2. How long will you survive, and ultimately how much tonnage you sink is down to skill and cunning.','2024/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2591010/Silent_Depth_2_Pacific/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5405,'the_baby_in_yellow',NULL,'You\'ve got a new babysitting job, and things are taking a turn for the weird. Feed him, read him a bedtime story, and try not to fall into his dreams. How long can you stay in control?','2023/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2291340/The_Baby_In_Yellow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5406,'rogue_light_deck_builder',NULL,'Your house needs a deck. You have a hammer. Freedom is $1,000,000.','2025/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3149370/ROGUE_LIGHT_DECK_BUILDER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5407,'kitsune_tails',NULL,'Run, jump, and dash across a land inspired by Japanese mythology and untangle the love triangle between three young women on a journey of self discovery. Explore the complicated relationships between kitsune and humans through classic platforming action.','2024/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1325260/Kitsune_Tails/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5408,'archaelund',NULL,'Explore a vast open world and crawl through dungeons in first person, then fight tactical turn-based battles from a top-down perspective. Guide your adventuring party through Archaelund, mankind\'s last frontier, and uncover its many secrets.','2024/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1082970/Archaelund/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5409,'song_of_horror_complete_edition',NULL,'A 3rd person, fixed-camera survival horror adventure. Fear the Presence, a mysterious entity you cannot fight: stay alert, hide, breathe slowly... Explore cursed places where unseen spirits and lost souls linger in a true horror story for the ages.','2019/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1096570/SONG_OF_HORROR_COMPLETE_EDITION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5410,'master_of_orion',NULL,'The ascendant spacefaring 4X strategy game returns! A new chapter in the epic Master of Orion saga is poised to once again capture the imaginations of millions of gamers.','2016/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/298050/Master_of_Orion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5411,'my_time_at_sandrock_-_monster_whisperer',NULL,'This content requires the base game My Time at Sandrock on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2808740/My_Time_at_Sandrock__Monster_Whisperer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5412,'welcome_to_the_game',NULL,'Welcome to the Game is a creepy horror/puzzle game that takes you into the world of the Deep Web. Explore the Deep Web with the sole purpose of trying to find a Red Room, an online service / website that allows you to see and participate in interactive torture and murder.','2016/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/485380/Welcome_to_the_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5413,'row_divers',NULL,'Row Divers is a short, experimental incremental game about diving into dungeons in the form of rows, shooting enemies, collecting resources, and upgrading your bow to conquer the depths!','2025/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2572300/Row_Divers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5414,'thehunter_classic',NULL,'The most realistic hunting experience awaits. Explore 12 reserves and hunt 45 unique species, ranging from waterfowl to big game. Over 100 weapons from state-of-the art rifles to bows. Customize your load-out with stands, blinds and dogs. Play alone or in multiplayer with up to 7 friends.','2014/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/253710/theHunter_Classic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5415,'kingdom:_new_lands',NULL,'Kingdom: New Lands builds upon the award-winning gameplay and mystery of Kingdom by introducing an abundance of new content to the IGF-nominated title while maintaining the simplicity and depth that legions of monarchs have come to experience and enjoy.','2016/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/496300/Kingdom_New_Lands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5416,'rage',NULL,'Powered by id’s revolutionary id Tech® 5 technology, RAGE is an intense first-person shooter with breakneck vehicle combat, an expansive world to explore, and jaw-dropping graphics!','2011/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/9200/RAGE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5417,'il-2_sturmovik:_arado_ar_234_b-2_collector_plane',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/29','Released','http