e game NARUTO SHIPPUDEN: Ultimate Ninja STORM 4 on Steam in order to play.','2017/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/495160/NARUTO_STORM_4__Road_to_Boruto_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5424,'forsaken_frontiers',NULL,'Step into the frozen unknown in Forsaken Frontiers, a cooperative analog horror adventure set in the unforgiving embrace of an everlasting winter.','2025/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2810780/Forsaken_Frontiers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5425,'disgaea_4_complete+',NULL,'The ultimate Disgaea has arrived to Steam! HL-raising action and a horde of special features await you in this tale of fiery revolution.','2020/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1233880/Disgaea_4_Complete/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5426,'spirit_hunter:_death_mark',NULL,'A strange rumor is spreading through the shadows of Tokyo\'s H City: a mysterious disfigurement has been appearing on the bodies of certain individuals. Anyone who receives the Mark will rapidly die of unknown, horrifying causes. The countdown to death has already begun...','2019/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/980830/Spirit_Hunter_Death_Mark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5427,'voice_of_cards:_the_isle_dragon_roars',NULL,'Voice of Cards: The Isle Dragon Roars is an RPG set in a world of swords and sorcery, told entirely through the medium of cards.','2021/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1113570/Voice_of_Cards_The_Isle_Dragon_Roars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5428,'tech_market_simulator',NULL,'Build and manage your own tech store! Sell products like keyboards, mice, and gaming chairs. Hire employees, grow your shop, and make it the best place for gamers to shop. Can you become the top tech store?','2025/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3225600/Tech_Market_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5429,'total_war:_rome_ii_-_beasts_of_war_unit_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ROME II - Emperor Edition on Steam in order to play.','2014/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/267630/Total_War_ROME_II__Beasts_of_War_Unit_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5430,'gunpoint',NULL,'Gunpoint is a stealth puzzle game that lets you rewire its levels to trick people. You play a freelance spy who takes jobs from his clients to break into high security buildings and steal sensitive data.','2013/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/206190/Gunpoint/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5431,'gylt',NULL,'Shape your fears… Fear the shapes. Embark on a journey where you face your worst fears and are confronted with the emotional impact of your actions in this narrative adventure game with puzzles, stealth and action.','2023/7/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2206210/GYLT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5432,'my_little_universe',NULL,'Stranded on a barren moon with nothing but your tools, fuelless ship, and celestial powers of creation, you are destined to recreate what was once lost and be the hero of your own Little Universe! Don\'t forget to call in up to three of your friends to join your journey in the Splitscreen Co-op Mode!','2023/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2328750/My_Little_Universe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5433,'megaquarium:_deep_freeze_-_deluxe_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Megaquarium on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2574770/Megaquarium_Deep_Freeze__Deluxe_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5434,'train_sim_world®_5:_lirr_commuter:_new_york_-_long_beach,_hempstead_&_hicksville_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970530/Train_Sim_World_5_LIRR_Commuter_New_York__Long_Beach_Hempstead__Hicksville_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5435,'the_darkside_detective:_a_fumble_in_the_dark',NULL,'Delouse your room with sage and pack up your travel-sized ouija board, it’s time to re-enter Twin Lakes - America’s 34th most haunted city. Join Detective McQueen as he puzzles his way through 9 chilling cases, risking life and pixelated limb to solve the macabre mysteries that plague the poor town.','2021/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/795420/The_Darkside_Detective_A_Fumble_in_the_Dark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5436,'ashes_of_the_singularity:_escalation',NULL,'A massive-scale real-time strategy game where you command entire armies on a dynamic battlefield. Conquer multiple worlds across several single-player campaigns; or play with your friends in multiplayer combat.','2016/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/507490/Ashes_of_the_Singularity_Escalation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5437,'battle_realms:_zen_edition',NULL,'Return of the Classic, now remastered! Battle Realms is a fantasy RTS inspired by the stories told in martial- arts movies and oriental mythology. Develop your peasants into a highly trained and deadly efficient clan of warriors who are ready to die with your name on their lips.','2019/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1025600/Battle_Realms_Zen_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5438,'dead_space™_3_awakened',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead Space™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238070/Dead_Space_3_Awakened/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5439,'axiom_verge_2',NULL,'Explore a sprawling, alien world in the sequel to the award winning Axiom Verge.','2022/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/946030/Axiom_Verge_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5440,'music_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_songs_of_the_eastern_front',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1579992/Music__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_Songs_of_the_Eastern_Front/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5441,'plains_of_pain',NULL,'Survive a brutal open world alone or with friends. Explore a procedural wasteland scorched by chaos. Build and defend your base, trade for what you need, complete deadly quests, and fight to claim faction outposts before someone else does.','2023/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2218970/Plains_of_Pain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_114'),(5442,'vertigo_remastered',NULL,'An immersive story-driven shooter incorporating the cutting edge of VR gameplay, Vertigo Remastered is a complete overhaul and occasional reimagining of the 2016 original.','2020/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1318090/Vertigo_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5443,'flashing_lights:_buck_-_police,_fire,_rescue_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Flashing Lights - Police, Firefighting, Emergency Services (EMS) Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3640340/Flashing_Lights_BUCK__Police_Fire_Rescue_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5444,'ten_bells',NULL,'You\'re trapped in an old English pub. Unravel a chilling tale by identifying anomalies while trying to escape. Confront the horror as you survive the endless loop of Ten Bells.','2024/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3044030/Ten_Bells/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5445,'idun_-_frontline_survival',NULL,'A defense RTS where you can move turrets at will. Extract resources, upgrade technology, and defend against enemy swarms in a gripping space campaign. Hold the line, set up your turrets, and brace for screen-filling hordes!','2025/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2186360/IDUN__Frontline_Survival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5446,'the_sims™_4_vintage_glamour_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2016/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235751/The_Sims_4_Vintage_Glamour_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5447,'proximate',NULL,'Congratulations, contractor! You\'ve been approved to trial our cutting-edge AI visor. Use it to explore the Neuras lab and recover the staff\'s research. Your visor is safe, reliable, and up to 99% accurate. Just don\'t ask why the \"ketchup\" in the corner makes such a horrible crunching sound.','2024/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2957800/PROXIMATE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5448,'reus_2_-_ice_age',NULL,'This content requires the base game Reus 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3333960/Reus_2__Ice_Age/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5449,'the_sims™_4_artist_studio_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2815420/The_Sims_4_Artist_Studio_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5450,'nexus_5x',NULL,'eXplore, eXpand, eXploit, eXterminate, EXPRESS. All of the depth, diplomacy, conflict and conquest of a turn-based 4X epic but played in fast-paced 60-minute competitive sessions. Play Solo or Multiplayer for 2-8 players.','2024/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1983990/Nexus_5X/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5451,'dying_light_-_10th_anniversary_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dying Light on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3454290/Dying_Light__10th_Anniversary_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5452,'tropico_6_-_caribbean_skies',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tropico 6 on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1449310/Tropico_6__Caribbean_Skies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5453,'death_in_unison',NULL,'Survive the world\'s deadliest psychopaths. Experience a unique 2-player co-op experience that puts your teamwork and communication to the test. Complete your duties alone or with a partner in a prison like no other.','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2454890/DEATH_IN_UNISON/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5454,'desk_paws',NULL,'Collect over 100 stylish little pets on your desktop! They can freely move along the bottom of your screen, or live in the little houses you\'ve carefully decorated for them. Hmm... or perhaps send them on adventures to earn treats?','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3586060/Desk_Paws/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5455,'wallace_&_gromit’s_grand_adventures',NULL,'Enter the colorful world of West Wallaby Street in a series of four cracking adventures brought to you by Aardman Animations, the creators of the Wallace & Gromit animated films, and award-winning Telltale Games.','2009/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/31100/Wallace__Gromits_Grand_Adventures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5456,'lizards_must_die_2',NULL,'LIZARDS MUST DIE 2 is a cooperative slasher action game, a high–quality continuation of the SENSATIONAL first part. Insidious lizards attacked the lands of the Rus again. HYPERBOREA is on fire and only the GLORIOUS HEROES can kick the invaders from their homeland.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3107800/LIZARDS_MUST_DIE_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5457,'star_valor',NULL,'Choose your own destiny as you explore an open-world procedurally generated galaxy where anything is possible. Become a miner, a trader, a bounty hunter, a pirate, or perhaps a jack of all trades. Start off small and build your way to the top but remember with every action, comes consequences.','2022/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/833360/Star_Valor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5458,'megacopter:_blades_of_the_goddess',NULL,'Pilot the Megacopter, a sentient weapon that gains power by feeding on the blood of its enemies. Play through the campaign featuring seek and destroy, boss, rescue, and defense missions against the evil reptoid army. Upgrade Megacopter with the fabled AZ-TECH: ancient weaponry and armor.','2024/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1228360/Megacopter_Blades_of_the_Goddess/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5459,'lucky_tower_ultimate',NULL,'Escape from an incredibly dangerous, randomly generated tower in a slapstick, roguelite adventure that looks like a cartoon and feels like a joke. Slashy slashy!','2024/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1700270/Lucky_Tower_Ultimate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5460,'c.a.s.t._(chernozem_anomaly_strike_team)',NULL,'C.A.S.T is a third-person PvE extraction shooter playable solo or in co-op. Select your character and loadout to battle enemy hordes, evade anomalies, and complete objectives across handcrafted maps with dynamic procedural elements.','2024/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3140620/CAST_CHERNOZEM_ANOMALY_STRIKE_TEAM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5461,'cascadia',NULL,'Compete to create the most perfect ecosystem in the award-winning board game journey!','2025/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2438970/Cascadia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5462,'vampire:_the_masquerade_–_swansong',NULL,'Play as 3 vampires, wield their powers wisely, and strike the right balance between your human and animal side in a heart-pounding story in which your choices will decide the fate of Boston.','2023/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1299510/Vampire_The_Masquerade__Swansong/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5463,'shadow_of_the_ninja_-_reborn',NULL,'After 34 years in the shadows, prepare to see this legendary action adventure in a new light! Looking and playing better than ever before, Shadow of the Ninja - Reborn is Tengo Project’s remake of a cult classic, that the fans have been waiting for.','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2543760/Shadow_of_the_Ninja__Reborn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5464,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_goodyear_tyres_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1117140/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Goodyear_Tyres_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5465,'ys_seven',NULL,'Experience the first “modern-era” Ys game, now off the small screen for its worldwide PC debut! Features a full party system, dozens of unique combat skills, and a massive overworld to explore. Uncover the secret of the Five Great Dragons, and help Adol Christin save the day once again!','2017/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/587100/Ys_SEVEN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5466,'clank!_-_sunken_treasures',NULL,'This content requires the base game Clank! on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3550040/Clank__Sunken_Treasures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5467,'goodbye_volcano_high',NULL,'Goodbye Volcano High is a cinematic narrative adventure about love, change, and the end of the world. Guide Fang through their final year of high school as they try to make things right before time is up.','2023/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1310330/Goodbye_Volcano_High/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5468,'muv-luv',NULL,'One of the most highly-acclaimed visual novel series arrives on Steam, newly revamped and officially in English! An interdimensional love story that takes high school romance on a roller-coaster ride through the depths of despair, culminating in a sci-fi grand finale of epic proportions.','2016/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/802880/MuvLuv/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5469,'undernauts:_labyrinth_of_yomi',NULL,'Escape from “Yomi” – a dungeon filled with riches – and danger. Make use of your powerful skills and magic items to create exits and reach the surface alive.','2021/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1570510/Undernauts_Labyrinth_of_Yomi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5470,'do_not_feed_the_monkeys_2099',NULL,'Spy on strangers through security cameras, invade their privacy and discover their secrets in this digital voyeur simulator. Welcome to the future of The Primate Observation Club. Even in 2099 the rule about messing with your unlucky subjects still remains in this sequel: DO NOT feed the monkeys!','2023/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1964040/Do_Not_Feed_the_Monkeys_2099/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5471,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_the_shadow_under_the_cowl',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2643040/Hunt_Showdown_1896__The_Shadow_Under_the_Cowl/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5472,'zuma\'s_revenge!',NULL,'An irresistible force has taken our fearless frog to an island where the puzzle-action of Zuma has evolved in amazing ways… but evil spirits and tenacious tiki bosses rule the land! Survive by firing stone spheres to destroy the deadly stream of balls. Conquer over 60 levels!','2009/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3620/Zumas_Revenge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5473,'the_siege_and_the_sandfox',NULL,'A 2D stealth Metroidvania with parkour platforming. Explore the majestic palace and ancient prisons of a kingdom under siege. Don the mantle of the legendary Sandfox as you venture into the ruins below, and discover the true threat from a sand-borne evil.','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/653060/The_Siege_and_the_Sandfox/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5474,'gun_factory_simulator',NULL,'Take control of your very own firearms factory. Start with a workshop and a gun shop, and evolve it into a factory of mass destruction. Craft bullets to rockets, handguns to shotguns, hire workers & managers, and become a merchant of death. Get use to the smell of gunpowder and cash.','2025/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3137520/Gun_Factory_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5475,'trailmakers:_high_seas_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Trailmakers on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1607390/Trailmakers_High_Seas_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5476,'rift',NULL,'Dive into a world of epic adventure! Create your perfect hero thanks to a uniquely customizable class system. Collect, craft, and customize your gear. Go it alone or group up to challenge dungeons, raids, dynamic open-world content, and your fellow players.','2013/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/39120/RIFT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5477,'hd_poker:_texas_hold\'em',NULL,'HD Poker - The High Def Poker experience! Crush the competition with the newest FREE poker game.','2018/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/797430/HD_Poker_Texas_Holdem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5478,'nin_online',NULL,'Become a Ninja in an Open World MMORPG. Nin Online blends deep roleplaying systems with intense real-time combat where only the strongest thrive.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1674010/Nin_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5479,'the_final_station',NULL,'Travel by train through a dying world. Look after your passengers, keep your train operational, and make sure you can always reach the next station. Make your way through swarms of infected at each station. Explore mysterious and abandoned stations looking for supplies and survivors.','2016/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/435530/The_Final_Station/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5480,'progress_racer_rpg',NULL,'A car-upgrading, meta-unveiling incremental game where two girls fight over your attention. Race along an obstacle-ridden track to gain Km, then spend Km to level up and purchase upgrades. Travel far enough to reunite with your true love- if the entire world doesn\'t break before then...','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3346820/Progress_Racer_RPG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5481,'fairy_tail',NULL,'Magic x Guilds x RPG = ”FAIRY TAIL”! Based on the fantasy adventure comic about Natsu, a Dragon Slayer of the rowdy Fairy Tail magician guild, and his unique group of friends battling against unusual and memorable enemies.','2020/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1233260/FAIRY_TAIL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5482,'rush_rally_3',NULL,'Indie smash hit Rush Rally 3 is a Simulation-style rally driving game created by just one person. Take on the challenge of rallies, rallycross and hill climbs, across 11 countries, with over 20 different cars. All of which can all be upgraded, tuned and customised to your liking.','2022/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2020860/Rush_Rally_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5483,'disney•pixar_toy_story_3:_the_video_game',NULL,'In Toy Story 3: The Video Game help Buzz, Woody and the rest of the Toys ensure no toy gets left behind. Dive into all new heroic adventures in Story Mode or let your imagination run wild in the exiting new open world of Toy Box Mode! Come and play to infinity…and beyond!','2011/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/300820/DisneyoPixar_Toy_Story_3_The_Video_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5484,'ea_sports_fc™_24',NULL,'EA SPORTS FC™ 24 welcomes you to The World’s Game: the most true-to-football experience ever with HyperMotionV, PlayStyles optimised by Opta, and an enhanced Frostbite™ Engine.','2023/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2195250/EA_SPORTS_FC_24/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5485,'neptunia:_sisters_vs_sisters',NULL,'With Gamindustri on the brink of destruction, Nepgear and the Candidates must band together and restore order!','2023/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1932160/Neptunia_Sisters_VS_Sisters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5486,'love,_elections,_and_chocolate',NULL,'Love, Elections, and Chocolate is a romantic visual novel developed by the Japanese game studio Sprite. Upon its release in Japan, it garnered numerous awards for its exceptional art, captivating music, and well-crafted characters.','2025/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3027600/Love_Elections_and_Chocolate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5487,'conan_exiles_-_architects_of_argos_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Conan Exiles on Steam in order to play.','2020/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1265640/Conan_Exiles__Architects_of_Argos_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5488,'legend_of_mana',NULL,'The HD Remaster of Legend of Mana is coming to Steam. Meet a colorful cast of characters, use the unique \"Land Make\" System to build the World Map, and square off against fearsome monsters in the vibrant world of Fa’Diel.','2021/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1175830/Legend_of_Mana/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5489,'junkyard_builder',NULL,'In Junkyard Builder, you’re the proud owner of a once-forgotten junkyard, now brimming with endless potential. Dive into the satisfying world of restoration, recycling, and raw hustle as you transform trash into treasure and rise to become the ruler of the junk empire!','2025/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3339330/Junkyard_Builder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_115'),(5490,'my_child_lebensborn_remastered',NULL,'My Child Lebensborn is a story-driven nurture game based on real events. Play as the adoptive parent of Karin or Klaus, and experience the struggles they go through alongside them. Balance your time and resources wisely, while helping your child cope with the effects of hatred.','2023/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2430730/My_Child_Lebensborn_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5491,'the_vanishing_of_ethan_carter',NULL,'The Vanishing of Ethan Carter is a first-person story-driven mystery. Purchase this game to get both the original and the Unreal Engine 4 remaster called The Vanishing of Ethan Carter Redux.','2014/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/258520/The_Vanishing_of_Ethan_Carter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5492,'chrono_ark_-_high_roller',NULL,'This content requires the base game Chrono Ark on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3193720/Chrono_Ark__High_Roller/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5493,'dark_deity',NULL,'Step into the world of Terrazael and lead soon-to-be legendary heroes in a quest to restore a land fractured by broken oaths, reckless wars, and untamed magic. Fight back in turn-based battles, manage character relationships, collect dangerous artifacts, and hopefully restore the world...','2021/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1374840/Dark_Deity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5494,'gris_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for GRIS, but does not include the base game.','2018/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/986250/GRIS_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5495,'zexion',NULL,'Seek out new weapons and equipment to delve deeper into the dangerous world of Cypher-X72! Be warned, you aren\'t the only one seeking the forbidden technology known as Zexion! It will take cunning and valor to succeed in this action-packed sci-fi adventure!','2025/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3392510/Zexion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5496,'infinite_rails',NULL,'A railway-building adventure in an endless, procedurally generated world. Lay tracks, transport passengers and goods, complete tasks, and unlock unique locomotives. Play solo or with friends and create your ultimate railway network!','2025/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3399920/Infinite_Rails/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5497,'pyramids_and_aliens:_escape_room',NULL,'Embark on an archaeological adventure inside an ancient pyramid to find your missing mentor. As an intrepid explorer, solve puzzles, investigate clues, and unravel the pyramid\'s secrets. Spoiler: it was not built by humans!','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2833640/Pyramids_and_Aliens_Escape_Room/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5498,'fresh_start_cleaning_simulator',NULL,'Fresh Start is a relaxing single player game, in which you embark on a mission to clean up the world and restore nature to its fresh and colorful shape. Watch as the world changes in front of your eyes as you help animals, solve puzzles and grow plants around you.','2022/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1856030/Fresh_Start_Cleaning_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5499,'deathsprint_66',NULL,'Compete in a bloody fight to the finish in DEATHSPRINT 66, fusing high-speed on-foot racing with deadly obstacles and brutal abilities. Unleash your velocity, push limits, and claim glory like never before.','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1273560/DeathSprint_66/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5500,'the_crimson_diamond',NULL,'Follow amateur geologist and reluctant detective Nancy Maple to the ghost town of Crimson, Ontario to investigate the discovery of a massive diamond in this retro-inspired, EGA text parser mystery adventure!','2024/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1098770/The_Crimson_Diamond/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5501,'lost_in_vivo',NULL,'A horror game about claustrophobia. During a storm your service dog is forced down a broken sewer drain. You find the nearest sewer entrance and run in after it. Along the way you will meet others that are also stricken by abnormal or psychological fear.','2018/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/963710/Lost_in_Vivo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5502,'kinkoi:_golden_loveriche',NULL,'Kinkoi: Golden Loveriche is a Japanese-style visual novel produced by Saga Planets, a Japanese developer of romance VNs. The game won numerous awards in the year of its release in Japan for its art, music, characters, and story.','2021/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1277940/Kinkoi_Golden_Loveriche/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5503,'bonaparte_-_a_mechanized_revolution',NULL,'1789, Paris. Take Napoleon’s place in an alternate history as Céline or César Bonaparte in this ideology driven, turn-based strategy journey. Defend, reform or oppose the monarchy and write your own alternative history by combining cunning political skills and tactical military prowess.','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2560340/Bonaparte__A_Mechanized_Revolution/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5504,'celtic_heroes',NULL,'Are you looking for that classic MMORPG vibe? Whether you\'re a minmaxer strategizing every detail for maximum efficiency, a savvy fashion collector in search of the most stunning outfits, or even someone who enjoys the journey of casual leveling, Celtic Heroes opens its gates to you!','2025/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2829820/Celtic_Heroes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5505,'creepy_shift:_house_for_sale',NULL,'Handyman needed—ASAP! The investor’s coming in the morning, and the house still isn’t ready! Take on an extra shift where horror meets simulation. Tackle the chaos, uncover dark secrets, and finish everything before dawn.','2025/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3400650/Creepy_Shift_House_For_Sale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5506,'caves_of_lore',NULL,'I created Caves of Lore because of my deep love for RPGs. This project took me 6 years to make and I learned a lot about coding, art, and storytelling. If you reach the end then be sure to let me know! Caves has deep combat, classic-styled pixel art, and (of course) LORE! 📖','2023/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2227130/Caves_of_Lore/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5507,'defense_grid:_the_awakening',NULL,'Defense Grid: The Awakening is a unique spin on tower defense gameplay that will appeal to players of all skill levels. A horde of enemies is invading, and it\'s up to the player to stop them by strategically building fortification towers around their base.','2008/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/18500/Defense_Grid_The_Awakening/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5508,'across_the_obelisk:_bernard,_the_alchemist',NULL,'This content requires the base game Across the Obelisk on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3185640/Across_the_Obelisk_Bernard_the_Alchemist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5509,'blasphemous_-_\'alloy_of_sin\'_character_skin',NULL,'This content requires the base game Blasphemous on Steam in order to play.','2019/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1143853/Blasphemous__Alloy_of_Sin_Character_Skin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5510,'raw_metal',NULL,'Infiltrate the depths of an exoplanet mining facility to scavenge for gear and challenge a corrupt megacorporation. Utilize gadgets and equipment in high-stakes stealth, and hone your fighting skills in breakneck combat in this stylish stealth-action dungeon crawler.','2024/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2279600/Raw_Metal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5511,'dark_messiah_of_might_&_magic',NULL,'Discover a new breed of Action-RPG game powered by an enhanced version of the Source™ Engine by Valve. Set in the Might & Magic® universe, players will experience ferocious combat in a dark and immersive fantasy environment. Swords, Stealth, Sorcery. Choose your way to kill.','2006/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2100/Dark_Messiah_of_Might__Magic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5512,'franchise_hockey_manager_11',NULL,'Franchise Hockey Manager returns for the 2024-25 season with plenty of additions to the deepest, most authentic hockey strategy gaming experience you can find. Choose from teams around the globe and select a team to guide to glory, including a chance at the ultimate prize, the Stanley Cup®.','2024/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2936410/Franchise_Hockey_Manager_11/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5513,'yooka-laylee',NULL,'Yooka-Laylee is an all-new open-world platformer from genre veterans Playtonic! Explore huge, beautiful worlds, meet an unforgettable cast of characters and horde a vault-load of collectibles as buddy-duo Yooka and Laylee embark on an epic adventure to thwart corporate creep Capital B!','2017/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/360830/YookaLaylee/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5514,'beyond_galaxyland',NULL,'Beyond Galaxyland is a thrilling adventure-RPG combining cosmic exploration, strategic turn-based combat, and epic boss battle events across a vast solar system. Join Doug and his gun-toting guinea pig on an exhilarating quest to save Earth, itself.','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1543710/Beyond_Galaxyland/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5515,'toy_soldiers:_complete',NULL,'Bring your toys to life in this action-packed, Toy Soldiers game bundle which includes the original Toy Soldiers, Toy Soldiers: Cold War, and all four DLC’s – Kaiser’s Battle, Invasion, Napalm and Evil Empire.','2016/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/262120/Toy_Soldiers_Complete/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5516,'it\'s_only_money',NULL,'The mayor of Rockhaven threw you down a hole into the Undercity. Why? Net worth too low. In this open-world simulation, you and up to 3 pals will steal, fight, and scheme to reclaim the city. Customise your rides, buy businesses, and take on the Mayor’s forces. Rockhaven is yours for the taking!','2024/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1415220/Its_Only_Money/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5517,'demon_turf:_queens_edition',NULL,'The ultimate version of the 3D Platformer with attitude! Join Beebz on three seperate adventures to ultimately claim the Demon Queen title! Jump, spin and punch your way across the turfs with this Expressive Platformer!','2021/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1325900/Demon_Turf_Queens_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5518,'dcs:_persian_gulf',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2018/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/411890/DCS_Persian_Gulf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5519,'the_sims™_4_perfect_patio_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2015/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235752/The_Sims_4_Perfect_Patio_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5520,'nukitashi_2',NULL,'A new battle begins for Junnosuke—backed by the FS Big Three! “This is what it truly means for the minority to get vengeance.”','2024/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2614070/NUKITASHI_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5521,'no_more_heroes_2:_desperate_struggle',NULL,'Continue the fight in the HD remaster of the second entry in everyone\'s favorite assassin action series! After falling down the ranks of the United Assassins Association, Travis Touchdown whips out his beam katana to reclaim his rightful spot at the top.','2021/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1420300/No_More_Heroes_2_Desperate_Struggle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5522,'panzer_corps_2:_elite_-_ghost_division',NULL,'This content requires the base game Panzer Corps 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3714230/Panzer_Corps_2_Elite__Ghost_Division/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5523,'umamusume:_pretty_derby_-_party_dash',NULL,'A colorful cast of pixel-art Umamusume are all in line and ready to compete in the Slapdash Grand Prix, a school festival featuring four zany events! Which team will run, shoot, and eat their way to gold and glory?','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2313020/Umamusume_Pretty_Derby__Party_Dash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5524,'rocket_rats',NULL,'Rocket Rats is a survivors-like game where you defeat cheese-based astral bodies in space – as a rat! Clear waves of enemies, collect cheese, upgrade your gear, and conquer the moon!','2024/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3069810/Rocket_Rats/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5525,'northgard_-_svardilfari,_clan_of_the_horse',NULL,'This content requires the base game Northgard on Steam in order to play.','2019/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1036760/Northgard__Svardilfari_Clan_of_the_Horse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5526,'farlands',NULL,'Congratulations, you’ve bought your own planet! An agrarian rock at the edge of the galaxy that, for some reason, was practically being given away for free. So the time has come to leave your hectic, stressful life in an overcrowded metropolis for a more rural and rewarding life.','2024/7/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2252680/Farlands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5527,'supremacy:_call_of_war_1942',NULL,'Take over the control of one of the mighty nations during the times of World War 2 in this persisting long-term strategy game. Conquer provinces, forge alliances and build up your economy in real-time. Research top secret weapons of World War 2 and become the one true superpower!','2017/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/672680/Supremacy_Call_of_War_1942/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5528,'capes',NULL,'Superheroes clash in this turn based strategy game. Recruit, train, and deploy your team in order to take back the city from the villains that hold it hostage.','2024/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2081080/Capes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5529,'carto',NULL,'Carto is a charming adventure game wrapped around a unique, world-altering puzzle mechanic. Use this power to explore mysterious lands, help a quirky cast of characters, and guide Carto on her journey back to her family.','2020/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1172450/Carto/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5530,'chained_in_the_backrooms',NULL,'Chained in the Backrooms is a 1-4 player co-op, mission-based horror game. Trapped in a blurry subconscious and chained together, toy bears must solve puzzles, complete challenging missions, and survive against creatures trying to destroy them.','2025/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3060170/Chained_in_the_Backrooms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5531,'the_sims™_4_greenhouse_haven_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2167330/The_Sims_4_Greenhouse_Haven_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5532,'pony_island',NULL,'Pony Island is a suspense puzzle game in disguise. You are in limbo, trapped in a malevolent and malfunctioning arcade machine devised by the devil himself. It is not a game about ponies.','2016/1/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/405640/Pony_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5533,'mosaic_of_the_pharaohs',NULL,'Mosaic of The Pharaohs is a picross/minesweeper hybrid featuring a single ENORMOUS puzzle inspired by Egyptology','2025/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3530670/Mosaic_of_The_Pharaohs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5534,'florence',NULL,'Florence Yeoh feels a little... stuck. Her life is an endless routine of work, sleep, and spending too much time on social media. Then one day, she meets a cello player named Krish who changes everything about how she sees the world and herself.','2020/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1102130/Florence/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5535,'landlord\'s_super',NULL,'Your quintessential construction simulator is here. Take a dodgy loan, restore a property, move in the locals, attend to their grievances, then celebrate with a pint in this fully-simulated, open-world 1980\'s Britain.','2023/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1127840/Landlords_Super/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5536,'unspottable',NULL,'Now Online! Unspottable is a competitive party game. Blend in the crowd of AI characters, hunt down the other players and use the many different environment specific rules to win the game. Walk like a robot and punch like a human!','2020/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1243960/Unspottable/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_116'),(5537,'afterlove_ep',NULL,'From the creator of Coffee Talk and What Comes After, comes a slice-of-life adventure set in modern Jakarta about love, loss and finding your own way forward. Step into the shoes of Rama, a young musician struggling to move on with life after the death of his girlfriend, Cinta.','2025/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1599780/Afterlove_EP/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5538,'behind_glass:_aquarium_simulator',NULL,'Create stunning virtual aquariums on your PC! Our advanced 3D engine brings your fish tank to life with breathtaking realism, featuring lifelike fish, plants, decorations, and more. Transform your monitor into a vibrant, living aquarium. Virtual aquascaping has never been easier!','2025/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1611580/Behind_Glass_Aquarium_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5539,'flotsam',NULL,'The floating garbage town strategy game! Scavenge what precious garbage you can from the ocean\'s surface and grow your city while doing your best to survive in this colorful post-apocalyptic world.','2019/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/821250/Flotsam/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5540,'blacksad:_under_the_skin',NULL,'BLACKSAD: Under the Skin - A dark corruption scandal in the heart of the New York City\'s underworld for charismatic detective John Blacksad!','2019/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1003890/Blacksad_Under_the_Skin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5541,'human_resource_machine',NULL,'Program little office workers to solve puzzles. Be a good employee! The machines are coming... for your job. From the creators of World of Goo and Little Inferno.','2015/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/375820/Human_Resource_Machine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5542,'dead_by_daylight_-_charity_case',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dead by Daylight on Steam in order to play.','2017/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/627510/Dead_by_Daylight__Charity_Case/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5543,'strategic_command_wwii:_war_in_the_pacific',NULL,'Strategic Command WWII: War in the Pacific is a turn-based strategy game. It offers a comprehensive experience of the Pacific Theater, challenging you to achieve victory in one of history\'s greatest conflicts.','2024/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2740080/Strategic_Command_WWII_War_in_the_Pacific/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5544,'gunsmith_simulator_-_fabryka_broni_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Gunsmith Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3499740/Gunsmith_Simulator__Fabryka_Broni_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5545,'akimbot',NULL,'In the action-adventure platformer, Akimbot, blast your way through armies of robots, pilot spaceships and forge your own path to save the universe from impending doom! Set in a sci-fi world where only robots exist, travel the galaxy and experience non-stop robot mayhem and explosive action!','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1843540/Akimbot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5546,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_mountain_village',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2955870/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Mountain_Village/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5547,'alien_hominid_hd',NULL,'The 2D side-scrolling shooter from The Behemoth is back! With your mighty blaster and a group of mysterious kids by your side, destroy the agency and reclaim your spaceship!','2023/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1285360/Alien_Hominid_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5548,'dodonpachi_resurrection',NULL,'The legendary bullet-hell shoot-’em-up series has come to Steam! DoDonPachi is ressurected after a Blissful Death with enough modes to satisfy the beginner and the expert player alike. Tonight we dine in bullet hell!','2016/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/464450/DoDonPachi_Resurrection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5549,'tropico_6_-_going_viral',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tropico 6 on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2594010/Tropico_6__Going_Viral/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5550,'under_the_waves',NULL,'Stan, a professional diver in the North Sea, is struggling to overcome a life-changing loss during an extended mission underwater. Stuck in his self-imposed solitude, he starts to experience strange events and will have to make the most significant choice of his life...','2023/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1975440/Under_The_Waves/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5551,'tank_mechanic_simulator_-_first_supply_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tank Mechanic Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1485420/Tank_Mechanic_Simulator__First_Supply_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5552,'intravenous',NULL,'Teeth-clenching stealth, followed by tactical hardcore gunplay for those not looking for a quiet way in. Intravenous redefines challenging stealth-action and will keep you on the edge of your seat!','2021/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1486630/Intravenous/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5553,'in_sound_mind',NULL,'In Sound Mind is an imaginative first-person psychological horror with frenetic puzzles, unique boss fights, and original music by The Living Tombstone. Journey within the inner workings of the one place you can’t seem to escape—your own mind.','2021/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1119980/In_Sound_Mind/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5554,'deep_rock_galactic_-_decontaminator_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Deep Rock Galactic on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2416900/Deep_Rock_Galactic__Decontaminator_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5555,'murder_house',NULL,'A local news team breaks into an abandoned house to chase a salacious ghost story... until a MANIAC chases them! ...VHS era 80\'s slasher. PS1 style survival horror!','2020/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1064460/Murder_House/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5556,'stellar_tactics',NULL,'A Sci-Fi role-playing game featuring turn-based ground combat, space exploration, deep character customization and a massive living universe with over 160,000 star systems. Equip your ships with the best equipment you can find, gather a powerful crew of mercenaries and set out into the void!','2016/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/465490/Stellar_Tactics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5557,'shattered_pixel_dungeon',NULL,'Shattered Pixel Dungeon is a traditional roguelike dungeon crawler that\'s simple to start but hard to master! Every game is a unique challenge, with six different heroes, randomized levels and enemies, and hundreds of items to collect and use.','2022/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1769170/Shattered_Pixel_Dungeon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5558,'a_park_full_of_cats',NULL,'Welcome to \'A Park Full of Cats,\' a hidden object game that invites you to revel in the enchanting world of amusement parks! Experience the thrill and excitement of the rides and give those cats the fun they truly deserve!','2024/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2610090/A_Park_Full_of_Cats/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5559,'hidden_deep',NULL,'Hidden Deep is an atmospheric sci-fi action game heavily inspired by Aliens, The Thing, and Half-Life. Explore, climb, swim, scan, blast and shoot your way through dangerous missions in a huge sub oceanic mining and research facility. Fear the horrors that lurk below…','2022/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/976890/Hidden_Deep/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5560,'creeper_world_3:_arc_eternal',NULL,'Creeper World 3 is what happens when cellular automata takes over a strategy simulation. Instead of discrete units that attack your base, a fluid-like substance spreads over the terraformable terrain. Your base, your weapons, your strategy... you must adapt them all.','2014/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/280220/Creeper_World_3_Arc_Eternal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5561,'divinity_ii:_developer\'s_cut',NULL,'Dragons: they have been hunted, they have been slain, but now the hour to strike back has come.','2012/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/219780/Divinity_II_Developers_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5562,'mini_racer_car_shop_simulator',NULL,'Manage your mini racer car shop, sell mini cars and spare parts, and unleash your creativity with custom builds. Test drive your creations on the race track before putting them up for sale. Transform your shop into a haven for mini car enthusiasts and build a thriving business in the process!','2025/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3294630/Mini_Racer_Car_Shop_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5563,'mushihimesama',NULL,'Battle huge \"Koju\" bugs in CAVE\'s beautiful fantasy shooter, Mushihimesama. Experience the thrill of bullet hell from the masters of the genre as you evade visually stunning shot patterns with thousands of bullets.','2015/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/377860/Mushihimesama/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5564,'deadpoly',NULL,'DeadPoly is a polygon arcade zombie survival looter shooter with base building, crafting, scavenging, leveling, questing, and more, but your only goal is survival, everything else is optional.','2022/1/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1621070/DeadPoly/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5565,'phantom_doctrine',NULL,'The year is 1983. The world teeters on the verge of destruction as the Cold War tightens its icy grip. East or West: trust no one, question everything. The fate of humanity rests in your hands as you pit spy versus spy in tactical Phantom Doctrine.','2018/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/559100/Phantom_Doctrine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5566,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_railroads_of_japan',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2313321/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Railroads_of_Japan/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5567,'spellforce:_conquest_of_eo_-_demon_scourge',NULL,'This content requires the base game SpellForce: Conquest of Eo on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2681600/SpellForce_Conquest_of_Eo__Demon_Scourge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5568,'combat_mission:_red_thunder',NULL,'Combat Mission Red Thunder focuses on the hard fought Eastern Front battles of Bagration and Poland, from the swamps of Belarus to the gates of Warsaw during the summer of 1944.','2023/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2418000/Combat_Mission_Red_Thunder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5569,'littlewood',NULL,'The world has already been saved. Now it\'s time to rebuild your town, learn new hobbies, and forge lifelong friendships in this peaceful and relaxing RPG.','2020/8/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/894940/Littlewood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5570,'super_animal_royale',NULL,'It’s a fight for furvival! Super Animal Royale is a 64-player, frenetic, top-down 2D battle royale where murderous animals fight tooth, claw, and machine gun across an abandoned safari park.','2021/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/843380/Super_Animal_Royale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5571,'elex',NULL,'ELEX is a handcrafted action role-playing experience from the award-winning creators of the Gothic series, set in a brand new post-apocalyptic Science Fantasy universe that puts players into a huge seamless game world full of original characters, mutated creatures, deep moral choices and powerful action.','2017/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/411300/ELEX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5572,'lego®_batman™_2:_dc_super_heroes',NULL,'Legends Unite! The Dynamic Duo of Batman and Robin join other famous super heroes from the DC Universe including Superman, Wonder Woman and Green Lantern to save Gotham City from destruction at the hands of the notorious villains Lex Luthor and the Joker.','2012/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/213330/LEGO_Batman_2_DC_Super_Heroes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5573,'paradiddle',NULL,'So much more than a VR drum kit. Learn to drum step by step, flex your skills with the built-in rhythm game, and build your own custom kit from a library of 60+ percussive instruments without the limitations of money or physical space. Fun, intuitive drumming for pros and newcomers alike!','2022/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/685240/Paradiddle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5574,'bloons_td_battles',NULL,'Go head to head with other players in a Bloon-popping battle for victory. From the creators of best-selling Bloons TD 5, this all new Battles game is specially designed for multiplayer combat, featuring the ability to control bloons directly and send them charging past your opponent\'s defenses.','2016/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/444640/Bloons_TD_Battles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5575,'mass_effect_2_(2010)_edition',NULL,'Are you prepared to lose everything to save the galaxy? You\'ll need to be, Commander Shepard. It\'s time to bring together your greatest allies and recruit the galaxy\'s fighting elite to continue the resistance against the invading Reapers.','2010/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2362420/Mass_Effect_2_2010_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5576,'disco_elysium_-_soundtrack_and_artbooklet',NULL,'This content requires the base game Disco Elysium - The Final Cut on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1173140/Disco_Elysium__Soundtrack_and_Artbooklet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5577,'olliolli_world',NULL,'OlliOlli World is a bold new skateboarding action-platformer that’s bursting with personality. Flip and flow through the vivid and vibrant world of Radlandia, meeting colorful characters as you grind, trick, and air your way to discover the mystical skate gods on your quest for Gnarvana.','2022/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1190170/OlliOlli_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5578,'age_of_empires_iii:_definitive_edition_-_united_states_civilization',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires III: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2021/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1581450/Age_of_Empires_III_Definitive_Edition__United_States_Civilization/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5579,'caribbean_legend_-_ships_pack:_part_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game Caribbean Legend on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3549900/Caribbean_Legend__Ships_Pack_Part_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5580,'serious_sam_fusion_2017_(beta)',NULL,'Serious Sam Fusion is a central hub for several existing Serious Sam games developed by Croteam. Cool new features, engine upgrades, patches and updates will be released to existing owners for FREE!',NULL,NULL,'https://store.steampowered.com/app/564310/Serious_Sam_Fusion_2017_beta/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5581,'train_sim_world®_5:_mbta_commuter:_boston_-_framingham/worcester_line_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970920/Train_Sim_World_5_MBTA_Commuter_Boston__FraminghamWorcester_Line_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_117'),(5582,'kayak_vr:_mirage_-_soča_valley_(including_whitewater)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kayak VR: Mirage on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2926750/Kayak_VR_Mirage__Soa_Valley_including_whitewater/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5583,'pinball_m',NULL,'Get ready to tilt into terror. The new horror-inspired pinball platform for fearless players. Prove your skills on the most sinister, gory, and badass tables ever brought to life.','2023/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2337640/Pinball_M/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5584,'realm_of_ink',NULL,'Realm of Ink is an Ink-style action Roguelite game. While pursuing the Fox Demon, the swordswoman Red, unexpectedly finds that her life is dictated by the \'destiny\' within the world of the book. Only by breaking free can she unveil the truth of her existence and challenge the constraints of fate.','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2597080/Realm_of_Ink/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5585,'pac-man™_championship_edition_dx+',NULL,'It\'s time to gear up!Get ready for more ghost chain gobbling and frantic action in PAC-MAN® CE-DX+! The award-winning chomping game makes a shattering debut on Steam with even more content and a refined user-interface to compare high scores with your friends!','2013/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/236450/PACMAN_Championship_Edition_DX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5586,'ty_the_tasmanian_tiger_3',NULL,'CRIKEY! TY is back with a brand new adventure, in this fully remastered version of TY the Tasmanian Tiger 3: Night of the Quinkan. Pick up your rangs; pull on your shorts, and prepare to rescue the SOUTHERN RIVERS from a brand new threat - the QUINKAN...','2018/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/411980/TY_the_Tasmanian_Tiger_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5587,'axiom_verge_2',NULL,'Explore a sprawling, alien world in the sequel to the award winning Axiom Verge.','2022/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/946030/Axiom_Verge_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5588,'claptastic_voyage_and_ultimate_vault_hunter_upgrade_pack_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Borderlands: The Pre-Sequel on Steam in order to play.','2015/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/316410/Claptastic_Voyage_and_Ultimate_Vault_Hunter_Upgrade_Pack_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5589,'kingdom_rush_vengeance_-_pirate_kings_campaign',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Rush Vengeance - Tower Defense on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3118000/Kingdom_Rush_Vengeance__Pirate_Kings_Campaign/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5590,'star_wars™_episode_i_racer',NULL,'Two Engines. One Champion. No Limits.','1999/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/808910/STAR_WARS_Episode_I_Racer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5591,'just_cause™_3_dlc:_reaper_missile_mech',NULL,'This content requires the base game Just Cause™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2016/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/442052/Just_Cause_3_DLC_Reaper_Missile_Mech/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5592,'everdell',NULL,'Harvest resources to build a village of woodland critters in this adaptation of the award-winning tabletop board game!','2022/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1722840/Everdell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5593,'nite_team_4_-_military_hacking_division',NULL,'NITE Team 4 is a military hacking simulation game that explores the world of cyberwarfare and features realistic mission scenarios.','2019/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/544390/NITE_Team_4__Military_Hacking_Division/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5594,'my_recycling_center',NULL,'Operate, configure and expand your own recycling center in this first-person simulator! Work fast and sort the trash. Use the compactors to destroy the bulky waste. Earn satisfaction and cash to buy new containers and unlock new trash types. Use the second hand shop to sell re-usable items.','2024/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2613060/My_Recycling_Center/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5595,'threefold_recital',NULL,'Threefold Recital is set in an oriental fantasy world where the metropolis of Bluescales faces turmoil after a long golden age. The mix of magic, modern, and ancient technologies challenges governance, while tensions between humans, beastlings, and dragons grow. In the shadows, a crisis looms...','2025/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3084280/Threefold_Recital/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5596,'divinity_ii:_developer\'s_cut',NULL,'Dragons: they have been hunted, they have been slain, but now the hour to strike back has come.','2012/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/219780/Divinity_II_Developers_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5597,'anno_1800_-_docklands',NULL,'This content requires the base game Anno 1800 on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1530882/Anno_1800__Docklands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5598,'gearblocks',NULL,'Explore a world of creative building, interactive machines, and gears - lots of gears. Build all things mechanical: cars, trucks, cranes, tanks, gearboxes, engines, clocks, anything you can think of. Test your creations to destruction in challenging scenarios, and share them in the workshop!','2023/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1305080/GearBlocks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5599,'project_cars_3',NULL,'Journey from weekend warrior to racing legend & experience the thrill & emotion of authentic racing. Own, upgrade and personalise hundreds of cars, customise your driver, tailor every setting & play the way you want in YOUR Ultimate Driver Journey.','2020/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/958400/Project_CARS_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5600,'spellforce_3_soul_harvest',NULL,'Three years after the Purity Wars, Nortander is on the cusp of a new era.','2019/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/817540/SpellForce_3_Soul_Harvest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5601,'drug_lord_tycoon',NULL,'Start from nothing and rise to the top as you expand your criminal empire in Drug Lord Tycoon.','2024/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2450700/Drug_Lord_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5602,'overlord™:_raising_hell',NULL,'How evil can you get? Discover how corruptible you are in Overlord, the twisted fantasy action adventure where you can be evil (or really evil). In the game\'s seriously warped fantasy world, players will become the Overlord and get first-hand experience of how absolute power corrupts absolutely.','2008/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/12710/Overlord_Raising_Hell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5603,'blackjack_21:_blackjackist',NULL,'Blackjack is an exciting game that any player is sure to enjoy. Place your bet, get more points than the dealer and win chips. Feel the risk as you dive into the casino atmosphere and hit the big time!','2025/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3594780/Blackjack_21_Blackjackist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5604,'everholm',NULL,'Lilly was spirited away to a mysterious island. As her memories fade, everyone seems to know her and her quest for her missing sister. It’s time to establish a homestead, meet your friendly Everfolks, then learn their secrets and solve the mystery of Everholm, in this open-ended minimalist RPG!','2024/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2312520/Everholm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5605,'journey_to_the_savage_planet_-_hot_garbage',NULL,'This content requires the base game Journey To The Savage Planet on Steam in order to play.','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1503200/Journey_to_the_Savage_Planet__Hot_Garbage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5606,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_the_reckoning_son',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2719560/Hunt_Showdown_1896__The_Reckoning_Son/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5607,'duck_season',NULL,'The game of your dreams just dropped, DUCK SEASON, a hunter with ridiculous graphics. Luckily, it\'s summer vacation and Mom just surprised you with a one day rental of it! Unfortunately, as you binge play it becomes apparent that all is not right with Duck Season...','2017/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/503580/Duck_Season/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5608,'keeperrl',NULL,'KeeperRL is a retro dungeon simulator with roguelike and RPG elements. Take the role of an evil keeper and build a formidable dungeon. Recruit sinister minions, equip and train them to explore the world and fight the forces of good.','2024/2/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/329970/KeeperRL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5609,'ratropolis',NULL,'A fusion of roguelite, tower defense, city-building, and deck-building! We created a new kind of real time strategy game filled with addictive and fast-paced gameplay. Create your deck, defend your city, and build the largest Ratropolis in history!','2020/12/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1108370/Ratropolis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5610,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_lotus_remastered_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1981550/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__Lotus_Remastered_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5611,'songs_of_silence_-_lighteaters',NULL,'This content requires the base game Songs of Silence on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3400120/Songs_of_Silence__Lighteaters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5612,'max_manos',NULL,'Max Manos is an incremental destruction game where you play as a powerful hand, known as Max Manos, eliminating shapes. Chain explosive reactions, collect shards, and upgrade your abilities to destroy shapes even faster.','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3428620/Max_Manos/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_118'),(5613,'train_simulator:_welsh_marches:_newport_-_shrewsbury_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator