athhouse_|_地獄銭湯_restored_edition',NULL,'The Bathhouse | 地獄銭湯 Remake is a Japanese horror game that revolves around working at a bathhouse. A complete revamp of the original bathhouse.','2024/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2989950/The_Bathhouse___Restored_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5632,'finding_paradise',NULL,'A story-driven experience about two doctors traversing backwards through a dying man\'s memories to fulfill his last wish.','2017/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/337340/Finding_Paradise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5633,'dread_dawn',NULL,'This is an open-world zombie survival game set in a quarantined city. You play as a student left behind due to missing the evacuation convoy. Together with classmates and other survivors, you must defend the school, survive, and await rescue.','2024/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2093920/Dread_Dawn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5634,'disgaea_pc',NULL,'The hotheaded Laharl seeks to be the next big Overlord in the Netherworld...and will destroy anyone that gets in his way! With his devious vassal Etna and the angel trainee Flonne as his unlikely allies, he must battle his way to supremacy and retake the throne in this over-the-top RPG adventure!','2016/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/405900/Disgaea_PC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5635,'sword_art_online:_fatal_bullet',NULL,'Experience an original story where you are the protagonist in the world of Gun Gale Online. Create your own avatar and explore devastated lands while experiencing exciting third person shooting in this action RPG.','2018/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/626690/Sword_Art_Online_Fatal_Bullet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5636,'scum_weapon_skins_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SCUM on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2517170/SCUM_Weapon_Skins_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5637,'sapiens',NULL,'Create your own prehistoric civilization and lead your tribe in a world you shape. Start with nothing, build towns and industry, and advance through thousands of years of technological breakthroughs in this intimate yet expansive colony sim.','2022/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1060230/Sapiens/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5638,'qanga',NULL,'QANGA: Dive into a sci-fi adventure of exploration and resilience across the cosmos. Merge your mind with a state-of-the-art cyborg crafted by ICLabs Industries, and journey through this expansive universe!','2024/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1648190/QANGA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5639,'3dmark_speed_way_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base application 3DMark on Steam in order to run.','2022/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2019730/3DMark_Speed_Way_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5640,'sarah\'s_adventure:_time_travel',NULL,'This game unearths the essence of adventure by combining elements of exploration and puzzle-solving. The game’s appeal lies in its interactive gameplay mechanics, where your choices dictate the progression of the story.','2024/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2994430/Sarahs_Adventure_Time_Travel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5641,'ty_the_tasmanian_tiger_3',NULL,'CRIKEY! TY is back with a brand new adventure, in this fully remastered version of TY the Tasmanian Tiger 3: Night of the Quinkan. Pick up your rangs; pull on your shorts, and prepare to rescue the SOUTHERN RIVERS from a brand new threat - the QUINKAN...','2018/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/411980/TY_the_Tasmanian_Tiger_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5642,'conan_exiles_-_debaucheries_of_derketo_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Conan Exiles on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1147100/Conan_Exiles__Debaucheries_of_Derketo_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5643,'rise_of_the_triad:_ludicrous_edition',NULL,'The HUNT Returns... AGAIN! Play the original Cult Classic \'90s FPS remastered in 4K Ultrawide with UNLIMITED frame rates, RESTORED content, NEW episodes, a LEVEL EDITOR, online MULTIPLAYER, LUDICROUS gameplay options and MORE. Make \'em EAT LEAD or they\'ll bury you in a lunchbox!','2023/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1421490/Rise_of_the_Triad_Ludicrous_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5644,'chronomon',NULL,'Chronomon is a fresh take on the Monster Taming and Farming genre. Catch, train, and evolve unique creatures while rebuilding a world in ruins. Befriend villagers, engage in strategic battles, and grow your farm—all with cross-saves on every device, including smartwatches.','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2370420/Chronomon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5645,'beyond_blue',NULL,'Beyond Blue is a single-player narrative adventure that takes you deep into our planet’s beating blue heart. Explore the awesome wonder and unbounded mystery that exists within the world’s ocean.','2020/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/883360/Beyond_Blue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5646,'project_cars_3',NULL,'Journey from weekend warrior to racing legend & experience the thrill & emotion of authentic racing. Own, upgrade and personalise hundreds of cars, customise your driver, tailor every setting & play the way you want in YOUR Ultimate Driver Journey.','2020/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/958400/Project_CARS_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5647,'forgotten_seas',NULL,'You are lost in the Bermuda Void, where the ocean is endless and dry land precious. Craft your Ship-in-a-Bottle, then experience survival on the high seas. Sail for new land, build camps, hunt for treasures, trade for goods - then defend your ship from dreaded pirates stalking this strange realm!','2024/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2168260/Forgotten_Seas/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5648,'3dsen_vr',NULL,'Built with passion for retro lovers, 3dSenVR turns iconic NES games into living 3D dioramas you can step inside. A fresh, heartfelt take on 8-bit nostalgia in full VR.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/954280/3dSen_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5649,'dwarven_realms',NULL,'Face massive hordes of mobs and unleash chaotic abilities that paint the screen with mayhem. Dive into the largest mob density of any 3D ARPG and slay them all. Wield epic powers, create your build, and shape a world of endless possibilities in the action-packed ARPG experience.','2024/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2015240/Dwarven_Realms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5650,'zoria:_age_of_shattering',NULL,'A squad-based tactical RPG with fluid turn-based combat, outpost, and followers management, set in the expansive fantasy world of Zoria. Lead a team of four heroes with their unique skills and perks. Every team member contributes to undertaken battles.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1159090/Zoria_Age_of_Shattering/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5651,'ratshaker™',NULL,'RATSHAKER™ is the fun and quirky solution to all your rat problems! Hold on to the RAT, shake your arm, and watch life’s problems disappear! How far can you go?','2024/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3290710/RATSHAKER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5652,'gord',NULL,'Gord is a single-player adventure strategy. To survive, you must build, but to prevail, you must conquer the darkness beyond the gates. In this dark fantasy world, you must complete quests while managing a populace whose personal stories and well-being decide the fate of your tribe.','2023/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1351210/Gord/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5653,'omelet_you_cook',NULL,'The cozy chaotic cooking roguelike. Assemble omelets for quirky students using ingredients from a conveyor belt. Discover wacky combinations to satisfy the ever-demanding Principal Clucker.','2025/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3205380/Omelet_You_Cook/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5654,'guilty_gear_xrd_-sign-',NULL,'Kept you waitin\'. GUILTY GEAR Xrd -SIGN- is finally here on Steam!','2015/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/376300/GUILTY_GEAR_Xrd_SIGN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5655,'tracks_-_the_train_set_game',NULL,'Jump into the ultimate toy sandbox and build the train set of your dreams! Create colourful railway systems, decorate beautiful towns, transport commuting passengers, and even ride your train in first-person.','2019/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/657240/Tracks__The_Train_Set_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5656,'naval_action_-_navy_connection',NULL,'This content requires the base game Naval Action on Steam in order to play.','2020/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1412530/Naval_Action__Navy_Connection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5657,'trickshot_simulator',NULL,'The Ultimate TrickShot Simulation with realistic physics! Experience a variety of trickshot with simple mouse controls. Some stages are difficult. Pushing the limits of your precision and patience. When you pull off a miraculous trickshot, you’ll roar with triumph!','2025/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3384190/TrickShot_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5658,'sid_meier\'s_civilization®_iii_complete',NULL,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization III: Complete, the latest offering in the Sid Meier\'s Civilization III franchise, provides gaming fans with Sid Meier\'s Civilization III, the highly-addictive journey of discovery.','2001/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3910/Sid_Meiers_Civilization_III_Complete/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5659,'mecha_knights:_nightmare',NULL,'Mecha action shooter, plunging the player into an apocalyptic war. Engage in epic battles with endless hordes of monsters in your powerful customizable mechs.','2021/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com