the limits of pixel art. Push your score higher with the innovative Berserk System: the closer they are, the more points you get!','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2882440/DEVIL_BLADE_REBOOT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5667,'robotics;notes_elite',NULL,'Thanks to the rising popularity of the PhoneDroid—a device which features augmented reality (A.R.)—the age of advanced technology has finally reached Tanegashima. On that island, Central Tanegashima High\'s \"Robot Research Club\" is about to have their club disbanded.','2020/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1111380/ROBOTICSNOTES_ELITE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5668,'megaton_rainfall',NULL,'Become an indestructible interdimensional superbeing in this first-person superhero game, and save Earth from an alien invasion. Be careful though - you are so powerful you can destroy entire skyscrapers (unintentionally) when you miss your otherworldly target...','2017/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/430210/Megaton_Rainfall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5669,'railway_empire_2_-_bella_italia',NULL,'This content requires the base game Railway Empire 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2677580/Railway_Empire_2__Bella_Italia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5670,'asterigos:_curse_of_the_stars',NULL,'Embark on a journey full of danger in this action RPG, inspired by Greek and Roman mythologies. Explore the breathtaking city of Aphes and forge your way through legions of unique foes and mythical bosses to discover the truth behind the city’s curse.','2022/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1731070/Asterigos_Curse_of_the_Stars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5671,'yars_rising',NULL,'From the renowned development studio WayForward Technologies, Inc. (Shantae, River City Girls, Advance Wars 1+2: Re-Boot Camp) comes Yars Rising, a 2D action adventure exploration of one of Atari’s richest, and best known classic titles.','2024/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2534370/Yars_Rising/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_119'),(5672,'pathologic_classic_hd',NULL,'Pathologic Classic HD is the Definitive Edition of the original Cult Classic Psychological First-Person Survival game. In this unforgettable experience, players control one of three unique characters as they try to save a mysterious town from a deadly plague that cannot be stopped.','2015/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/384110/Pathologic_Classic_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5673,'road_96:_mile_0',NULL,'The prequel to Road 96. Play Zoe and Kaito where it all started. Change their destinies!','2023/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2095340/Road_96_Mile_0/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5674,'sid_meier\'s_alpha_centauri™_planetary_pack',NULL,'Sid Meier\'s Alpha Centauri™ Planetary Pack includes the original Alpha Centauri and the expansion, Alien Crossfire.','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2204130/Sid_Meiers_Alpha_Centauri_Planetary_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5675,'ben_and_ed_-_blood_party',NULL,'Welcome to the Blood Party! Play together with up to 3 people and compete in deadly game shows. Customize your zombie, build your own levels, share them via Steam Workshop and die a lot.','2018/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/500260/Ben_and_Ed__Blood_Party/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5676,'total_war:_rome_ii_-_daughters_of_mars_unit_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Total War: ROME II - Emperor Edition on Steam in order to play.','2014/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/297830/Total_War_ROME_II__Daughters_of_Mars_Unit_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5677,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_the_last_laugh',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3282880/Hunt_Showdown_1896__The_Last_Laugh/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5678,'whispers_of_a_machine',NULL,'Whispers of a Machine is a Sci-Fi Nordic Noir that tells the story of Vera, a cybernetically augmented detective in a post-AI world, who investigates a string of murders and unravels a dark conflict over forbidden technology.','2019/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/631570/Whispers_of_a_Machine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5679,'khatun_-_hero_-_for_honor',NULL,'This content requires the base game FOR HONOR™ on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3407080/Khatun__Hero__FOR_HONOR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5680,'echocalypse:_the_scarlet_covenant',NULL,'Kemono Girl RPG has topped the free download list on App Store and Google Play in multiple countries or regions! Embark on a journey with 10 million players worldwide in a post-apocalyptic exploration, and stand alongside charming Kemono girls! Enjoy a time-saving and relaxing card battle!','2024/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2917030/Echocalypse_The_Scarlet_Covenant/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5681,'detective_dotson',NULL,'A mystery adventure game about an aspiring actor turned detective. Dotson comes across a case where each clue unravels new details about his father’s sudden passing. Engage in a riveting story, explore vibrant modern India, and use your wits to uncover the truth.','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2450840/Detective_Dotson/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5682,'r-type_dimensions_ex',NULL,'R-Type and R-Type II, the legendary coin-op space shooters, are now together on Steam!','2018/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/928390/RType_Dimensions_EX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5683,'mega_man_x_legacy_collection_2',NULL,'Complete the exciting Mega Man X saga with four action-packed titles! This collection showcases the evolution of the series with Mega Man X5, Mega Man X6, Mega Man X7, and Mega Man X8. Test your skills in the new X Challenge mode, which pits players against two deadly bosses at once.','2018/7/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/743900/Mega_Man_X_Legacy_Collection_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5684,'anno_1800_-_the_passage',NULL,'This content requires the base game Anno 1800 on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1125794/Anno_1800__The_Passage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5685,'a_game_of_thrones:_the_board_game_-_digital_edition',NULL,'A Game of Thrones: The Board Game – Digital Edition is the digital adaptation of the top-selling strategy board game from Fantasy Flight Games.','2020/10/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1075190/A_Game_of_Thrones_The_Board_Game__Digital_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5686,'the_silver_case',NULL,'The Silver Case – the debut title from world-renowned developer SUDA51 has been fully remastered and localized to English for the first time ever!','2016/10/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/476650/The_Silver_Case/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5687,'the_sims_3_-_into_the_future',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2013/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/249180/The_Sims_3__Into_the_Future/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5688,'onmyoji',NULL,'Onmyoji is a turn-based fantasy strategy game with PVP or PVE battles, where you can strengthen your beloved shikigami to build your dream tactical team and defeat various demons to become the ultimate onmyoji. Cross-platform play available for both Steam and English mobile versions.','2018/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/551170/Onmyoji/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5689,'warframe:_encore_complete_collection',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warframe on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3559000/Warframe_Encore_Complete_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5690,'just_cause™_3_dlc:_sky_fortress_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Just Cause™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2016/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/400551/Just_Cause_3_DLC_Sky_Fortress_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5691,'postal_redux',NULL,'POSTAL Redux is a high definition remake of the classic dark and surreal twin-stick isometric shooter. Take control of The POSTAL Dude as he fights to survive in a world gone mad with violence.','2016/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/401680/POSTAL_Redux/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5692,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_te_awaroa_national_park',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1463090/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Te_Awaroa_National_Park/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5693,'stephen\'s_sausage_roll',NULL,'A simple 3d puzzle game.','2016/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/353540/Stephens_Sausage_Roll/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5694,'driver_booster_upgrade_to_pro(lifetime)',NULL,'This content requires the base application Driver Booster for Steam on Steam in order to run.','2018/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/920630/Driver_Booster_Upgrade_to_ProLifetime/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5695,'rfactor',NULL,'rFactor is a realistic easily extendable racing simulation from Image Space Incorporated. It offers the latest in vehicle and race customization, great graphics, outstanding multiplayer, and the height of racing realism.','2005/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/339790/rFactor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5696,'time_is_honey',NULL,'Time Is Honey is a relaxing idle game where you manage bee hives. Collect unique bees by opening bee packs, take care of them in real-time and then turn it all into profit. Unlock, upgrade and customize your hives, and enjoy completing your collection of bees.','2024/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2140570/Time_Is_Honey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5697,'distance',NULL,'Distance is an atmospheric racing platformer. Fusing futuristic arcade racing with parkour, survive a deadly, mysterious, neon-drenched city by jumping, rotating, and flying.','2018/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/233610/Distance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5698,'hira_hira_hihiru',NULL,'\"Hira Hira Hihiru\" is a visual novel set in a fictional Taishō Era. It tells the story of its two protagonists\' struggle against Aerodema, a terrifying disease which brings the dead back to life.','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2314820/Hira_Hira_Hihiru/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5699,'bless_unleashed',NULL,'Bless Unleashed is an open-world online game that can be enjoyed with your friends and countless others. Venture out to engage in intense combat while exploring vast regions and treacherous dungeons.','2021/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1254120/Bless_Unleashed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5700,'follow_the_meaning',NULL,'Follow the meaning is a surreal point-and-click puzzle adventure. Join detective Paul Trilby as he works to unravel the mysteries of a peculiar town, seemingly ruled by the local Hospital. Over the wall and behind tightly shut gates, a dark secret lies in wait…','2024/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2720280/Follow_the_meaning/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5701,'workers_&_resources:_soviet_republic_-_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Workers & Resources: Soviet Republic, but does not include the base game.','2019/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1049900/Workers__Resources_Soviet_Republic__Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5702,'pumping_simulator_2',NULL,'A gas station management game, start by selling a car to raise funds and invest in an abandoned plot of land. Build, expand, and upgrade your gas station, diversify services, customize and manage time efficiently during peak hours. And maybe you will become rich','2023/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2499470/Pumping_Simulator_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5703,'the_sims™_4_throwback_fit_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2021/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1458153/The_Sims_4_Throwback_Fit_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5704,'star_ocean_the_divine_force',NULL,'Square Enix and Tri-Ace present the latest title in the Star Ocean RPG series.','2022/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1776380/STAR_OCEAN_THE_DIVINE_FORCE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5705,'forza_horizon_5_treasure_map',NULL,'This content requires the base game Forza Horizon 5 on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1613285/Forza_Horizon_5_Treasure_Map/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5706,'sludge_life',NULL,'SLUDGE LIFE is a first-person / open-world / vandalism-centric stroll through a polluted island full of cranky idiots and a vibe so thick you can taste it.','2021/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1144770/SLUDGE_LIFE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5707,'american_truck_simulator_-_lode_king_&_prestige_trailers_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1967690/American_Truck_Simulator__Lode_King__Prestige_Trailers_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5708,'freedom_planet',NULL,'Fight your way across the celestial world of Avalice where cats are green, motorcycles drive up walls and monster girls do most of the buttkicking! Freedom Planet is a cartoony, combat-based platform adventure that pits a spunky dragonoid and her friends against an alien attack force.','2014/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/248310/Freedom_Planet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5709,'we_are_football_2024',NULL,'Welcome to WE ARE FOOTBALL 2024! Dive into the world of football like never before. Choose an existing club or start your own. Manage either men or women, lead your club to new heights, and become the next manager legend!','2024/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1951410/WE_ARE_FOOTBALL_2024/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5710,'click_mage',NULL,'Click Mage is a unique 2D resource gatherer and building game. Mine and process resources, upgrade your clicking power and construct buildings on an idyllic island with beautiful pixel art graphics.','2025/1/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3228180/Click_Mage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5711,'space_warlord_organ_trading_simulator',NULL,'Buy, sell, and trade organs in a strange and evolving universe. Dive into the quivering innards of alien capitalism in the sci-fi body horror market tycoon game you didn\'t know you needed.','2021/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1507780/Space_Warlord_Organ_Trading_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5712,'guacamelee!_2',NULL,'Head back to the Mexiverse in this long-awaited sequel to the smash hit Guacamelee! Uppercut your way to victory across stunning new hand-crafted levels. Featuring a dense and colorful world, new luchador moves, sassy new bosses, twice the enemies, and 300% more chickens!','2018/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/534550/Guacamelee_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5713,'voxel_tycoon',NULL,'Voxel Tycoon — a management sim set in the infinite voxel world. Mine resources and process them into goods on your custom factories. Set up supply chains and passenger routes with a huge fleet of trains, trucks, and buses, and turn small towns into prosperous megacities with a thriving economy!','2021/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/732050/Voxel_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5714,'the_guild_3',NULL,'The Guild 3 is a fascinating trade and life simulation that takes place during the late Middle Ages. Step into the shoes of a citizen, acquire businesses and mansions, produce goods and trade them, start intrigues in politics and society, love, hate, bribe, fight and live through good and bad times!','2022/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/311260/The_Guild_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5715,'crumb_circuit_simulator',NULL,'Powerful Realtime 3D Electronic Circuit Simulator','2022/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2198800/CRUMB_Circuit_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5716,'gujian3(古剑奇谭三)',NULL,'Gujian 3 is a mass 3D single-person RPG developed by Aurogon Info & Tech (Shanghai), a subsidiary of Wangyuan Shengtang. As the latest hit of the Gujian series, it boasts more free and smooth combat experience with its full real-time combat system. This generation expands the world of Gujian based on previous works.','2018/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/994280/Gujian3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5717,'astral_ascent_-_yamat_the_breach_traveler',NULL,'This content requires the base game Astral Ascent on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3073420/Astral_Ascent__Yamat_the_Breach_Traveler/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5718,'luna\'s_fishing_garden',NULL,'Luna\'s Fishing Garden is a short, cozy fishing and building game. Catch fish, trade it in and create the garden of your dreams by planting new trees, placing water objects and bringing animals to the archipelago.','2021/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1477790/Lunas_Fishing_Garden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5719,'ggst_additional_character_14_-_queen_dizzy',NULL,'This content requires the base game GUILTY GEAR -STRIVE- on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2524070/GGST_Additional_Character_14__Queen_Dizzy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_120'),(5720,'cluckmech_oasis',NULL,'Cluckmech Oasis, a top-down shooting Roguelike tower defense game. Play as the Warcluck and lead your team of animal heroes in a fight for survival. Collect, build and upgrade defenses, and engage in intense battle against waves of plant enemies.','2024/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2453360/Cluckmech_Oasis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5721,'botworld_odyssey',NULL,'Venture out into a huge open world to discover new bots and collect rare scrap to build them. Deploy your bots in tactical auto-battles on your quest to become the world’s greatest Botmaster.','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2936030/Botworld_Odyssey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5722,'victoria_ii:_heart_of_darkness',NULL,'This content requires the base game Victoria II: A House Divided on Steam in order to play.','2013/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/215001/Victoria_II_Heart_of_Darkness/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5723,'american_truck_simulator_-_retrowave_paint_jobs_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1784890/American_Truck_Simulator__Retrowave_Paint_Jobs_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5724,'sniper_elite',NULL,'As World War II draws to a close, the first covert battles of the Cold War begin. Caught in the life and death struggle between Soviets and Germans in war-torn Berlin, you control the fate of a lone American OSS Sniper.','2005/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3700/Sniper_Elite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5725,'moon:_remix_rpg_adventure',NULL,'Don\'t be a hero. Experience the love. Experience moon. moon is an anti-RPG steeped in story and character, mood and music.','2021/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1714580/moon_Remix_RPG_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5726,'expeditions:_viking',NULL,'Circa 790 AD. A small band of Norse warriors lands on the shores of England. History may have forgotten their names, but their actions live on. As the chieftain of your clan, let ambition guide your choices in the party-based RPG Expeditions: Viking. How will history remember you?','2017/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/445190/Expeditions_Viking/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5727,'gamedec_-_definitive_edition',NULL,'Gamedec is a single-player cyberpunk isometric RPG. You are a game detective, who solves crimes inside virtual worlds. Use your wits to gather info from your witnesses and suspects, getting to the bottom of deceptive schemes. The game continually adapts to your decisions and never judges.','2021/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/917720/Gamedec__Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5728,'sins_of_a_solar_empire_ii_-_paths_to_power',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sins of a Solar Empire II on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3195270/Sins_of_a_Solar_Empire_II__Paths_to_Power/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5729,'rez_infinite',NULL,'The legendary action-shooter finally comes to PC, and in style! Blast your way through mind-melting visuals and amazing beats, all in your quest through cyberspace to save a world on the verge of collapse. Playable on your desktop or in fully immersive VR.','2017/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/636450/Rez_Infinite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5730,'this_grand_life_2',NULL,'A money-focused life simulator. Create characters with allergies and addictions. Manage their lives through financial booms and busts. Advance their careers, start a small business, invest in real estate and stocks - or roleplay a penniless hobo.','2024/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2459490/This_Grand_Life_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5731,'ggst_additional_character_7_-_sin_kiske',NULL,'This content requires the base game GUILTY GEAR -STRIVE- on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2081051/GGST_Additional_Character_7__Sin_Kiske/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5732,'deep_rock_galactic_-_robot_rebellion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Deep Rock Galactic on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1946960/Deep_Rock_Galactic__Robot_Rebellion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5733,'i_just_want_to_be_single!!_season_one',NULL,'The anti-dating sim where you make friends instead of girlfriends! Balance between heartbreak and heartache! Will you graduate without a single friend? Or will you survive long enough to reject them all?','2025/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1703610/I_Just_Want_to_be_Single_Season_One/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5734,'naruto:_ultimate_ninja_storm',NULL,'NARUTO: Ultimate Ninja STORM allows players to battle in full 3D across massive environments. Players will unleash powerful jutsu attacks, perform acrobatic evasive maneuvers and even run up walls. NARUTO: Ultimate Ninja STORM has been remastered in HD.','2017/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/495140/NARUTO_Ultimate_Ninja_STORM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5735,'the_age_of_decadence',NULL,'The Age of Decadence is a turn-based, hardcore role-playing game set in a low magic, post-apocalyptic fantasy world. The game features a detailed skill-based character system, multiple skill-based ways to handle quests, choices & consequences, and extensive dialogue trees.','2015/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/230070/The_Age_of_Decadence/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5736,'astride',NULL,'Explore Astride, a horse game set in a Scandinavian-inspired environment.','2023/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1754960/Astride/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5737,'maze_mice',NULL,'Maze Mice is a bullet heaven roguelite where time only moves when you move. Collect dots, level up, choose upgrades, and avoid cats. All at your own pace.','2025/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3385370/Maze_Mice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5738,'phoenix_springs',NULL,'Lose yourself in the mystery of Phoenix Springs – a modern point-and-click set in a cryptic neo-noir world. It begins with an investigation: find your brother Leo. You already know where it ends.','2024/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1973310/Phoenix_Springs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5739,'a_tithe_in_blood',NULL,'A dark yuri visual novel about a quiet university student who discovers blood magic in the depths of her grief. Stepping into a world she little understands, Honoka finds unexpected love, and inadvertently sets in motion a deadly series of events.','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2989270/A_Tithe_in_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5740,'ys:_memories_of_celceta',NULL,'World-famous red-haired adventurer Adol Christin awakens in the unfamiliar land of Celceta, remembering nothing more than his name. Join Adol and his new friends as he embarks on an adventure to map the wilderness and reclaim his memories in this beloved action RPG from Nihon Falcom.','2018/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/587110/Ys_Memories_of_Celceta/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5741,'higurashi_when_they_cry_hou+',NULL,'The tragedy of Hinamizawa is over. Those held captive within its grip are free from the fate that bound them to June 1983. Yet the tale of Hinamizawa is not truly complete. There are many worlds not yet explored.','2023/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2491040/Higurashi_When_They_Cry_Hou/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5742,'wedding_witch',NULL,'Here is a witch who wants nothing but to marry you. She decides to seek potions from a certain Succubus in order to charm you... but a labyrinthine forest filled with devils stands in her way. Will she be able to find the potions, and with them, her happy ending?','2023/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2529820/Wedding_Witch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5743,'silent_breath',NULL,'Unpredictable horrors lurk around every corner, forcing you to find the missing people while desperately clinging to survival. In this experience even your own mind can become your enemy. Stay vigilant and keep your voice hushed, or risk becoming another victim of the forest\'s darkness','2024/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2796180/SILENT_BREATH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5744,'toy_shire',NULL,'Are you prepared for a thrilling toy army tower defense adventure? Welcome to the Toy Shire! Battle diverse foes in various locations, defend your family, and repel foes from your area. Save the world by strengthening your defense with toy towers!','2024/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2361460/Toy_Shire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5745,'your_chronicle',NULL,'\"Let\'s begin your own story.\" This is a text-based idle RPG game. There are already more than 3,000 unique story actions and it\'s still growing.','2021/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1546320/Your_Chronicle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5746,'casecracker',NULL,'In order to improve the efficiency of selecting talents, the Chicheng police specially developed a test system-the true detection system, with the black robe company. As a tester, you need to complete the cracking of the case under the rules of the system.','2022/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1723260/CaseCracker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5747,'huntdown',NULL,'In the mayhem-filled streets of the future where criminal gangs rule and cops fear to tread, only the bounty hunters can free the city from the corrupt fist of felony. Lay waste to the criminal underworld and make a killing in this hard boiled action comedy arcade shooter.','2021/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/598550/HUNTDOWN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5748,'yi_xian:_the_cultivation_card_game',NULL,'Yi Xian: The Cultivation Card Game is an online DBG which contains a PVE mode called Uncharted Realms and a PVP mode. Every game is a deck building from scratch. Players can have stronger decks by changing cards, and then build more powerful routines to defeat all opponents to win.','2024/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1948800/Yi_Xian_The_Cultivation_Card_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5749,'pinball_spire',NULL,'Action adventure meets pinball in this one-of-a-kind pinballvania adventure. When a mysterious spire appears from thin air, it\'s up to an intrepid pinball to bump, spin, shoot, and flip its way to the top and solve the tower’s mysteries!','2024/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2601940/Pinball_Spire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5750,'cue_club_2:_pool_&_snooker',NULL,'Experience pool and snooker like never before, thanks to the stunning HD graphics, fantastic playability and ultra realistic ball physics. Challenge a variety of stylish new opponents of different ability from beginner right up to pro level!','2016/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/366690/Cue_Club_2_Pool__Snooker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5751,'ertugrul_of_ulukayin',NULL,'Become a medieval warrior in this action-adventure game. Discover traditional myths and fight for your tribe. Mount your horse, sharpen your weapons and explore an ancient semi-open world.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2133520/Ertugrul_of_Ulukayin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5752,'hitman_3_-_makeshift_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game HITMAN World of Assassination on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2184791/HITMAN_3__Makeshift_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5753,'mass_effect_(2007)',NULL,'As Commander Shepard, you lead an elite squad on a heroic, action-packed adventure throughout the galaxy.','2008/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/17460/Mass_Effect_2007/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5754,'momodora:_moonlit_farewell',NULL,'\"Momodora: Moonlit Farewell\" is the latest installment in the Momodora series. Join Momo, High Priestess of the village of Koho, as she embarks on a divine mission to save her people from imminent destruction at the hands of the demon hordes summoned by a malevolent bellringer.','2024/1/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1747760/Momodora_Moonlit_Farewell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5755,'you_will_die_here_tonight',NULL,'Immerse yourself in retro top-down visuals as you face the horrors of Breckenridge Hall through intense first-person combat. Scavenge, solve puzzles, and upgrade your gear. Do whatever it takes to survive—but remember: You Will Die Here Tonight.','2023/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1446350/You_Will_Die_Here_Tonight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5756,'ogu_and_the_secret_forest',NULL,'Explore the wonderful world with baby Ogu! \'Ogu and the Secret Forest\' is a 2D adventure game with hand-drawn characters and various types of puzzles. Befriend bouncy characters and defeat strange creatures to unravel the mystery of the charming world.','2024/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1985960/Ogu_and_the_Secret_Forest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5757,'astral_throne',NULL,'Uncover the mystery of a land beset by a Falling Star\'s curse in this Roguelike Strategy RPG inspired by the classics. Build your party, recruit new allies, and synergize your team\'s skills for decisive victory.','2025/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2560500/Astral_Throne/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5758,'wildermyth_-_armors_and_skins',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wildermyth on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2139130/Wildermyth__Armors_and_Skins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5759,'phobies',NULL,'Phobies is a tactical card collecting strategy game where players battle one another in the surreal realm of the subconscious, where fears manifest. Use devious tactics and unleash a dazzling array of attacks and abilities to achieve victory!','2022/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1254130/Phobies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5760,'desktop_fishing',NULL,'Desktop Fishing is a cozy idle game that sits in the corner of your screen. Go about your usual desk work (or don\'t) while your frog buddy catches fish, discovers new outfits, and unlocks fishing spots.','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3411730/Desktop_Fishing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5761,'shovel_knight_dig',NULL,'Meet new friends and foes, visit strange lands, and outfit yourself in your quest to keep the entire land from collapsing underfoot! Jump, slash, and dig your way down an ever-changing chasm of mystery in Shovel Knight Dig, an all-new Shovel Knight adventure!','2022/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1416050/Shovel_Knight_Dig/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5762,'pathfinder:_wrath_of_the_righteous_-_a_dance_of_masks',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pathfinder: Wrath of the Righteous - Enhanced Edition on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2564580/Pathfinder_Wrath_of_the_Righteous__A_Dance_of_Masks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5763,'dungeons_&_dragons:_chronicles_of_mystara',NULL,'Dungeons & Dragons: Chronicles of Mystara brings reworkings of two of Capcom’s classic arcade hits - Dungeons & Dragons: Tower of Doom and Dungeons & Dragons: Shadow over Mystara – together in one definitive digital package.','2013/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/229480/Dungeons__Dragons_Chronicles_of_Mystara/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5764,'automobilista_2_-_racin´_usa_pack_pt1',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1648061/Automobilista_2__Racin_USA_Pack_Pt1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5765,'iron_harvest:_-_operation_eagle_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Iron Harvest on Steam in order to play.','2021/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1341702/Iron_Harvest__Operation_Eagle_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5766,'perennial_order',NULL,'Perennial Order is a 2D plant horror boss rush with challenging one-hit-death combat. Set in an atmospheric Dark Age world plagued by nature-infested horrors, explore a lore-filled and eldritch land alone or in two player co-op, all in a realistic painterly style.','2024/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1411020/Perennial_Order/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5767,'the_inn-sanity',NULL,'Early 90s. You stayed in a quiet hotel for just one night and the next morning you’ve found out that the old world was destroyed. Alien dreams, secrets of your past and other guests that are turning into monsters. This hotel will not let you to check out.','2025/1/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2688570/The_InnSanity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5768,'sonny_legacy_collection',NULL,'Sonny 1 and Sonny 2 team up in the Sonny Legacy Collection. Traverse a story-rich world where strategy meets supernatural in a quest for identity and survival. Master tactical turn-based combat and discover the truth behind Sonny\'s resurrection in these classic RPGs.','2024/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2757720/Sonny_Legacy_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_121'),(5769,'islands_of_insight',NULL,'Seek out and solve 10,000+ puzzles at your own pace across this sublime puzzle game.','2024/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2071500/Islands_of_Insight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5770,'the_final_station',NULL,'Travel by train through a dying world. Look after your passengers, keep your train operational, and make sure you can always reach the next station. Make your way through swarms of infected at each station. Explore mysterious and abandoned stations looking for supplies and survivors.','2016/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/435530/The_Final_Station/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5771,'ghostrunner_-_project_hel',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ghostrunner on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1760190/Ghostrunner__Project_Hel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5772,'music_-_hearts_of_iron_iv:_allied_speeches_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hearts of Iron IV on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1317250/Music__Hearts_of_Iron_IV_Allied_Speeches_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5773,'builders_of_greece',NULL,'Immerse yourself in the beautifully recreated golden age of Hellenic city-states. Builders of Greece is a city management game that lets you display your strategic and economic mastery. Build your Polis from scratch, make meaningful decisions, trade, fight and expand to become the ultimate ruler.','2025/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1273100/Builders_of_Greece/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5774,'mail_time',NULL,'It\'s Mail Time! As a newly trained Mail Scout, put on your pack, grab those letters, and deliver them across Grumblewood Grove! The forest animals eagerly await the sight of your mushroom hat in this cozy, cottagecore light-platformer adventure!','2023/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1607240/Mail_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5775,'immersion_pack_-_europa_universalis_iv:_rule_britannia',NULL,'This content requires the base game Europa Universalis IV on Steam in order to play.','2018/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/760070/Immersion_Pack__Europa_Universalis_IV_Rule_Britannia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5776,'misao_-_2024_hd_remaster',NULL,'Explore a school plagued by unnatural phenomena in this horror-adventure game revolving around the missing girl Misao. Improving upon 2017\'s \"Definitive Edition\" with refreshed graphics and support for HD resolutions, you can now experience the terror in a new form.','2017/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/691450/Misao__2024_HD_Remaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5777,'farming_simulator_15',NULL,'Welcome to the new generation of Farming Simulator!With a brand new graphics and physics engine, Farming Simulator 15 offers an immense open world, filled with details and visual effects transporting the Farming Simulator franchise to a new era.','2014/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/313160/Farming_Simulator_15/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5778,'heaven_will_be_mine',NULL,'HEAVEN WILL BE MINE is a visual novel about making terrible life decisions in the midst of a hot-blooded battle between giant robots. Select one of three terribly behaved girls to fight and/or make out with each other in their struggle for the fate of space.','2018/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/836450/Heaven_Will_Be_Mine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5779,'edge_of_eternity',NULL,'Wage epic turn-based battles as you follow Daryon and Selene on their quest to find a cure to the all-consuming Corrosion in this grand tale of hope and sacrifice, created by a small team of passionate JRPG lovers.','2021/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/269190/Edge_Of_Eternity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5780,'bao_bao\'s_cozy_laundromat',NULL,'Relax in Bao Bao’s Cozy Laundromat, an idle game where you join Bao Bao, a charming panda, in creating the coziest laundromat. Purchase colorful washing machines, add delightful decorations, and hire panda helpers. Watch your cozy laundromat bustle with life, even when you’re not around!','2025/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3194550/Bao_Baos_Cozy_Laundromat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5781,'hell_let_loose_-__operation_lüttich_units',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hell Let Loose on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3012950/Hell_Let_Loose___Operation_Lttich_Units/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5782,'broken_sword_2_-_the_smoking_mirror:_remastered_(2010)',NULL,'‘Broken Sword - The Smoking Mirror: Remastered’ is a stunning update to the multi million-selling original. A mysterious escapade of intrigue and deceit, in which journalist Nico Collard and her adventuring companion George Stobbart must overcome powerful forces from fulfilling their evil ambitions.','1997/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/33600/Broken_Sword_2__the_Smoking_Mirror_Remastered_2010/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5783,'the_sims™_4_storybook_nursery_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2815430/The_Sims_4_Storybook_Nursery_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5784,'start_again:_a_prologue',NULL,'timeloop depression station ✦ In Stars and Time\'s prototype-thingy-thing','2021/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1691420/START_AGAIN_a_prologue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5785,'simrail_-_the_railway_simulator:_cargo_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SimRail - The Railway Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2868050/SimRail__The_Railway_Simulator_Cargo_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5786,'daymare:_1994_sandcastle',NULL,'Daymare: 1994 Sandcastle is a third-person story-driven survival horror game prequel to the critically acclaimed Daymare: 1998. Step into the shoes of agent Dalila Reyes, a former government spy now in the service of H.A.D.E.S. unit and prepare to face the true horror.','2023/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1530470/Daymare_1994_Sandcastle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5787,'les_mills_xr_bodycombat',NULL,'Workout at home with an award-winning fitness app by Odders Lab and Les Mills! Discover the ultimate BODYCOMBAT experience from the world\'s leading fitness company in your headset, with an extensive workout portfolio, top-quality coaching, innovative mechanics and different intensities.','2025/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3484680/LES_MILLS_XR_BODYCOMBAT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5788,'hauntii',NULL,'An action adventure about a ghost’s journey through the afterlife. Possess enemies and the environment and fend off hostile spirits in pursuit of starry fragments from a past life.','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2060790/Hauntii/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5789,'legacy:_steel_&_sorcery_-_god_tier_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Legacy: Steel & Sorcery on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2923680/Legacy_Steel__Sorcery__God_Tier_Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5790,'cashgrab:_refunded',NULL,'An online co-op horror game with up to 6 players. Use fully physics-based objects and fluid movement to grab some cash and escape The Grind. Use cash to buy items and equipment and fund community goals. Create your Grabba and get rich or die trying.','2025/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3602720/CashGrab_Refunded/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5791,'eldevin',NULL,'Eldevin is the award winning indie story-driven Free to Play MMORPG (Massively Multiplayer Online Role Playing Game) from Hunted Cow Studios. Join thousands of other players and explore the mystical lands of Eldevin.','2014/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/298160/Eldevin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5792,'dimensionals',NULL,'Dimensionals is the hottest roguelike turn-based RPG with tons of Heroes to collect and level up. Build a party of 3 heroes and combine hundreds of skills to create insane combos in the ultimate tactical challenge. Fight through an epic story told in the style of voice acted comic book cutscenes.','2025/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2856450/Dimensionals/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5793,'space_crew:_legendary_edition',NULL,'Time for your toughest mission yet! Recruit and train your crew to tackle the growing threat from alien and android armies as you defend Earth to become a Galactic Legend in Space Crew: Legendary Edition. All new content free to existing owners of Space Crew!','2020/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1176710/Space_Crew_Legendary_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5794,'anomaly_agent',NULL,'ANOMALY AGENT is a cyberpunk action-adventure featuring fluid combat, a time-bending story, quirky characters and a catchy synthwave soundtrack! Punch or shoot through mobs of enemies, impact the story with your choices and stop the anomalies before the world plunges into chaos!','2024/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2378620/Anomaly_Agent/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5795,'the_rewinder',NULL,'The Rewinder is an adventure puzzle game based on Chinese mythology. You play as Yun, the last known Rewinder, who can communicate with spirits and explore other people\'s memories to alter the past.','2021/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1161170/The_Rewinder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5796,'hades_original_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Hades, but does not include the base game.','2019/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1206340/Hades_Original_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5797,'devil_daggers',NULL,'Devil Daggers is a fast-paced shooter that places you in an abyssal arena to face endless legions of demons. Armed with versatile magic daggers and a fluid movement system, fight to survive as long as you can.','2016/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/422970/Devil_Daggers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5798,'conan_exiles_-_the_savage_frontier_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Conan Exiles on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/919390/Conan_Exiles__The_Savage_Frontier_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5799,'let_it_die',NULL,'It\'s finally here! The survival action game that pits the strong against the weak is finally on PC! Experience all the heart-thumping action with a silky-smooth frame rate and ultra high resolution. How you make the best of the weapons, armor, and items at your disposal will determine your fate in the ever-changing \"Tower of Barbs!','2018/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/794600/LET_IT_DIE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5800,'heroes_of_valor_-_decorated_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Heroes of Valor on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3775520/Heroes_of_Valor__Decorated_Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5801,'dps_idle_2',NULL,'The long awaited sequel to DPS Idle. Collect cards, upgrade cards, defeat monsters, join guilds and recruit heroes. DPS IDLE 2!','2024/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2402710/DPS_IDLE_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5802,'voidsayer',NULL,'The world has fallen into darkness, cursed by the Abyss. You are one of the many hapless survivors at risk of being consumed. Unlike others, you have a chance to fight back. Voidsayer is a dark monster tamer jRPG. Assemble your monster team, take on eldritch horrors, and return hope to the world.','2025/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2754370/Voidsayer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5803,'warno_-_digital_guides',NULL,'This content requires the base game WARNO on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2981540/WARNO__Digital_Guides/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5804,'arcadia_fallen',NULL,'Play the role of a young alchemist apprentice who is unwillingly bound to an illegal spirit. Suddenly drawn into a war between humanity and magic, they must join a group of unlikely heroes to escape their own doom, hopefully saving the world along the way.','2021/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1174640/Arcadia_Fallen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5805,'observation',NULL,'Observation is a sci-fi thriller uncovering what happened to Dr. Emma Fisher, and the crew of her mission, through the lens of the station’s artificial intelligence S.A.M.','2020/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/906100/Observation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5806,'djmax_respect_v_-_v_liberty_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3038800/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__V_LIBERTY_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5807,'trailmakers:_rescue_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Trailmakers on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2863610/Trailmakers_Rescue_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5808,'a_dance_of_fire_and_ice_-_neo_cosmos',NULL,'This content requires the base game A Dance of Fire and Ice on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1977570/A_Dance_of_Fire_and_Ice__Neo_Cosmos/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5809,'metal_slug',NULL,'“METAL SLUG ”, the very first title in SNK’s legendary 2D run & gun action shooting game series where all began, returns to the missions on the Steam gaming platform!','2015/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/366250/METAL_SLUG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5810,'way_of_the_samurai_4',NULL,'Way of the Samurai 4 takes place in the humble port town of Amihama during the mid 19th Century, several years after the arrival of the “black ships” from the West ended Japan’s long history of cultural isolation.','2015/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/312780/Way_of_the_Samurai_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5811,'koira',NULL,'Save a puppy and embark on a heartwarming, hand-drawn adventure together. Journey to the heart of an enchanted forest, solving puzzles and avoiding hunters to protect your newfound friend.','2025/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1626620/Koira/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5812,'corn_kidz_64',NULL,'The unauthorized, kid-friendly version of the classic Stephen King thriller (or maybe not, maybe it\'s just a game about one-horned goatbabies)','2023/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2575900/Corn_Kidz_64/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_122'),(5813,'tlatoani:_aztec_cities',