owered.com/app/1046790/Eternal_Threads/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5819,'immortals_revenge',NULL,'Step into the immersive MMORPG world of Immortals Revenge, blending adventure, role-playing, and hack-and-slash gameplay. With rich storytelling and expansive landscapes to explore, master divine abilities to restore balance to Olympus.','2024/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3141480/Immortals_Revenge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5820,'world_war_z:_zeke_hunter_weapons_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game World War Z on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1708020/World_War_Z_Zeke_Hunter_Weapons_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5821,'dotage:_folkways',NULL,'This content requires the base game dotAGE on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3384630/dotAGE_Folkways/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5822,'rift_of_the_necrodancer:_hololive_-_\"ahoy!!_我ら宝鐘海賊団☆\"',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rift of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3627120/Rift_of_the_NecroDancer_hololive__Ahoy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5823,'flatout_2',NULL,'Experience the drive of your life as you throw yourself around on and off the track causing fences to shatter, tyre walls explode, water tanks and barrels fly across the track into other cars.','2006/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2990/FlatOut_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5824,'empires_of_the_undergrowth_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Empires of the Undergrowth on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3402630/Empires_of_the_Undergrowth__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5825,'endoparasitic',NULL,'Three limbs ripped off, infected with a deadly parasite, you must save your research. Drag yourself through the corridors of a secret research lab on a remote asteroid, fight off horribly mutated monsters, inject countless syringes of vaccines, and survive at all costs.','2022/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2124780/Endoparasitic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5826,'powerslave_exhumed',NULL,'PowerSlave Exhumed is a KEX Engine port of the classic console game perfectly blending both the PlayStation & Saturn versions','2022/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1678430/PowerSlave_Exhumed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5827,'war_thunder_-_av-8b_night_attack_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game War Thunder on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3209390/War_Thunder__AV8B_Night_Attack_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5828,'compound',NULL,'COMPOUND is a randomized rogue-lite, free-roaming shooter for VR veterans. Duck and dodge around enemy fire in a tough-as-nails retro FPS with multiple locomotion options. Download the demo below!','2022/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/615120/COMPOUND/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5829,'kill_la_kill_-if',NULL,'All looks and feels of the original anime series remodelled with 3D Cell-look technology! Perform devastating combos, destroy your opponents, and relive the anime with your favourite scenes from the original series, revived with stunning visuals and cinematics!','2019/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/922500/KILL_la_KILL_IF/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5830,'fish_fear_me',NULL,'A top-down action roguelite about catching fish, fighting them, selling their bones, and catching more fish. Upgrade your boat and weapons, hunt down sea monster bounties, delve into eldritch mysteries, and try to pay off a cosmic debt millennia in the making.','2025/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3000120/FISH_FEAR_ME/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5831,'the_nameless:_slay_dragon',NULL,'The Nameless: Slay Dragon is a gamebook-adventure flavored turn-based RPG In short - how to slay the immensely powerful and cunning evil dragon? You will play as a young man having a bloody feud with a dragon, and face powerful, sinister and tricky enemies with friends....','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2410170/The_Nameless_Slay_Dragon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5832,'tomb_raider:_legend',NULL,'Follow Lara Croft down a path of discovery as she travels the globe to remote, exotic locales in search of one of history\'s greatest artifacts, that unleashes unwelcome figures from Lara\'s mysterious past.','2006/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/7000/Tomb_Raider_Legend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5833,'automobilista_2_-_adrenaline_pack_pt1',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2518750/Automobilista_2__Adrenaline_Pack_Pt1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5834,'move_or_die',NULL,'Move or Die is an absurdly fast-paced 4-player local and online party game where the mechanics change every 20 seconds! It\'s THE friendship-ruining game.','2016/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/323850/Move_or_Die/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5835,'granny_remake',NULL,'Granny Remake is a gripping horror game where you must escape from a sinister house chased by a cunning and relentless Granny. Choose from multiple escape routes: drive away in a car, call the police, or unlock the main door','2023/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2110820/Granny_Remake/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5836,'underrail:_heavy_duty',NULL,'This content requires the base game UnderRail on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2604510/Underrail_Heavy_Duty/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5837,'vanity_fair:_the_pursuit',NULL,'Players follow Lu Yuan through important stages of his life and experience his growth trajectory from youth to maturity. It will take you to relive those decisions that you have never tried to make in reality, and feel the different life brought about by each choice.','2024/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2758000/Vanity_Fair_The_Pursuit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5838,'tattletail',NULL,'It’s Christmas 1998. The world’s most annoying toy just came out, and yours won’t stay in his box. Can you stop Tattletail from getting you in trouble before the bloodthirsty Mama Tattletail hunts you down? Story-driven first person horror. New DLC Included!','2016/12/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/568090/Tattletail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5839,'without_a_dawn',NULL,'Without a Dawn is a dark, psychological, and philosophical visual horror novel featuring hauntingly beautiful pseudo-ASCII art.','2025/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3145620/Without_a_Dawn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5840,'moonscars',NULL,'Push the limits of your combat skills, and master new abilities to progress through an unforgiving nonlinear 2D world. Face off against the relentless darkness that seeks to destroy you. In Moonscars, every death is a lesson learnt—and as you overcome each challenge, new truths will be revealed.','2022/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1374970/Moonscars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5841,'true_fear:_forsaken_souls_part_2',NULL,'True Fear: Forsaken Souls Part 2 is the sequel to one of the best rated horror escape games, acclaimed for its story and the atmosphere of horror mystery.','2018/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/935580/True_Fear_Forsaken_Souls_Part_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5842,'cards,_the_universe_and_everything',NULL,'Cards, the Universe and Everything is a unique trading card game with almost limitless possibilities: Dinosaurs, Norse gods, blue-footed boobies, Samurai, volcanoes, even the god particle. With the universe’s thingamabobs and endless strategies, are you ready for this gloriously bonkers game?','2025/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3411830/Cards_the_Universe_and_Everything/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5843,'aero_gpx',NULL,'Aero GPX is an anti-gravity racer focused on high velocity, flight, machine-to-machine combat, and responsive controls that are easy to pick up but difficult to master. Fight for the best position possible with high speeds, risky maneuvers, and visceral attacks!','2024/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2160360/Aero_GPX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5844,'obscure_ii_(obscure:_the_aftermath)',NULL,'Two years ago, a group of young teenagers found themselves trapped inside their school. They suffered through the longest night of their lives, chased by abominable creatures created by their principal. Some of them survived that terrible night, while others perished.','2008/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/254480/Obscure_II_Obscure_The_Aftermath/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5845,'cassette_beasts:_pier_of_the_unknown',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cassette Beasts on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2202291/Cassette_Beasts_Pier_of_the_Unknown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5846,'in_stars_and_time_artbook',NULL,'This content requires the base game In Stars And Time on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3588130/In_Stars_and_Time_Artbook/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5847,'civilization_v_-_civ_and_scenario_double_pack:_spain_and_inca',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier\'s Civilization® V on Steam in order to play.','2010/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/16867/Civilization_V__Civ_and_Scenario_Double_Pack_Spain_and_Inca/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5848,'the_ouroboros_king',NULL,'The Ouroboros King combines the strategic depth of chess with the build variety and replayability of roguelikes. Assemble a formidable army, discover powerful relics, and buy surprising gadgets to defeat the Coven.','2023/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2096510/The_Ouroboros_King/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5849,'neo_scavenger',NULL,'NEO Scavenger is a game where you must survive in the wasteland long enough to figure out who you are. Each turn, you must decide where to go, how to scavenge for supplies, and how to deal with anything and anyone you encounter.','2014/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/248860/NEO_Scavenger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5850,'crymachina',NULL,'CRYMACHINA is an action RPG where mechanical girls strive to survive in a post-apocalyptic world to become “Real Humans\'\'. But what does it mean to be a “Real Human”?','2023/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2258500/CRYMACHINA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5851,'the_walking_dead:_no_man\'s_land',NULL,'Step into the dangerous world of The Walking Dead: No Man\'s Land. Lead survivors in turn-based strategy battles, manage resources, and make tough choices to ensure their survival. Fight walkers, build your base, and face endless dangers.','2024/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2936310/The_Walking_Dead_No_Mans_Land/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5852,'roguebook',NULL,'Embrace the challenge of a roguelike deckbuilder with unique mechanics from the developers of Faeria and Richard Garfield, creator of Magic: The Gathering™. Build a team of two heroes, unleash powerful combos and defeat the legends of the Roguebook!','2021/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1076200/Roguebook/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5853,'orwell:_keeping_an_eye_on_you',NULL,'Big Brother has arrived - and it’s you. Investigate the lives of citizens to find those responsible for a series of terror attacks. Information from the internet, personal communications and private files are all accessible to you. But, be warned, the information you supply will have consequences.','2016/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/491950/Orwell_Keeping_an_Eye_On_You/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5854,'from_the_darkness',NULL,'From the darkness is a psychological horror game with a scary atmosphere, the game takes place in an old Soviet abandoned apartment.','2021/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1517340/From_The_Darkness/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5855,'spirit_hunter:_death_mark_ii',NULL,'Spirit Hunter: Death Mark II is a suspense-horror game set at a prestigious academy. When rumors circulate about supernatural occurrences at the famed Konoehara Academy in Tokyo’s H City, it’s up to the head of the Kujou family, also known as the “Spirit Doctor,” to take on the case.','2024/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2080800/Spirit_Hunter_Death_Mark_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5856,'who_wants_to_be_a_millionaire',NULL,'Put your general knowledge to the test in « Who wants to be a millionaire? », the official game!','2020/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1356240/Who_Wants_To_Be_A_Millionaire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5857,'aerofly_rc_10_-_rc_flight_simulator',NULL,'Aerofly RC 10 is the ultimate radio controller flight simulator for beginners and experts alike.','2023/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2394350/aerofly_RC_10__RC_Flight_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5858,'conan_exiles_-_jewel_of_the_west_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Conan Exiles on Steam in order to play.','2018/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/887120/Conan_Exiles__Jewel_of_the_West_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5859,'mount_&_blade:_with_fire_&_sword',NULL,'The standalone expansion for Mount & Blade! With Fire & Sword builds and expands upon the highly regarded combat system from Mount & Blade: Warband. Firearms have been introduced to the battlefield.','2011/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/48720/Mount__Blade_With_Fire__Sword/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5860,'the_light_brigade',NULL,'An award-winning roguelike VR shooter with realistic gunplay & immersive light magic. Ascend the ranks of The Light Brigade to unlock new weapons, upgrades, classes, and abilities as you fight to restore light to the darkness.','2023/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1579880/The_Light_Brigade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5861,'overlord™',NULL,'Prepare to be tempted, mesmerized and thrilled, become the Overlord, how corrupt you become depends on how you handle any given situation. Your actions impact the game world. With incredible power at your disposal and a team of evil minded minions to do your evil bidding, how will you resist the temptation to be incredibly despotic?','2007/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/11450/Overlord/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5862,'arzette:_the_jewel_of_faramore',NULL,'A NEW interactive animated adventure! In this action-adventure game, Arzette must explore the Kingdom of Faramore, slay fearsome foes, acquire powerful items, discover secrets, assist colorful characters, and defeat the evil Daimur!','2024/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1924780/Arzette_The_Jewel_of_Faramore/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_123'),(5863,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_assault_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2020/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1330480/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Assault_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5864,'five_nights_at_freddy\'s:_help_wanted_-_curse_of_dreadbear',NULL,'This content requires the base game FIVE NIGHTS AT FREDDY\'S: HELP WANTED on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1126200/Five_Nights_at_Freddys_Help_Wanted__Curse_of_Dreadbear/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5865,'wizdom_academy',NULL,'Headmaster, your academy awaits: Recruit young students and shape them into mighty wizards. Build, manage and customize your castle, manage your resources and send your squads in expedition to expand your school\'s prestige and influence.','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2668000/Wizdom_Academy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5866,'ancient_warfare_3',NULL,'Dive into a sandbox full of action and customization! Choose from different game modes like deathmatch, conquest, king of the hill, zombie survival and many more. Create your own scenarios and content in the easy to use in-game editors or use one of the 50k+ workshop items from other players...','2024/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/758990/Ancient_Warfare_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5867,'nine_sols_digital_art_book',NULL,'This content requires the base game Nine Sols on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3362590/Nine_Sols_Digital_Art_Book/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5868,'farming_simulator_17',NULL,'Take on the role of a modern farmer in Farming Simulator 17! Explore farming possibilities in a new North American environment. Drive over 250 farming vehicles and equipment from over 75 manufacturers, including new brands such as Challenger, Fendt, Valtra or Massey Ferguson.','2016/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/447020/Farming_Simulator_17/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5869,'romancing_saga_-minstrel_song-_remastered',NULL,'Romancing SaGa -Minstrel Song- returns as a stunning remastered edition, with new gameplay elements and quality of life features! Get ready for an even deeper story and an even more thrilling adventure!','2022/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1793030/Romancing_SaGa_Minstrel_Song_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5870,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_new_england_mountains',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2167630/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__New_England_Mountains/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5871,'420blazeit_2:_game_of_the_year_-=dank_dreams_and_goated_memes=-_[#wow/11_like_and_subscribe]_poggerz_edition',NULL,'Prepare yourself for the long awaited sequel. You will blaze it. You will no scope. You will see some weird af s*** as you fight and xD in 999fps to destroy the Illuminati and rescue the memes. Are you ready for 420BLAZEIT 2????!!1','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2624280/420BLAZEIT_2_GAME_OF_THE_YEAR_Dank_Dreams_and_Goated_Memes_wow11_Like_and_Subscribe_Poggerz_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5872,'sorcery!_parts_1_and_2',NULL,'An epic adventure in a land of monsters, traps and magic. Journey across the deadly Shamutanti Hills and through Kharé, Cityport of Thieves. Armed with your sword and over fifty spells with weird and wonderful effects, embark on a narrative adventure of a thousand choices where every one is remembered.','2016/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/411000/Sorcery_Parts_1_and_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5873,'lost_light',NULL,'Join the \"Firefly\" task force and unveil the sinister plot behind the exclusion zone in the world of Lost Light. You could either scavenge for supplies or go out with guns blazing and plunder. Survive the brutal domain where danger lurks in every corner!','2022/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1797880/Lost_Light/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5874,'remnant_ii®_-_the_dark_horizon',NULL,'This content requires the base game REMNANT II® on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2384075/Remnant_II__The_Dark_Horizon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5875,'arranger:_a_role-puzzling_adventure',NULL,'Find your way in a world of breezy, thoughtful puzzles, along a charming journey of self-discovery.','2024/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2596420/Arranger_A_RolePuzzling_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5876,'ggst_additional_character_15_-_venom',NULL,'This content requires the base game GUILTY GEAR -STRIVE- on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2524080/GGST_Additional_Character_15__Venom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5877,'american_truck_simulator_-_steering_creations_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2016/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/520550/American_Truck_Simulator__Steering_Creations_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5878,'joy_of_programming_-_software_engineering_simulator',NULL,'Use real Python code to automate machines, robots, drones and more: Program self-driving vehicles; crack passwords; apply machine learning; automate logistics; use image processing to guide missiles. Gain real coding skills and solve exciting bite-sized programming challenges.','2025/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2216770/JOY_OF_PROGRAMMING__Software_Engineering_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5879,'founder\'s_pack_upgrade:_master',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pax Dei on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2919400/Founders_Pack_Upgrade_Master/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5880,'rugby_league_team_manager_4',NULL,'The fourth instalment of “The Number 1 Rugby League Management Game”. The biggest leagues and competitions. Take full control of managing your own Rugby League club. Training schedules, coaches, physios, scouting, finances, sponsors and more. MUCH MORE!','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2837720/Rugby_League_Team_Manager_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5881,'karting_superstars',NULL,'A kart racing game without weapons! This is a pure motorsport arcade racer. Compete vs very challenging AI, get on the global leaderboards and play with others online.','2023/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2503220/Karting_Superstars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5882,'duskers',NULL,'Pilot drones into derelict spaceships to find the means to survive and piece together how the universe became a giant graveyard.','2016/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/254320/Duskers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5883,'clock_tower:_rewind',NULL,'The 16-bit nightmare returns. Survive, hide, and avoid the deadly Scissorman in this legendary horror classic.','2024/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2794770/Clock_Tower_Rewind/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5884,'final_factory',NULL,'Final Factory blends factory building, spaceship design, and a rich universe to explore. Build a mega factory and command a massive fleet against the hostile local aliens. Discover new technologies and unlock the secrets of an ancient civilization as you explore an infinite cosmos.','2024/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1383150/Final_Factory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5885,'demons_roots',NULL,'In a final struggle for survival, demonkind again invaded the human world. However, the world they return to after years in the darkness isn\'t the same as it once was...','2023/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1933660/Demons_Roots/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5886,'ubermosh',NULL,'UBERMOSH is an arcade game about cutting bullets with a sword, in a gun-filled cyberpunk mosh pit.','2015/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/357070/UBERMOSH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5887,'sailing_era',NULL,'Every voyage is a journey of \"Sailing & Beyond\" in Sailing Era! Navigate your fleet and sail for fun; run a business; have a romantic encounter in the tavern; capture pirates amid intense battle; explore inland for treasure... Experience foreign culture, make novel discoveries, and sail away!','2023/1/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2161440/Sailing_Era/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5888,'topple_tactics',NULL,'Topple Tactics is a physics-based multiplayer tower defense game where one huge player controls the map by placing towers and using abilities, whilst the little players level up their stats and equipment to reach the end of the map and defeat the huge player!','2023/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2390260/Topple_Tactics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5889,'higurashi_when_they_cry_hou_-_ch._5_meakashi',NULL,'Higurashi When They Cry is a sound novel. The music, backgrounds and characters work together to create a world that is the stage of a novel for the user to read. They laugh and cry and get angry. The user takes the point of view of the protagonist to experience the story.','2017/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/577480/Higurashi_When_They_Cry_Hou__Ch_5_Meakashi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5890,'yarimono_~_dlc_1',NULL,'This content requires the base game Yarimono on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3171570/Yarimono__DLC_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5891,'supertaxcity',NULL,'A new sensation!? City-building × Roguelike game *Super Tax City*. Choose and place your favorite facilities from randomly drawn options! The combinations are endless! Create a profitable city that\'s uniquely yours!','2025/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2881800/SuperTaxCity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5892,'terraformers:_megastructures',NULL,'This content requires the base game Terraformers on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2779050/Terraformers_Megastructures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5893,'planet_coaster_-_classic_rides_collection',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Coaster on Steam in order to play.','2019/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1061350/Planet_Coaster__Classic_Rides_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5894,'sonic_mania_-_encore_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sonic Mania on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/845640/Sonic_Mania__Encore_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5895,'star_wars™_-_x-wing_alliance™',NULL,'A neutral family fights for its business - and its survival - and is swept up in the struggle against the encroaching Empire. You must defy the strong-arm tactics of a rival family who will stop at nothing to destroy your trading company.','1999/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/361670/STAR_WARS__XWing_Alliance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5896,'bratz™:_flaunt_your_fashion',NULL,'The Bratz Pack has arrived– show the world your passion for fashion in a globe-trotting adventure to become the best style reporter!','2022/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2088340/Bratz_Flaunt_your_fashion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5897,'the_unholy_priest',NULL,'Manage a haunted funeral service as a priest in a cursed forest. Bury or cremate the dead, perform exorcisms, fend off demonic possessions, and quiet restless souls. Survive terrifying encounters, maintain sanity, and experience the pinnacle of horror simulation in The Unholy Priest!','2025/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2925970/The_Unholy_Priest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5898,'rewrite+',NULL,'In this city built upon the ideal coexistence of civilization and the environment, Tennouji Kotarou spends his days with his friends, Kanbe Kotori and Yoshino Haruhiko. In this peaceful city, a tumultuous event shakes the foundations of Kazamatsuri once a year.','2021/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1680000/Rewrite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5899,'fishing_planet:_wild_africa_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2022/1/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1804840/Fishing_Planet_Wild_Africa_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5900,'panzer_corps_gold',NULL,'The ultimate edition of Panzer Corps, containing hundreds of scenarios and all its expansions. Panzer Corps Gold is the culmination of the wargame that has enthralled millions of fans all around the globe, and now it’s your chance to fully experience a real classic.','2011/7/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/268400/Panzer_Corps_Gold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5901,'star_knightess_aura',NULL,'Follow Aura\'s adventure as she is thrust into the fantasy world of Roya. What she initially believed to follow the conventional plotline of a \"summoned to another world\"-story quickly turns into her worst nightmare.','2025/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1827650/Star_Knightess_Aura/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5902,'tom_clancy\'s_endwar™',NULL,'Live the thrilling career of an army commander and lead your army to victory in a massive online World War III! Take control of the U.S.-led Joint Strike Force, the European Enforcers Corps, or the Russian Spetsnaz Guards Brigade in a persistent ongoing World War.','2009/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/21800/Tom_Clancys_EndWar/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5903,'stargate:_timekeepers',NULL,'Stargate: Timekeepers is a real-time tactics game where you lead a team of specialists through a story-driven campaign set in the SG-1 universe. Sneak your characters behind enemy lines, use their unique skills, craft the perfect plan to unravel a timeloop mystery, and defeat the Goa’uld threat.','2024/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1523650/Stargate_Timekeepers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5904,'jurassic_world_evolution:_claire\'s_sanctuary',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1028430/Jurassic_World_Evolution_Claires_Sanctuary/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5905,'quantum_odyssey',NULL,'Visually program real quantum computers. No code needed. Solve open-ended puzzles and rewire your brain for the logic the universe truly obeys.','2025/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2802710/Quantum_Odyssey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5906,'earth_defense_force_6_-_additional_mission_pack_2「visions_of_malice」',NULL,'This content requires the base game EARTH DEFENSE FORCE 6 on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2378088/EARTH_DEFENSE_FORCE_6__Additional_Mission_Pack_2Visions_of_Malice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5907,'the_fruit_of_grisaia',NULL,'SIX FRUITS BARE THEIR FANGS AT THE WORLD. --The academy was their orchard. In this place of learning, protected by high walls from the outside world, there arrived a single young man who\'d lost his purpose in life. He\'d lost sight of what he wanted to protect.','2015/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/345610/The_Fruit_of_Grisaia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5908,'way_of_the_samurai_3',NULL,'Honour, sacrifice, betrayal… Your choices make you who you are. How will history remember you? Choose your friends and enemies carefully in a game where every decision has far-reaching consequences, and where finishing the game is just the beginning of your journey…','2016/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/427510/Way_of_the_Samurai_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5909,'homeworld:_deserts_of_kharak',NULL,'A ground-based RTS prequel to the classic Homeworld games. Assemble your fleet and lead them to victory on the shifting sands of Kharak in this compelling strategy game for PC from Blackbird Interactive.','2016/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/281610/Homeworld_Deserts_of_Kharak/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_124'),(5910,'kingdom_rush_5:_alliance_td_-_colossal_dwarfare_campaign',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Rush 5: Alliance TD on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3368630/Kingdom_Rush_5_Alliance_TD__Colossal_Dwarfare_Campaign/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5911,'i\'m_on_observation_duty',NULL,'As an employee of a mysterious organization your job is to monitor live surveillance camera footage and spot anomalies using your sharp eyes and good memory. Can you survive the entire night shift or will you succumb into paranoia?','2018/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1046820/Im_on_Observation_Duty/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5912,'motogp™22',NULL,'Engines running: give the green light to the most immersive and authentic MotoGP™ gaming experience ever. Virtual and Real have never been so near in MotoGP™22!','2022/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1710580/MotoGP22/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5913,'star_ocean™_-_the_last_hope_-™_4k_&_full_hd_remaster',NULL,'Explore the galaxy on your quest, make allies and enemies among the alien races you encounter, and uncover a danger so great that it threatens all of creation.','2017/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/609150/STAR_OCEAN__THE_LAST_HOPE__4K__Full_HD_Remaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5914,'northgard_-_garm,_clan_of_the_hounds',NULL,'This content requires the base game Northgard on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2946220/Northgard__Garm_Clan_of_the_Hounds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5915,'warhammer_40,000:_battlesector_-_daemons_of_khorne',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2199370/Warhammer_40000_Battlesector__Daemons_of_Khorne/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5916,'garten_of_banban_7',NULL,'Explore the monster-occupied levels of Banban’s Kindergarten. Survive the dreads that reside below as you are now completely on your own. Uncover the truth behind the place, and find the whereabouts of your missing child…','2024/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2693060/Garten_of_Banban_7/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5917,'war_selection',NULL,'War Selection is a compelling RTS game featuring base building, resource extraction and warfare. Evolve from a stone age tribe to a distinct industrial nation with unique game mechanics and battle for supremacy with dozens of players on a unique procedurally generated map.','2019/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1022450/War_Selection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5918,'warspear_online',NULL,'Create your hero and dive into an epic 2D MMORPG! Explore a vast open world, conquer castles, battle in free-for-all PvP, team up in guilds, join Alliance wars, explore dungeons, and celebrate with fun in-game events!','2017/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/326360/Warspear_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5919,'tom_clancy\'s_ghost_recon®',NULL,'Eastern Europe, 2008. War has broken out on the borders of Russia and the fate of the world hangs in the balance. That\'s when the call goes out for the Ghostsan elite handful of specially trained Green Berets, armed with the latest technology and trained to use the deadliest weapons.','2001/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/15300/Tom_Clancys_Ghost_Recon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5920,'death_in_the_water_2',NULL,'Dodge and carve your way through swarms of terrifying sea creatures controlled by Death, a vicious giant mind-controlling Kraken that haunts your every move. Scavenge for hidden treasure to unlock weapons, and upgrades to help you in your fight for survival. Every dive reveals a new nightmare.','2023/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1338840/Death_in_the_Water_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5921,'7_billion_humans',NULL,'Automate swarms of office workers to solve puzzles inside your very own parallel computer made of people. A thrilling followup to the award winning Human Resource Machine. Now with more humans!','2018/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/792100/7_Billion_Humans/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5922,'atelier_totori_~the_adventurer_of_arland~_dx',NULL,'The second release in the Arland series. In a search for her missing mother, Totori tours the world of Arland as an adventurer accompanied by her friends. Use Synthesis, Explore, and Battle to fulfil requests, raise her rank as an adventurer and venture into brand new lands.','2018/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/936180/Atelier_Totori_The_Adventurer_of_Arland_DX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5923,'an_arcade_full_of_cats',NULL,'Journey through gaming history\'s time and space, while searching for adorable feline companions in \'An Arcade Full of Cats,\' the ultimate pet\'em up hidden object game.','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2368470/An_Arcade_Full_of_Cats/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5924,'jade_empire™:_special_edition',NULL,'Step into the role of an aspiring martial-arts master and follow the path of the open palm or the closed fist.','2007/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/7110/Jade_Empire_Special_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5925,'builders_of_egypt',NULL,'Builders of Egypt is a city-building economic strategy taking place in the Nile Valley. Immerse yourself in a world full of pyramids, where you will become a part of the ancient world. Create history, be history!','2025/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/818520/Builders_of_Egypt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5926,'emperor_of_the_fading_suns_enhanced',NULL,'Command intergalactic forces in this epic return of the 4X strategy classic. From planetary politics to galactic warfare, the stakes couldn’t be higher as you lead your royal house through battles on land, sea, air, and the vast reaches of space.','2025/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2799350/Emperor_of_the_Fading_Suns_Enhanced/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5927,'clue/cluedo:_classic_edition_-_the_ultimate_detective’s_package',NULL,'This content requires the base game Clue/Cluedo: Classic Edition on Steam in order to play.','2018/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/850260/ClueCluedo_Classic_Edition__The_Ultimate_Detectives_Package/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5928,'barrage',NULL,'Embrace the technological evolution and build up your hydroelectric empire in Barrage, a turn-based strategy game where players compete to build majestic dams, exploit the power of running water, and bring their faction to victory!','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2879570/Barrage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5929,'vampyr_-_the_hunters_heirlooms_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Vampyr on Steam in order to play.','2018/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/728850/Vampyr__The_Hunters_Heirlooms_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5930,'a_night_filled_with_the_sound_of_rain',NULL,'A rainy night brings you to a small bar. When you step inside, you\'re met with soothing music. Your eyes land on a beautiful woman by the counter. Get to know Michiru and share your story with her. This unforgettable evening will be etched into your memory forever.','2025/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3556740/A_Night_Filled_With_the_Sound_of_Rain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5931,'buried_stars',NULL,'A mystery adventure set at the collapse site of a live survival audition show. Trapped contestants communicate with each other—and the outside world through social media—as they wait for rescue. But as unexpected events unfold, trust begins to crack, and survival becomes far more complicated.','2021/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1025960/BURIED_STARS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5932,'the_legend_of_bum-bo',NULL,'A puzzle based deck building rogue-like prequel to The Binding of Isaac... Made of cardboard!','2019/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1148650/The_Legend_of_BumBo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5933,'super_crazy_rhythm_castle',NULL,'It’s Super Crazy Rhythm Castle, the chaotic rhythm adventure! A puzzling co-op mashup unlike anything you\'ve ever heard. Solo, or with a band of up to three friends … … Can you conquer the castle?','2023/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1812560/SUPER_CRAZY_RHYTHM_CASTLE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5934,'girls_made_pudding',NULL,'\"When there\'s nobody there to see you, you disappear.\" In Girls Made Pudding, two girls tour a series of towns that people have disappeared from.','2025/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3337210/GIRLS_MADE_PUDDING/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5935,'oddworld:_stranger\'s_wrath_hd',NULL,'You\'re the Stranger, a mysterious bounty hunter on a mission to bag the ultimate prize. And you need that money like no one else because there is something very wrong with your health and the only way to fix it is a very costly operation.','2010/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/15750/Oddworld_Strangers_Wrath_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5936,'one_step_from_eden',NULL,'Build a powerful deck, cast spells on the fly, battle evolving enemies, find game-changing artifacts, make friends or make enemies, just make it to Eden.','2020/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/960690/One_Step_From_Eden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5937,'splitgate_2_-_starter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Splitgate 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3757860/Splitgate_2__Starter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5938,'train_simulator:_south_western_main_line:_southampton_-_bournemouth_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2019/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1055333/Train_Simulator_South_Western_Main_Line_Southampton__Bournemouth_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5939,'haydee_2',NULL,'Haydee II is a third-person puzzle-shooter, but with a sexy character and a cake!','2020/11/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1444650/Haydee_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5940,'dustborn',NULL,'Ragtag crew? Check. Musical gear? Check. Tour bus and robot driver? Check. Stolen package? Check! Embark on a perilous road-trip across a Divided States of America. Use the power of words to shape relationships with your crew, get out of trouble and reach your final destination.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/721180/Dustborn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5941,'röki',NULL,'Röki is a stunning adventure set in the snowcapped wilderness. As Tove, you must explore an uncharted world of hidden legends and forgotten monsters. Solve puzzles, collect curiosities, and uncover a tale of tragic loss, as you chart your path to redemption.','2020/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1067540/Rki/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5942,'chernobylite_2:_exclusion_zone',NULL,'Explore the mysterious open world of the Chornobyl Exclusion Zone in this post-apocalyptic action RPG adventure. Shape your non-linear story, develop skills, and work with teammates and factions. Use crafted weaponry in first-person or third-person perspective.','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2075100/Chernobylite_2_Exclusion_Zone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5943,'planet_centauri',NULL,'Dive into an epic adventure alone or with friends! Explore hidden dungeons, capture and tame fearsome monsters, build and defend your village. Craft powerful weapons, master magical spells, and transform an planet into the cradle of a new civilization!','2016/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/385380/Planet_Centauri/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5944,'rock_of_ages_2:_bigger_&_boulder™',NULL,'The greatest rock-racing, tower defense, art history game is back! Like the title says, Bigger & Boulder cranks up the surrealism and gameplay with chaotic 4P multiplayer, new time periods, and improved graphics, physics, and destructibility powered by UE4 to be, well… BIGGER AND BOULDER.','2017/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/434460/Rock_of_Ages_2_Bigger__Boulder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5945,'drums_rock',NULL,'Drums Rock is an arcade drums game for VR, follow the rhythm of rock with your drums and smash the demons. Live a unique campaign: with different levels, challenges, songs and worlds. Drums Rock is an ideal game to feel like a rock hero, while destroying hordes of demons to the rhythm of rock!','2023/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1906020/Drums_Rock/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5946,'northgard_-_hræsvelg,_clan_of_the_eagle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Northgard on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2138500/Northgard__Hraesvelg_Clan_of_the_Eagle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5947,'until_you_fall',NULL,'Fantasy and synthwave collide in this physically active VR sword fighting game. Grow stronger as you battle through an awesome neon environment and strike down magic-infused monstrosities in this hack-and-slash roguelite. Fight. Fall. Rise Again.','2020/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/858260/Until_You_Fall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5948,'the_bridge_curse_road_to_salvation',NULL,'Fear, anxiety, and laughter are the symbol of youth. Experience the true paranormal haunting with your friends from the first-person perspective and stay alive. The Bridge Curse Road to Salvation is an adaptation of a horror film, includes Taiwanese urban legend and an intriguing backstory.','2022/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1611430/The_Bridge_Curse_Road_to_Salvation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5949,'above_snakes',NULL,'Piece by piece, create your own world in this relaxing Wild West-inspired worldbuilder. Craft, farm, hunt, build your base, and explore.','2023/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1589120/Above_Snakes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5950,'dungeons_4_-_not_another_multiverse',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dungeons 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3332590/Dungeons_4__Not_Another_Multiverse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5951,'summa_expeditionis',NULL,'Summa Expeditionis is a survival and strategy game set in ancient Roman Empire. Follow the career of a Roman soldier from Legionnaire to Centurion. Build and manage your camp, recruit more soldiers and face the barbarians for the glory of Rome.','2024/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2056200/Summa_Expeditionis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5952,'niche_-_a_genetics_survival_game',NULL,'Niche - a genetics survival game is a turn-based strategy game combined with simulation and roguelike elements. Shape your own species of animals based on real genetics. Keep your species alive against all odds, such as predators, climate change and spreading sickness.','2016/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/440650/Niche__a_genetics_survival_game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5953,'old_world_-_behind_the_throne',NULL,'This content requires the base game Old World on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2587420/Old_World__Behind_the_Throne/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5954,'kill_it_with_fire',NULL,'Kill It With Fire is a first-person action game about hunting spiders and causing collateral damage.','2020/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1179210/Kill_It_With_Fire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_125'),(5955,'total_annihilation',NULL,'What began as a conflict over the transfer of consciousness from flesh to machines escalated into a war which has decimated a million worlds. The Core and the Arm have all but exhausted the resources of a galaxy in their struggle for domination.','1997/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/298030/Total_Annihilation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5956,'degrees_of_separation',NULL,'Degrees of Separation is a puzzle platformer where cooperation is built into every move. Two contrasting souls, Ember and Rime, fall in love, but are separated by an enigmatic force, and must use their powers to progress through a spectacular world of fantasy and adventure.','2019/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/809880/Degrees_of_Separation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5957,'dungreed',NULL,'Dungreed is a 2D side-scrolling action game with 2D Rogue-LITE elements. You become an adventurer exploring a continuously evolving dungeon to prevent the town from being destroyed. Eliminate enemies, use a variety of weapons and magic, eat food, and defeat evil in the dungeon!','2018/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/753420/Dungreed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5958,'re-volt',NULL,'Re-Volt lets you guide one of 28 remote control cars through insane race tracks set in unusual environments. Curbs become huge walls, toys are obstacles, and everything is fair game to drive on, through, or over.','2022/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/287310/ReVolt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5959,'field_of_glory_ii',NULL,'Field of Glory II is a turn-based tactical game set during the Rise of Rome from 280 BC to 25 BC.','2017/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/660160/Field_of_Glory_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5960,'higurashi_when_they_cry_hou_-_ch.7_minagoroshi',NULL,'Higurashi When They Cry is a sound novel. The music, backgrounds and characters work together to create a world that is the stage of a novel for the user to read. They laugh and cry and get angry. The user takes the point of view of the protagonist to experience the story.','2019/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1034940/Higurashi_When_They_Cry_Hou__Ch7_Minagoroshi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5961,'brothers_in_arms:_hell\'s_highway™',NULL,'Brothers in Arms Hell\'s Highway brings the critically acclaimed squad-based WWII shooter into the next generation of gaming with amazing graphics and sound, new cutting-edge gameplay features and a totally redesigned online component.','2008/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/15390/Brothers_in_Arms_Hells_Highway/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5962,'walkabout_mini_golf:_raptor_cliff\'s',NULL,'This content requires the base game Walkabout Mini Golf VR on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3526580/Walkabout_Mini_Golf_Raptor_Cliffs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5963,'sniper_killer',NULL,'Eliminate your victims as a serial killer dubbed ‘The Sniper Killer’. Terrorize the city with your keen eye and thirst for blood while staying one step ahead of a detective hell bent on bringing you to justice.','2024/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2389570/Sniper_Killer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5964,'chuzzle_deluxe',NULL,'Drag the rows of fuzzy Chuzzles up and down, left and right, to match colors, and they\'ll pop and return to their test-tube home. Choose from four play modes and two difficulty levels.','2006/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3310/Chuzzle_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5965,'outriders_worldslayer_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game OUTRIDERS on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1785250/OUTRIDERS_WORLDSLAYER_EXPANSION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5966,'mega_man_battle_network_legacy_collection_vol._2',NULL,'The renowned Mega Man Battle Network series, which has expanded into anime and comics, is back. Volume 2 includes six action packed games from both versions of Mega Man Battle Network 4 to both versions of Mega Man Battle Network 6, plus additional features like a gallery and online play!','2023/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1798020/Mega_Man_Battle_Network_Legacy_Collection_Vol_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5967,'mr.president!',NULL,'Mr.President! Can you take a bullet for the soon to be President of the United States of America?! You play as Dick “Rock-Hard” Johnson a bulletproof man, the best bodyguard money can buy. He is sworn to protect the most hated presidential candidate of all time Ronald Rump.','2016/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/507010/MrPresident/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5968,'assassin\'s_creed®_origins_-_the_curse_of_the_pharaohs',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assassin\'s Creed® Origins on Steam in order to play.','2018/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/662351/Assassins_Creed_Origins__The_Curse_Of_The_Pharaohs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5969,'good_company',NULL,'Good Company is an in-depth management sim about building a trail-blazing tech corporation. Assemble complex production lines, manage employee logistics, and sell high-quality products on the market to become the best company in the whole county!','2022/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/911430/Good_Company/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5970,'generation_zero®_-_heavy_weapons_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Generation Zero® on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2955520/Generation_Zero__Heavy_Weapons_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5971,'monster_boy_and_the_cursed_kingdom',NULL,'A legendary series returns with a grand new adventure! Enjoy a colorful action-adventure game made alongside Ryuichi Nishizawa, creator of the original Wonder Boy in Monster World series.','2019/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/449610/Monster_Boy_and_the_Cursed_Kingdom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5972,'artifact_seeker:_resurrection',NULL,'Artifact Seeker: Resurrection is a 3D Roguelike Survivor RPG game. Aurorium continent is just a board of gods game. You can obtain artifacts by slaying enemies. How to use the power of artifacts, to play the game of gods? To end the game ? Or just be a god yourself. Artifact Seeker, Your choice.','2024/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3054610/Artifact_Seeker_Resurrection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5973,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_european_suburbia',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2017/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/715190/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_European_Suburbia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5974,'train_sim_world®_5:_expert_db_br_101_&_ic_steuerwagen_loco_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970750/Train_Sim_World_5_Expert_DB_BR_101__IC_Steuerwagen_Loco_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5975,'a_park_full_of_cats:_haunted_ride',NULL,'This content requires the base game A Park Full of Cats on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2673390/A_Park_Full_of_Cats_Haunted_Ride/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5976,'amnesia™:_memories',NULL,'You awaken to find your memories gone. To learn the truth behind your amnesia, you’ll choose from five romantic paths, each its own world. With 20+ endings, can you write the lasting love story you deserve, or will your love and life come to an end?','2015/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/359390/Amnesia_Memories/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5977,'my_free_zoo',NULL,'A small zoo needs your help! As the new manager, it\'s your job to boost business. Design the zoo of your dreams. From wolves and polar bears all the way to prehistoric beasts – the further you progress in the game, the more exotic the animals you\'ll be able to keep in your zoo. Play now and save the zoo!','2017/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/694130/My_Free_Zoo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5978,'higurashi_when_they_cry_hou_-_ch.2_watanagashi',NULL,'Higurashi When They Cry is a sound novel. The music, backgrounds and characters work together to create a world that is the stage of a novel for the user to read. They laugh and cry and get angry. The user takes the point of view of the protagonist to experience the story.','2015/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/410890/Higurashi_When_They_Cry_Hou__Ch2_Watanagashi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5979,'shadowveil:_legend_of_the_five_rings',NULL,'Train unique samurai, embark on missions, and play the cards dealt each run on an epic roguelite adventure in the Legend of the Five Rings universe. Each defeat opens new strategic skill tree options and more powerful cards to face the growing threat in the Shadowlands.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2536960/Shadowveil_Legend_of_The_Five_Rings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5980,'alan_wake\'s_american_nightmare',NULL,'A thrilling new storyline, hordes of creepy enemies, serious firepower and beautiful Arizona locations, combined with a fun and challenging new game mode!','2012/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/202750/Alan_Wakes_American_Nightmare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5981,'mount_&_blade',NULL,'Calradia is a land at war, offering great riches and even greater dangers to adventurers and mercenaries that flock to shed their blood on its soil. With courage and a strong sword, an unknown stranger can make a name as a warrior. Free-form sand-box gameplay.','2008/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/22100/Mount__Blade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5982,'one-armed_cook',NULL,'One-armed cook is a chaotic co-op cooking game for up to 4 people. Work as a team or cook on your own, set your own pace, and don\'t let the stress of a full restaurant catch up to you. The goofy physics-based aspect of the game gives this cooking game a new twist.','2022/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1977530/Onearmed_cook/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5983,'tales_&_tactics',NULL,'Roguelike Squad-based Autobattler in a Tabletop RPG setting. Draft your army, carefully equip and position your units, make important choices, and meet a colorful cast of characters as you make ready for the Grand Tournament.','2024/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1652250/Tales__Tactics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5984,'artisan_td',NULL,'Artisan TD is a puzzle-oriented Tower Defense game where you must survive by building mazes.','2024/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2224640/Artisan_TD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5985,'the_escape:_together',NULL,'The Escape: Together is a 1-3 player Online CO-OP escape horror. The paranormal creature has taken over the house. You must use everything you find to survive and make your runaway.','2023/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2242760/The_Escape_Together/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5986,'dragon_quest_treasures',NULL,'Erik and his sister Mia dream of the day they can explore the world. One night they encounter a pair of otherworldly creatures, Porcus and Purrsula, and are whisked away to Draconia - a land full of treasures just waiting to be discovered.','2023/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2021210/DRAGON_QUEST_TREASURES/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5987,'while_waiting',NULL,'Presented by the team behind critically acclaimed \"Moncage\", this is a transformative adventure exploring the art of waiting. Clear the game by doing nothing, but discover the power of acceptance and patience in numerous situations from birth to death. Learn to embrace life as you wait.','2025/2/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2449160/While_Waiting/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5988,'assassin’s_creed®_chronicles:_russia',NULL,'Join Nikolaï Orelov in his search for redemption as you journey through an iconic, propaganda art style Russia in 2.5D gameplay. • Survive the aftermath of October Revolution & travel accross Russia. • Experience the thrill of being a stealthy Assassin in an exclusive modern setting.','2016/2/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/359600/Assassins_Creed_Chronicles_Russia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5989,'pixel_art_academy:_learn_mode',NULL,'Learn how to draw pixel art with a video game! Start from zero and develop real art skills in a relaxing way. Complete interactive tutorials, draw pixel art sprites, and play the games you create. Everyone can do this!','2024/8/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2330360/Pixel_Art_Academy_Learn_Mode/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5990,'foundry_-_founder\'s_edition_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game FOUNDRY on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2830490/Foundry__Founders_Edition_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5991,'bloobs_adventure_idle',NULL,'🎮 Dive into an immersive idle RPG adventure! Level up, gather resources, craft powerful gear & Tools. Explore vast lands, conquer foes, and master your skills. Enjoy the nostalgic pixel graphics in the world of Bloobs!','2024/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2942780/Bloobs_Adventure_Idle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5992,'dragon_ball_xenoverse',NULL,'DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE revisits famous battles from the series through your custom Avatar and other classic characters. New features include the mysterious Toki Toki City, new gameplay mechanics, new animations and many other amazing features!','2015/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/323470/DRAGON_BALL_XENOVERSE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5993,'inn_tycoon',NULL,'Welcome to Inn Tycoon! Build, design, and manage your dream inn. Serve delightful meals, offer various services, and hire a stellar staff. Create a top-notch hospitality empire and become the ultimate Inn Tycoon!','2024/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2749000/Inn_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5994,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_dead_man\'s_cut',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3282900/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Dead_Mans_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5995,'ghosts_\'n_goblins_resurrection',NULL,'Watch as this nostalgic yet completely reimagined storybook world unravels before your very eyes. Taking cues from both Ghosts \'n Goblins and Ghouls \'n Ghosts and giving birth to something entirely new, Resurrection is a title worthy of its name.','2021/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1375400/Ghosts_n_Goblins_Resurrection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5996,'q_remastered',NULL,'This game \"Q REMASTERED\" is a simple puzzle game that anyone can enjoy! You can freely draw lines and shapes on the screen. The drawn object will fall down due to gravity. You will use the object to solve more than 1200 missions. Can you get the ball out of the cup? Let\'s challenge!','2023/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2246110/Q_REMASTERED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5997,'despot\'s_game:_dystopian_battle_simulator',NULL,'Guide puny humans through Despot\'s Game - a rogue-like tactics army battler. Equip your team and sacrifice them through procedural dungeons as you fight enemies, and other players!','2022/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1227280/Despots_Game_Dystopian_Battle_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5998,'plutocracy',NULL,'The business simulator Plutocracy gives you the chance to become wealthy and powerful to take control over the world. Where policy, laws, officials and people are only the chess pieces how do you play your game?','2019/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/754500/Plutocracy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(5999,'casino_simulator',NULL,'Casino Simulator Expand Your Casino From Scratch, Hire Employees, Customize It, Gamble, Enjoy Your Own Casino','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2898270/Casino_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(6000,'dysmantle:_underworld',NULL,'This content requires the base game DYSMANTLE on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2004110/DYSMANTLE_Underworld/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(6001,'the_last_flame',NULL,'Recruit a party of unique heroes, fight deadly encounters, loot and craft powerful gear, discover and create thousands of synergetic builds! The Last Flame is an endless roguelike auto-battler in which you guide a righteous party of heroes through many challenges.','2025/1/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1830970/The_Last_Flame/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(6002,'rayman_raving_rabbids™',NULL,'Hordes of crazed out-of control bunnies have invaded, enslaving Rayman and forcing him to participate in \'gladiator\' style trials. Help Rayman win his freedom back by entertaining and outwitting these fury foes. Use the most hilarious fighting moves imaginable.','2007/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/15080/Rayman_Raving_Rabbids/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_126'),(6003,'higurashi_when_they_cry_hou_-_ch.6_tsumihoroboshi',NULL,'Higurashi When They Cry is a sound novel. The music, backgrounds and characters work together to create a world that is the stage of a novel for the user to read. They laugh and cry and get angry. The user takes the point of view of the protagonist to experience the story.','2018/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/668350/Higurashi_When_They_Cry_Hou__Ch6_Tsumihoroboshi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6004,'old_world_-_pharaohs_of_the_nile',NULL,'This content requires the base game Old World on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2587410/Old_World__Pharaohs_of_the_Nile/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6005,'victory_at_sea_atlantic_-_world_war_ii_naval_warfare',NULL,'Victory At Sea Atlantic transports you to the cold, unforgiving waters of the Atlantic Theatre in WWII. With a vast array of ships, planes, and subs, engage in epic sea battles & secure your place in history. Victory At Sea Atlantic is the ultimate naval warfare experience.','2025/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1674830/Victory_at_Sea_Atlantic__World_War_II_Naval_Warfare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6006,'axis_&_allies_1942_online',NULL,'Play the classic board game, Axis & Allies 1942 2nd Edition! Act as WWII powers in a turn-based strategy game that fits your screen and schedule— get notified on your turn and command armies at your own pace! Team up with friends, challenge the world’s top players, or go solo vs. A.I.','2021/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/898920/Axis__Allies_1942_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6007,'disneyland_adventures',NULL,'Disneyland Adventures allows fans of all ages to explore Disneyland park, enjoy adventures based on 18 popular attractions, engage in 100 challenging quests, and interact with 35 beloved characters. Disneyland Adventures is your ticket to the magical world of Disneyland right in your living room.','2018/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/630610/Disneyland_Adventures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6008,'underrail:_expedition',NULL,'This content requires the base game UnderRail on Steam in order to play.','2019/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/694330/Underrail_Expedition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127');
INSERT INTO `table_games` VALUES (6009,'stubbs_the_zombie_in_rebel_without_a_pulse',NULL,'Be the Zombie. Kick A** and Take Brains.','2005/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/7800/Stubbs_the_Zombie_in_Rebel_Without_a_Pulse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6010,'shadow_warrior_classic_redux',NULL,'The definitive version of the cult classic shooter, Shadow Warrior Classic Redux features remastered visuals and two massive expansion packs. Corporations rule every facet of life in a near-future Japan and employ Shadow Warriors, one-man armies of unparalleled skill, to protect their power and forcefully remove all opposition.','1997/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/225160/Shadow_Warrior_Classic_Redux/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6011,'red_orchestra_2:_heroes_of_stalingrad_with_rising_storm',NULL,'Contains full Rising Storm content as well!','2011/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/35450/Red_Orchestra_2_Heroes_of_Stalingrad_with_Rising_Storm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6012,'civilization_v_-_scrambled_continents_map_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier\'s Civilization® V on Steam in order to play.','2013/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/235584/Civilization_V__Scrambled_Continents_Map_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6013,'wolfquest_anniversary_-_building_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game WolfQuest: Anniversary Edition on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1970630/WolfQuest_Anniversary__Building_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6014,'conan_exiles_-_treasures_of_turan_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Conan Exiles on Steam in order to play.','2019/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1040930/Conan_Exiles__Treasures_of_Turan_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6015,'before_we_leave',NULL,'Before We Leave is a city building game set in a cozy corner of the universe. Nurture your Peeps and their surroundings while rebuilding and rediscovering civilisation. Settle new lands and planets while avoiding hungry Space Whales.','2021/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1073910/Before_We_Leave/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6016,'real_vr_fishing',NULL,'🎣 Dive into the Ultimate Real VR Fishing Experience! Explore stunningly realistic environments with Real VR Fishing. Relax in 40 beautiful maps and expand your adventure with DLC packs, unlocking 95 fishing locations. Discover 150+ fish species in the base game and over 300 species with DLC.','2024/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1266470/Real_VR_Fishing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6017,'outlanders',NULL,'Outlanders is a town-building strategy game, populated by hard-working, charming folk in search of a simpler life. Some just want to survive off the land, others want to create amazing things.','2023/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1766720/Outlanders/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6018,'let\'s_build_a_zoo:_dinosaur_island',NULL,'This content requires the base game Let\'s Build a Zoo on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1903410/Lets_Build_a_Zoo_Dinosaur_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6019,'hololive_treasure_mountain',NULL,'Stack the Love of Captain Marine! A Simple yet Exciting 3D Physics Puzzle Game!','2024/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2972990/hololive_Treasure_Mountain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6020,'grandpa_high_on_retro',NULL,'Grandpa goes on a third person, action adventure killing rampage, with his grandson after his smoking session was interrupted by a phone call.','2025/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2967320/Grandpa_High_on_Retro/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6021,'wandering_sword_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Wandering Sword, but does not include the base game.','2023/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2590060/Wandering_Sword_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6022,'the_house_of_da_vinci_vr',NULL,'As Leonardo\'s apprentice, you will solve puzzles, uncover inventions, and search for hidden objects in 16th-century Florence. Use a unique device to glimpse the past and unravel mysteries. Encounter war machines, intricate lockboxes, and immersive room escapes inspired by Da Vinci\'s genius.','2024/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2948310/The_House_of_Da_Vinci_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6023,'dcs:_mosquito_fb_vi',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1724230/DCS_Mosquito_FB_VI/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6024,'gamemaker_professional',NULL,'This content requires the base application GameMaker on Steam in order to run.','2023/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2626900/GameMaker_Professional/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6025,'hellblade:_senua\'s_sacrifice',NULL,'From the makers of Heavenly Sword, Enslaved: Odyssey to the West, and DmC: Devil May Cry, comes a warrior’s brutal journey into myth and madness. Set in the Viking age, a broken Celtic warrior embarks on a haunting vision quest into Viking Hell to fight for the soul of her dead lover.','2017/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/414340/Hellblade_Senuas_Sacrifice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6026,'the_diary',NULL,'Several diaries gradually reveal the thrilling story of a missing case; after multiple deductions, are the answers in the past or present? With frequent plot twists, you never know which is the truth and which is the unexpected; in a dense fog, time buries the past, but the marks remain.','2025/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2343880/The_Diary/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6027,'century:_age_of_ashes',NULL,'Century: Age of Ashes is a free-to-play multiplayer dragon shooter. Master a growing roster of classes and dragons, compete in intense arena battles and rule the skies in fast-paced aerial combats.','2021/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/918570/Century_Age_of_Ashes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6028,'helskate',NULL,'Helskate is a skateboarding action roguelite. Grind, perform tricks, and chain combos to power up your attacks to slay the monsters of Vertheim. Combine unique weapons and gear to suit your playstyle as you fight, die, and upgrade your abilities to come back to this labyrinth over and over again!','2025/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1295630/Helskate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6029,'the_wild_at_heart',NULL,'Wield an ever-growing herd of quirky creatures to rebuild broken paths, battle perilous beasts, and solve peculiar puzzles in a rich, interconnected world. Join two young runaways as they unravel the mysteries of a lost realm in this nostalgic storybook fantasy!','2021/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1093290/The_Wild_at_Heart/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6030,'snezhinka:sentinel_girls2',NULL,'A fast-paced shooter with simple controls. Enhance your character by purchasing cards and hold the line against waves of hostile mechs as an employee of a private military company.','2024/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2608350/SnezhinkaSentinel_Girls2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6031,'fallout_4_nuka-world',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fallout 4 on Steam in order to play.','2016/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/490650/Fallout_4_NukaWorld/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6032,'instants',NULL,'Assemble a chronological puzzle of family photos to piece together their most cherished memories. Uncover the family\'s life story as you arrange the pictures in the correct order within carefully crafted albums. Unleash your creativity and decorate them with multiple scrapbooking tools!','2025/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2948560/Instants/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6033,'spellcaster_university',NULL,'Develop a prestigious university of mages. Build rooms, train your students, fight orcs, slay the bureaucrats, manage your budget... a director\'s life is not a quiet one.','2021/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/895620/Spellcaster_University/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6034,'food_delivery_simulator',NULL,'Live the life of a food delivery driver. Deliver orders, earn money, upgrade your vehicle, explore a vast city, and make way to your success. Dive into a realistic daily adventure and level up to become the best delivery driver.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2986370/Food_Delivery_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6035,'[chilla\'s_art]_the_convenience_store_|_夜勤事件',NULL,'The Convenience Store | 夜勤事件 is a J-horror game about a college girl on a night shift.','2020/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1228520/Chillas_Art_The_Convenience_Store/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6036,'the_ninja_saviors:_return_of_the_warriors',NULL,'Alluring audio! Pixel art perfection! Beat-em up beauty! Discover how hard a 32,000kg ninja hits with The Ninja Saviours!','2023/7/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2288070/The_Ninja_Saviors_Return_of_the_Warriors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6037,'imperiums:_greek_wars',NULL,'Unique combination of turn-based 4X and historical grand strategy with a mythological twist. Explore the ancient world and build a world leading civilization. Survive, expand, conquer... and win!','2020/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1183470/Imperiums_Greek_Wars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6038,'decarnation',NULL,'Where do you run to when your demons reside within you? Decarnation is a pixel art adventure/action puzzle game with a horrific story inspired by some of the most influential films and novels in the genre. Dive into a breathtaking thriller where nightmares and dreams intertwine…','2023/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1672310/Decarnation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6039,'natsu-mon:_20th_century_summer_kid',NULL,'A circus troupe comes to Yomogi Town, a rural town in Japan situated between mountains and the ocean. As the son of the circus ringmaster, enjoy a special summer filled with wholesome adventures!','2024/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2839280/NatsuMon_20th_Century_Summer_Kid/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6040,'grimoire_groves',NULL,'Join the witches in their quest to restore the Grimoire Groves! Master magic, grow cute plant creatures and discover the mystery of the Rainbow Socks in this cozy, rogue-lite dungeon crawler.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1830430/Grimoire_Groves/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6041,'ruiner',NULL,'RUINER is a brutal action shooter set in the year 2091 in the cyber metropolis Rengkok. A wired psychopath lashes out against a corrupt system to uncover the truth and retrieve his kidnapped brother under the guidance of a secretive hacker friend.','2017/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/464060/RUINER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6042,'sanctum_2',NULL,'Sanctum 2 is the sequel to the world’s first Tower Defense/FPS hybrid game. Pick from four unique character classes and embark on a mission to protect the oxygen-producing Cores from hordes of deadly aliens who are threatened by their existence.','2013/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/210770/Sanctum_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6043,'redout:_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Redout is a tribute to the old racing monsters such as F-Zero, WipeOut, Rollcage, and POD. It is designed to be an uncompromising, fast, tough and satisfying driving experience, soaked in that vertigo that stands at the core of the arcade racing genre.','2016/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/517710/Redout_Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6044,'field_of_glory:_kingdoms_-_rajas_and_tribes',NULL,'This content requires the base game Field of Glory: Kingdoms on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3297820/Field_of_Glory_Kingdoms__Rajas_and_Tribes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6045,'lunistice',NULL,'Lunistice is a 3D Platformer created with simple & fun gameplay and a cute PS1/SEGA Saturn inspired artstyle in mind. Take the role of Hana the Tanuki and jump and fight through her dreams!','2022/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1701800/Lunistice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6046,'myst_iii:_exile',NULL,'The story of Myst continues in this third entry of the series, originally released in 2001. Return to this strange and wondrous universe, where books become portals into worlds, and where the lessons of the past may yet hold meaning for today...','2001/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/925930/Myst_III_Exile/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6047,'cyanotype_daydream_-the_girl_who_dreamed_the_world-',NULL,'Kaito wakes to find himself in a strange room, with no memories, and a taciturn girl named Yonagi by his side. Upon learning of his role, he immerses himself into three wondrous dream worlds with her. When all three stories meet a bitter end, Kaito recovers his memories, and the true story unfolds.','2022/2/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1607200/Cyanotype_Daydream_The_Girl_Who_Dreamed_the_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6048,'payday_2:_mcshay_weapon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1945682/PAYDAY_2_McShay_Weapon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6049,'bullet_girls_phantasia',NULL,'\"Bullet Girls Phantasia\" is the latest installment of the all-female third person shooter \"Bullet Girls\" series. This game is a thrilling action-packed game where cute girls shoot assault rifles and bazookas in a world filled with slimes, orcs, and dragons.','2020/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1163590/Bullet_Girls_Phantasia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6050,'desktop_cat_cafe',NULL,'Build your dream cat cafe in this tiny cozy management sim that lives at the bottom of your screen! Unlock exciting new recipes, decorate your space with our wide variety of goodies, and watch cute cat helpers take care of the cafe while you\'re doing other things.','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2978180/Desktop_Cat_Cafe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_127'),(6051,'the_abandoned_planet',NULL,'A throw-back, retro-inspired, point and click adventure with chunky and beautiful pixel art','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2014470/The_Abandoned_Planet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6052,'enigma_of_fear',NULL,'Become Mia, a paranormal detective searching for her missing father inside the Perimeter - a place that doesn\'t exist. Investigate clues like a real detective and unravel the mysteries behind the Enigma of Fear, defeating the terrible monsters who\'ll try to stop you.','2024/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1507580/Enigma_of_Fear/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6053,'hexen:_beyond_heretic',NULL,'While the Sidhe elf Corvus battled the evil forces of D\'Sparil, the remaining Serpent Riders were busy corrupting other dimensions. As a Warrior, Mage, or Cleric, you must defend your realm of Cronos from the second Serpent Rider known as Korax.','1995/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2360/Hexen_Beyond_Heretic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6054,'sledders',NULL,'Hit the backcountry in Sledders, the snowmobile simulator! Conquer deep powder with realistic physics and compete with friends in multiplayer. Are you skilled enough to reach the peak first? Jump in and prove your sledding skills!','2025/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2486740/Sledders/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6055,'railway_empire_2_-_high_voltage',NULL,'This content requires the base game Railway Empire 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2677560/Railway_Empire_2__High_Voltage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6056,'lakeview_cabin_2',NULL,'The ultimate 2D horror is back! Dive deep into the diverse world of horror movies! Nothing can prepare you for the R-rated challenges you will face!','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1291790/Lakeview_Cabin_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6057,'partisans_1941',NULL,'Partisans 1941 is a real-time tactics game with stealth elements, set on the eastern front of WW II. As an army commander behind enemy lines you gather a group of Partisans to wage guerilla warfare against the German occupants.','2020/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1227530/Partisans_1941/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6058,'the_darkside_detective',NULL,'Grab your trench coat, tune your sixth sense and join the Darkside Division as they investigate the outright bizarre, the downright dangerous and the confusing cases of Twin Lakes. Flesh-hungry tentacles, mafian zombies, and the occasional missing sock are no match for The Darkside Detective.','2017/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/368390/The_Darkside_Detective/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6059,'the_lord_of_the_rings:_return_to_moria™_digital_art_exhibition',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Lord of the Rings: Return to Moria™ on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3184500/The_Lord_of_the_Rings_Return_to_Moria_Digital_Art_Exhibition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6060,'depth',NULL,'Play as a shark or a diver in a dark aquatic world and overcome your enemies by employing cunning, teamwork, and stealth. Depth blends tension and visceral action as you team up against AI or be matched with other players in heart pounding combat.','2014/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/274940/Depth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6061,'them_and_us',NULL,'Them and Us is a classic, survival horror game with a focus on atmosphere and player immersion. Discover the truth of Alicia’s past as she descends further into her strange, unending nightmare.','2021/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/915600/Them_and_Us/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6062,'mx_vs._atv_reflex',NULL,'Think fast and hang on to your ride as you take independent control of the rider and take the ultimate test of mettle. Dual controls let you tear it up with death-defying tricks and high-flying freestyle action. Fight for traction and dig up the track to leave your mark.','2010/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/55140/MX_vs_ATV_Reflex/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6063,'warno_-_nemesis_#1_-_air_assault',NULL,'This content requires the base game WARNO on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2978640/WARNO__Nemesis_1__Air_Assault/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6064,'hero\'s_adventure_-_her_vanishing_silhouette',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hero\'s Adventure: Road to Passion on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3128600/Heros_Adventure__Her_Vanishing_Silhouette/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6065,'expansion_-_europa_universalis_iv:_cradle_of_civilization',NULL,'This content requires the base game Europa Universalis IV on Steam in order to play.','2017/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/721340/Expansion__Europa_Universalis_IV_Cradle_of_Civilization/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6066,'ys_seven',NULL,'Experience the first “modern-era” Ys game, now off the small screen for its worldwide PC debut! Features a full party system, dozens of unique combat skills, and a massive overworld to explore. Uncover the secret of the Five Great Dragons, and help Adol Christin save the day once again!','2017/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/587100/Ys_SEVEN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6067,'sail_the_seas',NULL,'Sail the Seas is a sailing, trading simulator set in 18th century, spanning whole world','2024/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2866270/Sail_the_Seas/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6068,'first_cut:_samurai_duel',NULL,'Every strike is lethal in this blood-soaked sword fighting game. Slash, clash, parry, dodge and watch limbs fly. Choose your move carefully - the first cut is also the last.','2024/1/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2193490/First_Cut_Samurai_Duel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6069,'omsi_2_add-on_studio_polygon_lite_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game OMSI 2: Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2019/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1139080/OMSI_2_AddOn_Studio_Polygon_Lite_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6070,'card_shark',NULL,'Card Shark is an adventure game full of cunning, intrigue, and delectable deceit. Enter a world where you’ll need to play your opponents better than you play your cards.','2022/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1371720/Card_Shark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6071,'djmax_respect_v_-_v_extension_iv_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2307471/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__V_EXTENSION_IV_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6072,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator_-_greenland_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ultimate Fishing® Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1055290/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator__Greenland_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6073,'gas_station_simulator_-_can_touch_this_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Gas Station Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1940030/Gas_Station_Simulator__Can_Touch_This_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6074,'fe',NULL,'Run, climb and glide your way through a dark Nordic forest and explore its living, breathing ecosystem filled with secrets and mystical creatures. Become Fe and discover a world that you will never want to leave.','2018/2/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1225580/Fe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6075,'moncage',NULL,'Moncage is a unique puzzle adventure game where you explore a fascinating world trapped inside a mysterious cube. With each face displaying a unique scene, you’ll have to leverage the illusions and discover the hidden links to solve the puzzle.','2021/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1195290/Moncage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6076,'scum_raymond_cruz_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SCUM on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2841840/SCUM_Raymond_Cruz_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6077,'bot_wars',NULL,'Bot Wars is an action RTS about managing a squad of kill-bots and their bases as you work to take over all the capture points across the map. Featuring corporate kill bot armies, ranging from a firearms and beverage manufacturer to a lovecraftian burger cult.','2021/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1672140/Bot_Wars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6078,'tropico_5',NULL,'Return to the remote island nation of Tropico and expand your Dynasty’s reign from the early colonial period to beyond the 21st Century, facing new challenges including advanced trading mechanics, technology and scientific research, as well as cooperative and competitive MULTIPLAYER.','2014/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/245620/Tropico_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6079,'snowrunner_-_mack_dual_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SnowRunner on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3398280/SnowRunner__Mack_Dual_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6080,'planet_coaster_-_adventure_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Coaster on Steam in order to play.','2017/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/768830/Planet_Coaster__Adventure_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6081,'stronghold:_definitive_edition_-_valley_of_the_wolf_campaign',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stronghold: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2728000/Stronghold_Definitive_Edition__Valley_of_the_Wolf_Campaign/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6082,'conan_exiles_-_blood_and_sand_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Conan Exiles on Steam in order to play.','2019/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1134010/Conan_Exiles__Blood_and_Sand_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6083,'life_eater',NULL,'If you don\'t sacrifice your neighbors, the world ends. Life Eater is a horror fantasy kidnapping simulator where you must become intimately familiar with your targets\' lives one intrusive action at a time... and hope that the dark god you serve is even real.','2024/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2632930/Life_Eater/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6084,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_assorted_sidearms_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2064720/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Assorted_Sidearms_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6085,'sentinels_of_the_multiverse',NULL,'You\'ve never played a comic book like this! Control a team of heroes battling evil villains across dynamic environments. Play out epic comic book battles come to life in this exciting adaptation of the hit card game.','2014/12/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/337150/Sentinels_of_the_Multiverse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6086,'lego®_marvel_super_heroes_dlc:_super_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game LEGO® Marvel™ Super Heroes on Steam in order to play.','2013/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/256320/LEGO_Marvel_Super_Heroes_DLC_Super_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6087,'binary_domain',NULL,'Set in futuristic Tokyo, take control of the robotic community before they control everything!','2012/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/203750/Binary_Domain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6088,'riviera:_the_promised_land',NULL,'The long-awaited \"Riviera: The Promised Land\" is back with many added features for easier play! The story unfolds like flipping through a picture book with various variations of music color the adventure. Let\'s set out on the journey to protect Riviera from the devastation of the \"The Retribution.\"','2024/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2891280/Riviera_The_Promised_Land/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6089,'trainz_railroad_simulator_2019',NULL,'Much more than just a train driving simulator. Build, drive and operate the railroad of your dreams with Trainz Railroad Simulator 2019.','2019/1/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/553520/Trainz_Railroad_Simulator_2019/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6090,'system_shock®_2_(1999)',NULL,'\"Remember, it is my will that guided you here. It is my will that gave you your cybernetic implants, the only beauty in that meat you call a body. If you value that meat... you will do as I tell you.\" The cult classic sci-fi horror FPS-RPG has returned.','1999/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/238210/System_Shock_2_1999/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6091,'bloodrayne_2:_terminal_cut',NULL,'Enhanced and updated for modern systems, this is the definitive edition of Rayne’s second adventure: a blood-soaked rampage of vengeance against the Cult of Kagan, a group led by Rayne\'s half-siblings that seek to carry out their father Kagan\'s legacy by creating a new era of vampire supremacy.','2020/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1373550/BloodRayne_2_Terminal_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6092,'myst:_masterpiece_edition',NULL,'The classic Myst experience with point and click controls, released as a remaster to the original in 2000. Enter a world where nothing is as it seems... and adventure knows no bounds!','1999/1/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/63660/Myst_Masterpiece_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6093,'icarus:_art_deco_furniture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game ICARUS on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2686540/Icarus_Art_Deco_Furniture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6094,'firework',NULL,'An accidental fire at a funeral forces the police to re-investigate a closed case of massacre. Lin Lixun participates the re-investigation by chances. As the investigation goes deeper, the past of the victims gradually emerges. However, the case becomes more bewildering.','2021/2/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1288310/Firework/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_128'),(6095,'system_shock®_2_(1999)',NULL,'\"Remember, it is my will that guided you here. It is my will that gave you your cybernetic implants, the only beauty in that meat you call a body. If you value that meat... you will do as I tell you.\" The cult classic sci-fi horror FPS-RPG has returned.','1999/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/238210/System_Shock_2_1999/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6096,'the_brew_barons',NULL,'A tranquil world becomes ever more corrupt by the day, spoiled by a pirate organization that forcefully impose their brewing monopoly over the lands. It\'s up to you to explore, forage, craft, sell and deliver your brews to overthrow the corrupt pirate organization and restore peace.','2024/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1636710/The_Brew_Barons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6097,'myst:_masterpiece_edition',NULL,'The classic Myst experience with point and click controls, released as a remaster to the original in 2000. Enter a world where nothing is as it seems... and adventure knows no bounds!','1999/1/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/63660/Myst_Masterpiece_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6098,'icarus:_art_deco_furniture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game ICARUS on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2686540/Icarus_Art_Deco_Furniture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6099,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_bones_and_bounties',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3037030/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Bones_and_Bounties/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6100,'humankind™_-_cultures_of_oceania_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game HUMANKIND™ on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2320211/HUMANKIND__Cultures_of_Oceania_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6101,'warhammer:_vermintide_2_-_necromancer_cosmetic_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer: Vermintide 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2585640/Warhammer_Vermintide_2__Necromancer_Cosmetic_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6102,'it_steals',NULL,'AROUND EVERY CORNER. Face against stealthy antagonists that will take advantage of your expectations.','2020/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1349060/It_Steals/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6103,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_modern_lines_paint_jobs_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2579670/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Modern_Lines_Paint_Jobs_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6104,'teenage_mutant_ninja_turtles:_shredder\'s_revenge_-_radical_reptiles',NULL,'This content requires the base game Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Shredder\'s Revenge on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2925190/Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_Shredders_Revenge__Radical_Reptiles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6105,'the_sims™_4_cool_kitchen_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2015/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235756/The_Sims_4_Cool_Kitchen_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6106,'horticular:_build_a_garden,_attract_wildlife',NULL,'Horticular is a relaxing garden builder where you grow plants, design habitats and attract a wide range of wildlife. Help the gnome Keepers restore a barren wasteland with magical powers and populate it with adorable critters. Reclaim nature from a looming corruption and create your perfect garden.','2024/7/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1928540/Horticular_Build_a_Garden_Attract_Wildlife/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6107,'warhammer:_chaosbane',NULL,'In a world ravaged by war and dominated by magic, you must rise up to face the Chaos hordes. Playing solo or with up to four players in local or online co-op, choose a hero from four character classes and prepare for epic battles wielding some of the most powerful artefacts of the Old World.','2019/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/774241/Warhammer_Chaosbane/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6108,'looking_up_i_see_only_a_ceiling',NULL,'A short psychological adventure about a stressed girl who wants to explore her ceiling.','2023/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1742930/Looking_Up_I_See_Only_A_Ceiling/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6109,'creepy_shift:_roadside_diner',NULL,'A broke young man takes on the night shift at a roadside diner. In the glow of the blood moon, routine tasks turn into a fight for survival. First-person horror based on a dark creepypasta with a set of rescue rules.','2024/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2955590/Creepy_Shift_Roadside_Diner/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6110,'despot\'s_game:_dystopian_battle_simulator',NULL,'Guide puny humans through Despot\'s Game - a rogue-like tactics army battler. Equip your team and sacrifice them through procedural dungeons as you fight enemies, and other players!','2022/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1227280/Despots_Game_Dystopian_Battle_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6111,'we_are_football_2024',NULL,'Welcome to WE ARE FOOTBALL 2024! Dive into the world of football like never before. Choose an existing club or start your own. Manage either men or women, lead your club to new heights, and become the next manager legend!','2024/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1951410/WE_ARE_FOOTBALL_2024/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6112,'bloodrayne_2:_terminal_cut',NULL,'Enhanced and updated for modern systems, this is the definitive edition of Rayne’s second adventure: a blood-soaked rampage of vengeance against the Cult of Kagan, a group led by Rayne\'s half-siblings that seek to carry out their father Kagan\'s legacy by creating a new era of vampire supremacy.','2020/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1373550/BloodRayne_2_Terminal_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6113,'yet_another_killing_game',NULL,'You wake up in a house, alone with two beautiful girls... But no one is allowed to leave until one of you DIES. Why is this happening? What is the purpose of this “killing game”? But most importantly...WHO SHOULD DIE?!','2025/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3217970/Yet_Another_Killing_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6114,'the_happyhills_homicide_2:_out_for_blood',NULL,'He is back. Once again take control of mass serial killer John Wade. Six years later, the infamous Pale Grin resurrects from the grave to terrorize the broken town of Happyhills. This time he has more on his mind than simple killing.','2025/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3489670/The_Happyhills_Homicide_2_Out_For_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6115,'retro_gadgets',NULL,'Retro Gadgets is a sandbox where you build, code, and customize gadgets inspired by old-school electronics.','2022/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1730260/Retro_Gadgets/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6116,'the_sims™_4_fitness_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2017/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235750/The_Sims_4_Fitness_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6117,'akiba\'s_trip:_undead_＆_undressed',NULL,'In Tokyo’s popular ”Electric Town” district, Akihabara, vampires called “Synthisters” walk among us. You must identify and dispose of them the only way you know how – by engaging them in hand-to-hand combat in order to strip them of their clothes so their bodies melt away in the sunlight.','2015/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/333980/AKIBAS_TRIP_Undead__Undressed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6118,'supremacy:_1914',NULL,'Take over the control of one of the mighty nations during the times of World War 1 in the biggest WW1 strategy game of all time. Conquer provinces, forge alliances and build up your economy in real-time on persistent maps. Build experimental weapons of World War 1 and become the one true superpower!','2019/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/979920/Supremacy_1914/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6119,'ghosts_\'n_goblins_resurrection',NULL,'Watch as this nostalgic yet completely reimagined storybook world unravels before your very eyes. Taking cues from both Ghosts \'n Goblins and Ghouls \'n Ghosts and giving birth to something entirely new, Resurrection is a title worthy of its name.','2021/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1375400/Ghosts_n_Goblins_Resurrection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6120,'zefyr:_a_thief\'s_melody',NULL,'In a colorful archipelago, play as a young thief studying at the Guild. Investigate kidnappings, steer clear of roaming pirates or fight them. Sail the ocean on a cute turtle and climb every island. Cure sick animals, and find the truth during this feel-good journey. Made by a dreamer solo dev.','2025/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1344990/Zefyr_A_Thiefs_Melody/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6121,'tower_of_kalemonvo',NULL,'Crawl to the top of the TOWER OF KALEMONVO, a hardcore isometric ARPG with randomly generated levels meant for fans of slower paced action games. Fight cultists and monsters, scavenge for magical loot, learn powerful spells and fully customize your stats and skills!','2025/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2351860/Tower_of_Kalemonvo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6122,'drone_perspective',NULL,'Real-time dynamic tactics with the strong focus on squad positioning and collaboration. Connect to the warzone from your home PC and orchestrate modern military operations from the Drone Perspective.','2025/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2730700/DRONE_PERSPECTIVE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6123,'surviving_mars:_deluxe_upgrade_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Surviving Mars on Steam in order to play.','2018/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/801710/Surviving_Mars_Deluxe_Upgrade_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6124,'anno_1602_history_edition',NULL,'Relive the beginnings of the Anno® series with Anno® 1602 History Edition, updated and optimized for current computers.','2024/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2820130/Anno_1602_History_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6125,'obduction',NULL,'A new sci-fi adventure from Cyan, the creators of Myst. Abducted far across the universe, you find yourself on a broken alien landscape with odd pieces of Earth. Explore, uncover, solve, and find a way to make it home.','2016/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/306760/Obduction/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6126,'combat_mission_shock_force_2',NULL,'The latest title in the famous Combat Mission franchise of wargames, now on Steam. Shock Force 2 brings you to a hypothetical conflict in Syria between the forces of NATO and the Syrian Army. Play either on WeGo or Real Time in an incredibly detailed and realistic 1:1 tactical simulation.','2020/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1369370/Combat_Mission_Shock_Force_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6127,'caribbean_legend_-_ships_pack:_part_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Caribbean Legend on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3549890/Caribbean_Legend__Ships_Pack_Part_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6128,'breachers™',NULL,'Supports cross-play with Quest and PSVR2 player base. Breachers™ is a tactical 5v5 VR FPS. Plan your assault or orchestrate your defense as a team through intense close-quarters combat. Climb, vault, rappel, swing, shoot and strategize your way to victory in stunning environments.','2023/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1922010/Breachers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6129,'star_wars™:_tie_fighter_special_edition',NULL,'The Imperial Navy is called upon to eradicate the last of the rebellion and restore law and order. As an Imperial navy starfighter pilot, you will safeguard imperiled lives thoughout the galaxy. Join the Emperor\'s cause in eliminating the Rebel uprising as the Empire strikes back!','1994/7/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/355250/STAR_WARS_TIE_Fighter_Special_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6130,'astlibra_gaiden:_the_cave_of_phantom_mist',NULL,'This content requires the base game ASTLIBRA Revision on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2669360/ASTLIBRA_Gaiden_The_Cave_of_Phantom_Mist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6131,'the_abandoned_planet',NULL,'A throw-back, retro-inspired, point and click adventure with chunky and beautiful pixel art','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2014470/The_Abandoned_Planet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6132,'arma_3_karts',NULL,'This content requires the base game Arma 3 on Steam in order to play.','2014/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/288520/Arma_3_Karts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6133,'rune_coliseum',NULL,'A deck-building roguelike game with unique semi-real-time combat system. Step into the shoes of an ancient gladiator and do your best to survive in the coliseum. Combine various skills and equipment, develop your own fighting style, and defeat all the enemies to become the next champion!','2024/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2360210/Rune_Coliseum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6134,'the_sims™_4_book_nook_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2278351/The_Sims_4_Book_Nook_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6135,'age_of_empires_ii:_definitive_edition_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition, but does not include the base game.','2020/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1228810/Age_of_Empires_II_Definitive_Edition_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6136,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator_-_amazon_river_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ultimate Fishing® Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1106170/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator__Amazon_River_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6137,'hacknet_-_labyrinths',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hacknet on Steam in order to play.','2017/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/521840/Hacknet__Labyrinths/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6138,'star_dynasties',NULL,'Take the reins of a feudal dynasty in a divided galaxy following the destruction of earth. Star Dynasties is a turn based, procedurally generated narrative of human drama and personal politics, mixed with a light empire management layer. Your choices. Your legacy.','2021/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1194590/Star_Dynasties/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6139,'anno_1800_-_seat_of_power',NULL,'This content requires the base game Anno 1800 on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1247680/Anno_1800__Seat_of_Power/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6140,'placid_plastic_duck_-_rooftop_one_percent',NULL,'This content requires the base game Placid Plastic Duck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3223500/Placid_Plastic_Duck__Rooftop_One_Percent/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6141,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_the_prodigal_daughter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2021/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1576410/Hunt_Showdown_1896__The_Prodigal_Daughter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_129'),(6142,'new_super_lucky\'s_tale',NULL,'Jump, burrow, and tail swipe your way to victory in this love letter to classic 3D platformers!','2020/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1038300/New_Super_Luckys_Tale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6143,'enjoy_the_diner',NULL,'Why not enjoy the diner? The moon is as full as it\'ll ever be, and there\'s even a drink fountain.','2023/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2336980/Enjoy_the_Diner/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6144,'deceive_inc.',NULL,'Go undercover as the world’s greatest spies in this tense multiplayer game of subterfuge. Disguise as anyone, deploy an arsenal of high-tech gadgets or neutralize the competition. As long as you extract with the objective, no trick is too dirty when you work for DECEIVE INC.','2023/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/820520/Deceive_Inc/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6145,'throne_and_liberty_–_talandre_celebration_pack:_gold',NULL,'This content requires the base game THRONE AND LIBERTY on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3487990/THRONE_AND_LIBERTY__Talandre_Celebration_Pack_Gold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6146,'galaxy_idle_clicker',NULL,'Embark on an interstellar journey with Galaxy Idle Clicker! Conquer galaxies, upgrade your spaceship, and face off against a myriad of enemy ships. With engaging minigames, powerful upgrades, GIC delivers an unparalleled idle space adventure. Join the cosmic conquest today and dominate the universe!','2024/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2962810/Galaxy_Idle_Clicker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6147,'late_shift',NULL,'Late Shift is a high stakes FMV crime thriller. Forced into a brutal London heist, your choices matter in this interactive cinematic experience with adaptable storylines that lead to one of seven conclusions. Your decisions are you.','2017/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/584980/Late_Shift/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6148,'warhammer_40,000:_battlesector_-_blood_angels_elites',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1718640/Warhammer_40000_Battlesector__Blood_Angels_Elites/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6149,'dungeon_dreams_2',NULL,'Roguelike Romance JRPG. Create your character and get a room at the Magic Academy dormitory, to win the Challenge of the Infinite Dungeon! A game with town building, relationships, and many quests with alternate routes.','2024/2/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1843470/Dungeon_Dreams_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6150,'promenade',NULL,'Go on an adventure in a world packed with secrets helped by your friend, a poulp with many abilities. Explore, solve puzzles, wander across dungeons, blast through races and much more in this cute game inspired by the best 3D platformers','2024/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1781260/Promenade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6151,'crime_boss:_rockay_city_-_hielo_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crime Boss: Rockay City on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3634240/Crime_Boss_Rockay_City__Hielo_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6152,'somerville',NULL,'In the wake of catastrophe find the means to make your family whole again.','2022/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1671410/Somerville/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6153,'city_bus_manager_-_holiday_resorts_&_sightseeing_buses',NULL,'This content requires the base game City Bus Manager on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3218520/City_Bus_Manager__Holiday_Resorts__Sightseeing_Buses/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6154,'onimusha:_warlords',NULL,'Capcom’s riveting samurai adventure returns! This version includes the original game’s intense swordplay and dramatic revenge story, plus improved controls, widescreen display, a new soundtrack, and more. Experience this enhanced version of the best-selling action-adventure classic!','2019/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/761600/Onimusha_Warlords/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6155,'soul_dossier',NULL,'Soul Dossier is a multiplayer game based on Oriental culture (5vS1). The game is based on a variety of traditional Oriental cultures, including five elements, eight diagrams and folklore.','2021/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1520470/Soul_Dossier/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6156,'judge_dredd:_dredd_vs._death',NULL,'Welcome to Mega-City One, a city of over 400 million people - every one of them a potential criminal. It is the third decade of the 22nd Century, unemployment is widespread, boredom is universal and only the Judges can prevent total anarchy. Empowered to dispense instant justice, they are Judge, Jury and Executioner all in one.','2005/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3710/Judge_Dredd_Dredd_vs_Death/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6157,'astrea:_six-sided_oracles',NULL,'Astrea is a DICE-deck-building roguelike that flips the script on deckbuilders by using dice instead of cards and a unique dual “damage” system: Purification vs Corruption. Build a dice pool strong enough to purify Astrea\'s out-of-control corruption and save the Star System.','2023/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1755830/Astrea_SixSided_Oracles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6158,'m.a.r.s.',NULL,'MARS is a Free-To-Play Third Person Shooter set in an evolving sci-fi world. From the hilarious Headhunter mode, to Huge Mecha vs Mecha battles, to fully customizable loadouts; whether Co-op or PvP, M.A.R.S. has something for everyone. Kill, Die, Repeat.','2021/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/314430/MARS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6159,'train_sim_world®_5:_db_br_218_diesel_loco_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970700/Train_Sim_World_5_DB_BR_218_Diesel_Loco_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6160,'petit_island',NULL,'Welcome to the beautiful and tropical Petit Island! Relive your grandpaw\'s youthful adventures by exploring the island and meeting all the unique islanders in this heartwarming open-world narrative exploration game. Preserve his memories before they fade away.','2024/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1744970/Petit_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6161,'expansion_-_crusader_kings_ii:_holy_fury',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings II on Steam in order to play.','2018/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/756660/Expansion__Crusader_Kings_II_Holy_Fury/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6162,'the_walking_dead:_michonne_-_a_telltale_miniseries',NULL,'The Walking Dead: Michonne - A Telltale Miniseries stars the iconic, blade-wielding character from Robert Kirkman\'s best-selling comic books.','2016/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/429570/The_Walking_Dead_Michonne__A_Telltale_Miniseries/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6163,'impossible_creatures_steam_edition',NULL,'Impossible Creatures is a 3D RTS game that pits the player against an evil villain. Using Earth’s most formidable animals as building blocks, the player must create an army of genetically-altered mutant monsters in a titanic struggle to protect an unsuspecting world.','2003/1/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/324680/Impossible_Creatures_Steam_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6164,'chocolate_factory_simulator',NULL,'Enter the world of steam and sugar and become a master chocolatier in Chocolate Factory Simulator. Craft gourmet chocolate for your customers in your steampunk workshop with the help of your automaton assistant Nougat.','2025/1/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2822370/Chocolate_Factory_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6165,'cozy_grove_-_new_neighbears_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cozy Grove on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1895480/Cozy_Grove__New_Neighbears_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6166,'urtuk:_the_desolation',NULL,'Urtuk is an open world, tactical turn-based RPG in a low-fantasy setting. Guide your band of adventurers through the ruins of an ancient world. Recruit new followers, loot the corpses of your fallen foes, and do your best to survive in this harsh and unforgiving realm.','2021/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1181830/Urtuk_The_Desolation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6167,'crosscode:_a_new_home',NULL,'This content requires the base game CrossCode on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1517030/CrossCode_A_New_Home/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6168,'horizon_chase_turbo',NULL,'Thrilling arcade racing game, inspired by the super-fun-straight-to-the-point classic racing games from the 90s.','2018/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/389140/Horizon_Chase_Turbo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6169,'tannenberg',NULL,'Experience authentic First World War action with 64 player battles of maneuver on the Eastern Front. Grab your rifle, ready your sabre and keep your gas mask close as you prepare to play a part in one of the most significant conflicts in history!','2019/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/633460/Tannenberg/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6170,'beach_invasion_1944',NULL,'Defend the fortified beach during D-day against invading forces in this WW2 FPS game as the enemy attacks you with troops, tanks, planes and more! Use the iconic WWII weapons such as MG42, Flak88 and Panzers, prepare your defenses with mines, explosives and bonuses!','2022/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2209680/Beach_Invasion_1944/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6171,'between_horizons_–_a_sci-fi_detective_adventure',NULL,'Between Horizons is a narrative 2.5D sci-fi detective adventure. 33 years into the Zephyr\'s journey, its mission is suddenly jeopardized. Can you find the culprit before it\'s too late? Experience an enthralling story set in a semi-open world that branches and ends based on your choices.','2024/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1921980/Between_Horizons__A_SciFi_Detective_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6172,'planet_coaster_-_studios_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Coaster on Steam in order to play.','2018/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/821090/Planet_Coaster__Studios_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6173,'hand_simulator',NULL,'There are many different levels where you can play with spinners, plunge into the subtleties of handling weapons, milk a cow, take part in a Mexican duel with your friends, have a good time fishing, play chess or simply chat in an anonymous club.','2017/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/657200/Hand_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6174,'car_mechanic_simulator_2015',NULL,'New cars, new tools, new options, more parts and much more fun in the next version of Car Mechanic Simulator! Take your wrench! Create and expand your auto repairs service empire. Car Mechanic Simulator 2015 will take you behind the scenes of daily routine in car workshop.','2015/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/320300/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2015/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6175,'sonic_adventure_2:_battle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sonic Adventure 2 on Steam in order to play.','2012/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/217900/SONIC_ADVENTURE_2_BATTLE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6176,'yohane_the_parhelion_-blaze_in_the_deepblue-',NULL,'Yohane the Parhelion is an official spin-off of \"Love Live! Sunshine\". Yohane\'s fantasy world sets the stage for a 2D metroidvania in \"Yohane the Parhelion: Blaze in the Deepblue\"!','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2404370/YOHANE_THE_PARHELION_BLAZE_in_the_DEEPBLUE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6177,'king\'s_bounty:_warriors_of_the_north',NULL,'King’s Bounty: Warriors of the North is the next chapter in the cult RPG/adventure saga.','2012/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/203350/Kings_Bounty_Warriors_of_the_North/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6178,'the_axis_unseen',NULL,'A heavy metal horror game where you hunt monsters from folklore in an open world. Discover enhanced sense powers, elemental arrows, magic and journals from people who came before you. Almost all of the UI exists in the world itself. Created by one of the developers of Skyrim and Fallout.','2024/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1807810/The_Axis_Unseen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6179,'slave_zero_x',NULL,'Slave Zero X is a stylish 2.5D character action game set in the biopunk world of Slave Zero (1999). Run & Slash your way through a dystopian future in this character action game which will resonate with fans of Devil May Cry, Strider, and Guilty Gear.','2024/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1903910/Slave_Zero_X/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6180,'the_red_lantern',NULL,'The Red Lantern is a narrative, dog sledding game about survival. You play as the Musher who, along with her team of 5 sled dogs, must find her way home. Care for your dogs, discover their stories, and learn how to navigate the unknowns of the Alaskan wilderness and prepare for your new life.','2021/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1053710/The_Red_Lantern/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6181,'songs_of_conquest_-_supporter_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Songs of Conquest on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1979540/Songs_of_Conquest__Supporter_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6182,'i\'m_on_observation_duty_4',NULL,'A spot the difference -type of puzzle horror game about monitoring live surveillance camera footage and spotting anomalies. Anomalies range from furniture movement to intruders. Fix anomalies by filing reports. You will need sharp eyes and good memory. The goal is to survive the entire night.','2021/12/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1730360/Im_on_Observation_Duty_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6183,'planet_coaster_-_vintage_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Coaster on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/891230/Planet_Coaster__Vintage_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6184,'industrial_annihilation',NULL,'The next major game in the Planetary Annihilation universe, Industrial Annihilation combines the iconic real-time strategy of the beloved Annihilation games with deep factory-building to deliver a blend of genres unlike any you’ve experienced before.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1796720/Industrial_Annihilation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6185,'final_fantasy_type-0™_hd',NULL,'FINAL FANTASY TYPE-0 HD brings an immersive world, memorable characters and the production value known of the series, together with high quality gameplay and storytelling truly worthy of the FINAL FANTASY name.','2015/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/340170/FINAL_FANTASY_TYPE0_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6186,'aliens:_fireteam_elite_-_wey-yu_armoury',NULL,'This content requires the base game Aliens: Fireteam Elite on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1643351/Aliens_Fireteam_Elite__WeyYu_Armoury/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6187,'how_2_escape',NULL,'How 2 Escape is an escape-simulation game where two players will need to cooperate on asymmetrical gameplay and devices. \"Talk together. Help each other.\" will be your new motto to survive in How 2 Escape.','2023/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2264140/How_2_Escape/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_130'),(6188,'i\'m_on_observation_duty_4',NULL,'A spot the difference -type of puzzle horror game about monitoring live surveillance camera footage and spotting anomalies. Anomalies range from furniture movement to intruders. Fix anomalies by filing reports. You will need sharp eyes and good memory. The goal is to survive the entire night.','2021/12/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1730360/Im_on_Observation_Duty_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6189,'planet_coaster_-_vintage_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Coaster on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/891230/Planet_Coaster__Vintage_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6190,'dream_tactics',NULL,'Dream Tactics is a GBA-styled strategy RPG with cunning card combos and deep character customization. Pick your party, manage cards to create unique playstyles, and outsmart hordes of pillows in turn-based combat to save the Dream World from its inevitable collapse.','2024/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1897650/Dream_Tactics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6191,'industrial_annihilation',NULL,'The next major game in the Planetary Annihilation universe, Industrial Annihilation combines the iconic real-time strategy of the beloved Annihilation games with deep factory-building to deliver a blend of genres unlike any you’ve experienced before.','2024/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1796720/Industrial_Annihilation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6192,'final_fantasy_type-0™_hd',NULL,'FINAL FANTASY TYPE-0 HD brings an immersive world, memorable characters and the production value known of the series, together with high quality gameplay and storytelling truly worthy of the FINAL FANTASY name.','2015/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/340170/FINAL_FANTASY_TYPE0_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6193,'aliens:_fireteam_elite_-_wey-yu_armoury',NULL,'This content requires the base game Aliens: Fireteam Elite on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1643351/Aliens_Fireteam_Elite__WeyYu_Armoury/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6194,'how_2_escape',NULL,'How 2 Escape is an escape-simulation game where two players will need to cooperate on asymmetrical gameplay and devices. \"Talk together. Help each other.\" will be your new motto to survive in How 2 Escape.','2023/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2264140/How_2_Escape/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6195,'condemned:_criminal_origins',NULL,'What twists the mind of an ordinary human into a serial killer?','2006/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/4720/Condemned_Criminal_Origins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6196,'everspace™_-_encounters',NULL,'This content requires the base game EVERSPACE™ on Steam in order to play.','2017/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/709150/EVERSPACE__Encounters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6197,'cities:_skylines_ii_-_creator_pack:_dragon_gate',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines II on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2945640/Cities_Skylines_II__Creator_Pack_Dragon_Gate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6198,'lakeview_cabin_2',NULL,'The ultimate 2D horror is back! Dive deep into the diverse world of horror movies! Nothing can prepare you for the R-rated challenges you will face!','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1291790/Lakeview_Cabin_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(61