019/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/886820/Nelke__the_Legendary_Alchemists_Ateliers_of_the_New_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6205,'payday_2:_hostile_takeover_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2215010/PAYDAY_2_Hostile_Takeover_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6206,'card_shark',NULL,'Card Shark is an adventure game full of cunning, intrigue, and delectable deceit. Enter a world where you’ll need to play your opponents better than you play your cards.','2022/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1371720/Card_Shark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6207,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_the_prescient_night',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2014790/Hunt_Showdown_1896__The_Prescient_Night/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6208,'many_nights_a_whisper',NULL,'A short interactive essay on dreams, pressure, and expectations. Take part in an ancient ritual where one shot determines the fate of a generation.','2025/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3541130/Many_Nights_a_Whisper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6209,'kingdom_come:_deliverance_–_ost_atmospheres_&_additionals',NULL,'This is additional content for Kingdom Come: Deliverance, but does not include the base game.','2019/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1052530/Kingdom_Come_Deliverance__OST_Atmospheres__Additionals/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6210,'a_total_war_saga:_troy_-_amazons',NULL,'This content requires the base game A Total War Saga: TROY on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1188790/A_Total_War_Saga_TROY__Amazons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6211,'sea_of_solitude',NULL,'When humans get too lonely, they turn into monsters… Set sail across a beautiful and evolving world of darkness and light, and discover what it means to be human.','2019/7/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1225590/Sea_of_Solitude/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6212,'minecraft_legends',NULL,'Discover the mysteries of Minecraft Legends, a new action strategy game. Explore a gentle land of rich resources and lush biomes on the brink of destruction. The ravaging piglins have arrived, and it’s up to you to inspire your allies and lead them in strategic battles to save the Overworld!','2023/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1928870/Minecraft_Legends/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6213,'the_walking_dead:_no_man\'s_land',NULL,'Step into the dangerous world of The Walking Dead: No Man\'s Land. Lead survivors in turn-based strategy battles, manage resources, and make tough choices to ensure their survival. Fight walkers, build your base, and face endless dangers.','2024/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2936310/The_Walking_Dead_No_Mans_Land/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6214,'warframe:_1999_cyte-09_bullseye_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warframe on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3327780/Warframe_1999_Cyte09_Bullseye_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6215,'heavy_cargo_-_the_truck_simulator',NULL,'Transport oversized cargo in a variety of missions across a 175km² open world. Drive customisable, highly detailed trucks through dynamic weather and day and night. The official cooperation with Gruber Logistics allows you to get behind the wheel of real-life heavy cargo transports.','2024/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1474930/Heavy_Cargo__The_Truck_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6216,'chop_goblins',NULL,'The Chop Goblins are loose, chopping their way through time itself in their ravenous quest for cheese. And the chop will not stop.','2022/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1935660/Chop_Goblins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6217,'tom_clancy\'s_rainbow_six®_siege_-_the_safari_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six® Siege X on Steam in order to play.','2016/1/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/417461/Tom_Clancys_Rainbow_Six_Siege__The_Safari_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6218,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator_-_moraine_lake_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ultimate Fishing® Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2018/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/970640/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator__Moraine_Lake_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6219,'metal:_hellsinger_-_purgatory',NULL,'This content requires the base game Metal: Hellsinger on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2386360/Metal_Hellsinger__Purgatory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6220,'endless_alice',NULL,'Endless Alice is a third-person action-adventure game combining Roguelite elements, anime aesthetics, and endless possibilities. Choose characters with unique combat styles and embark on adventures! Play solo or with friends in cooperative challenges for up to 4 players!','2025/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1425000/Endless_Alice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6221,'stray_gods:_orpheus',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stray Gods: The Roleplaying Musical on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2807170/Stray_Gods_Orpheus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6222,'s.t.a.l.k.e.r.:_clear_sky_-_enhanced_edition',NULL,'S.T.A.L.K.E.R.: Clear Sky is the prequel chapter of the Legends of the Zone Trilogy. With the ability to directly influence the balance of power through Faction Wars, step into the boots of Scar — a seasoned mercenary, able to somehow survive deadly Emissions.','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2427420/STALKER_Clear_Sky__Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6223,'internet_cafe_simulator_2',NULL,'Internet Cafe Simulator 2 is an extremely comprehensive and detailed internet cafe business simulation game.','2022/1/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1563180/Internet_Cafe_Simulator_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6224,'ghostpia_season_one',NULL,'\"In my dreams, I can get out. In my dreams, I can fit in.\" \'ghostpia\' mixes the adorable art style of an illustrated book with glitches-and-noise effects. There are no choices to be made. There\'s only a lonely girl in a ghost town and her story full of mystery, friendhood...and a bit of violence.','2023/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2192620/ghostpia_Season_One/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6225,'kao_the_kangaroo',NULL,'Inspired by the golden age of 3D Platformers, Kao The Kangaroo returns in a whole new adventure! Embark on an epic journey, master magical gloves, explore lush environments and take Kao through his most grand tale yet!','2022/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1370140/Kao_the_Kangaroo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6226,'ruined_nurse',NULL,'Explore the hospital by Thwarting the creatures that are trying to stop you and solving puzzles. Successfully install the internet and surprise customer...','2024/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2785280/Ruined_Nurse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6227,'garden_story',NULL,'Embark on a wholesome adventure to save The Grove! Forage resources, combat the invasive Rot, and restore the community. Relax and enjoy the fruits of your labor in this charming action-RPG starring a grape.','2021/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1062140/Garden_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6228,'across_the_obelisk:_the_wolf_wars',NULL,'This content requires the base game Across the Obelisk on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2325780/Across_The_Obelisk_The_Wolf_Wars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6229,'nebulock',NULL,'Nebulock is a short bullet-hell game with intense gameplay, where the player must destroy bosses made of blocks, collect resources and upgrade his spaceship.','2025/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3444480/Nebulock/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6230,'super_bomberman_r_2',NULL,'The latest title of the party battle games series SUPER BOMBERMAN R! With new adventures and game modes, it has the largest content volume in the series\' history!','2023/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1913740/SUPER_BOMBERMAN_R_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6231,'void_destroyer_2',NULL,'Start with nothing... End with everything! All you have is a basic ship, barely fit for combat, with it you\'ll start your journey and empire. A open world space sandbox, inspired by and expanding the classics.','2020/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/369530/Void_Destroyer_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6232,'slave_zero_x',NULL,'Slave Zero X is a stylish 2.5D character action game set in the biopunk world of Slave Zero (1999). Run & Slash your way through a dystopian future in this character action game which will resonate with fans of Devil May Cry, Strider, and Guilty Gear.','2024/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1903910/Slave_Zero_X/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_131'),(6233,'first_class_trouble',NULL,'First Class Trouble is a party game where players must work together and against each other to survive a disaster. The goal is to shut down a deadly A.I. Some players are impostors, secretly playing as human-looking killer robots intent on betraying the other players.','2021/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/953880/First_Class_Trouble/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6234,'destiny_2:_forsaken_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Destiny 2 on Steam in order to play.','2018/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1090150/Destiny_2_Forsaken_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6235,'alex_hill:_whispers_at_white_oak_inn',NULL,'A young woman died near the White Oak Inn. Now, her spirit is roaming around, and an employee is receiving strange letters. What dark secrets wait to be found? The clock is ticking and you, as Alex Hill, must uncover the truth before it’s too late.','2025/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2859200/Alex_Hill_Whispers_at_White_Oak_Inn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6236,'void_sails',NULL,'VOID SAILS is a single-player adventure where you captain a flying ship across uncharted space. Sail through mysterious worlds, battle powerful foes, and make story-defining choices. Uncover dark secrets in a game where every discovery could bring you closer to the truth—or to madness.','2025/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3367690/Void_Sails/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6237,'liminalcore',NULL,'Explore and admire while navigate through eerie, surreal environments inspired by the Backrooms lore. Explore this uncanny world lost in time and get lost in the otherworldly architecture in a world where reality bends and your sanity is tested.','2024/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3107900/Liminalcore/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6238,'wonder_boy:_the_dragon\'s_trap',NULL,'Boasting beautiful, hand-drawn animations and a re-orchestrated soundtrack, the cult classic returns with a unique blend of exploration, action, and adventure!','2017/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/543260/Wonder_Boy_The_Dragons_Trap/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6239,'9th_dawn_remake',NULL,'Rediscover the magic of the 9th Dawn series with this complete re-imagining of the original game. Venture into a massive 2.5D open world. Explore 45 new dungeons in single-player or online/local co-op, craft weapons, raise pets, play a deck-building card game, and take down the Castle of Maltyr!','2024/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1550180/9th_Dawn_Remake/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6240,'zexion',NULL,'Seek out new weapons and equipment to delve deeper into the dangerous world of Cypher-X72! Be warned, you aren\'t the only one seeking the forbidden technology known as Zexion! It will take cunning and valor to succeed in this action-packed sci-fi adventure!','2025/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3392510/Zexion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6241,'kallax',NULL,'Kallax is a chaotic furniture-building 2 to 6 players co-op game in which only one player can read the instruction manual at a time. Experience what should have been a one person\'s job and lose friendships forever.','2023/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1818280/KallaX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6242,'black_skylands',NULL,'Become the captain of an airship and explore the world of the skies, gather resources and build powerful weapons, uncover ancient secrets and fight beneath your ship\'s sails.','2023/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1143810/Black_Skylands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6243,'space_architect',NULL,'Design your dream space station in Space Architect! Master the power of automation or \'hire\' an army of crewmates to handle your ever-growing production. Mine asteroids, fabricate goods, and engage in interstellar trade to pay off the menacing Big Evil Corp. Will you thrive in the vastness of space?','2024/11/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1403740/Space_Architect/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6244,'disgaea_5_complete',NULL,'The nefarious Overlord Void Dark seeks to enslave countless Netherworlds...and only the young demon Killia can stop him! Assemble your tenacious army of rebels and unleash vengeance in this hell-raising adventure! The stakes are high, the damage cap is higher, and the destruction is limitless!','2018/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/803600/Disgaea_5_Complete/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6245,'happy_sheepies',NULL,'Happy Sheepies is a relaxing sheep farming game that includes some Crafting and Business Management elements with its simple Drag & Drop gameplay. Meet the needs of your sheepies, craft and sell your products, and grow your business!','2024/7/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2860450/Happy_Sheepies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6246,'rogue_company',NULL,'Join 20+ million players in Rogue Company, the ultimate third-person tactical action shooter! Become an agent of Rogue Company and wield powerful weapons, high-tech gadgets, and game-changing abilities. Accept the mission and jump into a variety of 4v4 and 6v6 game modes. Play FREE today!','2021/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/872200/Rogue_Company/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6247,'voidtrain_-_supporter_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Voidtrain on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2348780/Voidtrain__Supporter_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6248,'bonds_of_yachiyo',NULL,'At sunset, darkness swallowed everything. Bonds of Yachiyo is a Japanese horror tale of two best friends getting separated in a strange version of their own world. Escape from evil spirits, explore and solve puzzles as you try to unravel the truth and reunite the two friends!','2025/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2922180/Bonds_of_Yachiyo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6249,'astroneer:_glitchwalkers_-_deluxe_cosmetic_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game ASTRONEER on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3315070/ASTRONEER_Glitchwalkers__Deluxe_Cosmetic_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6250,'keplerth',NULL,'Welcome to Keplerth! Try to survive on a hostile alien planet in this 2D sandbox RPG, where you can choose to live alone or fight side by side with your friends in the online multiplayer mode. Survive, build, farm, fight, and explore your way to victory in this open-world adventure!','2022/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/747200/Keplerth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6251,'bad_2_bad:_apocalypse',NULL,'The open-world survival role-playing game \"Bad 2 Bad: Apocalypse\" tells the story of Delta Team and his comrades as they work to rebuild a world devastated by humans and their race turned into zombies.','2024/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2782610/Bad_2_Bad_Apocalypse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6252,'penko_park',NULL,'Snap pictures of spooky creatures & explore an abandoned wildlife park.','2020/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/852090/Penko_Park/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6253,'granny_3',NULL,'You have to escape Granny and Grandpa...You have five days...','2021/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1707550/Granny_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6254,'nordic_ashes:_remnants_of_corruption',NULL,'This content requires the base game Nordic Ashes: Survivors of Ragnarok on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3636780/Nordic_Ashes_Remnants_of_Corruption/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6255,'acres',NULL,'ACRES is a small strategy simulation game about growing crops for evolving market demands. Build a farm, one acre at a time, to create a prosperous enterprise. Upgrade equipment, optimize harvests, and nurture the soil against increasing time pressure. How long can you keep the farm operating?','2023/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2460920/ACRES/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6256,'strategic_command:_american_civil_war',NULL,'For the first time in the series’ history, Strategic Command will be taking you to the 19th century battlefields of the American Civil War. You will control the armies, research, production and diplomatic policy of either the Union or the Confederacy during a time of innovation and dramatic battles.','2022/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1966130/Strategic_Command_American_Civil_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6257,'car_mechanic_simulator_2015',NULL,'New cars, new tools, new options, more parts and much more fun in the next version of Car Mechanic Simulator! Take your wrench! Create and expand your auto repairs service empire. Car Mechanic Simulator 2015 will take you behind the scenes of daily routine in car workshop.','2015/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/320300/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2015/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6258,'arcania',NULL,'War covers the southern islands until it finally reaches the idyllic isle of Feshyr. You take on the role as the new nameless hero after your village has been pillaged and destroyed by paladins of the king. Seeking revenge, you soon realize that this cowardly attack did not just happen on a reckless mercenary`s whim.','2010/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/39690/ArcaniA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6259,'hitman_3_-_street_art_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game HITMAN World of Assassination on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2184790/HITMAN_3__Street_Art_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6260,'dark_souls™_iii_-_ashes_of_ariandel™',NULL,'This content requires the base game DARK SOULS™ III on Steam in order to play.','2016/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/506970/DARK_SOULS_III__Ashes_of_Ariandel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6261,'rustler_(grand_theft_horse)',NULL,'Become a medieval thug in a crazy open-world action game, full of pop-culture references. Complete insane quests, kill heroes, steal horses, fight guards, rob peasants, listen to some bard music, and much more! All packed in old-school gameplay style!','2021/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/844260/Rustler_Grand_Theft_Horse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6262,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_seaside_resorts',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1992291/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Seaside_Resorts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6263,'attack_on_toys',NULL,'Relive Your Childhood Toys comes to life! Build your Army Toys, make battle scenario, watch the Toys battling each other, and customize your play with Attack on Toys Toy Box. Command your Army Toys to fight againts another toys strategically and keep them alive during battle!','2021/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1269690/Attack_on_Toys/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6264,'baldr_sky',NULL,'Kou Kadokura, a cyber officer, seeks to uncover the truth behind the tragedy that ended his once peaceful life. A war looms, and the answers he’s looking for are locked away in him... So why can\'t he remember anything? Unravel the mysteries hidden in his lost memories through this fast-paced mech action game!','2019/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/741140/Baldr_Sky/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6265,'genesis_noir',NULL,'A noir adventure spanning time and space. When a love triangle between cosmic beings becomes a bitter confrontation, you\'ll witness a gunshot fired by a jealous god—otherwise known as The Big Bang. Jump into the expanding universe and search for a way to destroy creation and save your love.','2021/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/735290/Genesis_Noir/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6266,'overcrowd:_a_commute_\'em_up',NULL,'Design and build the most efficient metro stations known to man! Excavate. Expand. Set staff priorities. And manage the commuter flow. Overcrowd is a 2.5D management/tycoon/simulator set below the bustling city of Lubdon Town.','2020/10/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/726110/Overcrowd_A_Commute_Em_Up/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6267,'wizardry:_the_five_ordeals',NULL,'Welcome to the world of dungeon crawling! The classic dungeon crawler released back in 2006, returns to Steam with improved UI and more.','2023/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1308700/Wizardry_The_Five_Ordeals/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6268,'angels_of_death',NULL,'\"Please... kill me.\" \"Help me get outta here, and I\'ll kill you.\" ~ Angels of Death is a psychological horror-adventure game, consisting of four episodes.','2016/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/537110/Angels_of_Death/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6269,'ultimate_racing_2d_2',NULL,'The ultimate top-down racing game is back! Ultimate Racing 2D 2 includes new cars, new tracks, car/track editor, time-trial mode, improved online multiplayer and career mode, new settings and more.','2023/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1285230/Ultimate_Racing_2D_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6270,'speedway_challenge_2025',NULL,'Feel speedway emotions thanks to realistic riding physics. Play online mode with friends or local in career mode, league mode, challenges, tournament and quick matches. Are you ready for the challenge?','2025/4/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3497380/Speedway_Challenge_2025/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6271,'vox_machinae',NULL,'Strap yourself into the cockpit of a robot seven times taller than a Tyrannosaurus Rex and prepare to do battle in Vox Machinae: the ultimate giant robot combat action-simulator for both VR and standard screens.','2022/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/334540/Vox_Machinae/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6272,'crafty_survivors',NULL,'All heroes got corrupted! Unlock a diverse cast of crafty professionals, use their unique skills, create your own builds and defend your home by eliminating hordes of monsters. Gather materials, rebuild your village and craft your way to the origin of this malignous curse!','2025/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2137760/Crafty_Survivors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6273,'placid_plastic_duck_simulator_-_ducks_galore',NULL,'This content requires the base game Placid Plastic Duck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3295380/Placid_Plastic_Duck_Simulator__Ducks_Galore/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6274,'trackmania®_turbo',NULL,'Trackmania offers you the ultimate arcade racing universe where everything is about reaching the perfect racing time. Test your skills in over 200 tracks, experience immediate fun by challenging your friends at home (offline splitscreen) or online.','2016/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/375900/Trackmania_Turbo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6275,'anomaly_exit',NULL,'On your way home on the train, you weren\'t paying attention. Until you realised the train had been stopping at the same station over, and over again. Watch out for anomalies, and avoid the Anomaly Exit! Made for singleplayer and 2-6 co-operative multiplayer.','2024/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2232600/Anomaly_Exit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6276,'sketchy\'s_contract',NULL,'A 1-8 player co-op sci-fi looter horror game that takes place on a mysterious asteroid belt where players must complete contracts by traveling to exotic planets to kill creatures, find loot, and/or farm planetary materials that they must return to an ominous figure named Sketchy.','2024/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2823080/Sketchys_Contract/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6277,'rogue_heroes:_ruins_of_tasos',NULL,'Rogue Heroes is a topdown, roguelite adventure game inspired by the Zelda franchise. Play solo or team up with your friends to combat procedurally generated dungeons and take down the evil Titans that threaten to overwhelm the land of Tasos!','2021/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/787810/Rogue_Heroes_Ruins_of_Tasos/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6278,'conan_exiles_-_the_imperial_east_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Conan Exiles on Steam in order to play.','2018/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/760730/Conan_Exiles__The_Imperial_East_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_132'),(6279,'rogue_heroes:_ruins_of_tasos',NULL,'Rogue Heroes is a topdown, roguelite adventure game inspired by the Zelda franchise. Play solo or team up with your friends to combat procedurally generated dungeons and take down the evil Titans that threaten to overwhelm the land of Tasos!','2021/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/787810/Rogue_Heroes_Ruins_of_Tasos/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6280,'conan_exiles_-_the_imperial_east_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Conan Exiles on Steam in order to play.','2018/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/760730/Conan_Exiles__The_Imperial_East_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6281,'q_remastered',NULL,'This game \"Q REMASTERED\" is a simple puzzle game that anyone can enjoy! You can freely draw lines and shapes on the screen. The drawn object will fall down due to gravity. You will use the object to solve more than 1200 missions. Can you get the ball out of the cup? Let\'s challenge!','2023/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2246110/Q_REMASTERED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6282,'one_piece_burning_blood',NULL,'The game that all One Piece fans have been waiting for. One Piece Burning Blood is a dynamic and colourful new fighting game featuring the world’s most famous pirate: Monkey D. Luffy.','2016/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/425220/One_Piece_Burning_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6283,'while_the_iron\'s_hot',NULL,'Reforge a blacksmith’s village on an isle of the land’s finest artisans! Step into the boots of an expert smith for a crafty adventure filled with mystery and charm. Explore the land of Ellian, and prove that a hammer, anvil, and your wits can overcome any challenge.','2023/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1906830/While_the_Irons_Hot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6284,'the_sims™_4_castle_estate_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2727370/The_Sims_4_Castle_Estate_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6285,'carmageddon:_max_damage',NULL,'CARMAGEDDON: MAX DAMAGE is HERE! And it\'s the antidote to Racing Games.','2016/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/505170/Carmageddon_Max_Damage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6286,'gorn',NULL,'GORN is a ludicrously violent VR gladiator simulator, made by Free Lives, the developers of Broforce and Genital Jousting.','2019/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/578620/GORN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6287,'mk1:_ghostface',NULL,'This content requires the base game Mortal Kombat 1 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3286290/MK1_Ghostface/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6288,'placid_plastic_duck_simulator_-_so_many_ducks',NULL,'This content requires the base game Placid Plastic Duck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2579800/Placid_Plastic_Duck_Simulator__So_Many_Ducks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6289,'atomicrops',NULL,'A twin-stick, bullet-hell, roguelite where you must cultivate and defend the last farm in a post-apocalyptic wasteland. Farm mutated crops, upgrade your weapons, marry townsfolk, and kill every mutant creature that tries to invade your homestead! Yee-haw! ','2020/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/757320/Atomicrops/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6290,'the_wilds',NULL,'Become iconic animals and fight for survival in the The WILDS. Finding food, water, and shelter will be the easy part, protecting your family from hungry predators and a harsh environment will separate the weak from the strong. Welcome to a uniquely immersive animal experience...','2022/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1028590/The_WILDS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6291,'the_hong_kong_massacre',NULL,'Blast your way through the streets of Hong Kong in a fast-paced, top-down shooter. Inspired by classic action movies, The Hong Kong Massacre places you at the center of a hard-boiled revenge story, filled with brutal, cinematic shootouts and vivid underworld locations.','2019/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/741510/The_Hong_Kong_Massacre/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6292,'the_friends_of_ringo_ishikawa',NULL,'A highschool gang leader Ringo Ishikawa trying to live through his last autumn before graduation. With his best friends.','2018/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/846110/The_friends_of_Ringo_Ishikawa/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6293,'medieval:_total_war™_-_collection',NULL,'MEDIEVAL: Total War™ - Collection Edition is the compilation of the critically-acclaimed Medieval: Total War and its official expansion pack - Viking Invasion.','2002/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/345260/Medieval_Total_War__Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6294,'.hack//g.u._last_recode',NULL,'.hack//G.U. is back! This collection includes all 3 original .hack//G.U. titles, Rebirth, Reminisce, and Redemption, all fully restored and remastered. As well as an all new 4th Volume: .hack//G.U. Reconnection.','2017/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/525480/hackGU_Last_Recode/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6295,'my_lovely_empress',NULL,'My Lovely Empress is an empire management sim inspired by Asian mythology. As the Emperor of the Crimson Empire, you will build relations with neighboring rulers, balance internal factions, and ensure the prosperity of your people, all before you reap their souls to resurrect your beloved empress.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2052990/My_Lovely_Empress/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6296,'werewolf:_the_apocalypse_—_the_book_of_hungry_names',NULL,'Save the living earth with Rage and spirit! Can your shattered werewolf pack defeat a Wyrm Spirit that manifests as a lie that you want to believe?','2024/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2402280/Werewolf_The_Apocalypse__The_Book_of_Hungry_Names/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6297,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_train_stations',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2021/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1531470/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Train_Stations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6298,'red_matter',NULL,'Red Matter is a story-driven VR puzzle adventure game set during a dystopian sci-fi Cold War. Take on the role of Agent Epsilon, an astronaut of the Atlantic Union dispatched to an abandoned Volgravian moon base on a faraway planet. Your mission: to investigate a shady top secret research project.','2018/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/966680/Red_Matter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6299,'empty_shell',NULL,'EMPTY SHELL will throw you in a dark industrial environment, a secret facility on a Japanese island. Each volunteer has signed a contract for a \"recovery operation\" without being privy to too many details. A tense roguelite survival horror with a top down perspective.','2023/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2243110/EMPTY_SHELL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6300,'earth_defense_force_6_-_additional_mission_pack_1「lost_days」',NULL,'This content requires the base game EARTH DEFENSE FORCE 6 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2378087/EARTH_DEFENSE_FORCE_6__Additional_Mission_Pack_1Lost_Days/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6301,'mount_&_blade',NULL,'Calradia is a land at war, offering great riches and even greater dangers to adventurers and mercenaries that flock to shed their blood on its soil. With courage and a strong sword, an unknown stranger can make a name as a warrior. Free-form sand-box gameplay.','2008/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/22100/Mount__Blade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6302,'quest_master',NULL,'Quest Master is a dungeon maker inspired by the classics that first made us love dungeon crawling. Unleash your imagination, alone or in local co-op, to make dungeons full of puzzles, traps and monsters. Upload them for others to explore and challenge yourself with other players’ creations.','2024/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2094070/Quest_Master/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6303,'paquerette_down_the_bunburrows',NULL,'The buns... you HAVE to capture them!! Think outside the bunburrow or get outsmarted by bunnies in this cute pathfinding-based puzzle game!','2023/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1628610/Paquerette_Down_the_Bunburrows/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6304,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_brooklyn_&_queens',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2313320/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Brooklyn__Queens/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6305,'ys_i_&_ii_chronicles+',NULL,'Long, long ago, there was an ancient kingdom called Ys which prospered under the auspices of two heavenly Goddesses. Over time, the kingdom came to be known as Esteria, and its divine history was largely forgotten by all but the descendants of those who once preached the Goddesses’ will.','2013/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/223810/Ys_I__II_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6306,'iconoclasts',NULL,'Join renegade mechanic Robin and uncover the secrets of a dying planet. Explore a big world filled with intricate puzzles, interesting characters and menacing bosses in a beautiful platform adventure that tells a personal story about faith, purpose and the challenge of helping people.','2018/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/393520/Iconoclasts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6307,'fading_afternoon',NULL,'Seiji Maruyama is a middle-aged yakuza recently released from prison. Known as \"Gozuki\" (one of the demon generals from Buddhist mythology) he is the power that his oyabun counts on. But there is one thing his aniki is not taking into account: Maruyama is getting old.','2023/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1687000/Fading_Afternoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6308,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_greek_mythology_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3335300/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Greek_Mythology_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6309,'train_sim_world®_5:_schnellfahrstrecke_koln-aachen_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970110/Train_Sim_World_5_Schnellfahrstrecke_KolnAachen_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6310,'subside',NULL,'Subside is an immersive aquatic VR experience with multiple areas to explore and lifelike aquatic creatures to interact with. Crafted with unparalleled realism, it aims to replicate the nuances of real-life swimming and diving in shallow waters','2024/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2550040/Subside/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6311,'airport_ceo_-_vintage',NULL,'This content requires the base game Airport CEO on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1649580/Airport_CEO__Vintage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6312,'saga_frontier_2_remastered',NULL,'Experience two tales woven in a world of watercolor graphics.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2452080/SaGa_Frontier_2_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6313,'star_wars™_-_x-wing_special_edition',NULL,'Against the overwhelming might of the Empire stands a small but growing Rebel Alliance. Scattered resistance groups are uniting and what is needed most now are Starfighter pilots. Will you join their struggle to end this tyranny and become a hero of the Rebellion?','1994/1/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/354430/STAR_WARS__XWing_Special_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6314,'war_rats:_the_rat_em_up',NULL,'The rats told me to make this game. Run and gun alongside your troops in the Great Rat War against the vile TechnoRat armies. Recruit units, build structures, collect gear and upgrade your weapons to turn the tide of battle in your favor. The TechnoRat is all consuming!','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3167260/WAR_RATS_The_Rat_em_Up/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6315,'corpse_party',NULL,'A group of friends unknowingly perform an occult ritual that traps them in an otherworldly elementary school. Here, the vengeful spirits of young children threaten their lives and their sanity, and the only hope of survival is to uncover the chilling details behind the murders of those trapped before them...','2016/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/251270/Corpse_Party/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6316,'attack_at_dawn:_north_africa',NULL,'Attack at Dawn is a WWII strategy game that mixes the ease of real-time action with the depth of operational gameplay, all on beautifully crafted North Africa maps. Plan your strategy like Rommel or Montgomery and better the real history.','2022/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1383640/Attack_at_Dawn_North_Africa/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6317,'living_with_my_little_sister',NULL,'Your truant younger sister decided to crash at your place. Improve your relationship by spending time with her while balancing your job as an illustrator. Give her a head pat, cook for her, have a chat, and maybe, over time, she\'ll open up to you.','2025/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3478020/Living_with_my_Little_Sister/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6318,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_schwarzmüller_trailer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2016/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/388477/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Schwarzmller_Trailer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6319,'orcs_must_die!_2',NULL,'You’ve tossed, burned and sliced them by the thousands – now orcs must die more than ever before! Grab a friend and slay orcs in untold numbers in this sequel to the 2011 AIAS Strategy Game of the Year from Robot Entertainment.','2012/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/201790/Orcs_Must_Die_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6320,'umineko:_golden_fantasia',NULL,'The tag-team fighting game based on the original \"Umineko When They Cry\" series, finally released on Steam, in English and with improved rollback netplay!','2017/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/550340/Umineko_Golden_Fantasia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6321,'voxelgram',NULL,'Voxelgram is a 3D nonograms game where solving puzzles feels like sculpting in three dimensions. Reveal voxel models as you complete each challenge.','2019/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1158470/Voxelgram/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6322,'escape_memoirs:_mansion_heist',NULL,'\"Escape Memoirs: Mansion Heist\" is a co-operative atmospheric reverse escape-room puzzle game. You are a master thief who has been hired to rob a mysterious mansion, filled with various puzzles. Do you think you have what it takes to conquer the challenges that await you in the mansion.','2022/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1925320/Escape_Memoirs_Mansion_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6323,'cavern_of_dreams',NULL,'Embark on a magical quest as Fynn the dragon to rescue your unhatched siblings from the mysterious Cavern of Dreams in this N64-style 3D platformer. Gain new abilities, meet unique characters, solve puzzles, and beware of the mysterious villain.','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2059660/Cavern_of_Dreams/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6324,'gal_guardians:_demon_purge',NULL,'In order to save their school after it turns into a massive demonic castle, two \"Demon Hunter\" sisters slash and shoot their way through this 2D action adventure. Players can swap between control of both characters on the fly, each with entirely different skillsets.','2023/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2081400/Gal_Guardians_Demon_Purge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6325,'no_time',NULL,'Go on a trip through time! Experience the freedom of traveling into any date, hour and minute in time between the years 1 and 2077! Help your best friend Edward in his scientific affairs! Watch out for the Time Agents & avoid yourself!','2019/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1043340/No_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6326,'warsim:_the_realm_of_aslona',NULL,'Warsim is a deep, rich text based kingdom ruling sim unlike anything else, complete with charming ASCII graphics. Navigate the millions of different procedurally generated races, events and areas with a huge emphasis on player choice. Don\'t let its look fool you, there is depth in every direction.','2022/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/659540/Warsim_The_Realm_of_Aslona/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6327,'the_settlers®_:_heritage_of_kings_-_history_edition',NULL,'With this modernized History Edition dive into the diversified mix of enthralling build-up matches and exciting real-time fights. Manifold landscapes await to be explored and populated. Includes the main game plus the two expansions.','2019/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/965300/The_Settlers__Heritage_of_Kings__History_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_133'),(6328,'my_little_life',NULL,'A relaxing life-sim that lives on the bottom of your screen while you do other things.','2025/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2834600/My_Little_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6329,'aven_colony',NULL,'Build a new home for humanity in Aven Colony. Discover Aven Prime - an alien planet of deserts, tundras, and wetlands light years from earth. Build your colonies into massive, sprawling cities whilst dealing with the challenges faced when settling on a new world.','2017/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/484900/Aven_Colony/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6330,'world_war_z:_explorer_weapons_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game World War Z on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1640650/World_War_Z_Explorer_Weapons_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6331,'syrian_warfare',NULL,'Real Time Strategy with a high degree of realism. The game is based on a true story.','2017/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/485980/Syrian_Warfare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6332,'placid_plastic_duck_-_hippospace_download',NULL,'This content requires the base game Placid Plastic Duck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2400830/Placid_Plastic_Duck__Hippospace_Download/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6333,'an_arcade_full_of_cats:_timewarp_trouble',NULL,'This content requires the base game An Arcade Full of Cats on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2582360/An_Arcade_Full_of_Cats_TimeWarp_Trouble/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6334,'icey',NULL,'ICEY is a 2D side-scrolling action game and a META game in disguise. As you follow the narrator\'s omnipresent voice, you will see through ICEY\'s eyes and learn the truth about her world. The narrator will constantly urge you in one direction, but you must ask, \"Why? Why am I following his directions?“ Obey? Rebel?','2016/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/553640/ICEY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6335,'vertigo_2:_into_the_aether',NULL,'This content requires the base game Vertigo 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3305800/Vertigo_2_Into_the_Aether/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6336,'stasis:_bone_totem',NULL,'Get ready for a thrilling underwater adventure with classic point-and-click gameplay. Explore with three characters simultaneously. Featuring atmospheric isometric graphics, rendered video, and a soundtrack by Mark Morgan, BONE TOTEM takes you on a journey to hidden places deep below the waves...','2023/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1426010/STASIS_BONE_TOTEM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6337,'demon\'s_tilt',NULL,'TURBO CHARGED PINBALL RETURNS! Now with bigger sprites, more baddies, more secrets & MORE BULLETS! Demon\'s Tilt pushes the limits of the Video Pinball genre with SHMUP & Hack N\' Slash elements.','2019/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/422510/DEMONS_TILT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6338,'secret_of_mana',NULL,'The memorable adventure of Randi, Primm and Popoi is reborn as Secret of Mana! Originally released in 1993, Secret of Mana is by far the most popular title in the “Mana” series and has now undergone a much-awaited full 3D remake!','2018/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/637670/Secret_of_Mana/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6339,'wanted:_dead',NULL,'Wanted: Dead is a new hybrid slasher/shooter from the makers of Ninja Gaiden and Dead or Alive. The game follows a week in life of the Zombie Unit, an elite Hong Kong police squad on a mission to uncover a major corporate conspiracy.','2023/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1981610/Wanted_Dead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6340,'aliens:_fireteam_elite_-_endeavor_veteran_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Aliens: Fireteam Elite on Steam in order to play.','2021/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1643350/Aliens_Fireteam_Elite__Endeavor_Veteran_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6341,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator_-_aquariums_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ultimate Fishing® Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/940820/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator__Aquariums_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6342,'placid_plastic_duck_simulator_-_duck_addiction',NULL,'This content requires the base game Placid Plastic Duck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2303400/Placid_Plastic_Duck_Simulator__Duck_Addiction/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6343,'higurashi_when_they_cry_hou_-_ch.8_matsuribayashi',NULL,'Higurashi When They Cry is a sound novel. The music, backgrounds and characters work together to create a world that is the stage of a novel for the user to read. They laugh and cry and get angry. The user takes the point of view of the protagonist to experience the story.','2020/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1243670/Higurashi_When_They_Cry_Hou__Ch8_Matsuribayashi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6344,'northgard_-_kernev,_clan_of_the_stoat',NULL,'This content requires the base game Northgard on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2515460/Northgard__Kernev_Clan_of_the_Stoat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6345,'touhou_genso_wanderer_-reloaded-',NULL,'Based on the \"Touhou Project\" world, Touhou Genso Wanderer -Reloaded- is an addictive roguelike RPG that\'s easy for beginners to pickup and play, but with tons of advanced options for pros! Explore dungeons with your Touhou favorites characters, collect loot, and battle over the Golden Spheres!','2018/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/931500/Touhou_Genso_Wanderer_Reloaded/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6346,'healed_to_death',NULL,'Healed To Death is a single-player Rogue-Lite where you play as the Healer. The gameplay is inspired by healing in MMORPGs. Manage a party, Heal your allies, Explore dungeons and Destroy undead monsters with Healing & Support Spells.','2025/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2765490/Healed_To_Death/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6347,'isle_of_arrows',NULL,'Isle of Arrows is a Puzzle Tower Defense game in which you build a fortress in the sky. Place towers, expand the isle, and build your own paths. Can you find the perfect spot for each tile to beat the RNG and defend against waves of invaders?','2022/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1946970/Isle_of_Arrows/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6348,'cyber_warrior',NULL,'Cyber Warrior is a hacking simulator where you play as an ex retired bureau agent recruited back to take on a powerful criminal organization. Explore dozens of interactive desktops, navigate 200+ in-game websites, solve puzzles, customize your setup and make decisions that will shape a new cyber age','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/726980/Cyber_Warrior/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6349,'adventure_time:_pirates_of_the_enchiridion',NULL,'Ahoy! The Land of Ooo is underwater and it’s up to Finn and Jake to find out why. Join our heroes as they explore the high seas, search for hidden clues, interrogate shady suspects and fight pirates to solve the mystery and save their waterlogged world!','2018/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/728240/Adventure_Time_Pirates_of_the_Enchiridion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6350,'δv:_rings_of_saturn',NULL,'A physics-based mining sim, set in the thickest debris field in Sol. Every action has a reaction, lasers are invisible without a medium, and your thrust is a potent weapon. Find trade, adapt your equipment to your playstyle, hire a crew to help. Unravel the mysteries of the rings, or just get rich.','2023/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/846030/DV_Rings_of_Saturn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6351,'infectonator_3:_apocalypse',NULL,'A campy, crazy pixelart zombie apocalypse arcade sim where you\'re the bad guy. Drop your virus and spread it across the globe while you unlock a whole horde of bizarre undead to do your bidding.','2018/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/666570/Infectonator_3_Apocalypse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6352,'car_mechanic_simulator_2021_-_hot_rod_remastered_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Car Mechanic Simulator 2021 on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1931780/Car_Mechanic_Simulator_2021__Hot_Rod_Remastered_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6353,'flotsam',NULL,'The floating garbage town strategy game! Scavenge what precious garbage you can from the ocean\'s surface and grow your city while doing your best to survive in this colorful post-apocalyptic world.','2019/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/821250/Flotsam/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6354,'sands_of_salzaar',NULL,'Bringing you to an exotic desert where you’ll recruit, train, and guide your troops into battle against rival cities and factions. Embark on an adventure that’s uniquely yours; Customizable characters, professions, and factions. The land is filled with a variety of hidden secrets.','2021/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1094520/Sands_of_Salzaar/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6355,'happy_game',NULL,'A little boy falls asleep to a horrible nightmare. Can you make him happy again?','2021/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1206060/Happy_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6356,'last_time_i_saw_you',NULL,'First loves. Family issues. Yokai. \'Last Time I Saw You\' is a coming-of-age adventure set in 1980s Japan. Explore a haunted forest hiding a terrible secret, and interact with a vast cast of friendly and deceitful characters in this beautifully hand-drawn story with some light action elements.','2024/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1909750/Last_Time_I_Saw_You/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6357,'park_beyond',NULL,'Park Beyond is a theme park simulation game that gives you the freedom to create and manage the Parks of your Dreams! Whether you love to manage finances and visitor experience, or just create fun and cozy parks, the game has something in store just for you!','2023/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1368130/Park_Beyond/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6358,'don\'t_starve_together:_wortox_deluxe_chest',NULL,'This content requires the base game Don\'t Starve Together on Steam in order to play.','2019/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1051700/Dont_Starve_Together_Wortox_Deluxe_Chest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6359,'laura_of_reigetsu',NULL,'Laura and Lunaroa, friends from the remote village of Hatayaki, promised to marry in Yuriscene, a country allowing same-sex marriage. Reunited after five years, they embarked on a challenging journey to Yuriscene, overcoming numerous obstacles to fulfill their promise.','2025/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2497170/Laura_of_Reigetsu/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6360,'the_zachtronics_solitaire_collection',NULL,'The Zachtronics Solitaire Collection is here! Inside you will find all seven Zachtronics solitaire games, updated with new 4K graphics, plus one brand new Tarot-themed solitaire variant only available here.','2022/9/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1988540/The_Zachtronics_Solitaire_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6361,'pyrene',NULL,'Defeat hellish monsters and rebuild your home in Pyrene, a fast paced roguelike dungeon-crawler. Play with different heroes & spells, collect powerful relics to upgrade your deck while uncovering the mysteries behind your village’s destruction.','2024/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2468100/Pyrene/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6362,'screencheat',NULL,'Screencheat is a ridiculous competitive split-screen first-person shooter where everyone is invisible, so players are forced to look at each other’s screens to win. Supporting both local and online multiplayer, combat in Screencheat is fast and furious with a wide variety of one-hit kill weapons.','2014/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/301970/Screencheat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6363,'born_of_bread',NULL,'Get ready to go on a wacky and joyful turn-based RPG adventure! Play as Loaf, a freshly baked flour golem, and explore the different regions of a wonderful world ripe with mysteries with the help of a colorful cast of characters.','2023/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1555140/Born_of_Bread/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6364,'propagation:_paradise_hotel',NULL,'Trapped inside the Paradise Hotel, you are desperate to find your sister. Explore dark surroundings, gather resources, and survive terrifying encounters. This intense single-player VR survival horror game with great storytelling will get your adrenaline pumping.','2023/5/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1824960/Propagation_Paradise_Hotel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6365,'game_of_fate_2:_a_century\'s_promise',NULL,'Transported back a century by fate, you find yourself in a legendary tale of vengeance. Amidst powerful enemies in a tumultuous era, your mission is to assist those around you. Experience this immersive epic from a first-person perspective—authentic, weighty, yet brimming with hope.','2025/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3218600/Game_of_Fate_2_A_Centurys_Promise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6366,'karting_superstars',NULL,'A kart racing game without weapons! This is a pure motorsport arcade racer. Compete vs very challenging AI, get on the global leaderboards and play with others online.','2023/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2503220/Karting_Superstars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6367,'placid_plastic_duck_-_quacking_the_ice',NULL,'This content requires the base game Placid Plastic Duck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2229460/Placid_Plastic_Duck__Quacking_the_Ice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6368,'indiana_jones®_and_the_fate_of_atlantis™',NULL,'The Man With The Hat Is Back In His Greatest Adventure Yet! 1939 - The eve of World War II. Nazi agents are about to get their hands on a weapon more dangerous than the atom bomb. Only Indy can stop them before they unleash the deadly secret that sank Atlantis.','1992/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6010/Indiana_Jones_and_the_Fate_of_Atlantis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6369,'across_the_obelisk:_spooky_night_in_senenthia',NULL,'This content requires the base game Across the Obelisk on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2168960/Across_The_Obelisk_Spooky_Night_in_Senenthia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6370,'dcs:_su-27_flaming_cliffs',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2014/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/250310/DCS_Su27_Flaming_Cliffs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6371,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_vehicles_of_the_world',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2022/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1726381/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Vehicles_of_the_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6372,'windjammers_2',NULL,'The best flying disc game of all time is back, with amazing hand-drawn graphics, crazy new moves, gameplay mechanics and awesome characters and stages! New update brings new playable characters, new training mode, full crossplay support and more.','2022/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1114290/Windjammers_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6373,'workers_&_resources:_soviet_republic_-_help_for_ukraine',NULL,'This content requires the base game Workers & Resources: Soviet Republic on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1948180/Workers__Resources_Soviet_Republic__Help_for_Ukraine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6374,'just_go',NULL,'You will experience from absolute Novice to Top Go player, and show your talents in major Go leagues! The game also includes notable Go matches in history for you to explore. The full-dubbing tutorial for beginners will let you appreciate the charm of Go!','2022/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1862520/Just_Go/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_134'),(6375,'windjammers_2',NULL,'The best flying disc game of all time is back, with amazing hand-drawn graphics, crazy new moves, gameplay mechanics and awesome characters and stages! New update brings new playable characters, new training mode, full crossplay support and more.','2022/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1114290/Windjammers_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6376,'workers_&_resources:_soviet_republic_-_help_for_ukraine',NULL,'This content requires the base game Workers & Resources: Soviet Republic on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1948180/Workers__Resources_Soviet_Republic__Help_for_Ukraine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6377,'just_go',NULL,'You will experience from absolute Novice to Top Go player, and show your talents in major Go leagues! The game also includes notable Go matches in history for you to explore. The full-dubbing tutorial for beginners will let you appreciate the charm of Go!','2022/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1862520/Just_Go/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6378,'necrosmith_2',NULL,'Like a dead man reanimated by dark sorcery, the necromancer simulator is back! Give the undead the ability to fly over mountains and swim across rivers, explore a fully generated world at night and fend off enemy hordes during the day. Start a new, uhm, life.','2024/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2277320/Necrosmith_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6379,'moral_dilemma:_the_interview',NULL,'A fourth-wall-breaking narrative adventure. It’s interview day, and you really need this job—enough to ignore the talking printer, the anomaly corridor, and the ridiculous life-or-death trials your interviewer keeps putting you in. But deep down, you know... something here is very, very wrong.','2025/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3364880/Moral_Dilemma_The_Interview/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6380,'coloring_game_5',NULL,'Coloring Game 5 - coloring by numbers. Is a bright representative of anti-stress games.','2025/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3001970/Coloring_Game_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6381,'the_quintessential_quintuplets_-_five_memories_spent_with_you',NULL,'I want to confess my feelings for you...','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2507620/The_Quintessential_Quintuplets__Five_Memories_Spent_With_You/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6382,'scavenger_sv-4',NULL,'Scavenger SV-4 is a highly replayable atmospheric first-person science fiction game. Part simulator, part roguelike, it has elements of action, combat, resource management, and a dash of horror. It is not quite like any game you have played before.','2018/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/779590/Scavenger_SV4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6383,'pumpkin_jack',NULL,'Pumpkin Jack is a Spooky Scary 3D platformer in which you embody Jack, the Mythical Pumpkin Lord! Dive into an Epic Adventure through otherworldly landscapes and help the Evil annihilate the Good!','2020/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1186640/Pumpkin_Jack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6384,'the_sims™_4_sweet_slumber_party_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3197130/The_Sims_4_Sweet_Slumber_Party_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6385,'transport_fever_2:_early_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Transport Fever 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2195611/Transport_Fever_2_Early_Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6386,'the_spell_brigade_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Spell Brigade on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3194200/The_Spell_Brigade__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6387,'tales_of_monkey_island:_complete_season',NULL,'While explosively stripping the evil pirate LeChuck of his demonic mojo, Guybrush Threepwood inadvertently infects the entire Caribbean with the arch-fiend\'s expelled voodoo, which threatens to transform buccaneers into unruly pirate monsters.','2009/7/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/31170/Tales_of_Monkey_Island_Complete_Season/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6388,'arcanum:_of_steamworks_and_magick_obscura',NULL,'Imagine a place of wonder, where magick and technology coexist in an uneasy balance, and an adventurer might just as easily wield a flintlock pistol as a flaming sword. Welcome to the land of Arcanum.','2001/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/500810/Arcanum_Of_Steamworks_and_Magick_Obscura/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6389,'kingdom_come:_deliverance_–_artbook',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Come: Deliverance on Steam in order to play.','2018/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/801980/Kingdom_Come_Deliverance__Artbook/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6390,'clonizer',NULL,'Clonizer combines Hex-based tactics and roguelike deckbuilding! Play cards, manage clones, explore unique charming planets and outsmart aliens. Craft a powerful deck through your expedition and Clonize the universe to become employee of the month of CLONPO!','2025/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2449450/Clonizer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6391,'world_of_warships_—_prinz_eitel_friedrich',NULL,'This content requires the base game World of Warships on Steam in order to play.','2021/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1690140/World_of_Warships__Prinz_Eitel_Friedrich/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6392,'blackshard',NULL,'BLACKSHARD is a first-person exploration game. Wander through a strange megastructure, the Labyrinth, to unravel its mysteries... Your behavior within the Labyrinth will define the outcome of your journey. What path will you choose to take?','2025/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3223390/BLACKSHARD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6393,'axyz',NULL,'Axyz is a retro gravity switching puzzle game that asks the player to use their environmental and spatial awareness to beat every level. Soak in the vaporwave, switch gravity, collect tapes, and more in this tribute to 90s puzzle games.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2850490/Axyz/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6394,'party_hard',NULL,'It\'s 3:00 a.m. Your neighbours are having a loud party. Stop them. Party Hard is tinyBuild\'s award-winning stealth strategy game about ruining parties by any means.','2015/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/356570/Party_Hard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6395,'pixel_cafe',NULL,'Step into Pixel\'s shoes in this one-of-a-kind journey that bridges time, memories, and the aroma of fresh coffee. Dive deep into a city balancing its past and future. Engage in intense arcade challenges, immerse yourself in heartfelt stories, and navigate a world crafted in pixel art.','2023/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2409360/Pixel_Cafe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6396,'blessed_burden',NULL,'The most-aesthetically charged action horror first-person platformer. You play as the last priest who goes unarmed into the devil\'s abode to save the world.','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2379230/Blessed_Burden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6397,'snow_plowing_simulator',NULL,'Experience the serene joy of snow plowing in this relaxing simulation game! Drive powerful plows, clear roads, and keep your town safe. Uncover a surprising story, face survival challenges, and tackle advanced weather systems. Embrace winter\'s chill and become the ultimate snow-clearing hero!','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2096030/Snow_Plowing_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6398,'train_simulator:_wcml_trent_valley_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2015/7/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/325954/Train_Simulator_WCML_Trent_Valley_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6399,'fairy_tail:_dungeons',NULL,'Fairy Tail: Dungeons is a deck-building rogue-lite featuring characters from the Fairy Tail series. Collect Magic Cards based on moves from the series to build your own unique deck and take down powerful monsters as you head for the dungeon depths!','2024/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2305500/FAIRY_TAIL_DUNGEONS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6400,'sword_art_online_last_recollection',NULL,'The culmination of the SWORD ART ONLINE game series, Last Recollection features the largest roster of SAO playable characters and sub scenarios!','2023/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1566880/SWORD_ART_ONLINE_Last_Recollection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6401,'vacation_simulator',NULL,'The latest VR sensation from the creators of ‘Job Simulator’, now with free DLC! Welcome to Vacation Simulator: a rough approximation of VACATION inspired by real human NOT JOBBING. Reallocate your bandwidth and get ready to splash, s’more, snowball, and selfie your way to optimal relaxation.','2019/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/726830/Vacation_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6402,'rise_to_ruins',NULL,'A brutal godlike village sim that melds the god game, management, and tower defense genres! Fight off hoards of monsters at night, and expand your village in the day time. Inspired by games like Black and White, Rimworld, and Dwarf Fortress but not quite like any of them.','2019/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/328080/Rise_to_Ruins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6403,'dinosaur_fossil_hunter',NULL,'Become a real paleontologist, explore various environments and search for dinosaur fossils. Dig for and study the remnants of these majestic creatures to learn about their evolution. Build your own museum and experience an immersive background story.','2022/5/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/864700/Dinosaur_Fossil_Hunter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6404,'smile_for_me',NULL,'A heartbroken clown, wayward souls, and juicy mechanical lips. As “The Big Event\" draws near, help the troubled residents of the Habitat and de-mask the mysterious Doctor Habit... before it\'s too late.','2019/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1018850/Smile_For_Me/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6405,'contradiction:_spot_the_liar',NULL,'Spot the lie and beat the liars in \'Contradiction\' - the all-video murder mystery adventure!','2015/7/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/373390/Contradiction_Spot_The_Liar/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6406,'hatsune_miku_logic_paint_s',NULL,'\"Hatsune Miku Logic Paint -MIKULOGI-\" has evolved! Hatsune Miku Logic Paint S is now available on Steam!','2022/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2089350/Hatsune_Miku_Logic_Paint_S/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6407,'freddi_fish_2:_the_case_of_the_haunted_schoolhouse',NULL,'So who is haunting the schoolhouse, taking the toys and practically scaring the scales off all the guppies?','1996/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/294530/Freddi_Fish_2_The_Case_of_the_Haunted_Schoolhouse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6408,'no_time_to_relax',NULL,'No Time to Relax is a life simulation game where up to 4 players online or locally compete against each other in the ultimate game of life.','2019/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/829660/No_Time_to_Relax/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6409,'life_is_strange:_true_colors_-_deluxe_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Life is Strange: True Colors on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1571390/Life_is_Strange_True_Colors__Deluxe_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6410,'fuga:_melodies_of_steel',NULL,'Fuga: Melodies of Steel is an RPG where you place children, each with their own unique characteristics and skills, at different gun turrets in a tank to fight against the enemy.','2021/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1357860/Fuga_Melodies_of_Steel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6411,'the_house_in_fata_morgana:_a_requiem_for_innocence',NULL,'\"A Requiem for Innocence\" is a companion to the visual novel \"The House in Fata Morgana.\" It tells the tale of a young man dragged down by his ambitions and a girl both worshiped as a saint and maligned as a witch. For them, there is no happily ever after.','2018/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/804700/The_House_in_Fata_Morgana_A_Requiem_for_Innocence/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6412,'learn_japanese_rpg:_hiragana_forbidden_speech',NULL,'Dialogue changes from English to Japanese as you learn and progress in this comedic RPG backed by professional Japanese voice acting. This is a full 18+ hour introductory Japanese course and adventure all in one. Master hiragana, 136+ kanji, basic grammar, 240 common words used in anime.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1114950/Learn_Japanese_RPG_Hiragana_Forbidden_Speech/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6413,'uplink',NULL,'Uplink lets you play as a freelance hacker tackling risky contracts for corporations. Break into systems, steal data, sabotage rivals, and upgrade your gear. Support factions or go rogue in this immersive, strategy-driven hacking simulation game where your choices shape the outcome.','2006/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1510/Uplink/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6414,'generation_zero®_-_companion_accessories_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Generation Zero® on Steam in order to play.','2023/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2473770/Generation_Zero__Companion_Accessories_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6415,'atlantic_fleet',NULL,'Turn based tactical and strategic naval combat. Atlantic Fleet puts you in command of the Allies or Kriegsmarine (German Navy) in the longest military campaign of WWII, The Battle of the Atlantic.Take command of surface ships, submarines as well as carrier and land based aircraft in the deadly struggle for control of Atlantic shipping...','2016/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/420440/Atlantic_Fleet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6416,'feeding_frenzy_2_deluxe',NULL,'The feeding frenzy begins again! Swim and swerve through underwater worlds, chow down on smaller fish, and chomp your way to ocean supremacy. But watch out: boatloads of pesky predators are looking to make lunch out of you.','2006/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3390/Feeding_Frenzy_2_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6417,'viscera_cleanup_detail_-_house_of_horror',NULL,'This content requires the base game Viscera Cleanup Detail on Steam in order to play.','2015/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/413160/Viscera_Cleanup_Detail__House_of_Horror/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6418,'i_am_setsuna',NULL,'Inspired by the timeless classic Chrono Trigger, I am Setsuna is a great homage to the JRPG masterpieces of yesteryear. Journey with Setsuna as she prepares to make the ultimate sacrifice and save the people of her land.','2016/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/441830/I_am_Setsuna/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_135'),(6419,'the_game_of_life',NULL,'THE GAME OF LIFE showcases a beautifully rendered digital game board, cards and spinner that capture the fun of the Classic game full of adventure & surprises! THE GAME OF LIFE will take players on a journey where fortunes can be won…and lost!','2015/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/403120/THE_GAME_OF_LIFE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6420,'underward',NULL,'UNDERWARD is a 1-4 player co-op horror exploration game. Investigators must carry «TEST-SUBJECT» monsters from a deadly underground abandoned hospital ward.','2025/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3025290/UNDERWARD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6421,'blanc',NULL,'Blanc is an artistic cooperative adventure that follows the journey of a wolf cub and a fawn stranded in a vast, snowy wilderness. They must come together in an unlikely partnership to find their families.','2023/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1982340/Blanc/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6422,'oxenfree',NULL,'Oxenfree is a supernatural thriller about a group of friends who unwittingly open a ghostly rift. You are Alex, and you’ve just brought your new stepbrother Jonas to an overnight island party gone horribly wrong.','2016/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/388880/Oxenfree/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6423,'bloodstained:_ritual_of_the_night_-_\"iga\'s_back_pack\"_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Bloodstained: Ritual of the Night on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1041460/Bloodstained_Ritual_of_the_Night__Igas_Back_Pack_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6424,'prison_architect_-_future_tech_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Prison Architect on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2184800/Prison_Architect__Future_Tech_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6425,'mordheim:_city_of_the_damned_-_undead',NULL,'This content requires the base game Mordheim: City of the Damned on Steam in order to play.','2016/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/534990/Mordheim_City_of_the_Damned__Undead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6426,'everafter_falls',NULL,'Rediscover the simple life. Farm, fish, forge and fight to restore the peace in an all-new farming adventure. Features split-screen coop, a helpful pet, automated drones, resourceful pixies, a card-eating progression system, and dangerous dungeons to delve into!','2024/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1416960/Everafter_Falls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6427,'nekopara_extra',NULL,'About half a year before the opening of the patisserie, La Soleil where the catgirls work with Kashou. Back when Chocola and Vanilla were still kittens when they first arrived at the Minaduki household and before they opened up to the other catgirls.','2018/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/899970/NEKOPARA_Extra/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6428,'deadeye_deepfake_simulacrum',NULL,'Embody the ultimate cybernetic corporate agent. Master deadly gunplay, time manipulation, and supernatural abilities. Hack computers, people, even the individual bullets flying at you. Confront the future, and die trying.','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1545990/Deadeye_Deepfake_Simulacrum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6429,'sword_art_online_last_recollection',NULL,'The culmination of the SWORD ART ONLINE game series, Last Recollection features the largest roster of SAO playable characters and sub scenarios!','2023/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1566880/SWORD_ART_ONLINE_Last_Recollection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6430,'road_food_simulator',NULL,'Run a roadside Pizza restaurant with your friends. Play solo or in Co-op with other players. Make pizzas fast and fill orders. Keep your customers happy and get more orders. Improve your restaurant as your income increases.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3207670/Road_Food_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6431,'arranger:_a_role-puzzling_adventure',NULL,'Find your way in a world of breezy, thoughtful puzzles, along a charming journey of self-discovery.','2024/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2596420/Arranger_A_RolePuzzling_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6432,'tales_beyond_the_tomb_-_white_silence',NULL,'Years after a tragic expedition, investigator Aleksei Morozov returns to the frozen mountains to uncover the truth. But some trails should never be followed...','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3655960/Tales_Beyond_The_Tomb__White_Silence/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6433,'thrive',NULL,'An evolution simulation game. Take control of your species in the environment and edit your species as a whole. Compete with other evolving species for resources on an alien planet.','2021/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1779200/Thrive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6434,'mini_ninjas',NULL,'Mini Ninjas is a game that combines furious action with stealth and exploration for an experience that appeals to a wide audience across age groups and preferences. It’s an action-adventure with a strong focus on allowing the player freedom to explore the world and has the depth to allow for very varied gameplay and approaches to getting...','2009/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/35000/Mini_Ninjas/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6435,'prehistoric_hunt',NULL,'Dive into intense dinosaur hunting adventures with your friends. Complete hunting contracts for Preton Corporation. Gather rewards, improve your equipment and become a master hunter. Are you the hunter or the hunted?','2020/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/752900/Prehistoric_Hunt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6436,'dcs:_mirage_f1',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2071330/DCS_Mirage_F1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6437,'void_bastards',NULL,'Inspired by BioShock and System Shock 2, Void Bastards is a revolutionary new strategy-shooter that will test your wits as well as exercise your aim. Can you lead the misfit prisoners of the Void Ark through the derelict spaceships and myriad dangers of the Sargasso Nebula?','2019/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/857980/Void_Bastards/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6438,'bloobs_adventure_idle',NULL,'🎮 Dive into an immersive idle RPG adventure! Level up, gather resources, craft powerful gear & Tools. Explore vast lands, conquer foes, and master your skills. Enjoy the nostalgic pixel graphics in the world of Bloobs!','2024/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2942780/Bloobs_Adventure_Idle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6439,'abathor',NULL,'Abathor is a challenging 2D action platformer for solo play or up to 4 players. Embark on an epic 16-bit quest inspired by Golden Axe, Rastan, and Castlevania IV. Traverse Atlantis, battle demons, and defeat vicious bosses to save your progress! Enjoy an amazing OST from classic-era musicians!','2024/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2295610/Abathor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6440,'narita_boy',NULL,'Become symphonic in Narita Boy! A radical action-adventure as a legendary pixel hero trapped as a mere echo within the Digital Kingdom. Discover the mysteries behind the Techno-sword, lock swords with the corrupt and tainted Stallions. Save the world!','2021/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1069530/Narita_Boy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6441,'rise_of_the_white_sun',NULL,'A Giant Strategy Sandbox experience set in Warlord China. *Tons of playable factions! *Communist insurgents, * Boxers like rebels, *Greedy warlords, *Mongol riders, *A mad russian baron, *Shanghai gangsters, *And armored trains!','2023/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1189100/Rise_Of_The_White_Sun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6442,'the_witch_of_fern_island',NULL,'Welcome to Fern Island! As Abrill, become immersed in the island’s culture, uncover its deepest secrets, and master magical trades. Overcome the challenges of the island to demonstrate your mastery of magic and become the most well known witch around!','2024/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1550010/The_Witch_of_Fern_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6443,'mundaun',NULL,'Mundaun is a lovingly hand-penciled horror tale set in a dark, secluded valley of The Alps. Explore various areas full of secrets to discover, survive hostile encounters, drive vehicles, fill your inventory, and solve a variety of handcrafted puzzles.','2021/3/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/720350/Mundaun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6444,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_la_luz_mala',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2200640/Hunt_Showdown_1896__La_Luz_Mala/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6445,'inmost',NULL,'Escape the depths of an otherworldly labyrinth in this cinematic puzzle platformer. Explore a hauntingly beautiful world, with three playable characters, in one dark, interconnected story.','2020/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/938560/INMOST/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6446,'parkitect_-_booms_&_blooms',NULL,'This content requires the base game Parkitect on Steam in order to play.','2020/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1353170/Parkitect__Booms__Blooms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6447,'super_mining_mechs',NULL,'Build your own Super Mining Mech and explore the underground in search of new natural resources. Customize your mech with unlockable parts to dig deeper than ever - by yourself or with up to 7 friends in online co-op multiplayer! So, what are you waiting for? There’s mining to be done!','2024/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2830150/Super_Mining_Mechs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6448,'prince_of_persia®',NULL,'The critically acclaimed Prince of Persia® franchise returns for the first time on next-generation platforms with an all-new epic journey. Built by the same award-winning Ubisoft Montreal studio that created Assassin\'s Creed™, Prince of Persia has been in development for over three years to deliver a whole new action-adventure gaming...','2008/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/19980/Prince_of_Persia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6449,'train_simulator:_london_to_brighton_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2012/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/208280/Train_Simulator_London_to_Brighton_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6450,'ember_knights_-_wrath_of_the_architect',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ember Knights on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2948140/Ember_Knights__Wrath_of_the_Architect/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6451,'the_sims™_4_simtimates_collection_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2061330/The_Sims_4_Simtimates_Collection_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6452,'la-mulana_2',NULL,'The long-awaited sequel to La-Mulana, La-Mulana 2 follows Lumisa Kosugi as she explores the ancient ruins of La-Mulana. Desperate to find the cause of the recent slew of monsters appearing from the ruins, Lumisa discovers the \"other\" La-Mulana: the ruins known as Eg-Lana.','2018/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/835430/LaMulana_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6453,'beach_invasion_1945_-_pacific',NULL,'Defend the fortified beaches of Pacific against invading forces in this WW2 FPS game as the enemy attacks you with troops, tanks, planes and more! Play on your on own or COOP while using iconic Japanese and American WWII weapons and prepare your defenses with mines, explosives, and more!','2023/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2390480/Beach_Invasion_1945__Pacific/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6454,'blood_and_bacon',NULL,'This Co-op Shooter , has Day and Night levels, multiple maps, players will take on 25 enemy types and numerous bosses, like Gargantuan Monsters and Minibosses every 10 days as you explore, shoot and run for your life against the onslaught of porcine monstrosities.','2016/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/434570/Blood_and_Bacon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6455,'driver®_parallel_lines',NULL,'You were the fastest wheelman on the street. You were a legend. You were money. Until they set you up and sent you down. Twenty-eight years inside for someone else\'s crime. Now you\'re getting out. Guess what? You got a new job, it\'s called getting revenge.','2007/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/21780/Driver_Parallel_Lines/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6456,'cosmic_miners',NULL,'Explore asteroid fields, trade rare resources, and upgrade your ship in Cosmic Miners. Navigate faction alliances, complete missions, and rise through the ranks in a dynamic space adventure where your choices shape your path to cosmic power.','2025/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3329630/Cosmic_Miners/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6457,'trizon',NULL,'Trizon is a roguelike deck-building game. Fuse any two cards together to play crazy combos. The game combines auto-battler mechanics, where creatures attack on their own, with instant-effect spell cards. Battles are fast-paced and dynamic, set against a simple and restrained art style.','2025/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3064290/Trizon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6458,'kingdom_come:_deliverance_–_ost_essentials',NULL,'This is additional content for Kingdom Come: Deliverance, but does not include the base game.','2018/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/794220/Kingdom_Come_Deliverance__OST_Essentials/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6459,'surv1v3',NULL,'Forget what you have played so far, SURV1V3 is a unique realistic zombie survival fps game expressly designed for VIRTUAL REALITY that will let you test your survival skills. Play the thrilling story in single mode or coop with your friends (up to 4 players) and survive the apocalypse!','2021/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/722180/SURV1V3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6460,'dg2:_defense_grid_2',NULL,'Setting the bar as the definitive tower defense game, Defense Grid 2 introduces new worlds and threats to test your tower placement strategies. With a bold new look and the addition of new game modes, player-versus-player and multiplayer co-op, every play brings fun new opportunities and challenges.','2014/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/221540/DG2_Defense_Grid_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6461,'aquarium_designer',NULL,'Aquarium Designer gives you an opportunity to create the aquarium of your dreams! Become a professional whose job is to design it, build it, and fill it with the various underwater wildlife! All types, all sizes - your creativity is your only limit!','2021/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1339000/Aquarium_Designer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6462,'freedom_fighters',NULL,'Freedom Fighters is an intense third-person action game set in an alternate history New York during the invasion of a foreign superpower. Take on the role of Chris Stone, a hard-working plumber, and rise through the ranks of the resistance to prove yourself as a charismatic leader.','2003/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1347780/Freedom_Fighters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6463,'erannorth_chronicles',NULL,'Erannorth Chronicles blends old-school card strategy with deep RPG progression in a vast sandbox world. With no fixed story, revel in unmatched freedom and limitless character customization.','2021/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1580800/Erannorth_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6464,'strongest☆angel_zerachiel!',NULL,'In a city that worships the Goddess of Fortune, an angel descends. Her name is Zerachiel. Zerachiel struggles to rescue her comrades who are imprisoned by the cult, but she is defeated and stripped of her powers by a girl claiming to be a saint...','2025/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2804550/StrongestAngel_Zerachiel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6465,'lady_&_trish_costumes',NULL,'This content requires the base game Devil May Cry 4 Special Edition on Steam in order to play.','2015/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/359496/Lady__Trish_Costumes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6466,'yars_rising',NULL,'From the renowned development studio WayForward Technologies, Inc. (Shantae, River City Girls, Advance Wars 1+2: Re-Boot Camp) comes Yars Rising, a 2D action adventure exploration of one of Atari’s richest, and best known classic titles.','2024/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2534370/Yars_Rising/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_136'),(6467,'the_night_is_grey',NULL,'Graham’s alone in a forest filled with strange wolves. While he’s fleeing for his life he finds a lost girl in an abandoned lodge that won’t survive without his help. Try to find their way to safety in this slow-burning cinematic thriller filled with puzzles, hand-drawn animation and lots of mystery','2024/1/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1281490/The_Night_is_Grey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6468,'placid_plastic_duck_simulator_-_ducks,_please',NULL,'This content requires the base game Placid Plastic Duck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2142510/Placid_Plastic_Duck_Simulator__Ducks_Please/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6469,'deadnaut:_signal_lost',NULL,'Deadnaut: Signal Lost is a sci-fi horror turn-based roguelike where loyalty isn\'t earned - it\'s installed. Scavenge derelict ships and abandoned moons filled with hellish creatures, brutal AI and insanity storms. Gather gear and upgrades to fight or evade the hi-tech supersoldiers hunting you down.','2023/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1801410/Deadnaut_Signal_Lost/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6470,'prince_of_persia:_the_two_thrones™',NULL,'The Prince of Persia, a seasoned warrior, returns from the Island of Time to Babylon with his love, Kaileena. Instead of the peace that he longs for, he finds his homeland ravaged by war and the kingdom turned against him.','2005/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/13530/Prince_of_Persia_The_Two_Thrones/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6471,'corpse_party',NULL,'A group of friends unknowingly perform an occult ritual that traps them in an otherworldly elementary school. Here, the vengeful spirits of young children threaten their lives and their sanity, and the only hope of survival is to uncover the chilling details behind the murders of those trapped before them...','2016/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/251270/Corpse_Party/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6472,'payday_2:_midland_ranch_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1945681/PAYDAY_2_Midland_Ranch_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6473,'brigandine_the_legend_of_runersia',NULL,'The continent of Runersia is home to six major powers with more than 40 bases, 100 knights, and 50 types of monsters. Select a ruler, organize knights and monsters into troops, and conquer enemy bases!','2022/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1843940/Brigandine_The_Legend_of_Runersia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6474,'the_banished_vault',NULL,'A strategy game of exploration, endurance, and space travel on an interstellar gothic monastery. Explore solar systems, harvest resources, construct outposts, and face hazards in the challenging universe of The Banished Vault.','2023/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2341070/The_Banished_Vault/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6475,'frontier_hunter:_erza’s_wheel_of_fortune',NULL,'This is an anime-style Metroidvania game with an RPG progression system, numerous weapons for switching, and an emphasis on equipment building. It offers three switchable characters, smooth gameplay, impactful combat feedback, and anime-style story scenes.','2024/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1429500/Frontier_Hunter_Erzas_Wheel_of_Fortune/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6476,'blasphemous_-_digital_comic',NULL,'This content requires the base game Blasphemous on Steam in order to play.','2019/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1143851/Blasphemous__Digital_Comic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6477,'hush_hush_-_peanut_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hush Hush - Only Your Love Can Save Them on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2564190/Hush_Hush__Peanut_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6478,'viscerafest',NULL,'Viscerafest is a Sci-Fi Fantasy Singleplayer Arena FPS with minor Collectathon elements. Fight through hordes of aliens and eldritch monstrosities wielding a slew of powerful weapons, juggling your resources, and exploring over 23 intricately designed hand-crafted levels.','2025/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1406780/Viscerafest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6479,'ggst_additional_character_12_-_a.b.a',NULL,'This content requires the base game GUILTY GEAR -STRIVE- on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2524050/GGST_Additional_Character_12__ABA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6480,'house',NULL,'Try to survive through the night in a house that\'s trying its best to kill you and your family.','2020/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1444350/House/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6481,'shawarma_legend',NULL,'🌯 Shawarma Legend !! A real simulation of a shawarma restaurant !!','2024/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3036080/Shawarma_Legend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6482,'risen',NULL,'Delve into a gritty, raw and atmospheric fantasy world in which every action has a consequence. In the epic world of Risen, filled with mysterious earthquakes, fearsome monsters and unimaginable treasures, forge your path with the sword, learn the art of staff fighting or become a powerful mage.','2009/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/40300/Risen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6483,'dragonkin:_the_banished',NULL,'The draconic threat is once again upon us. Legendary heroes rise up to face the legions from the depths. Tame your wyrmlings, create unique power builds with the Ancestral Grid, expand your city and destroy the Dragons!','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1863430/Dragonkin_The_Banished/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6484,'embers_adrift',NULL,'Embers Adrift is a unique fantasy PvE MMO - group play truly shines and solo play is still rewarding. Designed with classic MMO principles in mind we desire to bring players together to create lasting memories and friendships in an immersive world wherein you may lose track of time. Welcome drifter!','2025/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3336530/Embers_Adrift/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6485,'shambles:_sons_of_apocalypse',NULL,'“The world you knew is already collapsed.”As an explorer in a bunker, explore a new world 500 years in the future and decide its fate. You can lead the world back to doom or bring it to peace. It all depends on your choices.','2025/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2289630/Shambles_Sons_of_Apocalypse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6486,'9th_dawn_iii',NULL,'9th Dawn III: Shadow of Erthil is a massive open world RPG/dungeon crawler packed full of content – featuring more than 270 monsters to fight and capture, a fun card game with 180 cards to collect, and over 1,400 unique items to hoard!','2020/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1154850/9th_Dawn_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6487,'northgard_-_vordr,_clan_of_the_owl',NULL,'This content requires the base game Northgard on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2658730/Northgard__Vordr_Clan_of_the_Owl/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6488,'enishia_and_the_binding_brand',NULL,'Enishia is a simple nun and the sole manager of the last church in Megista. However, she must pay off a mountain of debt to prevent the demolition of the church and its attached orphanage. How can she make the money she needs?','2024/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2582650/Enishia_and_the_Binding_Brand/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6489,'angels_fall_first',NULL,'From commanding the battle standing on the bridge of your flagship all the way down to tactical infantry firefights - AFF brings together all the combat you ever wanted in a rich science fiction setting. Boarding, pilotable capital ships, deep weapon customization and full AI support included!','2015/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/367270/Angels_Fall_First/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6490,'your_wife',NULL,'Feeling that your computer desktop is too plain? Want to find a cute girl to keep you company? Then try this desktop pet wife!','2024/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3339420/your_wife/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6491,'happy\'s_humble_burger_farm',NULL,'Congrats, you\'re hired! Serve customers and maintain the Happy\'s Humble Burger Farm restaurant alone on the overnight. But be careful; things fall apart if you mess up! After work, head home and keep your eyes open for a way to escape the Barnyard Buds and their fast food fever-dream.','2021/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1433340/Happys_Humble_Burger_Farm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6492,'divinity:_dragon_commander',NULL,'You are the Dragon Commander. Your mission it is to reunite a broken empire and become the new emperor. Success depends entirely on your ability to efficiently rule your empire, build invincible armies and lead them to victory.','2013/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/243950/Divinity_Dragon_Commander/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6493,'obscure',NULL,'For some time now, Leafmore High School has been the setting for unexplained disappearances. In this survival horror game, you take control of a group of 5 American students. With your friends, you try to unravel the mysterious happenings at this unremarkable-looking school. The night will be long and survival not will not be easy...','2005/4/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/254460/Obscure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6494,'pac-man_museum+',NULL,'PAC-MAN MUSEUM+ includes 14 titles from the legendary PAC-MAN series! Play a variety of classic and nostalgic PAC-MAN games across many genres!','2022/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1665130/PACMAN_MUSEUM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6495,'scribblenauts_unmasked:_a_dc_comics_adventure',NULL,'In Scribblenauts Unmasked: A DC Comics Adventure, Maxwell unites with Batman™, Superman™ and the rest of The Justice League™ to restore order to the DC Comics Universe. Challenge your imagination as you battle the mightiest villains in an exciting, action-filled adventure through GOTHAM CITY™, METROPOLIS™, ATLANTIS™ and other iconic...','2013/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/249870/Scribblenauts_Unmasked_A_DC_Comics_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6496,'waveshaper',NULL,'WAVESHAPER is a minimalist score attack game in which you attempt to stop the 2D vector menace, one obstacle at a time.','2017/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/562260/WAVESHAPER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6497,'between_horizons_–_a_sci-fi_detective_adventure',NULL,'Between Horizons is a narrative 2.5D sci-fi detective adventure. 33 years into the Zephyr\'s journey, its mission is suddenly jeopardized. Can you find the culprit before it\'s too late? Experience an enthralling story set in a semi-open world that branches and ends based on your choices.','2024/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1921980/Between_Horizons__A_SciFi_Detective_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6498,'the_sims™_4_casanova_cave_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3197120/The_Sims_4_Casanova_Cave_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6499,'glass_masquerade_3:_honeylines',NULL,'Get ready for the Glass Masquerade sequel! With brand new textured glass pieces, immerse yourself in the beautiful world of painted glass art. Assemble jigsaw puzzles inspired by different cultures and themes with new play modes and various fragments cuts.','2023/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1536980/Glass_Masquerade_3_Honeylines/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6500,'arizona_sunshine®',NULL,'Built exclusively for VR, Arizona Sunshine® puts you and up to 3 fellow survivors in the midst of a zombie apocalypse. Survive solo or in co-op, handle weapons with real-life movements, and explore a post-apocalyptic world in VR. Putting the undead back to rest is more thrilling than ever before.','2016/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/342180/Arizona_Sunshine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6501,'omsi_2_add-on_hamburg',NULL,'This content requires the base game OMSI 2: Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2014/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/313430/OMSI_2_Addon_Hamburg/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6502,'astrox_imperium',NULL,'Astrox Imperium is a relaxing space game where you fly around a generated universe. Mining, Fighting, Building, Exploring, and Surviving. What makes this game unique? You have complete control of how it plays. A robust sandbox and lots of MOD tools. Make it your game, and play it your own way.','2019/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/954870/Astrox_Imperium/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6503,'farmer\'s_dynasty',NULL,'Live – Build – Farm: Enjoy a unique mix of farming, constructing and life simulation that takes you to the countryside and holds plenty of challenging gameplay in stock!','2019/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/678900/Farmers_Dynasty/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6504,'amnesia:_rebirth',NULL,'A first-person horror adventure. Uncover your past and survive the Algerian desert. Fear is your enemy; stay calm to not succumb to an illness threatening you and your loved one. Avoid darkness, hide from monsters and solve puzzles. Adventure Mode available for a less scary experience.','2020/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/999220/Amnesia_Rebirth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6505,'disgaea_2_pc',NULL,'The Overlord Zenon has cursed the land, leaving a young man named Adell to seek vengeance. However, all hell breaks loose as Adell accidentally kidnaps the Princess of the Netherworld. Will Adell be able to return the Princess, defeat Zenon, and break the Overlord\'s dark curse?','2017/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/495280/Disgaea_2_PC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6506,'ziggurat_2',NULL,'Ziggurat is back, and now it\'s even better! Use powerful weapons and spells to break through hordes of enemies and explore labyrinthine dungeons in this hectic roguelite FPS, while you improve your skills and discover new equipment.','2021/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1159560/Ziggurat_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6507,'nidhogg_2',NULL,'The rules are simple. Reach the other side and kill anyone that stands in your way. Deftly parry and rend their throats, riddle their bowels with arrows, or squish their brains between your toes. The wurm cares not for chivalry.','2017/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/535520/Nidhogg_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6508,'aokana_-_four_rhythms_across_the_blue_-_extra2',NULL,'Aokana - EXTRA2 is the official Misaki after story for Aokana.','2022/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2206340/Aokana__Four_Rhythms_Across_the_Blue__EXTRA2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6509,'vendetta_forever',NULL,'Welcome to cult action paradise. Vendetta Forever is the critically acclaimed love letter to cult action cinema that combines iconic, cinematic inspired scenes with exhilarating VR action, powered by LO-KILL-MOTION. Shoot to kill. Kill to move.','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3557790/Vendetta_Forever/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6510,'surviving_mars:_pioneer',NULL,'The Red Planet is vast, desolate, and utterly indifferent to your survival. Surviving Mars: Pioneer is the first made-for-VR entry in the Surviving Mars universe, challenging you to carve out an existence in one of the most hostile environments imaginable.','2025/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3558730/Surviving_Mars_Pioneer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6511,'zortch',NULL,'Meet Zortch Maxinum: short order cook, amateur engineer and professional slacker; Bored and tired of her day job she decides to go on a holiday but alas she picks a cheap option: turns out it\'s a scheme by aliens who capture humans to eat their brains! also this game is a sci-fi horror comedy fps','2023/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2443360/Zortch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6512,'the_talos_principle:_road_to_gehenna',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Talos Principle on Steam in order to play.','2015/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/358470/The_Talos_Principle_Road_To_Gehenna/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_137'),(6513,'stickman_strikes:_conquer_fantasy_world',NULL,'A dragon\'s breath turns you into a stickman! Conquer castles, plunder territories, or lead your squad in this fantasy world! During your journey, you can explore various dungeons, discover hidden treasures, engage in trading, farming, craftmaking and more. Will you survive and regain your true self?','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2924170/Stickman_Strikes_Conquer_Fantasy_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6514,'gordian_quest',NULL,'An epic deckbuilding RPG inspired by old-school classics like Ultima and D&D, using modern gaming concepts like roguelite elements and turnbased strategic combat. Lead and nurture parties of heroes. Forge bonds and discover new skills among them. Guide them to unravel the curses laid upon the lands.','2022/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/981430/Gordian_Quest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6515,'the_sims™_4_pastel_pop_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1932742/The_Sims_4_Pastel_Pop_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6516,'placid_plastic_duck_vr',NULL,'The ultimate virtual reality rubber duck experience for your relaxation.','2025/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3595010/Placid_Plastic_Duck_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6517,'rogue_legacy',NULL,'Rogue Legacy is a genealogical rogue-\"LITE\" where anyone can be a hero. Each time you die, your child will succeed you. Every child is unique. One child might be colorblind, another might be a dwarf with vertigo. But that\'s OK, because no one is perfect, and you don\'t have to be to succeed.','2013/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/241600/Rogue_Legacy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6518,'leila',NULL,'Leila is a heartfelt, hand-animated narrative game about the small yet significant struggles we all face. Solve story-driven puzzles, relive fragile memories, and discover a deeply personal journey that may feel more familiar than you expect.','2025/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2458430/Leila/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6519,'atlantic_fleet',NULL,'Turn based tactical and strategic naval combat. Atlantic Fleet puts you in command of the Allies or Kriegsmarine (German Navy) in the longest military campaign of WWII, The Battle of the Atlantic.Take command of surface ships, submarines as well as carrier and land based aircraft in the deadly struggle for control of Atlantic shipping...','2016/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/420440/Atlantic_Fleet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6520,'painkiller_hell_&_damnation',NULL,'Evil has returned! Demonic powers are manifesting themselves as a myriad of dark creatures, fighting over the fates of imprisoned souls caught in Purgatory.','2012/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/214870/Painkiller_Hell__Damnation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6521,'overload',NULL,'A new six-degree-of-freedom shooter with intuitive controls, amazing lighting and graphics. From the creators of Descent, Overload is the best zero-gravity robot-blasting combat ever.','2018/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/448850/Overload/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6522,'bright_memory',NULL,'Bright Memory is a lightning-fast fusion of the FPS and action genres, created by one-man development studio FYQD using Unreal Engine. Combine a wide variety of skills and abilities to unleash dazzling combo attacks.','2020/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/955050/Bright_Memory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6523,'hacknet_-_labyrinths',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hacknet on Steam in order to play.','2017/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/521840/Hacknet__Labyrinths/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6524,'dcs:_uh-1h_huey',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2013/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/240500/DCS_UH1H_Huey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6525,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_schwarzmüller_trailer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2016/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/388477/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Schwarzmller_Trailer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6526,'gone_fishing',NULL,'GONE Fishing is a co-op multiplayer survival horror game where you and your friends must work together to stay alive, by fishing. The only way to survive is to keep feeding the lake’s insatiable hunger before it feeds on you. Can you satisfy the hunger... or will you become the next offering?','2025/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3645890/GONE_Fishing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6527,'nightmare_reaper',NULL,'Progress through the cursed depths of a nightmare while finding an arsenal of powerful weapons and improving your abilities along the way. This retro-inspired FPS with looter shooter and rogue-lite elements breaches the wall between classic and modern gameplay.','2022/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1051690/Nightmare_Reaper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6528,'yggdra_union',NULL,'In order to recapture her homeland, Yggdra gathers her allies and confronts the empire. \"Yggdra Union\" is a tactics RPG that features three elements: the \"Union System\", in which players team up with her allies to launch attacks, the exhilarating \"Clash\" through army battles, and the \"Tactics Card\".','2023/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2107860/Yggdra_Union/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6529,'super_video_golf',NULL,'Super Video Golf is a turn based 90s themed golf game, with up to 8 players locally or 8 computers online allowing a total of 16 players in a single game. Challenge yourself in Career mode or others online and offline in Free Play.','2023/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2173760/Super_Video_Golf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6530,'anno_1800_-_bright_harvest',NULL,'This content requires the base game Anno 1800 on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1314950/Anno_1800__Bright_Harvest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6531,'the_four_kings_casino_and_slots',NULL,'The Four Kings Casino & Slots is a rich social online multiplayer casino gaming experience. Play all of your favorite casino games like Poker, Blackjack, Roulette, Craps, Baccarat, Slots and more! Meet friends, climb the leaderboards and win rewards to customize your avatar.','2015/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/260430/The_Four_Kings_Casino_and_Slots/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6532,'idle_skilling',NULL,'Idle Skilling is the ultimate Idle Game with years of content! Meant to be played for 5-10 minutes a day, you gradually unlock new skills like mining, fishing, pet breeding, crusading, potion-making, lab-research, construction, and more! With new updates coming, you\'ll never run out of stuff to do!','2022/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1048370/Idle_Skilling/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6533,'nebuchadnezzar',NULL,'Create and customize cities in Nebuchadnezzar, a classic isometric city-builder where careful planning and define your rise as a ruler in ancient Mesopotamia.','2021/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1157220/Nebuchadnezzar/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6534,'beton_brutal',NULL,'Climb a massive overgrown concrete tower while constantly at risk of falling and losing precious progress. BETON BRUTAL offers a fluid and responsive first person parkour experience through tranquil brutalist architecture.','2023/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2330500/BETON_BRUTAL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6535,'hedon_bloodrite',NULL,'Zan and her orc sisters must fight to save their homeland from a demonic invasion! Immerse yourself in a sprawling underground world where the rich lore, exploration and puzzles of classic adventure games blend with the visceral combat of a 90s\' shooter.','2019/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1072150/Hedon_Bloodrite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6536,'fatum_betula',NULL,'Placed in a world without change, you must create fate by watering an ancient plant. Determine a future and live with it.','2020/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1281270/Fatum_Betula/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6537,'cyber_warrior',NULL,'Cyber Warrior is a hacking simulator where you play as an ex retired bureau agent recruited back to take on a powerful criminal organization. Explore dozens of interactive desktops, navigate 200+ in-game websites, solve puzzles, customize your setup and make decisions that will shape a new cyber age','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/726980/Cyber_Warrior/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6538,'progressbar95',NULL,'Progressbar95 is a unique indie game with a strong nostalgic vibe. It turns vintage GUI elements like panels, buttons and icons into game elements! Simple and addictive gameplay based on dozens of mini-games and puzzles. The game will make you smile!','2020/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1304550/Progressbar95/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6539,'s4u:_citypunk_2011_and_love_punch',NULL,'This is a modern adventure of young adults seeking love and meaning. Return to 2011\'s Castor Yard, tap on your keyboard, and make those letters dance: Use your online persona to make meaningful decisions for your clients and yourself.','2025/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2612700/S4U_CITYPUNK_2011_AND_LOVE_PUNCH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6540,'colossal_cave',NULL,'Acclaimed game designer Roberta Williams revives Colossal Cave as a retro, point-&-click, cave exploration puzzler. Based on the original 1970’s design by Will Crowther & Don Woods this 3D update maintains its vintage charm, while revitalizing it for modern gamers.','2023/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2215540/Colossal_Cave/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6541,'prodigal',NULL,'Prodigal is a story-rich action-adventure where you journey through a vibrant world fighting vicious monsters, exploring puzzling dungeons, and collecting magical artifacts. Unravel the mysteries of Vann\'s Point and bond with all of its curious townsfolk!','2020/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1393820/Prodigal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6542,'making*lovers',NULL,'Making*Lovers A story about the way love can bloom after dating begins. The focus in Making*Lovers is on the things that come after a relationship\'s beginning. With \"start dating, then fall in love\" as the concept, you will work towards the moment when love truly blooms.','2020/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1200720/MakingLovers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6543,'unforeseen_incidents',NULL,'Unforeseen Incidents is a classical style interactive mystery set in a beautifully hand-painted world. Join Harper Pendrell and experience a challenging investigation, smart dialog and a rich cast of characters in this thrilling new adventure game.','2018/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/501790/Unforeseen_Incidents/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6544,'monster_train:_the_last_divinity_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Train on Steam in order to play.','2021/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1359320/Monster_Train_The_Last_Divinity_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6545,'a_building_full_of_cats',NULL,'A Building Full of Cats is a hidden object game where you need to pet all the cats in the building. Don\'t leave any cats behind!','2022/7/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1969080/A_Building_Full_of_Cats/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6546,'snowrunner_-_kenworth_dual_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SnowRunner on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2353723/SnowRunner__Kenworth_Dual_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6547,'pode',NULL,'Friendship is EVERYTHING! Play this award-winning title together with your friends, or switch between characters as your traverse a cute puzzle adventure on your own! Glo & Bulder come together to charm young and adult alike!','2020/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/944080/Pode/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6548,'army_of_ruin',NULL,'Wreak havoc on countless foes with mighty weapons and deadly spells! Enhance your skills and face even greater dangers! Army of Ruin is an auto-shooter where you become the Bullet Hell.','2023/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1918040/Army_of_Ruin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6549,'can_of_wormholes',NULL,'Push, slice, ingest, flip, and squish worms in this puzzle game in which you play as a little sentient tin can.','2023/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1295320/Can_of_Wormholes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6550,'train_simulator:_great_eastern_main_line_london-ipswich_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2013/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/222593/Train_Simulator_Great_Eastern_Main_Line_LondonIpswich_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6551,'test_drive_unlimited_solar_crown',NULL,'TDUSC is a lifestyle and social experience that redefines what an open-world racing game can be. Explore a fully recreated Hong Kong Island. Take to the road behind the wheel of exceptional cars and live the ultimate life of luxury.','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1249970/Test_Drive_Unlimited_Solar_Crown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6552,'9-nine-:episode_1',NULL,'Help Miyako and Kakeru track down a superpowered serial killer before they strike again.','2019/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/976390/9nineEpisode_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6553,'tavern_talk:_tempest_tantrum',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tavern Talk on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3244740/Tavern_Talk_Tempest_Tantrum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6554,'blazblue:_chronophantasma_extend',NULL,'\'BlazBlue: Chronophantasma Extend\' is the sixth installment of the BlazBlue series, a combination of 2D fighting action game and visual novel.','2016/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/388750/BlazBlue_Chronophantasma_Extend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6555,'toilet_chronicles',NULL,'Toilet Chronicles - is a first person horror-comedy game with a mystical setting where you\'re trapped in a public restroom and need to find a way out with the help of your toilet neighbor. Every choice you make brings you to a different outcome.','2022/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1946550/Toilet_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6556,'halo:_spartan_strike',NULL,'Halo: Spartan Strike makes you a Spartan supersoldier battling evil forces. Delve into 30 challenging missions through cities and jungles using a devastating arsenal of weapons, abilities and vehicles including the iconic Warthog against the Covenant and Promethean enemies. *DirectX feature level 10 required*','2014/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/324570/Halo_Spartan_Strike/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_138'),(6557,'pode',NULL,'Friendship is EVERYTHING! Play this award-winning title together with your friends, or switch between characters as your traverse a cute puzzle adventure on your own! Glo & Bulder come together to charm young and adult alike!','2020/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/944080/Pode/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6558,'army_of_ruin',NULL,'Wreak havoc on countless foes with mighty weapons and deadly spells! Enhance your skills and face even greater dangers! Army of Ruin is an auto-shooter where you become the Bullet Hell.','2023/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1918040/Army_of_Ruin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6559,'can_of_wormholes',NULL,'Push, slice, ingest, flip, and squish worms in this puzzle game in which you play as a little sentient tin can.','2023/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1295320/Can_of_Wormholes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6560,'train_simulator:_great_eastern_main_line_london-ipswich_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2013/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/222593/Train_Simulator_Great_Eastern_Main_Line_LondonIpswich_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6561,'test_drive_unlimited_solar_crown',NULL,'TDUSC is a lifestyle and social experience that redefines what an open-world racing game can be. Explore a fully recreated Hong Kong Island. Take to the road behind the wheel of exceptional cars and live the ultimate life of luxury.','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1249970/Test_Drive_Unlimited_Solar_Crown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6562,'9-nine-:episode_1',NULL,'Help Miyako and Kakeru track down a superpowered serial killer before they strike again.','2019/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/976390/9nineEpisode_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6563,'blazblue:_chronophantasma_extend',NULL,'\'BlazBlue: Chronophantasma Extend\' is the sixth installment of the BlazBlue series, a combination of 2D fighting action game and visual novel.','2016/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/388750/BlazBlue_Chronophantasma_Extend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6564,'toilet_chronicles',NULL,'Toilet Chronicles - is a first person horror-comedy game with a mystical setting where you\'re trapped in a public restroom and need to find a way out with the help of your toilet neighbor. Every choice you make brings you to a different outcome.','2022/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1946550/Toilet_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6565,'halo:_spartan_strike',NULL,'Halo: Spartan Strike makes you a Spartan supersoldier battling evil forces. Delve into 30 challenging missions through cities and jungles using a devastating arsenal of weapons, abilities and vehicles including the iconic Warthog against the Covenant and Promethean enemies. *DirectX feature level 10 required*','2014/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/324570/Halo_Spartan_Strike/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6566,'gearbits',NULL,'Fast-paced mecha themed third person shooter.','2023/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2506580/Gearbits/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6567,'megaton_rainfall',NULL,'Become an indestructible interdimensional superbeing in this first-person superhero game, and save Earth from an alien invasion. Be careful though - you are so powerful you can destroy entire skyscrapers (unintentionally) when you miss your otherworldly target...','2017/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/430210/Megaton_Rainfall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6568,'arma_2:_operation_arrowhead',NULL,'Three years after the conflict in Chernarus, portrayed in the original Arma 2, a new flashpoint explodes in the Green Sea Region. Coalition forces led by the US Army are deployed to Takistan to quickly restore peace and prevent further civilian casualties.','2010/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/33930/Arma_2_Operation_Arrowhead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6569,'oddworld:_new_\'n\'_tasty',NULL,'Built from scratch, enjoy breathtaking visuals, enhanced audio and improved, deeper gameplay as New \'n\' Tasty reignites the original Oddworld: Abe\'s Oddysee using the latest next-generation technology.','2015/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/314660/Oddworld_New_n_Tasty/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6570,'senran_kagura_peach_ball',NULL,'SENRAN KAGURA has transformed into a wild pinball game! Bounce your ball along the curves of a crazy theme park, starring a ninja girl who thinks she\'s an animal! (Yep, you heard right!) Build up points to unlock special challenges, which showcase the girls\' charms!','2019/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1074080/SENRAN_KAGURA_Peach_Ball/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6571,'danganronpa_s:_ultimate_summer_camp',NULL,'With an all-star dream lineup of characters from each Danganronpa game, gather Hope Fragments at a tropical resort. Explore Jabberwock Island and develop your Dangan characters. Gather money through battle and upgrade your equipment, then defeat bosses and move on to the next island!','2022/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1691970/Danganronpa_S_Ultimate_Summer_Camp/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6572,'cube_chaos',NULL,'Cube Chaos is a complex strategy roguelike about placing units to create giant armies, factories, combos, or self replicating murder crabs, overwhelming and outsmarting your opponents. Build and adapt new strategies each run using a ludicrous variety of units, perks and more.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1958340/Cube_Chaos/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6573,'utter_a_name',NULL,'Disembodied souls linger in this old estate. To each one, utter their name.','2025/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3213430/Utter_a_Name/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6574,'alien:_isolation_-_safe_haven',NULL,'This content requires the base game Alien: Isolation on Steam in order to play.','2015/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/282514/Alien_Isolation__Safe_Haven/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6575,'de_blob',NULL,'The evil I.N.K.T. Corporation has declared \'Color is a Crime!\' and leeched Chroma City of all its beauty and interest. The race to rescue Chroma City has just begun, and only de Blob can save the world from a black-and-white future with his unique abilities to color the world back to life.','2017/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/532320/de_Blob/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6576,'winkeltje:_the_little_shop',NULL,'Winkeltje: The Little Shop is all about building, decorating, and running your own old-world fantasy shop. Buy low, sell high - from nails and apples to swords and alchemic love potions. Impress your customers, craft items, and be the master of your very own shop.','2022/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/949290/Winkeltje_The_Little_Shop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6577,'never_alone_(kisima_ingitchuna)',NULL,'Experience the epic journey of Nuna and Fox as they search for the source of an eternal blizzard that threatens the survival of everything they have ever known.','2014/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/295790/Never_Alone_Kisima_Ingitchuna/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6578,'node_farm',NULL,'Node Farm is a game about building a fully automated farm using nodes. Connect nodes, harvest and sell veggies, buy new islands, discover new nodes, and automate the process - all in a cozy farm simulation formula!','2024/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2738990/Node_Farm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6579,'ocean\'s_heart',NULL,'Ocean’s Heart is an epic top-down action RPG in which you explore a beautiful archipelago as a young woman named Tilia. Take on contracts to fight monsters, descend deep into ancient dungeons, defeat menacing foes, and unravel the mystery of Ocean’s Heart. All done in beautiful, bright pixel art.','2021/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1393750/Oceans_Heart/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6580,'mutazione',NULL,'A mutant soap opera where small-town gossip meets the supernatural. Explore the Mutazione community as Kai as she cares for her ailing grandfather. Discover magical gardens, new friends & old secrets. They can survive an apocalyptic meteor strike, but can they survive their small-town drama?','2019/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1080750/Mutazione/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6581,'deep_rock_galactic_-_original_soundtrack_volume_i_+_ii',NULL,'This is additional content for Deep Rock Galactic, but does not include the base game.','2018/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/802640/Deep_Rock_Galactic__Original_Soundtrack_Volume_I__II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6582,'deadly_premonition:_the_director\'s_cut',NULL,'Play as special agent Francis York Morgan in this open-world action-adventure as you solve the case of the Red Seed Murders and survive in a small, quirky American mountain town where supernatural creatures and a mysterious raincoat-clad, axe-wielding killer seek to end his investigation for good.','2013/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/247660/Deadly_Premonition_The_Directors_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6583,'realmyst:_masterpiece_edition',NULL,'Released in 2014, experience one of the first 3D adaptations of the renowned puzzle-adventure game Myst! Each discovery you make, every puzzle you solve, will bring you closer to reversing a wrong that has gone unchecked for ages.','2014/2/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/244430/realMyst_Masterpiece_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6584,'cursed_digicam_|_呪われたデジカメ',NULL,'You receive a cursed digital camera that captures ghosts from a strange website. The website allows you to liberate your loved ones by uploading images of their spirits using the camera. You decide to go to the nearest park where your girl was last seen.','2025/1/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3334550/Cursed_Digicam/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6585,'chill_pulse',NULL,'Chill Pulse combines productivity tools with serene environments. Use a Pomodoro timer and to-do lists to boost focus, while ambient sounds in settings from cyberpunk cities to ancient landscapes enhance relaxation.','2024/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2826180/Chill_Pulse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6586,'vampire:_the_masquerade_-_redemption',NULL,'Inhabiting the World of Darkness, you must face a series of brutal confrontations with your nemesis Vukodlak, a powerful vampire lord.','2000/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/559680/Vampire_The_Masquerade__Redemption/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6587,'that_time_i_got_reincarnated_as_a_slime_isekai_chronicles',NULL,'Spin a new tale of the Jura Tempest Federation together with all your favorite characters from the animated series!','2024/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2197680/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_ISEKAI_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6588,'flatout:_ultimate_carnage_collector\'s_edition',NULL,'Ready for the aggressive, adrenaline-filled ride that leaves you breathless? FlatOut: Ultimate Carnage Collector\'s Edition is all about destructive action. With carnage modes like the Deathmatch derby, Carnage Race and Head-on races are pure wreck-filled, adrenaline-pumping rides of maximum mayhem.','2008/8/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/12360/FlatOut_Ultimate_Carnage_Collectors_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6589,'emily_is_away_too',NULL,'Emily is Away Too is a brand new story featuring new characters and multiple different endings. Message your friends, surf the web and choose your path through this branching narrative.','2017/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/523780/Emily_is_Away_Too/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6590,'world_warfare_&_economics',NULL,'Take control of any nation and shape its future. Manage resources, trade, and taxes, engage in real-time warfare, navigate global diplomacy, and react to dynamic world events. Build a thriving economy, forge alliances, and command armies in a constantly evolving world!','2023/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1700300/World_Warfare__Economics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6591,'delivery_inc',NULL,'Delivery INC is a fast-paced time management game where you’ll be challenged with quick decision making and planning. Build a fleet of vehicles and drivers. Make deliveries before the customer’s patience runs out. Put your logic and delivery skills to the test in any real-world city.','2023/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1793260/Delivery_INC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6592,'global_city',NULL,'Become the mayor and build the city of your dreams! In this game, anything is possible. Whatever you can imagine in a city-building and development simulator, you can do. Start from the very beginning and unlock new possibilities for developing your city in Global City!','2021/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1731270/Global_City/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6593,'storage_hustle',NULL,'Storage Hustle is a Simulation RPG where you go into storage auctions to buy different mysterious storages. Discover and sell many items, join Yard Sales and haggle your way for profit!','2023/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2529170/Storage_Hustle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6594,'knights_college',NULL,'KnightsCollege is a kemono visual novel set in the Knight College, where elite knight candidates live. In this game, every choice is presented as a card, and the protagonist lives in the dormitory while collecting cards.','2021/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1510030/Knights_College/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6595,'stellar_warfare',NULL,'Space RTS with base building and ship customization. Personal passion project. More than 200 available ships, weapons and modules to design your fleet with. Contains a small campaign, several single and multiplayer game modes and a coop game mode. Also contains Wave defense!','2021/8/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1113030/Stellar_Warfare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6596,'fun_with_ragdolls:_the_game',NULL,'Become a ragdoll and create your own environments in Sandbox Mode, explore worlds created by others, or just flop around your destructible sets! Fun with Ragdolls: The Game lets you enjoy everything you love about ragdolls!','2019/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1142500/Fun_with_Ragdolls_The_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6597,'pool_cleaning_simulator',NULL,'\"Pool Cleaning Simulator is a PowerWash Simulator-esque cleaning game where you use a variety of tools to make filthy pools sparkling clean.\" The game recreates the entire process of cleaning, scrubbing, & maintaining various pools, from luxurious backyard havens to community swimming complexes.','2024/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2165620/Pool_Cleaning_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6598,'megadimension_neptunia_vii',NULL,'New challengers are taking control of Gamindustri, and Neptune\'s nowhere in sight. Now she’s gotta help a mysterious stranger fight a colossal new evil, reclaim her Goddess title, and find some time for pudding! Go next gen with Giant Battles and multi-worlds in this JRPG!','2016/7/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/460120/Megadimension_Neptunia_VII/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6599,'scourgebringer',NULL,'ScourgeBringer is a fast-paced free-moving roguelite platformer. Help Kyhra to explore the unknown and slash her way through ancient machines guarding the seal of her past, and maybe the redemption of humanity.','2020/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1037020/ScourgeBringer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6600,'tds_-_tower_defense_strategy',NULL,'TOWER ▪ DEFENSE ▪ STRATEGY. Control Vessels. Utilize their uniquely deep set of towers. Create an everchanging defense. Play with friends. Protect your Basin at all costs. An absolute Tower Defense, Real-Time Strategy Hybrid','2025/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2392280/TDS__Tower_Defense_Strategy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6601,'viscera_cleanup_detail_-_the_vulcan_affair',NULL,'This content requires the base game Viscera Cleanup Detail on Steam in order to play.','2018/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/982110/Viscera_Cleanup_Detail__The_Vulcan_Affair/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6602,'train_simulator:_the_riviera_line:_exeter-paignton_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2014/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/222632/Train_Simulator_The_Riviera_Line_ExeterPaignton_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6603,'bomber_crew_secret_weapons_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Bomber Crew on Steam in order to play.','2017/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/754680/Bomber_Crew_Secret_Weapons_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6604,'idle_cultivation',NULL,'Idle towards Immortality! Ascend the cultivation stages to become immortal. Battle experts, monsters and mythological beasts. Draw talismans, craft powerful equipment and powerful pills to assist you in combat.','2025/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3697240/Idle_Cultivation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6605,'dakar_desert_rally',NULL,'Dakar Desert Rally is the biggest off-road rally racing adventure ever developed. Experience the speed and excitement of the largest rally race on the planet, featuring a wide variety of licensed vehicles from motorcycles, cars, trucks, quads and SSVs.','2022/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1839940/Dakar_Desert_Rally/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6606,'dcs:_kola_map_by_orbx',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2778890/DCS_Kola_Map_by_Orbx/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_139'),(6607,'urtuk:_the_desolation',NULL,'Urtuk is an open world, tactical turn-based RPG in a low-fantasy setting. Guide your band of adventurers through the ruins of an ancient world. Recruit new followers, loot the corpses of your fallen foes, and do your best to survive in this harsh and unforgiving realm.','2021/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1181830/Urtuk_The_Desolation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6608,'jellycar_worlds',NULL,'It\'s a Car, made of Jelly! Squishy Physics, Tactile, Silly & Imaginative Driving/Platforming','2022/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1740930/JellyCar_Worlds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6609,'drums_rock',NULL,'Drums Rock is an arcade drums game for VR, follow the rhythm of rock with your drums and smash the demons. Live a unique campaign: with different levels, challenges, songs and worlds. Drums Rock is an ideal game to feel like a rock hero, while destroying hordes of demons to the rhythm of rock!','2023/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1906020/Drums_Rock/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6610,'real_vr_fishing',NULL,'🎣 Dive into the Ultimate Real VR Fishing Experience! Explore stunningly realistic environments with Real VR Fishing. Relax in 40 beautiful maps and expand your adventure with DLC packs, unlocking 95 fishing locations. Discover 150+ fish species in the base game and over 300 species with DLC.','2024/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1266470/Real_VR_Fishing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6611,'vvvvvv',NULL,'VVVVVV is a platform game all about exploring one simple mechanical idea - what if you reversed gravity instead of jumping?','2010/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/70300/VVVVVV/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6612,'atlas',NULL,'Set sail for the ultimate pirate experience! Embark on a grand adventure alongside thousands of other players in one of the largest game worlds ever built (and even claim a piece of it to call your own). Build your ship, assemble your crew, sail the high seas, and become a pirate legend!','2018/12/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/834910/ATLAS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6613,'just_shapes_&_beats_-_monstercat_track_selection',NULL,'This is additional content for Just Shapes & Beats, but does not include the base game.','2018/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/873030/Just_Shapes__Beats__Monstercat_Track_Selection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6614,'tiny_pasture_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tiny Pasture on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3467780/Tiny_Pasture__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6615,'deathsmiles',NULL,'Deathsmiles is CAVE\'s bullet-hell shoot-\'em-up where you take the role of one of five Angels to defend the magical land of Gilverado from an invasion by Hell itself! Eradicate this devilish assault!','2016/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/314180/Deathsmiles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6616,'freddi_fish_2:_the_case_of_the_haunted_schoolhouse',NULL,'So who is haunting the schoolhouse, taking the toys and practically scaring the scales off all the guppies?','1996/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/294530/Freddi_Fish_2_The_Case_of_the_Haunted_Schoolhouse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6617,'crashlands',NULL,'Fight and tame alien beasts, craft resources into menacing weaponry, befriend the outlandish locals, and go toe-to-chin with a world-domineering maniac.','2016/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/391730/Crashlands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6618,'unreal_life',NULL,'And now, for today\'s story.','2020/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1335560/UNREAL_LIFE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6619,'hollywood_mogul_4',NULL,'Own the studio. Run the studio. Make the movies. Play Hollywood Mogul 4 and run your own Hollywood movie studio in a complex, immersive, business strategy simulation that is TEXT-BASED with NO GRAPHICS and MINIMAL SOUND.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3536760/Hollywood_Mogul_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6620,'payday_2:_mcshay_weapon_pack_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2074230/PAYDAY_2_McShay_Weapon_Pack_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6621,'archean',NULL,'Gather resources, craft components, build vehicles, and code their logic in a physics-driven engineering sandbox and full scale space sim.','2024/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2941660/Archean/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6622,'ship_graveyard_simulator_2_-_submarines_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ship Graveyard Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2909000/Ship_Graveyard_Simulator_2__Submarines_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6623,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator_-_japan_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ultimate Fishing® Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2020/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1284880/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator__Japan_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6624,'no_umbrellas_allowed',NULL,'Reveal the true value of the items coming into the shop. Each item has their own history. Dig deep to see what is behind them and become an expert appraiser. Begin a tug of war with customers. With their own expectations and knowledge, they never give up on money.','2021/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1301390/No_Umbrellas_Allowed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6625,'the_ninja_saviors:_return_of_the_warriors',NULL,'Alluring audio! Pixel art perfection! Beat-em up beauty! Discover how hard a 32,000kg ninja hits with The Ninja Saviours!','2023/7/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2288070/The_Ninja_Saviors_Return_of_the_Warriors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6626,'cooking_simulator_-_cakes_and_cookies',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cooking Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1227350/Cooking_Simulator__Cakes_and_Cookies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6627,'owlboy',NULL,'Owlboy is a story-driven platform adventure game, where you can fly and explore a brand new world in the clouds! Pick up your friends, and bring them with you as you explore the open skies, in one of the most detailed adventures of this era.','2016/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/115800/Owlboy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6628,'production_line_:_car_factory_simulation',NULL,'Production line is the new car factory management/simulation/tycoon game that pushes your organisational and entrepreneurship skills to the limit. Can you build the ultimate optimised, free-flowing car production line whilst beating the competition and still turn a profit?','2019/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/591370/Production_Line__Car_factory_simulation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6629,'lilia:_the_fallen_flower_in_the_prison_city',NULL,'Captured, imprisoned, and forced to work... Will you escape, or become another cog in the machine?','2025/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3041820/Lilia_The_Fallen_Flower_in_the_Prison_City/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6630,'realm_grinder',NULL,'Grow your realm, build alliances, and explore one of the deepest idle RPGs ever!','2017/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/610080/Realm_Grinder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6631,'sedap!_a_culinary_adventure',NULL,'SEDAP! is a co-op cooking-combat adventure that combines the chaos of a collaborative kitchen and the wonders of adventuring into an unexplored world. Embark on an exciting culinary journey, whip up delectable delicacies, and serve your way through a fantastical reimagination of Southeast Asia!','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2650730/SEDAP_A_Culinary_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6632,'the_void_rains_upon_her_heart',NULL,'Help her heart battle tough bosses in this Boss Rush, Bullet-hell with rogue-like elements. Fight through several randomly chosen boss battles leading up to a final battle. Each defeated monster will give her random gifts that power up her heart. Don\'t let her heart break!','2018/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/790060/The_Void_Rains_Upon_Her_Heart/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6633,'tomb_raider:_underworld',NULL,'Tomb Raider: Underworld represents a new advancement in exploration-based gameplay. As fearless adventurer Lara Croft explore exotic locations around the world, each designed with an incredible attention to detail resulting in breathtaking high-definition visual fidelity that creates a truly believable world and delivers a new level of...','2008/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/8140/Tomb_Raider_Underworld/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6634,'blacktail',NULL,'Forge the legend of Baba Yaga, a girl accused of witchcraft and expelled from her home. Live out the origins of the Slavic myth in this one-of-a-kind blend of intense archery combat and dark storytelling set in a vibrant fairy tale world.','2022/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1532690/BLACKTAIL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6635,'ggst_additional_character_13_-_slayer',NULL,'This content requires the base game GUILTY GEAR -STRIVE- on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2524060/GGST_Additional_Character_13__Slayer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6636,'concordia:_digital_edition',NULL,'Concordia is a strategic, Euro-style board game. 🏺 Players take the roles of powerful Roman merchants and follow the Roman expansion with their trade routes, franchises, and production houses. 🏛️','2021/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1450330/Concordia_Digital_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6637,'ship_graveyard_simulator_2_-_steel_giants_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ship Graveyard Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2504670/Ship_Graveyard_Simulator_2__Steel_Giants_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6638,'king_of_retail',NULL,'The store is your kingdom! Expand your humble boutique into a thriving business: hire the right staff, decorate your displays, and lure in customers. Even your wildest ideas can turn a profit. Why not start a business that sells only white T-shirts and ketchup? PCs and beans? Your rule, your rules!','2022/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/968250/King_of_Retail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6639,'gabriel_knight:_sins_of_the_fathers_20th_anniversary_edition',NULL,'Revisit of one of adventure gaming’s greatest classics by master storyteller Jane Jensen! Struggling bookstore owner Gabriel Knight investigates the sinister Voodoo Murders in New Orleans, discovering the secrets of his family history and unfolding his destiny in this tale of horror and suspense.','2014/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/262000/Gabriel_Knight_Sins_of_the_Fathers_20th_Anniversary_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6640,'sovl_-_darkborn_elves',NULL,'This content requires the base game SOVL: Fantasy Warfare on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3230100/SOVL__Darkborn_Elves/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6641,'umurangi_generation',NULL,'Umurangi Generation is a first person photography game in the shitty future. Set in Tauranga Aotearoa off the back of an impending crisis you are a courier for the Tauranga Express. Throughout the game you will unlock a variety of lenses and equipment.','2020/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1223500/Umurangi_Generation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6642,'hotline_miami_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Hotline Miami, but does not include the base game.','2013/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/219152/Hotline_Miami_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6643,'laundry_&_supermarket_simulator',NULL,'\"Laundry Simulator\" immerses you in the bustling laundry business. Manage a boutique shop, handling everything from everyday clothes to luxury garments, and sell related products. Efficiently manage resources, upgrade equipment, and optimize layout to attract customers with superior service.','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3125570/Laundry__Supermarket_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6644,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_northern_justice',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2643050/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Northern_Justice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6645,'don\'t_escape_trilogy',NULL,'In this classic point-and-click adventure anthology by award-winning indie developer Scriptwelder, you\'ll protect an unsuspecting hamlet from yourself, try to prepare for an incoming undead horde, and search a seemingly empty spaceship for answers to a gruesome mystery.','2019/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1070550/Dont_Escape_Trilogy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6646,'dreamfall:_the_longest_journey',NULL,'Dreamfall: The Longest Journey, winner of multiple E3 awards as the best game in its genre, is the continuation of a saga that began in the award-winning The Longest Journey, considered to be one of the finest adventure games ever made.','2006/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6300/Dreamfall_The_Longest_Journey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6647,'midnight_special',NULL,'Welcome to Midnight Special, a point-and-click survival horror game drenched in 16-bit pixel art and 1980s retro dread. On a thunderous night in 1987 in Maine, you awaken in a labyrinthine manor. You must click, explore, and solve puzzles to escape. Will you go gentle into that good night?','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2560100/Midnight_Special/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6648,'doll_impostor',NULL,'Doll Impostor is a horror game where 1-4 players take on the role of guardians of possessed dolls. Work together to identify the impostor doll before 9 a.m, or face dire consequences. Every hour counts in this tense, fear-filled race against time.','2024/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2882870/Doll_Impostor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6649,'thief™_gold',NULL,'Stalk your prey on the quest for stolen goods with your blackjack, sword, and an assortment of unique arrows. Steal for money and uncover the hidden agendas of your allies and enemies as you play through an unravelling story of deception and revenge.','1998/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/211600/Thief_Gold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6650,'juice_galaxy',NULL,'Juice Galaxy is a happy place to fly around and smack things and drink juice. And explore things. And just, flip around doing stuff.','2023/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1708150/Juice_Galaxy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6651,'the_braves',NULL,'Demolish hordes of enemies and survive against all odds! Unlock different characters, find powerful skill combinations and embark on an exciting journey through the variety of very different worlds in this cute but unforgiving roguelike game!','2024/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2479830/The_Braves/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_140'),(6652,'back_in_service:_a_metro_driver',NULL,'Join the adventure and become the master of the metro in our game, which takes you into the underground world. Overcome challenges on the tracks from the cabin of a historic train. Can you complete the route, transport all passengers, and avoid delays?','2025/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3331320/Back_in_Service_a_Metro_Driver/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6653,'m.a.s.s._builder',NULL,'Commander, customize and build your Mechanical Assault Skeleton Suit (M.A.S.S.) and lead the fight against an alien invasion bent on exterminating the human race. The fate of humanity is in your hands.','2019/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/956680/MASS_Builder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6654,'two_point_hospital:_fancy_dress_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Two Point Hospital on Steam in order to play.','2020/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1376920/Two_Point_Hospital_Fancy_Dress_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6655,'first_class_escape_2:_head_in_the_clouds',NULL,'\"First Class Escape 2: Head in the Clouds\" is a co-operative atmospheric escape-room-style puzzle game, set in a beautiful luxury airship. Do you think you have what it takes to overcome the challenges that await you on the airship?','2022/2/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1826570/First_Class_Escape_2_Head_in_the_Clouds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6656,'gales_of_nayeli',NULL,'Gales of Nayeli is a Grid-Based Strategy RPG featuring 40+ playable characters. Follow Nayeli as she travels across Iuven on her way to face the tyrant, Bloodlust. Along the way, she will meet victims of Bloodlust’s reign lead the last charge against a darkness that echoes across time and space.','2025/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1878490/Gales_of_Nayeli/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6657,'turbo_dismount™',NULL,'Turbo Dismount is a kinetic tragedy about Mr. Dismount and the cars who love him. It is the official sequel to the wildly popular and immensely successful personal impact simulator - Stair Dismount.','2014/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/263760/Turbo_Dismount/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6658,'surviving_the_abyss',NULL,'Earth, 1976. You have been tasked with managing a deep-sea science facility working to perfect cloning. Explore the darkness and keep your crew alive in this hardcore survival colony builder. And beware. The darkness hides untold horrors.','2024/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1254320/Surviving_the_Abyss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6659,'scavenger_sv-4',NULL,'Scavenger SV-4 is a highly replayable atmospheric first-person science fiction game. Part simulator, part roguelike, it has elements of action, combat, resource management, and a dash of horror. It is not quite like any game you have played before.','2018/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/779590/Scavenger_SV4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6660,'star_wars_outlaws:_a_pirate\'s_fortune_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Star Wars Outlaws on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3541390/Star_Wars_Outlaws_A_Pirates_Fortune_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6661,'cossacks:_back_to_war',NULL,'Cossacks: Back to War contains all of the gameplay features of Cossacks: European Wars and Cossacks: The Art of War, this is a complete care package for all current and future Cossacks fans. This add-on contains two new nations: Switzerland and Hungary.','2002/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/4850/Cossacks_Back_to_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6662,'monaco:_what\'s_yours_is_mine',NULL,'Monaco: What\'s Yours Is Mine is a single player or co-op heist game. Assemble a crack team of thieves, case the joint, and pull off the perfect heist.','2013/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/113020/Monaco_Whats_Yours_Is_Mine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6663,'holdfast:_nations_at_war_-_loyalist_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Holdfast: Nations At War on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1243770/Holdfast_Nations_At_War__Loyalist_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6664,'blockbuster_inc.',NULL,'Ever dreamed of making your own movies? Build up your own movie studio, scout for upcoming stars, and produce cutting-edge films and TV shows. Try to stay ahead of your competition throughout the history of cinematography.','2024/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1793090/Blockbuster_Inc/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6665,'bloodstained:_ritual_of_the_night_-_classic_ii:_dominique\'s_curse',NULL,'This content requires the base game Bloodstained: Ritual of the Night on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2380803/Bloodstained_Ritual_of_the_Night__Classic_II_Dominiques_Curse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6666,'train_simulator:_portsmouth_direct_line:_london_waterloo_-_portsmouth_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/820203/Train_Simulator_Portsmouth_Direct_Line_London_Waterloo__Portsmouth_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6667,'interstellar_space:_genesis',NULL,'Interstellar Space: Genesis is a turn-based space 4X strategy game in which you attempt to build a thriving galactic empire. Discover mysteries among the stars, colonize worlds, and engage enemies in tactical turn-based combat on your journey to becoming the ruler of the galaxy!','2019/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/984680/Interstellar_Space_Genesis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6668,'ironwolf_vr',NULL,'IronWolf VR is a roomscale submarine game playable either singleplayer or online co-op with motion controls. Built from the ground up for VR, each part of the submarine has been crafted for an optimal VR experience.','2022/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/552080/IronWolf_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6669,'fishing_planet:_sport_bottom_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1000717/Fishing_Planet_Sport_Bottom_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6670,'kingdom_two_crowns:_ost',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Two Crowns on Steam in order to play.','2018/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/988810/Kingdom_Two_Crowns_OST/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6671,'prince_of_persia:_the_forgotten_sands™',NULL,'Prince of Persia The Forgotten Sands is the next chapter in the fan-favorite Sands of Time universe. Visiting his brother\'s kingdom following his adventure in Azad, the Prince finds the royal palace under siege from a mighty army bent on its destruction.','2010/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/33320/Prince_of_Persia_The_Forgotten_Sands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6672,'audiosurf_2',NULL,'Ride your music in more ways than ever before. Audiosurf 2 is the music game for your entire music collection. Hundreds of mods/skins on Workshop. Free demo available.','2015/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/235800/Audiosurf_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6673,'virtual_circuit_board',NULL,'Virtual Circuit Board is the sandbox drawing-based logic simulator where you can build, program, decorate, and simulate anything from simple monochrome circuits to complex and colorful computers. Play with digital logic in this sandbox-only experience.','2023/10/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1885690/Virtual_Circuit_Board/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6674,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator_-_florida_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ultimate Fishing® Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1256780/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator__Florida_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6675,'kingdom_come:_deliverance_–_band_of_bastards',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Come: Deliverance on Steam in order to play.','2019/2/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/977420/Kingdom_Come_Deliverance__Band_of_Bastards/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6676,'feign',NULL,'Feign is a role-playing game with a maximum of 12 players that takes place in a small town where innocents, imposters, and neutrals live together. You use your role at night and send a person from the village in the morning. 🤪','2021/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1436990/Feign/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6677,'holdfast:_nations_at_war_-_napoleon\'s_rise',NULL,'This content requires the base game Holdfast: Nations At War on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2692480/Holdfast_Nations_At_War__Napoleons_Rise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6678,'taiji',NULL,'Solve puzzle panels and uncover the meaning of the symbols within. Explore a dense world where secrets are hidden in plain sight.','2022/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1141580/Taiji/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6679,'warpips',NULL,'Warpips is the ultimate quick to learn but amazingly deep tug-of-war strategy game. Deploy the right composition of soldiers, tanks, helicopters and planes in this tight, streamlined strategy-focused war game. Compose the best army, research the right tech; overwhelm your enemy!','2022/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1291010/Warpips/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6680,'wolfquest:_anniversary_-_yellowstone_wolf_coat_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game WolfQuest: Anniversary Edition on Steam in order to play.','2021/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1529920/WolfQuest_Anniversary__Yellowstone_Wolf_Coat_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6681,'planet_coaster_-_magnificent_rides_collection',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Coaster on Steam in order to play.','2018/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/995780/Planet_Coaster__Magnificent_Rides_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6682,'yog-sothoth’s_yard',NULL,'Manage a hotel and hire employees including Death, a dragon, a Demon-Slayer, and a bioroid maid. Build your wealth through various means and refine your strategies based on the predictions of Oracles. Your choices will determine which employees become enamored with you.','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2194530/YogSothoths_Yard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6683,'cultist_simulator:_the_exile',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cultist Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2020/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1259930/Cultist_Simulator_The_Exile/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6684,'dialtown:_phone_dating_sim',NULL,'If you\'ve ever wanted to romantically pursue a phone, then hot DARN, do I have just the game for you.','2022/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1035990/Dialtown_Phone_Dating_Sim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6685,'moduwar',NULL,'Moduwar is an adaptive organic RTS where you control an alien creature, Modu - and your body is your army. Grow new organs, split, merge and mutate them into unique units that adapt to your needs as you fight against human and alien threats in single and multiplayer modes.','2025/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/923100/Moduwar/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6686,'spyparty',NULL,'SpyParty is a competitive espionage game about subtle human behavior. A Spy hides in plain sight at a fancy cocktail party, trying to accomplish missions while blending in with the other guests, while a Sniper with a single bullet looks inward, searching for the Spy.','2018/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/329070/SpyParty/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6687,'the_colonists',NULL,'Build a new home for your team of robots as they begin a new life for themselves on a distant planet where they can fulfil their ultimate dream: to be human.','2018/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/677340/The_Colonists/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6688,'meiji_tokyo_renka__full_moon',NULL,'“Meiji Tokyo Renka Full Moon” (also known as “Meikoi”) is a historical romance fantasy game in which the main character travels back in time to the Meiji era and meets and falls in love with the great figures of history. Having ability changes her relationship with them....','2024/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2779890/Meiji_Tokyo_Renka__Full_Moon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6689,'higurashi_when_they_cry_hou_-_ch.4_himatsubushi',NULL,'Higurashi When They Cry is a sound novel. The music, backgrounds and characters work together to create a world that is the stage of a novel for the user to read. They laugh and cry and get angry. The user takes the point of view of the protagonist to experience the story.','2016/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/526490/Higurashi_When_They_Cry_Hou__Ch4_Himatsubushi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6690,'a_hat_in_time_-_seal_the_deal',NULL,'This content requires the base game A Hat in Time on Steam in order to play.','2018/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/787340/A_Hat_in_Time__Seal_the_Deal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6691,'omno',NULL,'A single-player journey of discovery through an ancient world of wonders, created by solo developer Jonas Manke.','2021/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/969760/Omno/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6692,'change:_a_homeless_survival_experience',NULL,'CHANGE is an award nominated homeless survival experience set in a randomly created city with rogue-like elements. Explore, survive, earn perks, find items & kindness to develop your character & escape to a new life. Over 7 years of development & over 200 updates so far!','2020/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/926140/CHANGE_A_Homeless_Survival_Experience/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6693,'dream_life_in_the_country_side',NULL,'A laid-back farming simulator where you play as Lisa, a dedicated farmer by day and a passionate partner of Honoka at night. Work the land, raise animals, and cultivate your relationship. Unlock special scenes as your bond and farm flourish.','2025/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3442040/Dream_Life_in_the_Country_Side/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6694,'carmen_sandiego',NULL,'The scarlet super thief Carmen Sandiego is back! Adorn Carmen’s signature red hat and play as the vigilante herself to navigate a world of espionage, utilizing high-tech gadgets, and ultimately capturing VILE.','2025/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2475300/Carmen_Sandiego/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6695,'phantom_brigade',NULL,'Phantom Brigade is a hybrid turn-based & real-time tactical RPG with an innovative timeline-based command system. See the future, predict enemy actions, and plot your counterattack on the timeline! Outnumbered and out-gunned, lead the Brigade\'s campaign to retake their war-torn homeland.','2023/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/553540/Phantom_Brigade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6696,'machinika:_atlas',NULL,'Machinika: Atlas is an indie puzzle game and is the direct sequel to Machinika: Museum, you play as a museum researcher who just land on Atlas. Will you unravel the mysteries of the alien vessel? Solve cryptic puzzles to find out what happened!','2024/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2817620/Machinika_Atlas/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6697,'alien_shooter',NULL,'The endless darkness and the somber, long passages of a military complex have become the abode of evil, thousands of blood-thirsty creatures fill its offices, storehouses and mysterious laboratories. About 1,000 monsters on each map, showing up to 100 monsters simultaneously on one playing screen.','2003/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/33100/Alien_Shooter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6698,'golf_with_your_friends_-_bouncy_castle_course',NULL,'This content requires the base game Golf With Your Friends on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1901922/Golf_With_Your_Friends__Bouncy_Castle_Course/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_141'),(6699,'thief:_deadly_shadows',NULL,'You are Garrett, the master thief. Rarely seen and never caught, Garrett is the best that ever was. Able to sneak past any guard, pick any lock, and break into the most ingeniously secured residences. Garrett steals from the wealthy and gives to himself, making his living in the dark and foreboding City.','2004/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6980/Thief_Deadly_Shadows/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6700,'root:_exiles_&_partisans_&_vagabonds',NULL,'This content requires the base game Root on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1935900/Root_Exiles__Partisans__Vagabonds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6701,'arcanum:_of_steamworks_and_magick_obscura',NULL,'Imagine a place of wonder, where magick and technology coexist in an uneasy balance, and an adventurer might just as easily wield a flintlock pistol as a flaming sword. Welcome to the land of Arcanum.','2001/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/500810/Arcanum_Of_Steamworks_and_Magick_Obscura/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6702,'blazing_chrome',NULL,'In Blazing Chrome, bring your best pal and kick some metal butts to free the humankind while enjoying a classic run’n’gun, fully loaded with action and exciting fights!','2019/7/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/609110/Blazing_Chrome/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6703,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator_-_vr_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ultimate Fishing® Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2019/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1137540/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator__VR_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6704,'beholder_-_blissful_sleep',NULL,'This content requires the base game Beholder on Steam in order to play.','2017/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/616950/Beholder__Blissful_Sleep/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6705,'drift_ce',NULL,'Tune your dream drift car, change parts, boost performance and challenge other players on Japan\'s legendary EBISU circuits!','2021/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/520950/DRIFT_CE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6706,'alan_wake_collector\'s_edition_extras',NULL,'This content requires the base game Alan Wake on Steam in order to play.','2012/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/108726/Alan_Wake_Collectors_Edition_Extras/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6707,'togainu_no_chi_~lost_blood~',NULL,'Akira’s life has been defined by violence, but that won’t be enough to save him when he’s forced to play a deadly game. Will the bonds you forge in this stunning visual novel lead to his salvation, or to his ruin?','2020/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1174400/Togainu_no_Chi_Lost_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6708,'the_procession_to_calvary',NULL,'Pilfer from pirates, conspire with cardinals and perform miracles with an incompetent magician. The Procession to Calvary is a Pythonesque adventure game made from Renaissance paintings, and a spiritual successor to the critically acclaimed Four Last Things.','2020/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1071130/The_Procession_to_Calvary/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6709,'computer_tycoon',NULL,'Computer Tycoon is a fairly complex Business Grand Strategy game about Computer Evolution. Start in the 70s, invent until 2034, create the best computer systems, upgrade your infrastructure, lead a team, and alter computer history! It is time to \"Think Different\"','2017/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/686680/Computer_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6710,'fallout_4_-_automatron',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fallout 4 on Steam in order to play.','2016/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/435870/Fallout_4__Automatron/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6711,'brawlhalla:_ezio_starter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Brawlhalla on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2974360/Brawlhalla_Ezio_Starter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6712,'dcs:_ajs-37_viggen_by_heatblur_simulations',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2017/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/411930/DCS_AJS37_Viggen_by_Heatblur_Simulations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6713,'american_truck_simulator_-_classic_stripes_paint_jobs_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/951650/American_Truck_Simulator__Classic_Stripes_Paint_Jobs_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6714,'kingdoms_and_castles_-_parks_&_statues',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdoms and Castles on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1764300/Kingdoms_and_Castles__Parks__Statues/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6715,'minion_masters',NULL,'An addictive fast-paced hybrid of Card games & Tower-Defense. Play 1v1 - or bring a friend for 2v2 - and engage in epic online multiplayer battles full of innovative strategy and awesome plays! Collect 200+ cards with unique mechanics, all free!','2019/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/489520/Minion_Masters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6716,'kinkoi:_golden_time',NULL,'Welcome to Noble Private Academy, an institution that cultivates the wealthiest, most well-connected students in all of Japan! At this boarding school, one must be willing to accept all of its refined and dignified teachings or be met with strict opposition!','2022/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1985260/Kinkoi_Golden_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6717,'sunless_sea_-_zubmariner',NULL,'This content requires the base game SUNLESS SEA on Steam in order to play.','2016/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/452530/Sunless_Sea__Zubmariner/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6718,'little_noah:_scion_of_paradise',NULL,'Join the genius alchemist Noah and her cat companion Zipper as they explore ancient ruins to uncover the secrets hidden within! Create unique teams and combos from 40+ recruitable allies in this casual but compelling game!','2022/6/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1883260/Little_Noah_Scion_of_Paradise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6719,'capcom_beat_\'em_up_bundle',NULL,'Relive the glory days of cooperative arcade games with the Capcom Beat \'Em Up Bundle! This comprehensive collection includes seven classic titles, each with various multiplayer options and online capabilities!','2018/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/885150/Capcom_Beat_Em_Up_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6720,'crush_the_castle_legacy_collection',NULL,'Crush the Castle Legacy Collection is the triumphant return of the classic Armor Games physics destruction game! Let destruction reign by loading up your trusty trebuchet and showing the enemy castle who’s boss.','2022/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1838970/Crush_the_Castle_Legacy_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6721,'closer_the_distance',NULL,'Closer the Distance is a slice-of-life sim that tells a deeply emotional story about the connections between family and friends in the face of tragedy. Unearth long kept secrets, repair strained relationships, and help your loved ones move on.','2024/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1991300/Closer_the_Distance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6722,'escape_simulator:_supporter_pack_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Escape Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2843390/Escape_Simulator_Supporter_Pack_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6723,'a_summer\'s_end_-_hong_kong_1986',NULL,'A Summer\'s End is a visual novel set in 1980s Hong Kong. It tells of a love story between two women. Lush and vibrant visuals, the game features over 400 unique hand-drawn artwork inspired by Asian cinema and 1980s anime.','2020/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1111370/A_Summers_End__Hong_Kong_1986/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6724,'chornobyl_liquidators',NULL,'Chornobyl Liquidators is not a fantastic tale of exploring the Zone. It\'s a story about real people facing a real threat — the CNPP disaster. Invisible radiation, KGB, difficult moral choices... Do you have enough courage and strength to take on this challenge?','2024/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1113010/Chornobyl_Liquidators/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6725,'kvark',NULL,'Kvark is an FPS game set in a fictional version of the 80s Czech Republic. The player finds themselves in an underground facility that is falling apart as they travel through it. They will have to navigate through dark tunnels and will encounter many obstacles and enemies that will test their skills','2024/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2319390/Kvark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6726,'age_of_wonders_iii_-_eternal_lords_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Wonders III on Steam in order to play.','2015/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/329530/Age_of_Wonders_III__Eternal_Lords_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6727,'shelter_2',NULL,'As a powerful Lynx, you will make your way through vast open landscapes. In the harsh tundra, you will raise and strengthen your cubs by mastering your skills for hunting prey. Do everything you can to prepare your little ones for the vicious entities dwelling in the wilderness.','2015/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/275100/Shelter_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6728,'the_hex',NULL,'In a creaky old tavern, in a forgotten corner of the video-game universe, a storm is raging. An anonymous caller suggests that there is a murder plot. Six video game protagonists are the only plausible suspects...','2018/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/510420/The_Hex/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6729,'rogue_flight',NULL,'A breathtaking arcade space combat game inspired by prestige anime.','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2784620/ROGUE_FLIGHT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6730,'welcome_to_kowloon',NULL,'This is an indie horror from the first person, in which you find yourself in an area called Kowloon in search of cheap housing. The inhabitants of this place only at first glance seem to be ordinary people, but if we dig deeper, we will see their real faces.','2023/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2515240/Welcome_to_Kowloon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6731,'undisputed_-_the_problem_child_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Undisputed on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3102510/Undisputed__The_Problem_Child_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6732,'fight_knight',NULL,'FIGHT KNIGHT is a first-person dungeon-brawler! Grid-based dungeon crawling meets action-packed real time enemy encounters. Fight your way through puzzles and enemies to save those trapped in the Tower\'s eternal night!','2021/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/792120/FIGHT_KNIGHT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6733,'train_sim_world®_5:_schnellfahrstrecke_kassel_-_würzburg_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970050/Train_Sim_World_5_Schnellfahrstrecke_Kassel__Wrzburg_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6734,'train_simulator:_isle_of_wight_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2012/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/24021/Train_Simulator_Isle_of_Wight_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6735,'slay_the_princess_-_supporters_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Slay the Princess — The Pristine Cut on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2642210/Slay_the_Princess__Supporters_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6736,'project_arrhythmia',NULL,'A musical bullet-hell where all things beautiful are deadly. Dodge well little nanobot, you don\'t have much time.','2019/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/440310/Project_Arrhythmia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6737,'guacamelee!_super_turbo_championship_edition',NULL,'The definitive version of the smash hit Metroidvania-style action-platformer, Guacamelee! STCE adds new levels, powers, challenges and refinements to the sprawling, ridiculous, Mexican-inspired adventure of the original Guacamelee! Gold Edition.','2014/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/275390/Guacamelee_Super_Turbo_Championship_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6738,'nin_online',NULL,'Become a Ninja in an Open World MMORPG. Nin Online blends deep roleplaying systems with intense real-time combat where only the strongest thrive.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1674010/Nin_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6739,'the_shell_part_iii:_paradiso',NULL,'The coiling chains of obsession that began with The Shell now threaten to strangle Detective Reiji Tokisaka in the third and final entry in the trilogy. As old friends and foes rise up for one last confrontation, can anyone break the cycle—and can Reiji\'s heart ever be set free?','2025/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3296790/The_Shell_Part_III_Paradiso/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6740,'gravel',NULL,'Gravel is the ultimate off-road experience. The most extreme racing game that will let you try out amazing stunts in the wildest places on the planet!','2018/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/558260/Gravel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6741,'afl_26',NULL,'Get ready for the future of footy with AFL 26. Feel every hit, hear every roar, and live every moment with unmatched authenticity and intensity.','2025/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3468640/AFL_26/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6742,'hello_neighbor:_hide_and_seek',NULL,'Hello Neighbor: Hide and Seek follows the tragic story of the Neighbor’s family in this dramatic prequel to Hello Neighbor. Experience playing a game of hide-and-seek with your brother as you both deal with the loss of a family member.','2019/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/960420/Hello_Neighbor_Hide_and_Seek/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6743,'ascension:_deckbuilding_game',NULL,'Ascension: Deckbuilding Game is now available for your PC and Mac, complete with 9 full expansion decks! Play alone or with friends to battle against the Fallen One for honor and victory. Conceived and designed by Justin Gary, Ascension will provide hours of engaging and strategic game play for enthusiasts and experienced gamers alike.','2014/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/320430/Ascension_Deckbuilding_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6744,'glider_sim_–_flight_simulator',NULL,'Soar through the skies in this immersive flight simulator featuring Paragliding, Hang Gliding, and Ultralights. Built with real glider pilots in mind, Glider Sim delivers unmatched realism—playable in or out of VR.','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1422940/Glider_Sim__Flight_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6745,'pic-me!',NULL,'Pic-Me! is a card game about deception, where players use wonderous images to spark creativity and imagination. Each round becomes an intricate mindgame against the other players at the table. Will you be able to outsmart your friends or will you be tricked by them? 4-8 players only.','2024/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3265280/PicMe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6746,'dahlia_view',NULL,'Sometimes it takes a nightmare to wake a place like Dahlia View. Lead the investigation into a missing child and discover the dark secret of Dahlia View in this story-driven observational thriller from the creators of The Occupation and Ether One.','2021/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1548750/Dahlia_View/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6747,'endless™_space_2_-_vaulters',NULL,'This content requires the base game ENDLESS™ Space 2 on Steam in order to play.','2018/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/733140/ENDLESS_Space_2__Vaulters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_142'),(6748,'wrestlequest',NULL,'TAG TEAM WITH DESTINY! Pro wrestling and RPG fantasy collide in the ultimate pixel powered adventure. “Macho Man” Randy Savage and tons of other icons offer guidance as you powerbomb your way to glory beyond the ring. This hero’s journey ain’t just an epic quest, it’s WRESTLEQUEST!','2023/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1867510/WrestleQuest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6749,'tron:_identity',NULL,'Something has been taken. Enter a new Grid and forge alliances via visual novel gameplay, uncovering truths through Identity Disc puzzles. Make critical decisions and plot your own course in a world without a creator.','2023/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2109430/Tron_Identity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6750,'guns,_gore_&_cannoli',NULL,'Guns, Gore & Cannoli - An over-the-top, comical and fast-paced action game with hand-drawn graphics set in the Roaring Twenties. An all-you-can-shoot fest where you embody Vinnie, a mobster with a mission in a city controlled by gangsters and plagued by zombies. Featuring up to 4-man local co-op.','2015/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/322210/Guns_Gore__Cannoli/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6751,'romance_of_the_three_kingdoms_xiii',NULL,'\"The ultimate depiction of the Three Kingdom. A heroic drama of a gathering of Legends. \"With this as the concept behind Romance of the Three Kingdoms 13, we have compiled an experience that will immerse you even deeper into the world of the Three Kingdoms, with \"human drama,\" seen through the interactions of the...','2016/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/363150/Romance_of_the_Three_Kingdoms_XIII/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6752,'virtual_villagers:_a_new_home',NULL,'Care for and nurture a tribe of little people by teaching them the basics of survival. They need to become farmers, builders, scientists, parents and make decisions about unpredictable \'island events\'! Guide their day-to-day lives and help them explore and restore their new home.','2006/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/16100/Virtual_Villagers_A_New_Home/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6753,'garbanzo_quest',NULL,'GARBANZO QUEST! The crazy bullet-heck platformer where your main weapon is your own spit! Bring a friend! Hand-crafted challenges, secrets, and branching paths galore!','2024/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2105910/Garbanzo_Quest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6754,'agent_a:_a_puzzle_in_disguise',NULL,'A suave secret agent adventure game. Your mission (should you choose to accept) is to infiltrate enemy spy Ruby La Rouge’s secret hideaway and put a stop to her evil plans!','2019/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/801480/Agent_A_A_puzzle_in_disguise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6755,'silence_of_the_siren',NULL,'A turn-based sci-fi strategy that combines exploration and exciting clashes on the battlefield. Take control over several different species, raise powerful armies for your heroes and destroy your opponents! This HoMM-like is set in a scifi universe, with new mechanics on top of the classic formula.','2024/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2147380/Silence_of_the_Siren/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6756,'industria',NULL,'Embark on a gripping journey in INDUSTRIA, an atmospheric FPS set in Cold War-era East Berlin. Unravel the secrets of a mysterious parallel dimension while searching for a missing colleague. Explore a haunting reality where the truth awaits. Discover the dark past that lies beyond.','2021/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1172650/INDUSTRIA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6757,'power_&_revolution_2023_edition',NULL,'The latest edition of the ultrarealistic world simulator where you play as the Head of State or as the opposition! New Additions: dive deeper into the war in the Ukraine with artillery, trenches, mines, troop morale, etc; detailed immigration management; the justice system; and children.','2023/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2392520/Power__Revolution_2023_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6758,'musynx',NULL,'Indie rhythm game MUSYNX now on STEAM! Real \"KEY\" Sound System, Classic Gameplay, Unique Visual Themes and Constant Music Updates! MUSYNX is waiting for you!','2018/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/952040/MUSYNX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6759,'homeless',NULL,'Beneath the dazzling lights of New York, a sinister darkness lurks. In the hour when the whole city is sleeping, a strange and terrifying man emerges from the darkness, intent on shattering your mind and spirit','2024/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3018910/Homeless/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6760,'no_sun_to_worship',NULL,'A short, minimalist stealth-action game about the importance of art. We painted the sky ashen gray. Burned the heavens to starve each other. Now we walk an endless cemetery of regret.','2023/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2202470/No_Sun_To_Worship/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6761,'kind_words_(lo_fi_chill_beats_to_write_to)',NULL,'A game about writing nice letters to real people. Write and receive encouraging letters in a cozy room. Trade stickers and listen to chill music. We\'re all in this together. Sometimes all you need are a few kind words.','2019/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1070710/Kind_Words_lo_fi_chill_beats_to_write_to/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6762,'orbo\'s_odyssey',NULL,'Hop into Orbo\'s shoes! Run, jump and drill around your boss\'s office, make some new friends, and uncover terrifying secrets about the company you work for in this comedically surreal 3D platformer!','2023/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2539960/Orbos_Odyssey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6763,'drunken_wrestlers_2',NULL,'Drunken Wrestlers 2 is a funny physics-based multiplayer fighting game. Features include character customization and a powerful mod editor integrated with Steam Workshop.','2019/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/667530/Drunken_Wrestlers_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6764,'mordheim:_city_of_the_damned_-_undead',NULL,'This content requires the base game Mordheim: City of the Damned on Steam in order to play.','2016/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/534990/Mordheim_City_of_the_Damned__Undead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6765,'absolute_drift',NULL,'Absolute Drift is a racing game about becoming a master at the art of drifting.','2015/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/320140/Absolute_Drift/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6766,'icarus:_industrial_furniture_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game ICARUS on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2679990/Icarus_Industrial_Furniture_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6767,'payday_2:_mcshay_weapon_pack_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2200970/PAYDAY_2_McShay_Weapon_Pack_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6768,'onee_chanbara_origin',NULL,'To commemorate the 15th anniversary of the sword fighting action game series Onee Chanbara, the events of THE Onee Chanbara and THE Onee Chanbara 2 have been completely remade in full HD. The evolution of this high-speed action game cannot be missed!','2020/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1232460/Onee_Chanbara_ORIGIN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6769,'worms_clan_wars',NULL,'Worms™ Clan Wars is the biggest and best Worms™ game to date - more worms, larger landscapes, more dynamic water, more weapons and more customisation items than ever before.','2013/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/233840/Worms_Clan_Wars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6770,'liftoff®_-_night_fever',NULL,'This content requires the base game Liftoff®: FPV Drone Racing on Steam in order to play.','2019/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1020100/Liftoff__Night_Fever/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6771,'wargame:_red_dragon_-_nation_pack:_south_africa',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wargame: Red Dragon on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1575820/Wargame_Red_Dragon__Nation_Pack_South_Africa/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6772,'please,_don\'t_touch_anything_3d',NULL,'Now with Vive Support! A cryptic, brain-racking, button-pushing non-linear puzzle game.','2016/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/529590/Please_Dont_Touch_Anything_3D/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6773,'poker_master_-_texas_hold\'em,_roulette,_blackjack,_baccarat,_omaha,_slots,_teen_patti',NULL,'Free chips!Including Texas Hold\'em, Slots, Blackjack, Teen Patti, Omaha, Baccarat, Roulette and more poker games.','2020/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/994910/Poker_Master__Texas_Holdem_Roulette_Blackjack_Baccarat_Omaha_Slots_Teen_Patti/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6774,'timemelters',NULL,'Prevent Doomsday AFTER it happened! Designed by the co-creator of Sang-Froid - Tales of Werewolves and featuring both a single-player and co-op campaign, TimeMelters is a strategy hero defense where you go back in time and fight alongside your past selves.','2024/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1096140/Timemelters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6775,'staffer_case:_a_supernatural_mystery_adventure',NULL,'Staffer Case is a new sort of mystery game, asking players to find clues, arrange them into documents, and point out the contradictions between them to solve a series of murders. Each mystery unraveled leads you closer to the truth lying at the heart of each case!','2023/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2128480/Staffer_Case_A_Supernatural_Mystery_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6776,'dcs:_mi-24p_hind',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on S