/store.steampowered.com/app/28000/Kane__Lynch_2_Dog_Days/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6784,'mind_scanners',NULL,'Greetings. Your Mind Scanner request has been approved. Your duty is to diagnose and treat the citizens of The Structure. The patient list is long so don\'t waste your time. We’ll let you see your daughter soon...','2021/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1389550/Mind_Scanners/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6785,'garage:_bad_dream_adventure',NULL,'You are thrown into a weird world by the machine Garage. Can you escape from it?','2022/7/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1946430/Garage_Bad_Dream_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6786,'empire_of_sin_-_hunt_for_aurora',NULL,'This content requires the base game Empire of Sin on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1303314/Empire_of_Sin__Hunt_For_Aurora/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6787,'gunbot_diplomacy',NULL,'Splatter slimes, massacre mutants, and assemble your perfect Gunbot! Survive hordes of enemies in this top-down shooter roguelite by customizing your weapons on the unique upgrade grid, and pick from a wide variety of build-defining modules and wacky base bots for a new experience every run.','2025/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2800840/Gunbot_Diplomacy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6788,'mordhau_-_adventurer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game MORDHAU on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2817460/MORDHAU__Adventurer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6789,'vampire_therapist_-_couples_therapy',NULL,'This content requires the base game Vampire Therapist on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3320590/Vampire_Therapist__Couples_Therapy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6790,'gothic_ii:_gold_edition',NULL,'Gothic II: Gold Edition brings together the excitement of Gothic II and the add-on Night of the Raven to your fingertips!','2005/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/39510/Gothic_II_Gold_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6791,'haydee',NULL,'\"Haydee\" is a hardcore old-style metroidvania mixed with modern-day third person shooter and platformer mechanics. As well as a sexy character.','2016/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/530890/Haydee/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6792,'f1®_manager_2023',NULL,'The intense world of Formula 1® comes alive for a new season in F1® Manager 2023. 23 races, six F1® Sprint events, new cars, new circuits including the Las Vegas Strip Circuit, new drivers, new challenges… Your legacy begins here.','2023/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2287220/F1_Manager_2023/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6793,'make_good_choices',NULL,'You’re just trying to get home. It’s only a quarter mile. One street. What could go wrong.','2025/1/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3410310/Make_Good_Choices/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6794,'starcom:_nexus',NULL,'Suddenly thrown into an unknown galaxy, you must explore, fight or befriend aliens and transform your ship from a small survey vessel into a powerful battlecruiser to unravel the mystery of the forces that brought you here and find your way home.','2019/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/863590/Starcom_Nexus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_143'),(6795,'spirit_island_-_horizons_of_spirit_island',NULL,'This content requires the base game Spirit Island on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2419040/Spirit_Island__Horizons_of_Spirit_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6796,'kulebra_and_the_souls_of_limbo',NULL,'Use your wits, kindness and maybe a good whack to untangle a mysterious curse in Kulebra and the Souls of Limbo, a whimsical papercraft adventure about helping people move on.','2025/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2246470/Kulebra_and_the_Souls_of_Limbo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6797,'beloved_rapture',NULL,'Beloved Rapture is an indie jRPG inspired by the classics. Explore beautiful landscapes, fight in turn-based battles, and uncover many secrets. This mid-length adventure balances both an intimate coming of age story, and larger threats looming over the troubled kingdom.','2024/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2017620/Beloved_Rapture/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6798,'gerda:_a_flame_in_winter',NULL,'You have five days to save your husband, who has just been arrested by the Gestapo. Investigate, explore and form allegiances in this story-rich RPG-lite. Who will you trust?','2022/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1771360/Gerda_A_Flame_in_Winter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6799,'vermillion_-_vr_painting',NULL,'It’s time to discover your inner artist! With Vermillion, you get a fully equipped oil painting studio in your home, without any of the mess. Ready for the unrivaled sense of accomplishment from creating your first painting?','2021/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1608400/Vermillion__VR_Painting/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6800,'hades_ii_original_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Hades II, but does not include the base game.','2024/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2950840/Hades_II_Original_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6801,'wanted_raccoon',NULL,'WANTED RACCOON is a 3rd person raccoon simulator with a storyline and extensive research space. Steal food, ride a skateboard, be inconspicuous, fight with people, create equipment, upgrade skills, lead resistance and find a kidnapped family!','2021/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1320100/Wanted_Raccoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6802,'syberia',NULL,'Join Kate Walker as she travels to remote locations and time periods in this timeless voyage to discover her true destiny.','2002/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/46500/Syberia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6803,'yoru_ga_kuru!_-square_of_the_moon-_remastered',NULL,'In the city of Otsuna, a crimson-eyed girl invites Ryou to help her defeat a powerful enemy. An endless night approaches... but alongside his new friends, can Ryou cut through the darkness and save the world? Find out in this urban fantasy visual novel-dungeon crawler hybrid!','2025/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2901150/Yoru_ga_Kuru_Square_of_the_Moon_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6804,'aliens:_fireteam_elite_-_frontier_freelancer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Aliens: Fireteam Elite on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1643354/Aliens_Fireteam_Elite__Frontier_Freelancer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6805,'source_of_madness',NULL,'Source of Madness is a side-scrolling dark action roguelite set in a twisted Lovecraftian inspired world powered by procedural generation and AI machine learning. Take on the role of a new Acolyte as they embark on a nightmarish odyssey.','2022/5/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1315610/Source_of_Madness/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6806,'fabled_lands',NULL,'Fabled Lands is a challenging old-school narrative RPG set in an open world. Complete quests, fight, trade goods and develop your character. Explore a vast land of adventure: travel across the war-torn kingdom, survive the plains of howling darkness, and escape the Court of Hidden Faces.','2022/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1299620/Fabled_Lands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6807,'sprawl',NULL,'SPRAWL is a hardcore retro FPS set in an endless cyberpunk megalopolis. Escape the walled city and take on the militarized government of the sprawl. Fueled by the blood of your enemies and a mysterious voice in your head, make your way towards the spire to topple whatever lays within.','2023/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1549690/SPRAWL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6808,'ys_vi:_the_ark_of_napishtim',NULL,'Adventurer Adol Christin has washed ashore in yet another mysterious, isolated new land, inhabited by a people who sport long ears and bushy tails...and are none too fond of humans. Experience the very first 3D Ys game as never before, with a whole new gameplay mode unique to this release!','2015/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/312540/Ys_VI_The_Ark_of_Napishtim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6809,'unmetal',NULL,'UnMetal is a 2D stealth action-adventure that pays homage to the classics with a healthy dose of humor and satire. You play as Jesse Fox, who is definitely NOT an elite commando, under arrest for a crime he didn\'t commit, and must escape a covert military base using his wits and fists.','2021/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1203710/UnMetal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6810,'twilight_struggle',NULL,'Twilight Struggle is a two-player game where players play as either the US or USSR during the Cold War. Using actual events from history, players must plan out their strategies in order to obtain world dominance. Play Twilight Struggle and change the course of history.','2016/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/406290/Twilight_Struggle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6811,'just_another_night_shift',NULL,'Just Another Night Shift is a casual competitive 1v1 or 2v2 PvP stealth strategy game. Play as a Thief and as a Security Guard. Steal the statue and try to prevent it in this 3D indie game. Grab a friend and work THE NIGHT SHIFT of your life. Join us for hours of fun gameplay with your friends!','2024/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2331130/Just_Another_Night_Shift/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6812,'quasimorph_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Quasimorph on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2522910/Quasimorph__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6813,'kovaak\'s_anime_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game KovaaK\'s on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2633870/KovaaKs_Anime_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6814,'fish_shop_simulator',NULL,'Run your own aquarium shop in a cozy New York neighborhood. Buy and sell fish, aquariums, and decorations to friendly customers. Create beautifully decorated tanks and make a profit by selling them!','2025/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3298720/Fish_Shop_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6815,'pathfinder:_wrath_of_the_righteous_-_the_last_sarkorians',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pathfinder: Wrath of the Righteous - Enhanced Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2266770/Pathfinder_Wrath_of_the_Righteous__The_Last_Sarkorians/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6816,'golden_idol_investigations:_the_sins_of_new_wells',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Rise of the Golden Idol on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3333870/Golden_Idol_Investigations_The_Sins_of_New_Wells/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6817,'don\'t_starve_together:_wormwood_deluxe_chest',NULL,'This content requires the base game Don\'t Starve Together on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1084430/Dont_Starve_Together_Wormwood_Deluxe_Chest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6818,'the_artful_escape',NULL,'A teenage guitar prodigy sets out on a psychedelic journey to inspire his stage persona and confront the legacy of a dead folk legend. Starring voice performances by Michael Johnston, Caroline Kinley, Lena Headey, Jason Schwartzman, Mark Strong, and Carl Weathers.','2021/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1122680/The_Artful_Escape/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6819,'forgotton_anne',NULL,'Step into a hand-animated realm of wonder in which everyday objects take on a life of their own. Uncover the Forgotlings’ mysteries & harness magical forces as you embark upon a quest to return home.','2018/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/542050/Forgotton_Anne/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6820,'swords_\'n_magic_and_stuff',NULL,'Grab your friends and set out for adventure in this cozy, multiplayer, open world RPG! Explore, quest and craft your way through a densely packed open world. Level up 6 different classes and buy land to build and decorate your home to settle down in this medieval fantasy world.','2020/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/810040/Swords_n_Magic_and_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6821,'sorting_inc',NULL,'A casual and relaxing game about sorting various items. Join Sorting Inc and climb up through the departments to become the absolute expert in the field of sorting.','2025/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3227640/Sorting_Inc/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6822,'just_cause™_3_dlc:_bavarium_sea_heist_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Just Cause™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2016/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/442051/Just_Cause_3_DLC_Bavarium_Sea_Heist_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6823,'tom_clancy\'s_rainbow_six®_siege_-_ruby_weapon_skin',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six® Siege X on Steam in order to play.','2016/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/450790/Tom_Clancys_Rainbow_Six_Siege__Ruby_Weapon_Skin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6824,'submerged:_hidden_depths',NULL,'Boat, climb, interact and explore in the beautiful ruins of a sunken world.','2022/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1614270/Submerged_Hidden_Depths/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6825,'brok_the_investigator',NULL,'An innovative adventure mixed with beat \'em up and RPG elements. In a grim world where animals have replaced mankind, what kind of detective will you be?','2022/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/949480/BROK_the_InvestiGator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6826,'deathwish_enforcers_special_edition',NULL,'A gritty, non-stop blood bath from the creator of Insanity\'s Blade, Super Battle Princess Madelyn and the recently released GuardGrave. And a parody of beloved 60s and 70s classic action films, heroes and villains. Deathwish Enforcers... There\'s gonna be hell to pay!','2024/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2683030/Deathwish_Enforcers_Special_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6827,'all-in-one_sports_vr',NULL,'13 Sports in 1 Game ! What type of sports acitivities will be safer during the pandemic era? All in One sports VR offers the most safe way to keep you healthy for both physically and mentally with zero contact.','2023/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1514840/AllInOne_Sports_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6828,'omsi_2_add-on_hohenkirchen',NULL,'This content requires the base game OMSI 2: Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2333200/OMSI_2_Addon_Hohenkirchen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6829,'hiveswap:_act_2',NULL,'Continue Joey and Xefros’s adventure through the dark and dangerous planet Alternia. Meet dozens of unique and memorable characters, some more helpful than others, as you navigate this volatile alien culture. Hurry up! There’s a train to catch.','2020/11/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1181840/HIVESWAP_ACT_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6830,'transport_fever',NULL,'Transport Fever is a railroad-focused tycoon game. Players start in 1850 and build up a thriving transport company. As an emerging transport tycoon, the player constructs stations, airports, harbors and makes money by connecting areas requiring transport services. Build up your own Empire!','2016/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/446800/Transport_Fever/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6831,'game_of_fate:_chasing_through_time',NULL,'Immerse yourself in the first-person perspective, cross time and space, solve bizarre cases, save innocent victims, and catch a mysterious killer! You will solve murders, uphold justice, and also gain love. Are you ready? Play the \"Game of Fate\" that crosses time and space, life and death!','2024/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2963550/Game_of_Fate_Chasing_Through_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6832,'kathy_rain',NULL,'Set in the \'90s, Kathy Rain tells the story of a strong-willed journalism major who has to come to terms with her troubled past as she investigates the mysterious death of her recently deceased grandfather.','2016/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/370910/Kathy_Rain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6833,'leaf_blower_revolution_-_premium_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Leaf Blower Revolution - Idle Game on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1482631/Leaf_Blower_Revolution__Premium_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6834,'everything',NULL,'Be the Universe in this epic, award-winning reality simulation game - featuring thousands of playable characters, endless exploration, an extraordinary soundtrack and narration from Alan Watts.','2017/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/582270/Everything/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6835,'infinity_strash:_dragon_quest_the_adventure_of_dai',NULL,'The memories of the Hero, in your hands! Experience the story of the legendary anime series, DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai, in an exhilarating action role-playing game that combines stunning visuals with art from the anime and manga.','2023/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1895810/Infinity_Strash_DRAGON_QUEST_The_Adventure_of_Dai/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6836,'natural_selection_2',NULL,'A fast paced multiplayer shooter that pits aliens against humans in a strategic and action-packed struggle for survival!','2012/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/4920/Natural_Selection_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6837,'goat_simulator_3_-_digital_downgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Goat Simulator 3 on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2666450/Goat_Simulator_3__Digital_Downgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6838,'the_shell_part_ii:_purgatorio',NULL,'Detective Reiji Tokisaka is back to face down a mystery that spans decades, if not centuries. With the aftermath of his last case weighing on his soul and a long-silent cult resurgent, can he solve the crime—or will it become his curse?','2024/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2712550/The_Shell_Part_II_Purgatorio/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6839,'idle_cave_miner',NULL,'Idle Cave Miner is an idle game about crafting items, mining gems, and building your team of miners. Prestige, craft, and travel to other mines to increase your strength to dig deeper, and find what lurks below.','2023/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2289450/Idle_Cave_Miner/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_144'),(6840,'desktop_cat_cafe',NULL,'Build your dream cat cafe in this tiny cozy management sim that lives at the bottom of your screen! Unlock exciting new recipes, decorate your space with our wide variety of goodies, and watch cute cat helpers take care of the cafe while you\'re doing other things.','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2978180/Desktop_Cat_Cafe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6841,'kathy_rain',NULL,'Set in the \'90s, Kathy Rain tells the story of a strong-willed journalism major who has to come to terms with her troubled past as she investigates the mysterious death of her recently deceased grandfather.','2016/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/370910/Kathy_Rain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6842,'pathfinder:_wrath_of_the_righteous_-_the_last_sarkorians',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pathfinder: Wrath of the Righteous - Enhanced Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2266770/Pathfinder_Wrath_of_the_Righteous__The_Last_Sarkorians/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6843,'leaf_blower_revolution_-_premium_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Leaf Blower Revolution - Idle Game on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1482631/Leaf_Blower_Revolution__Premium_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6844,'everything',NULL,'Be the Universe in this epic, award-winning reality simulation game - featuring thousands of playable characters, endless exploration, an extraordinary soundtrack and narration from Alan Watts.','2017/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/582270/Everything/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6845,'infinity_strash:_dragon_quest_the_adventure_of_dai',NULL,'The memories of the Hero, in your hands! Experience the story of the legendary anime series, DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai, in an exhilarating action role-playing game that combines stunning visuals with art from the anime and manga.','2023/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1895810/Infinity_Strash_DRAGON_QUEST_The_Adventure_of_Dai/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6846,'natural_selection_2',NULL,'A fast paced multiplayer shooter that pits aliens against humans in a strategic and action-packed struggle for survival!','2012/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/4920/Natural_Selection_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6847,'goat_simulator_3_-_digital_downgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Goat Simulator 3 on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2666450/Goat_Simulator_3__Digital_Downgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6848,'the_shell_part_ii:_purgatorio',NULL,'Detective Reiji Tokisaka is back to face down a mystery that spans decades, if not centuries. With the aftermath of his last case weighing on his soul and a long-silent cult resurgent, can he solve the crime—or will it become his curse?','2024/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2712550/The_Shell_Part_II_Purgatorio/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6849,'idle_cave_miner',NULL,'Idle Cave Miner is an idle game about crafting items, mining gems, and building your team of miners. Prestige, craft, and travel to other mines to increase your strength to dig deeper, and find what lurks below.','2023/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2289450/Idle_Cave_Miner/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6850,'serial_cleaner',NULL,'Slip on your flares, grab your shades and hop in your station wagon, it\'s time to work… as a professional mob cleaner. In this stylish award winning 2D action-stealth game you have to make sure you get in, clean up and get out without leaving a trace - Queue the funky 70s inspired soundtrack!','2017/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/522210/Serial_Cleaner/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6851,'child_of_light',NULL,'Aurora, a young girl from 1895 Austria, awakens on the lost fairytale continent of Lemuria. To return home she must fight against the dark creatures of the Queen of the Night, who have stolen the sun, the moon and the stars. At stake is not only Lemuria, but Aurora’s true destiny.','2014/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/256290/Child_of_Light/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6852,'spirit_island_-_branch_&_claw',NULL,'This content requires the base game Spirit Island on Steam in order to play.','2021/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1516480/Spirit_Island__Branch__Claw/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6853,'fallen_leaf',NULL,'Fallen Leaf is a retro side-scrolling adventure focused on tight, action-packed level design set in a whimsical world where almost anything goes!','2024/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1459010/Fallen_Leaf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6854,'ape_out',NULL,'APE OUT is a wildly intense and colorfully stylized smash ‘em up about primal escape, rhythmic violence, and frenetic jazz.','2019/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/447150/APE_OUT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6855,'age_of_wonders:_planetfall_-_star_kings',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Wonders: Planetfall on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1137802/Age_of_Wonders_Planetfall__Star_Kings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6856,'expansion_-_europa_universalis_iv:_the_cossacks',NULL,'This content requires the base game Europa Universalis IV on Steam in order to play.','2015/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/373370/Expansion__Europa_Universalis_IV_The_Cossacks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6857,'ambidextro',NULL,'A multi-player game for a single player. Learn to control 2 characters at the same time, one with each hand. Achieve ambidexterity and rescue both the prince and the princess at the same time.','2025/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3445580/Ambidextro/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6858,'snowrunner_-_the_atom',NULL,'This content requires the base game SnowRunner on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2856380/SnowRunner__The_Atom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6859,'the_cat_lady',NULL,'The Cat Lady follows Susan Ashworth, a lonely 40-year old on the verge of suicide. She has no family, no friends and no hope for a better future. One day she discovers that five strangers will come along and change everything...','2012/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/253110/The_Cat_Lady/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6860,'civilization_v_-_civ_and_scenario_pack:_denmark_(the_vikings)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier\'s Civilization® V on Steam in order to play.','2011/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/99611/Civilization_V__Civ_and_Scenario_Pack_Denmark_The_Vikings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6861,'planet_coaster_-_world\'s_fair_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Coaster on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/953660/Planet_Coaster__Worlds_Fair_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6862,'cursed_digicam_|_呪われたデジカメ',NULL,'You receive a cursed digital camera that captures ghosts from a strange website. The website allows you to liberate your loved ones by uploading images of their spirits using the camera. You decide to go to the nearest park where your girl was last seen.','2025/1/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3334550/Cursed_Digicam/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6863,'creature_keeper',NULL,'Creature Keeper is an action-adventure RPG where you Befriend Creatures and fight alongside them in real time. Explore a mysterious world and uncover the truth behind a strange sickness spreading across the land. Power up your team, fill out your Bestiary, and embark on your journey of destiny!','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1826710/Creature_Keeper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6864,'pup_champs',NULL,'Lead a team of puppy soccer players, solve 170+ challenges and score goals in this cozy tactical puzzle game!','2025/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2848800/Pup_Champs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6865,'wars_across_the_world',NULL,'WAW is a unique historical strategy turn-based game, in a boardgame spirit, which aims at simulating in one single system ALL kind of wars and conflicts throughout the world (and beyond) from Prehistoric times to nowadays, on the operational or strategic levels.','2017/5/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/341040/Wars_Across_The_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6866,'nightmare_frames',NULL,'Nightmare Frames is a supernatural thriller where you\'ll step into the shoes of Alan Goldberg, in the search for the scariest horror film of all time. An enthralling journey through the streets of the Hollywood of the 80s, a small haunted town, and even Hell itself.','2022/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1650590/Nightmare_Frames/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6867,'the_mobius_machine',NULL,'Discover a vast alien world. Fight the ferocious local fauna and killer machines. Reveal its secrets and find a way to escape. The Mobius Machine is a side-scroller action adventure, with an emphasis on free-form exploration and intense combat.','2024/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2281940/The_Mobius_Machine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6868,'collection_of_saga_final_fantasy_legend',NULL,'Experience the origins of the SaGa series with the COLLECTION of SaGa FINAL FANTASY LEGEND, the first complete port of these hugely popular titles with new enhancements!','2021/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1642620/COLLECTION_of_SaGa_FINAL_FANTASY_LEGEND/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6869,'the_last_alchemist',NULL,'Master the wonders of alchemy! Solve alchemical puzzles by transforming and combining Essences. Craft items, tools and machines. Explore the enchanting world, gather peculiar resources, and befriend the Agari, adorable mushroom folk who will help you find the cure for your mysterious disease.','2024/7/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1536570/The_Last_Alchemist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6870,'zero_protocol',NULL,'In this immersive sci-fi thriller, you will experience the atmosphere of classic 3D games as you solve puzzles, follow an intriguing non-linear storyline, and engage in battles with monsters.','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2840250/ZERO_PROTOCOL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6871,'the_cave',NULL,'Assemble your team of three from seven unlikely adventurers, then descend into the mysterious depths to explore The Cave!','2013/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/221810/The_Cave/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6872,'train_sim_world®_5:_lner_class_a3_60103_flying_scotsman_steam_loco_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970410/Train_Sim_World_5_LNER_Class_A3_60103_Flying_Scotsman_Steam_Loco_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6873,'labyrinth_of_refrain:_coven_of_dusk',NULL,'Beneath a small town lies an endless maze known as the Labyrinth of Refrain. Dusk Witch Dronya arrives, and with her puppet soldiers, endeavors to find something buried deep within. Embark on an adventure as you discover the secrets underground.','2018/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/566540/Labyrinth_of_Refrain_Coven_of_Dusk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6874,'civilization_v_-_babylon_(nebuchadnezzar_ii)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier\'s Civilization® V on Steam in order to play.','2010/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/16868/Civilization_V__Babylon_Nebuchadnezzar_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6875,'session:_skate_sim_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Session: Skate Sim on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2075191/Session_Skate_Sim_Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6876,'six_ages_2:_lights_going_out',NULL,'Life after myths. Death, disaster, despair. A standalone survival-storybook combining interactive fiction and turn-based strategy. The world is ending, and your small clan’s survival depends on how you manage its relationship with the remaining gods and their followers.','2023/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2278010/Six_Ages_2_Lights_Going_Out/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6877,'joe_danger_2:_the_movie',NULL,'Joe Danger, the world’s most determined stuntman, returns to embark on a death-defying thrill-ride across the set of the greatest blockbuster movie ever made. Across 100 crazy levels he’ll chase crooks by police bike, destroy laser-firing robots with a stolen jetpack, escape giant boulders in a minecart, time-travel to punch dinosaurs...','2013/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/242110/Joe_Danger_2_The_Movie/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6878,'swordhaven:_iron_conspiracy',NULL,'Swordhaven is a classic party-based RPG. Explore the land of Nova Drakonia, embark on quests unique to your character, discover mysterious artefacts of the ancients, and unravel a hidden conspiracy that threatens the very existence of the world.','2024/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2108180/Swordhaven_Iron_Conspiracy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6879,'starborne:_frontiers',NULL,'Starborne: Frontiers is a free-to-play tactical autobattler with hundreds of unique ships. Form your fleet, customize it with a variety of equipment, and use strategy to create the perfect battlefield formation. Take on bounties, engage in the PvP arena, and bring order to the Frontier.','2024/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3021540/Starborne_Frontiers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6880,'aces_&_adventures',NULL,'Aces & Adventures is a deckbuilding RPG with poker-powered combat. Craft your deck, combining poker hands with powerful ability cards. Journey through 13 fully-voiced campaigns to save the Life Tree, or tackle procedurally-generated runs in this strategic deckbuilder unlike any other.','2023/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1815570/Aces__Adventures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6881,'golden_idol_investigations:_the_sins_of_new_wells',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Rise of the Golden Idol on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3333870/Golden_Idol_Investigations_The_Sins_of_New_Wells/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6882,'battlestar_galactica_deadlock:_sin_and_sacrifice',NULL,'This content requires the base game Battlestar Galactica Deadlock on Steam in order to play.','2019/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1001150/Battlestar_Galactica_Deadlock_Sin_and_Sacrifice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6883,'cats_&_dice',NULL,'A roguelike dice-building game where the goal is to overcome an ever-increasing target score each round. Assemble a synergistic set of Cats and dice, go for crazy combos and try to attain as high a score as you possibly can. Master the synergy between cats and dice to win!','2025/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3128280/Cats__Dice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6884,'x-com:_terror_from_the_deep',NULL,'The war continues... X-COM: UFO Defense brought you to a galactic battlefield. X-COM: Terror from the Deep brings the alien terror into a totally new dimension.Seeking to take advantage of a weakened Earth, X-COM\'s deep space foes unexpectedly change strategy and launch a powerful second front against planet Earth.','1995/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/7650/XCOM_Terror_From_the_Deep/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6885,'generation_zero®_-_motorbikes_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Generation Zero® on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2144761/Generation_Zero__Motorbikes_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6886,'manivore',NULL,'He doesn’t just hunt to kill. Manivore is not just a murderer, he is an artist. For him, death is not an outcome but a process. Can you uncover the truth within this twisted game, or will you be the next prey?','2025/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3601980/Manivore/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_145'),(6887,'keplerth',NULL,'Welcome to Keplerth! Try to survive on a hostile alien planet in this 2D sandbox RPG, where you can choose to live alone or fight side by side with your friends in the online multiplayer mode. Survive, build, farm, fight, and explore your way to victory in this open-world adventure!','2022/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/747200/Keplerth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6888,'the_sims™_4_spooky_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2015/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235759/The_Sims_4_Spooky_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6889,'svarog\'s_dream_-_return_of_the_old_gods_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Svarog\'s Dream on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2982030/Svarogs_Dream__Return_of_the_Old_Gods_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6890,'the_complex',NULL,'After a major bio-weapon attack on London, two scientists find themselves in a locked-down laboratory with time, and air, running out. The Complex is an interactive sci-fi thriller movie where your decisions lead to one of eight suspenseful endings.','2020/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1107790/The_Complex/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6891,'bongo_cat',NULL,'Bongo cat needs your help. Bongo cat needz more hatz!!! Every time you press a key, Bongo cat will punch your taskbar. Type, click, play, work to collect more points. Which hats will you find?','2025/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3419430/Bongo_Cat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6892,'bloodstained:_curse_of_the_moon_2',NULL,'Koji Igarashi and Inti Creates are back with more retro sword-and-whip action! Curse of the Moon 2 brings classic 2D action and a dark, 8-bit aesthetic together with modern playability.','2020/7/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1257360/Bloodstained_Curse_of_the_Moon_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6893,'spiritfall',NULL,'Spiritfall is a fast-paced Action Roguelite with combat inspired by Platform Fighters. Slash, smash, launch, and wall-splat a multitude of enemies using an ever-changing arsenal of divine powers.','2024/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1835240/Spiritfall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6894,'ravenous_devils',NULL,'A horror cooking simulator where the secret ingredient is crime. Improve your shops, buy new tools, expand your menu, and above all, make your customers happy.','2022/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1615290/Ravenous_Devils/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6895,'revue_starlight_el_dorado',NULL,'The first console game of the stage-themed multi-media franchise \"Revue Starlight\" is on its way!','2024/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2849960/Revue_Starlight_El_Dorado/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6896,'heads_will_roll:_reforged_-_threads_of_destiny',NULL,'This content requires the base game Heads Will Roll: Reforged on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3172940/Heads_Will_Roll_Reforged__Threads_of_Destiny/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6897,'pray_game',NULL,'Washed away to the island of Anatol, Alcy now must embark on a journey to escape the island and find her way to safety.','2023/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1551530/Pray_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6898,'streamer_life_simulator',NULL,'Streamer Life Simulator is a very comprehensive streamer life simulation game. Be the most popular streamer in the world.','2020/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1261040/Streamer_Life_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6899,'prison_architect_-_jungle_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Prison Architect on Steam in order to play.','2023/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2237250/Prison_Architect__Jungle_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6900,'don\'t_starve_together:_wurt_deluxe_chest',NULL,'This content requires the base game Don\'t Starve Together on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1167330/Dont_Starve_Together_Wurt_Deluxe_Chest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6901,'kingdom_under_fire:_the_crusaders',NULL,'The cult heavy metal fantasy action-strategy gem comes to PC in HD. Lead your armies from the front lines, giving strategic orders to your forces while wading into hack n’ slash action battle. Crush your foes across four campaigns, and spend the spoils of war on upgrading your forces.','2020/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1121420/Kingdom_Under_Fire_The_Crusaders/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6902,'omsi_2_add-on_citybus_o530',NULL,'This content requires the base game OMSI 2: Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2725480/OMSI_2_Addon_Citybus_o530/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6903,'will_to_live_online',NULL,'Will To Live is a MMORPG-shooter whose action takes place in a severe post-apocalyptic world. Explore the world, engage in fights with mutants and other survivors, join the clans in the struggle for existence and prove your right to Live.','2018/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/707010/Will_To_Live_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6904,'supreme_commander_2:_infinite_war_battle_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Supreme Commander 2 on Steam in order to play.','2010/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/40135/Supreme_Commander_2_Infinite_War_Battle_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6905,'lost_eidolons',NULL,'Lost Eidolons is a turn-based tactical RPG with a gripping cinematic narrative, set in a waning empire riven by civil war. Take on the role of a charming mercenary captain, Eden, and lead his band of allies through epic encounters on a classic turn-based battlefield.','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1580520/Lost_Eidolons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6906,'nanoapostle',NULL,'NanoApostle is a dark sci-fi boss rush action game featuring intense reaction-based combat and the unique \"Destruction Point\" system. Play as Anita, a child augmented with lethal nanomachines, as she battles against twisted cybernetic experiments to escape a top-secret facility.','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2400640/NanoApostle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6907,'dark_deception_chapter_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dark Deception on Steam in order to play.','2019/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1017030/Dark_Deception_Chapter_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6908,'letterlike',NULL,'Letterlike is a challenging roguelike word game that\'s all about collecting cards, upgrading words, and upgrading letter tiles to make the strongest synergies and reach the highest scores!','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3424020/Letterlike/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6909,'rhythm_witch:_beat_death',NULL,'Rhythm Witch: Beat Death is a game that melds rhythm and survival. Attack to the rhythm of the music while dodging monsters who move and attack to the beat. On your journey to eternal beauty, defeat dancing freaks, ghouls, dragon, and more!','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2951580/Rhythm_Witch_Beat_Death/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6910,'home_sheep_home:_farmageddon_party_edition',NULL,'Join Shaun the Sheep and his friends Timmy and Shirley on this epic adventure journeying through caverns, the busy streets of London and through outer space all in search of the green grass of home. Now with new multiplayer modes, controller support, widescreen graphics and much, much more!','2014/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/259810/Home_Sheep_Home_Farmageddon_Party_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6911,'victoria_ii:_a_house_divided',NULL,'This content requires the base game Victoria II on Steam in order to play.','2012/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/42968/Victoria_II_A_House_Divided/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6912,'burgie\'s_cozy_kitchen',NULL,'Manage a small burger joint in this adorable and chaotic idle cooking game. Play actively or use it a desktop companion while you work on your stuff. ✨Brighten your day with little breaks! Includes Pomodoro focus tool and stream integration to play with your chat.','2025/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3314340/Burgies_cozy_kitchen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6913,'romance_club_-_stories_i_play',NULL,'Immerse yourself in romantic visual stories where you control what happens!','2023/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2433470/Romance_Club__Stories_I_Play/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6914,'cursed_to_golf',NULL,'Cursed to Golf is a challenging golf-like adventure where every shot counts. Players are tasked with making it out of Golf Purgatory to become a Golfing Legend. With insane hazards, otherworldly power-ups and tons of replayability, will you make it back alive or will you forever be… Cursed to Golf!?','2022/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1726120/Cursed_to_Golf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6915,'teacup',NULL,'Teacup is a short and wholesome narrative adventure game with a focus on exploration and non-linear progression. Help a small and shy frog on her journey to find the ingredients she needs for her tea party!','2021/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1444300/Teacup/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6916,'living_with_sister:_monochrome_fantasy_-_expansion_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Living With Sister: Monochrome Fantasy on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3062990/Living_With_Sister_Monochrome_Fantasy__Expansion_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6917,'beyond_shadowgate',NULL,'The original design of the never-before seen point and click adventure has been brought to life after 30+ years in the vault - Beyond Shadowgate! This new massive game (created by the designer of the original hit Shadowgate and a leading 8-bit adventure studio) is 5 TIMES BIGGER than NES Shadowgate!','2024/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2332240/Beyond_Shadowgate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6918,'train_sim_world®_5:_lner_class_a3_60103_flying_scotsman_steam_loco_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970410/Train_Sim_World_5_LNER_Class_A3_60103_Flying_Scotsman_Steam_Loco_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6919,'rush_rally_origins',NULL,'The definitive top down racer','2022/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1728660/Rush_Rally_Origins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6920,'uplink',NULL,'Uplink lets you play as a freelance hacker tackling risky contracts for corporations. Break into systems, steal data, sabotage rivals, and upgrade your gear. Support factions or go rogue in this immersive, strategy-driven hacking simulation game where your choices shape the outcome.','2006/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1510/Uplink/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6921,'orcs_must_die!',NULL,'Slice them, burn them, skewer them, and launch them - no matter how you get it done, orcs must die in this fantasy action-strategy game from Robot Entertainment.','2011/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/102600/Orcs_Must_Die/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6922,'destiny_2:_beyond_light_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Destiny 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1314563/Destiny_2_Beyond_Light_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6923,'how_to_survive',NULL,'“A real Gem” – Destructoid at E3 “Offers a different experience for zombie game veterans” – Co-Optimus“Has a lot more going for it than smashing brains and gory, red goo ... With a surprisingly deep crafting system” – GamesRadarYou\'re shipwrecked on an isolated island, a desperate castaway in a total freakshow world. How will you survive?','2013/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/250400/How_to_Survive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6924,'date_a_live:_rio_reincarnation',NULL,'Show the Spirits the power of love and save the world in this romantic visual novel!','2019/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1047440/DATE_A_LIVE_Rio_Reincarnation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6925,'jujutsu_kaisen_cursed_clash_-_shibuya_incident',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jujutsu Kaisen Cursed Clash on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2579330/Jujutsu_Kaisen_Cursed_Clash__Shibuya_Incident/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6926,'far_fishing',NULL,'Far Fishing is a short and relaxing fishing game. Set off on a journey to the edge of the world, catching a variety of fish and upgrading your boat along the way.','2025/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3723470/Far_Fishing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6927,'wargroove',NULL,'Take to the battlefield with Wargroove, a strategy game for up to 4 players! Choose your Commander and wage turn-based war on battling factions. Design and share maps, cut-scenes and campaigns with easy-to-use editors and in-depth customization tools!','2019/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/607050/Wargroove/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6928,'swordhaven:_iron_conspiracy',NULL,'Swordhaven is a classic party-based RPG. Explore the land of Nova Drakonia, embark on quests unique to your character, discover mysterious artefacts of the ancients, and unravel a hidden conspiracy that threatens the very existence of the world.','2024/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2108180/Swordhaven_Iron_Conspiracy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6929,'a_tiny_sticker_tale',NULL,'A Tiny Sticker Tale is a cozy miniature adventure about changing the world, using the power of stickers!','2023/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2322180/A_Tiny_Sticker_Tale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6930,'melty_blood_archives',NULL,'This content requires the base game MELTY BLOOD: TYPE LUMINA on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1590580/MELTY_BLOOD_ARCHIVES/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6931,'wargame:_red_dragon_-_double_nation_pack:_reds',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wargame: Red Dragon on Steam in order to play.','2016/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/561470/Wargame_Red_Dragon__Double_Nation_Pack_REDS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6932,'the_silent_kingdom',NULL,'An otome RPG adventure with a dark story and meaningful choices. Shape the fate of a princess who must corrupt her soul in order to save her kingdom.','2025/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1828650/The_Silent_Kingdom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6933,'creature_creator',NULL,'Create your own creatures to explore online worlds with friends and collect new parts to upgrade your stats and abilities! Complete quests, battle enemies, challenge friends to minigames, or just have fun roleplaying — the possibilities are endless when your imagination is the limit!','2022/12/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1990050/Creature_Creator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6934,'trials_of_innocence',NULL,'Trials of Innocence is an indie courtroom detective game. Step into the shoes of the main character, rookie lawyer Luna Ray, and navigate her journey through the legal world. Unravel a shocking conspiracy that changes the fate of many, including herself, and confront her inner choices.','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2983140/Trials_of_Innocence/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6935,'frozenheim',NULL,'Lead your Viking clan onto unknown shores and carve out a future for your people in the fjords of Frozenheim. Gather resources, expand, and watch your settlement grow to a bustling town that will withstand the harshness of winter and wrath of other clans.','2022/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1134100/Frozenheim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_146'),(6936,'lost_planet®_3',NULL,'The extreme and unpredictable conditions that characterized the Lost Planet series return, harsher than ever before. Lost Planet 3 reveals new truths about the foreboding planet and the colonial history of E.D.N. III.','2013/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/226720/LOST_PLANET_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6937,'day_of_defeat',NULL,'Enlist in an intense brand of Axis vs. Allied teamplay set in the WWII European Theatre of Operations. Players assume the role of light/assault/heavy infantry, sniper or machine-gunner class, each with a unique arsenal of historical weaponry at their disposal. Missions are based on key historical operations.','2003/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/30/Day_of_Defeat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6938,'haak',NULL,'HAAK is a Metroidvania-Platformer. As the mysterious wanderer Haak, you embarked on an epic expedition across the vast cyber-wasteland to find your lost brother. Explore deserted cities and metro, refine your weapons and hack skills, and uncover the secrets behind metal and dust.','2022/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1352930/HAAK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6939,'encased:_a_sci-fi_post-apocalyptic_rpg',NULL,'A tactical sci-fi RPG set in an alternative 1970\'s, where an enormous and inexplicable artifact –the Dome– is discovered in a remote desert. Fight enemies, explore the anomalous wasteland, level up your character, join one of the forces in the ruined world.','2021/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/921800/Encased_A_SciFi_PostApocalyptic_RPG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6940,'bmx_bastards',NULL,'Customize your BMX and dive into a giant open world wich include Bike Parks from all around the world waiting for you.Can\'t find your favorite spot? Create it by yourself in our park editor.Don\'t wait any longer and come to prove you\'re a true Rider!','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2563760/BMX_Bastards/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6941,'the_sims™_4_little_campers_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1904391/The_Sims_4_Little_Campers_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6942,'out_of_sight_vr',NULL,'Out of Sight VR pulls you into a chilling nightmare where you see through the eyes of a child’s only comfort: her teddy bear. Guide Sophie through a sinister mansion and evade the lurking horrors that stalk her every move. The shadows are watching. And Sophie is counting on you.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3558720/Out_of_Sight_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6943,'wrc_8_fia_world_rally_championship',NULL,'The most complete and authentic official WRC simulation yet. New physics for all surfaces, a completely redesigned career mode, dynamic weather conditions, 50 teams, 14 countries, 100 tracks, weekly challenges and an eSports mode…','2020/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1004750/WRC_8_FIA_World_Rally_Championship/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6944,'idle_wizard',NULL,'RPG/Idle hybrid about becoming the most powerful wizard there is. Pick a class, get a pet, configure and improve your character in a myriad ways!','2019/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/992070/Idle_Wizard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6945,'lidar_exploration_program',NULL,'LiDAR Exploration Program is a relaxing atmospheric game with light horror elements, where you explore in complete darkness using a scanner to reveal the world around you.','2025/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1882190/LiDAR_Exploration_Program/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6946,'master_of_chess',NULL,'Play chess with help from your AI character, solve chess puzzles, build an unrivaled openings repertoire, and win tournaments worldwide. Become World Champion in the first and only chess career simulator!','2024/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2248900/Master_of_Chess/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6947,'combat_air_patrol_2:_military_flight_simulator',NULL,'Feel the power of flying the AV8B Harrier II. A middle ground flight and naval combat simulator with mission planner & fully dynamic open ended campaign. Showstopping VR.','2016/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/347170/Combat_Air_Patrol_2_Military_Flight_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6948,'throne_of_bone',NULL,'Draft minions to defeat all who oppose the noble art of necromancy. Wield spells, discover dark relics, and reclaim your castle to unite the land through undeath in this unholy amalgam of roguelike, deckbuilder, and autobattler.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1866630/Throne_of_Bone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6949,'stellar_blade™:_tachyon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stellar Blade™ on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3662250/Stellar_Blade_Tachyon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6950,'operation:_harsh_doorstop_\"closed_beta\"',NULL,'This version of Operation: Harsh Doorstop is updated nightly with all \"work-in-progress\" features that are currently being developed for the game. Our development team uses this to organize exclusive playtests for our paid supporters. You can gain access to these events by purchasing the game here.','2023/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1307180/Operation_Harsh_Doorstop_Closed_Beta/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6951,'steel_division:_normandy_44_-_back_to_hell',NULL,'This content requires the base game Steel Division: Normandy 44 on Steam in order to play.','2018/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/780340/Steel_Division_Normandy_44__Back_to_Hell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6952,'i,_robot',NULL,'Jeff Minter is back with another unique take on a 1980s Atari arcade game: I, Robot. Reimagined in Minter’s signature assault of colors, shapes and sounds, this new take on the eclectic arcade title is built from the ground up with new challenges, new twists, and a whole lot of llamas.','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2932910/I_Robot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6953,'transport_fever_2:_deluxe_upgrade_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Transport Fever 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2195610/Transport_Fever_2_Deluxe_Upgrade_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6954,'neverwinter_nights:_darkness_over_daggerford',NULL,'This content requires the base game Neverwinter Nights: Enhanced Edition on Steam in order to play.','2018/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/854960/Neverwinter_Nights_Darkness_Over_Daggerford/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6955,'automobilista_2_-_silverstone_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1386930/Automobilista_2__Silverstone_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6956,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_heart_of_korea',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2144480/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Heart_of_Korea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6957,'call_of_the_wild:_the_angler™_-_south_africa_reserve',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of the Wild: The Angler™ on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2500370/Call_of_the_Wild_The_Angler__South_Africa_Reserve/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6958,'tabletop_playground',NULL,'The modern digital tabletop game for fans and creators! Featuring deep customization and choice, enjoy more immersive tabletop sessions with friends than ever before. Build new rule sets for traditional games, play custom-made games by the community or create your own and share them with the world.','2020/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/838410/Tabletop_Playground/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6959,'immersion_pack_-_europa_universalis_iv:_third_rome',NULL,'This content requires the base game Europa Universalis IV on Steam in order to play.','2017/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/625050/Immersion_Pack__Europa_Universalis_IV_Third_Rome/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6960,'airborne_kingdom',NULL,'The sky city builder awaits. Create your own flying kingdom and lead it on a quest across an expansive world. Explore the varied landscape, build up a floating metropolis, aid struggling people below, uncover lost secrets and, ultimately, bring back the Airborne Kingdom legend.','2022/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/982290/Airborne_Kingdom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6961,'grim_dawn_-_steam_loyalist_items_pack_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Grim Dawn on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1088290/Grim_Dawn__Steam_Loyalist_Items_Pack_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6962,'incision',NULL,'All old-school FPS action. No Bullshit. Lots of blood & gore. Slaughter your way through nightmarish industrial mazes, transformed cityscapes and surreal alien structures to cut down the Growth in this ultraviolent, fast-paced, and merciless retro-styled first person shooter.','2022/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1734680/INCISION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6963,'9-nine-:episode_2',NULL,'It\'s Sora and Kakeru\'s time to shine when the action heats up in 9-nine-: Episode 2. Can they take down the murderer before it\'s too late for them both?','2019/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1033420/9nineEpisode_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6964,'spark_the_electric_jester_2',NULL,'Fast paced 3D action platformer.','2019/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1079210/Spark_the_Electric_Jester_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6965,'hyperdimension_neptunia_re;birth2:_sisters_generation',NULL,'Gamindustri has been taken over by a new threat, and the CPUs are nowhere to be found! It’s now up to their younger sisters to step into the spotlight and save the day in this hilarious, deeply customizable JRPG!','2015/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/351710/Hyperdimension_Neptunia_ReBirth2_Sisters_Generation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6966,'worms',NULL,'Throw a grenade down memory lane with the original and classic turn-based strategy game Worms™! Up to 4 teams of worms do battle over an ever-changing battlefield with falling weapon crates, crazed exploding sheep and more besides. Winner of many industry awards, find out what all the fuss was about.','1995/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/70640/Worms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6967,'kingdom_two_crowns:_regent\'s_royal_wardrobe',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Two Crowns on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3062350/Kingdom_Two_Crowns_Regents_Royal_Wardrobe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6968,'wargroove_2',NULL,'Trouble stirs on the shores of Aurania. An ambitious new faction has unearthed forbidden relics capable of catastrophic consequences. But how far will they go to achieve glory? Take to the battlefield, sea, and sky with a cast of new Commanders, using your wits to wage turn-based war!','2023/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1346020/Wargroove_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6969,'the_signal_state',NULL,'Set in a post-apocalyptic future, The Signal State puts your logic skills to the test with complex puzzles inspired by modular synthesizers. Repair machines, rebuild an abandoned farm, and be part of a revolution that will change the fate of agriculture once and for all.','2021/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1577620/The_Signal_State/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6970,'neptunia_x_senran_kagura:_ninja_wars',NULL,'Neptunia and SENRAN KAGURA join forces in this action-packed RPG!','2022/5/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1836860/Neptunia_x_SENRAN_KAGURA_Ninja_Wars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6971,'stronghold_hd_(2012)',NULL,'The original castle sim, Stronghold HD allows you to design, build and destroy historical castles. Engage in medieval warfare against the AI in one of two single player campaigns or online with up to 8 players.','2001/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/40950/Stronghold_HD_2012/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6972,'pro_cycling_manager_2024',NULL,'Become a sports director, take part in the world\'s top cycling races and lead your riders to victory. Set race objectives, negotiate contracts, find new sponsors and build your team season after season.','2024/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2494350/Pro_Cycling_Manager_2024/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6973,'ship_graveyard_simulator_2_-_warships_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ship Graveyard Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2628300/Ship_Graveyard_Simulator_2__Warships_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6974,'whisker_squadron:_survivor',NULL,'A smooth roguelite shooter from the creators of RACE THE SUN, featuring a voiced cast of feline pilots in a dramatic showdown against corporate-powered robots called The Swarm. Features a 3-act campaign with branching paths, epic bosses, and a wide arsenal of pilots, ships, and weapons.','2025/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2140100/Whisker_Squadron_Survivor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6975,'misericorde_volume_two:_white_wool_&_snow',NULL,'White Wool & Snow is the second visual novel in the Misericorde series.','2024/12/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3035990/Misericorde_Volume_Two_White_Wool__Snow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6976,'night_shift_nurses',NULL,'A washed-up mad doctor is hired back by a devious former test subject and asked to twist her hospital into a corrupt donation mill. Will he seize this second chance to practice his own vision of \"science,\" or will his many failings drag him down once again in this pseudo-medical visual novel?','2024/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3239270/Night_Shift_Nurses/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6977,'quiplash_2_interlashional',NULL,'The \"say anything\" party game is going international! All the hilarious content from Quiplash 2, now in French, Italian, German, and Spanish! With 100 NEW prompts in each language! (And you can still play in boring old English.) Get this QUINTILINGUAL Quiplash now, and take your next party global!','2020/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1111940/Quiplash_2_InterLASHional/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6978,'northgard_-_lyngbakr,_clan_of_the_kraken',NULL,'This content requires the base game Northgard on Steam in order to play.','2019/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1088640/Northgard__Lyngbakr_Clan_of_the_Kraken/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6979,'the_swapper',NULL,'What if someone knew your mind better than you did? The Swapper is an award-winning, narrative driven puzzle game set in the furthest reaches of space.','2013/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/231160/The_Swapper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6980,'dark_deception:_monsters_&_mortals',NULL,'Dark Deception: Monsters & Mortals is a multiplayer horror party game with multiple modes where players take on the role of monsters or mortals from Dark Deception\'s universe (and other universes) and fight for soul shards in nightmarish mazes!','2020/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1266690/Dark_Deception_Monsters__Mortals/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6981,'star_wars™:_battlefront_classic_collection',NULL,'Play the classic STAR WARS™ Battlefront games, online and offline in this definitive collection.','2024/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2446550/STAR_WARS_Battlefront_Classic_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6982,'magical_delicacy',NULL,'A magical pixel art platformer. Explore an unfamiliar town and deliver tasty treats to the townsfolk. Cook magical delicacies from your bought and gathered ingredients. Learn new ways to traverse, discover secrets, and figure out the intricacies of your orders.','2024/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2231190/Magical_Delicacy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_147'),(6983,'civilization_v_-_scrambled_nations_map_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier\'s Civilization® V on Steam in order to play.','2013/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/235585/Civilization_V__Scrambled_Nations_Map_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6984,'bapbap',NULL,'Join BAPBAP, the Roguelike Party game where no two matches are ever the same. Round up your homies, pick a character, and build a giga-unfair build that\'ll make them hate you - then do it all over again!','2025/3/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2226280/BAPBAP/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6985,'construction_simulator_-_kramer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Construction Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2203420/Construction_Simulator__Kramer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6986,'metal:_hellsinger_-_essential_hits_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Metal: Hellsinger on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2392613/Metal_Hellsinger__Essential_Hits_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6987,'risk_of_rain_(2013)',NULL,'Risk of Rain is an action platformer with roguelike elements. With permanent death as a primary feature, players will have to play their best to get as far as possible. Fight on a mysterious planet with randomly spawning enemies and bosses, either alone or with 3 friends in online co-op.','2013/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/248820/Risk_of_Rain_2013/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6988,'kona',NULL,'Northern Canada, 1970. A strange blizzard ravages Atamipek Lake. Step into the shoes of a detective to explore the eerie village, investigate surreal events, and battle the elements to survive. Kona is a chilly interactive tale you won\'t soon forget.','2017/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/365160/Kona/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6989,'dealer\'s_life_2',NULL,'Your favorite pawn shop experience is finally getting a sequel! Haggle like your life depends on it in this funny tycoon game. You never know WHAT is gonna stumble through that door!','2022/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1343670/Dealers_Life_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6990,'30xx',NULL,'Jump, shoot, and slash your way through 30XX, the roguelike action platformer you can play with a friend! Explore lush, ever-changing worlds that mix precise platforming with fevered combat. Destroy fearsome Guardians. Master unique Powers. Rediscover the thousand years we\'ve lost.','2023/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1029210/30XX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6991,'fights_in_tight_spaces_-_weapon_of_choice',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fights in Tight Spaces on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1867120/Fights_in_Tight_Spaces__Weapon_of_Choice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6992,'shadowverse_ccg',NULL,'Four million battles every day. One Shadowverse. Japan\'s #1 strategic card game. Made by card gamers for card gamers. ','2016/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/453480/Shadowverse_CCG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6993,'nightmare_of_decay',NULL,'A first-person action horror game set in a nightmarish manor infested with zombies, psychotic cultists, and a horde of other horrors. Utilize an assortment of different weapons in a brutal fight for survival as you try to escape from the Nightmare of Decay.','2022/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1848450/Nightmare_of_Decay/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6994,'ram:_random_access_mayhem',NULL,'The roguelike where you play as the enemies. Take control of your foes, turn them against each other in fast-paced combat, and leap to a new host before your current body breaks down.','2024/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2256450/RAM_Random_Access_Mayhem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6995,'signal_simulator',NULL,'Game inspired by SETI. Take the role of a scientist to find an extraterrestrial signal .Control massive Radio Antennas by using interactive control in your Observatory. Detect , download and decode unknown or story telling signals. Manage and Maintain an electrical system to improve your systems and make it more efficient.','2018/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/839310/Signal_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6996,'aliens:_fireteam_elite_-_uacm_frontline_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Aliens: Fireteam Elite on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1643353/Aliens_Fireteam_Elite__UACM_Frontline_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6997,'weed_shop_3',NULL,'BUILD YOUR VIRTUAL WEED EMPIRE: Grow the hottest strains & crossbreed new ones, roll your own Blunts, sell Bongs, hire Growers, make Solventless Concentrates, handle Rival Dealers, befriend Influencers, smoke Dabs, ride a Dolphin, and More! WELCOME TO WEED SHOP 3!','2022/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1182110/Weed_Shop_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6998,'april_grove',NULL,'Undertake your new job as a forester in a mystic and peaceful wood. Chop, gather, level up and unravel the expansive forest and its splendor at your own pace, one log at a time!','2025/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3622260/April_Grove/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(6999,'s.nero/dante/vergil',NULL,'This content requires the base game Devil May Cry 4 Special Edition on Steam in order to play.','2015/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/359491/SNeroDanteVergil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7000,'cosmicbreak_universal',NULL,'CosmicBreak Universal is an MMO action game that lets you play massive battles of up to 30 vs 30 players using customizable robots and humanoids! Create your own original character and aim for victory with your allies!','2008/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1140620/CosmicBreak_Universal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7001,'snowrunner_-_season_14:_reap_&_sow',NULL,'This content requires the base game SnowRunner on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2709460/SnowRunner__Season_14_Reap__Sow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7002,'here_comes_niko!',NULL,'Here Comes Niko! is the cozy 3D platformer for tired people! You play as Niko traveling across scenic islands. Make new friends, catch fish, solve puzzles, snag bugs, and more! Oh, Did I mention your boss is a frog?','2021/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/925950/Here_Comes_Niko/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7003,'airships:_heroes_and_villains',NULL,'This content requires the base game Airships: Conquer the Skies on Steam in order to play.','2023/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2333180/Airships_Heroes_and_Villains/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7004,'planet_coaster_-_spooky_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Coaster on Steam in order to play.','2017/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/710490/Planet_Coaster__Spooky_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7005,'little_big_workshop',NULL,'Manage your workers, stations, machines and create awesome stuff as your little big workshop grows into your dream factory!','2019/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/574720/Little_Big_Workshop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7006,'desecrators',NULL,'Desecrators is a retro FPS inspired by \'90s six-degrees-of-freedom shooters. Plunder your way through the galaxy to destructive weapons and technology powerful enough to take on the ultimate heist: The legendary vaults of the Galactic Treasury.','2025/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1311570/Desecrators/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7007,'splendor',NULL,'The OFFICIAL digital adaptation of the best-selling board game. ** ONLINE MULTIPLAYER NOW AVAILABLE !!! **','2015/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/376680/Splendor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7008,'silent_hunter®_iii',NULL,'The king of submarine simulations returns with an all-new 3D engine, new crew command features, and more realistic WWII naval action than ever before. The movie-like graphics and simple, tension-filled gameplay make this the perfect game for the realism fanatic and the casual gamer.','2005/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/15210/Silent_Hunter_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7009,'chippy',NULL,'Chip destructible bosses apart pixel-by-pixel in this twin-stick bullet-hell shooter.','2019/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/602700/Chippy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7010,'reality_break',NULL,'Rewrite the universe! Break reality to change your fate, and use your powers to stop sinister forces from altering existence itself. Discover the origin of your new abilities in a fast-paced ARPG Loot Collection Roguelite where you will bend, break, and change the laws of the universe!','2025/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1473060/Reality_Break/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7011,'stellar_monarch_2',NULL,'Stellar Monarch 2 is a feudal space empire builder where you feel like the Emperor, not a logistics officer. Great noble houses, usurpers to the throne, rebels, assassins, court intrigues, disloyal admirals, incompetent governors and ever-present alien threat.','2022/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1437750/Stellar_Monarch_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7012,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_cuatro_colinas_game_reserve',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1179710/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Cuatro_Colinas_Game_Reserve/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7013,'fpv_skydive_:_fpv_drone_simulator',NULL,'FPV SkyDive is a free-to-play realistic drone racing and freestyle simulator. Feel the adrenaline of high speed first-person view drone racing in single-player or multi-player scenarios. The future is now, become an FPV pilot today!','2021/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1278060/FPV_SkyDive__FPV_Drone_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7014,'king\'s_quest',NULL,'King’s Quest is a collection of five different chapter releases, each focusing on an untold tale in Graham’s past. Discover a wondrous world full of whimsical characters, charming puzzles and perilous dangers in this fun and enchanting coming of age story.','2015/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/345390/Kings_Quest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7015,'space_channel_5_vr_kinda_funky_news_flash!',NULL,'SEGA’s legendary Dreamcast rhythm game “Space Channel 5 ” is coming to virtual reality as ”Space Channel 5 VR Kinda Funky News Flash!\". Heroine Ulala will navigate you through the world of “Space Channel 5”','2020/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/879140/Space_Channel_5_VR_Kinda_Funky_News_Flash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7016,'jujutsu_kaisen_cursed_clash_-_hidden_inventory/premature_death',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jujutsu Kaisen Cursed Clash on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2579320/Jujutsu_Kaisen_Cursed_Clash__Hidden_InventoryPremature_Death/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7017,'shuffle_tactics',NULL,'Shuffle Tactics is a roguelike deckbuilding tactical RPG. Strategize to survive tough battles, pick the right cards to create powerful synergies, and bond with your sidekicks to get an edge in battle. Adventure awaits! Will you rise as Asteria\'s new King?','2025/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2186580/Shuffle_Tactics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7018,'diesel_railcar_simulator',NULL,'Drive vintage diesel trains, shifting gears manually and trying to reach a perfect score. Create new routes, trains and timetables. Share your creations and download new content from the Workshop.','2018/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/750170/Diesel_Railcar_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7019,'avernum:_escape_from_the_pit',NULL,'Avernum is a land underground, a subterranean nation full of rogues, misfits, and brigands, struggling for survival in the monster-infested darkness. Hunt for glory, treasure, and justice in the underworld. Fight for survival, freedom, and even vengeance in the epic indie cult-classic.','2012/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/208400/Avernum_Escape_From_the_Pit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7020,'rally_mechanic_simulator',NULL,'Take your opportunity as a real Rally Mechanic. Overcome all the obstacles that the reckless racers throw at you - including unrepairable parts, time limitations and more. Take good care of your rally cars so that on the next special they will perform as good as if they came out of the factory.','2025/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1588090/Rally_Mechanic_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7021,'vending_machine_business_simulator',NULL,'Build your business! control every aspect of a thriving vending machine business. Buy, place, and restock machines to increase profits. Do you have what it takes to manage, expand, and dominate the vending industry?','2024/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2998750/Vending_Machine_Business_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7022,'chrono_ark_-_summer_twilight',NULL,'This content requires the base game Chrono Ark on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2780000/Chrono_Ark__Summer_Twilight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7023,'r-type_final_2',NULL,'R-Type has returned! The legendary side-scroller is back and better than ever with beautifully rendered 3D graphics, exhilarating shoot-\'em-up gameplay, and a multitude of stages, ships, and weapons that will allow you to conduct a symphony of destruction upon your foes.','2021/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1442820/RType_Final_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7024,'payday_2:_black_cat_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1778790/PAYDAY_2_Black_Cat_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7025,'two_point_hospital:_exhibition_items_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Two Point Hospital on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1144500/Two_Point_Hospital_Exhibition_Items_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7026,'2.5_dimensional_seduction:_angels_on_stage!',NULL,'The anime \"2.5 Dimensional Seduction\" debuts its first game! Relive the anime in-game and enjoy a never-before-seen story! Strike a pose in cosplay battles! Obtain materials, level up your beautiful cosplayers, and deepen your bond with them! Now, shine out your best with your angels on stage!','2024/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2932040/25_DIMENSIONAL_SEDUCTION_Angels_on_Stage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7027,'flock',NULL,'Flock is a multiplayer co-op game about the joy of flight and collecting adorable flying creatures with your friends. Soar through beautiful landscapes, seeking out rare and elusive creatures to add to your flock.','2024/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1472930/Flock/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7028,'werewolf:_the_apocalypse_-_earthblood',NULL,'You are Cahal, a powerful Garou who chose to go into exile after losing control of his destructive rage. He can transform into a wolf and a Crinos, a huge ferocious beast. Master your three forms and their powers to punish those who defile Gaia.','2022/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/679110/Werewolf_The_Apocalypse__Earthblood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7029,'payday_2:_lost_in_transit_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2074240/PAYDAY_2_Lost_in_Transit_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_148'),(7030,'the_quintessential_quintuplets_-_memories_of_a_quintessential_summer',NULL,'A thrilling island getaway with the Nakano quintuplets!','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2507610/The_Quintessential_Quintuplets__Memories_of_a_Quintessential_Summer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7031,'caribbean_legend_-_ships_pack: