n and build the most efficient metro stations known to man! Excavate. Expand. Set staff priorities. And manage the commuter flow. Overcrowd is a 2.5D management/tycoon/simulator set below the bustling city of Lubdon Town.','2020/10/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/726110/Overcrowd_A_Commute_Em_Up/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7038,'battlestar_galactica_deadlock:_resurrection',NULL,'This content requires the base game Battlestar Galactica Deadlock on Steam in order to play.','2019/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1083890/Battlestar_Galactica_Deadlock_Resurrection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7039,'disney_princess:_enchanted_journey',NULL,'In Disney Princess: Enchanted Journey, players are transported to environments based on classic films as they discover the courage, trust, and friendship needed to become a real princess, while attempting to save each kingdom from evil.','2007/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/322130/Disney_Princess_Enchanted_Journey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7040,'succubus_affection',NULL,'In a world of human-like monsters, a young man lives in a quiet, remote village with his sister. However, he is attacked by monsters when he leaves the village. Now he works hard to become stronger so he no longer burdens his sister.','2020/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1328890/Succubus_Affection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7041,'mall_manager_simulator',NULL,'Take full control as you turn a quiet, empty shopping center into a thriving hub of life and profit. Stock shelves, set your own prices, handle payments, hire and train staff, and manage everything down to the finest detail. Every decision counts — and every success is truly yours.','2025/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3092980/MALL_MANAGER_SIMULATOR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7042,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_souls_of_a_feather',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2023/