/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7050,'aliens:_fireteam_elite_-_nostromo_salvage_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Aliens: Fireteam Elite on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1643352/Aliens_Fireteam_Elite__Nostromo_Salvage_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7051,'ez2on_reboot_:_r_-_hardcore_tano*c_music_pack_vol.2',NULL,'This content requires the base game EZ2ON REBOOT : R on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2688870/EZ2ON_REBOOT__R__HARDCORE_TANOC_Music_Pack_Vol2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7052,'space_quest™_collection',NULL,'Experience a blast from the past with the complete, completely twisted Space Quest Collection.','2006/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/10110/Space_Quest_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7053,'call_of_duty®:_modern_warfare®_iii_-_tracer_pack:_nuptial_nightmare_ultra_skin_pro_pack',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2024/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2790750/Call_of_Duty_Modern_Warfare_III__Tracer_Pack_Nuptial_Nightmare_Ultra_Skin_Pro_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7054,'stuck_in_time',NULL,'A unique mix of adventure and idle game. Plan and optimise your loops carefully and let the grind happen automatically. Explore this unique world, meet strange characters and escape the loop. A high-quality idle game that elevate the mechanics through an old school pixel-art adventure.','2021/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1814010/Stuck_In_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7055,'sonicomi',NULL,'Super Sonico is a cheerful, hardworking college student and amateur musician who\'s about to make her modeling debut. As her personal photographer, you will be responsible for Sonico\'s image, balancing the needs of your clients with your own vision for Sonico\'s future.','2016/7/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/444140/Sonicomi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),