/8400/Geometry_Wars_Retro_Evolved/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7062,'lamplight_city',NULL,'A steampunk-ish detective adventure from the creator of A Golden Wake and Shardlight! Can you help private investigator Miles Fordham find justice for his clients and track down his partner\'s killer before his entire world comes apart?','2018/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/761460/Lamplight_City/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7063,'xf_extreme_formula',NULL,'Race at the speed of sound and beyond in the great XF Extreme Formula championship! Taking place in the year 3000, you will tour trough the solar system proving you’re worthy of the title of champion.','2024/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2539910/XF_Extreme_Formula/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7064,'rising_world',NULL,'Rising World is a voxel based open-world sandbox game, featuring a procedurally generated world, playable in single and multi-player.','2014/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/324080/Rising_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7065,'thumper',NULL,'Thumper is rhythm violence: classic rhythm-action, blistering speed, and brutal physicality. You are a space beetle. Brave the hellish void and confront a maniacal giant head from the future.','2016/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/356400/Thumper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7066,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_cold_blooded',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1761570/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Cold_Blooded/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7067,'summer~life_in_the_countryside~_+outing',NULL,'This content requires the base game Summer~Life in the Countryside~ on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2107850/SummerLife_in_the_Countryside_Outing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7068,'jet_island',NULL,'Slide anywhere on your hoverboard at extreme speeds! Explore the massive open world of Jet Island! Learn to skate on any surface, swing from tall buildings, fly in ways you never knew were possible! Defeat the 4 giant boss fights! Get ready to experience complete freedom in VR!','2018/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/587220/Jet_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7069,'cyubevr',NULL,'Immerse yourself in a voxel game exclusively designed for VR. A beautiful infinite procedural world. Explore, gather resources, craft with your hands in 3D, and build anything you can imagine. Featuring great VR controls, near-infinite view distance, Steam Workshop mod support, and much more!','2018/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/619500/cyubeVR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7070,'across_the_obelisk:_amelia,_the_queen',NULL,'This content requires the base game Across the Obelisk on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2666340/Across_the_Obelisk_Amelia_the_Queen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7071,'one_piece_pirate_warriors_3',NULL,'Enjoy the original story of ONE PIECE from Fuschia Village to the mysterious kingdom of Dressrosa. Will your resolution be strong enough to defeat the most dangerous pirates, including Doflamingo and many more?','2015/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/331600/One_Piece_Pirate_Warriors_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7072,'shapez_-_puzzle_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game shapez on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1625400/shapez__Puzzle_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7073,'china:_mao\'s_legacy',NULL,'Year 1976, the stormy Cultural revolution has died down, hard times of hongweibing and public critics are coming to an end. Old and sick Mao Zedong will soon leave China to his comrades from CPC. The Cold War is coming into a new phase...','2019/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/950740/China_Maos_legacy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7074,'brave_alchemist_colette',NULL,'Colette has been living a happy life as an apprentice alchemist, but when a mysterious stranger pays her master Priscilla a visit, Priscilla sets out on a journey. With her master gone, it\'s up to Colette to inherit the workshop and help those in need while also embarking on adventures of her own!','2020/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1135830/Brave_Alchemist_Colette/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7075,'strategic_command:_world_war_i',NULL,'Strategic Command: World War I is a new chapter in the Strategic Command Franchise. Relive this momentous conflict from the opening shots of 1914 to the final offensives. Strategic Command: World War I covers all the main aspects and theatres of the war.','2019/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1096930/Strategic_Command_World_War_I/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7076,'yohane_the_parhelion_-blaze_in_the_deepblue-',NULL,'Yohane the Parhelion is an official spin-off of \"Love Live! Sunshine\". Yohane\'s fantasy world sets the stage for a 2D metroidvania in \"Yohane the Parhelion: Blaze in the Deepblue\"!','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2404370/YOHANE_THE_PARHELION_BLAZE_in_the_DEEPBLUE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_149'),(7077,'drawful_2',NULL,'For 3-8 players and an audience of thousands! Your phones or tablets are your controllers! The game of terrible drawings and hilariously wrong answers.','2016/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/442070/Drawful_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7078,'devil_may_cry_5_-_playable_character:_vergil',NULL,'This content requires the base game Devil May Cry 5 on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1432640/Devil_May_Cry_5__Playable_Character_Vergil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7079,'barony_extended_soundtrack_by_chris_kukla',NULL,'This content requires the base game Barony on Steam in order to play.','2018/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/470540/Barony_Extended_Soundtrack_by_Chris_Kukla/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7080,'phoenix_point_-_kaos_engines_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Phoenix Point on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1622221/Phoenix_Point__Kaos_Engines_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7081,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_rancho_del_arroyo',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1608440/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Rancho_del_Arroyo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7082,'flight_of_nova',NULL,'Flight of Nova is a simulator based on newtonian mechanics in which you control spacecraft in the Noren star system. You fly multiple types of spacecraft doing transport and search missions in an environment with realistic aerodynamics and orbital physics.','2022/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1069190/Flight_Of_Nova/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7083,'pinball_fx2_vr',NULL,'Creating a brand new way to play pinball that deftly combines the look and feel of digital pinball with the sensation of a real-world experience, Pinball FX2 VR is the premiere place for pinball action in VR!','2016/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/547590/Pinball_FX2_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7084,'quest_hunter',NULL,'Quest Hunter is an isometric action-RPG where your choice drives the story. Find tons of treasures and secrets, solve puzzles, equip your character, level up your skills and finish off enemy bosses. Play on the couch, alone or with friends, or make it an online party for up to four players!','2019/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/487000/Quest_Hunter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7085,'serre',NULL,'A visual novel about a girl and an alien drinking tea and falling in love!','2025/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3574510/Serre/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7086,'never_mourn',NULL,'Explore the world of Never Mourn in this rogue-lite action adventure. Death is never the end, merely the beginning of your next adventure. Use ancient necromantic magics to raise an army of undead daemons and do battle to close the rifts of Never Mourn.','2024/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1839820/Never_Mourn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7087,'the_sims™_3_showtime',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2012/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/47932/The_Sims_3_Showtime/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7088,'​our_life:_beginnings_&_always_-_step_3_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Our Life: Beginnings & Always on Steam in order to play.','2021/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1464062/Our_Life_Beginnings__Always__Step_3_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7089,'ys_origin',NULL,'The perfect mix of action, exploration and story with screen-filling bosses, unique platforming elements, and innovative puzzles.','2012/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/207350/Ys_Origin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7090,'tooth_and_tail',NULL,'Lead the revolution with an army of flamethrowing Boars, mustard gas-lobbing Skunks, and paratrooper-puking Owls. Tooth and Tail is a Real-Time-Strategy game featuring Single Player, Online Competitive Play, Split Screen, Replays, and more. Build a base, lead your army, eat your enemies!','2017/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/286000/Tooth_and_Tail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7091,'prison_architect_-_undead',NULL,'This content requires the base game Prison Architect on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2154010/Prison_Architect__Undead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7092,'while_we_wait_here',NULL,'Share thoughts and hot food with your last ever clients, as you wait for the world to end.','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2213120/While_We_Wait_Here/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7093,'sid_meier\'s_railroads!',NULL,'Sid Meier\'s Railroads! marks the return of the watershed title in simulation/strategy gaming that launched the popular \"tycoon\" genre, and inspired a new generation of games. Sid Meier\'s Railroads!','2006/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/7600/Sid_Meiers_Railroads/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7094,'monster_hunter_wilds_-_seikret_decoration:_duskhorn_caparison',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Hunter Wilds on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3117290/Monster_Hunter_Wilds__Seikret_Decoration_Duskhorn_Caparison/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7095,'kitchen_sync:_aloha!',NULL,'A cozy, story-driven cooking RPG set in Hawaii. Become head chef of your family\'s restaurant, build a team of passionate chefs, and dish up tasty Hawaiian food. Manage your kitchens, build friendships, find romance, explore the island’s tropical spots, and discover the power of cooking together.','2025/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2333930/Kitchen_Sync_Aloha/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7096,'indivisible',NULL,'Indivisible is a hand drawn action RPG platformer from Lab Zero, creators of the critically acclaimed Skullgirls! Set in a huge fantasy world, Indivisible tells the story of Ajna, a fearless girl with a rebellious streak who sets out on a quest to save everything she knows from being destroyed.','2019/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/421170/Indivisible/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7097,'mechabellum_-_mobile_forces_skin_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Mechabellum on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3241600/Mechabellum__Mobile_Forces_Skin_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7098,'a_hat_in_time_-_b-side_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for A Hat in Time, but does not include the base game.','2018/2/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/693170/A_Hat_in_Time__BSide_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7099,'evolution_board_game',NULL,'Predators lurk, food is scarce, you must adapt - or go extinct. Evolve your species to survive and dominate as you explore the campaign or go head-to-head with the skill-based matchmaker.','2019/2/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/469800/Evolution_Board_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7100,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_smoking_barrels_weapon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1252750/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Smoking_Barrels_Weapon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7101,'for_the_king:_lost_civilization_adventure_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game For The King on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1433560/For_The_King_Lost_Civilization_Adventure_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7102,'railway_empire_-_great_britain_&_ireland',NULL,'This content requires the base game Railway Empire on Steam in order to play.','2018/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/884141/Railway_Empire__Great_Britain__Ireland/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7103,'old_school',NULL,'Relive your school days in 3D, where old school graphics bring back timeless fun! Create your own star student and attend a schedule full of classes in time to gather the knowledge you need to thrive, while an equally important popularity contest challenges you survive...','2023/10/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2529120/Old_School/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7104,'bodyrecords',NULL,'BodyRecords is a chilling horror experience, blending bodycam immersion,microphone sensitivity to your voice, and eerie spaces. Work together with teammates to solve puzzles, evade lurking horrors, and escape. True cooperative play and unsettling atmosphere make every moment a tense challenge.','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3232040/BodyRecords/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7105,'the_sims™_4_secret_sanctuary_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2815450/The_Sims_4_Secret_Sanctuary_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7106,'the_disney_afternoon_collection',NULL,'Starring a cast of beloved Disney characters, The Disney Afternoon Collection takes you back to a golden era of gaming and afternoons filled with adventure. All six classic games feature new and improved visuals and include filtering options that replicate a retro look and feel.','2017/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/525040/The_Disney_Afternoon_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7107,'the_legend_of_nayuta:_boundless_trails',NULL,'A fateful encounter with the fairy Noi sets Nayuta and his friends on a path to explore beyond the borders of their island home in order to stop a dark plot.','2021/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1668530/The_Legend_of_Nayuta_Boundless_Trails/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7108,'super_jigsaw_puzzle:_generations',NULL,'If you like to make puzzles, Super Jigsaw Puzzle is your game. Enjoy its comfortable and intuitive interface and its relaxing music that will allow you to concentrate on the difficult task of solving these beautiful photos that pose a real challenge for lovers of puzzles.','2019/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1036950/Super_Jigsaw_Puzzle_Generations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7109,'joyquarium',NULL,'Joyquarium is a relaxing casual fish-raising game. Buy various cute fry and sell them at a high price after they grow up. With the money you earn, you can purchase aquatic plants, driftwood, scenery stone, etc. to decorate your tank (you can freely adjust the color, size, and position).','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3472890/Joyquarium/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7110,'mizi_no!',NULL,'In this free 2D puzzle game, you must reassemble broken objects that your cat has knocked over.','2024/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2654860/Mizi_NO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7111,'thief™_ii:_the_metal_age',NULL,'The ultimate thief is back! Tread softly as you make your way through 15 new complex, non-linear levels full of loot to steal and guards to outsmart. Improved enemy AI, new gadgets and a riveting story will draw you into the world of Thief™ II: The Metal Age, a place of powerful new technologies, fanatical religions and corruption.','2000/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/211740/Thief_II_The_Metal_Age/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7112,'epic_auto_towers',NULL,'Epic Auto Towers is a turn-based strategy game combining elements of autobattler, deckbuilder and roguelike. Purchase uncommon and rare Towers and build the strongest combo to withstand the monster assault! Discover unusual new Tower combinations as you come back for more.','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2116060/Epic_Auto_Towers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7113,'train_simulator:_liverpool-manchester_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2014/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/258653/Train_Simulator_LiverpoolManchester_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7114,'grow_up',NULL,'Leaping from mind-boggling heights, bouncing off Champolines, soaring inches from floating islands, BUD can do it all - that look of mild terror, that’s his daredevil face. Help the adorable little robot collect MOM’s scattered ship parts and return them to the moon.','2016/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/426790/Grow_Up/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7115,'dungeon_of_the_endless™',NULL,'Dungeon of the ENDLESS™ is a Rogue-Like Dungeon-Defense game, in which the player and their team of heroes must protect the generator of their crashed ship while exploring an ever-expanding dungeon, all while facing waves of monsters and special events as they try to find their way out...','2014/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/249050/Dungeon_of_the_ENDLESS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7116,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_lonely_howl',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1906330/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Lonely_Howl/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7117,'just_cause™_3_dlc:_mech_land_assault',NULL,'This content requires the base game Just Cause™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2016/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/400490/Just_Cause_3_DLC_Mech_Land_Assault/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7118,'the_beast_inside',NULL,'The Beast Inside is a unique, gripping twist on thriller and survival horror. Immerse in the story of long-buried secrets, personal tragedies, and madness. Play as two protagonists bounded by dark heritage. Combat the enemies, solve riddles and experience real terror in the 3D-scanned environment.','2019/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/792300/The_Beast_Inside/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7119,'kandagawa_jet_girls',NULL,'From the creators of SENRAN KAGURA, the future\'s wettest and wildest new sport is here! Join one of seven teams and race through Tokyo\'s waterways on futuristic jet machines, using water weapons to blow your opponents back onto dry land!','2020/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1233800/Kandagawa_Jet_Girls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7120,'minit',NULL,'Minit is a peculiar little adventure played sixty seconds at a time.','2018/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/609490/Minit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7121,'critters_for_sale',NULL,'Experience death from the comfort of your seat.','2021/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1078420/Critters_for_Sale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7122,'fida_puti_samurai',NULL,'A Retro-FPS \"virtual happy place\", jeopardized with a naughty bug. Traverse this action-oriented roguelite blasting waifus to uncover dirty secrets on a personal computer!','2022/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1534340/Fida_Puti_Samurai/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7123,'horizon\'s_gate',NULL,'Voyage into the wide world of Eral as an explorer, trader, or privateer. Defeat your enemies on land or at sea in deep but straightforward tactical combat. Unravel the secrets behind Dominio\'s betrayal – or sail off in search of your own adventure.','2020/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1224290/Horizons_Gate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_150'),(7124,'ozymandias:_bronze_age_empire_sim',NULL,'Build an empire in a single sitting. All the strategy of a classic 4X in a faster format, which also shines in multiplayer.','2022/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1768280/Ozymandias_Bronze_Age_Empire_Sim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7125,'star_fetchers',NULL,'The introduction to a wild ride with gangsters and deep state conspiracy theories','2020/1/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1178030/Star_Fetchers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7126,'scanner_sombre',NULL,'Scanner Sombre is a 3d horror cave exploration game where darkness is your greatest foe. Illuminate the unseen with your LIDAR scanner, revealing the eerie beauty and peril of the abyss. From the creators of Prison Architect, this immersive adventure uses light and shadow for a haunting experience.','2017/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/475190/Scanner_Sombre/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7127,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_fortification_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1170010/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Fortification_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7128,'samorost_3',NULL,'Samorost 3 is an exploration adventure and puzzle game from the award-winning creators of Machinarium and Botanicula. Travel across space to nine unique worlds teeming with colorful challenges, creatures and surprises to discover, brought to life with beautiful artwork, sound and music.','2016/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/421120/Samorost_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7129,'beach_buggy_racing_2:_island_adventure',NULL,'BBR2: Island Adventure is a mayhem-filled kart-racer with an emphasis on split screen fun and game rule customization. Customize and save your own zany race rules for epic contests with up to 8 local players.','2021/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1230800/Beach_Buggy_Racing_2_Island_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7130,'crush_the_industry',NULL,'Work your way to the top of a cutthroat game studio in this retro roguelike deckbuilder! Crush the Industry features strategic combat with a unique twist and deep replayability.','2025/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1098610/Crush_the_Industry/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7131,'payday_2:_san_martín_bank_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1252200/PAYDAY_2_San_Martn_Bank_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7132,'saelig',NULL,'SÆLIG is a game that blends together elements of simulation, strategy, RPG, and business management. Centred around the life of you and your family, you must try to survive and bring wealth and prosperity to your household.','2017/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/612720/SAELIG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7133,'the_sims™_4_kids_room_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2016/6/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235763/The_Sims_4_Kids_Room_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7134,'deathwatchers',NULL,'Use the specialized equipment at your disposal to locate & log as many paranormal events as possible. Decipher the ingredients needed for your ritual and try to exorcise any demons within. Any incorrect ingredients and you may never leave! 1-4 Players','2024/7/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2599370/DeathWatchers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7135,'garden_simulator',NULL,'PLANT - DESIGN - HARVEST - With Garden Simulator you’ll get your own allotment, place deco elements and cultivate plants to harvest and sell them. Get ready for a beautiful time in nature. Always remember: A garden is a delight to the eye and a solace for the soul.','2022/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1403310/Garden_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7136,'the_complex:_expedition',NULL,'When an expedition with your team into the complex goes horribly wrong, you\'re left alone and lost, wandering the seemingly infinite maze of hallways, otherwise known as the Backrooms. Might there be something following you?','2023/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2172260/The_Complex_Expedition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7137,'lost_ember_-_vr_edition',NULL,'Explore the remains of a fallen world from fascinating perspectives! Slip into the role of different animals to uncover the fate of an ancient world. Dive into deep waters, fly at lofty heights, dig underground as a mole, climb steep cliffs with a mountain goat, and many more!','2022/7/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1880890/LOST_EMBER__VR_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7138,'the_sims™_4_everyday_clutter_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1932743/The_Sims_4_Everyday_Clutter_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7139,'chroma_squad',NULL,'Tactical RPG about 5 stunt actors who decide to quit their jobs and start their own Power Rangers-inspired TV show! Cast actors, upgrade your studio, craft Mechas of cardboard and duct tape. Once the cameras are rolling, control your cast of 5 colored-jumpsuit-clad warriors in turn-based battles.','2015/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/251130/Chroma_Squad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7140,'bunhouse',NULL,'Bunhouse is a cute, simple, bunny-filled game focused on growing plants and managing a greenhouse with fellow buns. Take care of your leafy plant buddies by balancing the amount of water and light they get. Play with friends and upgrade your greenhouse for wholesome, relaxing fun.','2021/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1617430/Bunhouse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7141,'fishing_planet:_dnipro_delta_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3351850/Fishing_Planet_Dnipro_Delta_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7142,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_map_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2022/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1726382/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Map_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7143,'rwby:_grimm_eclipse',NULL,'RWBY: GRIMM ECLIPSE is a 4 player, online co-op, hack and slash game based upon Rooster Teeth’s international hit series RWBY.','2016/7/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/418340/RWBY_Grimm_Eclipse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7144,'sd_gundam_battle_alliance',NULL,'SD Gundam Battle Alliance is a multiplayer Gundam action RPG where you can smash foes solo or with friends in thrilling mechanized combat. Acquire new mobile suits, power them up, and take them into battle in various missions!','2022/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/824550/SD_GUNDAM_BATTLE_ALLIANCE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7145,'war_thunder_-_mig-23ml_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game War Thunder on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2232230/War_Thunder__MiG23ML_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7146,'kingspray_graffiti_vr',NULL,'Hanging out with friends, bombing walls, and smashing bottles would be much more fun with out the jail time.','2016/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/471660/Kingspray_Graffiti_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7147,'monster_hunter_wilds_-_hunter_layered_armor_set:_cypurrpunk',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Hunter Wilds on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3289720/Monster_Hunter_Wilds__Hunter_Layered_Armor_Set_Cypurrpunk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7148,'you_suck_at_parking®_-_complete_edition',NULL,'You Suck at Parking® is the only racing game where your goal is to stop and parking your ride is more important than your driving skills. It’s a hot race against the clock as you drift, cruise, and go airborne over 250 frustratingly fun, wild levels.','2022/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/837880/You_Suck_at_Parking__Complete_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7149,'nitro_kid',NULL,'Synthwave roguelike deckbuilder set in the neon 80\'s. Pick your agent. Build your deck. Hit card combos and fight through the floors of INFINITY tower. Featuring 30+ fresh Synthwave tracks by LudoWic, Tonebox and Jules Reves.','2022/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1709050/Nitro_Kid/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7150,'rollscape',NULL,'Roll, strategize, and upgrade your way to victory in this accessible and ultra-satisfying, yet captivating roguelike. Will you reach the end before running out of rolls? KEEP MULTIPLYING!!','2024/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2904290/RollScape/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7151,'tacoma',NULL,'Tacoma is a sci-fi narrative adventure from the creators of Gone Home. Set aboard a high-tech space station in the year 2088, explore every detail of how the station’s crew lived and worked, finding the clues that add up to a gripping story of trust, fear, and resolve in the face of disaster.','2017/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/343860/Tacoma/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7152,'barbie_project_friendship™',NULL,'Join Barbie™ on a fun summer adventure to save the Malibu Waves Community Center! Help friends, unlock minigames and earn points for upgrades while you restore a beloved landmark.','2024/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2478330/Barbie_Project_Friendship/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7153,'gearcity',NULL,'Do you find tycoon games too simplistic? GearCity is a complex and in-depth business simulator. It focuses on a realistic economic simulation of the global automobile industry. The game takes several hours to grasp and hundreds of hours to master. Can you succeed where many other CEOs have failed?','2022/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/285110/GearCity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7154,'kukoro:_stream_chat_games',NULL,'Kukoro: Stream chat games is a collection of +20 games, from 2D shooters to tactical RPG mini-games, with a high engage for your Twitch community. You and your audience will be able to play with you in real time receiving the individual relevance they deserve, growing your channel day by day.','2024/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1166990/Kukoro_Stream_chat_games/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7155,'pixel_cup_soccer_-_ultimate_edition',NULL,'Pixel Cup Soccer is a retro-style arcade game. Play friendly matches, tournaments or create your team and lead it to glory in career mode! You can play it alone or with up to 8 friends, locally or through Steam remote, you can choose whether to play competitively, cooperatively, or even both!','2022/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1620540/Pixel_Cup_Soccer__Ultimate_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7156,'brothers_in_arms:_road_to_hill_30™',NULL,'Based on a true story. Set during the famous airdrop before the invasion at Normandy, where Sgt. Matt Baker and his squad of 101st Airborne Paratroopers were scattered over the French countryside.','2005/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/15190/Brothers_in_Arms_Road_to_Hill_30/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7157,'tricky_madness',NULL,'Tricky Madness is an upcoming arcade snowboarding game with a focus on speed and big air inspired by classics like SSX and 1080. Race down the mountain, explore secret areas, catch big air and perform Wicked tricks.','2024/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2743850/Tricky_Madness/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7158,'kindred_spirits_on_the_roof',NULL,'During lunch one day, Toomi Yuna meets two \"Kindred Spirits\" on the roof of her school. When they insist she help them nurture young love, Yuna finds herself playing \"yuri cupid\" to six unique and adorable couples. Can she remain aloof or will the promise of a \"yuritopia\" reach her too?','2016/2/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/402620/Kindred_Spirits_on_the_Roof/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7159,'star_fetchers_:_escape_from_pork_belly',NULL,'This content requires the base game Star Fetchers on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2869630/Star_Fetchers__Escape_from_Pork_Belly/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7160,'voidwrought',NULL,'Voidwrought is a 2D action-platformer set in a hand-drawn world of cosmic horrors. Explore the thawing ruins of the First Civilisation and strike down the gods that dwell there. Grow your powers, uncover ancient artifacts, and expand your shrine amid the wreckage.','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2014550/Voidwrought/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7161,'metal:_hellsinger_vr',NULL,'Slay to the beat as the award-winning score of Metal: Hellsinger VR thunders through your body. Experience the smash-hit rhythm FPS like never before and enter a state of unparallelled flow. Show the Hells the meaning of metal.','2024/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2878270/Metal_Hellsinger_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7162,'djmax_respect_v_-_muse_dash_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1958170/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__Muse_Dash_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7163,'payday_2:_jiu_feng_smuggler_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1555050/PAYDAY_2_Jiu_Feng_Smuggler_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7164,'age_of_empires_ii:_definitive_edition_–_barbarossa’s_barrel_of_pickled_goods_animated_icons',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2672820/Age_of_Empires_II_Definitive_Edition__Barbarossas_Barrel_of_Pickled_Goods_Animated_Icons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7165,'heroes_of_might_&_magic_v:_tribes_of_the_east',NULL,'For the first time, play as the Orc faction and recruit heroes, build armies and manage cities as you explore and conquer legendary lands. Use tactics, skills and magic to outsmart fantasy armies while developing your heroes and unveiling the dark plot that threatens to tear the world of Ashan apart.','2007/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/15370/Heroes_of_Might__Magic_V_Tribes_of_the_East/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7166,'everquest',NULL,'Welcome to EverQuest® - the online game that started it all! No other MMO matches EverQuest\'s sheer content, now with 29 expansions and countless updates. EverQuest is free-to-play.','2012/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/205710/EverQuest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_151'),(7167,'endoparasitic_2',NULL,'Three limbs ripped off, infected with a deadly parasite, you must survive. Drag yourself through the hallways of an infested arcship, fight off twisted eldritch creatures, craft vaccines and ammunition, and escape to civilization.','2024/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2990640/Endoparasitic_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_1