 balls to create synergies, earn extreme scores, and beat the casino.','2024/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2789810/Bingle_Bingle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7181,'chess_ultra',NULL,'Introducing Chess Ultra; the most breathtaking chess game ever made. Experience stunning 4K visuals, seamless online multiplayer, Grandmaster approved AI and full VR compatibility.','2017/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/518060/Chess_Ultra/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7182,'cribbish',NULL,'Shuffle chaos. Brew victory. A roguelike deckbuilder where relics, potions, and risky hands rule the table. An arcane twist on Cribbage where potions and relics supercharge your cards and the deck always has an attitude. Choose your build wisely, the cards show no mercy!','2025/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3422700/Cribbish/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7183,'moonlighter:_between_dimensions',NULL,'This content requires the base game Moonlighter on Steam in order to play.','2019/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1121580/Moonlighter_Between_Dimensions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7184,'icarus:_interior_decorations_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game ICARUS on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2445280/Icarus_Interior_Decorations_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7185,'jigsaw_puzzle_dreams',NULL,'Beautiful Multiplayer Jigsaw Puzzle game where you can design the room you play in!','2021/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1653970/Jigsaw_Puzzle_Dreams/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7186,'enigmatis_2:_the_mists_of_ravenwood',NULL,'Enter Ravenwood Park and discover the secrets hidden in the mists…','2013/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/284770/Enigmatis_2_The_Mists_of_Ravenwood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7187,'warhammer_40,000:_inquisitor_-_martyr_-_sororitas_class',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Inquisitor - Martyr on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2138210/Warhammer_40000_Inquisitor__Martyr__Sororitas_Class/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7188,'pure_rock_crawling',NULL,'Pure Rock Crawling is a physics based off-road simulator. Featuring soft body tires, suspension customization that affects your handling, true to life drivetrain simulation and visual addons. Explore a variety of trails in free roam with multiple challenges.','2024/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/824720/Pure_Rock_Crawling/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7189,'path_of_the_abyss',NULL,'Dive deep into the Abyss.','2025/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1768650/Path_of_the_Abyss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7190,'the_bibites:_digital_life',NULL,'Explore real digital life in The Bibites! Play god by guiding your bibites on their evolutionary journey or engineer your own. Analyze their Neural Network brains and genetic information as they adapt to their environments. Save your favorites and test their strength in Challenge Mode!','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2736860/The_Bibites_Digital_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7191,'vr_giants',NULL,'VR Giants is a local coop VR game in which one VR player and one gamepad player work together. The VR player controls a giant and must protect and support the tiny player who is controlled by the screen player. The tiny player can use the body of the giant as an extension of the level.','2023/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1124160/VR_Giants/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7192,'praetorians_-_hd_remaster',NULL,'Relive the celebrated real-time strategy classic Praetorians, re-imagined in high definition. Praetorians is set amidst the political machinations of an emerging Roman Empire.','2020/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1100420/Praetorians__HD_Remaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7193,'far_cry®_4_valley_of_the_yetis',NULL,'This content requires the base game Far Cry® 4 on Steam in order to play.','2015/4/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/324344/Far_Cry_4_Valley_of_the_Yetis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7194,'ecosystem',NULL,'Create virtual lifeforms whose development is shaped by a deep simulation of evolution. Guide them as they fight, mate, and adapt to the environment you have built. All the creatures in the trailer evolved on their own in the game!','2024/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1133120/Ecosystem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7195,'endless™_space_2_-_supremacy',NULL,'This content requires the base game ENDLESS™ Space 2 on Steam in order to play.','2018/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/806780/ENDLESS_Space_2__Supremacy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7196,'portal_knights_-_druids,_furfolk,_and_relic_defense',NULL,'This content requires the base game Portal Knights on Steam in order to play.','2020/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1176870/Portal_Knights__Druids_Furfolk_and_Relic_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7197,'vampire:_the_masquerade_—_parliament_of_knives',NULL,'Dominate undead politics through cunning and violence! Will a missing Prince give you the opening to betray your sire and seize power?','2021/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1266100/Vampire_The_Masquerade__Parliament_of_Knives/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7198,'hob',NULL,'Transform the world of Hob! A new action-adventure from Runic Games, the award-winning studio behind Torchlight I and II. It\'s your chance. Make it home.','2017/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/404680/Hob/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7199,'the_last_spell_-_dwarves_of_runenberg',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Last Spell on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2795980/The_Last_Spell__Dwarves_of_Runenberg/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7200,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_meridian_turncoat',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1887100/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Meridian_Turncoat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7201,'hidden_cats_in_rio_de_janeiro',NULL,'The Hidden Cats continue their world trip and have now arrived in RIO! So let\'s search for them again. A cozy and relaxing experience to enjoy with your friends and family! Start with a beautiful monochromatic scene, relax, and find all the cats to reveal the final colored art.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2780690/Hidden_Cats_in_Rio_de_Janeiro/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7202,'sandwalkers',NULL,'Sandwalkers is a roguelike turn-based exploration game. Build your team, traverse varied hostile environments, face countless dangers, and gain knowledge that will help you find and resurrect the Mother Tree Umama.','2025/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1639080/Sandwalkers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7203,'late_homework_|_遅れた宿題',NULL,'Highschool student Haneko has forgotten her class assignments and must retrieve them by traversing a world of haunted horrors. Explore the dilapidated halls, find your missing homework, and avoid whatever\'s lurking around the corner in this bite-sized, retro survival horror experience.','2024/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3215660/Late_Homework/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7204,'him,_the_smile_＆_bloom',NULL,'Refreshingly adult Otome, centered around a local flower shop, it is a mature exploration of relationships, and the highs and lows romance. With twelve endings to enjoy, it is sure to make both your heart melt and your pulse race.','2025/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3197720/Him_the_Smile__bloom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7205,'abalon:_roguelike_tactics_ccg',NULL,'Abalon is a roguelike adventure that fuses tactical turn-based combat and card strategy. Choose your summoner and explore a tabletop world to discover its secrets. Build the perfect deck, outsmart your enemies and become legend!','2023/5/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1681840/Abalon_Roguelike_Tactics_CCG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7206,'dragon_cliff',NULL,'Dragon Cliff is a Semi-Idle RPG game with deep and complex itemization/skill systems to support endless character builds. Players are to collect adventurers, kill monsters, advance talent trees, enchant/reforge equipment, discover scrolls and finally assemble the most powerful adventure team!','2018/5/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/758190/Dragon_Cliff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7207,'lightyear_frontier_-_pioneer\'s_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Lightyear Frontier on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2655090/Lightyear_Frontier__Pioneers_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7208,'gemcraft_-_chasing_shadows',NULL,'An epic, challenging tower defense game with an emphasis on strategy and replayability. Summon gems of immense magical potency and harness their unique abilities against a seemingly endless horde of monsters. The archdemon seeks to swallow the world, and you must journey to stand against her.','2015/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/296490/GemCraft__Chasing_Shadows/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7209,'slice_of_sea',NULL,'Slice of Sea is a peaceful adventure and puzzle game. You play as Seaweed, a sea creature clearly out of their element. Explore desolate world of dust, all hand-drawn on paper in unique art style. Collect items, solve puzzles and lead Seaweed back home to the sea.','2021/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/750290/Slice_of_Sea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7210,'grow_home',NULL,'Experience the freedom of unbounded climbing as you take control of BUD, a procedurally animated robot on a quest to save his planet. Create your own path through an alien world as you control and ride a giant plant on a vertical journey to the stars.','2015/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/323320/Grow_Home/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7211,'rake_in_-_scoring_big_with_monster_girls!',NULL,'For generations, a legend has been passed down about the mysterious Treasure Island. The island is home to a vast amount of gold... and it could be yours for the taking! Embark on a Monster Girl-catching escapade as you uncover secrets in a riveting search for riches!','2025/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3367190/RAKE_IN__Scoring_Big_With_Monster_Girls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7212,'hell_let_loose_-_pea_dot',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hell Let Loose on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2677820/Hell_Let_Loose__Pea_Dot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7213,'bomb_rush_cyberfunk_dlc_-_base_&_jay',NULL,'This content requires the base game Bomb Rush Cyberfunk on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2518220/Bomb_Rush_Cyberfunk_DLC__Base__Jay/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7214,'fallen_gf',NULL,'Shino has been the protagonist\'s childhood friend since they were kids. She is like a symbol of a man\'s \"preferences\"... A girl with such high specs that anyone would take a second glance if they passed her by. However, everyday life with her doesn\'t seem to be just peaceful.','2025/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2817390/FALLEN_GF/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7215,'lucy_dreaming',NULL,'Discover a dark family secret and rid a young girl of her nightmares in this splendidly British point & click comedy adventure. Playing as sharp-witted Lucy, explore both dreams and reality to meet all the colourful characters who\'ll help you solve puzzles, gather clues and find a murderer.','2022/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1532710/Lucy_Dreaming/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_152'),(7216,'train_simulator:_london_underground_s8_emu_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base ga