/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1782451/Warhammer_Vermintide_2__Warrior_Priest_Cosmetic_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7223,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator_-_thailand_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ultimate Fishing® Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2020/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1318290/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator__Thailand_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7224,'shantae_and_the_seven_sirens',NULL,'Shantae is back in an all-new tropical adventure! In her fifth outing, the Half-Genie hero gains new Fusion Magic abilities to explore a vast sunken city, makes new Half-Genie friends, and battles the Seven Sirens in her biggest, most thrilling quest yet!','2020/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1191630/Shantae_and_the_Seven_Sirens/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7225,'kitten_burst',NULL,'Kitten Burst is an Adventure/Racing Game about a Flying Cat set in the year 200X. Explore Sites on the Web, Race through Circuits, & Battle Bullet Hell Bosses to Save Cyberspace.','2024/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1592360/Kitten_Burst/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7226,'hell_let_loose_-_hot_drop',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hell Let Loose on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1793011/Hell_Let_Loose__Hot_Drop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7227,'might_&_magic:_clash_of_heroes_-_definitive_edition',NULL,'Plan your next move wisely, every additional combo can make the difference! Whether in solo or duo, online or offline, mix and match your units to defeat your enemies in this Definitive Edition of Might & Magic: Clash of Heroes!','2023/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2213300/Might__Magic_Clash_of_Heroes__Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7228,'daemonologie',NULL,'A short folk horror story about the Scottish witch trials. You play the role of a witch finder. Speak to the locals and sort their truths from their lies. On the last morning a witch must hang, best you know who by then.','2024/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3048140/Daemonologie/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7229,'the_king_of_fighters_xiv_steam_edition',NULL,'THE KING OF FIGHTERS XIV finally hits STEAM! KOF XIV is back with its classic 2D gameplay and \"3-on-3 TEAM BATTLE\" game system but evolved to 3D! 58 charismatic fighters are about to clash in this new chapter of KOF!','2017/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/571260/THE_KING_OF_FIGHTERS_XIV_STEAM_EDITION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7230,'ravenswatch_-_nightmares_skin_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ravenswatch on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3113120/Ravenswatch__Nightmares_Skin_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7231,'symphonia',NULL,'Awaken an expansive musical realm in this non-violent and poetic platformer. In Symphonia, you\'ll use the power of your violin coupled with your platforming skills to gather an orchestra to bring the musical machinery of the world back to life.','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1865960/Symphonia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7232,'silt',NULL,'Dive into a surreal ocean abyss in an atmospheric puzzle-adventure. Explore dangerous waters, possess sea creatures and solve environmental puzzles to discover what lies deep below the surface…','2022/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1325890/SILT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7233,'automobilista_2_-_adrenaline_pack_pt2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2518760/Automobilista_2__Adrenaline_Pack_Pt2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7234,'cursed_lands',NULL,'Defeat the evil lurking in Castle Of N\'Mar in this RPG/dating sim game. Recruit your team in any order you want, use the optional social talents to win the battles, play as male or female and fully customize your avatar. Five romance per gender, including the unique Naga Enok and Sylrissa!','2018/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/758320/Cursed_Lands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7235,'airmech',NULL,'AirMech® Strike is a fast paced Action-RTS game that can be played solo, coop, or competitively online. Earn Kudos and Experience in battle and unlock a wide collection of AirMechs and Units while you practice the perfect strategy to emerge victorious!','2018/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/206500/AirMech/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7236,'fae_tactics',NULL,'In Fae Tactics, follow a young magic user named Peony on her journey across a vibrant world full of mystery and danger. Summon allies, cast spells, and befriend a motley crew of characters as you dive into the growing conflicts between man and magical beings known as fae.','2020/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/995980/Fae_Tactics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7237,'sabbat_of_the_witch',NULL,'Hoshina Shuuji has a secret: He has a mysterious power that allows him to perceive the emotions of others. However, he is soon to find out that he is not the only one who has something he doesn\'t want others to find out about as Ayachi Nene, a classmate, likewise has a secret.','2018/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/888790/Sabbat_of_the_Witch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7238,'bloodstained:_curse_of_the_moon',NULL,'Battle with swords and whips in this retro-style action game brought to you by game creator Koji Igarashi and Inti Creates! Play as Zangetsu, a demon slayer bearing a deep grudge, who must travel through perilous lands to defeat a powerful demon lurking in a dark castle.','2018/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/838310/Bloodstained_Curse_of_the_Moon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7239,'accurc_2',NULL,'AccuRC is an RC simulator mainly for helicopters, but also drones, fixed wing and cars, including racing, FPV in Photo and 3D sceneries. Our focus lies on flight dynamics realism and accurate recreation of the way different models feel. Our users say AccuRC is the most realistic sim they ever used.','2017/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/495290/AccuRC_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7240,'wayfinder_-_critical_role_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wayfinder on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3230340/Wayfinder__Critical_Role_Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7241,'iron_brigade',NULL,'Join The Mobile Trench Brigade and protect humanity from the evil Monovision menace!','2012/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/115120/Iron_Brigade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7242,'american_truck_simulator_-_michelin_fan_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2675870/American_Truck_Simulator__Michelin_Fan_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7243,'snail_simulator',NULL,'Have you ever wanted to be a snail? Now you can be! Explore the vast Snearth with snail friends! Join monthly Snail Parties! MMOS (Massive Multiplayer Online Snails)! BECOME a snail (in a simulation)!','2023/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1500740/Snail_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7244,'elechead',NULL,'⚡＋🤖＋🧩','2021/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1456880/ElecHead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7245,'alchemist_shop_simulator',NULL,'Run your own magic business! In Alchemist Shop Simulator you can trade magical wares, brew potions and take on special orders, meet many quirky clients, grow your ingredients in your garden, restock your shelves and manage prices. Keep expanding your business as you gain experience and wealth!','2025/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3043310/Alchemist_Shop_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7246,'spirit_island_-_branch_&_claw',NU