sident_Evil_4_Leon__Ashley_Costumes_Casual/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7253,'kalimba',NULL,'Jump, switch and fly your way through mind-bending subterranean puzzles in this stunning new platforming adventure from the award-winning Press Play! ','2015/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/324140/Kalimba/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7254,'batman™:_arkham_origins_-_cold,_cold_heart',NULL,'This content requires the base game Batman™: Arkham Origins on Steam in order to play.','2014/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/277830/Batman_Arkham_Origins__Cold_Cold_Heart/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7255,'purple_place_-_classic_games',NULL,'Welcome to \"Purple Place - Classic Games\" a fun-filled game where you\'ll embark on three exciting adventures like good old times! Get ready to immerse yourself in the world of creativity and challenge.','2023/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1117090/Purple_Place__Classic_Games/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7256,'call_of_duty®:_modern_warfare®_ii_-_pumpkin_patch:_pro_pack',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2023/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2534810/Call_of_Duty_Modern_Warfare_II__Pumpkin_Patch_Pro_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7257,'library_of_ruina_-_artbook',NULL,'This content requires the base game Library Of Ruina on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1735680/Library_of_Ruina__ArtBook/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7258,'commando_collection',NULL,'A reboot of classic 2D side-scrolling shooters, featuring a new Survival Mode and Workshop system. Fight as a WWII Allied soldier across diverse battlefields with imaginative weapons. Survival Mode brings fresh enemies, epic bosses, and new challenges—relive childhood memories with a twist!','2024/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3059010/Commando_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7259,'outrider_mako',NULL,'Take on the role of Mako on her quest to seek out and subsequently deliver her, uh, deliverables in this top-down view 2D action game. Jump on top of your enemies and slime them with goo to stop them in their tracks! Get those deliverables delivered!','2025/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1072400/Outrider_Mako/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7260,'planet_coaster_-_world\'s_fair_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Planet Coaster on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/953660/Planet_Coaster__Worlds_Fair_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7261,'sizeable',NULL,'Sizeable is a relaxing and peacefull puzzle/exploration game! Shrink and grow your way through small dioramas in search of hidden objects!','2021/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1333910/Sizeable/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_153'),(7262,'homefront',NULL,'The Rock Map Pack is Now Available! Join the Resistance, stand united and fight for freedom against an overwhelming military force.','2011/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/55100/Homefront/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7263,'detective_girl_of_the_steam_city',NULL,'Play as Sophie, a private investigator not unlike Sherlock Holmes. It\'s up to Sophie to uncover the hidden truths of London through her investigations. What mysteries and intrigue await her? Find out in this steampunk RPG!','2019/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1012030/Detective_Girl_of_the_Steam_City/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7264,'zombotron',NULL,'Fight to survive on a mysterious alien planet, outwit its vicious inhabitants, and do whatever it takes to find a way off that wretched rock.','2019/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/664830/Zombotron/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7265,'the_sims™_4_romantic_garden_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2016/2/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235758/The_Sims_4_Romantic_Garden_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7266,'the_expanse:_a_telltale_series_-_archangel',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Expanse: A Telltale Series on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2632830/The_Expanse_A_Telltale_Series__Archangel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7267,'the_dishwasher:_vampire_smile',NULL,'The followup to 2009\'s Dead Samurai, The Dishwasher: Vampire Smile is a combo-fueled, fast-paced, stylistic 2D action platformer that features the series\' staple gritty, graphic novel-inspired art style, built on a new engine that allows for an even more visually gruesome experience.','2017/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/268990/The_Dishwasher_Vampire_Smile/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7268,'hunt:_showdown_1896_–_the_penitent',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2100450/Hunt_Showdown_1896__The_Penitent/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7269,'moral_dilemma:_the_interview_-_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Moral Dilemma: The Interview on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3387780/Moral_Dilemma_The_Interview__DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7270,'chaos_code_-new_sign_of_catastrophe-',NULL,'Simple yet highly flexible hi-speed 2D Fighting game! Enjoy the thrill of fighting with all the flashy moves!','2017/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/536560/CHAOS_CODE_NEW_SIGN_OF_CATASTROPHE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7271,'​our_life:_beginnings_&_always_-_cove_wedding_story',NULL,'This content requires the base game Our Life: Beginnings & Always on Steam in order to play.','2022/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1854710/Our_Life_Beginnings__Always__Cove_Wedding_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7272,'shenmue_iii',NULL,'Shenmue III sees the eagerly anticipated continuation of the epic story-driven saga. Take control of Ryo Hazuki, a teenage martial artist, determined to unravel the mystery behind his father\'s murder and to exact revenge on the killer.','2020/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/878670/Shenmue_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7273,'banana',NULL,'Banana is a clicker Game, in which you click a Banana! In Banana you click the Banana to gain even more Bananas! Every 3 hours, you get dropped a banana. Each banana is also made by the community in discord. Come hang out with us and let\'s grow into something awesome !','2024/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2923300/Banana/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7274,'touhou_mystia\'s_izakaya_dlc5_pack_-_makai_&_lunar_capital',NULL,'This content requires the base game Touhou Mystia\'s Izakaya on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2399331/Touhou_Mystias_Izakaya_DLC5_Pack__Makai__Lunar_Capital/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7275,'fae_farm:_coasts_of_croakia',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fae Farm on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2673180/Fae_Farm_Coasts_of_Croakia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7276,'selfloss',NULL,'Selfloss is an emotional exploration game filled with rich lore, set in a whale-worshipping, Slavic-inspired world. Embark on the journey of the healer, Kazimir, and his magical staff as he fights a mysterious Miasma in search of a ritual to cure his wounded soul.','2024/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1086620/Selfloss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7277,'commandos_2_-_hd_remaster',NULL,'Relive the real-time tactics masterpiece that defined the genre like no other: Commandos 2 - HD Remaster is a true homage to one of gaming’s most celebrated masterpieces.','2020/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1100410/Commandos_2__HD_Remaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7278,'gloamvault',NULL,'\"90s Black Metal Monster Collector!\" In Gloamvault, you can charm any monster you encounter and add it to your party. Create a party with up to five minions and descend into the depths of the dungeon. Fuse any two monsters together to create stronger ones. Good luck surviving...','2025/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3460840/Gloamvault/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7279,'ara_fell:_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Take in the beauty of a magical world floating above the clouds, then take on a menacing race of vampires hidden in the dark. Ara Fell combines the best parts of Japanese-style roleplaying games with the best parts of western RPGs. The new Enhanced Edition features a slew of new features!','2016/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/440540/Ara_Fell_Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7280,'bloody_knuckles_street_boxing',NULL,'The Sweet Science Meets The STREETS!','2024/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2613950/Bloody_Knuckles_Street_Boxing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7281,'mordheim:_city_of_the_damned_-_witch_hunters',NULL,'This content requires the base game Mordheim: City of the Damned on Steam in order to play.','2016/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/450812/Mordheim_City_of_the_Damned__Witch_Hunters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7282,'paper_perjury',NULL,'It all started with a simple robbery. When that thread was pulled, a tapestry of mysteries was revealed. Solve cases and outsmart criminals in a detective story full of lies, confessions, and maybe even a murder or two.','2024/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1919600/Paper_Perjury/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7283,'clickolding',NULL,'The man in the corner of your hotel room wants you to click something. He wants to watch you click it.','2024/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3011440/CLICKOLDING/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7284,'killdozer',NULL,'Take command of your custom-built beast in KILLDOZER. Unleash instinctive combat in a fully destructible world where chaos reigns. Plan your assault, obliterate every obstacle, and shatter the limits of mayhem. Get. Your. Revenge.','2025/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3417500/KILLDOZER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7285,'disney_villains_cursed_café',NULL,'Stir up a fresh take on iconic Disney Villains in this rich visual novel.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2439220/Disney_Villains_Cursed_Caf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7286,'september_7th',NULL,'\"September 7th\" is a short horror game released for Christmas. The plot of the game is simple to the point of banality, and the gameplay is not delayed.The game also contains some Easter eggs and mentions. The game takes place in 2009.','2023/1/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2249160/September_7th/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7287,'sol-rui_-after_mini-',NULL,'Rui can\'t catch a break... She had only just returned to her world after saving Roots, thanks to the power of Sol, but now monsters are attacking her town and kidnapping people! However, the challenge awaiting her is very different this time. It\'s all smoke, mirrors and illusions...','2025/1/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3226850/SolRui_after_mini/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7288,'x-com:_terror_from_the_deep',NULL,'The war continues... X-COM: UFO Defense brought you to a galactic battlefield. X-COM: Terror from the Deep brings the alien terror into a totally new dimension.Seeking to take advantage of a weakened Earth, X-COM\'s deep space foes unexpectedly change strategy and launch a powerful second front against planet Earth.','1995/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/7650/XCOM_Terror_From_the_Deep/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7289,'thief_simulator_vr',NULL,'Become a thief in VR! Feel the thrill of stealing in free roam sandbox neighborhoods. Use lockpicks and hi-tech hacking tools. Observe your target, gather information and hide from police. Or drive a car like crazy to get out of trouble!','2020/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1019550/Thief_Simulator_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7290,'detective_grimoire',NULL,'Detective Grimoire has been called to investigate a murder. The owner of a small tourist attraction, seemingly killed by the mythical creature his attraction is based around... Explore the area, inspect the crime scene, grill suspects, solve puzzles, hunt for clues & uncover the secret of the swamp!','2014/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/272600/Detective_Grimoire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7291,'lego®_brawls',NULL,'Dream up the ultimate Minifigure brawlers and bash your way through all of your favorite LEGO® themes in the first team action brawler set in the LEGO universe. Play with friends at home or around the world and see how you stack up against the competition.','2022/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1731460/LEGO_Brawls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7292,'linkito',NULL,'Unleash your brainpower in Linkito and ignite the insurgency! Link, build, solve, defuse, and decode by using your logic. Craft your own challenges in the level editor or tackle community creations.','2024/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2312770/Linkito/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7293,'anno_1503_history_edition',NULL,'Experience the classic gameplay of 1503 A.D.: The New World, optimized for current computers with resolutions up to 4K.','2024/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2820110/Anno_1503_History_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7294,'gremlins,_inc.',NULL,'This is an intense strategy board game in a steampunk world of corrupt capitalist gremlins who compete for money, political power and prestige. Save and invest, steal and extort, arrest and get arrested – in single-player and multiplayer, with ranks and ladders, team mode and spectator mode.','2016/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/369990/Gremlins_Inc/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7295,'cyber_shadow',NULL,'The world has been taken over by synthetic lifeforms. A desperate plea for help sets Shadow, the sole survivor of his clan, on one last mission to uncover what started the path to perpetual ruin.','2021/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/861250/Cyber_Shadow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7296,'haven_park',NULL,'Be Flint, who is doing his best to keep his grandma\'s park up and running and make it a place for the campers to enjoy. Learn the camper\'s wishes and build whatever their hearts desire to attract even more quirky characters and look forward to whimsical conversations and quests.','2021/8/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1549550/Haven_Park/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7297,'sniper_elite_5:_p.1938_suppressed_pistol',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sniper Elite 5 on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1872751/Sniper_Elite_5_P1938_Suppressed_Pistol/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7298,'metal_gear_survive',NULL,'METAL GEAR SURVIVE builds upon MGSV’s stealth action gameplay with elements of exploration and survival creating a bold new experience. *An internet connection is required to play the game.','2018/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/543900/METAL_GEAR_SURVIVE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7299,'sheep',NULL,'In this Lemmings-inspired game, your goal is to herd sheep across 28 hazard-filled levels so they can be rescued by their educated alien cousins. You herd four breeds of sheep and have to protect them from the evil mr. Pear.','2025/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1644750/Sheep/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7300,'boneraiser_minions',NULL,'Amass an army of undead to fight endless waves of heroes intent to end your boneraising ways! In this gothic auto-battler rogue-lite Survivor-like, use the bones of slain heroes to raise your minions, collect relics and spells, and unlock meta upgrades, all to survive King Gigald\'s crusade!','2023/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1944570/Boneraiser_Minions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7301,'castlevania:_lords_of_shadow_–_mirror_of_fate_hd',NULL,'This sequel to Castlevania: Lords of Shadow reveals the story of the Belmonts as they battle destiny across generations to discover their true fate. Trevor Belmont, knight of the Brotherhood of Light, embarks on an epic quest to avenge his mother who was killed by his father Gabriel.','2014/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/282530/Castlevania_Lords_of_Shadow__Mirror_of_Fate_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7302,'ricochet',NULL,'A futuristic action game that challenges your agility as well as your aim, Ricochet features one-on-one and team matches played in a variety of futuristic battle arenas.','2000/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/60/Ricochet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7303,'call_of_the_wild:_the_angler™_-_spain_reserve',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of the Wild: The Angler™ on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2288430/Call_of_the_Wild_The_Angler__Spain_Reserve/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7304,'fuga:_melodies_of_steel_2',NULL,'The sequel to the captivating tale of Fuga: Melodies of Steel has arrived! This turn-based RPG is back with a ramped up battle system for more strategy, as well as a brand new event system that gives you more thrilling choices to affect your experience!','2023/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2001340/Fuga_Melodies_of_Steel_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7305,'inbento',NULL,'A cooking puzzle game about arranging beautiful bento lunches! Solve 120+ recipes, play with food, think inside the box and enjoy a heartwarming story in this culinary brain-teaser!','2019/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1567440/inbento/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7306,'the_sims™_4_riviera_retreat_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2782860/The_Sims_4_Riviera_Retreat_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7307,'my_friend_peppa_pig',NULL,'Start a fun-filled adventure with Peppa Pig. Create your style, meet favorite characters, and play in Peppa’s world. It’s just like being in the TV show!','2021/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1635590/My_Friend_Peppa_Pig/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7308,'cataclysm:_dark_days_ahead',NULL,'The epitome of a modern traditional roguelike: with turn-based play and a RPG-like skill progression system, it hearkens back to some of the major aspects of this genre. This game has an incredible depth, with a deep inventory system, vehicles and boats, NPCs with their own stories, and more.','2023/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2330750/Cataclysm_Dark_Days_Ahead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7309,'neckbreak',NULL,'An overdose of reality can have dire consequences... Tumble down the rabbit hole and embrace your downfall with 12 endings, non linear day by day progression, sanity system and more...','2022/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/992730/Neckbreak/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7310,'vividlope',NULL,'Rapid gravity arcade action! Dash! Spin! Slam! Paint!','2023/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2078510/VIVIDLOPE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_154'),(7311,'the_devourer:_hunted_souls',NULL,'Play as a paranormal investigator in our hybrid between first person survival and psychological horror story game. Investigate a haunted forest with up to 5 players CO-OP, try to lift the curse, experience a tragic story and take decisions together. Will you survive or will you lose your soul?','2023/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2309400/The_Devourer_Hunted_Souls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7312,'dawnsbury_days_-_the_profane_barrier',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dawnsbury Days on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2980090/Dawnsbury_Days__The_Profane_Barrier/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7313,'doctor_who:_the_edge_of_reality',NULL,'Experience an unforgettable adventure in space and time. Explore new worlds, face Daleks, Cybermen and Weeping Angels and join two Doctors on an epic quest to save the universe from an unstoppable new threat in this first-person narrative adventure.','2021/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1444920/Doctor_Who_The_Edge_of_Reality/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7314,'home_design_3d',NULL,'Home Design 3D is the reference interior design and home decor application, allowing you to draw, create and visualize your floor plans and home ideas.Design your dream projects simply and easily, in 2D and/or 3D. Get a good idea of your next home or simply have fun!','2015/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/420000/Home_Design_3D/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7315,'cracking_the_cryptic',NULL,'Curated Sudoku puzzles from YouTube\'s most popular Sudoku channel, Cracking the Cryptic!','2022/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2085970/Cracking_the_Cryptic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7316,'deduce_together',NULL,'Players throw questions at an AI and deduce the correct answers in this competitive multiplayer game. Compete based on your accuracy rate. Have fun with friends while testing your deductive skills and aim to become the ultimate knowledge champion!','2024/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3023190/Deduce_Together/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7317,'bomber_crew:_usaaf',NULL,'This content requires the base game Bomber Crew on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/756071/Bomber_Crew_USAAF/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7318,'payday_2:_lost_in_transit_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2074240/PAYDAY_2_Lost_in_Transit_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7319,'business_tour_-_board_game_with_online_multiplayer',NULL,'\"Business Tour\" is a free to play multiplayer tabletop game. Build your monopoly with friends. Complete daily tasks, compete against the other players and receive trade items rewards!','2017/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/397900/Business_Tour__Board_Game_with_Online_Multiplayer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7320,'river_city_girls',NULL,'There\'s trouble once again in River City, and this time only the girls can save the day! Using a variety of attacks, weapons, and items, these hot-blooded heroines are ready to teach the city’s lowlifes a lesson - either solo or in 2-player co-op! It’s an old-school rumble for a new generation!','2019/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1049320/River_City_Girls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7321,'foundation_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Foundation, but does not include the base game.','2019/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1015460/Foundation_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7322,'celeste_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Celeste, but does not include the base game.','2019/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1092840/Celeste_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7323,'il-2_sturmovik:_1946',NULL,'Il-2 1946 includes all of the original IL-2 series content: IL-2 Sturmovik™: Forgotten Battles, Ace Expansion Pack, Pacific Fighters™ and alternate histry campaigns of year 1946. What was years ago began as a one-aircraft study sim is now an astonishing anthology, with a whopping 229 flyable aircraft and over 300 aircraft total!','2006/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/15320/IL2_Sturmovik_1946/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7324,'flashing_lights:_emergency_response_lightbar_collection',NULL,'This content requires the base game Flashing Lights - Police, Firefighting, Emergency Services (EMS) Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2649420/Flashing_Lights_Emergency_Response_Lightbar_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7325,'resident_evil_2_-_claire_costume:_elza_walker',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/920564/Resident_Evil_2__Claire_Costume_Elza_Walker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7326,'ikonei_island:_an_earthlock_adventure',NULL,'Ikonei Island is yours to discover! Explore and gather resources. Farm the land, craft tools and gear, and build your base or a cozy home. Befriend magical creatures and fight monsters with your friends or solo!','2023/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1550730/Ikonei_Island_An_Earthlock_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7327,'store_wars:_multiplayer_shop_simulator',NULL,'Play solo or with up to 16 friends in a chaotic grocery store showdown! Manage, grow, and compete against rival stores in a fun, lighthearted battle of wits and strategy. Who will be the ultimate grocery tycoon? Sabotage, upgrade, and outwit your friends in this unpredictable simulator!','2024/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3213600/Store_Wars_Multiplayer_Shop_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7328,'zombie_cure_lab',NULL,'In a world overrun by the undead, build a lab to fight back with science. Manage survivors, gather vital resources, and turn zombies into allies. Defend your base and research the cure to reclaim humanity.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1620290/Zombie_Cure_Lab/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7329,'merge_adventure:_magic_dragons',NULL,'Merge dragons and magic to solve hard puzzles by playing merge games','2023/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2495050/Merge_Adventure_Magic_Dragons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7330,'the_sims™_3_outdoor_living_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2011/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/47897/The_Sims_3_Outdoor_Living_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7331,'gloamvault',NULL,'\"90s Black Metal Monster Collector!\" In Gloamvault, you can charm any monster you encounter and add it to your party. Create a party with up to five minions and descend into the depths of the dungeon. Fuse any two monsters together to create stronger ones. Good luck surviving...','2025/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3460840/Gloamvault/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7332,'super_motherload',NULL,'Set on Mars in an alternate Cold-War era, Super Motherload is a 1 to 4-player couch co-op digging adventure with storyline by Image Comics\' Kurtis Wiebe, a fully voiced cast of Soviet and American characters, and a procedurally-generated world that changes each time you play.','2013/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/269110/Super_Motherload/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7333,'zombotron',NULL,'Fight to survive on a mysterious alien planet, outwit its vicious inhabitants, and do whatever it takes to find a way off that wretched rock.','2019/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/664830/Zombotron/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7334,'monster_camp_character_pack_-_colorful_campers',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Prom 2: Monster Camp on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2299810/Monster_Camp_Character_Pack__Colorful_Campers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7335,'desperate_place',NULL,'Desperate Place is a strategic tower defense game where you play as a crew member who wakes up early on a damaged colonization starship. Stranded on an unknown planet, you must gather resources, repair the ship, and defend against alien monsters to survive and escape.','2025/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3058140/Desperate_Place/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7336,'old_world_-_the_sacred_and_the_profane',NULL,'This content requires the base game Old World on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2261870/Old_World__The_Sacred_and_The_Profane/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7337,'retrowave',NULL,'Neon lights, palm trees, synthwave, \'80s supercars speeding down an endless highway... Welcome to the world of Retrowave!','2022/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1239690/Retrowave/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7338,'twin_mirror',NULL,'The small town of Basswood will be changed forever by ex-investigative journalist Sam Higgs in this thrilling narrative experience from award-winning studio DON\'T NOD. Will you find the truth – no matter the cost?','2021/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1552810/Twin_Mirror/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7339,'shakedown:_hawaii',NULL,'Build a \"legitimate\" corporation via open world missions, shakedowns, sabotage and property acquisition.','2020/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/598730/Shakedown_Hawaii/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7340,'world_war_z:_pre-apocalypse_character_skins_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game World War Z on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2614660/World_War_Z_PreApocalypse_Character_Skins_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7341,'whitewater_vr:_extreme_kayaking_adventure',NULL,'Get ready to paddle through some of the world\'s wildest, and most challenging rapids in breathtaking VR. With stunning graphics, realistic physics, and heart-pumping action, you\'ll race against the clock as you navigate through wild waters filled with obstacles and surprises.','2024/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2360340/Whitewater_VR_Extreme_Kayaking_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7342,'soulstice',NULL,'Explore a dark world brimming with hidden mysteries, master a diverse combat system, and inhabit the dual forces of two sisters in a coming-of-age dark fantasy story with fast-paced action, vicious enemies, and spectacular boss fights.','2022/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1602080/Soulstice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7343,'titan_souls',NULL,'Between our world and the world beyond lie the Titan Souls, the spiritual source of all living things. Scattered amongst the ruins and guarded by the idle titans charged with their care, a solitary hero armed with a single arrow is assembling shards of the Titan Soul in a quest for truth and power.','2015/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/297130/Titan_Souls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7344,'team_sonic_racing™',NULL,'Team Sonic Racing combines the best elements of arcade and fast-paced competitive style racing as you face-off with friends in intense multiplayer racing.','2019/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/785260/Team_Sonic_Racing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7345,'the_sims™_3_master_suite_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2012/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/47931/The_Sims_3_Master_Suite_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7346,'tower_of_time',NULL,'A new kind of RPG awaits you. A story-rich dungeon crawler with innovative real-time combat that lets you pause or slow time. Tactical thinking is essential to succeed. Now with RPGlite and Permadeath for fast-paced game.','2018/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/617480/Tower_of_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7347,'shady_part_of_me',NULL,'Overcome emotional struggles across a touching narrative filled with twists and surprises. Embark on a dream-like journey, with breathtaking artistic direction and the enthralling voice of Hannah Murray (Game of Thrones, Skins).','2020/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1116580/Shady_Part_of_Me/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7348,'doom_vfr',NULL,'DOOM® VFR brings the fast-paced, brutal gameplay fans of the series love to virtual reality. Play as a cybernetic survivor who is activated by the UAC to fight the demon invasion, maintain order, and prevent catastrophic failure at the Mars facility.','2017/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/650000/DOOM_VFR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7349,'aimbeast',NULL,'The ultimate training and warmup solution for FPS/TPS players: Aimbeast combines human-like AI and lot of useful scenarios to make you better at all types of shooters in a fast and efficient way. Are you ready to become an Aimbeast?','2020/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1100990/Aimbeast/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7350,'閃攻機人アスラ_-_asura_the_striker_-',NULL,'A fast-paced 3D shooting action game packed with love for classic arcade hits of the \'80s and \'90s. Control ASURA, a humanoid combat weapon, and unleash shots, charged punches, and slow-motion powers to wipe out waves of alien invaders. Pure arcade intensity!','2025/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2389830/__ASURA_THE_STRIKER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7351,'dark_souls™_iii_-_ashes_of_ariandel™',NULL,'This content requires the base game DARK SOULS™ III on Steam in order to play.','2016/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/506970/DARK_SOULS_III__Ashes_of_Ariandel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7352,'bassmaster®_fishing',NULL,'Bassmaster® Fishing, the official video game is OUT NOW, bringing the thrill of competitive big bass fishing to PC. Dive into the fully licensed content from the Bassmaster series from amateur to elite events.','2021/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1449500/Bassmaster_Fishing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7353,'eastward_-_octopia',NULL,'This content requires the base game Eastward on Steam in order to play.','2024/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2305370/Eastward__Octopia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7354,'blockbuster_inc.',NULL,'Ever dreamed of making your own movies? Build up your own movie studio, scout for upcoming stars, and produce cutting-edge films and TV shows. Try to stay ahead of your competition throughout the history of cinematography.','2024/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1793090/Blockbuster_Inc/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7355,'monster_hunter_wilds_-_alma_outfit:_new_world_commission',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Hunter Wilds on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3117520/Monster_Hunter_Wilds__Alma_Outfit_New_World_Commission/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7356,'doomicorn_master_collection_cosmetic_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DOOM Eternal on Steam in order to play.','2021/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1460021/DOOMicorn_Master_Collection_Cosmetic_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_155'),(7357,'children_of_silentown',NULL,'Children of Silentown is a dark adventure game that tells the story of Lucy, a girl growing up in a village deep in a forest inhabited by monsters. People disappearing is nothing uncommon here, but this time, Lucy is old enough to investigate on her own. Or so she thinks.','2023/1/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1108000/Children_of_Silentown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7358,'hidden_through_time_2:_myths_&_magic',NULL,'Join Clicky on a new, enchanted adventure in Hidden Through Time 2: Myths & Magic! Search for hidden objects scattered around hand-drawn worlds, and unlock more as you go. With both a single player campaign and an online mode where you can create your own dreamworld, the adventure never ends!','2023/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2304640/Hidden_Through_Time_2_Myths__Magic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7359,'drainus',NULL,'This is a side-scrolling shooting game in which you take control of the \"Drainus\", the Kharlal Empire\'s most cutting-edge fighter with the ability to absorb energy bullets, and take down the enemy ships zipping through space.','2022/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1975360/DRAINUS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7360,'naruto_shippuden:_ultimate_ninja_storm_4_-_shikamaru\'s_tale_extra_scenario_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game NARUTO SHIPPUDEN: Ultimate Ninja STORM 4 on Steam in order to play.','2016/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/416420/NARUTO_SHIPPUDEN_Ultimate_Ninja_STORM_4__Shikamarus_Tale_Extra_Scenario_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7361,'once_upon_a_mind_-_a_little_too_friendly',NULL,'A story-rich psychological horror inspired by real-life experiences. Follow Emily, 23, as she moves to Brooklyn for a fresh start, but finds herself drawn into a slow spiral of obsession and control. Featuring voice acting, this atmospheric and grounded experience is deeply unsettling.','2025/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3690750/Once_Upon_A_Mind__A_Little_Too_Friendly/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7362,'bounty:_drag_racing',NULL,'Bounty: Drag Racing is the most complete online drag racing experience on the market. Race the fastest and most varied types of dragsters in the world. Customize and fine tune your cars to achieve maximum performance and hop online for the closest type of racing!','2024/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1803390/Bounty_Drag_Racing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7363,'remnant_records',NULL,'Remnant Records is a horror investigation game for 1 to 4 players. Explore places haunted by the dead, survive elaborate and unique ghosts and find out what happened to them through thousands of generated stories.','2024/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1916310/Remnant_Records/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7364,'royal_revolt_ii',NULL,'Royal Revolt 2 is an asynchronous PvP Reverse Tower Defense game full of medieval magic and action-laden battles.Can you set up your defenses so other Kings and Queens can\'t crash your castle gates? We\'re throwing down the gauntlet. Will you pick it up?','2021/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1571190/Royal_Revolt_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7365,'infinite_tournament_paintball',NULL,'Infinite is a modern era paintball game that aims to capture the real world aspects of tournament style paintball. Featuring X-Ball format of up to 10V10, Online and Offline Play, markers set to 10.5 ramping, slide or dive into your bunker and engage in competitive matches','2020/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1341160/Infinite_Tournament_Paintball/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7366,'time_break_chronicles',NULL,'Time Break Chronicles is a fusion of classic JRPGs and modern Roguelites, with a cast of 100 playable classes to find and unlock. Build your team, customize their abilities, and venture into a procedurally generated adventure through space-time and beyond!','2020/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1393500/Time_Break_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7367,'tangledeep',NULL,'Enter the magical world of Tangledeep, a beautifully polished dungeon crawler inspired by classic 16-bit RPGs! Colorful characters, a unique job system, tons of skills, items, and diverse environments with deep, turn-based roguelike gameplay. A different adventure every time you play!','2018/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/628770/Tangledeep/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7368,'automobilista_2_-_adrenaline_pack_pt2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2518760/Automobilista_2__Adrenaline_Pack_Pt2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7369,'loot_river',NULL,'Explore procedurally generated labyrinths in this challenging, narrative-rich roguelike. Master deep combat. Slide blocks of ancient ruins. Defeat bestial abominations. Loot, level up, strategize, fight, die and wake up anew. Unlock the secrets of the Loot River. Immortality is a bittersweet gift.','2022/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1494260/Loot_River/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7370,'deathmatch_classic',NULL,'Enjoy fast-paced multiplayer gaming with Deathmatch Classic (a.k.a. DMC). Valve\'s tribute to the work of id software, DMC invites players to grab their rocket launchers and put their reflexes to the test in a collection of futuristic settings.','2001/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/40/Deathmatch_Classic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7371,'astra:_knights_of_veda',NULL,'ASTRA: Knights of Veda is a visually stunning, story-rich, 2D RPG. A dark plague besets the world of Planis, perptrated through a dark ritual performed by the Mad King. You, and the other Knights of Veda, are the only ones who can bring normality back to the world.','2024/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2484250/ASTRA_Knights_of_Veda/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7372,'neon_ascending',NULL,'Grid management roguelike tower defense that emphasizes mechanics and features dazzling visual effects. Don\'t overthink it, just stack and play! Enhancement modules boost your attributes, affix modules change the mechanics, and more... all within the grid. Time to create a new and improved build!','2025/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2202010/Neon_Ascending/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7373,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator_-_kariba_dam_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ultimate Fishing® Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2019/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/994210/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator__Kariba_Dam_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7374,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_africa_in_miniature',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2148900/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Africa_in_Miniature/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7375,'cliff_empire',NULL,'After a nuclear war life on the surface became impossible. A 300m thick radioactive fog covered the Earth. We are looking for bold active people to manage the process of restoring life on Earth. Join!','2019/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/809140/Cliff_Empire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7376,'marc_eckō\'s_getting_up:_contents_under_pressure',NULL,'Play as Trane, a \"toy\" graffiti artist with the street smarts, athletic prowess and vision to become an \"All City King\" - the most reputable of all graffiti artists. Along your quest, uncover the mayor\'s deep, dark secret and use your fighting talents and high-wire graffiti to expose the city\'s leader as a corrupt...','2006/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/260190/Marc_Ecks_Getting_Up_Contents_Under_Pressure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7377,'while_we_wait_here',NULL,'Share thoughts and hot food with your last ever clients, as you wait for the world to end.','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2213120/While_We_Wait_Here/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7378,'blush_blush_-_kitsune_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Blush Blush on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2587610/Blush_Blush__Kitsune_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7379,'west_of_loathing:_reckonin\'_at_gun_manor',NULL,'This content requires the base game West of Loathing on Steam in order to play.','2019/2/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/954060/West_of_Loathing_Reckonin_at_Gun_Manor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7380,'omsi_2_add-on_digibus_mirage',NULL,'This content requires the base game OMSI 2: Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2239220/OMSI_2_Addon_Digibus_Mirage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7381,'endless™_space_2_-_awakening',NULL,'This content requires the base game ENDLESS™ Space 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1128540/ENDLESS_Space_2__Awakening/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7382,'automobilista_2_-_monza_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1648060/Automobilista_2__Monza_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7383,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_weapon_pack_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2019/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1108410/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Weapon_Pack_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7384,'the_shell_part_i:_inferno',NULL,'Unravel a string of gruesome murders terrorizing Tokyo in this mystery-thriller visual novel. The secrets of a case from six years prior may just be the key to the current unending cycle of tragedy—and the thing that cracks this woeful world’s shell may be one girl’s smile.','2023/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2258770/The_Shell_Part_I_Inferno/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7385,'iratus:_wrath_of_the_necromancer',NULL,'This content requires the base game Iratus: Lord of the Dead on Steam in order to play.','2020/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1293280/Iratus_Wrath_of_the_Necromancer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7386,'earn_to_die_2',NULL,'Earn to Die 2 is a 2D side-scrolling driving and upgrade game where you steer vehicles through a zombie apocalypse, literally smashing through zombie hordes along the way. Throughout the game you will unlock new vehicles, upgrading them into the ultimate zombie-smashing machines!','2016/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/431590/Earn_to_Die_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7387,'chrono_ark_-_summer_twilight',NULL,'This content requires the base game Chrono Ark on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2780000/Chrono_Ark__Summer_Twilight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7388,'blackwell_epiphany',NULL,'The last game in the Blackwell series.','2014/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/236930/Blackwell_Epiphany/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7389,'checkout:_cashier_simulator',NULL,'Step into the shoes of a supermarket cashier in this cute point-and-click game. Scan and bag over 300 unique products to earn as many points as you can before your shift ends! Between shifts, unwind by getting to know a cast of quirky coworkers.','2025/1/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2969140/Checkout_Cashier_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7390,'big_farm_story',NULL,'Build your dream farm with your friends & animals in Big Farm Story. Grow crops, tend your fields, craft and explore the world in this farming adventure. Meet new friends around each corner, shape your own community and have fun writing your own story.','2021/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1329510/Big_Farm_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7391,'summer~life_in_the_countryside~_+outing',NULL,'This content requires the base game Summer~Life in the Countryside~ on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2107850/SummerLife_in_the_Countryside_Outing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7392,'atc_ground_point',NULL,'Control the ground movement of airplanes at various airports. As the air traffic controller, ensure the airplanes move safely and get to the stand or runway on time.','2024/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3239550/ATC_Ground_Point/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7393,'starship_evo',NULL,'Create the Starship of your dreams, explore the vast expanse of the galaxy, land on planets and jump into epic space battles. Experience a truly unique and powerful building engine where your imagination is the limit. Welcome to the next evolution in Space Sandbox gaming!','2020/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/711980/Starship_EVO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7394,'research_story',NULL,'Set out to discover and record plants and creatures for the Violet Archive. Grow crops, tame animals, and build the perfect farm! Forge friendships along the way as you begin your life as a researcher!','2023/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1629830/Research_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7395,'heavenly_bodies_-_cleanup_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Heavenly Bodies on Steam in order to play.','2023/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2391340/Heavenly_Bodies__Cleanup_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7396,'break_siege',NULL,'Break Siege is a train-themed deck-building rougelike game in which you constantly construct your own deck and breakthrough forces of the Imperial in intense, real-time battles.','2025/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3234700/Break_Siege/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7397,'streets_of_rogue_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Streets of Rogue on Steam in order to play.','2020/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1285810/Streets_of_Rogue_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7398,'resident_evil_4_leon_&_ashley_costumes:_\'romantic\'',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2109304/Resident_Evil_4_Leon__Ashley_Costumes_Romantic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7399,'megaquarium:_architect\'s_collection',NULL,'This content requires the base game Megaquarium on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1339440/Megaquarium_Architects_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7400,'the_magical_mixture_mill',NULL,'Gather exotic ingredients, brew complex mixtures, and expand your magically automated production lines -- keeping your shelves stocked, your customers happy, and your pockets full.','2024/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1883800/The_Magical_Mixture_Mill/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7401,'touch_type_tale_-_strategic_typing',NULL,'Touch Type Tale is the strategy game you control by typing! Join a brave new era of strategy — tactical typing. Use a satisfying mesh of mechanics across a range of surprising challenges, with storybook campaigning and online play. You are Paul. (Hi there.) And the keyboard to the kingdom is yours.','2024/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/909470/Touch_Type_Tale__Strategic_Typing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7402,'911_operator_-_search_&_rescue',NULL,'This content requires the base game 911 Operator on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/606971/911_Operator__Search__Rescue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7403,'paint_the_town_red_vr',NULL,'This content requires the base game Paint the Town Red on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2474710/Paint_the_Town_Red_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_156'),(7404,'touch_type_tale_-_strategic_typing',NULL,'Touch Type Tale is the strategy game you control by typing! Join a brave new era of strategy — tactical typing. Use a satisfying mesh of mechanics across a range of surprising challenges, with storybook campaigning and online play. You are Paul. (Hi there.) And the keyboard to the kingdom is yours.','2024/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/909470/Touch_Type_Tale__Strategic_Typing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7405,'911_operator_-_search_&_rescue',NULL,'This content requires the base game 911 Operator on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/606971/911_Operator__Search__Rescue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7406,'paint_the_town_red_vr',NULL,'This content requires the base game Paint the Town Red on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2474710/Paint_the_Town_Red_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7407,'coloring_pixels_-_celebration_xl_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Coloring Pixels on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3698520/Coloring_Pixels__Celebration_XL_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7408,'112_operator_-_facilities',NULL,'This content requires the base game 112 Operator on Steam in order to play.','2020/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1300851/112_Operator__Facilities/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7409,'expansion_-_europa_universalis_iv:_el_dorado',NULL,'This content requires the base game Europa Universalis IV on Steam in order to play.','2015/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/338160/Expansion__Europa_Universalis_IV_El_Dorado/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7410,'way_of_the_hunter_-_steyr_arms_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Way of the Hunter on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2584760/Way_of_the_Hunter__Steyr_Arms_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7411,'lethal_league',NULL,'Lethal League is a competitive projectile fighting game where you have to hit an anti-gravity ball into the face of your opponent to win. The ball speeds up with every strike, up to explosively extreme velocities. Play intense local matches with friends and foes, challenge yourself in the singleplayer mode or battle it out online.','2014/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/261180/Lethal_League/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7412,'train_sim_world®_5:_northeast_corridor:_new_york_-_trenton',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970300/Train_Sim_World_5_Northeast_Corridor_New_York__Trenton/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7413,'painkiller:_black_edition',NULL,'Painkiller Black Edition includes the expansion pack Battle Out of Hell, featuring 10 additional single-player levels and many new villains.','2004/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/39530/Painkiller_Black_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7414,'gunner-chan!',NULL,'A 2.5D top-down, roguelike shooter set in a base that has been taken over by a revolt of robots.','2025/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2516990/Gunnerchan/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7415,'natsu_no_sagashimono_~what_we_found_that_summer~',NULL,'Summer vacation is finally here, and the next few weeks promise to be anything but uneventful! Natsu has just 30 days to acclimate to life in the countryside, help the locals face their demons, find that special someone, and gain the self-confidence to return home with his head held high!','2024/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2997980/Natsu_no_Sagashimono_What_We_Found_That_Summer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7416,'phantasmagoria',NULL,'Master storyteller Roberta Williams challenges you to experience the ultimate interactive nightmare.','1995/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/501990/Phantasmagoria/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7417,'orb_of_creation',NULL,'Orb of Creation is an active incremental-puzzle game in which you recreate the world with nothing but magic and ingenuity. Conjure resources, buy upgrades, and become an all-powerful wizard!','2022/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1910680/Orb_of_Creation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7418,'the_last_spell_-_dwarves_of_runenberg',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Last Spell on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2795980/The_Last_Spell__Dwarves_of_Runenberg/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7419,'hades_ii_original_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Hades II, but does not include the base game.','2024/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2950840/Hades_II_Original_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7420,'exfil',NULL,'EXFIL delivers raw tactical FPS intensity with no distractions. No loot grinding, no gimmicks—just pure realism. From the co-designer of \'Squad,\' this milsim tests your strategy, comms and teamwork in high-stakes, single-life matches. Will your squad rise to the challenge?','2024/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/860020/EXFIL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7421,'spice&wolf_vr2',NULL,'The team behind the original series has gotten together to bring you into the world of Spice and Wolf again for a second installment of VR animation! Animation has evolved from \"watching\" to \"experiencing.\"','2020/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1348700/SpiceWolf_VR2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7422,'pc_building_simulator_-_esports_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game PC Building Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1252990/PC_Building_Simulator__Esports_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7423,'this_land_is_my_land',NULL,'Experience the frontier as a chief of a Native American tribe and resist the onset of the settlers. Explore the vast world full of hostile humans and animals while defining your narrative through the decisions you make.','2021/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1069640/This_Land_Is_My_Land/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7424,'siralim_2',NULL,'Siralim 2 is an old-school monster catching RPG. Summon and customize hundreds of creatures to fight for you as you battle your way through endless dungeons. Find rare treasure and use it to upgrade your castle, empower your creatures, craft powerful artifacts, learn new spells, and much more.','2016/8/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/464620/Siralim_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7425,'stellar_settlers:_space_base_builder',NULL,'Stellar Settlers is a chill space base/city builder and colony sim game. With unique vertical and horizontal base-building gameplay, settle on 10 hostile alien planets and build your own thriving colony. Get enough materials to build a physics-based Spaceship and try to escape from disasters.','2025/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2628570/Stellar_Settlers_Space_Base_Builder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7426,'war_thunder_-_m1a1_hc_\"click-bait\"_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game War Thunder on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2690300/War_Thunder__M1A1_HC_ClickBait_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7427,'imagine_earth',NULL,'Build your own global colonies on distant worlds. Manage energy and resource supplies and produce goods for space trade. Form economic and diplomatic alliances or take over competing corporations. Conduct research to protect your colonists from disasters and avoid a climate crisis.','2021/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/280720/Imagine_Earth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7428,'milo_and_the_magpies',NULL,'Milo and the Magpies is a point-and-click, hidden object game following the story of a little cat named Milo who is trying to find his way home after getting turned around by an unfortunate encounter with some pesky magpies.','2021/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1407420/Milo_and_the_Magpies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7429,'chornobyl_liquidators',NULL,'Chornobyl Liquidators is not a fantastic tale of exploring the Zone. It\'s a story about real people facing a real threat — the CNPP disaster. Invisible radiation, KGB, difficult moral choices... Do you have enough courage and strength to take on this challenge?','2024/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1113010/Chornobyl_Liquidators/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7430,'the_talos_principle_vr',NULL,'The Talos Principle VR is a virtual reality version of Croteam\'s critically acclaimed first-person puzzle game in the tradition of philosophical science fiction.','2017/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/552440/The_Talos_Principle_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7431,'the_sims™_4_bathroom_clutter_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2061331/The_Sims_4_Bathroom_Clutter_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7432,'the_star_named_eos',NULL,'The Star Named EOS is a story-rich puzzle adventure built around photography. Recreate compositions of past photos to uncover the truth of a family mystery. Experience a harmonious mixture of beautiful hand-drawn art and engaging puzzles on a journey of reminiscence.','2024/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1619230/The_Star_Named_EOS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7433,'ark_park',NULL,'In ARK Park, engage in close encounters with primal species through a series of theme park attractions. Enter by yourself or with a group of adventurous friends, and witness dinosaurs roaming in the wild with your own eyes!','2018/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/529910/ARK_Park/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7434,'pinball_fx_-_williams™_pinball_volume_8',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pinball FX on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3225380/Pinball_FX__Williams_Pinball_Volume_8/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7435,'organ_trail:_director\'s_cut',NULL,'Organ Trail is a retro zombie survival game. Travel westward in a station wagon with 4 of your friends, scavenging for supplies and fending off the undead. Members of your party might die of dysentery or you might have to put them down yourself when they get bit.','2013/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/233740/Organ_Trail_Directors_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7436,'the_bureau:_xcom_declassified',NULL,'The year is 1962 and the Cold War has the nation gripped by fear.  A top-secret government unit called The Bureau begins investigating a series of mysterious attacks by an enemy more powerful than communism.','2013/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/65930/The_Bureau_XCOM_Declassified/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7437,'deathbulge:_battle_of_the_bands',NULL,'A party-based RPG about a 3-piece band of dysfunctional friends who, upon signing up to a perfectly normal battle of the bands contest, become cursed with an unusual power.','2023/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1083790/Deathbulge_Battle_of_the_Bands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7438,'princess_maker_2_refine',NULL,'Princess Maker 2 Refine is a life simulation game which you play as a father of a girl, who had descended from the star. You have 8 years to raise your daughter from age 10 to 18 – your daughter will grow into her adulthood through various experiences.','2016/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/523000/Princess_Maker_2_Refine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7439,'schim',NULL,'SCHiM is a game about jumping from shadow to shadow in a relaxing and lively environment. This 3D platformer takes elements of light, shadow & animation and adds them directly to the gameplay, delivering an experience that you will only find in SCHiM.','2024/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1519710/SCHiM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7440,'cooking_simulator_-_pizza',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cooking Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1400460/Cooking_Simulator__Pizza/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7441,'one_military_camp',NULL,'Build your own military camp, manage the economy, recruit the best candidates and train them to become elite specialists. Send them on missions across the land to end the war once and for all!','2023/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1743830/One_Military_Camp/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7442,'djmax_respect_v_-_technika_3_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2020/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1386612/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__TECHNIKA_3_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7443,'neongarten',NULL,'A minimalist cyberpunk city builder inspired by Islanders and Luck Be a Landlord.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3211750/Neongarten/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7444,'living_with_sister:_monochrome_fantasy_-_expansion_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Living With Sister: Monochrome Fantasy on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3062990/Living_With_Sister_Monochrome_Fantasy__Expansion_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7445,'warhammer_40,000:_battlesector_-_tyranid_elites',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1793050/Warhammer_40000_Battlesector__Tyranid_Elites/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7446,'four_last_things',NULL,'Four Last Things is a point-and-click adventure game made from Renaissance-era paintings and public domain recordings of classical music. It is about sin, and the Four Last Things – Death, Judgement, Heaven and Hell – and strives to be intelligent and ridiculous in equal measures.','2017/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/503400/Four_Last_Things/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7447,'among_ashes',NULL,'Among Ashes is a terrifying first-person survival horror game. Your friend has sent you a link to a game that someone posted online, but as you play you quickly realise that something is terribly wrong. Whatever you do… K̴͉͚̗̅̃̄E̷͓̤̺̊͠E̴̤̰̿̽P̴̠̳̀́ ̴̨̮̭̕̚P̷̠͇̳͐̓̀L̶̹̔Ả̷̧Y̵̘̺͆̓Ï̸̻̏͂N̷͙̯͊G̵͖̹̠̽̿','2024/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2430900/Among_Ashes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7448,'odinfall',NULL,'Ragnarok was just the beginning… of the end! Odinfall is a Viking-themed, rogue-lite, twin-stick shooter. Blast your way through procedurally generated levels, upgrade your character, modify your weapons and take down robotic Norse gods to earn your freedom!','2025/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2154240/Odinfall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7449,'dcs:_bf_109_k-4_kurfürst',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2014/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/316960/DCS_Bf_109_K4_Kurfrst/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7450,'dcs:_world_war_ii_assets_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2017/11/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/684851/DCS_World_War_II_Assets_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_157'),(7451,'age_of_empires_ii:_definitive_edition_–_joan’s_marvelous_moving_masterpieces_animated_icons',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2672810/Age_of_Empires_II_Definitive_Edition__Joans_Marvelous_Moving_Masterpieces_Animated_Icons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7452,'studio_system_:_guardian_angel',NULL,'An investigation of a secret film studio underneath their school has led 3 students down an estranged rabbit hole. With the fixed-camera as your weapon, shine a light on the truth and save your friends.','2025/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2194790/Studio_System__Guardian_Angel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7453,'garten_of_banban_4',NULL,'Explore the abandoned levels of Banban’s Kindergarten. Survive the residents of the establishment that was left suspiciously empty. Uncover the truth behind the place, and find the whereabouts of your missing child…','2023/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2383120/Garten_of_Banban_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7454,'snowrunner_-_jack_of_all_treads_tire_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SnowRunner on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2353722/SnowRunner__Jack_of_All_Treads_Tire_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7455,'keep_keepers',NULL,'Tower Defense meets Base Management. Strategically place your defenses. Craft wacky ammunition like fiery peppers and boomerang bananas. Discover amazing weapons and automate your economy while defending against waves of enemies. Can you handle the chaos?','2024/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2354330/Keep_Keepers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7456,'music_for_the_long_dark_--_volume_one',NULL,'This is additional content for The Long Dark, but does not include the base game.','2017/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/690180/Music_for_The_Long_Dark__Volume_One/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7457,'hired_2_die',NULL,'A 1-4 player co-op survival horror where the horror begins when the shift starts. Clean, organize, and contain dangerous creatures using CCTV, motion sensors, and more. Earn your paycheck, upgrade your tools, and capture them—because no one else will.','2025/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1729140/Hired_2_Die/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7458,'adventure_escape_mysteries',NULL,'Play a story-driven room escape game with unique puzzles enjoyed by tens of millions of players. Solve mysteries, puzzle through escape rooms, and find the clue that will crack the case in a critically acclaimed puzzle adventure game!','2020/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1141020/Adventure_Escape_Mysteries/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7459,'conquest_of_empires_2',NULL,'We insist on fair competition, and focus on testing players\' strategic intelligence and teamwork. We are committed to creating a user-friendly game, so that every player can easily enter the game, enjoy the glory of the ancient civilization, and feel the endless fun of conquest.','2023/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2542860/Conquest_of_Empires_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7460,'kaya\'s_prophecy',NULL,'Kaya’s Prophecy is a unique card based village builder! establish your village, gather resources, and craft tools and buildings in a vibrant world. Explore and combat various challenges and other groups in this colourful, deck-builder while appeasing your god to earn his favour.','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3051470/Kayas_Prophecy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7461,'age_of_empires_ii:_definitive_edition_–_barbarossa’s_barrel_of_pickled_goods_animated_icons',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2672820/Age_of_Empires_II_Definitive_Edition__Barbarossas_Barrel_of_Pickled_Goods_Animated_Icons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7462,'shardlight',NULL,'A post-apocalyptic adventure game from the publisher that brought you Primordia, Gemini Rue and Technobabylon! A young woman stricken with a deadly plague searches for a cure in a hostile world.','2016/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/336130/Shardlight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7463,'naval_action_-_rotterdam',NULL,'This content requires the base game Naval Action on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2402190/Naval_Action__Rotterdam/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7464,'gerda:_a_flame_in_winter',NULL,'You have five days to save your husband, who has just been arrested by the Gestapo. Investigate, explore and form allegiances in this story-rich RPG-lite. Who will you trust?','2022/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1771360/Gerda_A_Flame_in_Winter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7465,'democracy_3',NULL,'Have you ever wanted to be president? or prime-minister? Convinced you could do a better job of running the country? Let\'s face it, you could hardly do a worse job than our current political leaders.','2013/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/245470/Democracy_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7466,'chicken_police:_into_the_hive!',NULL,'A wild tale of conspiracy, loss, friendship, and... chickens?! Two rooster detectives are about to venture into the insect underworld to uncover a worldwide conspiracy, while also battling their inherent demons in this animal noir adventure satire.','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2362090/Chicken_Police_Into_the_HIVE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7467,'dark_hunting_ground',NULL,'Hunt the monsters that swarm the Dark Hunting Ground, collect the spoils, develop your skills freely and wisely and fight to become the strongest hunter!','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2494810/Dark_Hunting_Ground/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7468,'overcooked!_2_-_surf_\'n\'_turf',NULL,'This content requires the base game Overcooked! 2 on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/909720/Overcooked_2__Surf_n_Turf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7469,'risen_2:_dark_waters',NULL,'Set several years after the end of Risen, raging titans have devastated the world and pushed humanity to the brink of existence. Subsequently, monstrous creatures have risen from the watery depths of the sea and their attacks have brought all seafaring to a grinding halt.','2012/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/40390/Risen_2_Dark_Waters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7470,'electrician_simulator_-_smart_devices',NULL,'This content requires the base game Electrician Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2329870/Electrician_Simulator__Smart_Devices/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7471,'guts_and_glory',NULL,'A game about father and son riding their bicycle through obstacle courses of death, and other fun family experiences. Created by HakJak','2018/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/537340/Guts_and_Glory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7472,'nights_of_azure_2:_bride_of_the_new_moon',NULL,'A Tale of Three Beautiful Maidens Drawn to Each Other. When three friends, deceived and separated by the tricks of darkness, find each other again, their bond shall become the light that will clear away the shadows and guide them towards the truth...','2017/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/636570/Nights_of_Azure_2_Bride_of_the_New_Moon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7473,'thriving_city:_song',NULL,'In 960 A.D., the Zhao Song Dynasty was established. As the mayor, you\'ll need to help the townspeople settle down, cultivate the land and expand. However, when the emperor issues a national mandate, conflicts between factions threaten city development—what strategy will you adopt?','2024/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1956800/Thriving_City_Song/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7474,'please,_touch_the_artwork',NULL,'A cozy puzzler with story. Recreate paintings by applying lines & colors in a specific order. Explore beautiful mazes & collect letters of a poem. Help two sweethearts find a path towards each other. Three games in one. Hints when stuck. 160+ paintings, 3~4 hours, set to a chill soundtrack.','2022/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1097100/Please_Touch_The_Artwork/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7475,'the_bunny_graveyard',NULL,'Skye and her Handy Pals are looking for a new pal to help them out on her lovely lil\' garden! Think you\'re up for the job, partner?','2023/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1892420/The_Bunny_Graveyard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7476,'hands_of_necromancy_ii',NULL,'Hands of Necromancy II is a dark fantasy FPS sequel, inspired by classics such as Heretic and Doom. Choose from two characters, wield new weapons and learn even more powerful spells and transformations to prove once and for all that you are the supreme Necromancer, master of death itself!','2024/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2706450/Hands_of_Necromancy_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7477,'voice_of_cards:_the_beasts_of_burden',NULL,'The Voice of Cards series are RPGs where everything is shown through the medium of cards. Enjoy a truly unique gaming experience from the minds of YOKO TARO, Keiichi Okabe and Kimihiko Fujisaka.','2022/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1890740/Voice_of_Cards_The_Beasts_of_Burden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7478,'dariusburst_chronicle_saviours',NULL,'DARIUSBURST Chronicle Saviours is the latest installment in Taito\'s DARIUS series of arcade-style shooting games. Blast hordes of alien sea-monsters, and blaze your own trail through branching environments.','2015/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/377870/DARIUSBURST_Chronicle_Saviours/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7479,'steel_armor:_blaze_of_war',NULL,'Steel Armor: Blaze of War is realistic tank simulator with tactical elements. The game models Soviet T-62 tank and US M60A1 tank in detail. Each tank has interactive cockpit with crew. Player controls a tank, and commands a tank platoon and attached forces in 4 large scale dynamic campaigns.','2015/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/286280/Steel_Armor_Blaze_of_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7480,'moonbreaker',NULL,'Moonbreaker is a turn-based strategy, tactical skirmish game. The game is designed to be a true digital miniatures experience, set in an expansive sci-fi universe crafted by Brandon Sanderson. Direct Captain and Crew in gripping, ever-changing competition and adventure.','2024/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/845890/Moonbreaker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7481,'glass_masquerade',NULL,'Welcome to Glass Masquerade - an artistic puzzle game inspired by Art Deco & stained glass artisans of the 20th century. You need to combine hidden glass pieces to unveil clocks and themes exhibited by various cultures of the world at the \'International Times Exhibition\'','2016/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/511470/Glass_Masquerade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7482,'nurikabe_world',NULL,'Nurikabe World is a relaxing logic puzzle game where you solve puzzles by creating islands and connecting rivers to create beautiful sceneries. Experience different landscapes and seasons, solve puzzle campaigns and create your own levels.','2025/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2964540/Nurikabe_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7483,'welcome_to_maison_chichigami',NULL,'Deep in the mountains, there is said to be a legendary hot spring: called the Spirit Spring. Becoming lost on the way to the spring, you are rescued by a mysterious, reclusive family. But what secrets does this family hide away in their manor?','2025/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2914480/Welcome_to_Maison_Chichigami/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7484,'painting_vr',NULL,'Take a break from the stress of daily life with this must-have virtual painter’s studio. Even if you think you’re not a creative person, Painting VR might prove you wrong. Be amazed by what you can create with unlimited supplies of paint, canvases, and all the tools you need.','2022/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1905940/Painting_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7485,'imperator:_rome_-_epirus_content_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Imperator: Rome on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/978951/Imperator_Rome__Epirus_Content_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7486,'humankind™_-_cultures_of_latin_america_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game HUMANKIND™ on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1819410/HUMANKIND__Cultures_of_Latin_America_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7487,'rift_of_the_necrodancer:_celeste_-_\"reach_for_the_summit\"',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rift of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3550080/Rift_of_the_NecroDancer_Celeste__Reach_for_the_Summit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7488,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_rancho_del_arroyo',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1608440/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Rancho_del_Arroyo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7489,'the_devil_within:_satgat',NULL,'Join Kim Rip, a Royal Guard whose humanity is gradually slipping away, on a thrilling 2.5D action-adventure platforming journey in \'The Devil Within: Satgat\'. Uncover the mysteries of a desolate realm as you engage in stylish battles against formidable foes.','2024/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1802880/The_Devil_Within_Satgat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7490,'not_for_broadcast:_the_timeloop',NULL,'This content requires the base game Not For Broadcast on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2303601/Not_For_Broadcast_The_Timeloop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7491,'touhou_mystia\'s_izakaya_dlc4_pack_-_garden_of_the_sun_&_shining_needle_castle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Touhou Mystia\'s Izakaya on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2399330/Touhou_Mystias_Izakaya_DLC4_Pack__Garden_of_the_Sun__Shining_Needle_Castle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7492,'rise_of_industry',NULL,'Put your entrepreneurial skills to the test in the first title in the ROI series as you create & optimise intricate production lines. As an early 20th-Century industrialist, grow your empire & adapt to an ever-changing business landscape with unexpected events that could lead to boom…or bust.','2019/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/671440/Rise_of_Industry/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7493,'rift_of_the_necrodancer:_celeste_-_\"resurrections\"',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rift of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3559850/Rift_of_the_NecroDancer_Celeste__Resurrections/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_158'),(7494,'tunnet',NULL,'Build, debug and optimize a computer network in an underground facility.','2023/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2286390/Tunnet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7495,'tokyo_ghoul:re_[call_to_exist]',NULL,'It may not be stylish, but... Live.Eat or be eaten. TOKYO GHOUL:re [CALL to EXIST] is a co-op survival action game that lets you experience the exciting world of Tokyo Ghoul and Tokyo Ghoul:re for yourself.','2019/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/756530/TOKYO_GHOULre_CALL_to_EXIST/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7496,'fly_corp_-_american_dream',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fly Corp on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3285860/Fly_Corp__American_Dream/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7497,'tiny_thor',NULL,'Jump into this challenging retro platformer! Play as Thor, use his mighty hammer and unique items to explore the Northern Realms. Beware of mythical creatures blocking your path to become a god!','2023/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/541310/Tiny_Thor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7498,'fighting_ex_layer',NULL,'After a long wait, Arika\'s EX characters gather once again for another exciting battle! Kairi, Skullomania, Blaire, Pullum and the others are all back with the latest graphics. And this time they\'re bringing a brand new system - the \"Gougi System\". Grasp victory with Gougi!','2018/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/871200/FIGHTING_EX_LAYER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7499,'cook,_serve,_delicious!_3?!',NULL,'Cook, serve and manage your food truck as you dish out hundreds of different foods across war-torn America in this massive sequel to the million-selling series!','2020/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1000030/Cook_Serve_Delicious_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7500,'trombone_champ:_unflattened',NULL,'It’s time to step up and fulfill your destiny in Trombone Champ: Unflattened! A rhythm game where every note is yours to command. With more than 58+ unforgettable tracks, an all-new campaign, collectible cards, and wild trombones, you’re not just playing along with the music—you’re creating it! 🔥🎺','2024/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3151670/Trombone_Champ_Unflattened/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7501,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_high-tech_buildings',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2016/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/547500/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_HighTech_Buildings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7502,'destroyer:_the_u-boat_hunter',NULL,'Destroyer: The U-Boat Hunter brings you an authentic and historically accurate destroyer simulation along with gripping anti-submarine warfare set in the turmoils of the Atlantic Ocean during World War II.','2023/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1272010/Destroyer_The_UBoat_Hunter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7503,'furi_original_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Furi, but does not include the base game.','2016/7/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/497690/Furi_Original_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7504,'chuchel',NULL,'CHUCHEL is a comedy adventure game from the creators of Machinarium, Botanicula and Samorost. Join the hairy hero Chuchel and his rival Kekel as they will be facing numerous puzzles and challenges in their quest to retrieve the precious cherry!','2018/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/711660/CHUCHEL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7505,'american_truck_simulator_-_goodyear_tires_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2021/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1621740/American_Truck_Simulator__Goodyear_Tires_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7506,'battle_tanks:_world_war_ii',NULL,'Are you ready to fight? Download this incredibly addictive tank game right now! Choose a tank and fight with your friends in dynamic real-time battles.Meet the legendary tank shooter Battle Tanks! Show the whole world who\'s in charge here!','2019/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/782670/Battle_Tanks_World_War_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7507,'bustafellows',NULL,'A new visual novel from the legendary eXtend! Mixing dangerous romance with murder mystery, BUSTAFELLOWS is a steamy noir mystery that will make you shiver but ask for more!','2021/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1494470/BUSTAFELLOWS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7508,'hidden_&_dangerous_2:_courage_under_fire',NULL,'Hidden & Dangerous 2 is a first and third person tactical shooter that builds upon the tremendous success of Hidden & Dangerous. You lead a small squad of Allied soldiers deep behind enemy lines, to carry out secret missions during World War II.','2003/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/703320/Hidden__Dangerous_2_Courage_Under_Fire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7509,'praey_for_the_gods',NULL,'Praey for the Gods is a boss climbing open world adventure game where you play a lone hero sent to the edge of a dying frozen land to explore and solve the secrets of a never ending winter. Grapple, glide and grab hold of massive beasts as you fight to survive and return the world to proper order.','2021/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/494430/Praey_for_the_Gods/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7510,'the_legend_of_tianding',NULL,'The Legend of Tianding is a sidescrolling action game about Liao Tianding, the legendary Taiwanese Folk Hero. Explore the dazzling streets of Colonial Japanese Taiwan in the early 20th century.','2021/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1406850/The_Legend_of_Tianding/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7511,'dungeons_of_sundaria',NULL,'Adventure through epic dungeons facing fearsome creatures either solo or with a group of friends. Master your class, loot everything, and destroy the foul creatures of the deep! Will you become a hero of legend?','2023/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/587520/Dungeons_of_Sundaria/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7512,'primordia',NULL,'Life has ceased. Man is but a myth. And now, even the machines have begun to fail. Lead Horatio Nullbuilt and his sarcastic sidekick Crispin on a journey through the crumbling world of Primordia, facing malfunctioning robots, ancient secrets, and an implacable, power-hungry foe.','2012/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/227000/Primordia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7513,'rock_of_ages',NULL,'A rock-solid combination of rock-rolling action, deep strategy, and captivating art and music from different ages of history, this is a game of crush or be crushed!','2011/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/22230/Rock_of_Ages/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7514,'mother_russia_bleeds',NULL,'An old-fashioned beat \'em up with big doses of adrenaline and trippiness, somewhere between the classic style of Streets of Rage and the ultra-violence of Hotline Miami. Set in a cold, ruthless Soviet Union, Mother Russia Bleeds aims to conjure up anxiety, unease, and drug-addled frenzy.','2016/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/361300/Mother_Russia_Bleeds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7515,'sailaway_iii',NULL,'Sailing simulation. Explore the world\'s oceans or compete in races in the most realistic sailing simulator available. The sailing waters are as big as the real world and circumnavigation will take several months. Using true weather, true conditions and true sail trim.','2024/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2631870/Sailaway_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7516,'driftwood',NULL,'A game about high-speed downhill longboarding and a sloth named Eddy. Carve up the mountainside as you drift through the beautiful landscape, and find the perfect balance of speed and control.','2023/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2223700/Driftwood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7517,'kovaak\'s_tracking_trainer',NULL,'This content requires the base game KovaaK\'s on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1438210/KovaaKs_Tracking_Trainer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7518,'sid_meier\'s_colonization_(classic)',NULL,'The New World lies before you with all its peril, promise and infinite possibility. Your colonists anxiously follow you to shore. The treasures of an entire continent await you.','1994/1/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/327400/Sid_Meiers_Colonization_Classic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7519,'rift_of_the_necrodancer:_celeste_-_\"confronting_myself\"',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rift of the NecroDancer on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3550090/Rift_of_the_NecroDancer_Celeste__Confronting_Myself/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7520,'molek-syntez',NULL,'Use the MOLEK-SYNTEZ to create small molecules with various pharmacological effects from the comfort of your small Romanian apartment.','2019/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1168880/MOLEKSYNTEZ/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7521,'limscape_:_the_liminal_space_explorer',NULL,'A first-person exploration game where you walk through eerie and realistic spaces, searching for an exit. Powered by Unreal Engine\'s Lumen, it\'s perfect for those who enjoy quiet walks or simple games. Use the sandbox feature to create your own space! Requires a DirectX12-compatible GPU.','2025/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3227460/LIMSCAPE__THE_LIMINAL_SPACE_EXPLORER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7522,'castle_of_alchemists',NULL,'Defend your castle in this fast-paced tower defense/action hybrid game with stunning pixel art graphics! Play as alchemically enhanced warrior Bellator, set traps, build towers, craft powerful weapons, and defend your home! The fate of the castle lies in your hands!','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1724770/Castle_Of_Alchemists/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7523,'curse_crackers:_for_whom_the_belle_toils',NULL,'Curse Crackers is a fast-paced acrobatic platformer where you bounce, vault, and fight your way through a whimsical world with the help of your loyal companion. Eat snacks, collect items, and travel the world to stop Bonnie and her band of troublemakers!','2022/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1726760/Curse_Crackers_For_Whom_the_Belle_Toils/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7524,'dig_vr',NULL,'DIG VR captures the sheer joy, adrenaline and frustrations of life on a digger in an exciting experience for novices and pros. Featuring authentic, immersive controls that recreate the feeling of driving a real digger, DIG VR is a light-simulation game with a casual arcade-twist! ','2025/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2891460/DIG_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7525,'ys:_the_oath_in_felghana',NULL,'An Action RPG driven by fast-paced combat and paired with an intricate puzzle-filled world.','2012/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/207320/Ys_The_Oath_in_Felghana/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7526,'path_of_the_midnight_sun',NULL,'Protect a noblewoman reckoning with unholy powers as she wards off the soul of the Demon King sealed inside her. Doubt your own companions, survive against unforgiving hordes of monsters. But beware; every choice has consequences in this epic JRPG adventure of betrayal, romance & self-acceptance.','2023/1/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1969060/Path_of_the_Midnight_Sun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7527,'rugby_union_team_manager_4',NULL,'The fourth instalment of “The Number 1 Rugby Union Management Game”. Rugby Union Team Manager 4 gives you full control of managing your own Rugby Union team. Training schedules, coaches, physios, scouting, finances, sponsors, facilities and more. MUCH MORE!','2022/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1880930/Rugby_Union_Team_Manager_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7528,'animal_shelter_-_horse_shelter_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Animal Shelter on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2267210/Animal_Shelter__Horse_Shelter_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7529,'unlight:revive',NULL,'This is a story-centered competitive training card game.','2024/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3247080/UNLIGHTRevive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7530,'mayhemers',NULL,'\"Mayhemers\" is a multiplayer chaos creation game for up to 8 players with a procedurally generated map. Choose your side: Will you be a Mayhemer or a Guardian? Mayhemers\' task is to create chaos. Guardians\' task is to stop them.','2025/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2536260/Mayhemers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7531,'fallout_new_vegas®:_lonesome_road™',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fallout: New Vegas on Steam in order to play.','2011/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/72760/Fallout_New_Vegas_Lonesome_Road/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7532,'inertial_drift',NULL,'An arcade racer that tears up the rule book with innovative twin-stick controls, completely re-imagined driving mechanics and a huge roster of fiercely individual cars and tracks.','2020/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1184480/Inertial_Drift/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7533,'romancing_saga_3™',NULL,'The celebrated RPG classic comes West for the first time! Experience a brand-new HD remaster of the legendary 1995 RPG masterpiece introducing optimised graphics, a new dungeon to explore, new scenarios and a new game+ function.','2019/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/952540/Romancing_SaGa_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7534,'when_the_past_was_around',NULL,'When the Past was Around is an adventure point-and-click puzzle game about love, moving on, letting go, and the joy and pain of everything in between.','2020/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1164050/When_The_Past_Was_Around/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7535,'call_of_the_wild:_the_angler™_-_norway_reserve',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of the Wild: The Angler™ on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2165500/Call_of_the_Wild_The_Angler__Norway_Reserve/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7536,'gibbous_-__a_cthulhu_adventure',NULL,'Crazy cultists. Cthulhu. A talking cat. Gibbous takes you on an expansive, traditionally animated, hand-painted adventure. Play as three protagonists and explore a lushly rendered Lovecraft-inspired world, unraveling ancient conspiracies. A comedy cosmic horror adventure made in Transylvania!','2019/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/914020/Gibbous___A_Cthulhu_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7537,'red_faction',NULL,'JOIN THE REVOLUTION! Lured to Mars by the Ultor Corporation\'s promise of a better life, thousands have come to seek their fortune and work for the massive mining company. But all is not as it seems. A deadly plague is sweeping through the barracks, and miners suffer daily abuse at the hands of the Ultor guards.','2001/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/20530/Red_Faction/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_159'),(7538,'league_of_angels:_pact',NULL,'League of Angels: Pact is the latest action-idle MMORPG in the League of Angels series. Participate in fierce battles, awaken hundreds of Angels and empower them and finally, defend the Holy Land of Justice with their help!','2023/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1477460/League_of_Angels_Pact/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7539,'generation_zero®_-_alpine_unrest',NULL,'This content requires the base game Generation Zero® on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1157550/Generation_Zero__Alpine_Unrest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7540,'doom_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for DOOM, but does not include the base game.','2020/2/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1195480/DOOM_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7541,'way_of_the_hunter_-_kawasaki_utv_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Way of the Hunter on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2922210/Way_of_the_Hunter__Kawasaki_UTV_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7542,'il-2_sturmovik:_p-38j-25_collector_plane',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1198462/IL2_Sturmovik_P38J25_Collector_Plane/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7543,'guilty_gear_2_-overture-',NULL,'The ultimate melee action [GUILTY GEAR 2 -OVERTURE-] is now on Steam!! Pushing [Gameplay] and [Entertainment] to the extremes, with a splash of [Competitiveness] -- That\'s GUILTY GEAR 2 for you.','2016/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/437000/GUILTY_GEAR_2_OVERTURE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7544,'summer_of_\'58',NULL,'In the summer of 2008. The main character, at the request of followers, goes to Russia to explore the abandoned camp \"Yunost\". Locals say that this place is inhabited by restless souls. This will need to be checked.','2021/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1609080/Summer_of_58/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7545,'yomawari:_lost_in_the_dark',NULL,'Another chapter of the atmospheric horror series has emerged from the shadows! Eerie sound design and shadowy environments set the stage for gruesome and terrifying ghosts never seen before in the series.','2022/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1998330/Yomawari_Lost_in_the_Dark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7546,'torchlight_iii',NULL,'In Torchlight III, Novastraia is again under threat of invasion and it’s up to you to defend against the Netherim and its allies. Gather your wits and brave the frontier to find fame, glory, and new adventures!','2020/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1030210/Torchlight_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7547,'no_one_lives_under_the_lighthouse_director\'s_cut',NULL,'A slow burn retro horror game, in which you arrive at the old lighthouse on a small island near the coast of the United States. After the previous keeper has gone missing, you need to take over his duties and watch after the light.','2020/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1254370/No_one_lives_under_the_lighthouse_Directors_cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7548,'titanfall®_2:_monarch\'s_reign_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Titanfall® 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238100/Titanfall_2_Monarchs_Reign_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7549,'reveil',NULL,'REVEIL is a narrative first-person psycho-thriller game that focuses on story, puzzles and exploration. Find out what’s going on inside Walter Thompson and what his dark past at the Nelson Bros Circus has to do with it.','2024/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/809060/REVEIL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7550,'road_maintenance_simulator_2_-_winter_services',NULL,'In Road Maintenance Simulator 2, you take on a variety of authentic tasks that occur every day in a road maintenance depot - now including winter service! Choose from a wide selection of tools, attachments and vehicles to master the challenges ahead.','2024/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2865610/Road_Maintenance_Simulator_2__Winter_Services/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7551,'metal:_hellsinger_-_dream_of_the_beast',NULL,'This content requires the base game Metal: Hellsinger on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2252490/Metal_Hellsinger__Dream_of_the_Beast/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7552,'warhammer_40,000:_gladius_-_reinforcement_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/961840/Warhammer_40000_Gladius__Reinforcement_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7553,'overcooked!_2_-_surf_\'n\'_turf',NULL,'This content requires the base game Overcooked! 2 on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/909720/Overcooked_2__Surf_n_Turf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7554,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator_-_taupo_lake_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ultimate Fishing® Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2088220/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator__Taupo_Lake_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7555,'out_of_orbit',NULL,'Design, build, or pirate spaceships. Build bases on planets. Explore endless randomly generated universes, travel through black holes, command your crew, survive cosmic events, collect and trade materials, battle epic bosses, and much more. The sky is the limit, literally!','2023/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1859990/Out_of_Orbit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7556,'g-darius_hd',NULL,'You will see the creation of new lives... Capture enemies and fire them back at their allies as enormous beams of energy in this horizontally scrolling shooting game, featuring 5 versions of G-Darius with new features, enhancements, and Steam exclusive extras!','2022/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1640160/GDarius_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7557,'insurgency',NULL,'Take to the streets for intense close quarters combat, where a team\'s survival depends upon securing crucial strongholds and destroying enemy supply in this multiplayer and cooperative Source Engine based experience.','2014/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/222880/Insurgency/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7558,'forgotten_realms:_the_archives_-_collection_one',NULL,'The Forgotten Realms Archive - Collection One allows you to journey through the set of adventures: the Eye of the Beholder trilogy, a collection of first-person, real-time role-playing games.','2022/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1882240/Forgotten_Realms_The_Archives__Collection_One/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7559,'star_renegades',NULL,'Star Renegades is a dimension spanning rogue-lite strategy RPG. Outsmart uniquely generated adversaries, forge bonds between heroes and end the cycle!','2020/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/651670/Star_Renegades/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7560,'realpolitiks_3:_earth_and_beyond',NULL,'Prove your political brilliance in a grand strategy like no other: pick any contemporary country, set up your government and navigate the pitfalls of domestic and international politics. A glorious destiny awaits - the domination of not just the Earth, but the whole Solar system!','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2298690/Realpolitiks_3_Earth_and_Beyond/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7561,'logic_town',NULL,'Does Jim like chocolate cake? WAS JANET WEARING A HAT!?! Solve exhilarating mysteries like these in Logic Town, a relaxing coffee-break puzzle game of pure deduction.','2023/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2333240/Logic_Town/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7562,'3_minutes_to_midnight®_-_a_comedy_graphic_adventure',NULL,'In a race against time, Betty embarks on a thrilling, comedy-packed adventure to crack a conspiracy that starts with a bang and ends at 3 Minutes to Midnight.','2024/8/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/832500/3_Minutes_to_Midnight__A_Comedy_Graphic_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7563,'harvester',NULL,'A strange and twisted world...Harvester! The most violent adventure game of all time comes to Steam!','1996/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/287020/Harvester/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7564,'war_thunder_-_m1a1_hc_\"click-bait\"_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game War Thunder on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2690300/War_Thunder__M1A1_HC_ClickBait_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7565,'space_simulation_toolkit',NULL,'Physics sandbox game that uses a graphics card as a supercomputer. Change the laws of physics, design mechanisms, create A-Life worlds and inhabit them with living beings, experiment with evolution and AI.','2020/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1196080/Space_Simulation_Toolkit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7566,'guilty_gear_x2_#reload',NULL,'As humanity endeavored to better themselves, they created the biological marvel known as Gears. Originally intended as the next step of human evolution, they were instead fitted for war and turned against their own creators.','2004/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/314030/Guilty_Gear_X2_Reload/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7567,'blade_of_darkness',NULL,'Blade of Darkness is a hardcore fantasy action-adventure with unique combat mechanics and role-playing elements that pioneered the “soulsborne” genre. Pick one of four characters to hack and slash through a gory quest to save the world from the forces of Chaos.','2021/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1710170/Blade_of_Darkness/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7568,'epic_battle_fantasy_4',NULL,'A light-hearted turn-based RPG, heavily inspired by old 2D classics. You will battle through waves of cute enemies, grow your characters, explore a diverse world, solve puzzles, and of course, save the world. (Just updated to version 3!)','2014/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/265610/Epic_Battle_Fantasy_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7569,'kingdom_come:_deliverance_–_from_the_ashes',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Come: Deliverance on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/883150/Kingdom_Come_Deliverance__From_the_Ashes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7570,'furry_feet',NULL,'Furry Feet...Or Paws if you prefer. Does anything else has to be said?','2021/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1694960/Furry_Feet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7571,'spellmasons',NULL,'Spellmasons is a magical, tactical roguelike where you customize your spells to survive. Play solo or team up with your friends in online multiplayer, and explore a deep magic system where clever combinations yield powerfully satisfying results!','2023/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1618380/Spellmasons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7572,'angry_video_game_nerd_i_&_ii_deluxe',NULL,'Control \"The Nerd\" in a retro-inspired action platformer! It\'s two games in one, remixed and rebalanced to bring you the ultimate experience of Nerd Rage. Featuring stylized pixel art inspired by classic games, a highly energetic soundtrack, and challenging levels -- plus a special NEW chapter!','2020/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1162960/Angry_Video_Game_Nerd_I__II_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7573,'payday_2:_tijuana_music_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2076560/PAYDAY_2_Tijuana_Music_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7574,'serious_sam_classics:_revolution',NULL,'Serious Sam is a high-adrenaline arcade-action shooter heavily focused on frantic action. In a world where cyberpunk meets fantasy-fiction and advanced technology is mixed with black magic and psycho-powers, Sam travels through four beautiful worlds, confronting countless foes on his way to Mental\'s base.','2019/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/227780/Serious_Sam_Classics_Revolution/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7575,'checkmate_showdown',NULL,'Chess meets Fighting games. Crush your opponents in the arena and on the chessboard in this online multiplayer competitive tactical fighting game that mixes the strategic elegance of Chess with the fast-paced execution of fighting games.','2023/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1803410/Checkmate_Showdown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7576,'tropico_6_-_festival',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tropico 6 on Steam in order to play.','2021/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1631380/Tropico_6__Festival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7577,'electro_bop_boxing_league',NULL,'A new and unconventional mix of Auto-Battler + Rhythm tapping challenges.🎵 Claim your mechanical fighter fame in this Atompunk / Electro Swing themed boxing game! Outfit your boxer with a variety of parts, abilities, belts and crew upgrades earned through single matches or career mode.','2025/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3211280/Electro_Bop_Boxing_League/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7578,'conrad_stevenson\'s_paranormal_p.i.',NULL,'I made this first-person single player ghost hunting simulation game, trying to take an authentic approach at investigating ghosts. Use essential paranormal tools to help your community alleviate their concerns and put their minds at ease.','2023/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1872860/Conrad_Stevensons_Paranormal_PI/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7579,'decade',NULL,'Explore an alternate past. Discover how its ideas develop, distort, and disappear. Seed new movements, destroy others. Subvert the rise and fall of empires, art, ideologies, and individuals in this narrative adventure game.','2025/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3272360/Decade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7580,'budget_cuts_ultimate',NULL,'Enter a VR stealth game as the last human amidst robot managers programmed to \'optimize\' the workforce. Escape the office alive by sneaking past enemies or unleash a fistful of knives, quivers of arrows, grenades, and coffee mugs onto their unsuspecting circuits!','2023/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2221980/Budget_Cuts_Ultimate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7581,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_when_shadows_dance',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2531020/Hunt_Showdown_1896__When_Shadows_Dance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7582,'battle_chasers:_nightwar',NULL,'Battle Chasers: Nightwar is an RPG inspired by the classic console greats, featuring deep dungeon diving, turn-based combat presented in a classic JRPG format, and a rich story driven by exploration of the world.','2017/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/451020/Battle_Chasers_Nightwar/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_160'),(7583,'resident_evil_4_leon_&_ashley_costumes:_\'casual\'',NULL,'This content