),(7595,'battle_chasers:_nightwar',NULL,'Battle Chasers: Nightwar is an RPG inspired by the classic console greats, featuring deep dungeon diving, turn-based combat presented in a classic JRPG format, and a rich story driven by exploration of the world.','2017/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/451020/Battle_Chasers_Nightwar/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7596,'node_farm',NULL,'Node Farm is a game about building a fully automated farm using nodes. Connect nodes, harvest and sell veggies, buy new islands, discover new nodes, and automate the process - all in a cozy farm simulation formula!','2024/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2738990/Node_Farm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7597,'clem',NULL,'CLeM is a narrative-driven puzzle adventure game with a dark twist. Wake up in a world where puzzles intertwine with exploration, weaving a unique narrative rooted in alchemy. A voice awakens you. It gives you purpose. To guide you, you find a notebook with mysterious entries and a house to explore.','2024/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1861440/CLeM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7598,'screw_drivers',NULL,'Crazy physics and high-speed races! Craft vehicles cleverly by combining building blocks and mechanical parts to create powerful drivetrains. Unlock new parts, race for the gold, and challenge your friends in multiplayer.','2024/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1279510/Screw_Drivers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7599,'conrad_stevenson\'s_paranormal_p.i.',NULL,'I made this first-person single player ghost hunting simulation game, trying to take an authentic approach at investigating ghosts. Use essential paranormal tools to help your community alleviate their concerns and put their minds at ease.','2023/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1872860/Conrad_Stevensons_Paranormal_PI/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7600,'the_sims™_3_fast_lane_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2010/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/47896/The_Sims_3_Fast_Lane_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7601,'shower_with_your_dad_simulator_2015:_do_you_still_shower_with_your_dad',NULL,'\"Shower With Your Dad Simulator 2015: Do You Still Shower With Your Dad?\" is a fast paced shower-simulation where you shower with your 8-bit dad.It\'s good, clean fun!','2015/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/359050/Shower_With_Your_Dad_Simulator_2015_Do_You_Still_Shower_With_Your_Dad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7602,'fishing:_north_atlantic_-_scallops_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing: North Atlantic - Enhanced Edition on Steam in order to play.','2021/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1602660/Fishing_North_Atlantic__Scallops_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7603,'mordhau_-_banisher_weapon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game MORDHAU on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3199060/MORDHAU__Banisher_Weapon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7604,'olympic_games_tokyo_2020_–_the_official_video_game™',NULL,'The Olympic Games are back, and this time it\'s your chance for glory! Whether you play with friends, family, or go for gold on the global leaderboards, this is a party game that anyone can pick up and enjoy!','2021/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/981890/Olympic_Games_Tokyo_2020__The_Official_Video_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7605,'kingdom_come:_deliverance_–_from_the_ashes',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Come: Deliverance on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/883150/Kingdom_Come_Deliverance__From_the_Ashes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7606,'fallout_new_vegas:_old_world_blues',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fallout: New Vegas on Steam in order to play.','2011/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/72750/Fallout_New_Vegas_Old_World_Blues/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7607,'blades_of_time',NULL,'Ayumi, the gorgeous gun and sword-wielding treasure hunter, sets out on a journey to an ancient island in search of new adventures. While rich in bounty, the island is also filled with the magic of Chaos, being at the same time home to blood thirsty monsters.','2012/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/208670/Blades_of_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7608,'citydriver',NULL,'Driving realistically in a real city for the first time - driving fun & training with CityDriver! ViewApp\'s newest simulation offers you the opportunity to explore the streets of Munich with various cars.','2023/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2064810/CityDriver/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7609,'wattam',NULL,'Wattam is a game about the joys of friendship and discovery, from the imagination of Keita Takahashi (creator of Katamari Damacy and Noby Noby Boy) and developer Funomena.','2020/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/702680/Wattam/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7610,'gore_screaming_show',NULL,'A deeply unsettling visual novel following a boy who returns to his hometown expecting to find peace; however, it isn\'t long before his hopes are dashed by the monster known as Gore Screaming Show.','2022/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2182690/Gore_Screaming_Show/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7611,'bladestorm:_nightmare',NULL,'BLADESTORM: Nightmare is the newest evolution of 2007’s BLADESTORM: The Hundred Years’ War using the latest technologies and introducing many new elements. These technologies have made possible not only visual improvements, but also many new game elements. BLADESTORM: Nightmare offers an entirely new gameplay experience.','2015/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/350310/BLADESTORM_Nightmare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7612,'eyes_of_war',NULL,'Eyes of War is a real-time strategy game set in the medieval era, offering both single-player and multiplayer experiences where you can control every unit in character mode. Build your castle, lead your army, and dominate the map. Eyes of War invites you to epic battles of the medieval era!','2025/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2343930/Eyes_of_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7613,'doom_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for DOOM, but does not include the base game.','2020/2/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1195480/DOOM_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7614,'snowrunner_-_crocodile_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SnowRunner on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1838500/SnowRunner__Crocodile_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7615,'fallen_hero:_retribution',NULL,'So you\'re a villain now? Let\'s see if you survive the experience.','2023/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1343810/Fallen_Hero_Retribution/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7616,'renai_karichaimashita:_koikari_-_love_for_hire',NULL,'Due to family circumstances, Yuki has only one belief: money will make his little sister happy. And thus, he works part-time jobs late into the night. His plan is to start working full-time after graduation, but his little sister tells him that if he won\'t go to university, then she won\'t either.','2021/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1662850/Renai_Karichaimashita_Koikari__Love_For_Hire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7617,'deep_sleep_trilogy',NULL,'You can’t run from your dreams in this unsettling classic point-and-click horror game from award-winning indie developer scriptwelder. To find a way out, you’ll have to go even deeper into your nightmares.','2019/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1146510/Deep_Sleep_Trilogy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7618,'fibbage_xl',NULL,'NOTE: This game first appeared in The Jackbox Party Pack. It’s Fibbage XL – The Hilarious Bluffing Party Game in standalone form! Fool your friends with your lies, avoid theirs, and find the (usually outrageous) truth. “The mayor of Rabbit Hash, Kentucky is a ____.” Baby? Rabbit? Ham sandwich? Go!','2016/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/448080/Fibbage_XL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7619,'mayhem_brawler',NULL,'Mayhem Brawler is an urban fantasy themed beat \'em up that brings back the 90s arcade vibe to present day. With comic book style art and kick-ass soundtracks, it offers a unique experience that you can tackle solo or as co-op with friends while defining the next step in the story with your choices.','2021/8/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1306720/Mayhem_Brawler/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7620,'il-2_sturmovik:_fw_190_d-9_collector_plane',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1198461/IL2_Sturmovik_Fw_190_D9_Collector_Plane/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7621,'shapehero_factory',NULL,'In ShapeHero Factory, you’re the engineer of an ever-evolving paint-fuelled factory that spits out magical, shape-based warriors. Send them into battle - to death or glory - then build an even better factory on your next run.','2024/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2389040/ShapeHero_Factory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7622,'vigor',NULL,'Outlive the apocalypse! Dive into intense Encounters and extract the most valuable spoils the Outlands have to offer! Loot, shoot, and build to become the absolute Outlander and explore the landscape of a post-war Norway in Vigor, a free-to-play looter shooter.','2024/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2818260/Vigor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7623,'day_of_dragons_-_blitz_striker_amphithere',NULL,'This content requires the base game Day of Dragons on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1268630/Day_of_Dragons__Blitz_Striker_Amphithere/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7624,'mount_your_friends',NULL,'Experience the extreme simulated sporting sensation that\'s sweeping our digital nation! Mount Your Friends is a fiercely competitive sporting event for you to play with your friends in the contextual security of your own home, assuming that your home is not composed of sexual innuendo.','2014/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/296470/Mount_Your_Friends/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7625,'djmax_respect_v_-_muse_dash_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1958170/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__Muse_Dash_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7626,'cricket_22',NULL,'Cricket 22 delivers the Ashes, the Big Bash, The Hundred, and a multitude of other fan-favourite competitions! All-new mechanics, commentary, and a captivating, narrative driven career mode, will immediately immerse you in the ultimate cricket experience to date.','2021/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1701380/Cricket_22/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7627,'warhammer_40,000:_battle_sister',NULL,'Welcome to the grim darkness of the far future! Experience the war-torn universe of Warhammer 40,000 brought into jaw-dropping, visceral reality for the first time in VR. Immerse yourself in a gripping, action-filled story spanning the galaxy.','2022/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1733890/Warhammer_40000_Battle_Sister/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7628,'omega_strikers',NULL,'steam emailed me and told me legally I am not allowed to put the entire bee movie script here','2022/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1869590/Omega_Strikers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7629,'jewel_match_solitaire_fantasy_-_collector\'s_edition',NULL,'Experience a fresh take on solitaire — in an epic adventure, where magic and strategy intertwine. Complete fantasy village quests by solving creative puzzles with super-polished card play. Restore castles and meet a cast of charming characters across 1,000+ levels of beautifully crafted adventure.','2025/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3464820/Jewel_Match_Solitaire_Fantasy__Collectors_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_161'),(7630,'lovechoice',NULL,'\"What is love?\" We try to answer that with this game. The game encourages people to have a warm, soft, and understanding heart.','2021/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/939400/LoveChoice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7631,'rimworld_name_in_game_access',NULL,'This content requires the base game RimWorld on Steam in order to play.','2016/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/367680/RimWorld_Name_in_Game_Access/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7632,'sacred_gold',NULL,'A shadow of evil has fallen on the kingdom of Ancaria. It is a time for champions - a time to journey into the perilous world of SACRED. Battle blood-thirsty orcs & lumbering ogres... Destroy undead wizards & rotting mummies... Slay hellish demons & legendary dragons.','2006/8/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/12320/Sacred_Gold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7633,'darq:_complete_edition',NULL,'DARQ tells the story of Lloyd, a boy who finds himself in the middle of a lucid nightmare. Unable to wake up, Lloyd has to face his fears and decipher the meaning of the dream.','2019/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/433550/DARQ_Complete_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7634,'the_guardian_of_nature',NULL,'«The Guardian of Nature» is a hand-drawn, size-changing adventure. Embark on a magical journey with botanist Henry, use your size-changing ability to explore nature in big and small and solve solarpunk puzzles to put nature back in order.','2025/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2421950/The_Guardian_of_Nature/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7635,'seaorama:_world_of_shipping',NULL,'Experience the challenges of running a successful shipping company with Seaorama: World of Shipping.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2002570/SeaOrama_World_of_Shipping/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7636,'dungeon_village_2',NULL,'Recruit adventurers and monsters to create your own RRG-style town!','2023/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1983710/Dungeon_Village_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7637,'maiden_and_spell',NULL,'Maiden & Spell is a magical girl battle game, set in a cutesy fantasy world. Select from one of eight young ladies to battle 1 on 1 with a friend, or fight your way through a series of bosses and learn the secrets of The Kingdom of Stars.','2020/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1004770/Maiden_and_Spell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7638,'star_trek™:_judgment_rites',NULL,'Return to command of the USS Enterprise in this classic. True episodic format beams eight original point-and-click missions into your computer. Featuring the cast members and sound effects from Star Trek: The Original Series, Judgment Rites puts you on course for a galaxy of excitement!','2015/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/364800/Star_Trek_Judgment_Rites/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7639,'amazing_cultivation_simulator_-_immortal_tales_of_wudang',NULL,'This content requires the base game Amazing Cultivation Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2021/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1701600/Amazing_Cultivation_Simulator__Immortal_Tales_of_WuDang/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7640,'democracy_4_-_voting_systems',NULL,'This content requires the base game Democracy 4 on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2004030/Democracy_4__Voting_Systems/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7641,'another_brick_in_the_mall',NULL,'Design, build and manage a giant shopping center. Open shops, supermarkets, restaurants, movie theaters, bowling alleys and more. Hire and manage the best staff for the job and milk your customers for all they\'re worth!','2020/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/521150/Another_Brick_in_The_Mall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7642,'city_transport_simulator:_bus',NULL,'This content requires the base game City Transport Simulator® on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3592110/City_Transport_Simulator_Bus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7643,'monster_battles',NULL,'Gather your monster squad and fight in Monster Battles! Dive into this inventory management auto-battler. Collect, combine, and strategize with your monsters. The same-race monsters get powerful buffs, and monsters can fuse and evolve. Discover endless possibilities and build your ultimate squad!','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3141720/Monster_Battles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7644,'real_pool_3d_-_poolians',NULL,'Real Pool 3D (Poolians) is one of the best online pool games. Play against the computer or real players all over the world! It supports 8 different types of pool games and team play mode.','2019/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/670290/Real_Pool_3D__Poolians/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7645,'far_away',NULL,'Far Away is a visual novel full of dark humor depicting immersive storylines rather than romantic drama. You will play as Krosa, a typical girl who experiences gang conflicts, crimes, conspiracies, and family grudges in the port city of Bedjan.','2021/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1250760/Far_Away/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7646,'steel_division_2_-_blood_feud_in_transylvania',NULL,'This content requires the base game Steel Division 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1571580/Steel_Division_2__Blood_Feud_in_Transylvania/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7647,'boomerang_x',NULL,'Harness the power of a mystical boomerang to fling yourself through the air in this acrobatic arena shooter. Slice, fly, and blast through swarms of evil creatures on an abandoned island with a cryptic past. Stay agile or meet your doom.','2021/7/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1170060/Boomerang_X/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7648,'automobilista_2_-_racin´_usa_pack_pt3',NULL,'This content requires the base game Automobilista 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1648063/Automobilista_2__Racin_USA_Pack_Pt3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7649,'cat_detective_albert_wilde',NULL,'Play as the Cat Detective Albert Wilde. Walk, talk, interrogate, joke, solve a mystery, and experience an old film noir setting with humanoid animal characters. A story of quantum theory and parallel universes served with a lot of humour.','2025/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1810670/Cat_Detective_Albert_Wilde/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7650,'warplanes:_ww1_fighters',NULL,'Become a pilot! Immerse in WW1 aerial combat like never before in a captivating VR experience. Be a pilot during the Great War in Warplanes: WW1 Fighters. No matter whether you prefer arcade games or flight simulators – a variety of options will let you adjust the game to your preferences.','2021/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1546500/Warplanes_WW1_Fighters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7651,'dungeon\'s_legion',NULL,'You have been reincarnated as the Demon Lord in another world! Can you lead your forces to victory?','2023/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2287970/Dungeons_Legion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7652,'saiko_no_sutoka',NULL,'Saiko No Sutoka is a Horror Survival Game where you as a Protagonist must escape and avoid the crazy yandere girl who wants you dead.','2020/9/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1546860/Saiko_no_sutoka/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7653,'trine_3:_the_artifacts_of_power',NULL,'Trine 3: The Artifacts of Power is a platforming game of action, puzzles and adventure, and the sequel to the award winning Trine and Trine 2. Reunite with the three heroes in an all-new adventure, now for the first time in full 3D!','2015/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/319910/Trine_3_The_Artifacts_of_Power/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7654,'sonic_the_hedgehog_4_-_episode_ii',NULL,'The Sonic 4 Saga continues in Episode II with the return of a beloved side kick and fan-favorite villains! Following the events of Episode I, Metal Sonic has returned to form an alliance with Dr. Eggman! To face this new evil, Sonic will have to call upon an old friend to help him save the day!','2012/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/203650/Sonic_the_Hedgehog_4__Episode_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7655,'leisure_suit_larry_-_wet_dreams_don\'t_dry',NULL,'My new adventure takes me from the end of the ’80s directly into the 21st century and wow, how the world has changed! While my view of the world and women from way back in the 1980s collides with modern reality, I’m all set to date my way across the modern world!','2018/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/765870/Leisure_Suit_Larry__Wet_Dreams_Dont_Dry/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7656,'seum:_speedrunners_from_hell',NULL,'Like a bastard child of Quake 3 and Super Meat Boy, SEUM: Speedrunners from Hell is truly hardcore and focuses on speed and fast reaction.','2016/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/457210/SEUM_Speedrunners_from_Hell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7657,'the_sims™_4_cozy_bistro_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2782870/The_Sims_4_Cozy_Bistro_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7658,'payday_2:_hotline_miami',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2014/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/323500/PAYDAY_2_Hotline_Miami/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7659,'hero\'s_adventure_-_the_great_conquest',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hero\'s Adventure: Road to Passion on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2924120/Heros_Adventure__The_Great_Conquest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7660,'railway_empire_2_-_india',NULL,'This content requires the base game Railway Empire 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2677570/Railway_Empire_2__India/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7661,'supraland_crash',NULL,'This content requires the base game Supraland on Steam in order to play.','2020/7/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1093730/Supraland_Crash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7662,'fall_of_porcupine',NULL,'A pidgeon-doctor in a small town. A broken healthcare system. A heartfelt narrative game. Fall of Porcupine tells an emotional story about a young doctor who struggles to find his place. Accompany Finley in a lovingly illustrated world and uncover the darkest secrets of Porcupine.','2023/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1710540/Fall_of_Porcupine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7663,'vertigo_2:_into_the_aether',NULL,'This content requires the base game Vertigo 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3305800/Vertigo_2_Into_the_Aether/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7664,'fortify',NULL,'Fortify is a base designer for Rust. Quickly plan your base with lots of helpful tools and up to 3 other friends. See stability, raid durability and get a resource count with upkeep. Frequently updated with Rust changes and new features. Share designs with friends or on the steam workshop.','2016/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/505040/FORTIFY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7665,'shantae:_half-genie_hero_ultimate_edition',NULL,'The ultimate edition of Shantae: Half-Genie Hero comes with all of the previously released DLC, Modes, and Costumes in one epic collection!  Includes an exclusive Blue Bathing Suit for use in Beach Mode!','2018/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/764300/Shantae_HalfGenie_Hero_Ultimate_Edition/?snr=