onged to your father. Create recipes, cook the food and serve customers across an entire city. Customize and upgrade your food truck to reach more customers and expand your menu.','2022/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1160920/Food_Truck_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7673,'deathspank',NULL,'For uncounted years, DeathSpank has been a Dispenser of Justice, a Vanquisher of Evil, and a Hero to the Downtrodden.','2010/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/18040/DeathSpank/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7674,'momodora:_reverie_under_the_moonlight',NULL,'Momodora: Reverie Under The Moonlight is the fourth installment in the beloved Momodora series of 2D platformers. Unleash ravaging combos against a variety of formidable monsters and deftly dodge your way through a cursed land to seek audience with the Queen and dispel the evil that threatens all life.','2016/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/428550/Momodora_Reverie_Under_The_Moonlight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7675,'battlestar_galactica_deadlock:_ghost_fleet_offensive',NULL,'This content requires the base game Battlestar Galactica Deadlock on Steam in order to play.','2020/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1143820/Battlestar_Galactica_Deadlock_Ghost_Fleet_Offensive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7676,'what_the_dub?!',NULL,'What The Dub?! is a multiplayer party game where each player overdubs missing dialogue from hilariously awful B-movies, outdated PSAs, and bizarre industrial films, with their own witty (or just plain stupid) dubs!','2021/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1495860/What_The_Dub/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_162'),(7677,'jojo\'s_bizarre_adventure:_all-star_battle_r_-_wonder_of_u',NULL,'This content requires the base game JoJo\'s Bizarre Adventure: All-Star Battle R on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2382762/JoJos_Bizarre_Adventure_AllStar_Battle_R__Wonder_of_U/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_1