_it',NULL,'We\'ve made a calculator roguelike! Yes, it\'s not a joke. A boring device has turned into an interesting strategy, where each calculator you collect sets its own style of play. Can you count all the numbers and prove who\'s the king of calculations here?','2024/7/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3043740/Calculate_It/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7725,'super_fancy_pants_adventure',NULL,'Super Fancy Pants Adventure is a wild free-running adventure with buttery smooth platforming and a slick fountain pen!','2017/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/668210/Super_Fancy_Pants_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7726,'remote_reaper:_fpv_drone',NULL,'FPV drone simulator. Destroy enemy vehicles with high-precision strikes. Simulation of electronic warfare and realistic armor model.','2025/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3295810/Remote_Reaper_FPV_Drone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7727,'the_sims_3_70\'s,_80\'s_and_90\'s',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2013/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/223595/The_Sims_3_70s_80s_and_90s/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7728,'leximan',NULL,'Craft spells by combining floating fragments of words in Leximan, a whimsical adventure that uses creative wordplay to summon countless weird and wonderful solutions to puzzles. Alongside an awkward assembly of basement-wizards, save Academy Elementinia and become the hero nobody asked for!','2024/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2017200/Leximan/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7729,'star_trek™_:_25th_anniversary',NULL,'Beam aboard the USS Enterprise to join Captain Kirk and his intrepid crew in this classic adventure game. Eight original missions, each styled as episodes of an imagined fourth season of Star Trek: the Original Series, featuring the voice talents of the original actors!','2015/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/359650/Star_Trek__25th_Anniversary/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7730,'orwell:_ignorance_is_strength',NULL,'Step into the shoes of a government official in a top-secret department of the Orwell surveillance program. Given the power to both uncover and fabricate \"the truth\", how far will you go in the service of your country? Season 2 of Orwell, the award-winning surveillance thriller.','2018/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/633060/Orwell_Ignorance_is_Strength/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7731,'center_station_simulator',NULL,'Mine, farm, manufacture components and build a wide range of machines in an infinite basement. Forget primitive tasks thanks to automation! And sell your products to your customers! Build a parking, a gas station...','2024/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2823890/Center_Station_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7732,'the_25th_ward:_the_silver_case',NULL,'In the bayside area of Kanto, a murder with unknown motivations sets off a series of seemingly random events bringing together peculiar individuals, one of whom is detective Tokio Morishima. When their ambitions begin to collide, a truly shocking pattern emerges…','2018/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/697650/The_25th_Ward_The_Silver_Case/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7733,'fishing_planet:_golden_dragon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2018/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/730614/Fishing_Planet_Golden_Dragon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7734,'worlds_of_aria',NULL,'Lead your own DnD-like adventuring party on an epic adventure narrated by Laura Bailey. Invite your friends for free to the group with the Friends Pass, or strike out on your own. Cooperation, betrayal, and the luck of the dice… what wild escapades will you and your teammates get up to?','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1866980/Worlds_of_Aria/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7735,'creed:_rise_to_glory™',NULL,'You are Adonis Creed, fighting toe-to-toe with the world’s top opponents to establish your boxing legacy. This intense cinematic experience features new Phantom Melee Technology for impactful VR melee combat so you can train, fight, and win like Creed.','2018/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/804490/Creed_Rise_to_Glory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7736,'costume_quest_2',NULL,'A sequel to the popular Halloween adventure from Double Fine Productions!','2014/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/275180/Costume_Quest_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7737,'anomaly_collapse',NULL,'Command a squad of adorably fierce warriors in Anomaly Collapse, a turn-based Roguelite strategy game that offers a fresh twist to an old formula! Face off against otherworldly beings and uncover the dark secrets of supernatural calamities. Immerse yourself in a story where every move counts!','2024/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2082410/Anomaly_Collapse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7738,'desk_garden',NULL,'Relax and grow! A laid-back idle game where you nurture mysterious plants (some even human-like!), watch them flourish, then sell them to expand your magical garden. Design your own unique oasis at your own pace.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3575790/Desk_Garden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7739,'dcs:_ch-47f',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2943690/DCS_CH47F/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7740,'surmount:_a_mountain_climbing_adventure',NULL,'Fling yourself into a mountain climbing adventure! Become the first to reach the top of the highest mountain in the world and meet eccentric characters along the way!','2024/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1675000/Surmount_A_Mountain_Climbing_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7741,'sudden_strike_4_-_africa:_desert_war',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sudden Strike 4 on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/873870/Sudden_Strike_4__Africa_Desert_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7742,'re:zero_-starting_life_in_another_world-_the_prophecy_of_the_throne',NULL,'Enjoy a new Re:ZERO storyline, fully supervised by the series author Tappei Nagatsuki! Featuring brand new characters designed by the original artist Shinichirou Otsuka as well as your favorites from the series!','2021/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1277510/ReZERO_Starting_Life_in_Another_World_The_Prophecy_of_the_Throne/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7743,'​our_life:_beginnings_&_always_-_step_1_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Our Life: Beginnings & Always on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1464060/Our_Life_Beginnings__Always__Step_1_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7744,'platina_::_lab',NULL,'A new rhythm game featuring innovative characters inspired by databases! Join the research of PLATiNA :: LAB to uncover the secrets of the locked data world as a special \'Decoder\' with unique abilities.','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3430470/PLATiNA__LAB/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7745,'fireside_feelings',NULL,'Share your thoughts and discover those shared by others, in Fireside Feelings. Gather around the welcoming warmth of the campfire and take part in conversations between real people separated in space and time. Sometimes, we all need a good talk under the stars.','2025/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2990600/Fireside_Feelings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7746,'the_escapists:_the_walking_dead',NULL,'Merging the smash hit indie game The Escapists with the world wide phenomenon that is The Walking Dead, Team17 have taken the very best of both worlds and are now providing players with the opportunity to play Rick Grimes as he takes on hordes of zombies let loose upon the world.','2015/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/388060/The_Escapists_The_Walking_Dead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7747,'crime_boss:_rockay_city_-_dragon\'s_gold_cup',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crime Boss: Rockay City on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2934450/Crime_Boss_Rockay_City__Dragons_Gold_Cup/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7748,'shank',NULL,'Shank is the cult-classic revival of the sidescrolling beat-em-up. Play as Shank in an over-the-top grindhouse game, packed to the rim with enemies, bosses, combos, and more by the award-winning team at Klei Entertainment.','2010/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6120/Shank/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7749,'mordheim:_city_of_the_damned_-_witch_hunters',NULL,'This content requires the base game Mordheim: City of the Damned on Steam in order to play.','2016/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/450812/Mordheim_City_of_the_Damned__Witch_Hunters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7750,'batman™:_arkham_origins_blackgate_-_deluxe_edition',NULL,'A companion game to Batman: Arkham Origins, players can continue the storyline of the console version and discover more details of the Dark Knight’s past.','2014/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/267490/Batman_Arkham_Origins_Blackgate__Deluxe_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7751,'pile_up!',NULL,'\"Pile Up!\" is a strategic building game which you need to build houses, fulfill your people’s requests and manage your risky buildings in different ways on a small land. But don’t let your guard down in this chill environment, we only get you relaxed so you destroy everything you did.','2023/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2094910/Pile_Up/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7752,'vail_vr',NULL,'Download now and explore VAIL’s free-to-play Citadel. Discover why VAIL is the highest rated VR Shooter with best-in-class mechanics, precisely tuned interactions, and immersive physics systems.','2024/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/801550/VAIL_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7753,'9-nine-:episode_3',NULL,'9-nine-: Episode 3 is the latest chapter in this series of supernatural mystery visual novels with the focus now shifted towards a new heroine, Haruka Kosaka.','2020/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1142830/9nineEpisode_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7754,'spell_disk',NULL,'Build unique synergy spell combos to destroy the hordes of monsters and bosses in this rogue-lite action game.','2024/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2292060/Spell_Disk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7755,'reflection',NULL,'You woke up in some basement and don\'t remember who you are or how you ended up here... But what you do know is that you need to get out of here...','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3668080/Reflection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7756,'bejeweled_2_deluxe',NULL,'With awe-inspiring planetary backdrops, explosive new gems and dazzling special effects, Bejeweled 2 is more wildly addictive than ever before.','2006/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3300/Bejeweled_2_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7757,'sphinx_and_the_cursed_mummy',NULL,'Sphinx and the Cursed Mummy is an original 3rd person action-adventure inspired by the mythology of ancient Egypt. Travelling the world via magical portals to foil the evil plans of Set. Sphinx\'s journey will require all his wits, agility, and special powers.','2003/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/606710/Sphinx_and_the_Cursed_Mummy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7758,'unknown_tapes',NULL,'You are the prey. Unknown Tapes is a horror video game that employs the found footage technique to narrate a story focused on survival in a modern setting overrun by dinosaurs. It aims for realism and draws inspiration from Dino Crisis and Outlast.','2024/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2785200/Unknown_Tapes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7759,'kinkoi:_golden_time',NULL,'Welcome to Noble Private Academy, an institution that cultivates the wealthiest, most well-connected students in all of Japan! At this boarding school, one must be willing to accept all of its refined and dignified teachings or be met with strict opposition!','2022/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1985260/Kinkoi_Golden_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7760,'caesar™_iv',NULL,'Starting as governor of a newly formed province in the Roman Empire your goal is simple: advance up the empire\'s political ladder to become the next Caesar.','2006/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/517810/Caesar_IV/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7761,'gemcraft_-_frostborn_wrath',NULL,'The epic tower defense dark fantasy journey continues! Create powerful gems with various abilities and take on the battle against an endlessly flowing army of monsters, and face the growing darkness as you fight your way back towards the Spiritforge.','2020/1/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1106530/GemCraft__Frostborn_Wrath/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7762,'from_madness_with_love',NULL,'This is a dating sim with guys you will never be on the same page with! For some reason, you just can\'t communicate with the guy you like... An unusual yet extraordinary experience with a cute pixel art style, fully voiced in Japanese.','2023/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2101130/From_Madness_with_Love/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7763,'fable_anniversary_-_heroes_and_villains_content_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fable Anniversary on Steam in order to play.','2014/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/315151/Fable_Anniversary__Heroes_and_Villains_Content_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7764,'generation_zero®_-_eastern_european_weapons_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Generation Zero® on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2200740/Generation_Zero__Eastern_European_Weapons_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7765,'arx_fatalis',NULL,'This critically acclaimed first-person RPG from Arkane Studios takes the player on an amazing journey into the fantasy world of Arx. Arx is wrought with turmoil, brought to the brink of destruction by a violent war.','2002/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1700/Arx_Fatalis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7766,'revita',NULL,'In this fast paced twin-stick roguelite platformer, you play as an unnamed child ascending an ominous clocktower in pursuit of their lost memories. Harvest and sacrifice souls to grow your power in order to challenge procedural encounter rooms and intimidating bosses!','2022/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1175460/Revita/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7767,'star_wars_outlaws:_wild_card_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Star Wars Outlaws on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3271130/Star_Wars_Outlaws_Wild_Card_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7768,'pro_wrestler_story',NULL,'Pro Wrestling Team Management Sim, Face off with fearsome foes!','2025/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3334710/Pro_Wrestler_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7769,'phantom_abyss',NULL,'Phantom Abyss is a massive asynchronous multiplayer game that casts players into procedurally-generated temples and tasks them with retrieving the sacred relics hidden within deadly chambers.','2024/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/989440/Phantom_Abyss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7770,'last_day_of_june',NULL,'A deep, interactive adventure about love and loss, beautifully depicted and offering an intense cinematic experience. What would you do to save the one you love?','2017/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/635320/Last_Day_of_June/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_164'),(7771,'call_of_duty®:_modern_warfare®_iii_-_tracer_pack:_underboss_pro_pack',NULL,'This content requires one of the following products to play:','2024/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2790710/Call_of_Duty_Modern_Warfare_III__Tracer_Pack_Underboss_Pro_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7772,'fishing_planet:_sport_heavy_casting_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2016/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/423363/Fishing_Planet_Sport_Heavy_Casting_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7773,'ultra_mega_cats',NULL,'Blast your way through hordes of enemies in Ultra Mega Cats, a cooperative roguelike third-person shooter. Play As one of the Mega Cats, armed to the fangs with a wide variety of abilities and escape captivity from your Rodent and Bird Overlords!','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1882130/Ultra_Mega_Cats/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7774,'zombie_night_terror',NULL,'Prepare yourself for the most thrilling night of your life! Something strange has happened and people everywhere are turning into blood thirsty walking corpses. But guess who’s the brains behind this hungry undead army? YOU! So spread this pandemic and wipe humanity off the planet.','2016/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/416680/Zombie_Night_Terror/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7775,'monica\'s_newlywed_life',NULL,'Monica has married her childhood sweetheart and is now settling in the city with her new family. But it\'s going to take one million gold to buy her citizenship! Work odd jobs and fight monsters to make enough gold before time runs out!','2024/9/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2350310/Monicas_Newlywed_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7776,'massacre_at_the_mirage',NULL,'For less than the price of a movie ticket, experience your very own horror-fueled slasher flick in Massacre at the Mirage. Step into The Mirage cinema and face a chilling nightmare, where staff and patrons must survive a masked killer\'s rampage.','2024/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2794610/Massacre_At_The_Mirage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7777,'the_elder_scrolls_adventures:_redguard',NULL,'ONE MAN AGAINST AN EMPIRE','2022/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1812410/The_Elder_Scrolls_Adventures_Redguard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7778,'eastside_hockey_manager',NULL,'EHM offers fans the most realistic, in-depth and immersive simulation of hockey management available, giving them the chance to manage either club or country in any of the world’s top hockey-playing nations.','2015/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/301120/Eastside_Hockey_Manager/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7779,'penumbra_overture',NULL,'Penumbra: Overture is a first person survival horror game, emphasizing on survival and problem solving instead of mindless violence and gore.','2007/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/22180/Penumbra_Overture/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7780,'no_plan_b',NULL,'Carefully plan your team\'s tactics in close quarters battles. Use the timeline to synchronize each door breach, grenade throw and room entry with precision. Watch your team execute your plan autonomously in epic cinematic replays. Take on challenging roguelike campaigns or standalone missions.','2024/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1269020/No_Plan_B/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7781,'uncharted_waters_origin',NULL,'Commemorating 30 years of the Uncharted Waters seriesSail through the vast oceans, massive worlds and contentsOpen world exploration RPG Uncharted Waters Origin','2023/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1574360/Uncharted_Waters_Origin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7782,'breakout_13',NULL,'Breakout 13 is a thrilling narrative game with interactive cinematic experience. Based on true stories. Embark on a revealing journey as you attempt to break free from a negligent correctional institute and carve out your own path to justice. Each decision you make shapes the story.','2023/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2095300/Breakout_13/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7783,'red_faction®:_armageddon™',NULL,'Red Faction: Armageddon Path to War includes 4 new missions, 2 unlockable items and 10 new achievements!','2011/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/55110/Red_Faction_Armageddon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7784,'ring_of_pain',NULL,'Enter the Ring of Pain, a roguelike card crawler where encounters come to you. Each step around the ring a dire decision. Go for the loot or backstab a creeping horror? Meet strange friends bearing gifts and treasure. Choose your gear wisely to survive and discover the secrets of the Ring of Pain.','2020/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/998740/Ring_of_Pain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7785,'garden_paws',NULL,'You have inherited your grandparents farm as they set off to travel the world. Work with Frank at the local construction shop to finish off the final touches on your new home. Aid Frank and Mayor Wilson in building up the town so it may reach it\'s full potential.','2018/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/840010/Garden_Paws/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7786,'disc_creatures',NULL,'Humans live alongside creatures, each with different personalities, abilities, and moral codes. The invention of the DiscKid has changed life for everyone. Humans can copy creatures and use their power to help others and solve mysteries around the world.','2019/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1083190/Disc_Creatures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7787,'templar_battleforce',NULL,'An addictive mix of strategic combat and army building, with the precision of an RPG. Design your squad members\' exact build of equipment and talents to create unique fireteam combinations. Step into the pilot suit of a Leviathan mech, lead the Templar Knights in turn-based tactical warfare.','2015/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/370020/Templar_Battleforce/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7788,'farming_simulator_22_-_premium_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Farming Simulator 22 on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2243200/Farming_Simulator_22__Premium_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7789,'veritus',NULL,'Unshroud secrets hidden deep within the dark chambers of the god of shadow, Veritus’ castle. Persevere through monsters and mysteries lurking in every corner. Prepare to leave camp and journey into the castle’s lonely halls by collecting resources and equipment to make it out alive.','2024/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2513580/Veritus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7790,'airships:_lost_flotilla',NULL,'Airships: Lost Flotilla is a steampunk autoshooter where you fight your way through waves of enemies on your way to a safe harbour. Destroy your foes, harvest wreckage, and upgrade your ship.','2025/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2858150/Airships_Lost_Flotilla/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7791,'taisho_x_alice_episode_1',NULL,'DUALICE(TAISHO x ALICE episodeI) is a fairytale visual novel in which YOU must save your Prince Charming! You will take on the role of the fairytale heroine in order to rehabilitate your chosen love interest and guide him to his \"happily ever after\"!','2019/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1056570/TAISHO_x_ALICE_episode_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7792,'just_act_natural',NULL,'Just Act Natural is a hand-crafted online party game where players must hide among NPC characters to avoid detection from the seeker. Compete against your friends in a variety of game modes over a course of different rounds to be crowned the winner!','2022/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1485080/Just_Act_Natural/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7793,'factory_town_idle',NULL,'An entire town builder experience packed into a living spreadsheet. Build housing, assign workers, then craft and sell a huge variety of items to level up your town and expand your civilization across the world!','2024/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2207490/Factory_Town_Idle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7794,'remnant_ii®_-_the_forgotten_kingdom',NULL,'This content requires the base game REMNANT II® on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2384074/Remnant_II__The_Forgotten_Kingdom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7795,'dream_life_in_the_country_side',NULL,'A laid-back farming simulator where you play as Lisa, a dedicated farmer by day and a passionate partner of Honoka at night. Work the land, raise animals, and cultivate your relationship. Unlock special scenes as your bond and farm flourish.','2025/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3442040/Dream_Life_in_the_Country_Side/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7796,'way_of_the_hunter_-_bear_archery_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Way of the Hunter on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3091580/Way_of_the_Hunter__Bear_Archery_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7797,'boxville_2',NULL,'Boxville 2 continues the adventure of cans living in a box city. Two friends were setting up fireworks for the city celebration, but a mistake caused chaos and one friend went missing. Now our hero must explore Boxville and beyond to fix everything and find his friend.','2025/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3131280/Boxville_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7798,'hell_pie',NULL,'Hell Pie is an obscene 3D platformer that takes bad taste to the next level! Hell Pie sees you grab the horns of Nate, the ‘Demon of Bad Taste’. He is given the honorable task of gathering the disgusting ingredients for Satan’s infamous birthday pie!','2022/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/889910/Hell_Pie/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7799,'townsmen_vr',NULL,'Townsmen VR uses the exciting possibilities of virtual reality to further enhance the classic city building game with entirely new gameplay experiences and interactive mechanics. It combines elements of a God-game simulation and a classic building game with the interactive possibilities of VR.','2022/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/749960/Townsmen_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7800,'kingdom_come:_deliverance_–_the_amorous_adventures_of_bold_sir_hans_capon',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Come: Deliverance on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/921950/Kingdom_Come_Deliverance__The_Amorous_Adventures_of_Bold_Sir_Hans_Capon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7801,'check_inn',NULL,'Build hotels, accommodate guests and expand your hotel business throughout the world!','2025/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2741390/Check_Inn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7802,'digdigdrill',NULL,'DigDigDrill is an underground mining and resource collecting game. Dig freely for minerals and treasures. Use the items you collect to forge your original drills in a hack-and-slash style equipment system.','2024/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2916770/DigDigDrill/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7803,'witchhand',NULL,'You\'re a witch, leading your coven into new, unfriendly lands. Use the cards you find to build and expand your civilization. Befriend the local covens or use their bones to fuel your spells. Gather your familiars, the witching hour is nigh.','2024/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2420880/WitchHand/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7804,'payday_2:_the_butcher\'s_bbq_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2015/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/358150/PAYDAY_2_The_Butchers_BBQ_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7805,'meet_your_maker',NULL,'Meet Your Maker is a building game of brutal expression and conquest. Unleash your inner evil genius in co-op or single-player to build the ultimate fortress of devious deathtraps, or take on those built by others in a high-stakes heist to steal resources essential for your survival.','2023/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1194810/Meet_Your_Maker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7806,'9_childs_street',NULL,'This is a first-person indie horror game. In 9 Childs Street you will find the terrifying atmosphere of a recently abandoned house, and its captive inhabitants, through the eyes of a curious little boy in a red cap.','2023/2/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1895890/9_Childs_Street/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7807,'zombie_exodus:_safe_haven',NULL,'Zombies rise again at the dawn of Apocalypse! In this companion to the smash-hit Zombie Exodus, can you survive the early days of society\'s collapse?','2016/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/543980/Zombie_Exodus_Safe_Haven/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7808,'hakuoki:_kyoto_winds',NULL,'Romance 12 handsome warriors and the samurai of the Shinsengumi, uncover their dark secrets, and conquer your demons in this historical fantasy visual novel! Your narrative choices unlock multiple branching storylines and 30 different endings!','2017/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/589530/Hakuoki_Kyoto_Winds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7809,'titanic_vr',NULL,'Witness the sinking of RMS Titanic. Explore the shipwreck. Titanic VR is a diving simulator and immersive interactive story. With over 6 hours of game-play Titanic VR you will leave with a greater understanding of the historic tragedy that unfolded in 1912.','2018/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/741430/Titanic_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7810,'reassembly',NULL,'A spaceship building and universe-exploration game. Collect resources, expand and grow your fleet, and conquer your personal galaxy. Stellar ambience by Peaks.','2015/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/329130/Reassembly/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7811,'deathless._the_hero_quest',NULL,'In Deathless, elements of a collectible card game, roguelike, and turn-based strategy combine seamlessly. Build a unique deck of cards, discover unusual relics, and defeat legendary bosses. No two journeys will ever be the same with endless Path. Crush the Evil and save the world!','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2727210/Deathless_The_Hero_Quest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7812,'tom_clancy\'s_rainbow_six®_siege_-_cyan_weapon_skin',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six® Siege X on Steam in order to play.','2016/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/455572/Tom_Clancys_Rainbow_Six_Siege__Cyan_Weapon_Skin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7813,'endzone_-_a_world_apart:_prosperity',NULL,'This content requires the base game Endzone - A World Apart on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1632320/Endzone__A_World_Apart_Prosperity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7814,'comedy_night',NULL,'Tell jokes, sing songs, make friends or heckle. Comedy Night captures the fun experience of a real comedy club.','2017/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/665360/Comedy_Night/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7815,'mxgp_2020_-_the_official_motocross_videogame',NULL,'The official videogame of the Motocross Championship is back! Jump onto your bike and let the adrenaline rise with this new gaming experience. Take control: discover what\'s new in the official series.','2020/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1259800/MXGP_2020__The_Official_Motocross_Videogame/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7816,'beat_cop',NULL,'A retro, pixel art style adventure in New York, inspired by ’80s cop shows. You are Jack Kelly and you’ve been framed for murder. Now as a regular beat cop you have to find out, who did that. Expect thick crime story, a lot of black humour and all the other things you can find on the streets of Brooklyn.','2017/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/461950/Beat_Cop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_165'),(7817,'our_life:_beginnings_&_always_-_derek\'s_story',NULL,'This content requires the base game Our Life: Beginnings & Always on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2015100/Our_Life_Beginnings__Always__Dereks_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7818,'it_lurks_below',NULL,'It Lurks Below is an action-oriented, survival RPG in a randomly generated world. Fight through the massive underground dungeon, customize your character with random items and find out what evil lurks below.','2019/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/697550/It_Lurks_Below/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7819,'chill_town',NULL,'A unique blend of a Soothing Simulation and an Idle Game with Music, Decoration, Fishing, Cooking, Farming and more...','2025/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1940200/Chill_Town/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7820,'rebel_fury',NULL,'Rebel Fury is a digital implementation of the wargame published by GMT Games and designed by Mark Herman.','2025/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3072160/Rebel_Fury/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7821,'the_longest_journey',NULL,'The Longest Journey is an amazing graphical adventure, where the player controls the protagonist, April Ryan, on her journey between parallel universes.','2000/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/6310/The_Longest_Journey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7822,'mushroom_season',NULL,'Dive into Mushroom Season! Customize your character, explore lush forests, and compete in thrilling mushroom picking contest. Identify mushrooms, avoid the poisonous ones, and aim for the top trophy. Are you the ultimate forager?','2024/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3064670/Mushroom_Season/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7823,'golden_light',NULL,'Eat weapons, be scared and question your own mind in this Survival-Horror FPS Prop Hunt Roguelike about meat. Walls are watching you!','2022/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1245430/Golden_Light/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7824,'through_the_ages',NULL,'Legendary board game classic from award winning designer Vlaada Chvátil','2018/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/758370/Through_the_Ages/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7825,'mx_vs_atv_all_out',NULL,'All Terrain, All Vehicles, All You! MX vs ATV All Out is the complete off-road racing and lifestyle experience! Find your Rider Style at your private compound, Free Ride across massive environments, and compete in the best series events!','2018/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/520940/MX_vs_ATV_All_Out/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7826,'kong:_survivor_instinct',NULL,'When giant monsters fight, no one’s safe. Embark on a thrilling quest of survival in a city that’s become a battleground for Titans. Use the lethal strength of Kong and other monsters to your own advantage in this official Monsterverse game set shortly after the events of Godzilla vs. Kong.','2024/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2769080/Kong_Survivor_Instinct/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7827,'payday_2:_wolf_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2016/2/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/441600/PAYDAY_2_Wolf_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7828,'taimanin_yukikaze',NULL,'A classic visual novel about a demon-slaying ninja. Yukikaze is an up-and-coming young Taimanin with a suite of deadly lightning powers, but when she embarks on a mission to rescue her missing mother, she just might have bitten off more than she can chew...','2024/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2739700/Taimanin_Yukikaze/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7829,'the_sims™_4_my_wedding_stories_game_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2022/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1621460/The_Sims_4_My_Wedding_Stories_Game_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7830,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_the_son_of_gunpowder',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2430650/Hunt_Showdown_1896__The_Son_of_Gunpowder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7831,'superflight',NULL,'Superflight is an intense, easy to learn wingsuit game with an infinite number of beautiful procedurally generated maps. A great game to relax for half an hour and chase your latest highscore!','2017/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/732430/Superflight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7832,'dragon_ball_xenoverse_2_-_legend_patrol_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2023140/DRAGON_BALL_XENOVERSE_2__Legend_Patrol_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7833,'fishing_paradiso',NULL,'Embark on a relaxing tropical adventure in this cozy fishing RPG! Explore wondrous locations and befriend a charming cast of characters on your quest to become a master angler and discover the true meaning of paradise!','2022/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1781030/Fishing_Paradiso/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7834,'skill_legends_royale',NULL,'This is a free multiplayer PvP strategy game that incorporates rogue-like and auto chess elements, players need to equip their auto-battling heroes with the right treasures and skills to ultimately defeat all other players and become the champion.','2024/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3114410/Skill_Legends_Royale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7835,'endless_atc',NULL,'Endless ATC is a realistic air traffic control simulator with a simple, easy to use interface. The goal is to guide as many planes as possible safely to the runways. Find out how many flights you can manage to control!','2015/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/666610/Endless_ATC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7836,'space_hulk:_tactics',NULL,'Space Hulk: Tactics is a faithful adaptation of the board game Space Hulk, set in the Warhammer 40,000 universe, bringing a unique twist to the cult classic formula. Engage in bloody battles as either a squad of Terminator Space Marines or the deadly alien Genestealers.','2018/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/492230/Space_Hulk_Tactics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7837,'ao_tennis_2',NULL,'AO Tennis 2 is the only tennis experience designed for and by its community. Create your own players, stadiums and legendary matches. Enter the competition to reach the top of world tennis in Career Mode.','2020/1/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1072500/AO_Tennis_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7838,'cooking_simulator_-_shelter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cooking Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1575660/Cooking_Simulator__Shelter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7839,'#blud',NULL,'Save your friends, fight off the vampire apocalypse, and survive the horrors of freshman field hockey practice in #BLUD, a delightfully zany animated dungeon crawler that blurs the line between action RPGs and hyperkinetic 90s cartoons.','2024/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1921480/BLUD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7840,'needy_streamer_overload:_typing_of_the_net',NULL,'\"NEEDY STREAMER OVERLOAD: Typing of The Net\" is a typing game in which you enter internet lingo in a call-and-response format with a girl (OMGkawaiiAngel) who has a strong need for approval.','2025/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3215170/NEEDY_STREAMER_OVERLOAD_Typing_of_The_Net/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7841,'sky_force_anniversary',NULL,'Legendary shoot-\'em-up makes its way on the PCs! Abundant explosions, truly epic boss fights and beautifully crafted 3D environments are here to keep you entertained. Sky Force Anniversary offers single player experience and local cooperative mode for 2 players.','2015/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/355050/Sky_Force_Anniversary/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7842,'alien:_isolation_-_the_trigger',NULL,'This content requires the base game Alien: Isolation on Steam in order to play.','2015/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/282516/Alien_Isolation__The_Trigger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7843,'sorry!_i_surrounded_beauty!',NULL,'You embody Chen Mo, embark on a romantic journey through a first-person perspective. Throughout your interactions with different girls, you must navigate divergent choices, confront critical challenges, and gradually unravel the hidden truths woven into the story’s core.','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3193670/Sorry_I_surrounded_beauty/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7844,'risen_3_-_titan_lords',NULL,'The world has been abandoned by its gods and is scarred from the rampage of the Titans. Humanity is struggling to regain strength. You, however, have more pressing concerns: your own life has been shattered and you must set off to reclaim what is lost amidst the darkness spreading throughout the world.','2014/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/249230/Risen_3__Titan_Lords/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7845,'walking_zombie_2',NULL,'Zombie singleplayer shooter in modern polygon graphics with rich RPG elements.','2019/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/965200/Walking_Zombie_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7846,'ozmafia!!',NULL,'Once upon a time, a girl, her pet dog, and three companions made a journey to meet a great wizard who could grant their wishes. But what if the girl hadn’t believed that “there’s no place like home”? Explore a fairytale world through a dozen routes and 20+ endings!','2016/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/303290/OZMAFIA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7847,'gedonia',NULL,'Gedonia is a classic open world rpg, featuring a complete freedom of building your character, exploring a huge world and completing quests.','2022/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1114220/Gedonia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7848,'holdfast:_nations_at_war_-_grenadier_regiments',NULL,'This content requires the base game Holdfast: Nations At War on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2107250/Holdfast_Nations_At_War__Grenadier_Regiments/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7849,'backrooms_society',NULL,'Backrooms Society is a 1-8 player co-op horror game. Make your way through unique levels of the backrooms while trying to survive and avoid mysterious entities. Scavenge each level for gear and resources, bring it back to The Hub where you can sell valuables and buy/craft new gear.','2023/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2304620/Backrooms_Society/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7850,'cities:_skylines_-_concerts',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2017/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/614581/Cities_Skylines__Concerts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7851,'cheaters_cheetah',NULL,'Everyone will be given ACTUAL CHEATS in this multiplayer shooter. Use wallhacks and aimbots to your advantage and dominate the other cheetahs. The winner will get to BAN all losers!','2025/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3438990/Cheaters_Cheetah/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7852,'thunder_helix',NULL,'Pilot deadly helicopter gunships, battle enemy forces and complete dangerous missions within a thrilling desert warzone!','2024/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1906230/Thunder_Helix/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7853,'battlegroupvr',NULL,'BattleGroupVR is a first person real-time space strategy where you lead a fleet of powerful warships into battle from the bridge of your own flagship. Assemble your fleet, upgrade your load-outs, train your captains, engage the enemy and secure the sector. Try not to go down with the ship.','2023/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1178780/BattleGroupVR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7854,'nuclear_war_simulator',NULL,'Nuclear war simulator is a detailed realistic simulation and visualization of large-scale nuclear conflicts with a focus on humanitarian consequences. It lets you design conflict scenarios and estimate the consequences using a population density map and realistic weapons effects.','2023/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1603940/Nuclear_War_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7855,'evoland_legendary_edition',NULL,'Evoland Legendary Edition brings you two great and unique RPGs, with their graphic style and gameplay changing as you progress through the game!','2019/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1020470/Evoland_Legendary_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7856,'payday_2:_tailor_pack_1',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1184410/PAYDAY_2_Tailor_Pack_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7857,'dmc_devil_may_cry:_costume_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DmC: Devil May Cry on Steam in order to play.','2013/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/223790/DmC_Devil_May_Cry_Costume_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7858,'tasty_planet_forever',NULL,'Bigger. Better. Tastier.','2018/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/946010/Tasty_Planet_Forever/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7859,'starground',NULL,'Build a formidable factory and go dungeoning alone or with friends. Solve logic puzzles and automate resource collection and crafting, or venture into dungeons filled with dangers and rewards. Find your own ideal gameplay balance, as any unique path will advance the story!','2024/8/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2793380/Starground/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7860,'glass_masquerade_2:_illusions',NULL,'Welcome to the Glass Masquerade sequel - an artistic puzzle game inspired by stained glass artisans and Wonderland depictions of the 20th century. You need to combine hidden glass pieces to solve every riddle and free yourself from a tangled dream.','2019/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/935880/Glass_Masquerade_2_Illusions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7861,'brokenlore:_low',NULL,'BrokenLore: LOW is a psychological horror game set in a mist-covered, beautiful Japanese village, blending hyper-realistic graphics with low-poly elements. The main enemy is the Gashadokuro, a yokai from Japanese folklore.','2025/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3014520/BrokenLore_LOW/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7862,'american_truck_simulator_-_space_paint_jobs_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2019/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1116310/American_Truck_Simulator__Space_Paint_Jobs_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7863,'voodoo_vince:_remastered',NULL,'The classic character platformer is back after 13 years and newly remastered! Help Vince run, jump and fight his way through cemeteries, swamps and an evil carnival as he seeks to save his creator Madam Charmaine from the clutches of Kosmo The Inscrutable.','2017/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/545980/Voodoo_Vince_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_166'),(7864,'alien:_isolation_-_lost_contact',NULL,'This content requires the base game Alien: Isolation on Steam in order to play.','2015/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/282515/Alien_Isolation__Lost_Contact/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7865,'aeruta',NULL,'A bread revolution across the world now begins! Aeruta is a side-scrolling action game with a shop management twist, fight monsters for materials and use them to make breads, then finally make the deserted town popular again!','2024/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2286780/Aeruta/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7866,'alien_breed_2:_assault',NULL,'Can you survive the alien onslaught? Gamers across the world will now have a chance to play the next chapter in this high-budget, high-quality series.','2010/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/22650/Alien_Breed_2_Assault/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7867,'sunday_gold',NULL,'Sunday Gold is a point-and-click, turn-based adventure game set in grim, dystopian future. Play as a ragtag trio of criminals to hunt down and expose the dark secrets of an evil mega-corporation and the malevolent billionaire behind it.','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1969440/Sunday_Gold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7868,'word_factori',NULL,'Word Factori is a word-building game where your only resource is the letter \"i\". Build a chain of factories to bend, rotate, reflect, and merge \"i\" into more complex letters. Discover secret letter recipes, unlock hidden word art, and optimize your factory chains for high scores.','2023/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2072840/Word_Factori/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7869,'warriors_all-stars',NULL,'A battle of heroes where everyone is the lead! The very first all-stars title for Koei Tecmo! For the first time in Warriors series, flashy action combines both the traits of the original series and new exiting elements such as “Musou Rush”, open scenarios and multiple endings!','2017/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/610190/WARRIORS_ALLSTARS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7870,'botanicula',NULL,'Humor-filled indie adventure game created by the makers of Machinarium and Samorost.','2012/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/207690/Botanicula/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7871,'surviving_mars:_space_race',NULL,'This content requires the base game Surviving Mars on Steam in order to play.','2018/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/801670/Surviving_Mars_Space_Race/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7872,'patch_quest',NULL,'In a labyrinth surrounded by vicious monsters, Explorers must rely on their Lasso to survive! Capture and tame ANY monster to leap, glide, surf, tunnel and websling through a treacherous, patchwork maze. This roguelike/metroidvania seems cute, but it’s a deceptively difficult bullet-hell challenge!','2023/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1347970/Patch_Quest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7873,'tom_clancy\'s_rainbow_six®_siege_-_cobalt_weapon_skin',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six® Siege X on Steam in order to play.','2016/2/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/417464/Tom_Clancys_Rainbow_Six_Siege__Cobalt_Weapon_Skin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7874,'human_fast_food',NULL,'A cooking simulator where you run an underground fast food for monsters and serve them with human meat. Improve your kitchen appliances, unlock new recipes, manage your stock and keep the monsters well fed.','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3281090/Human_Fast_Food/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7875,'dark_fairy_tale:_dreamland_survivors',NULL,'This is a top-down, auto-shooting roguelike that can be played entirely one-handed. Players take on the role of Pinocchio, fallen into a nightmare, collecting forbidden Dream Eggs that grant ever-changing offensive and survival abilities. Slay twisted fairy tale creatures in endless nightmares!','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3288300/Dark_Fairy_Tale_Dreamland_Survivors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7876,'space_wreck',NULL,'The biggest little RPG in the world. Post-apocalyptic retro space adventure with an extreme focus on role-playing and replayability. Inch wide, miles deep - intentionally short yet surprisingly deep.','2023/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1063540/Space_Wreck/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7877,'mars_vice',NULL,'Mars Vice is a narrative adventure game set on a distant and futuristic Mars. Follow two civil investigators, Dax and Anaya, as they root out deep-seated corruption in the Martian city of Pavonis in this biopunk-infused story.','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1886910/Mars_Vice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7878,'darksiders_genesis_-_digital_extras',NULL,'This content requires the base game Darksiders Genesis on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1203440/Darksiders_Genesis__Digital_Extras/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7879,'hell_let_loose_-_oak_leaf',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hell Let Loose on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2885540/Hell_Let_Loose__Oak_Leaf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7880,'candy_&_toys_store_simulator',NULL,'Run your own candy and toys store. Place online orders for supplies, receive them via delivery truck, stock shelves, hire employees, set prices, take payments, expand, and design your store. Many things are waiting for you.','2024/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3013700/Candy__Toys_Store_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7881,'worms_crazy_golf',NULL,'Worms™ Crazy Golf is a hilarious mixture of the explosive action of Worms™ and the puzzle-based challenges of crazy golf! All of the trademark Worms™ humour, comic violence, and cartoon visuals are present, combined with addictive yet accessible golf gameplay.','2011/10/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/70620/Worms_Crazy_Golf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7882,'broken_reality',NULL,'A humorous adventure set in a 3D parody of the internet. Diverse puzzles, beautiful worlds, friends, experiences, upgrades and more, await those who \'log on\'!','2018/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/757480/Broken_Reality/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7883,'amazing_cultivation_simulator_-_deep_in_the_bamboo_forest',NULL,'This content requires the base game Amazing Cultivation Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1446730/Amazing_Cultivation_Simulator__Deep_in_the_bamboo_Forest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7884,'the_sims™_4_basement_treasures_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2167331/The_Sims_4_Basement_Treasures_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7885,'your_mother',NULL,'《Your Mother》is a computer desktop companion. Experience the love and kindness from mothers.','2025/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3399950/Your_Mother/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7886,'ghost_song',NULL,'On the desolate moon of Lorian, a long-dormant Deadsuit awakens from slumber. Journey beneath the surface on an atmospheric 2D adventure of self-discovery, ancient mysteries, and cosmic terror. Explore winding caverns and acquire new abilities to unearth this alien world’s long-buried secrets.','2022/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/347800/Ghost_Song/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7887,'alien:_isolation_-_trauma',NULL,'This content requires the base game Alien: Isolation on Steam in order to play.','2014/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/282513/Alien_Isolation__Trauma/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7888,'jurassic_world_evolution:_carnivore_dinosaur_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution on Steam in order to play.','2019/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/988470/Jurassic_World_Evolution_Carnivore_Dinosaur_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7889,'selfloss',NULL,'Selfloss is an emotional exploration game filled with rich lore, set in a whale-worshipping, Slavic-inspired world. Embark on the journey of the healer, Kazimir, and his magical staff as he fights a mysterious Miasma in search of a ritual to cure his wounded soul.','2024/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1086620/Selfloss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7890,'avernum_3:_ruined_world',NULL,'Wander free through this epic, indie fantasy adventure. Explore a huge world that evolves as time passes. Towns fight battles. Refugees flee. Disasters happen. Features cunning adventures, great depth, and unlimited freedom. Be a merchant or bounty hunter, buy a home, save the world!','2018/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/691830/Avernum_3_Ruined_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7891,'payday_2:_border_crossing_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1184411/PAYDAY_2_Border_Crossing_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7892,'paper_dolls:_original_/_纸人',NULL,'Paper Dolls Original is a first-person horror adventure game steeped in Eastern culture. You act a man who is separated from his daughter after a car accident. When he awakes, he finds himself in a deserted Asian mansion. Find your daughter and unveil a terrifying story buried for a hundred years','2019/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1051310/Paper_Dolls_Original/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7893,'recore:_definitive_edition',NULL,'From creator Keiji Inafune and the makers of Metroid Prime comes the ReCore: Definitive Edition, an action-adventure crafted for a new generation. As one of the last humans, forge friendships with robotic companions and lead them on an epic adventure through a dynamic world.','2018/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/537450/ReCore_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7894,'nuts',NULL,'NUTS is a single-player walking simulator surveillance mystery. Record the squirrels, report your findings, and piece together what’s really going on in Melmoth Forest.','2021/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/768450/NUTS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7895,'zombi',NULL,'London is falling. Are you prepared? The Last Blight is upon us. It was foretold. For the second time in history, a great plague has shrouded London in a fog of death. Big Ben tolls as thousands of unprepared die, or worse, are 