he 20th century’s greatest conflict, from Poland to China, Normandy to the Pacific, on a map encompassing the globe.','2018/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/957720/Strategic_Command_WWII_World_at_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7909,'ben_10:_power_trip',NULL,'Evil Hex has cursed Europe – and only Ben 10 can stop him! Explore a 3D world filled with combat, puzzles and secrets as you save the day!','2020/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1063040/Ben_10_Power_Trip/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_167'),(7910,'nba_2k_playgrounds_2',NULL,'NBA arcade action is back with NBA 2K Playgrounds 2! Pick your team, get ready to jam, and Ball Without Limits!','2018/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/726590/NBA_2K_Playgrounds_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7911,'watch_dogs_legion_:_bloodline',NULL,'This content requires the base game Watch Dogs®: Legion on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2239577/Watch_Dogs_Legion__Bloodline/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7912,'pro_11_-_football_manager_game',NULL,'Become the best football manager. Join Pro 11 and claim the championship!','2017/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/844960/Pro_11__Football_Manager_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7913,'arma_ii:_dayz_mod',NULL,'Join the scores of desperate survivors in the free Arma 2 DayZ Mod, the award-winning and massively popular persistent multiplayer mod for Arma 2: Combined Operations!','2013/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/224580/Arma_II_DayZ_Mod/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7914,'motorsport_manager_-_challenge_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Motorsport Manager on Steam in order to play.','2017/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/639680/Motorsport_Manager__Challenge_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7915,'jack_move',NULL,'Jack Move is a JRPG that features a unique blend of gritty cyberpunk story telling, turn based battles and beautiful modern pixel 