.steampowered.com/app/2649410/Flashing_Lights_Beast_Swat_Truck_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7922,'technobabylon',NULL,'A cyberpunk adventure game from the studio that brought you Gemini Rue and Blackwell! The year is 2087. Genetic engineering is the norm, and an omnipresent AI powers the city. Take control of three citizens of this world as they struggle to understand a deadly conspiracy.','2015/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/307580/Technobabylon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7923,'lost_lands_x',NULL,'The sudden madness of an old friend from the Lost Lands forces Susan, who has long since retired, to return to her old adventures. “Lost Lands X” is an adventure game in the genre of Hidden Objects, with plenty of mini-games and puzzles, unforgettable characters and complicated quests.','2025/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3511120/Lost_Lands_X/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7924,'championship_manager_2010',NULL,'Two years in the making, Championship Manager 2010 is the latest edition of the most established name in football management. TOTAL VISION With over 500 custom animations per player and multiple pitch views the custom 3D match engine lets you watch all your tactics and formations come together.','2009/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/35030/Championship_Manager_2010/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7925,'bloodwash',NULL,'A serial killer is terrorizing the city, and Sara\'s deadbeat boyfriend hasn\'t done the laundry. Can Sara survive a late-night trip to the laundromat, or will the Womb Ripper perform an early delivery?','2021/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1598160/Bloodwash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7926,'disillusion',NULL,'A mysterious muse calls upon you to investigate a Large tower in an oneiric land.','2021/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1490060/Disillusion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7927,'payday_2:_gunslinger_weapon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1449441/PAYDAY_2_Gunslinger_Weapon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7928,'mud_and_blood',NULL,'Mud and Blood, the cult classic flash real time strategy game, returns with its signature take on infantry tactics. Command a small squad through brutal battles against unfair odds. This is combat. Experience the chaos and unceremonious violence of modern war, where every decision counts.','2021/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1391530/Mud_and_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7929,'shank_2',NULL,'The fan-favorite 2D brawler is back as ex-mob hit man Shank returns to action in Shank 2. With those closest to him under attack, Shank is once again forced on the offensive. Now he must put his trusty arsenal of handguns, shotguns, automatic weapons, chainsaws, machetes, grenades, plus all-new weaponry and moves to use in order to...','2012/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/102840/Shank_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7930,'fureraba_~friend_to_lover~',NULL,'Springtime. The season of the cherry blossoms, and a time of new beginnings, new encounters, and new people. For Aoba Kyousuke, this new season marks the start of his second year in high school, and also the year he resolved himself to finally fulfill his long-cherished dream: finding a girlfriend.','2018/5/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/822760/Fureraba_Friend_to_Lover/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7931,'ecosystem',NULL,'Create virtual lifeforms whose development is shaped by a deep simulation of evolution. Guide them as they fight, mate, and adapt to the environment you have built. All the creatures in the trailer evolved on their own in the game!','2024/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1133120/Ecosystem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7932,'steel_division_2_-_nemesis_#7_-_hell\'s_highway',NULL,'This content requires the base game Steel Division 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3302920/Steel_Division_2__Nemesis_7__Hells_Highway/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7933,'season:_a_letter_to_the_future',NULL,'Leave home for the first time to collect memories before a mysterious cataclysm washes everything away. Ride, record, meet people, and unravel the strange world around you in this third-person meditative exploration game.','2023/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/695330/SEASON_A_letter_to_the_future/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7934,'the_sims™_4_luxury_party_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2015/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1235754/The_Sims_4_Luxury_Party_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7935,'men_of_war:_assault_squad',NULL,'Men of War: Assault Squad features a completely new cooperative skirmish game mode with access to five different nations (Russia, Germany, USA, Commonwealth and, for the first time ever in the Men of War series, Japan) as well as increased realism and accessibility.','2011/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/64000/Men_of_War_Assault_Squad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7936,'call_to_arms_-_season_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call to Arms on Steam in order to play.','2016/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/561140/Call_to_Arms__Season_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7937,'heroes_of_hammerwatch:_pyramid_of_prophecy',NULL,'This content requires the base game Heroes of Hammerwatch on Steam in order to play.','2019/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1015030/Heroes_of_Hammerwatch_Pyramid_of_Prophecy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7938,'aokana_-_four_rhythms_across_the_blue_-_extra1',NULL,'Aokana - EXTRA1 is the official Mashiro afterstory for Aokana.Experience even more Aokana in 1440p!','2020/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1340130/Aokana__Four_Rhythms_Across_the_Blue__EXTRA1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7939,'chef:_a_restaurant_tycoon_game',NULL,'Chef is a Restaurant Management game in which you create your own character, acquire supreme cooking skills, customize restaurants, design unique menus, and devise innovative recipes with a realistic editor.','2020/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/886900/Chef_A_Restaurant_Tycoon_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7940,'antimatter_dimensions',NULL,'Earn antimatter through dimensions! Gain Infinite antimatter to collapse the universe!','2022/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1399720/Antimatter_Dimensions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7941,'sudden_strike_4_-_the_pacific_war',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sudden Strike 4 on Steam in order to play.','2019/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/873871/Sudden_Strike_4__The_Pacific_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7942,'grim_legends:_the_forsaken_bride',NULL,'Enter an enchanting world of legends and magic, where your destiny was written in blood and whispers of true love.','2014/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/284850/Grim_Legends_The_Forsaken_Bride/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7943,'contrast',NULL,'CONTRAST is a puzzle/platform game where you can move between a fantastic 3D world and a mysterious shadowy universe in 2D in the blink of an eye. Delve into a dreamlike and surreal 1920s world, inspired by the performance art world of vaudeville and film noir, and cradled by a smooth and sultry jazz ambiance.','2013/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/224460/Contrast/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7944,'rebel_galaxy',NULL,'Rebel Galaxy is a swashbuckling space adventure, with action-packed combat, exploration, discovery, trade, and “negotiation” with the outlandish denizens at the edge of the known universe.','2015/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/290300/Rebel_Galaxy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7945,'garfield_kart',NULL,'Join Garfield and his friends in the funniest fast and fur-ious game! What character do you want to play with? Garfield, Odie, Jon, Nermal... you choose! Take part in no-holds-barred crazy races.','2013/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/362930/Garfield_Kart/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7946,'multi_turret_academy',NULL,'Multi Turret Academy is a top-down tank action game with roguelike elements. Select your vehicle from a growing list of historical models, then equip dozens of weapons and upgrades to lead your local tank club to victory!','2024/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1869270/Multi_Turret_Academy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7947,'rack_and_slay',NULL,'The rogue-like dungeon crawler where you\'re a billiard ball! Push monster balls into holes or traps in randomly generated levels. Stack up countless game-changing items to create broken builds. Find combos to create your own synergies and customize your playstyle. Rack and Slay!','2024/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2311990/Rack_and_Slay/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7948,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_shrine_maiden\'s_hell',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2304500/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Shrine_Maidens_Hell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7949,'valhall:_harbinger_-_beta_testing',NULL,'VALHALL is a blend of multiple genres, combining first & third person directional physical combat slasher with a survival experience set in a brutal world of Vikings. Survive, feel Thor\'s power, become an einherjar, and enter the ultimate battlefield!','2020/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/908740/VALHALL_Harbinger__Beta_Testing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7950,'dead_island_retro_revenge',NULL,'Time for some 16-bit retro revenge! When his beloved cat gets kidnapped, Max sets out across a zombie-infested California to get him back by force!','2016/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/337360/Dead_Island_Retro_Revenge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7951,'flower',NULL,'Experience award-winning Flower, now available on PC. Flower lets you take control of the wind as you explore and navigate beautiful, lush environments.','2019/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/966330/Flower/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7952,'xeno_crisis',NULL,'Xeno Crisis is an arena shooter in which up to two players take control of battle-hardened marines embarking on a deadly mission to confront an alien menace! Run and gun your way through thousands of adversaries, searching for survivors, and ultimately facing the origin of the outpost\'s demise.','2019/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/464260/Xeno_Crisis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7953,'hatoful_boyfriend',NULL,'Congratulations! You’ve been accepted as the only human student at the prestigious St. PigeoNation’s Institute, a school for talented birds! Roam the halls and find love in between classes as a sophomore student at the world’s greatest pigeon high school.','2014/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/310080/Hatoful_Boyfriend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7954,'pilo_and_the_holobook',NULL,'Join Pilo and Prof in a new space adventure! Use your Holobook to turn everything into stickers and create your own encyclopedia of a new world. Explore beautiful new planets and meet new friends in this adventure game.','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2423270/Pilo_and_the_Holobook/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7955,'coneru_-dimension_girl-',NULL,'Embark on a 2D action date with the dimension-girl, Coneru! This time, your date plan is to fend off the mysterious alien group \"Hateful Fruit Company\" invading Shinjuku City!','2025/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2600700/CONERU_DIMENSION_GIRL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7956,'elderborn',NULL,'ELDERBORN - a Metal AF* Slasher with brutal FPP melee combat and souls-like/RPG character progression. In the times of legend, barbarian tribes need a new dark messiah. Be that merciless slayer. Uncover ancient secrets in the city of doom. Forge your own destiny! *Action Fantasy.','2020/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/727850/ELDERBORN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_168'),(7957,'putt-putt®_goes_to_the_moon',NULL,'Due to a freak accident at the Fireworks Factory, Putt-Putt® is blasted to the moon!','1993/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/294650/PuttPutt_Goes_to_the_Moon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7958,'naval_action_-_leopard',NULL,'This content requires the base game Naval Action on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1143890/Naval_Action__Leopard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7959,'surgeon_simulator_2',NULL,'It’s time to ‘scrub in’ in this physics-based surgery sim. Unearth the mysteries of the Bossa Labs Medical Facility and save Bob’s life.','2021/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/774791/Surgeon_Simulator_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7960,'voice_love_on_air',NULL,'A BL dating sim with elements of studio management and interactions with voice actors! Follow Aki, a newbie voice director who has to complete the recordings for several BL dramas, and interact with the charming voice actors. Come give voice to the language of love!','2024/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2321120/Voice_Love_on_Air/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7961,'indoorlands',NULL,'The indoor park management simulator where you can create your rides and coasters from scratch and freely design your halls. Manage, expand and develop your own park to inspire your guests. Satisfy your visitors\' needs by unlocking and researching new buildings, rides, transportation and more!','2022/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1378890/Indoorlands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7962,'nekopara_vol._0',NULL,'Please note that NEKOPARA Vol. 0 is a fandisc for NEKOPARA Vol. 1What\'s NEKOPARA? Why, it\'s a cat paradise! This is a story just before Kashou opened \"La Soleil\".Enjoy a page from the leisurely, daily lives of Shigure and the Minaduki household\'s catgirls!','2015/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/385800/NEKOPARA_Vol_0/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7963,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_street_art_paint_jobs_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1967650/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Street_Art_Paint_Jobs_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7964,'steel_division_2_-_tribute_to_d-day_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Steel Division 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1307600/Steel_Division_2__Tribute_to_DDay_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7965,'little_inferno:_ho_ho_holiday',NULL,'This content requires the base game Little Inferno on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2108900/Little_Inferno_Ho_Ho_Holiday/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7966,'the_texas_chain_saw_massacre_-_hands',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Texas Chain Saw Massacre on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3026790/The_Texas_Chain_Saw_Massacre__Hands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7967,'payday_2:_the_overkill_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2015/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/348090/PAYDAY_2_The_OVERKILL_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7968,'system_shock:_enhanced_edition',NULL,'Re-discover what made System Shock the first of it\'s kind, a ground breaking immersive sim that would inspire a generation of games to come....','2015/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/410710/System_Shock_Enhanced_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7969,'omg_words',NULL,'Bringing roguelike mechanics to classic word games. Use relics to create powerful combos, play boons to craft your tiles and board, use your powers to defeat a host of tricky opponents.','2025/1/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2884080/OMG_Words/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7970,'dreadout',NULL,'DreadOut is a third person supernatural horror game where you play as Linda, a high school student trapped in an old abandoned town. Equipped with her trusty smart-phone, she will battle against terrifying encounters and solve mysterious puzzles which will ultimately determine her fate.','2014/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/269790/DreadOut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7971,'voor_de_kroon',NULL,'Fight for control during the Friso-Hollandic Wars. Set in the medieval 13th century, the game features a strategy campaign and historical battles. Fight with your army in 3rd person battles and command your troops.','2022/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1702390/Voor_De_Kroon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7972,'party_panic',NULL,'Party Panic is an online and local-multiplayer party game. Compete against your friends in the all new board game, play 30+ rapid fire minigames, race through the brutal Gauntlet, or complete the challenges on Trophy Island. There is even a built in drinking game! You\'ll laugh, you\'ll cry, it\'s stupid.','2017/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/506500/Party_Panic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7973,'feed_the_deep',NULL,'A lovecraftian roguelike. Dive into procedurally generated undersea caves. Collect gold, upgrade your equipment, and Feed the Deep.','2024/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2332260/Feed_the_Deep/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7974,'twinsen\'s_little_big_adventure_classic',NULL,'Twinsen\'s Little Big Adventure is a retro action-adventure game originally released in 1994. Equipped with your Magicball, you will have to face the evil Dr. Funfrock to save your girlfriend and the world of Twinsun.','1994/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/397330/Twinsens_Little_Big_Adventure_Classic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7975,'mashinky',NULL,'Mashinky is a transport strategy game about trains. The goal is to create your own transport empire on a procedurally generated map. It’s a unique blend of realistic graphics combined with an isometric construction mode and board game-like rules.','2018/10/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/598960/Mashinky/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7976,'the_lost_village',NULL,'Once there was a prosperous village of Martials, now none of it remains. As the son of the former Master, you will lead your followers to rebuild this village. Recruit followers and enter the mysterious illusional domain, acquire lost wonders. Will you see the rebirth of ancestors’ glory again?','2024/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1963040/The_Lost_Village/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7977,'vengeful_guardian:_moonrider',NULL,'Vengeful Guardian: Moonrider is a side-scrolling action platformer that channels the golden age of classic 16-bit action games in a full-throttle quest for revenge. Created to defend a totalitarian state, the Moonrider rejects its programming and now seeks vengeance on its creators.','2023/1/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1942010/Vengeful_Guardian_Moonrider/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7978,'​our_life:_beginnings_&_always_-_step_2_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Our Life: Beginnings & Always on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1464061/Our_Life_Beginnings__Always__Step_2_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7979,'technotopia',NULL,'Welcome to Technotopia, a city-builder card game. Take on the role of an AI designed to build a perfect city. Build districts, meet the needs of diverse communities and maintain the delicate balance between factions vying for control over you!','2024/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2825110/Technotopia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7980,'backyard_soccer_\'98',NULL,'Return to the soccer field with your favorite Backyard athletes! The original Backyard Soccer 1998 is back and now enhanced to run on Steam. Build your roster from among the iconic Backyard Kids. Kick, pass, and score in this classic game that made soccer fun for everyone!','2024/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3170410/Backyard_Soccer_98/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7981,'crown_wars:_the_black_prince',NULL,'The War of Crowns rages on. Knights and brigands run rampant throughout the land, sowing destruction. From your castle base, rise to become the lord who leads the battle against the forces of evil in this turn-based tactics and strategy game.','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1658920/Crown_Wars_The_Black_Prince/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7982,'air_twister',NULL,'Take flight with Air Twister - the new all-out rail shooter by legendary arcade developer Yu Suzuki! Similar to Suzuki’s massively successful Space Harrier series, you will encounter a large array of diverse and creatively designed enemies and challenging bosses.','2023/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2403620/Air_Twister/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7983,'bartender_hustle',NULL,'Mix amazing cocktails while you climb the ranks as a bartender and unlock diverse bartending venues in this narrative-driven bartender simulator.','2022/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1153210/Bartender_Hustle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7984,'imperator:_rome_-_complete_soundtrack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Imperator: Rome on Steam in order to play.','2019/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1016080/Imperator_Rome__Complete_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7985,'phoenix_point_-_corrupted_horizons_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Phoenix Point on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1622220/Phoenix_Point__Corrupted_Horizons_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7986,'helicopter_gunship_dex',NULL,'Helicopter Gunship DEX aims to replicate the brilliance of 90s helicopter simulators using modern technology. Employ realistic helicopter tactics during missions generated by a sophisticated procedural random mission system giving you an almost unlimited amount of re-playability.','2022/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2012140/Helicopter_Gunship_DEX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7987,'touhou_mystia\'s_izakaya_dlc3_pack_-_myouren_temple_&_divine_spirit_mausoleum',NULL,'This content requires the base game Touhou Mystia\'s Izakaya on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2191950/Touhou_Mystias_Izakaya_DLC3_Pack__Myouren_Temple__Divine_Spirit_Mausoleum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7988,'dear_esther:_landmark_edition',NULL,'Dear Esther immerses you in a stunningly realised world, a remote and desolate island somewhere in the outer Hebrides. As you step forwards, a voice begins to read fragments of a letter: \'Dear Esther...\' - and so begins a journey through one of the most original first-person games of recent years.','2017/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/520720/Dear_Esther_Landmark_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7989,'planetarian:_snow_globe',NULL,'\"planetarian: Snow Globe,\" the prequel to Key\'s sci-fi kinetic novel \"planetarian: The Reverie of a Little Planet,\" is now available with binaural audio support! Enjoy the story of a companion robot and her coworkers at a planetarium, and the simple joys they find in their everyday lives.','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2983350/planetarian_Snow_Globe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7990,'clickteam_fusion_2.5+_addon',NULL,'This content requires the base application Clickteam Fusion 2.5 on Steam in order to run.','2019/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1056780/Clickteam_Fusion_25_Addon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7991,'riven_(1997)',NULL,'Released in 1997 as the original sequel to Myst, one of the best-selling puzzle adventure games of all time. Prepare to enter a world \"torn asunder\" by timeless, unresolved conflicts -- a world of incomparable beauty, intrigue, and betrayal.','1997/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/63610/Riven_1997/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7992,'another_eden',NULL,'[Single player JRPG] Take your cat on a time-traveling adventure!','2021/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1252600/ANOTHER_EDEN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7993,'captured',NULL,'Trapped in what appears to be an endless hallway in your home, rooms begin to feel unfamiliar. Capture anomalies on camera and stay away from any sinister entities.','2024/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3114010/CAPTURED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7994,'911_operator_-_every_life_matters',NULL,'This content requires the base game 911 Operator on Steam in order to play.','2017/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/580731/911_Operator__Every_Life_Matters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7995,'sgs_overlord',NULL,'The largest amphibious operation of WW2, and a two-month campaign in the hell of the Norman bocage. Will you manage to make the decisive breakthrough before the Germans recover? Or will you succeed, as Rommel wanted, in crushing the Allied landing as close to the beaches as possible?','2024/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2639440/SGS_Overlord/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7996,'aooni',NULL,'[This is the origin of \"Blue Tragedy\"]The legendary horror game \"Ao Oni\" is now available on Steam!','2024/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2934190/Aooni/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7997,'long_gone_days',NULL,'A modern-day JRPG that imagines a world of war. Overcome language barriers, forge unlikely friendships, and find hope amidst conflict.','2023/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/510540/Long_Gone_Days/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7998,'a_day_out',NULL,'A Day Out is a monster-hunting and case-solving co-op third person shooter. Capture monsters and discover a new supernatural world with your friends!','2024/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1547670/A_Day_Out/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(7999,'star_wars™:_rogue_squadron_3d',NULL,'It is a time of great rejoicing in the galaxy. Luke Skywalker, with the help of Wedge Antilles, has blown up the Death Star. But there is little time to celebrate. The mighty Empire is gathering strength for a determined, all-out assault on the Rebel forces.','1998/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/455910/STAR_WARS_Rogue_Squadron_3D/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(8000,'agatha_christie_-_hercule_poirot:_the_first_cases',NULL,'Discover an untold crime story from the mysterious youth of the famous detective Hercule Poirot.','2021/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1573720/Agatha_Christie__Hercule_Poirot_The_First_Cases/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_169'),(8001,'the_dwarves',NULL,'A few heroes are facing hundreds of foes – are you even able to lead the coolest fantasy people to victory against the dark hordes? Explore a vast world, fight tactical real-time battles, and experience the fantastic story based on the bestseller \"The Dwarves\".','2016/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/403970/The_Dwarves/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8002,'second_sight',NULL,'Combining an atmospheric, psychological thriller narrative with paranormal psychic abilities, stealthy exploration and intense shooter action, Second Sight brings a new dimension to stealth action games, giving players control of a character endowed with incredible psychic abilities.','2005/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/11550/Second_Sight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8003,'oceanhorn_2:_knights_of_the_lost_realm',NULL,'Sequel to the critically acclaimed action adventure. Experience a gorgeous new third person 3D view and embark on an epic journey that unfolds the mysteries of what happened 1000 years ago.','2023/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1622710/Oceanhorn_2_Knights_of_the_Lost_Realm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8004,'grandma,_no!',NULL,'Step into Grandma’s slippers and wreak havoc in this physics-driven comedy where nothing stays under control—and that’s exactly the point. Fart, flop, and fumble your way through a home that refuses to behave.','2025/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2362680/Grandma_No/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8005,'toy_tactics',NULL,'Become a master strategist in this physics-based Real-Time Tactics game! Command minifig-inspired armies and customize strategies with hand-drawn formations. Conquer unique campaigns for all five armies and unleash massive battles in both single-player and multiplayer modes. Victory awaits!','2024/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1772530/Toy_Tactics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8006,'lacuna_–_a_sci-fi_noir_adventure',NULL,'A murder. A hack. A bombing. All it takes to plunge the solar system into war – unless you do something about it. Help CDI agent Neil Conrad make a string of increasingly difficult decisions in this modern dialog-driven adventure set in a gorgeous 2D sci-fi noir universe.','2021/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1364100/Lacuna__A_SciFi_Noir_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8007,'super_robot_wars_30_-_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Super Robot Wars 30 on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1823802/SUPER_ROBOT_WARS_30__Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8008,'animal_shelter_-_vet_clinic_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Animal Shelter on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2517260/Animal_Shelter__Vet_Clinic_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8009,'metal_slug_x',NULL,'“METAL SLUG X”, one of the most highly praised titles in the series among Metal Slug fans for 