the base game Titanfall® 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238102/Titanfall_2_Colony_Reborn_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8015,'minimalist_tower_defense',NULL,'Collect resources and establish a defense line before dark And then Facing countless enemies','2024/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2617400/Minimalist_Tower_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8016,'unturned_-_permanent_gold_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Unturned on Steam in order to play.','2014/7/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/306460/Unturned__Permanent_Gold_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8017,'oddada',NULL,'A tactile music maker with endless freedom to play! Use gadgets, gizmos and funky melodic toys to piece together a hand-crafted music track. Share what you make! Unlock new instruments! ODDADA!','2024/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1627870/ODDADA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8018,'fernbus_simulator_-_france',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fernbus Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/654120/Fernbus_Simulator__France/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8019,'expeditions:_rome_-_death_or_glory',NULL,'This content requires the base game Expeditions: Rome on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1805540/Expeditions_Rome__Death_or_Glory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8020,'spiritfarer®:_farewell_edition_-_ost',NULL,'This is additional content for Spiritfarer®: Farewell Edition, but does not include the base game.','2020/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1395720/Spiritfarer_Farewell_Edition__OST/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8021,'two_worlds_ii_hd',NULL,'Check out the new Velvet Edition bundle including both Two Worlds II and Pirates of the Flying Fortress DLC.','2011/2/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/7520/Two_Worlds_II_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8022,'rogue_voltage',NULL,'The engineering roguelike. Construct your combos by wiring circuits. Build crazy machines to zap the monsters and trigger satisfying chain reactions.','2024/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1494560/Rogue_Voltage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8023,'hand_of_doom',NULL,'Sign a contract in blood! Travel throughout the planes of existence slaying or befriending powerful doomlords in this wizard simulator inspired by the FMV games and dungeon crawlers of the early 90\'s. Learn powerful spells to solve puzzles and combat the dark forces amassing against you.','2023/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1924400/Hand_of_Doom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8024,'dome_keeper:_engineer_gear_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dome Keeper on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2152440/Dome_Keeper_Engineer_Gear_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8025,'de_blob_2',NULL,'In de Blob 2 Comrade Black and the Inkies are back with a whole new plot to rid the world of color. Set off on an action-packed color adventure where custom paints, patterns and music bring the world to life. De Blob 2 is a creative evolution driven by your imagination.','2017/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/563190/de_Blob_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8026,'nancy_drew®:_the_silent_spy',NULL,'Defuse a Toxic Plot and Reveal the Truth Behind Kate Drew’s Death!','2013/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/572730/Nancy_Drew_The_Silent_Spy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8027,'alnico_smithery',NULL,'Alnico Smithery is a hand-drawn, physics-based forging simulator. Mine for ore, smelt ingots, discover alloys, forge tools, and rebuild the smithery your grandfather left behind.','2024/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2381060/Alnico_Smithery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8028,'frontline_1942:_battles_of_the_world_war_2',NULL,'Immerse yourself in the times of the Second World War II and become a real hero! Shoot, capture, win – the path to glory is paved with shells!','2023/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2564660/Frontline_1942_Battles_of_the_World_War_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8029,'paw_patrol:_on_a_roll!',NULL,'PAW Patrol is on a roll! No job is too big, no pup is too small! Join the entire PAW Patrol team—including Everest and Tracker—for 16 exciting rescue missions around Adventure Bay! Help each pup use their unique abilities to help their friends and save the day!','2018/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/758730/Paw_Patrol_On_A_Roll/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8030,'happy_room',NULL,'Welcome to the laboratory! Here tests are taken upon highly durable human clones using newest weapon technologies. Your goal is to head these tests.','2016/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/550010/Happy_Room/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8031,'the_ascent_-_cyber_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Ascent on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1802470/The_Ascent__Cyber_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8032,'8-bit_armies',NULL,'8-Bit Armies is a retro Real-Time Strategy game. With a colorful, blocky voxel art style, 8-Bit Armies is Petroglyph\'s most fast-paced, friendly, and accessible RTS game to date. Featuring a campaign of 25 single-player missions, 12 co-op missions, multiplayer and skirmish modes.','2016/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/427250/8Bit_Armies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8033,'payday_2:_gage_spec_ops_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2016/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/548420/PAYDAY_2_Gage_Spec_Ops_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8034,'grand_mall_simulator',NULL,'Welcome to Grand Mall Simulator — Take control of a shopping mall and turn it into the city’s top shopping hotspot! Grand Mall Simulator is a multi-store management game where you hire staff, decorate storefronts, and earn money by completing tasks and expanding your business beyond the mall!','2024/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3327670/Grand_MALL_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8035,'brewmaster:_beer_brewing_simulator',NULL,'Brew your perfect beer in this relaxing home brewing sim. Use a realistic chemistry simulation to brew hoppy IPAs to creamy stouts. Customise your brewing space, create recipes and label your beer, unlock new equipment and enter competitions. Learn to brew, refine your craft and become a Brewmaster!','2022/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1569200/Brewmaster_Beer_Brewing_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8036,'cats_organized_neatly',NULL,'In this 2D puzzle game you have the responsibility to arrange your feline friends in a way that fits the grid. Cats Organized Neatly comes with 80 different handcrafted levels and a whole bunch of cats in all shapes and sizes.','2020/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1369340/Cats_Organized_Neatly/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8037,'tribe:_primitive_builder',NULL,'Chill out as you explore the beautiful, realistic island of exiles. Gather resources, craft tools, construct buildings and settlements. Manage tribe and automate your gameplay. Discover 4 lands, a storyline and save the inhabitants of the island.','2023/10/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1059900/Tribe_Primitive_Builder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8038,'lost_castle_/_失落城堡',NULL,'Lost Castle is an action RPG beat\'em up with roguelike elements and randomized dungeons for up to four players online and local!','2016/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/434650/Lost_Castle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8039,'sheepo',NULL,'Explore a strange planet, collect the creatures you find, and then shape-shift into them to expand your world. Build your own path, chat with the locals, and discover the planets sprawling secrets in this quirky metroidvania platformer.','2020/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1281790/SHEEPO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8040,'deckline',NULL,'Deckline is an atmospheric war-horror card game. Out of ammo and encircled, you play one last game of Durak to distract from the inevitable. Experience the grit and dread of modern combat through the lens of a board game.','2025/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3481320/Deckline/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8041,'d&d_lords_of_waterdeep',NULL,'Lords of Waterdeep is an award winning strategy board game, set in the Dungeons & Dragons world of Waterdeep. Play as one of the masked Lords of the City of Splendor. Intrigue abounds as you recruit adventurers, via your agents, to quest on your behalf and spread your influence.','2017/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/644390/DD_Lords_of_Waterdeep/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8042,'world_war_armies',NULL,'World War Armies is the ultimate PvP real-time strategy game. Command advanced war machines and compete for free against other players worldwide. Revolutionary mechanics reduce downtime and focus on direct engagement with the enemy, you get to the fun parts of RTS faster.','2024/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2438160/World_War_Armies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8043,'for_honor_-_sohei_hero',NULL,'This content requires the base game FOR HONOR™ on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3062480/FOR_HONOR__Sohei_Hero/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8044,'drod:_gunthro_and_the_epic_blunder',NULL,'DROD is a unique puzzle-logic game with clever mechanics and an engaging story. It is a turn-based top-down 2-D dungeon puzzler. The game play has amazing depth through emergent behaviors as puzzle elements are combined. There is a simple interface and only a handful of commands to master.','2012/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/314330/DROD_Gunthro_and_the_Epic_Blunder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8045,'pinball_fx_-_universal_pinball:_tv_classics',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pinball FX on Steam in order to play.','2024/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2915800/Pinball_FX__Universal_Pinball_TV_Classics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_170'),(8046,'pharmacy_simulator',NULL,'Experience a realistic pharmacy management experience with Pharmacy Simulator. Set up your shop, decorate it as you wish, and purchase over a hundred types of medications. Pharmacy Simulator offers you an incredibly realistic pharmacy experience. Prove your skills in a challenging economic system.','2024/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2930320/Pharmacy_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8047,'ai＊shoujo/ai＊少女',NULL,'Ever wanted to get away from it all? Well here\'s your chance! In AI Shoujo, a tropical island paradise filled with beautiful girls is waiting for you! Customize NPCs with a rich suite of character creation tools, then watch as they think, learn, and love. Kick back, relax, and enjoy life in the sun!','2020/3/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1250650/AIShoujoAI/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8048,'payday_2:_fugitive_weapon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1351060/PAYDAY_2_Fugitive_Weapon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8049,'american_truck_simulator_-_wild_west_paint_jobs_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game American Truck Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2187930/American_Truck_Simulator__Wild_West_Paint_Jobs_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8050,'tales_of_symphonia',NULL,'FIRST TIME ON STEAM – Based on the PlayStation®3 port of the original GameCube game, this RPG classic is finally available for PC.','2016/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/372360/Tales_of_Symphonia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8051,'immortal_redneck',NULL,'Immortal Redneck is a FPS set in Egypt with rogue-lite elements. Frantic gameplay, twitch controls and an arcade-style feel meet randomly generated dungeons, a complete skill tree, permanent death and 9 classes with different traits.','2017/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/595140/Immortal_Redneck/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8052,'snowrunner_-_land_rover_dual_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SnowRunner on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1785850/SnowRunner__Land_Rover_Dual_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8053,'ghost_exorcism_inc.',NULL,'Ghost Exorcism INC is a horror game where you can play alone, or in a team of up to 6 exorcists. Your mission will be to identify paranormal entities, and then exorcise them.','2021/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1618540/Ghost_Exorcism_INC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8054,'final_fantasy_iv:_the_after_years',NULL,'Take part in the epic sequel that unfolds nearly two decades after the events of FINAL FANTASY IV. Now enhanced for Windows PC.','2015/5/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/346830/FINAL_FANTASY_IV_THE_AFTER_YEARS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8055,'crysis_2_-_maximum_edition',NULL,'Aliens are decimating New York City, only you have the technology to survive. Be The Weapon.','2011/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/108800/Crysis_2__Maximum_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8056,'luminenight',NULL,'LumineNight is a story-driven detective adventure. Play as Detective Foster and his daughter to solve a series of murders spanning a decade. Interrogate suspects, infiltrate locations, solve puzzles, and gather evidence from crime scenes. Uncover the dark truth behind these killings.','2024/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2544570/LumineNight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8057,'sheltered',NULL,'Sheltered is a deep and emotional survival management game. You take on the role of protecting four family members who, after a global apocalypse, have found their way to a deserted shelter. ','2016/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/356040/Sheltered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8058,'voyager-19',NULL,'A short horror game where you control a decaying spacecraft exploring distant star systems.','2024/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2925510/Voyager19/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8059,'flashing_lights:_pickup_truck_triple_pack_(police,_fire,_ems)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Flashing Lights - Police, Firefighting, Emergency Services (EMS) Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2449260/Flashing_Lights_Pickup_Truck_Triple_Pack_Police_Fire_EMS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8060,'deisim',NULL,'Live the experience of being a powerful god and create the world to see the growth of mankind.','2022/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/525680/Deisim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8061,'tales_of_berseria™',NULL,'Players embark on a journey of self-discovery as they assume the role of Velvet, a young woman whose once kind demeanor has been replaced and overcome with a festering anger and hatred after a traumatic experience three years prior to the events within Tales of Berseria.','2017/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/429660/Tales_of_Berseria/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8062,'star_wars™_jedi_knight:_dark_forces_ii',NULL,'Jedi Knight: Dark Forces II picks up where the award-winning Dark Forces™ game left off...with even more features and firepower in dazzling 3D graphics. As Kyle Katarn, you must acquire a lightsaber and learn the ways of the Force to become a Jedi Knight.','1997/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/32380/STAR_WARS_Jedi_Knight_Dark_Forces_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8063,'cuckold_simulator:_life_as_a_beta_male_cuck',NULL,'CUCKOLD SIMULATOR, the exciting new game where you play as Cuckold (that is his name) in his day-to-day life. Work hard, give all your money to the bull, and be verbally abused by your fat wife.','2021/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1141550/CUCKOLD_SIMULATOR_Life_as_a_Beta_Male_Cuck/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8064,'super_hexagon',NULL,'Super Hexagon is a minimal action game by Terry Cavanagh, with music by Chipzel.','2012/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/221640/Super_Hexagon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8065,'automobilista',NULL,'AUTOMOBILISTA places you in the driving seat of an advanced racing simulator, featuring elite brazilian racing series along with a wide range of racing vehicles and international tracks for a uniquely diverse motorsports experience.','2016/2/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/431600/Automobilista/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8066,'monster_energy_supercross_-_the_official_videogame_3',NULL,'New ground and in-air physics, new rider models and new animations will create a more immersive experience and enable you to enjoy the Supercross world at its best!','2020/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1089830/Monster_Energy_Supercross__The_Official_Videogame_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8067,'love_n_life:_lucky_teacher',NULL,'After the pandemic Covitch69, you lost your job as a space aviation expert and now become a teacher in a small town. Luckily, every cloud has a silver lining as you are stepping into a world where love blooms unexpectedly and leads you to captivating ladies with immersive romantic tales.','2024/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2445340/Love_n_Life_Lucky_Teacher/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8068,'train_sim_world®_5:_lgv_mediterranee:_marseille_-_avignon_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2969690/Train_Sim_World_5_LGV_Mediterranee_Marseille__Avignon_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8069,'golftopia',NULL,'DESIGN, BUILD and MANAGE your own futuristic golf course. Keep 200 persistent visitors fed, hydrated, and happy. Defend your creation from a growing infestation of weeds with robotic workers and defensive turrets. Evolve your course into a mega resort where nobody wants to go home, EVER!','2021/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1144020/GolfTopia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8070,'age_of_wonders:_planetfall_-_revelations',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Wonders: Planetfall on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1137800/Age_of_Wonders_Planetfall__Revelations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8071,'fairy_fencer_f:_refrain_chord',NULL,'Help Fang and the gang harness the power of song in this comedic tactical RPG romp.','2023/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2228390/Fairy_Fencer_F_Refrain_Chord/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8072,'touhou_mystia\'s_izakaya_dlc2_pack_-_former_hell_&_chireiden',NULL,'This content requires the base game Touhou Mystia\'s Izakaya on Steam in order to play.','2022/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1927110/Touhou_Mystias_Izakaya_DLC2_Pack__Former_Hell__Chireiden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8073,'ice_lakes',NULL,'Ice Lakes is a modern ice fishing simulator with different single and multiplayer game modes and sandbox approach to wintertime fishing. Use and customize wide selection of fishing gear and learn how changing season, bottom topology, time of day and weather conditions affects fish behavior.','2016/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/393430/Ice_Lakes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8074,'pupperazzi:_the_dog_photography_game',NULL,'Put your love for pups to the test - we have a bunch of dogs that need their photos taken, doggone it! Photograph and catalogue the finest (and derpiest) dogs to build your career, upgrade your camera, and discover new canines. WOOF.','2022/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1028350/Pupperazzi_The_Dog_Photography_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8075,'payday_2:_jiu_feng_smuggler_pack_4',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/2/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1901420/PAYDAY_2_Jiu_Feng_Smuggler_Pack_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8076,'corsairs_legacy_-_pirate_action_rpg_&_sea_battles',NULL,'Get ready for ‘Corsairs Legacy’. It’s an open-world adventure in the Caribbean, the historical pirate life simulator. Sail the sea, fight the enemies, and explore islands. Will you rise to become a legendary pirate or meet your end at the hands of your enemies? The choice is yours.','2024/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1594880/Corsairs_Legacy__Pirate_Action_RPG__Sea_Battles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8077,'ibb_&_obb',NULL,'ibb & obb is a two player cooperative game set in a puzzle filled world where gravity goes both up and down. You can only succeed by working closely together. Find a friend for some true local co-op couch fun or match up online.','2014/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/95400/ibb__obb/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8078,'lazaret',NULL,'Lazaret is an atmospheric first-person horror game. You play as a member of a rescue team called out to investigate a distress signal coming from a ship that disappeared 4 years ago.','2024/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2088280/Lazaret/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8079,'majikoi!_love_me_seriously!',NULL,'Follow Yamato and his friends as they navigate the friendships, rivalries, and martial arts of Kawakami Academy.','2021/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1460490/Majikoi_Love_Me_Seriously/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8080,'boo_men',NULL,'Boo Men is a 1-4 player online co-op horror game. You and your crew of burglars are tasked with stealing from ghosts. Just remember to stay in the light because you never know what could be lurking in the dark...','2022/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1715730/Boo_Men/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8081,'myriad_death',NULL,'This is an exhilarating action and shooting game where you fight using weapons with different abilities.','2025/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3324320/MYRIAD_DEATH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8082,'cold_fear™',NULL,'In a ferocious Arctic storm, distress signals are sent from a mysterious Russian whaler. As leading Coast Guard veteran Tom Hansen, you board to investigate  and discover unthinkable horrors lurking beneath the ship\'s bloodstained decks.','2005/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/15270/Cold_Fear/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8083,'my_little_blacksmith_shop',NULL,'Craft weapons, armor and tools, manage resources and expand your workshop. Experience realistic physics-based forging, unlock new recipes and special orders, and interact with a medieval town\'s inhabitants as you work to become the greatest blacksmith in the land.','2017/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/980940/My_Little_Blacksmith_Shop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8084,'farmer\'s_life_-_pimp_my_cottage_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Farmer\'s Life on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2926840/Farmers_Life__Pimp_my_Cottage_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8085,'ginka',NULL,'\"Return to that summer with you...\" Ryusei returns to the small island of his younger years, where time flows by gently, to spend a fairy-tale summer vacation with his childhood friend who was spirited away.','2023/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2536840/GINKA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8086,'army_men_rts',NULL,'Army Men RTS brings you back to the days of staging battles with tiny plastic soldiers in your backyard...except these green soldiers carry out your every command!','2002/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/694500/Army_Men_RTS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8087,'project:_playtime',NULL,'PROJECT: PLAYTIME is a Free-to-Play multiplayer horror game where six players attempt to create one giant toy while surviving a terrifying monster that roams the toy factory. A seventh player controls the monster and is given only one goal: Find and kill everyone.','2022/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1961460/PROJECT_PLAYTIME/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8088,'猫神牧场：恐龙纪元（cat_god_ranch:​​age_of_dinosaurs​）',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cat God Ranch on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3795220/Cat_God_RanchAge_of_Dinosaurs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8089,'projekt_godhand',NULL,'ULTIMATE TOOL ASSISTED BULLSHITTING KEYBOARD DESTRUCTION RHYTHM GAME','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2978440/PROJEKT_GODHAND/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8090,'hero\'s_adventure_-_canvas_of_heroes',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hero\'s Adventure: Road to Passion on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3332620/Heros_Adventure__Canvas_of_Heroes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8091,'shardpunk',NULL,'The war is lost, the Capitol lies in ruins, and you’re on the run! Shardpunk mixes turn-based tactical strategy with RPG, survival, and resource management as you gather your team, scavenge for resources, fight enemy hordes, and seek shelter to live another day.','2023/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1183800/Shardpunk/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_171'),(8092,'touken_ranbu_warriors',NULL,'\"Touken Ranbu Warriors\" is an action game that is a collaboration between the \"spirits of blades\" simulation game \"Touken Ranbu ONLINE\" presented by DMM GAMES and NITRO PLUS, and the thrilling \"1 vs. 1,000\" WARRIORS series of KOEI TECMO GAMES.','2022/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1191260/Touken_Ranbu_Warriors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8093,'the_slaverian_trucker',NULL,'The Slaverian Trucker is a Survival/Truck/Life simulator game. Make enough money to survive and expand your wealth in the harsh semi-post apocalyptic lands of Slaveria, doing legal and illegal work, while maintaining, fixing, building, repairing, tuning your trucks, cars and other vehicles.','2021/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1822450/The_Slaverian_Trucker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8094,'pub_sim',NULL,'You\'ve just bought your first Pub. First steps are to clean it, stock it, set your markup and let in the Patrons. Keep the drinks flowing and try not to shortchange anyone! If you keep it going long enough you might just earn enough to spruce up the place, hire staff and expand the premises.','2025/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3010520/Pub_Sim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8095,'breakout_beyond',NULL,'Breakout is back! In this neon-drenched take on the classic, you’ll need to literally break through each puzzle by clearing bricks to breach the final goal. Rack up a combo and create spectacular light shows alone or with a friend.','2025/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3041770/Breakout_Beyond/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8096,'leaf_blower_revolution_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Leaf Blower Revolution - Idle Game on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1482630/Leaf_Blower_Revolution__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8097,'star_wars™_x-wing_vs_tie_fighter_-_balance_of_power_campaigns™',NULL,'Real-time against real pilots; this is Star Wars space combat as it was meant to be! Featuring challenging real-time dogfights of 2 to 8 players, Star Wars™: X-Wing vs. TIE Fighter is one of the most historically significant space combat simulators ever made.','1997/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/361690/STAR_WARS_XWing_vs_TIE_Fighter__Balance_of_Power_Campaigns/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8098,'hypnosis_of_corruption',NULL,'Hinata Yuzuzaka is highly respected and admired among her peers. When strange things start to occur at her school and the surrounding town, it will be up to her to get to the bottom of it all.','2024/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3041810/Hypnosis_of_Corruption/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8099,'westworld_awakening',NULL,'“Westworld Awakening” is a narrative-driven experience played from the perspective of Kate – a host who has attained self-awareness. To survive a dangerous underworld where no one and nothing is what it seems, you must overcome an entire world designed to destroy and enslave you.','2019/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1133320/Westworld_Awakening/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8100,'[echostasis]',NULL,'THE AWARD-WINNING CONCLUSION TO THE [ENIGMA] TRILOGY, [ECHOSTASIS] presents a world where our reality is not only curated by algorithms, but created by them.','2024/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1558000/ECHOSTASIS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8101,'shovel_knight:_shovel_of_hope',NULL,'Shovel Knight is a sweeping classic action-adventure game with awesome gameplay, memorable characters, and an 8-bit retro aesthetic. If you love games with perfect platforming, beautiful art, infectious music, lovable bosses, humor and levity, and real heart… Shovel Knight is for you!','2014/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/589500/Shovel_Knight_Shovel_of_Hope/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8102,'payday_2:_sokol_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2015/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/374301/PAYDAY_2_Sokol_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8103,'mighty_goose',NULL,'Mighty Goose is a fast paced run & gun shooter starring a bounty hunter Goose. Use epic weapons and devastating war machines to battle against screen filling bosses and hordes of enemies!','2021/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1299360/Mighty_Goose/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8104,'bounty_of_one_-_panic_in_the_mines',NULL,'This content requires the base game Bounty of One on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2900140/Bounty_of_One__Panic_in_the_Mines/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8105,'hollow_cocoon',NULL,'\"Trapped in a cocoon, the silkworm weaves her final dream.\" Hollow Cocoon is a first-person horror adventure game set in 1980s Japan. Immerse yourself in meticulously recreated environments as you venture into the depths of unspeakable horrors that await you.','2023/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2414630/Hollow_Cocoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8106,'prose_&_codes',NULL,'Explore the wonderful world of books through deceptively simple cryptograms. 10% of every purchase benefits Project Gutenberg, an online library of over 60,000 free ebooks.','2022/2/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1718910/Prose__Codes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8107,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_modern_city_center',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1148020/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Modern_City_Center/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8108,'endless™_space_2_-_penumbra',NULL,'This content requires the base game ENDLESS™ Space 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/988440/ENDLESS_Space_2__Penumbra/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8109,'natsumi_and_the_absurd_academy',NULL,'Natsumi meets classmates and teachers with unique personalities at the start of the semester, can she get used to school life from now on?','2025/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3326920/Natsumi_and_the_Absurd_Academy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8110,'jurassic_world_evolution:_cretaceous_dinosaur_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution on Steam in order to play.','2018/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/979930/Jurassic_World_Evolution_Cretaceous_Dinosaur_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8111,'samurai_bringer',NULL,'Samurai Bringer is a roguelite action game with levels which change with every playthrough, where you cut down hordes of Samurai and Demons to collect combat techniques and polish your fighting style in order to defeat Yamata-no-Orochi, the eight-headed dragon of Japanese mythology.','2022/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1851280/Samurai_Bringer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8112,'the_ramp',NULL,'A digital toy for skateboard loving people. Pure flow, no extra fluff.','2021/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1506510/The_Ramp/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8113,'[bober_bros]_the_hole',NULL,'[Bober Bros] The Hole is a first-person horror game that explores the cracks in domestic life. Your neighbor’s drilling starts the nightmare, but the holes reveal dark secrets far deeper than any wall could hide. No cheap scares, only disturbing reality.','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3037930/Bober_Bros_The_Hole/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8114,'pine_hearts',NULL,'Pine Hearts is a cosy little narrative-adventure game set in the sleepy scenery of Pine Hearts Caravan Park. Explore the great outdoors as you uncover items, unlock new paths, and discover all the little secrets stuffed throughout the Park.','2024/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1781010/Pine_Hearts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8115,'guardians_frontline',NULL,'Guardians Frontline is a sci-fi VR shooter that makes you a soldier and a commander. Fight off enemies and build bases in a single-player and co-op campaign, plus PvP game modes with full cross-play support.','2023/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1481440/Guardians_Frontline/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8116,'rescue_hq_-_the_tycoon',NULL,'Build up your headquarters from scratch and design your own masterpiece. In Rescue HQ you build, organize and manage a joint station for firefighters, police and ambulance. Manage your resources wisely and master challenging emergencies to keep your city safe! Are you up to the challenge?','2019/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/809720/Rescue_HQ__The_Tycoon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8117,'antonball_deluxe',NULL,'The breakout title from Summitsphere, Antonball Deluxe is a retro, high-octane smorgasbord of ballbusting arcade action! Antonball Deluxe quite literally turns the breakout genre on its head, blending traditional brick-breaking gameplay with tight, intense platforming.','2021/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1382320/Antonball_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8118,'civilization_v_-_explorer’s_map_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier\'s Civilization® V on Steam in order to play.','2011/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/16866/Civilization_V__Explorers_Map_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8119,'curious_expedition',NULL,'Curious Expedition is a roguelike expedition simulation set in the late 19th century. Together with famous personalities you will venture on unprecedented expeditions to regions never explored before for fame, science and treasures.','2016/9/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/358130/Curious_Expedition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8120,'neon_abyss_-_alter_ego',NULL,'This content requires the base game Neon Abyss on Steam in order to play.','2021/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1518790/Neon_Abyss__Alter_Ego/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8121,'superfighters_deluxe',NULL,'Superfighters Deluxe is a unique action game that combines brawling, shooting and platforming in dynamic sandboxy 2D levels. Lots of weapons and fun gameplay systems interlock to create absurd action-movie chaos.','2018/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/855860/Superfighters_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8122,'grifford_academy',NULL,'Grifford Academy is a story-rich, coming-of-age RPG set in a mystical book realm where your decisions shape the personalities of the characters. Engage in strategic turn-based combat as you set out to discover the secrets of Caldria.','2025/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2445780/Grifford_Academy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8123,'the_fermi_paradox',NULL,'The Fermi Paradox is a choice-driven sci-fi narrative strategy game in which your decisions in one corner of the galaxy can upend entire civilizations in another. Guide species through millennia and help them explore the vastness of space, make contact and, perhaps, create harmony.','2021/7/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1543150/The_Fermi_Paradox/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8124,'knights_and_merchants',NULL,'KNIGHTS and MERCHANTS recreates the era of the Middle Ages. Apart from the purely fictitious geography of our world, all game elements and scenes are based on the Anglo-Saxon period, 1200 A.D. And we haven\'t used imaginary elements like fabled creatures, either. The player takes on the role of an ordinary captain in the Palace Guard.','2013/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/253900/Knights_and_Merchants/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8125,'the_falconeer',NULL,'Soar through the skies aboard a majestic warbird, explore a stunning oceanic world and engage in epic aerial dogfights, in this BAFTA-nominated air combat game from solo developer, Tomas Sala.','2020/11/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1135260/The_Falconeer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8126,'deemo_-reborn-',NULL,'DEEMO -Reborn- is Rayark\'s classic game DEEMO, reborn in a whole new way on Steam. The fully 3D immersive journey will intoxicate you with the elegant sounds produced by you on the piano, as well as with the adventures you discover in this fairytale world.','2020/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1282210/DEEMO_Reborn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8127,'alien:_isolation_-_corporate_lockdown',NULL,'This content requires the base game Alien: Isolation on Steam in order to play.','2014/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/282512/Alien_Isolation__Corporate_Lockdown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8128,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_saseka_safari_trophy_lodge',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1164110/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Saseka_Safari_Trophy_Lodge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8129,'hell_let_loose_-_red_devils',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hell Let Loose on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2805150/Hell_Let_Loose__Red_Devils/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8130,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_hs-schoch_tuning_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1209461/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__HSSchoch_Tuning_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8131,'battle_academy',NULL,'A turn-based strategy game like no other has landed on Steam. Approachable, absorbing and visually impressive yet detailed, Battle Academy aims to revolutionise the strategy games market with a blend of intuitive design and compelling gameplay.','2010/8/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/287070/Battle_Academy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8132,'an_elder_scrolls_legend:_battlespire',NULL,'TRAPPED IN THE REALM OF DARKNESS','2022/4/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1812420/An_Elder_Scrolls_Legend_Battlespire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8133,'dcs:_p-47d_thunderbolt',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1120304/DCS_P47D_Thunderbolt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8134,'turbo_golf_racing',NULL,'An action-packed fusion of racing and golf. Traverse across a diverse range of courses, using your car to skilfully putt your ball in the hole. Face off against 7 opponents in Race mode, make every shot count in golf mode, or test your skills against the clock in Time Trials.','2024/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1324350/Turbo_Golf_Racing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8135,'dcs:_p-51d_mustang',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2012/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/223770/DCS_P51D_Mustang/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8136,'adore',NULL,'Adore is an action creature-collecting game where you build your team of unique creatures and go on a journey to resurrect the God of the Creatures.','2023/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1074620/Adore/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_172'),(8137,'northgard_-_dodsvagr,_clan_of_the_rat',NULL,'This content requires the base game Northgard on Steam in order to play.','2022/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1876990/Northgard__Dodsvagr_Clan_of_the_Rat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8138,'barista_simulator',NULL,'Barista Simulator, master the art of brewing with over 30 coffee recipes. Start with a basic setup, upgrade your café, manage your staff, and build your very own coffee haven. Are you ready for the ultimate coffee journey?','2023/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1694510/Barista_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8139,'error143',NULL,'A bickering and bantering rivals-to-lovers visual novel where you fall in love after first hack.','2022/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2066550/ERROR143/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8140,'moons_of_madness',NULL,'Moons of Madness is a first-person, story-driven cosmic horror game where the scientific exploration of Mars meets the supernatural dread of Lovecraft.','2019/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1012840/Moons_of_Madness/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8141,'sky_rogue',NULL,'Sky Rogue is a fwooshy rogue-lite action flight simulator! Blow things up over land, sea, and air, on an infinite number of procedurally-generated islands. Go toe-to-toe with enemy aces or assault giant flying aircraft carriers, but watch out for volleys of missiles; when you die, you\'re dead.','2017/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/381020/Sky_Rogue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8142,'surviving_mars:_revelation_radio_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Surviving Mars on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1658000/Surviving_Mars_Revelation_Radio_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8143,'payday_2:_the_golden_grin_casino_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2015/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/374300/PAYDAY_2_The_Golden_Grin_Casino_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8144,'marco_&_the_galaxy_dragon',NULL,'Marco, an orphan with missing memories, and Arco, a dragon who rules the galaxy, were hunting for treasure in space! On one of their adventures, Marco was given a clue to the whereabouts of her mother. Their next stop, her birthplace - Earth!','2020/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1202540/Marco__The_Galaxy_Dragon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8145,'tabletop_simulator_-_zombicide',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tabletop Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2016/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/468726/Tabletop_Simulator__Zombicide/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8146,'chronicon_-_the_mechanist',NULL,'This content requires the base game Chronicon on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2206120/Chronicon__The_Mechanist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8147,'trilogy_of_the_moon',NULL,'Immerse yourself in a romantic fantasy where past meets present! Experience a unique interactive game featuring Korea\'s stunning photoshoot models in this cinematic adventure.','2025/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3478200/Trilogy_of_the_Moon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8148,'farming_simulator_2013_titanium_edition',NULL,'Animal husbandry, crops, sales… It\'s up to you to manage and grow your own farm in a huge, totally new world!','2013/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/220260/Farming_Simulator_2013_Titanium_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8149,'aquanox_deep_descent',NULL,'We left the surface of the Earth in ruins, abandoned it and populated the oceans. The sea is now our new home. We call it Aqua. Pilot customized fighter ships and explore a deep sea dystopia torn by the struggle for resources and survival. Enter the unforgiving world of Aquanox Deep Descent.','2020/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/254370/Aquanox_Deep_Descent/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8150,'the_maid',NULL,'The Maid is a first-person psychological horror and mystery game that focuses on creating fear and tension in the player.','2025/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3456720/The_Maid/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8151,'star_realms',NULL,'Star Realms is a hugely popular space combat deckbuilding game. Download and play today (note: base set is required to play online) to find out why Star Realms is the winner of SXSW 2014 Board Game of the Year, 7 Golden Geek Awards from BoardGameGeek, and 2 Dice Tower awards!','2016/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/438140/Star_Realms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8152,'carrier_battles_4_guadalcanal_-_pacific_war_naval_warfare',NULL,'CARRIER BATTLES is a classic hex-and-counter digital wargame covering the naval-air battles of the Pacific War, from 1942 to 1943. Find your opponent and strike at him before he sinks your precious carriers, while preventing them from invading or supporting your own amphibious operations.','2020/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1163340/Carrier_Battles_4_Guadalcanal__Pacific_War_Naval_Warfare/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8153,'young_souls',NULL,'Young Souls is a gorgeous 2D brawler meets story-rich action RPG. Fight hordes of belligerent goblins, level up with hundreds of weapons and accessories, explore, and journey between worlds, as rebellious twins battle their way to save their foster father.','2022/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/985900/Young_Souls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8154,'joe_danger',NULL,'Can you put the world’s most determined stuntman back into the limelight? Combo, boost and pull ludicrous stunts as Joe attempts to race his way back into the record books in over 100 eye-popping levels. Leap school buses full of screaming kids and pools of ravenous sharks! Dodge spikes and mousetraps!','2013/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/229890/Joe_Danger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8155,'oddworld:_abe\'s_oddysee®',NULL,'Selected by the fickle finger of fate, Abe™, floor-waxer first class for RuptureFarms, was catapulted into a life of adventure when he overheard plans by his boss, Molluck the Glukkon™, to turn Abe and his fellow Mudokons into Tasty Treats as part of a last-ditch effort to rescue Molluck\'s failing meat-packing empire.','1997/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/15700/Oddworld_Abes_Oddysee/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8156,'doctor_who:_the_lonely_assassins',NULL,'Uncover the dark secrets of Wester Drumlins and confront a new evil in a thrilling found-phone mystery from the award-winning creators of Sara Is Missing and SIMULACRA.','2021/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1508270/Doctor_Who_The_Lonely_Assassins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8157,'million_arthur:_arcana_blood',NULL,'For the first time on Steam, the incredible, over-the-top 2D fighter Million Arthur: Arcana Blood is ready to kick-off! Featuring many of the popular characters from the smash hit Million Arthur series as well as a variety of guest fighters!','2019/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/989550/Million_Arthur_Arcana_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8158,'i_am_dead',NULL,'I Am Dead is a charming puzzle adventure game from the creators of Hohokum and Wilmot’s Warehouse about exploring the afterlife.','2020/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/951750/I_Am_Dead/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8159,'super_kiwi_64',NULL,'Super Kiwi 64 is a 3D-Platformer and Collect-a-Thon, in a low poly late 90s console look.','2022/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1949960/Super_Kiwi_64/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8160,'gold_mining_simulator_-_collector\'s_edition_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Gold Mining Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2017/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/715070/Gold_Mining_Simulator__Collectors_Edition_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8161,'togainu_no_chi_~lost_blood~',NULL,'Akira’s life has been defined by violence, but that won’t be enough to save him when he’s forced to play a deadly game. Will the bonds you forge in this stunning visual novel lead to his salvation, or to his ruin?','2020/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1174400/Togainu_no_Chi_Lost_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8162,'tools_up!',NULL,'Tools Up! is an exciting local co-op that tests your renovation and teamwork skills. Paint walls, tear off wallpaper, and move couches against the clock!','2019/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1004490/Tools_Up/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8163,'doom_eternal:_the_rip_and_tear_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DOOM Eternal on Steam in order to play.','2020/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1098300/DOOM_Eternal_The_Rip_and_Tear_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8164,'train_sim_world®_4:_scotrail_br_class_380_emu_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2789570/Train_Sim_World_4_ScotRail_BR_Class_380_EMU_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8165,'backroom_loop',NULL,'Backroom Loop is a first-person psychological horror (entertainment) game. You are trapped in a familiar-feeling space, exploring and escaping… only to return to the start. Can you break free from the loop?','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3672540/BACKROOM_LOOP/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8166,'assassin\'s_creed®_valhalla_-_dawn_of_ragnarök',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assassin\'s Creed Valhalla on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2210140/Assassins_Creed_Valhalla__Dawn_of_Ragnark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8167,'mistwinter_bay',NULL,'Rule a town in this story heavy, visual novel-like fantasy RPG! Interact with townsfolk and foreign leaders, build and expand, and tackle randomized events that affect the town and its people.','2024/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2191680/Mistwinter_Bay/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8168,'a_legionary\'s_life',NULL,'A Legionary\'s Life lets you play as a Roman soldier during the years of the Second Punic War and beyond. Rise up through the ranks and win prestigious awards or just focus on making it home in one piece; it\'s up to you.','2019/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1058430/A_Legionarys_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8169,'new_star_manager',NULL,'This is soccer management like you’ve never experienced it - Be more than just a player, be the head, the heart, and backbone of New Star FC. Be the Manager.','2018/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/883130/New_Star_Manager/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8170,'decisive_campaigns:_barbarossa',NULL,'Command a true operational structure. Can you balance and prioritize three different Theatres in order to achieve your objective?','2015/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/454530/Decisive_Campaigns_Barbarossa/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_173'),(8171,'liftoff®_-_slipstream',NULL,'This content requires the base game Liftoff®: FPV 