gers from a plane crash. Beautiful nurses, graceful flight attendants, cool rich women, cool bloggers, and mysterious women in red all need your help. Whether to save yourself or rescue everyone, it\'s up to you to decide!','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3418690/Lost_in_the_secret/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8184,'attack_of_the_earthlings',NULL,'Take on Galactoil, a comically dysfunctional intergalactic energy corporation, and its larger-than-life employees in a tactical-stealth game that fuses satisfying strategic gameplay and dark comedy in a quirky single-player story.','2018/2/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/621930/Attack_of_the_Earthlings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8185,'the_norwood_suite',NULL,'Explore the mysterious Hotel Norwood in this surreal first-person adventure. Curious characters, forgotten secrets, and head-nodding music await your arrival.','2017/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/696480/The_Norwood_Suite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8186,'the_utility_room',NULL,'This VR Journey takes you to the \'behind the scenes\' of the Universe. Beyond a door lies a barren landscape inhabited by strange rocky heads. Here, the maintenance and heavy lifting required keeps existence stable and temporal. You are a tourist. Don\'t do anything foolish.','2023/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2091960/The_Utility_Room/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8187,'tales_of_the_black_forest',NULL,'In a world filled with yōkai, a surging dark power has overshadowed a Japanese town. A group of 2 developers have produced a Japanese pixel adventure game to tell a tale that dates back to the Heisei era...In the name of dreams and passion.','2019/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1093910/Tales_of_the_Black_Forest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8188,'rodland_of_pipes',NULL,'Crawl through pipes, navigate the maze, listen carefully and get out before Rodland finds you.','2024/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3125120/Rodland_of_Pipes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8189,'bore_blasters',NULL,'Blast through rocks with your machine gun drill. Collect rare gems, ores and ancient artefacts, upgrade your ship and unlock new abilities. Uncover the mysteries of the deep and the dangers that lurk below.','2024/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2398170/BORE_BLASTERS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8190,'mojika_-_truth_rears_its_ugly_head',NULL,'Haunted by the ability to read minds, Suteru embarks on a journey of revenge against those who wronged him. Uncovering the secrets of his tormentors, he must confront his demons in a story that explores the depths and darkness of the human mind.','2025/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2697560/Mojika__Truth_Rears_Its_Ugly_Head/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8191,'race_for_the_galaxy',NULL,'Explore, Settle, Develop, Trade, Consume, or Produce? Which do you need most? Which of Earth\'s former colonies will be most successful at settling the galaxy, now that JumpDrive exists? Who will discover the secrets of the mysteriously vanished Alien Overlords? Your goal: to build the most prosperous and powerful space empire!','2017/6/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/579940/Race_for_the_Galaxy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8192,'arcadie:_second-born',NULL,'In this interactive tale of love and war, be the force of reason that your kingdom needs, or perpetuate its reputation as a force of destruction. Find love and weave friendships, or cast it all away for the sake of retribution.','2022/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2196980/Arcadie_SecondBorn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8193,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator_-_new_fish_species',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ultimate Fishing® Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2020/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1353980/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator__New_Fish_Species/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8194,'dishonored:_the_brigmore_witches',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dishonored on Steam in order to play.','2013/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/212894/Dishonored_The_Brigmore_Witches/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8195,'wizardry_8',NULL,'A New Wizardry for a New GenerationThe universe is in the throes of violent upheaval and change. Vast and mysterious forces are preparing for the final confrontation. A small group of heroes from distant lands must plunge into the heart of the maelstrom, to uncover long-forgotten secrets, and bring about a new era.','2001/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/245450/Wizardry_8/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8196,'fate',NULL,'Play (or Re-play) This Classic Dungeon Crawler!During the golden days of action RPGs, FATE was a powerhouse, winning runner-up for PC Magazine’s Role-Playing Game of the year. Popular enough to spawn 3 sequels, this was one of the premier dungeon crawlers of its time.','2005/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/246840/FATE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8197,'paranormal_torment',NULL,'Paranormal Torment is a psychological horror game in the spirit of P.T., where you\'re trapped in a loop of memory and guilt, forced to relive a tragedy over and over again. He\'s still waiting for you to come back...','2025/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3512250/Paranormal_Torment/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8198,'ancient_kingdoms',NULL,'Explore a vast open world filled with unique creatures and dungeons. Choose from six powerful classes and embark on an epic fantasy journey in this classic 2D RPG. Play singleplayer or multiplayer with your friends (up to 4 players).','2025/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2241380/Ancient_Kingdoms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8199,'trackmania²_stadium',NULL,'TrackMania² Stadium is the return of the popular Stadium environment enjoyed by millions of players with TrackMania Nations Forever. Now part of the ManiaPlanet environment, Stadium allows for improved services around the game, better graphics and a powerful track editor.','2013/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/232910/TrackMania_Stadium/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8200,'mango\'s_fisharium',NULL,'Mango’s Fisharium is a short incremental game about catching unique fishes and displaying them in the Fish Aquarium. Designed to be completed in around 4 hours.','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3697890/Mangos_Fisharium/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8201,'ultimate_epic_battle_simulator',NULL,'Here is a sandbox like no other. Create massive battles with absolutely no limits. Want to see 10,000 chickens fight an army of Romans?? Sure, why not. Want to see a company of WW2 U.S soldiers fight 11,000 Medieval soldiers?? There are simply no limits to the carnage you can achieve in UEBS.','2017/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/616560/Ultimate_Epic_Battle_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8202,'the_last_door_-_collector\'s_edition',NULL,'Something ancient and evil is stirring in Victorian England. Only you can stop it. Journey to the brink of madness and beyond as you set forth alone into the dark.','2014/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/284390/The_Last_Door__Collectors_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8203,'trainz:_a_new_era',NULL,'Our \"Platinum Edition\" bundle provides fantastic value for new or existing customers. Expand your Trainz collection with a huge range of additional routes, sessions, locos and rolling stock, all at 75% off the regular pricing.','2015/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/315660/Trainz_A_New_Era/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8204,'age_of_empires_ii:_definitive_edition_–_la_hire’s_dry_humor_animated_icons',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2672800/Age_of_Empires_II_Definitive_Edition__La_Hires_Dry_Humor_Animated_Icons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8205,'fledgling_manor',NULL,'A supernatural horror visual novel where vampires compete to save their eternal unlives in a high-stakes reality show.','2024/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3238510/Fledgling_Manor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8206,'the_mr._rabbit_magic_show',NULL,'The incredible Mr. Rabbit invites you all to a mysterious magic show! Celebrate 10 years of Rusty Lake with a new free-to-play point-and-click adventure that promises to delight and… shock you with its sleight of hand!','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3472550/The_Mr_Rabbit_Magic_Show/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8207,'dusk_city',NULL,'A flourishing civilization had sunk into the sea. The night never dawns...... and a sense of apocalypse hangs over the world. You\'ll land on an island in such a world, and as you explore the town and ruins, you\'ll come into contact with fragments of the world\'s mysteries.','2024/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2973120/Dusk_City/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8208,'cats_hidden_in_china',NULL,'Find 100 cats hiding in China in this cute hand-drawn hidden object game by Travellin Cats - the original viral hidden cats game creator! Can you find them all?','2024/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2608040/Cats_Hidden_in_China/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8209,'warhammer:_vermintide_2_-_sister_of_the_thorn_cosmetic_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer: Vermintide 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1629010/Warhammer_Vermintide_2__Sister_of_the_Thorn_Cosmetic_Upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8210,'train_valley_2_-_japanese_trails',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Valley 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3643660/Train_Valley_2__Japanese_Trails/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8211,'dcs:_the_channel',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1120301/DCS_The_Channel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8212,'fishing_planet:_tropic_hunter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2020/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1200346/Fishing_Planet_Tropic_Hunter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8213,'speedball_2_hd',NULL,'Speedball 2 HD is a modern reincarnation on the classic, futuristic cyberpunk sports game Speedball, originally developed by the Bitmap Brothers and first released for the Atari ST in 1990. A brutal mix of handball and ice hockey placed at break-neck pace.','2013/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/251690/Speedball_2_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8214,'toki_tori_2+',NULL,'Toki Tori 2+ may look cute, but it’s a challenging puzzle adventure game. Whistle and stomp are the only moves you need to solve increasingly complex puzzles, as you go anywhere, anytime on a lush forest island.','2013/7/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/201420/Toki_Tori_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8215,'goblin_camp',NULL,'Build a new home for your goblins! Grow your settlement from a little encampment to a bustling city in a beautiful procedurally generated northern forest. Fish, farm, explore the forest and harness the spirits in a unique fantasy citybuilder inspired by Finnish mythology.','2024/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2431980/Goblin_Camp/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8216,'train_simulator:_glasgow_subway_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1869393/Train_Simulator_Glasgow_Subway_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8217,'payday_2:_southbound_tailor_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1945680/PAYDAY_2_Southbound_Tailor_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8218,'shantae_and_the_pirate\'s_curse',NULL,'Embark on an all-new adventure with Shantae, the hair-whipping belly dancing genie. After losing her magic, Shantae teams up with the nefarious pirate Risky Boots in order to save Sequin Land from a curse.','2015/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/345820/Shantae_and_the_Pirates_Curse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8219,'radiant_silvergun',NULL,'Set on the earth and in space on July 14, 2520 A.D., the film explores the mystery of mankind\'s extinction. Various terrains become battlefields. Enemies attack from all directions. There are 23 bosses in total. Aim for a high score by making full use of score bonuses and level-up weapons!','2023/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2450820/Radiant_Silvergun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8220,'space_beast_terror_fright',NULL,'S.B.T.F. is a very hard arcade-style / rogue-like / perma-death first person shooter. You play as Marines who must brave dark, claustrophobic and terrifyingly intense Space Beast infested spacecraft in order to extract critical data and lucrative upgrades. Can you make it out alive?','2022/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/357330/Space_Beast_Terror_Fright/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8221,'zero_caliber_vr',NULL,'Zero Caliber is the ultimate VR FPS: single player/Co-op campaign, PvP and mod support with 40+ realistic firearms & melee weapons, 100+ unlockable skins, 50+ attachments, realistic physics, progression & more! Immerse yourself in the action, customize your gear and unleash your inner hero!','2023/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/877200/Zero_Caliber_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8222,'kingdom_come:_deliverance_–_treasures_of_the_past',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Come: Deliverance on Steam in order to play.','2018/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/768530/Kingdom_Come_Deliverance__Treasures_of_The_Past/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8223,'superdimension_neptune_vs_sega_hard_girls',NULL,'A collaboration project between ASCII Media Works’ Dengeki Bunko and SEGA, the Sega Hard Girls are made up of various Sega consoles, including the Dreamcast, Sega Saturn, and Mega Drive! These anthropomorphized consoles are girls with an array of personalities and spunk, and this time they are teaming up with Neptune and IF for an...','2017/6/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/571530/Superdimension_Neptune_VS_Sega_Hard_Girls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8224,'snufkin:_melody_of_moominvalley_-_fuddler\'s_courtship',NULL,'This content requires the base game Snufkin: Melody of Moominvalley on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2875880/Snufkin_Melody_of_Moominvalley__Fuddlers_Courtship/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8225,'rogue_trooper_redux',NULL,'A pioneering tactical shooter and landmark comic book adaptation, Rogue Trooper is back, remastered and revitalised in true high definition. Experience acclaimed third-person action in this BAFTA-nominated tale of betrayal and revenge at the far reaches of the galaxy!','2017/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/529490/Rogue_Trooper_Redux/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8226,'wolfstride',NULL,'Get wrecked in this immature grown-up RPG about a trio of troublemakers stumbling their way through a giant mecha tournament. Repair and upgrade the team’s hand-me-down rig, pick up odd jobs to pay the bills, and battle the best-of-the-best all while running from the regrettable choices of the past.','2021/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1331210/Wolfstride/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8227,'gttod:_get_to_the_orange_door',NULL,'RISE. FALL. REPEAT. Ascend to the level of the Gods as you battle your way out of a shattered and chaotic dimension in this fast paced parkour FPS rogue-like.','2019/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/541200/GTTOD_Get_To_The_Orange_Door/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8228,'stasis',NULL,'STASIS The isometric, point-and-click, sci-fi horror adventure game! In the distant future aboard a seemingly abandoned spacecraft, John Maracheck awakes from stasis. He must push himself to new physical and emotional limits and unravel the mysteries around him.','2015/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/380150/STASIS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_174'),(8229,'hidden_cats_in_tokyo',NULL,'Hidden Cats in Tokyo is a hidden object adventure game where you must vaccinate all the cats in Tokyo before they turn into dangerous monsters. Collect cards of heroes, monsters, and cat things. Join the adventure and fight the huge monster with your giant robot in this fun hidden object game!','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2671320/Hidden_Cats_in_Tokyo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8230,'cats_hidden_in_japan',NULL,'Find 100 cats hiding in Japan in this cute hand-drawn hidden object game by Travellin Cats - the original viral hidden cats game creator! Can you find them all?','2025/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2700540/Cats_Hidden_in_Japan/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8231,'slasher\'s_keep',NULL,'Hack, slash, shoot and loot your way through procedurally generated dungeons! Smack your enemies into spikes with your inventory sack!','2020/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/598060/Slashers_Keep/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8232,'zork_anthology',NULL,'Once you step through the door to Zork, you leave the world of arcade games and trite fantasies behind and enter the dimension of your imagination.','1989/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/570580/Zork_Anthology/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8233,'root_-_the_clockwork_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Root on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1462460/Root__The_Clockwork_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8234,'agatha_christie_-_the_abc_murders',NULL,'The ABC Murders is an adventure and investigation game adapted from the classic Agatha Christie novel. You are the famous private detective Hercule Poirot and, once again, you find yourself up against a mysterious serial killer who goes by the name of \"ABC\".','2016/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/374900/Agatha_Christie__The_ABC_Murders/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8235,'master_key',NULL,'Master Key is a top-down adventure game with a strong focus on item-based exploration and secrets. Embark on a journey to discover what that key could be used for and meet colorful characters!','2024/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1763030/Master_Key/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8236,'sankaku_renai:_love_triangle_trouble',NULL,'Meet Sousuke. He\'s just your average student, living in a rural town. Ever since his father remarried when he was young, he\'s been living together with his little sister Nanaru. Together with his childhood friend Maho and their other friends, they have fun geeking out in the Otaku Club.','2019/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1009450/Sankaku_Renai_Love_Triangle_Trouble/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8237,'hunt:_showdown_1896_–_reap_what_you_sow',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2081520/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Reap_What_You_Sow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8238,'heroes_of_might_&_magic_v:_hammers_of_fate',NULL,'Take part in a thrilling new adventure in the world of Ashan with the Hammers of Fate expansion. Discover uncharted territories and experience new ways of playing Heroes of Might & Magic V. Introducing a brand-new Dwarves faction, made up of heroic warriors and rune magic adepts who stalk the deepest mountains and most hostile regions of...','2006/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/15380/Heroes_of_Might__Magic_V_Hammers_of_Fate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8239,'aliya:_timelink',NULL,'The player connects to a girl in distress in space thousands of years later? How will they resolve the crisis and discover the truth? Through the mechanism of real-time synchronization, the game breaks through the dimensional wall and creates an immersive dialogue across time and space.','2024/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2704110/Aliya_Timelink/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8240,'naruto_shippuden:_ultimate_ninja_storm_4_-_the_sound_four_characters_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game NARUTO SHIPPUDEN: Ultimate Ninja STORM 4 on Steam in order to play.','2016/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/416422/NARUTO_SHIPPUDEN_Ultimate_Ninja_STORM_4__The_Sound_Four_Characters_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8241,'open_wheel_manager_2',NULL,'The ultimate racing management sim - Strategize, customize, refine to create your racing edge. Hire, research, win sponsors and attract the best drivers all while managing every aspect of your 90’s race team.','2024/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1757580/Open_Wheel_Manager_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8242,'ravenswatch_-_unleashed_skin_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ravenswatch on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3393430/Ravenswatch__Unleashed_Skin_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8243,'seal_world',NULL,'Meet silly seals, eat fibsh, swim, and relax!','2023/12/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1684410/Seal_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8244,'q.u.b.e._2',NULL,'Q.U.B.E. 2 is the sequel to the hit first-person puzzle game Q.U.B.E. You are Amelia Cross, a stranded archaeologist who has awoken among the ruins of an ancient alien landscape. With the distant help of another survivor you must solve the puzzles of this mysterious world and find a way back home.','2018/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/359100/QUBE_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8245,'lightmatter',NULL,'A first-person puzzler where shadows kill you. Watch your step or be swallowed by the darkness.','2020/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/994140/Lightmatter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8246,'terra_memoria',NULL,'A shortage of magic crystals and the sudden awakening of ancient robots leads six new friends on an incredible investigation across Terra – a cozy and fantastic world that combines 3D and pixel art.','2024/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1912750/Terra_Memoria/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8247,'videoverse',NULL,'Relive the days of the early internet and dive into this fictional video game era, where the \'Kinmoku Shark’ gaming system and its online social network \'Videoverse\' were still popular…','2023/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2079180/VIDEOVERSE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8248,'one_lonely_outpost',NULL,'An alien world sometimes needs a farmer’s touch to bring it to life. In this sci-fi, colonization-life sim, terraform a barren world: turn wastelands into verdant landscapes while exploring, farming, building, and unlocking all the mysteries of this strange new planet.','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1465550/One_Lonely_Outpost/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8249,'monster_hunter_wilds_-_seikret_decoration:_purehorn_caparison',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Hunter Wilds on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3117280/Monster_Hunter_Wilds__Seikret_Decoration_Purehorn_Caparison/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8250,'brain_show:_party_game',NULL,'Compete with your friends in brand new quiz game (online multiplayer). Take part in crazy TV Show. Dynamite explosions, sobbing mates, ruined friendships! Sounds like fun? It will be – with Brain Show - quiz game!','2023/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2235150/Brain_Show_Party_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8251,'pinball_fx_-_universal_classics™_pinball',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pinball FX on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2351795/Pinball_FX__Universal_Classics_Pinball/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8252,'fallen_hero:_rebirth',NULL,'They called you a hero; you call them fools. Use your telepathy romance old friends and fight new enemies as you become the greatest villain Los Diablos has ever known!','2018/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/800620/Fallen_Hero_Rebirth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8253,'fallacy_quiz',NULL,'Sharpen your critical thinking skills in this quiz game that challenges you to spot rhetorical fallacies. Everyone likes this game so you must too, right?','2024/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2847380/Fallacy_Quiz/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8254,'six_ages:_ride_like_the_wind',NULL,'Life between myths. Lead your clan into legend or obscurity. Plan ahead as you read this challenging storybook strategy game, immersing you in the land of old gods and magic also seen in King of Dragon Pass.','2019/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/881420/Six_Ages_Ride_Like_the_Wind/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8255,'samurai_shodown_neogeo_collection',NULL,'The ULTIMATE collection is here! It all began in ’93, and now, the weapon-based fighting game series that swept the world is ready to be taken home in a new stellar collection! Six NEOGEO titles as well as one mysterious, unreleased game are featured!','2020/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/999660/SAMURAI_SHODOWN_NEOGEO_COLLECTION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8256,'estate_agent_simulator',NULL,'Estate Agent Simulator lets you enter the exciting world of the real estate market. You can buy, decorate, advertise, rent or sell houses. You can buy vacant land and build houses. Environmental factors will affect the rental prices of houses.','2023/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2553050/Estate_Agent_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8257,'max_gentlemen_sexy_business!',NULL,'The premiere Victorian Business Tycoon & Dating Simulator. Your family business has been stolen from you! Forge sexy partnerships in the sheets while crushing rival companies in the streets to become England’s largest monopoly and reclaim your family honor.','2020/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/817840/Max_Gentlemen_Sexy_Business/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8258,'two_strikes',NULL,'Dive into the heart of ancient Japan in Two Strikes, a 2D combat extravaganza with breathtaking hand-drawn animations. As a fearless samurai, warrior monk, or daring outlaw, engage in electrifying duels where every strike can be your last.','2025/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1586750/Two_Strikes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8259,'i\'m_on_observation_duty_2',NULL,'Your job is to monitor live surveillance camera footage and spot anomalies in the monitored rooms. Anomalies range from furniture movement to otherworldly intruders. When you spot an anomaly you have to file a report to fix it. You will need sharp eyes and good memory to survive the entire night.','2020/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1257810/Im_on_Observation_Duty_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8260,'chicken_invaders_5',NULL,'Chicken Invaders puts you at the forefront of a battle against invading intergalactic chickens, bent on revenge for our oppression of Earth chickens. This time, the chickens have hatched a devious plan to block out sunlight and freeze Earth to death!','2015/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/353090/Chicken_Invaders_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8261,'fountains',NULL,'Master high-skilled combat to uncover the secrets of an ancient, interconnected world.','2024/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1841240/FOUNTAINS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8262,'jurassic_world_evolution_-_deluxe_dinosaur_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jurassic World Evolution on Steam in order to play.','2018/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/817550/Jurassic_World_Evolution__Deluxe_Dinosaur_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8263,'payday_2:_jiu_feng_smuggler_pack_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1746580/PAYDAY_2_Jiu_Feng_Smuggler_Pack_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8264,'aground',NULL,'As one of the last human survivors, you find yourself stranded on an uninhabited island. With a few other victims of the crash, can you craft, mine, and build your way to survival?','2020/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/876650/Aground/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8265,'civilization_v_-_civ_and_scenario_pack:_polynesia',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier\'s Civilization® V on Steam in order to play.','2011/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/99610/Civilization_V__Civ_and_Scenario_Pack_Polynesia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8266,'valkyrie_elysium',NULL,'Long ago, Ragnarok—the End Times—loomed upon the realms. The All-Father Odin, with the last of his strength, created an emissary of redemption, Valkyrie; her sole task being the salvation of a doomed world.','2022/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1963210/VALKYRIE_ELYSIUM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8267,'papa\'s_quiz',NULL,'Papa’s Quiz is a party game for 1-8 players. Use phones or tablets as controllers and compete in multiple question types, where the smartest and fastest player will be the last standing victor! Share screen on Discord or use Steam Remote Play to play with your friends!','2020/12/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1484730/Papas_Quiz/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8268,'stars_in_the_trash',NULL,'Stars in the Trash brings the magic of animated movie classics into a narrative-driven platformer that combines action, exploration and puzzles. Tired of feeling trapped at home, Moka, a spoiled cat decides to run away and seek adventure. Explore, make friends, fight, and escape from the kennelman.','2024/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1822240/Stars_In_The_Trash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8269,'tales_beyond_the_tomb_-_the_last_vigil',NULL,'Nick Harrison, a new security guard at the Guadalupe Cemetery, believes he is taking on a peaceful night shift. However, as night falls, he soon discovers he was very wrong. Nick realizes the cemetery holds more than just the dead.','2025/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3416690/Tales_Beyond_The_Tomb__The_Last_Vigil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8270,'priest_simulator:_vampire_show',NULL,'A mockumental action game. Go forth and rock in the absolute weirdest and most messed up simulator in the history of sandbox shooters. Fully unprofessional English language version. This dub will have you in stitches.','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/950620/Priest_Simulator_Vampire_Show/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8271,'affogato',NULL,'Affogato is a RPG featuring a unique \'reverse tower defense\' mechanic. Play as a sorceress managing a café in Arorua. Meet customers from all walks of life, hear their stories and travel into their minds to help them defeat their inner demons. Experience a city life that exudes magic and excitement.','2023/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1983970/Affogato/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8272,'if_found...',NULL,'If Found... is a game about going home, coming out and erasing everything.','2020/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1041920/If_Found/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8273,'lord_winklebottom_investigates',NULL,'It’s the 1920s and the world’s foremost detective is about to embark on his most challenging case yet. Thankfully, in this world that’s not quite like our own, there’s nobody better to crack the case than the great detective and gentleman giraffe, Lord Winklebottom.','2022/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1024160/Lord_Winklebottom_Investigates/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8274,'treasure_hunter_claire',NULL,'Treasure Hunter Claire is the story of the titular protagonist, Claire, and her adventure through the fabled land of Alstroemeria. What treasures and riches await her as she navigates the world?','2018/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/828070/Treasure_Hunter_Claire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8275,'slime_3k:_rise_against_despot',NULL,'Welcome to Slime 3K, an unhinged roguelite bullet-heaven set in the Despot’s Game universe! Build a deck of crazy weapons, grow stronger and devour hordes of pink puny humans as a murderous jelly blob on a warpath of death, violence and pretzels.','2024/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2348610/Slime_3K_Rise_Against_Despot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8276,'frog_legs',NULL,'A short, single-player horror action game starring Carl, the suburban house frog. Will you be able to conquer arcade challenges, solve puzzles, and Ribbit and Tear your way back to the life you once knew?','2025/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1734110/Frog_Legs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_175'),(8277,'one_deck_dungeon',NULL,'The hit roguelike adventure that captures all the fun of a dungeon crawl in a single deck of cards!','2018/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/770100/One_Deck_Dungeon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8278,'american_fugitive',NULL,'FREE UPDATE; STATE OF EMERGENCY, OUT NOW! Framed for your father’s murder, you’ll need to do whatever it takes to unveil the real culprit. Tackle thrilling missions for the criminal underworld - just don’t let the cops track you down!','2019/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/934780/American_Fugitive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8279,'founder\'s_pack_upgrade:_artisan',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pax Dei on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2919390/Founders_Pack_Upgrade_Artisan/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8280,'highrise_city',NULL,'Highrise City offers a new spin on City Simulations & Tycoon games expanding the economy and resource management aspect. Experience a modern take on the genre enriched with a complex resource based economy system.','2023/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1489970/Highrise_City/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8281,'l.a._noire:_the_vr_case_files',NULL,'L.A. Noire: The VR Case Files places you directly in the shoes of Detective Cole Phelps as you solve brutal crimes, plots and conspiracies inspired by real cases from 1947 Los Angeles, one of the most corrupt and violent times in L.A. history.','2017/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/722230/LA_Noire_The_VR_Case_Files/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8282,'hero_siege_-_bard_(class)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hero Siege on Steam in order to play.','2025/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3305660/Hero_Siege__Bard_Class/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8283,'sir,_you_are_being_hunted',NULL,'Sir, You Are Being Hunted is a freedom sandbox stealth experience, where each playthrough is unique, thanks to our British Countryside Generator. Escape from these robot-infested islands with violence, trickery and stealth. This brutally funny game is available for Windows, OSX, and Linux.','2013/8/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/242880/Sir_You_Are_Being_Hunted/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8284,'hyperdimension_neptunia_re;birth3_v_generation',NULL,'Lost in an alternate dimension, Neptune must collect enough shares to get back home. Sounds easy – except the Seven Sages want to rid Gamindustri of CPUs, including Neptune! Help defeat them and return her to her own world in this JRPG – or be stuck in the \'80s forever!','2015/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/353270/Hyperdimension_Neptunia_ReBirth3_V_Generation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8285,'no_creeps_were_harmed_td',NULL,'Employ lethal turrets, traps, and gadgets to defend against an onslaught of evolving creeps! Step into a twisted, hyper 3D, mind bending realm. Upgrade and adapt your defenses. Become a master maze crafter. Collect bizarre artifacts. Rush creeps for lucrative rewards, and succumb to greed!','2024/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1932260/No_Creeps_Were_Harmed_TD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8286,'payday_2:_golden_dagger_tailor_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1907080/PAYDAY_2_Golden_Dagger_Tailor_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8287,'noroi_kago:_the_grudged_domain',NULL,'NOROI KAGO: the Grudged Domain is a four-player co-op survival horror game based on \"Yokai\", supernatural beings from Japanese folklore. Trapped in a cursed domain, you and your companions must work together to endure the curse and find a way to escape, all the while hiding from the roaming yokai.','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1299060/NOROI_KAGO_the_Grudged_Domain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8288,'sword_art_online:_lost_song',NULL,'Enter the VRMMO world of the much-loved anime SWORD ART ONLINE! In Alfheim Online, a world of fairies and magic, you become the hero of the series, Kirito, and together with your wondrous friends try to conquer the floating land of Svart Alfheim.','2018/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/840720/Sword_Art_Online_Lost_Song/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8289,'contagion',NULL,'Contagion isn\'t your average Zombie Shooter but instead takes a more realistic and different approach to the popular genre with unique characters, environments, weapons, items, and a built in system that makes every round completely unpredictable with resources, objectives, and paths ever changing.','2013/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/238430/Contagion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8290,'holdfast:_frontlines_ww1_-_american_forces',NULL,'This content requires the base game Holdfast: Nations At War on Steam in order to play.','2022/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1906771/Holdfast_Frontlines_WW1__American_Forces/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8291,'legend_of_keepers:_career_of_a_dungeon_manager',NULL,'Legend of Keepers is the perfect mix between Dungeon Defender and Roguelite. You have been hired as a dungeon manager by the Dungeons Company. Your job is simple: protect their dungeons!','2021/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/978520/Legend_of_Keepers_Career_of_a_Dungeon_Manager/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8292,'out_of_orbit',NULL,'Design, build, or pirate spaceships. Build bases on planets. Explore endless randomly generated universes, travel through black holes, command your crew, survive cosmic events, collect and trade materials, battle epic bosses, and much more. The sky is the limit, literally!','2023/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1859990/Out_of_Orbit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8293,'spy_fox_2_\"some_assembly_required\"',NULL,'Once again, the world relies on Fox - Spy Fox, the suave secret agent who smoothly finesses his way through Spy Corps\' toughest assignments. This time, Spy Corps\' corrupt counterpart, the Society for Meaningless Evil, Larceny, Lying and Yelling (S.M.E.L.L.Y.) has devised a dogbot which will be unleashed upon the unsuspecting world!','1999/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/292240/Spy_Fox_2_Some_Assembly_Required/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8294,'ggst_additional_character_8_-_bedman?',NULL,'This content requires the base game GUILTY GEAR -STRIVE- on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2081052/GGST_Additional_Character_8__Bedman/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8295,'flashing_lights:_interceptor_suv_pack_(police,_fire,_ems)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Flashing Lights - Police, Firefighting, Emergency Services (EMS) Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3051230/Flashing_Lights_Interceptor_SUV_Pack_Police_Fire_EMS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8296,'evoland_2',NULL,'Evoland 2 is an unique RPG, with its graphic style and gameplay changing as you progress through a deep storyline based on time travel.','2015/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/359310/Evoland_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8297,'lunaria_fantasia',NULL,'Lunaria, a court mage of the kingdom of Sagittaries, is sent to investigate ancient ruins with her comrades. But the seemingly simple mission goes terribly wrong. The ruins are full of monsters, and a mysterious figure appears and robs Lunaria and her allies of their mana, the source of their magic.','2025/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2952680/Lunaria_Fantasia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8298,'distant_worlds_2:_factions_-_ikkuro_and_dhayut',NULL,'This content requires the base game Distant Worlds 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2140010/Distant_Worlds_2_Factions__Ikkuro_and_Dhayut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8299,'ever_17_-_the_out_of_infinity',NULL,'To the promise we once made and the place we must return','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2392500/Ever_17__The_Out_of_Infinity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8300,'sandboxels',NULL,'Falling-sand game with 500+ elements, chemistry, fire, life, food, and anything you can imagine.','2025/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3664820/Sandboxels/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8301,'colt_canyon',NULL,'Shoot your way through a hostile canyon full of hidden treasures, weapons, obstacles and all kinds of bloodthirsty scum! Colt Canyon is a stylish pixel art shooter with roguelike elements and real-time combat where you save your kidnapped partner from the ruthless bandits.','2020/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/940710/Colt_Canyon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8302,'stories_untold',NULL,'Stories Untold is a compilation tape of four experimental adventures, including a remaster of the original hit episode “The House Abandon”.','2017/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/558420/Stories_Untold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8303,'lobotomycorporation_artbook',NULL,'This content requires the base game Lobotomy Corporation | Monster Management Simulation on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/896000/LobotomyCorporation_ArtBook/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8304,'horizon\'s_gate',NULL,'Voyage into the wide world of Eral as an explorer, trader, or privateer. Defeat your enemies on land or at sea in deep but straightforward tactical combat. Unravel the secrets behind Dominio\'s betrayal – or sail off in search of your own adventure.','2020/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1224290/Horizons_Gate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8305,'game_dev_story',NULL,'Work hard and you may reach the top of the video game industry!','2022/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1847240/Game_Dev_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8306,'djmax_respect_v_-_technika_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2020/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1386610/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__TECHNIKA_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8307,'ocean_keeper:_dome_survival',NULL,'Explore dungeons, fight hordes of monsters and survive on a huge map. This is Ocean Keeper - an action roguelike with tower defense elements. Mine resources in caves, customize your Mech Spider, upgrade different weapons and face dangerous bosses that won\'t leave you a chance!','2025/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2845630/Ocean_Keeper_Dome_Survival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8308,'princess&blade',NULL,'A Clothing collection ARPG. Create set properties according to your clothing. Hundreds of clothes for the protagonist to enjoy, experience different battle strategies based on different outfits. Dress sexy or suit up like a heavily armoured angel of death.','2025/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1639430/PrincessBlade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8309,'hubris',NULL,'Hubris is a VR action-adventure game set in a unique and colourful Sci-Fi universe, with immersive movement options, including swimming, climbing, and jumping. Players will have to gather resources, craft food and upgrade their weapons to fight off alien wildlife, droids, and humanoid enemies.','2022/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1265800/Hubris/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8310,'wargame:_red_dragon_-_nation_pack:_italy',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wargame: Red Dragon on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3025360/Wargame_Red_Dragon__Nation_Pack_Italy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8311,'mr._prepper_-_animal_farm_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Mr. Prepper on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1882510/Mr_Prepper__Animal_Farm_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8312,'motorsport_manager_-_gt_series',NULL,'This content requires the base game Motorsport Manager on Steam in order to play.','2017/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/559430/Motorsport_Manager__GT_Series/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8313,'mindcop',NULL,'Mindcop is a non-linear „whodunnit“ detective game. It mixes a story driven adventure with real-time puzzle gaming. As the infamous Mindcop, you can dive into the minds of your suspects to uncover their secrets and unravel their lies.','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1517180/Mindcop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8314,'my_time_at_sandrock_-_pet_pack:_lil_gecko',NULL,'This content requires the base game My Time at Sandrock on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2595730/My_Time_at_Sandrock__Pet_Pack_Lil_Gecko/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8315,'warhammer_underworlds_-_shadespire_edition',NULL,'Lead your fighters to Glory in the ultimate PvP dice-and-cards strategy combat game. Warhammer Underworlds - Shadespire Edition pits mighty warbands against one another in an eternal battle for glory in the realms of the Age of Sigmar.','2020/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1022310/Warhammer_Underworlds__Shadespire_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8316,'pajama_sam:_no_need_to_hide_when_it\'s_dark_outside',NULL,'There\'s no reason to be afraid of the dark. Fed up with his fear of the dark, Sam transforms himself into Pajama Sam - world\'s youngest superhero and resolves to confront Darkness! With help from King the mine car, Otto the boat, and a host of fascinating characters.','1996/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/283960/Pajama_Sam_No_Need_to_Hide_When_Its_Dark_Outside/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8317,'nickelodeon_kart_racers_2:_grand_prix',NULL,'Nickelodeon Kart Racers is back and we’re kicking it into overdrive! In Nickelodeon Kart Racers 2: Grand Prix, you can select from 30 playable racers and 70 team members to assemble your ultimate pit crew.','2020/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1383960/Nickelodeon_Kart_Racers_2_Grand_Prix/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8318,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_modern_japan',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1148022/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Modern_Japan/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8319,'djmax_respect_v_-_technika_2_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2020/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1386611/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__TECHNIKA_2_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8320,'tom_clancy\'s_ghost_recon_wildlands_-_year_2_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tom Clancy\'s Ghost Recon® Wildlands on Steam in order to play.','2018/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/832700/Tom_Clancys_Ghost_Recon_Wildlands__Year_2_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8321,'drakensang_online',NULL,'Explore a world of magic and intrigue, filled with terrifying monsters and ferocious enemies! Discover the mysteries of Dracania, battle against the forces of evil and become a hero in Drakensang Online, the award-winning action RPG.','2023/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2067850/Drakensang_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8322,'delver',NULL,'Delve into the shifting dungeons on your hunt for the Yithidian orb, but getting it might just be the easy part. Delver is a single player first-person action roguelike dungeon crawler, just like you wished they used to make.','2018/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/249630/Delver/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8323,'blackberry_honey',NULL,'A lesbian love story set in Victorian England, featuring maids, music, and finding love in unexpected places.','2017/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/716340/Blackberry_Honey/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8324,'resident_evil_2_-_claire_costume:_noir',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/920563/Resident_Evil_2__Claire_Costume_Noir/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_176'),(8325,'rebelliongodsoul-specialswimsuitsoflinkers',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rebellion GODSOUL: Awakening on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3573840/RebellionGODSOULSpecialSwimsuitsOfLinkers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8326,'naval_action_-_painter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Naval Action on Steam in order to play.','2019/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1045170/Naval_Action__Painter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8327,'deathsmiles_i・ii',NULL,'Angels swooping across a disastrous sky! The shoot \'em up of gothic horrors is back','2022/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1884300/Deathsmiles_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8328,'lisa_the_joyful',NULL,'This content requires the base game LISA: The Painful on Steam in order to play.','2015/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/379310/LISA_the_Joyful/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8329,'lara_croft_and_the_guardian_of_light',NULL,'Take control of Lara and her new partner Totec, a Mayan tribesman, and uncover the ancient artifact known as the \"Mirror of Smoke\" in this all new action adventure game.','2010/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/35130/Lara_Croft_and_the_Guardian_of_Light/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8330,'dungeon_inn',NULL,'This is a cozy strategy management game where you manage an inn placed cleverly at the mouth of a dungeon. Juggle visits and business from 2 rivaling guilds, maximize profits, but keep your double-dealing a secret! Keep everyone happy and watch your inn thrive!','2024/11/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2552310/Dungeon_Inn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8331,'ultimate_fishing®_simulator_-_sakura®_lures_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Ultimate Fishing® Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1206630/Ultimate_Fishing_Simulator__Sakura_Lures_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8332,'another_world_–_20th_anniversary_edition',NULL,'Also known as Out Of This World™, Another World is a pioneer action/platformer that released across more than a dozen platforms since its debut in 1991. Along the years, Another World™ has attained cult status among critics and sophisticated gamers alike.','2013/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/233550/Another_World__20th_Anniversary_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8333,'battlestar_galactica_deadlock:_armistice',NULL,'This content requires the base game Battlestar Galactica Deadlock on Steam in order to play.','2020/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1315350/Battlestar_Galactica_Deadlock_Armistice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8334,'dragon_ruins_ii',NULL,'A dungeon crawler for tired people.','2025/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3293490/Dragon_Ruins_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8335,'tales_of_vesperia:_definitive_edition',NULL,'Celebrate the 10th anniversary of Tales of Vesperia and the return of this fan-favorite with the Definitive Edition!','2019/1/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/738540/Tales_of_Vesperia_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8336,'lockdown_protocol_-_winter',NULL,'This content requires the base game LOCKDOWN Protocol on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3391960/LOCKDOWN_Protocol__Winter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8337,'spirit_of_the_island',NULL,'A beautiful Life Sim Sandbox RPG with Cross-Platform Online COOP set on a tropical Archipelago. Build your farm, grow crops and animals, craft various items, cook dishes, gather resources, build shops and museum to attract visitors, and turn a desolate Island into a prosperous tourist destination!','2022/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1592110/Spirit_of_the_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8338,'hundred_days_-_winemaking_simulator',NULL,'Winemaking could be your best adventure. Make the best wine interacting with soil and nature and take your winery to the top. Your beautiful journey into the winemaking tradition starts now.','2021/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1042380/Hundred_Days__Winemaking_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8339,'audiosurf',NULL,'Ride your music. Audiosurf is a music-adapting puzzle racer where you use your own music to create your own experience. The shape, the speed, and the mood of each ride is determined by the song you choose.','2008/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/12900/AudioSurf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8340,'fortune_summoners',NULL,'A massive gameworld to explore with nearly a dozen dungeons to delve into.','2012/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/203510/Fortune_Summoners/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8341,'into_the_emberlands',NULL,'Venture out into the Emberlands and uncover an ever-changing world filled with surprising encounters and mystical creatures! Save villagers who got lost in the Miasma, collect resources and rebuild your village to create a safe haven for your people.','2025/1/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2856370/Into_the_Emberlands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8342,'first_dwarf',NULL,'Pilot a dwarven mech and fly a dragon as you build and defend outposts across a shattered magical realm. Craft, explore, and survive the dangers of floating islands corrupted by the Taint in this action-packed survival RPG with base-building and co-op.','2024/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1714900/First_Dwarf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8343,'euro_truck_simulator',NULL,'The original Euro Truck Simulator - the game which has become the classic of the genre and is still relevant today. The first truck simulation game in a European setting, with European long haul trucks!','2008/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/232010/Euro_Truck_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8344,'omsi_2_add-on_busbetrieb-simulator',NULL,'This content requires the base game OMSI 2: Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2017/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/636630/OMSI_2_Addon_BusbetriebSimulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8345,'biomorph',NULL,'BIOMORPH is a dark metroidvania game where you become the creatures that you kill! Solve ingenious puzzles and navigate a stunning hand-drawn world. Meet quirky characters, rebuild a city, and uncover the secrets of a sprawling, fallen civilization… and of your own mysterious origins.','2024/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1430220/BIOMORPH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8346,'nitroplus_blasterz:_heroines_infinite_duel',NULL,'The hit crossover 2D fighter finally makes its way to PC, updated to the latest arcade version for character balancing, added background animations and additional winning poses. It also includes all DLC from the console release, such as additional fighters Homura and Heart, in a single value package.','2016/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/482450/Nitroplus_Blasterz_Heroines_Infinite_Duel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8347,'sand:box',NULL,'\"Falling sand\" style particle sandbox, now with circuits and stickmen!','2023/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2179380/Sandbox/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8348,'welcome_back,_commander',NULL,'Commander, your strike team is to dive deep into the contaminated city of Sun Stone and get some answers before the mysterious deadly plague spreads . Good luck Commander!','2025/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3015620/Welcome_Back_Commander/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8349,'abyssal_blade',NULL,'ABYSSAL BLADE is a pixel-art boss rush inspired by MMO raid mechanics. With only 1 HP, take up your blade and challenge the five stages of grief.','2025/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3681370/ABYSSAL_BLADE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8350,'twinsen\'s_little_big_adventure_2_classic',NULL,'Twinsen\'s Little Big Adventure 2 Classic is a retro action-adventure game originally released in 1997. After saving the world from the evilish Doctor Funfrock, Twinsen is now ready to face a new threat coming from outer space.','1997/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/398000/Twinsens_Little_Big_Adventure_2_Classic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8351,'livestream_2:_escape_from_togaezuka_happy_place',NULL,'Can you escape the horror of being hunted down...? The sequel to the survival horror game \"Livestream: Escape from Hotel Izanami\" is now available!','2023/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2278630/Livestream_2_Escape_from_Togaezuka_Happy_Place/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8352,'​our_life:_beginnings_&_always_-_artbook',NULL,'This content requires the base game Our Life: Beginnings & Always on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2880490/Our_Life_Beginnings__Always__Artbook/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8353,'harem_in_another_world',NULL,'In Harem in Another World, you play as your normal everyday pervert, who is suddenly transported to another world. Explore this open and mysterious place through different lands to try and find your lost friends. Meet all manner of people and characters, from ghosts, to goblins, to giants and more!','2023/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2419800/Harem_in_Another_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8354,'tales_of_the_neon_sea',NULL,'Welcome to a world of intrigue and suspicion. Where humans and robots contend with escalating tensions and mutual distrust. And where gangster felines scheme their way to the top of the food chain. Welcome to the Tales of the Neon Sea!','2019/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/828740/Tales_of_the_Neon_Sea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8355,'foretales',NULL,'Decide the fate of the world in this ingenious story-driven card game. Foretales offers a unique take on the adventure genre, with a multitude of playstyles and story paths through which you can save the world… or bring about its end.','2022/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1170080/Foretales/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8356,'potionomics_-_boss_finn_content_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Potionomics on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3240680/Potionomics__Boss_Finn_Content_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8357,'fishing_adventure',NULL,'Fishing Adventure is a typical fishing game, where the player can (drums) catch different fish species! Fish in USA, Hawaii and other unique fisheries.','2019/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1101140/Fishing_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8358,'ad_fundum',NULL,'Take control of a giant mech and dive into an exciting underground adventure in a dieselpunk world! Dig deep, collect valuable minerals, upgrade wisely, explore diverse locations, uncover ancient secrets, and try not to explode! Will you save the world or vanish in the depths below?','2024/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2647820/Ad_Fundum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8359,'eldevin',NULL,'Eldevin is the award winning indie story-driven Free to Play MMORPG (Massively Multiplayer Online Role Playing Game) from Hunted Cow Studios. Join thousands of other players and explore the mystical lands of Eldevin.','2014/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/298160/Eldevin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8360,'neverwinter_nights:_enhanced_edition_tyrants_of_the_moonsea',NULL,'This content requires the base game Neverwinter Nights: Enhanced Edition on Steam in order to play.','2019/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1143400/Neverwinter_Nights_Enhanced_Edition_Tyrants_of_the_Moonsea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8361,'kingdom_rush_vengeance_-_hammerhold_campaign',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdom Rush Vengeance - Tower Defense on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2695220/Kingdom_Rush_Vengeance__Hammerhold_Campaign/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8362,'the_symbiant_re:union',NULL,'Take a deep dive into Danya’s and Brahve’s heat and romance in The Symbiant Re:Union. The events take place after two Endings of The Symbiant’s main game.','2024/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2355140/The_Symbiant_ReUnion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8363,'dreamscaper',NULL,'By night, delve deep into your subconscious and discover powerful artifacts to conquer your nightmares. By day, explore the city of Redhaven and build relationships to unlock the power of your dreams. DREAM. DIE. WAKE. REPEAT.','2021/8/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1040420/Dreamscaper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8364,'brothers_-_a_tale_of_two_sons',NULL,'Guide two brothers on an epic fairy tale journey from visionary Swedish film director, Josef Fares and top-tier developer Starbreeze Studios. Control both brothers at once as you experience co-op play in single player mode, like never before.','2013/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/225080/Brothers__A_Tale_of_Two_Sons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8365,'microvolts:_recharged',NULL,'Microvolts Recharged is a quirky lobby-based third-person shooter with a unique toy theme. The game features a fun character cast and freely swappable 7 weapon types. Battle it out across dozens of large well-designed maps and frag your enemies!','2023/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1426440/MICROVOLTS_Recharged/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8366,'labyrinth_of_touhou_-_gensokyo_and_the_heaven-piercing_tree',NULL,'Challenge the Great Tree with the maidens of Gensokyo! Challenge the mysterious great tree that suddenly appeared! Form and develop a large team from the characters of Touhou Project, and challenge the powerful foes that stand in your way! Now, enter the labyrinth that pierces even the skies!','2021/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1131920/LABYRINTH_OF_TOUHOU__GENSOKYO_AND_THE_HEAVENPIERCING_TREE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8367,'the_alien_cube',NULL,'Worlds collide as your cursed inheritance throws you into the middle of a series of mysterious events. Discover terrifying secrets as you follow your uncle’s disappearance, and confront a terrible truth that will change your life forever in this cosmic horror first-person adventure.','2021/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1099220/The_Alien_Cube/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8368,'armoured_commander_ii',NULL,'In this roguelike wargame, take command of a tank and its crew in the Second World War, joining one of over 50 campaigns across Europe, North Africa, Southeast Asia, and the Pacific. Fight with and against over 800 historically-based unit types, where each day is a struggle for survival.','2021/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1292020/Armoured_Commander_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_177'),(8369,'royal_order',NULL,'Intrigue, betrayal, deaths! A LGBT+ survival Raising Simulation in a high-fantasy royal court setting with RPG elements.','2024/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1749010/Royal_Order/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8370,'hoa',NULL,'Hoa is a beautiful puzzle-platforming game that features breathtaking hand-painted art, lovely music, and a peaceful, relaxing atmosphere.','2021/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1484900/Hoa/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8371,'fobia_-_st._dinfna_hotel',NULL,'Explore a decadent hotel across different timelines and uncover the dark history of a fanatical cult and your role in their plans.','2022/6/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1298140/Fobia__St_Dinfna_Hotel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8372,'dominions_5_-_warriors_of_the_faith',NULL,'In Dominions 5 you take control of a powerful being that rules a nation and aspires to godhood. The type of Pretender Gods can vary from magically powerful arch mages to huge titans or large monuments. Dominions is a deep 4x turn based strategy game with a very large variety of spells and units.','2017/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/722060/Dominions_5__Warriors_of_the_Faith/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8373,'first_class_escape:_the_train_of_thought',NULL,'\"First Class Escape: The Train of Thought\" is a co-operative atmospheric escape room puzzle game, set in a beautifully realized vintage train. Do you think you have what it takes to solve the puzzles and escape the train?','2021/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1738610/First_Class_Escape_The_Train_of_Thought/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8374,'pathfinder:_kingmaker_—_the_wildcards',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pathfinder: Kingmaker — Enhanced Plus Edition on Steam in order to play.','2018/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/900447/Pathfinder_Kingmaker__The_Wildcards/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8375,'blazblue:_continuum_shift_extend',NULL,'The second entry in the critically acclaimed BlazBlue franchise, BlazBlue: Continuum Shift Extend adds a number of gameplay modes, story scenarios, new moves, and an all-new playable character to further enhance the BlazBlue experience and solidify its status as one of the all-time great 2D fighters','2014/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/294810/BlazBlue_Continuum_Shift_Extend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8376,'taisho_x_alice_episode_3',NULL,'DUALICE(TAISHO x ALICE episode III) is a fairytale visual novel in which YOU must save your Prince Charming! You will take on the role of the fairytale heroine in order to rehabilitate your chosen love interest and guide him to his \"happily ever after\"!','2021/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1515890/TAISHO_x_ALICE_episode_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8377,'lair_of_the_clockwork_god',NULL,'A fast-paced Point-and-Click adventure AND an indie platfomer in one! Join adventurer Ben and wannabe indie darling Dan in a race against time to stop all the Apocalypses happening at the same time.','2020/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1060600/Lair_of_the_Clockwork_God/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8378,'mars_horizon',NULL,'Lead a major space agency as you guide humanity to Mars in this strategy simulation game. Construct a base, design and build rockets, conduct missions throughout the Solar System, and write your own history of Space exploration. Created with support from the European Space Agency.','2020/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/765810/Mars_Horizon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8379,'wargame:_red_dragon_-_nation_pack:_israel',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wargame: Red Dragon on Steam in order to play.','2016/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/529390/Wargame_Red_Dragon__Nation_Pack_Israel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8380,'forts_-_moonshot',NULL,'This content requires the base game Forts on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1033530/Forts__Moonshot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8381,'speed_stars',NULL,'Simple but challenging rhythm-based running game. Compete to achieve the highest rank, unlock more characters, set personal bests, and climb the leaderboards.','2020/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1482700/Speed_Stars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8382,'clawfish',NULL,'Clawfish is a fishing claw machine game. Visit an isolated train station with a fishing arcade. Explore the dock, play the machines, and take some time to relax by the water.','2021/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1621140/Clawfish/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8383,'psychonauts_in_the_rhombus_of_ruin',NULL,'Psychonauts in the Rhombus of Ruin is an all-new Virtual Reality adventure that takes players back into the mysterious and paranormal world of the Psychonauts for the first time in over ten years!','2018/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/788690/Psychonauts_in_the_Rhombus_of_Ruin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8384,'monstrum',NULL,'Monstrum takes the traditional survival horror formula and remixes it completely with procedurally generated levels, permadeath, and AI driven predators, ensuring that nowhere on its derelict cargo ship is ever truly safe.','2015/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/296710/Monstrum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8385,'low_magic_age',NULL,'Adventure and fight in a medieval fantasy open world! Build heroic characters with various abilities, travel through villages, cities, or perilous dungeons. Strategic turn-based combat system and advanced character building - Fog of war, charging and flanking, and more in the fast-paced Arena mode.','2017/1/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/576770/Low_Magic_Age/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8386,'doraemon_dorayaki_shop_story',NULL,'A simulation game where you create a wonderful sweets shop with Doraemon','2024/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2934180/Doraemon_Dorayaki_Shop_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8387,'proud_souls_(200,000)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Devil May Cry 4 Special Edition on Steam in order to play.','2015/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/359495/Proud_Souls_200000/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8388,'pinball_fx_-_williams_pinball_volume_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pinball FX on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2370406/Pinball_FX__Williams_Pinball_Volume_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8389,'deadliest_catch:_the_game',NULL,'Enter the dangerous world of king crab fishing in the deadly Bering Sea! Take command of your own fishing vessel, use realistic equipment, combat hazardous Alaskan waters and become the world\'s best crab catcher!','2020/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/838630/Deadliest_Catch_The_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8390,'block_fortress_2',NULL,'Choose a planet, build your fortress, and prepare for war. Arm yourself with powerful weapons, deploy troops, and defend your stronghold against relentless attacks. In this action-packed block-builder, survival is earned, and only the strongest will remain.','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2107030/Block_Fortress_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8391,'nickelodeon_all-star_brawl',NULL,'Brawl it out with your Nickelodeon favorites in epic platform battles.','2021/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1414850/Nickelodeon_AllStar_Brawl/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8392,'blue_fire',NULL,'Embark on an extraordinary adventure through the perished world of Penumbra to explore unique temples filled with increasingly difficult 3D platforming challenges, diverse enemies, quests, collectibles, and more. Slash daunting adversaries, leap through deadly traps and master the art of movement.','2021/2/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1220150/Blue_Fire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8393,'pine',NULL,'An open-world action adventure game set in a simulated world in which humans never reached the top of the food chain.','2019/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1042780/Pine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8394,'monster_camp_character_pack_-_new_blood',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Prom 2: Monster Camp on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1487530/Monster_Camp_Character_Pack__New_Blood/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8395,'avatar:_frontiers_of_pandora™_–_secrets_of_the_spires',NULL,'This content requires the base game Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora™ on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3005010/Avatar_Frontiers_of_Pandora__Secrets_of_The_Spires/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8396,'fell_seal:_arbiter\'s_mark_-_missions_and_monsters',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fell Seal: Arbiter\'s Mark on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1155320/Fell_Seal_Arbiters_Mark__Missions_and_Monsters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8397,'making_lovers_after_stories',NULL,'Making Lovers After Stories contains the official extra stories for Making Lovers. Experience the crazy stories that are happening to your favorite girls!','2022/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2093420/Making_Lovers_After_Stories/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8398,'apotheon',NULL,'Apotheon is a heroic action game set within the vibrant world of Ancient Greek Mythology. Ascend Mount Olympus, wrestle the divine powers from the Pantheon of Gods, and save mankind.','2015/2/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/208750/Apotheon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8399,'v-rally_4',NULL,'The return of a legendary off-road racing game! Enjoy an extreme experience while becoming an expert in a demanding simulation. Take on the challenges of rallies, rallycross, drifts, buggies and hill climbs, and set off on a spectacular journey across every continent.','2018/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/658700/VRally_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8400,'the_holy_gosh_darn',NULL,'Play as Cassiel, a foul-mouthed angel trapped in a time loop with a mission to save Heaven. Use the magical clock bestowed upon you from Death (yes, that Death, from Manual Samuel, stop asking) to jump between timelines across Heaven, Hell, Earth and Helheim to stop Heaven from going boom. Again.','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1466230/The_Holy_Gosh_Darn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8401,'doodle_champs',NULL,'The ultimate arty-party drawing experience! Choose from a mix of endlessly replayable party games made for artists and doodlers, or just hang out n\' draw together on a shared online canvas. Doodle Champs is optimized for play with Wacom tablets, but all pen-wielders and mouse-masters are welcome!','2025/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1618320/Doodle_Champs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8402,'payday_2:_yakuza_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2015/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/384020/PAYDAY_2_Yakuza_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8403,'eldest_souls',NULL,'Fast-paced and brutally challenging, Eldest Souls is a unique Soulslike experience. In a final act of vengeance, the Old Gods have unleashed a great Desolation upon the world. Mankind\'s only hope lies with a lone warrior… and his greatsword of pure Obsydian.','2021/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1108590/Eldest_Souls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8404,'fishing_planet:_sport_outfit_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2016/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/423367/Fishing_Planet_Sport_Outfit_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8405,'rocksmith+',NULL,'Learn guitar and piano with an expanding library of thousands of songs!','2024/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2834910/Rocksmith/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8406,'pocket_city_2',NULL,'A city-building game with a unique twist—step inside and experience your city firsthand! Plan roads, zones, and infrastructure while growing your economy, managing resources, and unlocking special buildings. Host events, build mega projects, and watch your city thrive in a dynamic world.','2025/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3566200/Pocket_City_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8407,'the_master\'s_pupil',NULL,'The Master’s Pupil is a hand painted puzzle adventure game set inside Claude Monet\'s eyeball','2023/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2082320/The_Masters_Pupil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8408,'love_live!_nijigasaki_high_school_idol_club_tokimeki_roadmap_to_future',NULL,'The first visual novel game of Love Live! Nijigasaki High School Idol Club!','2025/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3213690/Love_Live_Nijigasaki_High_School_Idol_Club_TOKIMEKI_Roadmap_to_Future/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8409,'force_of_nature_2:_ghost_keeper',NULL,'Force of Nature 2: Ghost Keeper offers incredible adventures full of mystery, danger, exploration and magic. This game combines the genres of Survival, Sandbox, Action, Adventure, RPG, Strategy and Resource Management','2021/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1316230/Force_of_Nature_2_Ghost_Keeper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8410,'nocturnal',NULL,'Carve your way with fire and steel to find out what secrets lie beyond the Mist in this intense 2-hour-long action-platformer game. Get ready to wield the flames and burn everything!','2023/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1634080/Nocturnal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8411,'chroma_zero',NULL,'Explore a unique and connected world. Understand its fragile balance, uncover its deepest questions, and find more than just the answers.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3121470/Chroma_Zero/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8412,'dicefolk:_will_chimeras_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dicefolk on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2945830/Dicefolk_Will_Chimeras_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8413,'thirsty_suitors',NULL,'Thirsty Suitors is a surreal story-driven game which throws turn-based RPG battles, skating and over-the-top cooking mechanics together in a spicy fusion! This isn\'t a dating sim - it\'s a breakup simulator. Battle your exes. Disappoint your parents. Find yourself.','2023/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1617220/Thirsty_Suitors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8414,'office_after_hours',NULL,'Spot anomalies and uncover hidden clues to escape an office where overwork turns strange and experiments happen more often than coffee breaks.','2025/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3207300/Office_After_Hours/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8415,'sundered®:_eldritch_edition',NULL,'Sundered is a chaotic hand­-drawn metroidvania where you resist or embrace ancient eldritch powers, a challenging and unique take on a classic genre from the creators of Jotun, now with local co-op!','2017/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/535480/Sundered_Eldritch_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8416,'dungeon_munchies',NULL,'Hunt down monsters to cook and eat them! You’ve been revived in a massive underground complex and you must leave this bizarre facility. Aided by the undead Necro-Chef Simmer, you must stay safe, get fed, find a way to get out','2022/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/799640/Dungeon_Munchies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8417,'endless™_legend_-_shifters',NULL,'This content requires the base game ENDLESS™ Legend on Steam in order to play.','2016/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/451050/ENDLESS_Legend__Shifters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_178'),(8418,'tiny_life',NULL,'In Tiny Life, you control a set of people that live together in a household. You take care of their daily needs, build their skills, forge new relationships... or just mess up their entire life in whatever way you can think of!','2023/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1651490/Tiny_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8419,'expansion_-_crusader_kings_ii:_the_old_gods',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings II on Steam in order to play.','2013/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/210908/Expansion__Crusader_Kings_II_The_Old_Gods/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8420,'payday_2:_weapon_color_pack_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1449442/PAYDAY_2_Weapon_Color_Pack_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8421,'teamfight_manager',NULL,'Teamfight Manager is a simulation game where you are the coach of an e-sports team. You must manage players to set them up for matches. Make the best of pick & ban by evaluating the characteristics of the champions/players! A smart strategy can make up for a lack of individual player skills.','2021/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1372810/Teamfight_Manager/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8422,'wool_at_the_gates',NULL,'A minimalist tactical base defense game where you play as a powerful hero, command troops, and harness class synergies inspired by auto-battlers. Fortify your city’s defenses to withstand hordes of enraged sheep, plan your tactics, and lead epic battles in a thrilling cycle of strategy and combat.','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2994990/Wool_at_the_Gates/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8423,'zeno_clash',NULL,'Zeno Clash is an action/fighting game set in a punk fantasy world. The game is played from a first person perspective and the combat is generally up close and brutal. Experience a deep storyline set in a fantastic world.','2009/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/22200/Zeno_Clash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8424,'the_sims™_3_town_life_stuff',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 3 on Steam in order to play.','2011/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/47899/The_Sims_3_Town_Life_Stuff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8425,'space_prison',NULL,'Survive the galaxy\'s toughest prison and rise to the top of a space gang! Explore, fight, craft, trade and learn convicts\' stories to escape the facility. Space Prison is a turn-based tactical survival game with deep strategy and social RPG elements.','2024/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1865930/Space_Prison/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8426,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_university_city',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2019/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1059820/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_University_City/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8427,'dome_keeper:_assessor_gear_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dome Keeper on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2380060/Dome_Keeper_Assessor_Gear_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8428,'payday_2:_lawless_tailor_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2352300/PAYDAY_2_Lawless_Tailor_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8429,'clannad_side_stories',NULL,'Delve further into the world of CLANNAD and experience the stories beyond the original visual novel adventure. Known as CLANNAD Hikari Mimamoru Sakamichi de in Japan, This Steam version features high resolution assets and is translated into English for the very first time.','2016/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/420100/CLANNAD_Side_Stories/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8430,'fossilfuel_2',NULL,'Turn up the volume, turn off the lights, and get ready for the definitive Jurassic survival horror experience. Pump your shotgun and put those dinos back where they belong... in the ground!','2024/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2299660/Fossilfuel_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8431,'primitive_society_simulator',NULL,'A colony-building game combined with grand strategy elements. Play as a tribal leader, guiding your people from the Stone Age to the Bronze Age. Survive, multiply, and compete for territory among ancient nations.','2024/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1876880/Primitive_Society_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8432,'f.i.s.t.:_forged_in_shadow_torch',NULL,'F.I.S.T.: Forged In Shadow Torch is a Metroidvania action game featuring exploration, intense combat and challenging platforming.','2021/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1330470/FIST_Forged_In_Shadow_Torch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8433,'misericorde:_volume_one',NULL,'Misericorde: Volume One is the first part of a series of mystery visual novels set in a convent in 1482.','2023/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1708110/Misericorde_Volume_One/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8434,'assault_spy',NULL,'Dash, evade, and smash your way to the truth as the corporate spy, Asaru; or the reckless CIA agent, Amelia! Uncover the dark secrets of the Negabot mega corporation as you save the company from a hostile takeover. Assault Spy is a stylish, fast paced, pure-action game with a dash of comedy.','2018/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/767930/Assault_Spy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8435,'lost_dimension',NULL,'In the near future a terrorist mastermind, known only as ‘The End’, threatens humanity with nuclear armageddon. A special task force, the S.E.A.L.E.D team, are the only ones who can stop him: a group of young combatants with incredible abilities and each with a mysterious past.','2017/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/626600/Lost_Dimension/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8436,'grindstone',NULL,'Grindstone is a puzzle game where epic adventures are just your 9-to-5. It’s your job to mine grindstones from the Creeps that lurk on the mountain in over 250 levels of intricate puzzles and hazards, all in the hopes of saving up enough grindstones to take your family on a much needed vacation.','2022/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1818690/Grindstone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8437,'sunrider_4:_the_captain\'s_return',NULL,'Captain Kayto Shields returns from exile in Sunrider 4: The Captain’s Return for a new space adventure!','2023/2/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2251620/Sunrider_4_The_Captains_Return/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8438,'paradise_marsh',NULL,'Stars vanished from the sky and scattered across a perfect endless wetland... Catch bugs and chat with many characters while playfully wandering through peaceful scenery. But don\'t lose sight of the night sky, the constellations need help!','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1709170/Paradise_Marsh/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8439,'mechwarrior_5:_mercenaries_-_digital_extras_content',NULL,'This content requires the base game MechWarrior 5: Mercenaries on Steam in order to play.','2021/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1456210/MechWarrior_5_Mercenaries__Digital_Extras_Content/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8440,'lilac_0',NULL,'The machine world of Molybdion has fallen into disarray. As Nidhogg eats the root of the planet, unending wars rage on the surface! Slice your way through hordes of metallic foes in five frantic levels, defeat fearsome bosses, and dodge countless bullets in this vintage vertical shoot \'em up.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3316380/Lilac_0/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8441,'siegecaster',NULL,'An active skill-based siege defense game. Prepare your aim and quickly assess the coming onslaught. Survive a large-scale assault on your home as you build outward to strengthen your arsenal. Engage epic hordes. Encircle powerful upgrade runes. Enhance your weapons. Siege the day.','2025/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3138350/Siegecaster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8442,'subway_midnight',NULL,'Board the train! Run away from a weirdo! Solve some puzzles! Make friends with some ghosts! Try not to become a ghost yourself!','2021/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1750570/Subway_Midnight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8443,'close_combat_2:_a_bridge_too_far',NULL,'Close Combat 2: A Bridge Too Far challenges you to take control of five strategic bridges in the most dramatic battle of World War II. From war-room strategy to gritty trench combat, battlefields come to life as you command Allied or Axis powers. It\'s a fight where every second counts.','2024/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2916170/Close_Combat_2_A_Bridge_Too_Far/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8444,'enigmatis_3:_the_shadow_of_karkhala',NULL,'Enigmatis 3: The Shadow of Karkhala is the final chapter in the blockbuster trilogy, an exciting detective story rife with adventure, puzzles, and ancient mystery. Follow the trail of a demonic preacher and unravel the secrets of Karkhala Peak!','2016/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/495110/Enigmatis_3_The_Shadow_of_Karkhala/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8445,'anno_1800_-_land_of_lions',NULL,'This content requires the base game Anno 1800 on Steam in order to play.','2020/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1442810/Anno_1800__Land_of_Lions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8446,'blossom_tales_ii:_the_minotaur_prince',NULL,'The Minotaur King has returned...and it\'s all your fault! Lily\'s back for a new \"classic\" action-adventure set hundreds of years after The Sleeping King!','2022/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1747830/Blossom_Tales_II_The_Minotaur_Prince/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8447,'sky_end_market',NULL,'This is a game to manage a supermarket. Set up shelves, arrange products, and make your store bigger and bigger!　Sell your goods to the remaining people, animals, and robots in the last place on earth just before the human race is exterminated.','2025/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3308550/Sky_End_Market/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8448,'planetarian_hd',NULL,'planetarian HD is an engaging and emotional visual novel from legendary game studio, Key. A sub-brand of VISUAL ARTS, Key are also famed for creating Kanon, AIR, CLANNAD, Little Busters!, Rewrite, Angel Beats!, and Summer Pockets.','2017/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/623080/planetarian_HD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8449,'panzer_corps_2:_frontlines_-_cyrenaica',NULL,'This content requires the base game Panzer Corps 2 on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3167270/Panzer_Corps_2_Frontlines__Cyrenaica/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8450,'alina_of_the_arena',NULL,'A roguelike deckbuilding tactics game that combines elements from \'Slay the Spire\' and \'Into the Breach\'. Play as a gladiator to survive. With roguelike deckbuilding and hex-based tactics, no longer bound by simple attack and defense. Make use of dodges and knockbacks to stay alive!','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1668690/Alina_of_the_Arena/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8451,'holdfast:_frontlines_ww1_-_ottoman_forces',NULL,'This content requires the base game Holdfast: Nations At War on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1960210/Holdfast_Frontlines_WW1__Ottoman_Forces/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8452,'taisho_x_alice_episode_2',NULL,'DUALICE(TAISHO x ALICE episode II) is a fairytale visual novel in which YOU must save your Prince Charming! You will take on the role of the fairytale heroine in order to rehabilitate your chosen love interest and guide him to his \"happily ever after\"!','2020/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1336060/TAISHO_x_ALICE_episode_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8453,'assassin’s_creedⓡ_odyssey_-_the_fate_of_atlantis',NULL,'This content requires the base game Assassin\'s Creed® Odyssey on Steam in order to play.','2019/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/937892/Assassins_CreedR_Odyssey__The_Fate_of_Atlantis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8454,'bridge_constructor_portal_-_portal_proficiency',NULL,'This content requires the base game Bridge Constructor Portal on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1113550/Bridge_Constructor_Portal__Portal_Proficiency/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8455,'south_park™:_the_fractured_but_whole™_-_bring_the_crunch',NULL,'This content requires the base game South Park™: The Fractured But Whole™ on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/564791/South_Park_The_Fractured_But_Whole__Bring_The_Crunch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8456,'battle_chef_brigade_deluxe',NULL,'Battle Chef Brigade pairs combo-based hunting and puzzle-based cooking in a hand drawn, fantasy adventure. Cook your way into the Brigade while subduing Victusia’s destructive monsters. Follow Mina and Thrash in the single-player campaign or challenge your friends in Local Multiplayer and Daily Cook-Offs.','2017/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/452570/Battle_Chef_Brigade_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8457,'battletech_digital_deluxe_content',NULL,'This content requires the base game BATTLETECH on Steam in order to play.','2018/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/799790/BATTLETECH_Digital_Deluxe_Content/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8458,'torchlight',NULL,'Adventure awaits in the award-winning Action RPG debut from Runic Games! Explore the randomized depths of this boom town, collect loot, and level up to save Torchlight - and possibly the world.','2009/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/41500/Torchlight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8459,'yasuke_simulator',NULL,'Step into 1579 as Yasuke, the African samurai, and join Oda Nobunaga in his quest to unite Japan! Master precise katana combat, uncover secret gear, and unleash your ancestral power in this historically inspired action-packed journey through feudal Japan.','2025/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3272300/Yasuke_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8460,'titanfall®_2:_angel_city\'s_most_wanted_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Titanfall® 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238104/Titanfall_2_Angel_Citys_Most_Wanted_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8461,'the_missing:_j.j._macfield_and_the_island_of_memories',NULL,'J.J. scours Memoria Island to find her best friend, who has gone missing during a camping trip. In order to save her best friend, she puts her own body and life on the line, reviving infinitely, as she presses forward. Why did she go missing? What is going on in this world?','2018/10/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/842910/The_MISSING_JJ_Macfield_and_the_Island_of_Memories/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8462,'trials_of_fire',NULL,'A Tactical, Deck-Building Roguelite. Choose 3 Heroes and adventure into a post-Cataclysmic wasteland. Engage enemies in a unique meld of card-play and tactical, positional combat. Level up and scavenge what you can to customise your decks and build a party to take on any challenge!','2021/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1038370/Trials_of_Fire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8463,'the_settlers®_7_:_history_edition',NULL,'Let yourself be enchanted by the new world of Settlers with this modernized History Edition – in the midst of green forests and lush meadows, it will bustle again. You alone hold the fate of your kingdom in your hands. Which strategy will you choose?','2019/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/965320/The_Settlers_7__History_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8464,'gigabash_-_godzilla_4_kaiju_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game GigaBash on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2161720/GigaBash__Godzilla_4_Kaiju_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8465,'long_live_the_queen',NULL,'Rule the world or die trying!Being a Princess is not an easy job. Being a Queen is even harder. Especially when you\'re only fourteen years old, and the reason you\'ve inherited the throne is that your royal mother has just met an untimely end.Now power is up for grabs.','2013/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/251990/Long_Live_The_Queen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8466,'voice_of_cards:_the_forsaken_maiden',NULL,'The second game in the unique Voice of Cards series, where all elements are presented entirely through the medium of cards, in the tradition of tabletop RPGs and gamebooks.','2022/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1748660/Voice_of_Cards_The_Forsaken_Maiden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_179'),(8467,'kingdom_under_fire:_heroes',NULL,'The cult hit Kingdom Under Fire saga continues on PC in glorious HD. Control seven new heroes across fifty brutal missions of hybrid hack n’ slash action and strategy. Crush your foes, hoard their treasure, and upgrade your forces for the next battle.','2020/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1315200/Kingdom_Under_Fire_Heroes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8468,'dino_path_trail',NULL,'Survive a Wild West where dinosaurs never went extinct. Fight off predators, outlaws, and the elements as you journey across deadly biomes to rescue your kidnapped sister. Hunt or be hunted in this ruthless survival roguelike.','2025/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2481670/Dino_Path_Trail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8469,'astalon:_tears_of_the_earth',NULL,'Uphold your pact with the Titan of Death, Epimetheus! Fight, climb and solve your way through a twisted tower as three unique adventurers, on a mission to save their village from impending doom!','2021/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1046400/Astalon_Tears_of_the_Earth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8470,'forgotten_realms:_the_archives_-_collection_two',NULL,'The Forgotten Realm Archives - Collection Two brings a healthy mix of “Gold Box” and nostalgia goodness to your PC, along with a combination of adventure builders, turn-based and real-time role-playing gameplay.','2022/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1882280/Forgotten_Realms_The_Archives__Collection_Two/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8471,'endless™_legend_-_tempest',NULL,'This content requires the base game ENDLESS™ Legend on Steam in order to play.','2016/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/521220/ENDLESS_Legend__Tempest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8472,'fallen_~makina_and_the_city_of_ruins~',NULL,'Fallen takes you on an adventure with Makina into the Ruins of Gardona. What fate awaits Makina and her friends on their travels as they descend further into the ruins? Find out in this JRPG classic!','2018/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/791330/Fallen_Makina_and_the_City_of_Ruins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8473,'9_years_of_shadows',NULL,'Fight to bring beautiful colors back to a hand-crafted world of darkness and discover the story of Europa, a young warrior, and her ghostly childhood companion, Apino.','2023/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1402120/9_Years_of_Shadows/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8474,'simpler_times',NULL,'Simpler Times is an experiential, interactive meditation that rewards patience and attention with poignant moments that can be replayed like a favorite song.','2024/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1812210/Simpler_Times/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8475,'ken_follett\'s_the_pillars_of_the_earth',NULL,'12th century, England: In a time of poverty and war, a small town begins the construction of a cathedral to claim wealth and safety for its people. In their struggle to survive, lives and destinies intertwine. Based on Ken Follett\'s world-bestseller ‘The Pillars of the Earth’.','2017/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/234270/Ken_Folletts_The_Pillars_of_the_Earth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8476,'train_simulator:_settle_to_carlisle_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2012/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/65255/Train_Simulator_Settle_to_Carlisle_Route_Addon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8477,'succubus_affection',NULL,'In a world of human-like monsters, a young man lives in a quiet, remote village with his sister. However, he is attacked by monsters when he leaves the village. Now he works hard to become stronger so he no longer burdens his sister.','2020/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1328890/Succubus_Affection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8478,'just_cause™_4_:_shark_&_bark_vehicle_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Just Cause 4 Reloaded on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1087131/Just_Cause_4__Shark__Bark_Vehicle_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8479,'escapists_2_-_glorious_regime_prison',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Escapists 2 on Steam in order to play.','2017/8/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/666350/Escapists_2__Glorious_Regime_Prison/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8480,'the_electrifying_incident:_a_monster_mini-expedition',NULL,'An adorable bite-sized adventure from the creators of A Monster’s Expedition - explore the facility, avoid the live electricity, and repair the malfunctioning reactor.','2025/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3352300/The_Electrifying_Incident_A_Monster_MiniExpedition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8481,'interior_worlds',NULL,'Snap your own homemade liminal space photos using a mysterious SLR camera as you explore a variety of empty, strange, and familiar spaces.','2023/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2207970/Interior_Worlds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8482,'strayed',NULL,'Strayed is an open-world multiplayer VR survival game focused on PvP interaction. Spawn empty-handed on the beaches of procedurally generated islands; explore the wilderness and deserted structures; gather resources and build your shelter. Be warned - others are just as motivated as you are.','2024/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2359470/Strayed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8483,'death_trash',NULL,'Death Trash features a post-apocalyptic world where cosmic horrors long for humanity but meet punks with shotguns. It combines old-school role-playing, modern action gameplay and player freedom. Create your own character and explore a handcrafted world.','2021/8/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/941460/Death_Trash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8484,'hextech_mayhem:_a_league_of_legends_story™',NULL,'In this fast-paced rhythm runner, every action has an explosive reaction and no amount of mayhem is too much. Take on the role of Hexplosives expert Ziggs as you rampage through the neighborhoods of Piltover!','2021/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1651960/Hextech_Mayhem_A_League_of_Legends_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8485,'disney_g-force',NULL,'G-Force draws you into the adventures of an elite team of trained guinea pigs on a mission to thwart a sinister plot to destroy the world. Take control of both G-Force commander Darwin and his sidekick, Mooch, as they apply their talents to defeat an evil army of altered household appliances.','2009/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/319170/Disney_GForce/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8486,'age_of_wonders:_planetfall_-_invasions',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Wonders: Planetfall on Steam in order to play.','2020/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1137801/Age_of_Wonders_Planetfall__Invasions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8487,'imscared',NULL,'\"I need a Heart in order to open it\"','2016/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/429720/IMSCARED/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8488,'disney_classic_games:_aladdin_and_the_lion_king',NULL,'The Disney 16-bit classics Aladdin and The Lion King return!','2019/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1126190/Disney_Classic_Games_Aladdin_and_The_Lion_King/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8489,'hero_of_the_kingdom:_the_lost_tales_3',NULL,'Lovely adventuring RPG series. Casual, story-driven journey and quests. A darkness is coming that will engulf the whole kingdom. Prepare for an adventure full of surprises and heroic deeds.','2024/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3340810/Hero_of_the_Kingdom_The_Lost_Tales_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8490,'witch_hunt',NULL,'Witch Hunt is a challenging horror themed hunting game that takes place in the 18th century. Main focus of the game is on exploration, non-linearity, and atmosphere.','2018/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/661790/Witch_Hunt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8491,'overthrown',NULL,'Lift and throw anything as you build and manage your kingdom in this chaotic city builder for 1-6 players. Harness the power of your soul-stealing crown to defend your citizens from bandits and mutants, farm the land, and gather resources. Keep citizens happy or see them desert you!','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1133500/Overthrown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8492,'phantom_fury',NULL,'Shelly “Bombshell” Harrison is back in this highly interactive mix of first person action and road movie adventure. Embark on an adrenaline-fueled journey around the USA. Use an enormous arsenal of weapons and skills to battle treacherous soldiers and vile mutants, all while trying to save mankind.','2024/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1733240/Phantom_Fury/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8493,'dr._fetus\'_mean_meat_machine',NULL,'Help Dr. Fetus create the perfect Meat Boy clone in a unique new twist on the tile-matching puzzle genre. In classic Meat Boy fashion, an endless cavalcade of devious and deadly traps stand between you and victory in this hardcore puzzle game that will push your skills to the limit.','2023/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2228030/Dr_Fetus_Mean_Meat_Machine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8494,'big_pharma',NULL,'What if you had it in your power to rid the world of disease, to improve the lives of millions, to ease suffering and cure the sick… and earn a tidy profit? As the head of your own Pharmaceutical Conglomerate you have this power resting in your hands. Will you use it for good?','2015/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/344850/Big_Pharma/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8495,'supreme_ruler_2030_expansion_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Supreme Ruler 2030 on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2702500/Supreme_Ruler_2030_Expansion_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8496,'upgun',NULL,'Face your friends in UpGun! Use each round to accumulate skills and overtake your opponents in this crazy deathmatch!','2021/8/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1575870/UpGun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8497,'train_valley',NULL,'Build railways, manage traffic and stay accident-free. Play in Europe, America, Japan and USSR in 1830-2020. Complete the story mode from the Gold Rush of 1849 to the first manned spaceflight, and then explore the random mode. Management. Construction. Trains. Welcome to Train Valley!','2015/9/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/353640/Train_Valley/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8498,'anode_heart:_layer_null',NULL,'Isometric card battler RPG with a touch of virtual creatures, set in a futuristic, digital world, with over-the-top villains and a very shadowy plot.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3068670/Anode_Heart_Layer_Null/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8499,'one_finger_death_punch_2',NULL,'The world\'s fastest brawler is back. Experience cinematic kung-fu in the most epic stickman fighter ever made. Staying true to the original, you play with only two buttons. Every press matters, do not button mash!','2019/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/980300/One_Finger_Death_Punch_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8500,'gravelord',NULL,'Gravelord is a fast-paced boomer shooter voiced by a badass protagonist featuring hand-crafted levels filled with secrets and hordes of enemies to kill. Dish out some brutal carnage with powerful guns and collect Tarot Cards to gain even more killing power. Let\'s put the fun back in funeral!','2025/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1823990/Gravelord/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8501,'the_fancy_pants_adventures:_classic_pack',NULL,'The classic Flash game series, compiled as the ultimate Fancy Pants fan collection - with updated visuals, loads of bonus features, and brand new Back Pages bonus levels. Follow along in Early Access, as creator Brad Borne brings these games back to their former glory. Run Fast, Run Fancy!','2024/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1668460/The_Fancy_Pants_Adventures_Classic_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8502,'golf_with_your_friends_-_fairytale_fables_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Golf With Your Friends on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2456991/Golf_With_Your_Friends__Fairytale_Fables_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8503,'moon_mystery',NULL,'The Moon\'s haunted - and when an astronaut loses contact with Earth, the adventure begins in full. Fill up your oxygen, load up the guns, and set out on an interstellar FPS adventure across the stars, filled with puzzles, fights, exploration, and strange secrets of the universe.','2024/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1933840/Moon_Mystery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8504,'the_callisto_protocol™_-_final_transmission',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Callisto Protocol™ on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2005983/The_Callisto_Protocol__Final_Transmission/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8505,'sail_forth',NULL,'Sail a fleet of customizable ships across an ocean whose ancient depths have swallowed the key to the mysterious past. Befriend fishfolk to expand your boat crews, take up arms against petulant pirates, and chart a course across an expansive watery world. Will you answer the call of High Adventure?','2022/12/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1031460/Sail_Forth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8506,'equilinox',NULL,'Equilinox is a relaxing nature simulation game in which you can create and nurture your own ecosystems. Shape the world to your liking, cultivate and raise hundreds of different species, and evolve your wildlife to unlock more exotic plants and animals.','2018/11/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/853550/Equilinox/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8507,'under_night_in-birth_exe:late[cl-r]',NULL,'Pick one of 20 unique characters and fight your way through the dangers of the “Hollow Night”, and claim your victory over those who would get in your way. Experience intuitive and tight 2D fighter controls, with a splash of devastating combos and unique fighting styles to keep your appetite for battle sated!','2018/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/801630/UNDER_NIGHT_INBIRTH_ExeLateclr/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8508,'sniper:_ghost_warrior',NULL,'As a Ghost Warrior, an elite sniper in a highly trained special ops unit, your unique skills in the art of stalking, target detection, surveillance and shooting accuracy will determine mission success.','2010/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/34830/Sniper_Ghost_Warrior/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8509,'miss_neko:_pirates',NULL,'Pirates ahead! The pirate girls on Skull Island have yet to witness the true extent of your prowess, Captain. Can you conquer them one by one with your ❤SKILLS❤ and plunder that precious treasure onto your ship?','2024/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2695270/Miss_Neko_Pirates/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8510,'knights_of_pen_and_paper_2',NULL,'Prepare to inhabit a world of chivalry, class warfare and off-beat pop references. Knights of Pen & Paper 2 is a turn-based, retro style, pixel-art adventure full of danger, intrigue, death, and saving throws!','2015/10/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/310060/Knights_of_Pen_and_Paper_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8511,'riders_republic_skate_plus_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Riders Republic on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2605010/Riders_Republic_Skate_Plus_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8512,'ereban:_shadow_legacy',NULL,'Ereban: Shadow Legacy is a fast-paced stealth platformer game where you become Ayana, the last descendant of a forgotten race. Harness mystical shadow powers, high-tech gadgets and avoid or kill to uncover the truth about your past and the key to saving a dying, morally grey universe.','2024/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1671360/Ereban_Shadow_Legacy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8513,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_super_stripes_paint_jobs_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1415700/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Super_Stripes_Paint_Jobs_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_180'),(8514,'metal_slug_3',NULL,'“METAL SLUG 3”, the masterpiece in SNK’s emblematic 2D run & gun action shooting game series, still continues to fascinate millions of fans worldwide to this day for its intricate dot-pixel graphics, and simple and intuitive game controls, heads out to the Steam gaming platform!','2014/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/250180/METAL_SLUG_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8515,'rebel_inc:_escalation_-_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Rebel Inc: Escalation, but does not include the base game.','2019/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1181630/Rebel_Inc_Escalation__Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8516,'maliki_:_poison_of_the_past',NULL,'Join Maliki and her wacky family in their epic battle against Poison, a fearsome plant creature that has colonized space-time. Go along on a fantastic odyssey through the ages that provides a unique mix of exploration, temporal riddles and turn-based fights full of surprises.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2893260/Maliki__Poison_Of_The_Past/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8517,'pipe_by_bmx_streets',NULL,'PIPE is a physics based BMX experience built for the BMX community designed to simulate realistic BMX motion. Perform over 50 aerial stunts, grind any corner, send big airs in the PIPE! PIPE also includes some fun Easter Eggs for those willing to explore and think outside the box.','2018/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/815780/PIPE_by_BMX_Streets/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8518,'elsword_free-to-play',NULL,'Elsword is your exciting, side-scrolling, all-action role-playing game: create your own hero, style up to suit your tastes and show off your skills in countless solo and multiplayer adventures – all presented in awesome manga visuals.','2018/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/558230/Elsword_FreetoPlay/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8519,'simon_the_sorcerer:_25th_anniversary_edition',NULL,'There are some things that kids just shouldn\'t have to put up with. Being transported to some weird dimension full of goblins, dwarves, swamplings, stupid wizards and sleeping giants is definitely one of them. Join Simon\'s quest to rescue the wizard Calypso from the evil sorcerer Sordid.','2018/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/674150/Simon_the_Sorcerer_25th_Anniversary_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8520,'usac:_code_breach',NULL,'USAC: Code Breach™ is a unique coop experience set in a cyberpunk universe. As a special police unit, you and your partner are called in to investigate the unexpected shutdown of a high-tech research facility. Between reflection and action, you must survive a situation that is beyond you.','2022/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1886070/USAC_Code_Breach/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8521,'bioweaver',NULL,'Bioweaver is an RPG game with the main content of treasure hunting and character building. You can use basic programming logic to deeply customize your skill sets, and you can also create organs with different attributes and functions with the special crafting system.','2024/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3177970/Bioweaver/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8522,'journey_of_wrestling',NULL,'A wrestling management sim that\'s easy to pick up and play. Book fantasy matches, create epic stories and develop your wrestlers as you grow to dominate the industry. With extensive customization and depth, you can bring your wrestling dreams to life.','2024/6/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2941580/Journey_of_Wrestling/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8523,'beyond_contact',NULL,'A fiercely formidable sci-fi survival game, set on a hostile alien world that wants you dead! Alone, or with a crew, do you have what it takes to survive?','2023/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/877010/Beyond_Contact/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8524,'cursorblade',NULL,'Cursorblade is a bullet hell game where you play as the cursor, fighting your way through waves of enemies. Combine weapons and items to become more powerful with your own unique builds. Slash, dodge, upgrade, and repeat!','2023/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2449040/Cursorblade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8525,'leaf_blower_revolution_-_materials_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Leaf Blower Revolution - Idle Game on Steam in order to play.','2022/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1873910/Leaf_Blower_Revolution__Materials_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8526,'steamworld_heist:_the_outsider',NULL,'This content requires the base game SteamWorld Heist on Steam in order to play.','2016/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/464840/SteamWorld_Heist_The_Outsider/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8527,'wyrmhall:_brush_and_banter',NULL,'Meet quirky characters and clean strange artifacts in this short cozy comedy game. From an enchanted teacup to a cursed skull with a chip on its shoulder, each item and client brings new twists and surprises.','2025/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2937590/WYRMHALL_Brush_and_Banter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8528,'raw_data',NULL,'Built from the ground up for VR, Raw Data’s action gameplay, intuitive controls, challenging enemies, and sci-fi atmosphere will completely immerse you within the surreal world of Eden Corp. Go solo or team up and become the adrenaline-charged heroes of your own futuristic technothriller.','2017/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/436320/Raw_Data/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8529,'battlestar_galactica_deadlock:_the_broken_alliance',NULL,'This content requires the base game Battlestar Galactica Deadlock on Steam in order to play.','2018/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/726560/Battlestar_Galactica_Deadlock_The_Broken_Alliance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8530,'destroy_all_humans!_skin_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Destroy All Humans! on Steam in order to play.','2020/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1254570/Destroy_All_Humans_Skin_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8531,'just_cause™_4:_soaring_speed_vehicle_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Just Cause 4 Reloaded on Steam in order to play.','2019/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1087121/Just_Cause_4_Soaring_Speed_Vehicle_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8532,'return_from_core',NULL,'Dig, explore, build, farm, automate, and meet charming Monster Girls in this sandbox RPG. Build your camp, plant crops, set up automated production lines and prepare for an unforgettable adventure!','2023/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2171630/Return_from_Core/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8533,'the_last_visit:_98th',NULL,'\"The Last Visit: 98th\" is a psychological indie horror from the first person, in the genre of a walking simulator, in the setting of the post-Soviet winter space. The main focus is on the atmosphere of horror, which is emphasized by realistic 3D graphics.','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2934890/The_Last_Visit_98th/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8534,'just_cause™_4:_sea_dogs_vehicle_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Just Cause 4 Reloaded on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1087123/Just_Cause_4_Sea_Dogs_Vehicle_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8535,'midnight_girl',NULL,'Midnight Girl is a casual point-and-click adventure game. The game takes place in France during the Sixties. The story, mood, and style of the game are inspired by the city of Paris, Belgian comics and heist films from the Sixties.','2023/10/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1578990/Midnight_Girl/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8536,'fashion_police_squad',NULL,'Even at this moment, our fashionable city is under assault. Baggy pants, dull suits, sightings of socks with sandals. A message needs to be sent, and it needs to be sent in style... Time to serve some good ol\' Fashion Justice!','2022/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1319460/Fashion_Police_Squad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8537,'my_dream_setup_-_pets_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game My Dream Setup on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2637930/My_Dream_Setup__Pets_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8538,'let_them_come',NULL,'Let Them Come is a fast paced pixel art shoot ‘em up. Twitchy trigger fingers and focused battle tactics are the order of the day as wave after wave of alien-like creatures try to take you down.','2017/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/505630/Let_Them_Come/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8539,'apewar',NULL,'Apewar is an online tactical and action FPS/TPS monkey war game adapted from real life. Build your monkey team and fight against your enemies. By playing in a coordinated way, you can have fun and win with a good strategy. Monkeys are strong together!','2023/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2306590/Apewar/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8540,'il-2_sturmovik:_gaz-mm_72-k_anti-aircraft_gun',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2021/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1622750/IL2_Sturmovik_GAZMM_72K_AntiAircraft_Gun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8541,'don\'t_be_afraid_2',NULL,'Descend deep into the nightmare that seamlessly blends with reality in this uncanny horror escape room game. Can you find your way out of the horrid mansion or will you succumb to your fears? Can you face and overcome your past, or will it break you?','2024/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2631880/Dont_Be_Afraid_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8542,'the_labyrinth_of_grisaia',NULL,'“Are things OK as they are?” In every second of every minute of the life the young man had lived, the same thought recurred in his mind. Looking back on his past, the girls he’d met in this peaceful life made him feel guilty, and his heart was tormented with that guilt.','2016/6/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/345620/The_Labyrinth_of_Grisaia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8543,'naval_action_-_prolific_forger',NULL,'This content requires the base game Naval Action on Steam in order to play.','2018/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/785910/Naval_Action__Prolific_Forger/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8544,'fraymakers',NULL,'Fraymakers is the ultimate customizable platform fighting game, featuring a cast of some of indie gaming\'s biggest icons. Duke it out with up to 4 players and call on assists to help out in the heat of battle. Create and play custom characters, stages, modes, and more for infinite fun!','2023/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1420350/Fraymakers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8545,'just_cause™_4:_toy_vehicle_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Just Cause 4 Reloaded on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1087120/Just_Cause_4_Toy_Vehicle_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8546,'monochrome_mobius:_rights_and_wrongs_forgotten',NULL,'A new JRPG from veteran studio AQUAPLUS, commemorating 20 years of the multi-media Utawarerumono series. This is the story of a man who will be sung about in legends.','2022/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1962430/Monochrome_Mobius_Rights_and_Wrongs_Forgotten/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8547,'trackmania²_canyon',NULL,'TrackMania² Canyon will let you experience the fun and adrenaline of racing stunning cars on sensational tracks in a major enhanced sequel to Nadeo Studio’s online racing phenomenon TrackMania, already enjoyed by millions of players.','2011/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/228760/TrackMania_Canyon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8548,'carrier_deck',NULL,'Carrier Deck is a fast paced time management game where you play as the Air Boss on board the CVN-76 in the midst of active war.','2017/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/580720/Carrier_Deck/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8549,'banned_footage_vol.1',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil 7 Biohazard on Steam in order to play.','2017/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/529930/Banned_Footage_Vol1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8550,'steel_assault',NULL,'Punch, whip, and zipline your way through a post-apocalyptic America in this 16-bit retro-style action platformer! Play as Taro Takahashi, a resistance soldier on a revenge mission against the dictator who lords over the ashes.','2021/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1280300/Steel_Assault/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8551,'il-2_sturmovik:_spitfire_mk.vb_collector_plane',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/894700/IL2_Sturmovik_Spitfire_MkVB_Collector_Plane/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8552,'witchspring3_re:fine_-_the_story_of_eirudy_-',NULL,'Choose fate. Choose story. The fate of the witches is in your hands.','2021/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1592520/WitchSpring3_ReFine__The_Story_of_Eirudy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8553,'that_which_gave_chase',NULL,'A first-person dog sledding thriller. Play as a sled dog musher hired to transport a scientist deep into the unforgiving wastes of the arctic.','2023/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2431100/That_Which_Gave_Chase/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8554,'a_year_of_springs',NULL,'Experience the stories of Haru, Erika, and Manami, a trio of friends navigating their feelings of love, connection, and just wanting to belong.','2021/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1688580/A_YEAR_OF_SPRINGS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_181'),(8555,'il-2_sturmovik:_ta_152_h-1_collector_plane',NULL,'This content requires the base game IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/18','Released','https://stor