inal_Vendetta/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8562,'xanadu_next',NULL,'Whenever mist hangs over Lake Orwell, sailors catch sight of a phantom castle just out of reach. As they draw near, it fades away, leaving only questions for all who have seen this “Castle Strangerock.” Now, you must aid your charge in uncovering its secrets...even if it costs you your very soul.','2016/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/312560/Xanadu_Next/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8563,'resident_evil_2_-_leon_costume:_noir',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/920561/Resident_Evil_2__Leon_Costume_Noir/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8564,'dragon_ball_xenoverse_2_conton_city_vote_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1999190/DRAGON_BALL_XENOVERSE_2_Conton_City_Vote_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8565,'them\'s_fightin\'_herds',NULL,'Them’s Fightin’ Herds is a 2D fighting game featuring a cast of adorable animals designed by acclaimed cartoon producer Lauren Faust. Beneath the cute and cuddly surface, a serious fighter awaits!','2020/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/574980/Thems_Fightin_Herds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8566,'cats_love_boxes',NULL,'Fofiño and Lily are always in pursue of fun, particularly boxes! Help them to move the boxes around in this puzzle adventure! ฅ^•ﻌ•^ฅ','2024/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1961160/Cats_Love_Boxes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8567,'jotunnslayer:_hordes_of_hel_-_odin’s_legendary_armor_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Jotunnslayer: Hordes of Hel on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3400400/Jotunnslayer_Hordes_of_Hel__Odins_Legendary_Armor_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8568,'vengeance_hunters',NULL,'Vengeance Hunters is an adrenaline fueled Neo-Geo hardware developed beat’em’up that lets you and a friend in local co-op fight mutants, zombies, punks, gangsters, lab techs with bombs (you read that correctly), suited mystery men, cyborgs and more across multiple stages, sublevels and secret areas.','2024/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2738110/Vengeance_Hunters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8569,'arkcraft:_the_rebirth_of_the_world',NULL,'In this open-world crafting and building game, you explore an ancient world full of dangers and secrets. Collect animals and plants, build bases and master the craft as you build your ark and save civilization from destruction by the flood and then rebuild it.','2024/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2869610/ArkCraft_The_Rebirth_of_the_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8570,'war_thunder_-_black_shark_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game War Thunder on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1557850/War_Thunder__Black_Shark_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8571,'sweet_transit',NULL,'Sweet Transit is a unique city builder where the railway is king. Build and automate the dream supply chain for your citizens, giving them all they need to expand quaint villages into bustling cities. Progress from steam power to diesel and beyond in this advanced train-driven experience.','2024/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1612770/Sweet_Transit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8572,'darksiders_ii_deathinitive_edition_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Darksiders II Deathinitive Edition, but does not include the base game.','2015/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/417380/Darksiders_II_Deathinitive_Edition_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8573,'distant_worlds_2:_factions_-_quameno_and_gizureans',NULL,'This content requires the base game Distant Worlds 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2409480/Distant_Worlds_2_Factions__Quameno_and_Gizureans/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8574,'europa_universalis_iii_complete',NULL,'Europa Universalis III Complete includes the original Europa Universalis III as well as the expansions In Nomine and Napoleons Ambition Europa Universalis III delves deeply into the areas of exploration, trade, warfare and diplomacy.','2007/1/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/25800/Europa_Universalis_III_Complete/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8575,'violent_horror_stories:_anthology',NULL,'4 short horror games from different authors and in different genres. Each game is an author\'s vision on the theme of \'pursuit\'.','2024/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3080380/Violent_Horror_Stories_anthology/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8576,'undead_horde_2:_necropolis',NULL,'As a powerful necromancer you have the ability to raise the dead and command them in battle. With each victory, your army will grow stronger and your city will become more powerful. Undead Horde 2 is an action game with elements from RPG, strategy and hack\'n\'slash. Rise from the crypt and rebuild!','2023/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2065810/Undead_Horde_2_Necropolis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8577,'the_witcher_adventure_game',NULL,'The Witcher Adventure Game is a digital adaptation of CD PROJEKT RED’s board game set in the brutal fantasy universe of monster slayer Geralt of Rivia. Travel across the beautifully rendered world of The Witcher and complete a variety of quests — hunt deadly beasts, solve ancient mysteries and more.','2014/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/303800/The_Witcher_Adventure_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8578,'devil_may_cry_5_original_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Devil May Cry 5, but does not include the base game.','2019/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1050460/Devil_May_Cry_5_Original_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8579,'loopers',NULL,'Tyler is a high schooler on a mission. He\'s going to use every minute of summer vacation to go on as many GPS-assisted scavenger hunts as possible. After running into some old friends during one of these hunts, strange things start happening: The day resets and today plays out exactly like yesterday','2023/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1811500/LOOPERS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8580,'a_hand_with_many_fingers',NULL,'Unravel a real conspiracy from deep within the CIA’s archives. Search classified documents and follow new leads in this non-linear investigative thriller.','2020/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1229030/A_Hand_With_Many_Fingers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8581,'blazing_aries',NULL,'The game tells the story of a new adventurer named Aries. She visits all kinds of cities, travels around the unknown world, fights against the \"Calamities\" that spread all over the world. This game\'s core is the orthodox action fighting mode!','2022/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1658930/Blazing_Aries/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8582,'risk:_global_domination_-_premium_mode',NULL,'This content requires the base game RISK: Global Domination on Steam in order to play.','2020/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1179450/RISK_Global_Domination__Premium_Mode/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8583,'train_sim_world®_5:_flixtrain_br_193_vectron_loco_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970830/Train_Sim_World_5_FlixTrain_BR_193_Vectron_Loco_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8584,'ai_limit_-_deluxe_edition_upgrade_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game AI LIMIT on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3391010/AI_LIMIT__Deluxe_Edition_Upgrade_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8585,'x3:_terran_conflict',NULL,'It is the year 2938. The long wished-for encounter of the X Universe and the Earth holds both joy and sorrow for the people. Despite flourishing trade, the clash of the diverse races, cultures and life forms creates new tensions, mistrust and open conflict that need to be overcome!','2008/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2820/X3_Terran_Conflict/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8586,'crime_boss:_rockay_city_-_cracker_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crime Boss: Rockay City on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3337580/Crime_Boss_Rockay_City__Cracker_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8587,'agent_intercept',NULL,'Agent Intercept is an over-the-top arcade action game where you drive a transforming spy vehicle through exotic locales, perform ridiculous stunts, and blow things up to save the world — in style!','2021/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1502710/Agent_Intercept/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8588,'train_simulator:_feather_river_canyon_enhanced:_oroville_-_portola',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2662410/Train_Simulator_Feather_River_Canyon_Enhanced_Oroville__Portola/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8589,'payday_2:_dragon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1555040/PAYDAY_2_Dragon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8590,'i_am_bread',NULL,'You are bread. Your mission, become toast! Take on all hazards to deliciousness as you head on an epic adventure in one of the the toughest games ever baked. All of the game modes (including Bagel Race) are now unlocked so there\'s sure to be something to suit everyone\'s taste!','2015/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/327890/I_Am_Bread/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8591,'robotics;notes_dash',NULL,'Half a year after the events of ROBOTICS;NOTES ELITE, Kaito Yashio is introduced to Itaru Hashida through Nae Tennouji. Unsettling incidents start occurring all around them, harbingers of an event that will again plunge the world into chaos.','2020/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1111390/ROBOTICSNOTES_DaSH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8592,'payday_2:_mcshay_mod_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2218650/PAYDAY_2_McShay_Mod_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8593,'decision:_red_daze',NULL,'Decision: Red Daze is an action RPG with a unique mix of survival and tower defense mechanics. Explore an apocalyptic wasteland, build a safe haven, and lead your team of specialists in a hopeless world, searching for a cure for the infectious disease that turns people into monsters.','2022/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1621760/Decision_Red_Daze/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8594,'wargame:_red_dragon_-_nation_pack:_netherlands',NULL,'This content requires the base game Wargame: Red Dragon on Steam in order to play.','2016/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/443730/Wargame_Red_Dragon__Nation_Pack_Netherlands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8595,'airline_tycoon_deluxe',NULL,'Airline Tycoon Deluxe is a funny economy simulation proceeding in realtime and assigning you the complete responsibility for an airline.','1998/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/331920/Airline_Tycoon_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8596,'ultimate_ragdoll_game',NULL,'Ultimate Ragdoll Game is a Sandbox game without any limits. Have fun with ragdolls available in Steam Workshop and build your very own constructions using wide variety of blocks.','2024/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1978720/Ultimate_Ragdoll_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8597,'project_demigod',NULL,'Suit up and save the day in Project Demigod, a physics-driven superhero sandbox with limitless possibilities.','2024/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1646580/Project_Demigod/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8598,'great_houses_of_calderia',NULL,'Great Houses of Calderia is a Feudal Grand Strategy game focusing on family dynamics & stories. Use your family strengths to compete against rivals to rise in the ranks of Calderia - produce, trade, scheme, bribe, and battle to build your legacy of power!','2024/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1812910/Great_Houses_of_Calderia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8599,'it\'s_quiz_time',NULL,'It\'s Quiz Time lets up to 8 players compete against each other to find out who the true quiz master is! Presented by Salli, the latest and greatest in quiz hosting technology, this game has over 30,000 questions ready for you, covering all the popular films, songs, books, and video games!','2017/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/648780/Its_Quiz_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8600,'sailing_era:_edge_of_the_world',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sailing Era on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2401890/Sailing_Era_Edge_of_the_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8601,'rock_star_life_simulator',NULL,'Rock Star Life Simulator is an extensive fame simulation game. Start this adventure by playing the guitar on the street, form your own band. Protect the fame, money, and charisma you earned with the right decisions and become a world star!','2025/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2530950/Rock_Star_Life_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8602,'ghost_janitors',NULL,'Ghost Janitors is a multiplayer psychological horror game for 1-4 players. Your job? Cleaning haunted houses while avoiding terrifying monsters. Ready to face the spine-tingling challenge with your team?','2024/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2772990/Ghost_Janitors/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8603,'motogp™21',NULL,'Take your place on the starting grid and get ready for the most realistic and immersive MotoGP™ videogame ever. Live the most authentic 2-wheels racing experience with the new MotoGP™21!','2021/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1447000/MotoGP21/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8604,'field_of_glory:_empires',NULL,'Field of Glory: Empires is a grand strategy game in which you will have to move in an intricate and living tapestry of nations and tribes, each one with their distinctive culture.','2019/7/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1011390/Field_of_Glory_Empires/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8605,'lonely_mountains:_downhill_-_eldfjall_island',NULL,'This content requires the base game Lonely Mountains: Downhill on Steam in order to play.','2020/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1256740/Lonely_Mountains_Downhill__Eldfjall_Island/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_182'),(8606,'pesterquest',NULL,'Embark on a quest of epic importance in Pesterquest, a grimsical episodic visual novel adventure set in the darkly funny Homestuck / Hiveswap universe, created by American author and artist Andrew Hussie.','2019/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1144030/Pesterquest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8607,'dragonloop',NULL,'Dragonloop is a Metroidvania that combines time and map design. Explore the big world in a five-day loop and open up new world lines. Explore a 2D hand-drawn world, engage in fast-paced and refreshing battles, retrieve memories.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2059210/DragonLoop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8608,'crisis_brigade_2_reloaded',NULL,'Crisis Brigade 2 reloaded is about covering, pointing and shooting, fast-paced pure action. Intense shootouts, powerful weapons, challenging levels, fierce enemies... Like the 90\'s classic arcade machines, but with the immersion that Virtual Reality is capable of.','2020/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1066180/Crisis_Brigade_2_reloaded/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8609,'plug_&_play',NULL,'Run, hit, switch, fall, love, plug, pull. And push.','2015/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/353560/Plug__Play/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8610,'resident_evil_village_-_street_wolf_outfit',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil Village on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1731081/Resident_Evil_Village__Street_Wolf_Outfit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8611,'14_minesweeper_variants',NULL,'Minesweeper but the rules are changing.','2022/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1865060/14_Minesweeper_Variants/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8612,'stories_from_the_outbreak',NULL,'Stories from the Outbreak is a turn-based roguelike zombie RPG. Lead a group of survivors from the doomed city of Riga towards a ferry sailing across the North Sea. Scavenge for supplies, battle the undead, decide the fate of your team. What are you willing to sacrifice in order to survive?','2024/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1968630/Stories_from_the_Outbreak/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8613,'the_sims™_4_urban_homage_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2738350/The_Sims_4_Urban_Homage_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8614,'kaze_and_the_wild_masks',NULL,'Go on a journey as Kaze in this 90’s classics inspired platformer. When the Crystal Islands get cursed, Kaze needs to save her friend Hogo while facing enraged living vegetables. Find the Wild Masks to unleash the powers of the legendary guardians and master land, sky and sea.','2021/3/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/829280/Kaze_and_the_Wild_Masks/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8615,'neon_hearts_city',NULL,'A private investigator, tracking a missing person, uncovers a conspiracy between humans and androids and a secret that could change everything. Neon Hearts City is a retro point-and-click adventure that thrusts you into a grungy cyberpunk city of the future.','2025/5/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3316640/Neon_Hearts_City/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8616,'mk1:_omni-man',NULL,'This content requires the base game Mortal Kombat 1 on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2636080/MK1_OmniMan/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8617,'14_minesweeper_variants_2',NULL,'Minesweeper but the rules are changing, again.','2024/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2631960/14_Minesweeper_Variants_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8618,'fubuki_～zero_in_on_holoearth～_hololive_alternative',NULL,'『FUBUKI ~zero in on Holoearth~』is a high-speed pixel action game where you control the protagonist, Shirakami Fubuki, and battle using swords and skills.','2025/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3446990/FUBUKI_zero_in_on_Holoearth_HOLOLIVE_ALTERNATIVE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8619,'first_bite',NULL,'An LGBTQ+ Vampiric Visual Novel. One Night. Three vampires. Make a deal with death or die trying.','2022/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1834820/First_Bite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8620,'saihate_station',NULL,'An exploration/horror/adventure game about the codependent, love-hate relationship between two men.','2025/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3079280/Saihate_Station/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8621,'guild_saga:_vanished_worlds',NULL,'On your maiden voyage with the Heroes Guild, your ship was capsized by an enigmatic maelstrom, stranding your party on Respite Island. Navigate your way through pirates, ferocious beasts, and shady alchemists as you unravel its mysteries.','2024/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2184350/Guild_Saga_Vanished_Worlds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8622,'super_seducer_2_-_advanced_seduction_tactics',NULL,'Ready to take your skills with women to the NEXT next level in this amazing sequel to the smash hit Super Seducer? We put you in everyday scenarios and let you do practically anything to see how it plays out with beautiful women.','2018/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/863570/Super_Seducer_2__Advanced_Seduction_Tactics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8623,'voidborn',NULL,'Slay demons and demigods in this fast-paced roguelite FPS. Create devastating weapon builds as you journey through massive dark fantasy environments on your quest to avenge god. Challenge the demigods, face inevitable death, and rise stronger with every rebirth.','2025/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2072660/Voidborn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8624,'rising_storm_2:_vietnam_-_sgt_joe\'s_support_bundle_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Rising Storm 2: Vietnam on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1042390/Rising_Storm_2_Vietnam__Sgt_Joes_Support_Bundle_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8625,'payday_2:_gage_ninja_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2015/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/384021/PAYDAY_2_Gage_Ninja_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8626,'death_of_a_wish',NULL,'THE NEO-SANCTUM SHALL FALL. Claim retribution against the theocratic Faiths as you master vicious hack-and-slash combat in this action-RPG where style is salvation.','2024/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2302080/Death_of_a_Wish/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8627,'unbound:_worlds_apart',NULL,'Summon portals to overcome vicious beasts, devious puzzles and fiendish platforming challenges. Master the unique powers of each portal to stop the collapse of reality, while exploring lush, hand-drawn worlds and unraveling a deep narrative full of mysteries.','2021/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/814680/Unbound_Worlds_Apart/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8628,'the_castles_of_burgundy',NULL,'Stefan Feld\'s highly decorated board game \"The Castles Of Burgundy\" by Ravensburger is getting its digital version on Steam! Enjoy against the challenging AI or friends a beautiful digital version of the classic board game!','2019/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/903040/The_Castles_of_Burgundy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8629,'disc_room',NULL,'Are you ready to get sliced in half? The year is 2089 and a giant disc has appeared in orbit of Jupiter. Step into the oversized space suit of a brave scientist and explore this sprawling intergalactic slaughterhouse.','2020/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1229580/Disc_Room/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8630,'greak:_memories_of_azur',NULL,'Greak: Memories of Azur is a single-player puzzle platformer adventure. Azur is under threat from an enemy attack who have control of strange creatures infecting the land. Take on the role of three siblings: Greak, Adara and Raydel and utilize their unique abilities to escape the invasion together.','2021/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1311070/Greak_Memories_of_Azur/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8631,'power_to_the_people',NULL,'Build and maintain a power grid for a constantly growing population, while fighting off all kinds of disasters in this thrilling resource management experience. It\'s time for you to give \"Power to the People\"! Do you have what it takes to keep the lights on?','2022/2/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1413370/Power_to_the_People/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8632,'payday_2:_mega_city_tailor_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1778791/PAYDAY_2_Mega_City_Tailor_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8633,'nancy_drew®:_sea_of_darkness',NULL,'Set a Course for Danger and Discovery!','2015/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/572700/Nancy_Drew_Sea_of_Darkness/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8634,'amazing_frog?_2',NULL,'Amazing Frog? 2 is the next generation of Amazing Frog? A Hardcore Parkour, open world buffet of bonkers physics sandbox ...ness.','2022/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1559680/Amazing_Frog_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8635,'dance_dash',NULL,'Arcade-style rhythm pumping FREE FULL BODY TRACKING on VR & PC. Empowered by mobile/webcam AI tracking. Groove to 100s of community songs and maps IN-GAME plus viral dance videos and MVs.','2023/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2005050/Dance_Dash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8636,'baionlenja',NULL,'BAIONLENJA is a skill-based FPS about B-HOPPING and BLADEJUMPING. Explore the megastructure and the horrors that lie within.','2025/5/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3509160/BAIONLENJA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8637,'combat_mission:_final_blitzkrieg',NULL,'Combat Mission Final Blitzkrieg (CMFB) follows the Western Allies through the battles along Germany\'s border and into the heart of the Reich itself.','2024/1/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2676000/Combat_Mission_Final_Blitzkrieg/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8638,'party_hard_2',NULL,'It\'s 3am and you just want to get some sleep. Welcome back to Party Hard! Stop parties using hundreds of new ways, incidentally destroy a drug syndicate, and save the Earth from an alien invasion. May the chickens be with you!','2018/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/572430/Party_Hard_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8639,'train_simulator:_frankfurt_u-bahn_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2019/3/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/896715/Train_Simulator_Frankfurt_UBahn_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8640,'uncover_the_smoking_gun',NULL,'A Battle of Wits with AI: Solve the case by conversing with a suspect robot using GPT to gather evidence. What single truth emerges from countless dialogues and pieces of information?','2024/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2492290/Uncover_the_Smoking_Gun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8641,'headbangers:_rhythm_royale',NULL,'Headbangers is a light-hearted, Rhythm Battle Royale Game where you and 29 other Pigeons compete against each other, all to complete your quest of claiming the title of Master Headbanger!','2023/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1761620/Headbangers_Rhythm_Royale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8642,'millennium_whisper',NULL,'It’s 1999 and there\'s a rumour going around. Whoever you confess your feelings to at the end of the millennium will be with you for a thousand years! Who will you choose on New Year\'s eve?','2025/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3156240/Millennium_Whisper/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8643,'kanade',NULL,'A visual novel about becoming lovers with Kanade—a half-human, half-alien girl. Enjoy a tender relationship with Kanade and witness how love blossoms into a song that saves the world.','2025/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3104270/KANADE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8644,'nancy_drew®:_treasure_in_the_royal_tower',NULL,'Follow Ancient Clues to Find Marie Antoinette’s Legendary Secret!','2001/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/615780/Nancy_Drew_Treasure_in_the_Royal_Tower/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8645,'hookah_haze',NULL,'It\'s the year 2xxx. The inexperienced Toru Sumiki lands a job managing Hookah Haze, a new hookah lounge on the outskirts of Akihabara, where they meet three eccentric girls. The story unfolds as the girls gradually open up to them, connecting through their fondness for hookah...','2024/7/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2470300/Hookah_Haze/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8646,'mysterium:_a_psychic_clue_game',NULL,'Mysterium is a cooperative deduction game set in the 1920s in which a ghost guides a group of psychics to uncover a murderer, as well as the weapon and location of the murder, using only visual clues.','2017/1/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/556180/Mysterium_A_Psychic_Clue_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8647,'pit_of_goblin',NULL,'In this online horror co-op, you play as a scrappy goblin, scavenging dungeons, dodging traps, and fleeing monsters to feed the Goblin King-Queen. Team up with goblin pals, or go rogue, as you dive deep and cause chaos! Fail to feed them, and you might be the next meal!','2024/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3253530/PIT_OF_GOBLIN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_183'),(8648,'endless™_legend_-_inferno',NULL,'This content requires the base game ENDLESS™ Legend on Steam in order to play.','2018/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/854750/ENDLESS_Legend__Inferno/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8649,'mega_mosaic',NULL,'Mega Mosaic is a meditative game about completing a single enormous puzzle','2024/5/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2915950/Mega_Mosaic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8650,'sudocats',NULL,'Sudoku for cat people. Cats are wonderful creatures but you better not put them together without proper introduction. So, plan ahead to display them in the right order so they get along!','2022/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1725640/Sudocats/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8651,'mutilate-a-doll_2',NULL,'A highly customizable virtual stressball and physics sandbox about mutilating ragdolls in various ways using an overwhelming amount of weapons and tools.','2019/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/665370/MutilateaDoll_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8652,'train_simulator:_fife_circle_line:_edinburgh_-_dunfermline_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2020/2/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1211470/Train_Simulator_Fife_Circle_Line_Edinburgh__Dunfermline_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8653,'dishwashing_simulator',NULL,'A short, unique survival-farming-base-building-tycoon-horror game where you must survive through washing dishes. Explore mysterious depths, manage resources, and unravel a cryptic narrative. In DWS, a chore becomes a journey to freedom.','2024/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2747780/Dishwashing_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8654,'aliens_versus_predator_classic_2000',NULL,'Aliens Versus Predator Classic 2000 features the Colonial Marine, Alien and Predator Campaigns and the frenetic single-player Skirmish mode from the original title: Alien Versus Predator Gold Edition, which was released to massive acclaim in 2000.','2000/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3730/Aliens_versus_Predator_Classic_2000/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8655,'sonic_the_hedgehog_4_-_episode_i',NULL,'The sequel fans have waited 16 years for is finally here - Sonic the Hedgehog 4 Episode I! Featuring enhanced gameplay elements, including the classic Sonic Spin Dash, and the versatile Homing Attack, Sonic the Hedgehog 4 Episode I picks up right where Sonic and Knuckles™ left off. Dr.','2012/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/202530/Sonic_the_Hedgehog_4__Episode_I/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8656,'carpathian_night_starring_bela_lugosi',NULL,'Bela Lugosi returns as Prince Dracula in this classicvania horror platformer! Battle your way through the monster plagued countryside, evade deadly traps and pitfalls, overcome Dracula’s commanders in single combat, and discover the secret history of your monstrous foes.','2024/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1445740/Carpathian_Night_Starring_Bela_Lugosi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8657,'decline\'s_drops',NULL,'Grab your punching gloves, put your clogs on and smash your way in the world of Decline\'s Drops, a fully hand-drawn platform-brawler full of weird frogs, bizarre chickens and odd hydras! Avenge your destroyed garden and defeat the 6 heads of the Eternal Corp.! If you can, that is.','2024/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1500180/Declines_Drops/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8658,'gunbrella',NULL,'Uncover the dark secrets of a gritty, tangled metropolis and battle diabolic villains with your trusty Gunbrella, a bulletproof brolly that doubles as a firearm.','2023/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1580180/Gunbrella/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8659,'redemption_reapers',NULL,'Descending suddenly on the world, the macabre Mort armies destroy nation after nation, leaving humanity decimated in their wake. Among the forces resisting the Mort is a small band of mercenaries known as the Ashen Hawk Brigade.','2023/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2139300/Redemption_Reapers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8660,'nemesis:_lockdown',NULL,'In Nemesis: Lockdown, you\'re part of a team exploring an alien-infested space base. Craft, hide and fight to make it out of its dark, threat-filled corridors. Fulfill your objective even if it means betraying your allies, but remember - this time, you are not the hunter. You are the PREY.','2022/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1915550/Nemesis_Lockdown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8661,'wolcen:_lords_of_mayhem',NULL,'Carve your path in this Hack’n’Slash free from class boundaries. Purify a world shattered by corruption, and uncover the grim secrets and forgotten horrors lurking in the shadows of this forsaken land as you rise in Power. Your Inner aspect beckons—will you answer?','2020/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/424370/Wolcen_Lords_of_Mayhem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8662,'desktop_dungeons',NULL,'Each step into the unknown heals you and reveals new obstacles as you guide fresh heros to glorious retirement or ignominious death. Master tactical spells, appease ancient gods and get rich through taxidermy in this award-winning quick-play puzzle-roguelike.','2023/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/226620/Desktop_Dungeons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8663,'exorcist_simulator',NULL,'Exorcist Simulator is a 1‑4 player online co‑op horror where every play asks the same, terrible question: Will you cast out the Devil —or wear his skin?','2025/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2487140/Exorcist_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8664,'subterror',NULL,'Explore abandoned biospheres at the bottom of the ocean, alone or with up to 4 friends.','2025/1/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2846060/Subterror/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8665,'greedland',NULL,'\"Greedland” is a roguelike game mixed with survivor-like elements. It\'s reminiscent of Crimsonland and Vampire Survivors, and as the battle progresses your character will become a mobile arsenal of destruction!','2023/8/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2218400/Greedland/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8666,'just_cause™_4:_neon_racer_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Just Cause 4 Reloaded on Steam in order to play.','2018/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/868428/Just_Cause_4_Neon_Racer_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8667,'lizards_must_die',NULL,'The great exploits of the Ancient Rus in the war with the lizards. Immerse yourself in the world of Hyperborea and defeat hordes of Lizards and other unholy who encroached on holy places Ancestors. Choose a blessed hero and go save the world from the green plague.','2023/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2532550/LIZARDS_MUST_DIE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8668,'nobunaga\'s_ambition:_sphere_of_influence_-_ascension',NULL,'In the simulation game series \"Nobunaga\'s Ambition\", players aim to unify Japan in the troubled times of the Warring States era. In this release we include \"Officer Play\" for the first time in the series, allowing players to advance from retainer to Castle Lord and then on to Daimyo.','2016/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/375450/NOBUNAGAS_AMBITION_Sphere_of_Influence__Ascension/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8669,'fields_of_asphodel',NULL,'Befriend misfit deities and make a life for yourself in the Underworld! Can you escape your arranged marriage to the King? Do you want to?','2024/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3013740/Fields_of_Asphodel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8670,'magequit',NULL,'A wizard brawler about spell drafting and beard envy, MageQuit allows up to 10 mages to battle it out online or locally. Beards grow longer with each kill; the wizard with the longest beard after 9 rounds wins!','2019/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/572220/MageQuit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8671,'siralim_3',NULL,'Siralim 3 is a mechanically deep, monster taming RPG. Summon and customize over 700 different creatures to fight for you as you battle your way through randomly generated dungeons. Find rare treasure and use it to craft new items, empower your creatures, learn new spells, and much more.','2018/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/841770/Siralim_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8672,'multiplayer_platform_golf',NULL,'Swing into the ultimate golf adventure with Multiplayer Platform Golf! Enjoy physics-based golfing and 3D platforming in multiplayer matches with up to 12 players. Create and share courses using the level editor and explore endless community maps via Steam Workshop. It’s time to tee off!','2024/2/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2263920/Multiplayer_Platform_Golf/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8673,'trinity_fusion',NULL,'ANOMALY WARP Update Out Now! Take control of your parallel selves and explore dark, Sci-Fi worlds. Slash, bash and shoot your way through this unique rogue-lite metroidvania where the only way to save the multiverse is to end it.','2023/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1911360/Trinity_Fusion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8674,'villages_&_dungeons',NULL,'A hardcore roguelite card game where deck-building strategies are at the core of everything! With a vast array of cards, random dungeons, a wealth of encounter events, and diverse enemies, it awaits your exploration and challenge.','2025/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3411020/Villages__Dungeons/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8675,'samurai_warriors:_spirit_of_sanada',NULL,'Struggle for survival. Death before surrender! Experience the dramatic story and epic, action-packed battles of the Sanada clan during Japan\'s Warring States period.','2017/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/595740/SAMURAI_WARRIORS_Spirit_of_Sanada/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8676,'ai_olympius',NULL,'Join the rebels in a third-person shooter with RPG elements and base-building mode. Fight against various combat drone models under the control of the supreme AI.','2023/7/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1478970/AI_Olympius/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8677,'werewolf:_the_apocalypse_—_purgatory',NULL,'A choice-driven RPG thriller set in the World of Darkness universe. Step into the shoes of Samira, a young werewolf refugee in Poland, as she battles dark forces and loneliness, caught between rage and despair. How will your story unfold?','2024/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2463980/Werewolf_The_Apocalypse__Purgatory/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8678,'blackwell_deception',NULL,'Street psychics. Their blinking neon signs are everywhere, promising love and wealth and happiness. They make a fortune preying on the gullible and milking them dry. So when these victims begin dying and leaving confused spirits behind, it can only take a genuine psychic (and her wayward spirit guide) to clean up the mess.','2012/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/80360/Blackwell_Deception/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8679,'senran_kagura_shinovi_versus',NULL,'The non-PC buxom shinobi of SENRAN KAGURA, the brawler series that’s as over-the-top with its fighting mechanics as it is with its gratuitous depictions of female ninja in various forms of undress, invade the PC realm for the first time in HD and 60fps glory.','2016/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/411830/SENRAN_KAGURA_SHINOVI_VERSUS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8680,'vampire:_the_masquerade_-_reckoning_of_new_york',NULL,'Vampire: The Masquerade - Reckoning of New York is a narrative game set in the World of Darkness Universe. Play as one of the members of the Vampire Clans in a shifting political landscape between the Camarilla and the Anarchs while trying your best to survive.','2024/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2658720/Vampire_The_Masquerade__Reckoning_of_New_York/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8681,'bastard_bonds',NULL,'Bastard Bonds is a mature, fast-paced tactical RPG with high-end pixel art and in-depth character customization.','2016/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/486720/Bastard_Bonds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8682,'say_no!_more',NULL,'SAY NO! MORE is the world’s first NPG (NO!-Playing Game). Play as an intern with a burning desire to say NO! to everything and everyone. Customize your character, say NO! in different styles and languages, clap back at mean colleagues and change the world!','2021/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1191900/Say_No_More/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8683,'metal_slug_2',NULL,'“METAL SLUG 2”, the 2nd entry in SNK’s emblematic 2D run & gun action shooting game returns to the battlefield on the Steam gaming platform!','2016/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/366260/METAL_SLUG_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8684,'cake_bash',NULL,'Fight to be the tastiest cake in Cake Bash! A frantic four player party game where adorable drawn-to-life cakes beat the crumbs out of each other.','2020/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/971690/Cake_Bash/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8685,'serious_sam_vr:_the_last_hope',NULL,'Serious Sam is back! And this time it\'s REAL!','2017/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/465240/Serious_Sam_VR_The_Last_Hope/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8686,'devil_may_cry_5_-_super_vergil_unlock',NULL,'This content requires the base game Devil May Cry 5 on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1432642/Devil_May_Cry_5__Super_Vergil_Unlock/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8687,'legion_td_2_-_desert_ridge_campaign',NULL,'This content requires the base game Legion TD 2 - Multiplayer Tower Defense on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2162190/Legion_TD_2__Desert_Ridge_Campaign/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8688,'motogp™20',NULL,'This year, experience all the thrills of the more-complete-than-ever Managerial Career mode and enjoy new technical improvements and graphics. Customize your bike and suit! Compete against the MotoGP™ legends or challenge your friends online!','2020/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1161490/MotoGP20/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8689,'love_love_school_days',NULL,'The protagonist is trapped in the world of a love game. Can you return to the real world again...? Try to escape while running away from the gal game heroine A love simulation-style survival horror game!','2023/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1305300/Love_Love_School_Days/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8690,'froggy\'s_battle',NULL,'Froggy\'s Battle is an action roguelike game set in a loop. Help Froggy the steezy magician skater frog defeat all the baddies squatting her favorite riding spot. Choose your upgrades carefully, become more and more powerful and kickflip yourself through waves of enemies and ferocious bosses!','2023/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2424650/Froggys_Battle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8691,'corpse_factory',NULL,'Discard your sense of morality and enter the world of CORPSE FACTORY. An obscure website allows users to request a death. Victims supposedly receive a photograph of their own corpse before they are killed! With English voice acting by an all-star cast.','2022/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1414250/CORPSE_FACTORY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8692,'infliction',NULL,'Wander through an interactive nightmare set within the confines of a once-happy household. Piece together the mystery behind a harrowing series of events while struggling to survive encounters with an entity that relentlessly stands in the way of finding absolution.','2018/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/692100/Infliction/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8693,'international_basketball_manager_23',NULL,'Become the basketball manager of the moment and leave your mark by leading your own dynasty. Control all the management tools that International Basketball Manager 23 puts at your fingertips to take your team to the top. Manager, your time has come!','2022/12/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2098130/International_Basketball_Manager_23/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8694,'layers_of_fear_(2016)',NULL,'Layers of Fear is a first-person psychedelic horror game with a heavy focus on story and exploration. Players take control of a painter whose sole purpose is to finish his Magnum Opus. The player must navigate a constantly changing Victorian-era mansion and ghastly visions of the painter’s psyche.','2016/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/391720/Layers_of_Fear_2016/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8695,'ty_the_tasmanian_tiger_4',NULL,'Bush Rescue Returns! The hero loved by millions worldwide, TY the Tasmanian Tiger™, is back! Join TY on an exciting new adventure in the great Aussie Outback. Use your wits and boomerangs to find hidden treasures, help the colorful locals, and uncover the mysteries of the land Down Under.','2015/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/287840/TY_the_Tasmanian_Tiger_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8696,'spacelines_from_the_far_out',NULL,'Run your own 60s-inspired space-age alien airlines in this randomly-generated chaotic 1-to-4-player local and online co-op game!','2022/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1412850/Spacelines_from_the_Far_Out/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_184'),(8697,'lords_of_the_fallen™_2014',NULL,'Plunge into a dark fantasy Action-RPG, harnessing powerful magic alongside a satisfying combat system. When the tyrannical god, Adyr, invades the human realm seeking vengeance for his imprisonment, humanity calls upon an unlikely defender… a convicted sinner named Harkyn.','2014/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/265300/Lords_Of_The_Fallen_2014/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8698,'sacred_2_gold',NULL,'Experience the world of Ancaria in its full glory with Sacred 2: Gold Edition. Containing Sacred 2 Fallen Angel and the awesome add-on Ice and Blood. Defeat countless dangerous enemies; capture powerful weapons and valuable treasures. Prepare yourself for the ultimate battle and become a legend.','2012/12/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/225640/Sacred_2_Gold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8699,'zup!_x',NULL,'Minimal physical puzzle with explosions','2018/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/508900/Zup_X/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8700,'payday_2:_breakfast_in_tijuana_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1347750/PAYDAY_2_Breakfast_in_Tijuana_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8701,'lawn_mowing_simulator_-_dino_safari',NULL,'This content requires the base game Lawn Mowing Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1844420/Lawn_Mowing_Simulator__Dino_Safari/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8702,'ikenfell',NULL,'A turn-based tactical RPG about a group of troublesome magic students. Use timing mechanics to power your spells and block attacks, explore the twisted halls of a vast magic school, fight challenging monsters and bosses, and uncover dark secrets never meant to be found.','2020/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/854940/Ikenfell/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8703,'ambition:_a_minuet_in_power',NULL,'18th century Paris - a city of love, lies and revolution. You are a woman of fashion trying to survive the political turmoil. Date a cast of unforgettable characters. Amass the wealth and respect you deserve. Engage in gossip that can alter the course of history, or lead you to the guillotine.','2021/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/949200/Ambition_A_Minuet_in_Power/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8704,'the_walking_dead_onslaught',NULL,'There’s no rest when survival is on the line. Step into AMC’s The Walking Dead and prepare for an onslaught of walkers as you assume the roles of your favorite characters from the show, and confront the horrors and humanity of this apocalyptic new world.','2020/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1082680/The_Walking_Dead_Onslaught/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8705,'cosmic_star_heroine',NULL,'3 exotic planets to explore. Aliens. Robots. Magic. Forbidden technology. Ruined Worlds. Ghosts. Long-lost secrets. Conspiracies. A galactic threat. And one brave heroine to make things right. Cosmic Star Heroine is an exciting new RPG from the creators of Cthulhu Saves the World.','2017/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/256460/Cosmic_Star_Heroine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8706,'beff_jezos_simulator',NULL,'Build Your Online Empire! Create and manage your store in Beff Jezos Simulator. Customize your shop, source products, set prices, hire employees and grow your business. Face realistic challenges with addictive gameplay, perfect for all gamers. Don’t forget to ask yourself—what would Beff Jezos do?','2024/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3128740/Beff_Jezos_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8707,'no_fair_play',NULL,'No Fair Play is a physics-based multiplayer game that combines parkour, combat, and football mechanics to offer great freedom to players.','2023/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1771180/No_Fair_Play/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8708,'capcom_fighting_collection',NULL,'Ten of Capcom\'s most popular arcade games in one bumper collection! A wide variety of titles are included from series such as Street Fighter and Darkstalkers, Cyberbots, and the first home console port of Red Earth! And of course, all titles support online play!','2022/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1685750/Capcom_Fighting_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8709,'cook,_serve,_delicious!',NULL,'One of the few hardcore restaurant sims in existence, Cook, Serve, Delicious! is a deceptively easy game to learn but incredibly challenging to master as you progress through your career from owning a terrible zero star cafe into a five star world famous restaurant.','2013/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/247020/Cook_Serve_Delicious/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8710,'succubers!_dark_covenant',NULL,'Succubers! Dark Covenant is an indie fantasy J-RPG featuring a diverse cast of female characters. You\'ll find nurses, nuns, housewives, and more! Explore the maps with your favorite characters and achieve your ultimate dreams!','2025/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3216170/Succubers_Dark_Covenant/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8711,'evil_west_-_wild_wild_east_skin_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Evil West on Steam in order to play.','2022/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1997840/Evil_West__Wild_Wild_East_Skin_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8712,'midnight_mayhem',NULL,'Work together to survive against an invisible monster with ever changing abilities. Asymmetric horror game best played with friends!','2025/6/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2890060/Midnight_Mayhem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8713,'leisure_suit_larry_-_wet_dreams_dry_twice',NULL,'No obstacle will keep me away from my beloved, my Faith, not even the wild and untamed islands of Kalau’a. Those lovely island ladies can only distract me for so long as my heart’s compass only points in one direction - Faith!','2020/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1373430/Leisure_Suit_Larry__Wet_Dreams_Dry_Twice/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8714,'cyberpunkdreams',NULL,'2090s America, torn apart by war and corporate greed. A lone traveller stands outside the gates of Cincinnati, greatest of the border cities. How far will you go to make it to the top? How far will you go to fulfil your mission?','2021/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1361680/cyberpunkdreams/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8715,'my_little_pony:_a_maretime_bay_adventure',NULL,'Sunny wants to bring the magic of Maretime Bay Day festival back to Equestria – but some pony is out to spoil her plans! Save the celebration by putting on fashion shows, rescuing cute animals, flying with Pegasi and more, with a helping hoof from your new MY LITTLE PONY friends.','2022/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1600780/MY_LITTLE_PONY_A_Maretime_Bay_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8716,'pathfinder:_kingmaker_—_beneath_the_stolen_lands',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pathfinder: Kingmaker — Enhanced Plus Edition on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/900449/Pathfinder_Kingmaker__Beneath_The_Stolen_Lands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8717,'djmax_respect_v_-_v_extension_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1080550/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__V_EXTENSION_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8718,'death_squared',NULL,'Death Squared is a co-op puzzle game about cooperation, communication, and robot explosions. You should buy it!','2017/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/471810/Death_Squared/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8719,'vagante',NULL,'Vagante is an action-packed platformer that features permanent death and procedurally generated levels. Play cooperatively with friends both locally and online, or adventure solo in this challenging roguelike-inspired game.','2018/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/323220/Vagante/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8720,'tonight_we_riot',NULL,'A revolutionary crowd-based retro brawler','2020/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/290690/Tonight_We_Riot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8721,'sorcery!_part_3',NULL,'An epic open-world narrative adventure through a world of monsters, traps and magic. Explore two intermeshed worlds, past and present, and create your own unique story where every decision you make is remembered. Survive, and defeat the Seven Serpents - if you can!','2016/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/445040/Sorcery_Part_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8722,'castle_story',NULL,'Castle Story is a creative voxel-based strategy game in which you can build castles one brick at a time using an army of little creatures called Bricktrons. Design and build your own castles, expand your territory in a vast landscape and defend your Bricktrons against onslaughts of hostile creatures.','2017/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/227860/Castle_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8723,'sifu_deluxe_cosmetic_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sifu on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2231950/Sifu_Deluxe_Cosmetic_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8724,'perennial_dusk_-kinsenka-',NULL,'“Perennial Dusk -Kinsenka-” is a kinetic novel about how the human heart endures relentless violence and limitless cruelty, telling the story of a group of exorcists-in-training as they gather the pieces needed to mend their wounded souls.','2025/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3470530/Perennial_Dusk_Kinsenka/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8725,'star_trek™:_bridge_crew_–_the_next_generation',NULL,'This content requires the base game Star Trek™: Bridge Crew on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/806190/Star_Trek_Bridge_Crew__The_Next_Generation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8726,'panzer_paladin',NULL,'Hop in the Paladin power armor, seize melee weapons from the demonic invaders and give them a taste of their own medicine!','2020/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/975510/Panzer_Paladin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8727,'terror_of_the_seven_seas',NULL,'Become a Mighty Captain in a Age of sail naval combat game, set in all of the Seven Seas! Sail the entire world: conquering, plundering, exploring and trading along the way! Gather your crew, ready your ship, hoist your sails and enter a world of swashbuckling and piracy!','2024/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2320880/Terror_of_the_Seven_Seas/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8728,'nightshade／百花百狼',NULL,'A romance visual novel game made in collaboration with D3P and Red Entertainment.Character design and illustrations are by the popular illustrator Teita. The romance revolves around Ninjas who have lived through the Sengoku Period. This game has published in 2016 as PS Vita in Japan.','2017/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/512180/Nightshade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8729,'the_king_of_fighters_2002_unlimited_match',NULL,'KOF 2002 UM is the 2nd title in the UM Series and a fully upgraded ver. of KOF 2002, a masterpiece of the KOF Series deserving its place of honor alongside KOF ’98. Based on THE NESTS CHRONICLES, 2002 UM includes the most characters of any title in the KOF Series, and fighting game history!','2015/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/222440/THE_KING_OF_FIGHTERS_2002_UNLIMITED_MATCH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8730,'angels_with_scaly_wings™_/_鱗羽の天使',NULL,'You, the player, are an ambassador for Earth sent through a mysterious portal into the world of dragons. Explore a town full of secrets and the people who keep them in this compelling sci-fi visual novel with slice of life and dating sim elements.','2017/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/571880/Angels_with_Scaly_Wings/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8731,'dragon_ball:_the_breakers',NULL,'DRAGON BALL: THE BREAKERS is an online asymmetrical action game where a team of 7 ordinary citizens tries to survive the Raider (a classic DRAGON BALL rival such as Cell, Frieza, and Buu), who will hunt and evolve into an unstoppable force!','2022/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1276760/DRAGON_BALL_THE_BREAKERS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8732,'world_of_warships_x_azur_lane_—_admiral_hipper’s_pride',NULL,'This content requires the base game World of Warships on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3608210/World_of_Warships_x_Azur_Lane__Admiral_Hippers_Pride/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8733,'stationeers:_h.e.m_droid_species_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Stationeers on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1038500/Stationeers_HEM_Droid_Species_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8734,'war_thunder_-_leopard_2a4_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game War Thunder on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2054412/War_Thunder__Leopard_2A4_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8735,'creeper_world:_anniversary_edition',NULL,'Imagine an enemy that is everywhere and moves like a giant, organic mass across the map. Imagine your base and your people surrounded by a blanket of crushing destruction from all directions. Your only hope, well what hope? Then you take the high ground and pound this enemy into oblivion.','2016/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/422910/Creeper_World_Anniversary_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8736,'dreamworks_dragons:_dawn_of_new_riders',NULL,'Join the new heroic duo, Scribbler and Patch, in an epic battle to save dragons and defeat the villain, Eir, who is controlling dragons to carry out her evil plans. ','2019/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/896960/DreamWorks_Dragons_Dawn_of_New_Riders/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8737,'greyhill_incident',NULL,'This story-driven Survival-Horror game is about a classic Alien-Invasion which takes place during the early 90s. As Ryan Baker, equipped with a baseball bat and a few bullets in his revolver, the story takes you across the atmospheric neighborhood of Greyhill which is invaded by UFOs & Grey Aliens.','2023/6/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1905020/Greyhill_Incident/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8738,'pathfinder:_kingmaker_—_varnhold\'s_lot',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pathfinder: Kingmaker — Enhanced Plus Edition on Steam in order to play.','2019/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/900448/Pathfinder_Kingmaker__Varnholds_Lot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8739,'spreadcheat',NULL,'SpreadCheat is a puzzle game that fuses intricate spreadsheet challenges with a comedic, 90s financial vibe in a retro Windows 3.11 setting. The Player takes on the role of the new office prodigy, solving absurd tasks and manipulating spreadsheet cells to hit specific targets using clever formulas.','2025/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2966550/SpreadCheat/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8740,'mecha_force',NULL,'Hop into the cockpit of a giant mecha in this VR experience. Fuse intense robot action and roguelike mechanics as you create your own unique mecha for battle!','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3193760/Mecha_Force/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8741,'hyperbolica',NULL,'Hyperbolica is a whimsical Non-Euclidean adventure with mind-bending worlds full of games, puzzles, mazes, and secrets! Immerse yourself in reality-warping geometries where lines can never be parallel, horizons are curved, and space grows exponentially.','2022/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1256230/Hyperbolica/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8742,'shantae:_risky\'s_revenge_-_director\'s_cut',NULL,'Shantae: Risky’s Revenge – Director’s Cut brings hair-whipping, belly-dancing to your PC! Play one of the most critically acclaimed handheld series of all time, now with brand new features!','2014/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/277890/Shantae_Riskys_Revenge__Directors_Cut/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8743,'tyranny_-_bastard\'s_wound',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tyranny on Steam in order to play.','2017/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/651440/Tyranny__Bastards_Wound/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8744,'albatroz',NULL,'Albatroz is a backpacking adventure RPG that will take you through majestic landscapes in search of your lost sibling. A tale about knowing when to let go and start over.','2024/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2171880/Albatroz/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_185'),(8745,'dark_deception_chapter_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dark Deception on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1019930/Dark_Deception_Chapter_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8746,'neo_cab',NULL,'A visual novel about emotional survival in an automated world. Play as Lina, the last human cab driver. It’s your first night driving the lonely streets of Los Ojos, and your best friend has just disappeared. Stay on the road. Stay on the search. Stay human.','2019/10/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/794540/Neo_Cab/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8747,'lakeview_cabin_collection',NULL,'Delve into the diverse world of horror movies in this 2D action puzzler. Nothing can prepare you for the R-rated challenges you will face!','2015/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/361990/Lakeview_Cabin_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8748,'remore:_infested_kingdom',NULL,'A tactical RPG where your survivors are fragile, and every step you take could be your last. Transport into a medieval apocalyptic infestation where you must use your wits and strategies to overcome the vile creatures that dwell there. How long can you stay alive?','2023/10/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2225480/REMORE_INFESTED_KINGDOM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8749,'moonleap',NULL,'Explore a world full of mysteries that transform with each jump! Moonleap is a game about a moon boy on his journey to recover shooting stars. Change day to night with your jump and catch all the stars in this challenging puzzle-platformer!','2023/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2166050/Moonleap/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8750,'train_sim_world®_5:_nahverkehr_dresden_-_riesa_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2969890/Train_Sim_World_5_Nahverkehr_Dresden__Riesa_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8751,'restaurant_owner:_a_restaurant_simulator',NULL,'Run your own restaurant. Create your menu, hire staff, decorate the place, take orders, serve guests, and grow your business. Food critics, online orders, events, and kitchen chaos are on the menu!','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3177280/Restaurant_Owner_A_Restaurant_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8752,'bus_driving_sim_22',NULL,'Experience what it feels like to be a real bus driver. Simulator featuring realistic physics, a variety of bus models (city buses, electric bus, school bus), three distinct regions to explore (US, Germany, Brazil) and much more. Test your skills in career, drive in freeride or play multiplayer.','2023/2/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1032700/Bus_Driving_Sim_22/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8753,'yokai_landlord:_monster_mystery!',NULL,'A Werewolf game-style social deduction adventure where you play as the landlord of an apartment and try to uncover the Yokai hiding among your residents. Not just a mystery adventure, this is a heart-warming tale of character growth.','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3193560/Yokai_Landlord_Monster_Mystery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8754,'hell_let_loose_-_false_front',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hell Let Loose on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1793010/Hell_Let_Loose__False_Front/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8755,'car_dealership_simulator',NULL,'Car Dealership Simulator is an extremely comprehensive and detailed car dealership business simulation game.','2023/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2141690/Car_Dealership_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8756,'e.y.e:_divine_cybermancy',NULL,'In a dark Cyberpunk world, you (and up to 3 friends) wage war against the all-powerful Federation in this Source-powered FPS/RPG.','2011/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/91700/EYE_Divine_Cybermancy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8757,'my_little_farmies',NULL,'Show your artistic side! Create your own medieval settlement in the My Little Farmies tycoon. Build artisan workshops and production sites. Trade with fruit, vegetables and cereals. Download My Little Farmies now!','2018/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/789100/My_Little_Farmies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8758,'forklift_simulator',NULL,'Start your career in logistics today in Forklift Simulator! Take on a variety of different missions, a selection of vehicles and an extensive career mode in which you can put your skills to the test. Are you ready for the challenges ahead?','2024/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2717850/Forklift_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8759,'tomoyo_after_~it\'s_a_wonderful_life~_english_edition',NULL,'From renowned visual novel studio Key, this is the sequel to the highly acclaimed visual novel CLANNAD. Featuring a truly memorable continuation to Tomoya and Tomoyo\'s journey, Tomoyo After promises to draw you even further into CLANNAD\'s world.','2016/7/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/462990/Tomoyo_After_Its_a_Wonderful_Life_English_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8760,'regular_human_workshop',NULL,'Regular Human Workshop is a 2D physics simulation sandbox. There are no predefined goals or objectives. Simply throw objects into the world and interact with them in various ways.','2022/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1441550/Regular_Human_Workshop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8761,'strider™_/_ストライダー飛竜®',NULL,'Strider returns in a brand new adventure, complete with incredible side-scrolling action, and lightning fast combat all in a massive interconnected world! Download the full game February 19th and become the original assassin!','2014/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/235210/STRIDER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8762,'infinity:_battlescape',NULL,'Infinity: Battlescape is a multiplayer space combat sim supporting hundreds of players on a single server. Join one of the corporate factions and fight for domination of a seamless, true-to-scale procedural star system. Participate in massive space and planetary battles involving hundreds of ships.','2019/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1079620/Infinity_Battlescape/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8763,'fable_hospital',NULL,'Fable Hospital is a medieval hospital management simulator with a touch of fantasy and humor. Cure hilarious diseases, manage an eccentric team, and gather resources in a world full of satire and fun.','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2726060/Fable_Hospital/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8764,'void_sols',NULL,'Death is but a lesson in the geometric gloom. Step into a hand-crafted souls-like as a forsaken triangle, carving your path through the remnants of this abstract fantasy. Fight powerful angular enemies and uncover twisted secrets as you liberate an oppressed world.','2024/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2736690/Void_Sols/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8765,'through_the_darkest_of_times',NULL,'Berlin 1933. “Adolf Hitler is chancellor!” We all know the consequences this message bore. Unspeakable horrors and suffering would sweep across the world. Few would stand and fight the monstrosity that was the German Reich. Will you? Lead an underground resistance group Through the Darkest of Times.','2020/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1003090/Through_the_Darkest_of_Times/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8766,'resident_evil_4_weapon_exclusive_upgrade_ticket_x3_(a)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2197324/Resident_Evil_4_Weapon_Exclusive_Upgrade_Ticket_x3_A/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8767,'chevalier_historie',NULL,'The fate of a captured princess lies in the hands of a single woman. Using the power of the spirits and a variety of items, the female knight Jeanne must explore the kingdom that\'s been thrown into chaos to save Princess Lily in this classic-style action RPG.','2022/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1413960/Chevalier_Historie/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8768,'rhapsody:_a_musical_adventure',NULL,'Dive back into your NIS roots and experience a game that laid the foundation for the beloved Disgaea series with Rhapsody: A Musical Adventure. Sharper graphics and updated image optimization bring this classic title into the present!','2022/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1866430/Rhapsody_A_Musical_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8769,'fishing_planet:_sport_carp_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1000718/Fishing_Planet_Sport_Carp_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8770,'eiyu*senki_gold_–_a_new_conquest',NULL,'A young man takes up his sword and leads an army in search of his missing past. Carefully plan strategic turn-based battles against adorable portrayals of historical and mythical world heroes, as you conquer the globe... for not well explained reasons!','2021/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1518430/EiyuSenki_Gold__A_New_Conquest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8771,'only_climb:_better_together',NULL,'Tired of sitting on the ground? Take a sky-high journey with your friends in Only Climb: Better Together! Touch the clouds with your own hands and find out what\'s behind them, but remember, there are no easy paths…','2023/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2500750/Only_Climb_Better_Together/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8772,'escape_memoirs:_mini_stories',NULL,'\"Escape Memoirs: Mini Stories\" is a series of co-operative escape-room style puzzle scenarios. Each one is sure to test your wits as you try to overcome the challenges that stand in the way of your escape.','2022/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2098350/Escape_Memoirs_Mini_Stories/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8773,'hue',NULL,'Hue is a vibrant, award-winning puzzle-adventure, where you alter the world by changing its background colour.','2016/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/383270/Hue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8774,'devour:_supporter_edition',NULL,'This content requires the base game DEVOUR on Steam in order to play.','2022/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1966630/DEVOUR_Supporter_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8775,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_the_revenant',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2020/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1304600/Hunt_Showdown_1896__The_Revenant/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8776,'gungrave_g.o.r.e',NULL,'Gungrave G.O.R.E is a stylish third-person action shooter by South-Korean Studio IGGYMOB in which you take on the role of Grave, a gunslinger of resurrection and badass anti-hero of your dreams, mowing down tons of enemies in a gory ballet of bullets.','2022/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1630110/Gungrave_GORE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8777,'strikers_1945_ii',NULL,'Easy to play, hard to master. This is one of the most iconic arcade shooter of the 90s, released by Psikyo. It comes back with many customizable options and online rankings!','2020/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1279380/STRIKERS_1945_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8778,'into_the_necrovale',NULL,'Into the Necrovale is an Action RPG in which you collect powerful items that interact with one another. You must be clever with your build if you hope to pierce the mysteries and dangers of the Necrovale, where a thousand generations of miscreants and criminals have been banished.','2024/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1717090/Into_the_Necrovale/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8779,'spellforce_-_platinum_edition',NULL,'Included in the Platinum Edition are three titles:SpellForce: The Order of DawnIn a world beyond imagination...In their immeasurable greed and constant thirst for power, the thirteen most powerful Mages of all time doomed the land, hurling it into an endless spiral of chaos and despair.','2009/11/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/39540/SpellForce__Platinum_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8780,'cyberdimension_neptunia:_4_goddesses_online',NULL,'In this hack \'n\' slash adventure co-developed with Tamsoft and Compile Heart, the 4 Goddesses enter an online fantasy game inspired by... themselves! Choose from 12 characters with unique playstyles and skills to fight in realtime brawls, customize with accessories, and play online with others!','2018/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/632350/Cyberdimension_Neptunia_4_Goddesses_Online/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8781,'football,_tactics_&_glory:_football_stars',NULL,'This content requires the base game Football, Tactics & Glory on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1293080/Football_Tactics__Glory_Football_Stars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8782,'payday_2:_gage_mod_courier',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2014/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/259381/PAYDAY_2_Gage_Mod_Courier/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8783,'payday_2:_tailor_pack_3',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1449440/PAYDAY_2_Tailor_Pack_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8784,'trine_4:_melody_of_mystery',NULL,'This content requires the base game Trine 4: The Nightmare Prince on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1444560/Trine_4_Melody_of_Mystery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8785,'paper_dolls_2_纸人贰',NULL,'Paper Dolls 2 is a first-person horror adventure game. A dark aura emanates from a Qing dynasty dwelling—the Yin Mansion. What happened to the once-famous Yin Family? Clues lead us to its second floor haunted by restless spirits. A truth, buried for over a hundred years, is waiting to be unraveled.','2020/7/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1334040/Paper_Dolls_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8786,'sniper_elite_4_-_target_führer',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sniper Elite 4 on Steam in order to play.','2017/2/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/474763/Sniper_Elite_4__Target_Fhrer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8787,'banner_of_the_maid',NULL,'Banner of the Maid is a mix of turn-based strategy and JRPG. Set in an alternate French Revolution with fantasy elements. As the young officer Pauline Bonaparte you will have to lead your troops to battle and play a role in the political vortex of Paris.','2019/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/994730/Banner_of_the_Maid/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_186'),(8788,'[na/eu]_black_desert_-_explorer_to_conqueror',NULL,'This content requires the base game Black Desert on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1914121/NAEU_Black_Desert__Explorer_to_Conqueror/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8789,'batman_-_the_telltale_series_shadows_mode',NULL,'This content requires the base game Batman - The Telltale Series on Steam in order to play.','2016/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1182000/Batman__The_Telltale_Series_Shadows_Mode/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8790,'garten_of_banban_2',NULL,'Continue the story of Banban’s Kindergarten. Delve deeper into the bizarre establishment where the place was left suspiciously empty. Try to survive the unexpected residents, all while uncovering the truth behind the place…','2023/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2262770/Garten_of_Banban_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8791,'castle_of_secrets',NULL,'Castle of Secrets is a dark psychological adventure with horror elements. Uncover the mystery behind your family\'s murder as you journey through the world of the dead, meet strange beings, solve puzzles, and make choices that shape the story.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1825110/Castle_of_Secrets/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8792,'tfc:_the_fertile_crescent',NULL,'Gather resources, build your base, and lead your people to victory in this captivating reimagining of classic base-building RTS, set in the Bronze Age. Secure fertile land, fend off raids, and stockpile food to generate knowledge and unlock powerful village advancements.','2024/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1674820/TFC_The_Fertile_Crescent/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8793,'big_helmet_heroes',NULL,'Throw yourself into an epic 3D beat’em up adventure with adorable knights, full of surprising worlds and situations. Grab your buddy and play in 2 player co-op to save the princess, but this is only the beginning!','2025/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2397250/Big_Helmet_Heroes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8794,'particle_fleet:_emergence',NULL,'Build and design your own fleets and stand opposed to the Particulate in this physics/strategy/RTS/fleet hybrid. Build partially destructible and self repairing ships that interact with enemies less controlled by some scripted logic and more driven by a real time massive physics particle simulation.','2016/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/422900/Particle_Fleet_Emergence/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8795,'contra_anniversary_collection',NULL,'The Contra Anniversary Collection brings this classic Run and Gun franchise back to modern platforms and a new generation of gamers.','2019/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1018020/Contra_Anniversary_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8796,'one_punch_man:_a_hero_nobody_knows',NULL,'The first \"One Punch Man\" game finally makes its debut! Dive into a dynamic fighting game experience with beloved characters from the first Season of One Punch Man! Play as your favorite hero – or become one!','2020/2/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/991560/ONE_PUNCH_MAN_A_HERO_NOBODY_KNOWS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8797,'dandelion_-_wishes_brought_to_you_-',NULL,'Dandelion -Wishes brought to you- is a female-oriented game developed by Cheritz. The game was released in South Korea in August, 2012. The English translation for Dandelion was released on Nov, 2012. Dandelion is known as a unique dating simulation with a sensational storyline and charming characters.','2012/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/321290/Dandelion__Wishes_brought_to_you/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8798,'terratech:_r&d_labs',NULL,'This content requires the base game TerraTech on Steam in order to play.','2015/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/331930/TerraTech_RD_Labs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8799,'coven',NULL,'COVEN is a hyper-violent retro FPS where your path of vengeance will take you across time and space. Destroy your enemies and eat their flesh.','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1785940/COVEN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8800,'everquest_ii',NULL,'EverQuest® II is the epitome of massively multiplayer gaming - the ultimate blend of deep features, heritage, and community.','2011/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/201230/EverQuest_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8801,'refence',NULL,'Refence is a roguelite based idle defense game, where you can choose heroes and their traits, upgrade your castle, and manage resources to fend off enemies from the Demon Realm who are trying to attack your castle.','2025/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3427090/Refence/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8802,'atomicrops:_reap_what_you_crow',NULL,'This content requires the base game Atomicrops on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1832910/Atomicrops_Reap_What_You_Crow/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8803,'championship_manager_2008',NULL,'Think you can do better? It\'s your decisions that count: your budget, your buys, your formation, your tactics... your chance to prove it! Use your skills and knowledge to manage your club the way you feel it should be - now it\'s your turn. All football fans around the world, believe they know more about football than anybody else.','2007/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/8060/Championship_Manager_2008/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8804,'kitty_powers\'_love_life',NULL,'From the creators of ‘Kitty Powers’ Matchmaker’, ‘Kitty Powers\' Love Life’ is a brand new take on the community/relationship sim genre, with a very British twist. Build and run your very own village for newly matched couples, under the watchful eye of your boss, outrageous drag queen Kitty Powers!','2018/2/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/416870/Kitty_Powers_Love_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8805,'amedama',NULL,'Side-scrolling, soul-shifting sandbox action adventure brought to life with a striking new 2D style! With only his soul remaining, Yushin must fight tooth and nail, possessing body after body on a quest to find his sister. With just seven days left until his soul departs, can he save her in time?','2024/9/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2411980/AMEDAMA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8806,'flashpoint_campaigns:_southern_storm',NULL,'Flashpoint Campaigns: Southern Storm is a grand tactical wargame set at the height of the Cold War, with the action centered on the year 1989.','2023/4/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2366530/Flashpoint_Campaigns_Southern_Storm/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8807,'star_trucker_-_official_game_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Star Trucker, but does not include the base game.','2024/9/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3088930/Star_Trucker__Official_Game_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8808,'bloodstained:_ritual_of_the_night_-_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Bloodstained: Ritual of the Night, but does not include the base game.','2019/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1101300/Bloodstained_Ritual_of_the_Night__Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8809,'resident_evil_2_-_original_ver._soundtrack_swap',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/920567/Resident_Evil_2__Original_Ver_Soundtrack_Swap/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8810,'mary_skelter_2',NULL,'What must you sacrifice to escape fate? Find out in this nightmarish dungeon-crawling RPG! The Nightmare continues in Mary Skelter 2! In this fairy tale dungeon crawler, play as fairy tale-inspired characters and escape a living prison while indestructible Nightmares give chase in real time.','2022/1/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1496250/Mary_Skelter_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8811,'lego_marvel_super_heroes_dlc:_asgard_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game LEGO® Marvel™ Super Heroes on Steam in order to play.','2014/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/256321/LEGO_Marvel_Super_Heroes_DLC_Asgard_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8812,'half-life:_alyx_-_final_hours',NULL,'THE FINAL HOURS OF HALF-LIFE: ALYX is an interactive storybook, written by Geoff Keighley, that takes fans inside Valve Software to chronicle the company’s past decade of game development, including the return of Half-Life.','2020/7/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1361700/HalfLife_Alyx__Final_Hours/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8813,'graveyard_keeper_artbook',NULL,'This content requires the base game Graveyard Keeper on Steam in order to play.','2018/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/919051/Graveyard_Keeper_Artbook/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8814,'motorsport_manager_-_endurance_series',NULL,'This content requires the base game Motorsport Manager on Steam in order to play.','2017/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/736770/Motorsport_Manager__Endurance_Series/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8815,'90_minute_fever_-_online_football_(soccer)_manager',NULL,'90 Minute Fever is an online football management game that offers extremely challenging gameplay where you get to compete against others from all over the world!','2023/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/468070/90_Minute_Fever__Online_Football_Soccer_Manager/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8816,'crime_boss:_rockay_city_-_jupiter_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crime Boss: Rockay City on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3245230/Crime_Boss_Rockay_City__Jupiter_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8817,'worms_world_party_remastered',NULL,'Imagine taking the perfect online gaming experience and one of the most popular Worms games ever made, adding a touch of Steam achievements, leaderboards, cloud saves, full controller support; a little sprinkle of 1080 / 60FPS, and you have Worms World Party Remastered!','2015/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/270910/Worms_World_Party_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8818,'enter_the_gungeon_-_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Enter the Gungeon, but does not include the base game.','2016/4/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/457840/Enter_the_Gungeon__Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8819,'payday_2:_winter_ghosts_tailor_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1824880/PAYDAY_2_Winter_Ghosts_Tailor_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8820,'ghostlore',NULL,'Ghostlore is an \'Eastpunk\' Action-RPG where you fight supernatural monsters from Southeast-Asian folklore. Inspired by classic ARPGs such as Diablo 2 and Titan Quest, Ghostlore features detailed item and character customization systems, procedurally generated maps, and awesome 90\'s retro graphics.','2023/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1783280/Ghostlore/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8821,'pawperty_damage',NULL,'Smash, kick, stomp and chomp your way through a fully destructible city! Go to town in this cathartic action sandbox, either alone or in split screen local multiplayer.','2023/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2154650/Pawperty_Damage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8822,'animal_shelter_-_puppies_&_kittens_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Animal Shelter on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1982080/Animal_Shelter__Puppies__Kittens_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8823,'fury_of_dracula:_digital_edition',NULL,'Dracula is ready to take over Europe and only four iconic vampire hunters can stop him, in this digital adaptation of the classic board game of deduction and gothic horror. Play locally with friends or with up to five players online. Will you be the hunter or the hunted?','2020/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/958530/Fury_of_Dracula_Digital_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8824,'the_adventurers',NULL,'The Adventurers is a turn-based tactical RPG where every decision shapes your legacy. Lead your party of heroes in an open world filled with random events that affect your story. Survive a high fantasy landscape where your epic saga is waiting to be written.','2024/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3062500/The_Adventurers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8825,'lock_\'n_load_tactical_digital:_core_game',NULL,'Lock \'n Load Tactical is fast and Furious tactical combat that is fast to learn. In LnLT you get squads, weapon teams, armored vehicles, fixed-wing aircraft, and, in the modern-era games, helicopters. Individuals such as Leaders, Medics, Snipers, Chaplains, Advisors, and, of course, Heroes.','2020/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1149940/Lock_n_Load_Tactical_Digital_Core_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8826,'tasty_planet',NULL,'Control a tiny ball of grey goo with the ability to eat anything smaller than itself. The more it eats, the bigger it gets! Soon you\'ll be able to eat the entire planet!','2017/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/687540/Tasty_Planet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8827,'phantom_brave_pc',NULL,'In the world of Ivoire lives Marona, an orphan with the ability to speak with phantoms. Though shunned by society, she believes in helping others. With her phantom companion Ash, Marona aims to purchase the mysterious Phantom Isle.','2016/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/409870/Phantom_Brave_PC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8828,'sugar_*_style',NULL,'Sugar * Style is a Japanese-style visual novel produced by Smee, a Japanese developer of romance VNs. Be the perfect husband for your future wife and conquer her heart with your husband-powers!','2021/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1540220/Sugar__Style/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8829,'bug_&_seek',NULL,'Catch 200+ real life bugs in this chill 8-bit cozy creature collector. You’ve bought the local bug zoo, abandoned after a mysterious robbery. Catch bugs that make jokes and puns, fill orders, build your collection, upgrade skills and equipment, and try to solve the Great Bug Heist.','2023/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2265310/Bug__Seek/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8830,'dig_or_die',NULL,'Crash land on a hostile planet where you\'ll have to build the strongest defenses if you wish to live to escape from it. But be warned... this planet is merciless. Build strong, and smart; else physics may flood or destroy your only hopes of survival.','2018/7/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/315460/Dig_or_Die/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8831,'civilization_v_-_civ_and_scenario_pack:_korea',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sid Meier\'s Civilization® V on Steam in order to play.','2011/8/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/99612/Civilization_V__Civ_and_Scenario_Pack_Korea/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8832,'never_second_in_rome',NULL,'Never Second in Rome is a turn-based historical game with RPG and management elements. You are a Roman centurion in the army of Julius Caesar. You will control both your character and the unit under his command.','2025/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3169580/Never_Second_in_Rome/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8833,'under_the_sand_redux_-_a_road_trip_simulator',NULL,'You. Your car. And world under the sand.','2020/9/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1062960/Under_the_Sand_REDUX__a_road_trip_simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_187'),(8834,'dooms_hair_salon',NULL,'Dooms Hair Salon is a comedy simulation game about running a hair salon in a chaotic town. Survive by operating the salon alone or with friends!','2025/3/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3398870/Dooms_Hair_Salon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8835,'飄流幻境m',NULL,'\"Wonderland M\" is a turn-based MMORPG with ancient civilizations, cute characters, and exploration. Pilot vehicles, meet characters, recruit companions, and create your dream home. Compose your own legendary adventure in \"Wonderland M\"!','2024/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1481340/M/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8836,'small_saga',NULL,'Beneath the streets of London, an angry mouse seeks revenge against the god who stole his tail. An epic RPG of miniature proportions!','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1320140/Small_Saga/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8837,'the_heart_of_influencer',NULL,'You are entrusted with training five \"troubled\" influencers from Mountain & Sea Media, and gain the “Heart Probe” ability which allows you to uncover girls’ inner thoughts. Use your wisdom and ability to help them meet their training KPIs, while discovering their real selves beneath their facades.','2025/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3562530/The_Heart_of_Influencer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8838,'northgard_-_himminbrjotir,_clan_of_the_ox',NULL,'This content requires the base game Northgard on Steam in order to play.','2020/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1223060/Northgard__Himminbrjotir_Clan_of_the_Ox/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8839,'the_captain',NULL,'In this retro-inspired adventure game you will have to race back home across the galaxy. Collect new friends on your journey. Make new enemies. You won\'t be able to save everyone. Who will you leave behind? Which civilizations will you save - or destroy - along the way?','2021/12/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1721530/The_Captain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8840,'gears_5_-_hivebusters',NULL,'This content requires the base game Gears 5 on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1415070/Gears_5__Hivebusters/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8841,'notruf_112_|_emergency_call_112',NULL,'Emergency Call 112 – The Fire Fighting Simulation is an exciting, fully detailed simulation of the eventful life of a big city fire department. It was developed in cooperation with and modelled on the fire brigade of Mülheim, Germany. Mülheim has one of the largest and most modern fire stations in Europe.','2016/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/491530/Notruf_112__Emergency_Call_112/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8842,'northgard_-_sváfnir,_clan_of_the_snake',NULL,'This content requires the base game Northgard on Steam in order to play.','2018/7/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/888650/Northgard__Svfnir_Clan_of_the_Snake/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8843,'tom_clancy\'s_rainbow_six®_3_gold',NULL,'Raven Shield:Command an elite multinational squad of special operatives against hidden terrorist forces. In Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six 3: Raven Shield, the third installment to the wildly popular Rainbow Six series, Team Rainbow faces the hidden global forces of a new and secretive foe.','2003/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/19830/Tom_Clancys_Rainbow_Six_3_Gold/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8844,'escape_memoirs:_mini_stories_-_bunker_scenario',NULL,'This content requires the base game Escape Memoirs: Mini Stories on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2222460/Escape_Memoirs_Mini_Stories__Bunker_Scenario/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8845,'valfaris:_mecha_therion',NULL,'Therion returns as the hunt for Lord Vroll continues. Pilot an advanced machine of death and destruction in this explosive 2.5D side-scrolling shoot ‘em up, and sequel to the critically acclaimed Valfaris. Strap in and unleash mecha hell!','2023/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1647920/Valfaris_Mecha_Therion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8846,'pine:_a_story_of_loss',NULL,'Alone in the forest glade he shared with his wife, a woodworker struggles to accept her passing. Help him hold on to cherished memories of their life together as he struggles to care for himself and his now empty home. Pine is a single-serving game focused on telling a beautiful, emotional tale.','2024/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2058340/Pine_A_Story_of_Loss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8847,'disassembly_3d',NULL,'Disassembly and destruction physics sandbox simulator. Detailed models of objects and vehicles and their internal parts. Disassemble objects successfully to unlock weapons mode and destruction. Fight evil mannequins with everything you got in physical combat!','2017/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/747910/Disassembly_3D/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8848,'saga_scarlet_grace:_ambitions™',NULL,'With the fate of the world uncertain, follow the journey of Urpina, Taria, Balmaint, and Leonard as they call on their might and set out to carve a new future. Take charge and shape your own adventure with ultimate freedom of choice.','2018/8/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/686720/SaGa_SCARLET_GRACE_AMBITIONS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8849,'thehunter:_call_of_the_wild™_-_duck_and_cover_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game theHunter: Call of the Wild™ on Steam in order to play.','2018/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/939840/theHunter_Call_of_the_Wild__Duck_and_Cover_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8850,'master_of_pottery',NULL,'Master of Pottery is a pottery-themed creation + simulation game. Make pottery, open exhibitions, complete orders, train apprentices, run your own showroom and start a relaxing pottery journey.','2019/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1160490/Master_Of_Pottery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8851,'ggst_additional_character_9_-_asuka',NULL,'This content requires the base game GUILTY GEAR -STRIVE- on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2081053/GGST_Additional_Character_9__Asuka/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8852,'glum',NULL,'In this unique “First-Person Booter” you take on the role as Glum, the crude ass-kicking goblin with his magical ass-kicking boot. Indulge in wacky physics-based combat, over-the-top violence and dark humour with a dash of platforming and points for being extra stylish and sadistic.','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2235550/GLUM/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8853,'gazillionaire',NULL,'Become a Gazillionaire by starting a tiny trading company and building a business empire!','2020/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1169100/Gazillionaire/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8854,'graveyard_keeper_ost',NULL,'This is additional content for Graveyard Keeper, but does not include the base game.','2018/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/919050/Graveyard_Keeper_OST/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8855,'fling_to_the_finish',NULL,'Fling to the Finish is a cooperative racing game where teammates are tethered together by a stretchy elastic rope. Get up close and personal with your partner to maneuver two characters bouncing, rolling, and flinging their way to the finish line!','2024/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1054430/Fling_to_the_Finish/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8856,'demolish_&_build_3',NULL,'Step into the boots of a demolition company owner. Accept and complete contracts to earn money, allowing you to buy new equipment and upgrade your business. Use powerful tools, from sledgehammers to giant excavators, and experience the realism of a true construction site, where every brick matters.','2024/9/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1203670/Demolish__Build_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8857,'raceleague',NULL,'Car racing game with soft-body damage, race track builder, track database and multiplayer','2022/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1565890/RaceLeague/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8858,'warhammer_40,000:_inquisitor_-_prophecy',NULL,'Foul Tyranids rampaging on barren worlds; the mysterious Aeldari waging war on the Imperium; a prophecy that could change the fate of an entire Sector. Purge the unclean with the new Tech-Adept Inquisitor and carry out the Emperor’s will in the grim Action-RPG “WH40k: Inquisitor - Prophecy”.','2019/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1042800/Warhammer_40000_Inquisitor__Prophecy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8859,'grand_emprise:_time_travel_survival',NULL,'TIME TRAVEL through history to BECOME GOD 🚀 Ride dinosaurs, forge tools, sail dunes, build a colony, siege castles, automate and fly, mine underground, launch to the moon, build a dyson sphere! An insane, unforgettable and revolutionary survival crafting base building open world adventure.','2023/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2236300/Grand_Emprise_Time_Travel_Survival/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8860,'doom_eternal:_series_one_cosmetic_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DOOM Eternal on Steam in order to play.','2021/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1460020/DOOM_Eternal_Series_One_Cosmetic_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8861,'psychedelica_of_the_black_butterfly',NULL,'Awakening in a mysterious mansion, her first, frantic thoughts are: \'Where am I? And more importantly, WHO am I?\'','2018/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/865820/Psychedelica_of_the_Black_Butterfly/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8862,'necrosmith',NULL,'A necromancer simulator. Assemble the dead using different body parts while upgrading your tower, combine the abilities of the different fantastic races to fight your way through the hordes of enemies and overrun the ’chosen ones’. To tell the truth, the dead are pretty, uhm, dumb.','2022/7/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1949190/Necrosmith/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8863,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_window_flags',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2016/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/461242/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Window_Flags/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8864,'ovrlrd',NULL,'OVRLRD is a mech combat simulator built from the ground up for Virtual Reality. Take the real, physical controls of a 50-foot bipedal weapons platform as you carry out complex operations across a challenging single-player campaign.','2024/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2163160/OVRLRD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8865,'spaceengine_pro',NULL,'This content requires the base game SpaceEngine on Steam in order to play.','2019/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1026970/SpaceEngine_PRO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8866,'atom_rpg:_post-apocalyptic_indie_game',NULL,'ATOM RPG is a post-apocalyptic indie game, inspired by classic CRPGs: Fallout, Wasteland, Deus Ex, Baldur\'s Gate and many others.','2018/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/552620/ATOM_RPG_Postapocalyptic_indie_game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8867,'my_dream_setup_-_garage_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game My Dream Setup on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3371380/My_Dream_Setup__Garage_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8868,'astrumis_-_survive_together',NULL,'Astrumis - Survive Together is an exclusively co-op horror game. One player controls a survivor on an abandoned spaceship and the other the ship itself. They must work together to survive against the mysterious monster.','2025/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2924860/Astrumis__Survive_Together/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8869,'save_room_-_organization_puzzle',NULL,'When you enter a save room you know you are safe, no danger can come to you, you can relax. Take advantage of this short period of time to organize your inventory, heal your wounds and reload your weapons. Can you make all the items fit in your inventory?','2022/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1955330/Save_Room__Organization_Puzzle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8870,'i\'ve_fallen_for_you!',NULL,'Eight women simultaneously appear in your life, offering you unconditional love and support! Will you choose to uphold your beliefs and become a good man, or give in to human temptations and become a bad man?','2024/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2754690/Ive_Fallen_For_You/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8871,'rewind_or_die',NULL,'There\'s a serial killer stalking your video store, and you just got called into work on your day off! Stock shelves, deal with customers and RUN FOR YOUR LIFE!','2023/4/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2329130/Rewind_Or_Die/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8872,'fishing_planet:_sport_topwater_night_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2017/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/591983/Fishing_Planet_Sport_Topwater_Night_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8873,'20xx',NULL,'20XX is a roguelike action platformer that you can play with a friend. Jump and shoot your way through ever-changing levels, collect awesome new powers, and battle mighty bosses in the name of saving the human race maybe!','2017/8/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/322110/20XX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8874,'cultist_simulator:_original_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Cultist Simulator, but does not include the base game.','2019/1/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/988320/Cultist_Simulator_Original_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8875,'the_escapists_2_-_dungeons_and_duct_tape',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Escapists 2 on Steam in order to play.','2018/5/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/821170/The_Escapists_2__Dungeons_and_Duct_Tape/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8876,'cards_&_tankards',NULL,'Grab a drink, invite your friends and ready your deck! Cards & Tankards is the first social collectible card game available for both PC and VR.','2023/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1506850/Cards__Tankards/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8877,'vampire:_the_masquerade_-_coteries_of_new_york',NULL,'Vampire: The Masquerade - Coteries 