steampowered.com/app/2696320/Thought_Experiment_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_188'),(8883,'rift_wizard',NULL,'Rift Wizard is a tough as nails fantasy roguelike featuring challenging turn based combat and deep open ended character building. Craft your spellbook from over 100 unique spells and abilities and fight your way through a series of procedurally generated challenges to defeat your nemesis.','2021/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1271280/Rift_Wizard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8884,'euro_truck_simulator_2_-_raven_truck_design_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Euro Truck Simulator 2 on Steam in order to play.','2014/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/318521/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2__Raven_Truck_Design_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8885,'expansion_-_crusader_kings_ii:_the_reaper\'s_due',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings II on Steam in order to play.','2016/8/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/449980/Expansion__Crusader_Kings_II_The_Reapers_Due/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8886,'custom_order_maid_3d2_it\'s_a_night_magic_+gp02',NULL,'This content requires the base game CUSTOM ORDER MAID 3D2 It\'s a Night Magic on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1769710/CUSTOM_ORDER_MAID_3D2_Its_a_Night_Magic_GP02/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8887,'3dmark_port_royal_upgrade',NULL,'This content requires the base application 3DMark on Steam in order to run.','2019/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/496103/3DMark_Port_Royal_upgrade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8888,'doomsday_paradise',NULL,'Can you get a date before the end of the world? Doomsday Paradise is a goofy, multiplayer dating sim about finding love before the apocalypse. With over 130 different endings and 12 different singles to woo- no two games will ever be the same.','2023/11/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1603420/Doomsday_Paradise/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8889,'one.',NULL,'The pioneering nakige that made a generation cry... Legendary \'90s visual novel ONE. is back and better than ever with updated art, animations, and features!','2023/12/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2432100/ONE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8890,'coloring_game_4',NULL,'The fourth game of the Coloring Game franchise (coloring by numbers). The game’s fans are going to enjoy the improved functionality and a multitude of new images.','2021/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1554790/Coloring_Game_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8891,'grim_legends_2:_song_of_the_dark_swan',NULL,'Save the feuding kingdoms!','2014/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/279800/Grim_Legends_2_Song_of_the_Dark_Swan/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8892,'putt-putt®_saves_the_zoo',NULL,'Today\'s the grand opening of the Cartown Zoo, and there\'s still so much to do: zoo chow is running low, and all the baby animals are missing.','1995/12/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/294660/PuttPutt_Saves_The_Zoo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8893,'tom_clancy\'s_rainbow_six®_siege_-_platinum_weapon_skin',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six® Siege X on Steam in order to play.','2016/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/417465/Tom_Clancys_Rainbow_Six_Siege__Platinum_Weapon_Skin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8894,'the_big_con',NULL,'Hustle your way across ‘90s America as a runaway teen con artist. Choose how to make your scratch as you don disguises, pick pockets, and rip people off in this comedic crime-filled adventure. Experience the totally rad \'90s in all its plaid and payphone glory!','2021/8/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1139280/The_Big_Con/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8895,'taboo_trial',NULL,'In the rogue action game \"Taboo Trial\", you will play as a young female warrior from the Norse mythology, who can transform into multiple cute and sexy female warriors. In the visually stunning 3D world, you will use your combat skills to uncover the truth behind the Twilight of the Gods.','2023/7/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2455060/Taboo_Trial/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8896,'psalm_5:9-13',NULL,'\"Psalm 5:9-13\" is a first-person psychological horror game with VHS effect. Be careful and attentive, there is something hiding in these rooms, something is watching from the darkness.','2024/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1837220/Psalm_5913/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8897,'universe_horizon',NULL,'An idle incremental game where you decide to travel across the whole Universe. Embark on this journey in your little ship and get as far away as possible from Earth, gathering resources and upgrading your spaceship along the way.','2025/1/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3207880/Universe_Horizon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8898,'combat_mission_cold_war',NULL,'CM Cold War is set in the tipping-point years of a conflict that gripped the world for 45 years. Between 1979-1982, both the NATO and Soviet Warsaw Pact militaries began the shift away from industrialized warfare of the early 20th century and towards the modern digital battlefield of today. ','2021/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1551160/Combat_Mission_Cold_War/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8899,'mk1:_noob_saibot',NULL,'This content requires the base game Mortal Kombat 1 on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3168160/MK1_Noob_Saibot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8900,'find_all_6:_netherlands',NULL,'Immerse yourself in an exciting adventure in the Find All 6: Netherlands game! You will explore the unique landscapes, historical cities and famous landmarks of the Netherlands. Look for hidden objects and color this painted world.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3444050/FIND_ALL_6_Netherlands/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8901,'月圆之夜_(night_of_full_moon)',NULL,'\"Night of the Full Moon\" is a stand-alone roguelike card game. Take adventure into Black Forest. Random event, random plot leads to different endings.','2019/7/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/769560/_Night_of_Full_Moon/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8902,'super_animal_royale_super_edition',NULL,'This content requires the base game Super Animal Royale on Steam in order to play.','2020/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1475530/Super_Animal_Royale_Super_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8903,'the_alliance_alive_hd_remastered',NULL,'Rise up and ignite the resistance in The Alliance Alive HD Remastered! Explore diverse realms, awaken new skills mid-battle, and forge alliances to challenge the Daemons that have taken over the world!','2020/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1027250/The_Alliance_Alive_HD_Remastered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8904,'trailmakers:_texture_pack_1',NULL,'This content requires the base game Trailmakers on Steam in order to play.','2019/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1183540/Trailmakers_Texture_Pack_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8905,'olija',NULL,'Olija is a game about Faraday\'s quest, a man shipwrecked then trapped in the mysterious country of Terraphage. Armed with a legendary harpoon, he and other castaways try to leave this hostile country to return to their homelands.','2021/1/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1297330/Olija/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8906,'payday_2:_the_biker_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2016/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/487210/PAYDAY_2_The_Biker_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8907,'evochron_legacy_se',NULL,'Advanced Space Flight, Combat, Trading, and Exploration Simulation. Set in a vast explorable universe, Evochron Legacy offers freeform gameplay with many diverse objectives and paths to choose from.','2016/1/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/398170/Evochron_Legacy_SE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8908,'myth_of_empires_-_xizhou_civilization_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Myth of Empires on Steam in order to play.','2025/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3502710/Myth_of_Empires__Xizhou_Civilization_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8909,'forever_skies_-_whale_and_dolphin_conservation_artifact',NULL,'This content requires the base game Forever Skies on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2635800/Forever_Skies__Whale_and_Dolphin_Conservation_Artifact/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8910,'titanic:_adventure_out_of_time',NULL,'Intrigue and adventure await you on board the Titanic, the most famous ocean liner in history. As a British secret agent on a vital mission, it is up to you to change the course of history as you explore the world’s most luxurious ocean vessel in all its original splendour.','1996/1/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/785480/Titanic_Adventure_Out_Of_Time/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8911,'tools_up!_ultimate_edition',NULL,'Tools Up! Ultimate Edition is a chaos-filled, local couch-coop extravaganza, all about renovating homes and the outdoors. It comes with all updates, content, and DLC in one package, supporting up to 4 players.','2024/1/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2551920/Tools_Up_Ultimate_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8912,'thomas_was_alone',NULL,'Guide a group of rectangles through a series of obstacles, using their different skills together to get to the end of each environment.','2012/11/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/220780/Thomas_Was_Alone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8913,'the_sims™_4_kitchen_clutter_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2025/5/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3200010/The_Sims_4_Kitchen_Clutter_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8914,'naruto_shippuden:_ultimate_ninja_storm_4_-_gaara\'s_tale_extra_scenario_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game NARUTO SHIPPUDEN: Ultimate Ninja STORM 4 on Steam in order to play.','2016/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/416421/NARUTO_SHIPPUDEN_Ultimate_Ninja_STORM_4__Gaaras_Tale_Extra_Scenario_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8915,'trek_to_yomi',NULL,'As a vow to his dying Master, the young swordsman Hiroki is sworn to protect his town and the people he loves against all threats. Faced with tragedy and bound to duty, the lone samurai must voyage beyond life and death to confront himself and decide his path forward.','2022/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1370050/Trek_to_Yomi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8916,'call_of_boba',NULL,'A cozy pixel art adventure about saving a struggling Boba Tea shop. Brew up tasty drinks, battle enemies for inspiration, make friends with customers, and much much more, on your quest to serve up the best tea in town!','2025/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2342690/Call_of_Boba/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8917,'the_caligula_effect:_overdose',NULL,'Mobius. An idyllic world that lets people forget about the pain and problems of reality. Created by a sentient vocaloid program, μ (Mu), reality and fantasy have become blurred, allowing people to relive their high school years in bliss -- but just how real is a virtual happiness?','2019/3/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/889600/The_Caligula_Effect_Overdose/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8918,'ai_roguelite',NULL,'World\'s first RPG in which all entities are AI-generated and all game mechanics are AI-directed.','2023/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1889620/AI_Roguelite/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8919,'one_hand_clapping',NULL,'One Hand Clapping is a vocal 2D platformer. Solve puzzles, by singing or humming into your microphone, and find confidence in the power of your voice as it changes the world around you.','2021/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/893720/One_Hand_Clapping/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8920,'tasty_planet:_back_for_seconds',NULL,'Control a tiny ball of grey goo with the ability to eat anything smaller than itself. The more it eats, the bigger it gets! Eat rats, dinosaurs, gladiators, samurai, pyramids, volcanoes... Everything! Soon you\'ll be eating the entire planet.','2016/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/445110/Tasty_Planet_Back_for_Seconds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8921,'train_simulator:_santa_fe_super_fleet_gp60m',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2955990/Train_Simulator_Santa_Fe_Super_Fleet_GP60M/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8922,'anno_1800_-_old_town_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Anno 1800 on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2222650/Anno_1800__Old_Town_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8923,'goat_simulator:_waste_of_space',NULL,'This content requires the base game Goat Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2016/5/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/463720/Goat_Simulator_Waste_of_Space/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8924,'batman_-_the_enemy_within_shadows_mode',NULL,'This content requires the base game Batman: The Enemy Within - The Telltale Series on Steam in order to play.','2016/8/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1181990/Batman__The_Enemy_Within_Shadows_Mode/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8925,'quest_for_glory_1-5',NULL,'The world of Gloriana, with all its wonderful diversity, awaits you.','1989/10/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/502750/Quest_for_Glory_15/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8926,'esports_godfather_hero_expansion_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Esports Godfather on Steam in order to play.','2025/1/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3379820/Esports_Godfather_Hero_Expansion_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8927,'nocturnals',NULL,'A short, choose your own adventure game about two boys that find each other in a lonely, post-apocalyptic town.','2024/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2578910/Nocturnals/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8928,'forza_motorsport_vip',NULL,'This content requires the base game Forza Motorsport on Steam in order to play.','2023/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2557400/Forza_Motorsport_VIP/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8929,'read_only_memories:_neurodiver',NULL,'Read Only Memories: NEURODIVER is a story-rich adventure and the sequel to 2064: Read Only Memories. Explore the rich world with an intuitive point-and-click interface as you take on the role of a young psychic agent tasked with tracking down a mysterious antagonist hiding in people\'s memories.','2024/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1293910/Read_Only_Memories_NEURODIVER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8930,'cooking_craze',NULL,'Cooking Craze is a fast and fun cooking game that lets you explore the cultures of the world through their delicious food! Upgrade your restaurants to serve only the best dishes and use a variety of special boosts to cook your way to victory!','2024/3/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2540630/Cooking_Craze/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8931,'figment',NULL,'Figment is an action-adventure game that invites you to explore a unique surreal universe filled with music, humor and multi layered narrative. Join Dusty and his ever-optimistic friend, Piper, on an adventure through the different sides of the mind seeking to restore the courage that\'s been lost.','2017/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/493540/Figment/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_189'),(8932,'invincible_presents:_atom_eve',NULL,'Become Atom Eve and take control of your own path as one of the most powerful superheroes in the Invincible universe! Unravel a mystery and balance the dangers and responsibilities of being a superhero with the relatable challenges of everyday life.','2023/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2060870/Invincible_Presents_Atom_Eve/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8933,'train_sim_world®_5:_bahnstrecke_salzburg_-_rosenheim_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2024/8/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2970540/Train_Sim_World_5_Bahnstrecke_Salzburg__Rosenheim_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8934,'croakoloco',NULL,'Croakoloco is a relaxing frog collecting idle game. Watch them jump, croak, and eat delicious flies. Grow frogs, feed frogs, or take control of one in “Froggy Mode” for a more active play style!','2024/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2628420/Croakoloco/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8935,'kinnikuneko:_super_muscle_cat',NULL,'Join KinnikuNeko, a cat with a bodybuilder\'s body, in this fun 2D platformer and fight against the mysterious alien invasion. A story full of goofy humor, friendship, drama and action. Its aesthetics are a love letter to 90s anime along with an unforgettable soundtrack.','2024/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1332950/KinnikuNeko_SUPER_MUSCLE_CAT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8936,'minoria',NULL,'Ink and blood stain the streets of Ramezia. Witches must burn and sins must be judged. Venture forth as Sister Semilla to burn down the pillars of heresy in Minoria, an action-platformer by Bombservice, creators of Momodora.','2019/8/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/940910/Minoria/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8937,'age_of_empires_ii_(2013):_the_african_kingdoms',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Empires II (Retired) on Steam in order to play.','2015/11/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/355950/Age_of_Empires_II_2013_The_African_Kingdoms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8938,'life_effect',NULL,'Alien invaders invaded the planet, having exterminated most of the population, humanity, being on the verge of annihilation, united the armies and gave a serious rebuff to the enemy. After several years of war, the climate on the planet has changed. The military founded fortifications.','2025/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2191050/LIFE_EFFECT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8939,'neon_abyss_-_chrono_trap',NULL,'This content requires the base game Neon Abyss on Steam in order to play.','2022/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1851340/Neon_Abyss__Chrono_Trap/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8940,'super_life_(rpg)',NULL,'Welcome home to Sun Villa! After a long summer at grandpa\'s ranch, it\'s time to finish school, get a job and move into your own place. Let the adventure of life begin!','2019/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1087460/Super_Life_RPG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8941,'sengoku_jidai:_shadow_of_the_shogun',NULL,'Sengoku Jidai: Shadow of the Shogun is a turn-based tactical and strategic game set during the Sengoku era; primarily focusing on the Japanese Warring States period and Japanese Invasion of Korea.','2016/5/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/397190/Sengoku_Jidai_Shadow_of_the_Shogun/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8942,'intruder_in_antiquonia',NULL,'Intruder In Antiquonia is a narrative mystery adventure that will immerse you in the Internet-hostile town of Antiquonia. Sarah does not remember who she is and how she got there. Help her solve the mysteries of her past while exploring beautiful hand-drawn environments.','2022/7/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1778870/Intruder_In_Antiquonia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8943,'below_the_stone',NULL,'Below the Stone is an extraction roguelike about dwarves on the quest for the deepest depths. A place where each and every descent will lead to new adventures -- and where only the most determined dwarves with many lost lives will be rewarded by the hidden world lying below the stone.','2023/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1170230/Below_the_Stone/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8944,'ostalgie:_the_berlin_wall',NULL,'The confrontation between the East and the West is coming to an end, but not between East and West Germany. The old party leaders are still sitting in their offices, not changing anything and waiting for exclamations from Moscow. But their end is close – Gorbachev and Kohl have already decided...','2018/3/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/774091/Ostalgie_The_Berlin_Wall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8945,'payday_2:_scarface_heist',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2016/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/548421/PAYDAY_2_Scarface_Heist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8946,'population:_one',NULL,'Fight anywhere in this squad-based VR Battle Royale','2020/10/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/691260/POPULATION_ONE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8947,'dragon_spirits_2',NULL,'In this modern urban-themed RPG, you can collect 80+ different dragon spirits, experiment with skill setups, assemble teams, and devise strategies to build your dragon spirit squad. Adventure through the virtual spaces in Metapolis, and uncover the conspiracy behind it all.','2024/9/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1965190/Dragon_Spirits_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8948,'disney_princess:_my_fairytale_adventure',NULL,'Young gamers travel to the worlds of Cinderella, Rapunzel, Ariel, Belle, and Tiana on a quest to transform evil imps back into friendly sprites in Disney Princess: My Fairytale Adventure.','2012/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/319080/Disney_Princess_My_Fairytale_Adventure/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8949,'jojo\'s_bizarre_adventure:_all-star_battle_r_-_alternate_world_diego_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game JoJo\'s Bizarre Adventure: All-Star Battle R on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2001013/JoJos_Bizarre_Adventure_AllStar_Battle_R__Alternate_World_Diego_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8950,'dying_light_2_stay_human:_hakon_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dying Light 2 Stay Human: Reloaded Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/7/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2456710/Dying_Light_2_Stay_Human_Hakon_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8951,'renaissance_kingdom_wars',NULL,'The year is 1510. As wars rage across Europe, Africa, and the Middle East, it is the age of gunpowder and mercenaries - that changed the course of history. You can do it as well, going from a leader of men to the ruler of an empire in this unique mix of RTS and grand strategy.','2024/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2533020/Renaissance_Kingdom_Wars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8952,'dealer\'s_life_legend',NULL,'Become a legendary merchant and haggler in this medieval fantasy world. Explore, trade and use potions to give you the upper hand in the latest instalment of the tycoon phenomenon Dealer’s Life!','2025/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2185030/Dealers_Life_Legend/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8953,'lilitales',NULL,'Branded as a traitor for losing the princess, the young knight Luna sets out on a lonely journey to rescue the princess and clear her name.','2019/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1141100/Lilitales/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8954,'tower_of_mask',NULL,'Tower of Mask is a thrilling survival horror in the spirit of the 80\'s dungeon crawlers. The most claustrophobic dungeon in modern times is yours to venture through alone. Hero, face the ancient tower where eerie masked humans prowl.','2024/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2918410/Tower_of_Mask/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8955,'spark_the_electric_jester',NULL,'Spark the electric jester is an action/platformer video game heavily based on best classics from the 16-bit era from both sides of the aisle.','2017/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/601810/Spark_the_Electric_Jester/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8956,'terraria:_official_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Terraria, but does not include the base game.','2015/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/409210/Terraria_Official_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8957,'you_don\'t_know_jack_vol._2',NULL,'Reintroduce yourself to this classic YDKJ sequel! All the fun of Volume 1, but with completely different questions, host, and smell! YOU DON’T KNOW JACK Volume 2 is the mutant offspring of the original award-winning, irreverent, fast-paced trivia game where you are a contestant on a manic game show.','1996/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/259940/YOU_DONT_KNOW_JACK_Vol_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8958,'lost_in_fantaland',NULL,'Lost in Fantaland is a Roguelite game with deck-building at its core, deeply integrated with board-game strategy mechanics. You will choose one of six unique characters and embark on a randomly generated adventure. Use your creativity to build your deck, and uncover the secrets of this world!','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1266430/Lost_In_Fantaland/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8959,'decision_legacy_collection',NULL,'All the games in the classic Decision series bundled together. From the zombie-ravaged streets of the original Decision to the brutal medieval battlegrounds of Decision Medieval, this collection delivers the raw, blood-soaked combat, base building, and survival gameplay that hooked Flash game fans.','2025/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3015510/Decision_Legacy_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8960,'nancy_drew®:_the_final_scene',NULL,'Search a Darkened Movie Theater to Free a Hostage from her Captor’s Dangerous Plot!','2001/11/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/615730/Nancy_Drew_The_Final_Scene/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8961,'the_ditzy_demons_are_in_love_with_me',NULL,'Ren’s virginity is in danger as he is suddenly pushed into the school’s special girl\'s dormitory full of useless demons. Assigned as an assistant to watch over them, his happy and troublesome days as a teacher for these cute but incompetent demons has begun.','2018/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/802870/The_Ditzy_Demons_Are_in_Love_With_Me/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8962,'ggst_additional_character_5_-_testament',NULL,'This content requires the base game GUILTY GEAR -STRIVE- on Steam in order to play.','2022/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1544405/GGST_Additional_Character_5__Testament/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8963,'dcs:_mi-8_mtv2_magnificent_eight',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2013/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/249310/DCS_Mi8_MTV2_Magnificent_Eight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8964,'goat_simulator:_goatz',NULL,'This content requires the base game Goat Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2015/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/344450/Goat_Simulator_GoatZ/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8965,'portal:_revolution',NULL,'The Portal Mod you\'ve been waiting for. Delve into a new story with original characters, spanning over 8 hours of gameplay and featuring over 40 new challenging test chambers which make use of new mechanics.','2024/1/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/601360/Portal_Revolution/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8966,'disney_epic_mickey_2:__the_power_of_two',NULL,'Unleash the power of the brush in an all new co-op adventure. Join Mickey and Oswald in an epic battle to save the magical world of Wasteland and change it forever. Interact with your favorite characters like never before in the most heroic adventure yet.','2012/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/245300/Disney_Epic_Mickey_2__The_Power_of_Two/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8967,'urbo',NULL,'URBO is a relaxing and meditative city-building puzzle game. Begin with an empty grid of landscape, choose an architectural style and build. Watch the population grow and the city flourish.','2023/9/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2141770/URBO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8968,'battle_chess',NULL,'It took 2000 years for someone to make chess better!','1988/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/622830/Battle_Chess/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8969,'the_living_remain',NULL,'The Living Remain is a virtual reality first person adventure shooter where players immerse themselves in a world where the undead have taken over. You must survive the horde of undead using an arsenal of weapons in a story driven campaign loaded with a variety of interactive environments.','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/594220/The_Living_Remain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8970,'terror_of_hemasaurus',NULL,'A retro city smash \'em up with satisfying destruction physics. Play as a Giant Monster unleashing terror upon mankind in this modern arcade experience with the action turned up to eleven.','2022/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1016180/Terror_of_Hemasaurus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8971,'virgo_versus_the_zodiac',NULL,'Dethrone the Zodiacs, revive the Golden Age and purge the Heretics that swarm the galaxy as Virgo, the queen of Purity, in this unforgiving timed actions turn-based JRPG.','2019/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/920320/Virgo_Versus_The_Zodiac/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8972,'charming_hearts',NULL,'\"Charming Hearts\" is a real-life interactive dating game. Players will meet, get to know, and fall in love with different types of beauty. Every choice will lead to a completely different chemical reaction with \"her\"; every entanglement, the sweet love is entangled and pulled.','2024/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2817140/Charming_Hearts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8973,'milling_machine_simulator',NULL,'Milling machine simulator will inspire novices and experts alike. Realistic physics and movements allow you to familiarize yourself with the machine in a 3D workshop setting. Enjoy playing around, learning and prototyping in Free milling mode. Or challenge yourself in Career mode.','2022/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1787960/Milling_machine_simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8974,'phantom_brave:_the_lost_hero',NULL,'Join Marona and her Phantom friends on a mission to defeat the sinister Shipwreck Fleet! Recruit Phantoms, bind them to objects, combine them with Gadgets, and even merge them with Marona herself in this Play-It-Your-Way RPG.','2025/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3049990/Phantom_Brave_The_Lost_Hero/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8975,'star_trek™:_starfleet_academy',NULL,'A must for any fan, Star Trek: Starfleet Academy is an action/flight simulator featuring filmed footage of the original Star Trek actors. Take your place among the best and brightest at Starfleet Academy!','2015/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/364810/Star_Trek_Starfleet_Academy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8976,'tales_of_maj\'eyal_-_forbidden_cults',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tales of Maj\'Eyal on Steam in order to play.','2018/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/590610/Tales_of_MajEyal__Forbidden_Cults/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8977,'zanki_zero:_last_beginning',NULL,'Explore the ruins, dungeons, and islands in this post-apocalyptic world through the POV of eight protagonists as they fight for survival and search for meaning in their never-ending cycles of life and death.','2019/4/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/819020/Zanki_Zero_Last_Beginning/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8978,'atomic_picnic',NULL,'Third-person bullet heaven meets explosive co-op action! Swing, dash, and blast through monster swarms while combining upgrades and discovering rare evolutions to create game-breaking builds of destruction.','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1903560/Atomic_Picnic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8979,'avernum_2:_crystal_souls',NULL,'Huge indie fantasy role-playing adventure in a massive, underground land. Packed with over 100 towns and dungeons and an epic story. Fight to complete up to three distinct game-winning quests. Master over 60 spells and abilities. Hunt for hundreds of magical artifacts. Over 50 hours of gameplay.','2015/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/337850/Avernum_2_Crystal_Souls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8980,'duck_season_pc',NULL,'An experimental first person narrative sending you back to Summer 1988 and you have a one day rental of Duck Season. Dive into the mystery and work through the hidden secrets spilling out of the cursed cartridge. The full hit VR game playable on your traditional flat screen!','2019/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/746510/Duck_Season_PC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_190'),(8981,'snk_40th_anniversary_collection',NULL,'SNK 40th Anniversary Collection is the ultimate collection of classic arcade games from SNK\'s golden age with 24 different nostalgic titles back from the 1980s, and many bells and whistles for the best game experience on Steam!!','2019/6/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/865940/SNK_40th_ANNIVERSARY_COLLECTION/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8982,'stray_cats_in_cozy_town',NULL,'Welcome to Cozy Town, where every day is International Cat Day! Be part of a village community where every stray is respected, loved and fed. Explore the charming streets and alleys to discover all the stray cats in this hidden-object game.','2024/8/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2901140/Stray_Cats_in_Cozy_Town/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8983,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_the_trick_shooter',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2021/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1397381/Hunt_Showdown_1896__The_Trick_Shooter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8984,'farming_simulator_22_-_pumps_n\'_hoses_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Farming Simulator 22 on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2052720/Farming_Simulator_22__Pumps_n_Hoses_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8985,'burger_shop_3',NULL,'Make tasty food items to serve hungry customers in this fast-paced sequel to the amazing food making games Burger Shop 1 & 2!','2023/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2505570/Burger_Shop_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8986,'mothered_-_a_role-playing_horror_game',NULL,'An immersive first-person horror adventure where you play the role of LIANA - a young girl who arrives home after major surgery and is met with a strange mannequin claiming to be her mother.','2021/12/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1830720/MOTHERED__A_ROLEPLAYING_HORROR_GAME/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8987,'mindlock_-_the_apartment',NULL,'Colin’s apartment maze has puzzles, dialogues, and some dry humor waiting for you. A surreal adventure of a special kind.','2024/11/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2669150/Mindlock__The_Apartment/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8988,'firefight',NULL,'Firefight is a World War II real-time simulation game similar in style to the old Close Combat series but brought up to date with better AI, individual soldier modelling, a faster frame rate to give more intense and realistic combat and an easy to use command interface.','2016/7/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/500190/Firefight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8989,'dungeons_of_dredmor',NULL,'Test your luck and cunning in this exciting RPG as you craft, cast, and pillage your way through Lord Dredmor\'s Dungeons.','2011/7/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/98800/Dungeons_of_Dredmor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8990,'battlezone_98_redux',NULL,'One of the greatest sci-fi strategy games of all time returns with remastered visuals, online multiplayer and near unlimited mod content from Steam Workshop. Experience thrilling first person action and acclaimed RTS in this explosive alternate vision of the 1960s space race.','2016/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/301650/Battlezone_98_Redux/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8991,'monster_hunter_wilds_-_sticker_set:_blossomdance',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Hunter Wilds on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3289710/Monster_Hunter_Wilds__Sticker_Set_Blossomdance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8992,'indiana_jones®_and_the_emperor\'s_tomb™',NULL,'As Indiana Jones, you’ll travel to 1935 China to prevent a powerful artifact from falling into evil hands. This globe-spanning adventure pits you against evil Nazis and the Asian underworld. It’ll take more than just a trusty whip and pistol to avoid the perils of the Emperor’s Tomb.','2003/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/560430/Indiana_Jones_and_the_Emperors_Tomb/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8993,'arcade_game_series:_galaga',NULL,'First appearing in arcades in 1981, the masterpiece GALAGA finally comes to Steam! Move the fighter left and right and destroy the waves of incoming aliens!','2016/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/403430/ARCADE_GAME_SERIES_GALAGA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8994,'yomawari:_midnight_shadows',NULL,'The dark is no place to be alone. After a beautiful show of summer fireworks, two young girls begin to make their way home. However, a mysterious attacker separates them, and both must brave the haunting night filled with unspeakable terrors and survive the darkness.','2017/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/625980/Yomawari_Midnight_Shadows/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8995,'this_war_of_mine:_forget_celebrations_charity_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game This War of Mine on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3323700/This_War_of_Mine_Forget_Celebrations_Charity_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8996,'garou:_mark_of_the_wolves',NULL,'“GAROU: MARK OF THE WOLVES”, the latest entry in the legendary \"FATAL FURY\" Series which still continues to fascinate players around the world to this day, returns for a new fight on Steam!','2016/12/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/366240/GAROU_MARK_OF_THE_WOLVES/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8997,'rage:_the_scorchers™',NULL,'This content requires the base game RAGE on Steam in order to play.','2012/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/209460/Rage_The_Scorchers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8998,'toward_dawn',NULL,'Inspired by Welsh mythology, experience a classic fantasy RPG adventure exploring the cycles of abuse. Customise your abilities, craft new equipment and Break your enemies in strategic turn-based combat.','2025/5/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3140160/Toward_Dawn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(8999,'ai_war_2:_the_neinzul_abyss',NULL,'This content requires the base game AI War 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1466780/AI_War_2_The_Neinzul_Abyss/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9000,'mxgp3_-_the_official_motocross_videogame',NULL,'Experience all the adrenaline of Motocross with the official Championship’s only videogame!','2017/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/561600/MXGP3__The_Official_Motocross_Videogame/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9001,'unmatched:_digital_edition',NULL,'Unmatched: Digital Edition is a highly asymmetrical game of card-driven battles between epic heroes from story and myth. ⚔️ Witness clashes you\'ve never seen before in duels or team fights. 💥 In battle, there are no equals! 💥','2023/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1677980/Unmatched_Digital_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9002,'prison_boss_vr',NULL,'Prison Boss VR is a crafting and trading game turning your VR space into a jail cell! Craft cigarettes, alcohol and cookies for other inmates! Customize your cell as your reputation grows! Earn cash until you can’t store it anymore and become the Prison Boss!','2017/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/673600/Prison_Boss_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9003,'friends_vs_friends:_el_pelicano',NULL,'This content requires the base game Friends vs Friends on Steam in order to play.','2024/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3153670/Friends_vs_Friends_El_Pelicano/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9004,'dishonored_-_the_knife_of_dunwall',NULL,'This content requires the base game Dishonored on Steam in order to play.','2013/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/208575/Dishonored__The_Knife_of_Dunwall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9005,'dc_league_of_super-pets:_the_adventures_of_krypto_and_ace',NULL,'Suit up as super-dogs Krypto and Ace to uncover Lex Luthor’s plot to pet-nap Metropolis’ strays. Soar through the skies, unleash your special abilities and protect the streets of Metropolis from Lex’s plans and bring the evil LexBots to heel.','2022/7/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1697760/DC_League_of_SuperPets_The_Adventures_of_Krypto_and_Ace/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9006,'emergency_call_112_-_the_attack_squad',NULL,'Take on the role of the attack squad and complete a variety of diverse missions ranging from apartment fires to rescuing people and many more. Get an overview of the situation at the scene and decide strategically how to tackle the upcoming tasks depending on the situation!','2024/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2482200/Emergency_Call_112__The_Attack_Squad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9007,'mechs_v_kaijus_-_tower_defense',NULL,'Mechs V Kaijus is an addictive hardcore tower defense gameplay. In Mechs V Kaijus you take on the role of Commander of a powerful Mechs squadron. Improve your Mech, strategically place towers and factories on the battlefield. Deploy support units on the battlefield, and save our civilization.','2018/5/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/809540/Mechs_V_Kaijus__Tower_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9008,'63_days',NULL,'Coming of age as a part of the first generation born free, WWII stripped me of my family, home, and future. Now I\'m left with only one choice: to get my revenge and independence, or die trying. The odds are against us: will our tactics, stealth and teamwork be enough?','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2202120/63_Days/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9009,'togges',NULL,'Togges is a charming and colourful 3D Puzzle-Platformer. Go on adventures, stack adorable living blocks and solve puzzles around the Cosmos to save the Galaxy from the threats of the Void.','2022/12/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1550270/Togges/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9010,'fast_and_low',NULL,'Fast and Low is a VR Tactical Shooter mixed with a traditional FPS. Players can play solo, locally via asymmetric multiplayer or play together online to breach rooms, neutralize hostiles, and rescue civilians. \'Cause when the bad guys gotta go...you gotta hit \'em Fast...and you gotta hit \'em Low.','2023/4/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1097620/Fast_and_Low/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9011,'dcs:_combined_arms',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2012/5/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/240300/DCS_Combined_Arms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9012,'who_takes_the_crown?',NULL,'Test your brain and your brawn in the toughest chess game ever made! Play against the Stockfish chess engine to build your path and climb upward to claim the crown, but be careful! One small blunder and you risk losing your progress. Heavy is the head that wears the crown, but who will take it?','2025/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2550290/Who_Takes_The_Crown/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9013,'robot_girl\'s_dream_-robotbattlechampionship-',NULL,'This game is an RPG game that follows the growth of a robot girl who has lost her memories. Players can aim for victory in the robot battle tournament, the main objective, and also enjoy interactions with both humans and robots.','2025/1/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2742730/Robot_girls_dream_RobotBattleChampionship/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9014,'solium_infernum_-_belphegor,_paragon_of_impiety',NULL,'This content requires the base game Solium Infernum on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2893270/Solium_Infernum__Belphegor_Paragon_of_Impiety/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9015,'abriss_-_build_to_destroy',NULL,'ABRISS is an atmospheric physics-destruction building game.Build structures from parts to let them crash into your targets. Unlock new parts, destroy more, witness entropy at its worst in digital-brutalist cityscapes. Build to destroy.','2023/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1671480/ABRISS__build_to_destroy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9016,'rock_of_ages_3:_make_&_break',NULL,'Competitive tower defense meets arcade action and gets rolled up with ACE Team\'s quirky, Monty Python-esque humor into one giant, creative game for the ages. This time around, you can even make your own levels!','2020/7/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1101360/Rock_of_Ages_3_Make__Break/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9017,'city_game_studio:_your_game_dev_adventure_begins',NULL,'Manage a game studio from the dawn of the gaming industry in 1976. Your journey starts with small indie titles and grows into a gaming empire. Develop, design, and conquer the industry. From humble beginnings to gaming legend – it’s your story, your studio, your legacy!','2021/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/726840/City_Game_Studio_Your_Game_Dev_Adventure_Begins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9018,'nimbatus_-_the_space_drone_constructor',NULL,'Command the Nimbatus and craft drones out of hundreds of different parts. Survive unknown threats in a fully destructible, procedural universe, compete against other players in different arenas or enjoy complete creative freedom in the sandbox.','2020/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/383840/Nimbatus__The_Space_Drone_Constructor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9019,'dragon_ball_xenoverse_2_-_hero_of_justice_pack_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/5/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2377310/DRAGON_BALL_XENOVERSE_2__HERO_OF_JUSTICE_Pack_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9020,'expansion_-_crusader_kings_ii:_horse_lords',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crusader Kings II on Steam in order to play.','2015/7/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/354330/Expansion__Crusader_Kings_II_Horse_Lords/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9021,'guns_of_icarus_alliance',NULL,'Own the skies in steam-powered airships! Guns of Icarus Alliance is a team-based online game that pits co-op crews against both rival teams and an AI that learns your tactics. Players become part of the story as each battle shapes history in an ever-changing steampunk world.','2017/3/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/608800/Guns_of_Icarus_Alliance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9022,'growmancer',NULL,'A small incremental game about greening the land. Play as the Growmancer, a wizard traveling worlds with his canine companion to transform wastelands into fertile grounds and battle destructive wildfires. Upgrade both via a skill tree. Challenge yourself or just relax.','2025/6/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3690720/Growmancer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9023,'simulacra',NULL,'An interactive horror experience of exploring a missing woman’s phone.','2017/10/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/712730/SIMULACRA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9024,'railway_empire_2_-_journey_to_the_east',NULL,'This content requires the base game Railway Empire 2 on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2517380/Railway_Empire_2__Journey_To_The_East/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9025,'hiveswap:_act_1',NULL,'A hand-drawn tribute to hilarious \'90s adventure games (with none of the accompanying frustration). Play as Joey Claire, a puzzle-solving teen snatched out of her time (1994) and place (Earth) and stranded on a hostile alien planet on the brink of rebellion.','2017/9/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/623940/HIVESWAP_ACT_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9026,'the_beast_within:_a_gabriel_knight®_mystery',NULL,'Play as both Gabriel and Grace as they are dispatched to Munich to solve a series of mutilation murders thought to be the work of werewolves.','1995/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/496760/The_Beast_Within_A_Gabriel_Knight_Mystery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9027,'accident',NULL,'Become a journalist who researches old car accident cases. Help victims and perform first aid, obtain evidence and reconstruct the events to discover what really happened.','2021/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/852220/Accident/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9028,'crimsonland',NULL,'Thousands of aliens, giant spiders, mutant lizards, and more are on the attack - can you survive the onslaught? Crimsonland is a top-down shooter with a touch of RPG. Unlock over 30 weapons and over 50 perks from quirky to brutal. Complete the quest and show your skills in five survival modes.','2014/6/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/262830/Crimsonland/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9029,'syberia_ii',NULL,'Having searched Eastern and Western Europe for a missing heir, Kate Walker finally completed her long and arduous journey, obtaining the signature of Hans Voralberg and closing the automaton factory buyout.','2004/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/46510/Syberia_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_191'),(9030,'recursed',NULL,'A puzzle game where the rooms are items and the items are rooms. Get to the goal by moving, rearranging and duplicating rooms and altering the structure of the world.','2016/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/497780/Recursed/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9031,'halls_of_torment_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Halls of Torment on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3386980/Halls_of_Torment__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9032,'commander_keen',NULL,'Commander Keen: Invasion of the Vorticons: Episode 1: Marooned on Mars (Dec. 14th 1990) Episode 2: The Earth Explodes (1991) Episode 3: Keen Must Die! (1991) Commander Keen\'s very first adventure, and the debut of id\'s groundbreaking side-scrolling technology.','1990/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/9180/Commander_Keen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9033,'train_simulator:_west_highland_line_(south)_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2015/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/277761/Train_Simulator_West_Highland_Line_South_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9034,'butcher',NULL,'BUTCHER is a fast-paced, blood-soaked 2D shooter where carnage is the only way forward. Become a ruthless cyborg tasked with eradicating humanity, leaving nothing but blood, guts, and destruction in your wake. There\'s no such thing as too much violence in this grim, retro-styled gorefest.','2016/10/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/474210/BUTCHER/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9035,'kity_builder',NULL,'Kity Builder is a cozy city-building sandbox mixed with platformer, where you build cute towns for kittens. There’s no time limits or resources to manage, just playful space for your creativity.','2025/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1622310/Kity_Builder/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9036,'djmax_respect_v_-_black_square_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2020/5/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1300211/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__BLACK_SQUARE_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9037,'redcon',NULL,'Command your own fortress in FTL-like real-time battles! Crush the enemy fortress with unrelenting bombardment or seize it with carefully executed invasion.','2016/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/449710/REDCON/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9038,'payday_2:_weapon_color_pack_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2020/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1347751/PAYDAY_2_Weapon_Color_Pack_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9039,'liminal_shift',NULL,'Liminal Shift is a unique atmospheric suspense game developed using the latest Unreal Engine 5 technologies such as Lumen and Nanite. With every step you take, Liminal Shift pushes you deeper into an eerie, unsettling experience like no other.','2025/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3282700/LIMINAL_SHIFT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9040,'night_stones',NULL,'You awake in Mythica, a cozy island where magical stones change day to night. Explore winding paths or venture into the wilds with your trusty glider and sailboat. To return home, you must befriend quirky townsfolk, discover hidden treasures, master magic, and face enemies in clever puzzle combat.','2024/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2300340/Night_Stones/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9041,'djmax_respect_v_-_portable_3_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2021/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1568680/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__Portable_3_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9042,'clover_reset',NULL,'\"Hey, do you know the meaning of the four-leaf clover?\" Set at \"Shonan Saika Academy,\" a prestigious school in Shonan, Kanagawa Prefecture, this is a youthful story of girls wavering between friendship and love.','2025/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3239250/Clover_Reset/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9043,'framed_collection',NULL,'Rearrange the panels of an animated comic book to craft the story of a noir-styled spy adventure in the FRAMED Collection--a compilation of the multi-award winning puzzle games FRAMED and FRAMED 2.','2018/5/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/322450/FRAMED_Collection/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9044,'flashing_lights:_thunder_sport_sedan_pack_(police,_fire,_ems)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Flashing Lights - Police, Firefighting, Emergency Services (EMS) Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2649430/Flashing_Lights_Thunder_Sport_Sedan_Pack_Police_Fire_EMS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9045,'fallen_gf',NULL,'Shino has been the protagonist\'s childhood friend since they were kids. She is like a symbol of a man\'s \"preferences\"... A girl with such high specs that anyone would take a second glance if they passed her by. However, everyday life with her doesn\'t seem to be just peaceful.','2025/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2817390/FALLEN_GF/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9046,'times_and_galaxy',NULL,'Embark on an interplanetary adventure as the first robo reporter for the Times & Galaxy, the solar system’s most trusted holopaper. You’re just an intern, but if you can get the scoop, write great stories, and impress your colleagues, maybe you\'ll get to keep your job!','2024/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/883230/Times_and_Galaxy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9047,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_spirit_of_nian',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1530430/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Spirit_of_Nian/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9048,'24_killers',NULL,'Explore a desert island full of oddities, transform into monsters you\'ve rescued, collect mysterious spirits, and unlock mods that change up future playthroughs.','2023/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1668310/24_Killers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9049,'harmony:_the_fall_of_reverie',NULL,'The fate of humanity is at stake. Use your gift of clairvoyance to see into the future and stop an apocalypse that threatens the balance between your world and the deities\'.','2023/6/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1966420/Harmony_The_Fall_of_Reverie/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9050,'nobunaga\'s_ambition:_sphere_of_influence',NULL,'Become a Daimyo of the Warring States period of Japanese history in NOBUNAGA\'S AMBITION, a historical simulation game of conquest and domination. It is the 30th anniversary of this series and this current release, NOBUNAGA\'S AMBITION: Sphere of Influence, is the crown of the series.','2015/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/392470/NOBUNAGAS_AMBITION_Sphere_of_Influence/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9051,'tekken_8_-_clive_rosfield_(final_fantasy_series)',NULL,'This content requires the base game TEKKEN 8 on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3145880/TEKKEN_8__Clive_Rosfield_FINAL_FANTASY_series/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9052,'the_making_of_karateka',NULL,'Play the history. Go behind the scenes of Jordan Mechner\'s landmark game Karateka in this interactive documentary from Digital Eclipse, with archival materials, video features, and more. Experience pixel-perfect versions of this legendary game, with all-new features.','2023/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1163060/The_Making_of_Karateka/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9053,'crittergarden',NULL,'You are an astrobiologist stranded on a lifeless planet. Breathe new life into this mysterious world by gathering plants, animals, and research upgrades to help it grow back to its full potential. Collect, breed, and evolve over 90 cute and quirky Critters to help you on your journey back home!','2025/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2663200/CritterGarden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9054,'touhou_makuka_sai_~_fantastic_danmaku_festival_part_ii',NULL,'Touhou Makuka Sai ~ Fantastic Danmaku Festival part II is a danmaku shooting game, which is the second part of Touhou Makuka Sai. The repeat of incident is coming again. Can the girls going to the netherworld solve the mystery?','2019/3/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1031480/TouHou_Makuka_Sai__Fantastic_Danmaku_Festival_Part_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9055,'bbq_simulator:_the_squad',NULL,'Dive into a hilarious sandbox BBQ experience with friends! Grill, serve, and manage mayhem as meats soar and sizzle. Craft your grill, cook steaks, and feed everyone before hunger strikes!','2022/5/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1755350/BBQ_Simulator_The_Squad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9056,'close_combat:_last_stand_arnhem',NULL,'Close Combat – Last Stand Arnhem is part of Close Combat series. Its design is based on the critically acclaimed Close Combat – A Bridge Too Far, originally developed by Atomic Games, as well as the more recent Close Combat: The Longest Day.','2011/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/936530/Close_Combat_Last_Stand_Arnhem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9057,'fernbus_simulator_-_vdl_futura_fdd2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fernbus Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1370010/Fernbus_Simulator__VDL_Futura_FDD2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9058,'fortune\'s_run',NULL,'Explore a decaying industrial world left behind in humanity\'s never-ending race to conquer the stars. Beneath its iron skies, desperate souls kill and steal for passage to the still-plentiful frontier worlds. Sink or swim in this high-octane first-person shooter with immersive sim elements.','2023/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1692240/Fortunes_Run/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9059,'children_of_morta:_paws_and_claws',NULL,'This content requires the base game Children of Morta on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1317160/Children_of_Morta_Paws_and_Claws/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9060,'chicken_invaders_4',NULL,'They came without warning, squawking menacingly, their ruffled feathers darkening the sun. Invading intergalactic chickens, out to punish humanity for our oppression of their earthly brethren. Now they\'re back, and they\'re having Earth for dinner!','2014/6/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/301300/Chicken_Invaders_4/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9061,'pathfinder:_wrath_of_the_righteous_-_the_lord_of_nothing',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pathfinder: Wrath of the Righteous - Enhanced Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2564570/Pathfinder_Wrath_of_the_Righteous__The_Lord_of_Nothing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9062,'killer_is_dead_-_nightmare_edition',NULL,'Get ready for some seriously stylish action from renowned designer SUDA51. In this exclusive version for PC, players will be slicing, dicing, and shooting as the suave executioner Mondo Zappa. Prepare for the thrill of love and kill in KILLER IS DEAD!','2014/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/261110/Killer_is_Dead__Nightmare_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9063,'fantasy_online_2',NULL,'Dive into Fantasy Online 2, a rich 2D pixel art MMORPG full of adventure. Master diverse skills, join a guild, explore pixelated zones, and engage in simple fun mmorpg combat. Hundreds of items are waiting for you to collect across 4 characters! Join the fun today!','2025/1/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2957110/Fantasy_Online_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9064,'waronoi',NULL,'Command modern military armies by zooming out and issuing orders to large formations, or zooming in to issue orders to individual squads and vehicles. Waronoi is the real-time strategy war game.','2020/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1444550/Waronoi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9065,'my_dream_setup_-_kitchen_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game My Dream Setup on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2926430/My_Dream_Setup__Kitchen_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9066,'raid:_world_war_ii',NULL,'RAID: World War II is an action-packed four player cooperative shooter set during a time when the Nazi war machine was still winning, and hope was in short supply.','2017/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/414740/RAID_World_War_II/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9067,'full_metal_furies',NULL,'From the creators of Rogue Legacy comes a \"true-cooperative\" action RPG. FULL METAL FURIES puts an emphasis on team play with a unique combat system where everyone is important. Play on the couch, alone or with friends, or make it an online party for up to four players!','2018/1/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/416600/Full_Metal_Furies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192');
INSERT INTO `table_games` VALUES (9068,'sniper_elite:_nazi_zombie_army',NULL,'** Please note: a remastered and improved edition of this game is now available in Zombie Army Trilogy.**Featuring a co-op campaign for 1 to 4 players, Nazi Zombie Army is a horrifying new stand-alone expansion of the award-winning Sniper Elite series.','2013/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/227100/Sniper_Elite_Nazi_Zombie_Army/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9069,'my_destiny_girls',NULL,'Xiao Bao opened his eyes, he was surrounded by six women. He embarked on an immersive journey of love with them. Amongst them were a gaming enthusiast, a sultry dancer, a childhood crush, a sexy doctor, an innocent schoolgirl, and a wealthy businesswoman. Who would be his true love?','2024/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2766860/MY_DESTINY_GIRLS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9070,'q.u.q.',NULL,'q.u.q. is a surreal visual novel about a somewhat crude girl that wanders a desert.','2023/2/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2302140/quq/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9071,'knights_and_bikes',NULL,'Saddle up for a bike-riding, frisbee-throwing, goose-petting, friendship-building, treasure-hunting, story-driven adventure for 1 or 2 players!','2019/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/592480/Knights_And_Bikes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9072,'sokobond_express',NULL,'Sokobond Express is a beautifully minimalist puzzle game that combines chemical bonds and puzzling pathfinding in novel ways.','2024/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1701330/Sokobond_Express/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_192'),(9073,'mineko\'s_night_market',NULL,'Mineko’s Night Market is a narrative-driven, social simulation adventure game that celebrates Japanese culture and invites players to craft whimsical items, eat delicious snacks, and ultimately enjoy all the cats.','2023/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/762940/Minekos_Night_Market/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9074,'grapple_dog',NULL,'Jump, Swing and Zip your way through colourful worlds and exciting challenges in this unique 2D action-platformer! Master the power of the Grapple on your adventure to save the world!','2022/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1345860/Grapple_Dog/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9075,'strikers_1945_iii',NULL,'Here\'s a challenge from 90\'s arcades! The ultimate Psikyo shooter! With online rankings.','2020/6/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1279400/STRIKERS_1945_III/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9076,'wolfquest:_classic',NULL,'LIVE THE LIFE OF A WILD WOLF! As a two-year-old gray wolf in Yellowstone National Park, hunt elk and moose, find a mate, and then establish a territory and raise your pups.','2015/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/431180/WolfQuest_Classic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9077,'knuckle_sandwich',NULL,'Knuckle Sandwich is a turn-based RPG by Andy Brophy. Get a job, beat up some monsters, and solve a mystery that\'s plaguing Bright City.','2023/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1012570/Knuckle_Sandwich/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9078,'mr._rabbit_magic_show_-_supporter_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Mr. Rabbit Magic Show on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3701380/Mr_Rabbit_Magic_Show__Supporter_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9079,'amairo_chocolate',NULL,'Autumn. With the leaves just starting to change color, a boy arrives at Yunagi Village. The first person he meets is a girl handing out flyers -- a cute, cat-eared waitress.','2020/3/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1238680/Amairo_Chocolate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9080,'dreamwild',NULL,'DREAMWILD is a fast paced, Arcade-Styled FPS set in a multitude of unique and bizarre psychedelic worlds! Slice through the endless horde with your accursed sword, discover the secrets that the DreamWilds have to offer, and get to the bottom of the dark plague spreading through all Mindspace!','2022/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2168450/DREAMWILD/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9081,'the_spirit_of_the_samurai',NULL,'A village in peril. A samurai reanimated. An Oni advancing. Fight an army of undead warriors and Japanese monsters as a human, a Kodama, and a cat in this 2D stop-motion action adventure.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1507120/The_Spirit_of_the_Samurai/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9082,'ohv',NULL,'Build your own buggy. Obtain, maintain and tune your OHV car. A game set in Poland in the 90s.','2024/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1783780/OHV/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9083,'ashen',NULL,'Ashen is an action RPG about a wanderer in search of a place to call home.','2019/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/649950/Ashen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9084,'bad_guys_at_school',NULL,'In Bad Guys at School you can play as students and revolt against school system by completing missions, or decide to become a teacher that must maintain order despite the violence and brutality in the school.','2020/6/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1218280/Bad_Guys_at_School/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9085,'lego®_the_hobbit™_-_the_big_little_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game LEGO® The Hobbit™ on Steam in order to play.','2014/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/292710/LEGO_The_Hobbit__The_Big_Little_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9086,'frogmonster',NULL,'Discover some of the most charming and challenging souslike bosses in Frogmonster, a Metroidvania FPS adventure where you explore a lively world filled with creatures, bugs, and beasts.','2024/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1853760/Frogmonster/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9087,'head_over_heels:_deluxe',NULL,'Join Head and Heels (pun intended) to defeat the Emperor in this award-winning vintage gem remake that plays (and looks!) better than ever before.','2025/3/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3153640/Head_Over_Heels_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9088,'the_sims™_4_bust_the_dust_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2021/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1458155/The_Sims_4_Bust_the_Dust_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9089,'tear_and_the_library_of_labyrinths',NULL,'The twin sisters Tear and Lumiere enjoy a happy life running their clinic. But when a demon abducts her sister, Tear must summon her courage to venture through worlds within magical tomes to bring her sister home safe.','2020/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1378040/Tear_and_the_Library_of_Labyrinths/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9090,'warhammer:_end_times_-_vermintide_karak_azgaraz',NULL,'This content requires the base game Warhammer: End Times - Vermintide on Steam in order to play.','2016/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/463791/Warhammer_End_Times__Vermintide_Karak_Azgaraz/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9091,'supernormal',NULL,'Inspired by Allison Road. SUPERNORMAL is a psychological horror game set in a seemingly ordinary apartment harboring dark secrets. Play as Detective Wyatt, tasked with unravelling the disappearance of Masato Sakamoto\'s daughter. Search for clues and unravel the sinister truth.','2024/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2532430/Supernormal/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9092,'super_indie_karts',NULL,'Super Indie Karts is a classic retro 16 to 64-bit style karting game, with Time Trials, Grand Prix, Splitscreen GP, Mission Mania, and Battle Mania! Featuring 48 racetracks, with many more coming soon. You don\'t have to wait until completion though as you can join the race now with Early Access!','2015/5/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/323670/Super_Indie_Karts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9093,'hand_of_fate',NULL,'Deckbuilding comes to life in Hand of Fate! An infinitely replayable series of quests - earn new cards, build your deck, then try to defeat it! In a cabin at the end of the world, the game of life and death is played. Draw your cards, play your hand, and discover your fate.','2015/2/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/266510/Hand_of_Fate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9094,'poetry_of_blood:_eclipse',NULL,'Blood Poem: Eclipse of the Moon is a 2D Rogue Lite hyper-speed action-adventure game. In the game, you play as the heroine code-named Ishtar, also known as \"Moon\" exploring a post-apocalyptic world. Your mission is to defeat beautiful bosses and bring them back to your lab.','2024/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2372330/Poetry_of_Blood_Eclipse/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9095,'garten_of_banban_3',NULL,'Embrace the horrors of Banban’s Kindergarten. Delve even deeper into the depths of the establishment that was left suspiciously empty. Try to survive the unexpected residents and continue the search for your child…','2023/5/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2311190/Garten_of_Banban_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9096,'world_of_warships_—_texas_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game World of Warships on Steam in order to play.','2018/5/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/845000/World_of_Warships__Texas_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9097,'nancy_drew®:_the_secret_of_shadow_ranch',NULL,'Take a Wild Ride into Terror and Trickery to Rein in a Ghostly Secret!','2004/6/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/572740/Nancy_Drew_The_Secret_of_Shadow_Ranch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9098,'dcs:_c-101_aviojet',NULL,'This content requires the base game DCS World Steam Edition on Steam in order to play.','2019/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/316966/DCS_C101_Aviojet/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9099,'might_&_magic:_heroes_vi',NULL,'Heroes VI is a fast-paced epic story where Angels plot to end -- once and for all -- an unfinished war with their ancient rivals, the Faceless.','2011/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/48220/Might__Magic_Heroes_VI/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9100,'waifu_app:_90_days_to_escape_a_lonely_fate',NULL,'Hiyori lives a very quiet and lonely life, but she decides enough is enough... She wants to change! And everything indeed changes when a spirit visits her and installs a strange app on her phone! The clock\'s ticking now... There are 90 days left!','2025/4/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3329420/Waifu_App_90_Days_to_Escape_a_Lonely_Fate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9101,'train_simulator:_southeastern_class_465_emu_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2013/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/222576/Train_Simulator_Southeastern_Class_465_EMU_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9102,'hentai_vs_furries',NULL,'Hentai VS Furries offers colorful gunshots. Skins, special angles for your enjoyment. And a \"Pleasure\" mode without a fight if you want to enjoy calm.','2020/1/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1208260/Hentai_Vs_Furries/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9103,'roots_of_yggdrasil',NULL,'Build settlements, explore the Nine Realms, collect artifacts and upgrade your deck to reach the top of Yggdrasil in this post-Ragnarok roguelike city-builder! Can you survive the end of the world?','2024/9/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2071430/Roots_of_Yggdrasil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9104,'hero_siege_-_gates_of_valhalla_collector\'s_edition_(expansion_set)',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hero Siege on Steam in order to play.','2022/6/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1574601/Hero_Siege__Gates_of_Valhalla_Collectors_Edition_Expansion_Set/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9105,'tin_hearts',NULL,'Behind every brilliant invention, hides a magical story. Guide a troop of tin soldiers through a magical toy-filled world, in this immersive narrative puzzle adventure game from members of the team that brought you Fable.','2023/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1831700/Tin_Hearts/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9106,'indiana_jones®_and_the_infernal_machine™',NULL,'The year is 1947. The Nazis have been crushed, the Cold War has begun and Soviet agents are sniffing around the ruins of the fabled Tower of Babel. What are they up to? The CIA recruits renowned archeologist and adventurer, Dr. Henry \"Indiana\" Jones, to find out.','1999/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/904540/Indiana_Jones_and_the_Infernal_Machine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9107,'satellite_reign',NULL,'Satellite Reign is a real-time, class-based strategy game, set in an open-world cyberpunk city. You command a group of 4 agents through rain-soaked, neon-lit streets, where the law is the will of mega-corporations.','2015/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/268870/Satellite_Reign/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9108,'snowrunner_-_western_star_wolf_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SnowRunner on Steam in order to play.','2022/9/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2058881/SnowRunner__Western_Star_Wolf_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9109,'strategic_command:_world_war_i_-_empires_in_turmoil',NULL,'This content requires the base game Strategic Command: World War I on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2526110/Strategic_Command_World_War_I__Empires_in_Turmoil/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9110,'rakuen',NULL,'A hospitalized Boy comes to terms with his own story by traveling with his Mom to a beautiful fantasy world; ultimately helping his fellow patients find closure by walking a mile in their shoes.','2017/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/559210/Rakuen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9111,'nancy_drew®:_the_haunting_of_castle_malloy',NULL,'Unveil a Ghostly Legend and Find a Vanished Groom!','2009/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/31910/Nancy_Drew_The_Haunting_of_Castle_Malloy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9112,'fishing_planet:_advanced_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2019/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/730616/Fishing_Planet_Advanced_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9113,'children_of_a_dead_earth',NULL,'The most scientifically accurate space warfare simulator ever made. Now with Steam Workshop!','2016/9/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/476530/Children_of_a_Dead_Earth/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9114,'my_dream_setup_-_bathroom_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game My Dream Setup on Steam in order to play.','2024/4/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2926420/My_Dream_Setup__Bathroom_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9115,'factory_outlet_simulator',NULL,'Factory Outlet Simulator is a very comprehensive product manufacturing and selling game. You can produce the products of world famous brands in your factory and sell them. Or you can expand your business and create your own brand. Use your business acumen to lead the market from zero to the top!','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2981590/Factory_Outlet_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9116,'keeper\'s_toll',NULL,'Delve into Keeper’s Toll, an action-packed roguelite brimming with challenge and despair. Survive against an onslaught of relentless hordes and grueling bosses with skill-based ARPG gameplay. Embrace the darkness and cleanse these cursed lands.','2024/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2002220/Keepers_Toll/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9117,'tastemaker',NULL,'TasteMaker is a restaurant tycoon game. Design your own restaurant from the ground up, decorate, create a menu, hire and manage staff, and much more. Keep your customers happy and make a profit to keep the restaurant of your dreams from turning into a nightmare.','2023/4/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1289340/TasteMaker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9118,'the_takeover',NULL,'The Takeover is a side-scrolling beat\'em up inspired by 90\'s classics such as Streets of Rage and Final Fight. Battle solo or alongside a friend in local co-op while listening to awesome tunes from Little V Mills, Richie Branson, James Ronald and industry legend Yuzo Koshiro!','2019/11/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/418620/The_TakeOver/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9119,'scum_charms_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SCUM on Steam in order to play.','2023/8/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2517160/SCUM_Charms_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9120,'zed_zone',NULL,'A great catastrophe has come, and you, who are on duty, crash and trapped in a Zed Zone. There are zombies and monsters everywhere, In order to escape, by collecting materials, upgrading skills, building shelters, defeating zombie waves and mysterious mechs, chasing a glimmer of hope.','2023/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1211600/ZED_ZONE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_193'),(9121,'dreadout_2',NULL,'A third-person horror adventure that draws inspiration from Indonesian urban legend. Play as Linda, a high school student with the ability to sense and see ghosts. This spine-chilling sequel expands on the cult hit original, making DreadOut 2 another terrifying addition to the horror genre.','2020/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/945710/DreadOut_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9122,'splintered',NULL,'A unique RPG where the villain randomizes the world with each defeat. Start with a classic RPG experience, then delve into shifting worlds where the overworld, items, and enemies shuffle, creating new challenges. Conquer these worlds to unravel the story and make your way to the final showdown!','2025/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3127000/Splintered/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9123,'dear_mirror_flower',NULL,'I am here, in this world... A Japanese-style fantasy adventure by Kogado Studio. In this town, strange incidents never cease. Join Satoree Mizuki, a girl who can read others’ minds, and uncover the truth behind these supernatural cases.','2025/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3543570/Dear_Mirror_Flower/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9124,'red_solstice_2:_survivors_-_season_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Red Solstice 2: Survivors on Steam in order to play.','2021/11/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1751750/Red_Solstice_2_Survivors__Season_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9125,'fight\'n_rage',NULL,'Fight’N Rage is a brand new old-school side-scroller beat’em up. Inspired by the classics from the “golden age”, and with an art style that mimics the aesthetic from the 90\'s arcade gems, this game pays homage to all classic gameplay features that makes this genre one of the best from its time!','2017/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/674520/FightN_Rage/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9126,'yiik:_a_postmodern_rpg',NULL,'Experience YIIK: A Postmodern RPG 1.5 (I.V) update with revamped battles and cutscenes. A child relinquishes her name for a birthday invite, hoping to find her brother. Alex\'s reality unravels, guided by a mysterious cat, witnessing a woman vanish, igniting an obsession that threatens his world.','2019/1/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/459080/YIIK_A_Postmodern_RPG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9127,'the_exit_8_vr',NULL,'The popular indie game “The Exit 8” is reborn and brought to virtual life as “The Exit 8 VR”! Experience the eerie and thrilling atmosphere of Japan\'s underground passageways, now with new anomalies!','2024/9/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3193770/The_Exit_8_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9128,'pathologic_2:_marble_nest',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pathologic 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1141960/Pathologic_2_Marble_Nest/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9129,'bionic_commando',NULL,'The first true sequel to the classic 1988 Nintendo Entertainment System original, Bionic Commando sees the return of the bionically-enhanced Nathan \"R.A.D.\" Spencer. Time has not been kind to Spencer: Five years after his heroic defeat of the Imperials, he has been betrayed by the government he swore to serve, imprisoned for...','2009/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/21670/Bionic_Commando/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9130,'final_knight',NULL,'Build a D&D-style party and switch between tank, DPS, and healer roles in real time. Combine class, mastery, and gear to unleash massive damage and repel invading giant monsters.','2025/1/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2072980/Final_Knight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9131,'akai_katana_shin',NULL,'Be guided anew into an epic tale set in the Taisho era with three titles from Cave\'s Akai Katana series that has captured the hearts of passionate shoot \'em up fans. New features include an online leaderboard and new musical arrangements.','2022/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2076220/Akai_Katana_Shin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9132,'evil_genius',NULL,'Everybody wants to rule the world! Achieve global power with EVIL GENIUS, the one and only complete world domination simulator. All the everyday tasks of the deliciously wicked mastermind are available to experience and master from building your ultra-secret base to developing spectacular super-weapons to carry out your nefarious master...','2004/9/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3720/Evil_Genius/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9133,'bejeweled_twist',NULL,'Get set for a vivid sensory rush as you spin and match explosive gems for shockwaves of fun. Rotate jewels freely to set up electrifying combos, outwit surprising obstacles like Locks and Bombs, and create high-voltage Flame and Lightning gems.','2008/11/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3560/Bejeweled_Twist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9134,'demon\'s_mirror',NULL,'Step into the Demon’s Mirror and enter a fantastical, nightmarish world in this roguelike deckbuilder! Strategy meets the arcane in a unique fusion of deck-building and chain-3 mechanics. Can you face your demons and come out unscathed?','2024/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1600910/Demons_Mirror/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9135,'mystery_case_files:_ravenhearst®',NULL,'Rumors surrounding the history of stately Ravenhearst Manor have circulated for decades. The recently acquired diary of Emma Ravenhearst may hold the key to unraveling the tale behind this unsettling place, yet the pages are missing.','2006/12/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/50990/Mystery_Case_Files_Ravenhearst/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9136,'vibrant_venture',NULL,'Vibrant Venture is a singleplayer 2D adventure platformer game featuring a quirky cast of characters! The game features four playable characters with multiple unique abilities that can be combined for extremely versatile, fluid and fun movement!','2020/7/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1264520/Vibrant_Venture/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9137,'a_plague_tale:_requiem_-_protector_pack_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game A Plague Tale: Requiem on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1906530/A_Plague_Tale_Requiem__Protector_Pack_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9138,'cafe_master_story',NULL,'Serve up food, drinks, and smiles in this retro cafe management sim!','2023/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2427100/Cafe_Master_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9139,'twilight_wars',NULL,'Twilight Wars is a tactical dungeon crawler set in a neon-drenched cyberpunk future. Corporations rule the world. Rebuild a shattered spy agency, assemble a team of elite operatives, and wage a covert war to reclaim the world from the shadows.','2025/5/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1396540/Twilight_Wars/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9140,'swords_and_sandals_immortals',NULL,'Gladiator! Grab your sword, equip your sandals and take on the world in multiplayer Swords and Sandals! Brutal turn-based combat where gladiators can lose limbs, wield guitars and yell so loudly enemy heads will fall off. This is the most fun you\'ll ever have in the arena!','2023/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1707650/Swords_and_Sandals_Immortals/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9141,'nordic_ashes_dark_knights',NULL,'This content requires the base game Nordic Ashes: Survivors of Ragnarok on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3312220/Nordic_Ashes_Dark_Knights/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9142,'wrc_5_fia_world_rally_championship',NULL,'Find all the cars, all the drivers and all the official rallies of the 2015 FIA World Rally Championship in THE racing simulation standard. Realistic driving on different road surfaces, dynamic damage, day/night system, weather… Experience all the sensations of rally racing in WRC 5!','2015/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/354160/WRC_5_FIA_World_Rally_Championship/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9143,'the_guild_ii_renaissance',NULL,'For centuries Europe has been dominated by the church and nobility. On the shoulders of ordinary people the servants of god and the noble families justified their power and wealth. This was the incontrovertible, divine world order. A truly dark era… In the 14th Century the world order is beginning to transform itself.','2010/7/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/39680/The_Guild_II_Renaissance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9144,'resist',NULL,'A dystopian future. An authoritarian regime. A tale of violence, intrigue, and hope. Swing from towering skyscrapers and battle deadly enemies as you fight to free your city from the evil that consumes it. With a kinetic swinging system, intense gunplay, and an immersive story campaign.','2022/12/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1914750/Resist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9145,'heartbound',NULL,'Heartbound is a non-traditional role-playing game about a boy, his dog, secrets, and sanity.','2018/12/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/567380/Heartbound/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9146,'railway_empire_-_germany',NULL,'This content requires the base game Railway Empire on Steam in order to play.','2019/3/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/884143/Railway_Empire__Germany/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9147,'focus_on_you',NULL,'The love at first sight, came like a sunny summer day. Meet YUA and make your own sparkling moments.','2019/7/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1032670/FOCUS_on_YOU/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9148,'hero_siege_-_stormweaver',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hero Siege on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2799870/Hero_Siege__Stormweaver/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9149,'call_of_the_wild:_the_angler™_-_ultra_cruiser_boat_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Call of the Wild: The Angler™ on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2659060/Call_of_the_Wild_The_Angler__Ultra_Cruiser_Boat_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9150,'radio_commander',NULL,'Use the radio to give commands to the soldiers on the battlefield. Keep track of the situation based on their voice reports only. Lead US platoons to clash with Vietcong in a realistic, innovative approach to the RTS genre. Make hard choices in a narrative driven experience, and face the outcome.','2019/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/871530/Radio_Commander/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9151,'let\'s_play!_oink_games',NULL,'Selling over 1,000,000 copies worldwide, the continually growing game maker, Oink Games, has brought their works to Steam! Play 7 popular board games in a variety of situations. With family, with friends, or even by yourself.','2022/7/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1933490/Lets_Play_Oink_Games/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9152,'corpus_edax',NULL,'An immersive first-person-melee RPG where you create your character and fight, talk or sneak your way out of confrontation. From concrete buildings to futuristic environments - start from the bottom and make your way through narrative missions to the top of the city in a bid for control.','2024/9/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2017610/CORPUS_EDAX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9153,'star_soraight_fantasy:_magic_to_reach_the_sky',NULL,'Tokino Sora zaps into another world mid-live! Join her Hololive friends in a thrilling Metroidvania-style action-adventure, blending 2D and 3D. Explore a mysterious realm, recover scattered items, and guide Sora’s epic tale to a dazzling finale!','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3668950/Star_Soraight_Fantasy_Magic_to_reach_the_sky/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9154,'for_honor™_-_pirate_hero',NULL,'This content requires the base game FOR HONOR™ on Steam in order to play.','2022/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1837260/FOR_HONOR__Pirate_Hero/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9155,'frogun_encore',NULL,'Frogun ENCORE is a dashing standalone expansion/sequel to indie hit FROGUN! Join now older Renata and Jake in a trek around the whole world to prevent the return of Beelzebub. ENCORE builds on FROGUN\'s retro PS1/N64 formula. Plus, enjoy the whole adventure in true couch co-op.','2024/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2312160/Frogun_Encore/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9156,'puzzlequest:_challenge_of_the_warlords',NULL,'PuzzleQuest: Challenge of the Warlords delivers, for the first time ever, classic puzzle-game action backed with an epic story of good vs. evil. Challenge your match 3 skills as you battle against computer opponents to save the Kingdom of Etheria from the evil Lord Bane.','2007/10/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/12500/PuzzleQuest_Challenge_of_the_Warlords/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9157,'casino_roulette:_roulettist',NULL,'Test your luck! Play casino roulette with stunning, realistic 3D graphics! Feel the risk as you dive into the casino atmosphere and hit the big time!','2025/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3601420/Casino_Roulette_Roulettist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9158,'touhou_hero_of_ice_fairy_dlc1_-_rose_idol',NULL,'This content requires the base game Touhou Hero of Ice Fairy on Steam in order to play.','2025/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3213970/Touhou_Hero_of_Ice_Fairy_DLC1__Rose_Idol/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9159,'gwent:_rogue_mage_(single-player_expansion)',NULL,'GWENT: Rogue Mage is a first single-player expansion to GWENT: The Witcher Card Game. It combines elements of roguelike, deckbuilding, and strategy games with GWENT card battles.','2022/7/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1711950/GWENT_Rogue_Mage_SinglePlayer_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9160,'hitman_go:_definitive_edition',NULL,'Hitman GO is a simple to play, but difficult to master turn-based strategy game set in a stunning interpretation of the Hitman universe.','2016/2/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/427820/Hitman_GO_Definitive_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9161,'for_honor™_-_warmonger_hero',NULL,'This content requires the base game FOR HONOR™ on Steam in order to play.','2020/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1366900/FOR_HONOR__Warmonger_Hero/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9162,'capitalism_2',NULL,'Create and control the business empire of your dreams. This in-depth strategy game covers almost every aspect of business that could be encountered in the real world.','2001/12/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/638200/Capitalism_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9163,'one_btn_bosses',NULL,'It\'s One Button Bosses, it\'s all in the name. You have one button. There are big bosses to beat. Push, tap, and bash in the handcrafted campaign or in the roguelike rifts.','2024/8/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1910600/ONE_BTN_BOSSES/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9164,'ride_2',NULL,'The fastest and most iconic bikes in the world\'s biggest digital garage!','2016/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/477770/Ride_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9165,'resident_evil_2_-_leon_costume:_arklay_sheriff',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil 2 on Steam in order to play.','2019/1/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/920560/Resident_Evil_2__Leon_Costume_Arklay_Sheriff/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_194'),(9166,'poems_&_codes',NULL,'Explore the wonderful world of poetry through deceptively simple cryptograms. 10% of every purchase benefits Project Gutenberg, an online library of over 60,000 free ebooks.','2023/10/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2295070/Poems__Codes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9167,'idling_gears',NULL,'Click! Place gears, click! Make money, click! Place more gears, click! Make even more money, click, click and above all click!','2023/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2285820/Idling_Gears/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9168,'hokko_life',NULL,'Hop off the train and into your new life in the village of Hokko! Take over the old workshop and get creative; use crafted materials and design everything in town! With complete creative freedom, what type of town will you build?','2022/9/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/824000/Hokko_Life/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9169,'otome_*_domain',NULL,'An inconveniently orphaned young man must attend an all-girls school just to survive in this comedy visual novel. His housemates took him in when he was in trouble, but now he doesn\'t know who\'s taking care of who...!','2022/12/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2153330/Otome__Domain/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9170,'monster_roadtrip_hitchhiker_pack_-_vicky_&_brian',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Prom 3: Monster Roadtrip on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2337900/Monster_Roadtrip_Hitchhiker_Pack__Vicky__Brian/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9171,'blossom_tales:_the_sleeping_king',NULL,'Explore a huge open game world in classic action-adventure fashion! Prove your worth by fighting through monster-infested dungeons to save the Kingdom of Blossom!','2017/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/446810/Blossom_Tales_The_Sleeping_King/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9172,'will_you_snail?',NULL,'A unique platformer where an evil AI predicts your movement. Dodge AI-spawned traps, solve optional puzzles and uncover the dark secrets of the simulation. Now with a level editor and infinite community-made content!','2022/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1115050/Will_You_Snail/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9173,'nine_parchments',NULL,'Nine Parchments is a co-operative blast\'em up game of magic mayhem from Frozenbyte, creators of the Trine series!','2017/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/471550/Nine_Parchments/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9174,'payday_2:_high_octane_tailor_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2022/7/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2074220/PAYDAY_2_High_Octane_Tailor_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9175,'train_simulator:_gwr_small_prairies_loco_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2014/12/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/277753/Train_Simulator_GWR_Small_Prairies_Loco_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9176,'dreams_of_aether',NULL,'A collection of dozens of Aether-flavored microgames! Dive into the Dreams of Aether, where everyone is trapped in a never-ending nightmare! Meet some of the strangest characters Aether has to offer!','2025/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3463050/Dreams_of_Aether/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9177,'bejeweled_deluxe',NULL,'In the game, you must swap two adjacent gems to line up three or more of the same jewel type horizontally or vertically to eliminate them. Keep playing until there are no moves left or you\'ve conquered the board. Bejeweled\'s gameplay can be fun for both kids and adults.','2006/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3350/Bejeweled_Deluxe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9178,'anemoiapolis:_chapter_1',NULL,'The most relaxing horror game you\'ll ever play. Anemoiapolis exists in the uncanny valley of American architecture -- endless carpeted floors and lonely malls. Escape for your life, and enjoy the scenery.','2023/3/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1522960/Anemoiapolis_Chapter_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9179,'mystery_case_files®:_13th_skull™_collector\'s_edition',NULL,'Uncover the secrets of the 13th Skull!','2016/8/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/514700/Mystery_Case_Files_13th_Skull_Collectors_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9180,'magic_research',NULL,'Magic Research is a text-based incremental game about Magic. You are the headmaster of a newly-created institution of Magic. Will you be able to lead your school to win the prestigious Tournament of Magic?','2023/3/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2311680/Magic_Research/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9181,'dice_people',NULL,'Dice People is an incremental game about rolling dice, creating a mass of units, smashing enemies, and gathering resources to get upgrades in a big skilltree.','2025/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3373670/Dice_People/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9182,'nancy_drew®:_alibi_in_ashes',NULL,'Escape the Smoky Intrigue of a Hometown Inferno!','2011/11/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/202670/Nancy_Drew_Alibi_in_Ashes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9183,'close_combat:_cross_of_iron',NULL,'In Close Combat: Cross of Iron you start off as a junior officer leading your men into battle in real-time, focusing on the Eastern Front of World War II. Earn promotions as you deal with an unforgiving enemy. Fight and survive through the frozen winter, hot dusty summer and muddy autumn.','2011/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1367320/Close_Combat_Cross_of_Iron/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9184,'pc_building_simulator_-_republic_of_gamers_workshop',NULL,'This content requires the base game PC Building Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2019/8/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1067590/PC_Building_Simulator__Republic_of_Gamers_Workshop/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9185,'resident_evil_3_-_classic_costume_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Resident Evil 3 on Steam in order to play.','2020/5/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1158730/RESIDENT_EVIL_3__Classic_Costume_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9186,'tennis_elbow_manager_2',NULL,'Become a tennis coach and manage up to 9 players: take care of training sessions, planning, sponsors, team members, and take control of them on the tennis court if you wish so! Will you be able to lead your players to the top of the world hierarchy?','2021/6/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/760630/Tennis_Elbow_Manager_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9187,'just_cause™_4:_adversary_vehicle_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Just Cause 4 Reloaded on Steam in order to play.','2019/8/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1087122/Just_Cause_4_Adversary_Vehicle_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9188,'the_eden_of_grisaia',NULL,'The final chapter in the Grisaia series, featuring The Seed of Blanc Aile, the overarching story\'s grand conclusion and Prologue De La Grisaia, a prologue set before Yuuji\'s arrival at Mihama.','2017/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/345630/The_Eden_of_Grisaia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9189,'flowstone_saga',NULL,'Master a totally unique puzzle-battle system in this 16-bit, JRPG-inspired adventure featuring an epic story, charming characters, stunning pixel art, and epic music. Follow a grand story set in the mysterious Ocean\'s End islands full of lost memories, ancient ruins, pirates, treasures, and frogs.','2024/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1372000/Flowstone_Saga/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9190,'geneforge_1_-_mutagen',NULL,'Unique, truly open-ended fantasy adventure in a strange, new world. Use battle or cunning to change the world, served by your own army of custom-made mutant monsters. Over 80 zones to explore and 50+ hours of gameplay. Multitudes of skills, abilities, factions, treasures, and servants to create.','2021/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1424710/Geneforge_1__Mutagen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9191,'desta:_the_memories_between',NULL,'Fall into a beautiful and puzzling dreamworld. Find your friends, unlock spectacular abilities and overcome the odds in a surreal tactical dodgeball adventure to uncover the mysteries of a broken world from the creators of Monument Valley.','2023/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2009650/Desta_The_Memories_Between/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9192,'bee_simulator',NULL,'Live the big adventure of a small bee! Explore a world brimming with life in which you collect pollen, defy dangerous wasps and save your hive! Play with others in three game modes, including four players co-op and PvP on split screen.','2020/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/914750/Bee_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9193,'duelists_of_eden',NULL,'Build a deck and battle online in real-time action with rollback netcode!','2024/3/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1664200/Duelists_of_Eden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9194,'mining_mechs',NULL,'Unleash your inner miner as you commandeer a high-tech Mining Mech! Mine for valuable resources and upgrade your mech for even bigger hauls as you explore the underground. Fun to play alone or with up to 7 friends in online co-op multiplayer!','2023/10/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1603180/Mining_Mechs/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9195,'jimmy_and_the_pulsating_mass',NULL,'One day, Jimmy looked inside.','2018/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/706560/Jimmy_and_the_Pulsating_Mass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9196,'tony_stewart\'s_all-american_racing',NULL,'In Tony Stewart’s All-American Racing, it’s always a Saturday night at the local short track! With three different styles of racing to choose from and a variety of tracks, it’s sure to be a good time for all!','2020/9/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1367690/Tony_Stewarts_AllAmerican_Racing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9197,'lone_fungus',NULL,'A handcrafted open-world platformer set in a world built by Mushrooms! Explore different locations filled with secrets, acquire new abilities and use those abilities to reach new places!','2023/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1674780/Lone_Fungus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9198,'the_fabulous_fear_machine',NULL,'The Fabulous Fear Machine is a narrative-driven strategy game with a pulp horror style. As the Machine\'s new Master, you must sow fear and expand your influence by creating Legends, harvesting resources, manipulating events, and spying on your enemies.','2023/10/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1540350/The_Fabulous_Fear_Machine/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9199,'in_woods',NULL,'In Woods is a roguelike survival game set in a forest. Fight different monsters, craft items, and defeat the final boss for victory.','2024/8/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2113770/In_Woods/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9200,'age_of_wonders_iii_-_golden_realms_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Age of Wonders III on Steam in order to play.','2014/9/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/299230/Age_of_Wonders_III__Golden_Realms_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9201,'titan_revenge',NULL,'Set in the vast expanse of Norse mythology, this MMORPG thrusts you into a world on the brink of apocalypse. As an intrepid hero, you must navigate the realms of the Aesir and Vanir, battling fearsome giants, mythical beasts, and treacherous gods.','2023/12/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2697890/Titan_Revenge/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9202,'centum',NULL,'Every why has a wherefore. You are trapped, and you must escape. But is that really the goal? Centum is an unreliable narrative-driven adventure where everything may be a lie.','2025/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2625550/Centum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9203,'slime_heroes',NULL,'Play as the last slime tasked with saving their home in this cute 3D action-adventure slimes-like! Customize your slime, play alone or with a friend, collect weapons and gear, battle challenging enemies and bosses, gain skills, and combine them to create your own abilities to suit your playstyle!','2025/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1511880/Slime_Heroes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9204,'prehistoric_kingdom:_digital_artbook,_vol._1',NULL,'This content requires the base game Prehistoric Kingdom on Steam in order to play.','2024/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2562770/Prehistoric_Kingdom_Digital_Artbook_Vol_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9205,'hunting_simulator_2',NULL,'With your hunting dog by your side, explore the Texan desert and forests of Colorado and Europe as you track down 33 animal species. Choose your gear from over 160 official weapons, accessories and clothing items (including Browning, Winchester and Bushnell).','2020/7/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1135910/Hunting_Simulator_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9206,'lords_of_infinity',NULL,'Lead an ancient and crumbling noble house in a rich gunpowder fantasy setting. Lie, bribe, and conspire to secure power and prestige – or to save a doomed kingdom from itself.','2023/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2169120/Lords_of_Infinity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9207,'potato_flowers_in_full_bloom',NULL,'Explore an underground labyrinth in search of mythical seeds in this 3D dungeon crawler RPG! Leaving things to chance will prove fatal🌱Explore underground labyrinths, expanding your range of actions as you go🌿Light up the path, defeat those in front of you, grow stronger, and unravel the mysteries','2022/3/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1601280/Potato_Flowers_in_Full_Bloom/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9208,'junkyard_truck',NULL,'Junkyard Truck is an open-world off road driving and mechanic simulator. Build, upgrade, and maintain your old off road truck. Make money using your skills in driving, scavenging, gambling, or moonshine brewing. Try to build a truck capable of taking on the difficult challenges around the map.','2022/7/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1697880/Junkyard_Truck/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9209,'dead_trash',NULL,'Years into a brutal lockdown, a once-thriving city lies in ruins, abandoned by its government and overrun by vicious, mindless infected. Grab your hammer, collect your nerves and enter the mayhem.','2025/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3316470/DEAD_TRASH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9210,'pinball_fx3_-_williams™_pinball:_volume_1',NULL,'This content requires the base game Pinball FX3 on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/947000/Pinball_FX3__Williams_Pinball_Volume_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9211,'lego®_the_hobbit™_-_side_quest_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game LEGO® The Hobbit™ on Steam in order to play.','2014/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/292711/LEGO_The_Hobbit__Side_Quest_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9212,'ai_learns_to_drive',NULL,'Train AI to drive! Create your own neural network and watch it evolve from chaos to mastery with the power of evolutionary algorithms and natural selection. Fine-tune the learning process to craft the ultimate AI driver, and test your creation in campaign challenges or on custom-built tracks.','2025/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3312030/AI_Learns_To_Drive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9213,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_the_wolf_at_the_door',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2021/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1586080/Hunt_Showdown_1896__The_Wolf_at_the_Door/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_195'),(9214,'m.a.r.s.',NULL,'MARS is a Free-To-Play Third Person Shooter set in an evolving sci-fi world. From the hilarious Headhunter mode, to Huge Mecha vs Mecha battles, to fully customizable loadouts; whether Co-op or PvP, M.A.R.S. has something for everyone. Kill, Die, Repeat.','2021/10/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/314430/MARS/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9215,'wendigo_blue',NULL,'Action-packed 2D beat-em-up with intense boss battles and a large variety of customizable equipment and skills. Up to 4 players with local co-op.','2025/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3359390/Wendigo_Blue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9216,'anthology_of_the_killer',NULL,'The complete surrealist horror-comedy series! A mysterious world of zines and blood!!','2024/10/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3212530/Anthology_Of_The_Killer/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9217,'orcs_must_die!_3_-_tipping_the_scales_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Orcs Must Die! 3 on Steam in order to play.','2022/4/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1936590/Orcs_Must_Die_3__Tipping_the_Scales_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9218,'project_highrise:_las_vegas',NULL,'This content requires the base game Project Highrise on Steam in order to play.','2017/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/582540/Project_Highrise_Las_Vegas/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9219,'shadow_empire:_oceania',NULL,'This content requires the base game Shadow Empire on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2183640/Shadow_Empire_Oceania/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9220,'down_in_bermuda',NULL,'An unnatural storm leaves an adventurous aviator stranded for decades within the infamous Bermuda. Overcome creatures of the deep and unravel the islands secrets in search of a way back home.','2021/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1107300/Down_in_Bermuda/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9221,'dodgeball_academia',NULL,'Dodgeball Academia is a sports RPG game featuring rookie dodgeball student, Otto. Join Otto and an eclectic cast of characters as they train to dominate on and off the courts of the academia.','2021/8/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1422420/Dodgeball_Academia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9222,'agents_of_mayhem',NULL,'In Agents of MAYHEM, you run a no-holds barred operation against a shadowy super-villain organization known only as LEGION and their mysterious leader, the Morningstar. Explore the city of Seoul as a variety of Super Agents to thwart LEGION\'s vile plans to take over the world!','2017/8/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/304530/Agents_of_Mayhem/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9223,'nameless_~the_one_thing_you_must_recall~',NULL,'Nameless ~The one thing you must recall~ is a visual novel game designed for female audiences. It was distributed by the publisher, Cheritz, in English, Korean, and Japanese on Nov. 11th, 2013 and now it is available on Steam.','2013/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/337930/Nameless_The_one_thing_you_must_recall/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9224,'blood_rush',NULL,'BLOOD RUSH is a fast paced, skill based FPS, mixed with roguelites elements. Upgrade yourself, buy unique guns, drain miracles from relics and destroy anyone or anything standing on your way!','2025/6/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2435870/Blood_Rush/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9225,'floor_plan_2',NULL,'Explore a tower of hilarious escape rooms and solve mind-bending puzzles in this absurd elevator adventure for virtual reality. Step out onto each floor, meet bizarre characters, unravel their secrets, and figure out how everything is connected to find the lost artifacts your boss is looking for.','2021/4/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1534850/Floor_Plan_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9226,'car_detailing_simulator',NULL,'Car Detailing Simulator, you get a chance to renew any car and restore its splendor at the request of demanding customers! A nice and well-groomed vehicle can be the pride of every human being! Clean, polish and marvel at your creations in this highly realistic game where every little detail counts!','2022/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1433570/Car_Detailing_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9227,'holoparade',NULL,'Collect your favorite characters, nurture them, and have fun just watching in this hololive fan game! It\'s a 2D tower defense game that offers depth for dedicated players, strategic elements, and easy enjoyment for casual players.','2023/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2647230/HoloParade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9228,'cities:_skylines_-_content_creator_pack:_art_deco',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2016/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/515190/Cities_Skylines__Content_Creator_Pack_Art_Deco/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9229,'ultimate_general:_gettysburg',NULL,'A Tactical Battle Simulator that allows you to command thousands of soldiers as a Union or Confederate General. The game features the most accurately created map, a non-linear battle campaign, complex morale, innovative control mechanics and smart AI.','2014/10/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/306660/Ultimate_General_Gettysburg/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9230,'cube_world',NULL,'Cube World is a voxel-based action RPG with a focus on exploration. It takes place in a procedurally generated fantasy world made up entirely of cubes.','2019/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1128000/Cube_World/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9231,'for_honor™_-_kyoshin_hero',NULL,'This content requires the base game FOR HONOR™ on Steam in order to play.','2021/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1641940/FOR_HONOR__Kyoshin_Hero/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9232,'skelethrone:_the_chronicles_of_ericona',NULL,'Skelethrone is a challenging 2D action platformer with RPG elements inspired by games like Castlevania and Dark Souls.','2024/8/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2139840/Skelethrone_The_Chronicles_of_Ericona/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9233,'atc4:_airport_osaka_[rjoo]',NULL,'This content requires the base game I am an Air Traffic Controller 4 on Steam in order to play.','2023/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2314640/ATC4_Airport_OSAKA_RJOO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9234,'lego®_the_hobbit™_-_the_battle_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game LEGO® The Hobbit™ on Steam in order to play.','2014/9/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/292712/LEGO_The_Hobbit__The_Battle_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9235,'championship_manager_2007',NULL,'The greatest football management sim returns... Think you can do better? It\'s your decisions that count: your budget, your buys, your formation, your tactics...your chance to prove it! Use your skills and knowledge to manage your club the way you feel it should be - now it\'s your turn.','2006/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/8040/Championship_Manager_2007/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9236,'element_td_2_-_mazing_expansion',NULL,'This content requires the base game Element TD 2 - Tower Defense on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2177070/Element_TD_2__Mazing_Expansion/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9237,'wagon',NULL,'WAGON is a 1-bit card game where you make tough decisions to try and survive winter on the Oregon Trail.','2025/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2458920/WAGON/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9238,'カルトに厳しいギャル-cult_vs_gal-',NULL,'Make mincemeat out of cults and chop heads with machetes! Old school shooter staples and gals, and a familiar difficulty level. Ye shall witness a new struggle!','2024/5/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2788360/CULT_VS_GAL/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9239,'rpg_maker_2003',NULL,'For the first time ever, RPG Maker 2003 is officially available in English! This legendary game development engine is both highly affordable and easy to use, and it remains one of the most popular RPG Maker installments to date.','2015/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/362870/RPG_Maker_2003/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9240,'payday_2:_h3h3_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2017/11/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/758420/PAYDAY_2_h3h3_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9241,'casecracker2',NULL,'Jia huasheng ,the policeman of Chicheng police station, got disappeared without any trace after leaving a letter which illustrates the police station to start the CaseCracker system version 2.0.','2024/5/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2294450/CaseCracker2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9242,'rimworld_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for RimWorld, but does not include the base game.','2019/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/990430/RimWorld_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9243,'pedro\'s_adventures_in_spanish_[learn_spanish]',NULL,'Want to improve your Spanish? Need a break from flash cards and listening exercises? Ready to put what you\'ve already learned into practice? ¡Felicidades amigos! This is the game for you.','2021/7/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1602930/Pedros_Adventures_in_Spanish_Learn_Spanish/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9244,'dino_trauma',NULL,'Dino Trauma introduces you to a secret laboratory somewhere in eastern Europe where gore and dinosaurs aren\'t unusual things. Retro FPS inspired by the \'90s legends.','2023/4/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2149420/Dino_Trauma/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9245,'hero’s_hour_-_rogue_realms',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hero\'s Hour on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2007040/Heros_Hour__Rogue_Realms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9246,'the_witcher_3:_wild_hunt_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt, but does not include the base game.','2020/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1229320/The_Witcher_3_Wild_Hunt_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9247,'dirt_rally_2.0_-_colin_mcrae:_flat_out_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DiRT Rally 2.0 on Steam in order to play.','2020/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1211480/DiRT_Rally_20__Colin_McRae_FLAT_OUT_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9248,'roundguard',NULL,'Roundguard is a bouncy dungeon crawler with pinball physics, lots of loot, and a randomized castle full of oddballs. Press your luck against hordes of dangerously cute monsters and challenging roguelike elements in this all-round bouncy adventure!','2020/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/848030/Roundguard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9249,'five_dates',NULL,'Five Dates is an interactive rom-com about the unpredictable world of digital dating. With five potential female matches, Vinny explores whether compatibility, chemistry and connection is still possible in a world where physical touch is no longer an option.','2020/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1353270/Five_Dates/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9250,'train_simulator:_london-faversham_high_speed_route_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2013/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/222557/Train_Simulator_LondonFaversham_High_Speed_Route_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9251,'mineral_defense',NULL,'Mineral Defense combines tower defense with roguelite elements and procedural generation. Build paths, unlock upgrades, and unleash powerful synergies to conquer evolving challenges in an ever-expanding world.','2024/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3125890/Mineral_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9252,'emergency_2',NULL,'Save Lives! When disaster strikes it all comes down to you! Take command of firefighters, doctors and more in this EMERGENCY Classics re-release of EMERGENCY 2. Now playable on modern operating systems!','2002/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/977840/EMERGENCY_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9253,'camping_simulator:_the_squad',NULL,'Camping Simulator lets you experience what camp means by preparing your backpack wisely for challenging conditions of nature. You can play all the experiences with up to 8 friends in multiplayer mode or single player mode.','2025/1/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1562260/Camping_Simulator_The_Squad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9254,'some_some_convenience_store',NULL,'A game about starting a relationship while working part-time at a convenience store','2020/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1217390/Some_Some_Convenience_Store/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9255,'tiny_metal:_full_metal_rumble',NULL,'Craft unique strategies and outmanoeuvre your foes in TINY METAL: FULL METAL RUMBLE, a turn-based Japanese wargame! With new tactical options, command over 23 uniquely diverse units - flank, assault, deploy heroes from orbital dropships, and focus the firepower of multiple units to even out otherwise disastrous odds.','2019/7/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1102100/TINY_METAL_FULL_METAL_RUMBLE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9256,'eden*',NULL,'A tale of the planet\'s final love story told using the full force of minori\'s critically acclaimed illustrative style, engaging musical compositions, and the highly talented staff that has led fans coming back for more every single time!','2015/1/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/315810/eden/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9257,'siralim',NULL,'Siralim is a deep RPG with light roguelike elements that allows you to summon and customize hundreds of creatures to fight in strategic battle. Fight your way through randomly generated dungeons and complete randomized quests.','2015/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/362090/Siralim/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9258,'tyranny_-_tales_from_the_tiers',NULL,'This content requires the base game Tyranny on Steam in order to play.','2017/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/647560/Tyranny__Tales_from_the_Tiers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9259,'gtr_2_fia_gt_racing_game',NULL,'The Game That Revolutionized the Racing Genre.','2006/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/8790/GTR_2_FIA_GT_Racing_Game/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9260,'little_nightmares_ii_digital_content_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Little Nightmares II on Steam in order to play.','2021/2/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1282531/Little_Nightmares_II_Digital_Content_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_196'),(9261,'crime_boss:_rockay_city_-_baker\'s_bundle',NULL,'This content requires the base game Crime Boss: Rockay City on Steam in order to play.','2024/11/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3115300/Crime_Boss_Rockay_City__Bakers_Bundle/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9262,'the_corridor',NULL,'THE CORRIDOR is a 20-30 minute experience about the relationship between player and game.','2020/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1347030/THE_CORRIDOR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9263,'spring_falls',NULL,'Spring Falls is a puzzle game about water, erosion, and watching things grow. Manipulate the landscape and bring wildflowers to life on a peaceful mountainside.','2019/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1040550/Spring_Falls/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9264,'touhou_artificial_dream_in_arcadia',NULL,'Explore Gensokyo from an outsider\'s perspective in this old-school Touhou DRPG!','2023/9/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2248430/Touhou_Artificial_Dream_in_Arcadia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9265,'find_all:_bunker',NULL,'Explore the underground bunker and the surface of the earth in anticipation of a nuclear explosion, finding various items and painting the black and white picture with colored inks.','2025/4/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3543720/FIND_ALL_Bunker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9266,'airship:_kingdoms_adrift',NULL,'Welcome to Suthseg! As the newly commissioned airship captain, forge a mercantile empire across the archipelago, until the great powers of Europa turn their attention toward it. Build up a fleet, chart trade routes, establish industries, and explore the frontier at your airship\'s helm!','2023/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1597310/Airship_Kingdoms_Adrift/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9267,'the_last_door:_season_2_-_collector\'s_edition',NULL,'In Season 2 of The Last Door, the search for his missing client will bring psychiatrist John Wakefield deeper into a conspiracy of darkness and closer to the heart of madness than ever before.','2016/3/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/402530/The_Last_Door_Season_2__Collectors_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9268,'black_mirror',NULL,'Scotland, 1926. Following the death of his father, David Gordon visits his ancestral home for the first time in his life. A life that is soon threatened by the dark secrets that claimed the sanity of many Gordons before him. Black Mirror Castle demands an offering.','2017/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/581300/Black_Mirror/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9269,'payday_2:_sydney_character_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game PAYDAY 2 on Steam in order to play.','2016/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/468410/PAYDAY_2_Sydney_Character_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9270,'cricket_captain_2023',NULL,'Create your own cricket management legacy with Cricket Captain 2023. A new adaptive aggression system, designed for the modern game, puts you in control. Enhanced statistics include historical international player rankings (including all-rounders), real-world form data, and wicket keeper statistics.','2023/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2333390/Cricket_Captain_2023/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9271,'mech_armada',NULL,'Create and command custom Mechs to outmaneuver The Swarm in this post-apocalyptic tactical turn-based rogue-lite. Leverage the terrain, learn each Mech\'s unique skills and use strategy and resources to survive an ever-changing series of battles to give humanity hope.','2022/6/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1389360/Mech_Armada/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9272,'alfred_hitchcock_-_vertigo',NULL,'Can you trust your own mind? Immerse yourself in a psychological thriller of a new kind, playing with the limits between reality and fantasy. Freely inspired by Alfred Hitchcock’s universe.','2021/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1449320/Alfred_Hitchcock__Vertigo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9273,'carmageddon_max_pack',NULL,'Carmageddon is the original freeform driving sensation, where pedestrians (and cows!) equal points, and your opponents are a bunch of crazies in a twisted mix of automotive killing machines. The game features anarchic drive-wherever-you-like gameplay and over-the-top surreal comedy violence. It’s the racing game where racing is for wimps.','1997/6/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/282010/Carmageddon_Max_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9274,'behemoth',NULL,'Dodge ‘n flap your wings in this new arcade extravaganza from The Behemoth! In BEHEMOTH™, you become one with the chicken to secure your flock in the nest and collect as much candy corn as possible!','2024/10/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3027260/BEHEMOTH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9275,'contraption_maker',NULL,'The spiritual successor to The Incredible Machine from its original designer and programmer. Play 100s of puzzles. Build and share elaborate contraptions with an huge variety of parts and critters.','2014/7/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/241240/Contraption_Maker/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9276,'monster_energy_supercross_-_the_official_videogame_6',NULL,'Mud, sweat, adrenaline, and fun: all the best the motocross and dirt bike world has to offer awaits you in the new Monster Energy Supercross 6!','2023/3/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2058750/Monster_Energy_Supercross__The_Official_Videogame_6/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9277,'loren_the_amazon_princess',NULL,'Loren The Amazon Princess is a fantasy epic combining intricate turn-based battles with a heroic tale of overcoming evil - with a twist! In this tale, you play as a loyal servant of the hero rather than the hero herself.','2014/1/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/257970/Loren_The_Amazon_Princess/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9278,'miniatures',NULL,'Miniatures is a collection of strange tales where childhood imagination and reality merge with darker undercurrents of mystery and magic. Explore a vast seascape, build odd furniture, feed a lizard and play with sand castles.','2024/11/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2428840/Miniatures/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9279,'atc4:_airport_naha_[roah]',NULL,'This content requires the base game I am an Air Traffic Controller 4 on Steam in order to play.','2021/8/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1453720/ATC4_Airport_NAHA_ROAH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9280,'session:_skate_sim_schoolyard',NULL,'This content requires the base game Session: Skate Sim on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2732710/Session_Skate_Sim_Schoolyard/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9281,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_ronin',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1397380/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Ronin/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9282,'the_indigo_parallel',NULL,'A surreal mind-bending journey into the depths of madness. You assume the role of Tom, a man hopelessly in love with Daisy, who embarks on a psychedelic adventure through a bizarre and unpredictable world.','2022/11/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1550870/The_Indigo_Parallel/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9283,'decimate_drive',NULL,'It\'s run or die in a killer car infested city. Dash from dumpster to park bench and don’t make a wrong move. Ice cream trucks, snowplows and dodgy vans all want you dead. Decimate Drive, an indie game, is terrifyingly fast-paced and drenched in atmospheric horror.','2024/2/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2427950/Decimate_Drive/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9284,'alien:_isolation_-_last_survivor',NULL,'This content requires the base game Alien: Isolation on Steam in order to play.','2014/10/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/282510/Alien_Isolation__Last_Survivor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9285,'successor',NULL,'A rogue-lite adventure in which you lead a lord and heroes to conquer fractured kingdoms in real-time with pause tactical combat, reinvented. Create campaigns to unravel secrets, earn rewards, and expand your miniature universe.','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1284730/Successor/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9286,'the_king_of_fighters_xiii_global_match',NULL,'Relive the pinnacle of 2D sprite-based fighting! Enhanced for online play! Complete with rollback netcode and overhauled online functionality!','2025/2/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3050220/THE_KING_OF_FIGHTERS_XIII_GLOBAL_MATCH/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9287,'zodiacats',NULL,'Follow cat Catherine on her journey for the lost astrology papyri and learn more about her job as a witch assistant for bringing good vibes into this Earth! Let Catherine guide you through the zodiac wheel, showing you about features of each solar sign. You can also learn about your cat\'s sign!','2022/1/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1817000/Zodiacats/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9288,'tokyo_dark',NULL,'Legend tells of a door deep below Tokyo\'s sewers. All who enter are lost forever. Detective Ito\'s partner is missing. Explore Tokyo & uncover the darkness that lays beneath the streets in this Point & Click - meets Visual Novel - narrative adventure that questions the very core of Ito\'s sanity.','2017/9/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/687260/Tokyo_Dark/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9289,'myst_iv:_revelation',NULL,'In Myst IV: Revelation, the next chapter in the greatest adventure saga of all time, you\'ll travel through environments pulsing with life to unearth a treacherous scheme involving two of Myst\'s most sinister villains.','2004/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/925940/Myst_IV_Revelation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9290,'blitzkrieg_anthology',NULL,'March into the real-time strategy legend, Blitzkrieg, and prepare for war. This legendary WWII RTS blends unprecedented realism and accuracy to form immersive 3D backgrounds and a game where brute force often takes a back seat to strategy and wits.','2003/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/313480/Blitzkrieg_Anthology/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9291,'the_stalked_2',NULL,'\"The Stalked 2\" is a standalone horror sequel to \"The Stalked\", where you play as Rachel, an avid hiker. What begins as a relaxing hike to a cabin turns into a nightmare filled with eerie interactions and unsettling events. Will you survive?','2025/3/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2976490/The_Stalked_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9292,'dreadhunter',NULL,'Plough through hordes of deadly monsters and defeat vicious bosses in an intense fast paced shooter RPG where all items are “legendary”, levels are ever-changing and combat is razor-sharp.','2023/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1553710/Dreadhunter/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9293,'sixty_four',NULL,'Dive into the world of Sixty Four, where you transform simple machines into a thriving factory.','2024/3/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2659900/Sixty_Four/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9294,'arcade_game_series:_pac-man',NULL,'First released in arcades in 1980, the masterpiece PAC-MAN comes to Steam! Move PAC-MAN up, down, left, and right to avoid the ghosts and gobble up all the Pac-Dots!','2016/4/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/394160/ARCADE_GAME_SERIES_PACMAN/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9295,'the_testament_of_sherlock_holmes',NULL,'Become the greatest detective of all time in The Testament of Sherlock Holmes, a twisting, turning investigation game set in a faithfully-reproduced London of 1898. As Sherlock Holmes, you must find clues, interrogate suspects and unveil a mystery in a story full of twists!','2012/9/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/205650/The_Testament_of_Sherlock_Holmes/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9296,'top_dog',NULL,'Dogfight your way through short, intense and randomized runs. Hard but easy to pickup, with daily leaderboards and minimum hardware requirements','2025/1/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1979410/TOP_DOG/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9297,'persona_3_reload_-_persona_5_royal_persona_set_2',NULL,'This content requires the base game Persona 3 Reload on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2334533/Persona_3_Reload__Persona_5_Royal_Persona_Set_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9298,'skinwalker_hunt',NULL,'Skinwalker Hunt is a horror themed hunting game from the creator of Witch Hunt. Main focus of the game is on exploration, non-linear gameplay, and atmosphere.','2022/8/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/993110/Skinwalker_Hunt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9299,'petit_game_collection_vol.1',NULL,'A spin-off minigame collection of \"Needy Streamer Overload\". Meet your internet angel in this retro-style game world!','2024/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2757490/Petit_Game_Collection_vol1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9300,'cultist_simulator:_the_ghoul',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cultist Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2019/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/871900/Cultist_Simulator_The_Ghoul/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9301,'machinika:_museum',NULL,'Welcome to the Museum! Machinika Museum is a mystery game where you discover beautiful and mysterious machines of extra-terrestrial origins in an atmospheric galaxy-spanning 3D puzzle game. Will you be able to understand their stories and discover what happened to their previous owner?','2021/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1507190/Machinika_Museum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9302,'berserk_boy',NULL,'BERSERK BOY is a high speed action packed Platformer, with Metroidvania elements. Packed with vibrant and stylish pixel art. Go Berserk! as you change into different forms and use the power of Lightning, Fire, Ice, Air, and Earth to save the planet!','2024/3/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1561340/Berserk_Boy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9303,'succumate',NULL,'From the creator of Summer Memories comes a new game where you must look after a demon named Lilim! Now you must juggle your time to keep her happy... or else!','2020/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1278390/Succumate/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9304,'lara_croft_go',NULL,'Lara Croft GO is a turn based puzzle-adventure set in a long-forgotten world. Explore the ruins of an ancient civilization, discover well-kept secrets and face deadly challenges as you uncover the myth of the Queen of Venom.','2016/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/540840/Lara_Croft_GO/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_197'),(9305,'payday_2:_chinatown_music_pack',NULL,'This is additional content for PAYDAY 2, but does not include the base game.','2023/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2353511/PAYDAY_2_Chinatown_Music_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9306,'full_metal_sergeant',NULL,'Be the drill instructor! Insult recruits with no remorse! Can you transform flabby recruits into lean war machines within 12 weeks?','2023/4/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1698350/Full_Metal_Sergeant/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9307,'dungeons_of_aether',NULL,'Delve into Dungeons of Aether, a turn-based dungeon crawler set in the Rivals of Aether universe. Control four new heroes as they uncover the mysteries of the Julesvale Caverns in Story Mode or test your mettle in the grueling Challenge Dungeons.','2023/2/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1668290/Dungeons_of_Aether/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9308,'azure_striker_gunvolt_2',NULL,'The ultra-refined 2D side-scrolling action you remember from \"Azure Striker Gunvolt\" is recharged and better than ever! In Gunvolt 2, series anti-hero Copen joins the fray as a playable character! Copy abilities from defeated boss characters and use them as your own!','2020/6/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1065180/Azure_Striker_Gunvolt_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9309,'retro_city_rampage™_dx',NULL,'OPEN-WORLD carjacking goes back to the \'80s in this 8-BIT nostalgic throwback. Run missions! Outrun the law! Rampage the city with weapons, power-ups and vehicles!','2014/11/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/204630/Retro_City_Rampage_DX/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9310,'112_operator_-_water_operations',NULL,'This content requires the base game 112 Operator on Steam in order to play.','2020/12/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1412760/112_Operator__Water_Operations/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9311,'gunbird_2',NULL,'Let\'s go on the treasure hunt through the skies of the world! The ultimate \"Psikyo Shooter\" with online rankings!','2020/6/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1279410/GUNBIRD_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9312,'epistory_-_typing_chronicles',NULL,'Epistory immerses you in an atmospheric action/adventure game where you play a girl riding a giant fox who fights an insectile corruption from an origami world. As you progress and explore this world, the story literally unfolds and the mysteries of the magic power of the words are revealed.','2016/3/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/398850/Epistory__Typing_Chronicles/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9313,'little_nightmares_iii_-_secrets_of_the_spiral_-_expansion_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game Little Nightmares III on Steam in order to play.','2025/10/9','Unreleased','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2170190/Little_Nightmares_III__Secrets_of_The_Spiral__Expansion_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9314,'stranger_of_paradise_final_fantasy_origin_-_season_pass',NULL,'This content requires the base game STRANGER OF PARADISE FINAL FANTASY ORIGIN on Steam in order to play.','2023/4/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2252280/STRANGER_OF_PARADISE_FINAL_FANTASY_ORIGIN__Season_Pass/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9315,'night_raider',NULL,'Night Raider is a thrilling adventure exploration shooter game. Players need to carry weapons into the city occupied by zombies, as far as possible in various buildings to collect necessary supplies, evacuate alive to bring supplies back to the camp. But you have to face are not just zombies...','2024/1/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2719290/Night_Raider/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9316,'djmax_respect_v_-_groove_coaster_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DJMAX RESPECT V on Steam in order to play.','2020/4/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1271671/DJMAX_RESPECT_V__GROOVE_COASTER_PACK/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9317,'children_of_morta:_ancient_spirits',NULL,'This content requires the base game Children of Morta on Steam in order to play.','2021/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1648880/Children_of_Morta_Ancient_Spirits/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9318,'sanctum',NULL,'You think Tower Defense games are all about building? You thought wrong. Sanctum is not your average Tower Defense title. When the havoc starts, you get to join the fray! As one of the world’s first First Person Shooter - Tower Defense games, Sanctum has taken the best of both worlds to deliver an epic, one-of-a-kind experience.','2011/4/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/91600/Sanctum/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9319,'warhammer_40,000:_dakka_squadron_-_flyboyz_edition',NULL,'Warhammer 40,000: Dakka Squadron - Flyboyz Edition. Blazing, Ork aerial combat waged across 41st millennium battlefields. Dakka Squadron is a fast-paced, aerial shooter where you are an Ork Flyboy, taking to the skies to do what Orks do best - fight!','2021/2/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1253190/Warhammer_40000_Dakka_Squadron__Flyboyz_Edition/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9320,'punch_club_2:_iron_fist',NULL,'This content requires the base game Punch Club 2: Fast Forward on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2923090/Punch_Club_2_Iron_Fist/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9321,'hotshot_racing',NULL,'Hotshot Racing is a blisteringly fast arcade-style racing game fusing drift handling, razor-sharp retro visuals and an incredible sense of speed to create an exhilarating driving experience.','2020/9/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/609920/Hotshot_Racing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9322,'eleven_table_tennis',NULL,'We\'re obsessed with creating the most realistic VR table tennis simulator the world has ever seen. After 5 years and countless hours of hard work, we believe that we have accomplished that goal.: : : [Play over Oculus Link/AirLink/Virtual Desktop Not Recommended: the tracking will be much worse]','2016/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/488310/Eleven_Table_Tennis/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9323,'rennsport',NULL,'RENNSPORT is the future of racing simulation, competition, and digital car culture. Live the thrill of driving high-performance race cars on laser-scanned circuits from around the world and breathtaking roads imagined by the community.','2024/12/16','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2077750/RENNSPORT/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9324,'doom_eternal:_series_seven_cosmetic_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game DOOM Eternal on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1749103/DOOM_Eternal_Series_Seven_Cosmetic_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9325,'stararc_echo',NULL,'Create your own furry character! In \"StarArc Echo\" you\'ll meets friends, fight alongside them, and share joyful moments! With a exciting PVE challenges, thrilling PVP battles, and various unique life skills, a boundlessly free and fantastical world awaits you.','2025/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2877480/StarArc_Echo/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9326,'171',NULL,'171 is an open world action adventure game with a Brazilian inspired ambience.','2022/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1269370/171/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9327,'wild_guns_reloaded',NULL,'Wild Guns Reloaded is a fast-paced arcade-style shooter, mixing the Wild West with steampunk. Play as Clint, Annie, Doris, or Bullet the dog with his sentry drone. Grab some friends and play together for some four player action!','2017/7/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/585910/Wild_Guns_Reloaded/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9328,'the_sims™_4_industrial_loft_kit',NULL,'This content requires the base game The Sims™ 4 on Steam in order to play.','2021/8/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1621470/The_Sims_4_Industrial_Loft_Kit/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9329,'pictopix',NULL,'Pictopix is a puzzle game where you use logic to color squares on grids in order to reveal pictures.','2017/1/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/568320/Pictopix/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9330,'disney\'s_hercules',NULL,'Become a true hero in a battle of mythic proportions.','1997/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/987400/Disneys_Hercules/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9331,'train_sim_world®_5:_metrolink_f59phr_loco_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Sim World® 5 on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3260370/Train_Sim_World_5_Metrolink_F59PHR_Loco_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9332,'mysteries_under_lake_ophelia',NULL,'Relax, and fish in a very strange lake.','2021/12/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1808130/Mysteries_Under_Lake_Ophelia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9333,'mothergunship',NULL,'MOTHERGUNSHIP is a bullet-hell FPS where you craft your own guns, fight gigantic bosses, and defeat a robotic alien armada that conquered Earth. Face off against overwhelming odds in brutal, non-stop combats where thinking on your feet is the only way to survive.','2018/7/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/574090/MOTHERGUNSHIP/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9334,'x-morph:_defense',NULL,'Unique fusion of a top-down shooter and tower defense strategy. You are the invader! Use destructive weapons or lead your enemies into a maze of towers. Strategize in the build mode by carefully selecting various types of alien towers or throw yourself right into the heat of the battle.','2017/8/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/408410/XMorph_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9335,'gato_roboto',NULL,'Pounce inside of your cozy armored mech and set off on a dangerous trek through an alien underworld full of irritable creatures and treacherous obstacles in a valiant effort to save your stranded captain and his crashed spaceship.','2019/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/916730/Gato_Roboto/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9336,'tametsi',NULL,'Tametsi is a difficult logic game played on a set of tiles, in which you must use the clues provided to discover and mark hidden mines.','2017/10/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/709920/Tametsi/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9337,'strikers_1945',NULL,'The vertical scrolling shooter game released in the arcade by \"Psikyo\". You can set the difficulty level, controls, screen orientation, etc. In addition, online rankings have been implemented! Aim to be the world\'s best Striker!','2020/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1261960/STRIKERS_1945/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9338,'into_the_darkness_vr',NULL,'Into the Darkness VR takes full advantage of VR tech. Your skills will be tested as you uncover the sinister secrets concealed within a secret base, hiding the consequences of the AI experiments of today. Face the many challenges dismembering robots and using realistic physics to your advantage.','2025/5/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1529530/Into_The_Darkness_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9339,'resonance',NULL,'When a brilliant particle physicist dies unexpectedly, the race is on to secure his terrible new technology before it falls into the wrong hands. The lives of four playable characters become entangled as they fight against the clock to find the dead scientist’s secret vault.','2012/7/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/212050/Resonance/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9340,'surgeon_simulator:_experience_reality',NULL,'Surgeon Simulator is bringing the ER to VR! The most critically acclaimed and infamous surgery simulation game as you have never seen it before! Featuring all of the surgeries and twisted humour of the original favourite plus a few new surprises...','2016/12/5','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/518920/Surgeon_Simulator_Experience_Reality/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9341,'hunt:_showdown_1896_-_commedia_della_morte',NULL,'This content requires the base game Hunt: Showdown 1896 on Steam in order to play.','2023/2/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2272500/Hunt_Showdown_1896__Commedia_Della_Morte/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9342,'gal*gun_vr',NULL,'Put the VR headset on and enter a world where you are the most popular guy around! Dreams do come true! The legendary arcade-shooting game \"Gal*Gun\" is here in VR!','2017/8/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/678520/GalGun_VR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9343,'miss_neko_3',NULL,'Ladies and gentlemen, welcome to the psychedelic city — Neko City#96572! All good things you want will happen here! Just dance with the charming neko, solve their match puzzles, and you will get mysterious rewards!','2022/12/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2022180/Miss_Neko_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9344,'fire_pro_wrestling_world_-_new_japan_pro-wrestling_collaboration',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fire Pro Wrestling World on Steam in order to play.','2018/9/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/912460/Fire_Pro_Wrestling_World__New_Japan_ProWrestling_Collaboration/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9345,'deathspank:_thongs_of_virtue',NULL,'Join DeathSpank in the hunt for the Thongs of Virtue! Fight through all new environments and quests and collect all new weapons, armor, and loot in one of the funniest action-RPGs to date!','2010/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/18050/DeathSpank_Thongs_of_Virtue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9346,'monster_roadtrip_hitchhiker_pack_-_amira_&_oz',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Prom 3: Monster Roadtrip on Steam in order to play.','2022/12/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2251130/Monster_Roadtrip_Hitchhiker_Pack__Amira__Oz/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9347,'wargame:_european_escalation',NULL,'The New Fatal Error DLC includes a new 5-mission Operation and touch-screen controls.','2012/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/58610/Wargame_European_Escalation/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9348,'oblin_party',NULL,'Control your hands and destroy friendships in this physics-based couch/online fighting game. Use your elastic arms to swing, slingshot, and parkour around the highly dynamic maps. Wield powerful weapons or use your bare fists to bonk your opponents!','2025/3/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2643290/Oblin_Party/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9349,'aliens:_dark_descent_-_lethe_recon_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Aliens: Dark Descent on Steam in order to play.','2023/6/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2272330/Aliens_Dark_Descent__Lethe_Recon_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9350,'popgoes_arcade',NULL,'Battle the corrupt animals of the forest, collect valuable items and abilities, and save the world, TWICE, in this retro-styled RPG adventure! As an official spinoff of the Five Nights at Freddy\'s horror game series, you can expect familiar characters, loads of secrets, and maybe some scares...','2022/7/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1986840/POPGOES_Arcade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9351,'cities:_skylines_-_country_road_radio',NULL,'This content requires the base game Cities: Skylines on Steam in order to play.','2018/5/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/815380/Cities_Skylines__Country_Road_Radio/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9352,'cuphead_-_official_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Cuphead, but does not include the base game.','2017/9/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/704710/Cuphead__Official_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_198'),(9353,'the_test:_reality_check',NULL,'The Test: Reality Check is one of multiple installments in an ongoing social experiment that can be classified as an atmospheric, psychological-simulation with horror elements. Dive deep into your own psyche to find answers to questions you\'ve kept locked away, hidden from yourself for far too long.','2025/2/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3447410/The_Test_Reality_Check/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9354,'sniper_elite_4_-_deathstorm_part_3:_obliteration',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sniper Elite 4 on Steam in order to play.','2017/7/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/474766/Sniper_Elite_4__Deathstorm_Part_3_Obliteration/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9355,'the_knight_witch',NULL,'The Knight Witch is a metroidvania adventure game with fast-paced, shoot \'em up combat set in a beautifully hand-drawn world. Cast devastating card-based spells, forge close bonds, and make moral choices all in your quest to save your home and discover who\'s behind the War Golem invasion.','2022/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1872680/The_Knight_Witch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9356,'just_cause™_4:_brawler_mech',NULL,'This content requires the base game Just Cause 4 Reloaded on Steam in order to play.','2019/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1087130/Just_Cause_4_Brawler_Mech/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9357,'persona_3_reload_-_persona_5_royal_persona_set_1',NULL,'This content requires the base game Persona 3 Reload on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2334532/Persona_3_Reload__Persona_5_Royal_Persona_Set_1/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9358,'hotel_r\'n\'r',NULL,'Hotel R’n’R, the gonzo VR rockstar simulator! Sell your soul to The Devil, smash up hotels and become Infamous. Pressure from hotel staff and your own limp wrists are against you, but with over 40 weapons, and a World Tour ahead of you, it’s time to get creative.','2020/5/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1011290/Hotel_RnR/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9359,'vasilisa_and_baba_yaga',NULL,'An adventure game based on the Russian folktale \"Vasilisa the Beautiful\". A scary story about the journey to the mistress of the forbidden forest for magical powers.','2024/10/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2331070/Vasilisa_and_Baba_Yaga/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9360,'darius_cozmic_collection_arcade',NULL,'Darius is one of the pioneers of the side-scrolling shoot \'em genre, and the Steam version replicates the multi-screen arcade experience with 4 different titles and 7 versions filled with aquatic-lifeform-themed bosses and epic, Zuntata-composed soundscapes!','2021/11/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1638330/Darius_Cozmic_Collection_Arcade/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9361,'slipstream',NULL,'Arcade-style racing game inspired by the spirit of the early 90s, with drifting mechanics and exotic tracks.','2018/5/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/732810/Slipstream/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9362,'richie\'s_plank_experience',NULL,'You\'re on a plank, 80 stories high. Knees shaky, palms sweaty. You have a choice. Do you walk or do you freeze? Richie\'s Plank is the only VR experience that lets you clone any real-world plank into the virtual world for 2X the immersion.','2017/12/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/517160/Richies_Plank_Experience/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9363,'spongebob_squarepants:_the_cosmic_shake_-_costume_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game SpongeBob SquarePants: The Cosmic Shake on Steam in order to play.','2023/1/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2152880/SpongeBob_SquarePants_The_Cosmic_Shake__Costume_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9364,'gothic®_3',NULL,'A nameless hero becomes a legend! Myrtana, a world in upheaval: overrun by orcs from the dark lands in the north, King Rhobar is defending Vengard, the former stronghold of the humans, with his last troop of followers.','2006/10/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/39500/Gothic_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9365,'vampire:_the_masquerade_-_bloodhunt',NULL,'Bloodhunt is a thrilling free-to-play battle royale game set in Prague consumed by a ruthless war between vampire factions. Use your supernatural powers, weapons, and wit to hunt your rivals and dominate the night!','2022/4/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/760160/Vampire_The_Masquerade__Bloodhunt/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9366,'panzer_corps_2:_axis_operations_-_1946',NULL,'This content requires the base game Panzer Corps 2 on Steam in order to play.','2023/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2393021/Panzer_Corps_2_Axis_Operations__1946/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9367,'x-com:_ufo_defense',NULL,'You are in control of X-COM: an organization formed by the world\'s governments to fight the ever-increasing alien menace.','1993/12/31','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/7760/XCOM_UFO_Defense/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9368,'polterguys:_possession_party',NULL,'Supernatural multiplayer madness where 8 players use sneaky sabotage to get opponents caught by a raging monster! Play as mischievous ghosts who possesses every-day objects to gain special powers and show off! Battle in spooky maps full of traps and use whacky powerups to sacrifice your friends!','2025/4/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1043520/Polterguys_Possession_Party/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9369,'train_simulator:_gwr_pannier_tank_pack_add-on',NULL,'This content requires the base game Train Simulator Classic 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2019/1/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/861888/Train_Simulator_GWR_Pannier_Tank_Pack_AddOn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9370,'mamiya',NULL,'MAMIYA is a captivating, dark mystery visual novel in which a group of young men struggle against existential dread before the end of the world.','2021/4/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1394930/MAMIYA/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9371,'black_squad',NULL,'Black Squad is a free-to-play military first-person-shooter. Players can master their skills and show off their strategies with a wide range of game maps, modes, and weapons to choose from. Join thousands of FPS players worldwide in one of the most played games on Steam!','2019/6/26','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/550650/Black_Squad/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9372,'hammerwatch',NULL,'A hack and slash action adventure, set in a fantasy pixel art environment. Play solo or co-op in this adventure from bottom to top of Castle Hammerwatch. Kill hordes of enemies with varied looks and features through four unique environments with traps, hidden secrets and puzzles.','2013/8/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/239070/Hammerwatch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9373,'toonstruck',NULL,'Toonstruck combines live action, cell animation, and an all star cast: Christopher Lloyd, Ben Stein, Dan Castellaneta, Tim Curry, and Dom DeLuise, for a not-to-be-missed adventure through a zany cartoon world on the brink of total Malevalation!','2016/11/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/369830/Toonstruck/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9374,'crypt_of_the_necrodancer_original_danny_baranowsky_soundtrack',NULL,'This is additional content for Crypt of the NecroDancer, but does not include the base game.','2014/7/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/314680/Crypt_of_the_Necrodancer_Original_Danny_Baranowsky_Soundtrack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9375,'telling_lies',NULL,'Four private lives. One big lie. Search through secretly recorded video conversations to discover the truth. The successor to the acclaimed Her Story.','2019/8/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/762830/Telling_Lies/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9376,'athenian_rhapsody',NULL,'Forge your own story and explore the world of Athens in Athenian Rhapsody, a souls-like platonic dating simulator with cooking-mama and WarioWare style battle mechanics... and by that I mean it\'s a choose-your-own-adventure action RPG with the ability to trade ENTIRE PLAYTHROUGHS between friends!!','2024/5/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1671720/Athenian_Rhapsody/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9377,'lego®_marvel_super_heroes_2_-_marvel\'s_avengers:_infinity_war_movie_level_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game LEGO® Marvel Super Heroes 2 on Steam in order to play.','2018/4/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/720780/LEGO_Marvel_Super_Heroes_2__Marvels_Avengers_Infinity_War_Movie_Level_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9378,'bullet_witch',NULL,'An army of demons has driven humanity to the brink of extinction. The only thing standing in their way? A woman in black, with a long gun like a witch’s broom and magical powers to match. Mow down hordes of monsters and reignite the spark of mankind’s resistance!','2018/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/696180/Bullet_Witch/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9379,'maestro:_secret_sorcery',NULL,'This content requires the base game Maestro on Steam in order to play.','2024/12/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3352570/Maestro_Secret_Sorcery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9380,'island_saver',NULL,'A group of amazing islands need your help! Horrid plastic waste has washed up and you need to sort it out with your trusty Trash Blaster! But look out for the Litterbugs. They love mess and they’re out to muck things up.','2020/5/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1210250/Island_Saver/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9381,'fishing_planet:_amazon_carnival_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing Planet on Steam in order to play.','2021/3/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1200348/Fishing_Planet_Amazon_Carnival_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9382,'half_dead_3',NULL,'Become a member of the highly anticipated sequel of the co-op sci-fi show. Gather a team of four friends. The more partners the more chances to survive. Find your way out in a deadly new room complex filled with even more sophisticated traps.','2022/9/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1520380/HALF_DEAD_3/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9383,'police_simulator:_patrol_officers:_fast_pursuit_police_vehicle_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Police Simulator: Patrol Officers on Steam in order to play.','2024/10/9','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3167630/Police_Simulator_Patrol_Officers_Fast_Pursuit_Police_Vehicle_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9384,'the_cub',NULL,'From the creators of Golf Club Nostalgia and Highwater. Return to their whimsical, neon-lit apocalypse in a Jungle Book meets The Armageddon fusion. Parkour through the remains of humanity as a child being hunted, while catchy end-of-days tunes and curious survivor stories play on the radio.','2024/1/19','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1941410/The_Cub/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9385,'dynasty_legends_2',NULL,'Stunning Next-Gen ARPG is coming! One vs thousands, battlefield is waiting! Be the God of War, you\'re unstoppable!','2024/12/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3101800/Dynasty_Legends_2/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9386,'naval_action_-_flags',NULL,'This content requires the base game Naval Action on Steam in order to play.','2018/11/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/904370/Naval_Action__Flags/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9387,'super_woden_gp',NULL,'Feel the excitement of the 90s with the isometric perspective, its huge number of vehicles and its brilliant soundtrack. More than 70 cars from six manufacturers from different countries to buy, an extensive campaign mode, dozens of circuits, rally stages, championships, and much more awaits you!','2021/9/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1534180/Super_Woden_GP/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9388,'faeria',NULL,'With its unique living board, Faeria is also the only card game where you can gain all 300 cards in less than 50 hours.','2017/3/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/397060/Faeria/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9389,'environmental_station_alpha',NULL,'Explore an abandoned space station in this retro-themed explorative action platformer.','2015/4/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/350070/Environmental_Station_Alpha/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9390,'build-a-lot',NULL,'Send the housing market through the roof as you build, buy, and sell houses in the new strategy game, Build-a-lot! You can flip houses for quick cash or sit back and watch the rental income pile up. Become a real estate mogul as you visit scenic towns, earn huge profits and perform special favors for the colorful local mayors.','2007/10/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/38080/BuildALot/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9391,'yaiba:_ninja_gaiden_z',NULL,'Step into a living comic book in this new take on the Ninja Gaiden series. Brandishing his ninja sword and the mecha weapons in his cyber arm, Yaiba slaughters zombies with brutal, over-the-top abandon. Will you slice enemies to pieces, crush them with Yaiba\'s cyborg arm or just rip off a zombie’s arms to use as nunchucks?','2014/3/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/252230/YAIBA_NINJA_GAIDEN_Z/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9392,'butterfly\'s_poison;_blood_chains',NULL,'Tokyo, 1918. World War I is coming to an end. Yuriko Nomiya, aristocratic by birth, is suddenly struck by a series of misfortunes. Is this fate brought about by the changing times, or is someone plotting against her? The dark, bittersweet tale of Yuriko and five young men is about to unfold...','2023/6/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2249450/Butterflys_Poison_Blood_Chains/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9393,'castle_doombad_classic',NULL,'BE THE VILLAIN and slay any hero who dares enter your dark domain! Deck out your castle with traps and minions as the ultimate diabolical dungeon keeper in this strategy / TD puzzler. Includes the original Castle Doombad game, rebuilt and remastered, plus brand new content.','2024/12/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2888470/Castle_Doombad_Classic/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9394,'30_birds',NULL,'Lantern City is on the verge of disaster: the Goddess Simurgh has been kidnapped by the evil Scientist! 30 Birds is a narrative puzzle game laid out on the surface of rotating lanterns. Wander through a gorgeous world inspired by Persian art, meet quirky birds, and solve puzzles to rescue Simurgh.','2024/11/27','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1708770/30_Birds/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9395,'fishing:_north_atlantic_-_a.f._theriault',NULL,'This content requires the base game Fishing: North Atlantic - Enhanced Edition on Steam in order to play.','2023/3/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2231830/Fishing_North_Atlantic__AF_Theriault/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9396,'error143_day_5',NULL,'This content requires the base game ERROR143 on Steam in order to play.','2023/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2230570/ERROR143_Day_5/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9397,'microcosmum:_survival_of_cells',NULL,'Microcosmum: survival of cells. Join the wonderful and amazing world of microorganisms.','2018/7/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/386260/Microcosmum_survival_of_cells/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9398,'biker_garage:_mechanic_simulator',NULL,'Become an ace motorcycle mechanic. Buy used motorcycles, repair, and sell them for a profit. Work with 15 types of motorbikes. Develop a workshop and attract as many customers as you can. Customize bikes or create your own dream bike from hundreds of available parts.','2019/11/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/989770/Biker_Garage_Mechanic_Simulator/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_199'),(9399,'flowers_-le_volume_sur_printemps-',NULL,'Suoh Shirahane, a shy girl with a mysterious past, will begin her first year of high school at Saint Angraecum Academy, where she hopes to find a new beginning. She will navigate friendships and mysteries at her new school, and discovers that love can come in many forms.','2016/8/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/452440/Flowers_Le_volume_sur_printemps/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9400,'ancestors_legacy',NULL,'Ancestors Legacy is a squad-based real time strategy with a strong focus on tactics. Inspired by medieval European history, it brings to life four different nations and their conflicts, usually solved by war.','2018/5/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/620590/Ancestors_Legacy/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9401,'cooking_companions',NULL,'Unravel the mystery in this cute psychological horror VN, set deep in the woods of the Tatras Mountains. Will you wind up on the chopping block?','2021/10/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1263230/Cooking_Companions/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9402,'hometopia',NULL,'Hometopia is a sandbox home-building game featuring thousands of assets and customization options. Choose from a variety of environments where you can design your dream homes—solo or with friends. Bring your architectural visions to life exactly as you imagine, with no budget limitations.','2025/4/2','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1138640/Hometopia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9403,'nancy_drew®:_the_deadly_device',NULL,'An Elusive Killer Shocks a High-Tech Lab!','2012/10/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/220420/Nancy_Drew_The_Deadly_Device/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9404,'ai_war_2:_zenith_onslaught',NULL,'This content requires the base game AI War 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/5/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1290340/AI_War_2_Zenith_Onslaught/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9405,'hello_charlotte_ep3:_childhood\'s_end',NULL,'\"All ended well.There was nothing to grieve about.\" A farewell, and a greeting.','2018/1/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/760890/Hello_Charlotte_EP3_Childhoods_End/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9406,'[chilla\'s_art]_night_delivery_|_例外配達',NULL,'Night Delivery | 例外配達 is a psychological Japanese horror adventure game.','2021/6/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1611490/Chillas_Art_Night_Delivery/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9407,'trackline_express',NULL,'Embark on a thrilling journey through an unforgiving desert. You\'ll need to gather scarce resources and utilize your strategic and management skills to build a little train capable of overcoming attacks and fires.','2024/4/18','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2343920/Trackline_Express/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9408,'3d_escape_room:_detective_story',NULL,'3D Escape Room: Detective Story is an immersive 3D puzzle game that takes you to 1930s London. In the game, you play as an insightful private detective, searching for clues in realistic 3D environments, solving intricate puzzles and mini-games, and cracking bizarre cases.','2025/3/13','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3411050/3D_Escape_Room_Detective_Story/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9409,'get_in_the_car,_loser!',NULL,'A lesbian road trip RPG by the co-creator of Ladykiller in a Bind about fighting for love and justice in the face of indifference, inspired by choice-driven visual novels, and a battle system influenced by classic and modern JRPGs. WILL YOU STAND AND FIGHT IN THE FACE OF EVIL?','2021/9/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/938860/Get_In_The_Car_Loser/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9410,'clamb',NULL,'A punishing VR climbing game. Climb a surreal mountain with nothing but a hammer.','2024/11/7','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2709120/Clamb/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9411,'last_train_home_–_legion_tales',NULL,'This content requires the base game Last Train Home on Steam in order to play.','2024/2/1','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2617710/Last_Train_Home__Legion_Tales/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9412,'zula_global',NULL,'Zula is an intense free-to-play FPS in which you can play cooperatively with your teammates to overthrow the enemy side. You can enjoy new content weekly and receive gifts every day. Variety of maps and weapons from the real world so you can immerse yourself 100%.','2018/1/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/747610/Zula_Global/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9413,'taisho_x_alice_epilogue',NULL,'This is the final installment of TAISHO x ALICE, a fairytale visual novel in which YOU must save your Prince Charming! Take on the role of the heroine in order to rehabilitate your chosen love interest and guide him to his \"happily ever after\" once and for all!','2021/6/24','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1596540/TAISHO_x_ALICE_epilogue/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9414,'the_end_of_dyeus',NULL,'Go in a quest for Dyeus in a primitive and cryptic open world ! Face mysterious assailants in intense and fast paced sword fights, and survive against a carnivorous fauna. Will you uncover the truth about Dyeus?','2021/10/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1304400/The_End_of_Dyeus/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9415,'poker_club',NULL,'Welcome to the most immersive poker simulation ever made. Live the life of a poker pro in a global Poker Tour, then join a Club and make a name for yourself in 200-player online tournaments.','2020/11/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1174460/Poker_Club/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9416,'way_of_the_hunter_-_remington_firearms_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game Way of the Hunter on Steam in order to play.','2024/6/17','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2922220/Way_of_the_Hunter__Remington_Firearms_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9417,'bronzebeard\'s_tavern',NULL,'Bronzebeard\'s Tavern is a goofy and playful restaurant manager sim where 1-8 players can work as a team with multiplayer co-op. Fulfill a number of different roles, serve a diverse range of customers and cook up delicious dwarven cuisine.','2023/11/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2422870/Bronzebeards_Tavern/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9418,'big_rigs:_over_the_road_racing',NULL,'Get ready for some brake jamm\'in, CB talk\'in, convoy roll\'in action across America! From Portland Oregon to Miami Florida, you\'ll be hauling loads and trying to stay one step ahead of the law as you climb into your Big Rig for non-stop driving action.','2025/4/8','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3598130/Big_Rigs_Over_the_Road_Racing/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9419,'steel_division_2_-_burning_baltics',NULL,'This content requires the base game Steel Division 2 on Steam in order to play.','2021/4/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1418231/Steel_Division_2__Burning_Baltics/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9420,'disney_universe',NULL,'For the first time, suit up in an off-the-wall multiplayer adventure where iconic Disney characters and legendary Disney worlds collide. Discover the mixed-up humor of this ever-expanding universe as you team up with friends to overcome challenges and defeat enemies.','2011/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/316260/Disney_Universe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9421,'welcome_to_paradize',NULL,'Paradise isn\'t exactly what you hoped for: it\'s infested with zombies! Thankfully, you can control them. Capture them and teach them to farm or fight. They will help you defend our camp while you explore the world looking for… a new paradise.','2024/2/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1519090/Welcome_to_ParadiZe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9422,'calico_-_neat_things_dlc',NULL,'This content requires the base game Calico on Steam in order to play.','2025/2/6','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3298220/Calico__Neat_Things_DLC/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9423,'kingdoms_of_amalur:_re-reckoning_-_fatesworn',NULL,'This content requires the base game Kingdoms of Amalur: Re-Reckoning on Steam in order to play.','2021/12/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1278260/Kingdoms_of_Amalur_ReReckoning__Fatesworn/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9424,'touhou:_scarlet_curiosity',NULL,'The world of Touhou comes alive in this beautiful action RPG (featuring “bullet hell” elements, of course!). Infamous vampire Remilia Scarlet and her dutiful maid, Sakuya, set off to chase rumors of a massive monster, all while sending baddies flying with fluid action and signature skills!','2018/7/11','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/845880/Touhou_Scarlet_Curiosity/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9425,'goat_simulator:_payday',NULL,'This content requires the base game Goat Simulator on Steam in order to play.','2016/1/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/425840/Goat_Simulator_PAYDAY/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9426,'nonograms',NULL,'Nonograms is a relaxing puzzle game where you use logic and creativity. Your goal is to reveal hidden pictures by filling in specific grid cells, based on numerical clues provided for each row and column. The games in this genre are also known as Picross, Griddlers, Pic-a-Pix, Hanjie, etc.','2024/2/29','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2622750/Nonograms/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9427,'air_traffic:_greenlight',NULL,'Air Traffic: Greenlight is an air-traffic-control-themed game. Direct aircraft in the area where radar coverage is limited. Prevent collisions, organize and expedite the flow of air traffic.','2022/2/3','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1861880/Air_Traffic_Greenlight/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9428,'puttler',NULL,'Puttler is a mini-golf puzzle game featuring wacky obstacles and a charming backstory. Build contraptions to score the golf ball under par across 14 courses and over 250 unique holes to solve.','2025/3/28','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3198680/Puttler/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9429,'steam_prison',NULL,'There are two kinds of people: the rulers and the ruled. The Heights are a gorgeous utopia. The Depths, a filthy industrial wasteland. Our heroine, raised in the Heights, has nothing but contempt for those below.','2019/2/14','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/977460/Steam_Prison/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9430,'kamitsubaki_city_regenerate',NULL,'Answer the summons to the parallel world of \"Kamitsubaki City\" and meet a cast of colorful characters as you set out on a quest to save this city from the brink of destruction in this dark-fantasy sci-fi visual novel!','2025/3/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2353340/KAMITSUBAKI_CITY_REGENERATE/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9431,'monster_roadtrip_playable_character_-_zoe',NULL,'This content requires the base game Monster Prom 3: Monster Roadtrip on Steam in order to play.','2022/10/21','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2147633/Monster_Roadtrip_Playable_character__Zoe/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9432,'pro_show_jumping',NULL,'Experience the world of professional show jumping with this simulation-based game! Ride through realistic jumping courses with a variety of horses, refine your eye for strides, design your very own courses and share them with friends.','2024/2/22','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2725650/Pro_Show_Jumping/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9433,'baladins',NULL,'Embark on a whimsical journey and bring joy to a bright fantasy world in this roleplaying adventure for 1-4 players. Craft your own story and solve quests how you like, but beware, for every time you fail the Dragon will send you back in time!','2024/5/15','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1866320/Baladins/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9434,'f1®_manager_2024_-_deluxe_upgrade_pack',NULL,'This content requires the base game F1® Manager 2024 on Steam in order to play.','2024/7/23','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2934790/F1_Manager_2024__Deluxe_Upgrade_Pack/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9435,'valkyrie_drive_-bhikkhuni-',NULL,'VALKYRIE DRIVE -BHIKKHUNI- is the all-new all-action brawler from the creators of SENRAN KAGURA. The girls of Bhikkhuni are infected with the mysterious VR-Virus and the only way to control it is to fight.','2017/6/20','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/550080/VALKYRIE_DRIVE_BHIKKHUNI/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9436,'slopecrashers',NULL,'Slopecrashers is an arcade snowboard racer starring a wild crew of animals on a globe-trotting quest to become champions — but someone’s out to ruin their plans! Race solo or with friends, pull off stylish tricks, and use wild power-ups to take down rivals in chaotic, fast-paced action.','2024/12/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1619580/Slopecrashers/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9437,'sniper_elite_4_-_deathstorm_part_2:_infiltration',NULL,'This content requires the base game Sniper Elite 4 on Steam in order to play.','2017/4/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/474765/Sniper_Elite_4__Deathstorm_Part_2_Infiltration/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9438,'hoofobia',NULL,'One player becomes the paranoid hunter, while the others disguise themselves as deer among a herd of AI. As a deer, blend in, outsmart the hunter, and strike when the moment is right. As the hunter, figure out who\'s faking it—before you lose your mind.','2025/6/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2467300/Hoofobia/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9439,'anodyne_2:_return_to_dust',NULL,'A 2D-3D Action-Adventure game! Run, jump, and drive across vast, dreamy 3D landscapes. Shrink into surreal, 2D dungeons inside of characters\' bodies. Travel the world, meet strange people, and save the world from the dangerous Nano Dust. Don\'t miss the follow-up to the classic game \'Anodyne\'!','2019/8/12','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/877810/Anodyne_2_Return_to_Dust/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9440,'wolf_tails',NULL,'\"Wolf Tails\" is a visual novel where you take care of two wolf-girls. There\'s Mirari, a kindhearted girl who is running away from her duties to her pack, and Fuyu, a brash and loud-mouthed girl who is wary of human culture and its \"influences\".','2018/5/4','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/822930/Wolf_Tails/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9441,'men_of_war:_assault_squad_2_-_ostfront_veteranen',NULL,'This content requires the base game Men of War: Assault Squad 2 on Steam in order to play.','2018/10/25','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/920840/Men_of_War_Assault_Squad_2__Ostfront_Veteranen/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9442,'boxville',NULL,'Boxville is an adventure puzzle game about speechless cans living in the city of boxes and drawing doodles on cardboards to tell the stories. Made in Ukraine.','2022/9/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1750710/Boxville/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9443,'moose_miners',NULL,'Take control of a mining operation run by moose. They mine and sell the gems. You need to decide where to spend the profits. Hire more miners and upgrade their gear. Buy new rails and minecarts to get deeper into the mine. The deeper you get the more valuable gems you will find.','2024/5/10','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2591410/Moose_Miners/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200'),(9444,'disney_illusion_island_starring_mickey_and_friends',NULL,'Mickey and Friends embark on an adventure to find three magical books and save the mysterious island of Monoth. Explore weird and wonderful biomes, meet unusual allies and face peculiar foes all in this hand-drawn 2D adventure.','2025/5/30','Released','https://store.steampowered.com/app/2054660/Disney_Illusion_Island_Starring_Mickey_and_Friends/?snr=1_7_7_230_150_200');
